#: ../NEWS:31
msgid ""
":gh:`148508`: An intermittent timing error when running SSL tests on iOS has"
" been resolved."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:34
msgid ""
":gh:`148370`: :mod:`configparser`: prevent quadratic behavior when a "
":exc:`~configparser.ParsingError` is raised after a parser fails to parse "
"multiple lines. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:38
msgid ""
":gh:`148254`: Use singular \"sec\" instead of \"secs\" in :mod:`timeit` "
"verbose output for consistency with other time units."
msgstr ":gh:`148254`: 在 :mod:`timeit` 详细输出中使用单数形式 \"sec\" 而非 \"secs\" 以与其他时间单位保持一致。"

#: ../NEWS:41
msgid ""
":gh:`148192`: ``email.generator.Generator._make_boundary`` could fail to "
"detect a duplicate boundary string if linesep was not \\n. It now correctly "
"detects boundary strings when linesep is \\r\\n as well."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:45
msgid ""
":gh:`146313`: Fix a deadlock in :mod:`multiprocessing`'s resource tracker "
"where the parent process could hang indefinitely in :func:`os.waitpid` "
"during interpreter shutdown if a child created via :func:`os.fork` still "
"held the resource tracker's pipe open."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:50
msgid ""
":gh:`145831`: Fix :func:`!email.quoprimime.decode` leaving a stray ``\\r`` "
"when ``eol='\\r\\n'`` by stripping the full *eol* string instead of one "
"character."
msgstr ""
":gh:`145831`: 通过去除完整的 *eol* 字符串而非单个字符修复当 ``eol='\\r\\n'`` 时 "
":func:`!email.quoprimime.decode` 留下单个 ``\\r`` 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:54
msgid ""
":gh:`145105`: Fix crash in :mod:`csv` reader when iterating with a re-"
"entrant iterator that calls :func:`next` on the same reader from within "
"``__next__``."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:58
msgid ""
":gh:`105936`: Attempting to mutate non-field attributes of "
":mod:`dataclasses` with both *frozen* and *slots* being ``True`` now raises "
":class:`~dataclasses.FrozenInstanceError` instead of :class:`TypeError`. "
"Their non-dataclass subclasses can now freely mutate non-field attributes, "
"and the original non-slotted class can be garbage collected."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:64
msgid ""
":gh:`70039`: Fixed bug where :meth:`smtplib.SMTP.starttls` could fail if "
":meth:`smtplib.SMTP.connect` is called explicitly rather than implicitly."
msgstr ""
":gh:`70039`: 修复当 :meth:`smtplib.SMTP.connect` 被显式调用而不是隐式调用时 "
":meth:`smtplib.SMTP.starttls` 可能失败的程序缺陷。"

