#: ../NEWS:77
msgid ""
":gh:`148393`: Fix data races between :c:func:`PyDict_Watch` / "
":c:func:`PyDict_Unwatch` and concurrent dict mutation in the :term:`free-"
"threaded build`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`148393`: 修复 :term:`free-threaded build` 中 :c:func:`PyDict_Watch` / "
":c:func:`PyDict_Unwatch` 与并发字典修改之间的数据竞争问题。"

#: ../NEWS:81
msgid ""
":gh:`148284`: Fix high stack consumption in Python's interpreter loop on "
"Clang 22 by setting function limits for inlining when building with computed"
" gotos."
msgstr ""
":gh:`148284`: 通过在带有计算跳转的编译时设置内联的函数限制修复 Python 的解释器循环在 Clang 22 上过高的栈消耗问题。"

#: ../NEWS:85
msgid ""
":gh:`148037`: Remove critical section from :c:func:`!PyCode_Addr2Line` in "
"free-threading."
msgstr ":gh:`148037`: 在自由线程构建中移除 :c:func:`!PyCode_Addr2Line` 的关键节。"

#: ../NEWS:88
msgid ":gh:`148208`: Fix recursion depth leak in :c:func:`PyObject_Print`"
msgstr ":gh:`148208`: 修复 :c:func:`PyObject_Print` 中的递归深度泄漏问题。"

