msgstr "Python 3.14.4 正式版"

#: ../NEWS:101
msgid "*Release date: 2026-04-07*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2026-04-07*"

#: ../NEWS:106
msgid ""
":gh:`145986`: :mod:`xml.parsers.expat`: Fixed a crash caused by unbounded C "
"recursion when converting deeply nested XML content models with "
":meth:`~xml.parsers.expat.xmlparser.ElementDeclHandler`. This addresses "
":cve:`2026-4224`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`145986`: :mod:`xml.parsers.expat`: 修复在使用 "
":meth:`~xml.parsers.expat.xmlparser.ElementDeclHandler` 转换深度嵌套的XML 内容模型时由无限 "
"C 递归导致的崩溃问题。 这解决了 :cve:`2026-4224`。"

#: ../NEWS:111
msgid ""
":gh:`145599`: Reject control characters in :class:`http.cookies.Morsel` "
":meth:`~http.cookies.Morsel.update` and "
":meth:`~http.cookies.BaseCookie.js_output`. This addresses :cve:`2026-3644`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`145599`: 拒绝在 :class:`http.cookies.Morsel` "
":meth:`~http.cookies.Morsel.update` 和 "
":meth:`~http.cookies.BaseCookie.js_output` 中出现控制字符。 这解决了 :cve:`2026-3644`。"

#: ../NEWS:116
msgid ""
":gh:`145506`: Fixes :cve:`2026-2297` by ensuring that "
"``SourcelessFileLoader`` uses :func:`io.open_code` when opening ``.pyc`` "
"files."
msgstr ""
":gh:`145506`: 通过确保 ``SourcelessFileLoader`` 在打开 ``.pyc`` 文件时使用 "
":func:`io.open_code` 修复 :cve:`2026-2297` 问题。"

