msgid ""
":gh:`144370`: Disallow usage of control characters in status in "
":mod:`wsgiref.handlers` to prevent HTTP header injections. Patch by Benedikt"
" Johannes."
msgstr ""
":gh:`144370`: 不允许在 :mod:`wsgiref.handlers` 的状态中使用控制字符以防止 HTTP 标头注入。 由 "
"Benedikt Johannes 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:124
msgid ""
":gh:`143930`: Reject leading dashes in URLs passed to "
":func:`webbrowser.open`."
msgstr ":gh:`143930`: 拒绝传给 :func:`webbrowser.open` 的 URL 中带有开头横杠符。"

#: ../NEWS:130
msgid ""
":gh:`148157`: Fix an unlikely crash when parsing an invalid type comments "
"for function parameters. Found by OSS Fuzz in :oss-fuzz:`492782951`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`148157`: 修复当解析针对函数形参的无效类型注释时可能发生的崩溃问题。 由 OSS Fuzz 在 :oss-"
"fuzz:`492782951` 中贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:133
msgid ""
":gh:`148144`: Initialize ``_PyInterpreterFrame.visited`` when copying "
"interpreter frames so incremental GC does not read an uninitialized byte "
"from generator and frame-object copies."
msgstr ""
":gh:`148144`: 在拷贝解释器帧时初始化 ``_PyInterpreterFrame.visited`` 以使增量式 GC "
"不会读取来自生成器和帧对象拷贝的未初始化字节数据。"

#: ../NEWS:137
msgid ""
":gh:`146615`: Fix a crash in :meth:`~object.__get__` for "
":c:expr:`METH_METHOD` descriptors when an invalid (non-type) object is "
"passed as the second argument. Patch by Steven Sun."
msgstr ""
":gh:`146615`: 修复针对 :c:expr:`METH_METHOD` 描述器的 :meth:`~object.__get__` "
"中当将无效的（空类型）对象作为第二个参数传入时的崩溃问题。 由 Steven Sun 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:141
msgid ""
":gh:`146308`: Fixed several error handling issues in the "
":mod:`!_remote_debugging` module, including safer validation of remote "
"``int`` objects, clearer asyncio task chain failures, and cache cleanup "
"fixes that avoid leaking or double-freeing metadata on allocation failure. "
"Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":gh:`146308`: 修复 :mod:`!_remote_debugging` 模块中的几个错误处理问题，包括更安全的远程 ``int`` "
"对象验证，更清晰的 asyncio 任务链失败信息，以及在分配失败时避免泄漏或双重释放元数据的缓存清理。 由 Pablo Galindo 编写补丁。."

#: ../NEWS:147
msgid ""
":gh:`146128`: Fix a bug which could cause constant values to be partially "
"corrupted in AArch64 JIT code. This issue is theoretical, and hasn't "
"actually been observed in unmodified Python interpreters."
msgstr ""
":gh:`146128`: 修复在 AArch64 JIT 代码中可能导致常量值部分损坏的程序缺陷。 此问题是理论性的，并未在未修改的 Python "
"解释器中被实际观察到。"

#: ../NEWS:151
msgid ""
":gh:`146250`: Fixed a memory leak in :exc:`SyntaxError` when re-initializing"
" it."
msgstr ":gh:`146250`: 修复 :exc:`SyntaxError` 在重初始化时的内存泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:154
msgid ""
":gh:`146245`: Fixed reference leaks in :mod:`socket` when audit hooks raise "
"exceptions in :func:`socket.getaddrinfo` and :meth:`!socket.sendto`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`146245`: 修复 :mod:`socket` 中审计钩子在 :func:`socket.getaddrinfo` 和 "
":meth:`!socket.sendto` 中引发异常时的引用泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:157
msgid ""
":gh:`146196`: Fix potential Undefined Behavior in "
":c:func:`PyUnicodeWriter_WriteASCII` by adding a zero-length check. Patch by"
" Shamil Abdulaev."
msgstr ""
":gh:`146196`: 通过添加零长度检测修复 :c:func:`PyUnicodeWriter_WriteASCII` 中潜在的未定义行为。 由 "
"Shamil Abdulaev 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:161
msgid ""
":gh:`146227`: Fix wrong type in ``_Py_atomic_load_uint16`` in the C11 "
"atomics backend (``pyatomic_std.h``), which used a 32-bit atomic load "
"instead of 16-bit. Found by Mohammed Zuhaib."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:165
msgid ""
":gh:`146056`: Fix :func:`repr` for lists and tuples containing ``NULL``\\ s."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:167
msgid ""
":gh:`146092`: Handle properly memory allocation failures on str and float "
"opcodes. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:170
msgid ""
":gh:`146041`: Fix free-threading scaling bottleneck in :func:`sys.intern` "
"and :c:func:`PyObject_SetAttr` by avoiding the interpreter-wide lock when "
"the string is already interned and immortalized."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:174
msgid ""
":gh:`145990`: ``python --help-env`` sections are now sorted by environment "
"variable name."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:177
msgid ""
":gh:`145990`: ``python --help-xoptions`` is now sorted by ``-X`` option "
"name."
msgstr ":gh:`145990`: ``python --help-xoptions`` 现在将按 ``-X`` 选项名称排序。"

#: ../NEWS:179
msgid ":gh:`145376`: Fix GC tracking in ``structseq.__replace__()``."
msgstr ":gh:`145376`: 修复 ``structseq.__replace__()`` 中的 GC 追踪问题。"

#: ../NEWS:181
msgid ""
":gh:`145792`: Fix out-of-bounds access when invoking faulthandler on a "
"CPython build compiled without support for VLAs."
msgstr ":gh:`145792`: 修复当在编译时未启用 VLA 支持的 CPython 构建版上唤起错误处理器时出现越界访问的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:184
msgid ""
":gh:`142183`: Avoid a pathological case where repeated calls at a specific "
"stack depth could be significantly slower."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:187
msgid ""
":gh:`145779`: Improve scaling of :func:`classmethod` and "
":func:`staticmethod` calls in the free-threaded build by avoiding the "
"descriptor ``__get__`` call."
msgstr ""
":gh:`145779`: 通过避免调用描述器的 ``__get__`` 来提升 :func:`classmethod` 和 "
":func:`staticmethod` 调用的适应性。"

#: ../NEWS:191
msgid ""
":gh:`145783`: Fix an unlikely crash in the parser when certain errors were "
"erroneously not propagated. Found by OSS Fuzz in :oss-fuzz:`491369109`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`145783`: 修复当有特定错误未被正确传播时解析器的意外崩溃问题。 由 OSS Fuzz 在 :oss-fuzz:`491369109` "
"中发现。."

#: ../NEWS:194
msgid ""
":gh:`145685`: Improve scaling of type attribute lookups in the :term:`free-"
"threaded build` by avoiding contention on the internal type lock."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:198
msgid ""
":gh:`145701`: Fix :exc:`SystemError` when ``__classdict__`` or "
"``__conditional_annotations__`` is in a class-scope inlined comprehension. "
"Found by OSS Fuzz in :oss-fuzz:`491105000`."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:202
msgid ""
":gh:`145713`: Make :meth:`bytearray.resize` thread-safe in the free-threaded"
" build by using a critical section and calling the lock-held variant of the "
"resize function."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:206
msgid ""
":gh:`145615`: Fixed a memory leak in the :term:`free-threaded build` where "
"mimalloc pages could become permanently unreclaimable until the owning "
"thread exited."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:210
msgid ""
":gh:`145566`: In the free threading build, skip the stop-the-world pause "
"when reassigning ``__class__`` on a newly created object."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:213
msgid ""
":gh:`145335`: Fix a crash in :func:`os.pathconf` when called with ``-1`` as "
"the path argument."
msgstr ":gh:`145335`: 修复 :func:`os.pathconf` 附带 ``-1`` 作为 path 参数进行调用时的煤库问题。"

#: ../NEWS:216
msgid ""
":gh:`145036`: In free-threaded build, fix race condition when calling "
":meth:`!__sizeof__` on a :class:`list`"
msgstr ""
":gh:`145036`: 在自由线程构建版中，修复在 :class:`list` 上调用 :meth:`!__sizeof__` 时的竞争条件问题。"

#: ../NEWS:219
msgid ":gh:`145376`: Fix reference leaks in various unusual error scenarios."
msgstr ":gh:`145376`: 修复多个不常见错误场景中的引用泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:221
msgid ""
":gh:`145234`: Fixed a ``SystemError`` in the parser when an encoding cookie "
"(for example, UTF-7) decodes to carriage returns (``\\r``). Newlines are now"
" normalized after decoding in the string tokenizer."
msgstr ""
":gh:`145234`: 修复解析器中当编码的 cookie (例如使用 UTF-7) 解码为回车符 (``\\r``) 时发生 "
"``SystemError`` 的问题。 现在字符串分词器中解码完成后会进行标准化处理。"

#: ../NEWS:225
msgid "Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr "由 Pablo Galindo 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:227
msgid ""
":gh:`130555`: Fix use-after-free in :meth:`dict.clear` when the dictionary "
"values are embedded in an object and a destructor causes re-entrant mutation"
" of the dictionary."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130555`: 修复 :meth:`dict.clear` 在字典值是嵌入到某个对象并且析构器导致该字典的重进入改变时的释放后使用问题。"

#: ../NEWS:231
msgid ""
":gh:`145187`: Fix compiler assertion fail when a type parameter bound "
"contains an invalid expression in a conditional block."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:234
msgid ""
":gh:`145142`: Fix a crash in the free-threaded build when the dictionary "
"argument to :meth:`str.maketrans` is concurrently modified."
msgstr ":gh:`145142`: 修复在自由线程构建中当传给 :meth:`str.maketrans` 的字典参数被并发修改时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:237
msgid ""
":gh:`144872`: Fix heap buffer overflow in the parser found by OSS-Fuzz."
msgstr ":gh:`144872`: 修复用 OSS-Fuzz 找到的解析器内堆缓冲区溢出问题。"

#: ../NEWS:239
msgid ""
":gh:`144766`: Fix a crash in fork child process when perf support is "
"enabled."
msgstr ":gh:`144766`: 修复当 perf 支持被启用时在分叉子进程中的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:241
msgid ""
":gh:`144759`: Fix undefined behavior in the lexer when ``start`` and "
"``multi_line_start`` pointers are ``NULL`` in "
"``_PyLexer_remember_fstring_buffers()`` and "
"``_PyLexer_restore_fstring_buffers()``. The ``NULL`` pointer arithmetic "
"(``NULL - valid_pointer``) is now guarded with explicit ``NULL`` checks."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:247
msgid ""
":gh:`144563`: Fix interaction of the Tachyon profiler and :mod:`ctypes` and "
"other modules that load the Python shared library (if present) in an "
"independent map as this was causing the mechanism that loads the binary "
"information to be confused. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:252
msgid ""
":gh:`144601`: Fix crash when importing a module whose ``PyInit`` function "
"raises an exception from a subinterpreter."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:255
msgid ""
":gh:`144438`: Align the QSBR thread state array to a 64-byte cache line "
"boundary to avoid false sharing in the :term:`free-threaded build`."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:258
msgid ""
":gh:`144513`: Fix potential deadlock when using critical sections during "
"stop-the-world pauses in the free-threaded build."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:261
msgid ""
":gh:`144446`: Fix data races in the free-threaded build when reading frame "
"object attributes while another thread is executing the frame."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:264
msgid ""
":gh:`143636`: Fix a crash when calling :class:`SimpleNamespace.__replace__()"
" <types.SimpleNamespace>` on non-namespace instances. Patch by Bénédikt "
"Tran."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:268
msgid ""
":gh:`143650`: Fix race condition in :mod:`importlib` where a thread could "
"receive a stale module reference when another thread's import fails."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:271
msgid ""
":gh:`141732`: Ensure the :meth:`~object.__repr__` for :exc:`ExceptionGroup` "
"and :exc:`BaseExceptionGroup` does not change when the exception sequence "
"that was original passed in to its constructor is subsequently mutated."
msgstr ""
":gh:`141732`: 确保针对 :exc:`ExceptionGroup` 和 :exc:`BaseExceptionGroup` 的  "
":meth:`~object.__repr__` 在最初传入其构造器的异常序列后来被修改时不会发生变化。"

#: ../NEWS:275
msgid ""
":gh:`140594`: Fix an out of bounds read when a single NUL character is read "
"from the standard input. Patch by Shamil Abdulaev."
msgstr ":gh:`140594`: 修正当从标准输入读取单个 NUL 字符时的读取越界问题。 由 Shamil Abdulaev 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:278
msgid ""
":gh:`91636`: While performing garbage collection, clear weakrefs to "
"unreachable objects that are created during running of finalizers.  If those"
" weakrefs were are not cleared, they could reveal unreachable objects."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91636`: 在执行垃圾回收期间，将清理指向在终结器运行中被创建的不可达对象的弱引用。 "
"如果这些弱引用未被清理，它们可以揭示相应的不可达对象。"

#: ../NEWS:283
msgid ""
":gh:`130327`: Fix erroneous clearing of an object's :attr:`~object.__dict__`"
" if overwritten at runtime."
msgstr ":gh:`130327`: 修复当对象的 :attr:`~object.__dict__` 在运行时被覆盖时错误的清理问题。"

#: ../NEWS:286
msgid ""
":gh:`80667`: Literals using the ``\\N{name}`` escape syntax can now "
"construct CJK ideographs and Hangul syllables using case-insensitive names."
msgstr ""
":gh:`80667`: Literals using 使用 ``\\N{name}`` 转义语法的字面值现在可以使用大小写不敏感的名称构造 CJK "
"表意文字和 Hangul 音节。"

#: ../NEWS:292
msgid ""
":gh:`144503`: Fix a regression introduced in 3.14.3 and 3.13.12 where the "
":mod:`multiprocessing` ``forkserver`` start method would fail with "
":exc:`BrokenPipeError` when the parent process had a very large "
":data:`sys.argv`.  The argv is now passed to the forkserver as separate "
"command-line arguments rather than being embedded in the ``-c`` command "
"string, avoiding the operating system's per-argument length limit."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:299
msgid ""
":gh:`146613`: :mod:`itertools`: Fix a crash in :func:`itertools.groupby` "
"when the grouper iterator is concurrently mutated."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:302
msgid ""
":gh:`146080`: :mod:`ssl`: fix a crash when an SNI callback tries to use an "
"SSL object that has already been garbage-collected. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`146080`: :mod:`ssl`: 修复当一个 SNI 回调试图使用已被作为垃圾回收的 SSL 对象时的崩溃问题。 由 Bénédikt"
" Tran 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:306
msgid ""
":gh:`146556`: Fix :func:`annotationlib.get_annotations` hanging indefinitely"
" when called with ``eval_str=True`` on a callable that has a circular "
"``__wrapped__`` chain (e.g. ``f.__wrapped__ = f``). Cycle detection using an"
" id-based visited set now stops the traversal and falls back to the globals "
"found so far, mirroring the approach of :func:`inspect.unwrap`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`146556`: 修复在具有循环的 ``__wrapped__`` 链 (例如 ``f.__wrapped__ = f``) "
"的可调用对象上调用 :func:`annotationlib.get_annotations` 并传入 ``eval_str=True`` "
"时无限挂起的问题。 循环检测使用基于标识号的已访问集现在将停止遍历并回退至目前已找到的全局变量，即沿用 :func:`inspect.unwrap` "
"的方式。"

#: ../NEWS:312
msgid ""
":gh:`146090`: :mod:`sqlite3`: fix a crash when "
":meth:`sqlite3.Connection.create_collation` fails with `SQLITE_BUSY "
"<https://sqlite.org/rescode.html#busy>`__. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`146090`: :mod:`sqlite3`: 修复当 "
":meth:`sqlite3.Connection.create_collation` 因 `SQLITE_BUSY "
"<https://sqlite.org/rescode.html#busy>`__ 而执行失败时的崩溃问题。 由 Bénédikt Tran 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:316
msgid ""
":gh:`146090`: :mod:`sqlite3`: properly raise :exc:`MemoryError` instead of "
":exc:`SystemError` when a context callback fails to be allocated. Patch by "
"Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`146090`: :mod:`sqlite3`: 当分配上下文回调失败时将正确地引发 :exc:`MemoryError` 而不是 "
":exc:`SystemError`。 由 Bénédikt Tran 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:320
msgid ""
":gh:`145633`: Fix ``struct.pack('f', float)``: use :c:func:`PyFloat_Pack4` "
"to raise :exc:`OverflowError`. Patch by Sergey B Kirpichev and Victor "
"Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`145633`: 修正 ``struct.pack('f', float)``: 使用 :c:func:`PyFloat_Pack4` 来引发"
" :exc:`OverflowError`。 由 Sergey B Kirpichev 和 Victor Stinner 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:324
msgid ""
":gh:`146310`: The :mod:`ensurepip` module no longer looks for ``pip-*.whl`` "
"wheel packages in the current directory."
msgstr ":gh:`146310`: :mod:`ensurepip` 模块将不会在当前目录下查找 ``pip-*.whl`` wheel 包。"

#: ../NEWS:327
msgid ""
":gh:`146083`: Update bundled `libexpat <https://libexpat.github.io/>`_ to "
"version 2.7.5."
msgstr ""
":gh:`146083`: 将捆绑的 `libexpat <https://libexpat.github.io/>`_ 更新至 2.7.5。"

#: ../NEWS:330
msgid ""
":gh:`146076`: :mod:`zoneinfo`: fix crashes when deleting ``_weak_cache`` "
"from a :class:`zoneinfo.ZoneInfo` subclass."
msgstr ""
":gh:`146076`: :mod:`zoneinfo`: 修复当从 :class:`zoneinfo.ZoneInfo` 子类删除 "
"``_weak_cache`` 时发生崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:333
msgid ""
":gh:`146054`: Limit the size of :func:`encodings.search_function` cache. "
"Found by OSS Fuzz in :oss-fuzz:`493449985`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`146054`: 限制 :func:`encodings.search_function` 缓冲区的大小。 由 OSS Fuzz 在 "
":oss-fuzz:`493449985` 中发现。"

#: ../NEWS:336
msgid ""
":gh:`146004`: All :option:`-X` options from the Python command line are now "
"propagated to child processes spawned by :mod:`multiprocessing`, not just a "
"hard-coded subset.  This makes the behavior consistent between default "
"\"spawn\" and \"forkserver\" start methods and the old \"fork\" start "
"method. The options that were previously not propagated are: "
"``context_aware_warnings``, ``cpu_count``, ``disable-remote-debug``, "
"``int_max_str_digits``, ``lazy_imports``, ``no_debug_ranges``, "
"``pathconfig_warnings``, ``perf``, ``perf_jit``, ``presite``, "
"``pycache_prefix``, ``thread_inherit_context``, and "
"``warn_default_encoding``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`146004`: 现在所有来自 Python 命令行的 :option:`-X` 选项都将传播到由 "
":mod:`multiprocessing` 通过 spawn 启动的子进程，而不只是一个硬编码的子集。 这使得默认 \"spawn\" 和 "
"\"forkserver\" 启动方法与旧式 \"fork\" 启动方法之间的行为保持一致。 之前不会被传播的选项是: "
"``context_aware_warnings``, ``cpu_count``, ``disable-remote-debug``, "
"``int_max_str_digits``, ``lazy_imports``, ``no_debug_ranges``, "
"``pathconfig_warnings``, ``perf``, ``perf_jit``, ``presite``, "
"``pycache_prefix``, ``thread_inherit_context`` 和 ``warn_default_encoding``。"

#: ../NEWS:347
msgid ""
":gh:`145883`: :mod:`zoneinfo`: Fix heap buffer overflow reads from malformed"
" TZif data. Found by OSS Fuzz, issues :oss-fuzz:`492245058` and :oss-"
"fuzz:`492230068`."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:351
msgid ""
":gh:`145754`: Request signature during mock autospec with ``FORWARDREF`` "
"annotation format. This prevents runtime errors when an annotation uses a "
"name that is not defined at runtime."
msgstr ""
":gh:`145754`: 在模拟使用 ``FORWARDREF`` 标注格式的 autospec 期间请求签名。 "
"这将防止在标注使用未在运行时定义的名称时发生运行时错误。"

#: ../NEWS:355
msgid ""
":gh:`145750`: Avoid undefined behaviour from signed integer overflow when "
"parsing format strings in the :mod:`struct` module. Found by OSS Fuzz in "
":oss-fuzz:`488466741`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`145750`: 当在 :mod:`struct` 模块中解析格式字符串时避免来自有符号整数溢出的未定义行为。 由 OSS Fuzz 在 "
":oss-fuzz:`488466741` 中发现。"

#: ../NEWS:359
msgid ""
":gh:`145492`: Fix infinite recursion in :class:`collections.defaultdict` "
"``__repr__`` when a ``defaultdict`` contains itself. Based on analysis by "
"KowalskiThomas in :gh:`145492`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`145492`: 修复 :class:`collections.defaultdict` ``__repr__`` 中当一个 "
"``defaultdict`` 包含其自身时的的无限回归问题。 基于 KowalskiThomas 在 :gh:`145492` 中的分析。"

#: ../NEWS:363
msgid ""
":gh:`145623`: Fix crash in :mod:`struct` when calling :func:`repr` or "
"``__sizeof__()`` on an uninitialized :class:`struct.Struct` object created "
"via ``Struct.__new__()`` without calling ``__init__()``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`145623`: 修复 :mod:`struct` 中当在通过 ``Struct.__new__()`` 而不调用 "
"``__init__()`` 创建的未初始化 :class:`struct.Struct` 对象上调用 :func:`repr` 或 "
"``__sizeof__()`` 时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:367
msgid ""
":gh:`145616`: Detect Android sysconfig ABI correctly on 32-bit ARM Android "
"on 64-bit ARM kernel"
msgstr ""
":gh:`145616`: 在 64 位 ARM 内核上的 32 位 ARM Android 中正确检测 Android sysconfig ABI。"

#: ../NEWS:370
msgid ""
":gh:`145551`: Fix InvalidStateError when cancelling process created by "
":func:`asyncio.create_subprocess_exec` or "
":func:`asyncio.create_subprocess_shell`. Patch by Daan De Meyer."
msgstr ""
":gh:`145551`: 修复当取消由 :func:`asyncio.create_subprocess_exec` 或 "
":func:`asyncio.create_subprocess_shell` 创建的进程时引发 InvalidStateError 的问题。 由 "
"Daan De Meyer 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:374
msgid ""
":gh:`145446`: Now :mod:`functools` is safer in free-threaded build when "
"using keywords in :func:`functools.partial`"
msgstr ""
":gh:`145446`:现在当在 :func:`functools.partial` 中使用关键字参数时自由线程构建上的 "
":mod:`functools` 将更为安全"

#: ../NEWS:377
msgid ""
":gh:`145417`: :mod:`venv`: Prevent incorrect preservation of SELinux context"
" when copying the ``Activate.ps1`` script. The script inherited the SELinux "
"security context of the system template directory, rather than the "
"destination project directory."
msgstr ""
