":gh:`145376`: 修复 :mod:`hashlib` 和 :mod:`hmac` 模块中在不常见错误场景下的双重释放和空指针解引用问题。"

#: ../NEWS:385
msgid ""
":gh:`145301`: :mod:`hmac`: fix a crash when the initialization of the "
"underlying C extension module fails."
msgstr ":gh:`145301`: :mod:`hmac`: 修复当下层的 C 扩展模块初始化失败时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:388
msgid ""
":gh:`145301`: :mod:`hashlib`: fix a crash when the initialization of the "
"underlying C extension module fails."
msgstr ":gh:`145301`: :mod:`hashlib`: 修复当下层 C 扩展模块的初始化失败时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:391
msgid ""
":gh:`145264`: Base64 decoder (see :func:`binascii.a2b_base64`, "
":func:`base64.b64decode`, etc) no longer ignores excess data after the first"
