":rfc:`4648`, section 3.3, it now ignores the pad character, \"=\", if it is "
"present before the end of the encoded data."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:397
msgid ""
":gh:`145158`: Avoid undefined behaviour from signed integer overflow when "
"parsing format strings in the :mod:`struct` module."
msgstr ":gh:`145158`: 当解析 :mod:`struct` 模块中的格式字符串时避免来自有符号整数溢出的未定义行为。"

#: ../NEWS:400
msgid ""
