msgstr ""
":gh:`144777`: 修复 :term:`free-threaded build` 中 "
":class:`io.IncrementalNewlineDecoder` 的数据竞争问题。"

#: ../NEWS:413
msgid ""
":gh:`144809`: Make :class:`collections.deque` copy atomic in the "
":term:`free-threaded build`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`144809`: 使 :class:`collections.deque` 的拷贝在 :term:`free-threaded build` "
"中是原子化的。"

#: ../NEWS:416
msgid ""
":gh:`144835`: Added missing explanations for some parameters in "
":func:`glob.glob` and :func:`glob.iglob`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`144835`: 为 :func:`glob.glob` 和 :func:`glob.iglob` 中的某些形参添加了缺失的说明。"

#: ../NEWS:419
msgid ""
":gh:`144833`: Fixed a use-after-free in :mod:`ssl` when ``SSL_new()`` "
"returns NULL in ``newPySSLSocket()``. The error was reported via a dangling "
"pointer after the object had already been freed."
msgstr ""
":gh:`144833`: 修复在 :mod:`ssl` 中当 ``newPySSLSocket()`` 的 ``SSL_new()`` 返回 NULL"
" 时的一个释放后再使用的问题。 此错误是在对象已被释放后通过一个悬空指针来报告的。"

#: ../NEWS:423
msgid ""
":gh:`144782`: Fix :class:`argparse.ArgumentParser` to be :mod:`pickleable "
"<pickle>`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`144782`: 将 :class:`argparse.ArgumentParser` 修正为 :mod:`可 pickle 对象 "
"<pickle>`。"

#: ../NEWS:426
msgid ""
":gh:`144259`: Fix inconsistent display of long multiline pasted content in "
"the REPL."
msgstr ":gh:`144259`: 修正F REPL 中多行长文本粘贴内容显示不一致的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:429
msgid ""
":gh:`144156`: Fix the folding of headers by the :mod:`email` library when "
":rfc:`2047` encoded words are used.  Now whitespace is correctly preserved "
"and also correctly added between adjacent encoded words.  The latter "
"property was broken by the fix for :gh:`92081`, which mostly fixed previous "
"failures to preserve whitespace."
msgstr ""
":gh:`144156`: 修复当使用 :rfc:`2047` 编码的单词时 :mod:`email` 库对标头的折叠问题。 "
"现在空格符会被正确保留并在相邻的已编码单词间正确添加。 后面的属性曾被针对 :gh:`92081` "
"的修复所破坏，该修复解决了之前大多数未保留空格符的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:435
msgid ""
":gh:`66305`: Fixed a hang on Windows in the :mod:`tempfile` module when "
"trying to create a temporary file or subdirectory in a non-writable "
"directory."
msgstr ""
":gh:`66305`: 修复 Windows 上的 :mod:`tempfile` 模块当尝试在不可写的目录下创建临时文件或子目录时的挂起问题。"

#: ../NEWS:439
msgid ""
":gh:`140814`: :func:`multiprocessing.freeze_support` no longer sets the "
"default start method as a side effect, which previously caused a subsequent "
":func:`multiprocessing.set_start_method` call to raise :exc:`RuntimeError`."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:444
msgid ""
":gh:`144475`: Calling :func:`repr` on :func:`functools.partial` is now safer"
" when the partial object's internal attributes are replaced while the string"
" representation is being generated."
msgstr ""
":gh:`144475`: 现在当生成字符串表示形式时对于 partial 对象的内部属性被替换的情况在 "
":func:`functools.partial` 上调用 :func:`repr` 将更为安全。"

#: ../NEWS:448
msgid ""
":gh:`144538`: Bump the version of pip bundled in ensurepip to version 26.0.1"
msgstr ":gh:`144538`: 将 ensurepip 内置的 pip 版本升级至 26.0.1"

#: ../NEWS:450
msgid ""
":gh:`144494`: Fix performance regression in :func:`asyncio.all_tasks` on "
":term:`free-threaded builds <free-threaded build>`. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`144494`: 修复 :func:`asyncio.all_tasks` on :term:`自由线程构建版 <free-threaded "
"build>` 中的性能衰退问题。 由 Kumar Aditya 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:453
msgid ""
":gh:`144316`: Fix crash in ``_remote_debugging`` that caused "
"``test_external_inspection`` to intermittently fail. Patch by Taegyun Kim."
msgstr ""
":gh:`144316`: 修复 ``_remote_debugging`` 中导致 ``test_external_inspection`` "
"间歇性失败的崩溃问题。 由 Taegyun Kim 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:456
msgid ""
":gh:`144363`: Update bundled `libexpat <https://libexpat.github.io/>`_ to "
"2.7.4"
msgstr ""
":gh:`144363`: 将捆绑的 `libexpat <https://libexpat.github.io/>`_ 更新至 2.7.4"

#: ../NEWS:459
msgid ""
":gh:`143637`: Fixed a crash in socket.sendmsg() that could occur if "
"ancillary data is mutated re-entrantly during argument parsing."
msgstr ":gh:`143637`: 修复 socket.sendmsg() 中当附属数据在参数解析期间以重进入方式被修改时可能发生的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:462
msgid ""
":gh:`143543`: Fix a crash in itertools.groupby that could occur when a user-"
