"方法在键比较期间重进入迭代器时可能发生的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:466
msgid ""
":gh:`140652`: Fix a crash in :func:`!_interpchannels.list_all` after closing"
" a channel."
msgstr ":gh:`140652`: 修复 :func:`!_interpchannels.list_all` 中在关闭一个通道后的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:469
msgid ""
":gh:`143698`: Allow *scheduler* and *setpgroup* arguments to be explicitly "
":const:`None` when calling :func:`os.posix_spawn` or "
":func:`os.posix_spawnp`. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`143698`: 当调用 :func:`os.posix_spawn` 或 :func:`os.posix_spawnp` 时允许 "
"*scheduler* 和 *setpgroup* 参数被显式地设为 :const:`None`。 由 Bénédikt Tran 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:473
msgid ""
":gh:`143698`: Raise :exc:`TypeError` instead of :exc:`SystemError` when the "
"*scheduler* in :func:`os.posix_spawn` or :func:`os.posix_spawnp` is not a "
"tuple. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`143698`: 当 :func:`os.posix_spawn` 或 :func:`os.posix_spawnp` 中的 "
"*scheduler* 不是一个元组时将引发 :exc:`TypeError` 而非 :exc:`SystemError`。 由 Bénédikt "
"Tran 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:477
msgid ""
":gh:`142516`: :mod:`ssl`: fix reference leaks in :class:`ssl.SSLContext` "
"objects. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`142516`: :mod:`ssl`: 修复 :class:`ssl.SSLContext` 对象中的引用泄漏问题。 由 Bénédikt "
"Tran 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:480
msgid ""
":gh:`143304`: Fix :class:`ctypes.CDLL` to honor the ``handle`` parameter on "
