msgstr ":gh:`143304`: 修正 :class:`ctypes.CDLL` 以在 POSIX 系统上接受 ``handle`` 形参。"

#: ../NEWS:483
msgid ""
":gh:`142781`: :mod:`zoneinfo`: fix a crash when instantiating "
":class:`~zoneinfo.ZoneInfo` objects for which the internal class-level cache"
" is inconsistent."
msgstr ""
":gh:`142781`: :mod:`zoneinfo`: 修复在内部类级缓存不一致的情况下当初始化 "
":class:`~zoneinfo.ZoneInfo` 对象时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:487
msgid ""
":gh:`142763`: Fix a race condition between :class:`zoneinfo.ZoneInfo` "
"creation and :func:`zoneinfo.ZoneInfo.clear_cache` that could raise "
":exc:`KeyError`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`142763`: 修复在 :class:`zoneinfo.ZoneInfo` 创建和 "
":func:`zoneinfo.ZoneInfo.clear_cache` 之间可能引发 :exc:`KeyError` 的竞争条件问题。"

#: ../NEWS:491
msgid ""
":gh:`142787`: Fix assertion failure in :mod:`sqlite3` blob subscript when "
"slicing with indices that result in an empty slice."
msgstr ":gh:`142787`: 修复在 :mod:`sqlite3` blob 抽取操作中当使用会导致空切片的索引进行切片时断言失败的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:494
msgid ""
":gh:`142352`: Fix :meth:`asyncio.StreamWriter.start_tls` to transfer "
"buffered data from :class:`~asyncio.StreamReader` to the SSL layer, "
"preventing data loss when upgrading a connection to TLS mid-stream (e.g., "
"when implementing PROXY protocol support)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`142352`: 修复 :meth:`asyncio.StreamWriter.start_tls` 以将缓冲数据从 "
":class:`~asyncio.StreamReader` 传输至 SSL 层，防止当连接升级为 TLS 中间流（例如在实现 PROXY "
"协议支持）时的数据丢失。"

#: ../NEWS:499
msgid ""
":gh:`141707`: Don't change :class:`tarfile.TarInfo` type from ``AREGTYPE`` "
"to ``DIRTYPE`` when parsing GNU long name or link headers."
msgstr ""
