":term:`free threaded <free threading>` build."
msgstr ""
":gh:`144981`: 使 :c:func:`PyUnstable_Code_SetExtra`, "
":c:func:`PyUnstable_Code_GetExtra` 和 "
":c:func:`PyUnstable_Eval_RequestCodeExtraIndex` 在 :term:`自由线程 <free "
"threading>` 构建版上是线程安全的。"

#: ../NEWS:605
msgid "Python 3.14.3 final"
msgstr "Python 3.14.3 正式版"

#: ../NEWS:607
msgid "*Release date: 2026-02-03*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2026-02-03*"

#: ../NEWS:612
msgid ""
":gh:`128067`: Fix a bug in PyREPL on Windows where output without a trailing"
" newline was overwritten by the next prompt."
msgstr ":gh:`128067`: 修复 Windows 上的 PyREPL 中不带末尾换行符的输出会被下一个提示符覆盖的程序缺陷。"

#: ../NEWS:616 ../NEWS:1144 ../NEWS:1965 ../NEWS:2004 ../NEWS:2219
#: ../NEWS:2358 ../NEWS:2844 ../NEWS:3127 ../NEWS:3952 ../NEWS:4318
#: ../NEWS:4896 ../NEWS:5448 ../NEWS:5797 ../NEWS:6262 ../NEWS:6950
