#: ../NEWS:55294
msgid "Tools/Demos"
msgstr "工具/示例"

#: ../NEWS:618
msgid ""
":gh:`142095`: Make gdb 'py-bt' command use frame from thread local state "
"when available. Patch by Sam Gross and Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`142095`: 在可能的情况下让 gdb 'py-bt' 命令使用来自线程局部状态的帧。 由 Sam Gross 和 Victor "
"Stinner 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:624
msgid ""
":gh:`144415`: The Android testbed now distinguishes between stdout/stderr "
"messages which were triggered by a newline, and those triggered by a manual "
"call to ``flush``. This fixes logging of progress indicators and similar "
"content."
msgstr ""
":gh:`144415`: Android testbed 现在会区分由换行符触发的和由手动调用 ``flush`` 触发的 stdout/stderr"
" 消息。 这将修正进度提示及类似内容的日志记录问题。"

#: ../NEWS:629
msgid ""
":gh:`143460`: Skip tests relying on infinite recusion if stack size is "
"unlimited."
msgstr ":gh:`143460`: 如果栈大小没有限制则将跳过依赖于无限递归的测试。"

#: ../NEWS:632
msgid ""
":gh:`65784`: Add support for parametrized resource ``wantobjects`` in "
"regrtests, which allows to run Tkinter tests with the specified value of "
":data:`!tkinter.wantobjects`, for example ``-u wantobjects=0``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`65784`: 增加对 regrtests 中参数化资源 ``wantobjects`` 的支持，这将允许运行 Tkinter "
"测试时使用指定的 :data:`!tkinter.wantobjects` 值，例如 ``-u wantobjects=0``。"

#: ../NEWS:636
msgid ""
":gh:`143553`: Add support for parametrized resources, such as ``-u "
"xpickle=2.7``."
msgstr ":gh:`143553`: 增加对参数化资源的支持，如 ``-u xpickle=2.7``。"

#: ../NEWS:639
msgid ""
":gh:`142836`: Accommodated Solaris in "
"``test_pdb.test_script_target_anonymous_pipe``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`142836`: 在 ``test_pdb.test_script_target_anonymous_pipe`` 中支持 Solaris。"

#: ../NEWS:642
msgid ""
":issue:`31391`: Forward-port test_xpickle from Python 2 to Python 3 and add "
"the resource back to test's command line."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31391`: 将 test_xpickle 从 Python 2 前向移植到 Python 3 并将资源添加回测试的命令行。"

#: ../NEWS:648
msgid ""
":gh:`144125`: :mod:`~email.generator.BytesGenerator` will now refuse to "
"serialize (write) headers that are unsafely folded or delimited; see "
":attr:`~email.policy.Policy.verify_generated_headers`. (Contributed by Bas "
"Bloemsaat and Petr Viktorin in :gh:`121650`)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`144125`: :mod:`~email.generator.BytesGenerator` "
"现在将拒绝序列化（写入）不安全折叠或分隔的标头；参见 "
":attr:`~email.policy.Policy.verify_generated_headers`。（由 Bas Bloemsaat 和 "
"Petr Viktorin 在 :gh:`121650` 中贡献。）"

#: ../NEWS:653
msgid ""
":gh:`143935`: Fixed a bug in the folding of comments when flattening an "
"email message using a modern email policy. Comments consisting of a very "
"long sequence of non-foldable characters could trigger a forced line wrap "
"that omitted the required leading space on the continuation line, causing "
"the remainder of the comment to be interpreted as a new header field. This "
"enabled header injection with carefully crafted inputs."
msgstr ""
":gh:`143935`: "
"修复了使用现代邮件策略扁平化电子邮件消息时注释折叠中的程序缺陷。由很长的不可折叠字符序列组成的注释可能会触发强制换行，而该换行会省略续行所需的前导空格，导致注释的剩余部分被解释为新的标头字段。这使得通过精心构造的输入实现标头注入成为可能。"

#: ../NEWS:660
msgid ":gh:`143925`: Reject control characters in ``data:`` URL media types."
msgstr ":gh:`143925`: 拒绝 ``data:`` URL 媒体类型中的控制字符。"

#: ../NEWS:662
msgid ""
":gh:`143919`: Reject control characters in :class:`http.cookies.Morsel` "
"fields and values."
msgstr ":gh:`143919`: 拒绝 :class:`http.cookies.Morsel` 字段和值中的控制字符。"

#: ../NEWS:665
msgid ""
":gh:`143916`: Reject C0 control characters within wsgiref.headers.Headers "
"fields, values, and parameters."
msgstr ":gh:`143916`: 拒绝 wsgiref.headers.Headers 字段、值和参数之内的 C0 控制字符。"

#: ../NEWS:671
msgid ""
":gh:`144380`: Improve performance of :class:`io.BufferedReader` line "
"iteration by ~49%."
msgstr ":gh:`144380`: 将 :class:`io.BufferedReader` 行迭代的性能提升 ~49%。"

#: ../NEWS:674
msgid ""
":gh:`144169`: Fix three crashes when non-string keyword arguments are "
"supplied to objects in the :mod:`ast` module."
msgstr ":gh:`144169`: 修复向 :mod:`ast` 模块中的对象提供非字符串关键字参数时的三个崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:677
msgid ""
":gh:`144100`: Fixed a crash in ctypes when using a deprecated "
"``POINTER(str)`` type in ``argtypes``. Instead of aborting, ctypes now "
"raises a proper Python exception when the pointer target type is unresolved."
msgstr ""
":gh:`144100`: 修复在 ``argtypes`` 中使用已弃用的 ``POINTER(str)`` 类型时 ctypes "
"中的崩溃问题。当指针目标类型未解析时，ctypes 现在会引发正确的 Python 异常而不是中止程序。"

#: ../NEWS:682
msgid ""
":gh:`144050`: Fix :func:`stat.filemode` in the pure-Python implementation to"
" avoid misclassifying invalid mode values as block devices."
msgstr ""
":gh:`144050`: 修正纯 Python 实现中的 :func:`stat.filemode` 以避免将无效的模式值误分类为块设备。"

#: ../NEWS:685
msgid ""
":gh:`144023`: Fixed validation of file descriptor 0 in posix functions when "
"used with follow_symlinks parameter."
msgstr ":gh:`144023`: 修复 posix 函数在附带 follow_symlinks 形参使用时文件描述符 0 的验证问题。"

#: ../NEWS:688
msgid ""
":gh:`143999`: Fix an issue where :func:`inspect.getgeneratorstate` and "
":func:`inspect.getcoroutinestate` could fail for generators wrapped by "
":func:`types.coroutine` in the suspended state."
msgstr ""
":gh:`143999`: 修复 :func:`inspect.getgeneratorstate` 和 "
":func:`inspect.getcoroutinestate` 对以 :func:`types.coroutine` "
"包装的生成器处于挂起状态时可能执行失败的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:692
msgid ""
":gh:`143831`: :class:`annotationlib.ForwardRef` objects are now hashable "
"when created from annotation scopes with closures. Previously, hashing such "
"objects would throw an exception. Patch by Bartosz Sławecki."
msgstr ""
":gh:`143831`: 从带有闭包的标注作用域创建的 :class:`annotationlib.ForwardRef` "
"对象现在可哈希。此前，对此类对象进行哈希会抛出异常。由 Bartosz Sławecki 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:696
msgid ""
":gh:`143874`: Fixed a bug in :mod:`pdb` where expression results were not "
"sent back to remote client."
msgstr ":gh:`143874`: 修复 :mod:`pdb` 中表达式结果未发送回远程客户端的程序缺陷。"

#: ../NEWS:699
msgid ""
":gh:`143880`: Fix data race in :func:`functools.partial` in the :term:`free "
"threading` build."
msgstr ""
":gh:`143880`: 修复 :term:`free threading` 构建版本中 :func:`functools.partial` "
"的数据竞争问题。"

#: ../NEWS:702
msgid ""
":gh:`143706`: Fix :mod:`multiprocessing` forkserver so that :data:`sys.argv`"
" is correctly set before ``__main__`` is preloaded. Previously, "
":data:`sys.argv` was empty during main module import in forkserver child "
"processes. This fixes a regression introduced in 3.13.8 and 3.14.1. Root "
"caused by Aaron Wieczorek, test provided by Thomas Watson, thanks!"
msgstr ""
":gh:`143706`: 修复 :mod:`multiprocessing` forkserver 以便在预加载 ``__main__`` "
"之前正确设置 :data:`sys.argv`。此前，forkserver 子进程中在主模块导入期间 :data:`sys.argv` 是空的。这修复了"
" 3.13.8 和 3.14.1 中引入的回归问题。由 Aaron Wieczorek 根本定位，由 Thomas Watson 提供测试，感谢！"

#: ../NEWS:708
msgid ""
":gh:`143638`: Forbid reentrant calls of the :class:`pickle.Pickler` and "
":class:`pickle.Unpickler` methods for the C implementation. Previously, this"
" could cause crash or data corruption, now concurrent calls of methods of "
"the same object raise :exc:`RuntimeError`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`143638`: 禁止 C 实现中 :class:`pickle.Pickler` 和 :class:`pickle.Unpickler` "
"方法的重入调用。此前，这可能会导致崩溃或数据损坏，现在对同一对象的方法进行并发调用将引发 :exc:`RuntimeError`。"

#: ../NEWS:713
msgid ""
":gh:`78724`: Raise :exc:`RuntimeError`'s when user attempts to call methods "
"on half-initialized :class:`~struct.Struct` objects, For example, created by"
" ``Struct.__new__(Struct)``.  Patch by Sergey B Kirpichev."
msgstr ""
":gh:`78724`: 当用户尝试调用半初始化的 :class:`~struct.Struct` 对象（例如由 "
"``Struct.__new__(Struct)`` 创建的对象）的方法时引发 :exc:`RuntimeError`。由 Sergey B "
"Kirpichev 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:717
msgid ""
":gh:`143196`: Fix crash when the internal encoder object returned by "
"undocumented function :func:`!json.encoder.c_make_encoder` was called with "
"non-zero second (*_current_indent_level*) argument."
msgstr ""
":gh:`143196`: 修复由未文档化函数 :func:`!json.encoder.c_make_encoder` "
"返回的内部编码器对象在附带非零第二个参数 (*_current_indent_level*) 调用时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:721
msgid ""
":gh:`143191`: :func:`_thread.stack_size` now raises :exc:`ValueError` if the"
" stack size is too small. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`143191`: 如果栈大小过小，:func:`_thread.stack_size` 现在将引发 :exc:`ValueError`。由 "
"Victor Stinner 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:724
msgid ""
":gh:`143602`: Fix a inconsistency issue in :meth:`~io.RawIOBase.write` that "
"leads to unexpected buffer overwrite by deduplicating the buffer exports."
msgstr ""
":gh:`143602`: 修复 :meth:`~io.RawIOBase.write` 中通过去重缓冲区导出导致意外缓冲区覆盖的不一致性问题。"

#: ../NEWS:727
msgid ""
":gh:`143547`: Fix :func:`sys.unraisablehook` when the hook raises an "
"exception and changes :func:`sys.unraisablehook`: hold a strong reference to"
" the old hook. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`143547`: 修复当钩子引发异常并更改 :func:`sys.unraisablehook` 时的 "
":func:`sys.unraisablehook`：持有对旧钩子的强引用。由 Victor Stinner 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:731
msgid ""
":gh:`143517`: :func:`annotationlib.get_annotations` no longer raises a "
":exc:`SyntaxError` when evaluating a stringified starred annotation that "
"starts with one or more whitespace characters followed by a ``*``. Patch by "
"Bartosz Sławecki."
msgstr ""
":gh:`143517`: 当求值以一个或多个空白字符后跟 ``*`` "
"开头的字符串化星号标注时，:func:`annotationlib.get_annotations` 不再引发 :exc:`SyntaxError`。由"
" Bartosz Sławecki 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:736
msgid ""
":gh:`143378`: Fix use-after-free crashes when a :class:`~io.BytesIO` object "
"is concurrently mutated during :meth:`~io.RawIOBase.write` or "
":meth:`~io.IOBase.writelines`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`143378`: 修复在 :meth:`~io.RawIOBase.write` 或 "
":meth:`~io.IOBase.writelines` 期间并发修改 :class:`~io.BytesIO` 对象时的释放后使用崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:740
msgid ""
":gh:`143346`: Fix incorrect wrapping of the Base64 data in "
":class:`!plistlib._PlistWriter` when the indent contains a mix of tabs and "
"spaces."
msgstr ""
":gh:`143346`: 修复当缩进包含制表符和空格混合时 :class:`!plistlib._PlistWriter` 中 Base64 "
"数据的错误换行问题。"

#: ../NEWS:744
msgid ""
":gh:`143310`: :mod:`tkinter`: fix a crash when a Python :class:`list` is "
"mutated during the conversion to a Tcl object (e.g., when setting a Tcl "
"variable). Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`143310`: :mod:`tkinter`: 修复在将 Python :class:`list` 转换为 Tcl 对象时 (例如在设置 "
"Tcl 变量时) 如果其被修改则会造成程序崩溃的问题。 由 Bénédikt Tran 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:748
msgid ""
":gh:`143309`: Fix a crash in :func:`os.execve` on non-Windows platforms when"
" given a custom environment mapping which is then mutated during parsing. "
"Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`143309`: 修复在非 Windows 平台上当给定一个在解析期间被修改的自定义环境映射时 :func:`os.execve` "
"中的崩溃问题。由 Bénédikt Tran 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:752
msgid ""
":gh:`143308`: :mod:`pickle`: fix use-after-free crashes when a "
":class:`~pickle.PickleBuffer` is concurrently mutated by a custom buffer "
"callback during pickling. Patch by Bénédikt Tran and Aaron Wieczorek."
msgstr ""
":gh:`143308`: :mod:`pickle`: 修复在 pickle 期间自定义缓冲区回调并发修改 "
":class:`~pickle.PickleBuffer` 时的释放后使用崩溃问题。由 Bénédikt Tran 和 Aaron Wieczorek "
"编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:756
msgid ""
":gh:`143237`: Fix support of named pipes in the rotating :mod:`logging` "
"handlers."
msgstr ":gh:`143237`: 修复 :mod:`logging` 滚动处理器中对命名管道的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:759
msgid ""
":gh:`143249`: Fix possible buffer leaks in Windows overlapped I/O on error "
"handling."
msgstr ":gh:`143249`: 修复 Windows 重叠 I/O 在错误处理时可能的缓冲区泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:762
msgid ""
":gh:`143241`: :mod:`zoneinfo`: fix infinite loop in "
":meth:`ZoneInfo.from_file <zoneinfo.ZoneInfo.from_file>` when parsing a "
"malformed TZif file. Patch by Fatih Celik."
msgstr ""
":gh:`143241`: :mod:`zoneinfo`: 修复解析格式错误的 TZif 文件时 :meth:`ZoneInfo.from_file "
"<zoneinfo.ZoneInfo.from_file>` 中的无限循环问题。由 Fatih Celik 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:766
msgid ""
":gh:`142830`: :mod:`sqlite3`: fix use-after-free crashes when the "
"connection's callbacks are mutated during a callback execution. Patch by "
"Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`142830`: :mod:`sqlite3`: 修复在回调执行期间修改连接的回调时的释放后使用崩溃问题。由 Bénédikt Tran "
"编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:770
msgid ""
":gh:`143200`: :mod:`xml.etree.ElementTree`: fix use-after-free crashes in "
":meth:`~object.__getitem__` and :meth:`~object.__setitem__` methods of "
":class:`~xml.etree.ElementTree.Element` when the element is concurrently "
"mutated. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`143200`: :mod:`xml.etree.ElementTree`: 修复当元素被并发修改时 "
":class:`~xml.etree.ElementTree.Element` 的 :meth:`~object.__getitem__` 和 "
":meth:`~object.__setitem__` 方法中的释放后使用崩溃问题。由 Bénédikt Tran 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:775
msgid ""
":gh:`142195`: Updated timeout evaluation logic in :mod:`subprocess` to be "
"compatible with deterministic environments like Shadow where time moves "
"exactly as requested."
msgstr ""
":gh:`142195`: 更新 :mod:`subprocess` 中的超时评估逻辑，使其兼容像 Shadow 这样时间完全按请求推进的确定性环境。"

#: ../NEWS:779
msgid ""
":gh:`142164`: Fix the ctypes bitfield overflow error message to report the "
"correct offset and size calculation."
msgstr ":gh:`142164`: 修复 ctypes 位域溢出错误消息以报告正确的偏移量和大小计算。"

#: ../NEWS:782
msgid ""
":gh:`143145`: Fixed a possible reference leak in ctypes when constructing "
"results with multiple output parameters on error."
msgstr ":gh:`143145`: 修复 ctypes 在出错时使用多个输出参数构造结果时可能的引用泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:785
msgid ""
":gh:`122431`: Corrected the error message in "
":func:`readline.append_history_file` to state that ``nelements`` must be "
"non-negative instead of positive."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122431`: 修正 :func:`readline.append_history_file` 中的错误消息以指明 "
"``nelements`` 必须是非负数而不是正数。"

#: ../NEWS:789
msgid ""
":gh:`143004`: Fix a potential use-after-free in "
":meth:`collections.Counter.update` when user code mutates the Counter during"
" an update."
msgstr ""
":gh:`143004`: 修复当用户代码在更新期间修改 Counter 时 :meth:`collections.Counter.update` "
"中潜在的释放后使用问题。"

#: ../NEWS:793
msgid ""
":gh:`143046`: The :mod:`asyncio` REPL no longer prints copyright and version"
" messages in the quiet mode (:option:`-q`). Patch by Bartosz Sławecki."
msgstr ""
":gh:`143046`: :mod:`asyncio` REPL 在静默模式下 (:option:`-q`) 将不再打印版权和版本消息。 由 "
"Bartosz Sławecki 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:796
msgid ""
":gh:`140648`: The :mod:`asyncio` REPL now respects the :option:`-I` flag "
"(isolated mode). Previously, it would load and execute "
":envvar:`PYTHONSTARTUP` even if the flag was set. Contributed by Bartosz "
"Sławecki."
msgstr ""
":gh:`140648`: :mod:`asyncio` REPL 现在遵守 :option:`-I` "
"标志（隔离模式）。此前，即使设置了该标志，它也会加载并执行 :envvar:`PYTHONSTARTUP`。由 Bartosz Sławecki 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:801
msgid ""
":gh:`142991`: Fixed socket operations such as recvfrom() and sendto() for "
"FreeBSD divert(4) socket."
msgstr ":gh:`142991`: 修复 FreeBSD divert(4) 套接字的 recvfrom() 和 sendto() 等套接字操作。"

#: ../NEWS:804
msgid ""
":gh:`143010`: Fixed a bug in :mod:`mailbox` where the precise timing of an "
"external event could result in the library opening an existing file instead "
"of a file it expected to create."
msgstr ""
":gh:`143010`: 修复 :mod:`mailbox` 中的一个程序缺陷，外部事件的精确时机可能导致库打开一个现有文件而不是它期望创建的文件。"

#: ../NEWS:808
msgid ""
":gh:`142881`: Fix concurrent and reentrant call of "
":func:`atexit.unregister`."
msgstr ":gh:`142881`: 修复 :func:`atexit.unregister` 的并发和重入调用问题。"

#: ../NEWS:810
msgid ""
":gh:`112127`: Fix possible use-after-free in :func:`atexit.unregister` when "
"the callback is unregistered during comparison."
msgstr ":gh:`112127`: 修复在比较期间取消注册回调时 :func:`atexit.unregister` 中可能的释放后使用问题。"

#: ../NEWS:813
msgid ""
":gh:`142783`: Fix zoneinfo use-after-free with descriptor _weak_cache. a "
"descriptor as _weak_cache could cause crashes during object creation. The "
"fix ensures proper reference counting for descriptor-provided objects."
msgstr ""
":gh:`142783`: 修复 zoneinfo 中描述器 _weak_cache 的释放后使用问题。描述器作为 _weak_cache "
"可能在对象创建期间导致崩溃。此修复确保对描述器提供的对象进行正确的引用计数。"

#: ../NEWS:817
msgid ""
":gh:`142754`: Add the *ownerDocument* attribute to :mod:`xml.dom.minidom` "
"elements and attributes created by directly instantiating the ``Element`` or"
" ``Attr`` class. Note that this way of creating nodes is not supported; "
"creator functions like :py:meth:`xml.dom.Document.documentElement` should be"
" used instead."
msgstr ""
":gh:`142754`: 为通过直接实例化 ``Element`` 或 ``Attr`` 类创建的 :mod:`xml.dom.minidom` "
"元素和属性添加 *ownerDocument* 属性。请注意这种创建节点的方式不受支持；应改用像 "
":py:meth:`xml.dom.Document.documentElement` 这样的创建器函数。"

#: ../NEWS:823
msgid ""
":gh:`142784`: The :mod:`asyncio` REPL now properly closes the loop upon the "
"end of interactive session. Previously, it could cause surprising warnings. "
"Contributed by Bartosz Sławecki."
msgstr ""
":gh:`142784`: :mod:`asyncio` REPL 现在在交互式会话结束时正确关闭循环。此前，这可能会导致意外的警告。由 Bartosz"
" Sławecki 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:827
msgid ""
":gh:`142555`: :mod:`array`: fix a crash in ``a[i] = v`` when converting *i* "
"to an index via :meth:`i.__index__ <object.__index__>` or :meth:`i.__float__"
" <object.__float__>` mutates the array."
msgstr ""
":gh:`142555`: :mod:`array`: 修复在 ``a[i] = v`` 中当通过 :meth:`i.__index__ "
"<object.__index__>` 或 :meth:`i.__float__ <object.__float__>` 将 *i* "
"转换为索引对数组进行修改时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:831
msgid ""
":gh:`142594`: Fix crash in ``TextIOWrapper.close()`` when the underlying "
"buffer's ``closed`` property calls :meth:`~io.TextIOBase.detach`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`142594`: 修复当底层缓冲区的 ``closed`` 属性调用 :meth:`~io.TextIOBase.detach` 时 "
"``TextIOWrapper.close()`` 中的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:834
msgid ""
":gh:`142451`: :mod:`hmac`: Ensure that the :attr:`HMAC.block_size "
"<hmac.HMAC.block_size>` attribute is correctly copied by :meth:`HMAC.copy "
"<hmac.HMAC.copy>`. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`142451`: :mod:`hmac`: 确保 :attr:`HMAC.block_size <hmac.HMAC.block_size>`"
" 属性被 :meth:`HMAC.copy <hmac.HMAC.copy>` 正确复制。由 Bénédikt Tran 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:838
msgid ""
":gh:`142495`: :class:`collections.defaultdict` now prioritizes "
":meth:`~object.__setitem__` when inserting default values from "
"``default_factory``. This prevents race conditions where a default value "
"would overwrite a value set before ``default_factory`` returns."
msgstr ""
":gh:`142495`: :class:`collections.defaultdict` 现在在从 ``default_factory`` "
"插入默认值时优先使用 :meth:`~object.__setitem__`。这可以防止默认值覆盖在 ``default_factory`` "
"返回之前设置的值的竞争条件。"

#: ../NEWS:843
msgid ""
":gh:`142651`: :mod:`unittest.mock`: fix a thread safety issue where "
":attr:`Mock.call_count <unittest.mock.Mock.call_count>` may return "
"inaccurate values when the mock is called concurrently from multiple "
"threads."
msgstr ""
":gh:`142651`: :mod:`unittest.mock`: 修复当 mock 从多个线程并发调用时 "
":attr:`Mock.call_count <unittest.mock.Mock.call_count>` 可能返回不准确值的线程安全问题。"

#: ../NEWS:848
msgid ""
":gh:`142595`: Added type check during initialization of the :mod:`decimal` "
"module to prevent a crash in case of broken stdlib.  Patch by Sergey B "
"Kirpichev."
msgstr ""
":gh:`142595`: 在 :mod:`decimal` 模块初始化期间增加类型检查以防止标准库损坏时的崩溃。由 Sergey B "
"Kirpichev 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:852
msgid ""
":gh:`142556`: Fix crash when a task gets re-registered during finalization "
"in :mod:`asyncio`. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`142556`: 修复在 :mod:`asyncio` 中执行最终化期间有任务被重新注册时导致的崩溃问题。 由 Kumar Aditya "
"编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:855
msgid ""
":gh:`123241`: Avoid reference count operations in garbage collection of "
":mod:`ctypes` objects."
msgstr ":gh:`123241`: 在 :mod:`ctypes` 对象的垃圾回收中避免引用计数操作。"

#: ../NEWS:858
msgid ""
":gh:`142517`: The non-``compat32`` :mod:`email` policies now correctly "
"handle refolding encoded words that contain bytes that can not be decoded in"
" their specified character set.  Previously this resulted in an encoding "
"exception during folding."
msgstr ""
":gh:`142517`: 非 ``compat32`` 的 :mod:`email` "
"策略现在可正确处理包含无法在其指定字符集中解码的字节的编码字的重新折叠。此前这会在折叠期间导致编码异常。"

#: ../NEWS:863
msgid ""
":gh:`112527`: The help text for required options in :mod:`argparse` no "
"longer extended with \" (default: None)\"."
msgstr ":gh:`112527`: 在 :mod:`argparse` 中针对必需选项的帮助文本不再带有 \" (default: None)\" 扩展。"

#: ../NEWS:866
msgid ""
":gh:`142346`: Fix usage formatting for mutually exclusive groups in "
":mod:`argparse` when they are preceded by positional arguments or followed "
"or intermixed with other optional arguments."
msgstr ""
":gh:`142346`: 修复 :mod:`argparse` 中当互斥组前面有位置参数或后面跟有其他可选参数或与其他可选参数混合时的用法格式化问题。"

#: ../NEWS:870
msgid ""
":gh:`142315`: Pdb can now run scripts from anonymous pipes used in process "
"substitution. Patch by Bartosz Sławecki."
msgstr ":gh:`142315`: Pdb 现在可以从进程替换中使用的匿名管道运行脚本。由 Bartosz Sławecki 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:873
msgid ""
":gh:`142332`: Fix usage formatting for positional arguments in mutually "
"exclusive groups in :mod:`argparse`. in :mod:`argparse`."
msgstr ":gh:`142332`: 修复 :mod:`argparse` 中互斥组中位置参数的用法格式化问题。"

#: ../NEWS:876
msgid ""
":gh:`142282`: Fix :func:`winreg.QueryValueEx` to not accidentally read "
"garbage buffer under race condition."
msgstr ":gh:`142282`: 修复 :func:`winreg.QueryValueEx` 在竞争条件下意外读取垃圾缓冲区的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:879
msgid ""
":gh:`75949`: Fix :mod:`argparse` to preserve ``|`` separators in mutually "
"exclusive groups when the usage line wraps due to length."
msgstr ":gh:`75949`: 修复 :mod:`argparse` 以在用法行因长度而换行时保留互斥组中的 ``|`` 分隔符。"

#: ../NEWS:882
msgid ""
":gh:`142267`: Improve :mod:`argparse` performance by caching the formatter "
"used for argument validation."
msgstr ":gh:`142267`: 通过缓存用于参数验证的格式化器来提高 :mod:`argparse` 性能。"

#: ../NEWS:885
msgid ""
":gh:`68552`: ``MisplacedEnvelopeHeaderDefect`` and ``Missing header name`` "
"defects are now correctly passed to the ``handle_defect`` method of "
"``policy`` in :class:`~email.parser.FeedParser`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`68552`: ``MisplacedEnvelopeHeaderDefect`` 和 ``Missing header name`` "
"缺陷现在可正确传递给 :class:`~email.parser.FeedParser` 中 ``policy`` 的 "
"``handle_defect`` 方法。"

#: ../NEWS:889
msgid ""
":gh:`142006`: Fix a bug in the :mod:`email.policy.default` folding algorithm"
" which incorrectly resulted in a doubled newline when a line ending at "
"exactly max_line_length was followed by an unfoldable token."
msgstr ""
":gh:`142006`: 修复 :mod:`email.policy.default` 折叠算法中的一个程序缺陷，该缺陷在行恰好结束于 "
"max_line_length 且后跟不可折叠 token 时会错误地产生双换行符。"

#: ../NEWS:893
msgid ""
":gh:`105836`: Fix :meth:`asyncio.run_coroutine_threadsafe` leaving "
"underlying cancelled asyncio task running."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105836`: 修复 :meth:`asyncio.run_coroutine_threadsafe` 让底层已取消的 asyncio "
"任务继续运行的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:896
msgid ""
":gh:`139971`: :mod:`pydoc`: Ensure that the link to the online documentation"
" of a :term:`stdlib` module is correct."
msgstr ":gh:`139971`: :mod:`pydoc`: 确保 :term:`stdlib` 模块的在线文档链接正确。"

#: ../NEWS:899
msgid ""
":gh:`139262`: Some keystrokes can be swallowed in the new ``PyREPL`` on "
"Windows, especially when used together with the ALT key. Fix by Chris Eibl."
msgstr ""
":gh:`139262`: Windows 上新的 ``PyREPL`` 中某些按键可能被吞掉，特别是与 ALT 键一起使用时。由 Chris Eibl"
" 修复。"

#: ../NEWS:903
msgid ""
":gh:`138897`: Improved :data:`license`/:data:`copyright`/:data:`credits` "
"display in the :term:`REPL`: now uses a pager."
msgstr ""
":gh:`138897`: 改进 :term:`REPL` 中 "
":data:`license`/:data:`copyright`/:data:`credits` 的显示：现在使用分页器。"

#: ../NEWS:906
msgid ""
":gh:`79986`: Add parsing for ``References`` and ``In-Reply-To`` headers to "
"the :mod:`email` library that parses the header content as lists of message "
"id tokens.  This prevents them from being folded incorrectly."
msgstr ""
":gh:`79986`: 为 :mod:`email` 库增加对 ``References`` 和 ``In-Reply-To`` "
"标头的解析支持，将标头内容解析为消息 ID token 的列表。这可以防止它们被错误折叠。"

#: ../NEWS:910
msgid ""
":gh:`136282`: Add support for :const:`~configparser.UNNAMED_SECTION` when "
"creating a section via the mapping protocol access"
msgstr ""
":gh:`136282`: 增加通过映射协议访问创建节时对 :const:`~configparser.UNNAMED_SECTION` 的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:913
msgid ""
":gh:`109263`: Starting a process from spawn context in "
":mod:`multiprocessing` no longer sets the start method globally."
msgstr ":gh:`109263`: 从 :mod:`multiprocessing` 中的 spawn 上下文启动进程时不再全局设置启动方法。"

#: ../NEWS:916
msgid ":gh:`133253`: Fix thread-safety issues in :mod:`linecache`."
msgstr ":gh:`133253`: 修复 :mod:`linecache` 中的线程安全问题。"

#: ../NEWS:918
msgid ""
":gh:`132715`: Skip writing objects during marshalling once a failure has "
"occurred."
msgstr ":gh:`132715`: 一旦发生失败，跳过在 marshal 期间写入对象。"

#: ../NEWS:922 ../NEWS:1636 ../NEWS:3569 ../NEWS:5196 ../NEWS:8224
#: ../NEWS:9907 ../NEWS:10875 ../NEWS:11394 ../NEWS:12308 ../NEWS:12832
#: ../NEWS:15099 ../NEWS:16306 ../NEWS:20532 ../NEWS:22554 ../NEWS:22953
#: ../NEWS:24363 ../NEWS:26223 ../NEWS:27057 ../NEWS:27465 ../NEWS:27753
#: ../NEWS:28040 ../NEWS:28910 ../NEWS:29343 ../NEWS:30501 ../NEWS:31384
#: ../NEWS:31853 ../NEWS:32235 ../NEWS:32626 ../NEWS:33008 ../NEWS:34746
#: ../NEWS:35695 ../NEWS:36244 ../NEWS:36564 ../NEWS:36813 ../NEWS:39533
#: ../NEWS:39937 ../NEWS:40167 ../NEWS:40325 ../NEWS:40541 ../NEWS:40794
#: ../NEWS:41970 ../NEWS:42256 ../NEWS:44127 ../NEWS:44667 ../NEWS:45021
#: ../NEWS:45413 ../NEWS:45791 ../NEWS:46263 ../NEWS:46589 ../NEWS:47703
#: ../NEWS:47976 ../NEWS:48178 ../NEWS:48439 ../NEWS:49558 ../NEWS:50858
#: ../NEWS:51026 ../NEWS:51568 ../NEWS:52085 ../NEWS:52418 ../NEWS:52930
#: ../NEWS:54954
msgid "IDLE"
msgstr "IDLE"

#: ../NEWS:924
msgid ""
":gh:`143774`: Better explain the operation of Format / Format Paragraph."
msgstr ":gh:`143774`: 更好地解释\"格式 / 格式化段落\"的操作。"

#: ../NEWS:929
msgid ":gh:`140806`: Add documentation for :func:`enum.bin`."
msgstr ":gh:`140806`: 增加 :func:`enum.bin` 的文档。"

#: ../NEWS:934
msgid ""
":gh:`144307`: Prevent a reference leak in module teardown at interpreter "
"finalization."
msgstr ":gh:`144307`: 在解释器最终化时防止模块卸载中的引用泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:937
msgid ""
":gh:`144194`: Fix error handling in perf jitdump initialization on memory "
"allocation failure."
msgstr ":gh:`144194`: 修复内存分配失败时 perf jitdump 初始化中的错误处理。"

#: ../NEWS:940
msgid ""
":gh:`144012`: Check if the result is ``NULL`` in ``BINARY_OP_EXTENT`` "
"opcode."
msgstr ":gh:`144012`: 在 ``BINARY_OP_EXTENT`` 操作码中检查结果是否为 ``NULL``。"

#: ../NEWS:942
msgid ""
":gh:`141805`: Fix crash in :class:`set` when objects with the same hash are "
"concurrently added to the set after removing an element with the same hash "
"while the set still contains elements with the same hash."
msgstr ""
":gh:`141805`: 修复在移除具有相同哈希值的元素后、集合中仍包含具有相同哈希值的元素的情况下并发向 :class:`set` "
"中添加具有相同哈希值的对象时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:946
msgid ":gh:`143670`: Fixes a crash in ``ga_repr_items_list`` function."
msgstr ":gh:`143670`: 修复 ``ga_repr_items_list`` 函数中的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:948
msgid ""
":gh:`143377`: Fix a crash in :func:`!_interpreters.capture_exception` when "
"the exception is incorrectly formatted. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`143377`: 修复异常格式不正确时 :func:`!_interpreters.capture_exception` 中的崩溃问题。由 "
"Bénédikt Tran 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:951
msgid ""
":gh:`136924`: The interactive help mode in the :term:`REPL` no longer "
"incorrectly syntax highlights text input as Python code. Contributed by Olga"
" Matoula."
msgstr ""
":gh:`136924`: :term:`REPL` 中的交互式帮助模式不再错误地将文本输入作为 Python 代码进行语法高亮。由 Olga "
"Matoula 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:955
msgid ""
":gh:`143189`: Fix crash when inserting a non-:class:`str` key into a split "
"table dictionary when the key matches an existing key in the split table but"
" has no corresponding value in the dict."
msgstr ""
":gh:`143189`: 修复当将非 :class:`str` 键插入拆分表字典时，如果该键与拆分表中现有键匹配但在字典中没有对应值时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:959
msgid ""
":gh:`143228`: Fix use-after-free in perf trampoline when toggling profiling "
"while threads are running or during interpreter finalization with daemon "
"threads active. The fix uses reference counting to ensure trampolines are "
"not freed while any code object could still reference them. Pach by Pablo "
"Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`143228`: 修复在线程运行时切换性能分析或在守护线程活动期间进行解释器终结时 perf trampoline "
"中的释放后使用问题。此修复使用引用计数来确保在任何代码对象仍可能引用 trampoline 时不会释放它们。由 Pablo Galindo 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:965
msgid ""
":gh:`142664`: Fix a use-after-free crash in :meth:`memoryview.__hash__ "
"<object.__hash__>` when the ``__hash__`` method of the referenced object "
"mutates that object or the view. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`142664`: 修复当被引用对象的 ``__hash__`` 方法修改该对象或视图时 :meth:`memoryview.__hash__ "
"<object.__hash__>` 中的释放后使用崩溃问题。由 Bénédikt Tran 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:969
msgid ""
":gh:`142557`: Fix a use-after-free crash in :ref:`bytearray.__mod__ <bytes-"
"formatting>` when the :class:`!bytearray` is mutated while formatting the "
"``%``-style arguments. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`142557`: 修复在格式化 ``%`` 风格参数时 :class:`!bytearray` 被修改时 "
":ref:`bytearray.__mod__ <bytes-formatting>` 中的释放后使用崩溃问题。由 Bénédikt Tran "
"编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:973
msgid ""
":gh:`143195`: Fix use-after-free crashes in :meth:`bytearray.hex` and "
":meth:`memoryview.hex` when the separator's :meth:`~object.__len__` mutates "
"the original object. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`143195`: 修复当分隔符的 :meth:`~object.__len__` 修改原始对象时 :meth:`bytearray.hex` "
"和 :meth:`memoryview.hex` 中的释放后使用崩溃问题。由 Bénédikt Tran 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:977
msgid ""
":gh:`142975`: Fix crash after unfreezing all objects tracked by the garbage "
"collector on the :term:`free threaded <free threading>` build."
msgstr ""
":gh:`142975`: 修复在 :term:`free threaded <free threading>` "
"构建版本中解冻垃圾回收器跟踪的所有对象后的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:980
msgid ""
":gh:`143135`: Set :data:`sys.flags.inspect` to ``1`` when "
":envvar:`PYTHONINSPECT` is ``0``. Previously, it was set to ``0`` in this "
"case."
msgstr ""
":gh:`143135`: 当 :envvar:`PYTHONINSPECT` 为 ``0`` 时将 :data:`sys.flags.inspect`"
" 设置为 ``1``。此前，在这种情况下它被设置为 ``0``。"

#: ../NEWS:984
msgid ""
":gh:`143003`: Fix an overflow of the shared empty buffer in "
":meth:`bytearray.extend` when ``__length_hint__()`` returns 0 for non-empty "
"iterator."
msgstr ""
":gh:`143003`: 修复当 ``__length_hint__()`` 对非空迭代器返回 0 时 "
":meth:`bytearray.extend` 中共享空缓冲区的溢出问题。"

#: ../NEWS:988
msgid ""
":gh:`143006`: Fix a possible assertion error when comparing negative non-"
"integer ``float`` and ``int`` with the same number of bits in the integer "
"part."
msgstr ":gh:`143006`: 修复比较整数部分具有相同位数的负非整数 ``float`` 和 ``int`` 时可能的断言错误。"

#: ../NEWS:992
msgid ""
":gh:`143057`: Avoid locking in :c:func:`PyTraceMalloc_Track` and "
":c:func:`PyTraceMalloc_Untrack` when :mod:`tracemalloc` is not enabled."
msgstr ""
":gh:`143057`: 当 :mod:`tracemalloc` 未启用时避免在 :c:func:`PyTraceMalloc_Track` 和 "
":c:func:`PyTraceMalloc_Untrack` 中加锁。"

#: ../NEWS:995
msgid ":gh:`142776`: Fix a file descriptor leak in import.c"
msgstr ":gh:`142776`: 修复 import.c 中的文件描述符泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:997
msgid ""
":gh:`142829`: Fix a use-after-free crash in :class:`contextvars.Context` "
"comparison when a custom ``__eq__`` method modifies the context via "
":meth:`~contextvars.ContextVar.set`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`142829`: 修复当自定义 ``__eq__`` 方法通过 :meth:`~contextvars.ContextVar.set` "
"修改上下文时 :class:`contextvars.Context` 比较中的释放后使用崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1001
msgid ""
":gh:`142766`: Clear the frame of a generator when :meth:`generator.close` is"
" called."
msgstr ":gh:`142766`: 当 :meth:`generator.close` 被调用时清除生成器的帧。"

#: ../NEWS:1004
msgid ""
":gh:`142737`: Tracebacks will be displayed in fallback mode even if "
":func:`io.open` is lost. Previously, this would crash the interpreter. Patch"
" by Bartosz Sławecki."
msgstr ""
":gh:`142737`: 即使 :func:`io.open` 丢失，回溯信息也将在回退模式下显示。此前，这会导致解释器崩溃。由 Bartosz "
"Sławecki 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1008
msgid ""
":gh:`142554`: Fix a crash in :func:`divmod` when :func:`!_pylong.int_divmod`"
" does not return a tuple of length two exactly. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`142554`: 修复当 :func:`!_pylong.int_divmod` 没有精确返回长度为 2 的元组时 "
":func:`divmod` 中的崩溃问题。由 Bénédikt Tran 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1011
msgid ""
":gh:`142560`: Fix use-after-free in :class:`bytearray` search-like methods "
"(:meth:`~bytearray.find`, :meth:`~bytearray.count`, "
":meth:`~bytearray.index`, :meth:`~bytearray.rindex`, and "
":meth:`~bytearray.rfind`) by marking the storage as exported which causes "
"reallocation attempts to raise :exc:`BufferError`. For "
":func:`~operator.contains`, :meth:`~bytearray.split`, and "
":meth:`~bytearray.rsplit` the :ref:`buffer protocol <bufferobjects>` is used"
" for this."
msgstr ""
":gh:`142560`: 通过将存储标记为已导出（这会导致重新分配尝试引发 :exc:`BufferError`）修复 "
":class:`bytearray` "
"搜索类方法（:meth:`~bytearray.find`、:meth:`~bytearray.count`、:meth:`~bytearray.index`、:meth:`~bytearray.rindex`"
" 和 :meth:`~bytearray.rfind`）中的释放后使用问题。对于 "
":func:`~operator.contains`、:meth:`~bytearray.split` 和 "
":meth:`~bytearray.rsplit`，为此使用 :ref:`buffer protocol <bufferobjects>`。"

#: ../NEWS:1020
msgid ""
":gh:`142531`: Fix a free-threaded GC performance regression.  If there are "
"many untracked tuples, the GC will run too often, resulting in poor "
"performance.  The fix is to include untracked tuples in the \"long lived\" "
"object count. The number of frozen objects is also now included since the "
"free-threaded GC must scan those too."
msgstr ""
":gh:`142531`: 修复自由线程 GC 性能回归问题。如果有很多未跟踪的元组，GC "
"会运行得太频繁，导致性能低下。修复方法是将未跟踪的元组包含在\"长寿命\"对象计数中。由于自由线程 GC "
"也必须扫描冻结对象，因此现在也包含了冻结对象的数量。"

#: ../NEWS:1026
msgid ""
":gh:`142402`: Fix reference counting when adjacent literal parts are merged "
"while constructing :class:`string.templatelib.Template`, preventing the "
"displaced string object from leaking."
msgstr ""
":gh:`142402`: 修复构造 :class:`string.templatelib.Template` "
"时合并相邻字面量部分时的引用计数问题，防止被替换的字符串对象泄漏。"

#: ../NEWS:1030
msgid ""
":gh:`133932`: Fix crash in the free threading build when clearing frames "
"that hold tagged integers."
msgstr ":gh:`133932`: 修复自由线程构建版本中清除持有标记整数的帧时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1033
msgid ""
":gh:`142343`: Fix SIGILL crash on m68k due to incorrect assembly constraint."
msgstr ":gh:`142343`: 修复 m68k 上由于不正确的汇编约束导致的 SIGILL 崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1035
msgid ""
":gh:`100964`: Fix reference cycle in exhausted generator frames. Patch by "
"Savannah Ostrowski."
msgstr ":gh:`100964`: 修复已耗尽生成器帧中的引用循环问题。由 Savannah Ostrowski 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1038
msgid ""
":gh:`69605`: Fix edge-cases around already imported modules in the "
":term:`REPL` auto-completion of imports."
msgstr ":gh:`69605`: 修正在 modules in the :term:`REPL` 自动补全导入功能中已导入模块的边界情况问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1041
msgid ""
":gh:`138568`: Adjusted the built-in :func:`help` function so that empty "
"inputs are ignored in interactive mode."
msgstr ":gh:`138568`: 调整内置 :func:`help` 函数以在交互模式下忽略空输入。"

#: ../NEWS:1044
msgid ""
":gh:`137007`: Fix a bug during JIT compilation failure which caused garbage "
"collection debug assertions to fail."
msgstr ":gh:`137007`: 修正一个在 JIT 编译期间会导致垃圾回收调试断言失败的程序缺陷。"

#: ../NEWS:1050
msgid ""
":gh:`142589`: Fix :c:func:`PyUnstable_Object_IsUniqueReferencedTemporary()` "
"handling of tagged ints on the interpreter stack."
msgstr ""
":gh:`142589`: 修正解释器栈中对带标签整数的 "
":c:func:`PyUnstable_Object_IsUniqueReferencedTemporary()` 处理。"

#: ../NEWS:1053
msgid ""
":gh:`142571`: :c:func:`!PyUnstable_CopyPerfMapFile` now checks that opening "
"the file succeeded before flushing."
msgstr ""
":gh:`142571`: 现在 :c:func:`!PyUnstable_CopyPerfMapFile` 会在刷新数据之前检查打开文件是否成功。"

#: ../NEWS:1059
msgid ""
":gh:`142454`: When calculating the digest of the JIT stencils input, sort "
"the hashed files by filenames before adding their content to the hasher. "
"This ensures deterministic hash input and hence deterministic hash, "
"independent on filesystem order."
msgstr ""
":gh:`142454`: 计算 JIT stencil "
"输入的摘要时，在将文件内容添加到哈希器之前按文件名对要哈希的文件进行排序。这确保了确定性的哈希输入从而产生确定性的哈希，与文件系统顺序无关。"

#: ../NEWS:1064
msgid ""
":gh:`141808`: When running ``make clean-retain-profile``, keep the generated"
" JIT stencils. That way, the stencils are not generated twice when Profile-"
"guided optimization (PGO) is used. It also allows distributors to supply "
"their own pre-built JIT stencils."
msgstr ""
":gh:`141808`: 运行 ``make clean-retain-profile`` 时保留生成的 JIT "
"stencil。这样在使用配置文件引导优化 (PGO) 时就不会生成两次 stencil。这也允许分发者提供他们自己预构建的 JIT stencil。"

#: ../NEWS:1069
msgid ""
":gh:`138061`: Ensure reproducible builds by making JIT stencil header "
"generation deterministic."
msgstr ":gh:`138061`: 通过使 JIT stencil 头文件生成确定化来确保可重复构建。"

#: ../NEWS:1074
msgid "Python 3.14.2 final"
msgstr "Python 3.14.2 正式版"

#: ../NEWS:1076
msgid "*Release date: 2025-12-05*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2025-12-05*"

#: ../NEWS:1081
msgid ""
":gh:`142145`: Remove quadratic behavior in ``xml.minidom`` node ID cache "
"clearing."
msgstr ":gh:`142145`: 移除 ``xml.minidom`` 节点 ID 缓存清理中的二次方增长行为。"

#: ../NEWS:1084
msgid ""
":gh:`119452`: Fix a potential memory denial of service in the "
":mod:`http.server` module. When a malicious user is connected to the CGI "
"server on Windows, it could cause an arbitrary amount of memory to be "
"allocated. This could have led to symptoms including a :exc:`MemoryError`, "
"swapping, out of memory (OOM) killed processes or containers, or even system"
" crashes."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119452`: 修正 :mod:`http.server` 模块中一个潜在的内存拒绝服务问题。 当一个恶意用户连接到 Windows 上的 "
"CGI 服务器时，它可能导致分配任意大小的内存。 这会造成多种问题包括 "
":exc:`MemoryError`、消耗交换空间、内存不足（OOM）杀死进程或容器，甚至系统崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:1094
msgid ""
":gh:`140797`: Revert changes to the undocumented :class:`!re.Scanner` class."
" Capturing groups are still allowed for backward compatibility, although "
"using them can lead to incorrect result. They will be forbidden in future "
"Python versions."
msgstr ""
":gh:`140797`: 撤销对未写入文档的 :class:`!re.Scanner` 类的修改。 "
"捕获分组仍被允许以保持向下兼容，不过使用它们可能导致不正确的结果。 它们将在未来的 Python 版本中被禁用。"

#: ../NEWS:1099
msgid ""
":gh:`142206`: The resource tracker in the :mod:`multiprocessing` module now "
"uses the original communication protocol, as in Python 3.14.0 and below, by "
"default. This avoids issues with upgrading Python while it is running. (Note"
" that such 'in-place' upgrades are not tested.) The tracker remains "
"compatible with subprocesses that use new protocol (that is, subprocesses "
"using Python 3.13.10, 3.14.1 and 3.15)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`142206`: :mod:`multiprocessing` 模块中的资源追踪器现在默认使用原始通信协议（与 Python 3.14.0 "
"及以下版本相同）。这避免了在 Python 运行时升级 Python "
"的问题。（请注意，这种\"原地\"升级未经测试。）追踪器仍然与使用新协议的子进程兼容（即使用 Python 3.13.10、3.14.1 和 3.15 "
"的子进程）。"

#: ../NEWS:1106
msgid ""
":gh:`142214`: Fix two regressions in :mod:`dataclasses` in Python 3.14.1 "
"related to annotations."
msgstr ":gh:`142214`: 修复 Python 3.14.1 中 :mod:`dataclasses` 与标注相关的两个回归问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1109
msgid ""
"An exception is no longer raised if ``slots=True`` is used and the "
"``__init__`` method does not have an ``__annotate__`` attribute (likely "
"because ``init=False`` was used)."
msgstr ""
"如果使用了 ``slots=True`` 且 ``__init__`` 方法没有 ``__annotate__`` 属性（可能是因为使用了 "
"``init=False``），现在不再引发异常。"

#: ../NEWS:1113
msgid ""
"An exception is no longer raised if annotations are requested on the "
"``__init__`` method and one of the fields is not present in the class "
"annotations. This can occur in certain dynamic scenarios."
msgstr "如果在 ``__init__`` 方法上请求标注且其中一个字段在类标注中不存在，现在不再引发异常。这种情况可能发生在某些动态场景中。"

#: ../NEWS:1117 ../NEWS:26830
msgid "Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr "由 Jelle Zijlstra 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1122
msgid ""
":gh:`142218`: Fix crash when inserting into a split table dictionary with a "
"non :class:`str` key that matches an existing key."
msgstr ":gh:`142218`: 修复使用与现有键匹配的非 :class:`str` 键插入拆分表字典时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1128
msgid ""
":gh:`116738`: Fix :mod:`cmath` data race when initializing trigonometric "
"tables with subinterpreters."
msgstr ":gh:`116738`: 修正在使用子解释器初始化三角函数表时 :mod:`cmath` 的数据竞争问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1133
msgid "Python 3.14.1 final"
msgstr "Python 3.14.1 正式版"

#: ../NEWS:1135
msgid "*Release date: 2025-12-02*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2025-12-02*"

#: ../NEWS:1140
msgid ""
":gh:`139810`: Installing with ``py install 3[.x]-dev`` will now select final"
" versions as well as prereleases."
msgstr ":gh:`139810`: 现在使用 ``py install 3[.x]-dev`` 安装时将会选择最终版本和预发布版本。"

#: ../NEWS:1146
msgid ""
":gh:`141692`: Each slice of an iOS XCframework now contains a ``lib`` folder"
" that contains a symlink to the libpython dylib. This allows binary modules "
"to be compiled for iOS using dynamic libreary linking, rather than Framework"
" linking."
msgstr ""
":gh:`141692`: 现在 iOS XCframework 的每个切片都包含一个 ``lib`` 文件夹，其中包含指向 libpython "
"dylib 的符号链接。 这允许为 iOS 编译二进制模块时使用动态库链接，而不是 Framework 链接。"

#: ../NEWS:1151
msgid ""
":gh:`141442`: The iOS testbed now correctly handles test arguments that "
"contain spaces."
msgstr ":gh:`141442`: 现在 iOS testbed 可正确地处理包含空格的测试参数。"

#: ../NEWS:1154
msgid ""
":gh:`140702`: The iOS testbed app will now expose the ``GITHUB_ACTIONS`` "
"environment variable to iOS apps being tested."
msgstr ""
":gh:`140702`: 现在 iOS testbed app 将把 ``GITHUB_ACTIONS`` 环境变量暴露给被测试的 iOS app。"

#: ../NEWS:1157
msgid ""
":gh:`137484`: Have ``Tools/wasm/wasi`` put the build Python into a directory"
" named after the build triple instead of \"build\"."
msgstr ""
":gh:`137484`: 由 ``Tools/wasm/wasi`` 将构建的 Python 放入以 build 加三个数值而非 \"build\" "
"命名的目录。"

#: ../NEWS:1160
msgid ""
":gh:`137248`: Add a ``--logdir`` option to ``Tools/wasm/wasi`` for "
"specifying where to write log files."
msgstr ":gh:`137248`: 给 ``Tools/wasm/wasi`` 增加 ``--logdir`` 选项用来指明将日志文件写到何处。"

#: ../NEWS:1163
msgid ""
":gh:`137243`: Have Tools/wasm/wasi detect a WASI SDK install in /opt when it"
" was directly extracted from a release tarball."
msgstr ""
":gh:`137243`: 当直接从发布 tarball 中提取文件时让 Tools/wasm/wasi 在 /opt 中检测 WASI SDK "
"安装情况。"

#: ../NEWS:1169
msgid ""
":gh:`140482`: Preserve and restore the state of ``stty echo`` as part of the"
" test environment."
msgstr ":gh:`140482`: 保留并恢复 ``stty echo`` 的状态作为测试环境的一部分。"

#: ../NEWS:1172
msgid ""
":gh:`140082`: Update ``python -m test`` to set ``FORCE_COLOR=1`` when being "
"run with color enabled so that :mod:`unittest` which is run by it with "
"redirected output will output in color."
msgstr ""
":gh:`140082`: 更新 ``python -m test`` 当启用彩色运行时设置 ``FORCE_COLOR=1`` "
"这样基于该设置运行的带转发输出的 :mod:`unittest` 将使用彩色输出。"

#: ../NEWS:1176
msgid ""
":gh:`139208`: Fix regrtest ``--fast-ci --verbose``: don't ignore the "
"``--verbose`` option anymore. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`139208`: 修复 regrtest ``--fast-ci --verbose``: 不会再忽略 ``--verbose`` 选项。 由"
" Victor Stinner 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1179
msgid ""
":gh:`136442`: Use exitcode ``1`` instead of ``5`` if "
":func:`unittest.TestCase.setUpClass` raises an exception"
msgstr ""
":gh:`136442`: 当 :func:`unittest.TestCase.setUpClass` 引发异常时使用退出码 ``1`` 而不是 "
"``5``"

#: ../NEWS:1185
msgid ""
":gh:`139700`: Check consistency of the zip64 end of central directory "
"record. Support records with \"zip64 extensible data\" if there are no bytes"
" prepended to the ZIP file."
msgstr ""
":gh:`139700`: 检测 zip64 中央目录记录末尾的一致性。 在没有字节数据被附加到 ZIP 文件时支持使用 \"zip64 可扩展数据\""
" 的记录。"

#: ../NEWS:1189
msgid ""
":gh:`139283`: :mod:`sqlite3`: correctly handle maximum number of rows to "
"fetch in :meth:`Cursor.fetchmany <sqlite3.Cursor.fetchmany>` and reject "
"negative values for :attr:`Cursor.arraysize <sqlite3.Cursor.arraysize>`. "
"Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`139283`: :mod:`sqlite3`: 正确处理 :meth:`Cursor.fetchmany "
"<sqlite3.Cursor.fetchmany>` 可获取的最大行数并拒绝 :attr:`Cursor.arraysize "
"<sqlite3.Cursor.arraysize>` 使用负值。 由 Bénédikt Tran 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1194
msgid ""
":gh:`137836`: Add support of the \"plaintext\" element, RAWTEXT elements "
"\"xmp\", \"iframe\", \"noembed\" and \"noframes\", and optionally RAWTEXT "
"element \"noscript\" in :class:`html.parser.HTMLParser`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`137836`: 在 :class:`html.parser.HTMLParser` 中增加对“纯文本”元素, RAWTEXT 元素 "
"\"xmp\", \"iframe\", \"noembed\" 和 \"noframes\"，以及可选的 RAWTEXT 元素 "
"\"noscript\" 的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:1198
msgid ""
":gh:`136063`: :mod:`email.message`: ensure linear complexity for legacy HTTP"
" parameters parsing. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`136063`: :mod:`email.message`: 确保旧式 HTTP 形参解析为线性复杂度。 由 Bénédikt Tran "
"编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1201
msgid ":gh:`136065`: Fix quadratic complexity in :func:`os.path.expandvars`."
msgstr ":gh:`136065`: 修复 :func:`os.path.expandvars` 中的二次幂复杂度问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1203
msgid ""
":gh:`119451`: Fix a potential memory denial of service in the "
":mod:`http.client` module. When connecting to a malicious server, it could "
"cause an arbitrary amount of memory to be allocated. This could have led to "
"symptoms including a :exc:`MemoryError`, swapping, out of memory (OOM) "
"killed processes or containers, or even system crashes."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119451`: 修正 :mod:`http.client` 模块中一个潜在的内存拒绝服务问题。 "
"当连接到一个恶意服务器时，它可能导致分配任意大小的内存。 这会造成多种问题包括 "
":exc:`MemoryError`、消耗交换空间、内存不足（OOM）杀死进程或容器，甚至系统崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:1209
msgid ""
":gh:`119342`: Fix a potential memory denial of service in the "
":mod:`plistlib` module. When reading a Plist file received from untrusted "
"source, it could cause an arbitrary amount of memory to be allocated. This "
"could have led to symptoms including a :exc:`MemoryError`, swapping, out of "
"memory (OOM) killed processes or containers, or even system crashes."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119342`: 修正a potential memory denial of service in the :mod:`plistlib` "
"模块中一个潜在的内存拒绝服务问题。 当读取从不受信任的源接收的 Plist 文件时，它可能导致分配任意大小的内存。 这会造成多种问题包括 "
":exc:`MemoryError`、消耗交换空间、内存不足（OOM）杀死进程或容器，甚至系统崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:1218
msgid ""
":gh:`74389`: When the stdin being used by a :class:`subprocess.Popen` "
"instance is closed, this is now ignored in "
":meth:`subprocess.Popen.communicate` instead of leaving the class in an "
"inconsistent state."
msgstr ""
":gh:`74389`: 当 :class:`subprocess.Popen` 实例使用的 stdin 被关闭时，现在此错误将被 "
":meth:`subprocess.Popen.communicate` 忽略而不是让该类进入不稳定状态。"

#: ../NEWS:1223
msgid ""
":gh:`87512`: Fix :func:`subprocess.Popen.communicate` timeout handling on "
"Windows when writing large input. Previously, the timeout was ignored during"
" stdin writing, causing the method to block indefinitely if the child "
"process did not consume input quickly. The stdin write is now performed in a"
" background thread, allowing the timeout to be properly enforced."
msgstr ""
":gh:`87512`: 修正在 Windows 上当写入大量输入内容时 :func:`subprocess.Popen.communicate` "
"的超时处理问题。 在之前版本中，在写入 stdin 时会忽略超时设置，导致在子进程未快速消费输入内容时此方法无限阻塞。 现在 stdin "
"写入将在后台线程中执行，以允许正确地应用超时设置。"

#: ../NEWS:1230
msgid ""
":gh:`141473`: When :meth:`subprocess.Popen.communicate` was called with "
"*input* and a *timeout* and is called for a second time after a "
":exc:`~subprocess.TimeoutExpired` exception before the process has died, it "
"should no longer hang."
msgstr ""
":gh:`141473`: 当 :meth:`subprocess.Popen.communicate` 附带 *input* 和 *timeout* "
"被调用并且是在进程死亡之前 :exc:`~subprocess.TimeoutExpired` 异常引发之后再次被调用时，它将不再会被挂起。"

#: ../NEWS:1235
msgid ""
":gh:`59000`: Fix :mod:`pdb` breakpoint resolution for class methods when the"
" module defining the class is not imported."
msgstr ":gh:`59000`: 修正 :mod:`pdb` 在未导入定义类的模块时针对类方法的中断点精确性问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1238
msgid ""
":gh:`141570`: Support :term:`file-like object` raising :exc:`OSError` from "
":meth:`~io.IOBase.fileno` in color detection (``_colorize.can_colorize()``)."
" This can occur when ``sys.stdout`` is redirected."
msgstr ""
":gh:`141570`: 支持让 :term:`file-like object` 在颜色检测 "
"(``_colorize.can_colorize()``) 中从 :meth:`~io.IOBase.fileno` 引发 "
":exc:`OSError`。 这种情况会在 ``sys.stdout`` 被重定向时发生。"

#: ../NEWS:1243
msgid ""
":gh:`141659`: Fix bad file descriptor errors from ``_posixsubprocess`` on "
"AIX."
msgstr ":gh:`141659`: 修复 AIX 上来自 ``_posixsubprocess`` 的无效文件描述符错误。"

#: ../NEWS:1246
msgid ":gh:`141600`: Fix musl version detection on Void Linux."
msgstr ":gh:`141600`: 修复 Void Linux 上的 musl 版本检测问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1248
msgid ""
":gh:`141497`: :mod:`ipaddress`: ensure that the methods "
":meth:`IPv4Network.hosts() <ipaddress.IPv4Network.hosts>` and "
":meth:`IPv6Network.hosts() <ipaddress.IPv6Network.hosts>` always return an "
"iterator."
msgstr ""
":gh:`141497`: :mod:`ipaddress`: 确保 :meth:`IPv4Network.hosts() "
"<ipaddress.IPv4Network.hosts>` 和 :meth:`IPv6Network.hosts() "
"<ipaddress.IPv6Network.hosts>` 等方法总是返回一个迭代器。"

#: ../NEWS:1253
msgid ""
":gh:`140938`: The :func:`statistics.stdev` and :func:`statistics.pstdev` "
"functions now raise a :exc:`ValueError` when the input contains an infinity "
"or a NaN."
msgstr ""
":gh:`140938`: 现在当输入包含无穷大或 NaN 时 :func:`statistics.stdev` 和 "
":func:`statistics.pstdev` 函数现在将引发 :exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../NEWS:1257
msgid ""
":gh:`124111`: Updated Tcl threading configuration in :mod:`_tkinter` to "
"assume that threads are always available in Tcl 9 and later."
msgstr ":gh:`124111`: 将 :mod:`_tkinter` 中的 Tcl 线程配置更新为假定线程在 Tcl 9 或更高版本中始终可用。"

#: ../NEWS:1260
msgid ""
":gh:`137109`: The :mod:`os.fork` and related forking APIs will no longer "
"warn in the common case where Linux or macOS platform APIs return the number"
" of threads in a process and find the answer to be 1 even when a "
":func:`os.register_at_fork` ``after_in_parent=`` callback (re)starts a "
"thread."
msgstr ""
":gh:`137109`: :mod:`os.fork` 及有关分叉 API 对于 Linux 或 macOS 平台 API "
"返回一个进程中线程数量的常见场景不会再发出警告并且即使在 :func:`os.register_at_fork` "
"``after_in_parent=`` 回调（重新）启动一个线程时返回的答案仍将为 1。"

#: ../NEWS:1266
msgid ""
":gh:`141314`: Fix assertion failure in :meth:`io.TextIOWrapper.tell` when "
"reading files with standalone carriage return (``\\r``) line endings."
msgstr ""
":gh:`141314`: 修复 :meth:`io.TextIOWrapper.tell` 在读取带以单个回车符 (``\\r``) "
"作为行结束符时的断言失败问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1269
msgid ""
":gh:`141311`: Fix assertion failure in :func:`!io.BytesIO.readinto` and "
"undefined behavior arising when read position is above capcity in "
":class:`io.BytesIO`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`141311`: 修复 assertion failure in :func:`!io.BytesIO.readinto` 在读取位置超出 "
":class:`io.BytesIO` 的容量时的断言失败和引发未定义行为问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1273
msgid ""
":gh:`141141`: Fix a thread safety issue with :func:`base64.b85decode`. "
"Contributed by Benel Tayar."
msgstr ""
":gh:`141141`: 修复 :func:`base64.b85decode` 的一个线程安全问题。 由 Benel Tayar 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:1276
msgid ""
":gh:`137969`: Fix :meth:`annotationlib.ForwardRef.evaluate` returning "
":class:`~annotationlib.ForwardRef` objects which don't update with new "
"globals."
msgstr ""
":gh:`137969`: 修复 :meth:`annotationlib.ForwardRef.evaluate` 返回的 "
":class:`~annotationlib.ForwardRef` 对象不随新的 globals 更新的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1280
msgid ""
":gh:`140911`: :mod:`collections`: Ensure that the methods "
"``UserString.rindex()`` and ``UserString.index()`` accept "
":class:`collections.UserString` instances as the sub argument."
msgstr ""
":gh:`140911`: :mod:`collections`: 确保 ``UserString.rindex()`` 和 "
"``UserString.index()`` 方法接受 :class:`collections.UserString` 实例作为子参数。"

#: ../NEWS:1284
msgid ""
":gh:`140797`: The undocumented :class:`!re.Scanner` class now forbids "
"regular expressions containing capturing groups in its lexicon patterns. "
"Patterns using capturing groups could previously lead to crashes with "
"segmentation fault. Use non-capturing groups (?:...) instead."
msgstr ""
":gh:`140797`: 未写入文档的 :class:`!re.Scanner` 类现在禁止了在其词汇模式中包含捕获分组的正则表达式。 "
"使用捕获分组的模式在之前会导致带有段错误的崩溃。 请改用非捕获分组 (?:...)。"

#: ../NEWS:1289
msgid ""
":gh:`125115`: Refactor the :mod:`pdb` parsing issue so positional arguments "
"can pass through intuitively."
msgstr ":gh:`125115`: 重构了 :mod:`pdb` 的解析问题以便位置参数能够直观地传递。"

#: ../NEWS:1292
msgid ""
":gh:`140815`: :mod:`faulthandler` now detects if a frame or a code object is"
" invalid or freed. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`140815`: 现在 :mod:`faulthandler` 会检测帧或代码对象是否不可用或已释放。 由 Victor Stinner "
"编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1295
msgid ""
":gh:`100218`: Correctly set :attr:`~OSError.errno` when "
":func:`socket.if_nametoindex` or :func:`socket.if_indextoname` raise an "
":exc:`OSError`. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100218`: 当 :func:`socket.if_nametoindex` 或 "
":func:`socket.if_indextoname` 引发 :exc:`OSError` 时正确设置 "
":attr:`~OSError.errno`。 由 Bénédikt Tran 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1299
msgid ""
":gh:`140875`: Fix handling of unclosed character references (named and "
"numerical) followed by the end of file in :class:`html.parser.HTMLParser` "
"with ``convert_charrefs=False``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`140875`: 修复当在 :class:`html.parser.HTMLParser` 中设置 "
"``convert_charrefs=False`` 时对文件结束位置上未关闭字符引用（名称型和数字型）的处理问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1303
msgid ""
":gh:`140734`: :mod:`multiprocessing`: fix off-by-one error when checking the"
" length of a temporary socket file path. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`140734`: :mod:`multiprocessing`: 修正在检查临时套接字文件路径长度时偏差为一的错误。 由 Bénédikt "
"Tran 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1306
msgid ""
":gh:`140874`: Bump the version of pip bundled in ensurepip to version 25.3"
msgstr ":gh:`140874`: 将 ensurepip 中捆绑的 pip 版本提升至 25.3"

#: ../NEWS:1308
msgid ""
":gh:`140691`: In :mod:`urllib.request`, when opening a FTP URL fails because"
" a data connection cannot be made, the control connection's socket is now "
"closed to avoid a :exc:`ResourceWarning`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`140691`: 在 :mod:`urllib.request` 中，当打开一个 FTP URL "
"的操作因无法建立数据连接而失败时，控制连接的套接字现在将关闭以避免 :exc:`ResourceWarning`。"

#: ../NEWS:1312
msgid ""
":gh:`103847`: Fix hang when cancelling process created by "
":func:`asyncio.create_subprocess_exec` or "
":func:`asyncio.create_subprocess_shell`. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`103847`: 修复当取消由 :func:`asyncio.create_subprocess_exec` 或 "
":func:`asyncio.create_subprocess_shell` 创建的进程时发生挂起的问题。 由 Kumar Aditya 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1316
msgid ":gh:`120057`: Add :func:`os.reload_environ` to ``os.__all__``."
msgstr ":gh:`120057`: 将 :func:`os.reload_environ` 添加到 ``os.__all__`` 中。"

#: ../NEWS:1318
msgid ""
":gh:`140228`: Avoid making unnecessary filesystem calls for frozen modules "
"in :mod:`linecache` when the global module cache is not present."
msgstr ":gh:`140228`: 当没有全局模块缓存时避免在 :mod:`linecache` 中为冻结模块执行不必要的文件系统调用。"

#: ../NEWS:1321
msgid ""
":gh:`140590`: Fix arguments checking for the "
":meth:`!functools.partial.__setstate__` that may lead to internal state "
"corruption and crash. Patch by Sergey Miryanov."
msgstr ""
":gh:`140590`: 修复针对可能导致内部状态破坏和崩溃的 :meth:`!functools.partial.__setstate__` "
"的参数检查。 由 Sergey Miryanov 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1325
msgid ""
":gh:`125434`: Display thread name in :mod:`faulthandler` on Windows. Patch "
"by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125434`: Windows 系统上在 :mod:`faulthandler` 中显示线程名称。 由 Victor Stinner "
"编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1328
msgid ""
":gh:`140634`: Fix a reference counting bug in "
":meth:`!os.sched_param.__reduce__`."
msgstr ":gh:`140634`: 修复 :meth:`!os.sched_param.__reduce__` 中的一个引用计数程序缺陷。"

#: ../NEWS:1331
msgid ""
":gh:`140633`: Ignore :exc:`AttributeError` when setting a module's "
"``__file__`` attribute when loading an extension module packaged as Apple "
"Framework."
msgstr ""
":gh:`140633`: 在加载打包为 Apple 框架的扩展模块时会忽略设置模块的 ``__file__`` 属性时引发的 "
":exc:`AttributeError`。"

#: ../NEWS:1335
msgid ""
":gh:`140593`: :mod:`xml.parsers.expat`: Fix a memory leak that could affect "
"users with :meth:`~xml.parsers.expat.xmlparser.ElementDeclHandler` set to a "
"custom element declaration handler. Patch by Sebastian Pipping."
msgstr ""
":gh:`140593`: :mod:`xml.parsers.expat`: 修复一个可能影响将 "
":meth:`~xml.parsers.expat.xmlparser.ElementDeclHandler` "
"设为自定义的元素声明处理器的用户的内存泄漏问题。 由 Sebastian Pipping 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1339
msgid ""
":gh:`140607`: Inside :meth:`io.RawIOBase.read`, validate that the count of "
"bytes returned by :meth:`io.RawIOBase.readinto` is valid (inside the "
"provided buffer)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`140607`: 在 :meth:`io.RawIOBase.read` 内部，验证由 "
":meth:`io.RawIOBase.readinto` 返回的字节计数是有效的（在所提供的缓冲区内部）。"

#: ../NEWS:1343
msgid ""
":gh:`138162`: Fix :class:`logging.LoggerAdapter` with ``merge_extra=True`` "
"and without the *extra* argument."
msgstr ""
":gh:`138162`: 修复 :class:`logging.LoggerAdapter` 带有 ``merge_extra=True`` 没有 "
"*extra* 参数的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1346
msgid ""
":gh:`138774`: :func:`ast.unparse` now generates full source code when "
"handling :class:`ast.Interpolation` nodes that do not have a specified "
"source."
msgstr ""
":gh:`138774`: 现在当处理没有指定源的 :class:`ast.Interpolation` 节点时 :func:`ast.unparse`"
" 会生成完整的源代码。now generates full source code when handlingnodes that do not "
"have a specified source."

#: ../NEWS:1350
msgid ""
":gh:`140474`: Fix memory leak in :class:`array.array` when creating arrays "
"from an empty :class:`str` and the ``u`` type code."
msgstr ""
":gh:`140474`: 修复当使用空 :class:`str` 和 ``u`` 类型码创建数组时 :class:`array.array` "
"中的内存泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1353
msgid ""
":gh:`137530`: :mod:`dataclasses` Fix annotations for generated ``__init__`` "
"methods by replacing the annotations that were in-line in the generated "
"source code with ``__annotate__`` functions attached to the methods."
msgstr ""
":gh:`137530`: :mod:`dataclasses` 通过将生成的源代码中内联的标注替换为关联到相应方法的 ``__annotate__``"
" 函数修复针对生成的 ``__init__`` 方法的标注。"

#: ../NEWS:1357
msgid ""
":gh:`140348`: Fix regression in Python 3.14.0 where using the ``|`` operator"
" on a :class:`typing.Union` object combined with an object that is not a "
"type would raise an error."
msgstr ""
":gh:`140348`: 修复了 Python 3.14.0 中当使用 ``|`` 运算符合并 :class:`typing.Union` "
"对象与不属于类型的对象时会引发错误的退化问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1361
msgid ""
":gh:`140272`: Fix memory leak in the :meth:`!clear` method of the "
":mod:`dbm.gnu` database."
msgstr ":gh:`140272`: 修复 :mod:`dbm.gnu` 数据库的 :meth:`!clear` 方法中的内存漏洞问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1364
msgid ""
":gh:`140041`: Fix import of :mod:`ctypes` on Android and Cygwin when ABI "
"flags are present."
msgstr ":gh:`140041`: 修复在 Android 和 Cygwin 上当存在 ABI 旗标时 :mod:`ctypes` 的导入问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1367
msgid ""
":gh:`140120`: Fixed a memory leak in :mod:`hmac` when it was using the hacl-"
"star backend. Discovered by ``@ashm-dev`` using AddressSanitizer."
msgstr ""
":gh:`140120`: 修复 :mod:`hmac` 中当其使用 hacl-star 后端时的内存泄漏问题。 由 ``@ashm-dev`` 使用 "
"AddressSanitizer 发现。"

#: ../NEWS:1370
msgid ""
":gh:`139905`: Add suggestion to error message for :class:`typing.Generic` "
"subclasses when ``cls.__parameters__`` is missing due to a parent class "
"failing to call :meth:`super().__init_subclass__() "
"<object.__init_subclass__>` in its ``__init_subclass__``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`139905`: 当 ``cls.__parameters__`` 由于父类在其 ``__init_subclass__`` 中调用 "
":meth:`super().__init_subclass__() <object.__init_subclass__>` 失败时为 "
":class:`typing.Generic` 子类的错误消息添加提示。"

#: ../NEWS:1375
msgid ""
":gh:`139894`: Fix incorrect sharing of current task with the child process "
"while forking in :mod:`asyncio`. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`139894`: 修复在 :mod:`asyncio` 内进行分叉时不正确的当前任务与子进程的共享。 由 Kumar Aditya 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1378
msgid ""
":gh:`139845`: Fix to not print KeyboardInterrupt twice in default asyncio "
"REPL."
msgstr ":gh:`139845`: 在默认 asyncio REPL 中修正为不再打印 KeyboardInterrupt 两次。"

#: ../NEWS:1381
msgid ""
":gh:`139783`: Fix :func:`inspect.getsourcelines` for the case when a "
"decorator is followed by a comment or an empty line."
msgstr ""
":gh:`139783`: 修正当一个装饰器后面跟一条注释或一个空行时 :func:`inspect.getsourcelines` 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1384
msgid ""
":gh:`139809`: Prevent premature colorization of subparser ``prog`` in "
":meth:`argparse.ArgumentParser.add_subparsers` to respect color environment "
"variable changes after parser creation."
msgstr ""
":gh:`139809`: 防止对 :meth:`argparse.ArgumentParser.add_subparsers` 中的子解析器 "
"``prog`` 过早着色以遵守在解析器创建之后色彩环境变量的修改。"

#: ../NEWS:1388
msgid ""
":gh:`139736`: Fix excessive indentation in the default :mod:`argparse` "
":class:`!HelpFormatter`. Patch by Alexander Edland."
msgstr ""
":gh:`139736`: 修复默认 :mod:`argparse` :class:`!HelpFormatter` 中的过度缩进。 由 "
"Alexander Edland 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1391
msgid ""
":gh:`70765`: :mod:`http.server`: fix default handling of HTTP/0.9 requests "
"in :class:`~http.server.BaseHTTPRequestHandler`. Previously, "
":meth:`!BaseHTTPRequestHandler.parse_request` incorrectly waited for headers"
" in the request although those are not supported in HTTP/0.9. Patch by "
"Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`70765`: :mod:`http.server`: 修复 "
":class:`~http.server.BaseHTTPRequestHandler` 中对 HTTP/0.9 请求的默认处理。 "
"在之前版本中，:meth:`!BaseHTTPRequestHandler.parse_request` 会不正确地等待请求中的标头虽然它们在 "
"HTTP/0.9 并不被支持。 由 Bénédikt Tran 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1397
msgid ""
":gh:`63161`: Fix :func:`tokenize.detect_encoding`. Support non-UTF-8 shebang"
" and comments if non-UTF-8 encoding is specified. Detect decoding error for "
"non-UTF-8 encoding. Detect null bytes in source code."
msgstr ""
":gh:`63161`: 修复 :func:`tokenize.detect_encoding` 的问题。 在指定了非 UTF-8 编码格式时支持 "
"UTF-8 shebang 和注释。 检测非 UTF-8 编码格式的解码错误。 检测源代码中的空字节。"

#: ../NEWS:1401
msgid ""
":gh:`139391`: Fix an issue when, on non-Windows platforms, it was not "
"possible to gracefully exit a ``python -m asyncio`` process suspended by "
"Ctrl+Z and later resumed by :manpage:`fg` other than with :manpage:`kill`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`139391`: 修复在非 Windows 平台上，当无法正常退出用 Ctrl+Z 挂起随后再由 :manpage:`fg` 恢复而不是 "
":manpage:`kill` 的 ``python -m asyncio`` 进程时会出现的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1405
msgid ""
":gh:`101828`: Fix ``'shift_jisx0213'``, ``'shift_jis_2004'``, "
"``'euc_jisx0213'`` and ``'euc_jis_2004'`` codecs truncating null chars as "
"they were treated as part of multi-character sequences."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101828`: 修复 ``'shift_jisx0213'``, ``'shift_jis_2004'``, "
"``'euc_jisx0213'`` 和 ``'euc_jis_2004'`` 编解码器因为空字符被当作多字符串序列的一部分而截断它们的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1409
msgid ""
":gh:`139289`: Do a real lazy-import on :mod:`rlcompleter` in :mod:`pdb` and "
"restore the existing completer after importing :mod:`rlcompleter`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`139289`: 在 :mod:`pdb` 的 :mod:`rlcompleter` 上执行真正的惰性导入并在导入 "
":mod:`rlcompleter` 之后现有的 completer。"

#: ../NEWS:1412
msgid ":gh:`139246`: fix: paste zero-width in default repl width is wrong."
msgstr ":gh:`139246`: 修正：在默认 repl 宽度中粘贴零宽度是错误的。"

#: ../NEWS:1414
msgid ""
":gh:`90949`: Add "
":meth:`~xml.parsers.expat.xmlparser.SetAllocTrackerActivationThreshold` and "
":meth:`~xml.parsers.expat.xmlparser.SetAllocTrackerMaximumAmplification` to "
":ref:`xmlparser <xmlparser-objects>` objects to prevent use of "
"disproportional amounts of dynamic memory from within an Expat parser. Patch"
" by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`90949`: 为 :ref:`xmlparser <xmlparser-objects>` 对象添加 "
":meth:`~xml.parsers.expat.xmlparser.SetAllocTrackerActivationThreshold` 和 "
":meth:`~xml.parsers.expat.xmlparser.SetAllocTrackerMaximumAmplification` "
"以防止在一个 Expat 解析器内部使用不适当大小的动态内存。 由 Bénédikt Tran 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1422
msgid ""
":gh:`139210`: Fix use-after-free when reporting unknown event in "
":func:`xml.etree.ElementTree.iterparse`. Patch by Ken Jin."
msgstr ""
":gh:`139210`: 修复当在 :func:`xml.etree.ElementTree.iterparse` 中报告未知事件时的释放后使用问题。"
" 由 Ken Jin 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1425
msgid ""
":gh:`138860`: Lazy import :mod:`rlcompleter` in :mod:`pdb` to avoid deadlock"
" in subprocess."
msgstr ":gh:`138860`: 在 :mod:`pdb` 中惰性导入 :mod:`rlcompleter` 以避免在子进程中发生死锁。"

#: ../NEWS:1428
msgid ""
":gh:`112729`: Fix crash when calling :func:`concurrent.interpreters.create` "
"when the process is out of memory."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112729`: 修复当进程内存不足时调用 :func:`concurrent.interpreters.create` 的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1431
msgid ""
":gh:`135729`: Fix unraisable exception during finalization when using "
":mod:`concurrent.interpreters` in the REPL."
msgstr ""
":gh:`135729`: 修复当在 REPL 中使用 :mod:`concurrent.interpreters` "
"时执行最终化期间不可引发的异常问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1434
msgid ""
":gh:`139076`: Fix a bug in the :mod:`pydoc` module that was hiding functions"
" in a Python module if they were implemented in an extension module and the "
"module did not have ``__all__``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`139076`: 修复 :mod:`pydoc` 模块中当一个Python 模块内的函数是在扩展模块中实现并且该模块没有 "
"``__all__`` 时会将其隐藏的程序缺陷。"

#: ../NEWS:1438
msgid ""
":gh:`139065`: Fix trailing space before a wrapped long word if the line "
"length is exactly *width* in :mod:`textwrap`."
msgstr ":gh:`139065`: 修复 :mod:`textwrap` 中当行长度恰好为 *width* 时被折行的长单词之前的行尾空格问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1441
msgid ""
":gh:`139001`: Fix race condition in :class:`pathlib.Path` on the internal "
"``_raw_paths`` field."
msgstr ""
":gh:`139001`: 修复在内部 ``_raw_paths`` 字段上 :class:`pathlib.Path` 中的竞争条件问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1444
msgid ""
":gh:`138813`: :class:`!multiprocessing.BaseProcess` defaults ``kwargs`` to "
"``None`` instead of a shared dictionary."
msgstr ""
":gh:`138813`: :class:`!multiprocessing.BaseProcess` 将 ``kwargs`` 默认为 "
"``None`` 而不是一个共享字典。"

#: ../NEWS:1447
msgid ":gh:`138993`: Dedent :data:`credits` text."
msgstr ":gh:`138993`: 撤销 :data:`credits` 文本的缩进。text."

#: ../NEWS:1449
msgid ""
":gh:`138891`: Fix ``SyntaxError`` when ``inspect.get_annotations(f, "
"eval_str=True)`` is called on a function annotated with a :pep:`646` "
"``star_expression``"
msgstr ""
":gh:`138891`: 修复当在带有 :pep:`646` ``star_expression`` 标注的函数上调用 "
"``inspect.get_annotations(f, eval_str=True)`` 时的 ``SyntaxError`` 问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1453
msgid ""
":gh:`130567`: Fix possible crash in :func:`locale.strxfrm` due to a platform"
" bug on macOS."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130567`: 修复由于 macOS 上存在一个平台程序缺陷而可能在 :func:`locale.strxfrm` 发生的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1456
msgid ""
":gh:`138859`: Fix generic type parameterization raising a :exc:`TypeError` "
"when omitting a :class:`ParamSpec` that has a default which is not a list of"
" types."
msgstr ""
":gh:`138859`: 修复当省略具有不为类型列表的默认值的 :class:`ParamSpec` 时泛型类型参数化引发 "
":exc:`TypeError` 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1460
msgid ""
":gh:`138764`: Prevent :func:`annotationlib.call_annotate_function` from "
"calling ``__annotate__`` functions that don't support "
"``VALUE_WITH_FAKE_GLOBALS`` in a fake globals namespace with empty globals."
msgstr ""
":gh:`138764`: 在具有空 globals 的模拟 globals 命名空间中避免 "
":func:`annotationlib.call_annotate_function` 调用不支持 "
"``VALUE_WITH_FAKE_GLOBALS`` 的 ``__annotate__`` 函数。"

#: ../NEWS:1465
msgid ""
"Make ``FORWARDREF`` and ``STRING`` annotations fall back to using ``VALUE`` "
"annotations in the case that neither their own format, nor "
"``VALUE_WITH_FAKE_GLOBALS`` are supported."
msgstr ""
"让 ``FORWARDREF`` 和 ``STRING`` 标注在它们自己的格式或 ``VALUE_WITH_FAKE_GLOBALS`` "
"均不受支持的情况下回退为使用 ``VALUE`` 标注。"

#: ../NEWS:1469
msgid ""
":gh:`138775`: Use of ``python -m`` with :mod:`base64` has been fixed to "
"detect input from a terminal so that it properly notices EOF."
msgstr ""
":gh:`138775`: 修复对 :mod:`base64` 使用 ``python -m`` 时检测来自终端的输入问题以使其能正确感知 EOF。"

#: ../NEWS:1472
msgid ""
":gh:`138779`: Support device numbers larger than ``2**63-1`` for the "
":attr:`~os.stat_result.st_rdev` field of the :class:`os.stat_result` "
"structure."
msgstr ""
":gh:`138779`: 针对 :class:`os.stat_result` 结构体的 "
":attr:`~os.stat_result.st_rdev` 字段支持大于 ``2**63-1`` 的设备号。"

#: ../NEWS:1476
msgid ""
":gh:`137706`: Fix the partial evaluation of annotations that use "
"``typing.Annotated[T, x]`` where ``T`` is a forward reference."
msgstr ""
":gh:`137706`: 修复使用 ``typing.Annotated[T, x]`` 的标注部分求值问题，其中 ``T`` 是一个前向引用。"

#: ../NEWS:1479
msgid ""
":gh:`88375`: Fix normalization of the ``robots.txt`` rules and URLs in the "
":mod:`urllib.robotparser` module. No longer ignore trailing ``?``. "
"Distinguish raw special characters ``?``, ``=`` and ``&`` from the percent-"
"encoded ones."
msgstr ""
":gh:`88375`: 在 :mod:`urllib.robotparser` 模块中修复 ``robots.txt`` 规则和 URL "
"的正规化问题。 不会再忽略末尾的 ``?``。 对原始特殊字符 ``?``, ``=`` 和 ``&`` 与其百分号编码形式进行区分。"

#: ../NEWS:1484
msgid ""
":gh:`111788`: Fix parsing errors in the :mod:`urllib.robotparser` module. "
"Don't fail trying to parse weird paths. Don't fail trying to decode non-"
"UTF-8 ``robots.txt`` files."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111788`: 修复 :mod:`urllib.robotparser` 模块中的解析错误。 尝试解析怪异路径时不会失败。 尝试解码非 "
"UTF-8 的 ``robots.txt`` 文件时不会失败。"

#: ../NEWS:1488
msgid ""
":gh:`98896`: Fix a failure in multiprocessing resource_tracker when "
"SharedMemory names contain colons. Patch by Rani Pinchuk."
msgstr ""
":gh:`98896`: 修正当 SharedMemory 名称包含冒号时 multiprocessing resource_tracker "
"中的一个错误。 由 Rani Pinchuk 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1491
msgid ""
":gh:`138425`: Fix partial evaluation of :class:`annotationlib.ForwardRef` "
"objects which rely on names defined as globals."
msgstr ""
":gh:`138425`: 修复依赖于定义为全局变量的名称的 :class:`annotationlib.ForwardRef` 对象的部分求值问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1494
msgid ""
":gh:`138432`: :meth:`zoneinfo.reset_tzpath` will now convert any "
":class:`os.PathLike` objects it receives into strings before adding them to "
"``TZPATH``. It will raise ``TypeError`` if anything other than a string is "
"found after this conversion. If given an :class:`os.PathLike` object that "
"represents a relative path, it will now raise ``ValueError`` instead of "
"``TypeError``, and present a more informative error message."
msgstr ""
":gh:`138432`: 现在 :meth:`zoneinfo.reset_tzpath` 会将它接收到的任何 "
":class:`os.PathLike` 对象在将其添加到 ``TZPATH`` 之前转换为字符串。 如果在此转换之后发现任何字符串以外的对象则将引发 "
"``TypeError``。 如果给出一个代表相对路径的 :class:`os.PathLike` 对象，则将引发 ``ValueError`` 而不是"
" ``TypeError``，并提供更详细的错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:1501
msgid ""
":gh:`138008`: Fix segmentation faults in the :mod:`ctypes` module due to "
"invalid :attr:`~ctypes._CFuncPtr.argtypes`. Patch by Dung Nguyen."
msgstr ""
":gh:`138008`: 修复 :mod:`ctypes` 模块中由于无效的 :attr:`~ctypes._CFuncPtr.argtypes` "
"而导致的段错误。 由 Dung Nguyen 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1504
msgid ""
":gh:`60462`: Fix :func:`locale.strxfrm` on Solaris (and possibly other "
"platforms)."
msgstr ":gh:`60462`: 修复 Solaris 中的 :func:`locale.strxfrm` 问题（可能也存在于其他平台）。"

#: ../NEWS:1507
msgid ""
":gh:`138239`: The REPL now highlights :keyword:`type` as a soft keyword in "
":ref:`type statements <type>`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`138239`: 现在 REPL 会将 :keyword:`type` 作为 :ref:`type 语句 <type>` "
"中的软关键字高亮显示。"

#: ../NEWS:1510
msgid ""
":gh:`138204`: Forbid expansion of shared anonymous :mod:`memory maps <mmap>`"
" on Linux, which caused a bus error."
msgstr ":gh:`138204`: 在 Linux 和禁止扩展共享匿名 :mod:`内存地图 <mmap>`，因为这会导致总线错误。"

#: ../NEWS:1513
msgid ""
":gh:`138010`: Fix an issue where defining a class with an "
":func:`@warnings.deprecated <warnings.deprecated>`-decorated base class may "
"not invoke the correct :meth:`~object.__init_subclass__` method in cases "
"involving multiple inheritance. Patch by Brian Schubert."
msgstr ""
":gh:`138010`: 修复一个当使用以 :func:`@warnings.deprecated <warnings.deprecated>` "
"装饰的基类定义的类在涉及多重继承的情况下可能不会唤起正确的 :meth:`~object.__init_subclass__` 方法的问题。 由 "
"Brian Schubert 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1518
msgid ""
":gh:`138151`: In :mod:`annotationlib`, improve evaluation of forward "
"references to nonlocal variables that are not yet defined when the "
"annotations are initially evaluated."
msgstr ""
":gh:`138151`: 在 :mod:`annotationlib` 中，改进针对当标注被初始求值时尚未定义 nonlocal "
"变量的前向引用的求值。"

#: ../NEWS:1522
msgid ""
":gh:`137317`: :func:`inspect.signature` now correctly handles classes that "
"use a descriptor on a wrapped :meth:`!__init__` or :meth:`!__new__` method. "
"Contributed by Yongyu Yan."
msgstr ""
":gh:`137317`: :func:`inspect.signature` 现在能够正确处理在包装的 :meth:`!__init__` 或 "
":meth:`!__new__` 方法上使用描述器的类。 由 Yongyu Yan 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:1526
msgid ""
":gh:`137754`: Fix import of the :mod:`zoneinfo` module if the C "
"implementation of the :mod:`datetime` module is not available."
msgstr ""
":gh:`137754`: 修复当 :mod:`datetime` 模块的 C 实现不可用时 :mod:`zoneinfo` 模块的导入问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1529
msgid ""
":gh:`137490`: Handle :data:`~errno.ECANCELED` in the same way as "
":data:`~errno.EINTR` in :func:`signal.sigwaitinfo` on NetBSD."
msgstr ""
":gh:`137490`: 在 NetBSD 上以与 :func:`signal.sigwaitinfo` 中的 "
":data:`~errno.EINTR` 相同的方式处理 :data:`~errno.ECANCELED`。"

#: ../NEWS:1532
msgid ""
":gh:`137477`: Fix :func:`!inspect.getblock`, :func:`inspect.getsourcelines` "
"and :func:`inspect.getsource` for generator expressions."
msgstr ""
":gh:`137477`: 修复生成器表达式的 :func:`!inspect.getblock`, "
":func:`inspect.getsourcelines` 和 :func:`inspect.getsource`。"

#: ../NEWS:1535
msgid ""
":gh:`137044`: Return large limit values as positive integers instead of "
"negative integers in :func:`resource.getrlimit`. Accept large values and "
"reject negative values (except :data:`~resource.RLIM_INFINITY`) for limits "
"in :func:`resource.setrlimit`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`137044`: 在 :func:`resource.getrlimit` 中返回的大数值限制为正整数而不是负整数。 对在 "
":func:`resource.setrlimit` 中的限制接受大数值并拒绝负值 (除了 "
":data:`~resource.RLIM_INFINITY`)。"

#: ../NEWS:1540
msgid ""
":gh:`75989`: :func:`tarfile.TarFile.extractall` and "
":func:`tarfile.TarFile.extract` now overwrite symlinks when extracting "
"hardlinks. (Contributed by Alexander Enrique Urieles Nieto in :gh:`75989`.)"
msgstr ""
":gh:`75989`: 现在当提取硬链接时 :func:`tarfile.TarFile.extractall` 和 "
":func:`tarfile.TarFile.extract` 将覆盖符号链接。 （由 Alexander Enrique Urieles Nieto "
"在 :gh:`75989` 中贡献。）"

#: ../NEWS:1545
msgid ""
":gh:`137017`: Fix :obj:`threading.Thread.is_alive` to remain ``True`` until "
"the underlying OS thread is fully cleaned up. This avoids false negatives in"
" edge cases involving thread monitoring or premature "
":obj:`threading.Thread.is_alive` calls."
msgstr ""
":gh:`137017`: 将 :obj:`threading.Thread.is_alive` 修正为保持 ``True`` 直到下层的 OS "
"线程被完全清理。 这将在涉及线程监控或过早调用 :obj:`threading.Thread.is_alive` 的边界场景下避免误报假阴性结果。"

#: ../NEWS:1550
msgid ""
":gh:`137273`: Fix debug assertion failure in :func:`locale.setlocale` on "
"Windows."
msgstr ":gh:`137273`: 修复在 Windows 上 :func:`locale.setlocale` 中的调试断言失败问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1553
msgid ""
":gh:`137239`: :mod:`heapq`: Update :data:`!heapq.__all__` with ``*_max`` "
"functions."
msgstr ":gh:`137239`: :mod:`heapq`: 为 :data:`!heapq.__all__` 更新 ``*_max`` 函数。"

#: ../NEWS:1556
msgid ""
":gh:`81325`: :class:`tarfile.TarFile` now accepts a :term:`path-like <path-"
"like object>` when working on a tar archive. (Contributed by Alexander "
"Enrique Urieles Nieto in :gh:`81325`.)"
msgstr ""
":gh:`81325`: 当处理 tar 归档时 :class:`tarfile.TarFile` 现在可接受 :term:`路径型对象 <path-"
"like object>`。 （由 Alexander Enrique Urieles Nieto 在 :gh:`81325` 中贡献。）"

#: ../NEWS:1560
msgid ""
":gh:`137185`: Fix a potential async-signal-safety issue in "
":mod:`faulthandler` when printing C stack traces."
msgstr ":gh:`137185`: 修复在打印 C 栈跟踪信息时 :mod:`faulthandler` 中潜在的异步信号安全问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1563
msgid ""
":gh:`136914`: Fix retrieval of :attr:`doctest.DocTest.lineno` for objects "
"decorated with :func:`functools.cache` or "
":class:`functools.cached_property`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`136914`: 修复针对以 :func:`functools.cache` 或 "
":class:`functools.cached_property` 装饰的对象提取 :attr:`doctest.DocTest.lineno` "
"的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1567
msgid ""
":gh:`136912`: :func:`hmac.digest` now properly handles large keys and "
"messages by falling back to the pure Python implementation when necessary. "
"Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`136912`: 现在 :func:`hmac.digest` 能在必要时通过回退至纯 Python 实现来正确地处理大量键和消息。 由 "
"Bénédikt Tran 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1571
msgid ""
":gh:`83424`: Allows creating a :class:`ctypes.CDLL` without name when "
"passing a handle as an argument."
msgstr ":gh:`83424`: 在传入句柄作为参数时允许创建没有名称的 :class:`ctypes.CDLL`。"

#: ../NEWS:1574
msgid ""
":gh:`136234`: Fix :meth:`asyncio.WriteTransport.writelines` to be robust to "
"connection failure, by using the same behavior as "
":meth:`~asyncio.WriteTransport.write`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`136234`: 通过使用与 :meth:`~asyncio.WriteTransport.write` 相同的行为，修复 "
":meth:`asyncio.WriteTransport.writelines` 对于连接失败的健壮性。"

#: ../NEWS:1578
msgid ":gh:`136507`: Fix mimetypes CLI to handle multiple file parameters."
msgstr ":gh:`136507`: 修正 mimetypes CLI 以处理多个文件形参。"

#: ../NEWS:1580
msgid ""
":gh:`136057`: Fixed the bug in :mod:`pdb` and :mod:`bdb` where ``next`` and "
"``step`` can't go over the line if a loop exists in the line."
msgstr ""
":gh:`136057`: 修复了在 :mod:`pdb` 和 :mod:`bdb` 中如果行内存在循环则 ``next`` 和 ``step`` "
"无法穿过该行的程序缺陷。"

#: ../NEWS:1583
msgid ""
":gh:`135386`: Fix opening a :mod:`dbm.sqlite3` database for reading from "
"read-only file or directory."
msgstr ":gh:`135386`: 修复了从只读的文件或目录打开一个 :mod:`dbm.sqlite3` 数据库供读取时出现的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1586
msgid ""
":gh:`135444`: Fix :meth:`asyncio.DatagramTransport.sendto` to account for "
"datagram header size when data cannot be sent."
msgstr ""
":gh:`135444`: 修正 :meth:`asyncio.DatagramTransport.sendto` "
"以在数据无法被发送时将数据报标头大小纳入考量。"

#: ../NEWS:1589
msgid ""
":gh:`126631`: Fix :mod:`multiprocessing` ``forkserver`` bug which prevented "
"``__main__`` from being preloaded."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126631`: 修正 :mod:`multiprocessing` 中 ``forkserver`` 阻止预加载 ``__main__`` "
"的程序缺陷。"

#: ../NEWS:1592
msgid ""
":gh:`135307`: :mod:`email`: Fix exception in ``set_content()`` when encoding"
" text and max_line_length is set to ``0`` or ``None`` (unlimited)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`135307`: :mod:`email`: 修正当 encoding 文本和 max_line_length 被设为 ``0`` 或 "
"``None`` (无限制) 时在 ``set_content()`` 中引发异常的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1595
msgid ""
":gh:`134453`: Fixed :func:`subprocess.Popen.communicate` ``input=`` handling"
" of :class:`memoryview` instances that were non-byte shaped on POSIX "
"platforms. Those are now properly cast to a byte shaped view instead of "
"truncating the input.  Windows platforms did not have this bug."
msgstr ""
":gh:`134453`: 修正 POSIX 平台上 :func:`subprocess.Popen.communicate` 对于非字节形状 "
":class:`memoryview` 实例的 ``input=`` 处理。 现在它们会被正确转换为字节形状视图而不是截断输入。 Windows "
"平台不存在此程序缺陷。platforms did not have this bug."

#: ../NEWS:1600
msgid ""
":gh:`134698`: Fix a crash when calling methods of :class:`ssl.SSLContext` or"
" :class:`ssl.SSLSocket` across multiple threads."
msgstr ""
":gh:`134698`: 修复在多个线程上调用 :class:`ssl.SSLContext` 或 :class:`ssl.SSLSocket` "
"的方法时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1603
msgid ""
":gh:`125996`: Fix thread safety of :class:`collections.OrderedDict`. Patch "
"by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125996`: 修复 :class:`collections.OrderedDict` 的线程安全问题。 由 Kumar Aditya "
"编写补丁。."

#: ../NEWS:1606
msgid ""
":gh:`133789`: Fix unpickling of :mod:`pathlib` objects that were pickled in "
"Python 3.13."
msgstr ":gh:`133789`: 修正对在 Python 3.13 中封存的 :mod:`pathlib` 对象进行解封时存在的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1609
msgid ""
":gh:`127081`: Fix libc thread safety issues with :mod:`dbm` by performing "
"stateful operations in critical sections."
msgstr ":gh:`127081`: 通过在关键节中执行有状态操作修复 :mod:`dbm` 的 libc 线程安全问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1612
msgid ""
":gh:`132551`: Make :class:`io.BytesIO` safe in :term:`free-threaded <free "
"threading>` build."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132551`: 使 :class:`io.BytesIO` 在 :term:`自由线程 <free threading>` 构建中保证安全。"

#: ../NEWS:1615
msgid ""
":gh:`131788`: Make ``ResourceTracker.send`` from :mod:`multiprocessing` re-"
"entrant safe"
msgstr ""
":gh:`131788`: 使 :mod:`multiprocessing` 中的 ``ResourceTracker.send`` 保证重进入安全。"

#: ../NEWS:1618
msgid ""
":gh:`118981`: Fix potential hang in ``multiprocessing.popen_spawn_posix`` "
"that can happen when the child proc dies early by closing the child fds "
"right away."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118981`: 通过立即关闭子进程 fds 修复当子进程提前死亡时 "
"``multiprocessing.popen_spawn_posix`` 中潜在的挂起问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1622
msgid ""
":gh:`102431`: Clarify constraints for \"logical\" arguments in methods of "
":class:`decimal.Context`."
msgstr ":gh:`102431`: 在 :class:`decimal.Context` 的方法中明确对“逻辑”参数的约束。"

#: ../NEWS:1625
msgid ""
":gh:`78319`: UTF8 support for the IMAP APPEND command has been made RFC "
"compliant."
msgstr ":gh:`78319`: 对 IMAP APPEND 命令的 UTF8 支持已做到符合 RFC 规范。"

#: ../NEWS:1628
msgid ""
":issue:`38735`: Fix failure when importing a module from the root directory "
"on unix-like platforms with sys.pycache_prefix set."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38735`: 修正在设置了 sys.pycache_prefix 的类 unix 平台上从根目录导入模块时执行失败的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1631
msgid ""
":issue:`41839`: Allow negative priority values from "
":func:`os.sched_get_priority_min` and :func:`os.sched_get_priority_max` "
"functions."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41839`: 允许 :func:`os.sched_get_priority_min` 和 "
":func:`os.sched_get_priority_max` 函数使用负的优先级值。"

#: ../NEWS:1638
msgid ""
":gh:`96491`: Deduplicate version number in IDLE shell title bar after saving"
" to a file."
msgstr ":gh:`96491`: 去除在保存到文件后 IDLE shell 标题栏中重复的版本号。"

#: ../NEWS:1641
msgid ""
":gh:`139742`: Colorize t-string prefixes for template strings in IDLE, as "
"done for f-string prefixes."
msgstr ":gh:`139742`: 在 IDLE 中为模板字符串的 t 字符串前缀设置颜色，如同 f 字符串前缀一样。"

#: ../NEWS:1647
msgid ""
":gh:`141994`: :mod:`xml.sax.handler`: Make Documentation of "
":data:`xml.sax.handler.feature_external_ges` warn of opening up to `external"
" entity attacks "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XML_external_entity_attack>`_. Patch by "
"Sebastian Pipping."
msgstr ""
":gh:`141994`: :mod:`xml.sax.handler`: 在 "
":data:`xml.sax.handler.feature_external_ges` 的文档中警告 `外部实体攻击 "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XML_external_entity_attack>`_ 风险。 由 Sebastian"
" Pipping 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1653
msgid ""
":gh:`140578`: Remove outdated sencence in the documentation for "
":mod:`multiprocessing`, that implied that "
":class:`concurrent.futures.ThreadPoolExecutor` did not exist."
msgstr ""
":gh:`140578`: 移除 :mod:`multiprocessing` 中过时的句子，其中假定 "
":class:`concurrent.futures.ThreadPoolExecutor` 不存在。"

#: ../NEWS:1660
msgid ""
":gh:`142048`: Fix quadratically increasing garbage collection delays in "
"free-threaded build."
msgstr ":gh:`142048`: 修正在自由线程构建版中指数级增加的垃圾回收延迟问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1666
msgid ""
":gh:`116738`: Fix thread safety issue with :mod:`re` scanner objects in "
"free-threaded builds."
msgstr ":gh:`116738`: 修正自由线程构建版中 :mod:`re` 扫描器对象的线程安全问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1672
msgid ""
":gh:`141930`: When importing a module, use Python's regular file object to "
"ensure that writes to ``.pyc`` files are complete or an appropriate error is"
" raised."
msgstr ":gh:`141930`: 当导入模块时，使用 Python 的常规文件对象以确保完整写入 ``.pyc`` 文件否则将引发适当的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:1676
msgid ""
":gh:`120158`: Fix inconsistent state when enabling or disabling monitoring "
"events too many times."
msgstr ":gh:`120158`: 修正当启用或禁用监视事件太多次时的不一致状态问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1679
msgid ""
":gh:`139653`: Only raise a ``RecursionError`` or trigger a fatal error if "
"the stack pointer is both below the limit pointer *and* above the stack "
"base. If outside of these bounds assume that it is OK. This prevents false "
"positives when user-space threads swap stacks."
msgstr ""
":gh:`139653`: 如果栈指针低于限制指针 *并且* 高于栈基准位置则仅引发 ``RecursionError`` 或者触发一个致命错误。 "
"如果在此边界以外则认为没有问题。 这将避免当用户空间线程与栈相交换时的误报问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1684
msgid ""
":gh:`139103`: Improve multithreaded scaling of dataclasses on the free-"
"threaded build."
msgstr ":gh:`139103`: 在自由线程构建上改进数据类的多线程调节操作。"

#: ../NEWS:1687
msgid ""
":gh:`141579`: Fix :func:`sys.activate_stack_trampoline` to properly support "
"the ``perf_jit`` backend. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":gh:`141579`: 修复 :func:`sys.activate_stack_trampoline` 以正确地支持 ``perf_jit`` "
"后端。 由 Pablo Galindo 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1690
msgid ""
":gh:`114203`: Skip locking if object is already locked by two-mutex critical"
" section."
msgstr ":gh:`114203`: 如果对象已被双向互斥关键节锁定则跳过锁定操作。"

#: ../NEWS:1693
msgid ""
":gh:`141528`: Suggest using "
":meth:`concurrent.interpreters.Interpreter.close` instead of the private "
"``_interpreters.destroy`` function when warning about remaining "
"subinterpreters. Patch by Sergey Miryanov."
msgstr ""
":gh:`141528`: 当就其他子解释器发出警告时建议使用 "
":meth:`concurrent.interpreters.Interpreter.close` 而不是私有的 "
"``_interpreters.destroy`` 函数。 由 Sergey Miryanov 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1697
msgid ""
":gh:`141312`: Fix the assertion failure in the ``__setstate__`` method of "
"the range iterator when a non-integer argument is passed. Patch by Sergey "
"Miryanov."
msgstr ""
":gh:`141312`: 修复在 range 迭代器的 ``__setstate__`` 方法中当传入非整数参数时的断言失败问题。 由 Sergey "
"Miryanov 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1704
msgid ""
":gh:`116738`: Make csv module thread-safe on the :term:`free threaded <free "
"threading>` build."
msgstr ":gh:`116738`: 使 csv 模块在 :term:`自由线程 <free threading>` 构建上线程安全。"

#: ../NEWS:1710
msgid ""
":gh:`140939`: Fix memory leak when :class:`bytearray` or :class:`bytes` is "
"formated with the ``%*b`` format with a large width that results in a "
":exc:`MemoryError`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`140939`: 修复当 :class:`bytearray` 或 :class:`bytes` 使用 ``%*b`` "
"格式以很大的宽度值进行格式化而导致 :exc:`MemoryError` 时的内存泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1717
msgid ""
":gh:`140260`: Fix :mod:`struct` data race in endian table initialization "
"with subinterpreters. Patch by Shamil Abdulaev."
msgstr ""
":gh:`140260`: 修复子解释器端序表初始化中的 :mod:`struct` 数据竞争问题。 由 Shamil Abdulaev 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1723
msgid ""
":gh:`140530`: Fix a reference leak when ``raise exc from cause`` fails. "
"Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`140530`: 修复当 ``raise exc from cause`` 执行失败时的引用泄漏问题。 由 Bénédikt Tran "
"编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1726
msgid ""
":gh:`140373`: Correctly emit ``PY_UNWIND`` event when generator object is "
"closed. Patch by Mikhail Efimov."
msgstr ":gh:`140373`: 当生成器对象关闭时正确发出 ``PY_UNWIND`` 事件。由 Mikhail Efimov 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1729
msgid ""
":gh:`140576`: Fixed crash in :func:`tokenize.generate_tokens` in case of "
"specific incorrect input. Patch by Mikhail Efimov."
msgstr ""
":gh:`140576`: 修复 :func:`tokenize.generate_tokens` 在特定错误输入情况下的崩溃问题。 由 Mikhail"
" Efimov 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1732
msgid ""
":gh:`140551`: Fixed crash in :class:`dict` if :meth:`dict.clear` is called "
"at the lookup stage. Patch by Mikhail Efimov and Inada Naoki."
msgstr ""
":gh:`140551`: 修复当 :meth:`dict.clear` 在查找阶段被调用时 :class:`dict` 中的崩溃问题。 由 "
"Mikhail Efimov 和 Inada Naoki 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1735
msgid ""
":gh:`140517`: Fixed a reference leak when iterating over the result of "
":func:`map` with ``strict=True`` when the input iterables have different "
"lengths. Patch by Mikhail Efimov."
msgstr ""
":gh:`140517`: 修复当输入的可迭代对象具有不同长度时在对设置了 ``strict=True`` 的 :func:`map` "
"的结果进行迭代时的引用泄漏问题。 由 Mikhail Efimov 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1739
msgid ""
":gh:`140471`: Fix potential buffer overflow in :class:`ast.AST` node "
"initialization when encountering malformed :attr:`~ast.AST._fields` "
"containing non-:class:`str`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`140471`: 修复了在遇到包含非 :class:`str` 的不良格式 :attr:`~ast.AST._fields` 时 "
":class:`ast.AST` 节点初始化中潜在的缓冲区溢出问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1743
msgid ""
":gh:`140431`: Fix a crash in Python's :term:`garbage collector <garbage "
"collection>` due to partially initialized :term:`coroutine` objects when "
"coroutine origin tracking depth is enabled "
"(:func:`sys.set_coroutine_origin_tracking_depth`)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`140431`: 修复在 Python 的 :term:`垃圾回收器 <garbage collection>` 中当协程原始跟踪深度 "
"(:func:`sys.set_coroutine_origin_tracking_depth`) 被启用时由于部分初始化的 "
":term:`coroutine` 对象导致的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1751
msgid ""
":gh:`140398`: Fix memory leaks in :mod:`readline` functions "
":func:`~readline.read_init_file`, :func:`~readline.read_history_file`, "
":func:`~readline.write_history_file`, and "
":func:`~readline.append_history_file` when :c:func:`PySys_Audit` fails."
msgstr ""
":gh:`140398`: 修复当 :c:func:`PySys_Audit` 执行失败时在 :mod:`readline` 的 "
":func:`~readline.read_init_file`, :func:`~readline.read_history_file`, "
":func:`~readline.write_history_file` 和 :func:`~readline.append_history_file`"
" 函数中的内存泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1759
msgid ""
":gh:`140406`: Fix memory leak when an object's :meth:`~object.__hash__` "
"method returns an object that isn't an :class:`int`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`140406`: 修复当一个对象的 :meth:`~object.__hash__` 方法返回不为 :class:`int` "
"的对象时发生崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1762
msgid ""
":gh:`140358`: Restore elapsed time and unreachable object count in GC debug "
"output. These were inadvertently removed during a refactor of ``gc.c``. The "
"debug log now again reports elapsed collection time and the number of "
"unreachable objects. Contributed by Pål Grønås Drange."
msgstr ""
":gh:`140358`: 恢复在 GC 调试输出中的已花费时间和不可访问对象计数。 这些内容在 ``gc.c`` 重构期间被无意中移除了。 "
"调试日志现在将再次报告已花费收集时间和不可访问对象数量。 由 Pål Grønås Drange 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:1767
msgid ""
":gh:`140306`: Fix memory leaks in cross-interpreter channel operations and "
"shared namespace handling."
msgstr ":gh:`140306`: 修复跨解释器通道操作和共享命名空间处理中的内存泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1770
msgid ":gh:`140301`: Fix memory leak of ``PyConfig`` in subinterpreters."
msgstr ":gh:`140301`: 修复子解释器中 ``PyConfig`` 的内存泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1772
msgid ""
":gh:`140257`: Fix data race between interpreter_clear() and take_gil() on "
"eval_breaker during finalization with daemon threads."
msgstr ""
":gh:`140257`: 修复守护线程最终化期间在 eval_breaker 上 interpreter_clear() 和 take_gil() "
"之间的数据竞争问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1775
msgid ""
":gh:`139951`: Fixes a regression in GC performance for a growing heap "
"composed mostly of small tuples."
msgstr ":gh:`139951`: 修复针对主要由小元组构成的堆不断增长导致的 GC 性能回归问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1778
msgid ""
"Counts number of actually tracked objects, instead of trackable objects. "
"This ensures that untracking tuples has the desired effect of reducing GC "
"overhead."
msgstr "实际跟踪对象，而非可跟踪对象的计数。 这将确保未跟踪的元组具有降低 GC 开销的预期效果。"

#: ../NEWS:1780
msgid ""
"Does not track most untrackable tuples during creation. This prevents large "
"numbers of small tuples causing excessive GCs."
msgstr "不跟踪在创建期间大部分不可跟踪的元组。 这将避免大量小元组导致过度的 GC 操作。"

#: ../NEWS:1783
msgid ""
":gh:`140104`: Fix a bug with exception handling in the JIT. Patch by Ken "
"Jin. Bug reported by Daniel Diniz."
msgstr ""
":gh:`140104`: 修复 JIT 中的一个异常处理程序缺陷。 由 Ken Jin 编写补丁。 由 Daniel Diniz 报告程序缺陷。"

#: ../NEWS:1786
msgid ""
":gh:`140061`: Fixing the checking of whether an object is uniquely "
"referenced to ensure free-threaded compatibility. Patch by Sergey Miryanov."
msgstr ":gh:`140061`: 修正检查对象是否被唯一引用的功能以确保自由线程兼容性。 由 Sergey Miryanov 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1789
msgid ":gh:`140067`: Fix memory leak in sub-interpreter creation."
msgstr ":gh:`140067`: 修复子解释器创建中的内存泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1791
msgid ""
":gh:`140000`: Fix potential memory leak when a reference cycle exists "
"between an instance of :class:`typing.TypeAliasType`, "
":class:`typing.TypeVar`, :class:`typing.ParamSpec`, or "
":class:`typing.TypeVarTuple` and its ``__name__`` attribute. Patch by "
"Mikhail Efimov."
msgstr ""
":gh:`140000`: 修复当 :class:`typing.TypeAliasType`, :class:`typing.TypeVar`, "
":class:`typing.ParamSpec` 或 :class:`typing.TypeVarTuple` 的实例及其 ``__name__`` "
"属性之间存在引用循环时潜在的内存泄漏问题。 由 Mikhail Efimov 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1796
msgid ""
":gh:`139914`: Restore support for HP PA-RISC, which has an upwards-growing "
"stack."
msgstr ":gh:`139914`: 恢复对 HP PA-RISC 的支持，它具有向上增长的栈。"

#: ../NEWS:1799
msgid ""
":gh:`139988`: Fix a memory leak when failing to create a "
":class:`~typing.Union` type. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`139988`: 修复当创建 :class:`~typing.Union` 类型失败时的内存泄漏问题。 由 Bénédikt Tran "
"编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1802
msgid ""
":gh:`139748`: Fix reference leaks in error branches of functions accepting "
"path strings or bytes such as :func:`compile` and :func:`os.system`. Patch "
"by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`139748`: 修复在接受路径字符串或字节串的函数如 :func:`compile` 和 :func:`os.system` "
"的错误分支中的引用泄漏问题。 由 Bénédikt Tran 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1806
msgid ""
":gh:`139516`: Fix lambda colon erroneously start format spec in f-string in "
"tokenizer."
msgstr ":gh:`139516`: 修复 lambda 的冒号在 tokenizer 的 f-字符串中错误开启格式说明的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1809
msgid ""
":gh:`139640`: :func:`ast.parse` no longer emits syntax warnings for "
"``return``/``break``/``continue`` in ``finally`` (see :pep:`765`) -- they "
"are only emitted during compilation."
msgstr ""
":gh:`139640`: :func:`ast.parse` 将不再针对 ``finally`` 中的 "
"``return``/``break``/``continue`` 发出语法警告 (参见 :pep:`765`) -- 它们只会在编译期间发出。"

#: ../NEWS:1813
msgid ""
":gh:`139640`: Fix swallowing some syntax warnings in different modules if "
"they accidentally have the same message and are emitted from the same line. "
"Fix duplicated warnings in the ``finally`` block."
msgstr ""
":gh:`139640`: 修复在多个模块中当某些语法警告具有相同消息并从相同行发出时被漏掉的问题。 修复 ``finally`` 代码块中重复的警告。"

#: ../NEWS:1817
msgid ""
":gh:`63161`: Support non-UTF-8 shebang and comments in Python source files "
"if non-UTF-8 encoding is specified. Detect decoding error in comments for "
"default (UTF-8) encoding. Show the line and position of decoding error for "
"default encoding in a traceback. Show the line containing the coding cookie "
"when it conflicts with the BOM in a traceback."
msgstr ""
":gh:`63161`: 当在 Python 源文件中指定非 UTF-8 编码格式时支持非 UTF-8 shebang 和注释。 针对默认 "
"(UTF-8) 编码格式检测注释中的解码错误。 在回溯中显示针对默认编码格式的解码错误的行和位置。  在回溯中显示包含与 BOM 冲突的 coding "
"cookie 的行。"

#: ../NEWS:1826
msgid ""
":gh:`116738`: Make :mod:`mmap` thread-safe on the :term:`free threaded <free"
" threading>` build."
msgstr ":gh:`116738`: 使 :mod:`mmap` 在 :term:`自由线程 <free threading>` 构建上线程安全。"

#: ../NEWS:1832
msgid ""
":gh:`138558`: Fix handling of unusual t-string annotations in annotationlib."
" Patch by Dave Peck."
msgstr ":gh:`138558`: 修正在 annotationlib 中对不常见 t-字符串标注的处理。 由 Dave Peck 编写代码。"

#: ../NEWS:1835
msgid ""
":gh:`134466`: Don't run PyREPL in a degraded environment where setting "
"termios attributes is not allowed."
msgstr ":gh:`134466`: 当不允许设置 termios 属性时不在降级的环境中运行 PyREPL。"

#: ../NEWS:1838
msgid ""
":gh:`138944`: Fix :exc:`SyntaxError` message when invalid syntax appears on "
"the same line as a valid ``import ... as ...`` or ``from ... import ... as "
"...`` statement. Patch by Brian Schubert."
msgstr ""
":gh:`138944`: 修复当无效的语法与有效的 ``import ... as ...`` 或 ``from ... import ... as "
"...`` 语句出现在同一行时的 :exc:`SyntaxError`。 由 Brian Schubert 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1842
msgid ""
":gh:`105487`: Remove non-existent :meth:`~object.__copy__`, "
":meth:`~object.__deepcopy__`, and :attr:`~type.__bases__` from the "
":meth:`~object.__dir__` entries of :class:`types.GenericAlias`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105487`: 从 :class:`types.GenericAlias` 的 :meth:`~object.__dir__` "
"条目中移除不存在的 :meth:`~object.__copy__`, :meth:`~object.__deepcopy__` 和 "
":attr:`~type.__bases__`。"

#: ../NEWS:1846
msgid ""
":gh:`69605`: Fix some standard library submodules missing from the "
":term:`REPL` auto-completion of imports."
msgstr ":gh:`69605`: 修复 :term:`REPL` 的导入自动补全中缺失某些标准库子模块的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1852
msgid ""
":gh:`116738`: Make :mod:`cProfile` thread-safe on the :term:`free threaded "
"<free threading>` build."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116738`: 使 :mod:`cProfile` 在 :term:`自由线程 <free threading>` 构建上线程安全。"

#: ../NEWS:1855
msgid ""
":gh:`138004`: On Solaris/Illumos platforms, thread names are now encoded as "
"ASCII to avoid errors on systems (e.g. OpenIndiana) that don't support non-"
"ASCII names."
msgstr ""
":gh:`138004`: 在 Solaris/Illumos 平台上，线程名称现在将被编码为 ASCII 以避免在不支持非 ASCII 名称的系统 "
"(例如 OpenIndiana) 上出错。"

#: ../NEWS:1862
msgid ""
":gh:`137433`: Fix a potential deadlock in the :term:`free threading` build "
"when daemon threads enable or disable profiling or tracing while the main "
"thread is shutting down the interpreter."
msgstr ""
":gh:`137433`: 修复在 :term:`free threading` "
"构建版中主线程正执行关闭解释器操作期间当守护线程启用或禁用性能分析或跟踪时潜在的死锁问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1866 ../NEWS:2172
msgid ""
":gh:`137400`: Fix a crash in the :term:`free threading` build when disabling"
" profiling or tracing across all threads with "
":c:func:`PyEval_SetProfileAllThreads` or :c:func:`PyEval_SetTraceAllThreads`"
" or their Python equivalents :func:`threading.settrace_all_threads` and "
":func:`threading.setprofile_all_threads`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`137400`：修复了在 :term:`free threading` 构建模式下，当使用 "
":c:func:`PyEval_SetProfileAllThreads` 或 :c:func:`PyEval_SetTraceAllThreads` "
"函数 (或其 Python 等效函数 :func:`threading.settrace_all_threads` 和 "
":func:`threading.setprofile_all_threads`) 禁用所有线程的分析或跟踪功能时出现的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1873
msgid ""
":gh:`58124`: Fix name of the Python encoding in Unicode errors of the code "
"page codec: use \"cp65000\" and \"cp65001\" instead of \"CP_UTF7\" and "
"\"CP_UTF8\" which are not valid Python code names. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`58124`: 修正代码页编解码器的 Unicode 错误中 Python 编码格式名称：使用 \"cp65000\" 和 "
"\"cp65001\" 而不是无效的 Python 代码名称 \"CP_UTF7\" 和 \"CP_UTF8\"。 由 Victor Stinner "
"编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1877
msgid ""
":gh:`132657`: Improve performance of :class:`frozenset` by removing locks in"
" the free-threading build."
msgstr ":gh:`132657`: 通过移除自由线程构建中的锁提升了 :class:`frozenset` 的性能。"

#: ../NEWS:1880
msgid ""
":gh:`133400`: Fixed Ctrl+D (^D) behavior in _pyrepl module to match old "
"pre-3.13 REPL behavior."
msgstr ":gh:`133400`: 修复 _pyrepl 模块中的 Ctrl+D (^D) 行为以匹配 3.13 版之前的旧 REPL 行为。"

#: ../NEWS:1883
msgid ""
":gh:`128640`: Fix a crash when using threads inside of a subinterpreter."
msgstr ":gh:`128640`: 修复在子解释器中使用线程时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1888
msgid ""
":gh:`137422`: Fix :term:`free threading` race condition in "
":c:func:`PyImport_AddModuleRef`. It was previously possible for two calls to"
" the function return two different objects, only one of which was stored in "
":data:`sys.modules`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`137422`: 修复 :c:func:`PyImport_AddModuleRef` 中的 :term:`free threading` "
"竞争条件问题。 在之前版本中对该函数的两次调用有可能返回两个不同对象，只有其中一个会被存储到 :data:`sys.modules` 中。"

#: ../NEWS:1893
msgid ""
":gh:`140042`: Removed the sqlite3_shutdown call that could cause closing "
"connections for sqlite when used with multiple sub interpreters."
msgstr ":gh:`140042`: 移除可能导致与多个子解释器一起使用时关闭 sqlite 连接的 sqlite3_shutdown 调用。"

#: ../NEWS:1896
msgid ""
":gh:`141042`: Make qNaN in :c:func:`PyFloat_Pack2` and "
":c:func:`PyFloat_Pack4`, if while conversion to a narrower precision "
"floating-point format --- the remaining after truncation payload will be "
"zero.  Patch by Sergey B Kirpichev."
msgstr ""
":gh:`141042`: 当转换至较窄精度的浮点格式时，在 :c:func:`PyFloat_Pack2` 和 "
":c:func:`PyFloat_Pack4` 中使用 qNaN --- 在截断载荷之后的剩余值将为零。 由 Sergey B Kirpichev "
"编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1901
msgid ""
":gh:`140487`: Fix :c:macro:`Py_RETURN_NOTIMPLEMENTED` in limited C API 3.11 "
"and older: don't treat ``Py_NotImplemented`` as immortal. Patch by Victor "
"Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`140487`: 修复受限 C API 3.11 或更早版本中的 :c:macro:`Py_RETURN_NOTIMPLEMENTED`: "
"不将 ``Py_NotImplemented`` 当作永生对象。 由 Victor Stinner 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1905
msgid ""
":gh:`140153`: Fix :c:func:`Py_REFCNT` definition on limited C API 3.11-3.13."
" Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`140153`: 修复受限 C API 3.11-3.13 中的 :c:func:`Py_REFCNT` 定义。 由 Victor "
"Stinner 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1908
msgid ""
":gh:`139653`: Add :c:func:`PyUnstable_ThreadState_SetStackProtection` and "
":c:func:`PyUnstable_ThreadState_ResetStackProtection` functions to set the "
"stack protection base address and stack protection size of a Python thread "
"state. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`139653`: 增加 :c:func:`PyUnstable_ThreadState_SetStackProtection` 和 "
":c:func:`PyUnstable_ThreadState_ResetStackProtection` 函数用于设置 Python "
"线程状态的栈保护基准地址和栈保护大小。 由 Victor Stinner 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1916
msgid ""
":gh:`141808`: Do not generate the jit stencils twice in case of PGO builds "
"on Windows."
msgstr ":gh:`141808`: 在 Windows 上的 PGO 构建场景中不会重复生成 jit stencil。"

#: ../NEWS:1919
msgid ""
":gh:`141784`: Fix ``_remote_debugging_module.c`` compilation on 32-bit "
"Linux. Include Python.h before system headers to make sure that "
"``_remote_debugging_module.c`` uses the same types (ABI) than Python. Patch "
"by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`141784`: 修复在 32 位 Linux 上 ``_remote_debugging_module.c`` 的编译问题。 "
"在系统头文件之前先包括 Python.h 以确保 ``_remote_debugging_module.c`` 使用与 Python 相同的类型 "
"(ABI)。 由 Victor Stinner 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1924
msgid ""
":gh:`140768`: Warn when the WASI SDK version doesn't match what's supported."
msgstr ":gh:`140768`: 当 WASI SDK 版本与受支持版本不匹配时发出警告。"

#: ../NEWS:1926
msgid ""
":gh:`140513`: Generate a clear compilation error when "
"``_Py_TAIL_CALL_INTERP`` is enabled but either ``preserve_none`` or "
"``musttail`` is not supported."
msgstr ""
":gh:`140513`: 当 ``_Py_TAIL_CALL_INTERP`` 被启用但 ``preserve_none`` 或 "
"``musttail`` 不受支持时生成明确的编译错误。"

#: ../NEWS:1930
msgid ":gh:`140189`: iOS builds were added to CI."
msgstr ":gh:`140189`: iOS 构建被添加到 CI。"

#: ../NEWS:1932
msgid ""
":gh:`138489`: When cross-compiling for WASI by ``build_wasm`` or "
"``build_emscripten``, the ``build-details.json`` step is now included in the"
" build process, just like with native builds."
msgstr ""
":gh:`138489`: 当通过 ``build_wasm`` 或 ``build_emscripten`` 为 WASI "
"执行交叉编译时，``build-details.json`` 步骤现在将被包括在构建过程中，就像原生构建一样。"

#: ../NEWS:1936
msgid ""
"This fixes the ``libinstall`` task which requires the ``build-details.json``"
" file during the process."
msgstr "这将修正 ``libinstall`` 任务在进程执行期间需要 ``build-details.json`` 文件的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1939
msgid ""
":gh:`137618`: ``PYTHON_FOR_REGEN`` now requires Python 3.10 to Python 3.15. "
"Patch by Adam Turner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`137618`: ``PYTHON_FOR_REGEN`` 现在需要 Python 3.10 至 Python 3.15。 由 Adam "
"Turner 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1942
msgid ""
":gh:`123681`: Check the ``strftime()`` behavior at runtime instead of at the"
" compile time to support cross-compiling. Remove the internal macro "
"``_Py_NORMALIZE_CENTURY``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123681`: 在运行时而不是编译时检查 ``strftime()`` 的行为以支持交叉编译。 移除内部宏 "
"``_Py_NORMALIZE_CENTURY``。"

#: ../NEWS:1948
msgid "Python 3.14.0 final"
msgstr "Python 3.14.0 正式版"

#: ../NEWS:1950
msgid "*Release date: 2025-10-07*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2025-10-07*"

#: ../NEWS:1955
msgid ":gh:`124111`: Update macOS installer to use Tcl/Tk 8.6.17."
msgstr ":gh:`124111`: 更新 macOS 安装程序以使用 Tcl/Tk 8.6.17。"

#: ../NEWS:1957 ../NEWS:1962
msgid ":gh:`139573`: Updated bundled version of OpenSSL to 3.0.18."
msgstr ":gh:`139573`: 将捆绑的 OpenSSL 版本升级至 3.0.18。"

#: ../NEWS:1967
msgid ""
":gh:`139330`: SBOM generation tool didn't cross-check the version and "
"checksum values against the ``Modules/expat/refresh.sh`` script, leading to "
"the values becoming out-of-date during routine updates."
msgstr ""
":gh:`139330`: SBOM 生成工具不会针对 ``Modules/expat/refresh.sh`` "
"脚本交叉检查版本和校验和值，导致这些值在例程更新期间变得过时。"

#: ../NEWS:1971
msgid ""
":gh:`132006`: XCframeworks now include privacy manifests to satisfy Apple "
"App Store submission requirements."
msgstr ":gh:`132006`: XCframeworks 现在包括隐私声明以满足 Apple App Store 的提交要求。"

#: ../NEWS:1974
msgid ""
":gh:`138171`: A script for building an iOS XCframework was added. As part of"
" this change, the top level ``iOS`` folder has been moved to be a "
"subdirectory of the ``Apple`` folder."
msgstr ""
":gh:`138171`: 增加一个用于构建 iOS XCframework 的脚本。 作为此项改变的一部分，最高层级的 ``iOS`` 文件夹被移动为"
" ``Apple`` 文件夹的子目录。"

#: ../NEWS:1981
msgid ""
":gh:`139400`: :mod:`xml.parsers.expat`: Make sure that parent Expat parsers "
"are only garbage-collected once they are no longer referenced by subparsers "
"created by :meth:`~xml.parsers.expat.xmlparser.ExternalEntityParserCreate`. "
"Patch by Sebastian Pipping."
msgstr ""
":gh:`139400`: :mod:`xml.parsers.expat`: 确保父级 Expat 解析器当其不再被 "
":meth:`~xml.parsers.expat.xmlparser.ExternalEntityParserCreate` "
"所创建的子解析器所引用时只会被作为垃圾回收一次。 由 Sebastian Pipping 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1990
msgid ":gh:`139312`: Upgrade bundled libexpat to 2.7.3"
msgstr ":gh:`139312`: 将捆绑的 libexpat 升级至 2.7.3"

#: ../NEWS:1994
msgid "Python 3.14.0 release candidate 3"
msgstr "Python 3.14.0 release candidate 3"

#: ../NEWS:1996
msgid "*Release date: 2025-09-18*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2025-09-18*"

#: ../NEWS:2001
msgid ""
":gh:`138896`: Fix error installing C runtime on non-updated Windows machines"
msgstr ":gh:`138896`: 修复在未更新的 Windows 机器上安装 C 运行时导致的错误"

#: ../NEWS:2006
msgid ""
":gh:`137873`: The iOS test runner has been simplified, resolving some issues"
" that have been observed using the runner in GitHub Actions and Azure "
"Pipelines test environments."
msgstr ""
":gh:`137873`: iOS 测试运行器已简化，解决了在 GitHub Actions 和 Azure Pipelines "
"测试环境中使用该运行器时观察到的一些问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2013
msgid ""
":gh:`135661`: Fix CDATA section parsing in :class:`html.parser.HTMLParser` "
"according to the HTML5 standard: ``] ]>`` and ``]] >`` no longer end the "
"CDATA section. Add private method ``_set_support_cdata()`` which can be used"
" to specify how to parse ``<[CDATA[`` --- as a CDATA section in foreign "
"content (SVG or MathML) or as a bogus comment in the HTML namespace."
msgstr ""
":gh:`135661`：根据 HTML5 标准修复了 :class:`html.parser.HTMLParser` 中的 CDATA "
"段解析问题：``] ]>`` 和 ``]] >`` 不再终止 CDATA 段。新增私有方法 "
"``_set_support_cdata()``，可用于指定如何解析 ``<[CDATA[`` —— 在外部内容（SVG 或 MathML）中作为 "
"CDATA 段解析，或在 HTML 命名空间中作为伪注释解析。"

#: ../NEWS:2023
msgid ":gh:`138998`: Update bundled libexpat to 2.7.2"
msgstr ":gh:`138998`: 将捆绑的 libexpat 更新至 2.7.2"

#: ../NEWS:2025
msgid ""
":gh:`118803`: Add back :class:`collections.abc.ByteString` and "
":class:`typing.ByteString`. Both had been removed in prior alpha, beta and "
"release candidates for Python 3.14, but their removal has now been postponed"
" to Python 3.17."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118803`：重新添加 :class:`collections.abc.ByteString` 和 "
":class:`typing.ByteString`。这两个类在 Python 3.14 的 alpha、beta "
"和候选版本中已被移除，但现在它们的移除计划已推迟至 Python 3.17。"

#: ../NEWS:2030
msgid ""
":gh:`137226`: Fix :func:`typing.get_type_hints` calls on generic "
":class:`typing.TypedDict` classes defined with string annotations."
msgstr ""
":gh:`137226`：修复了在带有字符串注解的泛型 :class:`typing.TypedDict` 类上调用 "
":func:`typing.get_type_hints` 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2033
msgid ""
":gh:`138804`: Raise :exc:`TypeError` instead of :exc:`AttributeError` when "
"an argument of incorrect type is passed to :func:`shlex.quote`. This "
"restores the behavior of the function prior to 3.14."
msgstr ""
":gh:`138804`：当向 :func:`shlex.quote` 传递类型错误的参数时，将引发 :exc:`TypeError` 而非 "
":exc:`AttributeError`。此变更恢复了该函数在 3.14 版本之前的行为。"

#: ../NEWS:2037
msgid ""
":gh:`128636`: Fix crash in PyREPL when os.environ is overwritten with an "
"invalid value for mac"
msgstr ":gh:`128636`：修复了macOS 平台在 PyREPL 中当 `os.environ` 被覆盖为无效值时导致的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2040
msgid ""
":gh:`138514`: Raise :exc:`ValueError` when a multi-character string is "
"passed to the *echo_char* parameter of :func:`getpass.getpass`. Patch by "
"Benjamin Johnson."
msgstr ""
":gh:`138514`: 当将多字符字符串传给 :func:`getpass.getpass` 的 *echo_char* 形参时将引发 "
":exc:`ValueError`。 由 Benjamin Johnson 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2044
msgid ":gh:`138515`: :mod:`email` is added to Emscripten build."
msgstr ":gh:`138515`: 向 Emscripten 构建版添加了 :mod:`email`。"

#: ../NEWS:2046
msgid ""
":gh:`99948`: :func:`ctypes.util.find_library` now works in Emscripten build."
msgstr ":gh:`99948`: :func:`ctypes.util.find_library` 现在可用于 Emscripten 构建版。"

#: ../NEWS:2048
msgid ""
":gh:`138253`: Add the *block* parameter in the :meth:`!put` and :meth:`!get`"
" methods of the :mod:`concurrent.interpreters` queues for compatibility with"
" the :class:`queue.Queue` interface."
msgstr ""
":gh:`138253`：在 :mod:`concurrent.interpreters` 队列的 :meth:`!put` 和 "
":meth:`!get` 方法中添加了 *block* 形参，以实现与 :class:`queue.Queue` 接口的兼容性。"

#: ../NEWS:2052
msgid ""
":gh:`138133`: Prevent infinite traceback loop when sending CTRL^C to Python "
"through ``strace``."
msgstr ":gh:`138133`：修复了通过 ``strace`` 向 Python 发送 CTRL^C 时可能导致无限回溯循环的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2055
msgid ""
":gh:`134869`: Fix an issue where pressing Ctrl+C during tab completion in "
"the REPL would leave the autocompletion menu in a corrupted state."
msgstr ":gh:`134869`: 修复了一个问题，即在 REPL 中进行选项卡补全时按下 Ctrl+C 会导致自动补全菜单处于损坏状态。"

#: ../NEWS:2058
msgid ""
":gh:`90548`: Fix ``musl`` detection for :func:`platform.libc_ver` on Alpine "
"Linux if compiled with --strip-all."
msgstr ""
":gh:`90548`: 在 Alpine Linux  上修复当使用 --strip-all 编译时对 "
":func:`platform.libc_ver` 的 ``musl`` 检测问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2061
msgid ""
":gh:`136134`: :meth:`!SMTP.auth_cram_md5` now raises an "
":exc:`~smtplib.SMTPException` instead of a :exc:`ValueError` if Python has "
"been built without MD5 support. In particular, :class:`~smtplib.SMTP` "
"clients will not attempt to use this method even if the remote server is "
"assumed to support it. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`136134`: 现在如果 Python 构建版不带 MD5 支持 :meth:`!SMTP.auth_cram_md5` 则会引发 "
":exc:`~smtplib.SMTPException` 而不是 :exc:`ValueError`。 特别地，即使远端服务器提供支持 "
":class:`~smtplib.SMTP` 客户端将不会尝试使用此方法。 由 Bénédikt Tran 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2067
msgid ""
":gh:`136134`: :meth:`IMAP4.login_cram_md5 <imaplib.IMAP4.login_cram_md5>` "
"now raises an :exc:`IMAP4.error <imaplib.IMAP4.error>` if CRAM-MD5 "
"authentication is not supported. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`136134`: 如果 CRAM-MD5 验证不受支持则 :meth:`IMAP4.login_cram_md5 "
"<imaplib.IMAP4.login_cram_md5>` 现在会引发 :exc:`IMAP4.error "
"<imaplib.IMAP4.error>`。 由 Bénédikt Tran 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2071
msgid ""
":gh:`134953`: Expand ``_colorize`` theme with ``keyword_constant`` and "
"implement in :term:`repl`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`134953`：扩展 ``_colorize`` 主题，增加 ``keyword_constant`` 配置，并在 "
":term:`repl`（交互式解释器）中实现该功能。 "

#: ../NEWS:2077
msgid ""
":gh:`71810`: Raise :exc:`OverflowError` for ``(-1).to_bytes()`` for signed "
"conversions when bytes count is zero.  Patch by Sergey B Kirpichev."
msgstr ""
":gh:`71810`：修复了在字节数为零的有符号转换中，``(-1).to_bytes()`` 未抛出 :exc:`OverflowError` "
"的问题。由 Sergey B Kirpichev 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2080
msgid ""
":gh:`138192`: Fix :mod:`contextvars` initialization so that all "
"subinterpreters are assigned the :attr:`~contextvars.Token.MISSING` value."
msgstr ""
":gh:`138192`: 修复了 :mod:`contextvars` 初始化问题以使所有子解释器都已分配 "
":attr:`~contextvars.Token.MISSING` 值。"

#: ../NEWS:2083
msgid ""
":gh:`138479`: Fix a crash when a generic object's ``__typing_subst__`` "
"returns an object that isn't a :class:`tuple`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`138479`：修复了当泛型对象的 ``__typing_subst__`` 返回非 :class:`tuple` 类型对象时出现的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2086
msgid ""
":gh:`138372`: Fix :exc:`SyntaxWarning` emitted for erroneous subscript "
"expressions involving :ref:`template string literals <t-strings>`. Patch by "
"Brian Schubert."
msgstr ""
":gh:`138372`: 修复了针对涉及 :ref:`模板字符串字面值 <t-strings>` 的错误下标表达式发出 "
":exc:`SyntaxWarning` 的问题。 由 Brian Schubert 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2090
msgid ""
":gh:`138318`: The default REPL now avoids highlighting built-in names (for "
"instance :class:`set` or :func:`format`) when they are used as attribute "
"names (for instance in ``value.set`` or ``text.format``)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`138318`: 默认 REPL 现在会在内置名称 (例如 :class:`set` 或 :func:`format`) 被用作属性名称 "
"(例如 ``value.set`` 或 ``text.format``) 时避免高亮它们。"

#: ../NEWS:2094
msgid ""
":gh:`138349`: Fix crash in certain cases where a module contains both a "
"module-level annotation and a comprehension."
msgstr ":gh:`138349`：修复了模块同时包含模块级注解和推导式时可能发生的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2097
msgid ""
":gh:`137384`: Fix a crash when using the :mod:`warnings` module in a "
"finalizer at shutdown. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`137384`：修复了在程序关闭时，在终结器（finalizer）中使用 :mod:`warnings` 模块导致的崩溃问题。由 Kumar "
"Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2100
msgid ""
":gh:`137883`: Fix runaway recursion when calling a function with keyword "
"arguments."
msgstr ":gh:`137883`：修复了在调用带有关键字参数的函数时出现的无限递归问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2103
msgid ""
":gh:`137079`: Fix keyword typo recognition when parsing files. Patch by "
"Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":gh:`137079`: 修复了在解析文件时的关键字拼写错误识别问题。 由 Pablo Galindo 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2106
msgid ""
":gh:`137728`: Fix the JIT's handling of many local variables. This "
"previously caused a segfault."
msgstr ":gh:`137728`：修复了即时编译器（JIT）处理大量局部变量时的问题。此前这种情况会导致段错误（segfault）。"

#: ../NEWS:2109
msgid ""
":gh:`137576`: Fix for incorrect source code being shown in tracebacks from "
"the Basic REPL when :envvar:`PYTHONSTARTUP` is given. Patch by Adam Hartz."
msgstr ""
":gh:`137576`: 修复的当给出 :envvar:`PYTHONSTARTUP` 时在来自 Basic REPL "
"的回溯中显示不正确的源代码问题。 由 Adam Hartz 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2114
msgid "Python 3.14.0 release candidate 2"
msgstr "Python 3.14.0 release candidate 2"

#: ../NEWS:2116
msgid "*Release date: 2025-08-14*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2025-08-14*"

#: ../NEWS:2121
msgid ""
":gh:`137450`: macOS installer shell path management improvements: separate "
"the installer ``Shell profile updater`` postinstall script from the ``Update"
" Shell Profile.command`` to enable more robust error handling."
msgstr ""
":gh:`137450`: macOS 安装程序 shell 路径管理的改进：拆分安装程序的 ``Shell profile updater`` "
"安装后脚本与 ``Update Shell Profile.command`` 以启用更健壮的错误处理。"

#: ../NEWS:2125
msgid ""
":gh:`137134`: Update macOS installer to ship with SQLite version 3.50.4."
msgstr ":gh:`137134`: 更新 macOS 安装程序以附带 SQLite 3.50.4 版。"

#: ../NEWS:2130
msgid ":gh:`137134`: Update Windows installer to ship with SQLite 3.50.4."
msgstr ":gh:`137134`: 更新 Windows 安装程序以附带 SQLite 3.50.4。"

#: ../NEWS:2135
msgid ""
":gh:`137426`: Remove the code deprecation of "
"``importlib.abc.ResourceLoader``. It is documented as deprecated, but left "
"for backwards compatibility with other classes in ``importlib.abc``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`137426`: 移除了 ``importlib.abc.ResourceLoader`` 的代码弃用。 它在文档中已被宣布弃用，但与 "
"``importlib.abc`` 中的其他类一起被保留用于向下兼容。"

#: ../NEWS:2139
msgid ""
":gh:`137282`: Fix tab completion and :func:`dir` on "
":mod:`concurrent.futures`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`137282`: 修复在 :mod:`concurrent.futures` 上的 tab 补全和 :func:`dir` 操作的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2142
msgid ""
":gh:`137257`: Bump the version of pip bundled in ensurepip to version 25.2"
msgstr ":gh:`137257`: 将 ensurepip 中捆绑的 pip 版本提升至 25.2"

#: ../NEWS:2144
msgid ""
":gh:`137226`: Fix behavior of :meth:`annotationlib.ForwardRef.evaluate` when"
" the *type_params* parameter is passed and the name of a type param is also "
"present in an enclosing scope."
msgstr ""
":gh:`137226`：修复了当传入 *type_params* "
"形参且类型参数名称同时存在于外围作用域时，:meth:`annotationlib.ForwardRef.evaluate` 方法的行为问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2148
msgid ""
":gh:`130522`: Fix unraisable :exc:`TypeError` raised during "
":term:`interpreter shutdown` in the :mod:`threading` module."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130522`: 在 :mod:`threading` 模块中修复 :term:`interpreter shutdown` 期间不可引发的 "
":exc:`TypeError` 问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2151
msgid ""
":gh:`137059`: Fix handling of file URLs with a Windows drive letter in the "
"URL authority by :func:`urllib.request.url2pathname`. This fixes a "
"regression in earlier pre-releases of Python 3.14."
msgstr ""
":gh:`137059`: 修正 :func:`urllib.request.url2pathname` 对 URL 权限中带有 Windows "
"驱动器号的文件 URL 的处理。 这修正了发较早的 Python 3.14 预发布版中的一个回归问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2155
msgid ""
":gh:`130577`: :mod:`tarfile` now validates archives to ensure member offsets"
" are non-negative.  (Contributed by Alexander Enrique Urieles Nieto in "
":gh:`130577`.)"
msgstr ""
":gh:`130577`: :mod:`tarfile` 现在可验证归档以确保成员偏移量为非负值。 （由 Alexander Enrique "
"Urieles Nieto 在 :gh:`130577` 中贡献。）"

#: ../NEWS:2159
msgid ""
":gh:`135228`: When :mod:`dataclasses` replaces a class with a slotted "
"dataclass, the original class can now be garbage collected again. Earlier "
"changes in Python 3.14 caused this class to always remain in existence "
"together with the replacement class synthesized by :mod:`dataclasses`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`135228`：当 :mod:`dataclasses` 模块用带槽（slotted）的数据类替换原类时，原类现在可以被垃圾回收了。 "
"Python 3.14 中此前的改动会导致该原类始终与 :mod:`dataclasses` 合成的替换类一起存在。"

#: ../NEWS:2167
msgid ""
":gh:`136155`: We are now checking for fatal errors in EPUB builds in CI."
msgstr ":gh:`136155`：我们现已在持续集成（CI）流程中增加了对EPUB构建过程中致命错误的检查。"

#: ../NEWS:2179
msgid ""
":gh:`137314`: Fixed a regression where raw f-strings incorrectly interpreted"
" escape sequences in format specifications. Raw f-strings now properly "
"preserve literal backslashes in format specs, matching the behavior from "
"Python 3.11. For example, ``rf\"{obj:\\xFF}\"`` now correctly produces "
"``'\\\\xFF'`` instead of ``'ÿ'``. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":gh:`137314`: 修复了原始 f-字符串不正确地解读格式说明符中的转义序列的回归问题。 原始 "
"f-字符串现在会正确地保留格式说明符中的反斜杠字面值，以与自 Python 3.11 以来的行为相匹配。 "
"例如，``rf\"{obj:\\xFF}\"`` 现在会正确地产生 ``'\\\\xFF'`` 而不是 ``'ÿ'``。 由 Pablo Galindo"
" 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2185
msgid ""
":gh:`137308`: A standalone docstring in a node body is optimized as a "
":keyword:`pass` statement to ensure that the node's body is never empty. "
"There was a :exc:`ValueError` in :func:`compile` otherwise."
msgstr ""
":gh:`137308`：节点体中的独立文档字符串会被优化为 :keyword:`pass` 语句，以确保节点体永远不会为空。否则，在调用 "
":func:`compile` 函数时会产生 :exc:`ValueError` 异常。"

#: ../NEWS:2189
msgid ""
":gh:`137288`: Fix bug where some bytecode instructions of a boolean "
"expression are not associated with the correct exception handler."
msgstr ""
":gh:`137288`：修复了一个布尔表达式字节码指令与正确异常处理器关联异常的漏洞。该问题导致部分布尔表达式的字节码指令未能正确关联到对应的异常处理逻辑。"

#: ../NEWS:2192
msgid ""
":gh:`134291`: Remove some newer macOS API usage from the JIT compiler in "
"order to restore compatibility with older OSX 10.15 deployment targets."
msgstr ""
":gh:`134291`：从即时编译器(JIT)中移除了部分较新的macOS API使用，以恢复对旧版macOS 10.15部署目标的支持兼容性。"

#: ../NEWS:2195
msgid ""
":gh:`131338`: Disable computed stack limit checks on non-glibc linux "
"platforms to fix crashes on deep recursion."
msgstr ":gh:`131338`：在非 glibc 的 Linux 平台上禁用计算栈限制检查，以修复深度递归导致的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2198
msgid ""
":gh:`136870`: Fix data races while de-instrumenting bytecode of code objects"
" running concurrently in threads."
msgstr ":gh:`136870`: 修正了在线程并发运行的代码对象的字节码进行去工具化时的数据竞争问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2204
msgid ""
":gh:`137573`: Mark ``_PyOptimizer_Optimize`` as :c:macro:`Py_NO_INLINE` to "
"prevent stack overflow crashes on macOS."
msgstr ""
":gh:`137573`: 将 ``_PyOptimizer_Optimize`` 标记为 :c:macro:`Py_NO_INLINE` 以防止在to"
" prevent stack overflow crashes on macOS 上发生栈溢出崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:2210
msgid ":gh:`132339`: Add support for OpenSSL 3.5."
msgstr ":gh:`132339`: 添加对 OpenSSL 3.5 的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:2214
msgid "Python 3.14.0 release candidate 1"
msgstr "Python 3.14.0 rc1"

#: ../NEWS:2216
msgid "*Release date: 2025-07-22*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2025-07-22*"

#: ../NEWS:2221
msgid ""
":gh:`136251`: Fixes and usability improvements for "
"``Tools/wasm/emscripten/web_example``"
msgstr ":gh:`136251`：针对 ``Tools/wasm/emscripten/web_example`` 的修复与可用性改进"

#: ../NEWS:2227
msgid ""
":gh:`135661`: Fix parsing attributes with whitespaces around the ``=`` "
"separator in :class:`html.parser.HTMLParser` according to the HTML5 "
"standard."
msgstr ""
":gh:`135661`：根据 HTML5 标准，修复 :class:`html.parser.HTMLParser` 中解析 ``=`` "
"分隔符周围带有空白符的属性时出现的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2231
msgid ""
":gh:`118350`: Fix support of escapable raw text mode (elements \"textarea\" "
"and \"title\") in :class:`html.parser.HTMLParser`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118350`：修复 :class:`html.parser.HTMLParser` 对可转义原始文本模式（\"textarea\" 和 "
"\"title\" 元素）的支持问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2237
msgid ""
":gh:`136170`: Removed the unreleased ``zipfile.ZipFile.data_offset`` "
"property added in 3.14.0a7 as it wasn't fully clear which behavior it should"
" have in some situations so the result was not always what a user might "
"expect."
msgstr ""
":gh:`136170`：移除了 3.14.0a7 版本中新增但未正式发布的 ``zipfile.ZipFile.data_offset`` "
"属性，因为该属性在某些情况下的行为不够明确，导致结果可能与用户预期不符。"

#: ../NEWS:2241
msgid ":gh:`124621`: pyrepl now works in Emscripten."
msgstr ":gh:`124621`：pyrepl 现已支持在 Emscripten 环境中运行。"

#: ../NEWS:2243
msgid ""
":gh:`136874`: Discard URL query and fragment in "
":func:`urllib.request.url2pathname`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`136874`：在 :func:`urllib.request.url2pathname` 函数中丢弃 URL 的查询参数和片段标识符。"

#: ../NEWS:2246
msgid ":gh:`130645`: Enable color help by default in :mod:`argparse`."
msgstr ":gh:`130645`：在 :mod:`argparse` 模块中默认启用彩色帮助信息。"

#: ../NEWS:2248
msgid ":gh:`136549`: Fix signature of :func:`threading.excepthook`."
msgstr ":gh:`136549`：修复了 :func:`threading.excepthook` 的签名。"

#: ../NEWS:2250
msgid ""
":gh:`136523`: Fix :class:`wave.Wave_write` emitting an unraisable when open "
"raises."
msgstr ""
":gh:`136523`：修复当 :class:`wave.Wave_write` 打开文件失败抛出异常时，该类会生成无法捕获的异常的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2253
msgid ""
":gh:`52876`: Add missing ``keepends`` (default ``True``) parameter to "
":meth:`!codecs.StreamReaderWriter.readline` and "
":meth:`!codecs.StreamReaderWriter.readlines`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`52876`: 为 :meth:`!codecs.StreamReaderWriter.readline` 和 "
":meth:`!codecs.StreamReaderWriter.readlines` 方法添加缺失的 ``keepends`` 形参（默认值 "
"``True``）。"

#: ../NEWS:2257
msgid ""
":gh:`136470`: Correct :class:`concurrent.futures.InterpreterPoolExecutor`'s "
"default thread name."
msgstr ""
":gh:`136470`：修正 :class:`concurrent.futures.InterpreterPoolExecutor` 的默认线程名称。"

#: ../NEWS:2260
msgid ""
":gh:`136476`: Fix a bug that was causing the ``get_async_stack_trace`` "
"function to miss some frames in the stack trace."
msgstr ":gh:`136476`: 修复了一个导致 ``get_async_stack_trace`` 函数无法捕获栈回溯中部分帧的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:2263
msgid ""
":gh:`136434`: Fix docs generation of ``UnboundItem`` in "
":mod:`concurrent.interpreters` when running with :option:`-OO`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`136434`: 修复了在启用 :option:`-OO` 优化选项时，:mod:`concurrent.interpreters` 模块中 "
"``UnboundItem`` 文档的生成问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2266
msgid ""
":gh:`136380`: Raises :exc:`AttributeError` when accessing "
":class:`concurrent.futures.InterpreterPoolExecutor` and subinterpreters are "
"not available."
msgstr ""
":gh:`136380`: 当访问 :class:`concurrent.futures.InterpreterPoolExecutor` "
"且子解释器不可用时，会引发 :exc:`AttributeError` 异常。"

#: ../NEWS:2270
msgid ""
":gh:`134759`: Fix :exc:`UnboundLocalError` in "
":func:`email.message.Message.get_payload` when the payload to decode is a "
":class:`bytes` object. Patch by Kliment Lamonov."
msgstr ""
":gh:`134759`：修复 :func:`email.message.Message.get_payload` 函数在解码 "
":class:`bytes` 类型负载时引发的 :exc:`UnboundLocalError` 异常。由 Kliment Lamonov 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2274
msgid ""
":gh:`134657`: :mod:`asyncio`: Remove some private names from "
"``asyncio.__all__``."
msgstr ":gh:`134657`: :mod:`asyncio` 模块：从 ``asyncio.__all__`` 中移除了部分私有名称。"

#: ../NEWS:2280
msgid ""
":gh:`136801`: Fix PyREPL syntax highlighting on match cases after multi-line"
" case. Contributed by Olga Matoula."
msgstr ""
":gh:`136801`：修复 PyREPL 在多行 case 语句后对 match case 进行语法高亮显示的问题。由 Olga Matoula "
"贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:2286
msgid ""
":gh:`136421`: Fix crash when initializing :mod:`datetime` concurrently."
msgstr ":gh:`136421`：修复在并发初始化 :mod:`datetime` 时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2291
msgid ""
":gh:`136541`: Fix some issues with the perf trampolines on x86-64 and "
"aarch64.  The trampolines were not being generated correctly for some cases,"
" which could lead to the perf integration not working correctly. Patch by "
"Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":gh:`136541`: 修复了x86-64和aarch64架构下性能跳转(perf "
"trampolines)的相关问题。这些跳转代码在某些情况下未能正确生成，可能导致性能分析集成(perf "
"integration)无法正常工作。由Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2296
msgid ""
":gh:`136517`: Fixed a typo that prevented printing of uncollectable objects "
"when the :const:`gc.DEBUG_UNCOLLECTABLE` mode was set."
msgstr ""
":gh:`136517`: 修复了一个拼写错误，该错误会导致在设置 :const:`gc.DEBUG_UNCOLLECTABLE` "
"模式时无法打印不可回收对象。"

#: ../NEWS:2299
msgid ""
":gh:`136525`: Fix issue where per-thread bytecode was not instrumented for "
"newly created threads."
msgstr ":gh:`136525`：修复新创建线程的每线程字节码未被插桩的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2302
msgid ""
":gh:`132661`: ``Interpolation.expression`` now has a default, the empty "
"string."
msgstr ":gh:`132661`: ``Interpolation.expression`` 属性现在有了默认值——空字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:2305
msgid ":gh:`132661`: Reflect recent :pep:`750` change."
msgstr ":gh:`132661`：反映最近的 :pep:`750` 变更。"

#: ../NEWS:2307
msgid ""
"Disallow concatenation of ``string.templatelib.Template`` and :class:`str`. "
"Also, disallow implicit concatenation of t-string literals with string or "
"f-string literals."
msgstr ""
"禁止将 ``string.templatelib.Template`` 对象与 :class:`str` 类型字符串进行拼接，同时禁止 t-字符串 "
"字面量与字符串或 f-字符串 字面量进行隐式拼接。"

#: ../NEWS:2314
msgid ""
":gh:`116738`: Make functions in :mod:`grp` thread-safe on the :term:`free "
"threaded <free threading>` build."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116738`: 使 :mod:`grp` 中的函数在 :term:`自由线程 <free threading>` 构建上线程安全。"

#: ../NEWS:2320
msgid ""
":gh:`135148`: Fixed a bug where f-string debug expressions (using =) would "
"incorrectly strip out parts of strings containing escaped quotes and # "
"characters. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":gh:`135148`：修复了一个 bug，该 bug 会导致 f-字符串 调试表达式（使用 “=” 语法）错误地去除包含转义引号和 # "
"字符的字符串部分。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2324
msgid ""
":gh:`133136`: Limit excess memory usage in the :term:`free threading` build "
"when a large dictionary or list is resized and accessed by multiple threads."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133136`: 限制 :term:`free threading` 构建版本在多线程同时访问和调整大型字典或列表大小时的内存超额使用。"

#: ../NEWS:2328
msgid ""
":gh:`91153`: Fix a crash when a :class:`bytearray` is concurrently mutated "
"during item assignment."
msgstr ":gh:`91153`：修复在并发修改 :class:`bytearray` 对象时，因项赋值操作导致程序崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2331
msgid ""
":gh:`127971`: Fix off-by-one read beyond the end of a string in string "
"search."
msgstr ":gh:`127971`：修复字符串搜索时越界读取字符串末尾外一个字符的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2337
msgid ""
":gh:`112068`: Revert support of nullable arguments in :c:func:`PyArg_Parse`."
msgstr ":gh:`112068`：撤销对 :c:func:`PyArg_Parse` 函数中可空参数的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:2339
msgid ""
":gh:`133296`: New variants for the critical section API that accept one or "
"two :c:type:`PyMutex` pointers rather than :c:type:`PyObject` instances are "
"now public in the non-limited C API."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133296`：非受限 C API 现已公开临界区 API 的新变体，这些新变体接受一个或两个 :c:type:`PyMutex` 指针，而非"
" :c:type:`PyObject` 实例。"

#: ../NEWS:2343
msgid ""
":gh:`134009`: Expose :c:func:`PyMutex_IsLocked` as part of the public C API."
msgstr ":gh:`134009`：将 :c:func:`PyMutex_IsLocked` 函数作为公共 C API 的一部分对外公开。"

#: ../NEWS:2348
msgid ""
":gh:`135621`: PyREPL no longer depends on the :mod:`curses` standard "
"library. Contributed by Łukasz Langa."
msgstr ""
":gh:`135621`：PyREPL 不再依赖 Python 标准库中的 :mod:`curses` 模块。由 Łukasz Langa 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:2353
msgid "Python 3.14.0 beta 4"
msgstr "Python 3.14.0 beta 4"

#: ../NEWS:2355
msgid "*Release date: 2025-07-08*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2025-07-08*"

#: ../NEWS:2360
msgid ""
":gh:`135968`: Stubs for ``strip`` are now provided as part of an iOS "
"install."
msgstr ":gh:`135968`: 现在，``strip`` 工具的存根文件已作为 iOS 安装包的一部分提供。"

#: ../NEWS:2362
msgid ":gh:`133600`: Backport file reorganization for Tools/wasm/wasi."
msgstr ":gh:`133600`: 将 Tools/wasm/wasi 目录的文件重组变更向下移植到旧版本。"

#: ../NEWS:2364
msgid ""
"This should make backporting future code changes easier. It also simplifies "
"instructions around how to do WASI builds in the devguide."
msgstr "此举将使未来代码变更的向下移植工作更为简便，同时简化了开发指南中关于如何构建WASI的说明文档。"

#: ../NEWS:2370
msgid ""
":gh:`135966`: The iOS testbed now handles the ``app_packages`` folder as a "
"site directory."
msgstr ":gh:`135966`: iOS测试平台现在将 ``app_packages`` 文件夹作为站点目录处理。"

#: ../NEWS:2373
msgid ""
":gh:`135494`: Fix regrtest to support excluding tests from ``--pgo`` tests. "
"Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ":gh:`135494`: 修复regrtest以支持从 ``--pgo`` 测试中排除测试。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2379
msgid ""
":gh:`136053`: :mod:`marshal`: fix a possible crash when deserializing "
":class:`slice` objects."
msgstr ":gh:`136053`: :mod:`marshal`: 修复在反序列化 :class:`slice` 对象时可能出现的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:2382
msgid ""
":gh:`135661`: Fix parsing start and end tags in "
":class:`html.parser.HTMLParser` according to the HTML5 standard."
msgstr ""
":gh:`135661`: 根据HTML5标准修复 :class:`html.parser.HTMLParser` 中开始和结束标签的解析。"

#: ../NEWS:2385
msgid ""
"Whitespaces no longer accepted between ``</`` and the tag name. E.g. ``</ "
"script>`` does not end the script section."
msgstr "不再接受在 ``</`` 和标签名之间的空格。例如，``</ script>`` 不会结束脚本部分。"

#: ../NEWS:2388
msgid ""
"Vertical tabulation (``\\v``) and non-ASCII whitespaces no longer recognized"
" as whitespaces. The only whitespaces are ``\\t\\n\\r\\f`` and space."
msgstr "垂直制表符(``\\v``)和非ASCII空格不再被识别为空白符。空白符只有 ``\\t\\n\\r\\f`` 和空格。"

#: ../NEWS:2391
msgid "Null character (U+0000) no longer ends the tag name."
msgstr "空字符(U+0000)不再结束标签名。"

#: ../NEWS:2393
msgid ""
"Attributes and slashes after the tag name in end tags are now ignored, "
"instead of terminating after the first ``>`` in quoted attribute value. E.g."
" ``</script/foo=\">\"/>``."
msgstr ""
"现在会忽略结束标签中标签名后的属性和斜杠，而不再在带引号的属性值中的第一个 ``>`` "
"处终止解析。例如：``</script/foo=\">\"/>``。"

#: ../NEWS:2397
msgid ""
"Multiple slashes and whitespaces between the last attribute and closing "
"``>`` are now ignored in both start and end tags. E.g. ``<a foo=bar/ //>``."
msgstr "现在在开始和结束标签中忽略最后一个属性和闭合 ``>`` 之间的多个斜杠和空白符。例如，``<a foo=bar/ //>``。"

#: ../NEWS:2400
msgid ""
"Multiple ``=`` between attribute name and value are no longer collapsed. "
"E.g. ``<a foo==bar>`` produces attribute \"foo\" with value \"=bar\"."
msgstr ""
"属性名与属性值之间多个连续的 ``=`` 符号将不再被合并处理。例如：``<a foo==bar>`` 会生成属性名为 \"foo\"、属性值为 "
"\"=bar\" 的标签。"

#: ../NEWS:2403
msgid ""
"[Reverted in :gh:`136927`] Whitespaces between the ``=`` separator and "
"attribute name or value are no longer ignored. E.g. ``<a foo =bar>`` "
"produces two attributes \"foo\" and \"=bar\", both with value None; ``<a "
"foo= bar>`` produces two attributes: \"foo\" with value \"\" and \"bar\" "
"with value None."
msgstr ""
"[在 :gh:`136927` 中已回退] ``=`` 分隔符与属性名或属性值之间的空白符将不再被忽略。例如，``<a foo =bar>`` "
"会生成两个属性：\"foo\" 和 \"=bar\"，它们的值均为 None；而 ``<a foo= bar>`` 会生成两个属性：\"foo\" "
"的值为空字符串，\"bar\" 的值为 None。"

#: ../NEWS:2408
msgid ""
":gh:`102555`: Fix comment parsing in :class:`html.parser.HTMLParser` "
"according to the HTML5 standard. ``--!>`` now ends the comment. ``-- >`` no "
"longer ends the comment. Support abnormally ended empty comments ``<-->`` "
"and ``<--->``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`102555`: 根据HTML5标准修复 :class:`html.parser.HTMLParser` 中的注释解析。``--!>`` "
"现在结束注释。``-- >`` 不再结束注释。支持异常结束的空注释 ``<-->`` 和 ``<--->``。"

#: ../NEWS:2416
msgid ""
":gh:`136286`: Fix pickling failures for protocols 0 and 1 for many objects "
"realted to subinterpreters."
msgstr ":gh:`136286`: 修复了协议0和协议1在序列化（pickling）与子解释器相关的众多对象时出现的失败问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2419
msgid ""
":gh:`136316`: Improve support for evaluating nested forward references in "
":func:`typing.evaluate_forward_ref`."
msgstr ":gh:`136316`: 改进了 :func:`typing.evaluate_forward_ref` 函数对嵌套前向引用的求值支持。"

#: ../NEWS:2422
msgid ""
":gh:`85702`: If ``zoneinfo._common.load_tzdata`` is given a package without "
"a resource a :exc:`zoneinfo.ZoneInfoNotFoundError` is raised rather than a "
":exc:`PermissionError`. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`85702`: 如果 ``zoneinfo._common.load_tzdata`` 被给予一个没有资源的包，则会引发 "
":exc:`zoneinfo.ZoneInfoNotFoundError` 而不是 :exc:`PermissionError`。由Victor "
"Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2426
msgid ""
":gh:`136028`: Fix parsing month names containing \"İ\" (U+0130, LATIN "
"CAPITAL LETTER I WITH DOT ABOVE) in :func:`time.strptime`. This affects "
"locales az_AZ, ber_DZ, ber_MA and crh_UA."
msgstr ""
":gh:`136028`: 修复在 :func:`time.strptime` 中解析包含 "
"\"İ\"（U+0130，拉丁大写字母I带点）的月份名称的问题。这影响 az_AZ、ber_DZ、ber_MA 和 crh_UA 语言环境。"

#: ../NEWS:2430
msgid ""
":gh:`135995`: In the palmos encoding, make byte ``0x9b`` decode to ``›`` "
"(U+203A - SINGLE RIGHT-POINTING ANGLE QUOTATION MARK)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`135995`: 在 palmos 编码中，使字节 ``0x9b`` 解码为 ``›`` (U+203A - 单右指向角引号) 。"

#: ../NEWS:2433
msgid ""
":gh:`53203`: Fix :func:`time.strptime` for ``%c`` and ``%x`` formats on "
"locales byn_ER, wal_ET and lzh_TW, and for ``%X`` format on locales ar_SA, "
"bg_BG and lzh_TW."
msgstr ""
":gh:`53203`: 修复 :func:`time.strptime` 对于 byn_ER、wal_ET 和 lzh_TW 语言环境的 ``%c``"
" 和 ``%x`` 格式，以及对于 ar_SA、bg_BG 和 lzh_TW 语言环境的 ``%X`` 格式。"

#: ../NEWS:2437
msgid ""
":gh:`91555`: An earlier change, which was introduced in 3.14.0b2, has been "
"reverted. It disabled logging for a logger during handling of log messages "
"for that logger. Since the reversion, the behaviour should be as it was "
"before 3.14.0b2."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91555`: 3.14.0b2 版本中引入的一项更改已被撤销。该更改在处理日志消息时禁用了日志记录器的日志记录。撤销后，行为应恢复至 "
"3.14.0b2 之前的状态。"

#: ../NEWS:2442
msgid ""
":gh:`135878`: Fixes a crash of :class:`types.SimpleNamespace` on :term:`free"
" threading` builds, when several threads were calling its "
":meth:`~object.__repr__` method at the same time."
msgstr ""
":gh:`135878`: 修复 :class:`types.SimpleNamespace` 在 :term:`free threading` "
"构建中，当多个线程同时调用其 :meth:`~object.__repr__` 方法时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2446
msgid ""
":gh:`135836`: Fix :exc:`IndexError` in "
":meth:`asyncio.loop.create_connection` that could occur when non-\\ "
":exc:`OSError` exception is raised during connection and socket's "
"``close()`` raises :exc:`!OSError`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`135836`: 修复 :meth:`asyncio.loop.create_connection` 中的 "
":exc:`IndexError`，该错误可能在连接过程中引发非 :exc:`OSError` 异常且套接字的 ``close()`` 引发 "
":exc:`!OSError` 时发生。"

#: ../NEWS:2450
msgid ""
":gh:`135836`: Fix :exc:`IndexError` in "
":meth:`asyncio.loop.create_connection` that could occur when the Happy "
"Eyeballs algorithm resulted in an empty exceptions list during connection "
"attempts."
msgstr ""
":gh:`135836`: 修复 :meth:`asyncio.loop.create_connection` 中的 "
":exc:`IndexError`，该错误可能在 Happy Eyeballs 算法在连接尝试中导致异常列表为空时发生。"

#: ../NEWS:2454
msgid ""
":gh:`135855`: Raise :exc:`TypeError` instead of :exc:`SystemError` when "
":func:`!_interpreters.set___main___attrs` is passed a non-dict object. Patch"
" by Brian Schubert."
msgstr ""
":gh:`135855`: 当 :func:`!_interpreters.set___main___attrs` 被传递非字典对象时，引发 "
":exc:`TypeError` 而非 :exc:`SystemError`。由 Brian Schubert 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2458
msgid ""
":gh:`135815`: :mod:`netrc`: skip security checks if :func:`os.getuid` is "
"missing. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`135815`: :mod:`netrc`: 如果 :func:`os.getuid` 缺失，则跳过安全检查。由 Bénédikt Tran "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2461
msgid ""
":gh:`135640`: Address bug where it was possible to call "
":func:`xml.etree.ElementTree.ElementTree.write` on an ElementTree object "
"with an invalid root element. This behavior blanked the file passed to "
"``write`` if it already existed."
msgstr ""
":gh:`135640`: 解决了一个错误，该错误允许在 :func:`xml.etree.ElementTree.ElementTree.write`"
" 中使用无效的根元素调用 ElementTree 对象。此行为会清空传递给 ``write`` 的已存在文件。"

#: ../NEWS:2466
msgid ""
":gh:`135645`: Added ``supports_isolated_interpreters`` field to "
":data:`sys.implementation`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`135645`: 向 :data:`sys.implementation` 添加了 "
"``supports_isolated_interpreters`` 字段。"

#: ../NEWS:2469
msgid ""
":gh:`135646`: Raise consistent :exc:`NameError` exceptions in "
":func:`annotationlib.ForwardRef.evaluate`"
msgstr ""
":gh:`135646`: 在 :func:`annotationlib.ForwardRef.evaluate` 方法中引发统一的 "
":exc:`NameError` 异常"

#: ../NEWS:2472
msgid ""
":gh:`135557`: Fix races on :mod:`heapq` updates and :class:`list` reads on "
"the :term:`free threaded <free threading>` build."
msgstr ""
":gh:`135557`: 修复 :term:`自由线程 <free threading>` 构建中 :mod:`heapq` 更新和 "
":class:`list` 读取的竞争条件。"

#: ../NEWS:2475
msgid ""
":gh:`119180`: Only fetch globals and locals if necessary in "
":func:`annotationlib.get_annotations`"
msgstr ""
":gh:`119180`: 在 :func:`annotationlib.get_annotations` 函数中，仅在必要时获取全局变量和局部变量"

#: ../NEWS:2478
msgid ""
":gh:`135561`: Fix a crash on DEBUG builds when an HACL* HMAC routine fails. "
"Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`135561`: 修复 DEBUG 构建中 HACL* HMAC 例程失败时的崩溃问题。由 Bénédikt Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2481
msgid ""
":gh:`135487`: Fix :meth:`!reprlib.Repr.repr_int` when given integers with "
"more than :func:`sys.get_int_max_str_digits` digits. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`135487`: 修复 :meth:`!reprlib.Repr.repr_int` 当给定整数超过 "
":func:`sys.get_int_max_str_digits` 数字时的问题。由 Bénédikt Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2485
msgid ""
":gh:`135335`: :mod:`multiprocessing`: Flush ``stdout`` and ``stderr`` after "
"preloading modules in the ``forkserver``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`135335`: :mod:`multiprocessing`: 在 ``forkserver`` 中预加载模块后刷新 ``stdout`` "
"和 ``stderr``。"

#: ../NEWS:2488
msgid ""
":gh:`135069`: Fix the \"Invalid error handling\" exception in "
":class:`!encodings.idna.IncrementalDecoder` to correctly replace the "
"'errors' parameter."
msgstr ""
":gh:`135069`: 修复 :class:`!encodings.idna.IncrementalDecoder` "
"中的“无效错误处理”异常，正确替换 'errors' 形参。"

#: ../NEWS:2492
msgid ""
":gh:`130662`: +Accept leading zeros in precision and width fields for "
"+:class:`~decimal.Decimal` formatting, for example ``format(Decimal(1.25), "
"'.016f')``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130662`: + 支持在 :class:`~decimal.Decimal` "
"格式化中，精度（precision）和宽度（width）字段接受前导零。例如：``format(Decimal(1.25), '.016f')``。"

#: ../NEWS:2496
msgid ""
":gh:`130662`: Accept leading zeros in precision and width fields for "
":class:`~fractions.Fraction` formatting, for example ``format(Fraction(1, "
"3), '.016f')``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130662`: 支持在 :class:`~fractions.Fraction` "
"格式化中，精度（precision）和宽度（width）字段接受前导零。例如：``format(Fraction(1, 3), '.016f')``。"

#: ../NEWS:2500
msgid ""
":gh:`87790`: Support underscore and comma as thousands separators in the "
"fractional part for :class:`~fractions.Fraction`'s formatting.  Patch by "
"Sergey B Kirpichev."
msgstr ""
":gh:`87790`: 支持在 :class:`~fractions.Fraction` 的格式化中，使用下划线和逗号作为小数部分的分组分隔符。由 "
"Sergey B Kirpichev 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2504
msgid ""
":gh:`87790`: Support underscore and comma as thousands separators in the "
"fractional part for :class:`~decimal.Decimal`'s formatting.  Patch by Sergey"
" B Kirpichev."
msgstr ""
":gh:`87790`: 支持在 :class:`~decimal.Decimal` 的格式化中，使用下划线和逗号作为小数部分的分组分隔符。由 "
"Sergey B Kirpichev 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2508
msgid ""
":gh:`130664`: Handle corner-case for :class:`~fractions.Fraction`'s "
"formatting: treat zero-padding (preceding the width field by a zero "
"(``'0'``) character) as an equivalent to a fill character of ``'0'`` with an"
" alignment type of ``'='``, just as in case of :class:`float`'s."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130664`: 处理 :class:`~fractions.Fraction` "
"格式化的边缘情况：将零填充（在宽度字段前加零（``'0'``）字符）视为与 ``'0'`` 填充字符和 ``'='`` 对齐类型等效，就像 "
":class:`float` 的情况一样。"

#: ../NEWS:2516
msgid ""
":gh:`136155`: EPUB builds are fixed by excluding non-XHTML-compatible tags."
msgstr ":gh:`136155`: 已修复EPUB构建问题：通过排除非XHTML兼容标签实现修复。"

#: ../NEWS:2521
msgid ""
":gh:`109700`: Fix memory error handling in :c:func:`PyDict_SetDefault`."
msgstr ":gh:`109700`: 修复了 :c:func:`PyDict_SetDefault` 函数中的内存错误处理问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2523
msgid ""
":gh:`78465`: Fix error message for ``cls.__new__(cls, ...)`` where ``cls`` "
"is not instantiable builtin or extension type (with ``tp_new`` set to "
"``NULL``)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`78465`: 修复 ``cls.__new__(cls, ...)`` 的错误消息，其中 ``cls`` "
"是不可实例化的内置或扩展类型（``tp_new`` 设置为 ``NULL``）。"

#: ../NEWS:2527
msgid ""
":gh:`129958`: Differentiate between t-strings and f-strings in syntax error "
"for newlines in format specifiers of single-quoted interpolated strings."
msgstr ":gh:`129958`: 在单引号插值字符串的格式说明符中换行时，需区分t-字符串和f-字符串的语法错误。"

#: ../NEWS:2530
msgid ""
":gh:`135871`: Non-blocking mutex lock attempts now return immediately when "
"the lock is busy instead of briefly spinning in the :term:`free threading` "
"build."
msgstr ""
":gh:`135871`: 在 :term:`free threading` "
"构建版本中，非阻塞互斥锁尝试在锁被占用时会立即返回，而不再进行短暂的忙等待。"

#: ../NEWS:2534
msgid ""
":gh:`135106`: Restrict the trashcan mechanism to GC'ed objects and untrack "
"them while in the trashcan to prevent the GC and trashcan mechanisms "
"conflicting."
msgstr ""
":gh:`135106`: "
"将垃圾回收箱（trashcan）机制限制为仅作用于垃圾回收（GC）管理的对象，并在进入垃圾回收箱时取消对这些对象的跟踪，以防止垃圾回收机制与垃圾回收箱机制之间发生冲突。"

#: ../NEWS:2538
msgid ""
":gh:`135607`: Fix potential :mod:`weakref` races in an object's destructor "
"on the :term:`free threaded <free threading>` build."
msgstr ""
":gh:`135607`: 修复 :term:`自由线程 <free threading>` 构建版本中，对象析构函数可能存在的 "
":mod:`weakref` 竞态条件问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2541
msgid ":gh:`135608`: Fix a crash in the JIT involving attributes of modules."
msgstr ":gh:`135608`: 修复涉及模块属性的 JIT 崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2543
msgid ""
":gh:`135543`: Emit ``sys.remote_exec`` audit event when "
":func:`sys.remote_exec` is called and migrate ``remote_debugger_script`` to "
"``cpython.remote_debugger_script``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`135543`: 当调用 :func:`sys.remote_exec` 时发出 ``sys.remote_exec`` 审计事件，并将 "
"``remote_debugger_script`` 迁移到 ``cpython.remote_debugger_script``。"

#: ../NEWS:2547
msgid ""
":gh:`134280`: Disable constant folding for ``~`` with a boolean argument. "
"This moves the deprecation warning from compile time to runtime."
msgstr ":gh:`134280`: 禁用对布尔参数使用按位取反运算符 ``~`` 时的常量折叠优化。此举将弃用警告的触发时机从编译时调整至运行时。"

#: ../NEWS:2553
msgid ""
":gh:`135906`: Fix compilation errors when compiling the internal headers "
"with a C++ compiler."
msgstr ":gh:`135906`: 修复了使用C++编译器编译内部头文件时产生的编译错误。"

#: ../NEWS:2559
msgid ""
":gh:`134273`: Add support for configuring compiler flags for the JIT with "
"``CFLAGS_JIT``"
msgstr ":gh:`134273`: 通过 ``CFLAGS_JIT`` 添加对 JIT 编译器标志配置的支持"

#: ../NEWS:2564
msgid "Python 3.14.0 beta 3"
msgstr "Python 3.14.0 beta 3"

#: ../NEWS:2566
msgid "*Release date: 2025-06-17*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2025-06-17*"

#: ../NEWS:2571
msgid ""
":gh:`135099`: Fix a crash that could occur on Windows when a background "
"thread waits on a :c:type:`PyMutex` while the main thread is shutting down "
"the interpreter."
msgstr ""
":gh:`135099`: 修复了在 Windows 上当后台线程等待 :c:type:`PyMutex` 而主线程正在关闭解释器时可能发生的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:2578
msgid ""
":gh:`132815`: Fix test__opcode: add ``JUMP_BACKWARD`` to specialization "
"stats."
msgstr ":gh:`132815`: 修复 test__opcode 测试：在特化统计中添加 ``JUMP_BACKWARD`` 指令。"

#: ../NEWS:2581
msgid ""
":gh:`135489`: Show verbose output for failing tests during PGO profiling "
"step with --enable-optimizations."
msgstr ":gh:`135489`: 在使用 --enable-optimizations 时，为 PGO 分析步骤中失败的测试显示详细输出。"

#: ../NEWS:2584
msgid ":gh:`135120`: Add :func:`!test.support.subTests`."
msgstr ":gh:`135120`: 添加 :func:`!test.support.subTests`。"

#: ../NEWS:2589
msgid ""
":gh:`135462`: Fix quadratic complexity in processing specially crafted input"
" in :class:`html.parser.HTMLParser`. End-of-file errors are now handled "
"according to the HTML5 specs -- comments and declarations are automatically "
"closed, tags are ignored."
msgstr ""
":gh:`135462`: 修复 :class:`html.parser.HTMLParser` "
"在处理特制输入时的二次方复杂度问题。现根据HTML5规范处理文件结束错误——自动闭合注释和声明，忽略标签。"

#: ../NEWS:2594
msgid ""
":gh:`135034`: Fixes multiple issues that allowed ``tarfile`` extraction "
"filters (``filter=\"data\"`` and ``filter=\"tar\"``) to be bypassed using "
"crafted symlinks and hard links."
msgstr ""
":gh:`135034`: 修复了多个问题，这些问题允许使用精心构造的符号链接和硬链接绕过 ``tarfile`` "
"提取过滤器（``filter=\"data\"`` 和 ``filter=\"tar\"``）。"

#: ../NEWS:2598
msgid ""
"Addresses :cve:`2024-12718`, :cve:`2025-4138`, :cve:`2025-4330`, and "
":cve:`2025-4517`."
msgstr ""
"解决了 :cve:`2024-12718`、:cve:`2025-4138`、:cve:`2025-4330` 和 :cve:`2025-4517`。"

#: ../NEWS:2604
msgid ""
":gh:`65697`: :class:`configparser`'s error message when attempting to write "
"an invalid key is now more helpful."
msgstr ":gh:`65697`: :class:`configparser` 在尝试写入无效键时的错误信息现在更有帮助。"

#: ../NEWS:2607
msgid ""
":gh:`135497`: Fix :func:`os.getlogin` failing for longer usernames on BSD-"
"based platforms."
msgstr ":gh:`135497`: 修复了在基于 BSD 的平台上 :func:`os.getlogin` 对于较长用户名失败的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2610
msgid ""
":gh:`135429`: Fix the argument mismatch in ``_lsprof`` for ``PY_THROW`` "
"event."
msgstr ":gh:`135429`: 修复了 ``_lsprof`` 中 ``PY_THROW`` 事件的参数不匹配问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2613
msgid ""
":gh:`135368`: Fix :class:`unittest.mock.Mock` generation on "
":func:`dataclasses.dataclass` objects. Now all special attributes are set as"
" it was before :gh:`124429`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`135368`: 修复了在 :func:`dataclasses.dataclass` 对象上生成 "
":class:`unittest.mock.Mock` 的问题。现在所有特殊属性都像 :gh:`124429` 之前那样设置。"

#: ../NEWS:2617
msgid ""
":gh:`133967`: Do not normalize :mod:`locale` name 'C.UTF-8' to "
"'en_US.UTF-8'."
msgstr ":gh:`133967`: 不将 :mod:`locale` 名称 'C.UTF-8' 标准化为 'en_US.UTF-8'。"

#: ../NEWS:2619
msgid ""
":gh:`135321`: Raise a correct exception for values greater than 0x7fffffff "
"for the ``BINSTRING`` opcode in the C implementation of :mod:`pickle`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`135321`: 为 :mod:`pickle` 的 C 实现中的 ``BINSTRING`` 操作码的值大于 0x7fffffff "
"的情况引发正确的异常。"

#: ../NEWS:2622
msgid ""
":gh:`135276`: Backported bugfixes in zipfile.Path from zipp 3.23. Fixed "
"``.name``, ``.stem`` and other basename-based properties on Windows when "
"working with a zipfile on disk."
msgstr ""
":gh:`135276`: 从 zipp 3.23 回溯了 zipfile.Path 中的 bug 修复。修复了在 Windows 上处理磁盘上的 "
"zipfile 时 ``.name``、``.stem`` 和其他基于基名的属性的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2626
msgid ""
":gh:`135244`: :mod:`uuid`: when the MAC address cannot be determined, the "
"48-bit node ID is now generated with a cryptographically-secure pseudo-"
"random number generator (CSPRNG) as per :rfc:`RFC 9562, §6.10.3 "
"<9562#section-6.10-3>`. This affects :func:`~uuid.uuid1` and "
":func:`~uuid.uuid6`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`135244`: :mod:`uuid`: 当无法确定MAC地址时，现在按照 :rfc:`RFC 9562, §6.10.3 "
"<9562#section-6.10-3>` 使用加密安全的伪随机数生成器（CSPRNG）生成48位节点ID。这影响了 "
":func:`~uuid.uuid1` 和 :func:`~uuid.uuid6`。"

#: ../NEWS:2632
msgid ""
":gh:`134970`: Fix the \"unknown action\" exception in "
":meth:`argparse.ArgumentParser.add_argument_group` to correctly replace the "
"action class."
msgstr ""
":gh:`134970`: 修复了 :meth:`argparse.ArgumentParser.add_argument_group` "
"中“未知动作”异常，以正确替换动作类。"

#: ../NEWS:2636
msgid ""
":gh:`134718`: :func:`ast.dump` now only omits ``None`` and ``[]`` values if "
"they are default values."
msgstr ":gh:`134718`: :func:`ast.dump` 现在仅在它们是默认值时省略 ``None`` 和 ``[]`` 值。"

#: ../NEWS:2639
msgid ""
":gh:`134939`: Add the :mod:`concurrent.interpreters` module.  See "
":pep:`734`."
msgstr ":gh:`134939`: 添加了 :mod:`concurrent.interpreters` 模块。参见 :pep:`734`。"

#: ../NEWS:2641
msgid ""
":gh:`134885`: Fix possible crash in the :mod:`compression.zstd` module "
"related to setting parameter types. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`134885`: 修复了 :mod:`compression.zstd` 模块中与设置形参类型相关的可能崩溃。由Jelle "
"Zijlstra提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2644
msgid ""
":gh:`134857`: Improve error report for :mod:`doctest`\\ s run with "
":mod:`unittest`. Remove :mod:`!doctest` module frames from tracebacks and "
"redundant newline character from a failure message."
msgstr ""
":gh:`134857`: 改进了与 :mod:`unittest` 一起运行的 :mod:`doctest` 的错误报告。从回溯中移除 "
":mod:`!doctest` 模块帧，并从失败消息中移除冗余的换行符。"

#: ../NEWS:2648
msgid ""
":gh:`128840`: Fix parsing long IPv6 addresses with embedded IPv4 address."
msgstr ":gh:`128840`: 修复了解析包含嵌入式IPv4地址的长IPv6地址的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2650
msgid ""
":gh:`134637`: Fix performance regression in calling a :mod:`ctypes` function"
" pointer in :term:`free threading`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`134637`: 修复了在 :term:`free threading` 中调用 :mod:`ctypes` 函数指针时的性能回归。"

#: ../NEWS:2653
msgid ""
":gh:`134696`: Built-in HACL* and OpenSSL implementations of hash function "
"constructors now correctly accept the same *documented* named arguments. For"
" instance, :func:`~hashlib.md5` could be previously invoked as "
"``md5(data=data)`` or ``md5(string=string)`` depending on the underlying "
"implementation but these calls were not compatible. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`134696`: 内置的HACL*和OpenSSL哈希函数构造器实现现在正确接受相同的 *文档化* "
"命名参数。例如，:func:`~hashlib.md5` 之前可以根据底层实现以 ``md5(data=data)`` 或 "
"``md5(string=string)`` 形式调用，但这些调用不兼容。由Bénédikt Tran提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2660
msgid ""
":gh:`134151`: :mod:`email`: Fix :exc:`TypeError` in "
":func:`email.utils.decode_params` when sorting :rfc:`2231` continuations "
"that contain an unnumbered section."
msgstr ""
":gh:`134151`: :mod:`email`: 修复了 :func:`email.utils.decode_params` "
"中在排序包含未编号部分的 :rfc:`2231` 续篇时的 :exc:`TypeError`。"

#: ../NEWS:2664
msgid ""
":gh:`134210`: :func:`curses.window.getch` now correctly handles signals. "
"Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`134210`: :func:`curses.window.getch` 现在正确处理信号。由Bénédikt Tran提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2667
msgid ""
":gh:`134152`: :mod:`email`: Fix parsing of email message ID with invalid "
"domain."
msgstr ":gh:`134152`: :mod:`email`: 修复了带有无效域的电子邮件消息ID的解析。"

#: ../NEWS:2670
msgid ""
":gh:`133489`: :func:`random.getrandbits` can now generate more that 2\\ "
":sup:`31` bits. :func:`random.randbytes` can now generate more that 256 MiB."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133489`: :func:`random.getrandbits` 现在可以生成超过2\\ :sup:`31` "
"位的随机数。:func:`random.randbytes` 现在可以生成超过256 MiB的数据。"

#: ../NEWS:2674
msgid ""
":gh:`132813`: Improve error messages for incorrect types and values of "
":class:`csv.Dialect` attributes."
msgstr ":gh:`132813`: 改进当 :class:`csv.Dialect` 属性的类型和值不正确时的错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:2677
msgid ""
":gh:`132969`: Prevent the :class:`~concurrent.futures.ProcessPoolExecutor` "
"executor thread, which remains running when :meth:`shutdown(wait=False) "
"<concurrent.futures.Executor.shutdown>`, from attempting to adjust the "
"pool's worker processes after the object state has already been reset during"
" shutdown. A combination of conditions, including a worker process having "
"terminated abormally, resulted in an exception and a potential hang when the"
" still-running executor thread attempted to replace dead workers within the "
"pool."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132969`: 防止 :class:`~concurrent.futures.ProcessPoolExecutor` 执行器线程在 "
":meth:`shutdown(wait=False) <concurrent.futures.Executor.shutdown>` "
"后仍然运行时，在对象状态已在关闭过程中被重置后尝试调整池的工作进程。一系列条件，包括工作进程异常终止，导致当仍在运行的执行器线程尝试替换池中的死亡工作者时出现异常和可能的挂起。"

#: ../NEWS:2686
msgid ""
":gh:`127081`: Fix libc thread safety issues with :mod:`os` by replacing "
"``getlogin`` with ``getlogin_r`` re-entrant version."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127081`: 通过用可重入版本的 ``getlogin_r`` 替换 ``getlogin``，修复 :mod:`os` "
"的libc线程安全问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2689
msgid ""
":gh:`131884`: Fix formatting issues in :func:`json.dump` when both *indent* "
"and *skipkeys* are used."
msgstr ""
":gh:`131884`: 修复当同时使用 *indent* 和 *skipkeys* 时 :func:`json.dump` 的格式化问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2692
msgid ""
":gh:`130999`: Avoid exiting the new REPL and offer suggestions even if there"
" are non-string candidates when errors occur."
msgstr ":gh:`130999`: 避免在发生错误时退出新的REPL，并在即使有非字符串候选时也提供建议。"

#: ../NEWS:2698
msgid ""
":gh:`135171`: Document that the :term:`iterator` for the leftmost "
":keyword:`!for` clause in the generator expression is created immediately."
msgstr ""
":gh:`135171`: 文档说明生成器表达式中最左边的 :keyword:`!for` 子句的 :term:`iterator` 是立即创建的。"

#: ../NEWS:2701
msgid ""
":issue:`45210`: Document that error indicator may be set in tp_dealloc, and "
"how to avoid clobbering it."
msgstr ":issue:`45210`: 文档说明错误指示器可能在tp_dealloc中设置，以及如何避免覆盖它。"

#: ../NEWS:2707
msgid ""
":gh:`135496`: Fix typo in the f-string conversion type error "
"(\"exclamanation\" -> \"exclamation\")."
msgstr ":gh:`135496`: 修复f-string转换类型错误中的拼写错误(\"exclamanation\" -> \"exclamation\")。"

#: ../NEWS:2710
msgid ""
":gh:`135371`: Fixed :mod:`asyncio` debugging tools to properly display "
"internal coroutine call stacks alongside external task dependencies. The "
"``python -m asyncio ps`` and ``python -m asyncio pstree`` commands now show "
"complete execution context. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":gh:`135371`: 修正 :mod:`asyncio` 调试工具以正确显示内部协程调用栈和外部任务依赖关系。``python -m "
"asyncio ps``和 ``python -m asyncio pstree`` 命令现在显示完整的执行上下文。由Pablo "
"Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2718
msgid ""
":gh:`127319`: Set the ``allow_reuse_port`` class variable to ``False`` on "
"the XMLRPC, logging, and HTTP servers. This matches the behavior in prior "
"Python releases, which is to not allow port reuse."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127319`: 将XMLRPC、日志记录和HTTP服务器上的 ``allow_reuse_port`` "
"类变量设置为``False``。这匹配了之前Python版本的行为，即不允许端口重用。"

#: ../NEWS:2725
msgid ""
":gh:`135171`: Reverts the behavior of async generator expressions when "
"created with object w/o __aiter__ method to the pre-3.13 behavior of raising"
" a TypeError."
msgstr ""
":gh:`135171`: 将当创建时不带__aiter__方法的对象的异步生成器表达式的行为恢复到3.13之前的行为，即引发TypeError。"

#: ../NEWS:2729
msgid ""
":gh:`130077`: Properly raise custom syntax errors when incorrect syntax "
"containing names that are prefixes of soft keywords is encountered.  Patch "
"by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":gh:`130077`: 当遇到包含软关键字前缀名称的错误语法时，正确引发自定义语法错误。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2733
msgid ""
":gh:`135171`: Reverts the behavior of generator expressions when created "
"with a non-iterable to the pre-3.13 behavior of raising a TypeError. It is "
"no longer possible to cause a crash in the debugger by altering the "
"generator expression's local variables. This is achieved by moving the "
"``GET_ITER`` instruction back to the creation of the generator expression "
"and adding an additional check to ``FOR_ITER``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`135171`: "
"将生成器表达式在创建时遇到不可迭代对象的行为恢复到3.13之前的TypeError行为。不再可能通过改变生成器表达式的局部变量来导致调试器崩溃。这是通过将"
" ``GET_ITER`` 指令移回生成器表达式的创建并给 ``FOR_ITER`` 添加额外检查实现的。"

#: ../NEWS:2743
msgid ""
":gh:`116738`: Make methods in :mod:`heapq` thread-safe on the :term:`free "
"threaded <free threading>` build."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116738`: 使 :mod:`heapq` 中的方法在 :term:`自由线程 <free threading>` 构建上线程安全。"

#: ../NEWS:2749
msgid ""
":gh:`134876`: Add support to :pep:`768` remote debugging for Linux kernels "
"which don't have CONFIG_CROSS_MEMORY_ATTACH configured."
msgstr ""
":gh:`134876`: 为未配置CONFIG_CROSS_MEMORY_ATTACH的Linux内核添加对 :pep:`768` 远程调试的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:2752
msgid ""
":gh:`134889`: Fix handling of a few opcodes that leave operands on the stack"
" when optimizing ``LOAD_FAST``."
msgstr ":gh:`134889`: 修复在优化 ``LOAD_FAST`` 时处理几个在栈上留下操作数的操作码的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2758
msgid ""
":gh:`134908`: Fix crash when iterating over lines in a text file on the "
":term:`free threaded <free threading>` build."
msgstr ":gh:`134908`: 修复在 :term:`自由线程 <free threading>` 构建上迭代文本文件行时崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2764
msgid ""
":gh:`132617`: Fix :meth:`dict.update` modification check that could "
"incorrectly raise a \"dict mutated during update\" error when a different "
"dictionary was modified that happens to share the same underlying keys "
"object."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132617`: 修复 :meth:`dict.update` "
"修改检查，当修改一个恰好共享相同底层键对象的不同字典时，可能错误地引发“更新期间字典被修改”错误的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2769
msgid ""
":gh:`134679`: Fix crash in the :term:`free threading` build's QSBR code that"
" could occur when changing an object's ``__dict__`` attribute."
msgstr ""
":gh:`134679`: 修复 :term:`free threading` 构建的 QSBR 代码在更改对象的 ``__dict__`` "
"属性时可能发生的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:2772
msgid ""
":gh:`127682`: No longer call ``__iter__`` twice in list comprehensions. This"
" brings the behavior of list comprehensions in line with other forms of "
"iteration"
msgstr ":gh:`127682`: 在列表推导式中不再调用 ``__iter__`` 两次。这使得列表推导式的行为与其他形式的迭代一致"

#: ../NEWS:2776
msgid ""
":gh:`133912`: Fix the C API function ``PyObject_GenericSetDict`` to handle "
"extension classes with inline values."
msgstr ":gh:`133912`: 修复C API函数 ``PyObject_GenericSetDict`` 以处理具有内联值的扩展类。"

#: ../NEWS:2782
msgid ""
":gh:`134989`: Fix ``Py_RETURN_NONE``, ``Py_RETURN_TRUE`` and "
"``Py_RETURN_FALSE`` macros in the limited C API 3.11 and older: don't treat "
"``Py_None``, ``Py_True`` and ``Py_False`` as immortal. Patch by Victor "
"Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`134989`: 在有限的C API 3.11及更早版本中修复 ``Py_RETURN_NONE``、``Py_RETURN_TRUE`` "
"和``Py_RETURN_FALSE``宏：不将 ``Py_None``、``Py_True`` 和 ``Py_False`` 视为不朽。由Victor"
" Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2787
msgid ""
":gh:`134989`: Implement :c:func:`PyObject_DelAttr` and "
":c:func:`PyObject_DelAttrString` as macros in the limited C API 3.12 and "
"older. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`134989`: 在有限的C API 3.12及更早版本中将 :c:func:`PyObject_DelAttr` 和 "
":c:func:`PyObject_DelAttrString` 实现为宏。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2791
msgid ""
":gh:`133968`: Add :c:func:`PyUnicodeWriter_WriteASCII` function to write an "
"ASCII string into a :c:type:`PyUnicodeWriter`. The function is faster than "
":c:func:`PyUnicodeWriter_WriteUTF8`, but has an undefined behavior if the "
"input string contains non-ASCII characters. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133968`: 添加 :c:func:`PyUnicodeWriter_WriteASCII` 函数以将ASCII字符串写入 "
":c:type:`PyUnicodeWriter`。此函数比 :c:func:`PyUnicodeWriter_WriteUTF8` "
"更快，但如果输入字符串包含非ASCII字符，则行为未定义。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2799
msgid ""
":gh:`119132`: Remove \"experimental\" tag from the CPython free-threading "
"build."
msgstr ":gh:`119132`: 从CPython的自由线程构建中移除“实验性”标签。"

#: ../NEWS:2802
msgid ""
":gh:`135497`: Fix the detection of ``MAXLOGNAME`` in the ``configure.ac`` "
"script."
msgstr ":gh:`135497`: 修复 ``configure.ac`` 脚本中 ``MAXLOGNAME`` 的检测。"

#: ../NEWS:2805
msgid ""
":gh:`134923`: Windows builds with profile-guided optimization enabled now "
"use ``/GENPROFILE`` and ``/USEPROFILE`` instead of deprecated ``/LTCG:`` "
"options."
msgstr ""
":gh:`134923`: 启用了基于配置文件的优化的Windows构建现在使用 ``/GENPROFILE`` 和 ``/USEPROFILE`` "
"替代已弃用的 ``/LTCG:`` 选项。"

#: ../NEWS:2809
msgid ""
":gh:`134774`: Fix :c:macro:`Py_DEBUG` macro redefinition warnings on Windows"
" debug builds. Patch by Chris Eibl."
msgstr ""
":gh:`134774`: 修复Windows调试构建中 :c:macro:`Py_DEBUG` 宏重定义的警告。补丁由Chris Eibl提供。"

#: ../NEWS:2812
msgid ""
":gh:`134632`: Fixed ``build-details.json`` generation to use ``INCLUDEPY``, "
"in order to reference the ``pythonX.Y`` subdirectory of the include "
"directory, as required in :pep:`739`, instead of the top-level include "
"directory."
msgstr ""
":gh:`134632`: 修复 ``build-details.json`` 生成以使用 ``INCLUDEPY``，以便引用包含目录的 "
"``pythonX.Y`` 子目录，如 :pep:`739` 所要求，而不是顶级包含目录。"

#: ../NEWS:2819
msgid "Python 3.14.0 beta 2"
msgstr "Python 3.14.0 beta 2"

#: ../NEWS:2821
msgid "*Release date: 2025-05-26*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2025-05-26*"

#: ../NEWS:2826
msgid ""
":gh:`130727`: Fix a race in internal calls into WMI that can result in an "
"\"invalid handle\" exception under high load. Patch by Chris Eibl."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130727`: 修复了对 WMI 的内部调用中一个竞争问题，它可能在高负载情况下导致 \"invalid handle（无效句柄）\" "
"异常。 由 Chris Eibl 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2829
msgid ""
":gh:`76023`: Make :func:`os.path.realpath` ignore Windows error 1005 when in"
" non-strict mode."
msgstr ":gh:`76023`: 使 :func:`os.path.realpath` 在非严格模式下忽略Windows错误1005。"

#: ../NEWS:2832
msgid ""
":gh:`133779`: Reverts the change to generate different :file:`pyconfig.h` "
"files based on compiler settings, as it was frequently causing extension "
"builds to break. In particular, the ``Py_GIL_DISABLED`` preprocessor "
"variable must now always be defined explicitly when compiling for the "
"experimental free-threaded runtime. The :func:`sysconfig.get_config_var` "
"function can be used to determine whether the current runtime was compiled "
"with that flag or not."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133779`: 撤销了根据编译器设置生成不同的 :file:`pyconfig.h` "
"文件的更改，因为它经常导致扩展构建失败。特别是，当为实验性自由线程运行时编译时，``Py_GIL_DISABLED`` "
"预处理器变量现在必须始终明确定义。:func:`sysconfig.get_config_var` 函数可用于确定当前运行时是否是用该标志编译的。"

#: ../NEWS:2840
msgid ""
":gh:`133626`: Ensures packages are not accidentally bundled into the "
"traditional installer."
msgstr ":gh:`133626`: 确保包不会意外捆绑到传统安装程序中。"

#: ../NEWS:2846
msgid ""
":gh:`134215`: :term:`REPL` import autocomplete only suggests private modules"
" when explicitly specified."
msgstr ":gh:`134215`: :term:`REPL` 导入自动补全仅在明确指定时才建议私有模块。"

#: ../NEWS:2852
msgid ""
":gh:`133744`: Fix multiprocessing interrupt test. Add an event to "
"synchronize the parent process with the child process: wait until the child "
"process starts sleeping. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133744`: 修复多进程中断测试。添加一个事件来同步父进程与子进程：等待直到子进程开始睡眠。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2856
msgid ""
":gh:`133682`: Fixed test case "
"``test.test_annotationlib.TestStringFormat.test_displays`` which ensures "
"proper handling of complex data structures (lists, sets, dictionaries, and "
"tuples) in string annotations."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133682`: 修复了测试用例 "
"``test.test_annotationlib.TestStringFormat.test_displays``，确保在字符串注释中正确处理复杂数据结构（列表、集合、字典和元组）。"

#: ../NEWS:2861
msgid ""
":gh:`133639`: Fix ``TestPyReplAutoindent.test_auto_indent_default()`` "
"doesn't run ``input_code``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133639`: 修复 ``TestPyReplAutoindent.test_auto_indent_default()`` 不运行 "
"``input_code``的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2867
msgid ""
":gh:`133767`: Fix use-after-free in the \"unicode-escape\" decoder with a "
"non-\"strict\" error handler."
msgstr ":gh:`133767`: 修复在非\"严格\"错误处理程序中使用\"unicode-escape\"解码器时的释放后使用问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2870
msgid ""
":gh:`128840`: Short-circuit the processing of long IPv6 addresses early in "
":mod:`ipaddress` to prevent excessive memory consumption and a minor denial-"
"of-service."
msgstr ":gh:`128840`: 在 :mod:`ipaddress` 中早期短路处理长IPv6地址，以防止过多的内存消耗和轻微的拒绝服务。"

#: ../NEWS:2877
msgid ""
":gh:`132710`: If possible, ensure that :func:`uuid.getnode` returns the same"
" result even across different processes. Previously, the result was constant"
" only within the same process. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132710`: 如果可能，确保 :func:`uuid.getnode` "
"即使在不同进程中也能返回相同的结果。以前，结果仅在同一个进程中保持不变。由Bénédikt Tran提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2881
msgid ""
":gh:`80334`: :func:`multiprocessing.freeze_support` now checks for work on "
"any \"spawn\" start method platform rather than only on Windows."
msgstr ""
":gh:`80334`: :func:`multiprocessing.freeze_support` "
"现在检查任何\"spawn\"启动方法平台上的工作，而不仅限于Windows。"

#: ../NEWS:2884
msgid ""
":gh:`134582`: Fix tokenize.untokenize() round-trip errors related to "
"t-strings braces escaping"
msgstr ":gh:`134582`: 修复与t-strings大括号转义相关的tokenize.untokenize()往返错误"

#: ../NEWS:2887
msgid ""
":gh:`134546`: Ensure :mod:`pdb` remote debugging script is readable by "
"remote Python process."
msgstr ":gh:`134546`: 确保 :mod:`pdb` 远程调试脚本可以被远程Python进程读取。"

#: ../NEWS:2890
msgid ""
":gh:`134451`: Converted ``asyncio.tools.CycleFoundException`` from dataclass"
" to a regular exception type."
msgstr ":gh:`134451`: 将 ``asyncio.tools.CycleFoundException`` 从数据类转换为常规异常类型。"

#: ../NEWS:2893
msgid ""
":gh:`114177`: Fix :mod:`asyncio` to not close subprocess pipes which would "
"otherwise error out when the event loop is already closed."
msgstr ":gh:`114177`: 修复 :mod:`asyncio` 不关闭子进程管道，否则在事件循环已经关闭时会出错。"

#: ../NEWS:2896
msgid ""
":gh:`90871`: Fixed an off by one error concerning the backlog parameter in "
":meth:`~asyncio.loop.create_unix_server`. Contributed by Christian Harries."
msgstr ""
":gh:`90871`: 修复了关于 :meth:`~asyncio.loop.create_unix_server` "
"中backlog形参的差一错误。由Christian Harries贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:2900
msgid ":gh:`134323`: Fix the :meth:`threading.RLock.locked` method."
msgstr ":gh:`134323`: 修复 :meth:`threading.RLock.locked` 方法。"

#: ../NEWS:2902
msgid ""
":gh:`86802`: Fixed asyncio memory leak in cancelled shield tasks. For "
"shielded tasks where the shield was cancelled, log potential exceptions "
"through the exception handler. Contributed by Christian Harries."
msgstr ""
":gh:`86802`: 修复了已取消的防护任务（shielded "
"tasks）中的asyncio内存泄漏问题。对于那些防护操作被取消的受保护任务，现在会通过异常处理器记录潜在的异常情况。由Christian "
"Harries贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:2906
msgid ""
":gh:`134209`: :mod:`curses`: The :meth:`curses.window.instr` and "
":meth:`curses.window.getstr` methods now allocate their internal buffer on "
"the heap instead of the stack; in addition, the max buffer size is increased"
" from 1023 to 2047."
msgstr ""
":gh:`134209`: :mod:`curses`: 现在，:meth:`curses.window.instr` 和 "
":meth:`curses.window.getstr` 方法在堆上而不是栈上分配它们的内部缓冲区；此外，最大缓冲区大小从1023增加到2047。"

#: ../NEWS:2911
msgid ""
":gh:`134235`: Updated tab completion on REPL to include builtin modules. "
"Contributed by Tom Wang, Hunter Young"
msgstr ":gh:`134235`: 更新了REPL上的标签补全功能，以包括内置模块。由Tom Wang, Hunter Young贡献"

#: ../NEWS:2914
msgid ""
":gh:`134152`: Fixed :exc:`UnboundLocalError` that could occur during "
":mod:`email` header parsing if an expected trailing delimiter is missing in "
"some contexts."
msgstr ""
":gh:`134152`: 修复了在某些上下文中，如果缺少预期的尾随定界符，在 :mod:`email` 头解析过程中可能发生的 "
":exc:`UnboundLocalError`。"

#: ../NEWS:2918
msgid ""
":gh:`134168`: :mod:`http.server`: Fix IPv6 address binding and "
":option:`--directory <http.server --directory>` handling when using HTTPS."
msgstr ""
":gh:`134168`: :mod:`http.server`: 修复了使用HTTPS时的IPv6地址绑定和 :option:`--directory"
" <http.server --directory>` 处理。"

#: ../NEWS:2921
msgid ""
":gh:`62184`: Remove import of C implementation of :class:`io.FileIO` from "
"Python implementation which has its own implementation"
msgstr ""
":gh:`62184`: 从Python实现中移除了对 :class:`io.FileIO` 的C实现的导入，该Python实现有自己的实现"

#: ../NEWS:2924
msgid ""
":gh:`133982`: Emit :exc:`RuntimeWarning` in the Python implementation of "
":mod:`io` when the :term:`file-like object <file object>` is not closed "
"explicitly in the presence of multiple I/O layers."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133982`: 在 :mod:`io` 的Python实现中，当在存在多个I/O层的情况下没有显式关闭 :term:`文件型对象 <file"
" object>` 时，发出 :exc:`RuntimeWarning`。"

#: ../NEWS:2928
msgid ""
":gh:`133890`: The :mod:`tarfile` module now handles "
":exc:`UnicodeEncodeError` in the same way as :exc:`OSError` when cannot "
"extract a member."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133890`: :mod:`tarfile` 模块现在在无法提取成员时以与 :exc:`OSError` 相同的方式处理 "
":exc:`UnicodeEncodeError`。"

#: ../NEWS:2931
msgid ""
":gh:`134097`: Fix interaction of the new :term:`REPL` and :option:`-X "
"showrefcount <-X>` command line option."
msgstr ""
":gh:`134097`: 修复了新 :term:`REPL` 和 :option:`-X showrefcount <-X>` 命令行选项的交互问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2934
msgid ""
":gh:`133889`: The generated directory listing page in "
":class:`http.server.SimpleHTTPRequestHandler` now only shows the decoded "
"path component of the requested URL, and not the query and fragment."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133889`: :class:`http.server.SimpleHTTPRequestHandler` "
"中生成的目录列表页面现在只显示请求URL的解码路径组件，而不显示查询和片段。"

#: ../NEWS:2938
msgid ""
":gh:`134098`: Fix handling paths that end with a percent-encoded slash "
"(``%2f`` or ``%2F``) in :class:`http.server.SimpleHTTPRequestHandler`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`134098`: 修复了在 :class:`http.server.SimpleHTTPRequestHandler` "
"中处理以百分比编码的斜杠（``%2f``或 ``%2F``）结尾的路径的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2941
msgid ""
":gh:`132124`: On POSIX-compliant systems, "
":func:`!multiprocessing.util.get_temp_dir` now ignores :envvar:`TMPDIR` (and"
" similar environment variables) if the path length of ``AF_UNIX`` socket "
"files exceeds the platform-specific maximum length when using the "
":ref:`forkserver <multiprocessing-start-method-forkserver>` start method. "
"Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132124`: 在符合POSIX的系统上，:func:`!multiprocessing.util.get_temp_dir` 现在在使用 "
":ref:`forkserver <multiprocessing-start-method-forkserver>` 启动方法时，如果 "
"``AF_UNIX`` 套接字文件的路径长度超过平台特定的最大长度，则忽略 :envvar:`TMPDIR` (以及类似的环境变量) "
"。补丁由Bénédikt Tran提供。"

#: ../NEWS:2948
msgid ""
":gh:`134062`: :mod:`ipaddress`: fix collisions in :meth:`~object.__hash__` "
"for :class:`~ipaddress.IPv4Network` and :class:`~ipaddress.IPv6Network` "
"objects."
msgstr ""
":gh:`134062`: :mod:`ipaddress`: 修复 :meth:`~object.__hash__` 中 "
":class:`~ipaddress.IPv4Network` 和 :class:`~ipaddress.IPv6Network` 对象的冲突。"

#: ../NEWS:2952
msgid ""
":gh:`133970`: Make :class:`!string.templatelib.Template` and "
":class:`!string.templatelib.Interpolation` generic."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133970`: 使 :class:`!string.templatelib.Template` 和 "
":class:`!string.templatelib.Interpolation` 成为泛型。"

#: ../NEWS:2955
msgid ""
":gh:`71253`: Raise :exc:`ValueError` in :func:`open` if *opener* returns a "
"negative file-descriptor in the Python implementation of :mod:`io` to match "
"the C implementation."
msgstr ""
":gh:`71253`: 在 Python 实现的 :mod:`io` 中，如果 *opener* 返回一个负的文件描述符，则在 "
":func:`open` 中抛出 :exc:`ValueError` 以匹配 C 实现。"

#: ../NEWS:2959
msgid ""
":gh:`133960`: Simplify and improve :func:`typing.evaluate_forward_ref`. It "
"now no longer raises errors on certain invalid types. In several situations,"
" it is now able to evaluate forward references that were previously "
"unsupported."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133960`: 简化并改进 "
":func:`typing.evaluate_forward_ref`。现在它不再在某些无效类型上抛出错误。在几种情况下，它现在能够评估之前不支持的前向引用。"

#: ../NEWS:2964
msgid ""
":gh:`133925`: Make the private class ``typing._UnionGenericAlias`` hashable."
msgstr ":gh:`133925`: 使私有类 ``typing._UnionGenericAlias`` 可哈希。"

#: ../NEWS:2966
msgid ""
":gh:`133653`: Fix :class:`argparse.ArgumentParser` with the "
"*formatter_class* argument. Fix TypeError when *formatter_class* is a custom"
" subclass of :class:`!HelpFormatter`. Fix TypeError when *formatter_class* "
"is not a subclass of :class:`!HelpFormatter` and non-standard *prefix_char* "
"is used. Fix support of colorizing when *formatter_class* is not a subclass "
"of :class:`!HelpFormatter`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133653`: 修复 :class:`argparse.ArgumentParser` 使用 *formatter_class* "
"参数时的错误。修复当 *formatter_class* 是 :class:`!HelpFormatter` 的自定义子类时的 "
"TypeError。修复当 *formatter_class* 不是 :class:`!HelpFormatter` 的子类且使用非标准 "
"*prefix_char* 时的 TypeError。修复当 *formatter_class* 不是 :class:`!HelpFormatter` "
"的子类时的颜色化支持。"

#: ../NEWS:2973
msgid ""
":gh:`132641`: Fixed a race in :func:`functools.lru_cache` under free-"
"threading."
msgstr ":gh:`132641`: 修复了 :func:`functools.lru_cache` 在自由线程下的竞争条件。"

#: ../NEWS:2976
msgid ""
":gh:`133783`: Fix bug with applying :func:`copy.replace` to :mod:`ast` "
"objects. Attributes that default to ``None`` were incorrectly treated as "
"required for manually created AST nodes."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133783`: 修复将 :func:`copy.replace` 应用于 :mod:`ast` 对象时的错误。默认值为 ``None`` "
"的属性被错误地视为手动创建的 AST 节点的必需属性。"

#: ../NEWS:2980
msgid ""
":gh:`133684`: Fix bug where :func:`annotationlib.get_annotations` would "
"return the wrong result for certain classes that are part of a class "
"hierarchy where ``from __future__ import annotations`` is used."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133684`: 修复 :func:`annotationlib.get_annotations` 在用于某些类的类层次结构中返回错误结果的 "
"bug，这些类使用了 ``from __future__ import annotations``。"

#: ../NEWS:2984
msgid ""
":gh:`77057`: Fix handling of invalid markup declarations in "
":class:`html.parser.HTMLParser`."
msgstr ":gh:`77057`: 修复 :class:`html.parser.HTMLParser` 中无效标记声明的处理。"

#: ../NEWS:2987
msgid ""
":gh:`130328`: Speedup pasting in ``PyREPL`` on Windows in a legacy console. "
"Patch by Chris Eibl."
msgstr ":gh:`130328`: 在 Windows 的传统控制台中加速 ``PyREPL`` 的粘贴。由 Chris Eibl 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2990
msgid ""
":gh:`133701`: Fix bug where :class:`typing.TypedDict` classes defined under "
"``from __future__ import annotations`` and inheriting from another "
"``TypedDict`` had an incorrect ``__annotations__`` attribute."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133701`: 修复在 ``from __future__ import annotations`` 下定义且继承自另一个 "
"``TypedDict`` 的 :class:`typing.TypedDict` 类具有不正确 ``__annotations__`` 属性的 "
"bug。"

#: ../NEWS:2994
msgid ""
":gh:`133581`: Improve unparsing of t-strings in :func:`ast.unparse` and "
"``from __future__ import annotations``. Empty t-strings now round-trip "
"correctly and formatting in interpolations is preserved. Patch by Jelle "
"Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133581`: 改进 :func:`ast.unparse` 和 ``from __future__ import "
"annotations`` 中 t-strings 的反解析。现在空 t-strings 能正确往返转换，插值中的格式也得到了保留。由 Jelle "
"Zijlstra 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2999
msgid ""
":gh:`133551`: Support t-strings (:pep:`750`) in :mod:`annotationlib`. Patch "
"by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133551`: 在 :mod:`annotationlib` 中支持 t-strings (:pep:`750`)。由 Jelle "
"Zijlstra 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3002
msgid ""
":gh:`133439`: Fix dot commands with trailing spaces are mistaken for multi-"
"line SQL statements in the sqlite3 command-line interface."
msgstr ":gh:`133439`: 修复 sqlite3 命令行界面中将带尾随空格的点命令误认为多行 SQL 语句的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:3005
msgid ""
":gh:`132493`: Avoid accessing ``__annotations__`` unnecessarily in "
":func:`inspect.signature`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132493`: 在 :func:`inspect.signature` 中避免不必要地访问 ``__annotations__``。"

#: ../NEWS:3008
msgid ""
":gh:`132876`: ``ldexp()`` on Windows doesn't round subnormal results before "
"Windows 11, but should.  Python's :func:`math.ldexp` wrapper now does round "
"them, so results may change slightly, in rare cases of very small results, "
"on Windows versions before 11."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132876`: 在 Windows 11 之前，Windows 上的 ``ldexp()`` "
"不会对亚正规结果进行四舍五入，但应该这样做。Python 的 :func:`math.ldexp` 包装器现在会对它们进行四舍五入，因此在 "
"Windows 11 之前的版本上，极少数非常小的结果可能会略有变化。"

#: ../NEWS:3013
msgid ""
":gh:`133009`: :mod:`xml.etree.ElementTree`: Fix a crash in "
":meth:`Element.__deepcopy__ <object.__deepcopy__>` when the element is "
"concurrently mutated. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133009`: :mod:`xml.etree.ElementTree`: 修复当元素被并发修改时 "
":meth:`Element.__deepcopy__ <object.__deepcopy__>` 中的崩溃。补丁由 Bénédikt Tran "
"提供。"

#: ../NEWS:3017
msgid ""
":gh:`91555`: Ignore log messages generated during handling of log messages, "
"to avoid deadlock or infinite recursion. [NOTE: This change has since been "
"reverted.]"
msgstr ":gh:`91555`: 忽略在处理日志消息期间生成的日志消息，以避免死锁或无限递归。[注意：此更改已被撤销。]"

#: ../NEWS:3021
msgid ""
":gh:`125028`: :data:`functools.Placeholder` cannot be passed to "
":func:`functools.partial` as a keyword argument."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125028`: :data:`functools.Placeholder` 不能作为关键字参数传递给 "
":func:`functools.partial`。"

#: ../NEWS:3024
msgid ""
":gh:`62824`: Fix aliases for ``iso8859_8`` encoding. Patch by Dave "
"Goncalves."
msgstr ":gh:`62824`: 修复 ``iso8859_8`` 编码的别名。由 Dave Goncalves 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3026
msgid ""
":gh:`86155`: :meth:`html.parser.HTMLParser.close` no longer loses data when "
"the ``<script>`` tag is not closed. Patch by Waylan Limberg."
msgstr ""
":gh:`86155`: :meth:`html.parser.HTMLParser.close` 现在在 ``<script>`` "
"标签未关闭时不再丢失数据。由 Waylan Limberg 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3029
msgid ""
":gh:`69426`: Fix :class:`html.parser.HTMLParser` to not unescape character "
"entities in attribute values if they are followed by an ASCII alphanumeric "
"or an equals sign."
msgstr ""
":gh:`69426`: 修复 :class:`html.parser.HTMLParser` 不在属性值中取消转义字符实体，如果它们后面跟着 "
"ASCII 字母数字或等号。"

#: ../NEWS:3033
msgid ""
":issue:`28494`: Improve Zip file validation false positive rate in "
":func:`zipfile.is_zipfile`."
msgstr ":issue:`28494`: 在 :func:`zipfile.is_zipfile` 中改进 Zip 文件验证的假阳性率。"

#: ../NEWS:3036
msgid ""
":gh:`134381`: Fix :exc:`RuntimeError` when using a not-started "
":class:`threading.Thread` after calling :func:`os.fork`"
msgstr ""
":gh:`134381`: 修复在调用 :func:`os.fork` 后使用未启动的 :class:`threading.Thread` 时引发的 "
":exc:`RuntimeError`"

#: ../NEWS:3042
msgid ""
":gh:`127960`: PyREPL interactive shell no longer starts with ``__package__``"
" and ``__file__`` global names set to ``_pyrepl`` package internals. "
"Contributed by Yuichiro Tachibana."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127960`: PyREPL 交互式 shell 不再以设置为 `_pyrepl` 包内部的 `__package__` 和 "
"`__file__` 全局名称启动。由 Yuichiro Tachibana 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:3046
msgid ""
":gh:`130397`: Remove special-casing for C stack depth limits for WASI. Due "
"to WebAssembly's built-in stack protection this does not pose a security "
"concern."
msgstr ":gh:`130397`: 移除 WASI 的 C 栈深度限制的特殊处理。由于 WebAssembly 内置的栈保护，这不构成安全问题。"

#: ../NEWS:3050
msgid ""
":gh:`128066`: Fixes an edge case where PyREPL improperly threw an error when"
" Python is invoked on a read only filesystem while trying to write history "
"file entries."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128066`: 修复了一个边缘情况，当 Python 在只读文件系统上被调用并尝试写入历史文件条目时，PyREPL 错误地抛出错误。"

#: ../NEWS:3054
msgid ""
":gh:`69605`: When auto-completing an import in the :term:`REPL`, finding no "
"candidates now issues no suggestion, rather than suggestions from the "
"current namespace."
msgstr ""
":gh:`69605`: 在 :term:`REPL` 中自动补全导入时，现在如果没有找到候选，将不会发出建议，而不是从当前命名空间提出建议。"

#: ../NEWS:3058
msgid ""
":gh:`134158`: Fix coloring of double braces in f-strings and t-strings in "
"the :term:`REPL`."
msgstr ":gh:`134158`: 修复 :term:`REPL` 中 f-字符串和 t-字符串双大括号的着色问题。"

#: ../NEWS:3061
msgid ""
":gh:`134119`: Fix crash when calling :func:`next` on an exhausted template "
"string iterator. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`134119`: 修复在耗尽的模板字符串迭代器上调用 :func:`next` 时的崩溃问题。由 Jelle Zijlstra 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3064
msgid ""
":gh:`134100`: Fix a use-after-free bug that occurs when an imported module "
"isn't in :data:`sys.modules` after its initial import. Patch by Nico-Posada."
msgstr ""
":gh:`134100`: 修复了一个在导入的模块在初始导入后不在 :data:`sys.modules` 中时出现的释放后使用错误。由 Nico-"
"Posada 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3068
msgid ""
":gh:`133999`: Fix :exc:`SyntaxError` regression in :keyword:`except` parsing"
" after :gh:`123440`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133999`: 修复 :gh:`123440` 后 :keyword:`except` 解析中的 :exc:`SyntaxError` "
"回归。"

#: ../NEWS:3071
msgid ""
":gh:`133886`: Fix :func:`sys.remote_exec` for non-ASCII paths in non-UTF-8 "
"locales and non-UTF-8 paths in UTF-8 locales."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133886`: 修复 :func:`sys.remote_exec` 对于非 UTF-8 区域设置中的非 ASCII 路径和 UTF-8 "
"区域设置中的非 UTF-8 路径的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:3074
msgid ""
":gh:`133703`: Fix hashtable in dict can be bigger than intended in some "
"situations."
msgstr ":gh:`133703`: 修复字典中的哈希表在某些情况下可能比预期大的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:3077
msgid ""
":gh:`133778`: Fix bug where assigning to the :attr:`~type.__annotations__` "
"attributes of classes defined under ``from __future__ import annotations`` "
"had no effect."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133778`: 修复在 ``from __future__ import annotations`` 下定义的类的 "
":attr:`~type.__annotations__` 属性赋值无效的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:3081
msgid ""
":gh:`132762`: :meth:`~dict.fromkeys` no longer loops forever when adding a "
"small set of keys to a large base dict. Patch by Angela Liss."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132762`: :meth:`~dict.fromkeys` 在向一个大基础字典添加一小部分键时不再无限循环。补丁由 Angela Liss"
" 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:3084
msgid ""
":gh:`133541`: Inconsistent indentation in user input crashed the new REPL "
"when syntax highlighting was active. This is now fixed."
msgstr ":gh:`133541`: 当语法高亮激活时，用户输入中的不一致缩进导致的新 REPL 崩溃现已修复。"

#: ../NEWS:3087
msgid ""
":gh:`133516`: Raise :exc:`ValueError` when constants ``True``, ``False`` or "
"``None`` are used as an identifier after NFKC normalization."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133516`: 当常量 ``True``、``False`` 或 ``None`` 在 NFKC 规范化后被用作标识符时，引发 "
":exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../NEWS:3090
msgid ""
":gh:`132542`: Update :attr:`Thread.native_id <threading.Thread.native_id>` "
"after :manpage:`fork(2)` to ensure accuracy. Patch by Noam Cohen."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132542`: 在 :manpage:`fork(2)` 后更新 :attr:`Thread.native_id "
"<threading.Thread.native_id>` 以确保准确性。由 Noam Cohen 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3096
msgid ""
":gh:`134144`: Fix crash when calling :c:func:`Py_EndInterpreter` with a "
":term:`thread state` that isn't the initial thread for the interpreter."
msgstr ""
":gh:`134144`: 修复了当调用 :c:func:`Py_EndInterpreter` 时，如果 :term:`thread state` "
"不是解释器的初始线程时会崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:3102
msgid ""
":gh:`134455`: Fixed ``build-details.json`` generation to use the correct "
"``c_api.headers`` as defined in :pep:`739`, instead of ``c_api.include``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`134455`: 修复了 ``build-details.json`` 生成，以使用 :pep:`739` 中定义的正确的 "
"``c_api.headers``，而不是 ``c_api.include``。"

#: ../NEWS:3105
msgid ""
":gh:`131769`: Fix detecting when the build Python in a cross-build is a "
"pydebug build."
msgstr ":gh:`131769`: 修复了在交叉构建中检测构建的 Python 是否为 pydebug 构建的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:3108
msgid ""
":gh:`117088`: AIX linker don't support -h option, so avoid it through "
"platform check"
msgstr ":gh:`117088`: AIX 链接器不支持 -h 选项，因此通过平台检查避免使用它"

#: ../NEWS:3113
msgid "Python 3.14.0 beta 1"
msgstr "Python 3.14.0 beta 1"

#: ../NEWS:3115
msgid "*Release date: 2025-05-06*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2025-05-06*"

#: ../NEWS:3120
msgid ""
":gh:`132930`: Marks the installer for Windows as deprecated and updates "
"documentation to cover the new Python install manager."
msgstr ":gh:`132930`: 将 Windows 安装程序标记为已弃用，并更新文档以涵盖新的 Python 安装管理器。"

#: ../NEWS:3123
msgid ""
":gh:`127405`: Add ``ABIFLAGS`` to :func:`sysconfig.get_config_vars` on "
"Windows. Patch by Xuehai Pan."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127405`: 在 Windows 上向 :func:`sysconfig.get_config_vars` 添加 "
"``ABIFLAGS``。由 Xuehai Pan 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3129
msgid ""
":gh:`130453`: Allow passing multiple keyword arguments with the same "
"function name in :program:`pygettext`."
msgstr ":gh:`130453`: 允许在 :program:`pygettext` 中传递具有相同函数名称的多个关键字参数。"

#: ../NEWS:3132
msgid ""
":gh:`130195`: Add warning messages when :program:`pygettext` unimplemented "
"``-a/--extract-all`` option is called."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130195`: 当调用 :program:`pygettext` 未实现的 ``-a/--extract-all`` 选项时，添加警告消息。"

#: ../NEWS:3138
msgid ""
":gh:`133131`: The iOS testbed will now select the most recently released "
"\"SE-class\" device for testing if a device isn't explicitly specified."
msgstr ":gh:`133131`: 当未显式指定设备时 iOS testbed 现在将选择最近发布的 \"SE-class\" 设备用于测试。"

#: ../NEWS:3141
msgid ""
":gh:`91048`: Add ability to externally inspect all pending asyncio tasks, "
"even if no task is currently entered on the event loop."
msgstr ":gh:`91048`: 添加了外部检查所有待处理的 asyncio 任务的能力，即使当前事件循环中没有任务被输入。"

#: ../NEWS:3144
msgid ""
":gh:`109981`: The test helper that counts the list of open file descriptors "
"now uses the optimised ``/dev/fd`` approach on all Apple platforms, not just"
" macOS. This avoids crashes caused by guarded file descriptors."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109981`: 对打开的文件描述符进行计数的 test helper 现在会在所有 Apple 平台上使用已优化的 ``/dev/fd`` "
"方式，而不是仅在 macOS 上。 这将避免由受保护的文件描述符导致的程序崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:3148
msgid ""
":gh:`132678`: Add ``--prioritize`` to ``-m test``. This option allows the "
"user to specify which selected tests should execute first, even if the order"
" is otherwise randomized. This is particularly useful for tests that run the"
" longest."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132678`: 向 ``-m test`` 添加 "
"``--prioritize``。此选项允许用户指定哪些选定的测试应该首先执行，即使顺序是随机化的。这对于运行时间最长的测试特别有用。"

#: ../NEWS:3153
msgid ""
":gh:`131290`: Tests in :file:`Lib/test` can now be correctly executed as "
"standalone scripts."
msgstr ":gh:`131290`: :file:`Lib/test` 中的测试现在可以正确地作为独立脚本执行。"

#: ../NEWS:3159
msgid ""
":gh:`115322`: The underlying extension modules behind :mod:`readline`:, "
":mod:`subprocess`, and :mod:`ctypes` now raise audit events on previously "
"uncovered code paths that could lead to file system access related to C "
"function calling and external binary execution.  The "
"``ctypes.call_function`` audit hook has also been fixed to use an unsigned "
"value for its ``function pointer``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115322`: :mod:`readline`、:mod:`subprocess` 和 :mod:`ctypes` "
"背后的底层扩展模块现在会在之前未覆盖的代码路径上引发审计事件，这些路径可能导致与 C "
"函数调用和外部二进制执行相关的文件系统访问。``ctypes.call_function`` 审计钩子也已修复，以使用无符号值作为其 "
"``function pointer``。"

#: ../NEWS:3169
msgid ":gh:`133490`: Add color support to PDB in remote mode."
msgstr ":gh:`133490`: 向远程模式下的 PDB 添加颜色支持。"

#: ../NEWS:3171
msgid ""
":gh:`132493`: Avoid eagerly evaluating annotations in functions decorated "
"with :func:`reprlib.recursive_repr`."
msgstr ":gh:`132493`: 避免在装饰有 :func:`reprlib.recursive_repr` 的函数中急切地评估注解。"

#: ../NEWS:3174
msgid ""
":gh:`130645`: Add color to stdlib argparse CLIs. Patch by Hugo van Kemenade."
msgstr ":gh:`130645`: 为标准库 argparse 的 CLI 添加颜色支持。由 Hugo van Kemenade 提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3176
msgid ""
":gh:`119180`: Make :func:`annotationlib.get_annotations` succeed with the "
"``FORWARDREF`` format if evaluating the annotations throws an exception "
"other than :exc:`NameError` or :exc:`AttributeError`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119180`: 使 :func:`annotationlib.get_annotations` 在评估注解抛出除 "
":exc:`NameError` 或 :exc:`AttributeError` 之外的异常时，仍能成功使用 ``FORWARDREF`` 格式。"

#: ../NEWS:3180
msgid ""
":gh:`133351`: Fix remote PDB to correctly request tab completions for Python"
" expressions from the server when completing a continuation line of a multi-"
"line Python block."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133351`: 修复远程 PDB，使其在完成多行 Python 块的延续行时，能正确从服务器请求 Python 表达式的标签补全。"

#: ../NEWS:3184
msgid ""
":gh:`133367`: Add the ``--feature-version``, ``--optimize``, and ``--show-"
"empty`` options to the :mod:`ast` command-line interface. Patch by Semyon "
"Moroz."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133367`: 向 :mod:`ast` 命令行界面添加 ``--feature-version``、``--optimize`` 和 "
"``--show-empty`` 选项。由 Semyon Moroz 提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3188
msgid ""
":gh:`133363`: The :class:`cmd.Cmd` class has been fixed to reliably call the"
" ``completedefault`` method whenever the ``do_shell`` method is not defined "
"and tab completion is requested for a line beginning with ``!``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133363`: 修复 :class:`cmd.Cmd` 类，确保在未定义 ``do_shell`` 方法且请求对以 ``!`` "
"开头的行进行标签补全时，可靠地调用 ``completedefault`` 方法。"

#: ../NEWS:3192
msgid ":gh:`113081`: Highlight syntax on source code in :mod:`pdb`."
msgstr ":gh:`113081`: 在 :mod:`pdb` 中高亮显示源代码语法。"

#: ../NEWS:3194
msgid ":gh:`133349`: Introduced auto-indent in :mod:`pdb` multi-line input."
msgstr ":gh:`133349`: 在 :mod:`pdb` 的多行输入中引入自动缩进。"

#: ../NEWS:3196
msgid ""
":gh:`133306`: Use ``\\z`` instead of ``\\Z`` in :func:`fnmatch.translate` "
"and :func:`glob.translate`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133306`: 在 :func:`fnmatch.translate` 和 :func:`glob.translate` 中使用 "
"``\\z`` 替代 ``\\Z``。"

#: ../NEWS:3199
msgid ""
":gh:`133306`: Support ``\\z`` as a synonym for ``\\Z`` in :mod:`regular "
"expressions <re>`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133306`: 在 :mod:`regular expressions <re>` 中支持 ``\\z`` 作为 ``\\Z`` 的同义词。"

#: ../NEWS:3202
msgid ""
":gh:`133300`: Make :class:`argparse.ArgumentParser`'s ``suggest_on_error`` a"
" keyword-only parameter. Patch by Hugo van Kemenade."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133300`: 使 :class:`argparse.ArgumentParser` 的 ``suggest_on_error`` "
"成为仅关键字参数。由 Hugo van Kemenade 提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3205
msgid ""
":gh:`133290`: Fix attribute caching issue when setting "
":attr:`ctypes._Pointer._type_` in the undocumented and deprecated "
":func:`!ctypes.SetPointerType` function and the undocumented "
":meth:`!set_type` method."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133290`: 修复在未记录且已弃用的 :func:`!ctypes.SetPointerType` 函数和未记录的 "
":meth:`!set_type` 方法中设置 :attr:`ctypes._Pointer._type_` 时的属性缓存问题。"

#: ../NEWS:3210
msgid ""
":gh:`133223`: When PDB is attached to a remote process, do a better job of "
"intercepting Ctrl+C and forwarding it to the remote process."
msgstr ":gh:`133223`: 当 PDB 附加到远程进程时，更好地拦截 Ctrl+C 并将其转发到远程进程。"

#: ../NEWS:3213
msgid ""
":gh:`133153`: Do not complete :mod:`pdb` commands in ``interact`` mode of "
":mod:`pdb`."
msgstr ":gh:`133153`: 在 :mod:`pdb` 的 ``interact`` 模式下不补全 :mod:`pdb` 命令。"

#: ../NEWS:3216
msgid ""
":gh:`133139`: Add the :func:`curses.assume_default_colors` function, a "
"refinement of the :func:`curses.use_default_colors` function which allows to"
" change the color pair ``0``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133139`: 添加 :func:`curses.assume_default_colors` 函数，这是 "
":func:`curses.use_default_colors` 函数的改进版，允许更改颜色对 ``0``。"

#: ../NEWS:3220
msgid ""
":gh:`133089`: Use original timeout value for "
":exc:`subprocess.TimeoutExpired` when the func :meth:`subprocess.run` is "
"called with a timeout instead of sometimes a confusing partial remaining "
"time out value used internally on the final ``wait()``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133089`: 当调用 :meth:`subprocess.run` 函数时使用原始超时值处理 "
":exc:`subprocess.TimeoutExpired`，而不是在内部的最后 ``wait()`` 中使用有时令人困惑的部分剩余超时值。"

#: ../NEWS:3225
msgid ""
":gh:`133036`: :func:`codecs.open` is now deprecated. Use :func:`open` "
"instead. Contributed by Inada Naoki."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133036`: :func:`codecs.open` 现已弃用。请改用 :func:`open`。由 Inada Naoki 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:3228
msgid ""
":gh:`132987`: Many builtin and extension functions which accept an unsigned "
"integer argument, now use :meth:`~object.__index__` if available."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132987`: 许多接受无符号整数参数的内建和扩展函数现在如果可用的话会使用 :meth:`~object.__index__`。"

#: ../NEWS:3231
msgid ""
":gh:`124703`: Set return code to ``1`` when aborting process from "
":mod:`pdb`."
msgstr ":gh:`124703`: 当从 :mod:`pdb` 终止进程时，将返回码设置为 ``1``。"

#: ../NEWS:3233
msgid ""
":gh:`133005`: Support passing ``preset`` option to :func:`tarfile.open` when"
" using ``'w|xz'`` mode."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133005`: 在使用 ``'w|xz'`` 模式时支持向 :func:`tarfile.open` 传递 ``preset`` 选项。"

#: ../NEWS:3236
msgid ""
":gh:`115032`: Support for custom logging handlers with the *strm* argument "
"is deprecated and scheduled for removal in Python 3.16. Define handlers with"
" the *stream* argument instead. Patch by Mariusz Felisiak."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115032`: 支持使用 *strm* 参数的自定义日志处理程序已被弃用，并计划在 Python 3.16 中移除。请改用 *stream*"
" 参数定义处理程序。由 Mariusz Felisiak 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3240
msgid ""
":gh:`132991`: Add :data:`!socket.IP_FREEBIND` constant on Linux 2.4 and "
"later."
msgstr ":gh:`132991`: 在 Linux 2.4 及更高版本上添加 :data:`!socket.IP_FREEBIND` 常量。"

#: ../NEWS:3243
msgid ""
":gh:`132995`: Bump the version of pip bundled in ensurepip to version 25.1.1"
msgstr ":gh:`132995`: 将 ensurepip 内置的 pip 版本升级至 25.1.1 版本"

#: ../NEWS:3245
msgid ""
":gh:`132933`: The zipapp module now applies the filter when creating the "
"list of files to add, rather than waiting until the file is being added to "
"the archive."
msgstr ":gh:`132933`: zipapp模块现在在创建要添加的文件列表时应用过滤器，而不是等到文件被添加到存档时。"

#: ../NEWS:3249
msgid ""
":gh:`121249`: Always support the :c:expr:`float complex` and :c:expr:`double"
" complex` C types in the :mod:`struct` module.  Patch by Sergey B Kirpichev."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121249`: 总是在 :mod:`struct` 模块中支持 :c:expr:`float complex` 和 "
":c:expr:`double complex` C 类型。由 Sergey B Kirpichev 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3253
msgid ""
":gh:`132915`: :func:`fcntl.fcntl` and :func:`fcntl.ioctl` can now detect a "
"buffer overflow and raise :exc:`SystemError`. The stack and memory can be "
"corrupted in such case, so treat this error as fatal."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132915`: :func:`fcntl.fcntl` 和 :func:`fcntl.ioctl` 现在可以检测缓冲区溢出并引发 "
":exc:`SystemError`。在这种情况下，堆栈和内存可能会被破坏，因此将此错误视为致命错误。"

#: ../NEWS:3257
msgid ""
":gh:`132017`: Fix error when ``pyrepl`` is suspended, then resumed and "
"terminated."
msgstr ":gh:`132017`: 修复了当 ``pyrepl`` 被挂起、然后恢复并终止时的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:3260
msgid ""
":gh:`132893`: Improved :meth:`statistics.NormalDist.cdf` accuracy for inputs"
" smaller than the mean."
msgstr ":gh:`132893`: 提高了 :meth:`statistics.NormalDist.cdf` 对于小于均值的输入的准确性。"

#: ../NEWS:3263
msgid ""
":gh:`130328`: Speedup pasting in ``PyREPL`` on Windows. Fix by Chris Eibl."
msgstr ":gh:`130328`: 在Windows上加速 ``PyREPL`` 中的粘贴。由 Chris Eibl 修复。"

#: ../NEWS:3265
msgid ""
":gh:`132882`: Fix copying of :class:`typing.Union` objects containing "
"objects that do not support the ``|`` operator."
msgstr ":gh:`132882`: 修复了包含不支持 ``|`` 运算符的对象的 :class:`typing.Union` 对象的复制问题。"

#: ../NEWS:3268
msgid ""
":gh:`93696`: Fixed the breakpoint display error for frozen modules in "
":mod:`pdb`."
msgstr ":gh:`93696`: 修复了 :mod:`pdb` 中冻结模块的断点显示错误。"

#: ../NEWS:3271
msgid ""
":gh:`129965`: Add MIME types for ``.7z``, ``.apk``, ``.deb``, ``.glb``, "
"``.gltf``, ``.gz``, ``.m4v``, ``.php``, ``.rar``, ``.rpm``, ``.stl`` and "
"``.wmv``. Patch by Hugo van Kemenade."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129965`: 为 "
"``.7z``、``.apk``、``.deb``、``.glb``、``.gltf``、``.gz``、``.m4v``、``.php``、``.rar``、``.rpm``、``.stl``"
" 和 ``.wmv`` 添加 MIME 类型。由 Hugo van Kemenade 提交补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3275
msgid ""
":gh:`132742`: :func:`fcntl.fcntl` now supports arbitrary :term:`bytes-like "
"objects <bytes-like object>`, not only :class:`bytes`. :func:`fcntl.ioctl` "
"now automatically retries system calls failing with EINTR and releases the "
"GIL during a system call even for large bytes-like object."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132742`: :func:`fcntl.fcntl` 现在支持任意的字节类对象 <bytes-like object>`，而不仅仅是 "
":class:`bytes`。:func:`fcntl.ioctl` 现在会自动重试因 EINTR 失败的系统调用，并在系统调用期间释放 "
"GIL，即使对于大的字节类对象也是如此。"

#: ../NEWS:3280
msgid ""
":gh:`132451`: The CLI for the PDB debugger now accepts a ``-p PID`` argument"
" to allow attaching to a running process. The process must be running the "
"same version of Python as the one running PDB."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132451`: PDB 调试器的 CLI 现在接受 ``-p PID`` 参数，以允许附加到正在运行的进程。该进程必须运行与运行 PDB 的"
" Python 相同的版本。"

#: ../NEWS:3284
msgid ""
":gh:`125618`: Add a *format* parameter to "
":meth:`annotationlib.ForwardRef.evaluate`. Evaluating annotations in the "
"``FORWARDREF`` format now succeeds in more cases that would previously have "
"raised an exception."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125618`: 向 :meth:`annotationlib.ForwardRef.evaluate` 添加了一个 *format* "
"参数。现在在更多情况下以 ``FORWARDREF`` 格式评估注释会成功，而以前这些情况会引发异常。"

#: ../NEWS:3289
msgid ""
":gh:`132805`: Fix incorrect handling of nested non-constant values in the "
"FORWARDREF format in :mod:`annotationlib`."
msgstr ":gh:`132805`: 修复了 :mod:`annotationlib` 中 FORWARDREF 格式中嵌套非常量值的错误处理。"

#: ../NEWS:3292
msgid ":gh:`132734`: Add new constants for Bluetooth :mod:`sockets <socket>`."
msgstr ":gh:`132734`: 为蓝牙 :mod:`sockets <socket>` 添加了新常量。"

#: ../NEWS:3294
msgid ""
":gh:`132673`: Fix :exc:`AssertionError` raised on :class:`ctypes.Structure` "
"with ``_align_ = 0`` and ``_fields_ = []``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132673`: 修复了在 :class:`ctypes.Structure` 中 ``_align_ = 0`` 和 ``_fields_ "
"= []`` 时引发的 :exc:`AssertionError`。"

#: ../NEWS:3297
msgid ""
":gh:`132578`: Rename the ``threading.Thread._handle`` field to avoid "
"shadowing methods defined on subclasses of ``threading.Thread``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132578`: 重命名 ``threading.Thread._handle`` 字段以避免遮蔽 ``threading.Thread`` "
"子类上定义的方法。"

#: ../NEWS:3300
msgid ""
":gh:`132561`: Fix the public ``locked`` method of "
"``multiprocessing.SemLock`` class. Also adding 2 tests for the derivated "
":class:`multiprocessing.Lock` and :class:`multiprocessing.RLock` classes."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132561`: 修复了 ``multiprocessing.SemLock`` 类的公共 ``locked`` 方法。还为派生类 "
":class:`multiprocessing.Lock` 和 :class:`multiprocessing.RLock` 添加了 2 个测试。"

#: ../NEWS:3304
msgid ""
":gh:`121468`: Add :func:`pdb.set_trace_async` function to support "
":keyword:`await` statements in :mod:`pdb`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121468`: 添加 :func:`pdb.set_trace_async` 函数以支持 :mod:`pdb` 中的 "
":keyword:`await` 语句。"

#: ../NEWS:3307
msgid ""
":gh:`132493`: :class:`typing.Protocol` now uses "
":func:`annotationlib.get_annotations` when checking whether or not an "
"instance implements the protocol with :func:`isinstance`. This enables "
"support for ``isinstance`` checks against classes with deferred annotations."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132493`: :class:`typing.Protocol` 现在在检查实例是否通过 :func:`isinstance` "
"实现协议时使用 :func:`annotationlib.get_annotations`。这支持了对具有延迟注释的类进行 ``isinstance``"
" 检查。"

#: ../NEWS:3313
msgid ""
":gh:`132536`: Do not disable :monitoring-event:`PY_THROW` event in "
":mod:`bdb` because it can't be disabled."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132536`: 不要在 :mod:`bdb` 中禁用 :monitoring-event:`PY_THROW` 事件，因为它不能被禁用。"

#: ../NEWS:3316
msgid ""
":gh:`132527`: Include the valid typecode 'w' in the error message when an "
"invalid typecode is passed to :class:`array.array`."
msgstr ":gh:`132527`: 当有无效的类型码被传给 :class:`array.array` 时将在错误消息中包括有效的类型码 'w'。"

#: ../NEWS:3319
msgid ""
":gh:`132099`: The Bluetooth socket with the :data:`~socket.BTPROTO_HCI` "
"protocol on Linux now accepts an address in the format of an integer "
"``device_id``, not only a tuple  ``(device_id,)``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132099`: 在Linux上，使用 :data:`~socket.BTPROTO_HCI` 协议的蓝牙套接字现在接受整数格式的 "
"``device_id`` 地址，而不仅仅是元组 ``(device_id,)``。"

#: ../NEWS:3323
msgid ""
":gh:`81793`: Fix :func:`os.link` on platforms (like Linux) where the system "
":c:func:`!link` function does not follow symlinks. On Linux, it now follows "
"symlinks by default or if ``follow_symlinks=True`` is specified. On Windows,"
" it now raises an error if ``follow_symlinks=True`` is passed. On macOS, it "
"now raises an error if ``follow_symlinks=False`` is passed and the system "
":c:func:`!linkat` function is not available at runtime."
msgstr ""
":gh:`81793`: 修复 :func:`os.link` 在像Linux这样的平台上，系统的 :c:func:`!link` "
"函数不遵循符号链接的问题。在Linux上，现在默认遵循符号链接，或者在指定 ``follow_symlinks=True`` "
"时遵循。在Windows上，现在如果传入 ``follow_symlinks=True`` 则会引发错误。在macOS上，现在如果传入 "
"``follow_symlinks=False`` 并且系统的 :c:func:`!linkat` 函数在运行时不可用，则会引发错误。"

#: ../NEWS:3330
msgid ""
":gh:`132493`: Support creation of :class:`typing.Protocol` classes with "
"annotations that cannot be resolved at class creation time."
msgstr ":gh:`132493`: 支持创建 :class:`typing.Protocol` 类，这些类带有在类创建时无法解析的注解。"

#: ../NEWS:3333
msgid ""
":gh:`132491`: Rename ``annotationlib.value_to_string`` to "
":func:`annotationlib.type_repr` and provide better handling for function "
"objects."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132491`: 将 ``annotationlib.value_to_string`` 重命名为 "
":func:`annotationlib.type_repr` 并提供对函数对象的更好处理。"

#: ../NEWS:3337
msgid ""
":gh:`132426`: Add :func:`annotationlib.get_annotate_from_class_namespace` as"
" a helper for accessing annotations in metaclasses, and remove "
"``annotationlib.get_annotate_function``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132426`: 添加 :func:`annotationlib.get_annotate_from_class_namespace` "
"作为访问元类中注解的助手，并移除 ``annotationlib.get_annotate_function``。"

#: ../NEWS:3341
msgid ""
":gh:`70145`: Add support for channels in Bluetooth HCI protocol "
"(:const:`~socket.BTPROTO_HCI`)."
msgstr ":gh:`70145`: 在蓝牙HCI协议 (:const:`~socket.BTPROTO_HCI`) 中添加对通道的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:3344
msgid ""
":gh:`131913`: Add a shortcut function "
":func:`multiprocessing.Process.interrupt` alongside the existing "
":func:`multiprocessing.Process.terminate` and "
":func:`multiprocessing.Process.kill` for an improved control over child "
"process termination."
msgstr ""
":gh:`131913`: 添加一个快捷函数 :func:`multiprocessing.Process.interrupt`，与现有的 "
":func:`multiprocessing.Process.terminate` 和 "
":func:`multiprocessing.Process.kill` 一起，用于改进对子进程终止的控制。"

#: ../NEWS:3350
msgid ""
":gh:`132439`: Fix ``PyREPL`` on Windows: characters entered via AltGr are "
"swallowed. Patch by Chris Eibl."
msgstr ":gh:`132439`: 修复Windows上的 ``PyREPL``：通过AltGr输入的字符被吞掉。补丁由Chris Eibl提供。"

#: ../NEWS:3353
msgid ""
":gh:`132429`: Fix support of Bluetooth sockets on NetBSD and DragonFly BSD. "
"Add support for *cid* and *bdaddr_type* in the BTPROTO_L2CAP address on "
"FreeBSD. Return *cid* in ``getsockname()`` for BTPROTO_L2CAP if it is not "
"zero."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132429`: 修复NetBSD和DragonFly BSD上蓝牙套接字的支持。在FreeBSD上为BTPROTO_L2CAP地址添加对 "
"*cid* 和 *bdaddr_type* 的支持。如果 *cid* 不为零，则在BTPROTO_L2CAP的 ``getsockname()`` "
"中返回 *cid*。"

#: ../NEWS:3358
msgid ""
":gh:`132106`: :meth:`QueueListener.start "
"<logging.handlers.QueueListener.start>` now raises a :exc:`RuntimeError` if "
"the listener is already started."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132106`: 现在当监听器已启动时 :meth:`QueueListener.start "
"<logging.handlers.QueueListener.start>` 将会引发 :exc:`RuntimeError`。"

#: ../NEWS:3362
msgid ""
":gh:`132417`: Fix a ``NULL`` pointer dereference when a C function called "
"using :mod:`ctypes` with ``restype`` :class:`~ctypes.py_object` returns "
"``NULL``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132417`: 修复了当使用 :mod:`ctypes` 调用 C 函数且 ``restype`` "
":class:`~ctypes.py_object` 返回 ``NULL`` 时的 ``NULL`` 指针解引用问题。"

#: ../NEWS:3366
msgid ""
":gh:`132385`: Fix instance error suggestions trigger potential exceptions in"
" :meth:`object.__getattr__` in :mod:`traceback`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132385`: 修复 :mod:`traceback` 中实例错误提示触发 :meth:`object.__getattr__` "
"内的潜在异常问题。"

#: ../NEWS:3369
msgid ""
":gh:`125866`: Add optional *add_scheme* argument to "
":func:`urllib.request.pathname2url`; when set to true, a complete URL is "
"returned. Likewise add optional *require_scheme* argument to "
":func:`~urllib.request.url2pathname`; when set to true, a complete URL is "
"accepted."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125866`: 向 :func:`urllib.request.pathname2url` 添加可选的 *add_scheme* "
"参数；当设置为 true 时，返回完整的 URL。同样向 :func:`~urllib.request.url2pathname` 添加可选的 "
"*require_scheme* 参数；当设置为 true 时，接受完整的 URL。"

#: ../NEWS:3375
msgid ""
":gh:`132308`: A :class:`traceback.TracebackException` now correctly renders "
"the ``__context__`` and ``__cause__`` attributes from :ref:`falsey <truth>` "
":class:`Exception`, and the ``exceptions`` attribute from falsey "
":class:`ExceptionGroup`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132308`: 现在 :class:`traceback.TracebackException` 将正确地渲染来自 :ref:`falsey"
" <truth>` 的 :class:`Exception` 的 ``__context__`` 和 ``__cause__`` "
"属性，以及来自具有假值的 :class:`ExceptionGroup` 的 ``exceptions`` 属性。"

#: ../NEWS:3380
msgid ""
":gh:`130645`: Add colour to :mod:`argparse` help output. Patch by Hugo van "
"Kemenade."
msgstr ":gh:`130645`: 向 :mod:`argparse` 帮助输出添加颜色。由 Hugo van Kemenade 提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3383
msgid ""
":gh:`127495`: In PyREPL, append a new entry to the ``PYTHON_HISTORY`` file "
"*after* every statement.  This should preserve command-line history after "
"interpreter is terminated.  Patch by Sergey B Kirpichev."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127495`: 在 PyREPL 中，每次语句执行后向 ``PYTHON_HISTORY`` "
"文件追加一个新条目。这应该在解释器终止后保留命令行历史。由 Sergey B Kirpichev 提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3387
msgid ""
":gh:`129463`: Comparison of :class:`annotationlib.ForwardRef` objects no "
"longer uses the internal ``__code__`` and ``__ast_node__`` attributes, which"
" are used as caches."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129463`: :class:`annotationlib.ForwardRef` 对象的比较不再使用内部的 ``__code__`` 和 "
"``__ast_node__`` 属性，这些属性被用作缓存。"

#: ../NEWS:3391
msgid ""
":gh:`132250`: Fixed the :exc:`SystemError` in :mod:`cProfile` when locating "
"the actual C function of a method raises an exception."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132250`: 修复了 :mod:`cProfile` 中当定位一个方法对应的具体  C 函数时引发异常的所使用的 "
":exc:`SystemError` 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:3394
msgid ""
":gh:`132064`: :func:`annotationlib.get_annotations` now uses the "
"``__annotate__`` attribute if it is present, even if ``__annotations__`` is "
"not present. Additionally, the function now raises a :py:exc:`TypeError` if "
"it is passed an object that does not have any annotatins."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132064`: :func:`annotationlib.get_annotations` 现在如果存在 ``__annotate__`` "
"属性则使用它，即使 ``__annotations__`` 不存在。此外，如果传递给函数的对象没有任何注释，函数现在会引发 "
":py:exc:`TypeError`。"

#: ../NEWS:3400
msgid ""
":gh:`130664`: Support the ``'_'`` digit separator in formatting of the "
"integral part of :class:`~decimal.Decimal`'s.  Patch by Sergey B Kirpichev."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130664`: 支持在 :class:`~decimal.Decimal` 的整数部分格式化中使用 ``'_'`` 数字分隔符。由 "
"Sergey B Kirpichev 提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3404
msgid ""
":gh:`131952`: Add color output to the :program:`json` CLI. Patch by Tomas "
"Roun."
msgstr ":gh:`131952`: 向 :program:`json` CLI 添加颜色输出。由 Tomas Roun 提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3407
msgid ""
":gh:`132063`: Prevent exceptions that evaluate as falsey (namely, when their"
" ``__bool__`` method returns ``False`` or their ``__len__`` method returns "
"0) from being ignored by :class:`concurrent.futures.ProcessPoolExecutor` and"
" :class:`concurrent.futures.ThreadPoolExecutor`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132063`: 避免求值为假的异常 (比如，当其 ``__bool__`` 方法返回 ``False`` 或其 ``__len__`` "
"方法返回 0）被 :class:`concurrent.futures.ProcessPoolExecutor` 和 "
":class:`concurrent.futures.ThreadPoolExecutor` 忽略。"

#: ../NEWS:3412
msgid ""
":gh:`132106`: :class:`logging.handlers.QueueListener` now implements the "
"context manager protocol, allowing it to be used in a :keyword:`with` "
"statement."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132106`: :class:`logging.handlers.QueueListener` 现在实现了上下文管理器协议，允许在 "
":keyword:`with` 语句中使用它。"

#: ../NEWS:3416
msgid ""
":gh:`132054`: The ``application/yaml`` mime type (:rfc:`9512`) is now "
"supported by :mod:`mimetypes`. Patch by Sasha \"Nelie\" Chernykh and Hugo "
"van Kemenade."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132054`: :mod:`mimetypes` 现在支持 ``application/yaml`` mime 类型 "
"(:rfc:`9512`)。由 Sasha \"Nelie\" Chernykh 和 Hugo van Kemenade 提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3420
msgid ""
":gh:`119605`: Respect ``follow_wrapped`` for :meth:`!__init__` and "
":meth:`!__new__` methods when getting the class signature for a class with "
":func:`inspect.signature`. Preserve class signature after wrapping with "
":func:`warnings.deprecated`. Patch by Xuehai Pan."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119605`: 当获取具有 :func:`inspect.signature` 的类的类签名时将遵循 :meth:`!__init__` 和"
" :meth:`!__new__` 方法的 ``follow_wrapped``。 在使用 :func:`warnings.deprecated` "
"进行包装之后将保持类签名不变。 由 Xuehai Pan 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3425
msgid ""
":gh:`118761`: Improve import times by up to 33x for the :mod:`shlex` module,"
" and improve the performance of :func:`shlex.quote` by up to 12x. Patch by "
"Adam Turner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118761`: 将 :mod:`shlex` 模块的导入时间提高多达 33 倍，并将 :func:`shlex.quote` 的性能提高多达"
" 12 倍。由 Adam Turner 提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3429
msgid ""
":gh:`85302`: Add support for :data:`~socket.BTPROTO_SCO` in sockets on "
"FreeBSD."
msgstr ":gh:`85302`: 在 FreeBSD 上的套接字中添加对 :data:`~socket.BTPROTO_SCO` 的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:3432
msgid ""
":gh:`131757`: Make :func:`functools.lru_cache` call the cached function "
"unlocked to allow concurrency."
msgstr ":gh:`131757`: 使 :func:`functools.lru_cache` 在未锁定的状态下调用缓存函数以允许并发。"

#: ../NEWS:3435
msgid ""
":gh:`131423`: :mod:`ssl` can show descriptions for errors added in OpenSSL "
"3.4.1. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`131423`: :mod:`ssl` 可以显示 OpenSSL 3.4.1 中添加的错误描述。由 Bénédikt Tran 提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3438
msgid ""
":gh:`131434`: Improve error reporting for incorrect format in "
":func:`time.strptime`."
msgstr ":gh:`131434`: 改进了针对 :func:`time.strptime` 中不正确格式的错误报告。"

#: ../NEWS:3441
msgid ""
":gh:`131524`: Add help message to :mod:`platform` command-line interface. "
"Contributed by Harry Lees."
msgstr ":gh:`131524`: 为 :mod:`platform` 命令行界面添加帮助信息。由 Harry Lees 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:3444
msgid ""
":gh:`100926`: Move :func:`ctypes.POINTER` types cache from a global internal"
" cache (``_pointer_type_cache``) to the "
":attr:`ctypes._CData.__pointer_type__` attribute of the corresponding "
":mod:`ctypes` types. This will stop the cache from growing without limits in"
" some situations."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100926`: 将 :func:`ctypes.POINTER` "
"类型的缓存从全局内部缓存（``_pointer_type_cache``）移动到相应 :mod:`ctypes` 类型的 "
":attr:`ctypes._CData.__pointer_type__` 属性中。这将阻止缓存在某些情况下无限增长。"

#: ../NEWS:3450
msgid ""
":gh:`85702`: If ``zoneinfo._common.load_tzdata`` is given a package without "
"a resource a ``ZoneInfoNotFoundError`` is raised rather than a "
":exc:`IsADirectoryError`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`85702`: 如果 ``zoneinfo._common.load_tzdata`` 被给予一个没有资源的包，会抛出 "
"``ZoneInfoNotFoundError`` 而不是 :exc:`IsADirectoryError`。"

#: ../NEWS:3454
msgid ""
":gh:`123471`: Make concurrent iterations over :class:`itertools.repeat` safe"
" under free-threading."
msgstr ":gh:`123471`: 使得 :class:`itertools.repeat` 的并发迭代在自由线程下安全。"

#: ../NEWS:3457
msgid ":gh:`131127`: Systems using LibreSSL now successfully build."
msgstr ":gh:`131127`: 使用 LibreSSL 的系统现在将能成功地构建。"

#: ../NEWS:3459
msgid ""
":gh:`89157`: Make the pure Python implementation of "
":func:`datetime.date.fromisoformat`, only accept ASCII strings for "
"consistency with the C implementation."
msgstr ""
":gh:`89157`: 使得 :func:`datetime.date.fromisoformat` 的纯 Python 实现仅接受 ASCII "
"字符串，以与 C 实现保持一致。"

#: ../NEWS:3463
msgid ""
":gh:`130941`: Fix :class:`configparser.ConfigParser` parsing empty "
"interpolation with ``allow_no_value`` set to ``True``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130941`: 修复了当 ``allow_no_value`` 设为 ``True`` 时 "
":class:`configparser.ConfigParser` 解析空插值的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:3466
msgid ""
":gh:`110067`: Make :mod:`heapq` max-heap functions "
":func:`heapq.heapify_max`, :func:`heapq.heappush_max`, "
":func:`heapq.heappop_max`, and :func:`heapq.heapreplace_max` public. "
"Previous underscored naming is kept for backwards compatibility. "
"Additionally, the missing function :func:`heapq.heappushpop_max` has been "
"added to both the C and Python implementations."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110067`: 将 :mod:`heapq` 的最大堆函数 :func:`heapq.heapify_max`, "
":func:`heapq.heappush_max`, :func:`heapq.heappop_max`, 和 "
":func:`heapq.heapreplace_max` 公开。之前的带下划线命名为了向后兼容而保留。此外，缺失的函数 "
":func:`heapq.heappushpop_max` 已添加到 C 和 Python 实现中。"

#: ../NEWS:3473
msgid ""
":gh:`129098`: Fix REPL traceback reporting when using :func:`compile` with "
"an inexisting file. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129098`: 修复当对不存在的文件使用 :func:`compile` 时的 REPL 回溯报告。 由 Bénédikt Tran "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3476
msgid ""
":gh:`130631`: :func:`!http.cookiejar.join_header_words` is now more similar "
"to the original Perl version. It now quotes the same set of characters and "
"always quote values that end with ``\"\\n\"``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130631`: 现在 :func:`!http.cookiejar.join_header_words` 将更类似于原始的 Perl 版本。"
" 它现在会为相同的字符集加引号并且总是会为以 ``\"\\n\"`` 结尾的值加引号。"

#: ../NEWS:3480
msgid ""
":gh:`130482`: Add ability to specify name for :class:`!tkinter.OptionMenu` "
"and :class:`!tkinter.ttk.OptionMenu`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130482`: 添加为 :class:`!tkinter.OptionMenu` 和 "
":class:`!tkinter.ttk.OptionMenu` 指定名称的能力。"

#: ../NEWS:3483
msgid ""
":gh:`77065`: Add keyword-only optional argument *echo_char* for "
":meth:`getpass.getpass` for optional visual keyboard feedback support. Patch"
" by Semyon Moroz."
msgstr ""
":gh:`77065`: 为 :meth:`getpass.getpass` 添加仅关键字可选参数 *echo_char*，以支持可选的视觉键盘反馈。由"
" Semyon Moroz 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3487
msgid ""
":gh:`130317`: Fix :c:func:`PyFloat_Pack2` and :c:func:`PyFloat_Unpack2` for "
"NaN's with payload.  This corrects round-trip for :func:`struct.unpack` and "
":func:`struct.pack` in case of the IEEE 754 binary16 \"half precision\" "
"type. Patch by Sergey B Kirpichev."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130317`: 修复 :c:func:`PyFloat_Pack2` 和 :c:func:`PyFloat_Unpack2` 对于带有负载的"
" NaN 的处理。这纠正了在 IEEE 754 binary16 \"半精度\" 类型情况下 :func:`struct.unpack` 和 "
":func:`struct.pack` 的往返。由 Sergey B Kirpichev 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3492
msgid ""
":gh:`130402`: Joining running daemon threads during interpreter shutdown now"
" raises :exc:`PythonFinalizationError`."
msgstr ":gh:`130402`: 在解释器关闭期间加入运行的守护线程现在会抛出 :exc:`PythonFinalizationError`。"

#: ../NEWS:3495
msgid ""
":gh:`130167`: Improve speed of :func:`difflib.IS_LINE_JUNK`. Patch by Semyon"
" Moroz."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130167`: 提高 :func:`difflib.IS_LINE_JUNK` 的速度。由 Semyon Moroz 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3498
msgid ""
":gh:`101410`: Added more detailed messages for domain errors in the "
":mod:`math` module."
msgstr ":gh:`101410`: 为 :mod:`math` 模块中的域错误添加了更详细的消息。"

#: ../NEWS:3501
msgid ""
":gh:`128384`: Make :class:`warnings.catch_warnings` use a context variable "
"for holding the warning filtering state if the "
":data:`sys.flags.context_aware_warnings` flag is set to true.  This makes "
"using the context manager thread-safe in multi-threaded programs.  The flag "
"is true by default in free-threaded builds and is otherwise false. The value"
" of the flag can be overridden by the the :option:`-X context_aware_warnings"
" <-X>` command-line option or by the :envvar:`PYTHON_CONTEXT_AWARE_WARNINGS`"
" environment variable."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128384`: 如果 :data:`sys.flags.context_aware_warnings` 标志设置为真，则让 "
":class:`warnings.catch_warnings` "
"使用上下文变量来保存警告过滤状态。这使得在多线程程序中使用上下文管理器是线程安全的。在自由线程构建中，该标志默认为真，否则为假。可以通过 "
":option:`-X context_aware_warnings <-X>` 命令行选项或 "
":envvar:`PYTHON_CONTEXT_AWARE_WARNINGS` 环境变量覆盖该标志的值。"

#: ../NEWS:3510
msgid ""
":gh:`129719`: Fix missing :data:`!socket.CAN_RAW_ERR_FILTER` constant in the"
" socket module on Linux systems. It was missing since Python 3.11."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129719`: 修复在 Linux 系统上 socket 模块缺失 :data:`!socket.CAN_RAW_ERR_FILTER` "
"常量的问题。 它自 Python 3.11 起就是缺失的。"

#: ../NEWS:3513
msgid ""
":gh:`129027`: Raise :exc:`DeprecationWarning` for "
":func:`sys._clear_type_cache`. This function was deprecated in Python 3.13 "
"but it didn't raise a runtime warning."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129027`: 为 :func:`sys._clear_type_cache` 抛出 "
":exc:`DeprecationWarning`。此函数在 Python 3.13 中已被弃用，但它没有抛出运行时警告。"

#: ../NEWS:3517
msgid ""
":gh:`128307`: Add ``eager_start`` keyword argument to "
":meth:`asyncio.loop.create_task`"
msgstr ""
":gh:`128307`: 向 :meth:`asyncio.loop.create_task` 添加 ``eager_start`` 关键字参数"

#: ../NEWS:3520
msgid ""
":gh:`127604`: Add support for printing the C stack trace on systems that "
"support it via :func:`faulthandler.dump_c_stack` or via the *c_stack* "
"argument in :func:`faulthandler.enable`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127604`: 添加支持，在支持的系统上通过 :func:`faulthandler.dump_c_stack` 或通过 "
":func:`faulthandler.enable` 中的 *c_stack* 参数打印 C 堆栈跟踪。"

#: ../NEWS:3524
msgid ""
":gh:`127385`: Add the ``F_DUPFD_QUERY`` constant to the :mod:`fcntl` module."
msgstr ":gh:`127385`: 将 ``F_DUPFD_QUERY`` 常量添加到 :mod:`fcntl` 模块。"

#: ../NEWS:3526
msgid ""
":gh:`126838`: Add *resolve_host* keyword-only parameter to "
":func:`urllib.request.url2pathname`, and fix handling of file URLs with "
"authorities."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126838`: 向 :func:`urllib.request.url2pathname` 添加 *resolve_host* "
"仅关键字参数，并修复带有权限的文件 URL 的处理。"

#: ../NEWS:3530
msgid ""
":gh:`82129`: Fix :exc:`NameError` when calling :func:`typing.get_type_hints`"
" on a :func:`dataclasses.dataclass` created by "
":func:`dataclasses.make_dataclass` with un-annotated fields."
msgstr ""
":gh:`82129`: 修复当调用 :func:`typing.get_type_hints` 时，在由 "
":func:`dataclasses.make_dataclass` 创建的、带有未注解字段的 "
":func:`dataclasses.dataclass` 上抛出 :exc:`NameError` 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:3534
msgid ""
":gh:`122559`: Remove :meth:`!__reduce__` and :meth:`!__reduce_ex__` methods "
"that always raise :exc:`TypeError` in the C implementation of "
":class:`io.FileIO`, :class:`io.BufferedReader`, :class:`io.BufferedWriter` "
"and :class:`io.BufferedRandom` and replace them with default "
":meth:`!__getstate__` methods that raise :exc:`!TypeError`. This restores "
"fine details of behavior of Python 3.11 and older versions."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122559`: 移除在 "
":class:`io.FileIO`、:class:`io.BufferedReader`、:class:`io.BufferedWriter` 和 "
":class:`io.BufferedRandom` 的 C 实现中总是抛出 :exc:`TypeError` 的 "
":meth:`!__reduce__` 和 :meth:`!__reduce_ex__` 方法，并用默认的抛出 :exc:`!TypeError` 的 "
":meth:`!__getstate__` 方法替换它们。这恢复了 Python 3.11 及更早版本行为的细微细节。"

#: ../NEWS:3541
msgid ""
":gh:`122179`: :func:`hashlib.file_digest` now raises :exc:`BlockingIOError` "
"when no data is available during non-blocking I/O. Before, it added spurious"
" null bytes to the digest."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122179`: :func:`hashlib.file_digest` 现在在非阻塞 I/O 期间没有数据可用时抛出 "
":exc:`BlockingIOError`。之前，它会在摘要中添加虚假的空字节。"

#: ../NEWS:3545
msgid ""
":gh:`53032`: Expose :func:`decimal.IEEEContext` to support creation of "
"contexts corresponding to the IEEE 754 (2008) decimal interchange formats. "
"Patch by Sergey B Kirpichev."
msgstr ""
":gh:`53032`: 公开 :func:`decimal.IEEEContext` 以支持创建对应于 IEEE 754 (2008) "
"十进制交换格式的上下文。由 Sergey B Kirpichev 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3549
msgid ""
":gh:`120220`: Deprecate the :class:`!tkinter.Variable` methods "
":meth:`!trace_variable`, :meth:`!trace_vdelete` and :meth:`!trace_vinfo`. "
"Methods :meth:`!trace_add`, :meth:`!trace_remove` and :meth:`!trace_info` "
"can be used instead."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120220`: 弃用 :class:`!tkinter.Variable` 方法 "
":meth:`!trace_variable`、:meth:`!trace_vdelete` 和 :meth:`!trace_vinfo`。可以使用 "
":meth:`!trace_add`、:meth:`!trace_remove` 和 :meth:`!trace_info` 方法替代。"

#: ../NEWS:3554
msgid ""
":gh:`113539`: :mod:`webbrowser`: Names in the :envvar:`BROWSER` environment "
"variable can now refer to already registered web browsers, instead of always"
" generating a new browser command."
msgstr ""
":gh:`113539`: :mod:`webbrowser`: :envvar:`BROWSER` "
"环境变量中的名称现在可以引用已注册的网页浏览器，而不是总是生成一个新的浏览器命令。"

#: ../NEWS:3558
msgid ""
"This makes it possible to set :envvar:`BROWSER` to the value of one of the "
"supported browsers on macOS."
msgstr "这使得可以将 :envvar:`BROWSER` 设置为 macOS 上支持的浏览器之一的值。"

#: ../NEWS:3561
msgid ""
":issue:`44172`: Keep a reference to original :mod:`curses` windows in "
"subwindows so that the original window does not get deleted before "
"subwindows."
msgstr ":issue:`44172`: 在子窗口中保留对原始 :mod:`curses` 窗口的引用，以便原始窗口不会在子窗口之前被删除。"

#: ../NEWS:3565
msgid ""
":gh:`75223`: Deprecate undotted extensions in "
":meth:`mimetypes.MimeTypes.add_type`. Patch by Hugo van Kemenade."
msgstr ""
":gh:`75223`: 弃用 :meth:`mimetypes.MimeTypes.add_type` 中的无点扩展名。由 Hugo van "
"Kemenade 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3571
msgid ":gh:`112936`: fix IDLE: no Shell menu item in single-process mode."
msgstr ":gh:`112936`: 修复 IDLE：在单进程模式下没有 Shell 菜单项。"

#: ../NEWS:3576
msgid ""
":gh:`107006`: Move documentation and example code for "
":class:`threading.local` from its docstring to the official docs."
msgstr ":gh:`107006`: 将 :class:`threading.local` 的文档和示例代码从其文档字符串移至官方文档。"

#: ../NEWS:3579
msgid ""
":gh:`125142`: As part of the builtin help intro text, show the keyboard "
"shortcuts for the new, non-basic REPL (F1, F2, and F3)."
msgstr ":gh:`125142`: 作为内置帮助介绍文本的一部分，展示新的非基本 REPL 的键盘快捷键（F1、F2 和 F3）。"

#: ../NEWS:3585
msgid ""
":gh:`133336`: :option:`!-J` is no longer reserved for use by Jython. Patch "
"by Adam Turner."
msgstr ":gh:`133336`: :option:`!-J` 不再保留供 Jython 使用。由 Adam Turner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3588
msgid ""
":gh:`133261`: Fix bug where the cycle GC could untrack objects in the "
"trashcan because they looked like they were immortal. When objects are added"
" to the trashcan, we take care to ensure they keep a mortal reference count."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133261`: 修复一个错误，其中循环 GC "
"可能会因为对象看起来是不朽的而在垃圾箱中取消跟踪对象。当对象被添加到垃圾箱时，我们注意确保它们保持一个凡人引用计数。"

#: ../NEWS:3593
msgid ""
":gh:`133346`: Added experimental color theming support to the ``_colorize`` "
"module."
msgstr ":gh:`133346`: 向 ``_colorize`` 模块添加了实验性的颜色主题支持。"

#: ../NEWS:3596
msgid ""
":gh:`132917`: For the free-threaded build, check the process memory usage "
"increase before triggering a full automatic garbage collection.  If the "
"memory used has not increased 10% since the last collection then defer it."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132917`: 对于自由线程构建，在触发完整的自动垃圾回收之前检查进程内存使用量的增加。如果自上次回收以来使用的内存没有增加 "
"10%，则推迟回收。"

#: ../NEWS:3600
msgid ""
":gh:`91048`: Add a new ``python -m asyncio ps PID`` command-line interface "
"to inspect asyncio tasks in a running Python process. Displays a flat table "
"of await relationships. A variant showing a tree view is also available as "
"``python -m asyncio pstree PID``. Both are useful for debugging async code. "
"Patch by Pablo Galindo, Łukasz Langa, Yury Selivanov, and Marta Gomez "
"Macias."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91048`: 添加一个新的 `python -m asyncio ps PID` "
"命令行接口，用于检查运行中的Python进程内的asyncio任务。显示一个扁平化的等待关系表。一个显示树状视图的变体也可用，命令为 `python "
"-m asyncio pstree PID`。这两个命令对于调试异步代码非常有用。由Pablo Galindo、Łukasz Langa、Yury "
"Selivanov和Marta Gomez Macias提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3607
msgid ""
":gh:`133304`: Workaround NaN's \"canonicalization\" in "
":c:func:`PyFloat_Pack4` and :c:func:`PyFloat_Unpack4` on RISC-V."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133304`: 在RISC-V上为 :c:func:`PyFloat_Pack4` 和 :c:func:`PyFloat_Unpack4` "
"修复NaN的\"规范化\"问题。"

#: ../NEWS:3610
msgid ""
":gh:`133197`: Improve :exc:`SyntaxError` error messages for incompatible "
"string / bytes prefixes."
msgstr ":gh:`133197`: 为不兼容的字符串/字节前缀改进 :exc:`SyntaxError` 错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:3613
msgid ""
":gh:`133231`: Add new utilities of observing JIT compilation: "
":func:`sys._jit.is_available`, :func:`sys._jit.is_enabled`, and "
":func:`sys._jit.is_active`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133231`: 添加观察JIT编译的新工具 : "
":func:`sys._jit.is_available`、:func:`sys._jit.is_enabled` 和 "
":func:`sys._jit.is_active`。"

#: ../NEWS:3620
msgid ""
":gh:`133194`: :func:`ast.parse` will no longer parse new :pep:`758` syntax "
"with older *feature_version* passed."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133194`: :func:`ast.parse` 将不再解析新的 :pep:`758` "
"语法，如果传入旧的*feature_version*。"

#: ../NEWS:3626
msgid ""
":gh:`131798`: Split ``CALL_LEN`` into several uops allowing the JIT to "
"remove them when optimizing. Patch by Diego Russo."
msgstr ":gh:`131798`: 将`CALL_LEN`拆分为几个uops，允许JIT在优化时移除它们。由Diego Russo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3629
msgid ""
":gh:`131798`: Use ``sym_new_type`` instead of ``sym_new_not_null`` for "
"_BUILD_STRING, _BUILD_SET"
msgstr ""
":gh:`131798`: 对于_BUILD_STRING、_BUILD_SET使用 `sym_new_type` 而非 "
"`sym_new_not_null`"

#: ../NEWS:3632
msgid ""
":gh:`132942`: Fix two races in the type lookup cache.  This affected the "
"free-threaded build and could cause crashes (apparently quite difficult to "
"trigger)."
msgstr ":gh:`132942`: 修复类型查找缓存中的两个竞争条件。这影响了自由线程构建并可能导致崩溃（显然很难触发）。"

#: ../NEWS:3636
msgid ""
":gh:`131798`: Propagate the return type of ``_BINARY_OP_SUBSCR_TUPLE_INT`` "
"in JIT. Patch by Tomas Roun"
msgstr ""
":gh:`131798`: 在JIT中传播 ``_BINARY_OP_SUBSCR_TUPLE_INT`` 的返回类型。由Tomas Roun提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:3639
msgid ""
":gh:`132952`: Speed up startup with the ``-S`` argument by importing the "
"private ``_io`` module instead of :mod:`io`. This fixes a performance "
"regression introduced earlier in Python 3.14 development and restores "
"performance to the level of Python 3.13."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132952`: 通过导入私有`_io`模块而非 :mod:`io`，加速使用`-S` 参数的启动。这修复了Python "
"3.14开发早期引入的性能回归，并将性能恢复到Python 3.13的水平。"

#: ../NEWS:3644
msgid ""
":gh:`131798`: Allow the JIT to remove int guards after ``_CALL_LEN`` by "
"setting the return type to int. Patch by Diego Russo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`131798`: 允许JIT通过将返回类型设置为int来移除 `_CALL_LEN` 后的int守卫。由Diego Russo提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:3647
msgid ""
":gh:`131798`: Split ``CALL_TUPLE_1`` into several uops allowing the JIT to "
"remove some of them. Patch by Tomas Roun"
msgstr ""
":gh:`131798`:将 ``CALL_TUPLE_1`` 拆分为多个微操作单元(uops)，使即时编译器(JIT)能够移除其中部分操作。由 "
"Tomas Roun 提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:3650
msgid ""
":gh:`131798`: Split ``CALL_STR_1`` into several uops allowing the JIT to "
"remove some of them. Patch by Tomas Roun"
msgstr ""
":gh:`131798`: 将 ``CALL_STR_1`` 拆分为多个微操作单元(uops)，使即时编译器(JIT)能够移除其中部分操作。由 "
"Tomas Roun 提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:3653
msgid ""
":gh:`132825`: Enhance unhashable key/element error messages for "
":class:`dict` and :class:`set`. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132825`: 增强对于不可哈希键/元素的错误消息，涉及 :class:`dict` 和 :class:`set`。由Victor "
"Stinner提交补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3656
msgid ""
":gh:`131591`: Reset any :pep:`768` remote debugging pending call in children"
" after :func:`os.fork` calls."
msgstr ":gh:`131591`: 在 :func:`os.fork` 调用后，重置任何 :pep:`768` 远程调试的挂起调用。"

#: ../NEWS:3659
msgid ""
":gh:`132713`: Fix ``repr(list)`` race condition: hold a strong reference to "
"the item while calling ``repr(item)``. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132713`: 修复 ``repr(list)`` 的竞态条件：在调用 ``repr(item)`` 时保持对项的强引用。由Victor "
"Stinner提交补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3662
msgid ""
":gh:`132661`: Implement :pep:`750` (Template Strings). Add new syntax for "
"t-strings and implement new internal :class:`!string.templatelib.Template` "
"and :class:`!string.templatelib.Interpolation` types."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132661`: 实现 :pep:`750` (模板字符串) 。为t-strings添加新语法并实现新的内部 "
":class:`!string.templatelib.Template` 和 "
":class:`!string.templatelib.Interpolation` 类型。"

#: ../NEWS:3666
msgid ""
":gh:`132479`: Fix compiler crash in certain circumstances where multiple "
"module-level annotations include comprehensions and other nested scopes."
msgstr ":gh:`132479`: 修复在特定情况下编译器崩溃的问题，这些情况包括多个模块级注释包含推导式和其他嵌套作用域。"

#: ../NEWS:3669
msgid ""
":gh:`132747`: Fix a crash when calling :meth:`~object.__get__` of a "
":term:`method` with a :const:`None` second argument."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132747`: 修复当以 :const:`None` 作为第二个参数调用 :term:`method` 的 "
":meth:`~object.__get__` 方法时发生的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:3672
msgid ""
":gh:`132744`: Certain calls now check for runaway recursion and respect the "
"system recursion limit."
msgstr ":gh:`132744`: 现在某些调用会检查失控递归并尊重系统递归限制。"

#: ../NEWS:3675
msgid ""
":gh:`132449`: Syntax errors that look like misspellings of Python keywords "
"now provide a helpful fix suggestion for the typo.  Contributed by Pablo "
"Galindo Salgado."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132449`: 看起来像是Python关键字拼写错误的语法错误现在会为拼写错误提供有用的修复建议。由Pablo Galindo "
"Salgado贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:3682
msgid ""
":gh:`132737`: Support profiling code that requires ``__main__``, such as "
":mod:`pickle`."
msgstr ":gh:`132737`: 支持分析需要 ``__main__`` 的代码，例如 :mod:`pickle`。"

#: ../NEWS:3688
msgid ""
":gh:`132639`: Added :c:func:`PyLong_AsNativeBytes`, "
":c:func:`PyLong_FromNativeBytes` and "
":c:func:`PyLong_FromUnsignedNativeBytes` to the limited C API."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132639`: 在有限的C API中添加了 :c:func:`PyLong_AsNativeBytes`, "
":c:func:`PyLong_FromNativeBytes` 和 :c:func:`PyLong_FromUnsignedNativeBytes`。"

#: ../NEWS:3692
msgid ""
":gh:`100239`: Add specialisation for ``BINARY_OP/SUBSCR`` on list and slice."
msgstr ":gh:`100239`: 为 ``BINARY_OP/SUBSCR`` 在列表和切片上添加特化。"

#: ../NEWS:3694
msgid ""
":gh:`132508`: Uses tagged integers on the evaluation stack to represent the "
"instruction offsets when reraising an exception. This avoids the need to box"
" the integer which could fail in low memory conditions."
msgstr ":gh:`132508`: 在重新引发异常时，使用标记的整数在评估栈上表示指令偏移量。这避免了在低内存条件下需要装箱整数的情况。"

#: ../NEWS:3698
msgid ""
":gh:`124476`: Fix decoding from the locale encoding in the C.UTF-8 locale."
msgstr ":gh:`124476`: 修复在C.UTF-8语言环境中从区域编码解码的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:3700
msgid ""
":gh:`131927`: Compiler warnings originating from the same module and line "
"number are now only emitted once, matching the behaviour of warnings emitted"
" from user code. This can also be configured with :mod:`warnings` filters."
msgstr ""
":gh:`131927`: 来自同一模块和行号的编译器警告现在只发出一次，匹配从用户代码发出的警告行为。这也可以通过 :mod:`warnings` "
"过滤器进行配置。"

#: ../NEWS:3705
msgid ""
":gh:`132457`: Make :func:`staticmethod` and :func:`classmethod` generic."
msgstr ":gh:`132457`: 使 :func:`staticmethod` 和 :func:`classmethod` 泛型化。"

#: ../NEWS:3707
msgid ""
":gh:`131798`: Use ``sym_new_type`` instead of ``sym_new_not_null`` for "
"_BUILD_LIST, _BUILD_SET, _BUILD_MAP"
msgstr ""
":gh:`131798`: 对于 _BUILD_LIST、_BUILD_SET、_BUILD_MAP，使用 ``sym_new_type`` 代替 "
"``sym_new_not_null``"

#: ../NEWS:3710
msgid ""
":gh:`131798`: Split ``CALL_TYPE_1`` into several uops allowing the JIT to "
"remove some of them."
msgstr ":gh:`131798`: 将 ``CALL_TYPE_1`` 拆分为多个 uops，允许 JIT 移除其中的一些。"

#: ../NEWS:3713
msgid ""
":gh:`132386`: Fix crash when passing a dict subclass as the ``globals`` "
"parameter to :func:`exec`."
msgstr ":gh:`132386`: 修复了将字典子类作为 ``globals`` 参数传递给 :func:`exec` 时崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:3716
msgid ""
":gh:`127682`: No longer call ``__iter__`` twice when creating and executing "
"a generator expression. Creating a generator expression from a non-interable"
" will raise only when the generator expression is executed. This brings the "
"behavior of generator expressions in line with other generators."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127682`: 在创建和执行生成器表达式时不再调用两次 "
"``__iter__``。从不可迭代对象创建生成器表达式时，只有在生成器表达式执行时才会引发异常。这使得生成器表达式的行为与其他生成器保持一致。"

#: ../NEWS:3721
msgid ""
":gh:`132261`: The internal storage for annotations and annotate functions on"
" classes now uses different keys in the class dictionary. This eliminates "
"various edge cases where access to the ``__annotate__`` and "
"``__annotations__`` attributes would behave unpredictably."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132261`: 类上注释和注释函数的内部存储现在在类字典中使用不同的键。这消除了访问 ``__annotate__`` 和 "
"``__annotations__`` 属性时行为不可预测的各种边缘情况。"

#: ../NEWS:3726
msgid ""
":gh:`132284`: Don't wrap base ``PyCFunction`` slots on class creation if not"
" overridden."
msgstr ":gh:`132284`: 如果未被覆盖，不要在类创建时包装基础的 ``PyCFunction`` 槽。"

#: ../NEWS:3729
msgid ""
":gh:`130415`: Improve the JIT's ability to remove unused constant and local "
"variable loads, and fix an issue where deallocating unused values could "
"cause JIT code to crash or behave incorrectly."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130415`: 提高了 JIT 移除未使用的常量和局部变量加载的能力，并修复了解除分配未使用值可能导致 JIT 代码崩溃或行为不正确的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:3733
msgid ""
":gh:`126703`: Fix possible use after free in cases where a method's "
"definition has the same lifetime as its ``self``."
msgstr ":gh:`126703`: 修复了方法的定义与其 ``self`` 具有相同生命周期时可能出现的释放后使用问题。"

#: ../NEWS:3736
msgid ""
":gh:`132286`: Fix that :attr:`type.__annotate__` was not deleted, when "
":attr:`type.__annotations__` was deleted."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132286`: 修复了删除 :attr:`type.__annotations__` 时未删除 "
":attr:`type.__annotate__` 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:3739
msgid ""
":gh:`131798`: Allow the JIT to remove an extra ``_TO_BOOL_BOOL`` instruction"
" after ``_CONTAINS_OP_DICT`` by setting the return type to bool."
msgstr ""
":gh:`131798`: 通过将返回类型设置为 bool，允许 JIT 移除 ``_CONTAINS_OP_DICT`` 之后的额外 "
"``_TO_BOOL_BOOL`` 指令。"

#: ../NEWS:3742
msgid ""
":gh:`124715`: Prevents against stack overflows when calling "
":c:func:`Py_DECREF`. Third-party extension objects no longer need to use the"
" \"trashcan\" mechanism, as protection is now built into the "
":c:func:`Py_DECREF` macro."
msgstr ""
":gh:`124715`: 防止调用 :c:func:`Py_DECREF` 时栈溢出。第三方扩展对象不再需要使用“垃圾桶”机制，因为 "
":c:func:`Py_DECREF` 宏中现在内置了保护。"

#: ../NEWS:3747
msgid ""
":gh:`131798`: Allow the JIT compiler to remove some type checks for "
"operations on lists, tuples, dictionaries, and sets."
msgstr ":gh:`131798`: 允许 JIT 编译器移除对列表、元组、字典和集合操作的一些类型检查。"

#: ../NEWS:3750
msgid ""
":gh:`128398`: Improve error message when an object supporting the "
"synchronous (resp. asynchronous) context manager protocol is entered using "
":keyword:`async with` (resp. :keyword:`with`) instead of :keyword:`with` "
"(resp. :keyword:`async with`). Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128398`: 改进错误消息，当对象支持同步（或异步）上下文管理器协议时，使用 :keyword:`async with` (或 "
":keyword:`with`) 而不是 :keyword:`with` (或 :keyword:`async with`) 进入时。 由 "
"Bénédikt Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3755
msgid ""
":gh:`131798`: Allow the JIT to remove unicode guards after "
"``_BINARY_OP_SUBSCR_STR_INT`` by setting the return type to string."
msgstr ""
":gh:`131798`: 通过将返回类型设置为字符串，允许JIT在 ``_BINARY_OP_SUBSCR_STR_INT`` "
"之后移除unicode守卫。"

#: ../NEWS:3758
msgid ""
":gh:`131878`: Handle uncaught exceptions in the main input loop for the new "
"REPL."
msgstr ":gh:`131878`: 在新的REPL中处理主输入循环中未捕获的异常。"

#: ../NEWS:3761
msgid ""
":gh:`131878`: Fix support of unicode characters with two or more codepoints "
"on Windows in the new REPL."
msgstr ":gh:`131878`: 在新的REPL中修复Windows上支持两个或更多码点的unicode字符。"

#: ../NEWS:3764
msgid ""
":gh:`126835`: Move constant folding to the peephole optimizer. Rename AST "
"optimization related files (Python/ast_opt.c -> Python/ast_preprocess.c), "
"structs (_PyASTOptimizeState -> _PyASTPreprocessState) and functions "
"(_PyAST_Optimize -> _PyAST_Preprocess, _PyCompile_AstOptimize -> "
"_PyCompile_AstPreprocess)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126835`: 将常量折叠移动到窥孔优化器。重命名AST优化相关文件（Python/ast_opt.c -> "
"Python/ast_preprocess.c），结构体（_PyASTOptimizeState -> "
"_PyASTPreprocessState）和函数（_PyAST_Optimize -> _PyAST_Preprocess, "
"_PyCompile_AstOptimize -> _PyCompile_AstPreprocess）。"

#: ../NEWS:3770
msgid ""
":gh:`114809`: Add support for macOS multi-arch builds with the JIT enabled"
msgstr ":gh:`114809`: 添加对启用JIT的macOS多架构构建的支持"

#: ../NEWS:3772
msgid ""
":gh:`131507`: PyREPL now supports syntax highlighting. Contributed by Łukasz"
" Langa."
msgstr ":gh:`131507`: PyREPL现在支持语法高亮。由Łukasz Langa贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:3775
msgid ""
":gh:`130907`: If the ``__annotations__`` of a module object are accessed "
"while the module is executing, return the annotations that have been defined"
" so far, without caching them."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130907`: 如果在模块执行时访问模块对象的 ``__annotations__``，则返回到目前为止定义的注释，而不缓存它们。"

#: ../NEWS:3779
msgid ""
":gh:`130104`: Three-argument :func:`pow` now try calling "
":meth:`~object.__rpow__` if necessary. Previously it was only called in two-"
"argument :func:`!pow` and the binary power operator."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130104`: 三参数 :func:`pow` 现在会在必要时尝试调用 :meth:`~object.__rpow__`。之前它只在两参数 "
":func:`!pow` 和二元幂运算符中被调用。"

#: ../NEWS:3783
msgid ""
":gh:`130070`: Fixed an assertion error for :func:`exec` passed a string "
"``source`` and a non-``None`` ``closure``. Patch by Bartosz Sławecki."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130070`: 修复了 :func:`exec` 传递字符串 ``source`` 和非 ``None`` ``closure`` "
"时的断言错误。由Bartosz Sławecki提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3786
msgid ""
":gh:`129958`: Fix a bug that was allowing newlines inconsistently in format "
"specifiers for single-quoted f-strings. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129958`: 修复了一个错误，该错误允许在单引号 f-字符串 的格式说明符中不一致地使用换行符。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3789
msgid ""
":gh:`129858`: ``elif`` statements that follow an ``else`` block now have a "
"specific error message."
msgstr ":gh:`129858`: 跟随 ``else`` 块的 ``elif`` 语句现在有特定的错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:3792
msgid ":gh:`69605`: Add module autocomplete to PyREPL."
msgstr ":gh:`69605`: 向PyREPL添加模块自动完成功能。"

#: ../NEWS:3794
msgid ":gh:`128555`: Add the :data:`sys.flags.thread_inherit_context` flag."
msgstr ":gh:`128555`: 添加 :data:`sys.flags.thread_inherit_context` 标志。"

#: ../NEWS:3796
msgid ""
"This flag is set to true by default on the free-threaded build and false "
"otherwise.  If the flag is true, starting a new thread using "
":class:`threading.Thread` will, by default, use a copy of the "
":class:`contextvars.Context` from the caller of "
":meth:`threading.Thread.start` rather than using an empty context."
msgstr ""
"在自由线程构建中，此标志默认设置为true，否则为false。如果标志为true，默认情况下，使用 :class:`threading.Thread` "
"启动新线程时，将使用 :meth:`threading.Thread.start` 调用者的 :class:`contextvars.Context` "
"副本，而不是使用空上下文。"

#: ../NEWS:3802
msgid ""
"Add the :option:`-X thread_inherit_context <-X>` command-line option and "
":envvar:`PYTHON_THREAD_INHERIT_CONTEXT` environment variable, which set the "
":data:`~sys.flags.thread_inherit_context` flag."
msgstr ""
"添加了 :option:`-X thread_inherit_context <-X>` 命令行选项和 "
":envvar:`PYTHON_THREAD_INHERIT_CONTEXT` 环境变量，它们设置了 "
":data:`~sys.flags.thread_inherit_context` 标志。"

#: ../NEWS:3806
msgid ""
"Add the ``context`` keyword parameter to :class:`~threading.Thread`.  It can"
" be used to explicitly pass a context value to be used by a new thread."
msgstr ""
"向 :class:`~threading.Thread` 添加了 ``context`` 关键字参数。它可以用来显式传递一个上下文值供新线程使用。"

#: ../NEWS:3809
msgid "Make the ``_contextvars`` module built-in."
msgstr "使 ``_contextvars`` 模块成为内置模块。"

#: ../NEWS:3811
msgid ""
":gh:`123539`: Improve :exc:`SyntaxError` message for using ``import ... as``"
" and ``from ... import ... as`` with not a name."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123539`: 改进了使用 ``import ... as`` 和 ``from ... import ... as`` 时如果不是名称的 "
":exc:`SyntaxError` 消息。"

#: ../NEWS:3814
msgid ""
":gh:`102567`: :option:`-X importtime <-X>` now accepts value ``2``, which "
"indicates that an ``importtime`` entry should also be printed if an imported"
" module has already been loaded. Patch by Noah Kim and Adam Turner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`102567`: :option:`-X importtime <-X>` 现在接受值 ``2``，表示如果导入的模块已经加载，也应打印 "
"``importtime`` 条目。由Noah Kim和Adam Turner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3819
msgid ""
":gh:`116436`: Improve error message when :exc:`TypeError` occurs during "
":meth:`dict.update`"
msgstr ":gh:`116436`: 改进了在 :meth:`dict.update` 期间发生 :exc:`TypeError` 时的错误消息"

#: ../NEWS:3822
msgid ""
":gh:`103997`: String arguments passed to \"-c\" are now automatically "
"dedented as if by :func:`textwrap.dedent`. This allows \"python -c\" "
"invocations to be indented in shell scripts without causing indentation "
"errors. (Patch by Jon Crall and Steven Sun)"
msgstr ""
":gh:`103997`: 传递给\"-c\"的字符串参数现在会自动去除缩进，就像通过 :func:`textwrap.dedent` "
"处理一样。这使得\"python -c\"调用可以在shell脚本中缩进而不会导致缩进错误。（由Jon Crall和Steven Sun提供补丁）"

#: ../NEWS:3830
msgid ":gh:`89562`: Remove ``hostflags`` member from ``PySSLContext`` struct."
msgstr ":gh:`89562`: 从 ``PySSLContext`` 结构中移除了 ``hostflags`` 成员。"

#: ../NEWS:3835
msgid ""
":gh:`133166`: Fix regression where :c:func:`PyType_GetModuleByDef` returns "
"NULL without setting :exc:`TypeError` when a static type is passed."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133166`: 修复了当传递静态类型时，:c:func:`PyType_GetModuleByDef` 返回NULL而不设置 "
":exc:`TypeError` 的回归问题。"

#: ../NEWS:3838
msgid ""
":gh:`133164`: Add :c:func:`PyUnstable_Object_IsUniqueReferencedTemporary` "
"function for determining if an object exists as a unique temporary variable "
"on the interpreter's stack.  This is a replacement for some cases where "
"checking that :c:func:`Py_REFCNT` is one is no longer sufficient to "
"determine if it's safe to modify a Python object in-place with no visible "
"side effects."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133164`: 添加了 :c:func:`PyUnstable_Object_IsUniqueReferencedTemporary` "
"函数，用于确定对象是否作为解释器堆栈上的唯一临时变量存在。这是对某些情况的替代，其中检查 :c:func:`Py_REFCNT` "
"为一不再足以确定是否可以安全地修改Python对象而不会产生可见的副作用。"

#: ../NEWS:3845
msgid ""
":gh:`133140`: Add :c:func:`PyUnstable_Object_IsUniquelyReferenced` as a "
"replacement for ``Py_REFNCT(op) == 1`` on :term:`free threaded <free "
"threading>` builds of Python."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133140`: 在Python的 :term:`自由线程 <free threading>` 构建中，添加 "
":c:func:`PyUnstable_Object_IsUniquelyReferenced` 作为 ``Py_REFNCT(op) == 1`` "
"的替代。"

#: ../NEWS:3849
msgid ""
":gh:`131747`: On non-Windows platforms, deprecate using "
":attr:`ctypes.Structure._pack_` to use a Windows-compatible layout on non-"
"Windows platforms. The layout should be specified explicitly by setting "
":attr:`ctypes.Structure._layout_` to ``'ms'``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`131747`: 在非Windows平台上，弃用使用 :attr:`ctypes.Structure._pack_` "
"来实现与非Windows平台兼容的布局。布局应通过将 :attr:`ctypes.Structure._layout_` 设置为 ``'ms'`` "
"来明确指定。"

#: ../NEWS:3854
msgid ""
":gh:`128972`: For non-free-threaded builds, the memory layout of "
":c:struct:`PyASCIIObject` is reverted to match Python 3.13. (Note that the "
"structure is not part of stable ABI and so its memory layout is *guaranteed*"
" to remain stable.)"
msgstr ""
":gh:`128972`: 对于非自由线程构建，:c:struct:`PyASCIIObject` 的内存布局被恢复以匹配Python "
"3.13。（注意，该结构不是稳定ABI的一部分，因此其内存布局 *保证* 保持不变。）"

#: ../NEWS:3859
msgid ""
":gh:`133079`: The undocumented APIs :c:macro:`!Py_C_RECURSION_LIMIT` and "
":c:member:`!PyThreadState.c_recursion_remaining`, added in 3.13, are removed"
" without a deprecation period."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133079`: 在3.13版本中添加的未公开API :c:macro:`!Py_C_RECURSION_LIMIT` 和 "
":c:member:`!PyThreadState.c_recursion_remaining` 在没有弃用期的情况下被移除。"

#: ../NEWS:3863
msgid ""
":gh:`132987`: The ``k`` and ``K`` formats in :c:func:`PyArg_Parse` now "
"support the :meth:`~object.__index__` special method, like all other integer"
" formats."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132987`: :c:func:`PyArg_Parse` 中的 ``k`` 和 ``K`` 格式现在支持 "
":meth:`~object.__index__` 特殊方法，就像所有其他整数格式一样。"

#: ../NEWS:3867
msgid ""
":gh:`132909`: Fix an overflow when handling the :ref:`K <capi-py-buildvalue-"
"format-K>` format in :c:func:`Py_BuildValue`. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132909`: 修复了在 :c:func:`Py_BuildValue` 中处理 :ref:`K <capi-py-buildvalue-"
"format-K>` 格式时的溢出问题。由Bénédikt Tran提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3871
msgid ""
":gh:`132798`: Deprecated and undocumented functions "
":c:func:`!PyUnicode_AsEncodedObject`, :c:func:`!PyUnicode_AsDecodedObject`, "
":c:func:`!PyUnicode_AsEncodedUnicode` and "
":c:func:`!PyUnicode_AsDecodedUnicode` are scheduled for removal in 3.15."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132798`: 已弃用且未公开的函数 :c:func:`!PyUnicode_AsEncodedObject`, "
":c:func:`!PyUnicode_AsDecodedObject`, :c:func:`!PyUnicode_AsEncodedUnicode` "
"和 :c:func:`!PyUnicode_AsDecodedUnicode` 计划在3.15版本中移除。"

#: ../NEWS:3877
msgid ""
":gh:`132470`: Creating a :class:`ctypes.CField` with a *byte_size* that does"
" not match the actual type size now raises a :exc:`ValueError` instead of "
"crashing the interpreter."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132470`: 现在，当创建一个 :class:`ctypes.CField` 时，如果 *byte_size* "
"与实际类型大小不匹配，将引发 :exc:`ValueError`，而不是导致解释器崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:3881
msgid ""
":gh:`112068`: [Reverted in :gh:`136991`] Add support of nullable arguments "
"in :c:func:`PyArg_Parse` and similar functions. Adding ``?`` after any "
"format unit makes ``None`` be accepted as a value."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112068`: [在 :gh:`136991` 中已回退] 在 :c:func:`PyArg_Parse` "
"及类似函数中添加了对可空参数的支持。在任何格式单元后添加 ``?`` 将使 ``None`` 被接受为一个值。"

#: ../NEWS:3885
msgid ""
":gh:`50333`: Non-tuple sequences are deprecated as argument for the "
"``(items)`` format unit in :c:func:`PyArg_ParseTuple` and other "
":ref:`argument parsing <arg-parsing>` functions if *items* contains format "
"units which store a :ref:`borrowed buffer <c-arg-borrowed-buffer>` or a "
":term:`borrowed reference`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`50333`: 在 :c:func:`PyArg_ParseTuple` 和其他 :ref:`参数解析 <arg-parsing>` "
"函数中，如果 *items* 包含存储 :ref:`borrowed buffer <c-arg-borrowed-buffer>` 或 "
":term:`借用引用 <borrowed reference>` 的格式单元，则非元组序列作为 ``(items)`` 格式单元的参数已被弃用。"

#: ../NEWS:3894
msgid ""
":gh:`113464`: Use the cpython-bin-deps \"externals\" repository for Windows "
"LLVM dependency management. Installing LLVM manually is no longer necessary "
"for Windows JIT builds."
msgstr ""
":gh:`113464`: 使用 cpython-bin-deps \"externals\" 仓库进行 Windows LLVM "
"依赖管理。Windows JIT 构建不再需要手动安装 LLVM。"

#: ../NEWS:3898
msgid ""
":gh:`133183`: iOS compiler shims now include ``IPHONEOS_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET`` "
"in target triples, ensuring that SDK version minimums are honored."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133183`: iOS 编译器垫片现在在目标三元组中包含 ``IPHONEOS_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET``，确保遵守 SDK "
"版本最低要求。"

#: ../NEWS:3901
msgid ""
":gh:`133167`: Fix compilation process with ``--enable-optimizations`` and "
"``--without-docstrings``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`133167`: 修复了使用 ``--enable-optimizations`` 和 ``--without-docstrings`` "
"的编译过程。"

#: ../NEWS:3904
msgid ""
":gh:`133171`: Since free-threaded builds do not support the experimental JIT"
" compiler, prevent these configurations from being combined."
msgstr ":gh:`133171`: 由于自由线程构建不支持实验性 JIT 编译器，防止这些配置被结合使用。"

#: ../NEWS:3907
msgid ":gh:`132758`: Fix building with tail call interpreter and pystats."
msgstr ":gh:`132758`: 修复了使用尾调用解释器和 pystats 的构建问题。"

#: ../NEWS:3909
msgid ""
":gh:`132649`: The :file:`PC\\layout` script now allows passing ``--include-"
"tcltk`` on Windows ARM64."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132649`: :file:`PC\\layout` 脚本现在允许在 Windows ARM64 上传递 ``--include-"
"tcltk``。"

#: ../NEWS:3912
msgid ""
":gh:`132257`: Change the default LTO flags on GCC to not pass ``-flto-"
"partition=none``, and allow parallelization of LTO. For newer GNU makes and "
"GCC, this has a multiple factor speedup for LTO build times, with no "
"noticeable loss in performance."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132257`: 更改 GCC 上的默认 LTO 标志，不再传递 ``-flto-partition=none``，并允许 LTO "
"的并行化。对于较新的 GNU make 和 GCC，这在 LTO 构建时间上有倍数级的加速，且性能无明显损失。"

#: ../NEWS:3917
msgid ""
":gh:`132026`: Fix use of undefined identifiers in platform triplet detection"
" on MIPS Linux platforms."
msgstr ":gh:`132026`: 修复了在 MIPS Linux 平台上平台三元组检测中未定义标识符的使用。"

#: ../NEWS:3922
msgid "Python 3.14.0 alpha 7"
msgstr "Python 3.14.0 alpha 7"

#: ../NEWS:3924
msgid "*Release date: 2025-04-08*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2025-04-08*"

#: ../NEWS:3929
msgid ":gh:`124111`: Update macOS installer to use Tcl/Tk 8.6.16."
msgstr ":gh:`124111`: 更新 macOS 安装程序以使用 Tcl/Tk 8.6.16。"

#: ../NEWS:3931
msgid ""
":gh:`131423`: Update macOS installer to use OpenSSL 3.0.16. Patch by "
"Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ":gh:`131423`: 更新 macOS 安装程序以使用 OpenSSL 3.0.16.。 由 Bénédikt Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3934
msgid ":gh:`131025`: Update macOS installer to ship with SQLite 3.49.1."
msgstr ":gh:`131025`: 更新 macOS 安装程序以使用 SQLite 3.49.1。"

#: ../NEWS:3939
msgid ""
":gh:`131423`: Update bundled version of OpenSSL to 3.0.16. The new build "
"also disables uplink support, which may be relevant to embedders but has no "
"impact on normal use."
msgstr ""
":gh:`131423`: 更新捆绑的 OpenSSL 版本至 3.0.16。新构建还禁用了 uplink "
"支持，这可能与嵌入者相关，但对正常使用无影响。"

#: ../NEWS:3943
msgid ""
":gh:`131453`: Some :data:`!SND_*` and :data:`!MB_*` constants are added to "
":mod:`winsound`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`131453`: 一些 :data:`!SND_*` 和 :data:`!MB_*` 常量被添加到 :mod:`winsound` 中。"

#: ../NEWS:3946
msgid ""
":gh:`91349`: Replaces our copy of ``zlib`` with ``zlib-ng``, for performance"
" improvements in :mod:`zlib`."
msgstr ":gh:`91349`: 将我们的 ``zlib`` 副本替换为 ``zlib-ng``，以提高 :mod:`zlib` 的性能。"

#: ../NEWS:3949
msgid ":gh:`131025`: Update Windows installer to ship with SQLite 3.49.1."
msgstr ":gh:`131025`: 更新 Windows 安装程序，附带 SQLite 3.49.1。"

#: ../NEWS:3954
msgid ""
":gh:`132121`: Always escape non-printable Unicode characters in "
":program:`pygettext`."
msgstr ":gh:`132121`: 在 :program:`pygettext` 中始终转义不可打印的 Unicode 字符。"

#: ../NEWS:3957
msgid ""
":gh:`131852`: :program:`msgfmt` no longer adds the ``POT-Creation-Date`` to "
"generated ``.mo`` files for consistency with GNU ``msgfmt``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`131852`: :program:`msgfmt` 将不再向生成的 ``.mo`` 文件添加 ``POT-Creation-Date`` "
"以与 GNU ``msgfmt`` 保持一致。"

#: ../NEWS:3963
msgid ""
":gh:`131277`: Allow to unset one or more environment variables at once via "
":meth:`EnvironmentVarGuard.unset() "
"<test.support.os_helper.EnvironmentVarGuard.unset>`. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`131277`: 允许通过 :meth:`EnvironmentVarGuard.unset() "
"<test.support.os_helper.EnvironmentVarGuard.unset>` 方法一次性取消设置一个或多个环境变量。由 "
"Bénédikt Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3968
msgid ""
":gh:`131050`: ``test_ssl.test_dh_params`` is skipped if the underlying TLS "
"library does not support finite-field ephemeral Diffie-Hellman."
msgstr ""
":gh:`131050`: 如果底层的 TLS 库不支持有限域短暂 Diffie-Hellman，则跳过 "
"``test_ssl.test_dh_params``。"

#: ../NEWS:3974
msgid ":gh:`131809`: Update bundled libexpat to 2.7.1"
msgstr ":gh:`131809`: 将捆绑的 libexpat 更新至 2.7.1"

#: ../NEWS:3976
msgid ":gh:`131261`: Upgrade to libexpat 2.7.0"
msgstr ":gh:`131261`: 更新至 libexpat 2.7.0"

#: ../NEWS:3978
msgid ""
":gh:`121284`: Fix bug in the folding of rfc2047 encoded-words when "
"flattening an email message using a modern email policy. Previously when an "
"encoded-word was too long for a line, it would be decoded, split across "
"lines, and re-encoded. But commas and other special characters in the "
"original text could be left unencoded and unquoted. This could theoretically"
" be used to spoof header lines using a carefully constructed encoded-word if"
" the resulting rendered email was transmitted or re-parsed."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121284`: 修复了在使用现代电子邮件策略扁平化电子邮件消息时，rfc2047 "
"编码词的折叠错误。以前，当一个编码词对于一行来说太长时，它会被解码、跨行分割并重新编码。但是原始文本中的逗号和其他特殊字符可能会被保留未编码和未引用。如果生成的渲染电子邮件被传输或重新解析，理论上可以利用精心构造的编码词来欺骗标题行。"

#: ../NEWS:3989
msgid ""
":gh:`132174`: Fix function name in error message of "
"``_interpreters.run_string``."
msgstr ":gh:`132174`: 修复了 ``_interpreters.run_string`` 的错误消息中的函数名称问题。"

#: ../NEWS:3992
msgid ""
":gh:`132171`: Fix crash of ``_interpreters.run_string`` on string "
"subclasses."
msgstr ":gh:`132171`: 修复了字符串子类上 ``_interpreters.run_string`` 导致的程序崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:3994
msgid ""
":gh:`129204`: Introduce new ``_PYTHON_SUBPROCESS_USE_POSIX_SPAWN`` "
"environment variable knob in :mod:`subprocess` to control the use of "
":func:`os.posix_spawn`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129204`: 在 :mod:`subprocess` 中引入新的 "
"``_PYTHON_SUBPROCESS_USE_POSIX_SPAWN`` 环境变量节点来控制 :func:`os.posix_spawn` 的使用。"

#: ../NEWS:3998
msgid ""
":gh:`132159`: Do not shadow user arguments in generated :meth:`!__new__` by "
"decorator :class:`warnings.deprecated`. Patch by Xuehai Pan."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132159`: 在由 :class:`warnings.deprecated` 装饰器生成的 :meth:`!__new__` "
"中不屏蔽用户参数。 由 Xuehai Pan 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4001
msgid ""
":gh:`132168`: The :class:`ctypes.py_object` type now supports subscription, "
"making it a :term:`generic type`."
msgstr ":gh:`132168`: :class:`ctypes.py_object` 类型现在支持订阅，使其成为 泛型类型`。"

#: ../NEWS:4004
msgid ""
":gh:`84481`: Add the :attr:`!zipfile.ZipFile.data_offset` attribute, which "
"stores the offset to the beginning of ZIP data in a file when available. "
"When the :class:`zipfile.ZipFile` is opened in either mode ``'w'`` or "
"``'x'`` and the underlying file does not support ``tell()``, the value will "
"be ``None`` instead."
msgstr ""
":gh:`84481`: 添加 :attr:`!zipfile.ZipFile.data_offset` 属性，该属性在可用时存储文件中 ZIP "
"数据开始的偏移量。当 :class:`zipfile.ZipFile` 以 ``'w'`` 或 ``'x'`` 模式打开且底层文件不支持 "
"``tell()`` 时，该值将为 ``None``。"

#: ../NEWS:4010
msgid ""
":gh:`132075`: Fix possible use of :mod:`socket` address structures with "
"uninitialized members. Now all structure members are initialized with zeroes"
" by default."
msgstr ":gh:`132075`: 修复可能使用带未初始化成员的 :mod:`socket` 地址结构体。 现在所有结构体成员默认都将初始化为零。"

#: ../NEWS:4014
msgid ""
":gh:`118761`: Improve import times by up to 27x for the :mod:`string` "
"module. Patch by Adam Turner."
