msgstr ""
":gh:`131492`: 修复当构造 :class:`gzip.GzipFile` 发生文件名错误，例如传入无效的 ``compresslevel``"
" 时的资源泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:4057
msgid ""
":gh:`131435`: 10-20% performance improvement of :func:`random.randint`."
msgstr ":gh:`131435`: :func:`random.randint` 的性能提高了10-20%。"

#: ../NEWS:4059
msgid ""
":gh:`131461`: Fix :exc:`ResourceWarning` when constructing a "
":class:`gzip.GzipFile` in write mode with a broken file object."
msgstr ""
":gh:`131461`: 修复了在写入模式下构建 :class:`gzip.GzipFile` 时，如果文件对象损坏会发出 "
":exc:`ResourceWarning` 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:4062
msgid ""
":gh:`125866`: Deprecate the :mod:`!nturl2path` module. Call "
":func:`urllib.request.url2pathname` and :func:`~urllib.request.pathname2url`"
