":gh:`125866`: 弃用 :mod:`!nturl2path` 模块。改为调用 "
":func:`urllib.request.url2pathname` 和 :func:`~urllib.request.pathname2url`。"

#: ../NEWS:4066
msgid ""
":gh:`126367`: Fix issue where :func:`urllib.request.url2pathname` raised "
":exc:`OSError` when given a Windows URI containing a colon character not "
"following a drive letter, such as before an NTFS alternate data stream."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126367`: 修复了 :func:`urllib.request.url2pathname` "
"在给定包含不遵循驱动器号的冒号字符（如NTFS备用数据流前的冒号）的Windows URI时会引发 :exc:`OSError` 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:4070
msgid ""
":gh:`120144`: Disable ``CALL`` event in :mod:`bdb` in ``monitoring`` backend"
" when we don't need any new events on the code object to get a better "
"performance."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120144`: 在不需要代码对象上的任何新事件以获得更好性能时，禁用 :mod:`bdb` 中``monitoring``后端的 "
"``CALL`` 事件。"

#: ../NEWS:4074
msgid ""
":gh:`131358`: Register ``cseuckr`` as an encoding alias for ``euc_kr``."
msgstr ":gh:`131358`: 将 ``cseuckr`` 注册为 ``euc_kr`` 的编码别名。"

#: ../NEWS:4076
msgid ""
":gh:`131325`: Fix sendfile fallback implementation to drain data after "
"writing to transport in :mod:`asyncio`."
msgstr ":gh:`131325`: 修复 :mod:`asyncio` 中 sendfile 回退实现在写入传输后的耗尽数据问题。"

#: ../NEWS:4079
msgid ""
":gh:`90548`: :func:`platform.libc_ver` can now detect and report the version"
" of ``musl`` on Alpine Linux."
msgstr ""
":gh:`90548`: :func:`platform.libc_ver` 现在可以检测并报告Alpine Linux上 ``musl`` 的版本。"

#: ../NEWS:4082
msgid ""
":gh:`129843`: Fix incorrect argument passing in "
