msgstr ""
":gh:`128055`: 修复在构建目录外运行时（例如安装后）的 "
"``test.test_sysconfig.test_sysconfigdata_json``。"

#: ../NEWS:4132
msgid ""
":gh:`126037`: :mod:`xml.etree.ElementTree`: Fix a crash in "
