"<xml.etree.ElementTree.Element.findall>` 的崩溃问题。由 Bénédikt Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4139
msgid ""
":gh:`127794`: When headers are added to :class:`email.message.Message` "
"objects, either through :meth:`email.message.Message.__setitem__` or "
":meth:`email.message.Message.add_header`, the field name is now validated "
"according to :rfc:`RFC 5322, Section 2.2 <5322#section-2.2>` and a "
":exc:`ValueError` is raised if the field name contains any invalid "
"characters."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127794`: 当通过 :meth:`email.message.Message.__setitem__` 或 "
":meth:`email.message.Message.add_header` 向 :class:`email.message.Message` "
"对象添加头信息时，现在会根据 :rfc:`RFC 5322, Section 2.2 <5322#section-2.2>` "
"验证字段名称，如果字段名称包含任何无效字符，则会抛出 :exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../NEWS:4146
msgid ""
":gh:`123599`: Deprecate :meth:`!pathlib.PurePath.as_uri`; use "
