#: ../NEWS:4149
msgid ""
":gh:`126033`: :mod:`xml.etree.ElementTree`: Fix a crash in "
":meth:`Element.remove <xml.etree.ElementTree.Element.remove>` when the "
"element is concurrently mutated. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126033`: :mod:`xml.etree.ElementTree`: 修复了当元素被并发修改时 "
":meth:`Element.remove <xml.etree.ElementTree.Element.remove>` 的崩溃问题。由 "
"Bénédikt Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4153
msgid ""
":gh:`120144`: Add the optional backend of ``sys.monitoring`` to :mod:`bdb` "
