msgstr ""
":gh:`120144`: 向 :mod:`bdb` 添加了 ``sys.monitoring`` 的可选后端，并用于 :mod:`pdb`。"

#: ../NEWS:4156
msgid ""
":gh:`74598`: Add :func:`fnmatch.filterfalse` for excluding names matching a "
