msgstr ""
":gh:`74598`: 添加 :func:`fnmatch.filterfalse` 用于排除匹配模式的名称。由 Bénédikt Tran "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4159
msgid ":gh:`114917`: Add support for AI_NUMERICSERV in getaddrinfo emulation"
msgstr ":gh:`114917`: 在 getaddrinfo 模拟中添加对 AI_NUMERICSERV 的支持"

#: ../NEWS:4161
msgid ""
":issue:`17254`: Added aliases for Thai Language using Microsoft Code Pages."
msgstr ":issue:`17254`: 为使用微软代码页的泰语添加了别名。"

#: ../NEWS:4166
msgid ""
":gh:`131417`: Mention :class:`asyncio.Future` and :class:`asyncio.Task` in "
