msgstr ""
":gh:`131417`: 在泛型类列表中提及 :class:`asyncio.Future` 和 :class:`asyncio.Task`。"

#: ../NEWS:4172
msgid ""
":gh:`131798`: Allow the JIT to remove an extra ``_TO_BOOL_BOOL`` instruction"
