msgstr ":gh:`99108`: 添加基于HACL*的HMAC (:rfc:`2104`)内置实现支持。由Bénédikt Tran提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4256
msgid ""
":gh:`130080`: Implement PEP 765: Disallow return/break/continue that exit a "
