msgstr ":gh:`128632`: 禁止将 ``__classdict__`` 作为类型参数的名称。在某些情况下，使用此名称之前会使解释器崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:4266
msgid ""
":gh:`126703`: Improve performance of builtin methods by using a freelist."
msgstr ":gh:`126703`: 通过使用自由列表提高内置方法的性能。"

#: ../NEWS:4268
msgid ""
":gh:`126703`: Improve performance of  :class:`range` by using a freelist."
msgstr ":gh:`126703`: 通过使用自由列表提高 :class:`range` 的性能。"

#: ../NEWS:4273
msgid ":gh:`131740`: Update PyUnstable_GC_VisitObjects to traverse perm gen."
msgstr ":gh:`131740`: 更新PyUnstable_GC_VisitObjects以遍历永久代。"

#: ../NEWS:4275
msgid ""
":gh:`131525`: The PyTupleObject now caches the computed hash value in the "
"new field ob_hash."
msgstr ":gh:`131525`: PyTupleObject现在在新字段ob_hash中缓存计算出的哈希值。"

#: ../NEWS:4281
msgid ""
":gh:`131865`: The DTrace build now properly passes the ``CC`` and ``CFLAGS``"
" variables to the ``dtrace`` command when utilizing SystemTap on Linux."
msgstr ""
":gh:`131865`: 当在Linux上使用SystemTap时，DTrace构建现在正确地将 ``CC`` 和 ``CFLAGS`` 变量传递给 "
"``dtrace`` 命令。"

#: ../NEWS:4284
msgid ":gh:`131675`: Fix mimalloc library builds for 32-bit ARM targets."
msgstr ":gh:`131675`: 修复32位ARM目标的mimalloc库构建。"

#: ../NEWS:4286
msgid ""
":gh:`131691`: clang-cl on Windows needs option ``/EHa`` to support SEH "
"(structured exception handling) correctly. Fix by Chris Eibl."
msgstr ""
":gh:`131691`: Windows上的clang-cl需要选项 ``/EHa`` 以正确支持SEH（结构化异常处理）。由Chris "
"Eibl修复。"

#: ../NEWS:4289
msgid ""
":gh:`131278`: Add optimizing flag ``WITH_COMPUTED_GOTOS`` to Windows builds "
"for when using a compiler that supports it (currently clang-cl). Patch by "
"Chris Eibl."
msgstr ""
":gh:`131278`: 为Windows构建添加优化标志 "
"``WITH_COMPUTED_GOTOS``，以便在使用支持它的编译器（当前为clang-cl）时使用。由Chris Eibl提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4293
msgid ""
":gh:`130213`: Update the vendored HACL* library to fix build issues with "
"older clang compilers."
msgstr ":gh:`130213`: 更新捆绑的HACL*库以修复与旧版clang编译器的构建问题。"

#: ../NEWS:4296
msgid ""
":gh:`130673`: Fix potential ``KeyError`` when handling object sections "
"during JIT building process."
msgstr ":gh:`130673`: 修复在 JIT 构建过程中处理对象部分时潜在的 ``KeyError``。"

#: ../NEWS:4301
msgid "Python 3.14.0 alpha 6"
msgstr "Python 3.14.0 alpha 6"

#: ../NEWS:4303
msgid "*Release date: 2025-03-14*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2025-03-14*"

#: ../NEWS:4308
msgid ""
":gh:`128540`: Ensure web browser is launched by :func:`webbrowser.open` on "
"macOS, even for ``file://`` URLs."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128540`: 确保在 macOS 上通过 :func:`webbrowser.open` 启动网页浏览器，即使是 ``file://`` "
"URL。"

#: ../NEWS:4314
msgid ""
":gh:`131020`: :source:`pylauncher <PC/launcher2.c>` correctly detects a BOM "
"when searching for the shebang. Fix by Chris Eibl."
msgstr ""
":gh:`131020`: :source:`pylauncher <PC/launcher2.c>` 在搜索 shebang 行时能正确检测 BOM。"
" 由 Chris Eibl 修复。"

#: ../NEWS:4320
msgid ""
":gh:`130453`: Make it possible to override default keywords in "
":program:`pygettext`."
msgstr ":gh:`130453`: 使得在 :program:`pygettext` 中覆盖默认关键词成为可能。"

#: ../NEWS:4323
msgid ""
":gh:`85012`: Correctly reset ``msgctxt`` when compiling messages in "
":program:`msgfmt`."
msgstr ":gh:`85012`: 在编译 :program:`msgfmt` 中的消息时能正确地重置 ``msgctxt``。"

#: ../NEWS:4326
msgid ""
":gh:`130453`: Extend support for specifying custom keywords in "
":program:`pygettext`."
msgstr ":gh:`130453`: 扩展支持在 :program:`pygettext` 中指定自定义关键词。"

#: ../NEWS:4329
msgid ""
":gh:`130195`: Add warning messages when ``pygettext`` unimplemented "
"``-a/--extract-all`` option is called."
msgstr ":gh:`130195`: 当调用 ``pygettext`` 未实现的 ``-a/--extract-all`` 选项时添加警告信息。"

#: ../NEWS:4332
msgid ""
":gh:`130057`: Add support for translator comments in "
":program:`pygettext.py`."
msgstr ":gh:`130057`: 在 :program:`pygettext.py` 中添加对翻译者注释的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:4334
msgid ""
":gh:`130025`: The iOS testbed now correctly handles symlinks used as Python "
"framework references."
msgstr ":gh:`130025`: 现在 iOS testbed 可正确地处理被用作 Python 框架引用的符号链接。"

#: ../NEWS:4337
msgid ""
":gh:`129911`: Fix the keyword entry in the help output of "
":program:`pygettext`."
msgstr ":gh:`129911`: 修复 :program:`pygettext` 帮助输出中的关键词条目。"

#: ../NEWS:4343
msgid ""
":gh:`129200`: Multiple iOS testbed runners can now be started at the same "
"time without introducing an ambiguity over simulator ownership."
msgstr ":gh:`129200`: 多个 iOS testbed 运行器现在可以同时启动而不会导致模拟器所有权的歧义。"

#: ../NEWS:4346
msgid ""
":gh:`130292`: The iOS testbed will now run successfully on a machine that "
"has not previously run Xcode tests (such as CI configurations)."
msgstr ":gh:`130292`: 现在 iOS testbed 将能在之前未运行过 Xcode 测试（如 CI 配置）的机器上成功运行。"

#: ../NEWS:4349
msgid ""
":gh:`130293`: The tests of terminal colorization are no longer sensitive to "
"the value of the ``TERM`` variable in the testing environment."
msgstr ":gh:`130293`: 终端彩色测试对于测试环境中的 ``TERM`` 变量将不再敏感。"

#: ../NEWS:4352
msgid ""
":gh:`129401`: Fix a flaky test in ``test_repr_rlock`` that checks the "
"representation of :class:`multiprocessing.RLock`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129401`: 修复 ``test_repr_rlock`` 中检查 :class:`multiprocessing.RLock` "
"表示的脆弱测试。"

#: ../NEWS:4355
msgid ":gh:`126332`: Add unit tests for pyrepl."
msgstr ":gh:`126332`: 增加了针对 pyrepl 的单元测试。"

#: ../NEWS:4360
msgid ""
":gh:`127371`: Avoid unbounded buffering for "
":meth:`!tempfile.SpooledTemporaryFile.writelines`. Previously, disk "
"spillover was only checked after the lines iterator had been exhausted. This"
" is now done after each line is written."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127371`: 避免了对 :meth:`!tempfile.SpooledTemporaryFile.writelines` 的无限缓冲。 "
"在之前版本中，磁盘溢出仅并在行迭代器已耗尽之后才会被检查。 现在在每行写入之后都会进行。"

#: ../NEWS:4368
msgid ""
":gh:`131204`: Use monospace font from System Font Stack for cross-platform "
"support in :class:`difflib.HtmlDiff`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`131204`: 在 :class:`difflib.HtmlDiff` 中将使用来自 System Font Stack "
"的等宽字体以提供跨平台支持。for cross-platform support ."

#: ../NEWS:4371
msgid ""
":gh:`131196`: Improve performance of :attr:`uuid.UUID.hex` and "
":meth:`uuid.UUID.__str__ <object.__str__>`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`131196`: 提高 :attr:`uuid.UUID.hex` 和 :meth:`uuid.UUID.__str__ "
"<object.__str__>` 的性能。"

#: ../NEWS:4374
msgid ""
":gh:`130940`: The behavior of ``PyConfig.use_system_logger`` was modified to"
" be enabled by default on iOS. It remains disabled by default on macOS."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130940`: 修改了 ``PyConfig.use_system_logger`` 的行为，在 iOS 上默认启用。在 macOS "
"上默认仍为禁用。"

#: ../NEWS:4377
msgid ""
":gh:`131123`: Supported completions for attributes of convenience variables "
"in :mod:`pdb`."
msgstr ":gh:`131123`: 支持在 :mod:`pdb` 中为便利变量的属性提供补全。"

#: ../NEWS:4380
msgid ""
":gh:`93096`: Removed undocumented CLI ``python -m difflib``. Use ``python -m"
" doctest Lib/difflib.py -v`` instead. Patch by Semyon Moroz."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93096`: 移除了未记录的 CLI ``python -m difflib``。改用 ``python -m doctest "
"Lib/difflib.py -v``。由 Semyon Moroz 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4383
msgid ""
":gh:`93096`: Removed undocumented ``-t`` and ``-v`` arguments of ``python -m"
" pickle``. Use ``python -m doctest Lib/pickle.py -v`` instead. Patch by "
"Semyon Moroz."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93096`: 移除了 ``python -m pickle`` 的未记录 ``-t`` 和 ``-v`` 参数。改用 ``python -m"
" doctest Lib/pickle.py -v``。由 Semyon Moroz 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4387
msgid ""
":gh:`81267`: Correct :func:`time.sleep` error message when an object that "
"cannot be interpreted as an integer or float is provided."
msgstr ":gh:`81267`: 当提供无法解释为整数或浮点的对象时，更正 :func:`time.sleep` 的错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:4390
msgid ""
":gh:`93096`: Removed undocumented ``-t`` and ``-v`` arguments of ``python -m"
" pickletools``. Use ``python -m doctest Lib/pickletools.py -v`` instead. "
"Patch by Semyon Moroz."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93096`: 移除了 ``python -m pickletools`` 的未记录 ``-t`` 和 ``-v`` 参数。改用 "
"``python -m doctest Lib/pickletools.py -v``。由 Semyon Moroz 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4394
msgid ""
":gh:`131045`: Fix issue with ``__contains__``, values, and pseudo-members "
"for :class:`enum.Flag`."
msgstr ":gh:`131045`: 修复 :class:`enum.Flag` 的 ``__contains__``、值以及伪成员问题。"

#: ../NEWS:4397
msgid ""
":gh:`130959`: Fix pure-Python implementation of "
":func:`datetime.time.fromisoformat` to reject times with spaces in "
"fractional part (for example, ``12:34:56.400 +02:00``), matching the C "
"implementation. Patch by Michał Gorny."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130959`: 修复了 :func:`datetime.time.fromisoformat` 的纯 Python "
"实现以拒绝小数部分带有空格的时间值 (例如 ``12:34:56.400 +02:00``)，以与 C 实现相匹配。 由 Michał Gorny "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4402
msgid ""
":gh:`130806`: Deleting :class:`gzip.GzipFile` before it is closed now emits "
"a :exc:`ResourceWarning`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130806`: 在 :class:`gzip.GzipFile` 关闭之前删除它现在会发出 :exc:`ResourceWarning`。"

#: ../NEWS:4405
msgid ""
":gh:`130637`: Add validation for numeric response data in poplib.POP3.stat()"
" method"
msgstr ":gh:`130637`: 在 poplib.POP3.stat() 方法中添加对数值响应数据的验证"

#: ../NEWS:4408
msgid ""
":gh:`130665`: Only apply locale to :ref:`calendar CLI <calendar-cli>` when "
"set via ``--locale`` and not via ``LANG`` environment variable."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130665`: 仅在通过 ``--locale`` 设置而非 ``LANG`` 环境变量时，将区域设置应用于 :ref:`calendar "
"CLI <calendar-cli>`。"

#: ../NEWS:4411
msgid ""
":gh:`130660`: ``sys.ps1`` and ``sys.ps2`` are now restored after "
":func:`code.interact` call."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130660`: 在调用 :func:`code.interact` 后，现在会恢复 ``sys.ps1`` 和 ``sys.ps2``。"

#: ../NEWS:4414
msgid ""
":gh:`130608`: Remove *dirs_exist_ok* argument from :meth:`pathlib.Path.copy`"
" and :meth:`~pathlib.Path.copy_into`. These methods are new in Python 3.14."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130608`: 从 :meth:`pathlib.Path.copy` 和 :meth:`~pathlib.Path.copy_into` "
"中移除了 *dirs_exist_ok* 参数。这些方法是 Python 3.14 中新增的。"

#: ../NEWS:4417
msgid ""
":gh:`130461`: Remove ``.. index::`` directives from the :mod:`uuid` module "
"documentation. These directives previously created entries in the general "
"index for :func:`~uuid.getnode` as well as the :func:`~uuid.uuid1`, "
":func:`~uuid.uuid3`, :func:`~uuid.uuid4`, :func:`~uuid.uuid5`, and "
":func:`~uuid.uuid8` constructor functions."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130461`: 从 :mod:`uuid` 模块文档中移除了 ``.. index::`` 指令。这些指令之前为 "
":func:`~uuid.getnode` 以及 "
":func:`~uuid.uuid1`、:func:`~uuid.uuid3`、:func:`~uuid.uuid4`、:func:`~uuid.uuid5`"
" 和 :func:`~uuid.uuid8` 构造函数在通用索引中创建了条目。"

#: ../NEWS:4423
msgid ""
":gh:`130379`: The zipapp module now calculates the list of files to be added"
" to the archive before creating the archive. This avoids accidentally "
"including the target when it is being created in the source directory."
msgstr ":gh:`130379`: zipapp 模块现在在创建存档之前计算要添加到存档中的文件列表。这避免了当目标在源目录中创建时意外包含它。"

#: ../NEWS:4427
msgid ""
":gh:`82987`: Inline breakpoints like :func:`breakpoint` or "
":func:`pdb.set_trace` will always stop the program at calling frame, "
"ignoring the ``skip`` pattern (if any)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`82987`: 像 :func:`breakpoint` 或 :func:`pdb.set_trace` "
"这样的内联断点将始终在调用帧处停止程序，忽略 ``skip`` 模式（如果有的话）。"

#: ../NEWS:4431
msgid ""
":gh:`125377`: ``<tab>`` at the beginning of the line in :mod:`pdb` multi-"
"line input will fill in a 4-space indentation now, instead of inserting a "
"``\\t`` character."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125377`: 在 :mod:`pdb` 多行输入中，行首的 ``<tab>`` 现在会填充 4 个空格的缩进，而不是插入一个 "
"``\\t`` 字符。"

#: ../NEWS:4435
msgid ""
":gh:`125413`: Ensure the path returned from :meth:`pathlib.Path.copy` or "
":meth:`~pathlib.Path.move` has fresh :attr:`~pathlib.Path.info`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125413`: 确保从 :meth:`pathlib.Path.copy` 或 :meth:`~pathlib.Path.move` "
"返回的路径具有新鲜的 :attr:`~pathlib.Path.info`。"

#: ../NEWS:4438
msgid ""
":gh:`65697`: stdlib configparser will now attempt to validate that keys it "
"writes will not result in file corruption (creating a file unable to be "
"accurately parsed by a future read() call from the same parser). Attempting "
"a corrupting write() will raise an InvalidWriteError."
msgstr ""
":gh:`65697`: 标准库 configparser 现在会尝试验证其写入的键不会导致文件损坏（创建的文件无法被同一解析器的未来 read() "
"调用准确解析）。尝试进行损坏的 write() 将引发 InvalidWriteError。"

#: ../NEWS:4443
msgid ""
":gh:`125413`: Speed up :meth:`Path.copy <pathlib.Path.copy>` by making "
"better use of :attr:`~pathlib.Path.info` internally."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125413`: 通过内部更好地利用 :attr:`~pathlib.Path.info`，加速 :meth:`Path.copy "
"<pathlib.Path.copy>`。"

#: ../NEWS:4446
msgid ""
":gh:`130285`: Fix corner case for :func:`random.sample` allowing the "
"*counts* parameter to specify an empty population. So now, ``sample([], 0, "
"counts=[])`` and ``sample('abc', k=0, counts=[0, 0, 0])`` both give the same"
" result as ``sample([], 0)``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130285`: 修复了 :func:`random.sample` 的一个边缘情况，允许 *counts* "
"参数指定一个空的总数。现在，``sample([], 0, counts=[])`` 和 ``sample('abc', k=0, counts=[0,"
" 0, 0])`` 都会给出与 ``sample([], 0)`` 相同的结果。"

#: ../NEWS:4451
msgid ""
":gh:`124703`: Executing ``quit`` command in :mod:`pdb` will raise "
":exc:`bdb.BdbQuit` when :mod:`pdb` is started from an interactive console "
"using :func:`breakpoint` or :func:`pdb.set_trace`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`124703`: 在交互式控制台中使用 :func:`breakpoint` 或 :func:`pdb.set_trace` 启动 "
":mod:`pdb` 时，执行 ``quit`` 命令会引发 :exc:`bdb.BdbQuit`。"

#: ../NEWS:4455
msgid ""
":gh:`107773`: Make :mod:`datetime` subclass :meth:`~object.__repr__` "
"consistent both implementations. Patch by Semyon Moroz."
msgstr ""
":gh:`107773`: 使 :mod:`datetime` 子类的 :meth:`~object.__repr__` 在两个实现中保持一致。补丁由 "
"Semyon Moroz 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:4458
msgid ":gh:`130250`: Fix regression in ``traceback.print_last()``."
msgstr ":gh:`130250`: 修复 ``traceback.print_last()`` 中的回归问题。"

#: ../NEWS:4460
msgid ""
":gh:`123471`: Make concurrent iterations over :class:`itertools.batched` "
"safe under free-threading."
msgstr ":gh:`123471`: 在自由线程下使 :class:`itertools.batched` 的并发迭代安全。"

#: ../NEWS:4463
msgid ""
":gh:`57537`: Support breakpoints for :mod:`zipimport` modules on :mod:`pdb`"
msgstr ":gh:`57537`: 支持在 :mod:`pdb` 中为 :mod:`zipimport` 模块设置断点"

#: ../NEWS:4465
msgid ""
":gh:`130230`: Fix crash in :func:`pow` with only :class:`~decimal.Decimal` "
"third argument."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130230`: 修复仅使用 :class:`~decimal.Decimal` 作为第三个参数时 :func:`pow` 的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:4468
msgid ""
":gh:`126944`: Show explicit errors when required arguments of :mod:`pdb` "
"commands are missing"
msgstr ":gh:`126944`: 当 :mod:`pdb` 命令缺少必要参数时显示明确的错误"

#: ../NEWS:4471
msgid ""
":gh:`127750`: Improve repr of :class:`functools.singledispatchmethod` "
"methods and descriptors."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127750`: 改进 :class:`functools.singledispatchmethod` 方法和描述符的 repr。"

#: ../NEWS:4474
msgid ""
":gh:`128520`: Apply type conversion consistently in "
":class:`pathlib.PurePath` and :class:`~pathlib.Path` methods can accept a "
"path object as an argument, such as :meth:`~pathlib.PurePath.match` and "
":meth:`~pathlib.Path.rename`. The argument is now converted to path object "
"if it lacks a :meth:`~pathlib.PurePath.with_segments` attribute, and not "
"otherwise."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128520`: 在 :class:`pathlib.PurePath` 和 :class:`~pathlib.Path` "
"方法中一致应用类型转换，可以接受路径对象作为参数，如 :meth:`~pathlib.PurePath.match` 和 "
":meth:`~pathlib.Path.rename`。如果参数缺少 :meth:`~pathlib.PurePath.with_segments` "
"属性，现在会将其转换为路径对象，否则不会。"

#: ../NEWS:4481
msgid ""
":gh:`118761`: Reverts a change in the previous release attempting to make "
"some stdlib imports used within the :mod:`subprocess` module lazy as this "
"was causing errors during ``__del__`` finalizers calling methods such as "
"``terminate``, or ``kill``, or ``send_signal``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118761`: 撤销上一个版本中的更改，该更改尝试使 :mod:`subprocess` 模块内使用的一些 stdlib "
"导入变为懒加载，因为这会导致在 ``__del__`` 终结器中调用诸如 ``terminate``、``kill`` 或 "
"``send_signal`` 等方法时出现错误。"

#: ../NEWS:4486
msgid ""
":gh:`130164`: Fixed failure to raise :exc:`TypeError` in "
":meth:`inspect.Signature.bind` for positional-only arguments provided by "
"keyword when a variadic keyword argument (e.g. ``**kwargs``) is present."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130164`: 修复了当存在可变关键字参数 (即 ``**kwargs``) 时在 "
":meth:`inspect.Signature.bind` 中以关键字形式提供仅限位置参数不会引发 :exc:`TypeError` 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:4490
msgid ""
":gh:`130151`: Fix reference leaks in :func:`!_hashlib.hmac_new` and "
":func:`!_hashlib.hmac_digest`. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130151`: 修复 :func:`!_hashlib.hmac_new` 和 :func:`!_hashlib.hmac_digest` "
"中的引用泄漏。由 Bénédikt Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4493
msgid ""
":gh:`130145`: Fix :meth:`!asyncio.AbstractEventloop.run_forever` when "
"another loop is already running."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130145`: 修复当另一个循环已经在运行时 :meth:`!asyncio.AbstractEventloop.run_forever` "
"的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:4496
msgid ""
":gh:`130139`: Fix bug where :func:`ast.parse` did not error on AST input "
"which is not of the correct type, when called with optimize=False."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130139`: 修复当调用 optimize=False 时，:func:`ast.parse` 对不正确类型的 AST 输入未报错的 "
"bug。"

#: ../NEWS:4499
msgid ""
":gh:`127260`: Forbid the use of colon (\":\") as a fractional component "
"separator and other improvements to the consistency of error raising between"
" the C and Python implementations of :meth:`datetime.time.fromisoformat` and"
" :meth:`datetime.datetime.fromisoformat`. Patch by Semyon Moroz."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127260`: 禁止使用冒号(\":\")作为分数分隔符，并改进 :meth:`datetime.time.fromisoformat` 和"
" :meth:`datetime.datetime.fromisoformat` 的C和Python实现之间错误抛出的一致性。由Semyon "
"Moroz提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4505
msgid ""
":gh:`85795`: Using :func:`super` and ``__class__`` :term:`closure variable` "
"in user-defined methods of :class:`typing.NamedTuple` subclasses is now "
"explicitly prohibited at runtime. Contributed by Bartosz Sławecki in "
":gh:`130082`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`85795`: 现在在运行时明确禁止在 :class:`typing.NamedTuple` 子类的用户定义方法中使用 "
":func:`super` 和 ``__class__`` 闭包变量`。由Bartosz Sławecki在 :gh:`130082` 中贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:4510
msgid ""
":gh:`118761`: Improve import time of :mod:`cmd` by lazy importing "
":mod:`inspect` and removing :mod:`string`. Patch by Semyon Moroz."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118761`: 通过懒加载 :mod:`inspect` 和移除 :mod:`string` 来提高 :mod:`cmd` "
"的导入时间。补丁由Semyon Moroz提供。"

#: ../NEWS:4513
msgid ""
":gh:`129726`: Fix :class:`gzip.GzipFile` raising an unraisable exception "
"during garbage collection when referring to a temporary object by breaking "
"the reference loop with :mod:`weakref`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129726`: 通过使用 :mod:`weakref` 打破引用循环，修复 :class:`gzip.GzipFile` "
"在垃圾收集时引用临时对象抛出无法处理的异常的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:4517
msgid ""
":gh:`127750`: Remove broken :func:`functools.singledispatchmethod` caching "
"introduced in :gh:`85160`. Achieve the same performance using different "
"optimization."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127750`: 移除在 :gh:`85160` 中引入的有问题的 "
":func:`functools.singledispatchmethod` 缓存。通过不同的优化实现相同的性能。"

#: ../NEWS:4521
msgid ""
":gh:`129948`: Add support for shared :class:`set` to "
":class:`multiprocessing.managers.SyncManager` via :meth:`SyncManager.set() "
"<multiprocessing.managers.SyncManager.set>`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129948`: 通过 :meth:`SyncManager.set() "
"<multiprocessing.managers.SyncManager.set>` 为 "
":class:`multiprocessing.managers.SyncManager` 添加对共享 :class:`set` 的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:4525
msgid ""
":gh:`129965`: Update MIME types for ``.avi`` and ``.wav``. Add MIME types "
"for ``.docx``, ``.pptx``, ``.xlsx``, ``.epub``, ``.flac``, ``.m4a``, "
"``.odg``, ``.odp``, ``.ods``, ``.odt``, ``.oga``, ``.ogg``, ``.ogx`` and "
"``.weba``. Patch by Hugo van Kemenade."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129965`: 更新 ``.avi`` 和 ``.wav`` 的MIME类型。为 "
"``.docx``、``.pptx``、``.xlsx``、``.epub``、``.flac``、``.m4a``、``.odg``、``.odp``、``.ods``、``.odt``、``.oga``、``.ogg``、``.ogx``和"
" ``.weba`` 添加MIME类型。由Hugo van Kemenade提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4530
msgid ""
":gh:`129889`: Support context manager protocol by "
":class:`contextvars.Token`. Patch by Andrew Svetlov."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129889`: 通过 :class:`contextvars.Token` 支持上下文管理器协议。补丁由Andrew Svetlov提供。"

#: ../NEWS:4533
msgid ""
":gh:`97850`: Update the deprecation warning of "
":meth:`importlib.abc.Loader.load_module`."
msgstr ":gh:`97850`: 更新 :meth:`importlib.abc.Loader.load_module` 的弃用警告。"

#: ../NEWS:4536
msgid ""
":gh:`129678`: :class:`configparser.ConfigParser`: do not write an empty "
"unnamed section"
msgstr ":gh:`129678`: :class:`configparser.ConfigParser`: 不写入未命名的空节"

#: ../NEWS:4539
msgid ""
":gh:`128641`: Restore :meth:`configparser.ConfigParser.read` performance."
msgstr ":gh:`128641`: 恢复 :meth:`configparser.ConfigParser.read` 的性能。"

#: ../NEWS:4541
msgid ""
":gh:`129569`: Fix :func:`unicodedata.normalize` to always return a built-in "
":class:`str` object when given an input of a :class:`str` subclass, "
"regardless of whether the string is already normalized."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129569`: 修复 :func:`unicodedata.normalize`，使其在输入为 :class:`str` "
"子类时，无论字符串是否已经规范化，总是返回一个内置的 :class:`str` 对象。"

#: ../NEWS:4545
msgid ""
":gh:`128231`: Execution of multiple statements in the new REPL now stops "
"immediately upon the first exception encountered. Patch by Bartosz Sławecki."
msgstr ":gh:`128231`: 在新的REPL中执行多条语句时，现在会在遇到第一个异常时立即停止。由Bartosz Sławecki提交补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4549
msgid ""
":gh:`96092`: Fix bug in :func:`traceback.walk_stack` called with None where "
"it was skipping more frames than in prior versions. This bug fix also "
"changes walk_stack to walk the stack in the frame where it was called rather"
" than where it first gets used."
msgstr ""
":gh:`96092`: 修复了当使用None调用 :func:`traceback.walk_stack` "
"时，它跳过的帧比之前版本多的bug。这个错误修复还改变了walk_stack的行为，使其在调用它的帧中遍历堆栈，而不是在它首次被使用的地方。"

#: ../NEWS:4554
msgid ""
":gh:`129288`: Add optional ``l2_cid`` and ``l2_bdaddr_type`` fields to "
":mod:`socket` ``BTPROTO_L2CAP`` sockaddr tuple."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129288`: 向 :mod:`socket` ``BTPROTO_L2CAP`` sockaddr元组添加了可选的 ``l2_cid`` "
"和``l2_bdaddr_type`` 字段。"

#: ../NEWS:4557
msgid ""
":gh:`128703`: Fix :func:`mimetypes.guess_type` to use default mapping for "
"empty ``Content-Type`` in registry."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128703`: 修复 :func:`mimetypes.guess_type` 在注册表中对空的 ``Content-Type`` "
"使用默认映射。"

#: ../NEWS:4560
msgid ""
":gh:`128647`: Eagerly write to buffers passed to :class:`gzip.GzipFile`'s "
":meth:`~io.BufferedIOBase.readinto` and :meth:`~io.BufferedIOBase.readinto1`"
" implementations, avoiding unnecessary allocations. Patch by Chris "
"Markiewicz."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128647`: 急切地写入传递给 :class:`gzip.GzipFile` 的 "
":meth:`~io.BufferedIOBase.readinto` 和 :meth:`~io.BufferedIOBase.readinto1` "
"实现的缓冲区，避免不必要的分配。由Chris Markiewicz提交补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4565
msgid ""
":gh:`128184`: Improve display of :class:`annotationlib.ForwardRef` object "
"within :class:`inspect.Signature` representations. This also fixes a "
":exc:`NameError` that was raised when using :func:`dataclasses.dataclass` on"
" classes with unresolvable forward references."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128184`: 改进了 :class:`annotationlib.ForwardRef` 对象在 "
":class:`inspect.Signature` 表示中的显示。这也修复了在使用 :func:`dataclasses.dataclass` "
"对具有不可解析前向引用的类时引发的 :exc:`NameError`。"

#: ../NEWS:4570
msgid ""
":gh:`128041`: Add "
":meth:`concurrent.futures.ProcessPoolExecutor.terminate_workers` and "
":meth:`concurrent.futures.ProcessPoolExecutor.kill_workers` as ways to "
"terminate or kill all living worker processes in the given pool. "
"(Contributed by Charles Machalow in :gh:`130849`.)"
msgstr ""
":gh:`128041`: 添加了 "
":meth:`concurrent.futures.ProcessPoolExecutor.terminate_workers` 和 "
":meth:`concurrent.futures.ProcessPoolExecutor.kill_workers` "
"作为终止或杀死给定池中所有存活工作进程的方法。（由Charles Machalow在 :gh:`130849` 中贡献。）"

#: ../NEWS:4576
msgid ""
":gh:`127647`: Add protocols :class:`io.Reader` and :class:`io.Writer` as "
"alternatives to :class:`typing.IO`, :class:`typing.TextIO`, and "
":class:`typing.BinaryIO`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127647`: 添加了协议 :class:`io.Reader` 和 :class:`io.Writer` 作为 "
":class:`typing.IO`、:class:`typing.TextIO` 和 :class:`typing.BinaryIO` 的替代品。"

#: ../NEWS:4580
msgid ""
":gh:`109798`: Added additional information into error messages in "
":mod:`datetime`, and made the messages more consistent between the C and "
"Python implementations. Patch by Semyon Moroz."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109798`: 在 :mod:`datetime` 的错误消息中添加了额外信息，并使C和Python实现之间的消息更加一致。由Semyon "
"Moroz提交补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4584
msgid ""
":gh:`125746`: Delay deprecated :meth:`zipimport.zipimporter.load_module` "
"removal time to 3.15. Use :meth:`zipimport.zipimporter.exec_module` instead."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125746`: 将已被弃用的 :meth:`zipimport.zipimporter.load_module` 移除时间推迟到 3.15。"
" 请改用 :meth:`zipimport.zipimporter.exec_module`。"

#: ../NEWS:4588
msgid ""
":gh:`74028`: Add the optional ``buffersize`` parameter to "
":meth:`concurrent.futures.Executor.map` to limit the number of submitted "
"tasks whose results have not yet been yielded. If the buffer is full, "
"iteration over the *iterables* pauses until a result is yielded from the "
"buffer."
msgstr ""
":gh:`74028`: 为 :meth:`concurrent.futures.Executor.map` 添加了可选的 ``buffersize``"
" 参数，以限制尚未产生结果的已提交任务的数量。如果缓冲区已满，对 *iterables* 的迭代将暂停，直到从缓冲区产生一个结果。"

#: ../NEWS:4594
msgid ""
":gh:`124927`: Non-printing characters are now properly handled in the new "
"REPL."
msgstr ":gh:`124927`: 现在在新的 REPL 中正确处理非打印字符。"

#: ../NEWS:4597
msgid ""
":gh:`124096`: Turn on virtual terminal mode and enable bracketed paste in "
"REPL on Windows console. (If the terminal does not support bracketed paste, "
"enabling it does nothing.)"
msgstr ""
":gh:`124096`: 在 Windows 控制台的 REPL 中开启虚拟终端模式并启用括号粘贴。（如果终端不支持括号粘贴，启用它不会有任何效果。）"

#: ../NEWS:4601
msgid ""
":gh:`89083`: Add :func:`uuid.uuid7` for generating UUIDv7 objects as "
"specified in :rfc:`9562`. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`89083`: 添加 :func:`uuid.uuid7` 以生成 :rfc:`9562` 中指定的 UUIDv7 对象。由 Bénédikt"
" Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4604
msgid ""
":gh:`89083`: Add :func:`uuid.uuid6` for generating UUIDv6 objects as "
"specified in :rfc:`9562`. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`89083`: 添加 :func:`uuid.uuid6` 以生成 :rfc:`9562` 中指定的 UUIDv6 对象。由 Bénédikt"
" Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4607
msgid ""
":gh:`117151`: Increase ``io.DEFAULT_BUFFER_SIZE`` from 8k to 128k and adjust"
" :func:`open` on platforms where :meth:`os.fstat` provides a ``st_blksize`` "
"field (such as Linux) to use ``max(min(blocksize, 8 MiB), "
"io.DEFAULT_BUFFER_SIZE)`` rather than always using the device block size. "
"This should improve I/O performance. Patch by Romain Morotti."
msgstr ""
":gh:`117151`: 将 ``io.DEFAULT_BUFFER_SIZE`` 从 8k 增加到 128k，并在 :meth:`os.fstat`"
" 提供 ``st_blksize`` 字段的平台（如 Linux）上调整 :func:`open`，使用 ``max(min(blocksize, 8 "
"MiB), io.DEFAULT_BUFFER_SIZE)`` 而不是总是使用设备块大小。这应该能提高 I/O 性能。由 Romain Morotti "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4613
msgid ""
":gh:`105499`: Make :class:`types.UnionType` an alias for "
":class:`typing.Union`. Both ``int | str`` and ``Union[int, str]`` now create"
" instances of the same type. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105499`: 使 :class:`types.UnionType` 成为 :class:`typing.Union` 的别名。现在 "
"``int | str`` 和 ``Union[int, str]`` 都创建相同类型的实例。由 Jelle Zijlstra 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4617
msgid ""
":gh:`93096`: Document the command-line for :mod:`mimetypes`. It now exits "
"with ``1`` on failure instead of ``0`` and ``2`` on incorrect command-line "
"parameters instead of ``1``. Also, errors are printed to stderr instead of "
"stdout and their text is made tighter. Patch by Oleg Iarygin and Hugo van "
"Kemenade."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93096`: 记录了 :mod:`mimetypes` 的命令行。现在在失败时退出码为 ``1`` 而不是 "
"``0``，在命令行参数不正确时退出码为 ``2`` 而不是 ``1``。此外，错误信息被打印到 stderr 而不是 "
"stdout，并且它们的文本更加紧凑。由 Oleg Iarygin 和 Hugo van Kemenade 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4626
msgid ""
":gh:`125722`: Require Sphinx 8.2.0 or later to build the Python "
"documentation. Patch by Adam Turner."
msgstr ":gh:`125722`: 构建 Python 文档需要 Sphinx 8.2.0 或更高版本。由 Adam Turner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4629
msgid ""
":gh:`129712`: The wheel tags supported by each macOS universal SDK option "
"are now documented."
msgstr ":gh:`129712`: 现在记录了每个 macOS 通用 SDK 选项支持的 wheel 标签。"

#: ../NEWS:4632
msgid ""
":gh:`46236`: C API: Document :c:func:`PyUnicode_RSplit`, "
":c:func:`PyUnicode_Partition` and :c:func:`PyUnicode_RPartition`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`46236`: C API: 文档化了 "
":c:func:`PyUnicode_RSplit`、:c:func:`PyUnicode_Partition` 和 "
":c:func:`PyUnicode_RPartition`。"

#: ../NEWS:4638
msgid ""
":gh:`131141`: Fix data race in :data:`sys.monitoring` instrumentation while "
"registering callback."
msgstr ":gh:`131141`: 修复在注册回调时 :data:`sys.monitoring` 插桩中的数据竞争问题。"

#: ../NEWS:4641
msgid ""
":gh:`130804`: Fix support of unicode characters on Windows in the new REPL."
msgstr ":gh:`130804`: 修复新REPL中在Windows上对Unicode字符的支持问题。"

#: ../NEWS:4643
msgid ""
":gh:`130932`: Fix incorrect exception handling in "
"``_PyModule_IsPossiblyShadowing``"
msgstr ":gh:`130932`: 修复 ``_PyModule_IsPossiblyShadowing`` 中错误的异常处理"

#: ../NEWS:4646
msgid ""
":gh:`122029`: :func:`sys.setprofile` and :func:`sys.settrace` will not "
"generate a ``c_call`` event for ``INSTRUMENTED_CALL_FUNCTION_EX`` if the "
"callable is a method with a C function wrapped, because we do not generate "
"``c_return`` event in such case."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122029`: :func:`sys.setprofile` 和 :func:`sys.settrace` 不会为 "
"``INSTRUMENTED_CALL_FUNCTION_EX`` 生成 ``c_call`` "
"事件，如果可调用对象是一个包装了C函数的方法，因为在这种情况下我们不会生成 ``c_return`` 事件。"

#: ../NEWS:4651
msgid ""
":gh:`129964`: Fix JIT crash on Windows on Arm. Patch by Diego Russo and "
"Brandt Bucher."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129964`: 修复Windows on Arm上的JIT崩溃问题。由Diego Russo和Brandt Bucher提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4654
msgid ""
":gh:`130851`: Fix a crash in the :term:`free threading` build when "
"constructing a :class:`code` object with :attr:`~codeobject.co_consts` that "
"contains instances of types that are not otherwise generated by the bytecode"
" compiler."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130851`: 修复在 :term:`free threading` 构建中，当构造一个包含非字节码编译器生成类型实例的 "
":attr:`~codeobject.co_consts` 的 :class:`code` 对象时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:4659
msgid ""
":gh:`128534`: Ensure that both left and right branches have the same source "
"for ``async for`` loops. Add these branches to the ``co_branches()`` "
"iterator."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128534`: 确保 ``async for`` 循环的左右分支具有相同的源。将这些分支添加到 ``co_branches()`` "
"迭代器中。"

#: ../NEWS:4663
msgid ""
":gh:`130794`: Fix memory leak in the :term:`free threaded <free threading>` "
"build when resizing a shared list or dictionary from multiple short-lived "
"threads."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130794`: 修复在 :term:`自由线程 <free threading>` "
"构建中，当从多个短生命周期线程调整共享列表或字典大小时的内存泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:4667
msgid ""
":gh:`130415`: Improve JIT understanding of integers in boolean context."
msgstr ":gh:`130415`: 提高JIT对布尔上下文中整数的理解能力。"

#: ../NEWS:4669
msgid ""
":gh:`130382`: Fix ``PyRefTracer_DESTROY`` not being sent from "
":file:`Python/ceval.c` ``Py_DECREF()``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130382`: 修复从 :file:`Python/ceval.c` ``Py_DECREF()`` 中未发送 "
"``PyRefTracer_DESTROY`` 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:4672
msgid ":gh:`130574`: Renumber :opcode:`RESUME` from 149 to 128."
msgstr ":gh:`130574`: 将 :opcode:`RESUME` 的编号从149更改为128。"

#: ../NEWS:4674
msgid ""
":gh:`124878`: Fix race conditions during runtime finalization that could "
"lead to accessing freed memory."
msgstr ":gh:`124878`: 修复运行时结束期间可能导致访问已释放内存的竞争条件。"

#: ../NEWS:4677
msgid ""
":gh:`130415`: Improve the experimental JIT's ability to narrow boolean "
"values based on the results of truthiness tests."
msgstr ":gh:`130415`: 提高实验性JIT基于真值测试结果缩小布尔值范围的能力。"

#: ../NEWS:4680
msgid ""
":gh:`130618`: Fix a bug that was causing ``UnicodeDecodeError`` or "
"``SystemError`` to be raised when using f-strings with ``lambda`` "
"expressions with non-ASCII characters. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`130618`: 修复一个在使用带有非ASCII字符的 ``lambda`` 表达式的f-字符串时引发 "
"``UnicodeDecodeError`` 或 ``SystemError`` 的bug。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:4684
msgid ""
":gh:`123044`: Make sure that the location of branch targets in ``match`` "
"cases is in the body, not the pattern."
msgstr ":gh:`123044`: 确保 ``match`` 情况中分支目标的位置在主体中，而不是在模式中。"

#: ../NEWS:4687
msgid ""
":gh:`128534`: Add branch monitoring (``BRANCH_LEFT`` and ``BRANCH_RIGHT`` "
"events) for ``async for`` loops."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128534`: 为 ``async for`` 循环添加分支监控（``BRANCH_LEFT`` 和 ``BRANCH_RIGHT`` "
"事件）。"

#: ../NEWS:4690
msgid ""
":gh:`130163`: Fix possible crashes related to concurrent change and use of "
"the :mod:`sys` module attributes."
msgstr ":gh:`130163`: 修复与并发更改和使用 :mod:`sys` 模块属性相关的可能崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:4693
msgid ""
":gh:`122029`: ``INSTRUMENTED_CALL_KW`` will expand the method before "
"monitoring to reflect the actual behavior more accurately."
msgstr ":gh:`122029`: ``INSTRUMENTED_CALL_KW`` 将在监控之前扩展方法，以更准确地反映实际行为。"

#: ../NEWS:4696
msgid ""
":gh:`130415`: Improve JIT's ability to optimize strings in boolean contexts."
msgstr ":gh:`130415`: 提高JIT在布尔上下文中优化字符串的能力。"

#: ../NEWS:4698
msgid ""
":gh:`130396`: Use actual stack limits (from "
":manpage:`pthread_getattr_np(3)`) for linux, and other systems with "
"``_GNU_SOURCE`` defined, when determining limits for C stack protection."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130396`: 在确定C栈保护的限制时，对于linux和其他定义了 ``_GNU_SOURCE`` 的系统，使用实际的栈限制(来自 "
":manpage:`pthread_getattr_np(3)`)。"

#: ../NEWS:4702
msgid ""
":gh:`128396`: Fix a crash that occurs when calling :func:`locals` inside an "
"inline comprehension that uses the same local variable as the outer frame "
"scope where the variable is a free or cell var."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128396`: 修复在内联理解中调用 :func:`locals` "
"时发生的崩溃，该内联理解使用了与外部框架作用域相同的局部变量，其中变量是自由或单元变量。"

#: ../NEWS:4706
msgid ""
":gh:`129107`: Fix two more :class:`bytearray` functions for :term:`free "
"threading`."
msgstr ":gh:`129107`: 为 :term:`free threading` 修复两个更多的 :class:`bytearray` 函数。"

#: ../NEWS:4709
msgid ""
":gh:`127705`: Use tagged references (``_PyStackRef``) for the default build "
"as well as for the free-threading build. This has a small negative "
"performance impact short-term but will enable larger speedups in the future "
"and significantly reduce maintenance costs by allowing a single "
"implementation of tagged references in the future."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127705`: "
"为默认构建以及自由线程构建使用标记引用(``_PyStackRef``)。这在短期内会对性能有小的负面影响，但将来会实现更大的速度提升，并通过允许将来标记引用的单一实现显著降低维护成本。"

#: ../NEWS:4715
msgid ""
":gh:`130094`: Fix two race conditions involving concurrent imports that "
"could lead to spurious failures with :exc:`ModuleNotFoundError`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130094`: 修复涉及并发导入的两个竞态条件，这些条件可能导致与 :exc:`ModuleNotFoundError` 相关的虚假失败。"

#: ../NEWS:4718
msgid ""
":gh:`129107`: Make :class:`bytearray` iterator safe under :term:`free "
"threading`."
msgstr ":gh:`129107`: 使 :class:`bytearray` 迭代器在 :term:`free threading` 下安全。"

#: ../NEWS:4721
msgid ""
":gh:`115802`: Use the more efficient \"medium\" code model for JIT-compiled "
"code on supported platforms."
msgstr ":gh:`115802`: 在支持的平台上，为JIT编译的代码使用更高效的“中等”代码模型。"

#: ../NEWS:4724
msgid ""
":gh:`107956`: A ``build-details.json`` file is now install in the platform-"
"independent standard library directory (:pep:`739` implementation)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`107956`: 现在在平台无关的标准库目录中安装了一个 ``build-details.json`` 文件(:pep:`739` 实现)。"

#: ../NEWS:4728
msgid ""
":gh:`116042`: Fix location for SyntaxErrors of invalid escapes in the "
"tokenizer. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":gh:`116042`: 修复标记器中无效转义的SyntaxErrors的位置。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:4731
msgid ""
":gh:`91079`: Change C stack overflow protection to consider the amount of "
"stack consumed, rather than a counter. This allows deeper recursion in many "
"cases, but remains safe."
msgstr ":gh:`91079`: 更改C栈溢出保护以考虑栈消耗量，而不是计数器。这在许多情况下允许更深的递归，但仍然保持安全。"

#: ../NEWS:4735
msgid ""
":gh:`129715`: Improve the experimental JIT's handling of returns to unknown "
"callers."
msgstr ":gh:`129715`: 改进实验性JIT对返回到未知调用者的处理。"

#: ../NEWS:4741
msgid ":gh:`129983`: Fix data race in compile_template in :file:`sre.c`."
msgstr ":gh:`129983`: 修复 :file:`sre.c` 中compile_template的数据竞争。"

#: ../NEWS:4746
msgid ""
":gh:`129967`: Fix a race condition in the :term:`free threading` build when "
"``repr(set)`` is called concurrently with ``set.clear()``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129967`: 修复了在 :term:`free threading` 构建中，当 ``repr(set)`` 与 "
"``set.clear()`` 并发调用时出现的竞态条件。"

#: ../NEWS:4749
msgid ""
":gh:`129953`: The internal (evaluation) stack is now spilled to memory "
"whenever execution escapes from the interpreter or JIT compiled code. This "
"should have no observable effect in either Python or builtin extensions, but"
" will allow various important optimizations in the future."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129953`: "
"现在每当执行从解释器或JIT编译代码中逃逸时，内部(评估)栈会被溢出到内存。这在Python或内置扩展中不应有可观察的影响，但将为未来各种重要的优化创造条件。"

#: ../NEWS:4754
msgid ""
":gh:`129515`: Clarify syntax error messages for conditional expressions when"
" a statement is specified before an :keyword:`if` or after an "
":keyword:`else` keyword."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129515`: 澄清了在条件表达式中，当在 :keyword:`if` 之前或 :keyword:`else` "
"关键字之后指定语句时的语法错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:4758
msgid ""
":gh:`129349`: :meth:`bytes.fromhex` and :meth:`bytearray.fromhex` now "
"accepts ASCII :class:`bytes` and :term:`bytes-like objects <bytes-like "
"object>`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129349`: :meth:`bytes.fromhex` 和 :meth:`bytearray.fromhex` 现在接受ASCII "
":class:`bytes` 和 :term:`字节类对象 <bytes-like object>`。"

#: ../NEWS:4761
msgid ""
":gh:`129149`: Add fast path for medium-size integers in "
":c:func:`PyLong_FromSsize_t`. Patch by Chris Eibl."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129149`: 在 :c:func:`PyLong_FromSsize_t` 中添加了对中等大小整数的快速路径。由Chris "
"Eibl提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4764
msgid ""
":gh:`129107`: Make the :type:`bytearray` safe under :term:`free threading`."
msgstr ":gh:`129107`: 使 :type:`bytearray` 在 :term:`free threading` 下安全。"

#: ../NEWS:4766
msgid ""
":gh:`128974`: Fix a crash in :meth:`UnicodeError.__str__ <object.__str__>` "
"when custom attributes implement :meth:`~object.__str__` with side-effects. "
"Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128974`: 修复了当自定义属性通过带有副作用的 :meth:`~object.__str__` 实现时，在 "
":meth:`UnicodeError.__str__ <object.__str__>` 中发生的崩溃。由Bénédikt Tran提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4770
msgid ""
":gh:`126085`: :class:`typing.TypeAliasType` now supports star unpacking."
msgstr ":gh:`126085`: :class:`typing.TypeAliasType` 现在支持星号解包。"

#: ../NEWS:4772
msgid ""
":gh:`125331`: ``from __future__ import barry_as_FLUFL`` now works in more "
"contexts, including when it is used in files, with the ``-c`` flag, and in "
"the REPL when there are multiple statements on the same line. Previously, it"
" worked only on subsequent lines in the REPL, and when the appropriate flags"
" were passed directly to :func:`compile`. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125331`: ``from __future__ import barry_as_FLUFL`` "
"现在在更多上下文中工作，包括在文件中使用、使用 ``-c`` "
"标志以及在REPL中同一行有多个语句时。以前，它仅在REPL的后续行中工作，并且在适当的标志直接传递给 :func:`compile` 时。由Pablo"
" Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4778
msgid ""
":gh:`121464`: Make concurrent iterations over the same :func:`enumerate` "
"iterator safe under free-threading. See `Strategy for Iterators in Free "
"Threading <https://github.com/python/cpython/issues/124397>`_."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121464`: 使同一 :func:`enumerate` 迭代器的并发迭代在自由线程下安全。参见` 自由线程中的迭代器策略 "
"<https://github.com/python/cpython/issues/124397>`_。"

#: ../NEWS:4782
msgid ""
":gh:`87790`: Support underscore and comma as thousands separators in the "
"fractional part for floating-point presentation types of the new-style "
"string formatting (with :func:`format` or :ref:`f-strings`).  Patch by "
"Sergey B Kirpichev."
msgstr ""
":gh:`87790`: 在新式字符串格式化的浮点数表示类型中（使用 :func:`format` 或 "
":ref:`f-strings`），支持下划线和逗号作为千位分隔符。由Sergey B Kirpichev提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4787
msgid ""
":gh:`124445`: Fix specialization of generic aliases that are generic over a "
":class:`typing.ParamSpec` and have been specialized with a nested type "
"variable."
msgstr ":gh:`124445`: 修复对 :class:`typing.ParamSpec` 泛型且用嵌套类型变量特化的泛型别名的特化。"

#: ../NEWS:4791
msgid ""
":gh:`120608`: Adapt :func:`reversed` for use in the free-threading build. "
"The :func:`reversed` is still not thread-safe in the sense that concurrent "
"iterations may see the same object, but they will not corrupt the "
"interpreter state."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120608`: 为自由线程构建适配 :func:`reversed`。:func:`reversed` "
"在并发迭代可能看到同一对象的意义上仍非线程安全，但不会破坏解释器状态。"

#: ../NEWS:4799
msgid ""
":gh:`100388`: Fix the ``platform._sys_version()`` method when ``__DATE__`` "
"is undefined at buildtime by changing default buildtime datetime string to "
"the UNIX epoch."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100388`: 当 ``__DATE__`` 在构建时未定义时，通过将默认构建时间日期字符串改为UNIX纪元来修复 "
"``platform._sys_version()`` 方法。"

#: ../NEWS:4806
msgid ""
":issue:`44369`: Improve syntax errors for incorrectly closed strings. Patch "
"by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":issue:`44369`: 改进错误关闭字符串的语法错误。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4812
msgid ""
":gh:`111178`: Fix :c:type:`PyCMethod` API: replace ``size_t nargs`` with "
"``Py_ssize_t nargs`` in :c:type:`PyCMethod`. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111178`: 修复 :c:type:`PyCMethod` API：在 :c:type:`PyCMethod` 中用 "
"``Py_ssize_t nargs`` 替换 ``size_t nargs``。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4815
msgid ""
":gh:`130947`: Add again :c:func:`PySequence_Fast` to the limited C API. "
"Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130947`: 再次将 :c:func:`PySequence_Fast` 添加到有限的C API中。补丁由Victor "
"Stinner提供。"

#: ../NEWS:4818 ../NEWS:5398
msgid ""
":gh:`128863`: The following private functions are deprecated and planned for"
