":c:func:`!_PyUnicodeWriter_Dealloc`: replace "
"``_PyUnicodeWriter_Dealloc(&writer)`` with "
":c:func:`PyUnicodeWriter_Discard(writer) <PyUnicodeWriter_Discard>`."
