":c:func:`!_PyUnicodeWriter_WriteChar`: 将 "
"``_PyUnicodeWriter_WriteChar(&writer, ch)`` 替换为 "
":c:func:`PyUnicodeWriter_WriteChar(writer, ch) <PyUnicodeWriter_WriteChar>`."

