#: ../NEWS:4836
msgid ""
":c:func:`!_PyUnicodeWriter_WriteSubstring`: replace "
"``_PyUnicodeWriter_WriteSubstring(&writer, str, start, end)`` with "
":c:func:`PyUnicodeWriter_WriteSubstring(writer, str, start, end) "
