#: ../NEWS:4868
msgid ""
":gh:`130090`: Building with ``PlatformToolset=ClangCL`` on Windows now "
"supports PGO (profile guided optimization). Patch by Chris Eibl with "
"invaluable support from Steve Dover."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130090`: 在Windows上使用 ``PlatformToolset=ClangCL`` "
"构建时，现在支持PGO（性能引导优化）。由Chris Eibl提供补丁，得到Steve Dover的宝贵支持。"

#: ../NEWS:4872
msgid ":gh:`129819`: Allow building the JIT with the tailcall interpreter."
msgstr ":gh:`129819`: 允许使用尾调用解释器构建JIT。"

#: ../NEWS:4874
msgid ""
":gh:`129989`: Fix a bug where the tailcall interpreter was enabled when "
"``--without-tail-call-interp`` was provided to the configure script."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129989`: 修复一个bug，其中当向配置脚本提供 ``--without-tail-call-interp`` 时，尾调用解释器被启用。"

#: ../NEWS:4877
msgid ""
":gh:`129838`: Don't redefine ``_Py_NO_SANITIZE_UNDEFINED`` when compiling "
"with a recent GCC version and undefined sanitizer enabled."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129838`: 当使用最近的GCC版本和启用未定义消毒器编译时，不重新定义``_Py_NO_SANITIZE_UNDEFINED``。"

#: ../NEWS:4880
msgid ""
":gh:`82909`: ``#pragma``-based linking with ``python3*.lib`` can now be "
"switched off with :c:expr:`Py_NO_LINK_LIB`. Patch by Jean-Christophe "
"Fillion-Robin."
msgstr ""
":gh:`82909`: 现在可以通过 :c:expr:`Py_NO_LINK_LIB` 关闭基于 ``#pragma`` 的与 "
"``python3*.lib`` 的链接。由 Jean-Christophe Fillion-Robin 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4886
msgid "Python 3.14.0 alpha 5"
msgstr "Python 3.14.0 alpha 5"

#: ../NEWS:4888
msgid "*Release date: 2025-02-11*"
msgstr "*发布日期：2025-02-11*"

#: ../NEWS:4893
msgid ":gh:`91132`: Update macOS installer to use ncurses 6.5."
msgstr ":gh:`91132`: 更新 macOS 安装程序以使用 ncurses 6.5。"

#: ../NEWS:4898
msgid ""
":gh:`129248`: The iOS test runner now strips the log prefix from each line "
"output by the test suite."
msgstr ":gh:`129248`: iOS 测试运行器现在会从测试套件的每行输出中去除日志记录前缀。"

#: ../NEWS:4901
msgid ""
":gh:`104400`: Fix several bugs in extraction by switching to an AST parser "
"in :program:`pygettext`."
msgstr ":gh:`104400`: 通过切换到 :program:`pygettext` 中的 AST 解析器来修复提取过程中的几个错误。"

#: ../NEWS:4907
msgid ""
":gh:`129386`: Add ``test.support.reset_code``, which can be used to reset "
"various bytecode-level optimizations and local instrumentation for a "
"function."
msgstr ":gh:`129386`: 添加 ``test.support.reset_code``，可用于重置函数的各种字节码级优化和本地检测。"

#: ../NEWS:4911
msgid ""
":gh:`128474`: Disable ``test_embed`` test cases that segfault on BOLT "
"instrument binaries. The tests are only disabled when BOLT is enabled."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128474`: 禁用 ``test_embed`` 测试用例，这些用例在 BOLT 检测二进制文件上会导致段错误。这些测试仅在启用 BOLT"
" 时被禁用。"

#: ../NEWS:4914
msgid ""
":gh:`128003`: Add an option ``--parallel-threads=N`` to the regression test "
"runner that runs individual tests in multiple threads in parallel in order "
"to find concurrency bugs.  Note that most of the test suite is not yet "
"reviewed for thread-safety or annotated with ``@thread_unsafe`` when "
"necessary."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128003`: 为回归测试运行器添加一个选项 ``--parallel-"
"threads=N``，该选项可以在多个线程中并行运行单个测试，以发现并发错误。请注意，大部分测试套件尚未进行线程安全审查或在必要时标注 "
"``@thread_unsafe``。"

#: ../NEWS:4923
msgid ""
":gh:`105704`: When using :func:`urllib.parse.urlsplit` and "
":func:`urllib.parse.urlparse` host parsing would not reject domain names "
"containing square brackets (``[`` and ``]``). Square brackets are only valid"
" for IPv6 and IPvFuture hosts according to `RFC 3986 Section 3.2.2 "
"<https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc3986#section-3.2.2>`__."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105704`: 当使用 :func:`urllib.parse.urlsplit` 和 "
":func:`urllib.parse.urlparse` 时主机解析将不会拒绝包含方括号 (``[`` 和 ``]``) 的主机名。 根据 `RFC "
"3986 第 3.2.2 节 <https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc3986#section-3.2.2>`__ "
"方括号仅适用于 IPv6 和 IPvFuture 主机。"

#: ../NEWS:4929
msgid ""
":gh:`126108`: Fix a possible ``NULL`` pointer dereference in "
":c:func:`!PySys_AddWarnOptionUnicode`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126108`: 修正了 :c:func:`!PySys_AddWarnOptionUnicode` 中的一个可能的 ``NULL`` "
"指针解引用。"

#: ../NEWS:4932
msgid ""
":gh:`80222`: Fix bug in the folding of quoted strings when flattening an "
"email message using a modern email policy. Previously when a quoted string "
"was folded so that it spanned more than one line, the surrounding quotes and"
" internal escapes would be omitted. This could theoretically be used to "
"spoof header lines using a carefully constructed quoted string if the "
"resulting rendered email was transmitted or re-parsed."
msgstr ""
":gh:`80222`: "
"修复在使用现代电子邮件策略扁平化电子邮件消息时引用字符串折叠的错误。之前，当一个引用字符串被折叠以至于跨越多行时，周围的引号和内部转义将被省略。理论上，如果生成的渲染电子邮件被传输或重新解析，这可能会被用来使用精心构造的引用字符串欺骗标题行。"

#: ../NEWS:4939
msgid ""
":gh:`119511`: Fix a potential denial of service in the :mod:`imaplib` "
"module. When connecting to a malicious server, it could cause an arbitrary "
"amount of memory to be allocated. On many systems this is harmless as unused"
" virtual memory is only a mapping, but if this hit a virtual address size "
"limit it could lead to a :exc:`MemoryError` or other process crash. On "
"unusual systems or builds where all allocated memory is touched and backed "
"by actual ram or storage it could've consumed resources doing so until "
"similarly crashing."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119511`: 修复 :mod:`imaplib` "
"模块中潜在的拒绝服务问题。当连接到恶意服务器时，可能导致分配任意数量的内存。在许多系统上，这是无害的，因为未使用的虚拟内存只是一个映射，但如果这达到了虚拟地址大小限制，可能会导致"
" :exc:`MemoryError` 或其他进程崩溃。在不寻常的系统或构建中，所有分配的内存都被触及并由实际 RAM "
"或存储支持，这可能会消耗资源，直到类似崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:4951
msgid ""
":gh:`129939`: Comparison pages with highlighted changes generated by the "
":class:`difflib.HtmlDiff` class now support dark mode."
msgstr ":gh:`129939`: 由 :class:`difflib.HtmlDiff` 类生成的带有高亮更改的比较页面现在支持暗模式。"

#: ../NEWS:4954
msgid ""
":gh:`129928`: Raise :exc:`sqlite3.ProgrammingError` if a user-defined SQL "
"function with invalid number of parameters is created. Patch by Erlend "
"Aasland."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129928`: 如果创建了参数数量无效的用户自定义SQL函数，则引发 "
":exc:`sqlite3.ProgrammingError`。由Erlend Aasland提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4958
msgid ":gh:`129583`: Update bundled pip to 25.0.1"
msgstr ":gh:`129583`: 将捆绑的pip更新至25.0.1版本"

#: ../NEWS:4960
msgid ""
":gh:`129766`: Fix crash in :mod:`warnings`, when calling ``_release_lock()``"
" with no existing lock."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129766`: 修复在调用 ``_release_lock()`` 时无现有锁的情况下 :mod:`warnings` 模块崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:4963
msgid ""
":gh:`129005`: ``_pyio.FileIO.readall()`` now allocates, resizes, and fills a"
" data buffer using the same algorithm ``_io.FileIO.readall()`` uses."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129005`: ``_pyio.FileIO.readall()`` 现在使用与 ``_io.FileIO.readall()`` "
"相同的算法来分配、调整大小和填充数据缓冲区。"

#: ../NEWS:4966
msgid ""
":gh:`129646`: Update the locale alias mapping in the :mod:`locale` module to"
" match the latest X Org locale alias mapping and support new locales in "
"Glibc 2.41."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129646`: 更新 :mod:`locale` 模块中的语言区域别名映射以匹配最新的 X Org 语言区域别名映射并支持 Glibc "
"2.41 中的新增语言区域。"

#: ../NEWS:4970
msgid ""
":gh:`128317`: Put CLI calendar highlighting in private class, removing "
"``highlight_day`` from public :class:`calendar.TextCalendar` API. Patch by "
"Hugo van Kemenade."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128317`: 将CLI日历高亮放入私有类中，从公共 :class:`calendar.TextCalendar` API中移除 "
"``highlight_day``。由Hugo van Kemenade提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4974
msgid ""
":gh:`129603`: Fix bugs where :class:`sqlite3.Row` objects could segfault if "
"their inherited :attr:`~sqlite3.Cursor.description` was set to ``None``. "
"Patch by Erlend Aasland."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129603`: 修复当继承的 :attr:`~sqlite3.Cursor.description` 被设置为 ``None`` 时 "
":class:`sqlite3.Row` 对象可能导致的段错误。由Erlend Aasland提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4978
msgid ""
":gh:`129559`: Add :meth:`bytearray.resize` method so :class:`bytearray` can "
"be efficiently resized in place."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129559`: 添加 :meth:`bytearray.resize` 方法，以便可以高效地原地调整 :class:`bytearray` "
"的大小。"

#: ../NEWS:4981
msgid ""
":gh:`129502`: Unlikely errors in preparing arguments for :mod:`ctypes` "
"callback are now handled in the same way as errors raised in the callback of"
" in converting the result of the callback -- using "
":func:`sys.unraisablehook` instead of :func:`sys.excepthook` and not setting"
" :data:`sys.last_exc` and other variables."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129502`: 在准备 :mod:`ctypes` "
"回调参数时不太可能发生的错误现在以与回调中引发的错误或在转换回调结果时的错误相同的方式处理——使用 :func:`sys.unraisablehook`"
" 而不是 :func:`sys.excepthook`，并且不设置 :data:`sys.last_exc` 和其他变量。"

#: ../NEWS:4987
msgid ""
":gh:`129403`: Corrected :exc:`ValueError` message for "
":class:`asyncio.Barrier` and :class:`threading.Barrier`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129403`: 修正了用于 :class:`asyncio.Barrier` 和 :class:`threading.Barrier` 的 "
":exc:`ValueError` 消息。"

#: ../NEWS:4990
msgid ""
":gh:`129409`: Fix an integer overflow in the :mod:`csv` module when writing "
"a data field larger than 2GB."
msgstr ":gh:`129409`: 修复了 :mod:`csv` 模块中当写入大于 2GB 的数据字段时的整数溢出。"

#: ../NEWS:4993
msgid ""
":gh:`126400`: Add a socket *timeout* keyword argument to "
":class:`logging.handlers.SysLogHandler`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126400`: 向 :class:`logging.handlers.SysLogHandler` 添加一个套接字 *timeout* "
"关键字参数。"

#: ../NEWS:4996
msgid ""
":gh:`118761`: Always lazy import ``warnings`` in :mod:`threading`. Patch by "
"Taneli Hukkinen."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118761`: 在 :mod:`threading` 中总是延迟导入 ``warnings``。由Taneli Hukkinen提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4999
msgid ""
":gh:`118761`: Improve import time of :mod:`subprocess` by lazy importing "
"``locale`` and ``signal``. Patch by Taneli Hukkinen."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118761`: 通过惰性导入 ``locale`` 和 ``signal`` 提升了 :mod:`subprocess` 的导入速度。 由 "
"Taneli Hukkinen 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5002
msgid ""
":gh:`129346`: In :mod:`sqlite3`, handle out-of-memory when creating user-"
"defined SQL functions."
msgstr ":gh:`129346`: 在 :mod:`sqlite3` 中，处理当创建用户自定义 SQL 函数时的内存不足问题。"

#: ../NEWS:5005
msgid ""
":gh:`129005`: Optimize ``_pyio.FileIO.readinto`` by avoiding unnecessary "
"objects and copies using :func:`os.readinto`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129005`: 通过使用 :func:`os.readinto` 避免不必要的对象和复制来优化 "
"``_pyio.FileIO.readinto``。"

#: ../NEWS:5008
msgid ""
":gh:`129195`: Support reporting call graph information from "
":func:`!asyncio.staggered.staggered_race`."
msgstr ":gh:`129195`: 支持从 :func:`!asyncio.staggered.staggered_race` 报告调用图信息。"

#: ../NEWS:5011
msgid ""
":gh:`129205`: Add :func:`os.readinto` to read into a :ref:`buffer object "
"<bufferobjects>` from a file descriptor."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129205`: 添加 :func:`os.readinto` 以从文件描述符读取到 :ref:`buffer object "
"<bufferobjects>` 中。"

#: ../NEWS:5014
msgid ""
":gh:`128772`: Fix :mod:`pydoc` for methods with the ``__module__`` attribute"
" equal to ``None``."
msgstr ":gh:`128772`: 针对 ``__module__`` 属性等于 ``None`` 的方法修正 :mod:`pydoc`。"

#: ../NEWS:5017
msgid ""
":gh:`129061`: Fix FORCE_COLOR and NO_COLOR when empty strings. Patch by Hugo"
" van Kemenade."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129061`: 修复FORCE_COLOR和NO_COLOR当为空字符串时的问题。由Hugo van Kemenade提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5020
msgid ""
":gh:`92897`: Scheduled the deprecation of the ``check_home`` argument of "
":func:`sysconfig.is_python_build` to Python 3.15."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92897`: 计划在Python 3.15中弃用 :func:`sysconfig.is_python_build` 的 "
"``check_home`` 参数。"

#: ../NEWS:5023
msgid ""
":gh:`129064`: Deprecate :func:`!sysconfig.expand_makefile_vars`, in favor of"
" using :func:`sysconfig.get_paths` with the ``vars`` argument."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129064`: 弃用 :func:`!sysconfig.expand_makefile_vars`，推荐使用带有 ``vars`` 参数的"
" :func:`sysconfig.get_paths`。"

#: ../NEWS:5026
msgid ""
":gh:`128550`: Removed an incorrect optimization relating to eager tasks in "
":class:`asyncio.TaskGroup` that resulted in cancellations being missed."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128550`: 移除了 :class:`asyncio.TaskGroup` 中关于急切任务的不正确优化，该优化导致取消操作被忽略。"

#: ../NEWS:5029
msgid ""
":gh:`128991`: Release the enter frame reference within :mod:`bdb` callback"
msgstr ":gh:`128991`: 在 :mod:`bdb` 回调中释放进入帧的引用。"

#: ../NEWS:5031
msgid ""
":gh:`118761`: Reduce import time of :mod:`pstats` and :mod:`zipfile` by up "
"to 20%, by removing unnecessary imports to :mod:`typing`. Patch by Bénédikt "
"Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118761`: 通过移除对 :mod:`typing` 的不必要导入，将 :mod:`pstats` 和 :mod:`zipfile` "
"的导入时间减少高达20%。由Bénédikt Tran提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5035
msgid ""
":gh:`128978`: Fix a :exc:`NameError` in "
":func:`!sysconfig.expand_makefile_vars`. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128978`: 修复 :func:`!sysconfig.expand_makefile_vars` 中的 "
":exc:`NameError`。由Bénédikt Tran提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5038
msgid ""
":gh:`128961`: Fix a crash when setting state on an exhausted "
":class:`array.array` iterator."
msgstr ":gh:`128961`: 修复在设置耗尽的 :class:`array.array` 迭代器状态时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:5041
msgid ""
":gh:`128894`: Fix ``traceback.TracebackException._format_syntax_error`` not "
"to fail on exceptions with custom metadata."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128894`: 修复 ``traceback.TracebackException._format_syntax_error`` "
"在包含自定义元数据的异常上不失败的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:5044
msgid ""
":gh:`128916`: Do not attempt to set ``SO_REUSEPORT`` on sockets of address "
"families other than ``AF_INET`` and ``AF_INET6``, as it is meaningless with "
"these address families, and the call with fail with Linux kernel 6.12.9 and "
"newer."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128916`: 不尝试在 ``AF_INET`` 和 ``AF_INET6`` 之外的地址族套接字上设置 "
"``SO_REUSEPORT``，因为这对这些地址族来说毫无意义，并且在Linux内核6.12.9及更新版本中调用会失败。"

#: ../NEWS:5049
msgid ""
":gh:`118761`: Improve import time of :mod:`tomllib` by removing ``typing``, "
"``string``, and ``tomllib._types`` imports. Patch by Taneli Hukkinen."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118761`: 通过移除 ``typing``、``string`` 和 ``tomllib._types`` 的导入，提高 "
":mod:`tomllib` 的导入速度。由Taneli Hukkinen提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5052
msgid ""
":gh:`128679`: :mod:`tracemalloc`: Fix race conditions when "
":func:`tracemalloc.stop` is called by a thread, while other threads are "
"tracing memory allocations. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128679`: :mod:`tracemalloc`: 当一个线程调用 :func:`tracemalloc.stop` "
"时，而其他线程正在跟踪内存分配，修复了竞争条件。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5056
msgid ":gh:`128891`: Add specialized opcodes to ``opcode.opname``."
msgstr ":gh:`128891`: 向 ``opcode.opname`` 添加专门的操作码。"

#: ../NEWS:5058
msgid ""
":gh:`118761`: Reduce import time of :mod:`gettext` by up to ten times, by "
"importing :mod:`re` on demand. In particular, ``re`` is no longer implicitly"
" exposed as ``gettext.re``. Patch by Eli Schwartz."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118761`: 通过按需导入 :mod:`re`，将 :mod:`gettext` 的导入时间减少多达十倍。特别是，``re`` "
"不再隐式暴露为 ``gettext.re``。由Eli Schwartz提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5062
msgid ""
":gh:`118761`: Reduce the import time of :mod:`optparse` when no help text is"
" printed. Patch by Eli Schwartz."
msgstr ":gh:`118761`: 在未打印帮助文本时，减少 :mod:`optparse` 的导入时间。补丁由Eli Schwartz提供。"

#: ../NEWS:5065
msgid ""
":gh:`128657`: Fix possible extra reference when using objects returned by "
":func:`hashlib.sha256` under :term:`free threading`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128657`: 修复在使用 :term:`free threading` 下由 :func:`hashlib.sha256` "
"返回的对象时可能出现的额外引用问题。"

#: ../NEWS:5068
msgid ""
":gh:`118761`: Reduce the import time of :mod:`csv` by up to five times, by "
"importing :mod:`re` on demand. In particular, ``re`` is no more implicitly "
"exposed as ``csv.re``. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118761`: 通过按需导入 :mod:`re`，将 :mod:`csv` 的导入时间最多减少五倍。特别地，``re`` 不再隐式暴露为 "
"``csv.re``。由 Bénédikt Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5072
msgid ""
":gh:`128308`: Support the *name* keyword argument for eager tasks in "
":func:`asyncio.loop.create_task`,  :func:`asyncio.create_task` and "
":func:`asyncio.TaskGroup.create_task`, by passing on all *kwargs* to the "
"task factory set by :func:`asyncio.loop.set_task_factory`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128308`: 通过将所有 *kwargs* 传递给由 :func:`asyncio.loop.set_task_factory` "
"设置的任务工厂，支持 :func:`asyncio.loop.create_task`、:func:`asyncio.create_task` 和 "
":func:`asyncio.TaskGroup.create_task` 中急切任务的 *name* 关键字参数。"

#: ../NEWS:5077
msgid ""
":gh:`118761`: Improve the performance of :func:`base64.b16decode` by up to "
"ten times by more efficiently checking the byte-string for hexadecimal "
"digits. Reduce the import time of :mod:`base64` by up to six times, by no "
"longer importing :mod:`re`. Patch by Bénédikt Tran, Chris Markiewicz, and "
"Adam Turner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118761`: 通过更有效地检查字节字符串是否为十六进制数字，将 :func:`base64.b16decode` "
"的性能最多提高十倍。通过不再导入 :mod:`re`，将 :mod:`base64` 的导入时间最多减少六倍。由 Bénédikt Tran、Chris"
" Markiewicz 和 Adam Turner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5083
msgid ""
":gh:`128156`: When using macOS system ``libffi``, support for complex types "
"in :mod:`ctypes` is now checked at runtime (macOS 10.15 or newer). The types"
" must also be available at build time."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128156`: 当使用 macOS 系统的 ``libffi`` 时，:mod:`ctypes` "
"中对复杂类型的支持现在在运行时检查（macOS 10.15 或更新版本）。这些类型也必须在构建时可用。"

#: ../NEWS:5087
msgid ""
":gh:`128636`: Fix PyREPL failure when :data:`os.environ` is overwritten with"
" an invalid value."
msgstr ":gh:`128636`: 修复当 :data:`os.environ` 被无效值覆盖时的 PyREPL 错误。"

#: ../NEWS:5090
msgid ""
":gh:`128498`: Default to stdout isatty for color detection instead of "
"stderr. Patch by Hugo van Kemenade."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128498`: 颜色检测信息默认发往 stdout isatty 而非 stderr。 由 Hugo van Kemenade 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5093
msgid ""
":gh:`128384`: Add locking to :mod:`warnings` to avoid some data races when "
"free-threading is used.  Change ``_warnings_runtime_state.mutex`` to be a "
"recursive mutex and expose it to :mod:`warnings`, via the "
":func:`!_acquire_lock` and :func:`!_release_lock` functions. The lock is "
"held when ``filters`` and ``_filters_version`` are updated."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128384`: 向 :mod:`warnings` 添加锁定以避免在使用自由线程时出现一些数据竞争。将 "
"``_warnings_runtime_state.mutex`` 更改为递归互斥锁，并通过 :func:`!_acquire_lock` 和 "
":func:`!_release_lock` 函数将其暴露给 :mod:`warnings`。在更新 ``filters`` 和 "
"``_filters_version`` 时持有锁。"

#: ../NEWS:5099
msgid ""
":gh:`128509`: Add :func:`sys._is_immortal` for identifying :term:`immortal` "
"objects at runtime."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128509`: 添加 :func:`sys._is_immortal` 用于在运行时识别 :term:`immortal` 对象。"

#: ../NEWS:5102
msgid ""
":gh:`128479`: Fix :func:`!asyncio.staggered.staggered_race` leaking tasks "
"and issuing an unhandled exception."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128479`: 修复 :func:`!asyncio.staggered.staggered_race` 泄露任务和发出未处理异常的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:5105
msgid ""
":gh:`128427`: :const:`uuid.NIL` and :const:`uuid.MAX` are now available to "
"represent the Nil and Max UUID formats as defined by :rfc:`9562`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128427`: :const:`uuid.NIL` 和 :const:`uuid.MAX` 现在可用于表示由 :rfc:`9562` 定义的"
" Nil 和 Max UUID 格式。"

#: ../NEWS:5108
msgid ""
":gh:`91279`: :meth:`zipfile.ZipFile.writestr` now respect "
"``SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH`` that distributions can set centrally and have build "
"tools consume this in order to produce reproducible output."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91279`: :meth:`zipfile.ZipFile.writestr` 现在尊重 "
"``SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH``，发行版可以集中设置此变量，构建工具可以消费此变量以产生可重现的输出。"

#: ../NEWS:5112
msgid ""
":gh:`112064`: Fix incorrect handling of negative read sizes in "
":meth:`HTTPResponse.read <http.client.HTTPResponse.read>`. Patch by Yury "
"Manushkin."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112064`: 修复 :meth:`HTTPResponse.read <http.client.HTTPResponse.read>` "
"中负读取大小的错误处理。由 Yury Manushkin 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5116
msgid ":gh:`58956`: Fixed a frame reference leak in :mod:`bdb`."
msgstr ":gh:`58956`: 修复了 :mod:`bdb` 中的一个帧引用泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:5118
msgid ""
":gh:`128131`: Completely support random access of uncompressed unencrypted "
"read-only zip files obtained by :meth:`ZipFile.open <zipfile.ZipFile.open>`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128131`: 完全支持通过 :meth:`ZipFile.open <zipfile.ZipFile.open>` 获取的未压缩未加密只读"
" zip 文件的随机访问。"

#: ../NEWS:5122
msgid ""
":gh:`127975`: Avoid reusing quote types in :func:`ast.unparse` if not "
"needed."
msgstr ":gh:`127975`: 在 :func:`ast.unparse` 中避免不必要地重复使用引号类型。"

#: ../NEWS:5124
msgid ""
":gh:`115514`: Fix exceptions and incomplete writes after "
":class:`!asyncio._SelectorTransport` is closed before writes are completed."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115514`: 修复了在 :class:`!asyncio._SelectorTransport` "
"关闭前未完成写入时的异常和不完整写入问题。"

#: ../NEWS:5128
msgid ""
":gh:`121604`: Add missing Deprecation warnings for "
":const:`importlib.machinery.DEBUG_BYTECODE_SUFFIXES`, "
":const:`importlib.machinery.OPTIMIZED_BYTECODE_SUFFIXES`, "
":class:`importlib.machinery.WindowsRegistryFinder`, "
":class:`importlib.abc.ResourceLoader`, "
":meth:`importlib.abc.SourceLoader.path_mtime`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121604`: 为 "
":const:`importlib.machinery.DEBUG_BYTECODE_SUFFIXES`、:const:`importlib.machinery.OPTIMIZED_BYTECODE_SUFFIXES`、:class:`importlib.machinery.WindowsRegistryFinder`、:class:`importlib.abc.ResourceLoader`、:meth:`importlib.abc.SourceLoader.path_mtime`"
" 添加缺失的弃用警告。"

#: ../NEWS:5135
msgid ""
":gh:`127873`: When ``-E`` is set, only ignore ``PYTHON_COLORS`` and not "
"``FORCE_COLOR``/``NO_COLOR``/``TERM`` when colourising output. Patch by Hugo"
" van Kemenade."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127873`: 当设置 ``-E`` 时，仅在颜色化输出时忽略 ``PYTHON_COLORS``，而不忽略 "
"``FORCE_COLOR``/``NO_COLOR``/``TERM``。由 Hugo van Kemenade 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5139
msgid ""
":gh:`125413`: Add :attr:`pathlib.Path.info` attribute, which stores an "
"object implementing the :class:`pathlib.types.PathInfo` protocol (also new)."
" The object supports querying the file type and internally caching "
":func:`~os.stat` results. Path objects generated by "
":meth:`~pathlib.Path.iterdir` are initialized with file type information "
"gleaned from scanning the parent directory."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125413`: 添加 :attr:`pathlib.Path.info` 属性，该属性存储了一个实现 "
":class:`pathlib.types.PathInfo` 协议的对象（也是新增的）。该对象支持查询文件类型并在内部缓存 "
":func:`~os.stat` 结果。通过 :meth:`~pathlib.Path.iterdir` 生成的 Path "
"对象会使用从扫描父目录中获取的文件类型信息进行初始化。"

#: ../NEWS:5146
msgid ""
":gh:`127712`: Fix handling of the ``secure`` argument of "
":class:`logging.handlers.SMTPHandler`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127712`: 修复了 :class:`logging.handlers.SMTPHandler` 的 ``secure`` "
"参数的处理问题。"

#: ../NEWS:5149
msgid ""
":gh:`127096`: Do not recreate unnamed section on every read in "
":class:`configparser.ConfigParser`. Patch by Andrey Efremov."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127096`: 在 :class:`configparser.ConfigParser` 中不每次读取时重新创建未命名节。由 Andrey "
"Efremov 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5152
msgid ":gh:`124369`: Deprecate ``pdb.Pdb.curframe_locals``"
msgstr ":gh:`124369`: 弃用 ``pdb.Pdb.curframe_locals``"

#: ../NEWS:5154
msgid ""
":gh:`126332`: Fix _pyrepl crash when entering a double CTRL-Z on an "
"overflowing line."
msgstr ":gh:`126332`: 修复了在溢出行上输入双重 CTRL-Z 时 _pyrepl 崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:5157
msgid ""
":gh:`125553`: Fix round-trip invariance for backslash continuations in "
":func:`tokenize.untokenize`."
msgstr ":gh:`125553`: 修复了 :func:`tokenize.untokenize` 中反斜杠续行的往返不变性问题。"

#: ../NEWS:5160
msgid ""
":gh:`91048`: Add :func:`asyncio.capture_call_graph` and "
":func:`asyncio.print_call_graph` functions."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91048`: 添加 :func:`asyncio.capture_call_graph` 和 "
":func:`asyncio.print_call_graph` 函数。"

#: ../NEWS:5163
msgid ""
":gh:`124703`: Quitting :mod:`pdb` in ``inline`` mode will emit a "
"confirmation prompt and exit gracefully now, instead of printing an "
"exception traceback."
msgstr ":gh:`124703`: 在 ``inline`` 模式下退出 :mod:`pdb` 时将发出确认提示并优雅退出，而不是打印异常回溯。"

#: ../NEWS:5167
msgid ""
":gh:`123987`: Fixed issue in NamespaceReader where a non-path item in a "
"namespace path, such as a sentinel added by an editable installer, would "
"break resource loading."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123987`: 修复了NamespaceReader中的问题，其中命名空间路径中的非路径项（如可编辑安装程序添加的标记）会破坏资源加载。"

#: ../NEWS:5171
msgid ""
":gh:`119349`: Add the :func:`ctypes.util.dllist` function to list the loaded"
" shared libraries for the current process."
msgstr ":gh:`119349`: 添加了 :func:`ctypes.util.dllist` 函数，用于列出当前进程加载的共享库。"

#: ../NEWS:5174
msgid ""
":gh:`55454`: Add IMAP4 ``IDLE`` support to the :mod:`imaplib` module.  Patch"
" by Forest."
msgstr ":gh:`55454`: 向 :mod:`imaplib` 模块添加IMAP4 ``IDLE`` 支持。由Forest提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5177
msgid ""
":gh:`119257`: Show tab completions menu below the current line, which "
"results in less janky behaviour, and fixes a cursor movement bug. Patch by "
"Daniel Hollas"
msgstr ""
":gh:`119257`: 在当前行下方显示标签补全菜单，这减少了不稳定的行为，并修复了一个光标移动的bug。由Daniel Hollas提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5181
msgid ""
":gh:`101410`: Support custom messages for domain errors in the :mod:`math` "
"module (:func:`math.sqrt`, :func:`math.log` and :func:`math.atanh` were "
"modified as examples).  Patch by Charlie Zhao and Sergey B Kirpichev."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101410`: 在 :mod:`math` 模块中支持域错误的自定义消息（修改了 "
":func:`math.sqrt`、:func:`math.log` 和 :func:`math.atanh` 作为示例）。由Charlie "
"Zhao和Sergey B Kirpichev提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5185
msgid ""
":gh:`81340`: Use :func:`os.copy_file_range` in :func:`shutil.copy`, "
":func:`shutil.copy2`, and :func:`shutil.copyfile` functions by default. An "
"underlying Linux system call gives filesystems an opportunity to implement "
"the use of copy-on-write (in case of btrfs and XFS) or server-side copy (in "
"the case of NFS.) Patch by Illia Volochii."
msgstr ""
":gh:`81340`: 默认在 :func:`shutil.copy`、:func:`shutil.copy2` 和 "
":func:`shutil.copyfile` 函数中使用 "
":func:`os.copy_file_range`。底层的Linux系统调用为文件系统提供了实现写时复制（对于btrfs和XFS）或服务器端复制（对于NFS）的机会。由Illia"
" Volochii提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5191
msgid ""
":issue:`27307`: Add attribute and item access support to "
":class:`string.Formatter` in auto-numbering mode, which allows format "
"strings like '{.name}' and '{[1]}'."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27307`: 在自动编号模式下向 :class:`string.Formatter` "
"添加属性和项访问支持，这允许格式字符串如'{.name}'和'{[1]}'。"

#: ../NEWS:5198
