"``'freebsd13'`` 或 ``'freebsd14'``。"

#: ../NEWS:5244
msgid ""
":gh:`129345`: Fix null pointer dereference in :func:`syslog.openlog` when an"
" audit hook raises an exception."
msgstr ":gh:`129345`: 修复当审计钩子引发异常时 :func:`syslog.openlog` 中的空指针解引用问题。"

#: ../NEWS:5250
msgid ""
":gh:`129231`: Improve memory layout of JIT traces. Patch by Diego Russo"
msgstr ":gh:`129231`: 优化 JIT 跟踪的内存布局。由 Diego Russo 提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:5252
msgid ""
":gh:`129149`: Add fast path for medium-size integers in "
":c:func:`PyLong_FromUnsignedLong`, :c:func:`PyLong_FromUnsignedLongLong` and"
" :c:func:`PyLong_FromSize_t`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129149`: 在 "
":c:func:`PyLong_FromUnsignedLong`、:c:func:`PyLong_FromUnsignedLongLong` 和 "
":c:func:`PyLong_FromSize_t` 中添加对中等大小整数的快速路径。"

#: ../NEWS:5256
msgid ""
":gh:`129201`: The free-threaded version of the cyclic garbage collector has "
"been optimized to conditionally use CPU prefetch instructions during the "
"collection.  This can reduce collection times by making it more likely that "
"data is in the CPU cache when it is needed.  The prefetch instructions are "
"enabled if the number of long-lived objects (objects surviving a full "
"collection) exceeds a threshold."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129201`: 自由线程版本的循环垃圾回收器已优化，条件性地在回收过程中使用 CPU 预取指令。这通过增加数据在需要时位于 CPU "
"缓存中的可能性，可以减少回收时间。如果长寿命对象（在完整回收后存活的对象）数量超过阈值，则启用预取指令。"

#: ../NEWS:5263
msgid ""
":gh:`129093`: Fix f-strings such as ``f'{expr=}'`` sometimes not displaying "
"the full expression when the expression contains ``!=``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129093`: 修复像 ``f'{expr=}'`` 这样的 f-字符串在表达式包含 ``!=`` 时有时不显示完整表达式的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:5266
msgid ""
":gh:`124363`: Treat debug expressions in f-string as raw strings. Patch by "
"Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":gh:`124363`: 将 f-string 中的调试表达式视为原始字符串。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:5269
msgid ""
":gh:`128714`: Fix the potential races in get/set dunder methods "
"``__annotations__``, ``__annotate__`` and ``__type_params__`` for function "
"object, and add related tests."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128714`: 修复函数对象的 get/set 魔术方法 ``__annotations__``、``__annotate__`` 和 "
"``__type_params__`` 中的潜在竞争条件，并添加相关测试。"

#: ../NEWS:5273
msgid ""
":gh:`128799`: Add frame of ``except*`` to traceback when it wraps a naked "
"exception."
msgstr ":gh:`128799`: 当 ``except*`` 包装裸异常时，将其框架添加到回溯中。"

#: ../NEWS:5276
msgid ""
":gh:`128842`: Collect JIT memory stats using pystats. Patch by Diego Russo."
msgstr ":gh:`128842`: 使用 pystats 收集 JIT 内存统计信息。由 Diego Russo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5278
msgid ""
":gh:`100239`: Specialize ``BINARY_OP`` for bitwise logical operations on "
"compact ints."
msgstr ":gh:`100239`: 为紧凑整数的位逻辑操作专门化 ``BINARY_OP``。"

#: ../NEWS:5281
msgid ""
":gh:`128910`: Undocumented and unused private C-API functions "
"``_PyTrash_begin`` and ``_PyTrash_end`` are removed."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128910`: 移除未文档化且未使用的私有 C-API 函数 ``_PyTrash_begin`` 和 ``_PyTrash_end``。"

#: ../NEWS:5284
msgid ""
":gh:`128807`: Add a marking phase to the free-threaded GC.  This is similar "
"to what was done in :gh:`126491`.  Since the free-threaded GC does not have "
"generations and is not incremental, the marking phase looks for all objects "
"reachable from known roots.  The roots are objects known to not be garbage, "
"like the module dictionary for :mod:`sys`.  For most programs, this marking "
"phase should make the GC a bit faster since typically less work is done per "
"object."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128807`: 向自由线程 GC 添加标记阶段。这与 :gh:`126491` 中所做的类似。由于自由线程 GC "
"没有分代且不是增量的，标记阶段会查找从已知根可达的所有对象。根是已知不是垃圾的对象，比如 :mod:`sys` "
"的模块字典。对于大多数程序，这个标记阶段应该使 GC 稍微快一些，因为通常每个对象做的工作更少。"

#: ../NEWS:5292
msgid ""
":gh:`100239`: Add opcode ``BINARY_OP_EXTEND`` which executes a pair of "
"functions (guard and specialization functions) accessed from the inline "
"cache."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100239`: 添加操作码 ``BINARY_OP_EXTEND``，该操作码执行从内联缓存中访问的一对函数（守卫函数和特化函数）。"

#: ../NEWS:5296
msgid ""
":gh:`128563`: A new type of interpreter has been added to CPython. This "
"interpreter uses tail calls for its instruction handlers. Preliminary "
"benchmark results suggest 7-11% geometric mean faster on pyperformance "
"(depending on platform), and up to 30% faster on Python-intensive workloads."
" This interpreter currently only works on newer compilers, such as "
"``clang-19``. Other compilers will continue using the old interpreter. Patch"
" by Ken Jin, with ideas on how to implement this in CPython by Mark Shannon,"
" Garret Gu, Haoran Xu, and Josh Haberman."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128563`: CPython 中添加了一种新型的解释器。该解释器对其指令处理程序使用尾调用。初步基准测试结果表明，在 "
"pyperformance "
"上几何平均速度提高了7-11%（取决于平台），在Python密集型工作负载上速度提高了30%。该解释器目前仅适用于较新的编译器，如 "
"``clang-19``。其他编译器将继续使用旧解释器。由 Ken Jin 提供补丁，Mark Shannon、Garret Gu、Haoran Xu "
"和 Josh Haberman 提供了在 CPython 中实现的想法。"

#: ../NEWS:5305
msgid ""
":gh:`126703`: Improve performance of iterating over lists and tuples by "
"using a freelist for the iterator objects."
msgstr ":gh:`126703`: 通过为迭代器对象使用自由列表，提高了迭代列表和元组的性能。"

#: ../NEWS:5308
msgid ""
":gh:`127953`: The time to handle a ``LINE`` event in sys.monitoring (and "
"sys.settrace) is now independent of the number of lines in the code object."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127953`: 在 sys.monitoring（和 sys.settrace）中处理 ``LINE`` "
"事件的时间现在与代码对象中的行数无关。"

#: ../NEWS:5312
msgid ":gh:`128330`: Restore terminal control characters on REPL exit."
msgstr ":gh:`128330`: 在 REPL 退出时恢复终端控制字符。"

#: ../NEWS:5314
msgid ""
":gh:`128016`: Improved the ``SyntaxWarning`` message for invalid escape "
"sequences to clarify that such sequences will raise a ``SyntaxError`` in "
"future Python releases. The new message also suggests a potential fix, i.e.,"
" ``Did you mean \"\\\\e\"?``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128016`: 改进了无效转义序列的 ``SyntaxWarning`` 消息，以明确这些序列在未来的 Python 版本中会引发 "
"``SyntaxError``。新消息还建议了可能的修复方法，即 ``Did you mean \"\\\\e\"?``。"

#: ../NEWS:5319
msgid ""
":gh:`126004`: Fix handling of :attr:`UnicodeError.start` and "
":attr:`UnicodeError.end` values in the :func:`codecs.replace_errors` error "
"handler. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126004`: 修复了 :func:`codecs.replace_errors` 错误处理程序中 "
":attr:`UnicodeError.start` 和 :attr:`UnicodeError.end` 值的处理。由 Bénédikt Tran "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5323
