msgstr ""
":gh:`126004`: 修复了 :func:`codecs.xmlcharrefreplace_errors` 错误处理程序中 "
":attr:`UnicodeError.start` 和 :attr:`UnicodeError.end` 值的处理。由 Bénédikt Tran "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5333
msgid ":gh:`127119`: Slightly optimize the :class:`int` deallocator."
msgstr ":gh:`127119`: 稍微优化了 :class:`int` 的析构器。"

#: ../NEWS:5335
msgid ""
":gh:`127349`: Fixed the error when resizing terminal in Python REPL. Patch "
