msgstr ":gh:`127349`: 修复了在 Python REPL 中调整终端大小时的错误。由 Semyon Moroz 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5338
msgid ""
":gh:`125723`: Fix crash with ``gi_frame.f_locals`` when generator frames "
