"Efimov 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5344
msgid ""
":gh:`126349`: Add :func:`turtle.fill`, :func:`turtle.poly` and "
":func:`turtle.no_animation` context managers. Patch by Marie Roald and Yngve"
" Mardal Moe."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126349`: 添加 :func:`turtle.fill`、:func:`turtle.poly` 和 "
":func:`turtle.no_animation` 上下文管理器。由 Marie Roald 和 Yngve Mardal Moe 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5351
msgid ""
":gh:`115911`: If the current working directory cannot be determined due to "
