"by Alex Willmer."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115911`: 如果由于权限问题无法确定当前工作目录，则导入操作将不再引发 :exc:`PermissionError`。由 Alex "
"Willmer 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5358
msgid ""
":gh:`112713`: Added support for the ``Partitioned`` cookie flag in "
":mod:`http.cookies`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112713`: 在 :mod:`http.cookies` 中添加了对 ``Partitioned`` cookie 标志的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:5364
msgid ""
":gh:`129533`: Update :c:func:`PyGC_Enable()`, :c:func:`PyGC_Disable()`, "
":c:func:`PyGC_IsEnabled()` to use atomic operation for thread-safety at "
"free-threading build. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129533`: 更新 :c:func:`PyGC_Enable()`, :c:func:`PyGC_Disable()`, "
":c:func:`PyGC_IsEnabled()` 以在自由线程构建版上为线程安全使用自动操作。 由 Donghee Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5368
msgid ""
":gh:`89188`: Implement :c:func:`PyUnicode_KIND` and :c:func:`PyUnicode_DATA`"
" as function, in addition to the macros with the same names. The macros rely"
" on C bit fields which have compiler-specific layout. Patch by Victor "
"Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`89188`: 实现 :c:func:`PyUnicode_KIND` 和 :c:func:`PyUnicode_DATA` "
"作为函数，除同名宏外。这些宏依赖于具有编译器特定布局的 C 位字段。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5373
msgid ""
":gh:`91417`: Remove :c:func:`PySequence_Fast` from the limited C API, since "
"this function has to be used with :c:macro:`PySequence_Fast_GET_ITEM` which "
"never worked in the limited C API. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91417`: 从有限 C API 中移除 :c:func:`PySequence_Fast`，因为此函数必须与 "
":c:macro:`PySequence_Fast_GET_ITEM` 一起使用，后者在有限 C API 中从未工作过。由 Victor Stinner"
" 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5377
msgid ""
":gh:`128509`: Add :c:func:`PyUnstable_IsImmortal` for determining whether an"
" object is :term:`immortal`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128509`: 添加 :c:func:`PyUnstable_IsImmortal` 用于确定对象是否为 :term:`immortal`。"

#: ../NEWS:5380
msgid ""
":gh:`129033`: Remove ``_PyInterpreterState_GetConfigCopy()`` and "
"``_PyInterpreterState_SetConfig()`` private functions. Use instead "
":c:func:`PyConfig_Get` and :c:func:`PyConfig_Set`, public C API added by "
":pep:`741` \"Python Configuration C API\". Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129033`: 移除 ``_PyInterpreterState_GetConfigCopy()`` 和 "
"``_PyInterpreterState_SetConfig()`` 私有函数。改为使用 :c:func:`PyConfig_Get` 和 "
":c:func:`PyConfig_Set`，这是由 :pep:`741` \"Python 配置 C API\" 新增的公共 C API。由 "
"Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5385
msgid ""
":gh:`129033`: Remove the private ``_Py_InitializeMain()`` function. It was a"
" :term:`provisional API` added to Python 3.8 by :pep:`587`. Patch by Victor "
"Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129033`: 移除私有函数 ``_Py_InitializeMain()``。这是由 :pep:`587` 在 Python 3.8 "
"中添加的 :term:`provisional API`。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5389
msgid ""
":gh:`128844`: Add :c:func:`PyUnstable_TryIncRef` and "
":c:func:`PyUnstable_EnableTryIncRef` unstable APIs.  These are helpers for "
"dealing with unowned references in a thread-safe way, particularly in the "
"free threading build."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128844`: 添加 :c:func:`PyUnstable_TryIncRef` 和 "
":c:func`PyUnstable_EnableTryIncRef` 不稳定 "
"API。这些是用于以线程安全方式处理无主引用，特别是在自由线程构建中的辅助工具。"

#: ../NEWS:5394
msgid ""
":gh:`128911`: Add :c:func:`PyImport_ImportModuleAttr` and "
":c:func:`PyImport_ImportModuleAttrString` helper functions to import a "
"module and get an attribute of the module. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128911`: 添加 :c:func:`PyImport_ImportModuleAttr` 和 "
":c:func:`PyImport_ImportModuleAttrString` 辅助函数，用于导入模块并获取模块的属性。补丁由 Victor "
"Stinner 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:5401
msgid ":c:func:`!_PyBytes_Join`: use :c:func:`PyBytes_Join`."
msgstr ":c:func:`!_PyBytes_Join`: 使用 :c:func:`PyBytes_Join`。"

