msgid ":c:func:`!_Py_fopen_obj`: use :c:func:`Py_fopen`."
msgstr ":c:func:`!_Py_fopen_obj`: 使用 :c:func:`Py_fopen`。"

#: ../NEWS:5418
msgid ""
":gh:`126599`: Remove some internal test APIs for the experimental JIT "
"compiler."
msgstr ":gh:`126599`: 移除实验性JIT编译器的一些内部测试API。"

#: ../NEWS:5421
msgid ""
":gh:`127925`: Convert the :mod:`decimal` module to use :pep:`757` C API "
"(export-import integers), offering some speed-up if the integer part of the "
":class:`~decimal.Decimal` instance is small.  Patch by Sergey B Kirpichev."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127925`: 将 :mod:`decimal` 模块转换为使用 :pep:`757` C API（导出导入整数），如果 "
":class:`~decimal.Decimal` 实例的整数部分较小，可以提供一些加速。由Sergey B Kirpichev提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5429
msgid ""
":gh:`129660`: Drop ``test_embed`` from PGO training, whose contribution in "
"recent versions is considered to be ignorable."
msgstr ":gh:`129660`: 从 PGO 训练中丢弃 ``test_embed``，它在近期版本中的贡献被认为是可忽略的。"

#: ../NEWS:5432
msgid ""
":gh:`128902`: Fix compile errors with Clang 9 and older due to lack of "
"``__attribute__((fallthrough))`` support."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128902`: 修复由于缺乏 ``__attribute__((fallthrough))`` 支持而在Clang "
"9及更早版本中出现的编译错误。"

#: ../NEWS:5437
msgid "Python 3.14.0 alpha 4"
msgstr "Python 3.14.0 alpha 4"

#: ../NEWS:5439
msgid "*Release date: 2025-01-14*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2025-01-14*"

#: ../NEWS:5444
msgid ""
":gh:`127592`: Usage of the unified Apple System Log APIs was disabled when "
"the minimum macOS version is earlier than 10.12."
msgstr ":gh:`127592`: 当最小 macOS 版本早于 10.12 时禁用统一 Apple System Log API。"

#: ../NEWS:5450
msgid ""
":gh:`128152`: Fix a bug where Argument Clinic's C pre-processor parser tried"
" to parse pre-processor directives inside C comments. Patch by Erlend "
"Aasland."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128152`: 修正了 Argument Clinic 的 C 预处理器解析器试图解析 C 注释里的预处理器指令的程序错误。 由 "
"Erlend Aasland 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5457
msgid ""
":gh:`128690`: Temporarily do not use test_embed in PGO profile builds until "
"the problem with test_init_pyvenv_cfg failing in some configurations is "
"resolved."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128690`: "
"在PGO配置文件构建中暂时不使用test_embed，直到在某些配置中test_init_pyvenv_cfg失败的问题得到解决。"

#: ../NEWS:5464
msgid ""
":gh:`128731`: Fix :exc:`ResourceWarning` in "
":meth:`urllib.robotparser.RobotFileParser.read`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128731`: 修复 :exc:`ResourceWarning` 在 "
":meth:`urllib.robotparser.RobotFileParser.read` 中的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:5467
msgid ""
":gh:`71339`: Add new assertion methods for :mod:`unittest`: "
":meth:`~unittest.TestCase.assertHasAttr`, "
":meth:`~unittest.TestCase.assertNotHasAttr`, "
":meth:`~unittest.TestCase.assertIsSubclass`, "
":meth:`~unittest.TestCase.assertNotIsSubclass` "
":meth:`~unittest.TestCase.assertStartsWith`, "
":meth:`~unittest.TestCase.assertNotStartsWith`, "
":meth:`~unittest.TestCase.assertEndsWith` and "
":meth:`~unittest.TestCase.assertNotEndsWith`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`71339`: 为 :mod:`unittest` "
"添加新的断言方法：:meth:`~unittest.TestCase.assertHasAttr`, "
":meth:`~unittest.TestCase.assertNotHasAttr`, "
":meth:`~unittest.TestCase.assertIsSubclass`, "
":meth:`~unittest.TestCase.assertNotIsSubclass` "
":meth:`~unittest.TestCase.assertStartsWith`, "
":meth:`~unittest.TestCase.assertNotStartsWith`, "
":meth:`~unittest.TestCase.assertEndsWith` 和 "
":meth:`~unittest.TestCase.assertNotEndsWith`。"

#: ../NEWS:5477
msgid ""
":gh:`118761`: Improve import time of :mod:`pickle` by 25% by removing an "
"unnecessary regular expression. As such, :mod:`re` is no more implicitly "
"available as ``pickle.re``. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118761`: 通过移除不必要的正则表达式，将 :mod:`pickle` 的导入时间提高了25%。因此，:mod:`re` 不再作为 "
"``pickle.re`` 隐式可用。由Bénédikt Tran提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5481
msgid ""
":gh:`128661`: Fixes :func:`typing.evaluate_forward_ref` not showing "
"deprecation when ``type_params`` arg is not passed."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128661`: 修复了 :func:`typing.evaluate_forward_ref` 在未传递 ``type_params`` "
"参数时不显示弃用警告的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:5484
msgid ""
":gh:`128562`: Fix possible conflicts in generated :mod:`tkinter` widget "
"names if the widget class name ends with a digit."
msgstr ":gh:`128562`: 修正了当控件类名称是以数字结尾时在生成的 :mod:`tkinter` 控件名称中可能出现的冲突。"

#: ../NEWS:5487
msgid ":gh:`128559`: Improved import time of :mod:`asyncio`."
msgstr ":gh:`128559`: 提高了 :mod:`asyncio` 的导入时间。"

#: ../NEWS:5489
msgid ""
":gh:`128552`: Fix cyclic garbage introduced by "
":meth:`asyncio.loop.create_task` and :meth:`asyncio.TaskGroup.create_task` "
"holding a reference to the created task if it is eager."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128552`: 修正了由于 :meth:`asyncio.loop.create_task` 和 "
":meth:`asyncio.TaskGroup.create_task` 在其为主动型时持有对所创建任务的引用而导致的循环垃圾。"

#: ../NEWS:5493
msgid ""
":gh:`128340`: Add internal thread safe handle to be used in "
":meth:`asyncio.loop.call_soon_threadsafe` for thread safe cancellation."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128340`: 添加内部线程安全句柄，用于 :meth:`asyncio.loop.call_soon_threadsafe` "
"以实现线程安全的取消操作。"

#: ../NEWS:5496
msgid ""
":gh:`128182`: Fix crash when using :mod:`ctypes` pointers concurrently on "
"the :term:`free threaded <free threading>` build."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128182`: 修复了在 :term:`自由线程 <free threading>` 构建上同时使用 :mod:`ctypes` "
"指针时崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:5499
msgid ""
":gh:`128400`: Only show the current thread in :mod:`faulthandler` on the "
":term:`free threaded <free threading>` build to prevent races."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128400`: 在 :term:`自由线程 <free threading>` 构建上，仅在 :mod:`faulthandler` "
"中显示当前线程以防止竞争。"

#: ../NEWS:5502
msgid ""
":gh:`128400`: Fix crash when using :func:`faulthandler.dump_traceback` while"
" other threads are active on the :term:`free threaded <free threading>` "
"build."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128400`: 修复了在 :term:`自由线程 <free threading>` 构建版上其他线程激活的情况下使用 "
":func:`faulthandler.dump_traceback` 时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:5506
msgid ""
":gh:`128388`: Fix ``PyREPL`` on Windows to support more keybindings, like "
"the :kbd:`Control-←` and :kbd:`Control-→` word-skipping keybindings and "
"those with meta (i.e. :kbd:`Alt`), e.g. :kbd:`Alt-d` to ``kill-word`` or "
":kbd:`Alt-Backspace` ``backward-kill-word``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128388`: 修复 Windows 上的 ``PyREPL`` 以支持更多键绑定，如 :kbd:`Control-←` 和 "
":kbd:`Control-→` 的单词跳过键绑定以及带有元键（即 :kbd:`Alt`）的键绑定，例如 :kbd:`Alt-d` 对应 ``kill-"
"word`` 或 :kbd:`Alt-Backspace` 对应 ``backward-kill-word``。"

#: ../NEWS:5511
msgid ""
":gh:`88834`: Unify the instance check for :class:`typing.Union` and "
":class:`types.UnionType`: :class:`!Union` now uses the instance checks "
"against its parameters instead of the subclass checks."
msgstr ""
":gh:`88834`: 统一了 :class:`typing.Union` 和 :class:`types.UnionType` 的实例检查方式：现在"
" :class:`!Union` 将针对其形参使用实例检查而不是子类检查。"

#: ../NEWS:5515
msgid ""
":gh:`128302`: Fix "
":meth:`!xml.dom.xmlbuilder.DOMEntityResolver.resolveEntity`, which was "
"broken by the Python 3.0 transition."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128302`: 修正了 "
":meth:`!xml.dom.xmlbuilder.DOMEntityResolver.resolveEntity`，它是在 Python 3.0 "
"过渡期中被破坏的。"

#: ../NEWS:5519
msgid ""
":gh:`128317`: Highlight today in colour in :mod:`calendar`'s CLI output. "
"Patch by Hugo van Kemenade."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128317`: 在 :mod:`calendar` 的 CLI 输出中高亮显示今天的日期。由 Hugo van Kemenade 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5522
msgid ""
":gh:`128302`: Allow :meth:`!xml.dom.xmlbuilder.DOMParser.parse` to correctly"
" handle :class:`!xml.dom.xmlbuilder.DOMInputSource` instances that only have"
" a :attr:`!systemId` attribute set."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128302`: 允许 :meth:`!xml.dom.xmlbuilder.DOMParser.parse` 正确地处理仅设置了 "
":attr:`!systemId` 属性的 :class:`!xml.dom.xmlbuilder.DOMInputSource` 实例。"

#: ../NEWS:5526
msgid ""
":gh:`128151`: Improve generation of :class:`~uuid.UUID` objects version 3, "
"4, 5, and 8 via their dedicated functions by 30%. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128151`: 通过专用函数提高 :class:`~uuid.UUID` 对象版本 3、4、5 和 8 的生成速度 30%。由 "
"Bénédikt Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5529
msgid ""
":gh:`128118`: Improve performance of :func:`copy.copy` by 30% via a fast "
"path for atomic types and container types."
msgstr ":gh:`128118`: 通过为原子类型和容器类型提供快速路径，将 :func:`copy.copy` 的性能提高 30%。"

#: ../NEWS:5532
msgid ""
":gh:`127946`: Fix crash when modifying :class:`ctypes._CFuncPtr` objects "
"concurrently on the :term:`free threaded <free threading>` build."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127946`: 修复在 :term:`自由线程 <free threading>` 构建上并发修改 "
":class:`ctypes._CFuncPtr` 对象时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:5535
msgid ""
":gh:`128062`: Revert the font of :mod:`turtledemo`'s menu bar to its default"
" value and display the shortcut keys in the correct position."
msgstr ":gh:`128062`: 将 :mod:`turtledemo` 菜单栏的字体恢复为默认值并在正确的位置上显示快捷键。"

#: ../NEWS:5538
msgid ""
":gh:`128014`: Fix resetting the default window icon by passing "
"``default=''`` to the :mod:`tkinter` method :meth:`!wm_iconbitmap`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128014`: 通过将 ``default=''`` 传给 :mod:`tkinter` 方法 :meth:`!wm_iconbitmap`"
" 修复了重设默认窗口图标问题。"

#: ../NEWS:5541
msgid ""
":gh:`41872`: Fix quick extraction of module docstrings from a file in "
":mod:`pydoc`. It now supports docstrings with single quotes, escape "
"sequences, raw string literals, and other Python syntax."
msgstr ""
":gh:`41872`: 修正了在 :mod:`pydoc` 中自文件中快速提取模块文档字符串的功能。 "
"现在它支持具有单引用、转义序列、原始字符串字面值以及其他 Python 语法的文档字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:5545
msgid ""
":gh:`127060`: Set TERM environment variable to \"dumb\" to disable traceback"
" colors in IDLE, since IDLE doesn't understand ANSI escape sequences. Patch "
"by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127060`: 将 TERM 环境变量设为 \"dumb\" 以在 IDLE 中禁用彩色回溯信息，因为 IDLE 无法解读 ANSI "
"转义序列。 由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5549
msgid ""
":gh:`126742`: Fix support of localized error messages reported by "
":manpage:`dlerror(3)` and :manpage:`gdbm_strerror <gdbm(3)>` in "
":mod:`ctypes` and :mod:`dbm.gnu` functions respectively. Patch by Bénédikt "
"Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126742`: 在 :mod:`ctypes` 和 :mod:`dbm.gnu` 函数中分别修正了对 "
":manpage:`dlerror(3)` 和 :manpage:`gdbm_strerror <gdbm(3)>` 所报告的本地化错误消息的支持。 由"
" Bénédikt Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5554
msgid ""
":gh:`122548`: Adds two new local events to sys.monitoring, ``BRANCH_LEFT`` "
"and ``BRANCH_RIGHT``. This allows the two arms of the branch to be disabled "
"independently, which should hugely improve performance of branch-level "
"coverage tools. The old branch event, ``BRANCH`` is now deprecated."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122548`: 向 sys.monitoring 添加了两个新本地事件 ``BRANCH_LEFT`` 和 "
"``BRANCH_RIGHT``。这允许独立禁用分支的两臂，这将极大地提高分支级覆盖率工具的性能。旧的分支事件 ``BRANCH`` 现已弃用。"

#: ../NEWS:5560
msgid ""
":gh:`127847`: Fix the position when doing interleaved seeks and reads in "
"uncompressed, unencrypted zip files returned by "
":meth:`zipfile.ZipFile.open`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127847`: 修复了在由 :meth:`zipfile.ZipFile.open` 返回的未压缩、未加密的 zip "
"文件上执行交错定位和读取时的位置问题。"

#: ../NEWS:5564
msgid ""
":gh:`127688`: Add the :data:`~os.SCHED_DEADLINE` and "
":data:`~os.SCHED_NORMAL` constants to the :mod:`os` module."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127688`: 将 :data:`~os.SCHED_DEADLINE` 和 :data:`~os.SCHED_NORMAL` 常量添加到 "
":mod:`os` 模块中。"

#: ../NEWS:5567
msgid ""
":gh:`83662`: Add missing ``__class_getitem__`` method to the Python "
"implementation of :func:`functools.partial`, to make it compatible with the "
"C version. This is mainly relevant for alternative Python implementations "
"like PyPy and GraalPy, because CPython will usually use the C-implementation"
" of that function."
msgstr ""
":gh:`83662`: 为 :func:`functools.partial` 的 Python 实现增加了缺失的 "
"``__class_getitem__`` 方法，以使其与 C 版本相兼容。 这主要影响其他 Python 实现如 PyPy 和 GraalPy，因为 "
"CPython 通常会使用相应函数的 C 实现。"

#: ../NEWS:5573
msgid ""
":gh:`127586`: :class:`multiprocessing.pool.Pool` now properly restores "
"blocked signal handlers of the parent thread when creating processes via "
"either *spawn* or *forkserver*."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127586`: 现在当通过 *spawn* 或 *forkserver* 创建进程时 "
":class:`multiprocessing.pool.Pool` 会正确地恢复父线程被阻塞的信号处理器。"

#: ../NEWS:5577
msgid ""
":gh:`98188`: Fix an issue in :meth:`email.message.Message.get_payload` where"
" data cannot be decoded if the Content Transfer Encoding mechanism contains "
"trailing whitespaces or additional junk text. Patch by Hui Liu."
msgstr ""
":gh:`98188`: 修复了在 :meth:`email.message.Message.get_payload` 中当 Content "
"Transfer Encoding 机制包含末尾空格或额外冗余文本时数据无法被解码的问题。 由 Hui Liu 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5581
msgid ""
":gh:`127529`: Correct behavior of "
":func:`!asyncio.selector_events.BaseSelectorEventLoop._accept_connection` in"
" handling :exc:`ConnectionAbortedError` in a loop. This improves performance"
" on OpenBSD."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127529`: 修正 "
":func:`!asyncio.selector_events.BaseSelectorEventLoop._accept_connection` "
"在处理循环中的 :exc:`ConnectionAbortedError` 时的行为。这提高了在 OpenBSD 上的性能。"

#: ../NEWS:5586
msgid ""
":gh:`127360`: When a descriptive error message cannot be provided for an "
":exc:`ssl.SSLError`, the \"unknown error\" message now shows the internal "
"error code (as retrieved by ``ERR_get_error`` and similar OpenSSL "
"functions)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127360`: 当无法为 :exc:`ssl.SSLError` 提供描述性错误消息时，“未知错误”消息现在会显示内部错误代码（通过 "
"``ERR_get_error`` 和类似的 OpenSSL 函数检索）。"

#: ../NEWS:5591
msgid ""
":gh:`127196`: Fix crash when dict with keys in invalid encoding were passed "
"to several functions in ``_interpreters`` module."
msgstr ":gh:`127196`: 修复了在 ``_interpreters`` 模块中当具有无效编码格式的键的字典被传给某些函数时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:5594
msgid ""
":gh:`124130`: Fix a bug in matching regular expression ``\\B`` in empty "
"input string. Now it is always the opposite of ``\\b``. To get an old "
"behavior, use ``(?!\\A\\Z)\\B``. To get a new behavior in old Python "
"versions, use ``(?!\\b)``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`124130`: 修复了在空输入字符串中匹配正则表达式 ``\\B`` 的错误。现在它总是 ``\\b`` 的反面。要获得旧行为，请使用 "
"``(?!\\A\\Z)\\B``。要在旧 Python 版本中获得新行为，请使用 ``(?!\\b)``。"

#: ../NEWS:5599
msgid ""
":gh:`126639`: :class:`tempfile.NamedTemporaryFile` will now issue a "
":exc:`ResourceWarning` when it is finalized by the garbage collector without"
" being explicitly closed."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126639`: :class:`tempfile.NamedTemporaryFile` 现在会在被垃圾收集器最终化而没有显式关闭时发出 "
":exc:`ResourceWarning`。"

#: ../NEWS:5603
msgid ""
":gh:`126624`: Expose error code "
":data:`~xml.parsers.expat.errors.XML_ERROR_NOT_STARTED` of Expat >=2.6.4 in "
":mod:`xml.parsers.expat.errors`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126624`: 在 :mod:`xml.parsers.expat.errors` 中暴露 Expat >=2.6.4 的错误代码 "
":data:`~xml.parsers.expat.errors.XML_ERROR_NOT_STARTED`。"

#: ../NEWS:5607
msgid ""
":gh:`126225`: :mod:`getopt` and :mod:`optparse` are no longer marked as "
"deprecated. There are legitimate reasons to use one of these modules in "
"preference to :mod:`argparse`, and none of these modules are at risk of "
"being removed from the standard library. Of the three, ``argparse`` remains "
"the recommended default choice, *unless* one of the concerns noted at the "
"top of the ``optparse`` module documentation applies."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126225`: :mod:`getopt` 和 :mod:`optparse` 不再被标记为已弃用。 存在合法的理由优先使用这些模块而不是 "
":mod:`argparse`，这些模块均没有从标准库中被移除的风险。 对于这三个模块，``argparse`` 仍然是推荐的默认选择，*除非* "
"``optparse`` 模块文档的开头部分所提及的事项之一需要被纳入考量。"

#: ../NEWS:5614
msgid ""
":gh:`124761`: Add :data:`~socket.SO_REUSEPORT_LB` constant to :mod:`socket` "
"for FreeBSD."
msgstr ""
":gh:`124761`: 为 FreeBSD 在 :mod:`socket` 中添加 :data:`~socket.SO_REUSEPORT_LB` "
"常量。"

#: ../NEWS:5617
msgid ""
":gh:`121720`: :class:`enum.EnumDict` can now be used without resorting to "
"private API."
msgstr ":gh:`121720`: :class:`enum.EnumDict` 现在可以不借助私有 API 使用。"

#: ../NEWS:5620
msgid ""
":gh:`123424`: Add :meth:`zipfile.ZipInfo._for_archive` setting default "
"properties on :class:`~zipfile.ZipInfo` objects. Patch by Bénédikt Tran and "
"Jason R. Coombs."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123424`: 添加 :meth:`zipfile.ZipInfo._for_archive` 方法，为 "
":class:`~zipfile.ZipInfo` 对象设置默认属性。补丁由 Bénédikt Tran 和 Jason R. Coombs 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:5624
msgid ""
":gh:`121676`: Deprecate calling the Python implementation of "
":meth:`functools.reduce` with a ``function`` or ``sequence`` as a "
":term:`keyword argument`. This will be forbidden in Python 3.16 in order to "
"match the C implementation."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121676`: 弃用以 ``function`` 或 ``sequence`` 作为 :term:`关键字参数 <keyword "
"argument>` 调用 :meth:`functools.reduce` 的 Python 实现。为了与 C 实现保持一致，Python 3.16 "
"将禁止此操作。"

#: ../NEWS:5629
msgid ""
":gh:`112015`: :func:`ctypes.memoryview_at` now exists to create a "
":class:`memoryview` object that refers to the supplied pointer and length. "
"This works like :func:`ctypes.string_at` except it avoids a buffer copy, and"
" is typically useful when implementing pure Python callback functions that "
"are passed dynamically-sized buffers."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112015`: 现在存在 :func:`ctypes.memoryview_at` 函数，用于创建一个指向提供的指针和长度的 "
":class:`memoryview` 对象。这与 :func:`ctypes.string_at` "
"类似，但避免了缓冲区复制，通常在实现传递动态大小缓冲区的纯 Python 回调函数时非常有用。"

#: ../NEWS:5635
msgid ""
":gh:`95371`: Added support for other image formats (PNG, PGM, and PPM) to "
"the turtle module. Patch by Shin-myoung-serp."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95371`: 为 turtle 模块添加了对其他图像格式（PNG、PGM 和 PPM）的支持。由 Shin-myoung-serp "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5641
msgid ""
":gh:`128078`: Fix a :exc:`SystemError` when using :func:`anext` with a "
"default tuple value. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128078`: 修正了当附带默认的元组值使用 :func:`anext` 时导致的 :exc:`SystemError`。 由 "
"Bénédikt Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5644
msgid ""
":gh:`128717`: Fix a crash when setting the recursion limit while other "
"threads are active on the :term:`free threaded <free threading>` build."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128717`: 修复了在 :term:`自由线程 <free threading>` 构建版上其他线程激活的情况下设置递归上限时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:5647
msgid ""
":gh:`124483`: Treat ``Py_DECREF`` and variants as escaping when generating "
"opcode and uop metadata. This prevents the possibility of a ``__del__`` "
"method causing the JIT to behave incorrectly."
msgstr ""
":gh:`124483`: 在生成操作码和 uop 元数据时，将 ``Py_DECREF`` 及其变体视为逃逸。这防止了 ``__del__`` "
"方法导致 JIT 行为不正确的可能性。"

#: ../NEWS:5651
msgid ""
":gh:`126703`: Improve performance of class methods by using a freelist."
msgstr ":gh:`126703`: 通过使用 freelist 提高了类方法的性能。"

#: ../NEWS:5653
msgid ""
":gh:`128137`: Update :c:type:`PyASCIIObject` layout to handle interned field"
" with the atomic operation. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128137`: 更新 :c:type:`PyASCIIObject` 布局以使用原子操作处理 interned 字段。由 Donghee "
"Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5659
msgid ""
":gh:`128192`: Upgrade HTTP digest authentication algorithm for "
":mod:`urllib.request` by supporting SHA-256 digest authentication as "
"specified in :rfc:`7616`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128192`: 通过支持 :rfc:`7616` 中指定的 SHA-256 摘要认证，升级了 :mod:`urllib.request` 的"
" HTTP 摘要认证算法。"

#: ../NEWS:5666
msgid ":gh:`126868`: Increase usage of freelist for :class:`int` allocation."
msgstr ":gh:`126868`: 增加 :class:`int` 分配中 freelist 的使用。"

#: ../NEWS:5668
msgid ""
":gh:`114203`: Optimize ``Py_BEGIN_CRITICAL_SECTION`` for simple recursive "
"calls."
msgstr ":gh:`114203`: 为简单的递归调用优化 ``Py_BEGIN_CRITICAL_SECTION``。"

#: ../NEWS:5671
msgid ""
":gh:`127705`: Adds stackref debugging when ``Py_STACKREF_DEBUG`` is set. "
"Finds all double-closes and leaks, logging the origin and last borrow."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127705`: 当设置 ``Py_STACKREF_DEBUG`` 时，添加 stackref "
"调试。查找所有双重关闭和泄漏，记录来源和最后的借用。"

#: ../NEWS:5674
msgid ""
"Inspired by HPy's debug mode. https://docs.hpyproject.org/en/latest/debug-"
"mode.html"
msgstr "受HPy调试模式的启发。https://docs.hpyproject.org/en/latest/debug-mode.html"

#: ../NEWS:5677
msgid ""
":gh:`128079`: Fix a bug where :keyword:`except* <except_star>` does not "
"properly check the return value of an :exc:`ExceptionGroup`'s "
":meth:`~BaseExceptionGroup.split` function, leading to a crash in some "
"cases. Now when :meth:`~BaseExceptionGroup.split` returns an invalid object,"
" :keyword:`except* <except_star>` raises a :exc:`TypeError` with the "
"original raised :exc:`ExceptionGroup` object chained to it."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128079`: 修复了一个由于 :keyword:`except* <except_star>` 不能正确地检查 "
":exc:`ExceptionGroup` 的 :meth:`~BaseExceptionGroup.split` "
"函数的返回值，导致在某些情况下发生崩溃的程序错误。 现在当 :meth:`~BaseExceptionGroup.split` "
"返回无效对象时，:keyword:`except* <except_star>` 将引发一个 :exc:`TypeError` 并原来所引发的 "
":exc:`ExceptionGroup` 对象与其进行串连。"

#: ../NEWS:5684
msgid ""
":gh:`128030`: Avoid error from calling ``PyModule_GetFilenameObject`` on a "
"non-module object when importing a non-existent symbol from a non-module "
"object."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128030`: 避免当从非模块对象导入不存在的符号时由于在非模块对象上调用 ``PyModule_GetFilenameObject`` "
"所导致的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:5691
msgid ""
":gh:`128035`: Indicate through :data:`ssl.HAS_PHA` whether the :mod:`ssl` "
"module supports TLSv1.3 post-handshake client authentication (PHA). Patch by"
" Will Childs-Klein."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128035`: 通过 :data:`ssl.HAS_PHA` 表示 :mod:`ssl` "
"模块是否支持TLSv1.3握手后客户端认证（PHA）。由Will Childs-Klein提交补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5698
msgid ""
":gh:`127274`: Add a new flag, ``CO_METHOD``, to :attr:`~codeobject.co_flags`"
" that indicates whether the code object belongs to a function defined in "
"class scope."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127274`: 向 :attr:`~codeobject.co_flags` 添加一个新标志 "
"``CO_METHOD``，用于表示代码对象是否属于在类作用域中定义的函数。"

#: ../NEWS:5702
msgid ""
":gh:`66409`: During the :ref:`path initialization <sys-path-init>`, we now "
"check if ``base_exec_prefix`` is the same as ``base_prefix`` before falling "
"back to searching the Python interpreter directory."
msgstr ""
":gh:`66409`: 在 :ref:`path initialization <sys-path-init>` "
"期间，我们现在在退回搜索Python解释器目录之前检查 ``base_exec_prefix`` 是否与 ``base_prefix`` 相同。"

#: ../NEWS:5706
msgid ""
":gh:`127970`: We now use the location of the ``libpython`` runtime library "
"used in the current process to determine :data:`sys.base_prefix` on all "
"platforms implementing the `dladdr "
"<https://pubs.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/9799919799/functions/dladdr.html>`_ "
"function defined by the UNIX standard — this includes Linux, Android, macOS,"
" iOS, FreeBSD, etc. This was already the case on Windows and macOS Framework"
" builds."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127970`: 我们现在使用当前进程中使用的 ``libpython`` 运行时库的位置来确定在所有实现了由UNIX标准定义的 "
"`dladdr "
"<https://pubs.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/9799919799/functions/dladdr.html>`_ "
"函数的平台上的 :data:`sys.base_prefix` —— "
"这包括Linux、Android、macOS、iOS、FreeBSD等。在Windows和macOS框架构建中已经是这种情况。"

#: ../NEWS:5714
msgid ""
":gh:`127773`: Do not use the type attribute cache for types with "
"incompatible :term:`MRO`."
msgstr ":gh:`127773`: 对于具有不兼容 :term:`MRO` 的类型，不使用类型属性缓存。"

#: ../NEWS:5717
msgid ""
":gh:`127903`: ``Objects/unicodeobject.c``: fix a crash on DEBUG builds in "
"``_copy_characters`` when there is nothing to copy."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127903`: ``Objects/unicodeobject.c``: 修复了在DEBUG构建中当没有内容可复制时 "
"``_copy_characters`` 的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:5720
msgid ""
":gh:`127809`: Fix an issue where the experimental JIT may infer an incorrect"
" result type for exponentiation (``**`` and ``**=``), leading to bugs or "
"crashes."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127809`: 修复了一个问题，在该问题中，实验性JIT可能为幂运算（``**`` 和 "
"``**=``）推断出错误的结果类型，从而导致错误或崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:5724
msgid ""
":gh:`126862`: Fix a possible overflow when a class inherits from an absurd "
"number of super-classes. Reported by Valery Fedorenko. Patch by Bénédikt "
"Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126862`: 修复了一个类继承自极其多的超类时可能出现的溢出问题。由Valery Fedorenko报告。由Bénédikt "
"Tran提交补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5731
msgid ""
":gh:`128400`: :c:func:`Py_FatalError` no longer shows all threads on the "
":term:`free threaded <free threading>` build to prevent crashes."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128400`: :c:func:`Py_FatalError` 不再在 自由线程 <free threading>` "
"构建上显示所有线程以防止崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:5734
msgid ""
":gh:`128629`: Add macros :c:func:`Py_PACK_VERSION` and "
":c:func:`Py_PACK_FULL_VERSION` for bit-packing Python version numbers."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128629`: 添加宏 :c:func:`Py_PACK_VERSION` 和 :c:func:`Py_PACK_FULL_VERSION`"
" 用于位打包Python版本号。"

#: ../NEWS:5737
msgid ""
":gh:`128008`: Add :c:func:`PyWeakref_IsDead` function, which tests if a weak"
" reference is dead."
msgstr ":gh:`128008`: 添加 :c:func:`PyWeakref_IsDead` 函数，用于测试弱引用是否已失效。"

#: ../NEWS:5740
msgid ""
":gh:`127350`: Add :c:func:`Py_fopen` function to open a file. Similar to the"
" :c:func:`!fopen` function, but the *path* parameter is a Python object and "
"an exception is set on error. Add also :c:func:`Py_fclose` function to close"
" a file, function needed for Windows support. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127350`: 添加 :c:func:`Py_fopen` 函数以打开文件。类似于 :c:func:`!fopen` 函数，但 *path*"
" 参数是一个 Python 对象，并且在出错时会设置异常。同时添加 :c:func:`Py_fclose` 函数以关闭文件，此函数为 Windows "
"支持所需。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5749
msgid ""
":gh:`128627`: For Emscripten builds the function pointer cast call "
"trampoline now uses the wasm-gc ref.test instruction if it's available "
"instead of Wasm JS type reflection."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128627`: 对于 Emscripten 构建，函数指针转换调用 trampoline 现在使用 wasm-gc 的 ref.test "
"指令（如果可用），而不是 Wasm JS 类型反射。"

#: ../NEWS:5753
msgid ""
":gh:`128472`: Skip BOLT optimization of functions using computed gotos, "
"fixing errors on build with LLVM 19."
msgstr ":gh:`128472`: 跳过使用计算跳转的函数的 BOLT 优化，修复了使用 LLVM 19 构建时的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:5756
msgid ""
":gh:`115765`: GNU Autoconf 2.72 is now required to generate "
":file:`configure`. Patch by Erlend Aasland."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115765`: 现在需要 GNU Autoconf 2.72 来生成 :file:`configure`。由 Erlend Aasland "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5759
msgid ""
":gh:`123925`: Fix building the :mod:`curses` module on platforms with "
"libncurses but without libncursesw."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123925`: 修复在没有 libncursesw 但有 libncurses 的平台上构建 :mod:`curses` 模块的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:5762
msgid ""
":gh:`90905`: Add support for cross-compiling to x86_64 on aarch64/arm64 "
"macOS."
msgstr ":gh:`90905`: 添加对在 aarch64/arm64 macOS 上交叉编译到 x86_64 的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:5765
msgid ""
":gh:`128321`: Set ``LIBS`` instead of ``LDFLAGS`` when checking if "
":mod:`sqlite3` library functions are available. This fixes the ordering of "
"linked libraries during checks, which was incorrect when using a statically "
"linked ``libsqlite3``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128321`: 在检查 :mod:`sqlite3` 库函数是否可用时设置 ``LIBS`` 而不是 "
"``LDFLAGS``。这修复了链接库的顺序问题，该问题在使用静态链接的 ``libsqlite3`` 时是不正确的。"

#: ../NEWS:5770
msgid ""
":gh:`100384`: Error on ``unguarded-availability`` in macOS builds, "
"preventing invalid use of symbols that are not available in older versions "
"of the OS."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100384`: 在 macOS 构建中对 ``unguarded-availability`` "
"报错，防止在旧版本的操作系统中使用不可用的符号。"

#: ../NEWS:5773
msgid ""
":gh:`128104`: Remove ``Py_STRFTIME_C99_SUPPORT`` conditions in favor of "
"requiring C99 :manpage:`strftime(3)` specifier support at build time. When "
"cross-compiling, there is no build time check and support is assumed."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128104`: 移除 ``Py_STRFTIME_C99_SUPPORT`` 条件，改为要求在构建时支持 C99 "
":manpage:`strftime(3)` 说明符。当交叉编译时，没有构建时检查，假设支持。"

#: ../NEWS:5777
msgid ""
":gh:`127951`: Add option ``--pystats`` to the Windows build to enable "
"performance statistics collection."
msgstr ":gh:`127951`: 为 Windows 构建添加 ``--pystats`` 选项以启用性能统计收集。"

#: ../NEWS:5782
msgid "Python 3.14.0 alpha 3"
msgstr "Python 3.14.0 alpha 3"

#: ../NEWS:5784
msgid "*Release date: 2024-12-17*"
msgstr "*发布日期：2024-12-17*"

#: ../NEWS:5789
msgid ""
":gh:`127353`: Allow to force color output on Windows using environment "
"variables. Patch by Andrey Efremov."
msgstr ":gh:`127353`: 允许在 Windows 上使用环境变量强制设置颜色输出。 由 Andrey Efremov 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5792
msgid ""
":gh:`125729`: Makes the presence of the :mod:`turtle` module dependent on "
"the Tcl/Tk installer option. Previously, the module was always installed but"
" would be unusable without Tcl/Tk."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125729`: 使 :mod:`turtle` 模块的存在依赖于 Tcl/Tk 安装程序选项。之前，模块总是安装，但没有 Tcl/Tk "
"时将无法使用。"

#: ../NEWS:5799
msgid ""
":gh:`126700`: Add support for multi-argument :mod:`gettext` functions in "
":program:`pygettext.py`."
msgstr ":gh:`126700`: 在 :program:`pygettext.py` 中添加对 :mod:`gettext` 函数多参数的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:5805
msgid ""
":gh:`127906`: Test the limited C API in test_cppext. Patch by Victor "
"Stinner."
msgstr ":gh:`127906`: 在 test_cppext 中测试受限 C API。 由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5807
msgid ""
":gh:`127637`: Add tests for the :mod:`dis` command-line interface. Patch by "
"Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ":gh:`127637`: 增加针对 :mod:`dis` 命令行界面的测试。 由 Bénédikt Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5810
msgid ""
":gh:`126925`: iOS test results are now streamed during test execution, and "
"the deprecated xcresulttool is no longer used."
msgstr ":gh:`126925`: 现在 iOS 测试结果在测试执行期间流式输出，且已弃用的 xcresulttool 不再被使用。"

#: ../NEWS:5813
msgid ""
":gh:`127076`: Disable strace based system call tests when LD_PRELOAD is set."
msgstr ":gh:`127076`: 当设置了 LD_PRELOAD 时，禁用基于 strace 的系统调用测试。"

#: ../NEWS:5815
msgid ""
":gh:`127076`: Filter out memory-related ``mmap``, ``munmap``, and "
"``mprotect``  calls from file-related ones when testing :mod:`io` behavior "
"using strace."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127076`: 在使用 strace 测试 :mod:`io` 行为时，从与文件相关的调用中过滤掉与内存相关的 "
"``mmap``、``munmap`` 和 ``mprotect`` 调用。"

#: ../NEWS:5822
msgid ""
":gh:`127655`: Fixed the "
":class:`!asyncio.selector_events._SelectorSocketTransport` transport not "
"pausing writes for the protocol when the buffer reaches the high water mark "
"when using :meth:`asyncio.WriteTransport.writelines`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127655`: 修正了 :class:`!asyncio.selector_events._SelectorSocketTransport`"
" 传输当使用 :meth:`asyncio.WriteTransport.writelines` 时不在缓冲区到达高水位时暂停为协议写入的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:5830
msgid ""
":gh:`126907`: Fix crash when using :mod:`atexit` concurrently on the "
":term:`free-threaded <free threading>` build."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126907`: 修复在 :term:`free-threaded <free threading>` 构建上并发使用 "
":mod:`atexit` 时崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:5833
msgid ""
":gh:`127870`: Detect recursive calls in ctypes ``_as_parameter_`` handling. "
"Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127870`: 检测在 ctypes ``_as_parameter_`` 处理中的递归调用。 由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5836
msgid ""
":gh:`127732`: The :mod:`platform` module now correctly detects Windows "
"Server 2025."
msgstr ":gh:`127732`: 现在 :mod:`platform` 模块能正确地检测 Windows Server 2025。"

#: ../NEWS:5839
msgid ""
":gh:`126789`: Fixed :func:`sysconfig.get_config_vars`, "
":func:`sysconfig.get_paths`, and siblings, returning outdated cached data if"
" the value  of :data:`sys.prefix` or :data:`sys.exec_prefix` changes. "
"Overwriting :data:`sys.prefix` or :data:`sys.exec_prefix` still is "
"discouraged, as that might break other parts of the code."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126789`: 修复了 "
":func:`sysconfig.get_config_vars`、:func:`sysconfig.get_paths` 及其相关函数，如果 "
":data:`sys.prefix` 或 :data:`sys.exec_prefix` 的值发生变化，会返回过时的缓存数据。仍然不鼓励覆盖 "
":data:`sys.prefix` 或 :data:`sys.exec_prefix`，因为这可能会破坏代码的其他部分。"

#: ../NEWS:5845
msgid ""
":gh:`127718`: Add colour to :mod:`test.regrtest` output. Patch by Hugo van "
"Kemenade."
msgstr ":gh:`127718`: 为 :mod:`test.regrtest` 输出添加颜色。由 Hugo van Kemenade 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5848
msgid ""
":gh:`127610`: Added validation for more than one var-positional or var-"
"keyword parameters in :class:`inspect.Signature`. Patch by Maxim Ageev."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127610`: 在 :class:`inspect.Signature` 中添加了对多于一个可变位置参数或可变关键字参数的验证。由 "
"Maxim Ageev 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5852
msgid ""
":gh:`127627`: Added ``posix._emscripten_debugger()`` to help with debugging "
"the test suite on the Emscripten target."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127627`: 添加了 ``posix._emscripten_debugger()`` 以帮助在 Emscripten "
"目标上调试测试套件。"

#: ../NEWS:5855
msgid ""
":gh:`126821`: macOS and iOS apps can now choose to redirect stdout and "
"stderr to the system log during interpreter configuration."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126821`: 在解释器配置期间 macOS 和 iOS app 现在能选择将 stdout 和 stderr 重定向到系统日志。"

#: ../NEWS:5858
msgid ""
":gh:`93312`: Include ``<sys/pidfd.h>`` to get ``os.PIDFD_NONBLOCK`` "
"constant. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93312`: 包括 ``<sys/pidfd.h>`` 以获取 ``os.PIDFD_NONBLOCK`` 常量。 由 Victor "
"Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5861
msgid ""
":gh:`127481`: Add the ``EPOLLWAKEUP`` constant to the :mod:`select` module."
msgstr ":gh:`127481`: 向 :mod:`select` 模块添加了 ``EPOLLWAKEUP`` 常量。"

#: ../NEWS:5863
msgid ""
":gh:`127065`: Make :func:`operator.methodcaller` thread-safe and re-entrant "
"safe."
msgstr ":gh:`127065`: 使 :func:`operator.methodcaller` 线程安全和可重入安全。"

#: ../NEWS:5866
msgid ""
":gh:`127321`: :func:`pdb.set_trace` will not stop at an opcode that does not"
" have an associated line number anymore."
msgstr ":gh:`127321`: :func:`pdb.set_trace` 不再在没有关联行号的操作码处停止。"

#: ../NEWS:5869
msgid ""
":gh:`127429`: Fixed bug where, on cross-builds, the :mod:`sysconfig` POSIX "
"data was being generated with the host Python's ``Makefile``. The data is "
"now generated from current build's ``Makefile``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127429`: 修复了在交叉构建时，:mod:`sysconfig` POSIX 数据是用主机 Python 的 ``Makefile`` "
"生成的问题。现在数据是从当前构建的 ``Makefile`` 生成的。"

#: ../NEWS:5873
msgid ""
":gh:`127413`: Add the :option:`dis --specialized` command-line option to "
"show specialized bytecode. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127413`: 添加了 :option:`dis --specialized` 命令行选项以显示专门的字节码。由 Bénédikt Tran"
" 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5876
msgid ""
":gh:`125413`: Revert addition of :meth:`!pathlib.Path.scandir`. This method "
"was added in 3.14.0a2. The optimizations remain for file system paths, but "
"other subclasses should only have to implement :meth:`pathlib.Path.iterdir`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125413`: 撤销添加 :meth:`!pathlib.Path.scandir`。此方法在 3.14.0a2 "
"版本中添加。文件系统路径的优化仍然保留，但其他子类只需实现 :meth:`pathlib.Path.iterdir`。"

#: ../NEWS:5881
msgid ""
":gh:`127257`: In :mod:`ssl`, system call failures that OpenSSL reports using"
" ``ERR_LIB_SYS`` are now raised as :exc:`OSError`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127257`: 在 :mod:`ssl` 中，OpenSSL 报告使用 ``ERR_LIB_SYS`` 的系统调用失败现在将作为 "
":exc:`OSError` 被引发。"

#: ../NEWS:5884
msgid ""
":gh:`59705`: On Linux, :class:`threading.Thread` now sets the thread name to"
" the operating system. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`59705`: 在 Linux 上，:class:`threading.Thread` 现在将线程名称设置为操作系统。由 Victor "
"Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5887
msgid ""
":gh:`127303`: Publicly expose :data:`~token.EXACT_TOKEN_TYPES` in "
":attr:`!token.__all__`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127303`: 公开暴露 :data:`~token.EXACT_TOKEN_TYPES` 在 :attr:`!token.__all__`"
" 中。"

#: ../NEWS:5890
msgid ""
":gh:`127331`: :mod:`ssl` can show descriptions for errors added in OpenSSL "
"3.4."
msgstr ":gh:`127331`: :mod:`ssl` 可以显示 OpenSSL 3.4 中添加的错误描述。"

#: ../NEWS:5893
msgid ""
":gh:`123967`: Fix faulthandler for trampoline frames. If the top-most frame "
"is a trampoline frame, skip it. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123967`: 修复了 faulthandler 对于 trampoline 框架的处理。如果最顶层的框架是 trampoline "
"框架，则跳过它。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5896
msgid ""
":gh:`127178`: A ``_sysconfig_vars_(...).json`` file is now shipped in the "
"standard library directory. It contains the output of "
":func:`sysconfig.get_config_vars` on the default environment encoded as JSON"
" data. This is an implementation detail, and may change at any time."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127178`: 现在标准库目录中提供了一个 ``_sysconfig_vars_(...).json`` 文件。它包含 "
":func:`sysconfig.get_config_vars` 在默认环境下作为 JSON 数据编码的输出。这是一个实现细节，可能会随时更改。"

#: ../NEWS:5901
msgid ""
":gh:`127072`: Remove outdated ``socket.NETLINK_*`` constants not present in "
"Linux kernels beyond 2.6.17."
msgstr ":gh:`127072`: 移除了在 Linux 内核 2.6.17 之后不再存在的过时 ``socket.NETLINK_*`` 常量。"

#: ../NEWS:5904
msgid ""
":gh:`127255`: The :func:`~ctypes.CopyComPointer` function is now public. "
"Previously, this was private and only available in ``_ctypes``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127255`: :func:`~ctypes.CopyComPointer` 函数现在是公开的。之前，这是私有的，仅在 "
"``_ctypes`` 中可用。"

#: ../NEWS:5907
msgid ""
":gh:`127182`: Fix :meth:`!io.StringIO.__setstate__` crash, when "
":const:`None` was passed as the first value."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127182`: 修复了 :meth:`!io.StringIO.__setstate__` 当 :const:`None` "
"作为第一个值传递时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:5910
msgid ""
":gh:`127217`: Fix :func:`urllib.request.pathname2url` for paths starting "
"with multiple slashes on Posix."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127217`: 修复了 :func:`urllib.request.pathname2url` 对于 Posix "
"上以多个斜杠开头的路径的处理。"

#: ../NEWS:5913
msgid ""
":gh:`125866`: :func:`urllib.request.pathname2url` now adds an empty "
"authority when generating a URL for a path that begins with exactly one "
"slash. For example, the path ``/etc/hosts`` is converted to the scheme-less "
"URL ``///etc/hosts``. As a result of this change, URLs without authorities "
"are only generated for relative paths."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125866`: :func:`urllib.request.pathname2url` 现在在为一个以一个斜杠开头的路径生成 URL "
"时添加一个空的授权部分。例如，路径 ``/etc/hosts`` 被转换为无方案的 URL "
"``///etc/hosts``。由于这一变化，没有授权部分的 URL 仅对相对路径生成。"

#: ../NEWS:5919
msgid ""
":gh:`127221`: Add colour to :mod:`unittest` output. Patch by Hugo van "
"Kemenade."
msgstr ":gh:`127221`: 为 :mod:`unittest` 输出添加颜色。由 Hugo van Kemenade 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5922
msgid ""
":gh:`127035`: Fix :mod:`shutil.which` on Windows. Now it looks at direct "
"match if and only if the command ends with a PATHEXT extension or X_OK is "
"not in mode. Support extensionless files if \".\" is in PATHEXT. Support "
"PATHEXT extensions that end with a dot."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127035`: 修复了 Windows 上的 :mod:`shutil.which`。现在它仅在命令以 PATHEXT 扩展名结束或 "
"X_OK 不在模式中时查看直接匹配。如果 \".\" 在 PATHEXT 中，则支持无扩展名的文件。支持以点结束的 PATHEXT 扩展名。"

#: ../NEWS:5927
msgid ""
":gh:`122273`: Support PyREPL history on Windows. Patch by devdanzin and "
"Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122273`: 在 Windows 上支持 PyREPL 历史记录。由 devdanzin 和 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5930
msgid ""
":gh:`125866`: :func:`urllib.request.pathname2url` and "
":func:`~urllib.request.url2pathname` no longer convert Windows drive letters"
" to uppercase."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125866`: :func:`urllib.request.pathname2url` 和 "
":func:`~urllib.request.url2pathname` 不再将 Windows 驱动器字母转换为大写。"

#: ../NEWS:5934
msgid ""
":gh:`127078`: Fix issue where :func:`urllib.request.url2pathname` failed to "
"discard an extra slash before a UNC drive in the URL path on Windows."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127078`: 修复了 :func:`urllib.request.url2pathname` 在 Windows 上无法丢弃 URL "
"路径中 UNC 驱动器前的额外斜杠的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:5937
msgid ""
":gh:`126766`: Fix issue where :func:`urllib.request.url2pathname` failed to "
"discard any 'localhost' authority present in the URL."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126766`: 修复 :func:`urllib.request.url2pathname` 在 URL 中存在 'localhost' "
"授权时未能丢弃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:5940
msgid ""
":gh:`127065`: Fix crash when calling a :func:`operator.methodcaller` "
"instance from multiple threads in the free threading build."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127065`: 修复在自由线程构建中从多个线程调用 :func:`operator.methodcaller` 实例时崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:5943
msgid ""
":gh:`127090`: Fix value of :attr:`urllib.response.addinfourl.url` for "
"``file:`` URLs that express relative paths and absolute Windows paths. The "
"canonical URL generated by :func:`urllib.request.pathname2url` is now used."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127090`: 修复 :attr:`urllib.response.addinfourl.url` 对于表达相对路径和绝对 Windows "
"路径的 ``file:`` URL 的值。现在使用 :func:`urllib.request.pathname2url` 生成的规范 URL。"

#: ../NEWS:5948
msgid ""
":gh:`126992`: Fix LONG and INT opcodes to only use base 10 for string to "
"integer conversion in :mod:`pickle`."
msgstr ":gh:`126992`: 修复 LONG 和 INT 操作码在 :mod:`pickle` 中仅使用基数为 10 的字符串到整数转换。"

#: ../NEWS:5951
msgid ""
":gh:`126997`: Fix support of STRING and GLOBAL opcodes with non-ASCII "
"arguments in :mod:`pickletools`. :func:`pickletools.dis` now outputs non-"
"ASCII bytes in STRING, BINSTRING and SHORT_BINSTRING arguments as escaped "
"(``\\xXX``)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126997`: 修复 :mod:`pickletools` 中 STRING 和 GLOBAL 操作码对非 ASCII "
"参数的支持。:func:`pickletools.dis` 现在将 STRING、BINSTRING 和 SHORT_BINSTRING 参数中的非 "
"ASCII 字节输出为转义形式（``\\xXX``）。"

#: ../NEWS:5956
msgid ""
":gh:`126316`: :mod:`grp`: Make :func:`grp.getgrall` thread-safe by adding a "
"mutex. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126316`: :mod:`grp`: 通过添加互斥锁使 :func:`grp.getgrall` 线程安全。由 Victor "
"Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5959
msgid ""
":gh:`126618`: Fix the representation of :class:`itertools.count` objects "
"when the count value is :data:`sys.maxsize`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126618`: 修复当计数值为 :data:`sys.maxsize` 时 :class:`itertools.count` 对象的表示。"

#: ../NEWS:5962
msgid ""
":gh:`126615`: The :exc:`~ctypes.COMError` exception is now public. "
"Previously, this was private and only available in ``_ctypes``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126615`: :exc:`~ctypes.COMError` 异常现在公开。之前这是私有的，仅在 ``_ctypes`` 中可用。"

#: ../NEWS:5965
msgid ""
":gh:`126985`: When running under a virtual environment with the :mod:`site` "
"disabled (see :option:`-S`), :data:`sys.prefix` and :data:`sys.base_prefix` "
"will now point to the virtual environment, instead of the base installation."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126985`: 当在禁用 :mod:`site` 的虚拟环境下运行时（见 :option:`-S`），:data:`sys.prefix` "
"和 :data:`sys.base_prefix` 现在将指向虚拟环境，而不是基本安装。"

#: ../NEWS:5970
msgid ""
":gh:`112192`: In the :mod:`trace` module, increase the coverage precision "
"(``cov%``) to one decimal."
msgstr ":gh:`112192`: 在 :mod:`trace` 模块中，将覆盖率精度（``cov%``）提高到一位小数。"

#: ../NEWS:5973
msgid ""
":gh:`118761`: Improve import time of :mod:`mimetypes` by around 11-16 times."
" Patch by Hugo van Kemenade."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118761`: 通过 Hugo van Kemenade 的补丁，将 :mod:`mimetypes` 的导入时间提高约 11-16 倍。"

#: ../NEWS:5976
msgid ""
":gh:`126947`: Raise :exc:`TypeError` in "
":meth:`!_pydatetime.timedelta.__new__` if the passed arguments are not "
":class:`int` or :class:`float`, so that the Python implementation is in line"
" with the C implementation."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126947`: 如果传递的参数不是 :class:`int` 或 :class:`float`，则在 "
":meth:`!_pydatetime.timedelta.__new__` 中引发 :exc:`TypeError`，以使 Python 实现与 C "
"实现一致。"

#: ../NEWS:5981
msgid ""
":gh:`126946`: Improve the :exc:`~getopt.GetoptError` error message when a "
"long option prefix matches multiple accepted options in "
":func:`getopt.getopt` and :func:`getopt.gnu_getopt`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126946`: 在 :func:`getopt.getopt` 和 :func:`getopt.gnu_getopt` "
"中，当长选项前缀匹配多个接受的选项时，改进 :exc:`~getopt.GetoptError` 错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:5985
msgid ""
":gh:`126899`: Make tkinter widget methods :meth:`!after` and "
":meth:`!after_idle` accept arguments passed by keyword."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126899`: 使 tkinter 小部件方法 :meth:`!after` 和 :meth:`!after_idle` "
"接受通过关键字传递的参数。"

#: ../NEWS:5988
msgid ""
":gh:`85168`: Fix issue where :func:`urllib.request.url2pathname` and "
":func:`~urllib.request.pathname2url` always used UTF-8 when quoting and "
"unquoting file URIs. They now use the :term:`filesystem encoding and error "
"handler`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`85168`: 修复了 :func:`urllib.request.url2pathname` 和 "
":func:`~urllib.request.pathname2url` 在引用和取消引用文件 URI 时总是使用 UTF-8 的问题。它们现在使用 "
":term:`filesystem encoding and error handler`。"

#: ../NEWS:5993
msgid ""
":gh:`126780`: Fix :func:`os.path.normpath` for drive-relative paths on "
"Windows."
msgstr ":gh:`126780`: 修复 Windows 上 :func:`os.path.normpath` 对驱动器相对路径的处理。"

#: ../NEWS:5996
msgid ""
":gh:`126775`: Make :func:`linecache.checkcache` thread safe and GC re-"
"entrancy safe."
msgstr ":gh:`126775`: 使得 :func:`linecache.checkcache` 保证线程安全和 GC 重进入安全。"

#: ../NEWS:5999
msgid ""
":gh:`126601`: Fix issue where :func:`urllib.request.pathname2url` raised "
":exc:`OSError` when given a Windows path containing a colon character not "
"following a drive letter, such as before an NTFS alternate data stream."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126601`: 修复了 :func:`urllib.request.pathname2url` 在给定包含不跟随驱动器字母的冒号字符（如在 "
"NTFS 备用数据流前）的 Windows 路径时引发 :exc:`OSError` 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:6003
msgid ""
":gh:`126727`: ``locale.nl_langinfo(locale.ERA)`` now returns multiple era "
"description segments separated by semicolons. Previously it only returned "
"the first segment on platforms with Glibc."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126727`: ``locale.nl_langinfo(locale.ERA)`` 现在返回由分号分隔的多个时代描述段。以前在带有 "
"Glibc 的平台上它只返回第一段。"

#: ../NEWS:6007
msgid ":gh:`85046`: Add :data:`~errno.EHWPOISON` error code to :mod:`errno`."
msgstr ":gh:`85046`: 将 :data:`~errno.EHWPOISON` 错误代码添加到 :mod:`errno`。"

#: ../NEWS:6009
msgid ""
":gh:`118201`: Fixed intermittent failures of :any:`os.confstr`, "
":any:`os.pathconf` and :any:`os.sysconf` on iOS and Android."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118201`: 修复了 iOS 和 Android 上 :any:`os.confstr`, :any:`os.pathconf` 和 "
":any:`os.sysconf` 的间歇性失败。"

#: ../NEWS:6012
msgid ""
":gh:`86463`: The ``usage`` parameter of :class:`argparse.ArgumentParser` no "
"longer affects the default value of the ``prog`` parameter in subparsers."
msgstr ""
":gh:`86463`: :class:`argparse.ArgumentParser` 的 ``usage`` 参数不再影响子解析器中 "
"``prog`` 参数的默认值。"

#: ../NEWS:6015
msgid ""
":gh:`124008`: Fix possible crash (in debug build), incorrect output or "
"returning incorrect value from raw binary ``write()`` when writing to "
"console on Windows."
msgstr ""
":gh:`124008`: 修复了在 Windows 上写入控制台时，原始二进制 ``write()`` "
"可能崩溃（在调试构建中）、输出不正确或返回不正确值的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:6019
msgid ""
":gh:`123401`: The :mod:`http.cookies` module now supports parsing obsolete "
":rfc:`850` date formats, in accordance with :rfc:`9110` requirements. Patch "
"by Nano Zheng."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123401`: 现在 :mod:`http.cookies` 模块支持解释过时的 :rfc:`850` 日期格式，以符合 "
":rfc:`9110` 的要求。 由 Nano Zheng 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:6023
msgid ""
":gh:`122431`: :func:`readline.append_history_file` now raises a "
":exc:`ValueError` when given a negative value."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122431`: 现在当为 :func:`readline.append_history_file` 给出负值时将会引发 "
":exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../NEWS:6026
msgid ""
":gh:`122356`: Guarantee that the position of a file-like object passed to "
":func:`zipfile.is_zipfile` is left untouched after the call. Patch by "
"Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122356`: 保证传递给 :func:`zipfile.is_zipfile` 的文件类对象的位置在调用后保持不变。补丁由 "
"Bénédikt Tran 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:6030
msgid ""
":gh:`122288`: Improve the performances of :func:`fnmatch.translate` by a "
"factor 1.7. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122288`: 通过 1.7 倍因子提高了 :func:`fnmatch.translate` 的性能。由 Bénédikt Tran "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:6033
msgid ""
":gh:`88110`: Fixed :class:`multiprocessing.Process` reporting a "
"``.exitcode`` of 1 even on success when using the ``\"fork\"`` start method "
"while using a :class:`concurrent.futures.ThreadPoolExecutor`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`88110`: 修复了在使用 ``\"fork\"`` 启动方法时，即使成功，:class:`multiprocessing.Process`"
" 也报告 ``.exitcode`` 为 1 的问题，同时使用了 "
":class:`concurrent.futures.ThreadPoolExecutor`。"

#: ../NEWS:6037
msgid ""
":gh:`97514`: Authentication was added to the :mod:`multiprocessing` "
"forkserver start method control socket so that only processes with the "
"authentication key generated by the process that spawned the forkserver can "
"control it.  This is an enhancement over the other :gh:`97514` fixes so that"
" access is no longer limited only by filesystem permissions."
msgstr ""
":gh:`97514`: 为 :mod:`multiprocessing` forkserver 启动方法的控制套接字添加了认证，这样只有由生成 "
"forkserver 的进程生成的认证密钥的进程才能控制它。这是对其他 :gh:`97514` 修复的增强，使得访问不再仅受文件系统权限的限制。"

#: ../NEWS:6043
msgid ""
"The file descriptor exchange of control pipes with the forked worker process"
" now requires an explicit acknowledgement byte to be sent over the socket "
"after the exchange on all forkserver supporting platforms. That makes "
"testing the above much easier."
msgstr ""
"现在，与分叉的工作进程的控制管道的文件描述符交换在所有支持 forkserver "
"的平台上都需要在交换后通过套接字发送一个明确的确认字节。这使得上述测试变得容易得多。"

#: ../NEWS:6051
msgid ""
":gh:`127347`: Publicly expose :func:`traceback.print_list` in "
":attr:`!traceback.__all__`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127347`: 在 :attr:`!traceback.__all__` 中公开暴露 "
":func:`traceback.print_list`。"

#: ../NEWS:6057
msgid ""
":gh:`127740`: Fix error message in :func:`bytes.fromhex` when given an odd "
"number of digits to properly indicate that an even number of hexadecimal "
"digits is required."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127740`: 当给定奇数位数时，修复 :func:`bytes.fromhex` 中的错误消息，正确指示需要偶数位十六进制数字。"

#: ../NEWS:6061
msgid ""
":gh:`127058`: ``PySequence_Tuple`` now creates the resulting tuple "
"atomically, preventing partially created tuples being visible to the garbage"
" collector or through ``gc.get_referrers()``"
msgstr ""
":gh:`127058`: ``PySequence_Tuple`` 现在原子性地创建结果元组，防止垃圾收集器或通过 "
"``gc.get_referrers()`` 看到部分创建的元组。"

#: ../NEWS:6065
msgid ""
":gh:`127599`: Fix statistics for increments of object reference counts (in "
"particular, when a reference count was increased by more than 1 in a single "
"operation)."
msgstr ":gh:`127599`: 修复对象引用计数增加的统计（特别是当引用计数在单个操作中增加了超过1时）。"

#: ../NEWS:6069
msgid ""
":gh:`127651`: When raising :exc:`ImportError` for missing symbols in "
"``from`` imports, use ``__file__`` in the error message if "
"``__spec__.origin`` is not a location"
msgstr ""
":gh:`127651`: 当为 ``from`` 导入中缺失的符号引发 :exc:`ImportError` 时，如果 "
"``__spec__.origin`` 不是一个位置，则在错误消息中使用 ``__file__``。"

#: ../NEWS:6073
msgid ""
":gh:`127582`: Fix non-thread-safe object resurrection when calling "
"finalizers and watcher callbacks in the free threading build."
msgstr ":gh:`127582`: 在自由线程构建中调用终结器和监视器回调时，修复非线程安全的对象复活。"

#: ../NEWS:6076
msgid ""
":gh:`127434`: The iOS compiler shims can now accept arguments with spaces."
msgstr ":gh:`127434`: iOS 编译器垫片现在可以接受带有空格的参数。"

#: ../NEWS:6078
msgid ""
":gh:`127536`: Add missing locks around some list assignment operations in "
"the free threading build."
msgstr ":gh:`127536`: 在自由线程构建中，为一些列表分配操作添加缺失的锁。"

#: ../NEWS:6081
msgid ""
":gh:`127085`: Fix race when exporting a buffer from a :class:`memoryview` "
"object on the :term:`free-threaded <free threading>` build."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127085`: 在 :term:`free-threaded <free threading>` 构建中，从 "
":class:`memoryview` 对象导出缓冲区时修复竞态条件。"

#: ../NEWS:6084
msgid ""
":gh:`127238`: Correct error message for :func:`sys.set_int_max_str_digits`."
msgstr ":gh:`127238`: 更正 :func:`sys.set_int_max_str_digits` 的错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:6086
msgid ""
":gh:`113841`: Fix possible undefined behavior division by zero in "
":class:`complex`'s :c:func:`_Py_c_pow`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`113841`: 修复 :class:`complex` 的 :c:func:`_Py_c_pow` 中可能未定义行为的除以零错误。"

#: ../NEWS:6092
msgid ""
":gh:`127133`: Calling :meth:`argparse.ArgumentParser.add_argument_group` on "
"an argument group, and calling "
":meth:`argparse.ArgumentParser.add_argument_group` or "
":meth:`argparse.ArgumentParser.add_mutually_exclusive_group` on a mutually "
"exclusive group now raise exceptions. This nesting was never supported, "
"often failed to work correctly, and was unintentionally exposed through "
"inheritance. This functionality has been deprecated since Python 3.11."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127133`: 现在，在参数组上调用 "
":meth:`argparse.ArgumentParser.add_argument_group`，以及在互斥组上调用 "
":meth:`argparse.ArgumentParser.add_argument_group` 或 "
":meth:`argparse.ArgumentParser.add_mutually_exclusive_group` "
"会抛出异常。这种嵌套从未被支持，经常无法正确工作，并且是通过继承无意中暴露的。此功能自Python 3.11起已被弃用。"

#: ../NEWS:6103
msgid ""
":gh:`126491`: Add a marking phase to the GC. All objects that can be "
"transitively reached from builtin modules or the stacks are marked as "
"reachable before cycle detection. This reduces the amount of work done by "
"the GC by approximately half."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126491`: 向GC添加一个标记阶段。所有可以从内置模块或堆栈中转引用的对象在循环检测之前被标记为可达。这将GC的工作量大约减少了一半。"

#: ../NEWS:6108
msgid ""
":gh:`127020`: Fix a crash in the free threading build when "
":c:func:`PyCode_GetCode`, :c:func:`PyCode_GetVarnames`, "
":c:func:`PyCode_GetCellvars`, or :c:func:`PyCode_GetFreevars` were called "
"from multiple threads at the same time."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127020`: 修复了在自由线程构建中，当 "
":c:func:`PyCode_GetCode`、:c:func:`PyCode_GetVarnames`、:c:func:`PyCode_GetCellvars`"
" 或 :c:func:`PyCode_GetFreevars` 被多个线程同时调用时发生的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:6113
msgid ""
":gh:`127010`: Simplify GC tracking of dictionaries. All dictionaries are "
"tracked when created, rather than being lazily tracked when a trackable "
"object was added to them. This simplifies the code considerably and results "
"in a slight speedup."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127010`: "
"简化了对字典的GC跟踪。所有字典在创建时即被跟踪，而不是在向它们添加可跟踪对象时延迟跟踪。这极大地简化了代码并带来了轻微的速度提升。"

#: ../NEWS:6118
msgid ""
":gh:`126980`: Fix :meth:`~object.__buffer__` of :class:`bytearray` crashing "
"when :attr:`~inspect.BufferFlags.READ` or :attr:`~inspect.BufferFlags.WRITE`"
" are passed as flags."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126980`: 修复了当 :attr:`~inspect.BufferFlags.READ` 或 "
":attr:`~inspect.BufferFlags.WRITE` 作为标志传递时，:class:`bytearray` 的 "
":meth:`~object.__buffer__` 崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:6122
msgid ""
":gh:`126937`: Fix :exc:`TypeError` when a :class:`ctypes.Structure` has a "
"field size that doesn't fit into an unsigned 16-bit integer. Instead, the "
"maximum number of *bits* is :data:`sys.maxsize`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126937`: 修复了当 :class:`ctypes.Structure` 的字段大小不适合无符号16位整数时引发的 "
":exc:`TypeError`。现在，最大位数是 :data:`sys.maxsize`。"

#: ../NEWS:6126
msgid ""
":gh:`126868`: Increase performance of :class:`int` by adding a freelist for "
"compact ints."
msgstr ":gh:`126868`: 通过为紧凑整数添加自由列表，提高了 :class:`int` 的性能。"

#: ../NEWS:6129
msgid ""
":gh:`126881`: Fix crash in finalization of dtoa state. Patch by Kumar "
"Aditya."
msgstr ":gh:`126881`: 修复了dtoa状态在最终化时的崩溃。由Kumar Aditya提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:6131
msgid ""
":gh:`126892`: Require cold or invalidated code to \"warm up\" before being "
"JIT compiled again."
msgstr ":gh:`126892`: 要求冷代码或无效代码在被再次JIT编译之前“预热”。"

#: ../NEWS:6134
msgid ""
":gh:`126091`: Ensure stack traces are complete when throwing into a "
"generator chain that ends in a custom generator."
msgstr ":gh:`126091`: 确保当抛出到以自定义生成器结束的生成器链中时，堆栈跟踪是完整的。"

#: ../NEWS:6137
msgid ""
":gh:`126024`: Optimize decoding of short UTF-8 sequences containing non-"
"ASCII characters by approximately 15%."
msgstr ":gh:`126024`: 优化包含非ASCII字符的短UTF-8序列的解码，大约提升15%。"

#: ../NEWS:6140
msgid ""
":gh:`125420`: Add :meth:`memoryview.index` to :class:`memoryview` objects. "
"Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125420`: 向 :class:`memoryview` 对象添加 :meth:`memoryview.index`。由 Bénédikt"
" Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:6143
msgid ""
":gh:`125420`: Add :meth:`memoryview.count` to :class:`memoryview` objects. "
"Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125420`: 向 :class:`memoryview` 对象添加 :meth:`memoryview.count`。由 Bénédikt"
" Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:6146
msgid ""
":gh:`124470`: Fix crash in free-threaded builds when replacing object "
"dictionary while reading attribute on another thread"
msgstr ":gh:`124470`: 修复在自由线程构建中，当在另一个线程上读取属性时替换对象字典导致的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:6149
msgid ""
":gh:`69639`: Implement mixed-mode arithmetic rules combining real and "
"complex numbers as specified by C standards since C99.  Patch by Sergey B "
"Kirpichev."
msgstr ""
":gh:`69639`: 实现混合模式算术规则，结合实数和复数，符合自C99以来的C标准。由 Sergey B Kirpichev 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:6153
