msgstr ""
":gh:`127896`: 之前未记录的函数 :c:func:`PySequence_In` 现在是 软弃用`。改用 "
":c:func:`PySequence_Contains`。"

#: ../NEWS:6167
msgid ""
":gh:`127791`: Fix loss of callbacks after more than one call to "
":c:func:`PyUnstable_AtExit`."
msgstr ":gh:`127791`: 修复在多次调用 :c:func:`PyUnstable_AtExit` 后回调丢失的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:6170
msgid ""
":gh:`127691`: The :ref:`Unicode Exception Objects <unicodeexceptions>` C API"
