"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:6174
msgid ""
":gh:`123378`: Ensure that the value of :attr:`UnicodeEncodeError.end "
"<UnicodeError.end>` retrieved by :c:func:`PyUnicodeEncodeError_GetEnd` lies "
"in ``[min(1, objlen), max(min(1, objlen), objlen)]`` where *objlen* is the "
"length of :attr:`UnicodeEncodeError.object <UnicodeError.object>`. Similar "
"arguments apply to :exc:`UnicodeDecodeError` and "
":exc:`UnicodeTranslateError` and their corresponding C interface. Patch by "
"Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123378`: 确保通过 :c:func:`PyUnicodeEncodeError_GetEnd` 获取的 "
":attr:`UnicodeEncodeError.end <UnicodeError.end>` 的值位于 ``[min(1, objlen), "
"max(min(1, objlen), objlen)]`` 范围内，其中 *objlen* 是 "
":attr:`UnicodeEncodeError.object <UnicodeError.object>` 的长度。类似的论点适用于 "
":exc:`UnicodeDecodeError` 和 :exc:`UnicodeTranslateError` 及其相应的C接口。由 Bénédikt"
" Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:6182
msgid ""
":gh:`127314`: Improve error message when calling the C API without an active"
