#: ../NEWS:6185
msgid ""
":gh:`123378`: Ensure that the value of :attr:`UnicodeEncodeError.start "
"<UnicodeError.start>` retrieved by :c:func:`PyUnicodeEncodeError_GetStart` "
"lies in ``[0, max(0, objlen - 1)]`` where *objlen* is the length of "
":attr:`UnicodeEncodeError.object <UnicodeError.object>`. Similar arguments "
"apply to :exc:`UnicodeDecodeError` and :exc:`UnicodeTranslateError` and "
"their corresponding C interface. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123378`: 确保通过 :c:func:`PyUnicodeEncodeError_GetStart` 获取的 "
":attr:`UnicodeEncodeError.start <UnicodeError.start>` 值位于 ``[0, max(0, "
"objlen - 1)]`` 范围内，其中 *objlen* 是 :attr:`UnicodeEncodeError.object "
"<UnicodeError.object>` 的长度。类似的参数适用于 :exc:`UnicodeDecodeError` 和 "
":exc:`UnicodeTranslateError` 及其对应的 C 接口。由 Bénédikt Tran 提供补丁。"

