" loop. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126353`: :func:`asyncio.get_event_loop` 现在不会隐式创建事件循环。如果没有设置事件循环，现在会抛出 "
":exc:`RuntimeError`。由Kumar Aditya提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:6402
msgid ""
":gh:`126313`: Fix an issue in :func:`curses.napms` when "
":func:`curses.initscr` has not yet been called. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126313`: 修复当 :func:`curses.initscr` 尚未被调用时 :func:`curses.napms` "
"中的一个问题。由Bénédikt Tran提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:6405
msgid ""
":gh:`126303`: Fix pickling and copying of :class:`os.sched_param` objects."
msgstr ":gh:`126303`: 修复 :class:`os.sched_param` 对象的序列化和复制问题。"

#: ../NEWS:6407
msgid ""
":gh:`126138`: Fix a use-after-free crash on :class:`asyncio.Task` objects "
"whose underlying coroutine yields an object that implements an evil "
":meth:`~object.__getattribute__`. Patch by Nico Posada."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126138`: 修复 :class:`asyncio.Task` 对象中的一个使用后释放崩溃问题，该问题发生在底层协程生成一个实现邪恶 "
":meth:`~object.__getattribute__` 的对象时。由 Nico Posada 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:6411
msgid ""
":gh:`120057`: Replace the ``os.environ.refresh()`` method with a new "
":func:`os.reload_environ` function. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120057`: 用新的 :func:`os.reload_environ` 函数替换 ``os.environ.refresh()`` "
"方法。补丁由 Victor Stinner 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:6414
msgid ""
":gh:`126220`: Fix crash in :class:`!cProfile.Profile` and "
":class:`!_lsprof.Profiler` when their callbacks were directly called with 0 "
"arguments."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126220`: 修复 :class:`!cProfile.Profile` 和 :class:`!_lsprof.Profiler` "
"中当它们的回调被直接以0个参数调用时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:6418
msgid ""
":gh:`126212`: Fix issue where :func:`urllib.request.pathname2url` and "
":func:`~urllib.request.url2pathname` removed slashes from Windows DOS drive "
"paths and URLs."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126212`: 修复 :func:`urllib.request.pathname2url` 和 "
":func:`~urllib.request.url2pathname` 从 Windows DOS 驱动路径和 URL 中移除斜杠的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:6422
msgid ""
":gh:`126223`: Raise a :exc:`UnicodeEncodeError` instead of a "
":exc:`SystemError` upon calling :func:`!_interpreters.create` with an "
"invalid Unicode character."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126223`: 在调用 :func:`!_interpreters.create` 时遇到无效 Unicode 字符时，抛出 "
":exc:`UnicodeEncodeError` 而不是 :exc:`SystemError`。"

#: ../NEWS:6426
msgid ""
":gh:`126205`: Fix issue where :func:`urllib.request.pathname2url` generated "
"URLs beginning with four slashes (rather than two) when given a Windows UNC "
"path."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126205`: 修复当给定 Windows UNC 路径时，:func:`urllib.request.pathname2url` "
"生成以四个斜杠（而不是两个）开头的 URL 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:6430
msgid ""
":gh:`126156`: Improved performances of creating "
":py:class:`~http.cookies.Morsel` objects by a factor of 3.8x."
msgstr ":gh:`126156`: 将创建 :py:class:`~http.cookies.Morsel` 对象的性能提高了 3.8 倍。"

#: ../NEWS:6433
msgid ""
":gh:`126105`: Fix a crash in :mod:`ast` when the :attr:`ast.AST._fields` "
"attribute is deleted."
msgstr ":gh:`126105`: 修复 :mod:`ast` 中当 :attr:`ast.AST._fields` 属性被删除时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:6436
msgid ""
":gh:`126106`: Fixes a possible ``NULL`` pointer dereference in :mod:`ssl`."
msgstr ":gh:`126106`: 修复 :mod:`ssl` 中可能出现的 ``NULL`` 指针解引用问题。"

#: ../NEWS:6438
msgid ""
":gh:`126080`: Fix a use-after-free crash on :class:`asyncio.Task` objects "
"for which the underlying event loop implements an evil "
":meth:`~object.__getattribute__`. Reported by Nico-Posada. Patch by Bénédikt"
" Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126080`: 修复 :class:`asyncio.Task` 对象中的一个使用后释放崩溃问题，该问题发生在底层事件循环实现了一个邪恶的 "
":meth:`~object.__getattribute__` 时。由 Nico-Posada 报告。由 Bénédikt Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:6443
msgid ":gh:`125322`: Correct detection of complex numbers support in libffi."
msgstr ":gh:`125322`: 正确检测 libffi 中的复数支持。"

#: ../NEWS:6445
msgid ""
":gh:`126083`: Fixed a reference leak in :class:`asyncio.Task` objects when "
"reinitializing the same object with a non-``None`` context. Patch by Nico "
"Posada."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126083`: 修复 :class:`asyncio.Task` 对象中当用非 ``None`` "
"上下文重新初始化同一对象时的引用泄漏问题。由 Nico Posada 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:6449
msgid ""
":gh:`126068`: Fix exceptions in the :mod:`argparse` module so that only "
"error messages for ArgumentError and ArgumentTypeError are now translated. "
"ArgumentError is now only used for command line errors, not for logical "
"errors in the program. TypeError is now raised instead of ValueError for "
"some logical errors."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126068`: 修复 :mod:`argparse` 模块中的异常，现在只有 ArgumentError 和 "
"ArgumentTypeError 的错误信息会被翻译。ArgumentError "
"现在仅用于命令行错误，不用于程序中的逻辑错误。对于一些逻辑错误，现在会抛出 TypeError 而不是 ValueError。"

#: ../NEWS:6455
msgid ""
":gh:`125413`: Add :meth:`!pathlib.Path.scandir` method to efficiently fetch "
"directory children and their file attributes. This is a trivial wrapper of "
":func:`os.scandir`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125413`: 添加 :meth:`!pathlib.Path.scandir` 方法以高效获取目录子项及其文件属性。这是 "
":func:`os.scandir` 的一个简单包装。"

#: ../NEWS:6459
msgid ""
":gh:`125984`: Fix use-after-free crashes on :class:`asyncio.Future` objects "
"for which the underlying event loop implements an evil "
":meth:`~object.__getattribute__`. Reported by Nico-Posada. Patch by Bénédikt"
" Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125984`: 修复了 :class:`asyncio.Future` 对象上因底层事件循环实现了恶意的 "
":meth:`~object.__getattribute__` 而导致的释放后使用崩溃。由 Nico-Posada 报告，Bénédikt Tran "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:6464
msgid ""
":gh:`125926`: Fix :func:`urllib.parse.urljoin` for base URI with undefined "
"authority. Although :rfc:`3986` only specify reference resolution for "
"absolute base URI, :func:`!urljoin` should continue to return sensible "
"result for relative base URI."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125926`: 修复 :func:`urllib.parse.urljoin` 对于基础 URI 权限未定义的情况。尽管 "
":rfc:`3986` 仅规定了绝对基础 URI 的引用解析，:func:`!urljoin` 应继续为相对基础 URI 返回合理的结果。"

#: ../NEWS:6469
msgid ""
":gh:`125969`: Fix an out-of-bounds crash when an evil "
":meth:`asyncio.loop.call_soon` mutates the length of the internal callbacks "
"list. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125969`: 修复了当恶意的 :meth:`asyncio.loop.call_soon` 改变内部回调列表长度时导致的越界崩溃。由 "
"Bénédikt Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:6473
msgid ""
":gh:`125966`: Fix a use-after-free crash in "
":meth:`asyncio.Future.remove_done_callback`. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125966`: 修复了 :meth:`asyncio.Future.remove_done_callback` 中的释放后使用崩溃。由 "
"Bénédikt Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:6476
msgid ""
":gh:`125789`: Fix possible crash when mutating list of callbacks returned by"
" :attr:`!asyncio.Future._callbacks`. It now always returns a new copy in C "
"implementation :mod:`!_asyncio`. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125789`: 修复了当改变由 :attr:`!asyncio.Future._callbacks` 返回的回调列表时可能导致的崩溃。现在在"
" C 实现 :mod:`!_asyncio` 中总是返回一个新的副本。由 Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:6480
msgid ""
":gh:`126916`: Allow the *initial* parameter of :func:`functools.reduce` to "
"be passed as a keyword argument. Patch by Sayandip Dutta."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126916`: 允许 :func:`functools.reduce` 的 *initial* 参数作为关键字参数传递。由 Sayandip"
" Dutta 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:6483
msgid ""
":gh:`124452`: Fix an issue in "
":meth:`email.policy.EmailPolicy.header_source_parse` and "
":meth:`email.policy.Compat32.header_source_parse` that introduced spurious "
"leading whitespaces into header values when the header includes a newline "
"character after the header name delimiter (``:``) and before the value."
msgstr ""
":gh:`124452`: 修复了 :meth:`email.policy.EmailPolicy.header_source_parse` 和 "
":meth:`email.policy.Compat32.header_source_parse` "
"中的一个问题，该问题在头名称分隔符（``:``）之后和值之前包含换行符时，会在头值中引入虚假的前导空格。"

#: ../NEWS:6489
msgid ""
":gh:`117941`: :class:`!argparse.BooleanOptionalAction` now rejects option "
"names starting with ``--no-``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`117941`: :class:`!argparse.BooleanOptionalAction` 现在拒绝以 ``--no-`` "
"开头的选项名称。"

#: ../NEWS:6492
msgid ""
":gh:`125884`: Fixed the bug for :mod:`pdb` where it can't set breakpoints on"
" functions with certain annotations."
msgstr ":gh:`125884`: 修复了 :mod:`pdb` 中无法为带有特定注解的函数设置断点的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:6495
msgid ""
":gh:`125355`: Fix several bugs in "
":meth:`argparse.ArgumentParser.parse_intermixed_args`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125355`: 修复了 :meth:`argparse.ArgumentParser.parse_intermixed_args` "
"中的几个错误。"

#: ../NEWS:6498
msgid "The parser no longer changes temporarily during parsing."
msgstr "解析器在解析过程中不再临时改变。"

#: ../NEWS:6499
msgid "Default values are not processed twice."
msgstr "默认值不会被处理两次。"

#: ../NEWS:6500
msgid ""
"Required mutually exclusive groups containing positional arguments are now "
"supported."
msgstr "现在支持包含位置参数的必需互斥组。"

#: ../NEWS:6501
msgid ""
"The missing arguments report now includes the names of all required optional"
" and positional arguments."
msgstr "缺少的参数报告现在包括所有必需的可选和位置参数的名称。"

#: ../NEWS:6502
msgid ""
"Unknown options can be intermixed with positional arguments in "
"parse_known_intermixed_args()."
msgstr "未知选项可以与位置参数在 parse_known_intermixed_args() 中混合使用。"

#: ../NEWS:6504
msgid ""
":gh:`125767`: :class:`super` objects are now :mod:`pickleable <pickle>` and "
":mod:`copyable <copy>`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125767`: :class:`super` 对象现在可以被 :mod:`pickleable <pickle>` 和 "
":mod:`copyable <copy>`。"

#: ../NEWS:6507
msgid ""
":gh:`124969`: ``locale.nl_langinfo(locale.ALT_DIGITS)`` now returns a string"
" again. The returned value consists of up to 100 semicolon-separated "
"symbols."
msgstr ""
":gh:`124969`: ``locale.nl_langinfo(locale.ALT_DIGITS)`` "
"现在再次返回一个字符串。返回值由最多100个分号分隔的符号组成。"

#: ../NEWS:6511
msgid ""
":gh:`84850`: Remove :class:`!URLopener` and :class:`!FancyURLopener` classes"
" from :mod:`urllib.request`. They had previously raised "
":exc:`DeprecationWarning` since Python 3.3."
msgstr ""
":gh:`84850`: 从 :mod:`urllib.request` 中移除 :class:`!URLopener` 和 "
":class:`!FancyURLopener` 类。它们自 Python 3.3 起就已经引发 :exc:`DeprecationWarning`。"

#: ../NEWS:6515
msgid ""
":gh:`125666`: Avoid the exiting the interpreter if a null byte is given as "
"input in the new REPL."
msgstr ":gh:`125666`: 避免在新 REPL 中如果输入为空字节时退出解释器。"

#: ../NEWS:6518
msgid ""
":gh:`125710`: [Enum] fix hashable<->nonhashable comparisons for member "
"values"
msgstr ":gh:`125710`: [Enum] 修复成员值的可哈希<->不可哈希比较"

#: ../NEWS:6520
msgid ""
":gh:`125631`: Restore ability to set :attr:`~pickle.Pickler.persistent_id` "
"and :attr:`~pickle.Unpickler.persistent_load` attributes of instances of the"
" :class:`!Pickler` and :class:`!Unpickler` classes in the :mod:`pickle` "
"module."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125631`: 恢复在 :mod:`pickle` 模块中为 :class:`!Pickler` 和 :class:`!Unpickler`"
" 类的实例设置 :attr:`~pickle.Pickler.persistent_id` 和 "
":attr:`~pickle.Unpickler.persistent_load` 属性的能力。"

#: ../NEWS:6525
msgid ""
":gh:`125378`: Fixed the bug in :mod:`pdb` where after a multi-line command, "
"an empty line repeats the first line of the multi-line command, instead of "
"the full command."
msgstr ":gh:`125378`: 修复了 :mod:`pdb` 中在多行命令后，空行重复多行命令的第一行而不是完整命令的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:6529
msgid ""
":gh:`125682`: Reject non-ASCII digits in the Python implementation of "
":func:`json.loads` conforming to the JSON specification."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125682`: 在 Python 实现的 :func:`json.loads` 中拒绝非 ASCII 数字，以符合 JSON 规范。"

#: ../NEWS:6532
msgid ""
":gh:`125660`: Reject invalid unicode escapes for Python implementation of "
":func:`json.loads`."
msgstr ":gh:`125660`: 在 Python 实现的 :func:`json.loads` 中拒绝无效的 unicode 转义。"

#: ../NEWS:6535
msgid ""
":gh:`52551`: Use :c:func:`!wcsftime` to implement :func:`time.strftime` on "
"Windows."
msgstr ""
":gh:`52551`: 使用 :c:func:`!wcsftime` 在 Windows 上实现 :func:`time.strftime`。"

#: ../NEWS:6538
msgid ""
":gh:`125259`: Fix the notes removal logic for errors thrown in enum "
"initialization."
msgstr ":gh:`125259`: 修复了在枚举初始化中抛出错误的注释移除逻辑。"

#: ../NEWS:6541
msgid ""
":gh:`125633`: Add function :func:`inspect.ispackage` to determine whether an"
" object is a :term:`package` or not."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125633`: 添加函数 :func:`inspect.ispackage` 以确定一个对象是否为 :term:`package`。"

#: ../NEWS:6544
msgid ""
":gh:`125614`: In the :data:`~annotationlib.Format.FORWARDREF` format of "
":mod:`annotationlib`, fix bug where nested expressions were not returned as "
":class:`annotationlib.ForwardRef` format."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125614`: 在 :mod:`annotationlib` 的 "
":data:`~annotationlib.Format.FORWARDREF` 格式中，修复了嵌套表达式未以 "
":class:`annotationlib.ForwardRef` 格式返回的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:6548
msgid ""
":gh:`125590`: Allow ``FrameLocalsProxy`` to delete and pop if the key is not"
" a fast variable."
msgstr ":gh:`125590`: 允许 ``FrameLocalsProxy`` 删除和弹出非快速变量的键。"

#: ../NEWS:6551
msgid ""
":gh:`125600`: Only show stale code warning in :mod:`pdb` when we display "
"source code."
msgstr ":gh:`125600`: 仅在 :mod:`pdb` 中显示源代码时显示过时代码警告。"

#: ../NEWS:6554
msgid ""
":gh:`125542`: Deprecate passing keyword-only *prefix_chars* argument to "
":meth:`argparse.ArgumentParser.add_argument_group`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125542`: 弃用向 :meth:`argparse.ArgumentParser.add_argument_group` "
"传递仅关键字参数 *prefix_chars*。"

#: ../NEWS:6557
msgid ""
":gh:`125541`: Pressing :kbd:`Ctrl-C` while blocked in "
":meth:`threading.Lock.acquire`, :meth:`threading.RLock.acquire`, and "
":meth:`threading.Thread.join` now interrupts the function call and raises a "
":exc:`KeyboardInterrupt` exception on Windows, similar to how those "
"functions behave on macOS and Linux."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125541`: 在 Windows 上，当在 "
":meth:`threading.Lock.acquire`、:meth:`threading.RLock.acquire` 和 "
":meth:`threading.Thread.join` 中被阻塞时按下 :kbd:`Ctrl-C` 现在会中断函数调用并引发 "
":exc:`KeyboardInterrupt` 异常，类似于这些函数在 macOS 和 Linux 上的行为。"

#: ../NEWS:6563
msgid ""
":gh:`125519`: Improve traceback if :func:`importlib.reload` is called with "
"an object that is not a module. Patch by Alex Waygood."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125519`: 如果 :func:`importlib.reload` 被调用时传入的对象不是模块，改进回溯信息。由 Alex "
"Waygood 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:6566
msgid ""
":gh:`125451`: Fix deadlock when "
":class:`concurrent.futures.ProcessPoolExecutor` shuts down concurrently with"
" an error when feeding a job to a worker process."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125451`: 修复 :class:`concurrent.futures.ProcessPoolExecutor` "
"在向工作进程提供作业时因错误而并发关闭时的死锁问题。"

#: ../NEWS:6570
msgid ""
":gh:`125115`: Fixed a bug in :mod:`pdb` where arguments starting with ``-`` "
"can't be passed to the debugged script."
msgstr ":gh:`125115`: 修复了 :mod:`pdb` 中的一个错误，即无法将以 ``-`` 开头的参数传递给被调试的脚本。"

#: ../NEWS:6573
msgid ""
":gh:`125398`: Fix the conversion of the :envvar:`!VIRTUAL_ENV` path in the "
"activate script in :mod:`venv` when running in Git Bash for Windows."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125398`: 修复在 Git Bash for Windows 中运行时 :mod:`venv` 激活脚本中 "
":envvar:`!VIRTUAL_ENV` 路径的转换问题。"

#: ../NEWS:6576
msgid ""
":gh:`125245`: Fix race condition when importing :mod:`collections.abc`, "
"which could incorrectly return an empty module."
msgstr ":gh:`125245`: 修复导入 :mod:`collections.abc` 时可能错误返回空模块的竞争条件。"

#: ../NEWS:6579
msgid ""
":gh:`52551`: Fix encoding issues in :func:`time.strftime`, the "
":meth:`~datetime.datetime.strftime` method of the :mod:`datetime` classes "
":class:`~datetime.datetime`, :class:`~datetime.date` and "
":class:`~datetime.time` and formatting of these classes. Characters not "
"encodable in the current locale are now acceptable in the format string. "
"Surrogate pairs and sequence of surrogatescape-encoded bytes are no longer "
"recombinated. Embedded null character no longer terminates the format "
"string."
msgstr ""
":gh:`52551`: 修复了 :func:`time.strftime`、:mod:`datetime` 类 "
":class:`~datetime.datetime`、:class:`~datetime.date` 和 "
":class:`~datetime.time` 的 :meth:`~datetime.datetime.strftime` "
"方法以及这些类的格式化中的编码问题。现在，格式字符串中可以包含当前区域设置无法编码的字符。代理对和代理转义编码字节序列不再重新组合。嵌入的空字符不再终止格式字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:6588
msgid ""
":gh:`124984`: Fixed thread safety in :mod:`ssl` in the free-threaded build. "
"OpenSSL operations are now protected by a per-object lock."
msgstr ":gh:`124984`: 修复了 :mod:`ssl` 在自由线程构建中的线程安全问题。现在，OpenSSL 操作由每个对象的锁保护。"

#: ../NEWS:6591
msgid ""
":gh:`124651`: Properly quote template strings in :mod:`venv` activation "
"scripts."
msgstr ":gh:`124651`: 在 :mod:`venv` 激活脚本中正确引用模板字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:6594
msgid ""
":gh:`124694`: We've added "
":class:`concurrent.futures.InterpreterPoolExecutor`, which allows you to run"
" code in multiple isolated interpreters.  This allows you to circumvent the "
"limitations of CPU-bound threads (due to the GIL). Patch by Eric Snow."
msgstr ""
":gh:`124694`: 我们添加了 "
":class:`concurrent.futures.InterpreterPoolExecutor`，允许你在多个隔离的解释器中运行代码。这让你可以绕过"
" CPU 绑定线程的限制（由于 GIL）。补丁由 Eric Snow 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:6599
msgid "This addition is unrelated to :pep:`734`."
msgstr "这一添加与 :pep:`734` 无关。"

#: ../NEWS:6601
msgid ":gh:`58032`: Deprecate the :class:`argparse.FileType` type converter."
msgstr ":gh:`58032`: 弃用 :class:`argparse.FileType` 类型转换器。"

#: ../NEWS:6603
msgid ""
":gh:`99749`: Adds a feature to optionally enable suggestions for argument "
"choices and subparser names if mistyped by the user."
msgstr ":gh:`99749`: 添加了一个功能，可以可选地为用户输入错误的参数选择和子解析器名称启用建议。"

#: ../NEWS:6606
msgid ""
":gh:`58956`: Fixed a bug in :mod:`pdb` where sometimes the breakpoint won't "
"trigger if it was set on a function which is already in the call stack."
msgstr ":gh:`58956`: 修复了 :mod:`pdb` 中的一个 bug，其中如果断点设置在已经在调用堆栈中的函数上，有时不会触发。"

#: ../NEWS:6609
msgid ""
":gh:`124111`: The tkinter module can now be built to use either the new "
"version 9.0.0 of Tcl/Tk or the latest release 8.6.15 of Tcl/Tk 8.  Tcl/Tk 9 "
"includes many improvements, both to the Tcl language and to the appearance "
"and utility of the graphical user interface provided by Tk."
msgstr ""
":gh:`124111`: tkinter 模块现在可以构建为使用 Tcl/Tk 的新版本 9.0.0 或 Tcl/Tk 8 的最新版本 "
"8.6.15。Tcl/Tk 9 包括许多改进，包括对 Tcl 语言的改进以及 Tk 提供的图形用户界面的外观和实用性。"

#: ../NEWS:6614
msgid ""
":gh:`80958`: unittest discovery supports PEP 420 namespace packages as start"
" directory again."
msgstr ":gh:`80958`: unittest 发现再次支持 PEP 420 命名空间包作为起始目录。"

#: ../NEWS:6617
msgid ""
":gh:`123370`: Fix the canvas not clearing after running turtledemo clock."
msgstr ":gh:`123370`: 修复运行 turtledemo 时钟后画布不清除的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:6619
msgid ""
":gh:`89083`: Add :func:`uuid.uuid8` for generating UUIDv8 objects as "
"specified in :rfc:`9562`. Patch by Bénédikt Tran"
msgstr ""
":gh:`89083`: 添加 :func:`uuid.uuid8` 用于生成 :rfc:`9562` 中指定的 UUIDv8 对象。由 "
"Bénédikt Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:6622
msgid ""
":gh:`122549`: Add :func:`platform.invalidate_caches` to invalidate cached "
"results."
msgstr ":gh:`122549`: 添加 :func:`platform.invalidate_caches` 以无效缓存结果。"

#: ../NEWS:6625
msgid ""
":gh:`120754`: Update unbounded ``read`` calls in :mod:`zipfile` to specify "
"an explicit ``size`` putting a limit on how much data they may read. This "
"also updates handling around ZIP max comment size to match the standard "
"instead of reading comments that are one byte too long."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120754`: 更新 :mod:`zipfile` 中的无界 ``read`` 调用，以指定显式的 "
"``size``，限制它们可以读取的数据量。这也更新了 ZIP 最大注释大小的处理，以匹配标准，而不是读取多出一个字节的注释。"

#: ../NEWS:6630
msgid ""
":gh:`121267`: Improve the performance of :mod:`tarfile` when writing files, "
"by caching user names and group names."
msgstr ":gh:`121267`: 通过缓存用户名和组名，提高 :mod:`tarfile` 在写入文件时的性能。"

#: ../NEWS:6633
msgid ""
":gh:`70764`: Fixed an issue where :func:`inspect.getclosurevars` would "
"incorrectly classify an attribute name as a global variable when the name "
"exists both as an attribute name and a global variable."
msgstr ""
":gh:`70764`: 修复了 :func:`inspect.getclosurevars` "
"在属性名同时作为属性名和全局变量存在时，错误地将属性名分类为全局变量的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:6637
msgid ""
":gh:`118289`: :func:`!posixpath.realpath` now raises "
":exc:`NotADirectoryError` when *strict* mode is enabled and a non-directory "
"path with a trailing slash is supplied."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118289`: :func:`!posixpath.realpath` 现在在启用 *strict* "
"模式并提供带有斜杠的非目录路径时，会引发 :exc:`NotADirectoryError`。"

#: ../NEWS:6641
msgid ""
":gh:`119826`: Always return an absolute path for :func:`os.path.abspath` on "
"Windows."
msgstr ":gh:`119826`: 在 Windows 上，:func:`os.path.abspath` 现在总是返回绝对路径。"

#: ../NEWS:6644
msgid ""
":gh:`97850`: Remove deprecated :func:`!pkgutil.get_loader` and "
":func:`!pkgutil.find_loader`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`97850`: 移除已弃用的 :func:`!pkgutil.get_loader` 和 "
":func:`!pkgutil.find_loader`。"

#: ../NEWS:6647
msgid ""
":gh:`118986`: Add :data:`!socket.IPV6_RECVERR` constant (available since "
"Linux 2.2)."
msgstr ":gh:`118986`: 添加 :data:`!socket.IPV6_RECVERR` 常量（自 Linux 2.2 起可用）。"

#: ../NEWS:6650
msgid ""
":gh:`116897`: Accepting objects with false values (like ``0`` and ``[]``) "
"except empty strings, byte-like objects and ``None`` in :mod:`urllib.parse` "
"functions :func:`~urllib.parse.parse_qsl` and :func:`~urllib.parse.parse_qs`"
" is now deprecated."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116897`: 现在不推荐在 :mod:`urllib.parse` 函数 :func:`~urllib.parse.parse_qsl` "
"和 :func:`~urllib.parse.parse_qs` 中接受除空字符串、字节类对象和 ``None`` 之外的虚假值（如 ``0`` 和 "
"``[]``）。"

#: ../NEWS:6655
msgid ""
":gh:`101955`: Fix SystemError when match regular expression pattern "
"containing some combination of possessive quantifier, alternative and "
"capture group."
msgstr ":gh:`101955`: 修复当匹配包含某些占有量词、选择项和捕获组组合的正则表达式模式时出现的 SystemError。"

#: ../NEWS:6659
msgid ""
":gh:`71936`: Fix a race condition in :class:`multiprocessing.pool.Pool`."
msgstr ":gh:`71936`: 修复 :class:`multiprocessing.pool.Pool` 中的一个竞争条件。"

#: ../NEWS:6661
msgid ""
":issue:`46128`: Strip :class:`unittest.IsolatedAsyncioTestCase` stack frames"
" from reported stacktraces."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46128`: 从报告的堆栈跟踪中剥离 :class:`unittest.IsolatedAsyncioTestCase` 堆栈帧。"

#: ../NEWS:6664
msgid ""
":gh:`84852`: Add MIME types for MS Embedded OpenType, OpenType Layout, "
"TrueType, WOFF 1.0 and 2.0 fonts. Patch by Sahil Prajapati and Hugo van "
"Kemenade."
msgstr ""
":gh:`84852`: 为 MS Embedded OpenType、OpenType Layout、TrueType、WOFF 1.0 和 2.0 "
"字体添加 MIME 类型。由 Sahil Prajapati 和 Hugo van Kemenade 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:6671
msgid ""
":gh:`126622`: Added stub pages for removed modules explaining their removal,"
" where to find replacements, and linking to the last Python version that "
"supported them. Contributed by Ned Batchelder."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126622`: 为已移除的模块添加存根页面，解释它们的移除、在哪里可以找到替代品，并链接到支持它们的最后一个 Python 版本。由 Ned"
" Batchelder 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:6675
msgid ""
":gh:`125277`: Require Sphinx 7.2.6 or later to build the Python "
"documentation. Patch by Adam Turner."
msgstr ":gh:`125277`: 构建 Python 文档需要 Sphinx 7.2.6 或更高版本。由 Adam Turner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:6678
msgid ""
":gh:`60712`: Include the :class:`object` type in the lists of documented "
"types. Change by Furkan Onder and Martin Panter."
msgstr ""
":gh:`60712`: 在记录的类型列表中包括 :class:`object` 类型。由 Furkan Onder 和 Martin Panter "
"更改。"

#: ../NEWS:6684
msgid ""
":gh:`126795`: Increase the threshold for JIT code warmup. Depending on "
"platform and workload, this can result in performance gains of 1-9% and "
"memory savings of 3-5%."
msgstr ":gh:`126795`: 提高 JIT 代码热身的阈值。根据平台和工作负载，这可以带来 1-9% 的性能提升和 3-5% 的内存节省。"

#: ../NEWS:6688
msgid ""
":gh:`126341`: Now :exc:`ValueError` is raised instead of :exc:`SystemError` "
"when trying to iterate over a released :class:`memoryview` object."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126341`: 现在当尝试迭代已释放的 :class:`memoryview` 对象时，会引发 :exc:`ValueError` 而不是 "
":exc:`SystemError`。"

#: ../NEWS:6691
msgid ""
":gh:`126688`: Fix a crash when calling :func:`os.fork` on some operating "
"systems, including SerenityOS."
msgstr ":gh:`126688`: 修复了在包括 SerenityOS 在内的某些操作系统上调用 :func:`os.fork` 时发生的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:6697
msgid ""
":gh:`126066`: Fix :mod:`importlib` to not write an incomplete .pyc files "
"when a ulimit or some other operating system mechanism is preventing the "
"write to go through fully."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126066`: 修复 :mod:`importlib` 不会在 ulimit 或其他操作系统机制阻止写入完全通过时写入不完整的 .pyc "
"文件。"

#: ../NEWS:6704
msgid ""
":gh:`126222`: Do not include count of \"peek\" items in "
"``_PyUop_num_popped``. This ensures that the correct number of items are "
"popped from the stack when a micro-op exits with an error."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126222`: 不将“peek”项的计数包含在 ``_PyUop_num_popped`` "
"中。这确保了当微操作以错误退出时，从堆栈中弹出的项目数量是正确的。"

#: ../NEWS:6708
msgid ""
":gh:`126366`: Fix crash when using ``yield from`` on an object that raises "
"an exception in its ``__iter__``."
msgstr ":gh:`126366`: 修复了在 ``__iter__`` 中引发异常的对象上使用 ``yield from`` 时的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:6714
msgid ""
":gh:`126209`: Fix an issue with ``skip_file_prefixes`` parameter which "
"resulted in an inconsistent behaviour between the C and Python "
"implementations of :func:`warnings.warn`. Patch by Daehee Kim."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126209`: 修复了 ``skip_file_prefixes`` 参数的问题，该问题导致 :func:`warnings.warn` 的"
" C 和 Python 实现之间的行为不一致。由 Daehee Kim 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:6721
msgid ""
":gh:`126312`: Fix crash during garbage collection on an object frozen by "
":func:`gc.freeze` on the free-threaded build."
msgstr ":gh:`126312`: 修复了在自由线程构建上由 :func:`gc.freeze` 冻结的对象进行垃圾回收时的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:6724
msgid ""
":gh:`103951`: Relax optimization requirements to allow fast attribute access"
" to module subclasses."
msgstr ":gh:`103951`: 放宽优化要求，允许快速访问模块子类的属性。"

#: ../NEWS:6727
msgid ""
":gh:`126072`: Following :gh:`126101`, for :ref:`codeobjects` like lambda, "
"annotation and type alias, we no longer  add ``None`` to its "
":attr:`~codeobject.co_consts`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126072`: 根据 :gh:`126101`，对于像 lambda、注解和类型别名这样的 "
":ref:`codeobjects`，我们不再向其 :attr:`~codeobject.co_consts` 添加 ``None``。"

#: ../NEWS:6731
msgid ""
":gh:`126195`: Improve JIT performance by 1.4% on macOS Apple Silicon by "
"using platform-specific memory protection APIs. Patch by Diego Russo."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126195`: 通过使用平台特定的内存保护 API，在 macOS Apple Silicon 上提高 JIT 性能 1.4%。由 "
"Diego Russo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:6734
msgid ""
":gh:`126139`: Provide better error location when attempting to use a "
":term:`future statement <__future__>` with an unknown future feature."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126139`: 当尝试使用带有未知未来特性的 :term:`future 语句 <__future__>` 时，提供更好的错误位置。"

#: ../NEWS:6737
msgid ""
":gh:`126072`: Add a new attribute in :attr:`~codeobject.co_flags` to "
"indicate whether the first item in :attr:`~codeobject.co_consts` is the "
"docstring. If a code object has no docstring, ``None`` will **NOT** be "
"inserted."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126072`: 在 :attr:`~codeobject.co_flags` 中添加一个新属性，用于指示 "
":attr:`~codeobject.co_consts` 中的第一项是否为文档字符串。如果一个代码对象没有文档字符串，``None`` 将 "
"**不会** 被插入。"

#: ../NEWS:6741
msgid ""
":gh:`126076`: Relocated objects such as ``tuple``, ``bytes`` and ``str`` "
"objects are properly tracked by :mod:`tracemalloc` and its associated hooks."
" Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126076`: 重新定位的对象，如 ``tuple``、``bytes`` 和 ``str`` 对象，现在被 "
":mod:`tracemalloc` 及其相关钩子正确跟踪。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:6745
msgid ""
":gh:`90370`: Avoid temporary tuple creation for vararg in argument passing "
"with Argument Clinic generated code (if arguments either vararg or "
"positional-only)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`90370`: 在使用 Argument Clinic 生成的代码中传递参数时，避免为可变参数创建临时元组（如果参数是可变参数或仅位置参数）。"

#: ../NEWS:6749
msgid ""
":gh:`126018`: Fix a crash in :func:`sys.audit` when passing a non-string as "
"first argument and Python was compiled in debug mode."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126018`: 修复了在调试模式下编译的 Python 中，当传递非字符串作为第一个参数时 :func:`sys.audit` 崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:6752
msgid ""
":gh:`126012`: The :class:`memoryview` type now supports subscription, making"
" it a :term:`generic type`."
msgstr ":gh:`126012`: :class:`memoryview` 类型现在支持订阅，使其成为 :term:`generic type`。"

#: ../NEWS:6755
msgid ""
":gh:`125837`: Adds :opcode:`LOAD_SMALL_INT` and "
":opcode:`LOAD_CONST_IMMORTAL` instructions. ``LOAD_SMALL_INT`` pushes a "
"small integer equal to the ``oparg`` to the stack. ``LOAD_CONST_IMMORTAL`` "
"does the same as ``LOAD_CONST`` but is more efficient for immortal objects. "
"Removes ``RETURN_CONST``  instruction."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125837`: 添加了 :opcode:`LOAD_SMALL_INT` 和 :opcode:`LOAD_CONST_IMMORTAL` "
"指令。``LOAD_SMALL_INT`` 将一个等于 ``oparg`` 的小整数推送到堆栈上。``LOAD_CONST_IMMORTAL`` "
"的作用与 ``LOAD_CONST`` 相同，但对不朽对象更高效。移除了 ``RETURN_CONST`` 指令。"

#: ../NEWS:6761
msgid ""
":gh:`125942`: On Android, the ``errors`` setting of :any:`sys.stdout` was "
"changed from ``surrogateescape`` to ``backslashreplace``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125942`: 在 Android 上，:any:`sys.stdout` 的 ``errors`` 设置从 "
"``surrogateescape`` 更改为 ``backslashreplace``。"

#: ../NEWS:6764
msgid ""
":gh:`125859`: Fix a crash in the free threading build when "
":func:`gc.get_objects` or :func:`gc.get_referrers` is called during an in-"
"progress garbage collection."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125859`: 修复了在自由线程构建中，当在垃圾回收过程中调用 :func:`gc.get_objects` 或 "
":func:`gc.get_referrers` 时崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:6768
msgid ""
":gh:`125868`: It was possible in 3.14.0a1 only for attribute lookup to give "
"the wrong value. This was due to an incorrect specialization in very "
"specific circumstances. This is fixed in 3.14.0a2."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125868`: 在 3.14.0a1 中，只有在非常特定的情况下，属性查找可能会给出错误的值。这是由于在这些情况下进行了错误的专门化。这在 "
"3.14.0a2 中已修复。"

#: ../NEWS:6772
msgid ""
":gh:`125498`: The JIT has been updated to leverage Clang 19’s new "
"``preserve_none`` attribute, which supports more platforms and is more "
"useful than LLVM's existing ``ghccc`` calling convention. This also removes "
"the need to manually patch the calling convention in LLVM IR, simplifying "
"the JIT compilation process."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125498`: JIT 已更新以利用 Clang 19 的新 ``preserve_none`` 属性，该属性支持更多平台，并且比 LLVM"
" 现有的 ``ghccc`` 调用约定更有用。这也消除了手动修补 LLVM IR 中调用约定的需要，简化了 JIT 编译过程。"

#: ../NEWS:6778
msgid ""
":gh:`125703`: Correctly honour :mod:`tracemalloc` hooks in specialized "
"``Py_DECREF`` paths. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`125703`: 在专门的 ``Py_DECREF`` 路径中正确遵循 :mod:`tracemalloc` 钩子。Patch by "
"Pablo Galindo"

#: ../NEWS:6781
msgid ""
":gh:`125593`: Use color to highlight error locations in traceback from "
"exception group"
msgstr ":gh:`125593`: 使用颜色高亮异常组回溯中的错误位置"

#: ../NEWS:6784
msgid ""
":gh:`125017`: Fix crash on certain accesses to the ``__annotations__`` of "
":class:`staticmethod` and :class:`classmethod` objects."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125017`: 修复在某些访问 :class:`staticmethod` 和 :class:`classmethod` 对象的 "
"``__annotations__`` 时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:6787
msgid ""
":gh:`125588`: The Python PEG generator can now use f-strings in the grammar "
"actions. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`125588`: Python PEG 生成器现在可以在语法动作中使用 f-strings。Patch by Pablo Galindo"

#: ../NEWS:6790
msgid ""
":gh:`125444`: Fix illegal instruction for older Arm architectures. Patch by "
"Diego Russo, testing by Ross Burton."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125444`: 修复旧版 Arm 架构的非法指令问题。Patch by Diego Russo, testing by Ross "
"Burton."

#: ../NEWS:6793
msgid ""
":gh:`118423`: Add a new ``INSTRUCTION_SIZE`` macro to the cases generator "
"which returns the current instruction size."
msgstr ":gh:`118423`: 在案例生成器中添加一个新的 ``INSTRUCTION_SIZE`` 宏，返回当前指令大小。"

#: ../NEWS:6796
msgid ""
":gh:`125038`: Fix crash when iterating over a generator expression after "
"direct changes on ``gi_frame.f_locals``. Patch by Mikhail Efimov."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125038`: 修复在直接更改 ``gi_frame.f_locals`` 后迭代生成器表达式时的崩溃问题。Patch by Mikhail"
" Efimov."

#: ../NEWS:6799
msgid ""
":gh:`124855`: Don't allow the JIT and perf support to be active at the same "
"time. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":gh:`124855`: 不允许 JIT 和 perf 支持同时激活。Patch by Pablo Galindo"

#: ../NEWS:6802
msgid ":gh:`123714`: Update JIT compilation to use LLVM 19"
msgstr ":gh:`123714`: 更新 JIT 编译以使用 LLVM 19"

#: ../NEWS:6804
msgid ""
":gh:`123930`: Improve the error message when a script shadowing a module "
"from the standard library causes :exc:`ImportError` to be raised during a "
"\"from\" import. Similarly, improve the error message when a script "
"shadowing a third party module attempts to \"from\" import an attribute from"
" that third party module while still initialising."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123930`: 当脚本遮蔽标准库中的模块导致在“from”导入期间引发 :exc:`ImportError` "
"时，改进错误消息。类似地，当脚本遮蔽第三方模块并尝试在初始化期间“from”导入该第三方模块的属性时，改进错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:6810
msgid ""
":gh:`119793`: The :func:`map` built-in now has an optional keyword-only "
"*strict* flag like :func:`zip` to check that all the iterables are of equal "
"length. Patch by Wannes Boeykens."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119793`: :func:`map` 内置函数现在有一个可选的仅关键字参数 *strict*，类似于 "
":func:`zip`，用于检查所有可迭代对象是否长度相等。Patch by Wannes Boeykens."

#: ../NEWS:6817
msgid ""
":gh:`118950`: Fix bug where SSLProtocol.connection_lost wasn't getting "
"called when OSError was thrown on writing to socket."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118950`: 修复 SSLProtocol.connection_lost 在向套接字写入时抛出 OSError 时未被调用的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:6820
msgid ""
":gh:`113570`: Fixed a bug in ``reprlib.repr`` where it incorrectly called "
"the repr method on shadowed Python built-in types."
msgstr ""
":gh:`113570`: 修复 ``reprlib.repr`` 中的一个错误，其中它错误地调用了被遮蔽的 Python 内置类型的 repr 方法。"

#: ../NEWS:6826
msgid ""
":gh:`126554`: Fix error handling in :class:`ctypes.CDLL` objects which could"
" result in a crash in rare situations."
msgstr ":gh:`126554`: 修复 :class:`ctypes.CDLL` 对象中的错误处理，在极少数情况下可能导致崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:6829
msgid ""
":gh:`126061`: Add :c:func:`PyLong_IsPositive`, :c:func:`PyLong_IsNegative` "
"and :c:func:`PyLong_IsZero` for checking if a :c:type:`PyLongObject` is "
"positive, negative, or zero, respectively."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126061`: 添加 :c:func:`PyLong_IsPositive`、:c:func:`PyLong_IsNegative` 和 "
":c:func:`PyLong_IsZero` 用于检查 :c:type:`PyLongObject` 是否为正、负或零。"

#: ../NEWS:6833
msgid ""
":gh:`125608`: Fix a bug where dictionary watchers (e.g., "
":c:func:`PyDict_Watch`) on an object's attribute dictionary "
"(:attr:`~object.__dict__`) were not triggered when the object's attributes "
"were modified."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125608`: 修复了一个 "
"bug，当对象的属性被修改时，对象属性字典（:attr:`~object.__dict__`）上的字典观察者（例如 "
":c:func:`PyDict_Watch`）不会被触发。"

#: ../NEWS:6838
msgid ""
":gh:`123619`: Added the :c:func:`PyUnstable_Object_EnableDeferredRefcount` "
"function for enabling :pep:`703` deferred reference counting."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123619`: 添加了 :c:func:`PyUnstable_Object_EnableDeferredRefcount` 函数，用于启用"
" :pep:`703` 延迟引用计数。"

#: ../NEWS:6841
msgid ""
":gh:`121654`: Add :c:func:`PyType_Freeze` function to make a type immutable."
" Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121654`: 添加 :c:func:`PyType_Freeze` 函数使类型不可变。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:6844
msgid ""
":gh:`120026`: The :c:macro:`!Py_HUGE_VAL` macro is :term:`soft deprecated`."
msgstr ":gh:`120026`: :c:macro:`!Py_HUGE_VAL` 宏被 软弃用`。"

#: ../NEWS:6849
msgid ""
":gh:`126691`: Removed the ``--with-emscripten-target`` configure flag. We "
"unified the ``node`` and ``browser`` options and the same build can now be "
"used, independent of target runtime."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126691`: 移除了 ``--with-emscripten-target`` 配置标志。我们统一了 ``node`` 和 "
"``browser`` 选项，现在可以使用相同的构建，不受目标运行时的影响。"

#: ../NEWS:6853
msgid ""
":gh:`123877`: Use ``wasm32-wasip1`` as the target triple for WASI instead of"
" ``wasm32-wasi``. The latter will eventually be reclaimed for WASI 1.0 while"
" CPython currently only supports WASI preview1."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123877`: 使用 ``wasm32-wasip1`` 作为 WASI 的目标三元组，而不是 ``wasm32-wasi``。后者最终将被"
" WASI 1.0 收回，而 CPython 目前仅支持 WASI preview1。"

#: ../NEWS:6857
msgid ":gh:`126458`: Disable SIMD support for HACL under WASI."
msgstr ":gh:`126458`: 在 WASI 下禁用 HACL 的 SIMD 支持。"

#: ../NEWS:6859
msgid ":gh:`89640`: Hard-code float word ordering as little endian on WASM."
msgstr ":gh:`89640`: 在 WASM 上将浮点数字序硬编码为小端序。"

#: ../NEWS:6861
msgid ""
":gh:`126206`: ``make clinic`` now runs Argument Clinic using the ``--force``"
" option, thus forcefully regenerating generated code."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126206`: ``make clinic`` 现在使用 ``--force`` 选项运行 Argument "
"Clinic，从而强制重新生成生成的代码。"

#: ../NEWS:6864
msgid ""
":gh:`126187`: Introduced ``Tools/wasm/emscripten.py`` to simplify doing "
"Emscripten builds."
msgstr ":gh:`126187`: 引入了 ``Tools/wasm/emscripten.py`` 以简化 Emscripten 构建。"

#: ../NEWS:6867
msgid ""
":gh:`124932`: For cross builds, there is now support for having a different "
"install ``prefix`` than the ``host_prefix`` used by ``getpath.py``. This is "
