msgstr ":gh:`101525`: 如果二进制文件被BOLT重定位，则跳过 ``test_gdb``。由Donghee Na提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7016
msgid ""
":gh:`107562`: Test certificates have been updated to expire far in the "
