"``is_multicast``、``is_reserved``、``is_link_local``、``is_global`` 和 "
"``is_unspecified``。"

#: ../NEWS:7037
msgid ""
":gh:`112301`: Add ability to ignore warnings per file with warning count in "
"warning checking tooling. Patch by Nate Ohlson."
msgstr ":gh:`112301`: 在警告检查工具中添加按文件忽略警告的能力，并带有警告计数。由Nate Ohlson提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7040
msgid ""
":gh:`112301`: Add macOS warning tracking to warning check tooling. Patch by "
"Nate Ohlson."
msgstr ":gh:`112301`: 为警告检查工具添加macOS警告跟踪。由Nate Ohlson提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7043
msgid ""
":gh:`122133`: Authenticate the socket connection for the "
