"available like Windows."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122133`: 在 ``AF_UNIX`` 不可用的平台（如Windows）上，为 ``socket.socketpair()`` "
"后备方案验证套接字连接。"

#: ../NEWS:7047
msgid ""
"Patch by Gregory P. Smith <greg@krypto.org> and Seth Larson "
"<seth@python.org>. Reported by Ellie <el@horse64.org>"
msgstr ""
"由Gregory P. Smith <greg@krypto.org> 和 Seth Larson "
"<seth@python.org>提供补丁。由Ellie <el@horse64.org>报告。"

#: ../NEWS:7050
msgid ""
":gh:`121957`: Fixed missing audit events around interactive use of Python, "
"now also properly firing for ``python -i``, as well as for ``python -m "
"asyncio``. The events in question are ``cpython.run_stdin`` and "
"``cpython.run_startup``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121957`: 修复了Python交互式使用中缺失的审计事件，现在也能正确触发 ``python -i`` 以及 ``python -m "
"asyncio``。相关事件为 ``cpython.run_stdin`` 和 ``cpython.run_startup``。"

#: ../NEWS:7055
msgid ""
":gh:`112301`: Enable runtime protections for glibc to abort execution when "
"unsafe behavior is encountered, for all platforms except Windows."
msgstr ":gh:`112301`: 为除 Windows 外的所有平台启用 glibc 的运行时保护，当遇到不安全行为时中止执行。"

#: ../NEWS:7058
msgid ""
":gh:`121285`: Remove backtracking from tarfile header parsing for "
"``hdrcharset``, PAX, and GNU sparse headers."
msgstr ":gh:`121285`: 在 tarfile 头解析中移除对 ``hdrcharset``、PAX 和 GNU 稀疏头的回溯。"

#: ../NEWS:7061
msgid ""
":gh:`112301`: Add default compiler options to improve security. Enable "
"-Wimplicit-fallthrough, -fstack-protector-strong, -Wtrampolines."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112301`: 添加默认编译器选项以提高安全性。启用 -Wimplicit-fallthrough、-fstack-protector-"
"strong、-Wtrampolines。"

#: ../NEWS:7064
msgid ""
":gh:`118773`: Fixes creation of ACLs in :func:`os.mkdir` on Windows to work "
"correctly on non-English machines."
msgstr ":gh:`118773`: 修复 Windows 上 :func:`os.mkdir` 创建 ACL 在非英语机器上工作不正确的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7067
msgid ""
":gh:`118486`: :func:`os.mkdir` on Windows now accepts *mode* of ``0o700`` to"
" restrict the new directory to the current user. This fixes :cve:`2024-4030`"
" affecting :func:`tempfile.mkdtemp` in scenarios where the base temporary "
"directory is more permissive than the default."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118486`: Windows 上的 :func:`os.mkdir` 现在接受 ``0o700`` 的 *mode* "
"参数，将新目录限制为当前用户。这修复了 :cve:`2024-4030`，影响 :func:`tempfile.mkdtemp` "
"在基础临时目录比默认更宽松的情况下的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7075
msgid ""
":gh:`125422`: Fixed the bug where :mod:`pdb` and :mod:`bdb` can step into "
"the bottom caller frame."
msgstr ":gh:`125422`: 修复了 :mod:`pdb` 和 :mod:`bdb` 可以步入底部调用者帧的 bug。"

#: ../NEWS:7078
msgid ""
":gh:`100141`: Fixed the bug where :mod:`pdb` will be stuck in an infinite "
"loop when debugging an empty file."
msgstr ":gh:`100141`: 修复了调试空文件时 :mod:`pdb` 会陷入无限循环的 bug。"

#: ../NEWS:7081
msgid ""
":gh:`53203`: Fix :func:`time.strptime` for ``%c``, ``%x`` and ``%X`` formats"
" in many locales that use non-ASCII digits, like Persian, Burmese, Odia and "
"Shan."
msgstr ""
":gh:`53203`: 修复 :func:`time.strptime` 对于使用非 ASCII 数字的许多地区（如波斯语、缅甸语、奥里亚语和掸语）的"
" ``%c``、``%x`` 和 ``%X`` 格式的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7085
msgid ""
":gh:`125206`: Workaround for old libffi versions is added. Module ctypes "
"supports :c:expr:`double complex` only with libffi >= 3.3.0. Patch by "
"Mikhail Efimov."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125206`: 添加了对旧 libffi 版本的变通方案。模块 ctypes 仅支持 libffi >= 3.3.0 的 "
":c:expr:`double complex`。由 Mikhail Efimov 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7089
msgid ""
":gh:`89967`: Make :class:`~weakref.WeakKeyDictionary` and "
":class:`~weakref.WeakValueDictionary` safe against concurrent mutations from"
" other threads. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`89967`: 使 :class:`~weakref.WeakKeyDictionary` 和 "
":class:`~weakref.WeakValueDictionary` 对其他线程的并发修改安全。补丁由 Kumar Aditya 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:7093
msgid ""
":gh:`125260`: The :func:`gzip.compress` *mtime* parameter now defaults to 0 "
"for reproducible output. Patch by Bernhard M. Wiedemann and Adam Turner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125260`: :func:`gzip.compress` 的 *mtime* 参数现在默认为 0，以获得可重复的输出。补丁由 "
"Bernhard M. Wiedemann 和 Adam Turner 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:7096
msgid ""
":gh:`125243`: Fix data race when creating :class:`zoneinfo.ZoneInfo` objects"
" in the free threading build."
msgstr ":gh:`125243`: 修复在自由线程构建中创建 :class:`zoneinfo.ZoneInfo` 对象时的数据竞争。"

#: ../NEWS:7099
msgid ""
":gh:`125254`: Fix a bug where ArgumentError includes the incorrect ambiguous"
" option in :mod:`argparse`."
msgstr ":gh:`125254`: 修复 ArgumentError 在 :mod:`argparse` 中包含错误模糊选项的 bug。"

#: ../NEWS:7102
msgid ""
":gh:`125235`: Keep :mod:`tkinter` TCL paths in venv pointing to base "
"installation on Windows."
msgstr ":gh:`125235`: 保持 :mod:`tkinter` TCL 路径在 venv 中指向 Windows 上的基础安装。"

#: ../NEWS:7105
msgid ""
":gh:`61011`: Fix inheritance of nested mutually exclusive groups from parent"
" parser in :class:`argparse.ArgumentParser`. Previously, all nested mutually"
" exclusive groups lost their connection to the group containing them and "
"were displayed as belonging directly to the parser."
msgstr ""
":gh:`61011`: 修复了 :class:`argparse.ArgumentParser` "
"中父解析器中嵌套互斥组的继承问题。之前，所有嵌套的互斥组都会失去与包含它们的组的连接，并显示为直接属于解析器。"

#: ../NEWS:7110
msgid ""
":gh:`125118`: Don't copy arbitrary values to :c:expr:`_Bool` in the "
":mod:`struct` module."
msgstr ":gh:`125118`: 在 :mod:`struct` 模块中，不要将任意值复制到 :c:expr:`_Bool`。"

#: ../NEWS:7113
msgid ""
":gh:`125069`: Fix an issue where providing a :class:`pathlib.PurePath` "
"object as an initializer argument to a second :class:`~pathlib.PurePath` "
"object with a different :attr:`~pathlib.PurePath.parser` resulted in "
"arguments to the former object's initializer being joined by the latter "
"object's parser."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125069`: 修复了一个问题，该问题发生在将一个 :class:`pathlib.PurePath` "
"对象作为初始化参数传递给另一个具有不同 :attr:`~pathlib.PurePath.parser` 的 "
":class:`~pathlib.PurePath` 对象时，导致前一个对象初始化器的参数被后一个对象的解析器连接。"

#: ../NEWS:7119
msgid ""
":gh:`125096`: If the :envvar:`PYTHON_BASIC_REPL` environment variable is "
"set, the :mod:`site` module no longer imports the :mod:`!_pyrepl` module. "
"Moreover, the :mod:`site` module now respects :option:`-E` and :option:`-I` "
"command line options: ignore :envvar:`PYTHON_BASIC_REPL` in this case. Patch"
" by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125096`: 如果设置了 :envvar:`PYTHON_BASIC_REPL` 环境变量，:mod:`site` 模块将不再导入 "
":mod:`!_pyrepl` 模块。此外，:mod:`site` 模块现在尊重 :option:`-E` 和 :option:`-I` "
"命令行选项：在这种情况下忽略 :envvar:`PYTHON_BASIC_REPL`。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7125
msgid ""
":gh:`124969`: Fix ``locale.nl_langinfo(locale.ALT_DIGITS)``. Now it returns "
"a tuple of up to 100 strings (an empty tuple on most locales). Previously it"
" returned the first item of that tuple or an empty string."
msgstr ""
":gh:`124969`: 修复了 ``locale.nl_langinfo(locale.ALT_DIGITS)``。现在它返回最多 100 "
"个字符串的元组（在大多数区域设置中为空元组）。之前它返回该元组的第一个项目或空字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:7129
msgid ""
":gh:`124960`: Fix support for the ``barry_as_FLUFL`` future flag in the new "
"REPL."
msgstr ":gh:`124960`: 在新的 REPL 中修复了对 ``barry_as_FLUFL`` 未来标志的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:7132
msgid ""
":gh:`69998`: Fix :func:`locale.nl_langinfo` in case when different "
"categories have different locales. The function now sets temporarily the "
"``LC_CTYPE`` locale in some cases. This temporary change affects other "
"threads."
msgstr ""
":gh:`69998`: 修复了当不同类别具有不同区域设置时的 :func:`locale.nl_langinfo` "
"函数。该函数现在在某些情况下临时设置 ``LC_CTYPE`` 区域设置。这一临时更改会影响其他线程。"

#: ../NEWS:7136
msgid ""
":gh:`124958`: Fix refcycles in exceptions raised from "
":class:`asyncio.TaskGroup` and the python implementation of "
":class:`asyncio.Future`"
msgstr ""
":gh:`124958`: 修复了从 :class:`asyncio.TaskGroup` 和 :class:`asyncio.Future` 的 "
"Python 实现中引发的异常中的引用循环。"

#: ../NEWS:7140
msgid ""
":gh:`53203`: Fix :func:`time.strptime` for ``%c`` and ``%x`` formats in many"
" locales: Arabic, Bislama, Breton, Bodo, Kashubian, Chuvash, Estonian, "
"French, Irish, Ge'ez, Gurajati, Manx Gaelic, Hebrew, Hindi, Chhattisgarhi, "
"Haitian Kreyol, Japanese, Kannada, Korean, Marathi, Malay, Norwegian, "
"Nynorsk, Punjabi, Rajasthani, Tok Pisin, Yoruba, Yue Chinese, Yau/Nungon and"
" Chinese."
msgstr ""
":gh:`53203`: 修复 :func:`time.strptime` 在许多语言环境中对 ``%c`` 和 ``%x`` "
"格式的支持，包括阿拉伯语、比斯拉马语、布列塔尼语、博多语、卡舒比语、楚瓦什语、爱沙尼亚语、法语、爱尔兰语、吉兹语、古吉拉特语、曼克斯盖尔语、希伯来语、印地语、恰蒂斯加尔语、海地克里奥尔语、日语、卡纳达语、韩语、马拉地语、马来语、挪威语、新挪威语、旁遮普语、拉贾斯坦语、托克皮辛语、约鲁巴语、粤语、尧语/农贡语和中文。"

#: ../NEWS:7147
msgid ""
":gh:`123961`: Convert :mod:`curses` to multi-phase initialization "
"(:pep:`489`), thereby fixing reference leaks at interpreter shutdown. Patch "
"by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123961`: 将 :mod:`curses` 转换为多阶段初始化 (:pep:`489`)，从而修复解释器关闭时的引用泄漏。由 "
"Bénédikt Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7151
msgid ":gh:`124944`: Add ``SO_ORIGINAL_DST`` to the :mod:`socket` module."
msgstr ":gh:`124944`: 在 :mod:`socket` 模块中添加 ``SO_ORIGINAL_DST``。"

#: ../NEWS:7153
msgid ""
":gh:`117151`: The default buffer size used by :func:`shutil.copyfileobj` has"
" been increased from 64k to 256k on non-Windows platforms. It was already "
"larger on Windows."
msgstr ""
":gh:`117151`: :func:`shutil.copyfileobj` 使用的默认缓冲区大小在非 Windows 平台上已从 64k 增加到 "
"256k。在 Windows 上已经更大。"

#: ../NEWS:7157
msgid ""
":gh:`90102`: Skip the ``isatty`` system call during open() when the file is "
"known to not be a character device. This provides a slight performance "
"improvement when reading whole files."
msgstr ""
":gh:`90102`: 在 open() 期间跳过 ``isatty`` 系统调用，当已知文件不是字符设备时。这在读取整个文件时提供了轻微的性能提升。"

#: ../NEWS:7161
msgid ""
":gh:`124917`: Allow calling :func:`os.path.exists` and "
":func:`os.path.lexists` with keyword arguments on Windows. Fixes a "
"regression in 3.13.0."
msgstr ""
":gh:`124917`: 允许在 Windows 上使用关键字参数调用 :func:`os.path.exists` 和 "
":func:`os.path.lexists`。修复了 3.13.0 版本中的回归问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7165
msgid ""
":gh:`65865`: :mod:`argparse` now raises early error for invalid ``help`` "
"arguments to :meth:`~argparse.ArgumentParser.add_argument`, "
":meth:`~argparse.ArgumentParser.add_subparsers` and :meth:`!add_parser`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`65865`: :mod:`argparse` 现在会为 "
":meth:`~argparse.ArgumentParser.add_argument`、:meth:`~argparse.ArgumentParser.add_subparsers`"
" 和 :meth:`!add_parser` 的无效 ``help`` 参数引发早期错误。"

#: ../NEWS:7169
msgid ""
":gh:`124653`: Fix detection of the minimal Queue API needed by the "
":mod:`logging` module. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ":gh:`124653`: 修复检测 :mod:`logging` 模块所需的最小队列 API。由 Bénédikt Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7172
msgid ""
":gh:`91818`: The CLI of many modules (:mod:`ast`, :mod:`ensurepip`, "
":mod:`json`, :mod:`pdb`, :mod:`sqlite3`, :mod:`tokenize`, :mod:`venv`) now "
"uses the actual executable name instead of simply \"python\" to display in "
"the usage message."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91818`: 许多模块的 CLI "
"(:mod:`ast`、:mod:`ensurepip`、:mod:`json`、:mod:`pdb`、:mod:`sqlite3`、:mod:`tokenize`、:mod:`venv`)"
" 现在使用实际的可执行文件名而不是简单的 \"python\" 来显示在用法消息中。"

#: ../NEWS:7177
msgid ""
":gh:`124858`: Fix reference cycles left in tracebacks in "
":func:`asyncio.open_connection` when used with ``happy_eyeballs_delay``"
msgstr ""
":gh:`124858`: 修复在 :func:`asyncio.open_connection` 与 ``happy_eyeballs_delay``"
" 一起使用时留下的引用循环在 tracebacks 中的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7180
msgid ""
":gh:`124390`: Fixed :exc:`AssertionError` when using "
":func:`!asyncio.staggered.staggered_race` with "
":data:`asyncio.eager_task_factory`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`124390`: 修复了在使用 :func:`!asyncio.staggered.staggered_race` 与 "
":data:`asyncio.eager_task_factory` 时引发的 :exc:`AssertionError`。"

#: ../NEWS:7184
msgid ""
":gh:`85935`: :meth:`argparse.ArgumentParser.add_argument` now raises an "
"exception if an :ref:`action` that does not consume arguments (like "
"'store_const' or 'store_true') or explicit ``nargs=0`` are specified for "
"positional arguments."
msgstr ""
":gh:`85935`: 现在，如果为位置参数指定了不消耗参数的 :ref:`action` (如'store_const'或'store_true')"
" 或显式指定了``nargs=0``，:meth:`argparse.ArgumentParser.add_argument` 会引发异常。"

#: ../NEWS:7189
msgid ""
":gh:`124835`: Make :func:`tomllib.loads` raise :exc:`TypeError` not "
":exc:`AttributeError` on bad input types that do not have the ``replace`` "
"attribute. Improve error message when :class:`bytes` is received."
msgstr ""
":gh:`124835`: 让 :func:`tomllib.loads` 在输入类型不良且不具有 ``replace`` 属性时引发 "
":exc:`TypeError` 而非 :exc:`AttributeError`。改进接收到 :class:`bytes` 时的错误信息。"

#: ../NEWS:7193
msgid ""
":gh:`124693`: Fix a bug where :mod:`argparse` doesn't recognize negative "
"complex numbers or negative numbers using scientific notation."
msgstr ":gh:`124693`: 修复了 :mod:`argparse` 无法识别负复数或使用科学计数法的负数的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:7196
msgid ""
":gh:`124787`: Fix :class:`typing.TypeAliasType` with incorrect "
"``type_params`` argument. Now it raises a :exc:`TypeError` when a type "
"parameter without a default follows one with a default, and when an entry in"
" the ``type_params`` tuple is not a type parameter object."
msgstr ""
":gh:`124787`: 修复了 :class:`typing.TypeAliasType` 中 ``type_params`` "
"参数不正确的问题。现在，当没有默认值的类型参数跟随有默认值的参数时，以及当 ``type_params`` 元组中的条目不是类型参数对象时，会引发 "
":exc:`TypeError`。"

#: ../NEWS:7201
msgid ""
":gh:`66436`: Improved :ref:`prog` default value for "
":class:`argparse.ArgumentParser`. It will now include the name of the Python"
" executable along with the module or package name, or the path to a "
"directory, ZIP file, or directory within a ZIP file if the code was run that"
" way."
msgstr ""
":gh:`66436`: 改进了 :class:`argparse.ArgumentParser` 的 :ref:`prog` "
"默认值。现在它将包括Python可执行文件的名称以及模块或包名，或者如果代码是以这种方式运行的，将包括目录、ZIP文件或ZIP文件内目录的路径。"

#: ../NEWS:7207
msgid ""
":gh:`116850`: Fix :mod:`argparse` for namespaces with not directly writable "
"dict (e.g. classes)."
msgstr ":gh:`116850`: 修复了 :mod:`argparse` 对于具有不可直接写入字典的命名空间（例如类）的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7210
msgid ""
":gh:`101552`: Add an *annoation_format* parameter to "
":func:`inspect.signature`. Add an *quote_annotation_strings* parameter to "
":meth:`inspect.Signature.format`. Use the new functionality to improve the "
"display of annotations in signatures in :mod:`pydoc`. Patch by Jelle "
"Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101552`: 向 :func:`inspect.signature` 添加了一个 *annotation_format* 参数。向 "
":meth:`inspect.Signature.format` 添加了一个 *quote_annotation_strings* "
"参数。使用新功能改进了 :mod:`pydoc` 中签名注释的显示。由Jelle Zijlstra提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7216
msgid ""
":gh:`58573`: Fix conflicts between abbreviated long options in the parent "
"parser and subparsers in :mod:`argparse`."
msgstr ":gh:`58573`: 修复了 :mod:`argparse` 中父解析器和子解析器之间缩写长选项的冲突。"

#: ../NEWS:7219
msgid ""
":gh:`124594`: All :mod:`asyncio` REPL prompts run in the same "
":class:`context <contextvars.Context>`. Contributed by Bartosz Sławecki."
msgstr ""
":gh:`124594`: 所有 :mod:`asyncio` REPL提示符都在同一个 :class:`context "
"<contextvars.Context>` 中运行。由Bartosz Sławecki贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:7222
msgid ""
":gh:`61181`: Fix support of :ref:`choices` with string value in "
":mod:`argparse`. Substrings of the specified string no longer considered "
"valid values."
msgstr ""
":gh:`61181`: 修复了 :mod:`argparse` 中对带有字符串值的 :ref:`choices` "
"的支持。不再认为指定字符串的子字符串为有效值。"

#: ../NEWS:7226
msgid ""
":gh:`116750`: Provide :func:`sys.monitoring.clear_tool_id` to unregister all"
" events and callbacks set by the tool."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116750`: 提供 :func:`sys.monitoring.clear_tool_id` 以注销由工具设置的所有事件和回调。"

#: ../NEWS:7229
msgid ""
":gh:`124552`: Improve the accuracy of :mod:`bdb`'s check for the possibility"
" of breakpoint in a frame. This makes it possible to disable unnecessary "
"events in functions."
msgstr ":gh:`124552`: 提高 :mod:`bdb` 检查帧中可能断点的准确性。这使得可以禁用函数中不必要的事件。"

#: ../NEWS:7233
msgid ""
":gh:`124538`: Fixed crash when using :func:`gc.get_referents` on a capsule "
"object."
msgstr ":gh:`124538`: 修复了在胶囊对象上使用 :func:`gc.get_referents` 时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7236
msgid ""
":gh:`80259`: Fix :mod:`argparse` support of positional arguments with "
"``nargs='?'``, ``default=argparse.SUPPRESS`` and specified ``type``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`80259`: 修复 :mod:`argparse` 对带有 "
"``nargs='?'``、``default=argparse.SUPPRESS`` 和指定 ``type`` 的位置参数的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:7239
msgid ""
":gh:`120378`: Fix a crash related to an integer overflow in "
":func:`curses.resizeterm` and :func:`curses.resize_term`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120378`: 修复了与 :func:`curses.resizeterm` 和 :func:`curses.resize_term` "
"中整数溢出相关的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7242
msgid ""
":gh:`124498`: Fix :class:`typing.TypeAliasType` not to be generic, when "
"``type_params`` is an empty tuple."
msgstr ""
":gh:`124498`: 修复 :class:`typing.TypeAliasType` 当 ``type_params`` "
"为空元组时不泛型的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7245
msgid ""
":gh:`53834`: Fix support of arguments with :ref:`choices` in "
":mod:`argparse`. Positional arguments with :ref:`nargs` equal to ``'?'`` or "
"``'*'`` no longer check :ref:`default` against ``choices``. Optional "
"arguments with ``nargs`` equal to ``'?'`` no longer check :ref:`const` "
"against ``choices``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`53834`: 修复 :mod:`argparse` 中对带有 :ref:`choices` 的参数的支持。带有 :ref:`nargs` "
"等于 ``'?'`` 或 ``'*'`` 的位置参数不再检查 :ref:`default` 是否匹配 ``choices``。带有 ``nargs`` "
"等于 ``'?'`` 的可选参数不再检查 :ref:`const` 是否匹配 ``choices``。"

#: ../NEWS:7251
msgid ""
":gh:`123884`: Fixed bug in itertools.tee() handling of other tee inputs (a "
"tee in a tee). The output now has the promised *n* independent new "
"iterators.  Formerly, the first iterator was identical (not independent) to "
"the input iterator. This would sometimes give surprising results."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123884`: 修复了 itertools.tee() 处理其他 tee 输入（tee 中的 tee）时的 bug。现在输出具有承诺的 "
"*n* 个独立新迭代器。以前，第一个迭代器与输入迭代器相同（不独立）。这有时会给出令人惊讶的结果。"

#: ../NEWS:7256
msgid ""
":gh:`123017`: Due to unreliable results on some devices, "
":func:`time.strftime` no longer accepts negative years on Android."
msgstr ":gh:`123017`: 由于在某些设备上结果不可靠，:func:`time.strftime` 不再在 Android 上接受负年份。"

#: ../NEWS:7259
msgid ""
":gh:`123014`: :func:`os.pidfd_open` and :func:`signal.pidfd_send_signal` are"
" now unavailable when building against Android API levels older than 31, "
"since the underlying system calls may cause a crash."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123014`: :func:`os.pidfd_open` 和 :func:`signal.pidfd_send_signal` 现在在针对"
" Android API 级别低于 31 构建时不可用，因为底层系统调用可能导致崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:7263
msgid ""
":gh:`124176`: Add support for :func:`dataclasses.dataclass` in "
":func:`unittest.mock.create_autospec`. Now ``create_autospec`` will check "
"for potential dataclasses and use :func:`dataclasses.fields` function to "
"retrieve the spec information."
msgstr ""
":gh:`124176`: 在 :func:`unittest.mock.create_autospec` 中添加对 "
":func:`dataclasses.dataclass` 的支持。现在 ``create_autospec`` 将检查潜在的数据类并使用 "
":func:`dataclasses.fields` 函数检索规范信息。"

#: ../NEWS:7268
msgid ""
":gh:`124345`: :mod:`argparse` supports abbreviated single-dash long options "
"separated by ``=`` from its value."
msgstr ":gh:`124345`: :mod:`argparse` 支持由其值与 ``=`` 分隔的缩写单破折号长选项。"

#: ../NEWS:7271
msgid ""
":gh:`124400`: Fixed a :mod:`pdb` bug where ``until`` has no effect when it "
"appears in a ``commands`` sequence. Also avoid printing the frame "
"information at a breakpoint that has a command list containing a command "
"that resumes execution."
msgstr ""
":gh:`124400`: 修复了 :mod:`pdb` 中的一个bug，其中 ``until`` 在 ``commands`` "
"序列中出现时无效。同时避免在断点处打印框架信息，如果该断点包含一个恢复执行的命令列表。"

#: ../NEWS:7276
msgid ""
":gh:`90562`: Modify dataclasses to support zero-argument super() when "
"``slots=True`` is specified.  This works by modifying all references to "
"``__class__`` to point to the newly created class."
msgstr ""
":gh:`90562`: 修改数据类以支持在指定 ``slots=True`` 时无参数的super()。这是通过修改所有指向新创建类的 "
"``__class__`` 引用实现的。"

#: ../NEWS:7280
msgid ""
":gh:`104860`: Fix disallowing abbreviation of single-dash long options in "
":mod:`argparse` with ``allow_abbrev=False``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`104860`: 修复在 :mod:`argparse` 中不允许单破折号长选项缩写的问题，当``allow_abbrev=False``时。"

#: ../NEWS:7283
msgid ""
":gh:`63143`: Fix parsing mutually exclusive arguments in :mod:`argparse`. "
"Arguments with the value identical to the default value (e.g. booleans, "
"small integers, empty or 1-character strings) are no longer considered \"not"
" present\"."
msgstr ""
":gh:`63143`: 修复在 :mod:`argparse` "
"中解析互斥参数的问题。与默认值相同值的参数（例如布尔值、小整数、空或1字符字符串）不再被视为“不存在”。"

#: ../NEWS:7288
msgid ""
":gh:`72795`: Positional arguments with :ref:`nargs` equal to ``'*'`` or "
":data:`!argparse.REMAINDER` are no longer required. This allows to use "
"positional argument with ``nargs='*'`` and without ``default`` in mutually "
"exclusive group and improves error message about required arguments."
msgstr ""
":gh:`72795`: 具有 :ref:`nargs` 等于 ``'*'`` 或 :data:`!argparse.REMAINDER` "
"的位置参数不再必需。这允许在互斥组中使用 ``nargs='*'`` 且没有 ``default`` 的位置参数，并改进了关于必需参数的错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:7293
msgid ""
":gh:`59317`: Fix parsing positional argument with :ref:`nargs` equal to "
"``'?'`` or ``'*'`` if it is preceded by an option and another positional "
"argument."
msgstr ""
":gh:`59317`: 修复如果前面有一个选项和另一个位置参数时，解析 :ref:`nargs` 等于 ``'?'`` "
"或``'*'``的位置参数的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7297
msgid ""
":gh:`100980`: The :attr:`~ctypes.Structure._fields_` attribute of "
":class:`ctypes.Structure` and :class:`~ctypes.Union` is no longer set if the"
" setattr operation raises an error."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100980`: :class:`ctypes.Structure` 和 :class:`~ctypes.Union` 的 "
":attr:`~ctypes.Structure._fields_` 属性在setattr操作引发错误时不再设置。"

#: ../NEWS:7301
msgid ""
":gh:`53780`: :mod:`argparse` now ignores the first ``\"--\"`` (double dash) "
"between an option and command."
msgstr ":gh:`53780`: :mod:`argparse` 现在忽略选项和命令之间的第一个 ``\"--\"`` (双破折号) 。"

#: ../NEWS:7304
msgid ""
":gh:`124217`: Add RFC 9637 reserved IPv6 block ``3fff::/20`` in "
":mod:`ipaddress` module."
msgstr ":gh:`124217`: 在 :mod:`ipaddress` 模块中添加RFC 9637保留的IPv6块 ``3fff::/20``。"

#: ../NEWS:7307
msgid ""
":gh:`111513`: Improve the error message that may be raised by "
":meth:`datetime.date.fromtimestamp`."
msgstr ":gh:`111513`: 改进由 :meth:`datetime.date.fromtimestamp` 可能引发的错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:7310
msgid ""
":gh:`124248`: Fixed potential crash when using :mod:`struct` to process "
"zero-width 'Pascal string' fields (``0p``)."
msgstr ":gh:`124248`: 修复了使用 :mod:`struct` 处理零宽度'Pascal字符串'字段（``0p``）时可能导致的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:7313
msgid ""
":gh:`81691`: Fix handling of multiple ``\"--\"`` (double dashes) in "
":mod:`argparse`. Only the first one has now been removed, all subsequent "
"ones are now taken literally."
msgstr ""
":gh:`81691`: 修复在 :mod:`argparse` 中处理多个 ``\"--\"`` (双破折号) "
"的问题。现在只移除第一个，所有后续的都按字面意思处理。"

#: ../NEWS:7317
msgid ""
":gh:`87041`: Fix a bug in :mod:`argparse` where lengthy subparser argument "
"help is incorrectly indented."
msgstr ":gh:`87041`: 修复 :mod:`argparse` 中的一个错误，该错误导致冗长的子解析器参数帮助信息缩进不正确。"

#: ../NEWS:7320
msgid ""
":gh:`84559`: The default :mod:`multiprocessing` start method on Linux and "
"other POSIX systems has been changed away from often unsafe ``\"fork\"`` to "
"``\"forkserver\"`` (when the platform supports sending file handles over "
"pipes as most do) or ``\"spawn\"``.  Mac and Windows are unchanged as they "
"already default to ``\"spawn\"``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`84559`: Linux 和其他 POSIX 系统上 :mod:`multiprocessing` 的默认启动方法已从通常不安全的 "
"``\"fork\"`` 更改为 ``\"forkserver\"`` (当平台支持通过管道发送文件句柄时，大多数平台都支持) 或 "
"``\"spawn\"``。Mac 和 Windows 保持不变，因为它们已经默认为 ``\"spawn\"``。"

#: ../NEWS:7326
msgid ""
":gh:`124212`: Fix invalid variable in :mod:`venv` handling of failed symlink"
" on Windows"
msgstr ":gh:`124212`: 修复 Windows 上 :mod:`venv` 处理失败的符号链接时的无效变量。"

#: ../NEWS:7329
msgid ""
":gh:`124171`: Add workaround for broken :c:func:`!fmod()` implementations on"
" Windows, that loose zero sign (e.g. ``fmod(-10, 1)`` returns ``0.0``). "
"Patch by Sergey B Kirpichev."
msgstr ""
":gh:`124171`: 为 Windows 上损坏的 :c:func:`!fmod()` "
"实现添加了变通方案，该实现会丢失零的符号（例如，``fmod(-10, 1)`` 返回 ``0.0``）。由 Sergey B Kirpichev "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7333
msgid ""
":gh:`123978`: Remove broken :func:`time.thread_time` and "
":func:`time.thread_time_ns` on NetBSD."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123978`: 在 NetBSD 上移除损坏的 :func:`time.thread_time` 和 "
":func:`time.thread_time_ns`。"

#: ../NEWS:7336
msgid ""
":gh:`123934`: Fix :class:`unittest.mock.MagicMock` resetting magic methods "
"return values after ``.reset_mock(return_value=True)`` was called."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123934`: 修复 :class:`unittest.mock.MagicMock` 在调用 "
"``.reset_mock(return_value=True)`` 后重置魔术方法返回值的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7339
msgid ":gh:`124016`: Update :mod:`unicodedata` database to Unicode 16.0.0."
msgstr ":gh:`124016`: 将 :mod:`unicodedata` 数据库更新到 Unicode 16.0.0。"

#: ../NEWS:7341
msgid ""
":gh:`123968`: Fix the command-line interface for the :mod:`random` module to"
" select floats between 0 and N, not 1 and N."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123968`: 修复 :mod:`random` 模块的命令行界面，使其选择 0 到 N 之间的浮点数，而不是 1 到 N 之间。"

#: ../NEWS:7344
msgid ""
":gh:`123945`: Fix a bug where :mod:`argparse` doesn't recognize negative "
"numbers with underscores"
msgstr ":gh:`123945`: 修复 :mod:`argparse` 无法识别带下划线的负数的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7347
msgid ""
":gh:`123935`: Fix parent slots detection for dataclasses that inherit from "
"classes with ``__dictoffset__``."
msgstr ":gh:`123935`: 修复数据类继承自具有 ``__dictoffset__`` 的类时的父槽检测问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7350
msgid ""
":gh:`123892`: Add ``\"_wmi\"`` to :data:`sys.stdlib_module_names`. Patch by "
"Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123892`: 将 ``\"_wmi\"`` 添加到 :data:`sys.stdlib_module_names`。由 Victor "
"Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7353
msgid ""
":gh:`84808`: Fix error handling in :py:class:`~socket.socket` method "
":py:func:`~socket.socket.connect_ex` on platforms where :c:data:`errno` can "
"be negative."
msgstr ""
":gh:`84808`: 在 :c:data:`errno` 可能为负的平台上修复 :py:class:`~socket.socket` 方法 "
":py:func:`~socket.socket.connect_ex` 中的错误处理。"

#: ../NEWS:7357
msgid ""
":gh:`123756`: Added a new argument ``mode`` to :class:`pdb.Pdb`. Only allow "
":mod:`pdb` from command line to use ``restart`` command."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123756`: 向 :class:`pdb.Pdb` 添加了一个新参数 ``mode``。只允许命令行中的 :mod:`pdb` 使用 "
"``restart`` 命令。"

#: ../NEWS:7360
msgid ""
":gh:`122765`: Fix unbalanced quote errors occurring when activate.csh in "
":mod:`venv` was sourced with a custom prompt containing unpaired quotes or "
"newlines."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122765`: 修复当 :mod:`venv` 中的 activate.csh "
"被源时，如果自定义提示包含不成对的引号或换行符，会发生的不平衡引号错误。"

#: ../NEWS:7364
msgid ""
":gh:`123657`: Fix crash and memory leak in :func:`decimal.getcontext`. It "
"crashed when using a thread-local context by ``--with-decimal-"
"contextvar=no``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123657`: 修复 :func:`decimal.getcontext` 中的崩溃和内存泄漏。当使用线程本地上下文时，通过 "
"``--with-decimal-contextvar=no`` 会导致崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:7368
msgid ""
":gh:`123339`: Fix :func:`inspect.getsource` for classes in "
":mod:`collections.abc` and :mod:`decimal` (for pure Python implementation) "
"modules. :func:`inspect.getcomments` now raises OSError instead of "
"IndexError if the ``__firstlineno__`` value for a class is out of bound."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123339`: 修复 :func:`inspect.getsource` 对于 :mod:`collections.abc` 和 "
":mod:`decimal` (纯Python实现) 模块中的类。如果类的 ``__firstlineno__`` "
"值超出范围，:func:`inspect.getcomments` 现在会抛出 OSError 而不是 IndexError。"

#: ../NEWS:7373
msgid ""
":gh:`123374`: Remove check for redefined memo entry in "
":func:`pickletools.dis`."
msgstr ":gh:`123374`: 移除 :func:`pickletools.dis` 中对重新定义的备忘录条目的检查。"

#: ../NEWS:7376
msgid ""
":gh:`123504`: Fixed reference leak in the finalization of :mod:`tkinter`."
msgstr ":gh:`123504`: 修复 :mod:`tkinter` 在最终化时的引用泄漏。"

#: ../NEWS:7378
msgid ""
":gh:`123430`: Pages generated by the :mod:`http.server` module allow the "
"browser to apply its default dark mode."
msgstr ":gh:`123430`: 由 :mod:`http.server` 模块生成的页面允许浏览器应用其默认的暗模式。"

#: ../NEWS:7381
msgid ""
":gh:`123446`: Fix empty function name in :exc:`TypeError` when "
":func:`csv.reader`, :func:`csv.writer`, or :func:`csv.register_dialect` are "
"used without the required args."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123446`: 当 :func:`csv.reader`, :func:`csv.writer`, 或 "
":func:`csv.register_dialect` 在没有必需参数的情况下使用时，修复 :exc:`TypeError` 中的空函数名问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7385
msgid ""
":gh:`123448`: Fixed memory leak of :class:`typing.NoDefault` by moving it to"
" the static types array."
msgstr ":gh:`123448`: 通过将 :class:`typing.NoDefault` 移动到静态类型数组，修复了其内存泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7388
msgid ""
":gh:`123409`: Fix :attr:`ipaddress.IPv6Address.reverse_pointer` output "
"according to :rfc:`RFC 3596, §2.5 <3596#section-2.5>`.  Patch by Bénédikt "
"Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123409`: 根据 :rfc:`RFC 3596, §2.5 <3596#section-2.5>` 修复 "
":attr:`ipaddress.IPv6Address.reverse_pointer` 的输出。由 Bénédikt Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7392
msgid ""
":gh:`123089`: Make :class:`weakref.WeakSet` safe against concurrent "
"mutations while it is being iterated. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123089`: 使 :class:`weakref.WeakSet` 在迭代时安全抵抗并发修改。补丁由 Kumar Aditya 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:7395
msgid ""
":gh:`123363`: Show string value of :opcode:`CONTAINS_OP` oparg in :mod:`dis`"
" output. Patch by Alexandr153."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123363`: 在 :mod:`dis` 输出中显示 :opcode:`CONTAINS_OP` oparg 的字符串值。由 "
"Alexandr153 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7398
msgid ""
":gh:`123341`: Add :meth:`~object.__class_getitem__` to "
":class:`!tkinter.Event` for type subscript support at runtime. Patch by "
"Adonis Rakateli."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123341`: 向 :class:`!tkinter.Event` 添加 :meth:`~object.__class_getitem__`"
" 以支持运行时的类型下标。由 Adonis Rakateli 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7402
msgid ""
":gh:`123340`: Show string value of :opcode:`IS_OP` oparg in :mod:`dis` "
"output."
msgstr ":gh:`123340`: 在 :mod:`dis` 输出中显示 :opcode:`IS_OP` oparg 的字符串值。"

#: ../NEWS:7405
msgid ""
":gh:`119518`: Speed up normalization of :class:`pathlib.PurePath` and "
":class:`~pathlib.Path` objects by not interning string parts."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119518`: 通过不内部化字符串部分，加速 :class:`pathlib.PurePath` 和 "
":class:`~pathlib.Path` 对象的规范化。"

#: ../NEWS:7408
msgid ""
":gh:`123270`: Applied a more surgical fix for malformed payloads in "
":class:`zipfile.Path` causing infinite loops (:gh:`122905`) without breaking"
" contents using legitimate characters."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123270`: 对 :class:`zipfile.Path` "
"中导致无限循环的畸形负载应用了更为精确的修复（:gh:`122905`），而不会破坏使用合法字符的内容。"

#: ../NEWS:7412
msgid ""
":gh:`73991`: Add :meth:`pathlib.Path.copy_into` and "
":meth:`~pathlib.Path.move_into`, which copy and move files and directories "
"into *existing* directories."
msgstr ""
":gh:`73991`: 添加 :meth:`pathlib.Path.copy_into` 和 "
":meth:`~pathlib.Path.move_into`，它们将文件和目录复制和移动到 *现有* 目录中。"

#: ../NEWS:7416
msgid ""
":gh:`123228`: Fix return type for "
":func:`!_pyrepl.readline._ReadlineWrapper.get_line_buffer` to be "
":func:`str`.  Patch by Sergey B Kirpichev."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123228`: 将 :func:`!_pyrepl.readline._ReadlineWrapper.get_line_buffer` "
"的返回类型修复为 :func:`str`。由 Sergey B Kirpichev 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7420
msgid ""
":gh:`123240`: Raise audit events for the :func:`input` in the new REPL."
msgstr ":gh:`123240`: 为新的 REPL 中的 :func:`input` 引发审计事件。"

#: ../NEWS:7422
msgid ""
":gh:`76960`: Fix :func:`urllib.parse.urljoin` and "
":func:`urllib.parse.urldefrag` for URIs containing empty components. For "
"example, :func:`!urljoin` with relative reference \"?\" now sets empty query"
" and removes fragment. Preserve empty components (authority, params, query, "
"fragment) in :func:`!urljoin`. Preserve empty components (authority, params,"
" query) in :func:`!urldefrag`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`76960`: 修复 :func:`urllib.parse.urljoin` 和 "
":func:`urllib.parse.urldefrag` 对于包含空组件的 URI。例如，带有相对引用 \"?\" 的 "
":func:`!urljoin` 现在设置空查询并移除片段。在 :func:`!urljoin` 中保留空组件（授权、参数、查询、片段）。在 "
":func:`!urldefrag` 中保留空组件（授权、参数、查询）。"

#: ../NEWS:7429
msgid ""
":gh:`116810`: Resolve a memory leak introduced in CPython 3.10's :mod:`ssl` "
"when the :attr:`ssl.SSLSocket.session` property was accessed.  Speeds up "
"read and write access to said property by no longer unnecessarily cloning "
"session objects via serialization."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116810`: 解决了 CPython 3.10 的 :mod:`ssl` 中访问 "
":attr:`ssl.SSLSocket.session` 属性时引入的内存泄漏。不再通过序列化不必要地克隆会话对象，从而加快了对所述属性的读写访问。"

#: ../NEWS:7434
msgid ":gh:`123243`: Fix memory leak in :mod:`!_decimal`."
msgstr ":gh:`123243`: 修复 :mod:`!_decimal` 中的内存泄漏。"

#: ../NEWS:7436
msgid ""
":gh:`122546`: Consistently use same file name for different exceptions in "
"the new repl. Patch by Sergey B Kirpichev."
msgstr ":gh:`122546`: 在新 repl 中一致地为不同的异常使用相同的文件名。补丁由 Sergey B Kirpichev 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:7439
msgid ""
":gh:`123213`: :meth:`xml.etree.ElementTree.Element.extend` and "
":class:`~xml.etree.ElementTree.Element` assignment no longer hide the "
"internal exception if an erroneous generator is passed. Patch by Bar Harel."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123213`: :meth:`xml.etree.ElementTree.Element.extend` 和 "
":class:`~xml.etree.ElementTree.Element` 赋值不再隐藏如果传递了错误的生成器时的内部异常。由 Bar Harel "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7444
msgid ""
":gh:`85110`: Preserve relative path in URL without netloc in "
":func:`urllib.parse.urlunsplit` and :func:`urllib.parse.urlunparse`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`85110`: 在 :func:`urllib.parse.urlunsplit` 和 "
":func:`urllib.parse.urlunparse` 中保留没有 netloc 的 URL 的相对路径。"

#: ../NEWS:7447
msgid ""
":gh:`123165`: Add support for rendering :class:`~dis.Positions` in "
":mod:`dis`."
msgstr ":gh:`123165`: 添加对在 :mod:`dis` 中渲染 :class:`~dis.Positions` 的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:7450
msgid ""
":gh:`122909`: In urllib.request when URLError is raised opening an ftp URL, "
"the exception argument is now consistently a string. Earlier versions passed"
" either a string or an ftplib exception instance as the argument to "
"URLError."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122909`: 在 urllib.request 中，当打开 ftp URL 引发 URLError "
"时，异常参数现在始终是一个字符串。早期版本将字符串或 ftplib 异常实例作为参数传递给 URLError。"

#: ../NEWS:7455
msgid ""
":gh:`123084`: Deprecate :class:`!shutil.ExecError`, which hasn't been raised"
" by any :mod:`shutil` function since Python 3.4. It's now an alias for "
":exc:`RuntimeError`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123084`: 弃用 :class:`!shutil.ExecError`，自 Python 3.4 以来没有任何 "
":mod:`shutil` 函数抛出过它。现在它是 :exc:`RuntimeError` 的别名。"

#: ../NEWS:7459
msgid ""
":gh:`123085`: In a bare call to :func:`importlib.resources.files`, ensure "
"the caller's frame is properly detected when ``importlib.resources`` is "
"itself available as a compiled module only (no source)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123085`: 在裸调用 :func:`importlib.resources.files` 时，确保当 "
"``importlib.resources`` 本身仅作为编译模块可用时（无源代码），能正确检测到调用者的帧。"

#: ../NEWS:7463
msgid ""
":gh:`123067`: Fix quadratic complexity in parsing ``\"``-quoted cookie "
"values with backslashes by :mod:`http.cookies`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123067`: 通过 :mod:`http.cookies` 修复解析带有反斜杠的 ``\"`` 引号包围的 cookie "
"值时的二次复杂度问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7466
msgid ""
":gh:`123049`: Add support for :const:`~configparser.UNNAMED_SECTION` in "
":meth:`configparser.ConfigParser.add_section`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123049`: 在 :meth:`configparser.ConfigParser.add_section` 中添加对 "
":const:`~configparser.UNNAMED_SECTION` 的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:7469
msgid ""
":gh:`121735`: When working with zip archives, importlib.resources now "
"properly honors module-adjacent references (e.g. ``files(pkg.mod)`` and not "
"just ``files(pkg)``)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121735`: 在处理 zip 存档时，importlib.resources 现在能正确遵守模块相邻引用（例如 "
"``files(pkg.mod)`` 而不仅仅是 ``files(pkg)``）。"

#: ../NEWS:7473
msgid ""
":gh:`122981`: Fix :func:`inspect.getsource` for generated classes with "
"Python base classes (e.g. enums)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122981`: 修复 :func:`inspect.getsource` 对于具有 Python 基类（如枚举）的生成类的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:7476
msgid ""
":gh:`122903`: ``zipfile.Path.glob`` now correctly matches directories "
"instead of silently omitting them."
msgstr ":gh:`122903`: ``zipfile.Path.glob`` 现在能正确匹配目录，而不是默默地忽略它们。"

#: ../NEWS:7479
msgid ""
":gh:`122905`: :class:`zipfile.Path` objects now sanitize names from the "
"zipfile."
msgstr ":gh:`122905`: :class:`zipfile.Path` 对象现在会对来自 zipfile 的名称进行清理。"

#: ../NEWS:7482
msgid ""
":gh:`122873`: Enable :mod:`json` module to work as a script using the "
":option:`-m` switch: ``python -m json``. See the :ref:`JSON command-line "
"interface <json-commandline>` documentation. Patch by Trey Hunner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122873`: 使 :mod:`json` 模块能够通过 :option:`-m` 开关作为脚本工作：``python -m "
"json``。参见 :ref:`JSON 命令行界面 <json-commandline>` 文档。由 Trey Hunner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7486
msgid ""
":gh:`122858`: Deprecate :func:`!asyncio.iscoroutinefunction` in favor of "
":func:`inspect.iscoroutinefunction`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122858`: 弃用 :func:`!asyncio.iscoroutinefunction`，推荐使用 "
":func:`inspect.iscoroutinefunction`。"

#: ../NEWS:7489
msgid ""
":gh:`116263`: :class:`logging.handlers.RotatingFileHandler` no longer rolls "
"over empty log files."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116263`: :class:`logging.handlers.RotatingFileHandler` 不再滚动空日志文件。"

#: ../NEWS:7492
msgid ""
":gh:`105376`: Restore the deprecated :mod:`logging` ``warn()`` method. It "
"was removed in Python 3.13 alpha 1. Keep the deprecated ``warn()`` method in"
" Python 3.13. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105376`: 恢复已弃用的 :mod:`logging` ``warn()`` 方法。它在 Python 3.13 alpha 1 "
"中被移除。在 Python 3.13 中保留已弃用的 ``warn()`` 方法。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7496
msgid ""
":gh:`122311`: Improve errors in the :mod:`pickle` module. "
":exc:`~pickle.PicklingError` is now raised more often instead of "
":exc:`UnicodeEncodeError`, :exc:`ValueError` and :exc:`AttributeError`, and "
"the original exception is chained to it. Improve and unify error messages in"
" Python and C implementations."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122311`: 改进 :mod:`pickle` 模块中的错误。现在更频繁地引发 :exc:`~pickle.PicklingError` "
"而不是 :exc:`UnicodeEncodeError`、:exc:`ValueError` 和 "
":exc:`AttributeError`，并且原始异常被链接到它。改进并统一 Python 和 C 实现中的错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:7502
msgid ""
":gh:`122744`: Bump the version of pip bundled in ensurepip to version 24.2."
msgstr ":gh:`122744`: 将 ensurepip 中捆绑的 pip 版本提升至 24.2。"

#: ../NEWS:7504
msgid ""
":gh:`118761`: Improve import time of :mod:`pprint` by around seven times. "
"Patch by Hugo van Kemenade."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118761`: 通过大约七倍的速度提升 :mod:`pprint` 的导入时间。补丁由 Hugo van Kemenade 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:7507
msgid ""
":gh:`118974`: Add ``decorator`` parameter to "
":func:`dataclasses.make_dataclass` to customize the functional creation of "
"dataclasses."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118974`: 向 :func:`dataclasses.make_dataclass` 添加 ``decorator`` "
"参数以自定义数据类的函数式创建。"

#: ../NEWS:7511
msgid ""
":gh:`118814`: Fix the :class:`typing.TypeVar` constructor when name is "
"passed by keyword."
msgstr ":gh:`118814`: 修复 :class:`typing.TypeVar` 构造函数在名称通过关键字传递时的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7514
msgid ""
":gh:`122637`: Adjust ``cmath.tanh(nanj)`` and ``cmath.tanh(infj)`` for "
"recent C standards."
msgstr ":gh:`122637`: 根据最近的C标准调整 ``cmath.tanh(nanj)`` 和 ``cmath.tanh(infj)``。"

#: ../NEWS:7517
msgid ""
":gh:`122478`: Remove internal frames from tracebacks shown in "
":class:`code.InteractiveInterpreter` with non-default "
":func:`sys.excepthook`. Save correct tracebacks in "
":data:`sys.last_traceback` and update ``__traceback__`` attribute of "
":data:`sys.last_value` and :data:`sys.last_exc`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122478`: 从 :class:`code.InteractiveInterpreter` 显示的非默认 "
":func:`sys.excepthook` 的追溯中移除内部帧。在 :data:`sys.last_traceback` 中保存正确的追溯，并更新 "
":data:`sys.last_value` 和 :data:`sys.last_exc` 的 ``__traceback__`` 属性。"

#: ../NEWS:7523
msgid ""
":gh:`116622`: On Android, the ``FICLONE`` and ``FICLONERANGE`` constants are"
" no longer exposed by :mod:`fcntl`, as these ioctls are blocked by SELinux."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116622`: 在Android上，``FICLONE`` 和 ``FICLONERANGE`` 常量不再由 :mod:`fcntl` "
"公开，因为这些ioctls被SELinux阻止。"

#: ../NEWS:7526
msgid ""
":gh:`82378`: Make sure that the new :term:`REPL` interprets "
":data:`sys.tracebacklimit` in the same way that the classic REPL did."
msgstr ""
":gh:`82378`: 确保新的 :term:`REPL` 以与经典REPL相同的方式解释 :data:`sys.tracebacklimit`。"

#: ../NEWS:7529
msgid ""
":gh:`122334`: Fix crash when importing :mod:`ssl` after the main interpreter"
" restarts."
msgstr ":gh:`122334`: 修复在主解释器重启后导入 :mod:`ssl` 时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7532
msgid ""
":gh:`122459`: Optimize :mod:`pickling <pickle>` by name objects without the "
"``__module__`` attribute."
msgstr ":gh:`122459`: 通过没有 ``__module__`` 属性的名称对象优化 :mod:`pickling <pickle>`。"

#: ../NEWS:7535
msgid ""
":gh:`87320`: In :class:`code.InteractiveInterpreter`, handle exceptions "
"caused by calling a non-default :func:`sys.excepthook`. Before, the "
"exception bubbled up to the caller, ending the :term:`REPL`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`87320`: 在 :class:`code.InteractiveInterpreter` 中，处理调用非默认 "
":func:`sys.excepthook` 引起的异常。之前，异常会冒泡到调用者，结束 :term:`REPL`。"

#: ../NEWS:7539
msgid ""
":gh:`122272`: On some platforms such as Linux, year with century was not "
"0-padded when formatted by :meth:`~.datetime.strftime` with C99-specific "
"specifiers ``'%C'`` or ``'%F'``. The 0-padding behavior is now guaranteed "
"when the format specifiers ``'%C'`` and ``'%F'`` are supported by the C "
"library. Patch by Ben Hsing"
msgstr ""
":gh:`122272`: 在一些平台如Linux上，使用C99特定说明符 ``'%C'`` 或 ``'%F'`` 通过 "
":meth:`~.datetime.strftime` 格式化时，带世纪的年份没有用0填充。现在，当C库支持格式说明符 ``'%C'`` 和 "
"``'%F'`` 时，保证0填充行为。由Ben Hsing提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:7545
msgid ""
":gh:`122400`: Handle :exc:`ValueError`\\s raised by :func:`os.stat` in "
":class:`filecmp.dircmp` and :func:`filecmp.cmpfiles`. Patch by Bénédikt "
"Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122400`: 在 :class:`filecmp.dircmp` 和 :func:`filecmp.cmpfiles` 中处理由 "
":func:`os.stat` 引发的 :exc:`ValueError`\\。由Bénédikt Tran提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7549
msgid ":gh:`122311`: Fix some error messages in :mod:`pickle`."
msgstr ":gh:`122311`: 修复 :mod:`pickle` 中的一些错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:7551
msgid ""
":gh:`121650`: :mod:`email` headers with embedded newlines are now quoted on "
"output. The :mod:`~email.generator` will now refuse to serialize (write) "
"headers that are unsafely folded or delimited; see "
":attr:`~email.policy.Policy.verify_generated_headers`. (Contributed by Bas "
"Bloemsaat and Petr Viktorin in :gh:`121650`.)"
msgstr ""
":gh:`121650`: 现在，带有嵌入换行符的 :mod:`email` 标题在输出时会被引用。:mod:`~email.generator` "
"现在会拒绝序列化（写入）不安全折叠或分隔的标题；参见 "
":attr:`~email.policy.Policy.verify_generated_headers`。（由Bas Bloemsaat和Petr "
"Viktorin在 :gh:`121650` 中贡献。）"

#: ../NEWS:7557
msgid ""
":gh:`122332`: Fixed segfault with :meth:`asyncio.Task.get_coro` when using "
"an eager task factory."
msgstr ":gh:`122332`: 修复了在使用急切任务工厂时 :meth:`asyncio.Task.get_coro` 的段错误。"

#: ../NEWS:7560
