msgstr ":gh:`119180`: 修复了在 ``annotationlib.get_annotations`` 中处理具有自定义元类的类的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7577
msgid ""
":gh:`122170`: Handle :exc:`ValueError`\\s raised by :func:`os.stat` in "
":mod:`linecache`. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122170`: 在 :mod:`linecache` 中处理由 :func:`os.stat` 抛出的 "
":exc:`ValueError`。由Bénédikt Tran提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7580
msgid ""
":gh:`122163`: Add notes for JSON serialization errors that allow to identify"
" the source of the error."
msgstr ":gh:`122163`: 为JSON序列化错误添加了注释，允许识别错误的来源。"

#: ../NEWS:7583
msgid ""
":gh:`122129`: Improve support of method descriptors and wrappers in the help"
" title."
msgstr ":gh:`122129`: 改进了帮助标题中方法描述符和包装器的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:7586
msgid ""
":gh:`122145`: Fix an issue when reporting tracebacks corresponding to Python"
" code emitting an empty AST body. Patch by Nikita Sobolev and Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122145`: 修复了当报告对应于发出空AST体的Python代码的追溯时的一个问题。由Nikita Sobolev和Bénédikt "
"Tran提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7590
msgid ""
":gh:`121723`: Make :func:`logging.config.dictConfig` accept any object "
"implementing the Queue public API. See the :ref:`queue configuration "
"<configure-queue>` section for details. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121723`: 使 :func:`logging.config.dictConfig` 接受任何实现Queue公共API的对象。详情参见 "
":ref:`queue configuration <configure-queue>` 部分。由Bénédikt Tran提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7594
msgid ""
":gh:`82951`: Serializing objects with complex ``__qualname__`` (such as "
"unbound methods and nested classes) by name no longer involves serializing "
"parent objects by value in pickle protocols < 4."
msgstr ""
":gh:`82951`: 在pickle协议<4中，通过名称序列化具有复杂 ``__qualname__`` "
"的对象（如未绑定方法和嵌套类）不再涉及通过值序列化父对象。"

#: ../NEWS:7598
msgid ""
":gh:`120754`: ``Pathlib.read_bytes`` no longer opens the file in Python's "
"buffered I/O mode. This reduces overheads as the code reads a file in whole "
"leading to a modest speedup."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120754`: ``Pathlib.read_bytes`` 不再以 Python 的缓冲 I/O "
"模式打开文件。这减少了开销，因为代码一次性读取整个文件，从而实现了适度的加速。"

#: ../NEWS:7602
msgid ""
":gh:`113785`: :mod:`csv` now correctly parses numeric fields (when used with"
" :const:`csv.QUOTE_NONNUMERIC` or :const:`csv.QUOTE_STRINGS`) which start "
"with an escape character."
msgstr ""
":gh:`113785`: :mod:`csv` 现在正确解析以转义字符开头的数字字段（与 :const:`csv.QUOTE_NONNUMERIC` "
"或 :const:`csv.QUOTE_STRINGS` 一起使用时）。"

#: ../NEWS:7606
msgid ""
":gh:`122088`: :deco:`warnings.deprecated` now copies the coroutine status of"
" functions and methods so that :func:`inspect.iscoroutinefunction` returns "
"the correct result."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122088`: :deco:`warnings.deprecated` 现在会拷贝函数和方法的协程状态以使 "
":func:`inspect.iscoroutinefunction` 返回正确的结果。"

#: ../NEWS:7610
msgid ""
":gh:`122081`: Fix a crash in the :func:`!decimal.IEEEContext` optional "
"function available via the ``EXTRA_FUNCTIONALITY`` configuration flag."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122081`: 修复了通过 ``EXTRA_FUNCTIONALITY`` 配置标志可用的 "
":func:`!decimal.IEEEContext` 可选函数中的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7613
msgid ""
":gh:`73991`: Add :meth:`pathlib.Path.move`, which moves a file or directory "
