msgstr ":gh:`73991`: 添加 :meth:`pathlib.Path.move`，用于移动文件或目录树。"

#: ../NEWS:7616
msgid ""
":gh:`121268`: Remove workarounds for non-IEEE 754 systems in :mod:`cmath`."
msgstr ":gh:`121268`: 在 :mod:`cmath` 中移除了对非 IEEE 754 系统的变通方法。"

#: ../NEWS:7618
msgid ""
":gh:`119698`: Due to the lack of interest for "
":meth:`symtable.Class.get_methods`, the method is marked as deprecated and "
"will be removed in Python 3.16. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119698`: 由于对 :meth:`symtable.Class.get_methods` 缺乏兴趣，该方法被标记为已弃用，并将在 "
"Python 3.16 中移除。由 Bénédikt Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7622
msgid ""
":gh:`121889`: Adjusts ``cmath.acosh(complex('0+nanj'))`` for recent C "
"standards."
msgstr ":gh:`121889`: 根据最近的 C 标准调整了 ``cmath.acosh(complex('0+nanj'))``。"

#: ../NEWS:7625
msgid ""
":gh:`121804`: Correctly show error locations, when :exc:`SyntaxError` raised"
" in new repl. Patch by Sergey B Kirpichev."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121804`: 在新 repl 中引发 :exc:`SyntaxError` 时，正确显示错误位置。由 Sergey B Kirpichev"
" 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7628
msgid ""
":gh:`121797`: Add alternative :class:`~fractions.Fraction` constructor "
":meth:`Fraction.from_number() <fractions.Fraction.from_number>`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121797`: 添加了替代的 :class:`~fractions.Fraction` 构造函数 "
":meth:`Fraction.from_number() <fractions.Fraction.from_number>`。"

#: ../NEWS:7631
msgid ""
":gh:`121798`: Add alternative :class:`~decimal.Decimal` constructor "
":meth:`Decimal.from_number() <decimal.Decimal.from_number>`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121798`: 添加了替代的 :class:`~decimal.Decimal` 构造函数 "
":meth:`Decimal.from_number() <decimal.Decimal.from_number>`。"

#: ../NEWS:7634
msgid ""
":gh:`120930`: Fixed a bug introduced by :gh:`92081` that added an incorrect "
"extra blank to encoded words occurring in wrapped headers."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120930`: 修复了由 :gh:`92081` 引入的一个错误，该错误在包裹的标头中出现的编码单词上添加了一个不正确额外的空白。"

#: ../NEWS:7637
msgid ""
":gh:`57141`: The *shallow* argument to :class:`filecmp.dircmp` (new in "
"Python 3.13) is now keyword-only."
msgstr ""
":gh:`57141`: :class:`filecmp.dircmp` 的 *shallow* 参数（Python 3.13 "
"中新增）现在仅为关键字参数。"

#: ../NEWS:7640
msgid ""
":gh:`121245`: Simplify handling of the history file in "
"``site.register_readline()`` helper. The ``CAN_USE_PYREPL`` variable now "
"will be initialized, when imported.  Patch by Sergey B Kirpichev."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121245`: 简化了 ``site.register_readline()`` 辅助函数中历史文件的处理。现在 "
"``CAN_USE_PYREPL`` 变量将在导入时初始化。由 Sergey B Kirpichev 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7644
msgid ""
":gh:`121249`: Support the :c:expr:`float complex` and :c:expr:`double "
"complex` C types in the :mod:`struct` module if the compiler has C11 complex"
" arithmetic.  Patch by Sergey B Kirpichev."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121249`: 如果编译器支持 C11 复数算术，则在 :mod:`struct` 模块中支持 :c:expr:`float "
"complex` 和 :c:expr:`double complex` C 类型。由 Sergey B Kirpichev 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7648
msgid ""
":gh:`121486`: :mod:`math` functions :func:`~math.isqrt`, :func:`~math.log`, "
":func:`~math.log2` and :func:`~math.log10` now support integers larger than "
"``2**2**32`` on 32-bit platforms."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121486`: :mod:`math` 函数 "
":func:`~math.isqrt`、:func:`~math.log`、:func:`~math.log2` 和 "
":func:`~math.log10` 现在在 32 位平台上支持大于 ``2**2**32`` 的整数。"

#: ../NEWS:7652
msgid ""
":gh:`121474`: Fix missing sanity check for ``parties`` arg in "
":class:`threading.Barrier` constructor. Patch by Clinton Christian (pygeek)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121474`: 修复 :class:`threading.Barrier` 构造函数中 ``parties`` 参数缺少的健全性检查。由 "
"Clinton Christian (pygeek) 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7656
msgid ""
":gh:`121450`: Hard-coded breakpoints (:func:`breakpoint` and "
":func:`pdb.set_trace`) now reuse the most recent ``Pdb`` instance that calls"
" ``Pdb.set_trace()``, instead of creating a new one each time. As a result, "
"all the instance specific data like ``display`` and ``commands`` are "
"preserved across Hard-coded breakpoints."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121450`: 硬编码断点（:func:`breakpoint` 和 :func:`pdb.set_trace`）现在重用调用 "
"``Pdb.set_trace()`` 的最新 ``Pdb`` 实例，而不是每次创建新实例。因此，所有实例特定的数据如 ``display`` 和 "
"``commands`` 在硬编码断点之间得以保留。"

#: ../NEWS:7662
msgid ""
":gh:`119169`: Slightly speed up :func:`os.walk` by simplifying exception "
"handling."
msgstr ":gh:`119169`: 通过简化异常处理稍微加速 :func:`os.walk`。"

#: ../NEWS:7665
msgid ""
":gh:`121423`: Improve import time of :mod:`socket` by lazy importing modules"
" and writing :data:`!socket.errorTab` as a constant."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121423`: 通过延迟加载模块和将 :data:`!socket.errorTab` 写为常量来改善 :mod:`socket` "
"的导入时间。"

#: ../NEWS:7668
msgid ""
":gh:`59110`: :mod:`zipimport` supports now namespace packages when no "
"directory entry exists."
msgstr ":gh:`59110`: :mod:`zipimport` 现在在没有目录条目时支持命名空间包。"

#: ../NEWS:7671
msgid ""
":gh:`119004`: Fix a crash in :ref:`OrderedDict.__eq__ "
"<collections_OrderedDict__eq__>` when operands are mutated during the check."
" Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119004`: 修复 :ref:`OrderedDict.__eq__ <collections_OrderedDict__eq__>` "
"在检查操作数被修改时的崩溃。由 Bénédikt Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7675
msgid ""
":gh:`121313`: Limit the reading size in the "
":class:`multiprocessing.connection.Connection` class to 64 KiB to prevent "
"memory overallocation and unnecessary memory management system calls."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121313`: 在 :class:`multiprocessing.connection.Connection` 类中将读取大小限制为 64"
" KiB，以防止内存过度分配和不必要的内存管理系统调用。"

#: ../NEWS:7679
msgid ""
":gh:`121332`: Fix constructor of :mod:`ast` nodes with custom "
"``_attributes``. Previously, passing custom attributes would raise a "
":py:exc:`DeprecationWarning`. Passing arguments to the constructor that are "
"not in ``_fields`` or ``_attributes`` remains deprecated. Patch by Jelle "
"Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121332`: 修复带有自定义 ``_attributes`` 的 :mod:`ast` 节点的构造函数。以前，传递自定义属性会引发 "
":py:exc:`DeprecationWarning`。向构造函数传递不在 ``_fields`` 或 ``_attributes`` "
"中的参数仍然是不推荐的。由 Jelle Zijlstra 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7685
msgid ""
":gh:`121245`: Fix a bug in the handling of the command history of the new "
":term:`REPL` that caused the history file to be wiped at REPL exit."
msgstr ":gh:`121245`: 修复新 :term:`REPL` 命令历史处理中的一个错误，该错误导致历史文件在 REPL 退出时被清空。"

#: ../NEWS:7688
msgid ""
":gh:`121210`: Handle AST nodes with missing runtime fields or attributes in "
":func:`ast.compare`. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121210`: 在 :func:`ast.compare` 中处理运行时字段或属性缺失的 AST 节点。由 Bénédikt Tran "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7691
msgid ""
":gh:`121163`: Add support for ``all`` as an valid ``action`` for "
":func:`warnings.simplefilter` and :func:`warnings.filterwarnings`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121163`: 为 :func:`warnings.simplefilter` 和 "
":func:`warnings.filterwarnings` 添加对 ``all`` 作为有效 ``action`` 的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:7694
msgid ""
":gh:`121151`: Fix wrapping of long usage text of arguments inside a mutually"
" exclusive group in :mod:`argparse`."
msgstr ":gh:`121151`: 修复 :mod:`argparse` 中互斥组内参数长使用文本的换行问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7697
msgid ""
":gh:`121141`: Add support for :func:`copy.replace` to AST nodes. Patch by "
"Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121141`: 为 AST 节点添加对 :func:`copy.replace` 的支持。由 Bénédikt Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7700
msgid ""
":gh:`87744`: Fix waitpid race while calling "
":meth:`~asyncio.subprocess.Process.send_signal` in asyncio. Patch by Kumar "
"Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`87744`: 修复在 asyncio 中调用 :meth:`~asyncio.subprocess.Process.send_signal`"
" 时的 waitpid 竞争问题。由 Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7704
msgid ""
":gh:`121027`: Add a future warning in :meth:`!functools.partial.__get__`. In"
" future Python versions :class:`functools.partial` will be a method "
"descriptor."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121027`: 在 :meth:`!functools.partial.__get__` 中添加未来警告。未来的 Python 版本中 "
":class:`functools.partial` 将成为方法描述符。"

#: ../NEWS:7708
msgid ""
":gh:`121027`: Make the :class:`functools.partial` object a method "
"descriptor."
msgstr ":gh:`121027`: 使 :class:`functools.partial` 对象成为方法描述符。"

#: ../NEWS:7710
msgid ""
":gh:`117784`: CPython now detects whether its linked TLS library supports "
"TLSv1.3 post-handshake authentication and disables that feature if support "
"is lacking."
msgstr ":gh:`117784`: CPython 现在检测其链接的 TLS 库是否支持 TLSv1.3 握手后认证，并在不支持时禁用该功能。"

#: ../NEWS:7714
msgid ""
":gh:`121025`: Improve the :meth:`~object.__repr__` of "
":class:`functools.partialmethod`. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121025`: 改进 :class:`functools.partialmethod` 的 "
":meth:`~object.__repr__`。由 Bénédikt Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7717
msgid ""
":gh:`121018`: Fixed issues where :meth:`!argparse.ArgumentParser.parse_args`"
" did not honor ``exit_on_error=False``. Based on patch by Ben Hsing."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121018`: 修复 :meth:`!argparse.ArgumentParser.parse_args` 未遵守 "
"``exit_on_error=False`` 的问题。基于 Ben Hsing 的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7720
