msgstr ""
":gh:`61103`: 在 :mod:`ctypes` 中支持 :c:expr:`float complex`、:c:expr:`double "
"complex` 和 :c:expr:`long double complex` C 类型为 "
":class:`~ctypes.c_float_complex`、:class:`~ctypes.c_double_complex` 和 "
":class:`~ctypes.c_longdouble_complex`，如果编译器支持 C11 复数运算。由 Sergey B Kirpichev "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7733
msgid ":gh:`120888`: Upgrade pip wheel bundled with ensurepip (pip 24.1.1)"
msgstr ":gh:`120888`: 升级与 ensurepip 捆绑的 pip wheel（pip 24.1.1）"

#: ../NEWS:7735
