msgstr ""
":gh:`101830`: 在 Windows 上访问 :mod:`tkinter` 对象的字符串表示不再将底层的 Tcl 对象转换为字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:7738
msgid ""
":gh:`120678`: Fix regression in the new REPL that meant that globals from "
