"的全局命名空间中。由 Alex Waygood 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7742
msgid ""
":gh:`120811`: Fix possible memory leak in :meth:`contextvars.Context.run`."
msgstr ":gh:`120811`: 修复 :meth:`contextvars.Context.run` 中可能的内存泄漏。"

#: ../NEWS:7744
msgid ""
":gh:`120782`: Fix wrong references of the :mod:`datetime` types after "
"reloading the module."
msgstr ":gh:`120782`: 修复重新加载模块后 :mod:`datetime` 类型的错误引用。"

#: ../NEWS:7747
msgid ""
":gh:`120713`: :meth:`datetime.datetime.strftime` now 0-pads years with less "
"than four digits for the format specifiers ``%Y`` and ``%G`` on Linux. Patch"
" by Ben Hsing"
msgstr ""
":gh:`120713`: :meth:`datetime.datetime.strftime` 现在在 Linux 上对于格式说明符 ``%Y`` 和"
