#: ../NEWS:7751
msgid ""
":gh:`120769`: Make empty line in :mod:`pdb` repeats the last command even "
"when the command is from ``cmdqueue``."
msgstr ":gh:`120769`: 使 :mod:`pdb` 中的空行即使命令来自 ``cmdqueue`` 也重复最后一个命令。"

#: ../NEWS:7754
msgid ""
":gh:`120780`: Show string value of LOAD_SPECIAL oparg in :mod:`dis` output."
msgstr ":gh:`120780`: 在 :mod:`dis` 输出中显示 LOAD_SPECIAL oparg 的字符串值。"

#: ../NEWS:7756
msgid ""
":gh:`41431`: Add :meth:`datetime.time.strptime` and "
":meth:`datetime.date.strptime`. Contributed by Wannes Boeykens."
msgstr ""
":gh:`41431`: 添加 :meth:`datetime.time.strptime` 和 "
":meth:`datetime.date.strptime`。由 Wannes Boeykens 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:7759
msgid ""
":gh:`120743`: :term:`Soft deprecate <soft deprecated>` :func:`os.popen` and "
":func:`os.spawn* <os.spawnl>` functions. They should no longer be used to "
"write new code. The :mod:`subprocess` module is recommended instead. Patch "
"by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120743`: :term:`软弃用 <soft deprecated>` :func:`os.popen` 和 "
":func:`os.spawn* <os.spawnl>` 函数。它们不应再用于编写新代码。推荐使用 :mod:`subprocess` 模块。由 "
"Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7764
msgid ""
":gh:`120732`: Fix ``name`` passing to :class:`unittest.mock.Mock` object "
"when using :func:`unittest.mock.create_autospec`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120732`: 在使用 :func:`unittest.mock.create_autospec` 时修复传递给 "
":class:`unittest.mock.Mock` 对象的 ``name``。"

#: ../NEWS:7767
msgid ""
":gh:`111259`: :mod:`re` now handles patterns like ``\"[\\s\\S]\"`` or "
"``\"\\s|\\S\"`` which match any character as effectively as a dot with the "
"``DOTALL`` modifier (``\"(?s:.)\"``)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111259`: :mod:`re` 现在处理像 ``\"[\\s\\S]\"`` 或 ``\"\\s|\\S\"`` "
"这样的模式，这些模式匹配任何字符，效果与带有 ``DOTALL`` 修饰符的点（``\"(?s:.)\"``）相同。"

#: ../NEWS:7771
msgid ""
":gh:`120683`: Fix an error in :class:`logging.LogRecord`, when the integer "
"part of the timestamp is rounded up, while the millisecond calculation "
"truncates, causing the log timestamp to be wrong by up to 999 ms (affected "
"roughly 1 in 8 million timestamps)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120683`: 修复 :class:`logging.LogRecord` "
"中的一个错误，当时间戳的整数部分被四舍五入，而毫秒计算被截断时，导致日志时间戳最多相差 999 毫秒（大约每 800 万时间戳中有一个受影响）。"

#: ../NEWS:7776
msgid ""
":gh:`118710`: :class:`ipaddress.IPv4Address` and "
":class:`ipaddress.IPv6Address` attributes ``version`` and ``max_prefixlen`` "
"are now available on the class."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118710`: :class:`ipaddress.IPv4Address` 和 "
":class:`ipaddress.IPv6Address` 的属性 ``version`` 和 ``max_prefixlen`` 现在在类上可用。"

#: ../NEWS:7780
msgid ":gh:`120633`: Move scrollbar and remove tear-off menus in turtledemo."
msgstr ":gh:`120633`: 在 turtledemo 中移动滚动条并移除撕下菜单。"

#: ../NEWS:7782
msgid ""
":gh:`120606`: Allow users to use EOF to exit ``commands`` definition in "
":mod:`pdb`"
msgstr ":gh:`120606`: 允许用户在 :mod:`pdb` 中使用 EOF 退出 ``commands`` 定义。"

#: ../NEWS:7785
msgid ""
":gh:`120284`: Allow :meth:`asyncio.Runner.run` to accept :term:`awaitable` "
"objects instead of simply :term:`coroutine`\\s."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120284`: 允许 :meth:`asyncio.Runner.run` 接受 :term:`awaitable` 对象而不仅仅是 "
":term:`coroutine`\\s。"

#: ../NEWS:7788
msgid ""
":gh:`120541`: Improve the prompt in the \"less\" pager when :func:`help` is "
"called with non-string argument."
msgstr ":gh:`120541`: 当 :func:`help` 被调用时传入非字符串参数时，改进“less”分页器的提示。"

#: ../NEWS:7791
msgid ""
":gh:`120495`: Fix incorrect exception handling in Tab Nanny. Patch by "
"Wulian233."
msgstr ":gh:`120495`: 修复 Tab Nanny 中错误的异常处理。由 Wulian233 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7794
msgid ""
":gh:`120388`: Improve a warning message when a test method in "
":mod:`unittest` returns something other than ``None``. Now we show the "
"returned object type and optional asyncio-related tip."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120388`: 改进 :mod:`unittest` 中测试方法返回非 ``None`` "
"值时的警告信息。现在我们会显示返回的对象类型以及可选的 asyncio 相关提示。"

#: ../NEWS:7798
msgid ""
":gh:`120381`: Correct :func:`inspect.ismethoddescriptor` to check also for "
"the lack of :meth:`~object.__delete__`.  Patch by Jan Kaliszewski."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120381`: 修正 :func:`inspect.ismethoddescriptor` 以检查是否缺少 "
":meth:`~object.__delete__`。由 Jan Kaliszewski 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7801
msgid ""
":gh:`90425`: The OS byte in gzip headers is now always set to 255 when using"
" :func:`gzip.compress`."
msgstr ":gh:`90425`: 使用 :func:`gzip.compress` 时，gzip 头中的 OS 字节现在总是被设置为 255。"

#: ../NEWS:7804
msgid ""
":gh:`120343`: Fix column offset reporting for tokens that come after "
"multiline f-strings in the :mod:`tokenize` module."
msgstr ":gh:`120343`: 修复 :mod:`tokenize` 模块中多行 f-strings 之后出现的标记的列偏移报告。"

#: ../NEWS:7807
msgid ""
":gh:`119180`: As part of implementing :pep:`649` and :pep:`749`, add a new "
"module ``annotationlib``. Add support for unresolved forward references in "
"annotations to :mod:`dataclasses`, :class:`typing.TypedDict`, and "
":class:`typing.NamedTuple`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119180`: 作为实现 :pep:`649` 和 :pep:`749` 的一部分，添加了一个新模块 ``annotationlib``。为"
" :mod:`dataclasses`、:class:`typing.TypedDict` 和 :class:`typing.NamedTuple` "
"添加了对未解析的前向引用的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:7812
msgid ""
":gh:`119600`: Fix :func:`unittest.mock.patch` to not read attributes of the "
"target when ``new_callable`` is set. Patch by Robert Collins."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119600`: 修复 :func:`unittest.mock.patch` 在 ``new_callable`` "
"设置时不读取目标属性的问题。由 Robert Collins 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7815
msgid ""
":gh:`120289`: Fixed the use-after-free issue in :mod:`cProfile` by "
"disallowing ``disable()`` and ``clear()`` in external timers."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120289`: 通过禁止外部计时器中的 ``disable()`` 和 ``clear()`` 来修复 :mod:`cProfile` 中的"
" use-after-free 问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7818
msgid ""
":gh:`82017`: Added support for converting any objects that have the "
":meth:`!as_integer_ratio` method to a :class:`~fractions.Fraction`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`82017`: 添加了对任何具有 :meth:`!as_integer_ratio` 方法的对象转换为 "
":class:`~fractions.Fraction` 的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:7821
msgid ""
":gh:`114053`: Fix edge-case bug where :func:`typing.get_type_hints` would "
"produce incorrect results if type parameters in a class scope were "
"overridden by assignments in a class scope and ``from __future__ import "
"annotations`` semantics were enabled. Patch by Alex Waygood."
msgstr ""
":gh:`114053`: 修复了一个边缘情况下的 bug，即在类作用域中的类型参数被类作用域中的赋值覆盖并且启用了 ``from __future__"
" import annotations`` 语义时，:func:`typing.get_type_hints` 会产生不正确的结果。由 Alex "
"Waygood 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7826
msgid ""
":gh:`114053`: Fix erroneous :exc:`NameError` when calling "
":func:`inspect.get_annotations` with ``eval_str=True``` on a class that made"
" use of :pep:`695` type parameters in a module that had ``from __future__ "
"import annotations`` at the top of the file. Patch by Alex Waygood."
msgstr ""
":gh:`114053`: 修复了当在文件顶部有 ``from __future__ import annotations`` 的模块中，对使用了 "
":pep:`695` 类型参数的类调用 :func:`inspect.get_annotations` 并设置 ``eval_str=True`` "
"时出现的错误 :exc:`NameError`。由Alex Waygood提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7832
msgid ""
":gh:`120268`: Prohibit passing ``None`` to pure-Python "
":meth:`datetime.date.fromtimestamp` to achieve consistency with C-extension "
"implementation."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120268`: 禁止向纯Python的 :meth:`datetime.date.fromtimestamp` 传递 "
"``None``，以实现与C扩展实现的一致性。"

#: ../NEWS:7836
msgid ""
":gh:`120244`: Fix memory leak in :func:`re.sub` when the replacement string "
"contains backreferences."
msgstr ":gh:`120244`: 修复了当替换字符串包含反向引用时 :func:`re.sub` 中的内存泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7839
msgid ""
":gh:`120254`: Added ``commands`` argument to :func:`pdb.set_trace` which "
"allows users to send debugger commands from the source file."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120254`: 向 :func:`pdb.set_trace` 添加了 ``commands`` 参数，允许用户从源文件发送调试器命令。"

#: ../NEWS:7842
msgid ":gh:`120211`: Fix :mod:`tkinter.ttk` with Tcl/Tk 9.0."
msgstr ":gh:`120211`: 修复了 :mod:`tkinter.ttk` 与Tcl/Tk 9.0的兼容性问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7844
msgid ""
":gh:`71587`: Fix crash in C version of :meth:`datetime.datetime.strptime` "
"when called again on the restarted interpreter."
msgstr ""
":gh:`71587`: 修复了在重启的解释器上再次调用C版本的 :meth:`datetime.datetime.strptime` 时崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7847
msgid ""
":gh:`117983`: Defer the ``threading`` import in ``importlib.util`` until "
"lazy loading is used."
msgstr ":gh:`117983`: 在 ``importlib.util`` 中推迟 ``threading`` 的导入，直到使用懒加载。"

#: ../NEWS:7850
msgid ""
":gh:`120157`: Remove unused constant "
"``concurrent.futures._base._FUTURE_STATES`` in :mod:`concurrent.futures`. "
"Patch by Clinton Christian (pygeek)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120157`: 移除了 :mod:`concurrent.futures` "
"中未使用的常量``concurrent.futures._base._FUTURE_STATES``。由Clinton "
"Christian（pygeek）提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7854
msgid ""
":gh:`120161`: :mod:`datetime` no longer crashes in certain complex reference"
" cycle situations."
msgstr ":gh:`120161`: :mod:`datetime` 在特定的复杂引用循环情况下不再崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:7857
msgid ""
":gh:`119698`: Fix :meth:`symtable.Class.get_methods` and document its "
"behaviour. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119698`: 修复了 :meth:`symtable.Class.get_methods` 并记录了其行为。由Bénédikt "
"Tran提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7860
msgid ""
":gh:`120121`: Add :exc:`concurrent.futures.InvalidStateError` to module's "
"``__all__``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120121`: 向模块的 ``__all__`` 中添加了 "
":exc:`concurrent.futures.InvalidStateError`。"

#: ../NEWS:7863
msgid ""
":gh:`119933`: Add the :class:`symtable.SymbolTableType` enumeration to "
"represent the possible outputs of the :class:`symtable.SymbolTable.get_type`"
" method. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119933`: 添加了 :class:`symtable.SymbolTableType` 枚举，以表示 "
":class:`symtable.SymbolTable.get_type` 方法的可能输出。由Bénédikt Tran提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7867
msgid ""
":gh:`120029`: Expose :class:`symtable.Symbol` methods "
":meth:`~symtable.Symbol.is_free_class`, "
":meth:`~symtable.Symbol.is_comp_iter` and "
":meth:`~symtable.Symbol.is_comp_cell`. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120029`: 公开了 :class:`symtable.Symbol` 的方法 "
":meth:`~symtable.Symbol.is_free_class`、:meth:`~symtable.Symbol.is_comp_iter`"
" 和 :meth:`~symtable.Symbol.is_comp_cell`。由Bénédikt Tran提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7872
msgid ""
":gh:`120108`: Fix calling :func:`copy.deepcopy` on :mod:`ast` trees that "
"have been modified to have references to parent nodes. Patch by Jelle "
"Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120108`: 修复了对已被修改为具有父节点引用的 :mod:`ast` 树调用 :func:`copy.deepcopy` "
"的问题。由Jelle Zijlstra提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7875
msgid ""
":gh:`120056`: Add :data:`!socket.IP_RECVERR` and :data:`!socket.IP_RECVTTL` "
"constants (both available since Linux 2.2). And "
":data:`!socket.IP_RECVORIGDSTADDR` constant (available since Linux 2.6.29)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120056`: 添加 :data:`!socket.IP_RECVERR` 和 :data:`!socket.IP_RECVTTL` "
"常量（两者自 Linux 2.2 起可用）。以及 :data:`!socket.IP_RECVORIGDSTADDR` 常量（自 Linux "
"2.6.29 起可用）。"

#: ../NEWS:7880
msgid ":gh:`112672`: Support building :mod:`tkinter` with Tcl 9.0."
msgstr ":gh:`112672`: 支持使用 Tcl 9.0 构建 :mod:`tkinter`。"

#: ../NEWS:7882
msgid ""
":gh:`120057`: Added the :data:`os.environ.refresh() <os.environ>` method to "
"update :data:`os.environ` with changes to the environment made by "
":func:`os.putenv`, by :func:`os.unsetenv`, or made outside Python in the "
"same process. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120057`: 添加了 :data:`os.environ.refresh() <os.environ>` 方法，以通过 "
":func:`os.putenv`、:func:`os.unsetenv` 或在 Python 外部在同一进程中做出的更改来更新 "
":data:`os.environ`。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7887
msgid ""
":gh:`120029`: Expose :meth:`symtable.Symbol.is_type_parameter` in the "
":mod:`symtable` module. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120029`: 在 :mod:`symtable` 模块中公开 "
":meth:`symtable.Symbol.is_type_parameter`。补丁由 Bénédikt Tran 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:7890
msgid ""
":gh:`119819`: Fix regression to allow logging configuration with "
"multiprocessing queue types."
msgstr ":gh:`119819`: 修复回归问题，允许使用多进程队列类型进行日志配置。"

#: ../NEWS:7893
msgid ""
":gh:`65454`: :func:`unittest.mock.Mock.attach_mock` no longer triggers a "
"call to a ``PropertyMock`` being attached."
msgstr ""
":gh:`65454`: :func:`unittest.mock.Mock.attach_mock` 不再触发对正在附加的 "
"``PropertyMock`` 的调用。"

#: ../NEWS:7896
msgid ""
":gh:`117142`: The :mod:`ctypes` module may now be imported in all "
"subinterpreters, including those that have their own GIL."
msgstr ":gh:`117142`: :mod:`ctypes` 模块现在可以在所有子解释器中导入，包括那些拥有自己 GIL 的解释器。"

#: ../NEWS:7899
msgid ""
":gh:`118835`: Fix _pyrepl crash when using custom prompt with ANSI escape "
"codes."
msgstr ":gh:`118835`: 修复使用带有 ANSI 转义码的自定义提示时 _pyrepl 崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7902
msgid ""
":gh:`81936`: :meth:`!help` and :meth:`!showtopic` methods now respect a "
"configured *output* argument to :class:`!pydoc.Helper` and not use the pager"
" in such cases. Patch by Enrico Tröger."
msgstr ""
":gh:`81936`: :meth:`!help` 和 :meth:`!showtopic` 方法现在尊重为 "
":class:`!pydoc.Helper` 配置的 *output* 参数，在这种情况下不使用分页器。由 Enrico Tröger 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7906
msgid ""
":gh:`117398`: The ``_datetime`` module (C implementation for "
":mod:`datetime`) now supports being imported in multiple interpreters."
msgstr ":gh:`117398`: ``_datetime`` 模块（:mod:`datetime` 的 C 实现）现在支持在多个解释器中导入。"

#: ../NEWS:7909
msgid ""
":gh:`119824`: Print stack entry in :mod:`pdb` when and only when user input "
"is needed."
msgstr ":gh:`119824`: 在 :mod:`pdb` 中，当且仅当需要用户输入时打印堆栈条目。"

#: ../NEWS:7912
msgid ""
":gh:`119838`: In mixed arithmetic operations with "
":class:`~fractions.Fraction` and complex, the fraction is now converted to "
":class:`float` instead of :class:`complex`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119838`: 在 :class:`~fractions.Fraction` 和复数的混合算术运算中，分数现在被转换为 "
":class:`float` 而不是 :class:`complex`。"

#: ../NEWS:7916
msgid ""
":gh:`119770`: Make :mod:`termios` ``ioctl()`` constants positive. Patch by "
"Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119770`: 使 :mod:`termios` ``ioctl()`` 常量为正数。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7919
msgid ""
":gh:`89727`: Fix issue with :func:`shutil.rmtree` where a "
":exc:`RecursionError` is raised on deep directory trees."
msgstr ""
":gh:`89727`: 修复 :func:`shutil.rmtree` 的问题，其中在深层目录树上会引发 "
":exc:`RecursionError`。"

#: ../NEWS:7922
msgid ""
":gh:`119577`: The :exc:`DeprecationWarning` emitted when testing the truth "
"value of an :class:`xml.etree.ElementTree.Element` now describes "
"unconditionally returning ``True`` in a future version rather than raising "
"an exception in Python 3.14."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119577`: 当测试 :class:`xml.etree.ElementTree.Element` 的真值时，发出的 "
":exc:`DeprecationWarning` 现在描述了在未来的版本中无条件返回 ``True``，而不是在 Python 3.14 中引发异常。"

#: ../NEWS:7927
msgid ""
":gh:`89727`: Partially fix issue with :func:`shutil.rmtree` where a "
":exc:`RecursionError` is raised on deep directory trees. A recursion error "
"is no longer raised when :data:`!rmtree.avoids_symlink_attacks` is false."
msgstr ""
":gh:`89727`: 部分修复了 :func:`shutil.rmtree` 的问题，即在深目录树上会引发 "
":exc:`RecursionError`。当 :data:`!rmtree.avoids_symlink_attacks` 为 false "
"时，不再引发递归错误。"

#: ../NEWS:7931
msgid ""
":gh:`93963`: Remove deprecated names from ``importlib.abc`` as found in "
"``importlib.resources.abc``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93963`: 从 ``importlib.abc`` 中移除已弃用的名称，如在 ``importlib.resources.abc`` "
"中所见。"

#: ../NEWS:7934
msgid ""
":gh:`119118`: Fix performance regression in the :mod:`tokenize` module by "
"caching the ``line`` token attribute and calculating the column offset more "
"efficiently."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119118`: 通过缓存 ``line`` 令牌属性并更高效地计算列偏移，修复了 :mod:`tokenize` 模块的性能回归问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7938
msgid ""
":gh:`89727`: Fix issue with :func:`os.fwalk` where a :exc:`RecursionError` "
"was raised on deep directory trees by adjusting the implementation to be "
"iterative instead of recursive."
msgstr ""
":gh:`89727`: 通过将实现调整为迭代而非递归，修复了 :func:`os.fwalk` 在深目录树上引发 "
":exc:`RecursionError` 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7942
msgid ""
":gh:`119594`: If one calls pow(fractions.Fraction, x, module) with modulo "
"not None, the error message now says that the types are incompatible rather "
"than saying pow only takes 2 arguments. Patch by Wim Jeantine-Glenn and Mark"
" Dickinson."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119594`: 如果使用模数不为 None 调用 pow(fractions.Fraction, x, "
"module)，错误消息现在会说类型不兼容，而不是说 pow 只接受 2 个参数。由 Wim Jeantine-Glenn 和 Mark "
"Dickinson 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7947
msgid ""
":gh:`119588`: ``zipfile.Path.is_symlink`` now assesses if the given path is "
"a symlink."
msgstr ":gh:`119588`: ``zipfile.Path.is_symlink`` 现在评估给定路径是否为符号链接。"

#: ../NEWS:7950
msgid ""
":gh:`119562`: Remove :class:`!ast.Num`, :class:`!ast.Str`, "
":class:`!ast.Bytes`, :class:`!ast.NameConstant` and :class:`!ast.Ellipsis`. "
"They had all emitted deprecation warnings since Python 3.12. Patch by Alex "
"Waygood."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119562`: 移除 "
":class:`!ast.Num`、:class:`!ast.Str`、:class:`!ast.Bytes`、:class:`!ast.NameConstant`"
" 和 :class:`!ast.Ellipsis`。它们自 Python 3.12 起都已发出弃用警告。补丁由 Alex Waygood 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:7955
msgid ""
":gh:`119555`: Catch :exc:`SyntaxError` from :func:`compile` in the "
"runsource() method of the InteractiveColoredConsole.  Patch by Sergey B "
"Kirpichev."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119555`: 在 InteractiveColoredConsole 的 runsource() 方法中捕获来自 "
":func:`compile` 的 :exc:`SyntaxError`。由 Sergey B Kirpichev 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7959
msgid ""
":gh:`118908`: Limit exposed globals from internal imports and definitions on"
" new REPL startup. Patch by Eugene Triguba and Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118908`: 限制新 REPL 启动时从内部导入和定义中暴露的全局变量。由 Eugene Triguba 和 Pablo Galindo "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7962
msgid ""
":gh:`117865`: Improve the import time of the :mod:`ast` module by deferring "
"the import of :mod:`re`. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`117865`: 通过推迟导入 :mod:`re` 提高了 :mod:`ast` 模块的导入时间。由 Jelle Zijlstra 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7965
msgid ""
":gh:`119127`: Positional arguments of :func:`functools.partial` objects now "
"support placeholders via :data:`functools.Placeholder`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119127`: :func:`functools.partial` 对象的位置参数现在通过 "
":data:`functools.Placeholder` 支持占位符。"

#: ../NEWS:7968
msgid ""
":gh:`113892`: Now, the method ``sock_connect`` of "
":class:`asyncio.ProactorEventLoop` raises a :exc:`ValueError` if given "
"socket is not in non-blocking mode, as well as in other loop "
"implementations."
msgstr ""
":gh:`113892`: 现在，如果给定的套接字不在非阻塞模式下，:class:`asyncio.ProactorEventLoop` 的 "
"``sock_connect`` 方法会像其他循环实现一样引发 :exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../NEWS:7973
msgid ""
":gh:`119506`: Fix :meth:`!io.TextIOWrapper.write` method breaks internal "
"buffer when the method is called again during flushing internal buffer."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119506`: 修复了在刷新内部缓冲区期间再次调用 :meth:`!io.TextIOWrapper.write` "
"方法时会破坏内部缓冲区的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7976
msgid ""
":gh:`69214`: Fix ``fcntl.ioctl()`` *request* parameter: use an ``unsigned "
"long`` instead of an ``unsigned int`` for the *request* parameter of "
":func:`fcntl.ioctl` to support requests larger than ``UINT_MAX``. Patch by "
"Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`69214`: 修复 ``fcntl.ioctl()`` 的 *request* 参数：将 :func:`fcntl.ioctl` 的 "
"*request* 参数从 ``unsigned int`` 改为 ``unsigned long``，以支持大于 ``UINT_MAX`` 的请求。由"
" Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7981
msgid ""
":gh:`119105`: ``difflib``'s ``DIffer.compare()`` (and so also ``ndiff``) can"
" no longer be provoked into cubic-time behavior, or into unbounded "
"recursion, and should generally be faster in ordinary cases too. Results may"
" change in some cases, although that should be rare. Correctness of diffs is"
" not affected. Some similar lines far apart may be reported as deleting one "
"and adding the other, where before they were displayed on adjacent output "
"lines with markup showing the intraline differences."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119105`: ``difflib`` 的 ``DIffer.compare()``（以及 "
"``ndiff``）不再可能被诱导出立方级时间行为或无限递归，并且在普通情况下通常也会更快。在某些情况下结果可能会有所变化，尽管这种情况应该很少见。差异的正确性不受影响。一些相隔较远的相似行可能会被报告为删除一行并添加另一行，而之前它们被显示在相邻的输出行上，带有显示行内差异的标记。"

#: ../NEWS:7989
msgid ""
":gh:`119443`: The interactive REPL no longer runs with ``from __future__ "
"import annotations`` enabled. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119443`: 交互式 REPL 不再启用 ``from __future__ import annotations``。由 Jelle "
"Zijlstra 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7992
msgid ""
":gh:`119461`: Add ``socket.VMADDR_CID_LOCAL`` constant. Patch by Victor "
"Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119461`: 添加了 ``socket.VMADDR_CID_LOCAL`` 常量。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7995
msgid ""
":gh:`117398`: Objects in the datetime C-API are now all statically "
"allocated, which means better memory safety, especially when the module is "
"reloaded. This should be transparent to users."
msgstr ""
":gh:`117398`: datetime C-API "
"中的对象现在都是静态分配的，这意味着更好的内存安全性，尤其是在模块重新加载时。这对用户应该是透明的。"

#: ../NEWS:7999
msgid ""
":gh:`118894`: :mod:`asyncio` REPL now has the same capabilities as PyREPL."
msgstr ":gh:`118894`: :mod:`asyncio` REPL 现在具有与 PyREPL 相同的功能。"

#: ../NEWS:8001
msgid ":gh:`118830`: Bump :mod:`pickle` default protocol to ``5``."
msgstr ":gh:`118830`: 将 :mod:`pickle` 的默认协议提升至 ``5``。"

#: ../NEWS:8003
msgid ""
":gh:`118911`: In PyREPL, updated ``maybe-accept``'s logic so that if the "
"user hits :kbd:`Enter` twice, they are able to terminate the block even if "
"there's trailing whitespace. Also, now when the user hits arrow up, the "
"cursor is on the last functional line. This matches IPython's behavior. "
"Patch by Aya Elsayed."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118911`: 在 PyREPL 中，更新了 ``maybe-accept`` 的逻辑，使得如果用户按下 :kbd:`Enter` "
"两次，即使有尾随空格，也能够终止块。此外，现在当用户按下上箭头键时，光标会位于最后一个功能行上。这与 IPython 的行为相匹配。由 Aya "
"Elsayed 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8009
msgid ""
":gh:`115225`: Raise error on certain technically valid but pathological ISO "
"8601 strings passed to :meth:`datetime.time.fromisoformat` that were "
"previously parsed incorrectly."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115225`: 对传递给 :meth:`datetime.time.fromisoformat` 的某些技术上有效但不规范的 ISO "
"8601 字符串引发错误，这些字符串之前被错误解析。"

#: ../NEWS:8013
msgid ""
":gh:`111201`: Remove dependency to :mod:`readline` from the new Python REPL."
msgstr ":gh:`111201`: 从新的 Python REPL 中移除对 :mod:`readline` 的依赖。"

#: ../NEWS:8015
msgid ""
":gh:`119189`: When using the ``**`` operator or :func:`pow` with "
":class:`~fractions.Fraction` as the base and an exponent that is not "
"rational, a float, or a complex, the fraction is no longer converted to a "
"float."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119189`: 当使用 ``**`` 操作符或 :func:`pow` 时，如果基数是 "
":class:`~fractions.Fraction` 且指数不是有理数、浮点数或复数，分数不再转换为浮点数。"

#: ../NEWS:8020
msgid ""
":gh:`119174`: Fix high DPI causes turtledemo(turtle-graphics examples) "
"windows blurry Patch by Wulian233 and Terry Jan Reedy"
msgstr ""
":gh:`119174`: 修复高 DPI 导致 turtledemo（turtle-graphics 示例）窗口模糊的问题。由 Wulian233 和"
" Terry Jan Reedy 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8023
msgid ""
":gh:`119121`: Fix a NameError happening in "
"``asyncio.staggered.staggered_race``. This function is now tested."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119121`: 修复 ``asyncio.staggered.staggered_race`` 中发生的 "
"NameError。该函数现已测试。"

#: ../NEWS:8026
msgid ""
":gh:`119105`: ``difflib.Differ`` is much faster for some cases of diffs "
"where many pairs of lines are equally similar."
msgstr ":gh:`119105`: 对于许多对行相似度相等的差异情况，``difflib.Differ`` 现在快得多。"

#: ../NEWS:8029
msgid ""
":gh:`119113`: Fix issue where :meth:`pathlib.PurePath.with_suffix` didn't "
"raise :exc:`TypeError` when given ``None`` as a suffix."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119113`: 修复 :meth:`pathlib.PurePath.with_suffix` 在给定 ``None`` 作为后缀时未引发 "
":exc:`TypeError` 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:8032
msgid ""
":gh:`118643`: Fix an AttributeError in the :mod:`email` module when re-fold "
"a long address list. Also fix more cases of incorrect encoding of the "
"address separator in the address list."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118643`: 修复 :mod:`email` 模块在重新折叠长地址列表时的 "
"AttributeError。同时修复地址列表中地址分隔符编码不正确的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:8036
msgid ""
":gh:`73991`: Add :meth:`pathlib.Path.copy`, which copies a file or directory"
" to another."
msgstr ":gh:`73991`: 添加 :meth:`pathlib.Path.copy`，用于将文件或目录复制到另一个位置。"

#: ../NEWS:8039
msgid ""
":gh:`58933`: Make :mod:`pdb` return to caller frame correctly when "
"``f_trace`` of the caller frame is not set"
msgstr ":gh:`58933`: 当调用者帧的 ``f_trace`` 未设置时，使 :mod:`pdb` 正确返回到调用者帧。"

#: ../NEWS:8042
msgid ""
":gh:`82805`: Support single-dot file extensions in "
":attr:`pathlib.PurePath.suffix` and related attributes and methods. For "
"example, the :attr:`~pathlib.PurePath.suffixes` of ``PurePath('foo.bar.')`` "
"are now ``['.bar', '.']`` rather than ``[]``. This brings file extension "
"splitting in line with :func:`os.path.splitext`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`82805`: 支持 :attr:`pathlib.PurePath.suffix` "
"及相关属性和方法中的单点文件扩展名。例如，``PurePath('foo.bar.')`` 的 "
":attr:`~pathlib.PurePath.suffixes` 现在是 ``['.bar', '.']`` 而不是 "
"``[]``。这使得文件扩展名分割与 :func:`os.path.splitext` 保持一致。"

#: ../NEWS:8049
msgid ""
":gh:`118924`: Remove :data:`!version` and :data:`!version_info` from "
":mod:`sqlite3`. Patch by Hugo van Kemenade."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118924`: 从 :mod:`sqlite3` 中移除 :data:`!version` 和 "
":data:`!version_info`。由 Hugo van Kemenade 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8052
msgid ""
":gh:`118928`: Disallow using a sequence of parameters with named "
"placeholders in :mod:`sqlite3` queries. Patch by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118928`: 禁止在 :mod:`sqlite3` 查询中使用带有命名占位符的参数序列。由 Erlend E. Aasland 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8055
msgid ""
":gh:`118895`: Setting attributes on :data:`typing.NoDefault` now raises "
":exc:`AttributeError` instead of :exc:`TypeError`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118895`: 现在在 :data:`typing.NoDefault` 上设置属性会引发 :exc:`AttributeError` "
"而不是 :exc:`TypeError`。"

#: ../NEWS:8058
msgid ""
":gh:`118868`: Fixed issue where kwargs were no longer passed to the logging "
"handler QueueHandler"
msgstr ":gh:`118868`: 修复了 kwargs 不再传递给日志处理程序 QueueHandler 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:8061
msgid ""
":gh:`118827`: Remove deprecated :class:`!Quoter` class from "
":mod:`urllib.parse`. It had previously raised a :exc:`DeprecationWarning` "
"since Python 3.11. Patch by Nikita Sobolev."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118827`: 从 :mod:`urllib.parse` 中移除已弃用的 :class:`!Quoter` 类。自 Python 3.11"
" 起，它已经引发 :exc:`DeprecationWarning`。由 Nikita Sobolev 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8065
msgid ""
":gh:`118824`: Remove deprecated :func:`!pty.master_open` and "
":func:`!pty.slave_open`. Use :func:`pty.openpty` instead. Patch by Nikita "
"Sobolev."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118824`: 移除已弃用的 :func:`!pty.master_open` 和 :func:`!pty.slave_open`。改用 "
":func:`pty.openpty`。由 Nikita Sobolev 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8069
msgid ""
":gh:`118851`: ``ctx`` arguments to the constructors of :mod:`ast` node "
"classes now default to :class:`ast.Load() <ast.Load>`. Patch by Jelle "
"Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118851`: :mod:`ast` 节点类构造函数的 ``ctx`` 参数现在默认为 :class:`ast.Load() "
"<ast.Load>`。由 Jelle Zijlstra 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8073
msgid ""
":gh:`101588`: Remove copy, deepcopy, and pickle from itertools. These had "
"previously raised a DeprecationWarning since Python 3.12."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101588`: 从 itertools 中移除 copy、deepcopy 和 pickle。自 Python 3.12 起，这些已经引发 "
"DeprecationWarning。"

#: ../NEWS:8076
msgid ""
":gh:`118805`: Remove *type*, *choices*, and *metavar* parameters of "
":class:`!argparse.BooleanOptionalAction`. They were deprecated since Python "
"3.12."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118805`: 移除 :class:`!argparse.BooleanOptionalAction` 的 *type*、*choices*"
" 和 *metavar* 参数。自 Python 3.12 起，这些已被弃用。"

#: ../NEWS:8080
msgid ""
":gh:`118803`: :class:`!typing.ByteString` and "
":class:`!collections.abc.ByteString` are removed. They had previously raised"
" a :exc:`DeprecationWarning` since Python 3.12."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118803`: 移除 :class:`!typing.ByteString` 和 "
":class:`!collections.abc.ByteString`。自 Python 3.12 起，这些已经引发 "
":exc:`DeprecationWarning`。"

#: ../NEWS:8084
msgid ""
":gh:`118798`: The *isdst* parameter has been removed from "
":func:`email.utils.localtime`. Patch by Hugo van Kemenade."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118798`: 从 :func:`email.utils.localtime` 中移除 *isdst* 参数。由 Hugo van "
"Kemenade 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8087
msgid ""
":gh:`118760`: Restore the default value of ``tkiter.wantobjects`` to ``1``."
msgstr ":gh:`118760`: 将 ``tkinter.wantobjects`` 的默认值恢复为 ``1``。"

#: ../NEWS:8089
msgid ":gh:`118760`: Fix errors in calling Tkinter bindings on Windows."
msgstr ":gh:`118760`: 修复在 Windows 上调用 Tkinter 绑定的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:8091
msgid ""
":gh:`74033`: Drop support for passing keyword arguments to "
":class:`pathlib.Path`."
msgstr ":gh:`74033`: 放弃支持向 :class:`pathlib.Path` 传递关键字参数。"

#: ../NEWS:8094
msgid ""
":gh:`101357`: Suppress all :exc:`OSError` exceptions from "
":meth:`pathlib.Path.exists` and ``is_*()`` methods, rather than a selection "
"of more common errors. The new behaviour is consistent with "
":func:`os.path.exists`, :func:`os.path.isdir`, etc. Use "
":meth:`pathlib.Path.stat` to retrieve the file status without suppressing "
"exceptions."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101357`: 抑制来自 :meth:`pathlib.Path.exists` 和 ``is_*()`` 方法的所有 "
":exc:`OSError` 异常，而不是选择性地处理一些更常见的错误。新行为与 "
":func:`os.path.exists`、:func:`os.path.isdir` 等一致。使用 "
":meth:`pathlib.Path.stat` 来检索文件状态而不抑制异常。"

#: ../NEWS:8101
msgid ""
":gh:`78707`: Drop support for passing additional positional arguments to "
":meth:`pathlib.PurePath.relative_to` and "
":meth:`~pathlib.PurePath.is_relative_to`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`78707`: 放弃支持向 :meth:`pathlib.PurePath.relative_to` 和 "
":meth:`~pathlib.PurePath.is_relative_to` 传递额外的位置参数。"

#: ../NEWS:8105
msgid ""
":gh:`118507`: Fix :func:`os.path.isfile` on Windows for pipes. Speedup "
":func:`os.path.isjunction` and :func:`os.path.lexists` on Windows with a "
"native implementation."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118507`: 修复 Windows 上 :func:`os.path.isfile` 对于管道的判断。通过原生实现加速 Windows "
"上的 :func:`os.path.isjunction` 和 :func:`os.path.lexists`。"

#: ../NEWS:8109
msgid ""
":gh:`118772`: Allow :class:`typing.TypeVar` instances without a default to "
"follow instances without a default in some cases. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118772`: 允许 :class:`typing.TypeVar` 实例在某些情况下跟随无默认值的实例。由 Jelle Zijlstra "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8112
msgid ""
":gh:`118714`: Allow ``restart`` in post-mortem debugging of :mod:`pdb`. "
"Removed restart message when the user quits pdb from post-mortem mode."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118714`: 允许在 :mod:`pdb` 的事后调试中使用 ``restart``。移除当用户从事后模式退出 pdb 时的重启消息。"

#: ../NEWS:8115
msgid ":gh:`118673`: Removed executable bits and shebang from stdlib modules."
msgstr ":gh:`118673`: 从标准库模块中移除可执行位和 shebang。"

#: ../NEWS:8117
msgid ""
":gh:`110863`: :func:`os.path.realpath` now suppresses any :exc:`OSError` "
"from :func:`os.readlink` when *strict* mode is disabled (the default)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110863`: :func:`os.path.realpath` 现在在 *strict* 模式禁用（默认）时抑制来自 "
":func:`os.readlink` 的任何 :exc:`OSError`。"

#: ../NEWS:8120
msgid ""
":gh:`118263`: Speed up :func:`os.path.splitroot` & :func:`os.path.normpath` "
"with a direct C call."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118263`: 通过直接 C 调用加速 :func:`os.path.splitroot` 和 "
":func:`os.path.normpath`。"

#: ../NEWS:8123
msgid ""
":gh:`110190`: Fix ctypes structs with array on SPARC by setting "
"``MAX_STRUCT_SIZE`` to 32 in stgdict. Patch by Jakub Kulik"
msgstr ""
":gh:`110190`: 通过在 stgdict 中设置 ``MAX_STRUCT_SIZE`` 为 32 来修复 SPARC 上带有数组的 "
"ctypes 结构体。由 Jakub Kulik 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8126
msgid ""
":gh:`118033`: Fix :func:`dataclasses.dataclass` not creating a "
"``__weakref__`` slot when subclassing :class:`typing.Generic`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118033`: 修复 :func:`dataclasses.dataclass` 在继承 :class:`typing.Generic` "
"时不创建 ``__weakref__`` 槽的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:8129
msgid ""
":gh:`117766`: Always use :func:`str` to print ``choices`` in "
":mod:`argparse`."
msgstr ":gh:`117766`: 总是使用 :func:`str` 在 :mod:`argparse` 中打印 ``choices``。"

#: ../NEWS:8131
msgid ""
":gh:`106531`: In :mod:`importlib.resources`, sync with `importlib_resources "
"6.3.2 <https://importlib-"
"resources.readthedocs.io/en/latest/history.html#v6-3-2>`_, including: "
"``MultiplexedPath`` now expects ``Traversable`` paths, deprecating string "
"arguments to ``MultiplexedPath``; Enabled support for resources in namespace"
" packages in zip files; Fixed ``NotADirectoryError`` when calling files on a"
" subdirectory of a namespace package."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106531`: 在 :mod:`importlib.resources` 中，与 `importlib_resources 6.3.2 "
"<https://importlib-resources.readthedocs.io/en/latest/history.html#v6-3-2>`_"
" 同步，包括：``MultiplexedPath`` 现在期望 ``Traversable`` 路径，弃用 ``MultiplexedPath`` "
"的字符串参数；启用对 zip 文件中命名空间包资源的支持；修复在命名空间包的子目录上调用文件时的 ``NotADirectoryError``。"

#: ../NEWS:8139
msgid ""
":gh:`115937`: Removed extra preprocessing for the ``__signature__`` "
"attribute: the code just check if it's a :class:`inspect.Signature` "
"instance.  Patch by Sergey B Kirpichev."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115937`: 移除了对 ``__signature__`` 属性的额外预处理：代码仅检查它是否为 "
":class:`inspect.Signature` 实例。由 Sergey B Kirpichev 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8143
msgid ""
":gh:`115808`: Add :func:`operator.is_none` and :func:`operator.is_not_none` "
"functions."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115808`: 添加 :func:`operator.is_none` 和 :func:`operator.is_not_none` 函数。"

#: ../NEWS:8146
msgid ""
":gh:`114264`: Improve performance of :func:`copy.deepcopy` by adding a fast "
"path for atomic types."
msgstr ":gh:`114264`: 通过为原子类型添加快速路径来提高 :func:`copy.deepcopy` 的性能。"

#: ../NEWS:8149
msgid ""
":gh:`113878`: Add *doc* parameter to :func:`dataclasses.field`, so it can be"
" stored and shown as a documentation / metadata. If "
"``@dataclass(slots=True)`` is used, then the supplied string is available in"
" the :attr:`~object.__slots__` dict. Otherwise, the supplied string is only "
"available in the corresponding :class:`dataclasses.Field` object."
msgstr ""
":gh:`113878`: 向 :func:`dataclasses.field` 添加 *doc* "
"参数，以便它可以作为文档/元数据存储和显示。如果使用 ``@dataclass(slots=True)``，则提供的字符串将在 "
":attr:`~object.__slots__` 字典中可用。否则，提供的字符串仅在相应的 :class:`dataclasses.Field` "
"对象中可用。"

#: ../NEWS:8155
msgid ""
"In order to support this feature we are changing the ``__slots__`` format in"
" dataclasses from :class:`tuple` to :class:`dict` when documentation / "
"metadata is present."
msgstr ""
"为了支持此功能，我们在存在文档/元数据时，将数据类中的 ``__slots__`` 格式从 :class:`tuple` 更改为 "
":class:`dict`。"

#: ../NEWS:8159
msgid ":gh:`113978`: Ignore warnings on text completion inside REPL."
msgstr ":gh:`113978`: 忽略 REPL 内部文本完成的警告。"

#: ../NEWS:8161
msgid ""
":gh:`113008`: Correct argparse usage output for required, mutually exclusive"
" groups containing a positional argument"
msgstr ":gh:`113008`: 为包含位置参数的必需互斥组更正 argparse 使用输出。"

#: ../NEWS:8164
msgid ""
":gh:`108172`: ``webbrowser`` honors OS preferred browser on Linux when its "
"desktop entry name contains the text of a known browser name."
msgstr ""
":gh:`108172`: ``webbrowser`` 在 Linux 上尊重操作系统首选的浏览器，当其桌面条目名称包含已知浏览器名称的文本时。"

#: ../NEWS:8167 ../NEWS:13791
msgid ""
":gh:`109109`: You can now get the raw TLS certificate chains from TLS "
"connections via :meth:`ssl.SSLSocket.get_verified_chain` and "
":meth:`ssl.SSLSocket.get_unverified_chain` methods."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109109`: 您现在可以通过 :meth:`ssl.SSLSocket.get_verified_chain` 和 "
":meth:`ssl.SSLSocket.get_unverified_chain` 方法从 TLS 连接获取原始 TLS 证书链。"

#: ../NEWS:8171 ../NEWS:13795
msgid "Contributed by Mateusz Nowak."
msgstr "由 Mateusz Nowak 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:8173
msgid ""
":gh:`105623`: Fix performance degradation in "
":class:`logging.handlers.RotatingFileHandler`. Patch by Craig Robson."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105623`: 修复 :class:`logging.handlers.RotatingFileHandler` 中的性能下降问题。由 "
"Craig Robson 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8176
msgid ""
":gh:`102450`: Add missing ISO-8601 24:00 alternative to midnight of next day"
" to :meth:`datetime.datetime.fromisoformat` and "
":meth:`datetime.time.fromisoformat`. Patch by Izan \"TizzySaurus\" Robinson "
"(tizzysaurus@gmail.com)"
msgstr ""
":gh:`102450`: 向 :meth:`datetime.datetime.fromisoformat` 和 "
":meth:`datetime.time.fromisoformat` 添加缺失的 ISO-8601 24:00 替代为下一天的午夜。由 Izan "
"\"TizzySaurus\" Robinson (tizzysaurus@gmail.com) 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8181
msgid ""
":gh:`103956`: Fix lack of newline characters in :mod:`trace` module output "
"when line tracing is enabled but source code line for current frame is not "
"available."
msgstr ":gh:`103956`: 当启用行跟踪但当前帧的源代码行不可用时，修复 :mod:`trace` 模块输出中缺少换行符的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:8185
msgid ""
":gh:`92081`: Fix missing spaces in email headers when the spaces are mixed "
"with encoded 8-bit characters."
msgstr ":gh:`92081`: 修复电子邮件头中混合有编码的 8 位字符时缺少空格的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:8188
msgid ""
":gh:`103194`: Prepare Tkinter for C API changes in Tcl 8.7/9.0 to avoid "
":class:`!_tkinter.Tcl_Obj` being unexpectedly returned instead of "
":class:`bool`, :class:`str`, :class:`bytearray`, or :class:`int`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`103194`: 准备 Tkinter 以应对 Tcl 8.7/9.0 中的 C API 更改，避免意外返回 "
":class:`!_tkinter.Tcl_Obj` 而不是 :class:`bool`、:class:`str`、:class:`bytearray`"
" 或 :class:`int`。"

#: ../NEWS:8192
msgid ""
":gh:`87106`: Fixed handling in :meth:`inspect.Signature.bind` of keyword "
"arguments having the same name as positional-only arguments when a variadic "
"keyword argument (e.g. ``**kwargs``) is present."
msgstr ""
":gh:`87106`: 修复了当存在可变关键字参数（例如 ``**kwargs``）时，:meth:`inspect.Signature.bind` "
"处理与位置参数同名的关键字参数的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:8196
msgid ""
":gh:`103134`: Add additional methods to :ref:`proxy objects "
"<multiprocessing-proxy_objects>` in the :mod:`!multiprocessing` module:"
msgstr ""
":gh:`103134`: 向 :mod:`!multiprocessing` 模块中的 :ref:`代理对象 <multiprocessing-"
"proxy_objects>` 添加了额外的方法："

#: ../NEWS:8199
msgid ":meth:`!clear` and :meth:`!copy` for proxies of :class:`list`"
msgstr ":meth:`!clear` 和 :meth:`!copy` 用于 :class:`list` 的代理"

#: ../NEWS:8200
msgid ""
":meth:`~dict.fromkeys`, ``reversed(d)``, ``d | {}``, ``{} | d``, ``d |= "
"{'b': 2}`` for proxies of :class:`dict`"
msgstr ""
":meth:`~dict.fromkeys`, ``reversed(d)``, ``d | {}``, ``{} | d``, ``d |= "
"{'b': 2}`` 用于 :class:`dict` 的代理"

#: ../NEWS:8203
msgid ""
":issue:`45767`: Fix integer conversion in :func:`os.major`, "
":func:`os.minor`, and :func:`os.makedev`. Support device numbers larger than"
" ``2**63-1``. Support non-existent device number (``NODEV``)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45767`: 修复了 :func:`os.major`, :func:`os.minor`, 和 :func:`os.makedev`"
" 中的整数转换。支持大于 ``2**63-1`` 的设备号。支持不存在的设备号（``NODEV``）。"

#: ../NEWS:8207
msgid ""
":issue:`44864`: Do not translate user-provided strings in "
":class:`argparse.ArgumentParser`."
msgstr ":issue:`44864`: 不在 :class:`argparse.ArgumentParser` 中翻译用户提供的字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:8210
msgid ""
":issue:`41843`: Solaris now uses :func:`os.sendfile` fast-copy syscall for "
"more efficient :mod:`shutil` file copy related functions."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41843`: Solaris 现在使用 :func:`os.sendfile` 快速复制系统调用，以提高 :mod:`shutil` "
"文件复制相关函数的效率。"

#: ../NEWS:8213
msgid ""
":issue:`15987`: Implemented :func:`ast.compare` for comparing two ASTs. "
"Patch by Batuhan Taskaya with some help from Jeremy Hylton."
msgstr ""
":issue:`15987`: 实现了 :func:`ast.compare` 用于比较两个 AST。由 Batuhan Taskaya "
"提供补丁，Jeremy Hylton 提供了一些帮助。"

#: ../NEWS:8216
msgid ""
":gh:`67693`: Fix :func:`urllib.parse.urlunparse` and "
":func:`urllib.parse.urlunsplit` for URIs with path starting with multiple "
"slashes and no authority. Based on patch by Ashwin Ramaswami."
msgstr ""
":gh:`67693`: 修复了 :func:`urllib.parse.urlunparse` 和 "
":func:`urllib.parse.urlunsplit` 对于路径以多个斜杠开始且没有权限的 URI 的处理。基于 Ashwin "
"Ramaswami 的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8220
msgid ""
":issue:`14074`: Fix :mod:`argparse` metavar processing to allow positional "
"arguments to have a tuple metavar."
msgstr ":issue:`14074`: 修复了 :mod:`argparse` 的 metavar 处理，允许位置参数有一个元组 metavar。"

#: ../NEWS:8226
msgid ""
":gh:`122392`: Increase currently inadequate vertical spacing for the IDLE "
"browsers (path, module, and stack) on high-resolution monitors."
msgstr ":gh:`122392`: 在高分辨率显示器上增加了 IDLE 浏览器（路径、模块和堆栈）当前不足的垂直间距。"

#: ../NEWS:8229
msgid ""
":gh:`112938`: Fix uninteruptable hang when Shell gets rapid continuous "
"output."
msgstr ":gh:`112938`: 修复了 Shell 在快速连续输出时不可中断的挂起问题。"

#: ../NEWS:8232
msgid ""
":gh:`122482`: Change About IDLE to direct users to discuss.python.org "
"instead of the now unused idle-dev email and mailing list."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122482`: 更改 About IDLE，将用户引导至 discuss.python.org，而不是现在未使用的 idle-dev "
"电子邮件和邮件列表。"

#: ../NEWS:8235
msgid ""
":gh:`78889`: Stop Shell freezes by blocking user access to non-method "
"sys.stdout.shell attributes, which are all private."
msgstr ":gh:`78889`: 通过阻止用户访问非方法 sys.stdout.shell 属性（这些属性都是私有的）来停止 Shell 冻结。"

#: ../NEWS:8238
msgid ""
":gh:`120083`: Add explicit black IDLE Hovertip foreground color needed for "
"recent macOS. Fixes Sonoma showing unreadable white on pale yellow.  Patch "
"by John Riggles."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120083`: 为最近的 macOS 添加了明确的黑色 IDLE Hovertip 前景色。修复了 Sonoma "
"显示不可读的白色在淡黄色上的问题。由 John Riggles 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8242
msgid ":gh:`120104`: Fix padding in config and search dialog windows in IDLE."
msgstr ":gh:`120104`: 修复IDLE中配置和搜索对话框窗口的填充问题。"

#: ../NEWS:8247
msgid ""
":gh:`124872`: Added definitions for :term:`context`, :term:`current "
"context`, and :term:`context management protocol`, updated related "
"definitions to be consistent, and expanded the documentation for "
":class:`contextvars.Context`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`124872`: 添加了 :term:`context`、:term:`current context` 和 :term:`context "
"management protocol` 的定义，更新了相关定义以保持一致，并扩展了 :class:`contextvars.Context` 的文档。"

#: ../NEWS:8252
msgid ""
":gh:`125018`: The :mod:`importlib.metadata` documentation now includes "
"semantic cross-reference targets for the significant documented APIs. This "
"means intersphinx references like :func:`importlib.metadata.version` will "
"now work as expected."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125018`: :mod:`importlib.metadata` 文档现在包括重要文档API的语义交叉引用目标。这意味着像 "
":func:`importlib.metadata.version` 这样的intersphinx引用现在将按预期工作。"

#: ../NEWS:8257
msgid ""
":gh:`124720`: Update \"Using Python on a Mac\" section of the \"Python Setup"
" and Usage\" document and include information on installing free-threading "
"support."
msgstr ":gh:`124720`: 更新\"Python设置和使用\"文档中的\"在Mac上使用Python\"部分，并包含安装自由线程支持的信息。"

#: ../NEWS:8261
msgid ""
":gh:`124457`: Remove coverity scan from the CPython repo. It has not been "
"used since 2020 and is currently unmaintained."
msgstr ":gh:`124457`: 从CPython仓库中移除coverity扫描。自2020年以来未使用，目前无人维护。"

#: ../NEWS:8264
msgid ""
":gh:`116622`: Add an Android platform guide, and flag modules not available "
"on Android."
msgstr ":gh:`116622`: 添加Android平台指南，并标记在Android上不可用的模块。"

#: ../NEWS:8267
msgid ":gh:`123976`: Refresh docs around custom providers."
msgstr ":gh:`123976`: 刷新关于自定义提供者的文档。"

#: ../NEWS:8269
msgid ""
":gh:`70870`: Clarified the dual usage of the term \"free variable\" (both "
"the formal meaning of any reference to names defined outside the local "
"scope, and the narrower pragmatic meaning of nonlocal variables named in "
"``co_freevars``)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`70870`: 澄清了术语\"自由变量\"的双重用途（既指正式意义上对外部作用域定义的任何名称引用，也指在 ``co_freevars`` "
"中命名的非局部变量的狭义实用意义）。"

#: ../NEWS:8274
msgid ""
":gh:`121277`: Writers of CPython's documentation can now use ``next`` as the"
" version for the ``versionchanged``, ``versionadded``, ``deprecated`` "
"directives."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121277`: CPython文档的作者现在可以使用 ``next`` 作为 "
"``versionchanged``、``versionadded``、``deprecated``指令的版本。"

#: ../NEWS:8278
msgid ""
":gh:`117765`: Improved documentation for :func:`unittest.mock.patch.dict`"
msgstr ":gh:`117765`: 改进了 :func:`unittest.mock.patch.dict` 的文档。"

#: ../NEWS:8280
msgid ":gh:`121749`: Fix documentation for :c:func:`PyModule_AddObjectRef`."
msgstr ":gh:`121749`: 修复 :c:func:`PyModule_AddObjectRef` 的文档。"

#: ../NEWS:8282
msgid ""
":gh:`120012`: Clarify the behaviours of :meth:`multiprocessing.Queue.empty` "
"and :meth:`multiprocessing.SimpleQueue.empty` on closed queues. Patch by "
"Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120012`: 澄清了 :meth:`multiprocessing.Queue.empty` 和 "
":meth:`multiprocessing.SimpleQueue.empty` 在关闭队列上的行为。由Bénédikt Tran提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8286
msgid ""
":gh:`119574`: Added some missing environment variables to the output of "
":option:`--help-env`."
msgstr ":gh:`119574`: 添加了一些缺失的环境变量到 :option:`--help-env` 的输出中。"

#: ../NEWS:8289
msgid ""
":issue:`34008`: The :c:func:`Py_Main` documentation moved from the \"Very "
"High Level API\" section to the \"Initialization and Finalization\" section."
msgstr ":issue:`34008`: :c:func:`Py_Main` 文档从\"非常高层次的API\"部分移动到\"初始化和终结\"部分。"

#: ../NEWS:8292
msgid ""
"Also make it explicit that we expect ``Py_Main`` to typically be called "
"instead of ``Py_Initialize`` rather than after it (since ``Py_Main`` makes "
"its own call to ``Py_Initialize``). Document that calling both is supported "
"but is version dependent on which settings will be applied correctly."
msgstr ""
"同时明确指出，我们期望通常调用 ``Py_Main`` 而非 ``Py_Initialize`` 之后调用它（因为 ``Py_Main``会自行调用 "
"``Py_Initialize``）。文档说明同时调用两者是支持的，但具体哪个设置会正确应用取决于版本。"

#: ../NEWS:8301
msgid ""
":gh:`124375`: Fix a crash in the free threading build when the GC runs "
"concurrently with a new thread starting."
msgstr ":gh:`124375`: 修复了在自由线程构建中，当垃圾回收与新线程启动同时进行时发生的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:8304
msgid ""
":gh:`125221`: Fix possible race condition when calling "
":meth:`~object.__reduce_ex__` for the first time in the free threading "
"build."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125221`: 修复了在自由线程构建中首次调用 :meth:`~object.__reduce_ex__` 时可能出现的竞争条件。"

#: ../NEWS:8308
msgid ""
":gh:`125174`: Make the handling of reference counts of immortal objects more"
" robust. Immortal objects with reference counts that deviate from their "
"original reference count by up to a billion (half a billion on 32 bit "
"builds) are still counted as immortal."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125174`: 使对不朽对象引用计数的处理更加健壮。引用计数与原始引用计数偏差高达十亿（32位构建中为五亿）的不朽对象仍被视为不朽。"

#: ../NEWS:8313
msgid ""
":gh:`125039`: Make ``this_instr`` and ``prev_instr`` const in cases "
"generator."
msgstr ":gh:`125039`: 在生成器情况下使 ``this_instr`` 和 ``prev_instr`` 为常量。"

#: ../NEWS:8319
msgid ""
":gh:`125008`: Fix :func:`tokenize.untokenize` producing invalid syntax for "
"double braces preceded by certain escape characters."
msgstr ":gh:`125008`: 修复 :func:`tokenize.untokenize` 在特定转义字符前的双大括号产生无效语法的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:8325
msgid ""
":gh:`124871`: Fix compiler bug (in some versions of 3.13) where an assertion"
" fails during reachability analysis."
msgstr ":gh:`124871`: 修复了在某些3.13版本中，可达性分析期间断言失败的编译器错误。"

#: ../NEWS:8328
msgid ""
":gh:`123378`: Fix a crash in the :meth:`~object.__str__` method of "
":exc:`UnicodeError` objects when the :attr:`UnicodeError.start` and "
":attr:`UnicodeError.end` values are invalid or out-of-range. Patch by "
"Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123378`: 修复了当 :attr:`UnicodeError.start` 和 :attr:`UnicodeError.end` "
"值无效或超出范围时，:exc:`UnicodeError` 对象的 :meth:`~object.__str__` "
"方法崩溃的问题。补丁由Bénédikt Tran提供。"

#: ../NEWS:8333
msgid ""
":gh:`118093`: Improve the experimental JIT compiler's ability to stay \"on "
"trace\" when encountering highly-biased branches."
msgstr ":gh:`118093`: 提高了实验性JIT编译器在遇到高度偏置分支时保持\"在轨迹上\"的能力。"

#: ../NEWS:8336
msgid ""
":gh:`124642`: Fixed scalability issue in free-threaded builds for lock-free "
"reads from dictionaries in multi-threaded scenarios"
msgstr ":gh:`124642`: 修复了在多线程场景中从字典无锁读取的自由线程构建中的可扩展性问题。"

#: ../NEWS:8339
msgid ""
":gh:`116510`: Fix a crash caused by immortal interned strings being shared "
"between sub-interpreters that use basic single-phase init.  In that case, "
"the string can be used by an interpreter that outlives the interpreter that "
"created and interned it.  For interpreters that share obmalloc state, also "
"share the interned dict with the main interpreter."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116510`: "
"修复了由于不朽的内部字符串在使用基本单阶段初始化的子解释器之间共享而导致的崩溃。在这种情况下，字符串可以被创建和内部化它的解释器之外的另一个解释器使用。对于共享obmalloc状态的解释器，也与主解释器共享内部字典。"

#: ../NEWS:8345
msgid ""
":gh:`116510`: Fix a bug that can cause a crash when sub-interpreters use "
"\"basic\" single-phase extension modules.  Shared objects could refer to "
"PyGC_Head nodes that had been freed as part of interpreter cleanup."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116510`: "
"修复了一个当子解释器使用“基本”单阶段扩展模块时可能导致崩溃的bug。共享对象可能引用已被作为解释器清理一部分释放的PyGC_Head节点。"

#: ../NEWS:8349
msgid ""
":gh:`119180`: The ``__main__`` module no longer always contains an "
"``__annotations__`` dictionary in its global namespace."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119180`: ``__main__`` 模块不再总是在其全局命名空间中包含一个 ``__annotations__`` 字典。"

#: ../NEWS:8352
msgid ""
":gh:`124547`: When deallocating an object with inline values whose "
"``__dict__`` is still live: if memory allocation for the inline values "
"fails, clear the dictionary. Prevents an interpreter crash."
msgstr ""
":gh:`124547`: 当解除分配一个内联值对象且其 ``__dict__`` 仍然存活时：如果内联值的内存分配失败，清除字典。防止解释器崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:8356
msgid ""
":gh:`124513`: Fix a crash in FrameLocalsProxy constructor: check the number "
"of arguments. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`124513`: 修复FrameLocalsProxy构造函数中的一个崩溃：检查参数数量。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8359
msgid ""
":gh:`124442`: Fix nondeterminism in compilation by sorting the value of "
":attr:`~type.__static_attributes__`. Patch by kp2pml30."
msgstr ""
":gh:`124442`: 通过排序 :attr:`~type.__static_attributes__` "
"的值来修复编译中的非确定性。补丁由kp2pml30提供。"

#: ../NEWS:8362
msgid ""
":gh:`124285`: Fix bug where ``bool(a)`` can be invoked more than once during"
" the evaluation of a compound boolean expression."
msgstr ":gh:`124285`: 修复了在复合布尔表达式求值期间 ``bool(a)`` 可能被多次调用的bug。"

#: ../NEWS:8365
msgid ""
":gh:`123856`: Fix PyREPL failure when a keyboard interrupt is triggered "
"after using a history search"
msgstr ":gh:`123856`: 修复在使用历史搜索后触发键盘中断时PyREPL失败的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:8368
msgid ""
":gh:`65961`: Deprecate the setting and using ``__package__`` and "
"``__cached__``."
msgstr ":gh:`65961`: 弃用设置和使用 ``__package__`` 和 ``__cached__``。"

#: ../NEWS:8371
msgid ""
":gh:`119726`: The JIT now generates more efficient code for calls to C "
"functions resulting in up to 0.8% memory savings and 1.5% speed improvement "
"on AArch64. Patch by Diego Russo."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119726`: JIT现在为对C函数的调用生成更高效的代码，在AArch64上可实现高达0.8%的内存节省和1.5%的速度提升。由Diego"
" Russo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8375
msgid ""
":gh:`122878`: Use the ``pager`` binary, if available (e.g. on Debian and "
"derivatives), to display REPL ``help()``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122878`: 使用 ``pager`` 二进制文件（如果可用，例如在Debian及其衍生系统上）来显示REPL ``help()``。"

#: ../NEWS:8378
msgid ""
":gh:`124188`: Fix reading and decoding a line from the source file with non-"
"UTF-8 encoding for syntax errors raised in the compiler."
msgstr ":gh:`124188`: 修复了在编译器中引发语法错误时，从使用非UTF-8编码的源文件中读取和解码一行的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:8381
msgid ""
":gh:`124027`: Support ``<page up>``, ``<page down>``, and ``<delete>`` keys "
"in the Python REPL when ``$TERM`` is set to ``vt100``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`124027`: 当 ``$TERM`` 设置为 ``vt100`` 时，在Python REPL中支持 ``<page "
"up>``、``<page down>`` 和 ``<delete>`` 键。"

#: ../NEWS:8384
msgid ""
":gh:`124022`: Fix bug where docstring is removed from classes in interactive"
" mode."
msgstr ":gh:`124022`: 修复了在交互模式下从类中移除文档字符串的bug。"

#: ../NEWS:8387
msgid ""
":gh:`123958`: docstrings are now removed from the optimized AST in "
"optimization level 2."
msgstr ":gh:`123958`: 现在在优化级别2中从优化的AST中移除文档字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:8390
msgid ""
":gh:`123923`: The ``f_executable`` field in the internal "
":c:struct:`_PyInterpreterFrame` struct now uses a tagged pointer. Profilers "
"and debuggers that uses this field should clear the least significant bit to"
" recover the :c:expr:`PyObject*` pointer."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123923`: 内部 :c:struct:`_PyInterpreterFrame` 结构体中的 ``f_executable`` "
"字段现在使用了标记指针。使用此字段的性能分析器和调试器应清除最低有效位以恢复 :c:expr:`PyObject*` 指针。"

#: ../NEWS:8395
msgid ""
":gh:`77894`: Fix possible crash in the garbage collector when it tries to "
"break a reference loop containing a :class:`memoryview` object. Now a "
":class:`!memoryview` object can only be cleared if there are no buffers that"
" refer it."
msgstr ""
":gh:`77894`: 修复了垃圾回收器在尝试断开包含 :class:`memoryview` "
"对象的引用循环时可能发生的崩溃。现在，只有在没有缓冲区引用 :class:`!memoryview` 对象时才能清除它。"

#: ../NEWS:8400
msgid ""
":gh:`120221`: asyncio REPL is now again properly recognizing "
"KeyboardInterrupts. Display of exceptions raised in secondary threads is "
"fixed."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120221`: asyncio REPL 现在再次能够正确识别 "
"KeyboardInterrupts。修复了在次要线程中引发的异常的显示问题。"

#: ../NEWS:8404
msgid ""
":gh:`119310`: Allow the new interactive shell to read history files written "
"with the editline library that use unicode-escaped entries.  Patch by "
"aorcajo and Łukasz Langa."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119310`: 允许新的交互式 shell 读取使用 editline 库编写的、使用 unicode 转义条目的历史文件。由 "
"aorcajo 和 Łukasz Langa 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8408
msgid ""
":gh:`123572`: Fix key mappings for various F-keys in Windows for the new "
"REPL. Patch by devdanzin"
msgstr ":gh:`123572`: 修复了新 REPL 在 Windows 上各种 F 键的键映射问题。由 devdanzin 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8414
msgid ""
":gh:`123614`: Add :func:`turtle.save` to easily save Turtle drawings as "
"PostScript files. Patch by Marie Roald and Yngve Mardal Moe."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123614`: 添加 :func:`turtle.save` 以轻松将 Turtle 绘图保存为 PostScript 文件。由 Marie"
" Roald 和 Yngve Mardal Moe 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8420
msgid ""
":gh:`123339`: Setting the :attr:`!__module__` attribute for a class now "
"removes the ``__firstlineno__`` item from the type's dict, so they will no "
"longer be inconsistent."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123339`: 现在，为类设置 :attr:`!__module__` 属性会从类型的字典中移除 ``__firstlineno__`` "
"项，因此它们不再不一致。"

#: ../NEWS:8424
msgid ""
":gh:`119034`: Change ``<page up>`` and ``<page down>`` keys of the Python "
"REPL to history search forward/backward. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119034`: 将 Python REPL 的 ``<page up>`` 和 ``<page down>`` "
"键更改为向前/向后搜索历史记录。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8427
msgid ""
":gh:`123562`: Improve :exc:`SyntaxError` message for using ``case ... as "
"...`` with not a name."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123562`: 对于使用 ``case ... as ...`` 但不是名称的情况，改进了 :exc:`SyntaxError` 消息。"

#: ../NEWS:8430
msgid ""
":gh:`123545`: Fix a double decref in rare cases on experimental JIT builds."
msgstr ":gh:`123545`: 在实验性 JIT 构建中罕见情况下修复了双重递减引用。"

#: ../NEWS:8432
msgid ""
":gh:`123484`: Fix ``_Py_DebugOffsets`` for long objects to be relative to "
"the start of the object rather than the start of a subobject."
msgstr ":gh:`123484`: 修复 ``_Py_DebugOffsets`` 对于长对象，使其相对于对象的开始而不是子对象的开始。"

#: ../NEWS:8435
msgid ""
":gh:`123446`: Fix empty function name in :exc:`TypeError` when builtin magic"
" methods are used without the required args."
msgstr ":gh:`123446`: 当内置魔术方法在没有必需参数的情况下使用时，修复了 :exc:`TypeError` 中空函数名的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:8438
msgid ""
":gh:`123440`: Improve :exc:`SyntaxError` message for using ``except as`` "
"with not a name."
msgstr ":gh:`123440`: 对于使用 ``except as`` 但不是名称的情况，改进了 :exc:`SyntaxError` 消息。"

#: ../NEWS:8441
msgid ""
":gh:`116017`: Improved JIT memory consumption by periodically freeing memory"
" used by infrequently-executed code. This change is especially likely to "
"improve the memory footprint of long-running programs."
msgstr ":gh:`116017`: 通过定期释放不常执行代码占用的内存，改进了JIT内存消耗。这一改变尤其可能改善长时间运行程序的内存占用。"

#: ../NEWS:8445
msgid ":gh:`123344`: Add AST optimizations for type parameter defaults."
msgstr ":gh:`123344`: 为类型参数默认值添加AST优化。"

#: ../NEWS:8447
msgid ""
":gh:`123321`: Prevent Parser/myreadline race condition from segfaulting on "
"multi-threaded use. Patch by Bar Harel and Amit Wienner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123321`: 防止在多线程使用时Parser/myreadline竞争条件导致段错误。由Bar Harel和Amit "
"Wienner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8450
msgid ""
":gh:`123177`: Fix a bug causing stray prompts to appear in the middle of "
"wrapped lines in the new REPL."
msgstr ":gh:`123177`: 修复了一个导致新REPL中在换行的中间出现杂散提示符的bug。"

#: ../NEWS:8453
msgid ""
":gh:`122982`: Extend the deprecation period for bool inversion (``~``) by "
"two years."
msgstr ":gh:`122982`: 将布尔反演(``~``)的弃用期延长两年。"

#: ../NEWS:8456
msgid ""
":gh:`123271`: Make concurrent iterations over the same :func:`zip` iterator "
"safe under free-threading."
msgstr ":gh:`123271`: 使对同一个 :func:`zip` 迭代器的并发迭代在自由线程下安全。"

#: ../NEWS:8459
msgid ""
":gh:`123275`: Support :option:`-X gil=1 <-X>` and :envvar:`PYTHON_GIL=1 "
"<PYTHON_GIL>` on non-free-threaded builds."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123275`: 在非自由线程构建上支持 :option:`-X gil=1 <-X>` 和 :envvar:`PYTHON_GIL=1 "
"<PYTHON_GIL>`。"

#: ../NEWS:8462
msgid ""
":gh:`123177`: Deactivate line wrap in the Apple Terminal via a ANSI escape "
"code. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":gh:`123177`: 通过ANSI转义代码在Apple终端中停用行换行。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8465
msgid ""
":gh:`123229`: Fix valgrind warning by initializing the f-string buffers to 0"
" in the tokenizer. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`123229`: 通过在分词器中初始化f-string缓冲区为0来修复valgrind警告。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8468
msgid ""
":gh:`122298`: Restore printout of GC stats when "
"``gc.set_debug(gc.DEBUG_STATS)`` is called. This feature was accidentally "
"removed when implementing incremental GC."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122298`: 恢复当调用 ``gc.set_debug(gc.DEBUG_STATS)`` "
"时GC统计信息的打印输出。这一特性在实现增量GC时被意外移除。"

#: ../NEWS:8472
msgid ""
":gh:`121804`: Correctly show error locations when a :exc:`SyntaxError` is "
"raised in the basic REPL. Patch by Sergey B Kirpichev."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121804`: 在基本REPL中引发 :exc:`SyntaxError` 时正确显示错误位置。由Sergey B "
"Kirpichev提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8475
msgid ""
":gh:`115776`: Enables inline values (Python's equivalent of hidden classes) "
"on any class who's instances are of a fixed size."
msgstr ":gh:`115776`: 在任何实例大小固定的类上启用内联值（Python的隐藏类等价物）。"

#: ../NEWS:8478
msgid ""
":gh:`123142`: Fix too-wide source location in exception tracebacks coming "
"from broken iterables in comprehensions."
msgstr ":gh:`123142`: 修复来自理解中损坏的可迭代对象的异常跟踪中过宽的源位置。"

#: ../NEWS:8481
msgid ""
":gh:`123048`: Fix a bug where pattern matching code could emit a "
":opcode:`JUMP_FORWARD` with no source location."
msgstr ":gh:`123048`: 修复一个bug，其中模式匹配代码可能发出没有源位置的 :opcode:`JUMP_FORWARD`。"

#: ../NEWS:8484
msgid ""
":gh:`118093`: Break up ``CALL_ALLOC_AND_ENTER_INIT`` into micro-ops and "
"relax requirement for exact args, in order to increase the amount of code "
"supported by tier 2."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118093`: 将 ``CALL_ALLOC_AND_ENTER_INIT`` 分解为微操作并放宽对精确参数的要求，以增加tier "
"2支持的代码量。"

#: ../NEWS:8488
msgid ""
":gh:`123123`: Fix displaying :exc:`SyntaxError` exceptions covering multiple"
" lines. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":gh:`123123`: 修复显示覆盖多行的 :exc:`SyntaxError` 异常。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8491
msgid ""
":gh:`123083`: Fix a potential use-after-free in ``STORE_ATTR_WITH_HINT``."
msgstr ":gh:`123083`: 修复 ``STORE_ATTR_WITH_HINT`` 中潜在的释放后使用问题。"

#: ../NEWS:8493
msgid ""
":gh:`123022`: Fix crash in free-threaded build when calling "
":c:func:`Py_Initialize` from a non-main thread."
msgstr ":gh:`123022`: 修复在非主线程中调用 :c:func:`Py_Initialize` 时自由线程构建中的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:8496
msgid ":gh:`118093`: Add three specializations for :opcode:`CALL_KW`:"
msgstr ":gh:`118093`: 为 :opcode:`CALL_KW` 添加三个特化版本："

#: ../NEWS:8498
msgid ":opcode:`!CALL_KW_PY` for calls to Python functions"
msgstr ":opcode:`!CALL_KW_PY` 用于调用 Python 函数"

#: ../NEWS:8499
msgid ":opcode:`!CALL_KW_BOUND_METHOD` for calls to bound methods"
msgstr ":opcode:`!CALL_KW_BOUND_METHOD` 用于调用绑定方法"

#: ../NEWS:8500
msgid ":opcode:`!CALL_KW_NON_PY` for all other calls"
msgstr ":opcode:`!CALL_KW_NON_PY` 用于所有其他调用"

#: ../NEWS:8502
msgid ""
":gh:`122821`: Make sure that branches in :keyword:`while` statements have "
"consistent offsets for :mod:`sys.monitoring`. :keyword:`!while` statements "
"are now compiled with a simple jump at the end of the body, instead of "
"duplicating the test."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122821`: 确保 :keyword:`while` 语句中的分支对于 :mod:`sys.monitoring` 有一致的偏移量。现在 "
":keyword:`!while` 语句在主体末尾使用简单跳转编译，而不是重复测试。"

#: ../NEWS:8507
msgid ""
":gh:`122907`: Building with ``HAVE_DYNAMIC_LOADING`` now works as well as it"
" did in 3.12. Existing deficiences will be addressed separately. (See "
"https://github.com/python/cpython/issues/122950.)"
msgstr ""
":gh:`122907`: 使用 ``HAVE_DYNAMIC_LOADING`` 构建现在的工作效果与 3.12 "
"版本相同。现有的不足将单独处理。（参见 https://github.com/python/cpython/issues/122950。）"

#: ../NEWS:8511
msgid ""
":gh:`122888`: Fix crash on certain calls to ``str()`` with positional "
"arguments of the wrong type. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ":gh:`122888`: 修复在错误类型的参数位置调用 ``str()`` 时导致的崩溃。由 Jelle Zijlstra 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8514
msgid ""
":gh:`118093`: Improve the experimental JIT's handling of polymorphic code."
msgstr ":gh:`118093`: 改进实验性 JIT 对多态代码的处理。"

#: ../NEWS:8516
msgid ""
":gh:`122697`: Fixed memory leaks at interpreter shutdown in the free-"
"threaded build, and also reporting of leaked memory blocks via :option:`-X "
"showrefcount <-X>`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122697`: 修复了自由线程构建中解释器关闭时的内存泄漏，以及通过 :option:`-X showrefcount <-X>` "
"报告的内存块泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:8520
msgid ""
":gh:`116622`: Fix Android stdout and stderr messages being truncated or "
"lost."
msgstr ":gh:`116622`: 修复 Android 标准输出和标准错误消息被截断或丢失的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:8522
msgid ""
":gh:`122527`: Fix a crash that occurred when a ``PyStructSequence`` was "
"deallocated after its type's dictionary was cleared by the GC.  The type's "
":c:member:`~PyTypeObject.tp_basicsize` now accounts for non-sequence fields "
"that aren't included in the :c:macro:`Py_SIZE` of the sequence."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122527`: 修复当 ``PyStructSequence`` 在其类型的字典被 GC 清除后被释放时发生的崩溃。该类型的 "
":c:member:`~PyTypeObject.tp_basicsize` 现在计算了不包括在序列的 :c:macro:`Py_SIZE` "
"中的非序列字段。"

#: ../NEWS:8527
msgid ""
":gh:`122445`: Add only fields which are modified via self.* to "
":attr:`~type.__static_attributes__`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122445`: 仅将通过 self.* 修改的字段添加到 :attr:`~type.__static_attributes__`。"

#: ../NEWS:8530
msgid ""
":gh:`122417`: In the free-threaded build, the reference counts for heap type"
" objects are now partially stored in a distributed manner in per-thread "
"arrays.  This reduces contention on the heap type's reference count fields "
"when creating or destroying instances of the same type from multiple threads"
" concurrently."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122417`: "
"在自由线程构建中，堆类型对象的引用计数现在部分以分布式方式存储在每个线程的数组中。这减少了在多个线程同时创建或销毁相同类型的实例时对堆类型引用计数字段的争用。"

#: ../NEWS:8536
msgid ""
":gh:`116090`: Fix an issue in JIT builds that prevented some :keyword:`for` "
"loops from correctly firing :monitoring-event:`RAISE` monitoring events."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116090`: 修复了在JIT构建中阻止某些 :keyword:`for` 循环正确触发 :monitoring-event:`RAISE`"
" 监控事件的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:8539
msgid ""
":gh:`122300`: Preserve AST nodes for f-string with single-element format "
"specifiers. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":gh:`122300`: 保留f-string中单元素格式说明符的AST节点。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8542
msgid ""
":gh:`120906`: :attr:`frame.f_locals` now supports arbitrary hashable objects"
" as keys."
msgstr ":gh:`120906`: :attr:`frame.f_locals` 现在支持任意可哈希对象作为键。"

#: ../NEWS:8545
msgid ""
":gh:`122239`: When a :class:`list`, :class:`tuple` or :class:`dict` with too"
" many elements is unpacked, show the actual length in the error message."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122239`: 当解包的元素过多的 :class:`list`、:class:`tuple` 或 :class:`dict` "
"时，错误消息中会显示实际长度。"

#: ../NEWS:8548
msgid ""
":gh:`122245`: Detection of writes to ``__debug__`` is moved from the "
"compiler's codegen stage to the symtable. This means that these errors are "
"now detected even in code that is optimized away before codegen (such as "
"assertions with the :option:`-O` command line option)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122245`: 将对 ``__debug__`` "
"的写入检测从编译器的代码生成阶段移到了符号表。这意味着现在即使在代码生成之前被优化的代码中（如使用 :option:`-O` "
"命令行选项的断言），也能检测到这些错误。"

#: ../NEWS:8553
msgid ""
":gh:`122234`: Specializations for sums with float and complex inputs in "
":func:`sum` now always use compensated summation.  Also, for integer items "
"in above specializations: :c:func:`PyLong_AsDouble` is used, instead of "
":c:func:`PyLong_AsLongAndOverflow`.  Patch by Sergey B Kirpichev."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122234`: 在 :func:`sum` 中，对于浮点和复数输入的和的特殊化现在总是使用补偿求和。此外，对于上述特殊化中的整数项，使用 "
":c:func:`PyLong_AsDouble` 而不是 :c:func:`PyLong_AsLongAndOverflow`。由Sergey B "
"Kirpichev提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8558
msgid ""
":gh:`122208`: Dictionary watchers now only deliver the PyDict_EVENT_ADDED "
"event when the insertion is in a known good state to succeed."
msgstr ":gh:`122208`: 字典观察器现在仅在插入处于已知良好状态以成功时传递PyDict_EVENT_ADDED事件。"

#: ../NEWS:8561
msgid ""
":gh:`122160`: Remove the ``BUILD_CONST_KEY_MAP`` opcode. Use "
":opcode:`BUILD_MAP` instead."
msgstr ":gh:`122160`: 移除 ``BUILD_CONST_KEY_MAP`` 操作码。改用 :opcode:`BUILD_MAP`。"

#: ../NEWS:8564
msgid ""
":gh:`122029`: Emit ``c_call`` events in :func:`sys.setprofile` when a "
"``PyMethodObject`` pointing to a ``PyCFunction`` is called."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122029`: 在 :func:`sys.setprofile` 中，当调用指向 ``PyCFunction`` 的 "
"``PyMethodObject``时，发出 ``c_call`` 事件。"

#: ../NEWS:8567
msgid ""
":gh:`122026`: Fix a bug that caused the tokenizer to not correctly identify "
"mismatched parentheses inside f-strings in some situations. Patch by Pablo "
"Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`122026`: 修复了一个导致分词器在某些情况下不能正确识别f-string中不匹配括号的错误。补丁由Pablo Galindo提供。"

#: ../NEWS:8571
msgid ""
":gh:`99108`: Python's hashlib now unconditionally uses the vendored HACL* "
"library for Blake2. Python no longer accepts libb2 as an optional dependency"
" for Blake2."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99108`: Python的hashlib现在无条件地使用vendored "
"HACL*库进行Blake2。Python不再接受libb2作为Blake2的可选依赖。"

#: ../NEWS:8575
msgid ""
"We refreshed HACL* to the latest version, and now vendor HACL*'s 128-bit and"
" 256-bit wide vector implementations for Blake2, which are used on x86/x64 "
"toolchains when the required CPU features are available at runtime."
msgstr ""
"我们更新了HACL*至最新版本，现在vendored "
"HACL*的128位和256位宽向量实现用于Blake2，这些实现在x86/x64工具链中，当运行时所需的CPU特性可用时使用。"

#: ../NEWS:8580
msgid ""
"HACL*'s 128-bit wide vector implementation of Blake2 can also run on ARM "
"NEON and Power8, but lacking evidence of a performance gain, these are not "
"enabled (yet)."
msgstr ""
"HACL* 的 Blake2 128位宽向量实现也可以在 ARM NEON 和 Power8 上运行，但由于缺乏性能提升的证据，这些功能尚未启用。"

#: ../NEWS:8587
msgid ""
":gh:`121999`: The default extraction filter for the :mod:`tarfile` module is"
" now set to :func:`'data' <tarfile.data_filter>`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121999`: :mod:`tarfile` 模块的默认提取过滤器现在设置为 :func:`'data' "
"<tarfile.data_filter>`。"

#: ../NEWS:8593
msgid ""
":gh:`121860`: Fix crash when rematerializing a managed dictionary after it "
"was deleted."
msgstr ":gh:`121860`: 修复了在删除后重新实例化托管字典时崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:8596
msgid ""
":gh:`121795`: Improve performance of set membership testing, "
"``set.remove()`` and ``set.discard()`` when the argument is a set."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121795`: 提高了当参数为集合时，集合成员测试、``set.remove()`` 和 ``set.discard()`` 的性能。"

#: ../NEWS:8599
msgid ""
":gh:`121814`: Fixed the SegFault when :c:func:`PyEval_SetTrace` is used with"
" no Python frame on stack."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121814`: 修复了当 :c:func:`PyEval_SetTrace` 在堆栈上没有 Python 帧时使用时导致的段错误。"

#: ../NEWS:8602
msgid ""
":gh:`121295`: Fix PyREPL console getting into a blocked state after "
"interrupting a long paste"
msgstr ":gh:`121295`: 修复了 PyREPL 控制台在中断长粘贴后进入阻塞状态的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:8605
msgid ""
":gh:`121794`: Fix bug in free-threaded Python where a resurrected object "
"could lead to a negative ref count assertion failure."
msgstr ":gh:`121794`: 修复了在自由线程 Python 中，复活对象可能导致引用计数断言失败的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:8608
msgid ""
":gh:`121657`: Improve the :exc:`SyntaxError` message if the user tries to "
"use :keyword:`yield from <yield>` outside a function."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121657`: 如果用户试图在函数外部使用 :keyword:`yield from <yield>`，改进了 "
":exc:`SyntaxError` 的错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:8611
msgid ""
":gh:`121609`: Fix pasting of characters containing unicode character joiners"
" in the new REPL. Patch by Marta Gomez Macias"
msgstr ""
":gh:`121609`: 修复了新 REPL 中包含 Unicode 字符连接符的字符粘贴问题。由 Marta Gomez Macias 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8614
msgid ""
":gh:`121297`: Previously, incorrect usage of :keyword:`await` or "
"asynchronous comprehensions in code removed by the :option:`-O` option was "
"not flagged by the Python compiler. Now, such code raises "
":exc:`SyntaxError`. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121297`: 以前，Python 编译器不会标记由 :option:`-O` 选项移除的代码中 :keyword:`await` "
"或异步推导的错误使用。现在，此类代码会引发 :exc:`SyntaxError`。由 Jelle Zijlstra 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8619
msgid ""
":gh:`117482`: Unexpected slot wrappers are no longer created for builtin "
"static types in subinterpreters."
msgstr ":gh:`117482`: 在子解释器中不再为内置静态类型创建意外的槽包装器。"

#: ../NEWS:8622
msgid ""
":gh:`121562`: Optimized performance of hex_from_char by replacing switch-"
"case with a lookup table"
msgstr ":gh:`121562`: 通过用查找表替换 switch-case 优化了 hex_from_char 的性能。"

#: ../NEWS:8625
msgid ""
":gh:`121499`: Fix a bug affecting how multi-line history was being rendered "
"in the new REPL after interacting with the new screen cache. Patch by Pablo "
"Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`121499`: 修复了一个影响新 REPL 在与新屏幕缓存交互后如何渲染多行历史的错误。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8629
msgid ""
":gh:`121497`: Fix a bug that was preventing the REPL to correctly respect "
"the history when an input hook was set. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":gh:`121497`: 修复了一个阻止 REPL 在设置了输入钩子时正确尊重历史的错误。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8632
msgid ""
":gh:`121012`: Tier 2 execution now ensures that list iterators remain "
"exhausted, once they become exhausted."
msgstr ":gh:`121012`: Tier 2 执行现在确保列表迭代器一旦耗尽就保持耗尽状态。"

#: ../NEWS:8635
msgid ":gh:`121439`: Allow tuples of length 20 in the freelist to be reused."
msgstr ":gh:`121439`: 允许 freelist 中长度为 20 的元组被重用。"

#: ../NEWS:8637
msgid ""
":gh:`121288`: :exc:`ValueError` messages for :meth:`list.index`, "
":meth:`range.index`, :meth:`!deque.index`, :meth:`!deque.remove` and "
":meth:`!ShareableList.index` no longer contain the repr of the searched "
"value (which can be arbitrary large) and are consistent with error messages "
"for other :meth:`~sequence.index` and :meth:`~sequence.remove` methods."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121288`: 针对 :meth:`list.index`, :meth:`range.index`, "
":meth:`!deque.index`, :meth:`!deque.remove` 和 :meth:`!ShareableList.index` 的"
" :exc:`ValueError` 消息不再包含搜索值 的 repr (可能非常大) 并与其他 :meth:`~sequence.index` 和 "
":meth:`~sequence.remove` 方法的错误消息保持一致。"

#: ../NEWS:8644
msgid ""
":gh:`121368`: Fix race condition in ``_PyType_Lookup`` in the free-threaded "
"build due to a missing memory fence.  This could lead to ``_PyType_Lookup`` "
"returning incorrect results on arm64."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121368`: 修复了自由线程构建中由于缺少内存屏障导致的 ``_PyType_Lookup`` 中的竞争条件。这可能导致 "
"``_PyType_Lookup`` 在 arm64 上返回不正确的结果。"

#: ../NEWS:8648
msgid ""
":gh:`121149`: Added specialization for summation of complexes, this also "
"improves accuracy of builtin :func:`sum` for such inputs.  Patch by Sergey B"
" Kirpichev."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121149`: 增加了复数求和的专门处理，这也提高了内置函数 :func:`sum` 对此类输入的准确性。由 Sergey B "
"Kirpichev 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8652
msgid ""
":gh:`121130`: Fix f-strings with debug expressions in format specifiers. "
"Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":gh:`121130`: 修复了格式说明符中使用调试表达式的 f-strings。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8658
msgid ""
":gh:`121381`: Remove ``subprocess._USE_VFORK`` escape hatch code and "
"documentation. It was added just in case, and doesn't have any known cases "
"that require it."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121381`: 移除了 ``subprocess._USE_VFORK`` "
"的应急代码和文档。它只是为了以防万一添加的，并没有任何已知需要使用的情况。"

#: ../NEWS:8665
msgid ""
":gh:`119726`: Optimize code layout for calls to C functions from the JIT on "
"AArch64. Patch by Diego Russo."
msgstr ":gh:`119726`: 优化了 AArch64 上从 JIT 调用 C 函数的代码布局。由 Diego Russo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8668
msgid ""
":gh:`121115`: :c:func:`PyLong_AsNativeBytes` no longer uses "
":meth:`~object.__index__` methods by default. The "
"``Py_ASNATIVEBYTES_ALLOW_INDEX`` flag has been added to allow it."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121115`: :c:func:`PyLong_AsNativeBytes` 默认不再使用 "
":meth:`~object.__index__` 方法。添加了 ``Py_ASNATIVEBYTES_ALLOW_INDEX`` 标志以允许其使用。"

#: ../NEWS:8672
msgid ""
":gh:`120838`: :c:func:`Py_Finalize()` and :c:func:`Py_FinalizeEx()` now "
"always run with the main interpreter active."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120838`: :c:func:`Py_Finalize()` 和 :c:func:`Py_FinalizeEx()` "
"现在总是在主解释器激活状态下运行。"

#: ../NEWS:8675
msgid ""
":gh:`113433`: Subinterpreters now get cleaned up automatically during "
"runtime finalization."
msgstr ":gh:`113433`: 子解释器现在在运行时终止期间自动清理。"

#: ../NEWS:8678
msgid ""
":gh:`119726`: Improve the speed and memory use of C function calls from JIT "
"code on AArch64. Patch by Diego Russo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`119726`: 提高了 AArch64 上从 JIT 代码调用 C 函数的速度和内存使用效率。由 Diego Russo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8681
msgid ""
":gh:`116017`: Simplify the warmup mechanism used for \"side exits\" in JIT "
"code, resulting in slightly better performance and slightly lower memory "
"usage for most platforms."
msgstr ":gh:`116017`: 简化了 JIT 代码中用于“侧退出”的预热机制，从而在大多数平台上实现了稍微更好的性能和稍微更低的内存使用。"

#: ../NEWS:8685
msgid ""
":gh:`98442`: Fix too wide source locations of the cleanup instructions of a "
"with statement."
msgstr ":gh:`98442`: 修复了 with 语句的清理指令的源代码位置过宽的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:8688
msgid ""
":gh:`120754`: Reduce the number of system calls invoked when reading a whole"
" file (ex. ``open('a.txt').read()``). For a sample program that reads the "
"contents of the 400+ ``.rst`` files in the cpython repository ``Doc`` "
"folder, there is an over 10% reduction in system call count."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120754`: 减少读取整个文件时调用的系统调用次数（例如 ``open('a.txt').read()``）。对于一个读取 cpython"
" 仓库 ``Doc`` 文件夹中400多个 ``.rst`` 文件内容的示例程序，系统调用次数减少了超过10%。"

#: ../NEWS:8693
msgid ""
":gh:`119462`: Make sure that invariants of type versioning are maintained: *"
" Superclasses always have their version number assigned before subclasses * "
"The version tag is always zero if the tag is not valid. * The version tag is"
" always non-if the tag is valid."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119462`: 确保类型版本化的不变性得到维护： * 超类总是先于子类分配其版本号 * 如果标签无效，版本标签始终为零。 * "
"如果标签有效，版本标签始终为非零。"

#: ../NEWS:8698
msgid ""
":gh:`120437`: Fix ``_CHECK_STACK_SPACE`` optimization problems introduced in"
" :gh:`118322`."
msgstr ":gh:`120437`: 修复在 :gh:`118322` 中引入的 ``_CHECK_STACK_SPACE`` 优化问题。"

#: ../NEWS:8701
msgid ""
":gh:`120722`: Correctly set the bytecode position on return instructions "
"within lambdas. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ":gh:`120722`: 正确设置 lambda 中返回指令的字节码位置。由 Jelle Zijlstra 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8704
msgid ""
":gh:`120367`: Fix bug where compiler creates a redundant jump during pseudo-"
"op replacement. Can only happen with a synthetic AST that has a try on the "
"same line as the instruction following the exception handler."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120367`: 修复编译器在伪操作替换期间创建冗余跳转的 bug。只有在具有合成 AST 的情况下才会发生，该 AST "
"在异常处理程序之后的指令的同一行上有 try。"

#: ../NEWS:8708
msgid ""
":gh:`120507`: Remove the ``BEFORE_WITH`` and ``BEFORE_ASYNC_WITH`` "
"instructions. Add the new :opcode:`LOAD_SPECIAL` instruction. Generate code "
"for ``with`` and ``async with`` statements using the new instruction."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120507`: 移除 ``BEFORE_WITH`` 和 ``BEFORE_ASYNC_WITH`` 指令。添加新的 "
":opcode:`LOAD_SPECIAL` 指令。使用新指令为 ``with`` 和 ``async with`` 语句生成代码。"

#: ../NEWS:8712
msgid ""
":gh:`113993`: Strings interned with :func:`sys.intern` are again garbage-"
"collected when no longer used, as per the documentation. Strings interned "
"with the C function :c:func:`PyUnicode_InternInPlace` are still immortal. "
"Internals of the string interning mechanism have been changed. This may "
"affect performance and identities of :class:`str` objects."
msgstr ""
":gh:`113993`: 根据文档，使用 :func:`sys.intern` 内联的字符串在不再使用时再次被垃圾回收。使用 C 函数 "
":c:func:`PyUnicode_InternInPlace` 内联的字符串仍然是不朽的。字符串内联机制的内部已经改变。这可能会影响 "
":class:`str` 对象的性能和身份。"

#: ../NEWS:8721
msgid ""
":gh:`120485`: Add an override of ``allow_reuse_port`` on classes subclassing"
" ``socketserver.TCPServer`` where ``allow_reuse_address`` is also "
"overridden."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120485`: 在继承 ``socketserver.TCPServer`` 的类上添加 ``allow_reuse_port`` "
"的重写，其中 ``allow_reuse_address`` 也被重写。"

#: ../NEWS:8728
msgid ""
":gh:`120384`: Fix an array out of bounds crash in ``list_ass_subscript``, "
"which could be invoked via some specifically tailored input: including "
"concurrent modification of a list object, where one thread assigns a slice "
"and another clears it."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120384`: 修复 ``list_ass_subscript`` "
"中的数组越界崩溃，这可能是通过一些特别定制的输入调用的：包括对列表对象的并发修改，其中一个线程分配一个切片，另一个线程清除它。"

#: ../NEWS:8733
msgid ""
":gh:`120367`: Fix crash in compiler on code with redundant NOPs and JUMPs "
"which show up after exception handlers are moved to the end of the code."
msgstr ":gh:`120367`: 修复编译器在对包含冗余NOP和JUMP的代码（这些代码在异常处理程序移动到代码末尾后出现）时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:8739
msgid ""
":gh:`120380`: Fix Python implementation of :class:`pickle.Pickler` for "
":class:`bytes` and :class:`bytearray` objects when using protocol version 5."
" Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120380`: 修复使用协议版本5时，:class:`pickle.Pickler` 对 :class:`bytes` 和 "
":class:`bytearray` 对象的Python实现。由Bénédikt Tran提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8746
msgid ""
":gh:`120397`: Improve the throughput by up to two times for the "
":meth:`str.count`, :meth:`bytes.count` and :meth:`bytearray.count` methods "
"for counting single characters."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120397`: 对于 :meth:`str.count`, :meth:`bytes.count` 和 "
":meth:`bytearray.count` 方法在计数单个字符时的吞吐量提高了最多两倍。"

#: ../NEWS:8750
msgid ""
":gh:`120221`: Deliver real signals on Ctrl-C and Ctrl-Z in the new REPL. "
"Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":gh:`120221`: 在新的REPL中，对Ctrl-C和Ctrl-Z传递真实的信号。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8753
msgid ""
":gh:`120346`: Respect :envvar:`PYTHON_BASIC_REPL` when running in "
"interactive inspect mode (``python -i``). Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`120346`: 在交互式检查模式下运行（``python -i``）时，尊重 "
":envvar:`PYTHON_BASIC_REPL`。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8756
msgid ""
":gh:`93691`: Fix source locations of instructions generated for the iterator"
" of a for statement."
msgstr ":gh:`93691`: 修复为for语句的迭代器生成的指令的源代码位置。"

#: ../NEWS:8759
msgid ""
":gh:`120198`: Fix a crash when multiple threads read and write to the same "
"``__class__`` of an object concurrently."
msgstr ":gh:`120198`: 修复多个线程同时读写同一对象的 ``__class__`` 时发生的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:8762
msgid ""
":gh:`120298`: Fix use-after free in ``list_richcompare_impl`` which can be "
"invoked via some specifically tailored evil input."
msgstr ":gh:`120298`: 修复在通过某些特别设计的恶意输入调用时，``list_richcompare_impl``中的使用后释放问题。"

#: ../NEWS:8765
msgid ""
":gh:`119666`: Fix a compiler crash in the case where two comprehensions in "
"class scope both reference ``__class__``."
msgstr ":gh:`119666`: 修复在类作用域中两个推导式都引用 ``__class__`` 的情况下编译器崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:8768
msgid ""
":gh:`119726`: JIT: Re-use trampolines on AArch64 when creating stencils. "
"Patch by Diego Russo"
msgstr ":gh:`119726`: JIT: 在AArch64上创建模具时重复使用跳板。由Diego Russo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8771
msgid ""
":gh:`120225`: Fix crash in compiler on empty block at end of exception "
"handler."
msgstr ":gh:`120225`: 修复在异常处理程序末尾的空块上编译器崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:8774
msgid ""
":gh:`93691`: Fix source locations of instructions generated for with "
"statements."
msgstr ":gh:`93691`: 修复为with语句生成的指令的源代码位置。"

#: ../NEWS:8777
msgid ""
":gh:`120097`: ``FrameLocalsProxy`` now subclasses "
"``collections.abc.Mapping`` and can be matched as a mapping in ``match`` "
"statements"
msgstr ""
":gh:`120097`: ``FrameLocalsProxy`` 现在继承自 ``collections.abc.Mapping``，并且可以在 "
"``match`` 语句中作为映射进行匹配。"

#: ../NEWS:8780
msgid ""
":gh:`120080`: Direct call to the :meth:`!int.__round__` now accepts ``None``"
" as a valid argument."
msgstr ":gh:`120080`: 直接调用 :meth:`!int.__round__` 现在接受 ``None`` 作为有效参数。"

#: ../NEWS:8783
msgid ""
":gh:`119933`: Improve :exc:`SyntaxError` messages for invalid expressions in"
" a type parameters bound, a type parameter constraint tuple or a default "
"type parameter. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119933`: 改善了类型参数边界、类型参数约束元组或默认类型参数中无效表达式的 :exc:`SyntaxError` "
"消息。由Bénédikt Tran提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8787
msgid ""
":gh:`119724`: Reverted improvements to error messages for ``elif``/``else`` "
"statements not matching any valid statements, which made in hard to locate "
"the syntax errors inside those ``elif``/``else`` blocks."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119724`: "
"撤销了对`elif`/`else`语句不匹配任何有效语句的错误消息的改进，这些改进使得在这些`elif`/`else`块中定位语法错误变得困难。"

#: ../NEWS:8791
msgid ""
":gh:`119879`: String search is now slightly faster for certain cases. It now"
" utilizes last character gap (good suffix rule) for two-way periodic "
"needles."
msgstr ":gh:`119879`: 字符串搜索在某些情况下现在稍微快了一些。现在它利用最后字符间隙（好后缀规则）来处理双向周期针。"

#: ../NEWS:8795
msgid ""
":gh:`119842`: Honor :c:func:`PyOS_InputHook` in the new REPL. Patch by Pablo"
" Galindo"
msgstr ":gh:`119842`: 在新的REPL中尊重 :c:func:`PyOS_InputHook`。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:8798
msgid ""
":gh:`119180`: :func:`classmethod` and :func:`staticmethod` now wrap the "
":attr:`~object.__annotations__` and :attr:`~object.__annotate__` attributes "
"of their underlying callable lazily. See :pep:`649`. Patch by Jelle "
"Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119180`: :func:`classmethod` 和 :func:`staticmethod` 现在懒加载地包装它们底层可调用对象的 "
":attr:`~object.__annotations__` 和 :attr:`~object.__annotate__` 属性。参见 "
":pep:`649`。由Jelle Zijlstra提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8803
msgid ""
":gh:`119821`: Fix execution of :ref:`annotation scopes <annotation-scopes>` "
"within classes when ``globals`` is set to a non-dict. Patch by Jelle "
"Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119821`: 修复了当`globals`设置为非字典时在类内部执行 :ref:`annotation scopes "
"<annotation-scopes>` 的问题。由Jelle Zijlstra提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8807
msgid ":gh:`118934`: Make ``PyEval_GetLocals`` return borrowed reference"
msgstr ":gh:`118934`: 使 ``PyEval_GetLocals`` 返回借用引用"

#: ../NEWS:8809
msgid ""
":gh:`119740`: Remove the previously-deprecated delegation of :func:`int` to "
":meth:`~object.__trunc__`."
msgstr ":gh:`119740`: 移除了之前弃用的 :func:`int` 对 :meth:`~object.__trunc__` 的委托。"

#: ../NEWS:8812
msgid ""
":gh:`119689`: Generate stack effect metadata for pseudo instructions from "
"bytecodes.c."
msgstr ":gh:`119689`: 为来自bytecodes.c的伪指令生成堆栈效果元数据。"

#: ../NEWS:8815
msgid ""
":gh:`109218`: :func:`complex` accepts now a string only as a positional "
"argument. Passing a complex number as the \"real\" or \"imag\" argument is "
"deprecated; it should only be passed as a single positional argument."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109218`: :func:`complex` "
"现在仅接受字符串作为位置参数。传递复数作为\"real\"或\"imag\"参数已被弃用；它应该仅作为单个位置参数传递。"

#: ../NEWS:8819
msgid ""
":gh:`119548`: Add a ``clear`` command to the REPL. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":gh:`119548`: 向REPL添加了一个 ``clear`` 命令。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:8821
msgid ":gh:`111999`: Fix the signature of :meth:`str.format_map`."
msgstr ":gh:`111999`: 修复了 :meth:`str.format_map` 的签名。"

#: ../NEWS:8823
msgid ""
":gh:`119560`: An invalid assert in beta 1 has been removed.  The assert "
"would fail if ``PyState_FindModule()`` was used in an extension module's "
"init function before the module def had been initialized."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119560`: 移除了beta 1中的一个无效断言。如果在扩展模块的init函数中，在模块定义初始化之前使用 "
"``PyState_FindModule()``，该断言会失败。"

#: ../NEWS:8827
msgid ""
":gh:`119369`: Fix deadlock during thread deletion in free-threaded build, "
"which could occur when the GIL was enabled at runtime."
msgstr ":gh:`119369`: 修复了在自由线程构建中线程删除期间的死锁问题，该问题可能在运行时启用GIL时发生。"

#: ../NEWS:8830
msgid ""
":gh:`119525`: Fix deadlock involving ``_PyType_Lookup()`` cache in the free-"
"threaded build when the GIL is dynamically enabled at runtime."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119525`: 修复了在自由线程构建中，当GIL在运行时动态启用时，涉及 ``_PyType_Lookup()`` 缓存的死锁问题。"

#: ../NEWS:8833
msgid ""
":gh:`119258`: Eliminate type version guards in the tier two interpreter."
msgstr ":gh:`119258`: 在第二层解释器中消除了类型版本守卫。"

#: ../NEWS:8835
msgid ""
"Note that setting the ``tp_version_tag`` manually (which has never been "
"supported) may result in crashes."
msgstr "请注意，手动设置 ``tp_version_tag`` (从未被支持过) 可能会导致崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:8838
msgid ""
":gh:`119311`: Fix bug where names are unexpectedly mangled in the bases of "
"generic classes."
msgstr ":gh:`119311`: 修复了泛型类基类中名称意外被篡改的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:8841
msgid ""
":gh:`119395`: Fix bug where names appearing after a generic class are "
"mangled as if they are in the generic class."
msgstr ":gh:`119395`: 修复了泛型类后出现的名称被篡改为泛型类中的名称的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:8844
msgid ""
":gh:`119372`: Correct invalid corner cases in complex division (resulted in "
"``(nan+nanj)`` output), e.g.  ``1/complex('(inf+infj)')``.  Patch by Sergey "
"B Kirpichev."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119372`: 更正了复数除法中的无效极端情况（导致 ``(nan+nanj)`` 输出），例如 "
"``1/complex('(inf+infj)')``。由 Sergey B Kirpichev 提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8848
msgid ""
":gh:`119180`: Evaluation of annotations is now deferred. See :pep:`649` for "
"details."
msgstr ":gh:`119180`: 现在推迟了注解的评估。详情参见 :pep:`649`。"

#: ../NEWS:8851
msgid ""
":gh:`119180`: Replace :opcode:`!LOAD_ASSERTION_ERROR` opcode with "
":opcode:`LOAD_COMMON_CONSTANT` and add support for "
":exc:`NotImplementedError`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119180`: 用 :opcode:`LOAD_COMMON_CONSTANT` 替换 "
":opcode:`!LOAD_ASSERTION_ERROR` 操作码，并添加对 :exc:`NotImplementedError` 的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:8855
msgid ""
":gh:`119213`: Non-builtin modules built with argument clinic were crashing "
"if used in a subinterpreter before the main interpreter.  The objects that "
"were causing the problem by leaking between interpreters carelessly have "
"been fixed."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119213`: 如果在主解释器之前用于子解释器中，使用参数诊所构建的非内置模块会崩溃。已修复因对象在不同解释器之间不小心泄露而导致的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:8860
msgid ""
":gh:`119011`: Fixes ``type.__type_params__`` to return an empty tuple "
"instead of a descriptor."
msgstr ":gh:`119011`: 修复 ``type.__type_params__`` 返回空元组而非描述符的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:8863
msgid ""
":gh:`118692`: Avoid creating unnecessary :exc:`StopIteration` instances for "
"monitoring."
msgstr ":gh:`118692`: 为避免监控创建不必要的 :exc:`StopIteration` 实例。"

#: ../NEWS:8866
msgid ""
":gh:`119180`: Add an ``__annotate__`` attribute to functions, classes, and "
"modules as part of :pep:`649`. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119180`: 作为 :pep:`649` 的一部分，向函数、类和模块添加 ``__annotate__`` 属性。由 Jelle "
"Zijlstra 提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8869
msgid ""
":gh:`119049`: Fix displaying the source line for warnings created by the C "
"API if the :mod:`warnings` module had not yet been imported."
msgstr ":gh:`119049`: 如果 :mod:`warnings` 模块尚未导入，修复由 C API 创建的警告的源代码行显示。"

#: ../NEWS:8872
msgid ""
":gh:`119057`: Improve :exc:`ZeroDivisionError` error message. Now, all error"
" messages are harmonized: all ``/``, ``//``, and ``%`` operations just use "
"\"division by zero\" message. And ``0 ** -1`` operation uses \"zero to a "
"negative power\"."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119057`: 改进 :exc:`ZeroDivisionError` 错误消息。现在，所有错误消息都统一：所有 ``/``、``//`` "
"和 ``%`` 操作只使用“除以零”消息。而 ``0 ** -1`` 操作使用“零的负幂”。"

#: ../NEWS:8877
msgid ""
":gh:`118844`: Fix build failures when configuring with both ``--disable-"
"gil`` and ``--enable-experimental-jit``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118844`: 修复同时配置 ``--disable-gil`` 和 ``--enable-experimental-jit`` "
"时的构建失败。"

#: ../NEWS:8880
msgid ""
":gh:`118921`: Add ``copy()`` method for ``FrameLocalsProxy`` which returns a"
" snapshot ``dict`` for local variables."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118921`: 为 ``FrameLocalsProxy`` 添加 ``copy()`` 方法，该方法返回局部变量的快照 ``dict``。"

#: ../NEWS:8883
msgid ""
":gh:`117657`: Fix data races on the field that stores a pointer to the "
"interpreter's main thread that occur in free-threaded builds."
msgstr ":gh:`117657`: 修复在自由线程构建中发生的指向解释器主线程的指针字段上的数据竞争。"

#: ../NEWS:8886
msgid ""
":gh:`118750`: If the C version of the ``decimal`` module is available, "
"``int(str)`` now uses it to supply an asymptotically much faster conversion."
" However, this only applies if the string contains over about 2 million "
"digits."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118750`: 如果 ``decimal`` 模块的 C 版本可用，``int(str)`` "
"现在使用它来提供渐近更快的转换。然而，这仅适用于字符串包含超过约200万位数字的情况。"

#: ../NEWS:8891
msgid ""
":gh:`118767`: Using :data:`NotImplemented` in a boolean context now raises "
":exc:`TypeError`. Contributed by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118767`: 在布尔上下文中使用 :data:`NotImplemented` 现在会引发 :exc:`TypeError`。由 "
"Jelle Zijlstra 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:8894
msgid ""
":gh:`118561`: Fix race condition in free-threaded build where "
":meth:`list.extend` could expose uninitialised memory to concurrent readers."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118561`: 修复在自由线程构建版中的竞争条件问题，即 :meth:`list.extend` 可能会将未初始化的内存暴露给并发读取器。"

#: ../NEWS:8898
msgid ""
":gh:`117139`: Convert the Python evaluation stack to use internal stack "
"references. The purpose is to support tagged pointers. In :pep:`703`, this "
"will allow for its form of deferred reference counting. For both the default"
" and free-threaded builds, this sets up the infrastructure for unboxed "
"integers in the future."
msgstr ""
":gh:`117139`: 将 Python 评估栈转换为使用内部栈引用。目的是支持标记指针。在 :pep:`703` "
"中，这将允许其形式的延迟引用计数。对于默认和自由线程构建，这为未来未装箱整数设置了基础设施。"

#: ../NEWS:8907
msgid ""
":gh:`115801`: Raise ``TypeError`` when passing a string to "
":func:`difflib.unified_diff` and :func:`difflib.context_diff`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115801`: 当向 :func:`difflib.unified_diff` 和 :func:`difflib.context_diff`"
" 传递字符串时，引发 ``TypeError``。"

#: ../NEWS:8913
msgid ""
":gh:`117558`: Improve error messages when a string, bytes or bytearray "
"object of length 1 is expected."
msgstr ":gh:`117558`: 当期望长度为1的字符串、字节或字节数组对象时，改进错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:8916
msgid ""
":gh:`117195`: Avoid assertion failure for debug builds when calling "
"``object.__sizeof__(1)``"
msgstr ":gh:`117195`: 在调试构建中调用 ``object.__sizeof__(1)`` 时避免断言失败。"

#: ../NEWS:8919
msgid ""
":gh:`116022`: Improve the :meth:`~object.__repr__` output of "
":class:`~ast.AST` nodes."
msgstr ":gh:`116022`: 改进 :class:`~ast.AST` 节点的 :meth:`~object.__repr__` 输出。"

#: ../NEWS:8922
msgid ""
":gh:`114091`: Changed the error message for awaiting something that can't be"
" awaited from \"object <type> can't be used in an await expression\" to "
"\"'<type>' object can't be awaited\"."
msgstr ":gh:`114091`: 将无法等待的对象的错误消息从“对象 <type> 不能用于等待表达式”更改为“‘<type>’对象不能等待”。"

#: ../NEWS:8926
msgid ":gh:`113190`: :c:func:`Py_Finalize` now deletes all interned strings."
msgstr ":gh:`113190`: :c:func:`Py_Finalize` 现在删除所有内部字符串。"

