#: ../NEWS:9116
msgid ""
":gh:`119775`: Creating :c:data:`immutable types <Py_TPFLAGS_IMMUTABLETYPE>` "
"with mutable bases was deprecated since 3.12 and now raises a "
":exc:`TypeError`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119775`: 创建 :c:data:`不可变类型 <Py_TPFLAGS_IMMUTABLETYPE>` 时使用可变基类自 3.12 "
"起已被弃用，现在会引发 :exc:`TypeError`。"

#: ../NEWS:9120
msgid ""
":gh:`119585`: Fix crash when a thread state that was created by "
":c:func:`PyGILState_Ensure` calls a destructor that during "
":c:func:`PyThreadState_Clear` that calls back into "
":c:func:`PyGILState_Ensure` and :c:func:`PyGILState_Release`. This might "
"occur when in the free-threaded build or when using thread-local variables "
"whose destructors call :c:func:`PyGILState_Ensure`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119585`: 修复当由 :c:func:`PyGILState_Ensure` 创建的线程状态在 "
":c:func:`PyThreadState_Clear` 过程中调用一个析构函数，该析构函数又回调到 "
":c:func:`PyGILState_Ensure` 和 :c:func:`PyGILState_Release` "
"时崩溃的问题。这可能在自由线程构建中发生，或者在使用线程局部变量时，这些变量的析构函数调用了 :c:func:`PyGILState_Ensure`。"

#: ../NEWS:9127
msgid ""
":gh:`119613`: Macros ``Py_IS_NAN``, ``Py_IS_INFINITY`` and ``Py_IS_FINITE`` "
"are :term:`soft deprecated`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119613`: 宏 ``Py_IS_NAN``, ``Py_IS_INFINITY`` 和 ``Py_IS_FINITE`` 被 "
":term:`软弃用 <soft deprecated>`。"

#: ../NEWS:9130
msgid ""
":gh:`119336`: Restore the removed ``_PyLong_NumBits()`` function. It is used"
" by the pywin32 project. Patch by Ethan Smith"
msgstr ""
":gh:`119336`: 恢复被移除的 ``_PyLong_NumBits()`` 函数。pywin32 项目使用了它。由 Ethan Smith "
"提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:9133
msgid ""
":gh:`119344`: The critical section API is now public as part of the non-"
"limited C API."
msgstr ":gh:`119344`: 临界区 API 现在作为非限制 C API 的一部分公开。"

#: ../NEWS:9136
msgid ""
":gh:`119333`: Add :c:func:`PyContext_AddWatcher` and "
":c:func:`PyContext_ClearWatcher` APIs to register callbacks to receive "
"notification on enter and exit of context objects."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119333`: 添加 :c:func:`PyContext_AddWatcher` 和 "
":c:func:`PyContext_ClearWatcher` API 来注册回调，以接收进入和退出上下文对象的通知。"

#: ../NEWS:9140
msgid ""
":gh:`119247`: Added ``Py_BEGIN_CRITICAL_SECTION_SEQUENCE_FAST`` and "
"``Py_END_CRITICAL_SECTION_SEQUENCE_FAST`` macros to make it possible to use "
"PySequence_Fast APIs safely when free-threaded, and update str.join to work "
"without the GIL using them."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119247`: 添加 ``Py_BEGIN_CRITICAL_SECTION_SEQUENCE_FAST`` 和 "
"``Py_END_CRITICAL_SECTION_SEQUENCE_FAST`` 宏，使得在自由线程时安全使用 PySequence_Fast API"
" 成为可能，并更新 str.join 以在不使用 GIL 的情况下工作。"

#: ../NEWS:9145
msgid ""
":gh:`111389`: Add :c:macro:`PyHASH_MULTIPLIER` constant: prime multiplier "
"used in string and various other hashes. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111389`: 添加 :c:macro:`PyHASH_MULTIPLIER` 常量：用于字符串和各种其他哈希的素数乘数。由 Victor "
"Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9148
msgid ""
":gh:`118771`: Several C declarations with names that didn't start with the "
"``Py`` or ``_Py`` prefixes, which were added by mistake in 3.13 alpha and "
"beta releases, were moved to internal headers."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118771`: 几个名称不以 ``Py`` 或 ``_Py`` 前缀开头的 C 声明，这些声明在 3.13 alpha 和 beta "
"版本中被错误地添加，已被移动到内部头文件。"

#: ../NEWS:9152
msgid ""
":gh:`116984`: Make mimalloc includes relative to the current file to avoid "
"embedders or extensions needing to include ``Internal/mimalloc`` if they are"
" already including internal CPython headers."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116984`: 使 mimalloc 包含相对于当前文件的路径，以避免嵌入者或扩展需要包含 "
"``Internal/mimalloc``，如果它们已经在包含内部 CPython 头文件。"

#: ../NEWS:9156
msgid ""
":gh:`118789`: Add :c:func:`PyUnstable_Object_ClearWeakRefsNoCallbacks`, "
"which clears weakrefs without calling their callbacks."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118789`: 添加 "
":c:func:`PyUnstable_Object_ClearWeakRefsNoCallbacks`，它会清除弱引用而不调用它们的回调。"

#: ../NEWS:9159
msgid ""
":gh:`118789`: Restore ``_PyWeakref_ClearRef`` that was previously removed in"
" Python 3.13 alpha 1."
msgstr ":gh:`118789`: 恢复之前 Python 3.13 alpha 1 中移除的 ``_PyWeakref_ClearRef``。"

#: ../NEWS:9162
msgid ""
":gh:`117511`: Make the :c:type:`PyMutex` public in the non-limited C API."
msgstr ":gh:`117511`: 将 :c:type:`PyMutex` 在非限制 C API 中公开。"

#: ../NEWS:9164
msgid ""
":gh:`116560`: Add :c:func:`PyLong_GetSign` function.  Patch by Sergey B "
"Kirpichev."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116560`: 添加 :c:func:`PyLong_GetSign` 函数。由 Sergey B Kirpichev 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9167
msgid ""
":gh:`97588`: Fix creating bitfields in :mod:`ctypes` structures and unions. "
"Fields no longer overlap."
msgstr ":gh:`97588`: 修复在 :mod:`ctypes` 结构和联合中创建位字段的问题。字段不再重叠。"

#: ../NEWS:9170
msgid ""
":gh:`87135`: Attempting to acquire the GIL after runtime finalization has "
"begun in a different thread now causes the thread to hang rather than "
"terminate, which avoids potential crashes or memory corruption caused by "
"attempting to terminate a thread that is running code not specifically "
"designed to support termination. In most cases this hanging is harmless "
"since the process will soon exit anyway."
msgstr ""
":gh:`87135`: 在运行时终结已在另一线程开始时尝试获取 GIL "
"现在会导致线程挂起而非终止，这避免了因尝试终止一个正在运行代码的线程而可能导致的崩溃或内存损坏，这些代码并非专门设计来支持终止。在大多数情况下，这种挂起是无害的，因为进程很快就会退出。"

#: ../NEWS:9177
msgid ""
"The ``PyThread_exit_thread`` function is now deprecated.  Its behavior is "
"inconsistent across platforms, and it can only be used safely in the "
"unlikely case that every function in the entire call stack has been designed"
" to support the platform-dependent termination mechanism.  It is recommended"
" that users of this function change their design to not require thread "
"termination.  In the unlikely case that thread termination is needed and can"
" be done safely, users may migrate to calling platform-specific APIs such as"
" ``pthread_exit`` (POSIX) or ``_endthreadex`` (Windows) directly."
msgstr ""
"``PyThread_exit_thread`` "
"函数现已弃用。其行为在平台间不一致，且只有在极不可能的情况下才能安全使用，即整个调用堆栈中的每个函数都已设计为支持平台依赖的终止机制。建议使用此函数的用户更改其设计，不再需要线程终止。在极不可能需要线程终止且可以安全完成的情况下，用户可以迁移到直接调用特定平台的"
" API，如 ``pthread_exit`` (POSIX) 或 ``_endthreadex`` (Windows) 。"

#: ../NEWS:9187
msgid ""
":issue:`34008`: Added ``Py_IsInitialized`` to the list of APIs that are safe"
" to call before the interpreter is initialized, and updated the embedding "
"tests to cover it."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34008`: 将 ``Py_IsInitialized`` 添加到解释器初始化前可以安全调用的 API "
"列表中，并更新了嵌入测试以覆盖此功能。"

#: ../NEWS:9194
msgid ""
":gh:`125269`: Fix detection of whether ``-latomic`` is needed when cross-"
