msgstr ":gh:`125269`: 修复在使用配置脚本交叉编译 CPython 时是否需要 ``-latomic`` 的检测。"

#: ../NEWS:9197
msgid ""
":gh:`123990`: Remove ``WITH_FREELISTS`` macro and ``--without-freelists`` "
