msgid "Python 3.13.0 beta 1"
msgstr "Python 3.13.0 beta 1"

#: ../NEWS:9299
msgid "*Release date: 2024-05-08*"
msgstr "*发布日期：2024-05-08*"

#: ../NEWS:9304
msgid ":gh:`116741`: Update bundled libexpat to 2.6.2"
msgstr ":gh:`116741`: 更新捆绑的 libexpat 到 2.6.2"

#: ../NEWS:9306
msgid ""
":gh:`117233`: Detect BLAKE2, SHA3, Shake, & truncated SHA512 support in the "
"OpenSSL-ish libcrypto library at build time.  This allows :mod:`hashlib` to "
"be used with libraries that do not to support every algorithm that upstream "
