#: ../NEWS:9369
msgid ""
":gh:`118473`: Fix :func:`sys.set_asyncgen_hooks` not to be partially set "
"when raising :exc:`TypeError`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118473`: 修复 :func:`sys.set_asyncgen_hooks` 在引发 :exc:`TypeError` "
"时部分设置的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:9372
msgid ""
":gh:`118465`: Compiler populates the new ``__firstlineno__`` field on a "
"class with the line number of the first line of the class definition."
msgstr ":gh:`118465`: 编译器在类上填充新的 `__firstlineno__` 字段，该字段包含类定义的第一行的行号。"

#: ../NEWS:9375
