msgstr ""
":gh:`74929`: 实现PEP 667：转换 :attr:`FrameType.f_locals <frame.f_locals>` 和 "
":c:func:`PyFrame_GetLocals`，当帧引用函数或推导式时返回一个直写代理对象。"

#: ../NEWS:9392
msgid ""
":gh:`116767`: Fix crash in compiler on 'async with' that has many context "
"managers."
msgstr ":gh:`116767`: 修复编译器在'async with'具有许多上下文管理器时崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:9395
msgid ""
":gh:`118335`: Change how to use the tier 2 interpreter. Instead of running "
"Python with ``-X uops`` or setting the environment variable "
"``PYTHON_UOPS=1``, this choice is now made at build time by configuring with"
" ``--enable-experimental-jit=interpreter``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118335`: 改变如何使用第2层解释器。现在通过配置 `--enable-experimental-jit=interpreter` "
"在构建时做出此选择，而不是通过运行Python时使用 `-X uops` 或设置环境变量 `PYTHON_UOPS=1`。"

#: ../NEWS:9400
msgid ""
"**Beware!** This changes the environment variable to enable or disable "
"micro-ops to ``PYTHON_JIT``. The old ``PYTHON_UOPS`` is no longer used."
msgstr "**注意！** 这将用于启用或禁用微操作的环境变量更改为 `PYTHON_JIT`。旧的 `PYTHON_UOPS` 不再使用。"

#: ../NEWS:9403
msgid ":gh:`118306`: Update JIT compilation to use LLVM 18"
msgstr ":gh:`118306`: 更新JIT编译以使用LLVM 18"

#: ../NEWS:9405
msgid ""
":gh:`118160`: :ref:`Annotation scopes <annotation-scopes>` within classes "
"can now contain comprehensions. However, such comprehensions are not inlined"
" into their parent scope at runtime. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118160`: 类内的 :ref:`Annotation scopes <annotation-scopes>` "
"现在可以包含推导式。不过，这样的推导式在运行时不会内联到其父作用域中。由Jelle Zijlstra提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9409
msgid ""
":gh:`118272`: Fix bug where ``generator.close`` does not free the generator "
"frame's locals."
msgstr ":gh:`118272`: 修复了 ``generator.close`` 不释放生成器帧局部变量的bug。"

#: ../NEWS:9412
msgid ""
":gh:`118216`: Don't consider :mod:`__future__` imports with dots before the "
"module name."
msgstr ":gh:`118216`: 不考虑模块名前带点的 :mod:`__future__` 导入。"

#: ../NEWS:9415
msgid ""
":gh:`118074`: Make sure that the Executor objects in the COLD_EXITS array "
"aren't assumed to be GC-able (which would access bytes outside the object)."
msgstr ":gh:`118074`: 确保COLD_EXITS数组中的Executor对象不会被假定为可GC的（这会访问对象之外的字节）。"

#: ../NEWS:9419
msgid ""
":gh:`107674`: Lazy load frame line number to improve performance of tracing"
msgstr ":gh:`107674`: 延迟加载帧行号以提高追踪性能"

#: ../NEWS:9421
msgid ""
":gh:`118082`: Improve :exc:`SyntaxError` message for imports without names, "
"like in ``from x import`` and ``import`` cases. It now points out to users "
"that :keyword:`import` expects at least one name after it."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118082`: 改进了对于没有名称的导入（如 ``from x import`` 和 ``import`` 情况）的 "
":exc:`SyntaxError` 消息。现在它会向用户指出 :keyword:`import` 期望其后至少有一个名称。"

#: ../NEWS:9425
msgid ""
":gh:`118090`: Improve :exc:`SyntaxError` message for empty type param "
"brackets."
msgstr ":gh:`118090`: 改进了对于空类型参数括号的 :exc:`SyntaxError` 消息。"

#: ../NEWS:9428
msgid ""
":gh:`117958`: Added a ``get_jit_code()`` method to access JIT compiled "
"machine code from the UOp Executor when the experimental JIT is enabled. "
"Patch by Anthony Shaw."
msgstr ""
":gh:`117958`: 添加了一个 ``get_jit_code()`` 方法，当实验性JIT启用时，用于从UOp "
"Executor访问JIT编译的机器代码。由Anthony Shaw提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9432
msgid ""
":gh:`117901`: Add option for compiler's codegen to save nested instruction "
"sequences for introspection."
msgstr ":gh:`117901`: 为编译器的代码生成添加了一个选项，用于保存嵌套指令序列以供内省。"

#: ../NEWS:9435
msgid ""
":gh:`116622`: Redirect stdout and stderr to system log when embedded in an "
"Android app."
msgstr ":gh:`116622`: 当嵌入到Android应用中时，将stdout和stderr重定向到系统日志。"

#: ../NEWS:9438
msgid ""
":gh:`109118`: :ref:`annotation scope <annotation-scopes>` within class "
"scopes can now contain lambdas."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109118`: 类作用域内的 :ref:`annotation scope <annotation-scopes>` "
"现在可以包含lambda表达式。"

#: ../NEWS:9441
msgid ""
":gh:`117894`: Prevent ``agen.aclose()`` objects being re-used after "
"``.throw()``."
msgstr ":gh:`117894`: 防止 ``agen.aclose()`` 对象在 ``.throw()`` 后被重用。"

#: ../NEWS:9444
msgid ""
":gh:`117881`: prevent concurrent access to an async generator via "
"athrow().throw() or asend().throw()"
msgstr ":gh:`117881`: 防止通过athrow().throw()或asend().throw()并发访问异步生成器"

#: ../NEWS:9447
msgid ""
":gh:`117536`: Fix a :exc:`RuntimeWarning` when calling "
"``agen.aclose().throw(Exception)``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`117536`: 修复了调用 ``agen.aclose().throw(Exception)`` 时的 "
":exc:`RuntimeWarning`。"

#: ../NEWS:9450
msgid ""
":gh:`117755`: Fix mimalloc allocator for huge memory allocation (around "
"8,589,934,592 GiB) on s390x. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`117755`: 修复了s390x上对于巨大内存分配（约8,589,934,592 GiB）的mimalloc分配器。由Victor "
"Stinner提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9453
msgid ""
":gh:`117750`: Fix issue where an object's dict would get out of sync with "
"the object's internal values when being cleared. ``obj.__dict__.clear()`` "
"now clears the internal values, but leaves the dict attached to the object."
msgstr ""
":gh:`117750`: 修复了在清除对象字典时，对象字典与对象内部值不同步的问题。``obj.__dict__.clear()`` "
"现在会清除内部值，但保留字典与对象的关联。"

#: ../NEWS:9457 ../NEWS:9971
msgid ""
":gh:`117431`: Improve the performance of the following :class:`bytes` and "
":class:`bytearray` methods by adapting them to the :c:macro:`METH_FASTCALL` "
"calling convention:"
msgstr ""
":gh:`117431`: 通过将以下 :class:`bytes` 和 :class:`bytearray` 方法适配到 "
":c:macro:`METH_FASTCALL` 调用约定，提高了它们的性能："

#: ../NEWS:9461
msgid ":meth:`!count`"
msgstr ":meth:`!count`"

#: ../NEWS:9462
msgid ":meth:`!find`"
msgstr ":meth:`!find`"

#: ../NEWS:9463
msgid ":meth:`!index`"
msgstr ":meth:`!index`"

#: ../NEWS:9464
msgid ":meth:`!rfind`"
msgstr ":meth:`!rfind`"

#: ../NEWS:9465
msgid ":meth:`!rindex`"
msgstr ":meth:`!rindex`"

#: ../NEWS:9467
msgid ""
":gh:`117709`: Speed up calls to :func:`str` with positional-only argument, "
"by using the :pep:`590` ``vectorcall`` calling convention. Patch by Erlend "
"Aasland."
msgstr ""
":gh:`117709`: 通过使用 :pep:`590` ``vectorcall`` 调用约定，加快了带有位置唯一参数的 :func:`str` "
"调用速度。由 Erlend Aasland 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9471
msgid ""
":gh:`117680`: Give ``_PyInstructionSequence`` a Python interface and use it "
"in tests."
msgstr ":gh:`117680`: 为 ``_PyInstructionSequence`` 提供了一个 Python 接口，并在测试中使用它。"

#: ../NEWS:9474
msgid ""
":gh:`115776`: Statically allocated objects are, by definition, immortal so "
"must be marked as such regardless of whether they are in extension modules "
"or not."
msgstr ":gh:`115776`: 静态分配的对象根据定义是不朽的，因此无论它们是否在扩展模块中，都必须被标记为不朽。"

#: ../NEWS:9478
msgid ""
":gh:`117385`: Remove unhandled ``PY_MONITORING_EVENT_BRANCH`` and "
"``PY_MONITORING_EVENT_EXCEPTION_HANDLED`` events from :func:`sys.settrace`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`117385`: 从 :func:`sys.settrace` 中移除了未处理的 ``PY_MONITORING_EVENT_BRANCH``"
" 和 ``PY_MONITORING_EVENT_EXCEPTION_HANDLED`` 事件。"

#: ../NEWS:9482
msgid ""
":gh:`116322`: Extension modules may indicate to the runtime that they can "
"run without the GIL. Multi-phase init modules do so by calling providing "
"``Py_MOD_GIL_NOT_USED`` for the ``Py_mod_gil`` slot, while single-phase init"
" modules call ``PyUnstable_Module_SetGIL(mod, Py_MOD_GIL_NOT_USED)`` from "
"their init function."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116322`: 扩展模块可以向运行时表明它们可以在没有 GIL 的情况下运行。多阶段初始化模块通过为 ``Py_mod_gil`` 槽提供 "
"``Py_MOD_GIL_NOT_USED`` 来做到这一点，而单阶段初始化模块则在其初始化函数中调用 "
"``PyUnstable_Module_SetGIL(mod, Py_MOD_GIL_NOT_USED)``。"

#: ../NEWS:9488
msgid ""
":gh:`116129`: Implement :pep:`696`, adding support for defaults on type "
"parameters. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ":gh:`116129`: 实现了 :pep:`696`，增加了对类型参数默认值的支持。补丁由 Jelle Zijlstra 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:9491
msgid ""
":gh:`93502`: Add two new functions to the C-API, "
":c:func:`PyRefTracer_SetTracer` and :c:func:`PyRefTracer_GetTracer`, that "
"allows to track object creation and destruction the same way the "
":mod:`tracemalloc` module does. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`93502`: 向 C-API 添加了两个新函数 :c:func:`PyRefTracer_SetTracer` 和 "
":c:func:`PyRefTracer_GetTracer`，它们允许以与 :mod:`tracemalloc` "
"模块相同的方式跟踪对象的创建和销毁。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9496
msgid ""
":gh:`107674`: Improved the performance of :func:`sys.settrace` significantly"
msgstr ":gh:`107674`: 显著提高了 :func:`sys.settrace` 的性能。"

#: ../NEWS:9498
msgid ""
":gh:`95754`: Improve the error message when a script shadowing a module from"
" the standard library causes :exc:`AttributeError` to be raised. Similarly, "
"improve the error message when a script shadowing a third party module "
"attempts to access an attribute from that third party module while still "
"initialising."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95754`: 当脚本遮蔽标准库中的模块导致引发 :exc:`AttributeError` "
"时，改进错误信息。同样地，当脚本遮蔽第三方模块并试图在初始化过程中访问该第三方模块的属性时，也改进错误信息。"

#: ../NEWS:9504
msgid ""
":gh:`99180`: Elide uninformative traceback indicators in ``return`` and "
"simple ``assignment`` statements. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99180`: 在 ``return`` 和简单的 ``assignment`` 语句中省略无信息的回溯指示器。由Pablo "
"Galindo提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9507
msgid ""
":gh:`105879`: Allow the *globals* and *locals* arguments to :func:`exec` and"
" :func:`eval` to be passed as keywords."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105879`: 允许将 *globals* 和 *locals* 参数作为关键字传递给 :func:`exec` 和 "
":func:`eval`。"

#: ../NEWS:9513
msgid ""
":gh:`118418`: A :exc:`DeprecationWarning` is now emitted if you fail to pass"
" a value to the new *type_params* parameter of ``typing._eval_type()`` or "
"``typing.ForwardRef._evaluate()``. (Using either of these private and "
"undocumented functions is discouraged to begin with, but failing to pass a "
"value to the ``type_params`` parameter may lead to incorrect behaviour on "
"Python 3.12 or newer.)"
msgstr ""
":gh:`118418`: 现在，如果你没有为 ``typing._eval_type()`` 或 "
"``typing.ForwardRef._evaluate()`` 的新 *type_params* 参数传递值，将发出 "
":exc:`DeprecationWarning`。（首先，不鼓励使用这些私有且未文档化的函数，但如果没有为 ``type_params`` "
"参数传递值，可能会导致在 Python 3.12 或更新版本中出现错误行为。）"

#: ../NEWS:9520
msgid ""
":gh:`118660`: Add an optional second type parameter to "
":class:`typing.ContextManager` and :class:`typing.AsyncContextManager`, "
"representing the return types of :meth:`~object.__exit__` and "
":meth:`~object.__aexit__` respectively. This parameter defaults to ``bool | "
"None``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118660`: 为 :class:`typing.ContextManager` 和 "
":class:`typing.AsyncContextManager` 添加一个可选的第二个类型参数，分别表示 "
":meth:`~object.__exit__` 和 :meth:`~object.__aexit__` 的返回类型。此参数默认为 ``bool | "
"None``。"

#: ../NEWS:9526
msgid ""
":gh:`118650`: The ``enum`` module allows method named ``_repr_*`` to be "
"defined on ``Enum`` types."
msgstr ":gh:`118650`: ``enum`` 模块允许在 ``Enum`` 类型上定义名为 ``_repr_*`` 的方法。"

#: ../NEWS:9529
msgid ""
":gh:`118648`: Add type parameter defaults to :class:`typing.Generator` and "
":class:`typing.AsyncGenerator`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118648`: 为 :class:`typing.Generator` 和 :class:`typing.AsyncGenerator` "
"添加类型参数默认值。"

#: ../NEWS:9532
msgid ""
":gh:`101137`: Mime type ``text/x-rst`` is now supported by :mod:`mimetypes`."
msgstr ":gh:`101137`: :mod:`mimetypes` 现在支持 MIME 类型 ``text/x-rst``。"

#: ../NEWS:9534
msgid ""
":gh:`118164`: The Python implementation of the ``decimal`` module could "
"appear to hang in relatively small power cases (like ``2**117``) if context "
"precision was set to a very high value. A different method to check for "
"exactly representable results is used now that doesn't rely on computing "
"``10**precision`` (which could be effectively too large to compute)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118164`: 如果上下文精度设置为非常高的值，``decimal`` 模块的 Python 实现可能在相对较小的幂情况下（如 "
"``2**117``）看起来挂起。现在使用了一种不同的方法来检查完全可表示的结果，该方法不依赖于计算 ``10**precision`` "
"(这可能因为太大而无法有效计算) 。"

#: ../NEWS:9541
msgid ""
":gh:`111744`: ``breakpoint()`` and ``pdb.set_trace()`` now enter the "
"debugger immediately after the call rather than before the next line is "
"executed."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111744`: ``breakpoint()`` 和 ``pdb.set_trace()`` "
"现在在调用后立即进入调试器，而不是在执行下一行之前。"

#: ../NEWS:9544
msgid ":gh:`118500`: Add :mod:`pdb` support for zipapps"
msgstr ":gh:`118500`: 为 zipapps 添加 :mod:`pdb` 支持"

#: ../NEWS:9546
msgid ":gh:`118406`: Add signature for :class:`sqlite3.Connection` objects."
msgstr ":gh:`118406`: 为 :class:`sqlite3.Connection` 对象添加签名。"

#: ../NEWS:9548
msgid ""
":gh:`101732`: Use a Y2038 compatible openssl time function when available."
msgstr ":gh:`101732`: 在可用时使用兼容 Y2038 的 openssl 时间函数。"

#: ../NEWS:9550
msgid ""
":gh:`118404`: Fix :func:`inspect.signature` for non-comparable callables."
msgstr ":gh:`118404`: 修复 :func:`inspect.signature` 对于不可比较的可调用对象的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:9552
msgid ""
":gh:`118402`: Fix :func:`inspect.signature` for the result of the "
":func:`functools.cmp_to_key` call."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118402`: 修复 :func:`inspect.signature` 对于 :func:`functools.cmp_to_key` "
"调用结果的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:9555
msgid ""
":gh:`116622`: On Android, :any:`sysconfig.get_platform` now returns the "
"format specified by :pep:`738`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116622`: 在 Android 上，:any:`sysconfig.get_platform` 现在返回 :pep:`738` "
"指定的格式。"

#: ../NEWS:9558
msgid ""
":gh:`118285`: Allow to specify the signature of custom callable instances of"
" extension type by the ``__text_signature__`` attribute. Specify signatures "
"of :class:`operator.attrgetter`, :class:`operator.itemgetter`, and "
":class:`operator.methodcaller` instances."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118285`: 允许通过 ``__text_signature__`` 属性指定扩展类型的自定义可调用实例的签名。指定 "
":class:`operator.attrgetter`、:class:`operator.itemgetter` 和 "
":class:`operator.methodcaller` 实例的签名。"

#: ../NEWS:9563
msgid ""
":gh:`118314`: Fix an edge case in :func:`binascii.a2b_base64` strict mode, "
"where excessive padding is not detected when no padding is necessary."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118314`: 修复 :func:`binascii.a2b_base64` "
"严格模式下的一个边缘情况，其中在不必要填充时未检测到过多的填充。"

#: ../NEWS:9566
msgid ""
":gh:`118271`: Add the :class:`!PhotoImage` methods :meth:`!read` to read an "
"image from a file and :meth:`!data` to get the image data. Add *background* "
"and *grayscale* parameters to :class:`!PhotoImage` method :meth:`!write`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118271`: 为 :class:`!PhotoImage` 添加 :meth:`!read` 方法以从文件读取图像，以及 "
":meth:`!data` 方法以获取图像数据。为 :class:`!PhotoImage` 的 :meth:`!write` 方法添加 "
"*background* 和 *grayscale* 参数。"

#: ../NEWS:9571
msgid ""
":gh:`118225`: Add the :class:`!PhotoImage` method :meth:`!copy_replace` to "
"copy a region from one image to other image, possibly with pixel zooming "
"and/or subsampling. Add *from_coords* parameter to :class:`!PhotoImage` "
"methods :meth:`!copy`, :meth:`!zoom` and :meth:`!subsample`. Add *zoom* and "
"*subsample* parameters to :class:`!PhotoImage` method :meth:`!copy`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118225`: 为 :class:`!PhotoImage` 添加 :meth:`!copy_replace` "
"方法以将一个图像的区域复制到另一个图像，可能带有像素缩放和/或子采样。为 :class:`!PhotoImage` 的 "
":meth:`!copy`、:meth:`!zoom` 和 :meth:`!subsample` 方法添加 *from_coords* 参数。为 "
":class:`!PhotoImage` 的 :meth:`!copy` 方法添加 *zoom* 和 *subsample* 参数。"

#: ../NEWS:9577
msgid ""
":gh:`118221`: Fix a bug where :meth:`sqlite3.Connection.iterdump` could fail"
" if a custom :attr:`row factory <sqlite3.Connection.row_factory>` was used. "
"Patch by Erlend Aasland."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118221`: 修复了一个错误，其中如果使用了自定义的 :attr:`row factory "
"<sqlite3.Connection.row_factory>`，:meth:`sqlite3.Connection.iterdump` "
"可能会失败。由 Erlend Aasland 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9581
msgid ""
":gh:`118013`: Fix regression introduced in :gh:`103193` that meant that "
"calling :func:`inspect.getattr_static` on an instance would cause a strong "
"reference to that instance's class to persist in an internal cache in the "
":mod:`inspect` module. This caused unexpected memory consumption if the "
"class was dynamically created, the class held strong references to other "
"objects which took up a significant amount of memory, and the cache "
"contained the sole strong reference to the class. The fix for the regression"
" leads to a slowdown in :func:`!getattr_static`, but the function should "
"still be significantly faster than it was in Python 3.11. Patch by Alex "
"Waygood."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118013`: 修复了在 :gh:`103193` 中引入的回归问题，该问题意味着在实例上调用 "
":func:`inspect.getattr_static` 会导致对该实例类的强引用在 :mod:`inspect` "
"模块的内部缓存中持续存在。如果类是动态创建的，类持有占用大量内存的其他对象的强引用，并且缓存包含对类的唯一强引用，这会导致意外的内存消耗。对该回归问题的修复导致"
" :func:`!getattr_static` 的速度变慢，但该函数仍应比 Python 3.11 中的速度快得多。由 Alex Waygood "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9592
msgid ""
":gh:`118218`: Speed up :func:`itertools.pairwise` in the common case by up "
"to 1.8x."
msgstr ":gh:`118218`: 在常见情况下，将 :func:`itertools.pairwise` 的速度提高了多达 1.8 倍。"

#: ../NEWS:9595
msgid ""
":gh:`117486`: Improve the behavior of user-defined subclasses of "
":class:`ast.AST`. Such classes will now require no changes in the usual case"
" to conform with the behavior changes of the :mod:`ast` module in Python "
"3.13. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`117486`: 改进了 :class:`ast.AST` 的用户定义子类的行为。现在，这些类在通常情况下不需要任何更改即可符合 Python"
" 3.13 中 :mod:`ast` 模块的行为变化。由 Jelle Zijlstra 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9600
msgid ""
":gh:`90848`: Fixed :func:`unittest.mock.create_autospec` to configure parent"
" mock with keyword arguments."
msgstr ""
":gh:`90848`: 修复了 :func:`unittest.mock.create_autospec`，使其能够使用关键字参数配置父模拟。"

#: ../NEWS:9603
msgid ""
":gh:`118168`: Fix incorrect argument substitution when :data:`typing.Unpack`"
" is used with the builtin :class:`tuple`. :data:`!typing.Unpack` now raises "
":exc:`TypeError` when used with certain invalid types. Patch by Jelle "
"Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118168`: 修复了当 :data:`typing.Unpack` 与内置的 :class:`tuple` "
"一起使用时的不正确参数替换。现在，当 :data:`!typing.Unpack` 与某些无效类型一起使用时，会引发 "
":exc:`TypeError`。由 Jelle Zijlstra 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9608
msgid ""
":gh:`118131`: Add command-line interface for the :mod:`random` module. Patch"
" by Hugo van Kemenade."
msgstr ":gh:`118131`: 为 :mod:`random` 模块添加了命令行界面。由 Hugo van Kemenade 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9611
msgid ""
":gh:`118107`: Fix :mod:`zipimport` reading of ZIP64 files with file entries "
"that are too big or offset too far."
msgstr ":gh:`118107`: 修复了 :mod:`zipimport` 对 ZIP64 文件的读取，这些文件的条目太大或偏移太远。"

#: ../NEWS:9614
msgid ""
":gh:`102511`: Fix :func:`os.path.normpath` for UNC paths on Windows. Speed "
"up :func:`os.path.splitroot` with a native implementation."
msgstr ""
":gh:`102511`: 修复了 Windows 上 UNC 路径的 :func:`os.path.normpath`。通过原生实现加速 "
":func:`os.path.splitroot`。"

#: ../NEWS:9617
msgid ""
":gh:`117535`: Change the unknown filename of :mod:`warnings` from ``sys`` to"
" ``<sys>`` to clarify that it's not a real filename."
msgstr ""
":gh:`117535`: 将 :mod:`warnings` 的未知文件名从 ``sys`` 更改为 ``<sys>``，以澄清它不是真实的文件名。"

#: ../NEWS:9620
msgid ""
":gh:`114053`: Fix erroneous :exc:`NameError` when calling "
":func:`typing.get_type_hints` on a class that made use of :pep:`695` type "
"parameters in a module that had ``from __future__ import annotations`` at "
"the top of the file. Patch by Alex Waygood."
msgstr ""
":gh:`114053`: 修复了在文件顶部有 ``from __future__ import annotations`` 的模块中，对使用了 "
":pep:`695` 类型参数的类调用 :func:`typing.get_type_hints` 时出现的错误 :exc:`NameError`。由 "
"Alex Waygood 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9625
msgid ""
":gh:`116931`: Add parameter *fileobj* check for "
":func:`tarfile.TarFile.addfile`"
msgstr ":gh:`116931`: 为 :func:`tarfile.TarFile.addfile` 添加了 *fileobj* 参数检查。"

#: ../NEWS:9628
msgid ""
":gh:`117995`: Don't raise :exc:`DeprecationWarning` when a :term:`sequence` "
"of parameters is used to bind indexed, nameless placeholders. See also "
":gh:`100668`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`117995`: 当使用 :term:`sequence` 参数绑定索引化的无名占位符时，不再引发 "
":exc:`DeprecationWarning`。另见 :gh:`100668`。"

#: ../NEWS:9632
msgid ""
":gh:`80361`: Fix TypeError in :func:`email.message.Message.get_payload` when"
" the charset is :rfc:`2231` encoded."
msgstr ""
":gh:`80361`: 修复了当字符集为 :rfc:`2231` "
"编码时，:func:`email.message.Message.get_payload` 中的 TypeError。"

#: ../NEWS:9635
msgid ""
":gh:`86650`: Fix IndexError when parse some emails with invalid Message-ID "
"(including one-off addresses generated by Microsoft Outlook)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`86650`: 修复了解析一些带有无效 Message-ID（包括由 Microsoft Outlook 生成的一次性地址）的邮件时出现的 "
"IndexError。"

#: ../NEWS:9638
msgid ""
":gh:`117691`: Improve the error messages emitted by :mod:`tarfile` "
"deprecation warnings relating to PEP 706. If a ``filter`` argument is not "
"provided to ``extract()`` or ``extractall``, the deprecation warning now "
"points to the line in the user's code where the relevant function was "
"called. Patch by Alex Waygood."
msgstr ""
":gh:`117691`: 改进了由 :mod:`tarfile` 发出的与 PEP 706 相关的弃用警告的错误信息。如果未向 "
"``extract()`` 或 ``extractall`` 提供 ``filter`` 参数，弃用警告现在会指向用户代码中调用相关函数的那一行。由 "
"Alex Waygood 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9644
msgid ""
":gh:`115874`: Fixed a possible segfault during garbage collection of "
"``_asyncio.FutureIter`` objects. Patch by Savannah Ostrowski."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115874`: 修复了在垃圾回收 ``_asyncio.FutureIter`` 对象时可能出现的段错误。由 Savannah "
"Ostrowski 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9647
msgid ""
":gh:`115060`: Speed up :meth:`pathlib.Path.glob` by omitting an initial "
":meth:`~pathlib.Path.is_dir` call. As a result of this change, "
":meth:`~pathlib.Path.glob` can no longer raise :exc:`OSError`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115060`: 通过省略初始的 :meth:`~pathlib.Path.is_dir` 调用，加速了 "
":meth:`pathlib.Path.glob`。由于这一变化，:meth:`~pathlib.Path.glob` 不再能引发 "
":exc:`OSError`。"

#: ../NEWS:9651
msgid ""
":gh:`77102`: :mod:`site` module now parses ``.pth`` file with UTF-8 first, "
"and :term:`locale encoding` if ``UnicodeDecodeError`` happened. It supported"
" only locale encoding before."
msgstr ""
":gh:`77102`: :mod:`site` 模块现在首先使用 UTF-8 解析 ``.pth`` 文件，如果发生 "
"``UnicodeDecodeError`` 则使用 :term:`locale encoding`。之前仅支持 locale encoding。"

#: ../NEWS:9655
msgid ""
":gh:`76785`: We've exposed the low-level :mod:`!_interpreters` module for "
"the sake of the PyPI implementation of :pep:`734`.  It was sometimes "
"available as the :mod:`!_xxsubinterpreters` module and was formerly used "
"only for testing. For the most part, it should be considered an internal "
"module, like :mod:`!_thread` and :mod:`!_imp`. See "
"https://discuss.python.org/t/pep-734-multiple-interpreters-in-the-"
"stdlib/41147/26."
msgstr ""
":gh:`76785`: 我们为了 :pep:`734` 的 PyPI 实现，暴露了底层的 :mod:`!_interpreters` "
"模块。它有时可作为 :mod:`!_xxsubinterpreters` 模块可用，以前仅用于测试。在大多数情况下，它应被视为内部模块，如 "
":mod:`!_thread` 和 :mod:`!_imp`。参见 "
"https://discuss.python.org/t/pep-734-multiple-interpreters-in-the-"
"stdlib/41147/26。"

#: ../NEWS:9662
msgid ""
":gh:`115060`: Speed up :meth:`pathlib.Path.glob` by not scanning directories"
" for non-wildcard pattern segments."
msgstr "gh:`115060`: 通过不对非通配符模式段扫描目录来加速 :meth:`pathlib.Path.glob`。"

#: ../NEWS:9665
msgid ""
":gh:`117727`: Speed up :meth:`pathlib.Path.iterdir` by using "
":func:`os.scandir` internally."
msgstr ""
"gh:`117727`: 通过内部使用 :func:`os.scandir` 来加速 :meth:`pathlib.Path.iterdir`。"

#: ../NEWS:9668
msgid ""
":gh:`117586`: Speed up :meth:`pathlib.Path.walk` by working with strings "
"internally."
msgstr "gh:`117586`: 通过内部使用字符串来加速 :meth:`pathlib.Path.walk`。"

#: ../NEWS:9671
msgid ""
":gh:`117722`: Change the new multi-separator support in "
":meth:`asyncio.StreamReader.readuntil` to only accept tuples of separators "
"rather than arbitrary iterables."
msgstr ""
"gh:`117722`: 将 :meth:`asyncio.StreamReader.readuntil` "
"中的新多分隔符支持更改为仅接受分隔符元组而不是任意可迭代对象。"

#: ../NEWS:9675
msgid ""
":gh:`117692`: Fixes a bug when :class:`doctest.DocTestFinder` was failing on"
" wrapped ``builtin_function_or_method``."
msgstr ""
"gh:`117692`: 修复了当 :class:`doctest.DocTestFinder` 在包装的 "
"``builtin_function_or_method`` 上失败时的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:9678
msgid ""
":gh:`117348`: Largely restored import time performance of configparser by "
"avoiding dataclasses."
msgstr "gh:`117348`: 通过避免使用数据类，大幅恢复了 configparser 的导入时间性能。"

#: ../NEWS:9681
msgid ":gh:`117641`: Speedup :func:`os.path.commonpath` on Unix."
msgstr "gh:`117641`: 在 Unix 上加速 :func:`os.path.commonpath`。"

#: ../NEWS:9683
msgid ""
":gh:`117663`: Fix ``_simple_enum`` to detect aliases when multiple arguments"
" are present but only one is the member value."
msgstr "gh:`117663`: 修复 ``_simple_enum`` 以在存在多个参数但仅一个是成员值时检测别名。"

#: ../NEWS:9686
msgid ":gh:`117636`: Speedup :func:`os.path.join`."
msgstr "gh:`117636`: 加速 :func:`os.path.join`。"

#: ../NEWS:9688
msgid ""
":gh:`117618`: Support ``package.module`` as ``filename`` for ``break`` "
"command of :mod:`pdb`"
msgstr ""
"gh:`117618`: 支持 ``package.module`` 作为 ``filename`` 用于 :mod:`pdb` 的 ``break``"
" 命令。"

#: ../NEWS:9691
msgid ""
":gh:`102247`: the status codes enum with constants in http.HTTPStatus are "
"updated to include the names from RFC9110. This RFC includes some HTTP "
"statuses previously only used for WEBDAV and assigns more generic names to "
"them."
msgstr ""
"gh:`102247`: http.HTTPStatus 中的状态码枚举常量已更新，以包含来自 RFC9110 的名称。该 RFC 包括一些以前仅用于 "
"WEBDAV 的 HTTP 状态，并为它们分配了更通用的名称。"

#: ../NEWS:9696
msgid "The old constants are preserved for backwards compatibility."
msgstr "旧常量被保留以向后兼容。"

#: ../NEWS:9698
msgid ":gh:`117607`: Speedup :func:`os.path.relpath`."
msgstr "gh:`117607`: 加速 :func:`os.path.relpath`。"

#: ../NEWS:9700
msgid ""
":gh:`117586`: Speed up :meth:`pathlib.Path.glob` by working with strings "
"internally."
msgstr "gh:`117586`: 通过内部使用字符串来加速 :meth:`pathlib.Path.glob`。"

#: ../NEWS:9703
msgid ""
":gh:`117225`: Add colour to doctest output. Patch by Hugo van Kemenade."
msgstr "gh:`117225`: 为 doctest 输出添加颜色。由 Hugo van Kemenade 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9705
msgid ""
":gh:`117566`: :meth:`ipaddress.IPv6Address.is_loopback` will now return "
"``True`` for IPv4-mapped loopback addresses, i.e. addresses in the "
"``::ffff:127.0.0.0/104`` address space."
msgstr ""
"gh:`117566`: :meth:`ipaddress.IPv6Address.is_loopback` 现在将对于 IPv4 映射的环回地址返回 "
"``True``，即 ``::ffff:127.0.0.0/104`` 地址空间中的地址。"

#: ../NEWS:9709
msgid ""
":gh:`117546`: Fix issue where :func:`os.path.realpath` stopped resolving "
"symlinks after encountering a symlink loop on POSIX."
msgstr ""
"gh:`117546`: 修复了 :func:`os.path.realpath` 在 POSIX 上遇到符号链接循环后停止解析符号链接的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:9712
msgid ""
":gh:`116720`: Improved behavior of :class:`asyncio.TaskGroup` when an "
"external cancellation collides with an internal cancellation. For example, "
"when two task groups are nested and both experience an exception in a child "
"task simultaneously, it was possible that the outer task group would "
"misbehave, because its internal cancellation was swallowed by the inner task"
" group."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116720`: 改进了 :class:`asyncio.TaskGroup` "
"在外部取消与内部取消冲突时的行为。例如，当两个任务组嵌套并且同时在子任务中遇到异常时，外部任务组可能会行为不当，因为它的内部取消被内部任务组吞没了。"

#: ../NEWS:9719
msgid ""
"In the case where a task group is cancelled externally and also must raise "
"an :exc:`ExceptionGroup`, it will now call the parent task's "
":meth:`~asyncio.Task.cancel` method. This ensures that a "
":exc:`asyncio.CancelledError` will be raised at the next :keyword:`await`, "
"so the cancellation is not lost."
msgstr ""
"在任务组被外部取消并且必须引发 :exc:`ExceptionGroup` 的情况下，现在会调用父任务的 "
":meth:`~asyncio.Task.cancel` 方法。这确保在下一个 :keyword:`await` 时会引发 "
":exc:`asyncio.CancelledError`，因此取消不会被丢失。"

#: ../NEWS:9725
msgid ""
"An added benefit of these changes is that task groups now preserve the "
"cancellation count (:meth:`asyncio.Task.cancelling`)."
msgstr "这些更改的一个附加好处是现在任务组会保留取消操作计数 (:meth:`asyncio.Task.cancelling`)。"

#: ../NEWS:9728
msgid ""
"In order to handle some corner cases, :meth:`asyncio.Task.uncancel` may now "
"reset the undocumented ``_must_cancel`` flag when the cancellation count "
"reaches zero."
msgstr ""
"为了处理某些边界情况，现在 :meth:`asyncio.Task.uncancel` 可以在取消操作计数达到零时重置未写入文档的 "
"``_must_cancel`` 旗标。"

#: ../NEWS:9732
msgid ""
":gh:`117516`: Add :data:`typing.TypeIs`, implementing :pep:`742`. Patch by "
"Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`117516`: 添加 :data:`typing.TypeIs`，实现 :pep:`742`。由 Jelle Zijlstra 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9735
msgid ""
":gh:`117503`: Fix support of non-ASCII user names in bytes paths in "
":func:`os.path.expanduser` on Posix."
msgstr ""
":gh:`117503`: 修复了在 Posix 系统上 :func:`os.path.expanduser` 中非 ASCII 用户名的字节路径支持。"

#: ../NEWS:9738
msgid ""
":gh:`117394`: :func:`os.path.ismount` is now 2-3 times faster if the user "
"has permissions."
msgstr ":gh:`117394`: 如果用户有权限，:func:`os.path.ismount` 现在快 2-3 倍。"

#: ../NEWS:9741
msgid ""
":gh:`117313`: Only treat ``'\\n'``, ``'\\r'`` and ``'\\r\\n'`` as line "
"separators in re-folding the :mod:`email` messages. Preserve control "
"characters ``'\\v'``, ``'\\f'``, ``'\\x1c'``, ``'\\x1d'`` and ``'\\x1e'`` "
"and Unicode line separators ``'\\x85'``, ``'\\u2028'`` and ``'\\u2029'`` as "
"is."
msgstr ""
":gh:`117313`: 在重新折叠 :mod:`email` 消息时，仅将 ``'\\n'``、``'\\r'`` 和 ``'\\r\\n'`` "
"视为行分隔符。保留控制字符 ``'\\v'``、``'\\f'``、``'\\x1c'``、``'\\x1d'`` 和 ``'\\x1e'`` 以及 "
"Unicode 行分隔符 ``'\\x85'``、``'\\u2028'`` 和 ``'\\u2029'`` 不变。"

#: ../NEWS:9746
msgid ""
":gh:`117142`: Convert :mod:`!_ctypes` to multi-phase initialisation "
"(:pep:`489`)."
msgstr ":gh:`117142`: 将 :mod:`!_ctypes` 转换为多阶段初始化 (:pep:`489`)。"

#: ../NEWS:9749
msgid ""
":gh:`66543`: Add the :func:`mimetypes.guess_file_type` function which works "
"with file path. Passing file path instead of URL in "
":func:`~mimetypes.guess_type` is :term:`soft deprecated`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`66543`: 添加了 :func:`mimetypes.guess_file_type` 函数，该函数适用于文件路径。在 "
":func:`~mimetypes.guess_type` 中传递文件路径而非 URL 是 软弃用`。"

#: ../NEWS:9753
msgid ""
":gh:`68583`: webbrowser CLI: replace getopt with argparse, add long options."
" Patch by Hugo van Kemenade."
msgstr ""
":gh:`68583`: webbrowser CLI：用 argparse 替换 getopt，添加长选项。由 Hugo van Kemenade "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9756
msgid ""
":gh:`116871`: Name suggestions for :exc:`AttributeError` and "
":exc:`ImportError` now only include underscored names if the original name "
"was underscored."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116871`: :exc:`AttributeError` 和 :exc:`ImportError` "
"的名称建议现在仅在原始名称有下划线时才包括带下划线的名称。"

#: ../NEWS:9760
msgid ""
":gh:`116023`: Don't show empty fields (value ``None`` or ``[]``) in "
":func:`ast.dump` by default. Add ``show_empty=False`` parameter to "
"optionally show them."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116023`: 默认情况下不在 :func:`ast.dump` 中显示空字段（值为 ``None`` 或 ``[]``）。添加 "
"``show_empty=False`` 参数以可选地显示它们。"

#: ../NEWS:9764
msgid ""
":gh:`115961`: Added :attr:`!name` and :attr:`!mode` attributes for "
"compressed and archived file-like objects in modules :mod:`bz2`, "
":mod:`lzma`, :mod:`tarfile` and :mod:`zipfile`. The value of the "
":attr:`!mode` attribute of :class:`gzip.GzipFile` was changed from integer "
"(``1`` or ``2``) to string (``'rb'`` or ``'wb'``). The value of the "
":attr:`!mode` attribute of the readable file-like object returned by "
":meth:`zipfile.ZipFile.open` was changed from ``'r'`` to ``'rb'``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115961`: 在模块 :mod:`bz2`、:mod:`lzma`、:mod:`tarfile` 和 :mod:`zipfile` "
"中为压缩和归档文件类对象添加了 :attr:`!name` 和 :attr:`!mode` 属性。:class:`gzip.GzipFile` 的 "
":attr:`!mode` 属性值从整数（``1`` 或 ``2``）更改为字符串（``'rb'`` 或 ``'wb'``）。由 "
":meth:`zipfile.ZipFile.open` 返回的可读文件类对象的 :attr:`!mode` 属性值从 ``'r'`` 更改为 "
"``'rb'``。"

#: ../NEWS:9772
msgid ""
":gh:`82062`: Fix :func:`inspect.signature` to correctly handle parameter "
"defaults on methods in extension modules that use names defined in the "
"module namespace."
msgstr ""
":gh:`82062`: 修复 :func:`inspect.signature`，以正确处理使用模块命名空间中定义名称的扩展模块中方法的参数默认值。"

#: ../NEWS:9776
msgid ""
":gh:`83856`: Honor :mod:`atexit` for all :mod:`multiprocessing` start "
"methods"
msgstr ":gh:`83856`: 为所有 :mod:`multiprocessing` 启动方法启用 :mod:`atexit`。"

#: ../NEWS:9778
msgid ""
":gh:`113081`: Print colorized exception just like built-in traceback in "
":mod:`pdb`"
msgstr ":gh:`113081`: 在 :mod:`pdb` 中打印彩色异常，就像内置的 traceback 一样。"

#: ../NEWS:9781
msgid ""
":gh:`112855`: Speed up pickling of :class:`pathlib.PurePath` objects. Patch "
"by Barney Gale."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112855`: 加速 :class:`pathlib.PurePath` 对象的 pickle 操作。由 Barney Gale 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9784
msgid ":gh:`111744`: Support opcode events in :mod:`bdb`"
msgstr ":gh:`111744`: 在 :mod:`bdb` 中支持操作码事件。"

#: ../NEWS:9786
msgid ""
":gh:`109617`: :mod:`!ncurses`: fixed a crash that could occur on macOS 13 or"
" earlier when Python was built with Apple Xcode 15's SDK."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109617`: :mod:`!ncurses`: 修复了在 macOS 13 或更早版本上，当 Python 使用 Apple Xcode "
"15 的 SDK 构建时可能发生的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:9789
msgid ""
":gh:`83151`: Enabled arbitrary statements and evaluations in :mod:`pdb` "
"shell to access the local variables of the current frame, which made it "
"possible for multi-scope code like generators or nested function to work."
msgstr ""
":gh:`83151`: 在 :mod:`pdb` shell "
"中启用任意语句和评估，以访问当前帧的局部变量，这使得生成器或嵌套函数等多作用域代码可以工作。"

#: ../NEWS:9793
msgid ""
":gh:`110209`: Add :meth:`~object.__class_getitem__` to "
":class:`types.GeneratorType` and :class:`types.CoroutineType` for type "
"hinting purposes. Patch by James Hilton-Balfe."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110209`: 为类型提示目的，向 :class:`types.GeneratorType` 和 "
":class:`types.CoroutineType` 添加 :meth:`~object.__class_getitem__`。由 James "
"Hilton-Balfe 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9797
msgid ""
":gh:`108191`: The :class:`types.SimpleNamespace` now accepts an optional "
"positional argument which specifies initial values of attributes as a dict "
"or an iterable of key-value pairs."
msgstr ""
":gh:`108191`: :class:`types.SimpleNamespace` "
"现在接受一个可选的定位参数，该参数指定属性的初始值作为一个字典或键值对的可迭代对象。"

#: ../NEWS:9801
msgid ""
":gh:`62090`: Fix assertion errors caused by whitespace in metavars or "
"``SUPPRESS``-ed groups in :mod:`argparse` by simplifying usage formatting. "
"Patch by Ali Hamdan."
msgstr ""
":gh:`62090`: 通过简化使用格式，修复了由 :mod:`argparse` 中元变量或 ``SUPPRESS``-ed "
"组中的空白引起的断言错误。由 Ali Hamdan 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9805
msgid ""
":gh:`102402`: Adjust ``logging.LogRecord`` to use ``time.time_ns()`` and fix"
" minor bug related to floating-point math."
msgstr ""
":gh:`102402`: 调整 ``logging.LogRecord`` 使用 ``time.time_ns()`` 并修复与浮点数学相关的小错误。"

#: ../NEWS:9808
msgid ""
":gh:`100242`: Bring pure Python implementation ``functools.partial.__new__``"
" more in line with the C-implementation by not just always checking for the "
"presence of the attribute ``'func'`` on the first argument of ``partial``. "
"Instead, both the Python version and the C version perform an "
"``isinstance(func, partial)`` check on the first argument of ``partial``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100242`: 通过不仅仅总是检查 ``partial`` 的第一个参数是否存在 ``'func'`` 属性，使纯Python实现的 "
"``functools.partial.__new__`` 更符合C实现。相反，Python版本和C版本都在 ``partial`` 的第一个参数上执行"
" ``isinstance(func, partial)`` 检查。"

#: ../NEWS:9814
msgid ""
":gh:`99730`: HEAD requests are no longer upgraded to GET request during "
"redirects in urllib."
msgstr ":gh:`99730`: 在urllib中，HEAD请求不再在重定向时升级为GET请求。"

#: ../NEWS:9817
msgid ""
":gh:`66410`: Setting the :mod:`!tkinter` module global :data:`!wantobjects` "
"to ``2`` before creating the :class:`~tkinter.Tk` object or call the "
":meth:`!wantobjects` method of the :class:`!Tk` object with argument ``2`` "
"makes now arguments to callbacks registered in the :mod:`tkinter` module to "
"be passed as various Python objects (``int``, ``float``, ``bytes``, "
"``tuple``), depending on their internal representation in Tcl, instead of "
"always ``str``. :data:`!tkinter.wantobjects` is now set to ``2`` by default."
msgstr ""
":gh:`66410`: 在创建 :class:`~tkinter.Tk` 对象或调用 :class:`!Tk` 对象的 "
":meth:`!wantobjects` 方法之前，将 :mod:`!tkinter` 模块全局变量 :data:`!wantobjects` 设置为 "
"``2``，现在使得在 :mod:`tkinter` "
"模块中注册的回调参数根据其在Tcl中的内部表示作为各种Python对象（``int``、``float``、``bytes``、``tuple``）传递，而不仅仅是"
" ``str``。:data:`!tkinter.wantobjects` 现在默认设置为 ``2``。"

#: ../NEWS:9826
msgid ""
":issue:`40943`: Fix several IndexError when parse emails with truncated "
"Message-ID, address, routes, etc, e.g. ``example@``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40943`: 修复了在解析带有截断的Message-ID、地址、路由等的电子邮件时出现的几个IndexError，例如 "
"``example@``。"

#: ../NEWS:9829
msgid ":issue:`39324`: Add mime type mapping for .md <-> text/markdown"
msgstr ":issue:`39324`: 添加 .md 文件扩展名与 text/markdown MIME 类型的映射关系。"

#: ../NEWS:9831
msgid ""
":issue:`18108`: :func:`shutil.chown` now supports *dir_fd* and "
"*follow_symlinks* keyword arguments."
msgstr ""
