#: ../NEWS:9992
msgid ""
":gh:`109120`: Added handle of incorrect star expressions, e.g ``f(3, *)``. "
"Patch by Grigoryev Semyon"
msgstr ":gh:`109120`: 添加了对不正确星号表达式的处理，例如 ``f(3, *)``。补丁由Grigoryev Semyon提供。"

#: ../NEWS:9995
msgid ""
":gh:`117266`: Fix crashes for certain user-created subclasses of "
":class:`ast.AST`. Such classes are now expected to set the ``_field_types`` "
"attribute."
msgstr ""
":gh:`117266`: 修复了某些用户创建的 :class:`ast.AST` "
"子类的崩溃问题。现在期望这些类设置``_field_types``属性。"

#: ../NEWS:9999
msgid ""
":gh:`99108`: Updated the :mod:`hashlib` built-in `HACL\\* project`_ C code "
"from upstream that we use for many implementations when they are not present"
" via OpenSSL in a given build.  This also avoids the rare potential for a C "
"symbol name one definition rule linking issue."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99108`: 更新了 :mod:`hashlib` 内置的 `HACL\\* project`_ C "
"代码，这是我们用于许多实现的上游代码，当它们在给定构建中未通过 OpenSSL 提供时。这也避免了 C 符号名称一个定义规则链接问题的罕见可能性。"

#: ../NEWS:10006
msgid ""
":gh:`117108`: Change the old space bit of objects in the young generation "
"from 0 to gcstate->visited, so that any objects created during GC will have "
"the old bit set correctly if they get moved into the old generation."
msgstr ""
":gh:`117108`: 将年轻代中对象的旧空间位从 0 更改为 gcstate->visited，这样在 GC "
"期间创建的任何对象如果被移动到老年代，其旧位将被正确设置。"

#: ../NEWS:10010
msgid ""
":gh:`117108`: The cycle GC now chooses the size of increments based on the "
"total heap size, instead of the rate of object creation. This ensures that "
"it can keep up with growing heaps."
msgstr ":gh:`117108`: 循环 GC 现在基于堆的总大小而不是对象创建速率来选择增量的大小。这确保了它能够跟上堆的增长。"

#: ../NEWS:10014
msgid ""
":gh:`116735`: For ``INSTRUMENTED_CALL_FUNCTION_EX``, set ``arg0`` to "
"``sys.monitoring.MISSING`` instead of ``None`` for :monitoring-event:`CALL` "
"event."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116735`: 对于 ``INSTRUMENTED_CALL_FUNCTION_EX``，将 ``arg0`` 设置为 "
"``sys.monitoring.MISSING`` 而不是 ``None``，用于 :monitoring-event:`CALL` 事件。"

#: ../NEWS:10018
msgid ""
":gh:`113964`: Starting new threads and process creation through "
":func:`os.fork` are now only prevented once all non-daemon threads exit."
msgstr ":gh:`113964`: 现在只有在所有非守护线程退出后才阻止通过 :func:`os.fork` 创建新线程和进程。"

#: ../NEWS:10021
msgid ""
":gh:`116626`: Ensure ``INSTRUMENTED_CALL_FUNCTION_EX`` always emits "
":monitoring-event:`CALL`"
msgstr ""
":gh:`116626`: 确保 ``INSTRUMENTED_CALL_FUNCTION_EX`` 总是发出 :monitoring-"
"event:`CALL`"

#: ../NEWS:10024
msgid ""
":gh:`116554`: ``list.sort()`` now exploits more cases of partial ordering, "
"particularly those with long descending runs with sub-runs of equal values. "
"Those are recognized as single runs now (previously, each block of repeated "
"values caused a new run to be created)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116554`: ``list.sort()`` "
"现在利用了更多部分排序的情况，特别是那些具有长下降序列和相等值的子序列的情况。这些现在被识别为单个序列（以前，每个重复值的块都会导致新序列的创建）。"

#: ../NEWS:10029
msgid ""
":gh:`114099`: Added a Loader that can discover extension modules in an iOS-"
"style Frameworks folder."
msgstr ":gh:`114099`: 添加了一个加载器，可以在 iOS 风格的 Frameworks 文件夹中发现扩展模块。"

#: ../NEWS:10032
msgid ""
":gh:`115775`: Compiler populates the new ``__static_attributes__`` field on "
"a class with the names of attributes of this class which are accessed "
"through self.X from any function in its body."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115775`: 编译器用类体中任何函数通过 self.X 访问的该类的属性名称填充类上的新 "
"``__static_attributes__`` 字段。"

#: ../NEWS:10036
msgid ""
":gh:`115776`: The array of values, the ``PyDictValues`` struct is now "
"embedded in the object during allocation. This provides better performance "
"in the common case, and does not degrade as much when the object's "
"``__dict__`` is materialized."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115776`: 值数组 ``PyDictValues`` 结构现在在分配时嵌入到对象中。这在常见情况下提供了更好的性能，并且在对象的 "
"``__dict__`` 具体化时性能下降不多。"

#: ../NEWS:10041
msgid ""
":gh:`108362`: Implement an incremental cyclic garbage collector. By "
"collecting the old generation in increments, there is no need for a full "
"heap scan. This can hugely reduce maximum pause time for programs with large"
" heaps."
msgstr ""
":gh:`108362`: 实现了一个增量循环垃圾收集器。通过增量收集老年代，无需进行完整的堆扫描。这可以极大减少拥有大堆的程序的最高暂停时间。"

#: ../NEWS:10046
msgid ""
"Reduce the number of generations from three to two. The old generation is "
"split into two spaces, \"visited\" and \"pending\"."
msgstr "将代数从三代减少到两代。老年代被分成两个空间，“已访问”和“待处理”。"

#: ../NEWS:10049
msgid ""
"Collection happens in two steps:: * An increment is formed from the young "
"generation and a small part of the pending space. * This increment is "
"scanned and the survivors moved to the end of the visited space."
msgstr "收集分两步进行:: * 从年轻代和待处理空间的一小部分形成一个增量。 * 扫描这个增量，并将幸存者移动到已访问空间的末尾。"

#: ../NEWS:10053
msgid "When the collecting space becomes empty, the two spaces are swapped."
msgstr "当收集空间变空时，两个空间会交换。"

#: ../NEWS:10058
msgid ""
":gh:`109870`: Dataclasses now calls :func:`exec` once per dataclass, instead"
" of once per method being added.  This can speed up dataclass creation by up"
" to 20%."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109870`: 数据类现在每个数据类调用一次 "
":func:`exec`，而不是每个添加的方法调用一次。这可以将数据类的创建速度提高高达20%。"

#: ../NEWS:10062
msgid ""
":gh:`97901`: Mime type ``text/rtf`` is now supported by :mod:`mimetypes`."
msgstr ":gh:`97901`: :mod:`mimetypes` 现在支持MIME类型 ``text/rtf``。"

