#: ../NEWS:10111
msgid ""
":gh:`117310`: Fixed an unlikely early & extra ``Py_DECREF`` triggered crash "
"in :mod:`ssl` when creating a new ``_ssl._SSLContext`` if CPython was built "
"implausibly such that the default cipher list is empty **or** the SSL "
"library it was linked against reports a failure from its C "
"``SSL_CTX_set_cipher_list()`` API."
msgstr ""
":gh:`117310`: 修复了在创建新的 ``_ssl._SSLContext`` 时，如果 CPython "
"被不合理地构建导致默认密码列表为空，或链接的 SSL 库报告其 C ``SSL_CTX_set_cipher_list()`` API "
"失败时，可能触发的早期及额外的 ``Py_DECREF`` 崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:10117
msgid ""
":gh:`117294`: A ``DocTestCase`` now reports as skipped if all examples in "
"the doctest are skipped."
msgstr ":gh:`117294`: 如果 doctest 中的所有示例都被跳过，``DocTestCase`` 现在会报告为跳过。"

#: ../NEWS:10120
msgid ""
":gh:`98966`: In :mod:`subprocess`, raise a more informative message when "
"``stdout=STDOUT``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`98966`: 在 :mod:`subprocess` 中，当 ``stdout=STDOUT`` 时，会引发一个更信息化的消息。"

#: ../NEWS:10123
msgid ""
":gh:`117225`: doctest: only print \"and X failed\" when non-zero, don't "
"pluralise \"1 items\". Patch by Hugo van Kemenade."
msgstr ""
":gh:`117225`: doctest：只有当非零时才打印“and X failed”，不要将“1 items”复数化。由 Hugo van "
"Kemenade 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:10126
msgid ""
":gh:`117205`: Speed up :func:`compileall.compile_dir` by 20% when using "
"multiprocessing by increasing ``chunksize``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`117205`: 通过增加 ``chunksize``，在使用多处理时，:func:`compileall.compile_dir` "
"的速度提高了 20%。"

#: ../NEWS:10129
msgid ""
":gh:`117178`: Fix regression in lazy loading of self-referential modules, "
"introduced in :gh:`114781`."
msgstr ":gh:`117178`: 修复了在 :gh:`114781` 中引入的自引用模块的懒加载回归问题。"

#: ../NEWS:10132
msgid ""
":gh:`112383`: Fix :mod:`dis` module's handling of ``ENTER_EXECUTOR`` "
"instructions."
msgstr ":gh:`112383`: 修复 :mod:`dis` 模块对 ``ENTER_EXECUTOR`` 指令的处理。"

#: ../NEWS:10135
msgid ""
":gh:`117182`: Lazy-loading of modules that modify their own ``__class__`` no"
" longer reverts the ``__class__`` to :class:`types.ModuleType`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`117182`: 修改自身 ``__class__`` 的模块的懒加载不再将 ``__class__`` 恢复为 "
":class:`types.ModuleType`。"

#: ../NEWS:10138
msgid ""
":gh:`117084`: Fix :mod:`zipfile` extraction for directory entries with the "
"name containing backslashes on Windows."
msgstr ":gh:`117084`: 修复了 Windows 上 :mod:`zipfile` 提取包含反斜杠名称的目录条目时的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:10141
msgid ""
":gh:`117114`: Make :func:`os.path.isdevdrive` available on all platforms. "
"For those that do not offer Dev Drives, it will always return ``False``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`117114`: 使 :func:`os.path.isdevdrive` 在所有平台上可用。对于不提供 Dev Drives "
"的平台，它将始终返回 ``False``。"

#: ../NEWS:10144
msgid ""
":gh:`117110`: Fix a bug that prevents subclasses of :class:`typing.Any` to "
"be instantiated with arguments. Patch by Chris Fu."
msgstr ""
":gh:`117110`: 修复了一个阻止 :class:`typing.Any` 的子类用参数实例化的错误。由 Chris Fu 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:10147
msgid ""
":gh:`109653`: Deferred select imports in importlib.metadata and "
"importlib.resources for a 14% speedup."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109653`: 在 importlib.metadata 和 importlib.resources 中延迟选择导入，速度提升14%。"

#: ../NEWS:10150
msgid ""
":gh:`70647`: Start the deprecation period for the current behavior of "
":func:`datetime.datetime.strptime` and :func:`time.strptime` which always "
"fails to parse a date string with a :exc:`ValueError` involving a day of "
"month such as ``strptime(\"02-29\", \"%m-%d\")`` when a year is **not** "
"specified and the date happen to be February 29th.  This should help avoid "
"users finding new bugs every four years due to a natural mistaken assumption"
" about the API when parsing partial date values."
msgstr ""
":gh:`70647`: 开始弃用当前 :func:`datetime.datetime.strptime` 和 "
":func:`time.strptime` 的行为，当年份 **未** 指定且日期恰好是2月29日时，如 ``strptime(\"02-29\", "
"\"%m-%d\")``，总是解析失败并抛出 "
":exc:`ValueError`。这应有助于避免用户每四年因对API的自然错误假设而在解析部分日期值时发现新错误。"

#: ../NEWS:10158
msgid ":gh:`116987`: Fixed :func:`inspect.findsource` for class code objects."
msgstr ":gh:`116987`: 修复了 :func:`inspect.findsource` 对类代码对象的处理。"

#: ../NEWS:10160
msgid ""
":gh:`114099`: Modify standard library to allow for iOS platform differences."
msgstr ":gh:`114099`: 修改标准库以适应iOS平台的差异。"

#: ../NEWS:10162
msgid ""
":gh:`90872`: On Windows, :meth:`subprocess.Popen.wait` no longer calls "
"``WaitForSingleObject()`` with a negative timeout: pass ``0`` ms if the "
"timeout is negative. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`90872`: 在Windows上，:meth:`subprocess.Popen.wait` 不再用负超时调用 "
"``WaitForSingleObject()``：如果超时为负，则传递 ``0`` 毫秒。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:10166
msgid ""
":gh:`116957`: configparser: Don't leave ConfigParser values in an invalid "
"state (stored as a list instead of a str) after an earlier read raised "
"DuplicateSectionError or DuplicateOptionError."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116957`: configparser: 在早期读取引发 DuplicateSectionError 或 "
"DuplicateOptionError 后，不再将 ConfigParser 值保留在无效状态（存储为列表而不是字符串）。"

#: ../NEWS:10170
msgid ""
":gh:`115538`: :class:`!_io.WindowsConsoleIO` now emit a warning if a boolean"
" value is passed as a filedescriptor argument."
msgstr ":gh:`115538`: :class:`!_io.WindowsConsoleIO` 现在会在传递布尔值作为文件描述符参数时发出警告。"

#: ../NEWS:10173
msgid ":gh:`90095`: Ignore empty lines and comments in ``.pdbrc``"
msgstr ":gh:`90095`: 忽略 ``.pdbrc`` 中的空行和注释。"

#: ../NEWS:10175
msgid ""
":gh:`106531`: Refreshed zipfile._path from `zipp 3.18 "
"<https://zipp.readthedocs.io/en/latest/history.html#v3-18-0>`_, providing "
"better compatibility for PyPy, better glob performance for deeply nested "
"zipfiles, and providing internal access to ``CompleteDirs.inject`` for use "
"in other tests (like importlib.resources)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106531`: 从 `zipp 3.18 "
"<https://zipp.readthedocs.io/en/latest/history.html#v3-18-0>`_ 更新了 "
"zipfile._path，为PyPy提供了更好的兼容性，为深度嵌套的zip文件提供了更好的glob性能，并为其他测试（如 "
"importlib.resources）提供了对 ``CompleteDirs.inject`` 的内部访问。"

#: ../NEWS:10181
msgid ""
":gh:`63207`: On Windows, :func:`time.time` now uses the "
"``GetSystemTimePreciseAsFileTime()`` clock to have a resolution better than "
"1 us, instead of the ``GetSystemTimeAsFileTime()`` clock which has a "
"resolution of 15.6 ms. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`63207`: 在Windows上，:func:`time.time` 现在使用 "
"``GetSystemTimePreciseAsFileTime()`` 时钟，分辨率优于1微秒，而不是分辨率为15.6毫秒的 "
"``GetSystemTimeAsFileTime()`` 时钟。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:10186
msgid ""
":gh:`116764`: Restore support of ``None`` and other false values in "
":mod:`urllib.parse` functions :func:`~urllib.parse.parse_qs` and "
":func:`~urllib.parse.parse_qsl`. Also, they now raise a TypeError for non-"
"zero integers and non-empty sequences."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116764`: 恢复在 :mod:`urllib.parse` 函数 :func:`~urllib.parse.parse_qs` 和 "
":func:`~urllib.parse.parse_qsl` 中对 ``None`` 和其他假值的支持。此外，现在它们会对非零整数和非空序列抛出 "
"TypeError。"

#: ../NEWS:10191
msgid ""
":gh:`116811`: In ``PathFinder.invalidate_caches``, delegate to "
"``MetadataPathFinder.invalidate_caches``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116811`: 在 ``PathFinder.invalidate_caches`` 中，委托给 "
"``MetadataPathFinder.invalidate_caches``。"

