msgstr ""
":gh:`116608`: :mod:`importlib.resources` 函数 "
":func:`~importlib.resources.is_resource`、:func:`~importlib.resources.open_binary`、:func:`~importlib.resources.open_text`、:func:`~importlib.resources.path`、:func:`~importlib.resources.read_binary`"
