"数据现在直接存储在类型对象中，而不是存储在字典子类中。这是一个内部更改，不应影响使用。"

#: ../NEWS:10235
msgid ""
":gh:`116401`: Fix blocking :func:`os.fwalk` and :func:`shutil.rmtree` on "
"opening named pipe."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116401`: 修复了 :func:`os.fwalk` 和 :func:`shutil.rmtree` 在打开命名管道时的阻塞问题。"

#: ../NEWS:10238
msgid ":gh:`71052`: Implement :func:`ctypes.util.find_library` on Android."
msgstr ":gh:`71052`: 在 Android 上实现了 :func:`ctypes.util.find_library`。"

#: ../NEWS:10240
msgid ""
":gh:`90535`: Fix support of *interval* values > 1 in "
":class:`logging.TimedRotatingFileHandler` for ``when='MIDNIGHT'`` and "
"``when='Wx'``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`90535`: 修复了在 :class:`logging.TimedRotatingFileHandler` 中对于 "
"``when='MIDNIGHT'`` 和 ``when='Wx'`` 时 *interval* 值 > 1 的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:10244
msgid ""
":gh:`113308`: Remove some internal protected parts from :mod:`uuid`: "
"``_has_uuid_generate_time_safe``, ``_netbios_getnode``, "
"``_ipconfig_getnode``, and ``_load_system_functions``. They were unused."
msgstr ""
":gh:`113308`: 从 :mod:`uuid` "
