" 和 ``_load_system_functions``。它们未被使用。"

#: ../NEWS:10248
msgid ""
":gh:`115627`: Fix the :mod:`ssl` module error handling of connection "
"terminate by peer. It now throws an OSError with the appropriate error code "
"instead of an EOFError."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115627`: 修复了 :mod:`ssl` 模块在连接被对端终止时的错误处理。现在它会抛出一个带有适当错误代码的 OSError，而不是 "
"EOFError。"

#: ../NEWS:10252
msgid ""
":gh:`114847`: Speed up :func:`os.path.realpath` on non-Windows platforms."
msgstr ":gh:`114847`: 在非 Windows 平台上加速了 :func:`os.path.realpath`。"

#: ../NEWS:10254
msgid ":gh:`114271`: Fix a race in ``threading.Thread.join()``."
msgstr ":gh:`114271`: 修复了 ``threading.Thread.join()`` 中的一个竞争条件。"

#: ../NEWS:10256
msgid ""
"``threading._MainThread`` now always represents the main thread of the main "
"interpreter."
msgstr "``threading._MainThread`` 现在总是表示主解释器的主线程。"

#: ../NEWS:10259
msgid ""
"``PyThreadState.on_delete`` and ``PyThreadState.on_delete_data`` have been "
"removed."
msgstr "``PyThreadState.on_delete`` 和 ``PyThreadState.on_delete_data`` 已被移除。"

#: ../NEWS:10262
msgid ""
":gh:`113538`: Add :meth:`asyncio.Server.close_clients` and "
":meth:`asyncio.Server.abort_clients` methods which allow to more forcefully "
"close an asyncio server."
msgstr ""
":gh:`113538`: 添加了 :meth:`asyncio.Server.close_clients` 和 "
":meth:`asyncio.Server.abort_clients` 方法，允许更强制性地关闭一个 asyncio 服务器。"

#: ../NEWS:10266
msgid ""
":gh:`85287`: Changes Unicode codecs to return UnicodeEncodeError or "
"UnicodeDecodeError, rather than just UnicodeError."
msgstr ""
":gh:`85287`: 更改 Unicode 编解码器以返回 UnicodeEncodeError 或 "
"UnicodeDecodeError，而不仅仅是 UnicodeError。"

#: ../NEWS:10269
msgid ":gh:`113548`: :mod:`pdb` now allows CLI arguments to ``pdb -m``."
msgstr ":gh:`113548`: :mod:`pdb` 现在允许 CLI 参数传递给 ``pdb -m``。"

#: ../NEWS:10271
msgid ":gh:`112948`: Make completion of :mod:`pdb` similar to Python REPL"
msgstr ":gh:`112948`: 使 :mod:`pdb` 的补全类似于 Python REPL。"

#: ../NEWS:10273
msgid ""
":gh:`105866`: Fixed ``_get_slots`` bug which caused error when defining "
"dataclasses with slots and a weakref_slot."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105866`: 修复了 ``_get_slots`` 的 bug，该 bug 在定义带有 slots 和 weakref_slot "
"的数据类时会导致错误。"

#: ../NEWS:10276
msgid ""
":gh:`96471`: Add :py:class:`asyncio.Queue` termination with "
":py:meth:`~asyncio.Queue.shutdown` method."
msgstr ""
":gh:`96471`: 添加了 :py:class:`asyncio.Queue` 的终止功能，通过 "
":py:meth:`~asyncio.Queue.shutdown` 方法。"

#: ../NEWS:10279
msgid ":gh:`89739`: The :mod:`zipimport` module can now read ZIP64 files."
msgstr ":gh:`89739`: :mod:`zipimport` 模块现在可以读取 ZIP64 文件。"

#: ../NEWS:10281
msgid ""
":issue:`33533`: :func:`asyncio.as_completed` now returns an object that is "
"both an asynchronous iterator and plain iterator. The new asynchronous "
"iteration pattern allows for easier correlation between prior tasks and "
"their completed results. This is a closer match to "
":func:`concurrent.futures.as_completed`'s iteration pattern. Patch by Justin"
" Arthur."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33533`: :func:`asyncio.as_completed` "
"现在返回一个既是异步迭代器又是普通迭代器的对象。新的异步迭代模式使得在先前任务和它们完成的结果之间更容易建立关联。这与 "
":func:`concurrent.futures.as_completed` 的迭代模式更加匹配。由 Justin Arthur 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:10288
msgid ""
":issue:`27578`: :func:`inspect.getsource` (and related functions) work with "
"empty module files, returning ``'\\n'`` (or reasonable equivalent) instead "
"of raising ``OSError``. Patch by Kernc."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27578`: :func:`inspect.getsource` (及相关函数) 现在可以处理空模块文件，返回 ``'\\n'`` "
"(或合理等效内容) 而不是引发 ``OSError``。由 Kernc 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:10292
msgid ""
":issue:`37141`: Accept an iterable of separators in "
":meth:`asyncio.StreamReader.readuntil`, stopping when one of them is "
"encountered."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37141`: 在 :meth:`asyncio.StreamReader.readuntil` "
"中接受一个分隔符的可迭代对象，当遇到其中之一时停止。"

#: ../NEWS:10296
msgid ""
":gh:`66543`: Make :func:`mimetypes.guess_type` properly parsing of URLs with"
" only a host name, URLs containing fragment or query, and filenames with "
"only a UNC sharepoint on Windows. Based on patch by Dong-hee Na."
msgstr ""
":gh:`66543`: 使 :func:`mimetypes.guess_type` "
"能够正确解析仅包含主机名的URL、包含片段或查询的URL以及Windows上仅包含UNC共享点的文件名。基于 Dong-hee Na 的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:10300
msgid ""
":issue:`15010`: :meth:`unittest.TestLoader.discover` now saves the original "
"value of ``unittest.TestLoader._top_level_dir`` and restores it at the end "
"of the call."
msgstr ""
":issue:`15010`: :meth:`unittest.TestLoader.discover` 现在保存 "
"``unittest.TestLoader._top_level_dir`` 的原始值，并在调用结束时恢复它。"

#: ../NEWS:10307
msgid ":gh:`115977`: Remove compatibility references to Emscripten."
msgstr ":gh:`115977`: 移除对 Emscripten 的兼容性引用。"

#: ../NEWS:10309
