"``%N#`` 格式的支持：格式化对象类型和类型的完全限定名称：调用 :c:func:`PyType_GetModuleName`。更多信息请参见 "
":pep:`737`。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:10425
msgid ""
":gh:`111696`: Add :c:func:`PyType_GetModuleName` function to get the type's "
"module name. Equivalent to getting the ``type.__module__`` attribute. Patch "
"by Eric Snow and Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
