":gh:`115821`: [Enum] Improve error message when calling super().__new__() in"
" custom __new__."
msgstr ":gh:`115821`: [Enum] 改进在自定义 __new__ 中调用 super().__new__() 时的错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:10595
msgid ""
":gh:`85644`: Use the ``XDG_CURRENT_DESKTOP`` environment variable in "
":mod:`webbrowser` to check desktop. Prefer it to the deprecated "
"``GNOME_DESKTOP_SESSION_ID`` for GNOME detection."
msgstr ""
":gh:`85644`: 在 :mod:`webbrowser` 中使用 ``XDG_CURRENT_DESKTOP`` 环境变量来检查桌面环境。对于 "
"GNOME 检测，优先使用它而非已弃用的 ``GNOME_DESKTOP_SESSION_ID``。"

#: ../NEWS:10599
msgid ""
":gh:`75988`: Fixed :func:`unittest.mock.create_autospec` to pass the call "
"through to the wrapped object to return the real result."
msgstr ""
":gh:`75988`: 修复 :func:`unittest.mock.create_autospec` 以通过调用传递给包装对象来返回真实结果。"

#: ../NEWS:10602
msgid ""
":gh:`115881`: Fix issue where :func:`ast.parse` would incorrectly flag "
"conditional context managers (such as ``with (x() if y else z()): ...``) as "
"invalid syntax if ``feature_version=(3, 8)`` was passed. This reverts "
"changes to the grammar made as part of :gh:`94949`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115881`: 修复了当传递 ``feature_version=(3, 8)`` 时，:func:`ast.parse` "
"会错误地将条件上下文管理器（如 ``with (x() if y else z()): ...``）标记为无效语法的问题。这撤销了作为 "
":gh:`94949` 一部分对语法所做的更改。"

#: ../NEWS:10607
msgid ""
":gh:`115886`: Fix silent truncation of the name with an embedded null "
"character in :class:`multiprocessing.shared_memory.SharedMemory`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115886`: 修复了 :class:`multiprocessing.shared_memory.SharedMemory` "
"中嵌入空字符的名称被静默截断的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:10610
msgid ":gh:`115532`: Add kernel density estimation to the statistics module."
msgstr ":gh:`115532`: 向统计模块添加了核密度估计。"

#: ../NEWS:10612
msgid ""
":gh:`115714`: On WASI, the :mod:`time` module no longer get process time "
"using ``times()`` or ``CLOCK_PROCESS_CPUTIME_ID``, system API is that is "
"unreliable and is likely to be removed from WASI. The affected clock "
"functions fall back to calling ``clock()``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115714`: 在 WASI 上，:mod:`time` 模块不再使用 ``times()`` 或 "
"``CLOCK_PROCESS_CPUTIME_ID`` 获取进程时间，因为这些系统 API 不可靠，并可能从 WASI "
"中移除。受影响的时钟函数回退到调用 ``clock()``。"

#: ../NEWS:10617
msgid ""
":gh:`115809`: Improve algorithm for computing which rolled-over log files to"
" delete in :class:`logging.TimedRotatingFileHandler`. It is now reliable for"
" handlers without ``namer`` and with arbitrary deterministic ``namer`` that "
"leaves the datetime part in the file name unmodified."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115809`: 改进了 :class:`logging.TimedRotatingFileHandler` "
"中计算要删除哪些滚动日志文件的算法。现在对于没有 ``namer`` 和具有任意确定性 ``namer`` (不修改文件名中的日期时间部分) "
"的处理程序来说是可靠的。"

#: ../NEWS:10622
msgid ""
":gh:`74668`: :mod:`urllib.parse` functions :func:`~urllib.parse.parse_qs` "
"and :func:`~urllib.parse.parse_qsl` now support bytes arguments containing "
"raw and percent-encoded non-ASCII data."
msgstr ""
":gh:`74668`: :mod:`urllib.parse` 函数 :func:`~urllib.parse.parse_qs` 和 "
":func:`~urllib.parse.parse_qsl` 现在支持包含原始和百分比编码非 ASCII 数据的字节参数。"

#: ../NEWS:10626
msgid ""
":gh:`67044`: :func:`csv.writer` now always quotes or escapes ``'\\r'`` and "
"``'\\n'``, regardless of *lineterminator* value."
msgstr ""
":gh:`67044`: :func:`csv.writer` 现在总是引用或转义 ``'\\r'`` 和 ``'\\n'``，不管 "
"*lineterminator* 的值如何。"

#: ../NEWS:10629
msgid ""
":gh:`115712`: Restore support of space delimiter with "
"``skipinitialspace=True`` in :mod:`csv`. :func:`csv.writer` now quotes empty"
" fields if delimiter is a space and skipinitialspace is true and raises "
"exception if quoting is not possible."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115712`: 恢复了 :mod:`csv` 中 ``skipinitialspace=True`` "
"时对空格分隔符的支持。:func:`csv.writer` 现在如果分隔符是空格且 skipinitialspace "
"为真，则引用空字段，并在无法引用时引发异常。"

#: ../NEWS:10634
msgid ""
":gh:`112364`: Fixed :func:`ast.unparse` to handle format_spec with ``\"``, "
"``'`` or ``\\\\``. Patched by Frank Hoffmann."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112364`: 修复了 :func:`ast.unparse` 处理包含 ``\"``、``'`` 或 ``\\\\`` 的 "
"format_spec 的问题。由 Frank Hoffmann 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:10637
msgid ""
":gh:`112997`: Stop logging potentially sensitive callback arguments in "
":mod:`asyncio` unless debug mode is active."
msgstr ":gh:`112997`: 除非调试模式处于活动状态，否则停止记录 :mod:`asyncio` 中可能敏感的回调参数。"

#: ../NEWS:10640
msgid ""
":gh:`114914`: Fix an issue where an abandoned :class:`StreamWriter` would "
"not be garbage collected."
msgstr ":gh:`114914`: 修复了废弃的 :class:`StreamWriter` 不会被垃圾回收的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:10643
msgid ""
":gh:`111358`: Fix a bug in "
":meth:`asyncio.BaseEventLoop.shutdown_default_executor` to ensure the "
"timeout passed to the coroutine behaves as expected."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111358`: 修复 :meth:`asyncio.BaseEventLoop.shutdown_default_executor` "
"中的一个 bug，确保传递给协程的超时行为符合预期。"

#: ../NEWS:10647
msgid ""
":gh:`115618`: Fix improper decreasing the reference count for ``None`` "
"argument in :class:`property` methods :meth:`~property.getter`, "
":meth:`~property.setter` and :meth:`~property.deleter`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115618`: 修复 :class:`property` 方法 "
":meth:`~property.getter`、:meth:`~property.setter` 和 "
":meth:`~property.deleter` 中对 ``None`` 参数引用计数不当减少的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:10651
msgid ""
":gh:`112720`: Refactor :class:`dis.ArgResolver` to make it possible to "
"subclass and change the way jump args are interpreted."
msgstr ":gh:`112720`: 重构 :class:`dis.ArgResolver`，使其可以子类化并改变跳转参数的解析方式。"

#: ../NEWS:10654
msgid ""
":gh:`112006`: Fix :func:`inspect.unwrap` for types with the ``__wrapper__`` "
"data descriptor. Fix :meth:`inspect.Signature.from_callable` for builtins "
":func:`classmethod` and :func:`staticmethod`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112006`: 修复 :func:`inspect.unwrap` 对于带有 ``__wrapper__`` 数据描述符的类型的问题。修复 "
":meth:`inspect.Signature.from_callable` 对于内置函数 :func:`classmethod` 和 "
":func:`staticmethod` 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:10658
msgid ""
":gh:`101293`: Support callables with the ``__call__()`` method and types "
"with ``__new__()`` and ``__init__()`` methods set to class methods, static "
"methods, bound methods, partial functions, and other types of methods and "
"descriptors in :meth:`inspect.Signature.from_callable`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101293`: 在 :meth:`inspect.Signature.from_callable` 中支持带有 ``__call__()``"
" 方法的可调用对象，以及将 ``__new__()`` 和 ``__init__()`` "
"方法设置为类方法、静态方法、绑定方法、部分函数以及其他类型的方法和描述符的类型。"

#: ../NEWS:10663
msgid ":gh:`103092`: Isolate :mod:`!_lsprof` (apply :pep:`687`)."
msgstr ":gh:`103092`: 隔离 :mod:`!_lsprof` (应用 :pep:`687`) 。"

#: ../NEWS:10665
msgid ""
":gh:`113942`: :mod:`pydoc` no longer skips global functions implemented as "
"builtin methods, such as :class:`~type.MethodDescriptorType` and "
":class:`~type.WrapperDescriptorType`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`113942`: :mod:`pydoc` 不再跳过作为内置方法实现的全局函数，例如 "
":class:`~type.MethodDescriptorType` 和 :class:`~type.WrapperDescriptorType`。"

#: ../NEWS:10669
msgid ""
":gh:`115256`: Added DeprecationWarning when accessing the tarfile attribute "
"of TarInfo objects. The attribute is never used internally and is only "
"attached to TarInfos when the tarfile is opened in write-mode, not read-"
"mode. The attribute creates an unnecessary reference cycle which may cause "
"corruption when not closing the handle after writing a tarfile."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115256`: 当访问 TarInfo 对象的 tarfile 属性时添加 "
"DeprecationWarning。该属性在内部从未使用，并且仅在 tarfile 以写入模式打开时附加到 "
"TarInfos，而不是读取模式。该属性创建了一个不必要的引用循环，如果在写入 tarfile 后不关闭句柄，可能会导致损坏。"

#: ../NEWS:10675
msgid ""
":gh:`115197`: ``urllib.request`` no longer resolves the hostname before "
"checking it against the system's proxy bypass list on macOS and Windows."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115197`: ``urllib.request`` 在 macOS 和 Windows 上不再在检查系统代理绕过列表之前解析主机名。"

#: ../NEWS:10678
msgid ""
":gh:`113812`: :meth:`DatagramTransport.sendto` will now send zero-length "
"datagrams if called with an empty bytes object. The transport flow control "
"also now accounts for the datagram header when calculating the buffer size."
msgstr ""
":gh:`113812`: :meth:`DatagramTransport.sendto` 现在如果调用时使用空的 bytes "
"对象，将发送零长度的数据报。传输流控制在计算缓冲区大小时现在也会考虑数据报头。"

#: ../NEWS:10683
msgid ""
":gh:`114763`: Protect modules loaded with :class:`importlib.util.LazyLoader`"
" from race conditions when multiple threads try to access attributes before "
"the loading is complete."
msgstr ""
":gh:`114763`: 保护使用 :class:`importlib.util.LazyLoader` "
"加载的模块，防止在加载完成前多个线程尝试访问属性时出现竞争条件。"

#: ../NEWS:10687
msgid ""
":gh:`114709`: :func:`posixpath.commonpath` now raises a :exc:`ValueError` "
"exception when passed an empty iterable. Previously, :exc:`IndexError` was "
"raised."
msgstr ""
":gh:`114709`: :func:`posixpath.commonpath` 现在在传递空的可迭代对象时引发 :exc:`ValueError`"
" 异常。之前是引发 :exc:`IndexError`。"

#: ../NEWS:10691
msgid ""
":func:`posixpath.commonpath` now raises a :exc:`TypeError` exception when "
"passed ``None``. Previously, :exc:`ValueError` was raised."
msgstr ""
":func:`posixpath.commonpath` 现在在传递 ``None`` 时引发 :exc:`TypeError` 异常。之前是引发 "
":exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../NEWS:10694
msgid ""
":gh:`114610`: Fix bug where :meth:`pathlib.PurePath.with_stem` converted a "
"non-empty path suffix to a stem when given an empty *stem* argument. It now "
"raises :exc:`ValueError`, just like :meth:`pathlib.PurePath.with_suffix` "
"does when called on a path with an empty stem, given a non-empty *suffix* "
"argument."
msgstr ""
":gh:`114610`: 修复了 :meth:`pathlib.PurePath.with_stem` 在给定空的 *stem* "
"参数时将非空路径后缀转换为 stem 的 bug。现在它会引发 :exc:`ValueError`，就像 "
":meth:`pathlib.PurePath.with_suffix` 在路径有空的 stem 且给定非空的 *suffix* 参数时做的那样。"

#: ../NEWS:10700
msgid ""
":gh:`107361`: Add :data:`ssl.VERIFY_X509_PARTIAL_CHAIN` and "
":data:`VERIFY_X509_STRICT` to the default SSL context created with "
":func:`ssl.create_default_context`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`107361`: 将 :data:`ssl.VERIFY_X509_PARTIAL_CHAIN` 和 "
":data:`VERIFY_X509_STRICT` 添加到通过 :func:`ssl.create_default_context` 创建的默认 "
"SSL 上下文中。"

#: ../NEWS:10704
msgid ""
":gh:`112281`: Allow creating :ref:`union of types<types-union>` for "
":class:`typing.Annotated` with unhashable metadata."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112281`: 允许为 :class:`typing.Annotated` 创建 :ref:`类型的联合 <types-"
"union>`，即使元数据不可哈希。"

#: ../NEWS:10707
msgid ""
":gh:`111775`: Fix :meth:`importlib.resources.simple.ResourceHandle.open` for"
" text mode, added missed ``stream`` argument."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111775`: 修复了 :meth:`importlib.resources.simple.ResourceHandle.open` "
"在文本模式下的问题，添加了遗漏的 ``stream`` 参数。"

#: ../NEWS:10710
msgid ":gh:`90095`: Make .pdbrc and -c work with any valid pdb commands."
msgstr ":gh:`90095`: 使 .pdbrc 和 -c 可以与任何有效的 pdb 命令一起工作。"

#: ../NEWS:10712
msgid ""
":gh:`107625`: Raise :exc:`configparser.ParsingError` from "
":meth:`~configparser.ConfigParser.read` and "
":meth:`~configparser.ConfigParser.read_file` methods of "
":class:`configparser.ConfigParser` if a key without a corresponding value is"
" continued (that is, followed by an indented line)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`107625`: 如果键没有对应的值并且继续（即后面跟着缩进行），则从 :class:`configparser.ConfigParser` "
"的 :meth:`~configparser.ConfigParser.read` 和 "
":meth:`~configparser.ConfigParser.read_file` 方法中引发 "
":exc:`configparser.ParsingError`。"

#: ../NEWS:10718
msgid ""
":gh:`107155`: Fix incorrect output of ``help(x)`` where ``x`` is a "
":keyword:`lambda` function, which has an ``__annotations__`` dictionary "
"attribute with a ``\"return\"`` key."
msgstr ""
":gh:`107155`: 修复了 ``help(x)`` 的错误输出，其中 ``x`` 是一个 :keyword:`lambda` "
"函数，该函数有一个带有 ``\"return\"`` 键的 ``__annotations__`` 字典属性。"

#: ../NEWS:10722
msgid ""
":gh:`57141`: Add option for *non-shallow* comparisons to "
":class:`filecmp.dircmp` like :func:`filecmp.cmp`. Original patch by Steven "
"Ward. Enhanced by Tobias Rautenkranz"
msgstr ""
":gh:`57141`: 为 :class:`filecmp.dircmp` 添加了 *非浅层* 比较选项，类似于 "
":func:`filecmp.cmp`。原始由 Steven Ward 提供补丁。由 Tobias Rautenkranz 增强。"

#: ../NEWS:10726
msgid ""
":gh:`69990`: :meth:`Profile.print_stats` has been improved to accept "
"multiple sort arguments. Patched by Chiu-Hsiang Hsu and Furkan Onder."
msgstr ""
":gh:`69990`: :meth:`Profile.print_stats` 已改进为接受多个排序参数。由 Chiu-Hsiang Hsu 和 "
"Furkan Onder 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:10729
msgid ":gh:`104061`: Add :data:`socket.SO_BINDTOIFINDEX` constant."
msgstr ":gh:`104061`: 添加 :data:`socket.SO_BINDTOIFINDEX` 常量。"

#: ../NEWS:10731
msgid ":gh:`60346`: Fix ArgumentParser inconsistent with parse_known_args."
msgstr ":gh:`60346`: 修复 ArgumentParser 与 parse_known_args 不一致的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:10733
msgid ":gh:`102389`: Add ``windows_31j`` to aliases for ``cp932`` codec"
msgstr ":gh:`102389`: 将 ``windows_31j`` 添加到 ``cp932`` 编码的别名中。"

#: ../NEWS:10735
msgid ""
":gh:`72249`: Always include the :term:`module` name in the :func:`repr` of "
":func:`functools.partial` objects.  Patch by Furkan Onder and Anilyka Barry."
msgstr ""
":gh:`72249`: 始终在 :func:`functools.partial` 对象的 :func:`repr` 中包括 "
":term:`module` 名称。 由 Furkan Onder 和 Anilyka Barry 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:10739
msgid ""
":gh:`100985`: Update HTTPSConnection to consistently wrap IPv6 Addresses "
"when using a proxy."
msgstr ":gh:`100985`: 更新 HTTPSConnection 以在使用代理时一致地包装 IPv6 地址。"

#: ../NEWS:10742
msgid ""
":gh:`100884`: email: fix misfolding of comma in address-lists over multiple "
"lines in combination with unicode encoding."
msgstr ":gh:`100884`: email: 修复在多行地址列表中结合 Unicode 编码时逗号的错误折叠问题。"

#: ../NEWS:10745
msgid ""
":gh:`95782`: Fix :func:`io.BufferedReader.tell`, "
":func:`io.BufferedReader.seek`, :func:`!_pyio.BufferedReader.tell`, "
":func:`io.BufferedRandom.tell`, :func:`io.BufferedRandom.seek` and "
":func:`!_pyio.BufferedRandom.tell` being able to return negative offsets."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95782`: 修复 :func:`io.BufferedReader.tell`, "
":func:`io.BufferedReader.seek`, :func:`!_pyio.BufferedReader.tell`, "
":func:`io.BufferedRandom.tell`, :func:`io.BufferedRandom.seek` 和 "
":func:`!_pyio.BufferedRandom.tell` 可能返回负偏移量的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:10750
msgid ""
":gh:`96310`: Fix a traceback in :mod:`argparse` when all options in a "
"mutually exclusive group are suppressed."
msgstr ":gh:`96310`: 修复 :mod:`argparse` 中当互斥组中的所有选项被抑制时出现的回溯问题。"

#: ../NEWS:10753
msgid ""
":gh:`93205`: Fixed a bug in "
":class:`logging.handlers.TimedRotatingFileHandler` where multiple rotating "
"handler instances pointing to files with the same name but different "
"extensions would conflict and not delete the correct files."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93205`: 修复 :class:`logging.handlers.TimedRotatingFileHandler` "
"中的一个错误，其中指向具有相同名称但不同扩展名的文件的多个旋转处理程序实例会冲突并且不会删除正确的文件。"

#: ../NEWS:10758
msgid ":issue:`31116`: Add Z85 encoding to ``base64``."
msgstr ":issue:`31116`: 将 Z85 编码添加到 ``base64`` 中。"

#: ../NEWS:10760
msgid ""
":issue:`44865`: Add missing call to localization function in "
":mod:`argparse`."
msgstr ":issue:`44865`: 在 :mod:`argparse` 中添加对本地化函数的缺失调用。"

#: ../NEWS:10762
msgid ""
":issue:`43952`: Fix :meth:`multiprocessing.connection.Listener.accept` to "
"accept empty bytes as authkey. Not accepting empty bytes as key causes it to"
" hang indefinitely."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43952`: 修复 :meth:`multiprocessing.connection.Listener.accept` "
"以接受空字节作为 authkey。不接受空字节作为密钥会导致其无限期挂起。"

#: ../NEWS:10766
msgid ""
":issue:`42125`: linecache: get module name from ``__spec__`` if available. "
"This allows getting source code for the ``__main__`` module when a custom "
"loader is used."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42125`: linecache: 如果可用，从 ``__spec__`` 获取模块名称。这允许在使用自定义加载器时获取 "
"``__main__`` 模块的源代码。"

#: ../NEWS:10770
msgid ""
":issue:`41122`: Failing to pass arguments properly to "
":func:`functools.singledispatchmethod` now throws a TypeError instead of "
"hitting an index out of bounds internally."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41122`: 未能正确传递参数给 :func:`functools.singledispatchmethod` 现在会抛出 "
"TypeError，而不是内部遇到索引越界。"

#: ../NEWS:10774
msgid ""
":issue:`40818`: The asyncio REPL now runs :data:`sys.__interactivehook__` on"
" startup. The default implementation of :data:`sys.__interactivehook__` "
"provides auto-completion to the asyncio REPL. Patch contributed by Rémi "
"Lapeyre."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40818`: asyncio REPL 现在在启动时运行 "
":data:`sys.__interactivehook__`。:data:`sys.__interactivehook__` 的默认实现为 "
"asyncio REPL 提供了自动完成功能。补丁由 Rémi Lapeyre 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:10779
msgid ""
":issue:`33775`: Add 'default' and 'version' help text for localization in "
"argparse."
msgstr ":issue:`33775`: 在 argparse 中为本地化添加了 'default' 和 'version' 帮助文本。"

#: ../NEWS:10785
msgid ""
":gh:`115399`: Document :cve:`2023-52425` of Expat <2.6.0 under \"XML "
"vulnerabilities\"."
msgstr ":gh:`115399`: 在 \"XML 漏洞\" 下记录了 Expat <2.6.0 的 :cve:`2023-52425`。"

#: ../NEWS:10788
msgid ":gh:`109653`: Improve import time of :mod:`uuid` on Linux."
msgstr ":gh:`109653`: 提高了 Linux 上 :mod:`uuid` 的导入时间。"

#: ../NEWS:10793
msgid ""
":gh:`71052`: Add test exclusions to support running the test suite on "
"Android."
msgstr ":gh:`71052`: 添加测试排除项以支持在 Android 上运行测试套件。"

#: ../NEWS:10796
msgid ""
":gh:`71052`: Enable ``test_concurrent_futures`` on platforms that support "
"threading but not multiprocessing."
msgstr ":gh:`71052`: 在支持线程但不支持多处理的平台上启用 ``test_concurrent_futures``。"

#: ../NEWS:10799
msgid ""
":gh:`115796`: Make '_testinternalcapi.assemble_code_object' construct the "
"exception table for the code object."
msgstr ":gh:`115796`: 使 '_testinternalcapi.assemble_code_object' 为代码对象构造异常表。"

#: ../NEWS:10802
msgid ""
":gh:`115720`: Leak tests (``-R``, ``--huntrleaks``) now show a summary of "
"the number of leaks found in each iteration."
msgstr ":gh:`115720`: 泄漏测试（``-R``, ``--huntrleaks``）现在显示每次迭代中发现泄漏数量的摘要。"

#: ../NEWS:10805
msgid ""
":gh:`115122`: Add ``--bisect`` option to regrtest test runner: run failed "
"tests with ``test.bisect_cmd`` to identify failing tests. Patch by Victor "
"Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115122`: 为 regrtest 测试运行器添加 ``--bisect`` 选项：使用 ``test.bisect_cmd`` "
"运行失败的测试以识别失败的测试。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:10809
msgid ""
":gh:`115596`: Fix ``ProgramPriorityTests`` in ``test_os`` permanently "
"changing the process priority."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115596`: 修复 ``test_os`` 中的 ``ProgramPriorityTests`` 永久改变进程优先级的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:10812
msgid ""
":gh:`115556`: On Windows, commas passed in arguments to "
"``Tools\\buildbot\\test.bat`` and ``PCbuild\\\\rt.bat`` are now properly "
"handled."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115556`: 在 Windows 上，传递给 ``Tools\\buildbot\\test.bat`` 和 "
"``PCbuild\\\\rt.bat`` 的参数中的逗号现在被正确处理。"

#: ../NEWS:10816
msgid ""
":gh:`115420`: Fix translation of exception handler targets by "
"``_testinternalcapi.optimize_cfg``."
msgstr ":gh:`115420`: 修复 ``_testinternalcapi.optimize_cfg`` 对异常处理目标的翻译。"

#: ../NEWS:10819
msgid ""
":gh:`115376`: Fix segfault in ``_testinternalcapi.compiler_codegen`` on bad "
"input."
msgstr ":gh:`115376`: 修复 ``_testinternalcapi.compiler_codegen`` 在错误输入上的段错误。"

#: ../NEWS:10825
msgid ""
":gh:`116313`: Get WASI builds to work under wasmtime 18 w/ WASI 0.2/preview2"
" primitives."
msgstr ":gh:`116313`: 使 WASI 构建在 wasmtime 18 下使用 WASI 0.2/preview2 原语工作。"

#: ../NEWS:10828
msgid ""
":gh:`71052`: Change Android's :data:`sys.platform` from ``\"linux\"`` to "
"``\"android\"``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`71052`: 将 Android 的 :data:`sys.platform` 从 ``\"linux\"`` 改为 "
"``\"android\"``。"

#: ../NEWS:10831
msgid ""
":gh:`116117`: Backport ``libb2``'s PR #42 to fix compiling CPython on 32-bit"
" Windows with ``clang-cl``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116117`: 回退 ``libb2`` 的 PR #42 以修复在 32 位 Windows 上用 ``clang-cl`` 编译 "
"CPython 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:10834
msgid ":gh:`71052`: Fix several Android build issues"
msgstr ":gh:`71052`: 修复多个 Android 构建问题"

#: ../NEWS:10836
msgid ""
":gh:`114099`: A testbed project was added to run the test suite on iOS."
msgstr ":gh:`114099`: 添加了一个测试床项目以在 iOS 上运行测试套件。"

#: ../NEWS:10838
msgid ""
":gh:`115350`: Fix building ctypes module with -DWIN32_LEAN_AND_MEAN defined"
msgstr ":gh:`115350`: 修复在定义了 -DWIN32_LEAN_AND_MEAN 的情况下构建 ctypes 模块的问题"

#: ../NEWS:10840
msgid ":gh:`111225`: Link extension modules against libpython on Android."
msgstr ":gh:`111225`: 在 Android 上将扩展模块链接到 libpython。"

#: ../NEWS:10842
msgid ""
":gh:`115737`: The install name for libPython is now correctly set for non-"
"framework macOS builds."
msgstr ":gh:`115737`: 现在为非框架 macOS 构建正确设置了 libPython 的安装名称。"

#: ../NEWS:10845
msgid ""
":gh:`114099`: Makefile targets were added to support compiling an iOS-"
"compatible framework build."
msgstr ":gh:`114099`: 添加了 Makefile 目标以支持编译兼容 iOS 的框架构建。"

#: ../NEWS:10851
msgid ""
":gh:`116012`: Ensure the value of ``GetLastError()`` is preserved across GIL"
" operations."
msgstr ":gh:`116012`: 确保在 GIL 操作期间保留 ``GetLastError()`` 的值。"

#: ../NEWS:10854
msgid ""
":gh:`115582`: Building extensions intended for free-threaded builds of "
"CPython now require compiling with ``/DPy_GIL_DISABLED`` manually when using"
" a regular install. This is expected to change in future releases."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115582`: 现在，当使用常规安装时，为 CPython 的自由线程构建构建扩展需要手动使用 ``/DPy_GIL_DISABLED`` "
"进行编译。预计在未来的版本中会有所变化。"

#: ../NEWS:10858
msgid ""
":gh:`115554`: The installer now has more strict rules about updating the "
":ref:`launcher`. In general, most users only have a single launcher "
"installed and will see no difference. When multiple launchers have been "
"installed, the option to install the launcher is disabled until all but one "
"have been removed. Downgrading the launcher (which was never allowed) is now"
" more obviously blocked."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115554`: 安装程序现在对于更新 :ref:`launcher` "
"有更严格的规则。一般来说，大多数用户只安装了一个启动器，不会看到任何区别。当安装了多个启动器时，安装启动器的选项将被禁用，直到只剩下一个。降级启动器（从未允许）现在被更明显地阻止。"

#: ../NEWS:10865
msgid ""
":gh:`115543`: :ref:`launcher` can now detect Python 3.13 when installed from"
" the Microsoft Store, and will install Python 3.12 by default when "
":envvar:`PYLAUNCHER_ALLOW_INSTALL` is set."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115543`: :ref:`launcher` 现在可以检测从 Microsoft Store 安装的 Python 3.13，并且在设置 "
":envvar:`PYLAUNCHER_ALLOW_INSTALL` 时默认安装 Python 3.12。"

#: ../NEWS:10872
msgid ":gh:`116145`: Update macOS installer to Tcl/Tk 8.6.14."
msgstr ":gh:`116145`: 将 macOS 安装程序更新到 Tcl/Tk 8.6.14。"

#: ../NEWS:10877
msgid ""
":gh:`88516`: On macOS show a proxy icon in the title bar of editor windows "
"to match platform behaviour."
msgstr ":gh:`88516`: 在 macOS 上，在编辑器窗口的标题栏中显示代理图标以匹配平台行为。"

#: ../NEWS:10883
msgid ":gh:`100176`: Remove outdated Tools/{io,cc,string}bench"
msgstr ":gh:`100176`: 移除过时的 Tools/{io,cc,string}bench"

#: ../NEWS:10885
msgid ""
":issue:`45101`: Add consistency in usage message IO between 2 versions of "
"python-config."
msgstr ":issue:`45101`: 在两个版本的 python-config 之间添加使用消息 IO 的一致性。"

#: ../NEWS:10891
msgid ""
":gh:`114626`: Add again ``_PyCFunctionFastWithKeywords`` name, removed in "
"Python 3.13 alpha 4 by mistake.  Keep the old private "
"``_PyCFunctionFastWithKeywords`` name (Python 3.7) as an alias to the new "
"public name ``PyCFunctionFastWithKeywords`` (Python 3.13a4). Patch by Victor"
" Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`114626`: 再次添加 ``_PyCFunctionFastWithKeywords`` 名称，该名称在 Python 3.13 "
"alpha 4 中被错误移除。保留旧的私有 ``_PyCFunctionFastWithKeywords`` 名称（Python 3.7）作为新公共名称"
" ``PyCFunctionFastWithKeywords`` (Python 3.13a4) 的别名。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:10897
msgid ""
":gh:`111418`: Add :c:macro:`PyHASH_MODULUS`, :c:macro:`PyHASH_BITS`, "
":c:macro:`PyHASH_INF` and :c:macro:`PyHASH_IMAG` C macros.  Patch by Sergey "
"B Kirpichev."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111418`: 添加 "
":c:macro:`PyHASH_MODULUS`、:c:macro:`PyHASH_BITS`、:c:macro:`PyHASH_INF` 和 "
":c:macro:`PyHASH_IMAG` C 宏。由 Sergey B Kirpichev 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:10903
msgid "Python 3.13.0 alpha 4"
msgstr "Python 3.13.0 alpha 4"

#: ../NEWS:10905
msgid "*Release date: 2024-02-15*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2024-02-15*"

#: ../NEWS:10910
msgid ":gh:`115399`: Update bundled libexpat to 2.6.0"
msgstr ":gh:`115399`: 将捆绑的 libexpat 更新到 2.6.0"

#: ../NEWS:10912
msgid ""
":gh:`115243`: Fix possible crashes in :meth:`collections.deque.index` when "
"the deque is concurrently modified."
msgstr ":gh:`115243`: 修复在并发修改时 :meth:`collections.deque.index` 可能崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:10918
msgid ""
":gh:`112087`: For an empty reverse iterator for list will be reduced to "
":func:`reversed`. Patch by Donghee Na"
msgstr ":gh:`112087`: 对于列表的空反向迭代器将简化为 :func:`reversed`。由 Donghee Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:10921
msgid ""
":gh:`114570`: Add :exc:`PythonFinalizationError` exception. This exception "
"derived from :exc:`RuntimeError` is raised when an operation is blocked "
"during the :term:`Python finalization <interpreter shutdown>`. Patch by "
"Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`114570`: 添加 :exc:`PythonFinalizationError` 异常。此异常派生自 "
":exc:`RuntimeError`，在 :term:`Python 终结 <interpreter shutdown>` 期间阻止操作时引发。由 "
"Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:10926
msgid ""
":gh:`114695`: Add :func:`sys._clear_internal_caches`, which clears all "
"internal performance-related caches (and deprecate the less-general "
":func:`sys._clear_type_cache` function)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`114695`: 添加 :func:`sys._clear_internal_caches`，清除所有内部性能相关缓存（并弃用不太通用的 "
":func:`sys._clear_type_cache` 函数）。"

#: ../NEWS:10930
msgid ""
":gh:`114828`: Fix compilation crashes in uncommon code examples using "
":func:`super` inside a comprehension in a class body."
msgstr ":gh:`114828`: 修复在类体中的推导式内使用 :func:`super` 的不常见代码示例中的编译崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:10933
msgid ""
":gh:`112069`: Adapt :class:`set` and :class:`frozenset` methods to Argument "
"Clinic."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112069`: 使 :class:`set` 和 :class:`frozenset` 方法适应 Argument Clinic。"

#: ../NEWS:10936
msgid ""
":gh:`115011`: Setters for members with an unsigned integer type now support "
"the same range of valid values for objects that has a "
":meth:`~object.__index__` method as for :class:`int`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115011`: 现在，对于具有 :meth:`~object.__index__` 方法的对象，无符号整数类型成员的设置器支持与 "
":class:`int` 相同的有效值范围。"

#: ../NEWS:10940
msgid ""
":gh:`114887`: Changed socket type validation in "
":meth:`~asyncio.loop.create_datagram_endpoint` to accept all non-stream "
"sockets. This fixes a regression in compatibility with raw sockets."
msgstr ""
":gh:`114887`: 更改 :meth:`~asyncio.loop.create_datagram_endpoint` "
"中的套接字类型验证，以接受所有非流套接字。这修复了与原始套接字兼容性的回归问题。"

#: ../NEWS:10944
msgid ""
":gh:`114944`: Fixes a race between ``PyParkingLot_Park`` and "
"``_PyParkingLot_UnparkAll``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`114944`: 修复 ``PyParkingLot_Park`` 和 ``_PyParkingLot_UnparkAll`` "
"之间的竞争条件。"

#: ../NEWS:10947
msgid ""
":gh:`113462`: Limit the number of versions that a single class can use. "
"Prevents a few wayward classes using up all the version numbers."
msgstr ":gh:`113462`: 限制单个类可以使用的版本数量。防止一些偏离的类用完所有版本号。"

#: ../NEWS:10950
msgid ""
":gh:`76763`: The :func:`chr` builtin function now always raises "
":exc:`ValueError` for values outside the valid range. Previously it raised "
":exc:`OverflowError` for very large or small values."
msgstr ""
":gh:`76763`: :func:`chr` 内置函数现在总是对超出有效范围的值引发 "
":exc:`ValueError`。以前对于非常大或非常小的值会引发 :exc:`OverflowError`。"

#: ../NEWS:10954
msgid ""
":gh:`114806`: No longer specialize calls to classes, if those classes have "
"metaclasses. Fixes bug where the ``__call__`` method of the metaclass was "
"not being called."
msgstr ":gh:`114806`: 如果这些类有元类，则不再专门化对类的调用。修复了元类的 ``__call__`` 方法未被调用的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:10958
msgid ""
":gh:`107944`: Improve error message for function calls with bad keyword "
"arguments via getargs"
msgstr ":gh:`107944`: 通过 getargs 改进对带有错误关键字参数的函数调用的错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:10961
msgid ""
":gh:`112529`: The free-threaded build no longer allocates space for the "
"``PyGC_Head`` structure in objects that support cyclic garbage collection. A"
" number of other fields and data structures are used as replacements, "
"including ``ob_gc_bits``, ``ob_tid``, and mimalloc internal data structures."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112529`: 自由线程构建不再在为支持循环垃圾回收的对象中为 ``PyGC_Head`` "
"结构分配空间。使用了许多其他字段和数据结构作为替代，包括 ``ob_gc_bits``、``ob_tid`` 和 mimalloc 内部数据结构。"

#: ../NEWS:10967
msgid ":gh:`114456`: Lower the recursion limit under a debug build of WASI."
msgstr ":gh:`114456`: 在 WASI 的调试构建下降低递归限制。"

#: ../NEWS:10969
msgid ""
":gh:`114083`: Compiler applies folding of LOAD_CONST with following "
"instruction in a separate pass before other optimisations. This enables jump"
" threading in certain circumstances."
msgstr ""
":gh:`114083`: 编译器在其他优化之前，在一个单独的阶段应用与后续指令的 LOAD_CONST 折叠。这在一定情况下启用了跳转线程。"

#: ../NEWS:10973
msgid ""
":gh:`114388`: Fix a :exc:`RuntimeWarning` emitted when assign an integer-"
"like value that is not an instance of :class:`int` to an attribute that "
"corresponds to a C struct member of :ref:`type <PyMemberDef-types>` T_UINT "
"and T_ULONG. Fix a double :exc:`RuntimeWarning` emitted when assign a "
"negative integer value to an attribute that corresponds to a C struct member"
" of type T_UINT."
msgstr ""
":gh:`114388`: 修复了当将不是 :class:`int` 实例的类似整数值分配给对应于 :ref:`type <PyMemberDef-"
"types>` T_UINT 和 T_ULONG 的 C 结构成员的属性时发出的 "
":exc:`RuntimeWarning`。修复了当将负整数值分配给对应于类型 T_UINT 的 C 结构成员的属性时发出的双重 "
":exc:`RuntimeWarning`。"

#: ../NEWS:10980
msgid ""
":gh:`114265`: Compiler propagates line numbers before optimization, leading "
"to more optimization opportunities and removing the need for the "
"``guarantee_lineno_for_exits`` hack."
msgstr ""
":gh:`114265`: 编译器在优化前传播行号，从而带来更多优化机会并消除了对 ``guarantee_lineno_for_exits`` "
"技巧的需求。"

#: ../NEWS:10984
msgid ""
":gh:`112529`: The free-threaded build now has its own thread-safe GC "
"implementation that uses mimalloc to find GC tracked objects. It is non-"
"generational, unlike the existing GC implementation."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112529`: 自由线程构建现在拥有自己的线程安全 GC 实现，该实现使用 mimalloc 来找到 GC 跟踪的对象。与现有的 GC "
"实现不同，它是非分代的。"

#: ../NEWS:10988
msgid ""
":gh:`114050`: Fix segmentation fault caused by an incorrect format string in"
" ``TypeError`` exception when more than two arguments are passed to ``int``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`114050`: 修复了当向 ``int`` 传递超过两个参数时，由于 ``TypeError`` 异常中的格式字符串不正确而导致的分段错误。"

#: ../NEWS:10992
msgid ""
":gh:`112354`: The ``END_FOR`` instruction now pops only one value. This is "
"to better support side exits in loops."
msgstr ":gh:`112354`: ``END_FOR`` 指令现在只弹出一个值。这是为了更好地支持循环中的侧退出。"

#: ../NEWS:10995
msgid ""
":gh:`113884`: Make :class:`queue.SimpleQueue` thread safe when the GIL is "
"disabled."
msgstr ":gh:`113884`: 当 GIL 被禁用时，使 :class:`queue.SimpleQueue` 线程安全。"

#: ../NEWS:10998
msgid ""
":gh:`114058`: Implement the foundations of the Tier 2 redundancy eliminator."
msgstr ":gh:`114058`: 实现 Tier 2 冗余消除器的基础。"

#: ../NEWS:11000
msgid ""
":gh:`113939`: frame.clear(): Clear frame.f_locals as well, and not only the "
"fast locals. This is relevant once frame.f_locals was accessed, which would "
"contain also references to all the locals."
msgstr ""
":gh:`113939`: frame.clear(): 同时清除 frame.f_locals，而不仅仅是快速局部变量。这在 "
"frame.f_locals 被访问后相关，它将包含对所有局部变量的引用。"

#: ../NEWS:11004
msgid ""
":gh:`112050`: Convert :class:`collections.deque` to use Argument Clinic."
msgstr ":gh:`112050`: 将 :class:`collections.deque` 转换为使用 Argument Clinic。"

#: ../NEWS:11006
msgid ""
":gh:`112050`: Make methods on :class:`collections.deque` thread-safe when "
"the GIL is disabled."
msgstr ":gh:`112050`: 在GIL被禁用时，使 :class:`collections.deque` 上的方法线程安全。"

#: ../NEWS:11009
msgid ""
":gh:`113464`: Add an option (``--enable-experimental-jit`` for "
"``configure``-based builds or ``--experimental-jit`` for ``PCbuild``-based "
"ones) to build an *experimental* just-in-time compiler, based on `copy-and-"
"patch <https://fredrikbk.com/publications/copy-and-patch.pdf>`_"
msgstr ""
":gh:`113464`: 添加一个选项（对于基于`configure`的构建是`--enable-experimental-"
"jit`，对于基于`PCbuild`的构建是`--experimental-jit`）来构建一个 *实验性* 的即时编译器，基于`copy-and-"
"patch <https://fredrikbk.com/publications/copy-and-patch.pdf>`_。"

#: ../NEWS:11014
msgid ""
":gh:`113055`: Make interp->obmalloc a pointer. For interpreters that share "
"state with the main interpreter, this points to the same static memory "
"structure. For interpreters with their own obmalloc state, it is heap "
"allocated. Add free_obmalloc_arenas() which will free the obmalloc arenas "
"and radix tree structures for interpreters with their own obmalloc state."
msgstr ""
":gh:`113055`: "
"使interp->obmalloc成为一个指针。对于与主解释器共享状态的解释器，这指向同一个静态内存结构。对于拥有自己obmalloc状态的解释器，它是堆分配的。添加free_obmalloc_arenas()，它将为拥有自己obmalloc状态的解释器释放obmalloc区域和基数树结构。"

#: ../NEWS:11020
msgid ""
":gh:`55664`: Add warning when creating :class:`type` using a namespace "
"dictionary with non-string keys. Patched by Daniel Urban and Furkan Onder."
msgstr ""
":gh:`55664`: 当使用非字符串键的名称空间字典创建 :class:`type` 时添加警告。由Daniel Urban和Furkan "
"Onder提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:11023
msgid ":gh:`104530`: Use native Win32 condition variables."
msgstr ":gh:`104530`: 使用原生的Win32条件变量。"

#: ../NEWS:11028
msgid ""
":gh:`115392`: Fix a bug in :mod:`doctest` where incorrect line numbers would"
" be reported for decorated functions."
msgstr ":gh:`115392`: 修复 :mod:`doctest` 中的一个错误，该错误会导致装饰函数的行号报告不正确。"

#: ../NEWS:11031
msgid ""
":gh:`114563`: Fix several :func:`format` bugs when using the C "
"implementation of :class:`~decimal.Decimal`: * memory leak in some rare "
"cases when using the ``z`` format option (coerce negative 0) * incorrect "
"output when applying the ``z`` format option to type ``F`` (fixed-point with"
" capital ``NAN`` / ``INF``) * incorrect output when applying the ``#`` "
"format option (alternate form)"
msgstr ""
":gh:`114563`: 修复使用 :class:`~decimal.Decimal` 的C实现时的几个 :func:`format` 错误：* "
"在某些罕见情况下使用`z`格式选项（强制负0）时的内存泄漏 * 将`z`格式选项应用于`F`类型（固定点与大写`NAN` / `INF`）时的错误输出 "
"* 应用`#` 格式选项（交替形式）时的错误输出。"

#: ../NEWS:11038
msgid ""
":gh:`102840`: Fix confused traceback when floordiv, mod, or divmod "
"operations happens between instances of :class:`fractions.Fraction` and "
":class:`complex`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`102840`: 修复在 :fractions.Fraction`和 :class:`complex` "
"实例之间进行地板除、模或除模操作时混淆的追溯。"

#: ../NEWS:11042
msgid ""
":gh:`115165`: Most exceptions are now ignored when attempting to set the "
"``__orig_class__`` attribute on objects returned when calling :mod:`typing` "
"generic aliases (including generic aliases created using "
":data:`typing.Annotated`). Previously only :exc:`AttributeError` was "
"ignored. Patch by Dave Shawley."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115165`: 现在在尝试为调用 :mod:`typing` 泛型别名（包括使用 :data:`typing.Annotated` "
"创建的泛型别名）返回的对象设置`__orig_class__` 属性时，大多数异常会被忽略。之前只有 :exc:`AttributeError` "
"被忽略。由Dave Shawley提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:11048
msgid ""
":gh:`112903`: Fix \"issubclass() arg 1 must be a class\" errors in certain "
"cases of multiple inheritance with generic aliases (regression in early 3.13"
" alpha releases)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112903`: 修复在某些泛型别名多重继承情况下出现的 \"issubclass() arg 1 must be a class\" "
"错误（3.13 alpha早期版本的回归问题）。"

#: ../NEWS:11052
msgid ""
":gh:`115133`: Fix tests for :class:`~xml.etree.ElementTree.XMLPullParser` "
"with Expat 2.6.0."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115133`: 修复与Expat 2.6.0兼容的 "
":class:`~xml.etree.ElementTree.XMLPullParser` 测试。"

#: ../NEWS:11055
msgid ""
":gh:`115059`: :meth:`io.BufferedRandom.read1` now flushes the underlying "
"write buffer."
msgstr ":gh:`115059`: :meth:`io.BufferedRandom.read1` 现在会刷新底层写入缓冲区。"

#: ../NEWS:11058
msgid ""
":gh:`79382`: Trailing ``**`` no longer allows to match files and non-"
"existing paths in recursive :func:`~glob.glob`."
msgstr ":gh:`79382`: 在递归 :func:`~glob.glob` 中，尾随的 ``**`` 不再允许匹配文件和不存在的路径。"

#: ../NEWS:11061
msgid ""
":gh:`67837`: Avoid race conditions in the creation of directories during "
"concurrent extraction in :mod:`tarfile` and :mod:`zipfile`."
msgstr ":gh:`67837`: 在 :mod:`tarfile` 和 :mod:`zipfile` 的并发解压过程中避免目录创建的竞态条件。"

#: ../NEWS:11064
msgid ""
":gh:`115060`: Speed up :meth:`pathlib.Path.glob` by removing redundant regex"
" matching."
msgstr ":gh:`115060`: 通过移除冗余的正则表达式匹配来加速 :meth:`pathlib.Path.glob`。"

#: ../NEWS:11067
msgid ""
":gh:`97928`: Partially revert the behavior of :meth:`tkinter.Text.count`. By"
" default it preserves the behavior of older Python versions, except that "
"setting ``wantobjects`` to 0 no longer has effect. Add a new parameter "
"*return_ints*: specifying ``return_ints=True`` makes ``Text.count()`` always"
" returning the single count as an integer instead of a 1-tuple or ``None``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`97928`: 部分恢复 :meth:`tkinter.Text.count` 的行为。默认情况下，它保留了旧版Python的行为，除了设置 "
"``wantobjects`` 为0不再有效。新增了一个形参 *return_ints*：指定 ``return_ints=True`` 会使 "
"``Text.count()`` 总是返回单个计数的整数，而不是1元组或 ``None``。"

#: ../NEWS:11074
msgid ""
":gh:`114628`: When csv.Error is raised when handling TypeError, do not print"
" the TypeError traceback."
msgstr ":gh:`114628`: 在处理TypeError时引发csv.Error时，不再打印TypeError的回溯信息。"

#: ../NEWS:11077
msgid ""
":gh:`85984`: Added ``_POSIX_VDISABLE`` from C's ``<unistd.h>`` to "
":mod:`termios`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`85984`: 将C语言 ``<unistd.h>`` 中的 ``_POSIX_VDISABLE`` 添加到 :mod:`termios`。"

#: ../NEWS:11080
msgid ":gh:`114965`: Update bundled pip to 24.0"
msgstr ":gh:`114965`: 更新捆绑的pip到24.0版本。"

#: ../NEWS:11082
msgid ""
":gh:`114959`: :mod:`tarfile` no longer ignores errors when trying to extract"
" a directory on top of a file."
msgstr ":gh:`114959`: :mod:`tarfile` 在尝试在文件上提取目录时不再忽略错误。"

#: ../NEWS:11085
msgid ":gh:`114894`: Add :meth:`array.array.clear`."
msgstr ":gh:`114894`: 添加 :meth:`array.array.clear`。"

#: ../NEWS:11087
msgid ""
":gh:`114071`: Support tuple subclasses using auto() for enum member value."
msgstr ":gh:`114071`: 支持使用auto()为枚举成员值的元组子类。"

#: ../NEWS:11089
msgid ""
":gh:`109475`: Fix support of explicit option value \"--\" in :mod:`argparse`"
" (e.g. ``--option=--``)."
msgstr ":gh:`109475`: 修复 :mod:`argparse` 中对明确选项值\"--\"的支持（例如 ``--option=--``）。"

#: ../NEWS:11092
msgid ""
":gh:`49766`: Fix :class:`~datetime.date`-:class:`~datetime.datetime` "
"comparison. Now the special comparison methods like ``__eq__`` and "
"``__lt__`` return :data:`NotImplemented` if one of comparands is "
":class:`!date` and other is :class:`!datetime` instead of ignoring the time "
"part and the time zone or forcefully return \"not equal\" or raise "
":exc:`TypeError`. It makes comparison of :class:`!date` and "
":class:`!datetime` subclasses more symmetric and allows to change the "
"default behavior by overriding the special comparison methods in subclasses."
msgstr ""
":gh:`49766`: 修复 :class:`~datetime.date`-:class:`~datetime.datetime` "
"比较。现在，如果比较的一方是 :class:`!date` 而另一方是 :class:`!datetime`，特殊比较方法如 ``__eq__`` 和 "
"``__lt__`` 将返回 :data:`NotImplemented`，而不是忽略时间部分和时区或强制返回“不相等”或引发 "
":exc:`TypeError`。这使得 :class:`!date` 和 :class:`!datetime` "
"子类的比较更加对称，并允许通过在子类中重写特殊比较方法来改变默认行为。"

#: ../NEWS:11102
msgid ""
":gh:`110190`: Fix ctypes structs with array on Windows ARM64 platform by "
"setting ``MAX_STRUCT_SIZE`` to 32 in stgdict. Patch by Diego Russo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`110190`: 通过在 stgdict 中将 ``MAX_STRUCT_SIZE`` 设置为 32，修复 Windows ARM64 "
"平台上带数组的 ctypes 结构体。由 Diego Russo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:11105
msgid ""
":gh:`114678`: Ensure that deprecation warning for 'N' specifier in "
":class:`~decimal.Decimal` format is not raised for cases where 'N' appears "
"in other places in the format specifier. Based on patch by Stefan Krah."
msgstr ""
":gh:`114678`: 确保在 :class:`~decimal.Decimal` 格式中，对于格式说明符中其他位置出现 'N' 的情况，不会引发 "
"'N' 说明符的弃用警告。基于 Stefan Krah 的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:11109
msgid ""
":gh:`70303`: Return both files and directories from "
":meth:`pathlib.Path.glob` if a pattern ends with \"``**``\". Previously only"
" directories were returned."
msgstr ""
":gh:`70303`: 如果模式以 \"``**``\" 结尾，:meth:`pathlib.Path.glob` "
"现在会返回文件和目录。之前只返回目录。"

#: ../NEWS:11113
msgid ""
":gh:`109653`: Improve import time of :mod:`importlib.metadata` and "
":mod:`email.utils`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109653`: 提高 :mod:`importlib.metadata` 和 :mod:`email.utils` 的导入时间。"

#: ../NEWS:11116
msgid ""
":gh:`113280`: Fix a leak of open socket in rare cases when error occurred in"
" :class:`ssl.SSLSocket` creation."
msgstr ""
":gh:`113280`: 修复在 :class:`ssl.SSLSocket` 创建过程中发生错误时，在罕见情况下出现的开放套接字泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:11119
msgid ""
":gh:`77749`: :meth:`email.policy.EmailPolicy.fold` now always encodes non-"
"ASCII characters in headers if :attr:`~email.policy.EmailPolicy.utf8` is "
"false."
msgstr ""
":gh:`77749`: :meth:`email.policy.EmailPolicy.fold` 现在如果 "
":attr:`~email.policy.EmailPolicy.utf8` 为 false，总是编码头部的非 ASCII 字符。"

#: ../NEWS:11123
msgid ""
":gh:`83383`: Synchronization of the :mod:`dbm.dumb` database is now no-op if"
" there was no modification since opening or last synchronization. The "
"directory file for a newly created empty :mod:`dbm.dumb` database is now "
"created immediately after opening instead of deferring this until "
"synchronizing or closing."
msgstr ""
":gh:`83383`: 如果在打开或上次同步后没有修改，:mod:`dbm.dumb` 数据库的同步现在是无操作的。新创建的空的 "
":mod:`dbm.dumb` 数据库的目录文件现在在打开后立即创建，而不是推迟到同步或关闭时。"

#: ../NEWS:11129
msgid ""
":gh:`91602`: Add *filter* keyword-only parameter to "
":meth:`sqlite3.Connection.iterdump` for filtering database objects to dump. "
"Patch by Mariusz Felisiak."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91602`: 向 :meth:`sqlite3.Connection.iterdump` 添加 *filter* "
"仅关键字参数，用于过滤要转储的数据库对象。由 Mariusz Felisiak 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:11133
msgid ""
":gh:`112451`: Prohibit subclassing pure-Python :class:`datetime.timezone`. "
"This is consistent with C-extension implementation. Patch by Mariusz "
"Felisiak."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112451`: 禁止对纯Python的 :class:`datetime.timezone` "
"进行子类化。这与C扩展实现一致。由Mariusz Felisiak提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:11137
msgid ""
":gh:`69893`: Add the :meth:`!close` method for the iterator returned by "
":func:`xml.etree.ElementTree.iterparse`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`69893`: 为 :func:`xml.etree.ElementTree.iterparse` 返回的迭代器添加 "
":meth:`!close` 方法。"

#: ../NEWS:11140
msgid ""
":gh:`109653`: Reduce the import time of :mod:`threading` module by ~50%. "
"Patch by Daniel Hollas."
msgstr ":gh:`109653`: 通过Daniel Hollas的补丁，将 :mod:`threading` 模块的导入时间减少约50%。"

#: ../NEWS:11143
msgid ""
":gh:`114492`: Make the result of :func:`termios.tcgetattr` reproducible on "
"Alpine Linux. Previously it could leave a random garbage in some fields."
msgstr ""
":gh:`114492`: 使 :func:`termios.tcgetattr` 在Alpine "
"Linux上的结果可重现。之前它可能会在某些字段留下随机垃圾。"

#: ../NEWS:11146
msgid ""
":gh:`114315`: Make :class:`threading.Lock` a real class, not a factory "
"function. Add ``__new__`` to ``_thread.lock`` type."
msgstr ""
":gh:`114315`: 使 :class:`threading.Lock` 成为一个真正的类，而不是工厂函数。向 ``_thread.lock`` "
"类型添加 ``__new__``。"

#: ../NEWS:11149
msgid ""
":gh:`100414`: Add :mod:`dbm.sqlite3` as a backend to :mod:`dbm`, and make it"
" the new default :mod:`!dbm` backend. Patch by Raymond Hettinger and Erlend "
"E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100414`: 添加 :mod:`dbm.sqlite3` 作为 :mod:`dbm` 的后端，并使其成为新的默认 :mod:`!dbm` "
"后端。由Raymond Hettinger和Erlend E. Aasland提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:11153
msgid ""
":gh:`113267`: Revert changes in :gh:`106584` which made calls of "
"``TestResult`` methods ``startTest()`` and ``stopTest()`` unbalanced."
msgstr ""
":gh:`113267`: 撤销 :gh:`106584` 中的更改，这些更改使得 ``TestResult`` 方法的 ``startTest()``"
" 和 ``stopTest()`` 调用不平衡。"

#: ../NEWS:11156
msgid ""
":gh:`75128`: Ignore an :exc:`OSError` in "
":meth:`asyncio.BaseEventLoop.create_server` when IPv6 is available but the "
"interface cannot actually support it."
msgstr ""
":gh:`75128`: 在 :meth:`asyncio.BaseEventLoop.create_server` 中忽略 "
":exc:`OSError`，当IPv6可用但接口实际上不支持它时。"

#: ../NEWS:11160
msgid ""
":gh:`114423`: ``_DummyThread`` entries in ``threading._active`` are now "
"automatically removed when the related thread dies."
msgstr ""
":gh:`114423`: ``threading._active`` 中的 ``_DummyThread`` 条目现在会在相关线程死亡时自动移除。"

#: ../NEWS:11163
msgid ""
":gh:`114257`: Dismiss the :exc:`FileNotFound` error in "
":func:`ctypes.util.find_library` and just return ``None`` on Linux."
msgstr ""
":gh:`114257`: 在 :func:`ctypes.util.find_library` 中忽略 :exc:`FileNotFound` "
"错误，在Linux上直接返回 ``None``。"

#: ../NEWS:11166
msgid ""
":gh:`114321`: Expose more platform specific constants in the :mod:`fcntl` "
"module on Linux, macOS, FreeBSD and NetBSD."
msgstr ""
":gh:`114321`: 在Linux、macOS、FreeBSD和NetBSD上，向 :mod:`fcntl` 模块公开更多平台特定常量。"

#: ../NEWS:11169
msgid ""
":gh:`114328`: The :func:`tty.setcbreak` and new :func:`tty.cfmakecbreak` no "
"longer clears the terminal input ICRLF flag. This fixes a regression "
"introduced in 3.12 that no longer matched how OSes define cbreak mode in "
"their ``stty(1)`` manual pages."
msgstr ""
":gh:`114328`: :func:`tty.setcbreak` 和新的 :func:`tty.cfmakecbreak` "
"不再清除终端输入ICRLF标志。这修复了3.12中引入的一个回归问题，该问题不再匹配操作系统在其 ``stty(1)`` "
"手册页中定义的cbreak模式。"

#: ../NEWS:11174
msgid ""
":gh:`114281`: Remove type hints from ``Lib/asyncio/staggered.py``. The "
"annotations in the `typeshed <https://github.com/python/typeshed>`__ project"
" should be used instead."
msgstr ""
":gh:`114281`: 从 ``Lib/asyncio/staggered.py`` 中移除类型提示。应改用 `typeshed "
"<https://github.com/python/typeshed>`__ 项目中的注解。"

#: ../NEWS:11178
msgid ""
":gh:`101438`: Avoid reference cycle in ElementTree.iterparse. The iterator "
"returned by ``ElementTree.iterparse`` may hold on to a file descriptor. The "
"reference cycle prevented prompt clean-up of the file descriptor if the "
"returned iterator was not exhausted."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101438`: 避免在ElementTree.iterparse中出现引用循环。由 ``ElementTree.iterparse`` "
"返回的迭代器可能会持有一个文件描述符。如果返回的迭代器未被耗尽，引用循环会阻止文件描述符的及时清理。"

#: ../NEWS:11183
msgid ""
":gh:`114198`: The signature for the ``__replace__`` method on "
":mod:`dataclasses` now has the first argument named ``self``, rather than "
"``obj``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`114198`: :mod:`dataclasses` 中的 ``__replace__`` "
"方法的签名现在将第一个参数命名为``self``，而不是 ``obj``。"

#: ../NEWS:11187
msgid ""
":gh:`104522`: :exc:`OSError` raised when run a subprocess now only has "
"*filename* attribute set to *cwd* if the error was caused by a failed "
"attempt to change the current directory."
msgstr ""
":gh:`104522`: 运行子进程时引发的 :exc:`OSError` 现在仅在错误是由于尝试更改当前目录失败时，才会将 *filename* "
"属性设置为*cwd*。"

#: ../NEWS:11191
msgid ""
":gh:`114149`: Enum: correctly handle tuple subclasses in custom ``__new__``."
msgstr ":gh:`114149`: Enum: 在自定义的 ``__new__`` 中正确处理元组子类。"

#: ../NEWS:11193
msgid ""
":gh:`83648`: Support deprecation of options, positional arguments and "
"subcommands in :mod:`argparse`."
msgstr ":gh:`83648`: 支持在 :mod:`argparse` 中弃用选项、位置参数和子命令。"

#: ../NEWS:11196
msgid ":gh:`114087`: Speed up ``dataclasses.asdict`` up to 1.35x."
msgstr ":gh:`114087`: 将 ``dataclasses.asdict`` 的速度提高至1.35倍。"

#: ../NEWS:11198
msgid ""
":gh:`109534`: Fix a reference leak in "
":class:`asyncio.selector_events.BaseSelectorEventLoop` when SSL handshakes "
"fail. Patch contributed by Jamie Phan."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109534`: 修复了 :class:`asyncio.selector_events.BaseSelectorEventLoop` "
"中SSL握手失败时的引用泄漏问题。由Jamie Phan提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:11202
msgid ""
":gh:`79634`: Accept :term:`path-like objects <path-like object>` as patterns"
" in :meth:`pathlib.Path.glob` and :meth:`~pathlib.Path.rglob`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`79634`: 在 :meth:`pathlib.Path.glob` 和 :meth:`~pathlib.Path.rglob` 中接受 "
":term:`路径类对象 <path-like object>` 作为模式。"

#: ../NEWS:11205
msgid ""
":gh:`112202`: Ensure that a :func:`asyncio.Condition.notify` call does not "
"get lost if the awakened ``Task`` is simultaneously cancelled or encounters "
"any other error."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112202`: 确保如果被唤醒的 ``Task`` "
"同时被取消或遇到任何其他错误，:func:`asyncio.Condition.notify` 调用不会丢失。"

#: ../NEWS:11209
msgid ""
":gh:`113951`: Fix the behavior of ``tag_unbind()`` methods of "
":class:`tkinter.Text` and :class:`tkinter.Canvas` classes with three "
"arguments. Previously, ``widget.tag_unbind(tag, sequence, funcid)`` "
"destroyed the current binding for *sequence*, leaving *sequence* unbound, "
"and deleted the *funcid* command. Now it removes only *funcid* from the "
"binding for *sequence*, keeping other commands, and deletes the *funcid* "
"command. It leaves *sequence* unbound only if *funcid* was the last bound "
"command."
msgstr ""
":gh:`113951`: 修复了 :class:`tkinter.Text` 和 :class:`tkinter.Canvas` 类的 "
"``tag_unbind()`` 方法在三参数情况下的行为。以前，``widget.tag_unbind(tag, sequence, "
"funcid)`` 会销毁 *sequence* 的当前绑定，使 *sequence* 变为未绑定状态，并删除 *funcid* 命令。现在它仅从 "
"*sequence* 的绑定中移除 *funcid*，保留其他命令，并删除 *funcid* 命令。只有当 *funcid* "
"是最后一个绑定的命令时，才会使 *sequence* 变为未绑定状态。"

#: ../NEWS:11218
msgid ""
":gh:`97959`: Fix rendering class methods, bound methods, method and function"
" aliases in :mod:`pydoc`. Class methods no longer have \"method of "
"builtins.type instance\" note. Corresponding notes are now added for class "
"and unbound methods. Method and function aliases now have references to the "
"module or the class where the origin was defined if it differs from the "
"current. Bound methods are now listed in the static methods section. Methods"
" of builtin classes are now supported as well as methods of Python classes."
msgstr ""
":gh:`97959`: 修复 :mod:`pydoc` "
"中类方法、绑定方法、方法及函数别名的渲染问题。类方法不再显示“builtins.type实例的方法”注释。现在为类和未绑定方法添加了相应的注释。方法和函数别名现在如果原始定义与当前不同，会引用到定义原始内容的模块或类。绑定方法现在列在静态方法部分。内置类的方法现在和Python类的方法一样得到支持。"

#: ../NEWS:11227
msgid ""
":gh:`113796`: Add more validation checks in the :class:`csv.Dialect` "
"constructor. :exc:`ValueError` is now raised if the same character is used "
"in different roles."
msgstr ""
":gh:`113796`: 在 :class:`csv.Dialect` 构造函数中添加更多验证检查。如果同一个字符被用于不同的角色，现在会抛出 "
":exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../NEWS:11231
msgid ""
":gh:`113732`: Fix support of :data:`~csv.QUOTE_NOTNULL` and "
":data:`~csv.QUOTE_STRINGS` in :func:`csv.reader`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`113732`: 修复 :func:`csv.reader` 中对 :data:`~csv.QUOTE_NOTNULL` 和 "
":data:`~csv.QUOTE_STRINGS` 的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:11234
msgid ""
":gh:`113225`: Speed up :meth:`pathlib.Path.walk` by using "
":attr:`os.DirEntry.path` where possible."
msgstr ""
":gh:`113225`: 尽可能使用 :attr:`os.DirEntry.path` 来加速 :meth:`pathlib.Path.walk`。"

#: ../NEWS:11237
msgid ""
":gh:`89039`: When replace() method is called on a subclass of datetime, date"
" or time, properly call derived constructor. Previously, only the base "
"class's constructor was called."
msgstr ""
":gh:`89039`: 当在datetime、date或time的子类上调用replace()方法时，正确调用派生构造函数。之前仅调用基类的构造函数。"

#: ../NEWS:11241
msgid ""
"Also, make sure to pass non-zero fold values when creating subclasses in "
"various methods. Previously, fold was silently ignored."
msgstr "同时，确保在各种方法中创建子类时传递非零的fold值。之前，fold值被静默忽略。"

#: ../NEWS:11244
msgid ""
":gh:`112919`: Speed-up :func:`datetime.datetime.replace`, "
":func:`datetime.date.replace` and :func:`datetime.time.replace`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112919`: 加速 "
":func:`datetime.datetime.replace`、:func:`datetime.date.replace` 和 "
":func:`datetime.time.replace`。"

#: ../NEWS:11247
msgid ""
":gh:`59013`: Set breakpoint on the first executable line of the function, "
"instead of the line of function definition when the user do ``break func`` "
"using :mod:`pdb`"
msgstr ""
":gh:`59013`: 当用户使用 :mod:`pdb` 执行 ``break func`` "
"时，在函数的第一行可执行代码上设置断点，而不是函数定义的行。"

#: ../NEWS:11251
msgid ""
":gh:`112343`: Improve handling of pdb convenience variables to avoid "
"replacing string contents."
msgstr ":gh:`112343`: 改进pdb便利变量的处理，避免替换字符串内容。"

#: ../NEWS:11254
msgid ""
":gh:`112240`: Add option to calendar module CLI to specify the weekday to "
"start each week. Patch by Steven Ward."
msgstr ":gh:`112240`: 向calendar模块CLI添加选项，以指定每周开始的星期几。由Steven Ward提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:11257
msgid ""
":gh:`111741`: Recognise ``image/webp`` as a standard format in the "
":mod:`mimetypes` module."
msgstr ":gh:`111741`: 在 :mod:`mimetypes` 模块中识别 ``image/webp`` 为标准格式。"

#: ../NEWS:11260
msgid ""
":gh:`43457`: Fix the :mod:`tkinter` widget method :meth:`!wm_attributes`. It"
" now accepts the attribute name without the minus prefix to get window "
"attributes and allows to specify attributes and values to set as keyword "
"arguments. Add new optional keyword argument *return_python_dict*: calling "
"``w.wm_attributes(return_python_dict=True)`` returns the attributes as a "
"dict instead of a tuple. Calling ``w.wm_attributes()`` now returns a tuple "
"instead of string if *wantobjects* was set to 0."
msgstr ""
":gh:`43457`: 修复了 :mod:`tkinter` 部件方法 "
":meth:`!wm_attributes`。现在它接受不带减号前缀的属性名来获取窗口属性，并允许将属性和值指定为关键字参数。新增了可选关键字参数 "
"*return_python_dict*：调用 ``w.wm_attributes(return_python_dict=True)`` "
"会返回一个字典而非元组。调用 ``w.wm_attributes()`` 现在返回一个元组而非字符串，如果 *wantobjects* 被设置为0。"

#: ../NEWS:11268
msgid ""
":gh:`82626`: Many functions now emit a warning if a boolean value is passed "
"as a file descriptor argument."
msgstr ":gh:`82626`: 许多函数现在会在布尔值作为文件描述符参数传递时发出警告。"

#: ../NEWS:11271
msgid ""
":gh:`111051`: Added check for file modification during debugging with "
":mod:`pdb`"
msgstr ":gh:`111051`: 添加了使用 :mod:`pdb` 调试期间检查文件修改的功能。"

#: ../NEWS:11274
msgid ""
":gh:`110345`: Show the Tcl/Tk patchlevel (rather than version) in "
":meth:`tkinter._test`."
msgstr ":gh:`110345`: 在 :meth:`tkinter._test` 中显示 Tcl/Tk 补丁级别（而非版本）。"

#: ../NEWS:11277
msgid ""
":gh:`38807`: Fix race condition in :mod:`trace`. Instead of checking if a "
"directory exists and creating it, directly call :func:`os.makedirs` with the"
" kwarg ``exist_ok=True``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`38807`: 修复了 :mod:`trace` 中的竞态条件。不再检查目录是否存在并创建它，而是直接调用 "
":func:`os.makedirs` 并传递 ``exist_ok=True`` 关键字参数。"

#: ../NEWS:11281
msgid ""
":gh:`75705`: Set unixfrom envelope in :class:`mailbox.mbox` and "
":class:`mailbox.MMDF`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`75705`: 在 :class:`mailbox.mbox` 和 :class:`mailbox.MMDF` 中设置 unixfrom "
"信封。"

#: ../NEWS:11284
msgid ""
":gh:`106233`: Fix stacklevel in ``InvalidTZPathWarning`` during "
":mod:`zoneinfo` module import."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106233`: 修复了在导入 :mod:`zoneinfo` 模块期间 ``InvalidTZPathWarning`` 的堆栈级别。"

#: ../NEWS:11287
msgid ""
":gh:`105102`: Allow :class:`ctypes.Union` to be nested in "
":class:`ctypes.Structure` when the system endianness is the opposite of the "
"classes."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105102`: 允许 :class:`ctypes.Union` 嵌套在 :class:`ctypes.Structure` "
"中，当系统字节序与类的字节序相反时。"

#: ../NEWS:11291
msgid ""
":gh:`104282`: Fix null pointer dereference in "
":func:`lzma._decode_filter_properties` due to improper handling of BCJ "
"filters with properties of zero length. Patch by Radislav Chugunov."
msgstr ""
":gh:`104282`: 修复了由于对具有零长度属性的 BCJ 过滤器处理不当导致的 "
":func:`lzma._decode_filter_properties` 中的空指针解引用。补丁由 Radislav Chugunov 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:11295
msgid ""
":gh:`96471`: Add :py:class:`queue.Queue` termination with "
":py:meth:`~queue.Queue.shutdown`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`96471`: 添加了通过 :py:meth:`~queue.Queue.shutdown` 终止 "
":py:class:`queue.Queue` 的功能。"

#: ../NEWS:11298
msgid ""
":gh:`101599`: Changed argparse flag options formatting to remove redundancy."
msgstr ":gh:`101599`: 更改了 argparse 标志选项的格式以去除冗余。"

#: ../NEWS:11300
msgid ""
":gh:`85984`: Add POSIX pseudo-terminal functions :func:`os.posix_openpt`, "
