#: ../NEWS:11854
msgid ""
":gh:`51944`: Add the following constants to the :mod:`termios` module. These"
" values are present in macOS system headers: ``ALTWERASE``, ``B14400``, "
"``B28800``, ``B7200``, ``B76800``, ``CCAR_OFLOW``, ``CCTS_OFLOW``, "
"``CDSR_OFLOW``, ``CDTR_IFLOW``, ``CIGNORE``, ``CRTS_IFLOW``, ``EXTPROC``, "
"``IUTF8``, ``MDMBUF``, ``NL2``, ``NL3``, ``NOKERNINFO``, ``ONOEOT``, "
"``OXTABS``, ``VDSUSP``, ``VSTATUS``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`51944`: 向 :mod:`termios` 模块添加以下常量。这些值存在于 macOS "
"系统头文件中：``ALTWERASE``、``B14400``、``B28800``、``B7200``、``B76800``、``CCAR_OFLOW``、``CCTS_OFLOW``、``CDSR_OFLOW``、``CDTR_IFLOW``、``CIGNORE``、``CRTS_IFLOW``、``EXTPROC``、``IUTF8``、``MDMBUF``、``NL2``、``NL3``、``NOKERNINFO``、``ONOEOT``、``OXTABS``、``VDSUSP``、``VSTATUS``。"

#: ../NEWS:11861
msgid ""
":gh:`79325`: Fix an infinite recursion error in "
":func:`tempfile.TemporaryDirectory` cleanup on Windows."
msgstr ""
":gh:`79325`: 修复了 Windows 上 :func:`tempfile.TemporaryDirectory` 清理过程中的无限递归错误。"

#: ../NEWS:11864
msgid ""
":gh:`94692`: :func:`shutil.rmtree` now only catches OSError exceptions. "
