"ignore or pass to the error handler arbitrary exception when invalid "
"arguments were provided."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94692`: :func:`shutil.rmtree` 现在仅捕获 OSError "
"异常。之前，当提供无效参数时，``shutil.rmtree()`` 的符号链接攻击抵抗版本可能会忽略或将任意异常传递给错误处理器。"

#: ../NEWS:11869
msgid ""
":gh:`112736`: The use of del-safe symbols in ``subprocess`` was refactored "
"to allow for use in cross-platform build environments."
msgstr ":gh:`112736`: 重构了 ``subprocess`` 中 del-safe 符号的使用，以允许在跨平台构建环境中使用。"

#: ../NEWS:11872
msgid ""
":gh:`112727`: Speed up :meth:`pathlib.Path.absolute`. Patch by Barney Gale."
msgstr ":gh:`112727`: 加速 :meth:`pathlib.Path.absolute`。由 Barney Gale 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:11874
msgid ""
":gh:`74690`: Speedup :func:`issubclass` checks against simple "
":func:`runtime-checkable protocols <typing.runtime_checkable>` by around 6%."
" Patch by Alex Waygood."
msgstr ""
":gh:`74690`: 通过约 6% 加速 :func:`issubclass` 对简单 :func:`runtime-checkable "
"protocols <typing.runtime_checkable>` 的检查。由 Alex Waygood 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:11878
msgid ""
":gh:`74690`: Speedup :func:`isinstance` checks by roughly 20% for "
":func:`runtime-checkable protocols <typing.runtime_checkable>` that only "
"have one callable member. Speedup :func:`issubclass` checks for these "
"protocols by roughly 10%. Patch by Alex Waygood."
msgstr ""
":gh:`74690`: 对于仅有一个可调用成员的 :func:`runtime-checkable protocols "
"<typing.runtime_checkable>`，将 :func:`isinstance` 检查速度提高约 20%。对于这些协议，将 "
":func:`issubclass` 检查速度提高约 10%。由 Alex Waygood 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:11883
msgid ""
":gh:`112645`: Remove deprecation error on passing ``onerror`` to "
":func:`shutil.rmtree`."
msgstr ":gh:`112645`: 移除了向 :func:`shutil.rmtree` 传递 ``onerror`` 时的弃用错误。"

#: ../NEWS:11886
msgid ""
":gh:`112640`: Add ``kwdefaults`` parameter to :data:`types.FunctionType` to "
"set default keyword argument values."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112640`: 向 :data:`types.FunctionType` 添加 ``kwdefaults`` 参数以设置默认关键字参数值。"

#: ../NEWS:11889
msgid ""
":gh:`112622`: Ensure ``name`` parameter is passed to event loop in "
":func:`asyncio.create_task`."
msgstr ":gh:`112622`: 确保在 :func:`asyncio.create_task` 中将 ``name`` 参数传递给事件循环。"

#: ../NEWS:11892
msgid ""
":gh:`112618`: Fix a caching bug relating to :data:`typing.Annotated`. "
"``Annotated[str, True]`` is no longer identical to ``Annotated[str, 1]``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112618`: 修复了与 :data:`typing.Annotated` 相关的缓存错误。``Annotated[str, True]``"
" 不再与 ``Annotated[str, 1]`` 相同。"

#: ../NEWS:11895
msgid ""
":gh:`112334`: Fixed a performance regression in 3.12's :mod:`subprocess` on "
"Linux where it would no longer use the fast-path ``vfork()`` system call "
"when it could have due to a logic bug, instead falling back to the safe but "
"slower ``fork()``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112334`: 修复了3.12版本中Linux下 :mod:`subprocess` "
"模块的性能回归问题，该问题由于逻辑错误导致在能够使用快速路径 ``vfork()`` 系统调用时未能使用，转而回退到安全但较慢的 ``fork()``。"

#: ../NEWS:11900
msgid ""
"Also fixed a second 3.12.0 potential security bug.  If a value of "
"``extra_groups=[]`` was passed to :mod:`subprocess.Popen` or related APIs, "
"the underlying ``setgroups(0, NULL)`` system call to clear the groups list "
"would not be made in the child process prior to ``exec()``."
msgstr ""
"同时还修复了3.12.0版本中的第二个潜在安全漏洞。如果向 :mod:`subprocess.Popen` "
"或相关API传递了``extra_groups=[]``值，子进程在 ``exec()`` 之前不会调用底层的 ``setgroups(0, "
"NULL)`` 系统调用来清除组列表。"

#: ../NEWS:11905
msgid ""
"This was identified via code inspection in the process of fixing the first "
"bug."
msgstr "这是在修复第一个漏洞的过程中通过代码审查发现的。"

#: ../NEWS:11908
msgid ""
":gh:`110190`: Fix ctypes structs with array on Arm platform by setting "
"``MAX_STRUCT_SIZE`` to 32 in stgdict. Patch by Diego Russo."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110190`: 通过在stgdict中将 ``MAX_STRUCT_SIZE`` "
"设置为32，修复了Arm平台上带有数组的ctypes结构体问题。由Diego Russo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:11911
msgid ""
":gh:`81194`: Fix a crash in :func:`socket.if_indextoname` with specific "
"value (UINT_MAX). Fix an integer overflow in :func:`socket.if_indextoname` "
"on 64-bit non-Windows platforms."
msgstr ""
":gh:`81194`: 修复了 :func:`socket.if_indextoname` "
"在特定值（UINT_MAX）下的崩溃问题。修复了64位非Windows平台上 :func:`socket.if_indextoname` "
"的整数溢出问题。"

#: ../NEWS:11915
msgid ""
":gh:`112578`: Fix a spurious :exc:`RuntimeWarning` when executing the "
":mod:`zipfile` module."
msgstr ":gh:`112578`: 修复了执行 :mod:`zipfile` 模块时出现的虚假 :exc:`RuntimeWarning`。"

