#: ../NEWS:11996
msgid ""
":gh:`111615`: Fix a regression caused by a fix to :gh:`93162` whereby you "
"couldn't configure a :class:`QueueHandler` without specifying handlers."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111615`: 修复了由 :gh:`93162` 的修复引起的回归问题，该问题导致无法在不指定 handlers 的情况下配置 "
":class:`QueueHandler`。"

#: ../NEWS:11999
msgid ""
":gh:`75666`: Fix the behavior of :mod:`tkinter` widget's ``unbind()`` method"
" with two arguments. Previously, ``widget.unbind(sequence, funcid)`` "
"destroyed the current binding for *sequence*, leaving *sequence* unbound, "
"and deleted the *funcid* command. Now it removes only *funcid* from the "
"binding for *sequence*, keeping other commands, and deletes the *funcid* "
"command. It leaves *sequence* unbound only if *funcid* was the last bound "
"command."
msgstr ""
":gh:`75666`: 修复了 :mod:`tkinter` 小部件的 ``unbind()`` "
"方法在两个参数下的行为。之前，``widget.unbind(sequence, funcid)`` 会销毁 *sequence* 的当前绑定，使 "
"*sequence* 无绑定，并删除 *funcid* 命令。现在它只从 *sequence* 的绑定中移除 *funcid*，保留其他命令，并删除 "
"*funcid* 命令。只有当 *funcid* 是最后一个绑定命令时，才会使 *sequence* 无绑定。"

#: ../NEWS:12007
msgid ""
":gh:`67790`: Implement basic formatting support (minimum width, alignment, "
"fill) for :class:`fractions.Fraction`."
msgstr ":gh:`67790`: 为 :class:`fractions.Fraction` 实现了基本格式化支持（最小宽度、对齐、填充）。"

#: ../NEWS:12010
msgid ""
":gh:`111049`: Fix crash during garbage collection of the :class:`io.BytesIO`"
" buffer object."
msgstr ":gh:`111049`: 修复了 :class:`io.BytesIO` 缓冲对象在垃圾回收过程中的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:12013
msgid ""
":gh:`102980`: Redirect the output of ``interact`` command of :mod:`pdb` to "
"the same channel as the debugger. Add tests and improve docs."
msgstr ""
":gh:`102980`: 将 :mod:`pdb` 的 ``interact`` 命令的输出重定向到与调试器相同的通道。添加测试并改进文档。"

#: ../NEWS:12016
msgid ""
":gh:`102988`: :func:`email.utils.getaddresses` and "
":func:`email.utils.parseaddr` now return ``('', '')`` 2-tuples in more "
"situations where invalid email addresses are encountered instead of "
"potentially inaccurate values. Add optional *strict* parameter to these two "
"functions: use ``strict=False`` to get the old behavior, accept malformed "
"inputs. ``getattr(email.utils, 'supports_strict_parsing', False)`` can be "
"use to check if the *strict* parameter is available. Patch by Thomas Dwyer "
"and Victor Stinner to improve the :cve:`2023-27043` fix."
msgstr ""
":gh:`102988`: :func:`email.utils.getaddresses` 和 "
":func:`email.utils.parseaddr` 现在在遇到无效电子邮件地址的更多情况下返回 ``('', '')`` "
"2元组，而不是可能不准确的值。为这两个函数添加可选的 *strict* 参数：使用 ``strict=False`` "
"以获取旧行为，接受格式错误的输入。可以使用 ``getattr(email.utils, 'supports_strict_parsing', "
"False)`` 来检查 *strict* 参数是否可用。Thomas Dwyer 和 Victor Stinner 的补丁改进了 "
":cve:`2023-27043` 的修复。"

#: ../NEWS:12025
msgid ""
":gh:`52161`: :meth:`cmd.Cmd.do_help` now cleans docstrings with "
":func:`inspect.cleandoc` before writing them. Patch by Filip Łapkiewicz."
msgstr ""
":gh:`52161`: :meth:`cmd.Cmd.do_help` 现在在写入文档字符串之前使用 :func:`inspect.cleandoc`"
" 清理它们。Filip Łapkiewicz 的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12028
msgid ""
":gh:`82300`: Add ``track`` parameter to "
":class:`multiprocessing.shared_memory.SharedMemory` that allows using shared"
" memory blocks without having to register with the POSIX resource tracker "
"that automatically releases them upon process exit."
msgstr ""
":gh:`82300`: 向 :class:`multiprocessing.shared_memory.SharedMemory` 添加 "
"``track`` 参数，允许使用共享内存块而无需注册到 POSIX 资源跟踪器，该跟踪器会在进程退出时自动释放它们。"

#: ../NEWS:12033
msgid ""
":gh:`110109`: Add private ``pathlib._PurePathBase`` class: a base class for "
":class:`pathlib.PurePath` that omits certain magic methods. It may be made "
"public (along with ``_PathBase``) in future."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110109`: 添加私有 ``pathlib._PurePathBase`` 类：作为 :class:`pathlib.PurePath` "
"的基类，省略了一些魔术方法。未来可能会公开（连同 ``_PathBase``）。"

#: ../NEWS:12037
msgid ""
":gh:`109858`: Protect :mod:`zipfile` from \"quoted-overlap\" zipbomb. It now"
" raises BadZipFile when try to read an entry that overlaps with other entry "
"or central directory."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109858`: 保护 :mod:`zipfile` 免受“引用覆盖”zip炸弹攻击。现在在尝试读取与其他条目或中央目录重叠的条目时会引发 "
"BadZipFile。"

#: ../NEWS:12041
msgid ""
":gh:`109786`: Fix possible reference leaks and crash when re-enter the "
"``__next__()`` method of :class:`itertools.pairwise`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109786`: 修复了重新进入 :class:`itertools.pairwise` 的 ``__next__()`` "
"方法时可能出现的引用泄漏和崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:12044
msgid ""
":gh:`91539`: Small (10 - 20%) and trivial performance improvement of "
":func:`urllib.request.getproxies_environment`, typically useful when there "
"are many environment variables to go over."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91539`: :func:`urllib.request.getproxies_environment` 的小幅（10 - "
"20%）且简单的性能提升，通常在有许多环境变量需要遍历时有用。"

#: ../NEWS:12048
msgid ""
":gh:`103363`: Add *follow_symlinks* keyword-only argument to "
":meth:`pathlib.Path.owner` and :meth:`~pathlib.Path.group`, defaulting to "
"``True``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`103363`: 向 :meth:`pathlib.Path.owner` 和 :meth:`~pathlib.Path.group` "
"添加仅关键字参数 *follow_symlinks*，默认为 ``True``。"

#: ../NEWS:12052
msgid ":gh:`102130`: Support tab completion in :mod:`cmd` for ``editline``."
msgstr ":gh:`102130`: 在 :mod:`cmd` 中支持 ``editline`` 的标签补全。"

#: ../NEWS:12054
msgid ""
":gh:`99437`: :func:`runpy.run_path` now decodes path-like objects, making "
"sure __file__ and sys.argv[0] of the module being run are always strings."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99437`: :func:`runpy.run_path` 现在解码路径类对象，确保被运行模块的 __file__ 和 "
"sys.argv[0] 始终是字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:12057
msgid ""
":gh:`104003`: Add :func:`warnings.deprecated`, a decorator to mark "
"deprecated functions to static type checkers and to warn on usage of "
"deprecated classes and functions. See :pep:`702`. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`104003`: 添加 "
":func:`warnings.deprecated`，一个装饰器，用于向静态类型检查器标记已弃用的函数，并在使用已弃用的类和函数时发出警告。参见 "
":pep:`702`。由 Jelle Zijlstra 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12061
msgid ""
":gh:`103708`: Make hardcoded python name, a configurable parameter so that "
"different implementations of python can override it instead of making huge "
"diffs in sysconfig.py"
msgstr ""
":gh:`103708`: 将硬编码的 python 名称改为可配置参数，以便不同的 python 实现可以覆盖它，而不必在 sysconfig.py "
"中做出大量更改。"

#: ../NEWS:12065
msgid ""
":gh:`66515`: :class:`mailbox.MH` now supports folders that do not contain a "
"``.mh_sequences`` file (e.g. Claws Mail IMAP-cache folders). Patch by Serhiy"
" Storchaka."
msgstr ""
":gh:`66515`: :class:`mailbox.MH` 现在支持不包含 ``.mh_sequences`` 文件的文件夹（例如 Claws "
"Mail IMAP-cache 文件夹）。由 Serhiy Storchaka 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12069
msgid ""
":gh:`83162`: Renamed :exc:`!re.error` to :exc:`PatternError` for clarity, "
"and kept :exc:`!re.error` for backward compatibility. Patch by Matthias "
"Bussonnier and Adam Chhina."
msgstr ""
":gh:`83162`: 为了清晰起见，将 :exc:`!re.error` 重命名为 :exc:`PatternError`，并保留 "
":exc:`!re.error` 以向后兼容。由 Matthias Bussonnier 和 Adam Chhina 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12073
msgid ""
":gh:`91133`: Fix a bug in :class:`tempfile.TemporaryDirectory` cleanup, "
"which now no longer dereferences symlinks when working around file system "
"permission errors."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91133`: 修复了 :class:`tempfile.TemporaryDirectory` "
"清理中的一个错误，现在在解决文件系统权限错误时不再解引用符号链接。"

#: ../NEWS:12077
msgid ""
":issue:`43153`: On Windows, ``tempfile.TemporaryDirectory`` previously "
"masked a ``PermissionError`` with ``NotADirectoryError`` during directory "
"cleanup. It now correctly raises ``PermissionError`` if errors are not "
"ignored. Patch by Andrei Kulakov and Ken Jin."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43153`: 在 Windows 上，``tempfile.TemporaryDirectory`` 之前在目录清理过程中将 "
"``PermissionError`` 掩盖为 ``NotADirectoryError``。现在如果错误未被忽略，它会正确地引发 "
"``PermissionError``。由 Andrei Kulakov 和 Ken Jin 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12082
msgid ""
":issue:`32731`: :func:`getpass.getuser` now raises :exc:`OSError` for all "
"failures rather than :exc:`ImportError` on systems lacking the :mod:`pwd` "
"module or :exc:`KeyError` if the password database is empty."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32731`: :func:`getpass.getuser` 现在对于所有失败情况都会引发 :exc:`OSError`，而不是在缺乏"
" :mod:`pwd` 模块的系统上引发 :exc:`ImportError`，或者在密码数据库为空时引发 :exc:`KeyError`。"

#: ../NEWS:12086
msgid ""
":issue:`34321`: :class:`mmap.mmap` now has a *trackfd* parameter on Unix; if"
" it is ``False``, the file descriptor specified by *fileno* will not be "
"duplicated."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34321`: :class:`mmap.mmap` 现在在 Unix 上有一个 *trackfd* 参数；如果它是 "
"``False``，则 *fileno* 指定的文件描述符不会被复制。"

#: ../NEWS:12090
msgid ""
":issue:`35332`: The :func:`shutil.rmtree` function now ignores errors when "
"calling :func:`os.close` when *ignore_errors* is ``True``, and "
":func:`os.close` no longer retried after error."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35332`: :func:`shutil.rmtree` 函数现在在 *ignore_errors* 为 ``True`` 时忽略调用"
" :func:`os.close` 时的错误，并且 :func:`os.close` 在出错后不再重试。"

#: ../NEWS:12094
msgid ""
":issue:`35928`: :class:`io.TextIOWrapper` now correctly handles the decoding"
" buffer after ``read()`` and ``write()``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35928`: :class:`io.TextIOWrapper` 现在正确处理 ``read()`` 和 ``write()`` "
"后的解码缓冲区。"

#: ../NEWS:12097
msgid ""
":issue:`26791`: :func:`shutil.move` now moves a symlink into a directory "
"when that directory is the target of the symlink.  This provides the same "
"behavior as the mv shell command.  The previous behavior raised an "
"exception.  Patch by Jeffrey Kintscher."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26791`: :func:`shutil.move` 现在当一个目录是符号链接的目标时，将符号链接移动到该目录中。这提供了与 mv "
"shell 命令相同的行为。之前的行为会引发异常。由 Jeffrey Kintscher 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12102
msgid ""
":issue:`41422`: Fixed memory leaks of :class:`pickle.Pickler` and "
":class:`pickle.Unpickler` involving cyclic references via the internal memo "
"mapping."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41422`: 修复了 :class:`pickle.Pickler` 和 :class:`pickle.Unpickler` "
"通过内部备忘录映射涉及循环引用的内存泄漏。"

#: ../NEWS:12106
msgid ""
":issue:`19821`: The :func:`!pydoc.ispackage` function has been deprecated."
msgstr ":issue:`19821`: :func:`!pydoc.ispackage` 函数已被弃用。"

#: ../NEWS:12108
msgid ""
":issue:`40262`: The :meth:`ssl.SSLSocket.recv_into` method no longer "
"requires the *buffer* argument to implement ``__len__`` and supports buffers"
" with arbitrary item size."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40262`: :meth:`ssl.SSLSocket.recv_into` 方法不再要求 *buffer* 参数实现 "
"``__len__``，并且支持具有任意项目大小的缓冲区。"

#: ../NEWS:12112
msgid ""
":issue:`39912`: :func:`warnings.filterwarnings` and "
":func:`warnings.simplefilter` now raise appropriate exceptions instead of "
"``AssertionError``. Patch contributed by Rémi Lapeyre."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39912`: :func:`warnings.filterwarnings` 和 "
":func:`warnings.simplefilter` 现在会引发适当的异常，而不是 ``AssertionError``。补丁由 Rémi "
"Lapeyre 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:12116
msgid ""
":issue:`37260`: Fixed a race condition in :func:`shutil.rmtree` in which "
"directory entries removed by another process or thread while "
"``shutil.rmtree()`` is running can cause it to raise FileNotFoundError. "
"Patch by Jeffrey Kintscher."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37260`: 修复了 :func:`shutil.rmtree` 中的一个竞态条件，即在 ``shutil.rmtree()`` "
"运行时，另一个进程或线程删除的目录条目可能导致其引发 FileNotFoundError。由 Jeffrey Kintscher 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12121
msgid ""
":issue:`36959`: Fix some error messages for invalid ISO format string "
"combinations in ``strptime()`` that referred to directives not contained in "
"the format string. Patch by Gordon P. Hemsley."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36959`: 修复了 ``strptime()`` 中一些无效 ISO "
"格式字符串组合的错误消息，这些消息引用了格式字符串中不包含的指令。由 Gordon P. Hemsley 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12125
msgid ""
":issue:`18060`: Fixed a class inheritance issue that can cause segfaults "
"when deriving two or more levels of subclasses from a base class of "
"Structure or Union."
msgstr ""
":issue:`18060`: 修复了一个类继承问题，当从 Structure 或 Union 的基类派生两个或更多级别的子类时，可能导致段错误。"

#: ../NEWS:12129
msgid ""
":issue:`29779`: Add a new :envvar:`PYTHON_HISTORY` environment variable to "
"set the location of a ``.python_history`` file."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29779`: 添加了一个新的 :envvar:`PYTHON_HISTORY` 环境变量，用于设置 "
"``.python_history`` 文件的位置。"

#: ../NEWS:12132
msgid ""
":issue:`21360`: :class:`mailbox.Maildir` now ignores files with a leading "
"dot."
msgstr ":issue:`21360`: :class:`mailbox.Maildir` 现在忽略以点开头的文件。"

#: ../NEWS:12137
msgid ""
":gh:`111699`: Relocate ``smtpd`` deprecation notice to its own section "
"rather than under ``locale`` in What's New in Python 3.12 document"
msgstr ""
":gh:`111699`: 在 Python 3.12 文档的“新变化”中，将 ``smtpd`` 的弃用通知从其自己的部分移至 ``locale`` "
"下。"

#: ../NEWS:12140
msgid ""
":gh:`110746`: Improved markup for valid options/values for methods "
"ttk.treeview.column and ttk.treeview.heading, and for Layouts."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110746`: 改进了 ttk.treeview.column 和 ttk.treeview.heading "
"方法以及布局的有效选项/值的标记。"

#: ../NEWS:12143
msgid ""
":gh:`95649`: Document that the :mod:`asyncio` module contains code taken "
"from `v0.16.0 of the uvloop project "
"<https://github.com/MagicStack/uvloop/tree/v0.16.0>`_, as well as the "
"required MIT licensing information."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95649`: 文档说明 :mod:`asyncio` 模块包含从 `uvloop 项目的 v0.16.0 "
"<https://github.com/MagicStack/uvloop/tree/v0.16.0>`_ 中获取的代码，以及所需的 MIT 许可信息。"

#: ../NEWS:12151
msgid ""
":gh:`111798`: Disable ``test_super_deep()`` from ``test_call`` under pydebug"
" builds on WASI; the stack depth is too small to make the test useful."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111798`: 在 WASI 的 pydebug 构建下禁用 ``test_call`` 中的 "
"``test_super_deep()``；堆栈深度太小，无法使测试有用。"

#: ../NEWS:12154
msgid ""
":gh:`111801`: Lower the recursion limit in ``test_isinstance`` for "
"``test_infinitely_many_bases()``. This prevents a stack overflow on a "
"pydebug build of WASI."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111801`: 在 ``test_isinstance`` 中为 ``test_infinitely_many_bases()`` "
"降低递归限制。这防止了在 WASI 的 pydebug 构建中出现堆栈溢出。"

#: ../NEWS:12158
msgid ""
":gh:`111802`: Specify a low recursion depth for ``test_bad_getattr()`` in "
"``test.pickletester`` to avoid exhausting the stack under a pydebug build "
"for WASI."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111802`: 为 ``test.pickletester`` 中的 ``test_bad_getattr()`` "
"指定一个低的递归深度，以避免在 WASI 的 pydebug 构建下耗尽堆栈。"

#: ../NEWS:12162
msgid ""
":gh:`44626`: Fix :func:`os.path.isabs` incorrectly returning ``True`` when "
"given a path that starts with exactly one (back)slash on Windows."
msgstr ""
":gh:`44626`: 修复 :func:`os.path.isabs` 在给定以正好一个（反）斜杠开头的路径时在 Windows 上错误返回 "
"``True`` 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:12165
msgid ""
"Fix :meth:`pathlib.PureWindowsPath.is_absolute` incorrectly returning "
"``False`` for some paths beginning with two (back)slashes."
msgstr ""
"修复 :meth:`pathlib.PureWindowsPath.is_absolute` 对于某些以两个（反）斜杠开头的路径错误返回 "
"``False`` 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:12168
msgid ":gh:`113633`: Use module state for the _testcapi extension module."
msgstr ":gh:`113633`: 为 _testcapi 扩展模块使用模块状态。"

#: ../NEWS:12170
msgid ""
":gh:`109980`: Fix ``test_tarfile_vs_tar`` in ``test_shutil`` for macOS, "
"where system tar can include more information in the archive than "
":mod:`shutil.make_archive`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109980`: 在 macOS 上修复 ``test_shutil`` 中的 ``test_tarfile_vs_tar``，其中系统 "
"tar 可以在归档中包含比 :mod:`shutil.make_archive` 更多的信息。"

#: ../NEWS:12174
msgid ""
":gh:`112769`: The tests now correctly compare zlib version when "
":const:`zlib.ZLIB_RUNTIME_VERSION` contains non-integer suffixes. For "
"example zlib-ng defines the version as ``1.3.0.zlib-ng``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112769`: 现在，当 :const:`zlib.ZLIB_RUNTIME_VERSION` 包含非整数后缀时，测试正确比较 zlib "
"版本。例如，zlib-ng 将版本定义为 ``1.3.0.zlib-ng``。"

#: ../NEWS:12178
msgid ""
":gh:`112334`: Adds a regression test to verify that ``vfork()`` is used when"
" expected by :mod:`subprocess` on vfork enabled POSIX systems (Linux)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112334`: 添加回归测试以验证在启用了 vfork 的 POSIX 系统（如 Linux）上，:mod:`subprocess` "
"在预期时会使用 ``vfork()``。"

#: ../NEWS:12181
msgid ""
":gh:`108927`: Fixed order dependence in running tests in the same process "
"when a test that has submodules (e.g. test_importlib) follows a test that "
"imports its submodule (e.g. test_importlib.util) and precedes a test (e.g. "
"test_unittest or test_compileall) that uses that submodule."
msgstr ""
":gh:`108927`: 修复了在同一进程中运行测试时的顺序依赖问题，当一个具有子模块的测试（如 "
"test_importlib）跟随一个导入其子模块的测试（如 test_importlib.util）并先于一个使用该子模块的测试（如 "
"test_unittest 或 test_compileall）时。"

#: ../NEWS:12186
msgid ":issue:`40648`: Test modes that file can get with chmod() on Windows."
msgstr ":issue:`40648`: 测试 Windows 上文件可以通过 chmod() 获取的模式。"

#: ../NEWS:12191
msgid ""
":gh:`114013`: Fix ``Tools/wasm/wasi.py`` to not include the path to "
"``python.wasm`` as part of ``HOSTRUNNER``. The environment variable is meant"
" to specify how to run the WASI host only, having ``python.wasm`` and "
"relevant flags appended to the ``HOSTRUNNER``. This fixes ``make test`` "
"work."
msgstr ""
":gh:`114013`: 修复 ``Tools/wasm/wasi.py``，不将 ``python.wasm`` 的路径作为 "
"``HOSTRUNNER`` 的一部分。环境变量仅用于指定如何运行 WASI 主机，将 ``python.wasm`` 和相关标志附加到 "
"``HOSTRUNNER``。这修复了 ``make test`` 的工作。"

#: ../NEWS:12197
msgid ""
":gh:`113258`: Changed the Windows build to write out generated frozen "
"modules into the build tree instead of the source tree."
msgstr ":gh:`113258`: 更改 Windows 构建，将生成的冻结模块写入构建树而非源树。"

#: ../NEWS:12200
msgid ""
":gh:`112305`: Fixed the ``check-clean-src`` step performed on out of tree "
"builds to detect errant ``$(srcdir)/Python/frozen_modules/*.h`` files and "
"recommend appropriate source tree cleanup steps to get a working build "
"again."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112305`: 修复了在树外构建上执行的 ``check-clean-src`` 步骤，以检测错误的 "
"``$(srcdir)/Python/frozen_modules/*.h`` 文件，并建议适当的源树清理步骤以重新获得可工作的构建。"

#: ../NEWS:12205
msgid ":gh:`112536`: Add support for thread sanitizer (TSAN)"
msgstr ":gh:`112536`: 添加对线程消毒剂（TSAN）的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:12207
msgid ""
":gh:`112867`: Fix the build for the case that WITH_PYMALLOC_RADIX_TREE=0 "
"set."
msgstr ":gh:`112867`: 修复了当设置 WITH_PYMALLOC_RADIX_TREE=0 时的构建。"

#: ../NEWS:12209
msgid ""
":gh:`103065`: Introduce ``Tools/wasm/wasi.py`` to simplify doing a WASI "
"build."
msgstr ":gh:`103065`: 引入 ``Tools/wasm/wasi.py`` 以简化 WASI 构建。"

#: ../NEWS:12212
msgid ""
":issue:`11102`: The :func:`os.major`, :func:`os.makedev`, and "
":func:`os.minor` functions are now available on HP-UX v3."
msgstr ""
":issue:`11102`: :func:`os.major`、:func:`os.makedev` 和 :func:`os.minor` 函数现在在"
" HP-UX v3 上可用。"

#: ../NEWS:12215
msgid ":issue:`36351`: Do not set ipv6type when cross-compiling."
msgstr ":issue:`36351`: 交叉编译时不设置 ipv6type。"

#: ../NEWS:12220
msgid ""
":gh:`114096`: Process privileges that are activated for creating directory "
"junctions are now restored afterwards, avoiding behaviour changes in other "
"parts of the program."
msgstr ":gh:`114096`: 为创建目录连接激活的进程权限现在会在之后恢复，避免程序中其他部分的行为变化。"

#: ../NEWS:12224
msgid ""
":gh:`111877`: :func:`os.stat` calls were returning incorrect time values for"
" files that could not be accessed directly."
msgstr ":gh:`111877`: :func:`os.stat` 调用对于无法直接访问的文件返回了错误的时间值。"

#: ../NEWS:12227
msgid ":gh:`111973`: Update Windows installer to use SQLite 3.44.2."
msgstr ":gh:`111973`: 更新 Windows 安装程序以使用 SQLite 3.44.2。"

#: ../NEWS:12229
msgid ""
":gh:`113009`: :mod:`multiprocessing`: On Windows, fix a race condition in "
"``Process.terminate()``: no longer set the ``returncode`` attribute to "
"always call ``WaitForSingleObject()`` in ``Process.wait()``.  Previously, "
"sometimes the process was still running after ``TerminateProcess()`` even if"
" ``GetExitCodeProcess()`` is not ``STILL_ACTIVE``. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`113009`: :mod:`multiprocessing`: 在 Windows 上，修复了 "
"``Process.terminate()`` 中的一个竞态条件：不再将 ``returncode`` 属性设置为总是在 "
"``Process.wait()`` 中调用 ``WaitForSingleObject()``。之前，有时候即使 "
"``GetExitCodeProcess()`` 不是 ``STILL_ACTIVE``，进程在 ``TerminateProcess()`` "
"后仍在运行。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12236
msgid ""
":gh:`86179`: Fixes path calculations when launching Python on Windows "
"through a symlink."
msgstr ":gh:`86179`: 修复了通过符号链接在 Windows 上启动 Python 时的路径计算问题。"

#: ../NEWS:12239
msgid ""
":gh:`71383`: Update Tcl/Tk in Windows installer to 8.6.13 with a patch to "
"suppress incorrect ThemeChanged warnings."
msgstr ""
":gh:`71383`: 更新 Windows 安装程序中的 Tcl/Tk 到 8.6.13，并应用了一个补丁以抑制不正确的 ThemeChanged "
"警告。"

#: ../NEWS:12242
msgid ""
":gh:`111650`: Ensures the ``Py_GIL_DISABLED`` preprocessor variable is "
"defined in :file:`pyconfig.h` so that extension modules written in C are "
"able to use it."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111650`: 确保在 :file:`pyconfig.h` 中定义了 ``Py_GIL_DISABLED`` 预处理器变量，以便用 C "
"编写的扩展模块能够使用它。"

#: ../NEWS:12246
msgid ""
":gh:`112278`: Reduce the time cost for some functions in :mod:`platform` on "
"Windows if current user has no permission to the WMI."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112278`: 如果当前用户没有 WMI 的权限，减少 Windows 上 :mod:`platform` 中某些函数的时间成本。"

#: ../NEWS:12249
msgid ""
":gh:`73427`: Deprecate :func:`sys._enablelegacywindowsfsencoding`. Use "
":envvar:`PYTHONLEGACYWINDOWSFSENCODING` instead. Patch by Inada Naoki."
msgstr ""
":gh:`73427`: 弃用 :func:`sys._enablelegacywindowsfsencoding`。改用 "
":envvar:`PYTHONLEGACYWINDOWSFSENCODING`。由 Inada Naoki 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12252
msgid ""
":gh:`87868`: Correctly sort and remove duplicate environment variables in "
":py:func:`!_winapi.CreateProcess`."
msgstr ":gh:`87868`: 在 :py:func:`!_winapi.CreateProcess` 中正确排序并移除重复的环境变量。"

#: ../NEWS:12255
msgid ""
":issue:`37308`: Fix mojibake in :class:`mmap.mmap` when using a non-ASCII "
"*tagname* argument on Windows."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37308`: 修复在 Windows 上使用非 ASCII *tagname* 参数时 :class:`mmap.mmap` "
"中的乱码问题。"

#: ../NEWS:12261
msgid ""
":gh:`113666`: Add the following constants to module :mod:`stat`: "
"``UF_SETTABLE``, ``UF_TRACKED``, ``UF_DATAVAULT``, ``SF_SUPPORTED``, "
"``SF_SETTABLE``, ``SF_SYNTHETIC``, ``SF_RESTRICTED``, ``SF_FIRMLINK`` and "
"``SF_DATALESS``. The values ``UF_SETTABLE``, ``SF_SUPPORTED``, "
"``SF_SETTABLE`` and ``SF_SYNTHETIC`` are only available on macOS."
msgstr ""
":gh:`113666`: 向模块 :mod:`stat` "
"添加以下常量：``UF_SETTABLE``、``UF_TRACKED``、``UF_DATAVAULT``、``SF_SUPPORTED``、``SF_SETTABLE``、``SF_SYNTHETIC``、``SF_RESTRICTED``、``SF_FIRMLINK``"
" 和 ``SF_DATALESS``。值 ``UF_SETTABLE``、``SF_SUPPORTED``、``SF_SETTABLE`` 和 "
"``SF_SYNTHETIC`` 仅在 macOS 上可用。"

#: ../NEWS:12267
msgid ":gh:`113536`: :func:`os.waitid` is now available on macOS"
msgstr ":gh:`113536`: :func:`os.waitid` 现在在 macOS 上可用。"

#: ../NEWS:12269
msgid ""
":gh:`110459`: Running ``configure ... --with-openssl-rpath=X/Y/Z`` no longer"
" fails to detect OpenSSL on macOS."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110459`: 在 macOS 上运行 ``configure ... --with-openssl-rpath=X/Y/Z`` "
"不再无法检测到 OpenSSL。"

#: ../NEWS:12272
msgid ""
":gh:`74573`: Document that :mod:`dbm.ndbm` can silently corrupt DBM files on"
" updates when exceeding undocumented platform limits, and can crash "
"(segmentation fault) when reading such a corrupted file. (FB8919203)"
msgstr ""
":gh:`74573`: 文档说明 :mod:`dbm.ndbm` 在更新时超过未记录的平台限制时可能会静默损坏 DBM "
"文件，并且在读取此类损坏文件时可能会崩溃（段错误）。(FB8919203)"

#: ../NEWS:12276
msgid ""
":gh:`65701`: The :program:`freeze` tool doesn't work with framework builds "
"of Python. Document this and bail out early when running the tool with such "
"a build."
msgstr ""
":gh:`65701`: :program:`freeze` 工具不适用于 Python "
"的框架构建。文档说明这一点，并在使用此类构建运行工具时早期退出。"

#: ../NEWS:12280
msgid ""
":gh:`87277`: webbrowser: Don't look for X11 browsers on macOS. Those are "
"generally not used and probing for them can result in starting XQuartz even "
"if it isn't used otherwise."
msgstr ""
":gh:`87277`: webbrowser: 不要在 macOS 上寻找 X11 浏览器。这些通常不被使用，探测它们可能会导致启动 "
"XQuartz，即使它不被其他方式使用。"

#: ../NEWS:12284
msgid ":gh:`111973`: Update macOS installer to use SQLite 3.44.2."
msgstr ":gh:`111973`: 更新 macOS 安装程序以使用 SQLite 3.44.2。"

#: ../NEWS:12286
msgid ""
":gh:`108269`: Set ``CFBundleAllowMixedLocalizations`` to true in the "
"Info.plist for the framework, embedded Python.app and IDLE.app with "
"framework installs on macOS.  This allows applications to pick up the user's"
" preferred locale when that's different from english."
msgstr ""
":gh:`108269`: 在 macOS 上的框架、嵌入式 Python.app 和 IDLE.app 的 Info.plist 中设置 "
"``CFBundleAllowMixedLocalizations`` 为 "
"true。这允许应用程序在用户的首选区域设置与英语不同时，选择用户的区域设置。"

#: ../NEWS:12291
msgid ""
":gh:`102362`: Make sure the result of :func:`sysconfig.get_plaform` includes"
" at least a major and minor versions, even if ``MACOSX_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET`` "
"is set to only a major version during build to match the format expected by "
"pip."
msgstr ""
":gh:`102362`: 确保 :func:`sysconfig.get_plaform` 的结果至少包括主版本和次版本，即使在构建过程中 "
"``MACOSX_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET`` 仅设置为一个主版本以匹配 pip 预期的格式。"

#: ../NEWS:12296
msgid ""
":gh:`110017`: Disable a signal handling stress test on macOS due to a bug in"
" macOS (FB13453490)."
msgstr ":gh:`110017`: 由于 macOS 中的一个错误 (FB13453490)，在 macOS 上禁用信号处理压力测试。"

#: ../NEWS:12299
msgid ""
":gh:`110820`: Make sure the preprocessor definitions for "
"``ALIGNOF_MAX_ALIGN_T``, ``SIZEOF_LONG_DOUBLE`` and ``HAVE_GCC_ASM_FOR_X64``"
" are correct for Universal 2 builds on macOS."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110820`: 确保 ``ALIGNOF_MAX_ALIGN_T``、``SIZEOF_LONG_DOUBLE`` 和 "
"``HAVE_GCC_ASM_FOR_X64`` 的预处理器定义对于 macOS 上的 Universal 2 构建是正确的。"

#: ../NEWS:12303
msgid ""
":gh:`109981`: Use ``/dev/fd`` on macOS to determine the number of open files"
" in ``test.support.os_helper.fd_count`` to avoid a crash with \"guarded\" "
"file descriptors when probing for open files."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109981`: 在 macOS 上使用 ``/dev/fd`` 来确定 "
"``test.support.os_helper.fd_count`` 中打开的文件数量，以避免在探测打开的文件时因“受保护”的文件描述符而崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:12310
msgid ""
":gh:`72284`: Improve the lists of features, editor key bindings, and shell "
"key bingings in the IDLE doc."
msgstr ":gh:`72284`: 改进 IDLE 文档中的功能列表、编辑器键绑定和 shell 键绑定。"

#: ../NEWS:12313
msgid ""
":gh:`113903`: Fix rare failure of test.test_idle, in test_configdialog."
msgstr ":gh:`113903`: 修复 test.test_idle 在 test_configdialog 中的罕见失败。"

#: ../NEWS:12315
msgid ":gh:`113729`: Fix the \"Help -> IDLE Doc\" menu bug in 3.11.7 and 3.12.1."
msgstr ":gh:`113729`: 修复 3.11.7 和 3.12.1 中的“帮助 -> IDLE 文档”菜单错误。"

#: ../NEWS:12317
msgid ":gh:`113269`: Fix test_editor hang on macOS Catalina."
msgstr ":gh:`113269`: 修复 test_editor 在 macOS Catalina 上的挂起问题。"

#: ../NEWS:12319
msgid ""
":gh:`112898`: Fix processing unsaved files when quitting IDLE on macOS."
msgstr ":gh:`112898`: 修复在macOS上退出IDLE时处理未保存文件的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:12321
msgid ""
":issue:`13586`: Enter the selected text when opening the \"Replace\" dialog."
msgstr ":issue:`13586`: 打开“替换”对话框时输入选中的文本。"

#: ../NEWS:12326
msgid ""
":gh:`106560`: Fix redundant declarations in the public C API. Declare "
"PyBool_Type, PyLong_Type and PySys_Audit() only once. Patch by Victor "
"Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106560`: 修复公共C "
"API中的冗余声明。仅声明一次PyBool_Type、PyLong_Type和PySys_Audit()。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12330
msgid ""
":gh:`112438`: Fix support of format units \"es\", \"et\", \"es#\", and "
"\"et#\" in nested tuples in :c:func:`PyArg_ParseTuple`-like functions."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112438`: 修复在 :c:func:`PyArg_ParseTuple` "
"类似函数中嵌套元组中格式单元\"es\"、\"et\"、\"es#\"和\"et#\"的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:12333
msgid ""
":gh:`111545`: Add :c:func:`Py_HashPointer` function to hash a pointer. Patch"
" by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111545`: 添加 :c:func:`Py_HashPointer` 函数以哈希指针。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12336
msgid ""
":gh:`65210`: Change the declaration of the *keywords* parameter of "
":c:func:`PyArg_ParseTupleAndKeywords` and "
":c:func:`PyArg_VaParseTupleAndKeywords` for better compatibility with C++."
msgstr ""
":gh:`65210`: 更改 :c:func:`PyArg_ParseTupleAndKeywords` 和 "
":c:func:`PyArg_VaParseTupleAndKeywords` 的 *keywords* 参数的声明以提高与C++的兼容性。"

#: ../NEWS:12342
msgid "Python 3.13.0 alpha 2"
msgstr "Python 3.13.0 alpha 2"

#: ../NEWS:12344
msgid "*Release date: 2023-11-22*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2023-11-22*"

#: ../NEWS:12349
msgid ""
":gh:`112243`: Don't include comments in f-string debug expressions. Patch by"
" Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":gh:`112243`: 不要在f-string调试表达式中包含注释。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:12352
msgid ""
":gh:`112287`: Slightly optimize the Tier 2 (uop) interpreter by only loading"
" ``oparg`` and ``operand`` when needed. Also double the trace size limit "
"again, to 512 this time."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112287`: 通过仅在需要时加载 ``oparg`` 和 ``operand`` 来轻微优化Tier "
"2（uop）解释器。同时再次将跟踪大小限制翻倍，这次是512。"

#: ../NEWS:12356
msgid ""
":gh:`112266`: Change docstrings of :attr:`~object.__dict__` and "
":attr:`~object.__weakref__`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112266`: 更改 :attr:`~object.__dict__` 和 :attr:`~object.__weakref__` "
"的文档字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:12359
msgid ""
":gh:`111807`: Lower the max parser stack depth to 1000 under WASI debug "
"builds."
msgstr ":gh:`111807`: 在WASI调试构建下将最大解析器堆栈深度降低到1000。"

#: ../NEWS:12362
msgid ""
":gh:`111798`: When Python is built in debug mode, set the C recursion limit "
"to 500 instead of 1500. A debug build is likely built with low optimization "
"level which implies higher stack memory usage than a release build. Patch by"
" Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111798`: "
"当Python以调试模式构建时，将C递归限制设置为500而不是1500。调试构建很可能以低优化级别构建，这意味着比发布构建更高的堆栈内存使用。由Victor"
" Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12367
msgid ":gh:`106529`: Enable translating unspecialized ``FOR_ITER`` to Tier 2."
msgstr ":gh:`106529`: 启用将未特化的 ``FOR_ITER`` 翻译到Tier 2。"

#: ../NEWS:12369
msgid ":gh:`111916`: Make hashlib related modules thread-safe without the GIL"
msgstr ":gh:`111916`: 使hashlib相关模块在没有GIL的情况下线程安全"

#: ../NEWS:12371
msgid ""
":gh:`81137`: Deprecate assignment to a function's ``__code__`` field when "
"the new code object is of a mismatched type (e.g., from a generator to a "
"plain function)."
msgstr ":gh:`81137`: 当新代码对象类型不匹配时（例如，从生成器到普通函数），弃用对函数 ``__code__``字段的赋值。"

#: ../NEWS:12375
msgid ""
":gh:`79932`: Raise exception if :meth:`frame.clear` is called on a suspended"
" frame."
msgstr ":gh:`79932`: 如果 :suspension:`frame.clear` 在暂停的帧上调用，则引发异常。"

#: ../NEWS:12378
msgid ":gh:`81925`: Implement native thread ids for GNU KFreeBSD."
msgstr ":gh:`81925`: 为GNU KFreeBSD实现原生线程id。"

#: ../NEWS:12380
msgid ""
":gh:`111843`: Use exponential backoff to reduce the number of failed tier 2 "
"optimization attempts by over 99%."
msgstr ":gh:`111843`: 使用指数退避来减少Tier 2优化尝试失败的次数超过99%。"

#: ../NEWS:12383
msgid ""
":gh:`110829`: Joining a thread now ensures the underlying OS thread has "
"exited. This is required for safer fork() in multi-threaded processes."
msgstr ":gh:`110829`: 加入线程现在确保底层操作系统线程已退出。这是多线程进程中更安全fork()所必需的。"

#: ../NEWS:12386
msgid ""
":gh:`109369`: Make sure that tier 2 traces are de-optimized if the code is "
"instrumented"
msgstr ":gh:`109369`: 如果代码被插桩，确保二级追踪被去优化"

#: ../NEWS:12389
msgid ""
":gh:`111772`: Specialize slot loads and stores for _Py_T_OBJECT as well as "
"Py_T_OBJECT_EX"
msgstr ":gh:`111772`: 为_Py_T_OBJECT以及Py_T_OBJECT_EX专门化槽加载和存储"

#: ../NEWS:12392
msgid ""
":gh:`111666`: Speed up :meth:`BaseExceptionGroup.derive`, "
":meth:`BaseExceptionGroup.subgroup`, and :meth:`BaseExceptionGroup.split` by"
" changing how they parse passed arguments."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111666`: 通过改变它们解析传递参数的方式，加速 "
":meth:`BaseExceptionGroup.derive`、:meth:`BaseExceptionGroup.subgroup` 和 "
":meth:`BaseExceptionGroup.split`。"

#: ../NEWS:12396
msgid ""
":gh:`111654`: Fix runtime crash when some error happens in opcode "
"``LOAD_FROM_DICT_OR_DEREF``."
msgstr ":gh:`111654`: 修复操作码 ``LOAD_FROM_DICT_OR_DEREF`` 中发生某些错误时的运行时崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:12399
msgid ""
":gh:`111623`: Add support for sharing tuples between interpreters using the "
"cross-interpreter API.  Patch by Anthony Shaw."
msgstr ":gh:`111623`: 使用跨解释器API添加支持在解释器之间共享元组。由Anthony Shaw提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12402
msgid ""
":gh:`111354`: The oparg of :opcode:`YIELD_VALUE` is now ``1`` if the "
"instruction is part of a yield-from or await, and ``0`` otherwise."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111354`: 如果指令是yield-from或await的一部分，则 :opcode:`YIELD_VALUE` "
"的操作数现在为``1``，否则为 ``0``。"

#: ../NEWS:12405
msgid ""
"The SUSPENDED frame state is now split into ``SUSPENDED`` and "
"``SUSPENDED_YIELD_FROM``. This simplifies the code in ``_PyGen_yf``."
msgstr ""
"SUSPENDED帧状态现在分为 ``SUSPENDED`` 和 ``SUSPENDED_YIELD_FROM``。这简化了 ``_PyGen_yf``"
" 中的代码。"

#: ../NEWS:12408
msgid ""
":gh:`111520`: Merge the Tier 1 (bytecode) and Tier 2 (micro-ops) "
"interpreters together, moving the Tier 2 interpreter loop and switch into "
"``_PyEval_EvalFrameDefault()`` in ``Python/ceval.c``. The "
"``Python/executor.c`` file is gone. Also the ``TIER_ONE`` and ``TIER_TWO`` "
"macros are now handled by the code generator."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111520`: 将Tier 1（字节码）和Tier 2（微操作）解释器合并在一起，将Tier 2解释器循环和开关移动到 "
"``Python/ceval.c`` 中的 ``_PyEval_EvalFrameDefault()``。``Python/executor.c`` "
"文件已移除。此外，``TIER_ONE``和 ``TIER_TWO`` 宏现在由代码生成器处理。"

#: ../NEWS:12414
msgid ""
"**Beware!** This changes the environment variables to enable micro-ops and "
"their debugging to ``PYTHON_UOPS`` and ``PYTHON_LLTRACE``."
msgstr "**注意！**这将环境变量更改为 ``PYTHON_UOPS`` 和 ``PYTHON_LLTRACE`` 以启用微操作及其调试。"

#: ../NEWS:12417
msgid ""
":gh:`109181`: Speed up :class:`Traceback` object creation by lazily compute "
"the line number. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":gh:`109181`: 通过懒惰计算行号加速 :class:`Traceback` 对象创建。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:12420
msgid ":gh:`111420`: Allow type comments in parenthesized ``with`` statements"
msgstr ":gh:`111420`: 允许在括号化的 ``with`` 语句中使用类型注释"

#: ../NEWS:12422
msgid ""
":gh:`111438`: Add support for sharing floats between interpreters using the "
"cross-interpreter API.  Patch by Anthony Shaw."
msgstr ":gh:`111438`: 使用跨解释器API添加支持在解释器之间共享浮点数。由Anthony Shaw提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12425
msgid ""
":gh:`111435`: Add support for sharing of ``True`` and ``False`` between "
"interpreters using the cross-interpreter API.  Patch by Anthony Shaw."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111435`: 使用跨解释器API添加支持在解释器之间共享 ``True`` 和 ``False``。由Anthony Shaw提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12428
msgid ""
":gh:`102388`: Fix a bug where ``iso2022_jp_3`` and ``iso2022_jp_2004`` "
"codecs read out of bounds"
msgstr ":gh:`102388`: 修复 ``iso2022_jp_3`` 和 ``iso2022_jp_2004`` 编解码器读取越界的错误"

#: ../NEWS:12431
msgid ""
":gh:`111366`: Fix an issue in the :mod:`codeop` that was causing "
":exc:`SyntaxError` exceptions raised in the presence of invalid syntax to "
"not contain precise error messages. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`111366`: 修复了 :mod:`codeop` 中的一个问题，该问题导致在存在无效语法时引发的 :exc:`SyntaxError` "
"异常不包含精确的错误信息。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12435
msgid ""
":gh:`111380`: Fix a bug that was causing :exc:`SyntaxWarning` to appear "
"twice when parsing if invalid syntax is encountered later. Patch by Pablo "
"galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`111380`: 修复了一个错误，该错误导致在解析时如果遇到无效语法，:exc:`SyntaxWarning` 会显示两次。由Pablo "
"Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12439
msgid ""
":gh:`111374`: Added a new environment variable "
":envvar:`PYTHON_FROZEN_MODULES`. It determines whether or not frozen modules"
" are ignored by the import machinery, equivalent of the :option:`-X "
"frozen_modules <-X>` command-line option."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111374`: 添加了一个新的环境变量 "
":envvar:`PYTHON_FROZEN_MODULES`。它决定了导入机制是否忽略冻结模块，等同于命令行选项 :option:`-X "
"frozen_modules <-X>`。"

#: ../NEWS:12444
msgid ""
":gh:`111354`: Remove ``oparg`` from :opcode:`YIELD_VALUE`. Change ``oparg`` "
"of :opcode:`RESUME` to include information about the except-depth. These "
"changes make it possible to simplify the code in generator close."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111354`: 从 :opcode:`YIELD_VALUE` 中移除 ``oparg``。将 :opcode:`RESUME` 的 "
"``oparg`` 更改为包含关于except深度的信息。这些更改使得简化生成器关闭中的代码成为可能。"

#: ../NEWS:12448
msgid ""
":gh:`94438`: Fix a regression that prevented jumping across ``is None`` and "
"``is not None`` when debugging. Patch by Savannah Ostrowski."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94438`: 修复了一个回归问题，该问题在调试时阻止了跨 ``is None`` 和 ``is not None`` "
"的跳转。由Savannah Ostrowski提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12451
msgid ""
":gh:`67224`: Show source lines in tracebacks when using the ``-c`` option "
"when running Python. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":gh:`67224`: 在使用 ``-c`` 选项运行Python时，在回溯中显示源代码行。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12454
msgid ""
":gh:`111123`: Fix a bug where a :keyword:`global` declaration in an "
":keyword:`except` block is rejected when the global is used in the "
":keyword:`else` block."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111123`: 修复了一个错误，该错误导致在 :keyword:`except` 块中的 :keyword:`global` "
"声明在全局变量在 :keyword:`else` 块中使用时被拒绝。"

#: ../NEWS:12458
msgid ""
":gh:`110938`: Fix error messages for indented blocks with functions and "
"classes with generic type parameters. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":gh:`110938`: 修复了带有函数和带有泛型类型参数的类的缩进块的错误消息。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12461
msgid ""
":gh:`109214`: Remove unnecessary instruction pointer updates before "
"returning from frames."
msgstr ":gh:`109214`: 在从帧返回之前移除不必要的指令指针更新。"

#: ../NEWS:12464
msgid ""
":gh:`110912`: Correctly display the traceback for :exc:`MemoryError` "
"exceptions using the :mod:`traceback` module. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`110912`: 使用 :mod:`traceback` 模块正确显示 :exc:`MemoryError` 异常的回溯。由Pablo "
"Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12467
msgid ""
":gh:`109894`: Fixed crash due to improperly initialized static "
":exc:`MemoryError` in subinterpreter."
msgstr ":gh:`109894`: 修复了由于子解释器中静态 :exc:`MemoryError` 未正确初始化而导致的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:12470
msgid ""
":gh:`110892`: Return ``NULL`` for ``PyTrace_RETURN`` events caused by an "
"exception"
msgstr ":gh:`110892`: 对于由异常引起的 ``PyTrace_RETURN`` 事件返回 ``NULL``。"

#: ../NEWS:12473
msgid ""
":gh:`110864`: Fix argument parsing by ``_PyArg_UnpackKeywordsWithVararg`` "
"for functions defining pos-or-keyword, vararg, and kw-only parameters."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110864`: 通过 ``_PyArg_UnpackKeywordsWithVararg`` "
"修复了为定义位置或关键字、可变参数和仅关键字参数的函数的参数解析。"

#: ../NEWS:12476
msgid ""
":gh:`109094`: Replace ``prev_instr`` on the interpreter frame by "
"``instr_ptr`` which points to the beginning of the instruction that is "
"currently executing (or will execute once the frame resumes)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109094`: 将解释器帧上的 ``prev_instr`` 替换为 "
"``instr_ptr``，后者指向当前正在执行（或一旦帧恢复后将执行）的指令的开头。"

#: ../NEWS:12480
msgid ""
":gh:`110805`: Allow the repl to show source code and complete tracebacks. "
"Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":gh:`110805`: 允许 repl 显示源代码和完整的回溯。由 Pablo Galindo 提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12483
msgid ""
":gh:`110722`: Add :envvar:`PYTHON_PRESITE=package.module` to import a module"
" early in the interpreter lifecycle before ``site.py`` is executed.  Python "
"needs to be :ref:`built in debug mode <debug-build>` for this option to "
"exist."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110722`: 添加 :envvar:`PYTHON_PRESITE=package.module` 以在 ``site.py`` "
"执行之前在解释器生命周期的早期导入模块。Python 需要 :ref:`built in debug mode <debug-build>` "
"才能使此选项存在。"

#: ../NEWS:12488
msgid ""
":gh:`110481`: Implement biased reference counting in ``--disable-gil`` "
"builds."
msgstr ":gh:`110481`: 在 ``--disable-gil`` 构建中实现偏置引用计数。"

#: ../NEWS:12491
msgid ""
":gh:`110543`: Fix regression in Python 3.12 where "
":meth:`types.CodeType.replace` would produce a broken code object if called "
"on a module or class code object that contains a comprehension. Patch by "
"Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110543`: 修复 Python 3.12 中的回归问题，即 :meth:`types.CodeType.replace` "
"在包含理解的模块或类代码对象上调用时将产生损坏的代码对象。由 Jelle Zijlstra 提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12496
msgid ""
":gh:`89519`: Removed chained :class:`classmethod` descriptors (introduced in"
" :issue:`19072`).  This can no longer be used to wrap other descriptors such"
" as :class:`property`.  The core design of this feature was flawed and "
"caused a number of downstream problems.  To \"pass-through\" a "
":class:`classmethod`, consider using the :attr:`!__wrapped__` attribute that"
" was added in Python 3.10."
msgstr ""
":gh:`89519`: 移除了链式 :class:`classmethod` 描述符（在 :issue:`19072` "
"中引入）。这不能再用于包装其他描述符，如 :class:`property`。此特性的核心设计存在缺陷并导致了一系列下游问题。要“传递”一个 "
":class:`classmethod`，考虑使用 Python 3.10 中添加的 :attr:`!__wrapped__` 属性。"

#: ../NEWS:12503
msgid ":gh:`103615`: Use local events for opcode tracing"
msgstr ":gh:`103615`: 使用本地事件进行操作码追踪"

#: ../NEWS:12505
msgid ":issue:`46657`: Add mimalloc memory allocator support."
msgstr ":issue:`46657`: 添加 mimalloc 内存分配器支持。"

#: ../NEWS:12507
msgid ""
":gh:`106718`: When PyConfig.stdlib_dir is explicitly set, it's now respected"
" and won't be overridden by PyConfig.home."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106718`: 当 PyConfig.stdlib_dir 被显式设置时，现在会被尊重且不会被 PyConfig.home 覆盖。"

#: ../NEWS:12510
msgid ""
":gh:`106905`: Fix incorrect SystemError about AST constructor recursion "
"depth mismatch."
msgstr ":gh:`106905`: 修复关于 AST 构造器递归深度不匹配的错误 SystemError。"

#: ../NEWS:12513
msgid ""
":gh:`100445`: Improve error message for unterminated strings with escapes."
msgstr ":gh:`100445`: 改进带有转义的未终止字符串的错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:12515
msgid ""
":issue:`45759`: Improved error messages for ``elif``/``else`` statements not"
" matching any valid statements. Patch by Jeremiah Vivian."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45759`: 改进了 ``elif``/``else`` 语句不匹配任何有效语句时的错误消息。由 Jeremiah Vivian "
"提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12521
msgid ""
":gh:`111942`: Fix SystemError in the TextIOWrapper constructor with non-"
"encodable \"errors\" argument in non-debug mode."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111942`: 在非调试模式下修复 TextIOWrapper 构造器中使用不可编码的“errors”参数时的 SystemError。"

#: ../NEWS:12524
msgid ""
":gh:`111995`: Added the ``NI_IDN`` constant to the :mod:`socket` module when"
" present in C at build time for use with :func:`socket.getnameinfo`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111995`: 在构建时 C 中存在的 ``NI_IDN`` 常量添加到 :mod:`socket` 模块中，用于 "
":func:`socket.getnameinfo`。"

#: ../NEWS:12527
msgid ""
":gh:`109538`: Issue warning message instead of having :class:`RuntimeError` "
"be displayed when event loop has already been closed at "
":meth:`StreamWriter.__del__`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109538`: 当事件循环在 :meth:`StreamWriter.__del__` 中已经关闭时，显示警告信息而不是显示 "
":class:`RuntimeError`。"

#: ../NEWS:12531
msgid ""
":gh:`111942`: Fix crashes in :meth:`io.TextIOWrapper.reconfigure` when pass "
"invalid arguments, e.g. non-string encoding."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111942`: 修复在 :meth:`io.TextIOWrapper.reconfigure` "
"中传递无效参数（例如非字符串编码）时导致的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:12534
msgid ""
":gh:`111460`: :mod:`curses`: restore wide character support (including "
":func:`curses.unget_wch` and :meth:`~curses.window.get_wch`) on macOS, which"
" was unavailable due to a regression in Python 3.12."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111460`: :mod:`curses`: 在 macOS 上恢复宽字符支持（包括 :func:`curses.unget_wch` 和 "
":meth:`~curses.window.get_wch`），这在 Python 3.12 中因回归问题而不可用。"

#: ../NEWS:12538
msgid ""
":gh:`103791`: :class:`contextlib.suppress` now supports suppressing "
"exceptions raised as part of a :exc:`BaseExceptionGroup`, in addition to the"
" recent support for :exc:`ExceptionGroup`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`103791`: :class:`contextlib.suppress` 现在支持抑制作为 "
":exc:`BaseExceptionGroup` 一部分引发的异常，以及最近对 :exc:`ExceptionGroup` 的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:12542
msgid ""
":gh:`111835`: The :class:`mmap.mmap` class now has an "
":meth:`~mmap.mmap.seekable` method that can be used when a seekable file-"
"like object is required. The :meth:`~mmap.mmap.seek` method now returns the "
"new absolute position. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111835`: :class:`mmap.mmap` 类现在有一个 :meth:`~mmap.mmap.seekable` "
"方法，可以在需要可寻址的文件类对象时使用。:meth:`~mmap.mmap.seek` 方法现在返回新的绝对位置。由 Donghee Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12547
msgid ""
":gh:`111804`: Remove posix.fallocate() under WASI as the underlying "
"posix_fallocate() is not available in WASI preview2."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111804`: 在 WASI 下移除 posix.fallocate()，因为底层的 posix_fallocate() 在 WASI "
"preview2 中不可用。"

#: ../NEWS:12550
msgid ""
":gh:`111841`: Fix truncating arguments on an embedded null character in "
":meth:`os.putenv` and :meth:`os.unsetenv` on Windows."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111841`: 修复在 Windows 上的 :meth:`os.putenv` 和 :meth:`os.unsetenv` "
"中在嵌入的空字符处截断参数的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:12553
msgid ""
":gh:`111768`: :func:`wsgiref.util.is_hop_by_hop` is now exposed correctly in"
" ``__all__``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111768`: :func:`wsgiref.util.is_hop_by_hop` 现在在 ``__all__`` 中正确暴露。"

#: ../NEWS:12556
msgid ""
":gh:`80731`: Avoid executing the default function in :class:`cmd.Cmd` in an "
"except block"
msgstr ":gh:`80731`: 避免在 except 块中执行 :class:`cmd.Cmd` 的默认函数"

#: ../NEWS:12559
msgid ""
":gh:`111541`: Fix :mod:`doctest` for :exc:`SyntaxError` not-builtin "
"subclasses."
msgstr ":gh:`111541`: 修复 :mod:`doctest` 对于非内置子类的 :exc:`SyntaxError` 的处理。"

#: ../NEWS:12562
msgid ""
":gh:`111719`: Add extra argument validation for ``alias`` command in "
":mod:`pdb`"
msgstr ":gh:`111719`: 在 :mod:`pdb` 中为 ``alias`` 命令添加额外的参数验证"

#: ../NEWS:12565
msgid ""
":gh:`111482`: :mod:`time`: Make :func:`time.clock_gettime` and "
":func:`time.clock_gettime_ns` functions up to 2x faster by faster calling "
"convention. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111482`: :mod:`time`: 通过更快的调用约定，使 :func:`time.clock_gettime` 和 "
":func:`time.clock_gettime_ns` 函数的速度提高至 2 倍。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12569
msgid ""
":gh:`110894`: Call loop exception handler for exceptions in "
"``client_connected_cb`` of :func:`asyncio.start_server` so that applications"
" can handle it. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110894`: 为 :func:`asyncio.start_server` 的 ``client_connected_cb`` "
"中的异常调用循环异常处理器，以便应用程序可以处理它。由 Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12573
msgid ""
":gh:`111531`: Fix reference leaks in ``bind_class()`` and ``bind_all()`` "
"methods of :mod:`tkinter` widgets."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111531`: 修复 :mod:`tkinter` 小部件的 ``bind_class()`` 和 ``bind_all()`` "
"方法中的引用泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:12576
msgid ""
":gh:`111246`: :meth:`asyncio.loop.create_unix_server` will now automatically"
" remove the Unix socket when the server is closed."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111246`: :meth:`asyncio.loop.create_unix_server` 现在会在服务器关闭时自动删除 Unix "
"套接字。"

#: ../NEWS:12579
msgid ""
":gh:`111356`: Added :func:`io.text_encoding`, "
":data:`io.DEFAULT_BUFFER_SIZE`, and :class:`io.IncrementalNewlineDecoder` to"
" ``io.__all__``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111356`: 将 :func:`io.text_encoding`、:data:`io.DEFAULT_BUFFER_SIZE` 和 "
":class:`io.IncrementalNewlineDecoder` 添加到 ``io.__all__``。"

#: ../NEWS:12582
msgid ""
":gh:`66425`: Remove the code to set the REMOTE_HOST header from wsgiref "
"module, as it is unreachable. This header is used for performance reasons, "
"which is not necessary in the wsgiref module."
msgstr ""
":gh:`66425`: 从 wsgiref 模块中移除了设置 REMOTE_HOST "
"头部的代码，因为这是无法达到的。这个头部原本是出于性能考虑而使用的，但在 wsgiref 模块中并不必要。"

#: ../NEWS:12586
msgid ""
":gh:`111429`: Speed up :meth:`pathlib.PurePath.relative_to` and "
":meth:`~pathlib.PurePath.is_relative_to`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111429`: 加速 :meth:`pathlib.PurePath.relative_to` 和 "
":meth:`~pathlib.PurePath.is_relative_to`。"

#: ../NEWS:12589
msgid ":gh:`111342`: Fixed typo in :func:`math.sumprod`."
msgstr ":gh:`111342`: 修正了 :func:`math.sumprod` 中的拼写错误。"

#: ../NEWS:12591
msgid ""
":gh:`68166`: Remove mention of not supported \"vsapi\" element type in "
":meth:`tkinter.ttk.Style.element_create`. Add tests for ``element_create()``"
" and other ``ttk.Style`` methods. Add examples for ``element_create()`` in "
"the documentation."
msgstr ""
":gh:`68166`: 在 :meth:`tkinter.ttk.Style.element_create` 中移除了对不支持的 \"vsapi\" "
"元素类型的提及。为 ``element_create()`` 和其他 ``ttk.Style`` 方法添加了测试。在文档中为 "
"``element_create()`` 添加了示例。"

#: ../NEWS:12596
msgid ""
":gh:`111388`: Add ``show_group`` parameter to "
":func:`traceback.format_exception_only`, which allows to format "
":exc:`ExceptionGroup` instances."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111388`: 向 :func:`traceback.format_exception_only` 添加了 ``show_group`` "
"参数，允许格式化 :exc:`ExceptionGroup` 实例。"

#: ../NEWS:12600
msgid ""
":gh:`79033`: Another attempt at fixing :func:`asyncio.Server.wait_closed`. "
"It now blocks until both conditions are true: the server is closed, *and* "
"there are no more active connections. (This means that in some cases where "
"in 3.12.0 this function would *incorrectly* have returned immediately, it "
"will now block; in particular, when there are no active connections but the "
"server hasn't been closed yet.)"
msgstr ""
":gh:`79033`: 又一次尝试修复 "
":func:`asyncio.Server.wait_closed`。现在它会阻塞，直到两个条件都为真：服务器已关闭，*并且* "
"没有更多活跃连接。（这意味着在某些情况下，在 3.12.0 中此函数 *错误地* 立即返回，现在将会阻塞；特别是，当没有活跃连接但服务器尚未关闭时。）"

#: ../NEWS:12607
msgid ":gh:`111259`: Optimize recursive wildcards in :mod:`pathlib`."
msgstr ":gh:`111259`: 优化 :mod:`pathlib` 中的递归通配符。"

#: ../NEWS:12609
msgid ""
":gh:`111295`: Fix :mod:`time` not checking for errors when initializing."
msgstr ":gh:`111295`: 修复 :mod:`time` 在初始化时不检查错误的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:12611
msgid ":gh:`111253`: Add error checking during :mod:`!_socket` module init."
msgstr ":gh:`111253`: 在 :mod:`!_socket` 模块初始化期间添加错误检查。"

#: ../NEWS:12613
msgid ""
":gh:`111251`: Fix :mod:`!_blake2` not checking for errors when initializing."
msgstr ":gh:`111251`: 修复 :mod:`!_blake2` 在初始化时不检查错误的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:12615
msgid ""
":gh:`111233`: Fix :mod:`select` not checking for errors when initializing."
msgstr ":gh:`111233`: 修复 :mod:`select` 在初始化时不检查错误的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:12617
msgid ""
":gh:`111230`: Fix :mod:`ssl` not checking for errors when initializing."
msgstr ":gh:`111230`: 修复 :mod:`ssl` 在初始化时不检查错误的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:12619
msgid ""
":gh:`111174`: Fix crash in :meth:`io.BytesIO.getbuffer` called repeatedly "
"for empty BytesIO."
msgstr ":gh:`111174`: 修复在为空 BytesIO 重复调用 :meth:`io.BytesIO.getbuffer` 时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:12622
msgid ""
":gh:`111187`: Postpone removal version for locale.getdefaultlocale() to "
"Python 3.15."
msgstr ":gh:`111187`: 将 locale.getdefaultlocale() 的移除版本推迟到 Python 3.15。"

#: ../NEWS:12625
msgid ""
":gh:`111159`: Fix :mod:`doctest` output comparison for exceptions with "
"notes."
msgstr ":gh:`111159`: 修复 :mod:`doctest` 对带有注释的异常的输出比较。"

#: ../NEWS:12627
msgid ""
":gh:`110910`: Fix invalid state handling in :class:`asyncio.TaskGroup` and "
":class:`asyncio.Timeout`. They now raise proper RuntimeError if they are "
"improperly used and are left in consistent state after this."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110910`: 修复 :class:`asyncio.TaskGroup` 和 :class:`asyncio.Timeout` "
"中的无效状态处理。如果使用不当，现在会正确抛出 RuntimeError，并在之后保持状态一致。"

#: ../NEWS:12631
msgid ":gh:`111092`: Make turtledemo run without default root enabled."
msgstr ":gh:`111092`: 使 turtledemo 在没有启用默认根的情况下运行。"

#: ../NEWS:12633
msgid ""
":gh:`110944`: Support alias and convenience vars for :mod:`pdb` completion"
msgstr ":gh:`110944`: 支持 :mod:`pdb` 补全的别名和便捷变量。"

#: ../NEWS:12635
msgid ""
":gh:`110745`: Added *newline* parameter to :meth:`pathlib.Path.read_text`. "
"Patch by Junya Okabe."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110745`: 向 :meth:`pathlib.Path.read_text` 添加了 *newline* 参数。由 Junya "
"Okabe 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12638
msgid ""
":gh:`84583`: Make :mod:`pdb` enter post-mortem mode even for "
":exc:`SyntaxError`"
msgstr ":gh:`84583`: 使 :mod:`pdb` 即使对于 :exc:`SyntaxError` 也能进入事后模式。"

#: ../NEWS:12641
msgid ""
":gh:`80675`: Set ``f_trace_lines = True`` on all frames upon "
":func:`pdb.set_trace`"
msgstr ""
":gh:`80675`: 在 :func:`pdb.set_trace` 时在所有帧上设置 ``f_trace_lines = True``。"

#: ../NEWS:12644
msgid ""
":gh:`110771`: Expose the setup and cleanup portions of "
"``asyncio.run_forever()`` as the standalone methods "
"``asyncio.run_forever_setup()`` and ``asyncio.run_forever_cleanup()``. This "
"allows for tighter integration with GUI event loops."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110771`: 将 ``asyncio.run_forever()`` 的设置和清理部分作为独立方法 "
"``asyncio.run_forever_setup()`` 和 ``asyncio.run_forever_cleanup()`` 公开。这使得与 "
"GUI 事件循环的集成更加紧密。"

#: ../NEWS:12649
msgid ""
":gh:`110774`: Support setting the :class:`asyncio.Runner` loop_factory kwarg"
" in :class:`unittest.IsolatedAsyncioTestCase`"
msgstr ""
":gh:`110774`: 在 :class:`unittest.IsolatedAsyncioTestCase` 中支持设置 "
":class:`asyncio.Runner` 的 loop_factory 关键字参数。"

#: ../NEWS:12652
msgid ""
":gh:`110392`: Fix :func:`tty.setraw` and :func:`tty.setcbreak`: previously "
"they returned partially modified list of the original tty attributes. "
":func:`tty.cfmakeraw` and :func:`tty.cfmakecbreak` now make a copy of the "
"list of special characters before modifying it."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110392`: 修复 :func:`tty.setraw` 和 :func:`tty.setcbreak`：之前它们返回了原始 tty "
"属性的部分修改列表。:func:`tty.cfmakeraw` 和 :func:`tty.cfmakecbreak` "
"现在在修改特殊字符列表之前先复制一份。"

#: ../NEWS:12657
msgid ""
":gh:`59013`: Make line number of function breakpoint more precise in "
":mod:`pdb`"
msgstr ":gh:`59013`: 在 :mod:`pdb` 中使函数断点的行号更加精确。"

#: ../NEWS:12660
msgid ""
":gh:`88434`: Emit deprecation warning for non-integer numbers in "
":mod:`gettext` functions and methods that consider plural forms even if the "
"translation was not found."
msgstr ":gh:`88434`: 对于 :mod:`gettext` 函数和方法中的非整数数字，即使未找到翻译也考虑复数形式的情况下发出弃用警告。"

#: ../NEWS:12664
msgid ""
":gh:`110395`: Ensure that :func:`select.kqueue` objects correctly appear as "
"closed in forked children, to prevent operations on an invalid file "
"descriptor."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110395`: 确保 :func:`select.kqueue` 对象在 fork 的子进程中正确显示为关闭，以防止对无效文件描述符的操作。"

#: ../NEWS:12668
msgid ""
":gh:`110196`: Add ``__reduce__`` method to :class:`IPv6Address` in order to "
"keep ``scope_id``"
msgstr ""
":gh:`110196`: 向 :class:`IPv6Address` 添加 ``__reduce__`` 方法以保留 ``scope_id``。"

#: ../NEWS:12671
msgid ""
":gh:`109747`: Improve errors for unsupported look-behind patterns. Now "
"re.error is raised instead of OverflowError or RuntimeError for too large "
"width of look-behind pattern."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109747`: 改进对不支持的后视模式的错误提示。现在对于后视模式宽度过大的情况，会抛出 re.error 而不是 "
"OverflowError 或 RuntimeError。"

#: ../NEWS:12675
msgid ""
":gh:`109466`: Add the :attr:`ipaddress.IPv4Address.ipv6_mapped` property, "
"which returns the IPv4-mapped IPv6 address."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109466`: 添加 :attr:`ipaddress.IPv4Address.ipv6_mapped` 属性，该属性返回 IPv4 映射的"
" IPv6 地址。"

#: ../NEWS:12678
msgid ""
":gh:`85098`: Implement the CLI of the :mod:`symtable` module and improve the"
" repr of :class:`~symtable.Symbol`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`85098`: 实现了 :mod:`symtable` 模块的命令行接口，并改进了 :class:`~symtable.Symbol` 的 "
"repr。"

#: ../NEWS:12681
msgid ""
":gh:`108791`: Improved error handling in :mod:`pdb` command line interface, "
"making it produce more concise error messages."
msgstr ":gh:`108791`: 改进了 :mod:`pdb` 命令行接口中的错误处理，使其产生更简洁的错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:12684
msgid ""
":gh:`105931`: Change :mod:`compileall` to only strip the stripdir prefix "
"from the full path recorded in the compiled ``.pyc`` file, when the prefix "
"matches the start of the full path in its entirety. When the prefix does not"
" match, no stripping is performed and a warning to this effect is displayed."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105931`: 修改 :mod:`compileall`，使其仅当 stripdir 前缀完全匹配完整路径的开头时，才从编译的 "
"``.pyc`` 文件中记录的完整路径中去除该前缀。当前缀不匹配时，不执行去除操作，并显示警告信息。"

#: ../NEWS:12690
msgid ""
"Previously all path components of the stripdir prefix that matched the full "
"path were removed, while those that did not match were left alone (including"
" ones interspersed between matching components)."
msgstr "之前，stripdir 前缀的所有路径组件中，与完整路径匹配的部分会被移除，而不匹配的部分则保留（包括穿插在匹配组件之间的部分）。"

#: ../NEWS:12694
msgid ""
":gh:`107431`: Make the ``DictProxy`` and ``ListProxy`` types in "
":mod:`multiprocessing.managers` :ref:`Generic Alias Types<types-"
"genericalias>` for ``[]`` use in typing contexts."
msgstr ""
":gh:`107431`: 使 :mod:`multiprocessing.managers` 中的 ``DictProxy`` 和 "
"``ListProxy`` 类型成为 ``[]`` 使用的 :ref:`Generic Alias Types <types-"
"genericalias>`，以便在类型上下文中使用。"

#: ../NEWS:12698
msgid ""
":gh:`72904`: Add :func:`glob.translate`. This function converts a pathname "
"with shell-style wildcards to a regular expression."
msgstr ""
":gh:`72904`: 添加 :func:`glob.translate`。此函数将带有 shell 风格通配符的路径名转换为正则表达式。"

#: ../NEWS:12701
msgid ""
":gh:`90026`: Define ``USE_XATTRS`` on Cygwin so that XATTR-related functions"
" in the :mod:`os` module become available."
msgstr ""
":gh:`90026`: 在 Cygwin 上定义 ``USE_XATTRS``，使 :mod:`os` 模块中与 XATTR 相关的函数可用。"

#: ../NEWS:12704
msgid ""
":gh:`90890`: New methods :meth:`mailbox.Maildir.get_info`, "
":meth:`mailbox.Maildir.set_info`, :meth:`mailbox.Maildir.get_flags`, "
":meth:`mailbox.Maildir.set_flags`, :meth:`mailbox.Maildir.add_flag`, "
":meth:`mailbox.Maildir.remove_flag`. These methods speed up accessing a "
"message's info and/or flags and are useful when it is not necessary to "
"access the message's contents, as when iterating over a Maildir to find "
"messages with specific flags."
msgstr ""
":gh:`90890`: 新方法 :meth:`mailbox.Maildir.get_info`, "
":meth:`mailbox.Maildir.set_info`, :meth:`mailbox.Maildir.get_flags`, "
":meth:`mailbox.Maildir.set_flags`, :meth:`mailbox.Maildir.add_flag`, "
":meth:`mailbox.Maildir.remove_flag`。这些方法加快了访问邮件的 info 和/或 flags "
"的速度，并且在不需要访问邮件内容时非常有用，例如在迭代 Maildir 以查找具有特定 flags 的邮件时。"

#: ../NEWS:12712
msgid ""
":gh:`102956`: Fix returning of empty byte strings after seek in zipfile "
"module"
msgstr ":gh:`102956`: 修复 zipfile 模块中 seek 后返回空字节字符串的问题"

#: ../NEWS:12715
msgid ""
":gh:`102895`: Added a parameter ``local_exit`` for :func:`code.interact` to "
"prevent ``exit()`` and ``quit`` from closing ``sys.stdin`` and raise "
"``SystemExit``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`102895`: 为 :func:`code.interact` 添加了一个参数 ``local_exit``，以防止 ``exit()`` "
"和 ``quit`` 关闭 ``sys.stdin`` 并引发 ``SystemExit``。"

#: ../NEWS:12719
msgid ""
":gh:`97928`: Change the behavior of :meth:`tkinter.Text.count`. It now "
"always returns an integer if one or less counting options are specified. "
"Previously it could return a single count as a 1-tuple, an integer (only if "
"option ``\"update\"`` was specified) or ``None`` if no items found. The "
"result is now the same if ``wantobjects`` is set to ``0``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`97928`: 修改 :meth:`tkinter.Text.count` "
"的行为。现在，如果指定一个或更少的计数选项，它总是返回一个整数。以前，它可以返回一个单一计数作为1元组，一个整数（仅当指定选项 "
"``\"update\"`` 时）或 ``None`` 如果没有找到项目。现在，如果 ``wantobjects`` 设置为 ``0``，结果是相同的。"

#: ../NEWS:12725
msgid ""
":gh:`96954`: Switch the storage of the unicode codepoint names to use a "
"different data-structure, a `directed acyclic word graph "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deterministic_acyclic_finite_state_automaton>`_."
" This makes the unicodedata shared library about 440 KiB smaller. "
"Contributed by Carl Friedrich Bolz-Tereick using code from the PyPy project."
msgstr ""
":gh:`96954`: 将unicode码点名称的存储切换为使用不同的数据结构，即`有向无环字图 "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deterministic_acyclic_finite_state_automaton>`_。这使得unicodedata共享库小了约440"
" KiB。由Carl Friedrich Bolz-Tereick使用来自PyPy项目的代码贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:12732
msgid ""
":gh:`73561`: Omit the interface scope from an IPv6 address when used as Host"
" header by :mod:`http.client`."
msgstr ":gh:`73561`: 当 :mod:`http.client` 使用IPv6地址作为Host头时，省略接口范围。"

#: ../NEWS:12735
msgid ""
":gh:`86826`: :mod:`zipinfo` now supports the full range of values in the TZ "
"string determined by RFC 8536 and detects all invalid formats. Both Python "
"and C implementations now raise exceptions of the same type on invalid data."
msgstr ""
":gh:`86826`: :mod:`zipinfo` 现在支持RFC "
"8536确定的TZ字符串中的全部值范围，并检测所有无效格式。Python和C实现现在在无效数据上抛出相同类型的异常。"

#: ../NEWS:12743
msgid ""
":gh:`111808`: Make the default value of "
"``test.support.infinite_recursion()`` to be conditional based on whether "
"optimizations were used when compiling the interpreter. This helps with "
"platforms like WASI whose stack size is greatly restricted in debug builds."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111808`: 使 ``test.support.infinite_recursion()`` "
"的默认值基于编译解释器时是否使用了优化条件。这有助于像WASI这样的平台，在调试构建中其堆栈大小受到极大限制。"

#: ../NEWS:12748
msgid ""
":gh:`110722`: Gathering line coverage of standard libraries within the "
"regression test suite is now precise, as well as much faster. Patch by "
"Łukasz Langa."
msgstr ":gh:`110722`: 在回归测试套件中收集标准库的行覆盖率现在是精确的，而且快得多。由Łukasz Langa提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12752
msgid ""
":gh:`110367`: Make regrtest ``--verbose3`` option compatible with "
"``--huntrleaks -jN`` options. The ``./python -m test -j1 -R 3:3 --verbose3``"
" command now works as expected. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110367`: 使regrtest的 ``--verbose3`` 选项与 ``--huntrleaks -jN`` "
"选项兼容。``./python -m test -j1 -R 3:3 --verbose3``命令现在按预期工作。由Victor "
"Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12756
msgid ""
":gh:`111165`: Remove no longer used functions ``run_unittest()`` and "
"``run_doctest()`` from the :mod:`test.support` module."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111165`: 从 :mod:`test.support` 模块中移除不再使用的函数 ``run_unittest()`` "
"和``run_doctest()``。"

#: ../NEWS:12759
msgid ""
":gh:`110932`: Fix regrtest if the ``SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH`` environment variable"
" is defined: use the variable value as the random seed. Patch by Victor "
"Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110932`: 如果定义了 ``SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH`` "
"环境变量，修复regrtest：使用变量值作为随机种子。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12763
msgid ""
":gh:`110995`: test_gdb: Fix detection of gdb built without Python scripting "
"support. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ":gh:`110995`: test_gdb: 修复对未构建Python脚本支持的gdb的检测。由Victor Stinner提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12766
msgid ""
":gh:`110918`: Test case matching patterns specified by options ``--match``, "
"``--ignore``, ``--matchfile`` and ``--ignorefile`` are now tested in the "
"order of specification, and the last match determines whether the test case "
"be run or ignored."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110918`: 现在按照指定的顺序测试由选项 ``--match``、``--ignore``、``--matchfile`` "
"和``--ignorefile``指定的测试用例匹配模式，最后一个匹配决定测试用例是否运行或被忽略。"

#: ../NEWS:12771
msgid ""
":gh:`108747`: Add unit test for ``usercustomize`` and ``sitecustomize`` "
"hooks from :class:`site`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`108747`: 为 :class:`site` 中的 ``usercustomize`` 和 ``sitecustomize`` "
"钩子添加单元测试。"

#: ../NEWS:12777
msgid ""
":gh:`96954`: Make ``make regen-unicodedata`` work for out-of-tree builds of "
"CPython."
msgstr ":gh:`96954`: 使 ``make regen-unicodedata`` 适用于CPython的树外构建。"

#: ../NEWS:12780
msgid ""
":gh:`112088`: Add ``Tools/build/regen-configure.sh`` script to regenerate "
"the ``configure`` with an Ubuntu container image. The "
"``quay.io/tiran/cpython_autoconf:271`` container image "
"(`tiran/cpython_autoconf <https://github.com/tiran/cpython_autoconf>`_) is "
"no longer used. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112088`: 添加 ``Tools/build/regen-configure.sh`` "
"脚本以使用Ubuntu容器镜像重新生成``configure``。不再使用 ``quay.io/tiran/cpython_autoconf:271``"
" 容器镜像(`tiran/cpython_autoconf "
"<https://github.com/tiran/cpython_autoconf>`_)。由Victor Stinner提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12786
msgid ""
":gh:`111046`: For wasi-threads, memory is now exported to fix compatibility "
"issues with some wasm runtimes."
msgstr ":gh:`111046`: 对于wasi-threads，现在导出内存以修复与某些wasm运行时的兼容性问题。"

#: ../NEWS:12789
msgid ""
":gh:`110828`: AIX 32bit needs ``-latomic`` to build the :mod:`!_testcapi` "
"extension module."
msgstr ":gh:`110828`: AIX 32位需要 ``-latomic`` 来构建 :mod:`!_testcapi` 扩展模块。"

#: ../NEWS:12792
msgid ""
":gh:`85283`: The ``errno``, ``md5``, ``resource``, ``winsound``, "
"``_ctypes_test``, ``_multiprocessing.posixshmem``, ``_scproxy``, ``_stat``, "
"``_testimportmultiple`` and ``_uuid`` C extensions are now built with the "
":ref:`limited C API <limited-c-api>`. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`85283`: 现在使用 :ref:`limited C API <limited-c-api>` 构建 "
"``errno``、``md5``、``resource``、``winsound``、``_ctypes_test``、``_multiprocessing.posixshmem``、``_scproxy``、``_stat``、``_testimportmultiple``和"
" ``_uuid`` C扩展。由Victor Stinner提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12801
msgid ""
":gh:`111856`: Fixes :func:`~os.fstat` on file systems that do not support "
"file ID requests. This includes FAT32 and exFAT."
msgstr ":gh:`111856`: 修复在不支持文件ID请求的文件系统上的 :func:`~os.fstat`。这包括FAT32和exFAT。"

#: ../NEWS:12804
msgid ""
":gh:`111293`: Fix :data:`os.DirEntry.inode` dropping higher 64 bits of a "
"file id on some filesystems on Windows."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111293`: 修复 :data:`os.DirEntry.inode` 在Windows上某些文件系统中丢弃文件ID的高64位的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:12807
msgid ""
":gh:`110913`: WindowsConsoleIO now correctly chunks large buffers without "
"splitting up UTF-8 sequences."
msgstr ":gh:`110913`: WindowsConsoleIO现在正确地分块大缓冲区而不拆分UTF-8序列。"

#: ../NEWS:12813
msgid ""
":gh:`59703`: For macOS framework builds, in ``getpath.c`` use the system "
"``dladdr`` function to find the path to the shared library rather than "
"depending on deprecated macOS APIs."
msgstr ""
":gh:`59703`: 对于macOS框架构建，在 ``getpath.c`` 中使用系统 ``dladdr`` "
"函数来查找共享库的路径，而不是依赖于已弃用的macOS API。"

#: ../NEWS:12817
msgid ""
":gh:`110950`: Update macOS installer to include an upstream Tcl/Tk fix for "
"the ``Secure coding is not enabled for restorable state!`` warning "
"encountered in Tkinter on macOS 14 Sonoma."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110950`: 更新 macOS 安装程序，包含上游 Tcl/Tk 的修复，解决在 macOS 14 Sonoma 上 Tkinter "
"中遇到的 ``Secure coding is not enabled for restorable state!`` 警告问题。"

#: ../NEWS:12821
msgid ""
":gh:`111015`: Ensure that IDLE.app and Python Launcher.app are installed "
"with appropriate permissions on macOS builds."
msgstr ":gh:`111015`: 确保在 macOS 构建中，IDLE.app 和 Python Launcher.app 以适当的权限安装。"

#: ../NEWS:12824
msgid ""
":gh:`71383`: Update macOS installer to include an upstream Tcl/Tk fix for "
"the ``ttk::ThemeChanged`` error encountered in Tkinter."
msgstr ""
":gh:`71383`: 更新 macOS 安装程序，包含上游 Tcl/Tk 的修复，解决在 Tkinter 中遇到的 "
"``ttk::ThemeChanged`` 错误。"

#: ../NEWS:12827
msgid ""
":gh:`92603`: Update macOS installer to include a fix accepted by upstream "
"Tcl/Tk for a crash encountered after the first :meth:`tkinter.Tk` instance "
"is destroyed."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92603`: 更新 macOS 安装程序，包含上游 Tcl/Tk 接受的修复，解决在第一个 :meth:`tkinter.Tk` "
"实例被销毁后遇到的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:12834
msgid ""
":issue:`35668`: Add docstrings to the IDLE debugger module. Fix two bugs: "
"initialize ``Idb.botframe`` (should be in Bdb); in ``Idb.in_rpc_code``, "
"check whether ``prev_frame`` is ``None`` before trying to use it. Greatly "
"expand test_debugger."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35668`: 为 IDLE 调试器模块添加文档字符串。修复两个错误：初始化 ``Idb.botframe`` (应在 Bdb 中) "
"；在 ``Idb.in_rpc_code`` 中，尝试使用 ``prev_frame`` 前检查其是否为 ``None``。大幅扩展 "
"test_debugger。"

#: ../NEWS:12842
msgid ""
":gh:`111903`: Argument Clinic now supports the ``@critical_section`` "
"directive that instructs Argument Clinic to generate a critical section "
"around the function call, which locks the ``self`` object in ``--disable-"
"gil`` builds. Patch by Sam Gross."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111903`: Argument Clinic 现在支持 ``@critical_section`` 指令，该指令指示 Argument "
"Clinic 在函数调用周围生成一个临界区，在 ``--disable-gil`` 构建中锁定 ``self`` 对象。补丁由 Sam Gross "
"提供。"

#: ../NEWS:12850
msgid ""
":gh:`112026`: Add again the private ``_PyThreadState_UncheckedGet()`` "
