#: ../NEWS:12913
msgid ""
":gh:`111956`: Add internal-only one-time initialization API: ``_PyOnceFlag``"
" and ``_PyOnceFlag_CallOnce``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111956`: 添加仅供内部使用的一次性初始化API：``_PyOnceFlag``和``_PyOnceFlag_CallOnce``。"

#: ../NEWS:12916
msgid ""
":gh:`111262`: Add :c:func:`PyDict_Pop` and :c:func:`PyDict_PopString` "
"functions: remove a key from a dictionary and optionally return the removed "
"value. This is similar to :meth:`dict.pop`, but without the default value "
"and not raising :exc:`KeyError` if the key missing. Patch by Stefan Behnel "
"and Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111262`: 添加 :c:func:`PyDict_Pop` 和 :c:func:`PyDict_PopString` "
"函数：从字典中移除一个键并可选地返回被移除的值。这类似于 :meth:`dict.pop`，但没有默认值，如果键不存在也不会引发 "
":exc:`KeyError`。由Stefan Behnel和Victor Stinner提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12922
msgid ""
":gh:`111863`: Rename ``Py_NOGIL`` to ``Py_GIL_DISABLED``. Patch by Hugo van "
"Kemenade."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111863`: 将 ``Py_NOGIL`` 重命名为 ``Py_GIL_DISABLED``。由Hugo van "
"Kemenade提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12925
msgid ""
":gh:`111138`: Add :c:func:`PyList_Extend` and :c:func:`PyList_Clear` "
"functions: similar to Python ``list.extend()`` and ``list.clear()`` methods."
" Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111138`: 添加 :c:func:`PyList_Extend` 和 :c:func:`PyList_Clear` "
"函数：类似于Python的``list.extend()`` 和 ``list.clear()`` 方法。由Victor Stinner提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12929
msgid ""
":gh:`108765`: On Windows, ``Python.h`` no longer includes the ``<stddef.h>``"
" standard header file. If needed, it should now be included explicitly. "
"Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`108765`: 在Windows上，``Python.h``不再包含 ``<stddef.h>`` "
"标准头文件。如果需要，现在应该显式包含它。由Victor Stinner提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12933
msgid ""
":gh:`111569`: Implement \"Python Critical Sections\" from :pep:`703`. These "
"are macros to help replace the GIL with per-object locks in the ``--disable-"
"gil`` build of CPython. The macros are no-ops in the default build."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111569`: 实现来自 :pep:`703` 的\"Python临界区\"。这些宏帮助在CPython的 ``--disable-"
"gil``构建中用每对象锁替换GIL。在默认构建中，这些宏是无操作的。"

#: ../NEWS:12938
msgid ""
":gh:`111506`: In the limited C API version 3.13, :c:func:`Py_SET_REFCNT` "
"function is now implemented as an opaque function call. Patch by Victor "
"Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111506`: 在有限C API版本3.13中，:c:func:`Py_SET_REFCNT` "
"函数现在被实现为一个不透明的函数调用。由Victor Stinner提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12942
msgid ":gh:`108082`: Add :c:func:`PyErr_FormatUnraisable` function."
msgstr ":gh:`108082`: 添加 :c:func:`PyErr_FormatUnraisable` 函数。"

#: ../NEWS:12944
msgid ""
":gh:`110964`: Move the undocumented private _PyArg functions and "
"_PyArg_Parser structure to internal C API (``pycore_modsupport.h``). Patch "
"by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110964`: 将未记录的私有 _PyArg 函数和 _PyArg_Parser 结构移至内部 C "
"API（``pycore_modsupport.h``）。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12948
msgid ""
":gh:`110815`: Support non-ASCII keyword names in "
":c:func:`PyArg_ParseTupleAndKeywords`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110815`: 在 :c:func:`PyArg_ParseTupleAndKeywords` 中支持非 ASCII 关键字名称。"

#: ../NEWS:12951
msgid ""
":gh:`109587`: Introduced :c:func:`PyUnstable_PerfTrampoline_CompileCode`, "
":c:func:`PyUnstable_PerfTrampoline_SetPersistAfterFork` and "
":c:func:`PyUnstable_CopyPerfMapFile`. These functions allow extension "
"modules to initialize trampolines eagerly, after the application is \"warmed"
" up\". This makes it possible to have perf-trampolines running in an always-"
"enabled fashion."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109587`: 引入了 "
":c:func:`PyUnstable_PerfTrampoline_CompileCode`、:c:func:`PyUnstable_PerfTrampoline_SetPersistAfterFork`"
" 和 "
":c:func:`PyUnstable_CopyPerfMapFile`。这些函数允许扩展模块在应用程序“预热”后急切地初始化蹦床。这使得性能蹦床可以以始终启用的方式运行。"

#: ../NEWS:12958
msgid ""
":gh:`85283`: Add the :c:func:`PySys_Audit` function to the limited C API. "
"Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`85283`: 将 :c:func:`PySys_Audit` 函数添加到有限的 C API 中。补丁由 Victor Stinner 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:12961
msgid ""
":gh:`85283`: Add :c:func:`PyMem_RawMalloc`, :c:func:`PyMem_RawCalloc`, "
":c:func:`PyMem_RawRealloc` and :c:func:`PyMem_RawFree` to the limited C API."
" Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`85283`: 将 "
":c:func:`PyMem_RawMalloc`、:c:func:`PyMem_RawCalloc`、:c:func:`PyMem_RawRealloc`"
" 和 :c:func:`PyMem_RawFree` 添加到有限的 C API 中。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12965
msgid ""
":gh:`106672`: Functions :c:func:`PyDict_GetItem`, "
":c:func:`PyDict_GetItemString`, :c:func:`PyMapping_HasKey`, "
":c:func:`PyMapping_HasKeyString`, :c:func:`PyObject_HasAttr`, "
":c:func:`PyObject_HasAttrString`, and :c:func:`PySys_GetObject`, which clear"
" all errors occurred during calling the function, report now them using "
":func:`sys.unraisablehook`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106672`: 函数 "
":c:func:`PyDict_GetItem`、:c:func:`PyDict_GetItemString`、:c:func:`PyMapping_HasKey`、:c:func:`PyMapping_HasKeyString`、:c:func:`PyObject_HasAttr`、:c:func:`PyObject_HasAttrString`"
" 和 :c:func:`PySys_GetObject`，在调用函数期间清除所有发生的错误，现在使用 "
":func:`sys.unraisablehook` 报告它们。"

#: ../NEWS:12972
msgid ""
":gh:`67565`: Remove redundant C-contiguity check in :file:`getargs.c`, "
":mod:`binascii`, :mod:`ssl` and Argument Clinic. Patched by Stefan Krah and "
"Furkan Onder"
msgstr ""
":gh:`67565`: 移除 :file:`getargs.c`、:mod:`binascii`、:mod:`ssl` 和 Argument "
"Clinic 中多余的 C-连续性检查。由 Stefan Krah 和 Furkan Onder 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12978
msgid "Python 3.13.0 alpha 1"
msgstr "Python 3.13.0 alpha 1"

#: ../NEWS:12980
msgid "*Release date: 2023-10-13*"
msgstr "*发布日期：2023-10-13*"

#: ../NEWS:12985
msgid ""
":gh:`108310`: Fixed an issue where instances of :class:`ssl.SSLSocket` were "
"vulnerable to a bypass of the TLS handshake and included protections (like "
"certificate verification) and treating sent unencrypted data as if it were "
"post-handshake TLS encrypted data.  Security issue reported as "
":cve:`2023-40217` by Aapo Oksman. Patch by Gregory P. Smith."
msgstr ""
":gh:`108310`: 修复了一个问题，其中 :class:`ssl.SSLSocket` 的实例容易绕过 TLS "
"握手和包括的保护措施（如证书验证），并将发送的未加密数据视为握手后的 TLS 加密数据。安全问题的报告为 :cve:`2023-40217`，由 "
"Aapo Oksman 报告。由 Gregory P. Smith 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12991
msgid ""
":gh:`107774`: PEP 669 specifies that ``sys.monitoring.register_callback`` "
"will generate an audit event. Pre-releases of Python 3.12 did not generate "
"the audit event. This is now fixed."
msgstr ""
":gh:`107774`: PEP 669 指定 ``sys.monitoring.register_callback`` 将生成审计事件。Python"
" 3.12 的预发布版本未生成审计事件。现在已修复。"

#: ../NEWS:12995
msgid ""
":gh:`102988`: Reverted the :mod:`email.utils` security improvement change "
"released in 3.12beta4 that unintentionally caused "
":mod:`email.utils.getaddresses` to fail to parse email addresses with a "
"comma in the quoted name field. See :gh:`106669`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`102988`: 撤销了在3.12beta4版本中发布的 :mod:`email.utils` 安全改进变更，该变更无意中导致 "
":mod:`email.utils.getaddresses` 无法解析引用名字字段中包含逗号的电子邮件地址。参见 :gh:`106669`。"

#: ../NEWS:13000
msgid ""
":gh:`99108`: Refresh our new HACL* built-in :mod:`hashlib` code from "
"upstream. Built-in SHA2 should be faster and an issue with SHA3 on 32-bit "
"platforms is fixed."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99108`: 从上游刷新我们新的HACL*内置 :mod:`hashlib` "
"代码。内置的SHA2应该会更快，并且修复了32位平台上SHA3的一个问题。"

#: ../NEWS:13004
msgid ""
":gh:`102509`: Start initializing ``ob_digit`` during creation of "
":c:type:`PyLongObject` objects. Patch by Illia Volochii."
msgstr ""
":gh:`102509`: 在创建 :c:type:`PyLongObject` 对象时开始初始化 ``ob_digit``。由Illia "
"Volochii提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13010
msgid ""
":gh:`110782`: Fix crash when :class:`typing.TypeVar` is constructed with a "
"keyword argument. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110782`: 修复了当 :class:`typing.TypeVar` 用关键字参数构造时发生的崩溃。由Jelle "
"Zijlstra提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13013
msgid ""
":gh:`110752`: Reset ``ceval.eval_breaker`` in :func:`interpreter_clear`"
msgstr ":gh:`110752`: 在 :func:`interpreter_clear` 中重置 ``ceval.eval_breaker``"

#: ../NEWS:13015
msgid ""
":gh:`110721`: Use the :mod:`traceback` implementation for the default "
":c:func:`PyErr_Display` functionality. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`110721`: 使用 :mod:`traceback` 实现作为默认的 :c:func:`PyErr_Display` 功能。由Pablo "
"Galindo提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:13018
msgid ""
":gh:`110696`: Fix incorrect error message for invalid argument unpacking. "
"Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":gh:`110696`: 修复了无效参数解包的错误消息。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:13021
msgid ""
":gh:`104169`: Split the tokenizer into two separate directories: - One part "
"includes the actual lexeme producing logic and lives in ``Parser/lexer``. - "
"The second part wraps the lexer according to the different tokenization "
"modes   we have (string, utf-8, file, interactive, readline) and lives in "
"``Parser/tokenizer``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`104169`: 将tokenizer分成两个独立的目录：- 一部分包含实际的词素生成逻辑，位于``Parser/lexer``。- "
"第二部分根据我们拥有的不同tokenization模式（字符串，utf-8，文件，交互式，readline）包装lexer，位于 "
"``Parser/tokenizer``。"

#: ../NEWS:13027
msgid ""
":gh:`110688`: Remove undocumented ``test_c_api`` method from :class:`set`, "
"which was only defined for testing purposes under ``Py_DEBUG``. Now we have "
"proper CAPI tests."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110688`: 从 :class:`set` 中移除未文档化的 ``test_c_api`` 方法，该方法仅在 ``Py_DEBUG`` "
"下定义用于测试目的。现在我们有了适当的CAPI测试。"

#: ../NEWS:13031
msgid ""
":gh:`104584`: Fix a reference leak when running with :envvar:`PYTHONUOPS` or"
" :option:`-X uops <-X>` enabled."
msgstr ""
":gh:`104584`: 修复了在启用 :envvar:`PYTHONUOPS` 或 :option:`-X uops <-X>` "
"时运行时的引用泄漏。"

#: ../NEWS:13034
msgid ":gh:`110514`: Add ``PY_THROW`` to :func:`sys.setprofile` events"
msgstr ":gh:`110514`: 向 :func:`sys.setprofile` 事件添加 ``PY_THROW``"

#: ../NEWS:13036
msgid ""
":gh:`110489`: Optimise :func:`math.ceil` when the input is exactly a float, "
"resulting in about a 10% improvement."
msgstr ":gh:`110489`: 当输入恰好是一个浮点数时优化 :func:`math.ceil`，大约有10%的性能提升。"

#: ../NEWS:13039
msgid ""
":gh:`110455`: Guard ``assert(tstate->thread_id > 0)`` with ``#ifndef "
"HAVE_PTHREAD_STUBS``. This allows for for pydebug builds to work under WASI "
"which (currently) lacks thread support."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110455`: 用 ``#ifndef HAVE_PTHREAD_STUBS`` 保护 ``assert(tstate->thread_id"
" > 0)``。这允许pydebug构建在（目前）缺乏线程支持的WASI下工作。"

#: ../NEWS:13043
msgid ""
":gh:`110309`: Remove unnecessary empty constant nodes in the ast of f-string"
" specs."
msgstr ":gh:`110309`: 移除f-string规格的ast中不必要的空常量节点。"

#: ../NEWS:13046
msgid ""
":gh:`110259`: Correctly identify the format spec in f-strings (with single "
"or triple quotes) that have multiple lines in the expression part and "
"include a formatting spec. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`110259`: 正确识别f-字符串中的格式说明符（使用单引号或三引号），这些f-字符串在表达式部分有多行，并包含格式说明。由Pablo "
"Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13050
msgid ""
":gh:`110237`: Fix missing error checks for calls to ``PyList_Append`` in "
"``_PyEval_MatchClass``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110237`: 修复在 ``_PyEval_MatchClass`` 中对 ``PyList_Append`` 调用缺少错误检查的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:13053
msgid ""
":gh:`110164`: regrtest: If the ``SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH`` environment variable is"
" defined, regrtest now disables tests randomization. Patch by Victor "
"Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110164`: regrtest: 如果定义了 ``SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH`` "
"环境变量，regrtest现在会禁用测试随机化。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13057
msgid ""
":gh:`109889`: Fix the compiler's redundant NOP detection algorithm to skip "
"over NOPs with no line number when looking for the next instruction's "
"lineno."
msgstr ":gh:`109889`: 修复编译器的冗余NOP检测算法，使其在查找下一个指令的行号时跳过没有行号的NOP。"

#: ../NEWS:13061
msgid ""
":gh:`109853`: ``sys.path[0]`` is now set correctly for subinterpreters."
msgstr ":gh:`109853`: ``sys.path[0]`` 现在为子解释器正确设置。"

#: ../NEWS:13063
msgid ""
":gh:`109923`: Set line number on the ``POP_TOP`` that follows a "
"``RETURN_GENERATOR``."
msgstr ":gh:`109923`: 在 ``RETURN_GENERATOR`` 之后的 ``POP_TOP`` 上设置行号。"

#: ../NEWS:13066
msgid ""
":gh:`105716`: Subinterpreters now correctly handle the case where they have "
"threads running in the background.  Before, such threads would interfere "
"with cleaning up and destroying them, as well as prevent running another "
"script."
msgstr ":gh:`105716`: 子解释器现在能正确处理后台有线程运行的情况。在此之前，这些线程会干扰清理和销毁操作，并阻止运行另一个脚本。"

#: ../NEWS:13071
msgid ""
":gh:`109369`: The internal eval_breaker and supporting flags, plus the "
"monitoring version have been merged into a single atomic integer to speed up"
" checks."
msgstr ":gh:`109369`: 内部的eval_breaker和支持标志，以及监控版本已合并为一个原子整数，以加快检查速度。"

#: ../NEWS:13075
msgid ""
":gh:`109823`: Fix bug where compiler does not adjust labels when removing an"
" empty basic block which is a jump target."
msgstr ":gh:`109823`: 修复编译器在移除作为跳转目标的空基本块时不调整标签的bug。"

#: ../NEWS:13078
msgid ""
":gh:`109793`: The main thread no longer exits prematurely when a "
"subinterpreter is cleaned up during runtime finalization.  The bug was a "
"problem particularly because, when triggered, the Python process would "
"always return with a 0 exitcode, even if it failed."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109793`: "
"主线程不再在运行时终结期间清理子解释器时过早退出。这个bug尤其成问题，因为一旦触发，Python进程总是会以0退出码返回，即使它失败了。"

#: ../NEWS:13083
msgid ""
":gh:`109719`: Fix missing jump target labels when compiler reorders "
"cold/warm blocks."
msgstr ":gh:`109719`: 修复编译器在重新排序冷/热块时缺少跳转目标标签的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:13086
msgid ""
":gh:`109595`: Add :option:`-X cpu_count <-X>`  command line option to "
"override return results of :func:`os.cpu_count` and "
":func:`os.process_cpu_count`. This option is useful for users who need to "
"limit CPU resources of a container system without having to modify the "
"container (application code). Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109595`: 添加 :option:`-X cpu_count <-X>` 命令行选项，以覆盖 :func:`os.cpu_count` "
"和 :func:`os.process_cpu_count` "
"的返回结果。这个选项对于需要限制容器系统CPU资源但不需要修改容器（应用程序代码）的用户非常有用。由Donghee Na提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13092
msgid ""
":gh:`109627`: Fix bug where the compiler does not assign a new jump target "
"label to a duplicated small exit block."
msgstr ":gh:`109627`: 修复编译器未为重复的小退出块分配新跳转目标标签的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:13095
msgid ""
":gh:`109596`: Fix some tokens in the grammar that were incorrectly marked as"
" soft keywords. Also fix some repeated rule names and ensure that repeated "
"rules are not allowed. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`109596`: 修复语法中一些被错误标记为软关键字的令牌。同时修复一些重复的规则名称，并确保不允许重复规则。由Pablo "
"Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13099
msgid ""
":gh:`109496`: On a Python built in debug mode, :c:func:`Py_DECREF()` now "
"calls ``_Py_NegativeRefcount()`` if the object is a dangling pointer to "
"deallocated memory: memory filled with ``0xDD`` \"dead byte\" by the debug "
"hook on memory allocators. The fix is to check the reference count *before* "
"checking for ``_Py_IsImmortal()``. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109496`: 在Python的调试模式下，:c:func:`Py_DECREF()` "
"现在如果对象是指向已释放内存的悬挂指针（内存由内存分配器的调试钩子填充为 `0xDD` \"dead byte\"），则会调用 "
"``_Py_NegativeRefcount()``。 修复方法是在检查  ``_Py_IsImmortal()`` *之前* 检查引用计数。 由 "
"Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13105
msgid ""
":gh:`107265`: Deopt opcodes hidden by the executor when base opcode is "
"needed"
msgstr ":gh:`107265`: 当需要基础操作码时，由执行器隐藏的Deopt操作码"

#: ../NEWS:13107
msgid ""
":gh:`109371`: Deopted instructions correctly for tool initialization and "
"modified the incorrect assertion in instrumentation, when a previous tool "
"already sets INSTRUCTION events"
msgstr ""
":gh:`109371`: 正确地为工具初始化Deopt指令，并在仪表化中修改了错误的断言，当之前的工具已经设置了INSTRUCTION事件时。"

#: ../NEWS:13111
msgid ""
":gh:`105658`: Fix bug where the line trace of an except block ending with a "
"conditional includes an excess event with the line of the conditional "
"expression."
msgstr ":gh:`105658`: 修复以条件表达式结尾的except块的行跟踪包含条件表达式行的多余事件的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:13115
msgid ""
":gh:`109219`: Fix compiling type param scopes that use a name which is also "
"free in an inner scope."
msgstr ":gh:`109219`: 修复编译类型参数作用域时使用在内部作用域中也是自由名称的名称的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:13118
msgid ""
":gh:`109351`: Fix crash when compiling an invalid AST involving a named "
"(walrus) expression."
msgstr ":gh:`109351`: 修复编译涉及命名（海象）表达式的无效AST时崩溃的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:13121
msgid ""
":gh:`109341`: Fix crash when compiling an invalid AST involving a "
":class:`ast.TypeAlias`."
msgstr ":gh:`109341`: 修复编译涉及 :class:`ast.TypeAlias` 的无效AST时崩溃的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:13124
msgid ""
":gh:`109195`: Fix source location for the ``LOAD_*`` instruction preceding a"
" ``LOAD_SUPER_ATTR`` to load the ``super`` global (or shadowing variable) so"
" that it encompasses only the name ``super`` and not the following "
"parentheses."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109195`: 修复加载 ``super`` 全局（或遮蔽变量）的 ``LOAD_*`` 指令前面的源位置，使其仅包含名称 "
"``super`` 而不包括后面的括号。"

#: ../NEWS:13129
msgid ""
":gh:`109256`: Opcode IDs for specialized opcodes are allocated in their own "
"range to improve stability of the IDs for the 'real' opcodes."
msgstr ":gh:`109256`: 专用操作码的操作码ID在其自己的范围内分配，以提高'真实'操作码ID的稳定性。"

#: ../NEWS:13132
msgid ":gh:`109216`: Fix possible memory leak in :opcode:`BUILD_MAP`."
msgstr ":gh:`109216`: 修复 :opcode:`BUILD_MAP` 中可能的内存泄漏。"

#: ../NEWS:13134
msgid ""
":gh:`109207`: Fix a SystemError in ``__repr__`` of symtable entry object."
msgstr ":gh:`109207`: 修复符号表条目对象的 ``__repr__`` 中的SystemError。"

#: ../NEWS:13136
msgid ""
":gh:`109179`: Fix bug where the C traceback display drops notes from "
":exc:`SyntaxError`."
msgstr ":gh:`109179`: 修复C回溯显示中从 :exc:`SyntaxError` 中删除注释的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:13139
msgid ""
":gh:`109118`: Disallow nested scopes (lambdas, generator expressions, and "
"comprehensions) within PEP 695 annotation scopes that are nested within "
"classes."
msgstr ":gh:`109118`: 禁止在嵌套于类中的PEP 695注解作用域内使用嵌套作用域（lambda、生成器表达式和推导式）。"

#: ../NEWS:13143
msgid ""
":gh:`109156`: Add tests for de-instrumenting instructions while keeping the "
"instrumentation for lines"
msgstr ":gh:`109156`: 添加测试，用于在保留行的检测的同时去除指令的检测。"

#: ../NEWS:13146
msgid ""
":gh:`109114`: Relax the detection of the error message for invalid lambdas "
"inside f-strings to not search for arbitrary replacement fields to avoid "
"false positives. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`109114`: 放宽对f-字符串内无效lambda的错误消息检测，不再搜索任意替换字段以避免误报。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13150
msgid ""
":gh:`105848`: Add a new :opcode:`CALL_KW` opcode, used for calls containing "
"keyword arguments. Also, fix a possible crash when jumping over method calls"
" in a debugger."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105848`: 添加一个新的 :opcode:`CALL_KW` "
"操作码，用于包含关键字参数的调用。同时，修复在调试器中跳过方法调用时可能发生的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:13154
msgid ""
":gh:`109052`: Use the base opcode when comparing code objects to avoid "
"interference from instrumentation"
msgstr ":gh:`109052`: 在比较代码对象时使用基础操作码，以避免检测的干扰。"

#: ../NEWS:13157
msgid ""
":gh:`109118`: Fix interpreter crash when a NameError is raised inside the "
"type parameters of a generic class."
msgstr ":gh:`109118`: 修复当在泛型类的类型参数中引发NameError时解释器崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:13160
msgid ""
":gh:`88943`: Improve syntax error for non-ASCII character that follows a "
"numerical literal. It now points on the invalid non-ASCII character, not on "
"the valid numerical literal."
msgstr ":gh:`88943`: 改进跟随数字文字的非ASCII字符的语法错误。现在它指向无效的非ASCII字符，而不是有效的数字文字。"

#: ../NEWS:13164
msgid ""
":gh:`108976`: Fix crash that occurs after de-instrumenting a code object in "
"a monitoring callback."
msgstr ":gh:`108976`: 修复在监控回调中去除代码对象的检测后发生的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:13167
msgid ""
":gh:`108732`: Make iteration variables of module- and class-scoped "
"comprehensions visible to pdb and other tools that use ``frame.f_locals`` "
"again."
msgstr ":gh:`108732`: 使模块和类作用域的推导式的迭代变量再次对使用 ``frame.f_locals`` 的pdb和其他工具可见。"

#: ../NEWS:13171
msgid ""
":gh:`108959`: Fix caret placement for error locations for subscript and "
"binary operations that involve non-semantic parentheses and spaces. Patch by"
" Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":gh:`108959`: 修复涉及非语义括号和空格的下标和二元操作的错误位置的光标放置。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13175
msgid ""
":gh:`104584`: Fix a crash when running with :envvar:`PYTHONUOPS` or "
":option:`-X uops <-X>` enabled and an error occurs during optimization."
msgstr ""
":gh:`104584`: 修复在启用 :envvar:`PYTHONUOPS` 或 :option:`-X uops <-X>` "
"且优化过程中发生错误时的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:13178
msgid ""
":gh:`108727`: Define ``tp_dealloc`` for ``CounterOptimizer_Type``. This "
"fixes a segfault on deallocation."
msgstr ""
":gh:`108727`: 为 ``CounterOptimizer_Type`` 定义 ``tp_dealloc``。这修复了在释放时的段错误。"

#: ../NEWS:13181
msgid ""
":gh:`108520`: Fix :meth:`multiprocessing.synchronize.SemLock.__setstate__` "
"to properly initialize "
":attr:`multiprocessing.synchronize.SemLock._is_fork_ctx`. This fixes a "
"regression when passing a SemLock across nested processes."
msgstr ""
":gh:`108520`: 修复 :meth:`multiprocessing.synchronize.SemLock.__setstate__` "
"以正确初始化 "
":attr:`multiprocessing.synchronize.SemLock._is_fork_ctx`。这修复了在嵌套进程间传递SemLock时的回归问题。"

#: ../NEWS:13186
msgid ""
"Rename :attr:`multiprocessing.synchronize.SemLock.is_fork_ctx` to "
":attr:`multiprocessing.synchronize.SemLock._is_fork_ctx` to avoid exposing "
"it as public API."
msgstr ""
"将 :attr:`multiprocessing.synchronize.SemLock.is_fork_ctx` 重命名为 "
":attr:`multiprocessing.synchronize.SemLock._is_fork_ctx`，以避免将其暴露为公共API。"

#: ../NEWS:13190
msgid ""
":gh:`108654`: Restore locals shadowed by an inlined comprehension if the "
"comprehension raises an exception."
msgstr ":gh:`108654`：如果内联推导式引发异常，则恢复被内联推导式遮蔽的局部变量。"

#: ../NEWS:13193
msgid ""
":gh:`108488`: Change the initialization of inline cache entries so that the "
"cache entry for ``JUMP_BACKWARD`` is initialized to zero, instead of the "
"``adaptive_counter_warmup()`` value used for all other instructions. This "
"counter, unique among instructions, counts up from zero."
msgstr ""
":gh:`108488`：更改内联缓存条目的初始化方式，使得 ``JUMP_BACKWARD`` 的缓存条目初始化为零，而不是用于所有其他指令的 "
"``adaptive_counter_warmup()`` 值。这个计数器在指令中是唯一的，从零开始计数。"

#: ../NEWS:13198
msgid ""
":gh:`108716`: Turn off deep-freezing of code objects. Modules are still "
"frozen, so that a file system search is not needed for common modules."
msgstr ":gh:`108716`：关闭代码对象的深度冻结。模块仍然被冻结，因此不需要对常见模块进行文件系统搜索。"

#: ../NEWS:13201
msgid ""
":gh:`108614`: Add RESUME_CHECK instruction, to avoid having to handle "
"instrumentation, signals, and contexts switches in the tier 2 execution "
"engine."
msgstr ":gh:`108614`：添加 RESUME_CHECK 指令，以避免在第2层执行引擎中处理插装、信号和上下文切换。"

#: ../NEWS:13205
msgid ""
":gh:`108487`: Move an assert that would cause a spurious crash in a devious "
"case that should only trigger deoptimization."
msgstr ":gh:`108487`：移动一个断言，该断言在一个应仅触发去优化的狡猾情况下会导致虚假崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:13208
msgid ""
":gh:`106176`: Use a ``WeakValueDictionary`` to track the lists containing "
"the modules each thread is currently importing. This helps avoid a reference"
" leak from keeping the list around longer than necessary. Weakrefs are used "
"as GC can't interrupt the cleanup."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106176`：使用 ``WeakValueDictionary`` "
"来跟踪包含每个线程当前正在导入的模块的列表。这有助于避免因为列表保留时间过长而导致引用泄漏。使用弱引用是因为垃圾回收无法中断清理过程。"

#: ../NEWS:13213
msgid ""
":gh:`105481`: The regen-opcode build stage was removed and its work is now "
"done in regen-cases."
msgstr ":gh:`105481`：移除了regen-opcode构建阶段，其工作现在在regen-cases中完成。"

#: ../NEWS:13216
msgid ""
":gh:`107901`: Fix missing line number on :opcode:`JUMP_BACKWARD` at the end "
"of a for loop."
msgstr ":gh:`107901`：修复在for循环末尾的 :opcode:`JUMP_BACKWARD` 缺少行号的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:13219
msgid ""
":gh:`108113`: The :func:`compile` built-in can now accept a new flag, "
"``ast.PyCF_OPTIMIZED_AST``, which is similar to ``ast.PyCF_ONLY_AST`` except"
" that the returned ``AST`` is optimized according to the value of the "
"``optimize`` argument."
msgstr ""
":gh:`108113`：内置的 :func:`compile` 现在可以接受一个新标志 ``ast.PyCF_OPTIMIZED_AST``，它与 "
"``ast.PyCF_ONLY_AST`` 类似，但返回的 ``AST`` 会根据 ``optimize`` 参数的值进行优化。"

#: ../NEWS:13224
msgid ""
":func:`ast.parse` now accepts an optional argument ``optimize`` which is "
"passed on to the :func:`compile` built-in. This makes it possible to obtain "
"an optimized ``AST``."
msgstr ""
":func:`ast.parse` 现在接受一个可选参数 ``optimize``，该参数会传递给内置的 "
":func:`compile`。这使得获取优化的 ``AST`` 成为可能。"

#: ../NEWS:13228
msgid ""
":gh:`107971`: Opcode IDs are generated from bytecodes.c instead of being "
"hard coded in opcode.py."
msgstr ":gh:`107971`：操作码ID现在从bytecodes.c生成，而不是在opcode.py中硬编码。"

#: ../NEWS:13231
msgid ""
":gh:`107944`: Improve error message for function calls with bad keyword "
"arguments. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":gh:`107944`: 改进带有错误关键字参数的函数调用的错误消息。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13234
msgid ""
":gh:`108390`: Raise an exception when setting a non-local event (``RAISE``, "
"``EXCEPTION_HANDLED``, etc.) in ``sys.monitoring.set_local_events``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`108390`: "
"在`sys.monitoring.set_local_events`中设置非本地事件（`RAISE`、`EXCEPTION_HANDLED`等）时引发异常。"

#: ../NEWS:13237
msgid "Fixes crash when tracing in recursive calls to Python classes."
msgstr "修复在递归调用Python类时追踪导致的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:13239
msgid ""
":gh:`108035`: Remove the ``_PyCFrame`` struct, moving the pointer to the "
"current interpreter frame back to the threadstate, as it was for 3.10 and "
"earlier. The ``_PyCFrame`` existed as a performance optimization for "
"tracing. Since PEP 669 has been implemented, this optimization no longer "
"applies."
msgstr ""
":gh:`108035`: "
"移除`_PyCFrame`结构体，将指向当前解释器帧的指针移回线程状态，如同3.10及更早版本。`_PyCFrame`作为追踪的性能优化存在。由于PEP"
" 669已实现，此优化不再适用。"

#: ../NEWS:13245
msgid ""
":gh:`91051`: Fix abort / segfault when using all eight type watcher slots, "
"on platforms where ``char`` is signed by default."
msgstr ":gh:`91051`: 在默认情况下`char`为有符号的平台中，修复使用全部八个类型观察器槽时的中止/段错误。"

#: ../NEWS:13248
msgid ""
":gh:`106581`: Fix possible assertion failures and missing instrumentation "
"events when :envvar:`PYTHONUOPS` or :option:`-X uops <-X>` is enabled."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106581`: 当启用 :envvar:`PYTHONUOPS` 或 :option:`-X uops <-X>` "
"时，修复可能的断言失败和缺失的仪表事件。"

#: ../NEWS:13251
msgid ""
":gh:`107526`: Revert converting ``vars``, ``dir``, ``next``, ``getattr``, "
"and ``iter`` to argument clinic."
msgstr ":gh:`107526`: 将`vars`、`dir`、`next`、`getattr`和`iter`恢复为不使用参数诊所。"

#: ../NEWS:13254
msgid ""
":gh:`84805`: Autogenerate signature for :c:macro:`METH_NOARGS` and "
":c:macro:`METH_O` extension functions."
msgstr ":gh:`84805`: 为 :c:macro:`METH_NOARGS` 和 :c:macro:`METH_O` 扩展函数自动生成签名。"

#: ../NEWS:13257
msgid ""
":gh:`107758`: Make the ``dump_stack()`` routine used by the ``lltrace`` "
"feature (low-level interpreter debugging) robust against recursion by "
"ensuring that it never calls a ``__repr__`` method implemented in Python. "
"Also make the similar output for Tier-2 uops appear on ``stdout`` (instead "
"of ``stderr``), to match the ``lltrace`` code in ceval.c."
msgstr ""
":gh:`107758`: "
"通过确保`dump_stack()`例程从不调用Python实现的`__repr__`方法，使`lltrace`特性（低级解释器调试）使用的`dump_stack()`例程对递归具有鲁棒性。同时，为了使Tier-2"
" uops的类似输出与ceval.c中的`lltrace`代码匹配，使其出现在`stdout`上（而非`stderr`）。"

#: ../NEWS:13263
msgid ""
":gh:`107659`: Add docstrings for :func:`ctypes.pointer` and "
":func:`ctypes.POINTER`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`107659`: 为 :func:`ctypes.pointer` 和 :func:`ctypes.POINTER` 添加文档字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:13266
msgid ""
":gh:`105848`: Modify the bytecode so that the actual callable for a "
":opcode:`CALL` is at a consistent position on the stack (regardless of "
"whether or not bound-method-calling optimizations are active)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105848`: 修改字节码，使得 :opcode:`CALL` 的实际可调用对象在堆栈上的位置一致（无论是否激活绑定方法调用优化）。"

#: ../NEWS:13270
msgid ":gh:`107674`: Fixed performance regression in ``sys.settrace``."
msgstr ":gh:`107674`: 修复`sys.settrace`中的性能回归。"

#: ../NEWS:13272
msgid ""
":gh:`107724`: In pre-release versions of 3.12, up to rc1, the sys.monitoring"
" callback function for the ``PY_THROW`` event was missing the third, "
"exception argument. That is now fixed."
msgstr ""
":gh:`107724`: "
"在3.12的预发布版本中，直到rc1，`sys.monitoring`回调函数对于`PY_THROW`事件缺少第三个异常参数。现已修复。"

#: ../NEWS:13276
msgid ""
":gh:`84436`: Skip reference count modifications for many known immortal "
"objects."
msgstr ":gh:`84436`: 跳过对许多已知不朽对象的引用计数修改。"

#: ../NEWS:13279
msgid ""
":gh:`107596`: Specialize subscripting :class:`str` objects by :class:`int` "
"indexes."
msgstr ":gh:`107596`: 通过 :class:`int` 索引专门化 :class:`str` 对象的下标操作。"

#: ../NEWS:13282
msgid ""
":gh:`107080`: Trace refs builds (``--with-trace-refs``) were crashing when "
"used with isolated subinterpreters.  The problematic global state has been "
"isolated to each interpreter.  Other fixing the crashes, this change does "
"not affect users."
msgstr ""
":gh:`107080`: 跟踪引用构建（``--with-trace-"
"refs``）在与隔离的子解释器一起使用时崩溃。问题全局状态已被隔离到每个解释器。除了修复崩溃，此更改不影响用户。"

#: ../NEWS:13287
msgid ""
":gh:`107557`: Generate the cases needed for the barebones tier 2 abstract "
"interpreter for optimization passes in CPython."
msgstr ":gh:`107557`: 为CPython中的优化通道生成裸机第2层抽象解释器所需的案例。"

#: ../NEWS:13290
msgid ":gh:`106608`: Make ``_PyUOpExecutorObject`` variable length."
msgstr ":gh:`106608`: 使 ``_PyUOpExecutorObject`` 可变长度。"

#: ../NEWS:13292
msgid ""
":gh:`100964`: Clear generators' exception state after ``return`` to break "
"reference cycles."
msgstr ":gh:`100964`: 在 ``return`` 后清除生成器的异常状态以打破引用循环。"

#: ../NEWS:13295
msgid ""
":gh:`107455`: Improve error messages when converting an incompatible type to"
" :class:`ctypes.c_char_p`, :class:`ctypes.c_wchar_p` and "
":class:`ctypes.c_void_p`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`107455`: 在将不兼容类型转换为 :class:`ctypes.c_char_p`、:class:`ctypes.c_wchar_p` "
"和 :class:`ctypes.c_void_p` 时改进错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:13299
msgid ""
":gh:`107263`: Increase C recursion limit for functions other than the main "
"interpreter from 800 to 1500. This should allow functions like "
"``list.__repr__`` and ``json.dumps`` to handle all the inputs that they "
"could prior to 3.12"
msgstr ""
":gh:`107263`: 将主解释器以外的函数的C递归限制从800增加到1500。这应该允许像 ``list.__repr__`` 和 "
"``json.dumps`` 这样的函数处理所有它们在3.12之前可以处理的输入。"

#: ../NEWS:13304
msgid ""
":gh:`104584`: Fix an issue which caused incorrect inline caches to be read "
"when running with :envvar:`PYTHONUOPS` or :option:`-X uops <-X>` enabled."
msgstr ""
":gh:`104584`: 修复了一个问题，该问题在启用 :envvar:`PYTHONUOPS` 或 :option:`-X uops <-X>` "
"时导致读取了不正确的内联缓存。"

#: ../NEWS:13307
msgid ""
":gh:`104432`: Fix potential unaligned memory access on C APIs involving "
"returned sequences of ``char *`` pointers within the :mod:`grp` and "
":mod:`socket` modules. These were revealed using a ``-fsaniziter=alignment``"
" build on ARM macOS. Patch by Christopher Chavez."
msgstr ""
":gh:`104432`: 修复了在 :mod:`grp` 和 :mod:`socket` 模块中涉及返回 ``char *`` 指针序列的C "
"API中潜在的非对齐内存访问。这些是在ARM macOS上使用 ``-fsaniziter=alignment`` "
"构建时发现的。由Christopher Chavez提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13312
msgid ""
":gh:`106078`: Isolate :mod:`!_decimal` (apply :pep:`687`). Patch by Charlie "
"Zhao."
msgstr ":gh:`106078`: 隔离 :mod:`!_decimal` (应用 :pep:`687`) 。由Charlie Zhao提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13315
msgid ""
":gh:`106898`: Add the exception as the third argument to ``PY_UNIND`` "
"callbacks in ``sys.monitoring``. This makes the ``PY_UNWIND`` callback "
"consistent with the other exception handling callbacks."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106898`: 将异常作为第三个参数添加到 ``sys.monitoring`` 中的 ``PY_UNIND`` 回调。这使得 "
"``PY_UNWIND`` 回调与其他异常处理回调一致。"

#: ../NEWS:13319
msgid ""
":gh:`106895`: Raise a ``ValueError`` when a monitoring callback function "
"returns ``DISABLE`` for events that cannot be disabled locally."
msgstr ":gh:`106895`: 当监控回调函数为不能本地禁用的事件返回 ``DISABLE`` 时，引发 ``ValueError``。"

#: ../NEWS:13322
msgid ""
":gh:`106897`: Add a ``RERAISE`` event to ``sys.monitoring``, which occurs "
"when an exception is reraise, either explicitly by a plain ``raise`` "
"statement, or implicitly in an ``except`` or ``finally`` block."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106897`: 向 ``sys.monitoring`` 添加一个 ``RERAISE`` "
"事件，该事件在异常被重新抛出时发生，无论是通过简单的 ``raise``语句显式抛出，还是在 ``except`` 或 ``finally`` "
"块中隐式抛出。"

#: ../NEWS:13326
msgid ""
":gh:`77377`: Ensure that multiprocessing synchronization objects created in "
"a fork context are not sent to a different process created in a spawn "
"context. This changes a segfault into an actionable RuntimeError in the "
"parent process."
msgstr ""
":gh:`77377`: "
"确保在fork上下文中创建的多进程同步对象不会被发送到在spawn上下文中创建的不同进程。这将在父进程中将段错误更改为可操作的RuntimeError。"

#: ../NEWS:13331
msgid ""
":gh:`106931`: Statically allocated string objects are now interned globally "
"instead of per-interpreter.  This fixes a situation where such a string "
"would only be interned in a single interpreter. Normal string objects are "
"unaffected."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106931`: "
"静态分配的字符串对象现在全局内联，而不是每个解释器内联。这修复了此类字符串仅在单个解释器中内联的情况。普通字符串对象不受影响。"

#: ../NEWS:13336
msgid ":gh:`104621`: Unsupported modules now always fail to be imported."
msgstr ":gh:`104621`: 现在，不支持的模块总是无法导入。"

#: ../NEWS:13338
msgid ""
":gh:`107122`: Add :meth:`dbm.ndbm.ndbm.clear` to :mod:`dbm.ndbm`. Patch By "
"Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":gh:`107122`: 向 :mod:`dbm.ndbm` 添加 :meth:`dbm.ndbm.ndbm.clear`。由Donghee "
"Na提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13341
msgid ""
":gh:`107122`: Add :meth:`dbm.gnu.gdbm.clear` to :mod:`dbm.gnu`. Patch By "
"Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":gh:`107122`: 向 :mod:`dbm.gnu` 添加 :meth:`dbm.gnu.gdbm.clear`。由Donghee "
"Na提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13344
msgid ""
":gh:`107015`: The ASYNC and AWAIT tokens are removed from the Grammar, which"
" removes the possibility of making ``async`` and ``await`` soft keywords "
"when using ``feature_version<7`` in :func:`ast.parse`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`107015`: 从语法中删除了ASYNC和AWAIT令牌，这消除了在使用 :func:`ast.parse` "
"中的``feature_version<7``时使 ``async`` 和 ``await`` 成为软关键字的可能性。"

#: ../NEWS:13348
msgid ""
":gh:`106917`: Fix classmethod-style :func:`super` method calls (i.e., where "
"the second argument to :func:`super`, or the implied second argument drawn "
"from ``self/cls`` in the case of zero-arg super, is a type) when the target "
"of the call is not a classmethod."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106917`: 修复了类方法风格的 :func:`super` 方法调用（即，当 :func:`super` "
"的第二个参数，或者在零参数super情况下从 ``self/cls`` 中提取的隐含第二个参数是类型时），当调用的目标不是类方法时。"

#: ../NEWS:13353
msgid ""
":gh:`105699`: Python no longer crashes due an infrequent race when "
"initializing per-interpreter interned strings.  The crash would manifest "
"when the interpreter was finalized."
msgstr ":gh:`105699`: Python不再因为初始化每个解释器内联字符串时的不频繁竞争而崩溃。当解释器被最终化时，崩溃会显现。"

#: ../NEWS:13357
msgid ""
":gh:`105699`: Python no longer crashes due to an infrequent race in setting "
"``Py_FileSystemDefaultEncoding`` and ``Py_FileSystemDefaultEncodeErrors`` "
"(both deprecated), when simultaneously initializing two isolated "
"subinterpreters.  Now they are only set during runtime initialization."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105699`: Python不再因为设置 ``Py_FileSystemDefaultEncoding`` "
"和``Py_FileSystemDefaultEncodeErrors`` (两者都已弃用) "
"时的不频繁竞争而崩溃，当同时初始化两个隔离的子解释器时。现在它们仅在运行时初始化期间设置。"

#: ../NEWS:13362
msgid ""
":gh:`106908`: Fix various hangs, reference leaks, test failures, and "
"tracing/introspection bugs when running with :envvar:`PYTHONUOPS` or "
":option:`-X uops <-X>` enabled."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106908`: 修复了在启用 :envvar:`PYTHONUOPS` 或 :option:`-X uops <-X>` "
"时运行时的各种挂起、引用泄漏、测试失败和跟踪/内省错误。"

#: ../NEWS:13366
msgid ""
":gh:`106092`: Fix a segmentation fault caused by a use-after-free bug in "
"``frame_dealloc`` when the trashcan delays the deallocation of a "
"``PyFrameObject``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106092`: 修复了在垃圾回收延迟释放 ``PyFrameObject`` 时，由于 use-after-free 错误导致的段错误。"

#: ../NEWS:13370
msgid ""
":gh:`106485`: Reduce the number of materialized instances dictionaries by "
"dematerializing them when possible."
msgstr ":gh:`106485`: 通过尽可能地对实例字典进行去物质化，减少物质化实例字典的数量。"

#: ../NEWS:13373
msgid ""
":gh:`106719`: No longer suppress arbitrary errors in the ``__annotations__``"
" getter and setter in the type and module types."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106719`: 不再在类型和模块类型的 ``__annotations__`` getter 和 setter 中抑制任意错误。"

#: ../NEWS:13376
msgid ""
":gh:`106723`: Propagate ``frozen_modules`` to multiprocessing spawned "
"process interpreters."
msgstr ":gh:`106723`: 将 ``frozen_modules`` 传播到多进程生成的进程解释器中。"

#: ../NEWS:13379
msgid ":gh:`104909`: Split :opcode:`LOAD_ATTR_INSTANCE_VALUE` into micro-ops."
msgstr ":gh:`104909`: 将 :opcode:`LOAD_ATTR_INSTANCE_VALUE` 拆分为微操作。"

#: ../NEWS:13381
msgid ""
":gh:`104909`: Split :opcode:`LOAD_GLOBAL` specializations into micro-ops."
msgstr ":gh:`104909`: 将 :opcode:`LOAD_GLOBAL` 特化拆分为微操作。"

#: ../NEWS:13383
msgid ""
":gh:`106597`: A new debug structure of offsets has been added to the "
"``_PyRuntimeState`` that will help out-of-process debuggers and profilers to"
" obtain the offsets to relevant interpreter structures in a way that is "
"agnostic of how Python was compiled and that doesn't require copying the "
"headers. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`106597`: 在 ``_PyRuntimeState`` 中添加了一个新的调试结构偏移量，这将帮助进程外调试器和分析器以一种与 "
"Python 编译方式无关且不需要复制头文件的方式获取到相关解释器结构的偏移量。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13389
msgid ""
":gh:`106487`: Allow the *count* argument of :meth:`str.replace` to be a "
"keyword. Patch by Hugo van Kemenade."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106487`: 允许 :meth:`str.replace` 的 *count* 参数作为关键字。由 Hugo van Kemenade "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13392
msgid ""
":gh:`96844`: Improve error message of :meth:`list.remove`. Patch by Donghee "
"Na."
msgstr ":gh:`96844`: 改进 :meth:`list.remove` 的错误信息。由 Donghee Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13395
msgid ""
":gh:`81283`: Compiler now strips indents from docstrings. It reduces ``pyc``"
" file size 5% when the module is heavily documented. This change affects to "
"``__doc__`` so tools like doctest will be affected."
msgstr ""
":gh:`81283`: 编译器现在从文档字符串中去除缩进。当模块有大量文档时，这会减少 ``pyc`` 文件大小 5%。这一变化影响到 "
"``__doc__``，因此像 doctest 这样的工具会受到影响。"

#: ../NEWS:13399
msgid ""
":gh:`106396`: When the format specification of an f-string expression is "
"empty, the parser now generates an empty :class:`ast.JoinedStr` node for it "
"instead of an one-element :class:`ast.JoinedStr` with an empty string "
":class:`ast.Constant`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106396`: 当 f-string 表达式的格式规范为空时，解析器现在会为其生成一个空的 :class:`ast.JoinedStr` "
"节点，而不是一个包含空字符串 :class:`ast.Constant` 的单元素 :class:`ast.JoinedStr`。"

#: ../NEWS:13404
msgid ""
":gh:`100288`: Specialize :opcode:`LOAD_ATTR` for non-descriptors on the "
"class. Adds :opcode:`LOAD_ATTR_NONDESCRIPTOR_WITH_VALUES` and "
":opcode:`LOAD_ATTR_NONDESCRIPTOR_NO_DICT`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100288`: 为类上的非描述符特化 :opcode:`LOAD_ATTR`。添加了 "
":opcode:`LOAD_ATTR_NONDESCRIPTOR_WITH_VALUES` 和 "
":opcode:`LOAD_ATTR_NONDESCRIPTOR_NO_DICT`。"

#: ../NEWS:13408
msgid ""
":gh:`106008`: Fix possible reference leaks when failing to optimize "
"comparisons with :const:`None` in the bytecode compiler."
msgstr ":gh:`106008`: 修复了在字节码编译器中优化与 :const:`None` 的比较失败时可能出现的引用泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:13411
msgid ""
":gh:`106145`: Make ``end_lineno`` and ``end_col_offset`` required on "
"``type_param`` ast nodes."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106145`: 使 ``end_lineno`` 和 ``end_col_offset`` 在 ``type_param`` ast "
"节点上成为必需项。"

#: ../NEWS:13414
msgid ""
":gh:`106213`: Changed the way that Emscripten call trampolines work for "
"compatibility with Wasm/JS Promise integration."
msgstr ":gh:`106213`: 更改了Emscripten调用蹦床的工作方式，以提高与Wasm/JS Promise集成的兼容性。"

#: ../NEWS:13417
msgid ""
":gh:`106182`: :func:`sys.getfilesystemencoding` and "
":mod:`sys.getfilesystemencodeerrors` now return interned Unicode object."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106182`: :func:`sys.getfilesystemencoding` 和 "
":mod:`sys.getfilesystemencodeerrors` 现在返回interned Unicode对象。"

#: ../NEWS:13420
msgid ""
":gh:`106210`: Removed Emscripten import trampoline as it was no longer "
"necessary for Pyodide."
msgstr ":gh:`106210`: 移除了Emscripten导入蹦床，因为它对Pyodide不再必要。"

#: ../NEWS:13423
msgid ""
":gh:`104584`: Added a new, experimental, tracing optimizer and interpreter "
"(a.k.a. \"tier 2\"). This currently pessimizes, so don't use yet -- this is "
"infrastructure so we can experiment with optimizing passes. To enable it, "
"pass ``-Xuops`` or set ``PYTHONUOPS=1``. To get debug output, set "
"``PYTHONUOPSDEBUG=N`` where ``N`` is a debug level (0-4, where 0 is no debug"
" output and 4 is excessively verbose)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`104584`: "
"新增了一个实验性的追踪优化器和解释器（又称“第2层”）。目前这会降低性能，因此暂时不要使用——这是为了让我们可以实验优化传递的基础设施。要启用它，传递 "
"``-Xuops`` 或设置 ``PYTHONUOPS=1``。要获取调试输出，设置 ``PYTHONUOPSDEBUG=N``，其中 ``N`` "
"是调试级别（0-4，0表示无调试输出，4表示极其详细）。"

#: ../NEWS:13430
msgid ":gh:`105775`: :opcode:`LOAD_CLOSURE` is now a pseudo-op."
msgstr ":gh:`105775`: :opcode:`LOAD_CLOSURE` 现在是一个伪操作。"

#: ../NEWS:13432
msgid ""
":gh:`105730`: Allow any callable other than type objects as the condition "
"predicate in :meth:`BaseExceptionGroup.split` and "
":meth:`BaseExceptionGroup.subgroup`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105730`: 允许任何可调用对象（除类型对象外）作为 :meth:`BaseExceptionGroup.split` 和 "
":meth:`BaseExceptionGroup.subgroup` 中的条件谓词。"

#: ../NEWS:13436
msgid ""
":gh:`105979`: Fix crash in :func:`!_imp.get_frozen_object` due to improper "
"exception handling."
msgstr ":gh:`105979`: 修复了 :func:`!_imp.get_frozen_object` 中由于异常处理不当导致的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:13439
msgid ""
":gh:`106003`: Add a new :opcode:`TO_BOOL` instruction, which performs "
"boolean conversions for :opcode:`POP_JUMP_IF_TRUE`, "
":opcode:`POP_JUMP_IF_FALSE`, and :opcode:`UNARY_NOT` (which all expect exact"
" :class:`bool` values now). Also, modify the oparg of :opcode:`COMPARE_OP` "
"to include an optional \"boolean conversion\" flag."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106003`: 新增了一个 :opcode:`TO_BOOL` 指令，它为 :opcode:`POP_JUMP_IF_TRUE`、 "
":opcode:`POP_JUMP_IF_FALSE` 和 :opcode:`UNARY_NOT` (这些现在都期望精确的 :class:`bool` "
"值) 执行布尔转换。同时，修改 :opcode:`COMPARE_OP` 的oparg以包含一个可选的“布尔转换”标志。"

#: ../NEWS:13445
msgid ""
":gh:`98931`: Ensure custom :exc:`SyntaxError` error messages are raised for "
"invalid imports with multiple targets. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`98931`: 确保在具有多个目标的无效导入中引发自定义的 :exc:`SyntaxError` 错误消息。由Pablo "
"Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13448
msgid ""
":gh:`105724`: Improve ``assert`` error messages by providing exact error "
"range."
msgstr ":gh:`105724`: 通过提供精确的错误范围改进了 ``assert`` 错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:13451
msgid ""
":gh:`105908`: Fixed bug where :gh:`99111` breaks future import "
"``barry_as_FLUFL`` in the Python REPL."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105908`: 修复了 :gh:`99111` 在Python REPL中破坏未来导入 ``barry_as_FLUFL`` 的bug。"

#: ../NEWS:13454
msgid ""
":gh:`105840`: Fix possible crashes when specializing function calls with too"
" many ``__defaults__``."
msgstr ":gh:`105840`: 修复了在专门化函数调用时 ``__defaults__`` 过多可能导致崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:13457
msgid ""
":gh:`105831`: Fix an f-string bug, where using a debug expression (the ``=``"
" sign) that appears in the last line of a file results to the debug buffer "
"that holds the expression text being one character too small."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105831`: 修复了一个f-string的bug，其中使用调试表达式（``=`` "
"符号）出现在文件的最后一行时，导致保存表达式文本的调试缓冲区太小一个字符。"

#: ../NEWS:13461
msgid ""
":gh:`105800`: Correctly issue :exc:`SyntaxWarning` in f-strings if invalid "
"sequences are used. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`105800`: 在f-字符串中使用无效序列时正确发出 :exc:`SyntaxWarning`。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13464
msgid ""
":gh:`105340`: Include the comprehension iteration variable in ``locals()`` "
"inside a module- or class-scope comprehension."
msgstr ":gh:`105340`: 在模块或类作用域的推导式中，将推导式的迭代变量包含在 ``locals()`` 中。"

#: ../NEWS:13467
msgid ""
":gh:`105331`: Raise :exc:`ValueError` if the ``delay`` argument to "
":func:`asyncio.sleep` is a NaN (matching :func:`time.sleep`)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105331`: 如果 :func:`asyncio.sleep` 的 ``delay`` 参数是NaN，则引发 "
":exc:`ValueError` (与 :func:`time.sleep` 一致) 。"

#: ../NEWS:13470
msgid ""
":gh:`105587`: The runtime can't guarantee that immortal objects will not be "
"mutated by Extensions. Thus, this modifies _PyStaticObject_CheckRefcnt to "
"warn instead of asserting."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105587`: 运行时无法保证扩展不会修改不朽对象。因此，这修改了_PyStaticObject_CheckRefcnt以警告而不是断言。"

#: ../NEWS:13474
msgid ""
":gh:`105564`: Don't include artificil newlines in the ``line`` attribute of "
"tokens in the APIs of the :mod:`tokenize` module. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`105564`: 不在 :mod:`tokenize` 模块的API中的标记的 ``line`` 属性中包含人为的换行符。由Pablo "
"Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13477
msgid ""
":gh:`105549`: Tokenize separately ``NUMBER`` and ``NAME`` tokens that are "
"not ambiguous. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105549`: 分别对不模糊的 ``NUMBER`` 和 ``NAME`` 标记进行标记化。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13480
msgid ""
":gh:`105588`: Fix an issue that could result in crashes when compiling "
"malformed :mod:`ast` nodes."
msgstr ":gh:`105588`: 修复了一个在编译格式错误的 :mod:`ast` 节点时可能导致崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:13483
msgid ""
":gh:`100987`: Allow objects other than code objects as the \"executable\" in"
" internal frames. In the long term, this can help tools like Cython and "
"PySpy interact more efficiently. In the shorter term, it allows us to "
"perform some optimizations more simply."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100987`: "
"允许除代码对象外的其他对象作为内部帧中的“可执行文件”。长期来看，这可以帮助像Cython和PySpy这样的工具更有效地交互。在短期内，它允许我们更简单地进行一些优化。"

#: ../NEWS:13488
msgid ""
":gh:`105375`: Fix bugs in the :mod:`builtins` module where exceptions could "
"end up being overwritten."
msgstr ":gh:`105375`: 修复了 :mod:`builtins` 模块中的错误，其中异常可能被覆盖。"

#: ../NEWS:13491
msgid ""
":gh:`105375`: Fix bug in the compiler where an exception could end up being "
"overwritten."
msgstr ":gh:`105375`: 修复了编译器中的一个错误，其中异常可能被覆盖。"

#: ../NEWS:13494
msgid ""
":gh:`105375`: Improve error handling in :c:func:`PyUnicode_BuildEncodingMap`"
" where an exception could end up being overwritten."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105375`: 改进了 :c:func:`PyUnicode_BuildEncodingMap` 中的错误处理，其中异常可能被覆盖。"

#: ../NEWS:13497
msgid ""
":gh:`105486`: Change the repr of ``ParamSpec`` list of args in "
"``types.GenericAlias``."
msgstr ":gh:`105486`: 更改了 ``types.GenericAlias`` 中 ``ParamSpec`` 参数列表的repr。"

#: ../NEWS:13500
msgid ""
":gh:`105678`: Break the ``MAKE_FUNCTION`` instruction into two parts, "
"``MAKE_FUNCTION`` which makes the function and ``SET_FUNCTION_ATTRIBUTE`` "
"which sets the attributes on the function. This makes the stack effect of "
"``MAKE_FUNCTION`` regular to ease optimization and code generation."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105678`: 将 ``MAKE_FUNCTION`` 指令分成两部分，``MAKE_FUNCTION`` "
"用于创建函数，``SET_FUNCTION_ATTRIBUTE``用于设置函数的属性。这使得 ``MAKE_FUNCTION`` "
"的堆栈效果规范化，以简化优化和代码生成。"

#: ../NEWS:13505
msgid ""
":gh:`105435`: Fix spurious newline character if file ends on a comment "
"without a newline. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":gh:`105435`: 修复了如果文件以没有换行的注释结尾时的虚假换行字符。补丁由Pablo Galindo提供。"

#: ../NEWS:13508
msgid ""
":gh:`105390`: Correctly raise :exc:`tokenize.TokenError` exceptions instead "
"of :exc:`SyntaxError` for tokenize errors such as incomplete input. Patch by"
" Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`105390`: 对于如不完整输入之类的标记化错误，正确引发 :exc:`tokenize.TokenError` 异常而非 "
":exc:`SyntaxError`。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13512
msgid ""
":gh:`105259`: Don't include newline character for trailing ``NEWLINE`` "
"tokens emitted in the :mod:`tokenize` module. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`105259`: 在 :mod:`tokenize` 模块中，不包含为尾随 ``NEWLINE`` 标记发出的换行符。补丁由 Pablo "
"Galindo 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:13515
msgid ""
":gh:`104635`: Eliminate redundant :opcode:`STORE_FAST` instructions in the "
"compiler. Patch by Donghee Na and Carl Meyer."
msgstr ""
":gh:`104635`: 在编译器中消除冗余的 :opcode:`STORE_FAST` 指令。由 Donghee Na 和 Carl Meyer "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13518
msgid ""
":gh:`105324`: Fix the main function of the :mod:`tokenize` module when "
"reading from ``sys.stdin``. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`105324`: 修复 :mod:`tokenize` 模块的主函数在从 ``sys.stdin`` 读取时的行为。由 Pablo "
"Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13521
msgid ""
":gh:`33092`: Simplify and speed up interpreter for f-strings. Removes "
"``FORMAT_VALUE`` opcode. Add ``CONVERT_VALUE``, ``FORMAT_SIMPLE`` and "
"``FORMAT_WITH_SPEC`` opcode. Compiler emits more efficient sequence for each"
" format expression."
msgstr ""
":gh:`33092`: 简化并加速 f-strings 的解释器。移除 ``FORMAT_VALUE`` 操作码。添加 "
"``CONVERT_VALUE``、``FORMAT_SIMPLE`` 和 ``FORMAT_WITH_SPEC`` "
"操作码。编译器为每个格式表达式生成更高效的序列。"

#: ../NEWS:13526
msgid ""
":gh:`105229`: Remove remaining two-codeunit superinstructions. All remaining"
" superinstructions only take a single codeunit, simplifying instrumentation "
"and quickening."
msgstr ":gh:`105229`: 移除剩余的双代码单元超级指令。所有剩余的超级指令仅占用单个代码单元，简化了检测和加速过程。"

#: ../NEWS:13530
msgid ""
":gh:`105235`: Prevent out-of-bounds memory access during ``mmap.find()`` "
"calls."
msgstr ":gh:`105235`: 防止在 ``mmap.find()`` 调用期间发生越界内存访问。"

#: ../NEWS:13533
msgid ""
":gh:`98963`: Restore the ability for a subclass of :class:`property` to "
"define ``__slots__`` or otherwise be dict-less by ignoring failures to set a"
" docstring on such a class.  This behavior had regressed in 3.12beta1. An "
":exc:`AttributeError` where there had not previously been one was disruptive"
" to existing code."
msgstr ""
":gh:`98963`: 通过忽略在此类类上设置文档字符串的失败，恢复 :class:`property` 子类定义 ``__slots__`` "
"或以其他方式无字典的能力。此行为在 3.12beta1 中出现了倒退。在之前没有的情况下出现的 :exc:`AttributeError` "
"对现有代码造成了干扰。"

#: ../NEWS:13539
msgid ""
":gh:`104812`: The \"pending call\" machinery now works for all interpreters,"
" not just the main interpreter, and runs in all threads, not just the main "
"thread. Some calls are still only done in the main thread, ergo in the main "
"interpreter. This change does not affect signal handling nor the existing "
"public C-API (``Py_AddPendingCall()``), which both still only target the "
"main thread. The new functionality is meant strictly for internal use for "
"now, since consequences of its use are not well understood yet outside some "
"very restricted cases.  This change brings the capability in line with the "
"intention when the state was made per-interpreter several years ago."
msgstr ""
":gh:`104812`: "
"\"挂起调用\"机制现在适用于所有解释器，而不仅仅是主解释器，并且在所有线程中运行，而不仅限于主线程。某些调用仍然仅在主线程中进行，因此仅在主解释器中。此更改不影响信号处理，也不影响现有的公共C-"
"API（``Py_AddPendingCall()``），这两者仍然仅针对主线程。新功能目前严格限于内部使用，因为除了某些非常受限的情况外，其使用的后果尚不明确。这一变化使得该功能与几年前状态变为每个解释器时的意图一致。"

#: ../NEWS:13550
msgid ""
":gh:`105194`: Do not escape with backslashes f-string format specifiers. "
"Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":gh:`105194`: 不要对f-string格式说明符使用反斜杠转义。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13553
msgid ""
":gh:`105229`: Replace some dynamic superinstructions with single instruction"
" equivalents."
msgstr ":gh:`105229`: 用单指令等效替换一些动态超级指令。"

#: ../NEWS:13556
msgid ""
":gh:`105162`: Fixed bug in generator.close()/throw() where an inner iterator"
" would be ignored when the outer iterator was instrumented."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105162`: 修复了generator.close()/throw()中的一个错误，当外部迭代器被检测时，内部迭代器会被忽略。"

#: ../NEWS:13559
msgid ""
":gh:`105164`: Ensure annotations are set up correctly if the only annotation"
" in a block is within a :keyword:`match` block. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105164`: 确保如果一个块中唯一的注解位于 :keyword:`match` 块内，则正确设置注解。由Jelle "
"Zijlstra提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13562
msgid ""
":gh:`105148`: Make ``_PyASTOptimizeState`` internal to ast_opt.c. Make "
"``_PyAST_Optimize`` take two integers instead of a pointer to this struct. "
"This avoids the need to include pycore_compile.h in ast_opt.c."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105148`: 使 ``_PyASTOptimizeState`` 内部于ast_opt.c。使 ``_PyAST_Optimize`` "
"接受两个整数而不是指向此结构的指针。这避免了在ast_opt.c中包含pycore_compile.h的需要。"

#: ../NEWS:13566
msgid ""
":gh:`104799`: Attributes of :mod:`ast` nodes that are lists now default to "
"the empty list if omitted. This means that some code that previously raised "
":exc:`TypeError` when the AST node was used will now proceed with the empty "
"list instead. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`104799`: :mod:`ast` 节点的属性如果是列表，现在如果省略则默认为空列表。这意味着一些以前在使用AST节点时会引发 "
":exc:`TypeError` 的代码现在将使用空列表继续执行。由Jelle Zijlstra提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13571
msgid ""
":gh:`105111`: Remove the old trashcan macros ``Py_TRASHCAN_SAFE_BEGIN`` and "
"``Py_TRASHCAN_SAFE_END``. They should be replaced by the new macros "
"``Py_TRASHCAN_BEGIN`` and ``Py_TRASHCAN_END``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105111`: 移除旧的垃圾回收宏 ``Py_TRASHCAN_SAFE_BEGIN`` 和 "
"``Py_TRASHCAN_SAFE_END``。它们应该被新的宏 ``Py_TRASHCAN_BEGIN`` 和 "
"``Py_TRASHCAN_END`` 替换。"

#: ../NEWS:13575
msgid ""
":gh:`105035`: Fix :func:`super` calls on types with custom "
":c:member:`~PyTypeObject.tp_getattro` implementation (e.g. meta-types.)"
msgstr ""
":gh:`105035`: 修复了在具有自定义 :c:member:`~PyTypeObject.tp_getattro` 实现（例如元类型）的类型上的"
" :func:`super` 调用。"

#: ../NEWS:13578
msgid ""
":gh:`105017`: Show CRLF lines in the tokenize string attribute in both NL "
"and NEWLINE tokens. Patch by Marta Gómez."
msgstr ":gh:`105017`: 在NL和NEWLINE标记中显示tokenize字符串属性中的CRLF行。由Marta Gómez提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13581
msgid ""
":gh:`105013`: Fix handling of multiline parenthesized lambdas in "
":func:`inspect.getsource`. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`105013`: 修复 :func:`inspect.getsource` 中多行括号lambda的处理。由Pablo "
"Galindo提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13584
msgid ""
":gh:`105017`: Do not include an additional final ``NL`` token when parsing "
"files having CRLF lines. Patch by Marta Gómez."
msgstr ":gh:`105017`: 解析具有CRLF行的文件时，不包含额外的最终 ``NL`` 标记。由Marta Gómez提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13587
msgid ""
":gh:`104976`: Ensure that trailing ``DEDENT`` :class:`tokenize.TokenInfo` "
"objects emitted by the :mod:`tokenize` module are reported as in Python "
"3.11. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`104976`: 确保 :mod:`tokenize` 模块发出的尾随 ``DEDENT`` "
":class:`tokenize.TokenInfo` 对象如Python 3.11中报告的那样。由Pablo Galindo提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13591
msgid ""
":gh:`104972`: Ensure that the ``line`` attribute in "
":class:`tokenize.TokenInfo` objects in the :mod:`tokenize` module are always"
" correct. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`104972`: 确保 :mod:`tokenize` 模块中 :class:`tokenize.TokenInfo` 对象的 "
"``line`` 属性始终正确。由Pablo Galindo提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13595
msgid ""
":gh:`104955`: Fix signature for the new :meth:`~object.__release_buffer__` "
"slot. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`104955`: 修复新的 :meth:`~object.__release_buffer__` 槽的签名。由Jelle "
"Zijlstra提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13598
msgid ""
":gh:`104690`: Starting new threads and process creation through "
":func:`os.fork` during interpreter shutdown (such as from :mod:`atexit` "
"handlers) is no longer supported.  It can lead to race condition between the"
" main Python runtime thread freeing thread states while internal "
":mod:`threading` routines are trying to allocate and use the state of just "
"created threads. Or forked children trying to use the mid-shutdown runtime "
"and thread state in the child process."
msgstr ""
":gh:`104690`: 在解释器关闭期间（例如从 :mod:`atexit` 处理程序中）启动新线程和通过 :func:`os.fork` "
"创建进程不再受支持。这可能导致主Python运行时线程释放线程状态与内部 :mod:`threading` "
"例程尝试分配和使用刚创建线程的状态之间的竞争条件。或者fork的子进程尝试在子进程中使用关闭中的运行时和线程状态。"

#: ../NEWS:13606
msgid ""
":gh:`104879`: Fix crash when accessing the ``__module__`` attribute of type "
"aliases defined outside a module. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`104879`: 修复访问在模块外定义的类型别名的 ``__module__`` 属性时的崩溃。由Jelle Zijlstra提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13609
msgid ""
":gh:`104825`: Tokens emitted by the :mod:`tokenize` module do not include an"
" implicit ``\\n`` character in the ``line`` attribute anymore. Patch by "
"Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`104825`: :mod:`tokenize` 模块发出的标记不再在 ``line`` 属性中包含隐式的 ``\\n`` 字符。由Pablo"
" Galindo提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13613
msgid ""
":gh:`104770`: If a generator returns a value upon being closed, the value is"
" now returned by :meth:`generator.close`."
msgstr ":gh:`104770`: 如果生成器在关闭时返回一个值，该值现在由 :meth:`generator.close` 返回。"

#: ../NEWS:13616
msgid ""
":gh:`89091`: Raise :exc:`RuntimeWarning` for unawaited async generator "
"methods like :meth:`~agen.asend`, :meth:`~agen.athrow` and "
":meth:`~agen.aclose`. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`89091`: 对于未等待的异步生成器方法如 :meth:`~agen.asend`、:meth:`~agen.athrow` 和 "
":meth:`~agen.aclose`，引发 :exc:`RuntimeWarning`。由Kumar Aditya提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13620
msgid ""
":gh:`96663`: Add a better, more introspect-able error message when setting "
"attributes on classes without a ``__dict__`` and no slot member for the "
"attribute."
msgstr ":gh:`96663`: 当在没有 ``__dict__`` 且没有该属性的槽成员的类上设置属性时，添加一个更好、更可内省的错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:13624
msgid ""
":gh:`93627`: Update the Python pickle module implementation to match the C "
"implementation of the pickle module. For objects setting reduction methods "
"like :meth:`~object.__reduce_ex__` or :meth:`~object.__reduce__` to "
"``None``, pickling will result in a :exc:`TypeError`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93627`: 更新Python pickle模块实现以匹配C实现的pickle模块。对于将缩减方法如 "
":meth:`~object.__reduce_ex__` 或 :meth:`~object.__reduce__` 设置为 ``None`` "
"的对象，pickle操作将导致 :exc:`TypeError`。"

#: ../NEWS:13629
msgid ":gh:`101006`: Improve error handling when read :mod:`marshal` data."
msgstr ":gh:`101006`: 改进读取 :mod:`marshal` 数据时的错误处理。"

#: ../NEWS:13631
msgid ""
":gh:`91095`: Specializes calls to most Python classes. Specifically, any "
"class that inherits from ``object``, or another Python class, and does not "
"override ``__new__``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91095`: 专门化对大多数Python类的调用。具体来说，任何继承自 ``object`` 或其他Python类且未覆盖 "
"``__new__`` 的类。"

#: ../NEWS:13635
msgid "The specialized instruction does the following:"
msgstr "专门化指令执行以下操作："

#: ../NEWS:13637
msgid "Creates the object (by calling ``object.__new__``)"
msgstr "创建对象（通过调用 ``object.__new__``）"

#: ../NEWS:13638
msgid "Pushes a shim frame to the frame stack (to cleanup after ``__init__``)"
msgstr "将一个垫片帧推送到帧堆栈（以在 ``__init__`` 之后清理）"

#: ../NEWS:13639
msgid "Pushes the frame for ``__init__`` to the frame stack"
msgstr "将 ``__init__`` 的帧推送到帧堆栈"

#: ../NEWS:13641
msgid "Speeds up the instantiation of most Python classes."
msgstr "加速大多数Python类的实例化。"

#: ../NEWS:13646
msgid ""
":gh:`110786`: :mod:`sysconfig`'s CLI now ignores :exc:`BrokenPipeError`, "
"making it exit normally if its output is being piped and the pipe closes."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110786`: :mod:`sysconfig` 的命令行界面现在忽略 "
":exc:`BrokenPipeError`，如果其输出被管道传输且管道关闭，则正常退出。"

#: ../NEWS:13649
msgid ""
":gh:`103480`: The :mod:`sysconfig` module is now a package, instead of a "
"single-file module."
msgstr ":gh:`103480`: :mod:`sysconfig` 模块现在是一个包，而不是单文件模块。"

#: ../NEWS:13652
msgid ""
":gh:`110733`: Micro-optimization: Avoid calling ``min()``, ``max()`` in "
":meth:`BaseEventLoop._run_once`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110733`: 微优化：避免在 :meth:`BaseEventLoop._run_once` 中调用 ``min()``, "
"``max()``。"

#: ../NEWS:13655
msgid ""
":gh:`94597`: Added :class:`asyncio.EventLoop` for use with the "
":func:`asyncio.run` *loop_factory* kwarg to avoid calling the asyncio policy"
" system."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94597`: 添加了 :class:`asyncio.EventLoop` 用于 :func:`asyncio.run` 的 "
"*loop_factory* 关键字参数，以避免调用asyncio策略系统。"

#: ../NEWS:13659
msgid ""
":gh:`110682`: :func:`runtime-checkable protocols <typing.runtime_checkable>`"
" used to consider ``__match_args__`` a protocol member in "
"``__instancecheck__`` if it was present on the protocol. Now, this attribute"
" is ignored if it is present."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110682`: :func:`运行时可检查协议 <typing.runtime_checkable>` "
"过去如果在协议上存在``__match_args__``，则在 ``__instancecheck__`` "
"中将其视为协议成员。现在，如果存在此属性，则忽略它。"

#: ../NEWS:13664
msgid ""
":gh:`110488`: Fix a couple of issues in :meth:`pathlib.PurePath.with_name`: "
"a single dot was incorrectly considered a valid name, and in "
":class:`PureWindowsPath`, a name with an NTFS alternate data stream, like "
"``a:b``, was incorrectly considered invalid."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110488`: 修复 :meth:`pathlib.PurePath.with_name` 中的几个问题：单个点被错误地认为是有效名称，而在"
" :class:`PureWindowsPath` 中，具有NTFS替代数据流的名称，如 ``a:b``，被错误地认为是无效的。"

#: ../NEWS:13669
msgid ""
":gh:`110590`: Fix a bug in :meth:`!_sre.compile` where :exc:`TypeError` "
"would be overwritten by :exc:`OverflowError` when the *code* argument was a "
"list of non-ints."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110590`: 修复 :meth:`!_sre.compile` 中的一个bug，当 *code* "
"参数是非整数列表时，:exc:`TypeError` 会被 :exc:`OverflowError` 覆盖。"

#: ../NEWS:13673
msgid ""
":gh:`65052`: Prevent :mod:`pdb` from crashing when trying to display "
"undisplayable objects"
msgstr ":gh:`65052`: 防止 :mod:`pdb` 在尝试显示不可显示对象时崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:13676
msgid ""
":gh:`110519`: Deprecation warning about non-integer number in :mod:`gettext`"
" now always refers to the line in the user code where gettext function or "
"method is used. Previously it could refer to a line in ``gettext`` code."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110519`: 关于 :mod:`gettext` 中非整数数字的弃用警告现在总是引用用户代码中使用 gettext "
"函数或方法的行。之前它可能引用 ``gettext`` 代码中的一行。"

#: ../NEWS:13680
msgid ""
":gh:`89902`: Deprecate non-standard format specifier \"N\" for "
":class:`decimal.Decimal`. It was not documented and only supported in the C "
"implementation."
msgstr ""
":gh:`89902`: 弃用 :class:`decimal.Decimal` 的非标准格式说明符 \"N\"。它未被记录且仅在 C 实现中支持。"

#: ../NEWS:13684
msgid ""
":gh:`110378`: :func:`~contextlib.contextmanager` and "
":func:`~contextlib.asynccontextmanager` context managers now close an "
"invalid underlying generator object that yields more then one value."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110378`: :func:`~contextlib.contextmanager` 和 "
":func:`~contextlib.asynccontextmanager` 上下文管理器现在会关闭一个产生多个值的无效底层生成器对象。"

#: ../NEWS:13688
msgid ""
":gh:`106670`: In :mod:`pdb`, set convenience variable ``$_exception`` for "
"post mortem debugging."
msgstr ":gh:`106670`: 在 :mod:`pdb` 中，为事后调试设置便利变量 ``$_exception``。"

#: ../NEWS:13691
msgid ""
":gh:`110365`: Fix :func:`termios.tcsetattr` bug that was overwriting "
"existing errors during parsing integers from ``term`` list."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110365`: 修复 :func:`termios.tcsetattr` 在从 ``term`` 列表解析整数时覆盖现有错误的 bug。"

#: ../NEWS:13694
msgid ""
":gh:`109653`: Slightly improve the import time of several standard-library "
"modules by deferring imports of :mod:`warnings` within those modules. Patch "
"by Alex Waygood."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109653`: 通过在这些模块中延迟导入 :mod:`warnings`，略微提高几个标准库模块的导入时间。由 Alex Waygood "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13698
msgid ""
":gh:`110273`: :func:`dataclasses.replace` now raises TypeError instead of "
"ValueError if specify keyword argument for a field declared with init=False "
"or miss keyword argument for required InitVar field."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110273`: 如果为声明为 init=False 的字段指定关键字参数或为必需的 InitVar "
"字段缺少关键字参数，:func:`dataclasses.replace` 现在会引发 TypeError 而不是 ValueError。"

#: ../NEWS:13702
msgid ":gh:`110249`: Add ``--inline-caches`` flag to ``dis`` command line."
msgstr ":gh:`110249`: 向 ``dis`` 命令行添加 ``--inline-caches`` 标志。"

#: ../NEWS:13704
msgid ""
":gh:`109653`: Fix a Python 3.12 regression in the import time of "
":mod:`random`. Patch by Alex Waygood."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109653`: 修复 :mod:`random` 在 Python 3.12 导入时间的回归。由 Alex Waygood 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13707
msgid ""
":gh:`110222`: Add support of struct sequence objects in "
":func:`copy.replace`. Patched by Xuehai Pan."
msgstr ":gh:`110222`: 在 :func:`copy.replace` 中添加对结构序列对象的支持。由 Xuehai Pan 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13710
msgid ""
":gh:`109649`: :mod:`multiprocessing`, :mod:`concurrent.futures`, "
":mod:`compileall`: Replace :func:`os.cpu_count` with "
":func:`os.process_cpu_count` to select the default number of worker threads "
"and processes. Get the CPU affinity if supported. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109649`: "
":mod:`multiprocessing`、:mod:`concurrent.futures`、:mod:`compileall`: 用 "
":func:`os.process_cpu_count` 替换 :func:`os.cpu_count` 来选择默认的工作线程和进程数。如果支持，获取 "
"CPU 亲和力。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13716
msgid ""
":gh:`110150`: Fix base case handling in statistics.quantiles.  Now allows a "
"single data point."
msgstr ":gh:`110150`: 修复 statistics.quantiles 中的基本情况处理。现在允许单个数据点。"

#: ../NEWS:13719
msgid ""
":gh:`110036`: On Windows, multiprocessing ``Popen.terminate()`` now catches "
":exc:`PermissionError` and get the process exit code. If the process is "
"still running, raise again the :exc:`PermissionError`. Otherwise, the "
"process terminated as expected: store its exit code. Patch by Victor "
"Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110036`: 在 Windows 上，multiprocessing ``Popen.terminate()`` 现在捕获 "
":exc:`PermissionError` 并获取进程退出代码。如果进程仍在运行，则再次抛出 "
":exc:`PermissionError`。否则，进程按预期终止：存储其退出代码。由 Victor Stinner 提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13725
msgid ""
":gh:`110038`: Fixed an issue that caused :meth:`KqueueSelector.select` to "
"not return all the ready events in some cases when a file descriptor is "
"registered for both read and write."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110038`: 修复了一个问题，该问题导致 :meth:`KqueueSelector.select` "
"在某些情况下当文件描述符被同时注册为读和写时，不返回所有就绪的事件。"

#: ../NEWS:13729
msgid ""
":gh:`110045`: Update the :mod:`symtable` module to support the new scopes "
"introduced by :pep:`695`."
msgstr ":gh:`110045`: 更新 :mod:`symtable` 模块以支持由 :pep:`695` 引入的新作用域。"

#: ../NEWS:13732
msgid ""
":gh:`88402`: Add new variables to :py:meth:`sysconfig.get_config_vars` on "
"Windows: ``LIBRARY``, ``LDLIBRARY``, ``LIBDIR``, ``SOABI``, and "
"``Py_NOGIL``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`88402`: 在 Windows 上为 :py:meth:`sysconfig.get_config_vars` "
"添加新变量：``LIBRARY``, ``LDLIBRARY``, ``LIBDIR``, ``SOABI``, 和 ``Py_NOGIL``。"

#: ../NEWS:13736
msgid ""
":gh:`109631`: :mod:`re` functions such as :func:`re.findall`, "
":func:`re.split`, :func:`re.search` and :func:`re.sub` which perform short "
"repeated matches can now be interrupted by user."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109631`: 现在可以中断执行短重复匹配的 :mod:`re` 函数，如 :func:`re.findall`, "
":func:`re.split`, :func:`re.search` 和 :func:`re.sub`。"

#: ../NEWS:13740
msgid ""
":gh:`109653`: Reduce the import time of :mod:`email.utils` by around 43%. "
"This results in the import time of :mod:`email.message` falling by around "
"18%, which in turn reduces the import time of :mod:`importlib.metadata` by "
"around 6%. Patch by Alex Waygood."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109653`: 将 :mod:`email.utils` 的导入时间减少约 43%。这使得 :mod:`email.message` "
"的导入时间下降约 18%，进而使 :mod:`importlib.metadata` 的导入时间减少约 6%。由 Alex Waygood 提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13745
msgid ""
":gh:`109818`: Fix :func:`reprlib.recursive_repr` not copying "
"``__type_params__`` from decorated function."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109818`: 修复 :func:`reprlib.recursive_repr` 不复制装饰函数的 ``__type_params__``"
" 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:13748
msgid ""
":gh:`109047`: :mod:`concurrent.futures`: The *executor manager thread* now "
"catches exceptions when adding an item to the *call queue*. During Python "
"finalization, creating a new thread can now raise :exc:`RuntimeError`. Catch"
" the exception and call ``terminate_broken()`` in this case. Patch by Victor"
" Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109047`: :mod:`concurrent.futures`: *executor manager thread* 现在在向 "
"*call queue* 添加项时捕获异常。在 Python 终止期间，创建新线程现在可能抛出 "
":exc:`RuntimeError`。在这种情况下捕获异常并调用 ``terminate_broken()``。由 Victor Stinner "
"提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13754
msgid ""
":gh:`109782`: Ensure the signature of :func:`os.path.isdir` is identical on "
"all platforms. Patch by Amin Alaee."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109782`: 确保 :func:`os.path.isdir` 的签名在所有平台上相同。由 Amin Alaee 提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13757
msgid ""
":gh:`109653`: Improve import time of :mod:`functools` by around 13%. Patch "
"by Alex Waygood."
msgstr ":gh:`109653`: 将 :mod:`functools` 的导入时间提高约 13%。由 Alex Waygood 提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13760
msgid ""
":gh:`109590`: :func:`shutil.which` will prefer files with an extension in "
"``PATHEXT`` if the given mode includes ``os.X_OK`` on win32. If no "
"``PATHEXT`` match is found, a file without an extension in ``PATHEXT`` can "
"be returned. This change will have :func:`shutil.which` act more similarly "
"to previous behavior in Python 3.11."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109590`: 在win32上，如果给定的模式包含 ``os.X_OK``，:func:`shutil.which` "
"将优先选择``PATHEXT``中有扩展名的文件。如果没有找到 ``PATHEXT`` 匹配项，可以返回一个没有 ``PATHEXT`` "
"扩展名的文件。这一变化将使 :func:`shutil.which` 的行为更类似于Python 3.11中的先前行为。"

#: ../NEWS:13766
msgid ""
":gh:`109653`: Reduce the import time of :mod:`enum` by over 50%. Patch by "
"Alex Waygood."
msgstr ":gh:`109653`: 通过Alex Waygood的补丁，将 :mod:`enum` 的导入时间减少了50%以上。"

#: ../NEWS:13769
msgid ""
":gh:`109593`: Avoid deadlocking on a reentrant call to the multiprocessing "
"resource tracker. Such a reentrant call, though unlikely, can happen if a GC"
" pass invokes the finalizer for a multiprocessing object such as SemLock."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109593`: "
"避免在多进程资源跟踪器的重入调用上死锁。虽然不太可能，但如果GC传递调用了如SemLock这样的多进程对象的终结器，就可能发生这种重入调用。"

#: ../NEWS:13774
msgid ""
":gh:`109653`: Reduce the import time of :mod:`typing` by around a third. "
"Patch by Alex Waygood."
msgstr ":gh:`109653`: 通过Alex Waygood的补丁，将 :mod:`typing` 的导入时间减少了大约三分之一。"

#: ../NEWS:13777
msgid ""
":gh:`109649`: Add :func:`os.process_cpu_count` function to get the number of"
" logical CPUs usable by the calling thread of the current process. Patch by "
"Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109649`: 添加 :func:`os.process_cpu_count` "
"函数，以获取当前进程调用线程可用的逻辑CPU数量。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13781
msgid ""
":gh:`74481`: Add ``set_error_mode`` related constants in ``msvcrt`` module "
"in Python debug build."
msgstr ":gh:`74481`: 在Python调试构建中，``msvcrt``模块中添加了与 ``set_error_mode`` 相关的常量。"

#: ../NEWS:13784
msgid ""
":gh:`109613`: Fix :func:`os.stat` and :meth:`os.DirEntry.stat`: check for "
"exceptions. Previously, on Python built in debug mode, these functions could"
" trigger a fatal Python error (and abort the process) when a function "
"succeeded with an exception set. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109613`: 修复 :func:`os.stat` 和 "
":meth:`os.DirEntry.stat`：检查异常。以前，在Python调试模式下构建时，当函数成功但设置了异常时，这些函数可能会触发致命的Python错误（并中止进程）。由Victor"
" Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13789
msgid ""
":gh:`109599`: Expose the type of PyCapsule objects as ``types.CapsuleType``."
msgstr ":gh:`109599`: 将PyCapsule对象的类型公开为 ``types.CapsuleType``。"

#: ../NEWS:13797
msgid ":gh:`109559`: Update :mod:`unicodedata` database to Unicode 15.1.0."
msgstr ":gh:`109559`: 将 :mod:`unicodedata` 数据库更新到Unicode 15.1.0。"

#: ../NEWS:13799
msgid ""
":gh:`109543`: Remove unnecessary :func:`hasattr` check during "
":data:`typing.TypedDict` creation."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109543`: 在 :data:`typing.TypedDict` 创建期间移除不必要的 :func:`hasattr` 检查。"

#: ../NEWS:13802
msgid ""
":gh:`109495`: Remove unnecessary extra ``__slots__`` in "
":class:`~datetime.datetime`\\'s pure python implementation to reduce memory "
"size, as they are defined in the superclass. Patch by James Hilton-Balfe"
msgstr ""
":gh:`109495`: 在 :class:`~datetime.datetime` 的纯Python实现中移除不必要的额外 "
"``__slots__`` 以减少内存大小，因为它们已在超类中定义。由James Hilton-Balfe提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13806
msgid ""
":gh:`109461`: :mod:`logging`: Use a context manager for lock acquisition."
msgstr ":gh:`109461`: :mod:`logging`：使用上下文管理器进行锁获取。"

#: ../NEWS:13808
msgid ""
":gh:`109096`: :class:`http.server.CGIHTTPRequestHandler` has been deprecated"
" for removal in 3.15.  Its design is old and the web world has long since "
"moved beyond CGI."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109096`: :class:`http.server.CGIHTTPRequestHandler` "
"已被弃用，计划在3.15中移除。其设计陈旧，且网络世界早已超越CGI。"

#: ../NEWS:13812
msgid ""
":gh:`109409`: Fix error when it was possible to inherit a frozen dataclass "
"from multiple parents some of which were possibly not frozen."
msgstr ":gh:`109409`: 修复了当一个冻结的数据类可能从多个父类继承时，其中一些父类可能未被冻结的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:13815
msgid ""
":gh:`109375`: The :mod:`pdb` ``alias`` command now prevents registering "
"aliases without arguments."
msgstr ":gh:`109375`: :mod:`pdb` 的 ``alias`` 命令现在阻止注册没有参数的别名。"

#: ../NEWS:13818
msgid ""
":gh:`109319`: Deprecate the ``dis.HAVE_ARGUMENT`` field in favour of "
"``dis.hasarg``."
msgstr ":gh:`109319`: 弃用 ``dis.HAVE_ARGUMENT`` 字段，推荐使用 ``dis.hasarg``。"

#: ../NEWS:13821
msgid ""
":gh:`107219`: Fix a race condition in ``concurrent.futures``. When a process"
" in the process pool was terminated abruptly (while the future was running "
"or pending), close the connection write end. If the call queue is blocked on"
" sending bytes to a worker process, closing the connection write end "
"interrupts the send, so the queue can be closed. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`107219`: 修复了 ``concurrent.futures`` 中的竞争条件。当进程池中的进程被突然终止时（而 future "
"正在运行或挂起），关闭连接的写入端。如果调用队列在发送字节到工作进程时被阻塞，关闭连接的写入端会中断发送，因此队列可以被关闭。由 Victor "
"Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13827
msgid ""
":gh:`66143`: The :class:`codecs.CodecInfo` object has been made copyable and"
" pickleable. Patched by Robert Lehmann and Furkan Onder."
msgstr ""
":gh:`66143`: :class:`codecs.CodecInfo` 对象现在可以被复制和 pickle。由 Robert Lehmann 和 "
"Furkan Onder 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13830
msgid ""
":gh:`109187`: :meth:`pathlib.Path.resolve` now treats symlink loops like "
"other errors: in strict mode, :exc:`OSError` is raised, and in non-strict "
"mode, no exception is raised."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109187`: :meth:`pathlib.Path.resolve` 现在将符号链接循环视为其他错误：在严格模式下，会引发 "
