#: ../NEWS:13834
msgid ""
":gh:`50644`: Attempts to pickle or create a shallow or deep copy of "
":mod:`codecs` streams now raise a TypeError. Previously, copying failed with"
" a RecursionError, while pickling produced wrong results that eventually "
"caused unpickling to fail with a RecursionError."
msgstr ""
":gh:`50644`: 现在尝试 pickle 或创建 :mod:`codecs` 流的浅拷贝或深拷贝会引发 TypeError。之前，复制会因 "
"RecursionError 失败，而 pickle 会产生错误的结果，最终导致解 pickle 时因 RecursionError 失败。"

#: ../NEWS:13839
msgid ""
":gh:`109174`: Add support of :class:`types.SimpleNamespace` in "
":func:`copy.replace`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109174`: 在 :func:`copy.replace` 中添加了对 :class:`types.SimpleNamespace` "
"的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:13842
msgid ""
":gh:`109164`: :mod:`pdb`: Replace :mod:`getopt` with :mod:`argparse` for "
"parsing command line arguments."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109164`: :mod:`pdb`: 用 :mod:`argparse` 替换 :mod:`getopt` 来解析命令行参数。"

#: ../NEWS:13845
msgid ""
":gh:`109151`: Enable ``readline`` editing features in the :ref:`sqlite3 "
