"reselected for simplicity under the new syntax. (Patch by Steven Sun)"
msgstr ""
":gh:`108469`: :func:`ast.unparse` 现在支持 Python 3.12 引入的新 :term:`f-string` "
"语法。请注意，为了简化新语法，:term:`f-string` 引号被重新选择。（由 Steven Sun 提交的补丁）"

#: ../NEWS:13866
