":gh:`108751`: Add :func:`copy.replace` function which allows to create a "
"modified copy of an object. It supports named tuples, dataclasses, and many "
"other objects."
msgstr ""
":gh:`108751`: 添加 :func:`copy.replace` 函数，允许创建对象的修改副本。它支持命名元组、数据类和许多其他对象。"

#: ../NEWS:13870
