":c:type:`!id_t` 的操作系统上）现在以与设置 ID 失败相同的方式失败。"

#: ../NEWS:13900
msgid ""
":gh:`64662`: Fix support for virtual tables in "
":meth:`sqlite3.Connection.iterdump`. Patch by Aviv Palivoda."
msgstr ""
":gh:`64662`: 修复 :meth:`sqlite3.Connection.iterdump` 中对虚拟表的支持。由 Aviv Palivoda"
" 提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13903
msgid ""
":gh:`108111`: Fix a regression introduced in :gh:`101251` for 3.12, "
