"文件的能力，该文件使得创建的环境被Git忽略。当通过CLI调用venv时，默认开启此功能。"

#: ../NEWS:13925
msgid ""
":gh:`105736`: Harmonized the pure Python version of "
":class:`~collections.OrderedDict` with the C version. Now, both versions set"
" up their internal state in ``__new__``.  Formerly, the pure Python version "
"did the set up in ``__init__``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105736`: 将纯Python版本的 :class:`~collections.OrderedDict` "
"与C版本进行了协调。现在，两个版本都在 ``__new__`` 中设置其内部状态。以前，纯Python版本是在 ``__init__`` 中进行设置的。"

#: ../NEWS:13930
msgid ""
":gh:`108083`: Fix bugs in the constructor of :mod:`sqlite3.Connection` and "
":meth:`sqlite3.Connection.close` where exceptions could be leaked. Patch by "
"Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":gh:`108083`: 修复了 :mod:`sqlite3.Connection` 构造器和 "
":meth:`sqlite3.Connection.close` 中的bug，这些bug可能导致异常泄露。修补由Erlend E. Aasland提供。"

#: ../NEWS:13934
msgid ""
":gh:`107932`: Fix ``dis`` module to properly report and display bytecode "
"that do not have source lines."
msgstr ":gh:`107932`: 修复 ``dis`` 模块，使其能正确报告和显示没有源代码行的字节码。"

#: ../NEWS:13937
msgid ""
":gh:`105539`: :mod:`sqlite3` now emits an :exc:`ResourceWarning` if a "
":class:`sqlite3.Connection` object is not :meth:`closed "
"<sqlite3.connection.close>` explicitly. Patch by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105539`: 现在，如果 :class:`sqlite3.Connection` 对象没有被显式地 :meth:`closed "
"<sqlite3.connection.close>`，:mod:`sqlite3` 会发出一个 "
":exc:`ResourceWarning`。修补由Erlend E. Aasland提供。"

#: ../NEWS:13941
msgid ""
":gh:`107995`: The ``__module__`` attribute on instances of "
":class:`functools.cached_property` is now set to the name of the module in "
"which the cached_property is defined, rather than \"functools\". This means "
"that doctests in ``cached_property`` docstrings are now properly collected "
"by the :mod:`doctest` module. Patch by Tyler Smart."
msgstr ""
":gh:`107995`: :class:`functools.cached_property` 实例的 ``__module__`` "
"属性现在被设置为定义cached_property的模块的名称，而不是\"functools\"。这意味着 ``cached_property`` "
"文档字符串中的doctest现在可以被 :mod:`doctest` 模块正确收集。修补由Tyler Smart提供。"

#: ../NEWS:13947
msgid ""
":gh:`107963`: Fix :func:`multiprocessing.set_forkserver_preload` to check "
"the given list of modules names. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":gh:`107963`: 修复 :func:`multiprocessing.set_forkserver_preload` "
"以检查给定的模块名称列表。修补由Donghee Na提供。"

#: ../NEWS:13950
msgid ""
":gh:`106242`: Fixes :func:`os.path.normpath` to handle embedded null "
"characters without truncating the path."
msgstr ":gh:`106242`: 修复 :func:`os.path.normpath` 以处理嵌入的空字符而不截断路径。"

#: ../NEWS:13953
msgid ""
":gh:`81555`: :mod:`xml.dom.minidom` now only quotes ``\"`` in attributes."
msgstr ":gh:`81555`: :mod:`xml.dom.minidom` 现在只在属性中引用 ``\"``。"

#: ../NEWS:13955
msgid ""
":gh:`50002`: :mod:`xml.dom.minidom` now preserves whitespaces in attributes."
msgstr ":gh:`50002`: :mod:`xml.dom.minidom` 现在保留属性中的空白字符。"

#: ../NEWS:13957
msgid ""
":gh:`93057`: Passing more than one positional argument to "
":func:`sqlite3.connect` and the :class:`sqlite3.Connection` constructor is "
"deprecated. The remaining parameters will become keyword-only in Python "
"3.15. Patch by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
