#: ../NEWS:14059
msgid ""
":gh:`105002`: Fix invalid result from :meth:`PurePath.relative_to` method "
"when attempting to walk a \"``..``\" segment in *other* with *walk_up* "
"enabled. A :exc:`ValueError` exception is now raised in this case."
msgstr ""
