msgstr ""
":gh:`106751`: 优化 :meth:`SelectSelector.select` 以处理多次迭代的情况。由 Donghee Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14073
msgid ""
":gh:`106751`: Optimize :meth:`!_PollLikeSelector.select` for many iteration "
"case."
msgstr ":gh:`106751`: 优化 :meth:`!_PollLikeSelector.select` 以处理多次迭代的情况。"

#: ../NEWS:14076
msgid ""
":gh:`106751`: Optimize :meth:`KqueueSelector.select` for many iteration "
"case. Patch By Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106751`: 优化 :meth:`KqueueSelector.select` 以处理多次迭代的情况。由 Donghee Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14079
