#: ../NEWS:14100
msgid ""
":gh:`106752`: Fixed several bugs in zipfile.Path, including: in "
":meth:`zipfile.Path.match`, Windows separators are no longer honored (and "
"never were meant to be); Fixed ``name``/``suffix``/``suffixes``/``stem`` "
