msgid ":gh:`105481`: Expose opcode metadata through :mod:`!_opcode`."
msgstr ":gh:`105481`: 通过 :mod:`!_opcode` 公开操作码元数据。"

#: ../NEWS:14114
msgid ""
":gh:`106670`: Add the new ``exceptions`` command to the Pdb debugger. It "
