#: ../NEWS:14133
msgid ""
":gh:`106584`: Fix exit code for ``unittest`` if all tests are skipped. Patch"
" by Egor Eliseev."
msgstr ":gh:`106584`: 如果所有测试都被跳过，修复 ``unittest`` 的退出代码。由Egor Eliseev提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14136
msgid ""
":gh:`106566`: Optimize ``(?!)`` (pattern which always fails) in regular "
"expressions."
msgstr ":gh:`106566`: 优化正则表达式中的 ``(?!)`` (总是失败的模式) 。"

#: ../NEWS:14139
msgid ""
":gh:`106554`: :mod:`selectors`: Reduce Selector overhead by using a "
