msgstr ""
":gh:`106554`: :mod:`selectors`: 通过使用 ``dict.get()`` 查找文件描述符来减少Selector的开销。"

#: ../NEWS:14142
msgid ""
":gh:`106558`: Remove ref cycle in callers of "
