"from scope in a ``finally`` block."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106558`: 通过在 ``finally`` 块中删除作用域中的 ``result``，移除 "
":func:`~multiprocessing.managers.convert_to_error` 调用者中的引用循环。"

#: ../NEWS:14146
msgid ""
":gh:`100502`: Add :attr:`pathlib.PurePath.pathmod` class attribute that "
"stores the implementation of :mod:`os.path` used for low-level path "
"operations: either ``posixpath`` or ``ntpath``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100502`: 添加 :attr:`pathlib.PurePath.pathmod` 类属性，该属性存储用于低级路径操作的 "
":mod:`os.path` 实现：``posixpath`` 或 ``ntpath``。"

#: ../NEWS:14150
msgid ""
":gh:`106527`: Reduce overhead to add and remove :mod:`asyncio` readers and "
"writers."
msgstr ":gh:`106527`: 减少添加和移除 :mod:`asyncio` 读写器的开销。"

#: ../NEWS:14153
msgid ""
":gh:`106524`: Fix crash in :func:`!_sre.template` with templates containing "
