#: ../NEWS:14161
msgid ""
":gh:`106052`: :mod:`re` module: fix the matching of possessive quantifiers "
"in the case of a subpattern containing backtracking."
msgstr ":gh:`106052`: :mod:`re` 模块：在子模式包含回溯的情况下修复贪婪量词的匹配问题。"

#: ../NEWS:14164
msgid ""
":gh:`106510`: Improve debug output for atomic groups in regular expressions."
msgstr ":gh:`106510`: 改进正则表达式中原子组的调试输出。"

#: ../NEWS:14166
msgid ""
":gh:`106503`: Fix ref cycle in :class:`!asyncio._SelectorSocketTransport` by"
