#: ../NEWS:14169
msgid ":gh:`105497`: Fix flag mask inversion when unnamed flags exist."
msgstr ":gh:`105497`: 修复存在未命名标志时的标志掩码反转问题。"

#: ../NEWS:14171
msgid ""
":gh:`90876`: Prevent :mod:`multiprocessing.spawn` from failing to *import* "
"in environments where ``sys.executable`` is ``None``.  This regressed in "
"3.11 with the addition of support for path-like objects in multiprocessing."
msgstr ""
":gh:`90876`: 防止 :mod:`multiprocessing.spawn` 在 ``sys.executable`` 为 ``None``"
" 的环境中 *导入* 失败。这个问题在3.11版本中随着对多处理中路径类对象的支持而出现倒退。"

#: ../NEWS:14175
msgid ""
":gh:`106403`: Instances of :class:`typing.TypeVar`, "
":class:`typing.ParamSpec`, :class:`typing.ParamSpecArgs`, "
":class:`typing.ParamSpecKwargs`, and :class:`typing.TypeVarTuple` once again"
" support weak references, fixing a regression introduced in Python 3.12.0 "
"beta 1. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106403`: "
":class:`typing.TypeVar`、:class:`typing.ParamSpec`、:class:`typing.ParamSpecArgs`、:class:`typing.ParamSpecKwargs`"
" 和 :class:`typing.TypeVarTuple` 的实例再次支持弱引用，修复了Python 3.12.0 beta "
"1中引入的倒退。由Jelle Zijlstra提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14181
msgid ""
":gh:`89812`: Add private ``pathlib._PathBase`` class, which provides "
"experimental support for virtual filesystems, and may be made public in a "
"future version of Python."
msgstr ""
":gh:`89812`: 添加私有的 ``pathlib._PathBase`` "
"类，该类提供了对虚拟文件系统的实验性支持，并可能在未来的Python版本中公开。"

#: ../NEWS:14185
msgid ""
":gh:`106292`: Check for an instance-dict cached value in the :meth:`__get__`"
" method of :func:`functools.cached_property`. This better matches the "
"pre-3.12 behavior and improves compatibility for users subclassing "
":func:`functools.cached_property` and adding a :meth:`__set__` method."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106292`: 在 :func:`functools.cached_property` 的 :meth:`__get__` "
"方法中检查实例字典缓存值。这更好地匹配了3.12之前的行为，并提高了用户子类化 :func:`functools.cached_property` "
"并添加 :meth:`__set__` 方法的兼容性。"

#: ../NEWS:14190
msgid ""
":gh:`106350`: Detect possible memory allocation failure in the libtommath "
"function :c:func:`mp_init` used by the ``_tkinter`` module."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106350`: 检测 ``_tkinter`` 模块使用的 libtommath 函数 :c:func:`mp_init` "
"中可能的内存分配失败。"

#: ../NEWS:14193
msgid ""
":gh:`106330`: Fix incorrect matching of empty paths in "
":meth:`pathlib.PurePath.match`. This bug was introduced in Python 3.12.0 "
"beta 1."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106330`: 修复了在 :meth:`pathlib.PurePath.match` 中空路径的错误匹配问题。这个 bug 是在 "
"Python 3.12.0 beta 1 中引入的。"

#: ../NEWS:14197
msgid ""
":gh:`106309`: Deprecate :func:`typing.no_type_check_decorator`. No major "
"type checker ever added support for this decorator. Patch by Alex Waygood."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106309`: 弃用 "
":func:`typing.no_type_check_decorator`。没有任何主要类型检查器曾经添加对这个装饰器的支持。由 Alex "
"Waygood 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14200
msgid ""
":gh:`102541`: Make :func:`pydoc.doc` catch bad module :exc:`ImportError` "
"when output stream is not ``None``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`102541`: 当输出流不为 ``None`` 时，使 :func:`pydoc.doc` 捕获错误的模块 "
":exc:`ImportError`。"

#: ../NEWS:14203
msgid ""
":gh:`106263`: Fix crash when calling ``repr`` with a manually constructed "
"SignalDict object. Patch by Charlie Zhao."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106263`: 修复了在调用 ``repr`` 时手动构造的 SignalDict 对象导致的崩溃。由 Charlie Zhao 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14206
msgid ""
":gh:`106236`: Replace ``assert`` statements with ``raise RuntimeError`` in "
":mod:`threading`, so that ``_DummyThread`` cannot be joined even with "
"``-OO``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106236`: 在 :mod:`threading` 中用 ``raise RuntimeError`` 替换 ``assert`` "
"语句，这样即使使用 ``-OO`` 也无法加入 ``_DummyThread``。"

#: ../NEWS:14210
msgid ""
":gh:`106238`: Fix rare concurrency bug in lock acquisition by the logging "
"package."
msgstr ":gh:`106238`: 修复了日志包在获取锁时的罕见并发错误。"

#: ../NEWS:14213
msgid ""
":gh:`106152`: Added PY_THROW event hook for :mod:`cProfile` for generators"
msgstr ":gh:`106152`: 为 :mod:`cProfile` 添加了 PY_THROW 事件钩子用于生成器。"

#: ../NEWS:14215
msgid ""
":gh:`106075`: Added ``asyncio.taskgroups.__all__`` to ``asyncio.__all__`` "
"for export in star imports."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106075`: 将 ``asyncio.taskgroups.__all__`` 添加到 ``asyncio.__all__`` "
"以便在星号导入中导出。"

#: ../NEWS:14218
msgid ""
":gh:`104527`: Zipapp will now skip over appending an archive to itself."
msgstr ":gh:`104527`: Zipapp 现在将跳过向自己追加存档的操作。"

#: ../NEWS:14220
msgid ""
":gh:`106046`: Improve the error message from :func:`os.fspath` if called on "
"an object where ``__fspath__`` is set to ``None``. Patch by Alex Waygood."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106046`: 改进了 :func:`os.fspath` 的错误消息，当调用对象的 ``__fspath__`` 设置为 ``None``"
" 时。由 Alex Waygood 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14223
msgid ""
":gh:`105987`: Fix crash due to improper reference counting in :mod:`asyncio`"
" eager task factory internal routines."
msgstr ":gh:`105987`: 修复了由于 :mod:`asyncio` 急切任务工厂内部例程中引用计数不当导致的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:14226
msgid ""
":gh:`105974`: Fix bug where a :class:`typing.Protocol` class that had one or"
" more non-callable members would raise :exc:`TypeError` when "
":func:`issubclass` was called against it, even if it defined a custom "
"``__subclasshook__`` method. The behaviour in Python 3.11 and lower -- which"
" has now been restored -- was not to raise :exc:`TypeError` in these "
"situations if a custom ``__subclasshook__`` method was defined. Patch by "
"Alex Waygood."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105974`: 修复了一个 bug，其中具有一个或多个不可调用成员的 :class:`typing.Protocol` 类在调用 "
":func:`issubclass` 时会引发 :exc:`TypeError`，即使它定义了一个自定义的 ``__subclasshook__`` "
"方法。Python 3.11 及更低版本中的行为——现在已恢复——是在这些情况下如果定义了自定义 ``__subclasshook__`` 方法则不引发"
" :exc:`TypeError`。补丁由 Alex Waygood 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:14234
msgid ":gh:`96145`: Reverted addition of ``json.AttrDict``."
msgstr ":gh:`96145`: 撤回了 ``json.AttrDict`` 的添加。"

#: ../NEWS:14236
msgid ""
":gh:`89812`: Add :exc:`pathlib.UnsupportedOperation`, which is raised "
"instead of :exc:`NotImplementedError` when a path operation isn't supported."
msgstr ""
":gh:`89812`: 添加了 :exc:`pathlib.UnsupportedOperation`，当路径操作不被支持时，会抛出此异常而不是 "
":exc:`NotImplementedError`。"

#: ../NEWS:14239
msgid ""
":gh:`105808`: Fix a regression introduced in :gh:`101251` for 3.12, causing "
":meth:`gzip.GzipFile.flush` to not flush the compressor (nor pass along the "
"``zip_mode`` argument)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105808`: 修复了在 :gh:`101251` 中引入的 3.12 版本中的回归问题，该问题导致 "
":meth:`gzip.GzipFile.flush` 不刷新压缩器（也不传递 ``zip_mode`` 参数）。"

#: ../NEWS:14243
msgid ""
":gh:`105481`: :func:`~dis.stack_effect` no longer raises an exception if an "
"``oparg`` is provided for an ``opcode`` that doesn't use its arg, or when it"
" is not provided for an ``opcode`` that does use it. In the latter case, the"
" stack effect is returned for ``oparg=0``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105481`: :func:`~dis.stack_effect` 不再会为不使用的 ``oparg`` 的 ``opcode`` 提供 "
"``oparg`` 或为使用它的 ``opcode`` 不提供 ``oparg`` 时引发异常。在后一种情况下，返回 ``oparg=0`` "
"的堆栈效果。"

#: ../NEWS:14248
msgid ""
":gh:`104799`: Enable :func:`ast.unparse` to unparse function and class "
"definitions created without the new ``type_params`` field from :pep:`695`. "
"Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`104799`: 使 :func:`ast.unparse` 能够反解析没有来自 :pep:`695` 的新 ``type_params`` "
"字段创建的函数和类定义。由 Jelle Zijlstra 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14252
msgid ""
":gh:`105793`: Add *follow_symlinks* keyword-only argument to "
":meth:`pathlib.Path.is_dir` and :meth:`~pathlib.Path.is_file`, defaulting to"
" ``True``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105793`: 向 :meth:`pathlib.Path.is_dir` 和 :meth:`~pathlib.Path.is_file` "
"添加了仅关键字参数 *follow_symlinks*，默认为 ``True``。"

#: ../NEWS:14256
msgid ""
":gh:`105570`: Deprecate two methods of creating :class:`typing.TypedDict` "
"classes with 0 fields using the functional syntax: ``TD = "
"TypedDict(\"TD\")`` and ``TD = TypedDict(\"TD\", None)``. Both will be "
"disallowed in Python 3.15. To create a ``TypedDict`` class with 0 fields, "
"either use ``class TD(TypedDict): pass`` or ``TD = TypedDict(\"TD\", {})``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105570`: 弃用使用功能语法创建具有 0 个字段的 :class:`typing.TypedDict` 类的两种方法：``TD = "
"TypedDict(\"TD\")`` 和 ``TD = TypedDict(\"TD\", None)``。这两种方法都将在 Python 3.15 "
"中被禁止。要创建具有 0 个字段的 ``TypedDict`` 类，请使用 ``class TD(TypedDict): pass`` 或 ``TD ="
" TypedDict(\"TD\", {})``。"

#: ../NEWS:14262
msgid ":gh:`105745`: Fix ``webbrowser.Konqueror.open`` method."
msgstr ":gh:`105745`: 修复 ``webbrowser.Konqueror.open`` 方法。"

#: ../NEWS:14264
msgid ""
":gh:`105733`: :mod:`ctypes`: Deprecate undocumented "
":func:`!ctypes.SetPointerType` and :func:`!ctypes.ARRAY` functions. Patch by"
" Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105733`: :mod:`ctypes`: 弃用未记录的 :func:`!ctypes.SetPointerType` 和 "
":func:`!ctypes.ARRAY` 函数。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14268
msgid ""
":gh:`105687`: Remove deprecated ``re.template``, ``re.T``, ``re.TEMPLATE``, "
"``sre_constans.SRE_FLAG_TEMPLATE``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105687`: 移除已弃用的 "
