#: ../NEWS:14315
msgid ""
":gh:`105566`: Deprecate creating a :class:`typing.NamedTuple` class using "
"keyword arguments to denote the fields (``NT = NamedTuple(\"NT\", x=int, "
"y=str)``). This will be disallowed in Python 3.15. Use the class-based "
"syntax or the functional syntax instead."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105566`: 弃用使用关键字参数表示字段来创建 :class:`typing.NamedTuple` 类（``NT = "
"NamedTuple(\"NT\", x=int, y=str)``）。在 Python 3.15 "
"中将不再允许此操作。请使用基于类的语法或功能性语法代替。"

#: ../NEWS:14320
msgid ""
"Two methods of creating ``NamedTuple`` classes with 0 fields using the "
"functional syntax are also deprecated, and will be disallowed in Python "
"3.15: ``NT = NamedTuple(\"NT\")`` and ``NT = NamedTuple(\"NT\", None)``. To "
"create a ``NamedTuple`` class with 0 fields, either use ``class "
"NT(NamedTuple): pass`` or ``NT = NamedTuple(\"NT\", [])``."
msgstr ""
"使用功能性语法创建带有 0 个字段的 ``NamedTuple`` 类的两种方法也被弃用，并将在 Python 3.15 中不再允许：``NT = "
"NamedTuple(\"NT\")`` 和 ``NT = NamedTuple(\"NT\", None)``。要创建带有 0 个字段的 "
"``NamedTuple`` 类，请使用 ``class NT(NamedTuple): pass`` 或 ``NT = "
"NamedTuple(\"NT\", [])``。"

