"future libtommath by replacing usage of deprecated functions "
":c:func:`mp_to_unsigned_bin_n` and :c:func:`mp_unsigned_bin_size` when "
"necessary."
msgstr ""
":gh:`104399`: 准备 ``_tkinter`` 模块以通过必要时替换弃用的函数 :c:func:`mp_to_unsigned_bin_n`"
" 和 :c:func:`mp_unsigned_bin_size` 来构建与Tcl 9.0和未来的libtommath。"

