#: ../NEWS:15138
msgid ""
":gh:`107467`: The Argument Clinic command-line tool now prints to stderr "
"instead of stdout on failure."
msgstr ":gh:`107467`: Argument Clinic命令行工具现在在失败时向stderr而非stdout打印信息。"

#: ../NEWS:15141
msgid ""
":gh:`106970`: Fix bugs in the Argument Clinic ``destination <name> clear`` "
"command; the destination buffers would never be cleared, and the "
"``destination`` directive parser would simply continue to the fault handler "
"after processing the command. Patch by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106970`: 修复Argument Clinic中 ``destination <name> clear`` "
"命令的bug；目的地缓冲区永远不会被清除，且 ``destination`` 指令解析器在处理命令后会直接继续到错误处理器。由Erlend E. "
"Aasland提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:15146
msgid ""
":gh:`106706`: Change bytecode syntax for families to remove redundant name "
"matching pseudo syntax."
msgstr ":gh:`106706`: 更改字节码语法以移除家族中冗余的名称匹配伪语法。"

#: ../NEWS:15149
msgid ""
":gh:`106359`: Argument Clinic now explicitly forbids \"kwarg splats\" in "
"function calls used as annotations."
msgstr ":gh:`106359`: Argument Clinic 现在明确禁止在用作注解的函数调用中使用 \"kwarg splats\"。"

#: ../NEWS:15152
msgid ""
":gh:`103186`: ``freeze`` now fetches ``CONFIG_ARGS`` from the original "
"CPython instance the Makefile uses to call utility scripts. Patch by Ijtaba "
"Hussain."
msgstr ""
":gh:`103186`: ``freeze`` 现在从原始 CPython 实例获取 ``CONFIG_ARGS``，Makefile "
"使用该实例调用实用脚本。由 Ijtaba Hussain 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:15156
msgid ""
":gh:`95065`: It is now possible to deprecate passing parameters positionally"
" with Argument Clinic, using the new ``* [from X.Y]`` syntax. (To be read as"
" *\"keyword-only from Python version X.Y\"*.) See `documentation in the "
"Python Developer's Guide <https://devguide.python.org/development-"
"tools/clinic/#clinic-howto-deprecate-positional>`__ for more information. "
"Patch by Erlend E. Aasland with help from Alex Waygood, Nikita Sobolev, and "
"Serhiy Storchaka."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95065`: 现在可以使用 Argument Clinic 弃用以位置方式传递参数，使用新的 ``* [from X.Y]`` "
"语法。（解读为 *\"从 Python 版本 X.Y 开始仅限关键字\"*。）更多信息请参阅 `Python 开发者指南中的文档 "
"<https://devguide.python.org/development-tools/clinic/#clinic-howto-"
"deprecate-positional>`__。由 Erlend E. Aasland 提供补丁，Alex Waygood、Nikita "
"Sobolev 和 Serhiy Storchaka 协助。"

#: ../NEWS:15167
msgid ""
":gh:`85283`: If the :c:macro:`Py_LIMITED_API` macro is defined, "
":c:macro:`!Py_BUILD_CORE`, :c:macro:`!Py_BUILD_CORE_BUILTIN` and "
":c:macro:`!Py_BUILD_CORE_MODULE` macros are now undefined by ``<Python.h>``."
" Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`85283`: 如果定义了 :c:macro:`Py_LIMITED_API` 宏，``<Python.h>`` 现在会取消定义 "
":c:macro:`!Py_BUILD_CORE`、:c:macro:`!Py_BUILD_CORE_BUILTIN` 和 "
":c:macro:`!Py_BUILD_CORE_MODULE` 宏。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:15172
msgid ""
":gh:`110289`: Add :c:func:`PyUnicode_EqualToUTF8AndSize` and "
":c:func:`PyUnicode_EqualToUTF8` functions."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110289`: 添加 :c:func:`PyUnicode_EqualToUTF8AndSize` 和 "
":c:func:`PyUnicode_EqualToUTF8` 函数。"

#: ../NEWS:15175
msgid ""
":gh:`110235`: Raise :exc:`TypeError` for duplicate/unknown fields in "
"``PyStructSequence`` constructor. Patched by Xuehai Pan."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110235`: 在 ``PyStructSequence`` 构造函数中对重复/未知字段抛出 :exc:`TypeError`。补丁由 "
"Xuehai Pan 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:15178
msgid ""
":gh:`110014`: Remove undocumented ``PY_TIMEOUT_MAX`` constant from the "
"limited C API. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110014`: 从未记录的有限 C API 中移除 ``PY_TIMEOUT_MAX`` 常量。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:15181
msgid ""
":gh:`109521`: :c:func:`PyImport_GetImporter` now sets RuntimeError if it "
"fails to get :data:`sys.path_hooks` or :data:`sys.path_importer_cache` or "
"they are not list and dict correspondingly. Previously it could return NULL "
"without setting error in obscure cases, crash or raise SystemError if these "
"attributes have wrong type."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109521`: :c:func:`PyImport_GetImporter` 现在在无法获取 :data:`sys.path_hooks` "
"或 :data:`sys.path_importer_cache`，或者它们不是对应的列表和字典时设置 "
"RuntimeError。以前在模糊的情况下可能返回 NULL 而不设置错误，如果这些属性类型错误，可能崩溃或抛出 SystemError。"

#: ../NEWS:15187
msgid ""
":gh:`108724`: Add :c:type:`PyMutex` internal-only lightweight locking API."
msgstr ":gh:`108724`: 添加 :c:type:`PyMutex` 仅供内部使用的轻量级锁定 API。"

#: ../NEWS:15189
msgid ""
":gh:`85283`: Add :c:func:`PySys_AuditTuple` function: similar to "
":c:func:`PySys_Audit`, but pass event arguments as a Python :class:`tuple` "
"object.  Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`85283`: 添加 :c:func:`PySys_AuditTuple` 函数：类似于 "
":c:func:`PySys_Audit`，但将事件参数作为 Python :class:`tuple` 对象传递。由 Victor Stinner "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:15193
msgid ""
":gh:`108867`: Add :c:func:`PyThreadState_GetUnchecked()` function: similar "
"to :c:func:`PyThreadState_Get()`, but don't kill the process with a fatal "
"error if it is NULL. The caller is responsible to check if the result is "
"NULL. Previously, the function was private and known as "
"``_PyThreadState_UncheckedGet()``. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`108867`: 添加 :c:func:`PyThreadState_GetUnchecked()` 函数：类似于 "
":c:func:`PyThreadState_Get()`，但如果它为 NULL 不会以致命错误终止进程。调用者需负责检查结果是否为 "
"NULL。此前，该函数为私有函数，称为 ``_PyThreadState_UncheckedGet()``。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:15199
msgid ""
":gh:`108765`: ``Python.h`` no longer includes the ``<ctype.h>`` standard "
"header file. If needed, it should now be included explicitly. For example, "
"it provides ``isalpha()`` and ``tolower()`` functions which are locale "
"dependent. Python provides locale independent functions, like "
":c:func:`!Py_ISALPHA` and :c:func:`!Py_TOLOWER`. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`108765`: ``Python.h`` 不再包含 ``<ctype.h>`` 标准头文件。如果需要，现在应明确包含它。例如，它提供了 "
"``isalpha()`` 和 ``tolower()`` 函数，这些函数依赖于区域设置。Python 提供了不依赖于区域设置的函数，如 "
":c:func:`!Py_ISALPHA` 和 :c:func:`!Py_TOLOWER`。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:15205
msgid ""
":gh:`108765`: ``Python.h`` no longer includes the ``<unistd.h>`` standard "
"header file. If needed, it should now be included explicitly. For example, "
"it provides the functions: ``close()``, ``getpagesize()``, ``getpid()`` and "
"``sysconf()``. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`108765`: ``Python.h`` 不再包含 ``<unistd.h>`` "
"标准头文件。如果需要，现在应明确包含它。例如，它提供了函数：``close()``、``getpagesize()``、``getpid()`` 和 "
"``sysconf()``。补丁由 Victor Stinner 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:15210
msgid ""
":gh:`108765`: ``Python.h`` no longer includes the ``<ieeefp.h>`` standard "
"header. It was included for the ``finite()`` function which is now provided "
"by the ``<math.h>`` header. It should now be included explicitly if needed. "
"Remove also the ``HAVE_IEEEFP_H`` macro. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`108765`: ``Python.h`` 不再包含 ``<ieeefp.h>`` 标准头文件。它之前被包含用于 ``finite()`` "
"函数，现在该函数由 ``<math.h>`` 头文件提供。如果需要，现在应明确包含它。同时移除 ``HAVE_IEEEFP_H`` 宏。由 Victor"
" Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:15216
msgid ""
":gh:`108765`: ``Python.h`` no longer includes these standard header files: "
"``<time.h>``, ``<sys/select.h>`` and ``<sys/time.h>``. If needed, they "
"should now be included explicitly. For example, ``<time.h>`` provides the "
"``clock()`` and ``gmtime()`` functions, ``<sys/select.h>`` provides the "
"``select()`` function, and ``<sys/time.h>`` provides the ``futimes()``, "
"``gettimeofday()`` and ``setitimer()`` functions. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`108765`: ``Python.h`` 不再包含这些标准头文件：``<time.h>``、``<sys/select.h>`` 和 "
"``<sys/time.h>``。如果需要，现在应明确包含它们。例如，``<time.h>`` 提供了 ``clock()`` 和 "
"``gmtime()`` 函数，``<sys/select.h>`` 提供了 ``select()`` 函数，``<sys/time.h>`` 提供了 "
"``futimes()``、``gettimeofday()`` 和 ``setitimer()`` 函数。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:15223
msgid ""
":gh:`108511`: Add functions :c:func:`PyObject_HasAttrWithError`, "
":c:func:`PyObject_HasAttrStringWithError`, "
":c:func:`PyMapping_HasKeyWithError` and "
":c:func:`PyMapping_HasKeyStringWithError`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`108511`: 添加函数 "
":c:func:`PyObject_HasAttrWithError`、:c:func:`PyObject_HasAttrStringWithError`、:c:func:`PyMapping_HasKeyWithError`"
" 和 :c:func:`PyMapping_HasKeyStringWithError`。"

#: ../NEWS:15228
msgid ""
":gh:`107073`: Add :c:func:`PyObject_VisitManagedDict` and "
":c:func:`PyObject_ClearManagedDict` functions which must be called by the "
"traverse and clear functions of a type using "
":c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_MANAGED_DICT` flag. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`107073`: 添加 :c:func:`PyObject_VisitManagedDict` 和 "
":c:func:`PyObject_ClearManagedDict` 函数，这些函数必须由使用 "
":c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_MANAGED_DICT` 标志的类型的遍历和清除函数调用。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:15233
msgid ""
":gh:`108634`: Python built with :file:`configure` :option:`--with-trace-"
"refs` (tracing references) now supports the :ref:`Limited API <limited-c-"
"api>`. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`108634`: 使用 :file:`configure` :option:`--with-trace-refs` (跟踪引用) 构建的 "
"Python 现在支持 :ref:`Limited API <limited-c-api>`。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:15237
msgid ""
":gh:`108014`: Add :c:func:`PyLong_AsInt` function: similar to "
":c:func:`PyLong_AsLong`, but store the result in a C :c:expr:`int` instead "
"of a C :c:expr:`long`. Previously, it was known as the private function "
":c:func:`!_PyLong_AsInt` (with an underscore prefix). Patch by Victor "
"Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`108014`: 添加 :c:func:`PyLong_AsInt` 函数：类似于 "
":c:func:`PyLong_AsLong`，但将结果存储在 C 的 :c:expr:`int` 而不是 C 的 :c:expr:`long` "
"中。以前，它被称为私有函数 :c:func:`!_PyLong_AsInt` (带有下划线前缀) 。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:15243
msgid ""
":gh:`108314`: Add :c:func:`PyDict_ContainsString` function: same as "
":c:func:`PyDict_Contains`, but *key* is specified as a :c:expr:`const char*`"
" UTF-8 encoded bytes string, rather than a :c:expr:`PyObject*`. Patch by "
"Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`108314`: 添加 :c:func:`PyDict_ContainsString` 函数：与 "
":c:func:`PyDict_Contains` 相同，但 *key* 指定为 :c:expr:`const char*` UTF-8 "
"编码的字节字符串，而不是 :c:expr:`PyObject*`。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:15248
msgid ""
":gh:`108337`: Add atomic operations on additional data types in pyatomic.h."
msgstr ":gh:`108337`: 在 pyatomic.h 中添加对额外数据类型的原子操作。"

#: ../NEWS:15250
msgid ""
":gh:`108014`: Add :c:func:`Py_IsFinalizing` function: check if the main "
"Python interpreter is :term:`shutting down <interpreter shutdown>`. Patch by"
" Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`108014`: 添加 :c:func:`Py_IsFinalizing` 函数：检查主 Python 解释器是否正在 :term:`关闭 "
"<interpreter shutdown>`。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:15254
msgid ""
":gh:`107916`: C API functions :c:func:`PyErr_SetFromErrnoWithFilename`, "
":c:func:`PyErr_SetExcFromWindowsErrWithFilename` and "
":c:func:`PyErr_SetFromWindowsErrWithFilename` save now the error code before"
" calling :c:func:`PyUnicode_DecodeFSDefault`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`107916`: C API 函数 :c:func:`PyErr_SetFromErrnoWithFilename`, "
":c:func:`PyErr_SetExcFromWindowsErrWithFilename` 和 "
":c:func:`PyErr_SetFromWindowsErrWithFilename` 现在在调用 "
":c:func:`PyUnicode_DecodeFSDefault` 之前保存错误代码。"

#: ../NEWS:15259
msgid ""
":gh:`107915`: Such C API functions as ``PyErr_SetString()``, "
"``PyErr_Format()``, ``PyErr_SetFromErrnoWithFilename()`` and many others no "
"longer crash or ignore errors if it failed to format the error message or "
"decode the filename. Instead, they keep a corresponding error."
msgstr ""
":gh:`107915`: 诸如 ``PyErr_SetString()``, ``PyErr_Format()``, "
"``PyErr_SetFromErrnoWithFilename()`` 等 C API "
"函数，如果格式化错误消息或解码文件名失败，将不再崩溃或忽略错误。相反，它们会保留相应的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:15264
msgid ""
":gh:`107810`: Improve :exc:`DeprecationWarning` for uses of "
":c:type:`PyType_Spec` with metaclasses that have custom ``tp_new``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`107810`: 改进 :exc:`DeprecationWarning` 对于与具有自定义 ``tp_new`` 的元类一起使用的 "
":c:type:`PyType_Spec` 的使用。"

#: ../NEWS:15267
msgid ""
":gh:`107249`: Implement the :c:macro:`Py_UNUSED` macro for Windows MSVC "
"compiler. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`107249`: 为 Windows MSVC 编译器实现 :c:macro:`Py_UNUSED` 宏。补丁由 Victor Stinner"
" 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:15270
msgid ""
":gh:`107226`: :c:func:`PyModule_AddObjectRef` is now only available in the "
"limited API version 3.10 or later."
msgstr ""
":gh:`107226`: :c:func:`PyModule_AddObjectRef` 现在仅在有限 API 版本 3.10 或更高版本中可用。"

#: ../NEWS:15273
msgid ""
":gh:`106320`: Remove private ``_PyUnicode_AsString()`` alias to "
":c:func:`PyUnicode_AsUTF8`. It was kept for backward compatibility with "
"Python 3.0 - 3.2. The :c:func:`PyUnicode_AsUTF8` is available since Python "
"3.3. The :c:func:`PyUnicode_AsUTF8String` function can be used to keep "
"compatibility with Python 3.2 and older. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106320`: 移除了私有 ``_PyUnicode_AsString()`` 别名，该别名指向 "
":c:func:`PyUnicode_AsUTF8`。保留该别名是为了向后兼容 Python 3.0 - "
"3.2。:c:func:`PyUnicode_AsUTF8` 自 Python 3.3 "
"起可用。:c:func:`PyUnicode_AsUTF8String` 函数可用于保持与 Python 3.2 及更早版本的兼容性。由 Victor "
"Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:15279
msgid ""
":gh:`106572`: Convert :c:func:`PyObject_DelAttr` and "
":c:func:`PyObject_DelAttrString` macros to functions. Patch by Victor "
"Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106572`: 将 :c:func:`PyObject_DelAttr` 和 "
":c:func:`PyObject_DelAttrString` 宏转换为函数。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:15283
msgid ":gh:`106307`: Add :c:func:`PyMapping_GetOptionalItem` function."
msgstr ":gh:`106307`: 添加 :c:func:`PyMapping_GetOptionalItem` 函数。"

#: ../NEWS:15285
msgid ""
":gh:`106521`: Add :c:func:`PyObject_GetOptionalAttr` and "
":c:func:`PyObject_GetOptionalAttrString` functions."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106521`: 添加 :c:func:`PyObject_GetOptionalAttr` 和 "
":c:func:`PyObject_GetOptionalAttrString` 函数。"

#: ../NEWS:15288
msgid ""
":gh:`106320`: Remove ``_PyInterpreterState_Get()`` alias to "
":c:func:`PyInterpreterState_Get()` which was kept for backward compatibility"
" with Python 3.8. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106320`: 移除了 ``_PyInterpreterState_Get()`` 别名，该别名指向 "
":c:func:`PyInterpreterState_Get()`，保留该别名是为了向后兼容 Python 3.8。由 Victor Stinner "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:15292
msgid ""
":gh:`106316`: Remove ``cpython/pytime.h`` header file: it only contained "
"private functions. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106316`: 移除了 ``cpython/pytime.h`` 头文件：该文件仅包含私有函数。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:15295
msgid ""
":gh:`106023`: Remove private ``_PyObject_FastCall()`` function: use "
"``PyObject_Vectorcall()`` which is available since Python 3.8 (:pep:`590`). "
"Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106023`: 移除了私有 ``_PyObject_FastCall()`` 函数：使用 "
"``PyObject_Vectorcall()``，该函数自 Python 3.8 起可用 (:pep:`590`)。由 Victor Stinner "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:15299
msgid ""
":gh:`106168`: If Python is built in :ref:`debug mode <debug-build>` or "
":option:`with assertions <--with-assertions>`, :c:func:`PyTuple_SET_ITEM` "
"and :c:func:`PyList_SET_ITEM` now check the index argument with an "
"assertion. If the assertion fails, make sure that the size is set before. "
"Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106168`: 如果 Python 是在 :ref:`debug mode <debug-build>` 或 :option:`with "
"assertions <--with-assertions>` 模式下构建的，:c:func:`PyTuple_SET_ITEM` 和 "
":c:func:`PyList_SET_ITEM` 现在会通过断言检查索引参数。如果断言失败，确保在此之前设置了大小。由 Victor Stinner "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:15305
msgid ""
":gh:`106084`: Remove the old aliases to functions calling functions which "
"were kept for backward compatibility with Python 3.8 provisional API:"
msgstr ":gh:`106084`: 移除了旧别名，这些别名指向调用函数的函数，保留这些别名是为了向后兼容 Python 3.8 临时 API："

#: ../NEWS:15308
msgid "``_PyObject_CallMethodNoArgs()``: use ``PyObject_CallMethodNoArgs()``"
msgstr "``_PyObject_CallMethodNoArgs()``: 使用 ``PyObject_CallMethodNoArgs()``"

#: ../NEWS:15309
msgid "``_PyObject_CallMethodOneArg()``: use ``PyObject_CallMethodOneArg()``"
msgstr "``_PyObject_CallMethodOneArg()``: 使用 ``PyObject_CallMethodOneArg()``"

#: ../NEWS:15310
msgid "``_PyObject_CallOneArg()``: use ``PyObject_CallOneArg()``"
msgstr "``_PyObject_CallOneArg()``: 使用 ``PyObject_CallOneArg()``"

#: ../NEWS:15311
msgid "``_PyObject_FastCallDict()``: use ``PyObject_VectorcallDict()``"
msgstr "``_PyObject_FastCallDict()``: 使用 ``PyObject_VectorcallDict()``"

#: ../NEWS:15312
msgid "``_PyObject_Vectorcall()``: use ``PyObject_Vectorcall()``"
msgstr "``_PyObject_Vectorcall()``: 使用 ``PyObject_Vectorcall()``"

#: ../NEWS:15313
msgid "``_PyObject_VectorcallMethod()``: use ``PyObject_VectorcallMethod()``"
msgstr "``_PyObject_VectorcallMethod()``: 使用 ``PyObject_VectorcallMethod()``"

#: ../NEWS:15314
msgid "``_PyVectorcall_Function()``: use ``PyVectorcall_Function()``"
msgstr "``_PyVectorcall_Function()``: 使用 ``PyVectorcall_Function()``"

#: ../NEWS:15316
msgid ""
"Just remove the underscore prefix to update your code. Patch by Victor "
"Stinner."
msgstr "只需移除下划线前缀即可更新您的代码。由Victor Stinner提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:15319
msgid ""
":gh:`106004`: Adds :c:func:`PyDict_GetItemRef` and "
":c:func:`PyDict_GetItemStringRef` functions: similar to "
":c:func:`PyDict_GetItemWithError` but returning a :term:`strong reference` "
"instead of a :term:`borrowed reference`. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106004`: 添加 :c:func:`PyDict_GetItemRef` 和 "
":c:func:`PyDict_GetItemStringRef` 函数：类似于 "
":c:func:`PyDict_GetItemWithError`，但返回一个 :term:`strong reference` 而不是 "
":term:`borrowed reference`。 由 Victor Stinner 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:15324
msgid ""
":gh:`105927`: Deprecate the :c:func:`PyWeakref_GetObject` and "
":c:func:`PyWeakref_GET_OBJECT` functions: use the new "
":c:func:`PyWeakref_GetRef` function instead. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105927`: 弃用 :c:func:`PyWeakref_GetObject` 和 "
":c:func:`PyWeakref_GET_OBJECT` 函数：改用新的 :c:func:`PyWeakref_GetRef` 函数。由Victor"
" Stinner提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:15328
msgid ""
":gh:`105927`: Add :c:func:`PyWeakref_GetRef` function: similar to "
":c:func:`PyWeakref_GetObject` but returns a :term:`strong reference`, or "
"``NULL`` if the referent is no longer live. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105927`: 添加 :c:func:`PyWeakref_GetRef` 函数：类似于 "
":c:func:`PyWeakref_GetObject`，但返回一个 :term:`strong reference`，或者如果引用对象不再存活则返回"
" ``NULL``。 由 Victor Stinner 提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:15332
msgid ""
":gh:`105922`: Add :c:func:`PyImport_AddModuleRef`: similar to "
":c:func:`PyImport_AddModule`, but return a :term:`strong reference` instead "
"of a :term:`borrowed reference`. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105922`: 添加 :c:func:`PyImport_AddModuleRef`：类似于 "
":c:func:`PyImport_AddModule`，但返回一个 :term:`strong reference` 而不是 "
":term:`borrowed reference`。 由 Victor Stinner 提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:15336
msgid ""
":gh:`105227`: The new :c:func:`PyType_GetDict` provides the dictionary for "
"the given type object that is normally exposed by ``cls.__dict__``. Normally"
" it's sufficient to use :c:member:`~PyTypeObject.tp_dict`, but for the "
"static builtin types :c:member:`!tp_dict` is now always ``NULL``. "
":c:func:`!PyType_GetDict()` provides the correct dict object instead."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105227`: 新的 :c:func:`PyType_GetDict` 提供了给定类型对象的字典，通常由 ``cls.__dict__`` "
"暴露。通常使用 :c:member:`~PyTypeObject.tp_dict` "
"就足够了，但对于静态内置类型，:c:member:`!tp_dict` 现在总是 "
"``NULL``。:c:func:`!PyType_GetDict()` 提供了正确的字典对象。"

#: ../NEWS:15342
msgid ""
":gh:`105375`: Fix a bug in :c:func:`PyErr_WarnExplicit` where an exception "
"could end up being overwritten if the API failed internally."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105375`: 修复 :c:func:`PyErr_WarnExplicit` 中的一个错误，其中如果API内部失败，异常可能会被覆盖。"

#: ../NEWS:15345
msgid ""
":gh:`105603`: We've renamed the new (in 3.12) "
"``PyInterpreterConfig.own_gil`` to ``PyInterpreterConfig.gil`` and changed "
"the meaning of the value from \"bool\" to an integer with supported values "
"of ``PyInterpreterConfig_DEFAULT_GIL``, ``PyInterpreterConfig_SHARED_GIL``, "
"and ``PyInterpreterConfig_OWN_GIL``. The default is \"shared\"."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105603`: 我们已经将新（在3.12中）的 ``PyInterpreterConfig.own_gil`` 重命名为 "
"``PyInterpreterConfig.gil``，并将值的含义从“布尔”更改为整数，支持的值为 "
"``PyInterpreterConfig_DEFAULT_GIL``、``PyInterpreterConfig_SHARED_GIL`` 和 "
"``PyInterpreterConfig_OWN_GIL``。默认值为“共享”。"

#: ../NEWS:15351
msgid ""
":gh:`105387`: In the limited C API version 3.12, :c:func:`Py_INCREF` and "
":c:func:`Py_DECREF` functions are now implemented as opaque function calls "
"to hide implementation details. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105387`: 在有限 C API 版本 3.12 中，:c:func:`Py_INCREF` 和 :c:func:`Py_DECREF` "
"函数现在被实现为不透明的函数调用以隐藏实现细节。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:15355
msgid ""
":gh:`105396`: Deprecate the :c:func:`PyImport_ImportModuleNoBlock` function "
"which is just an alias to :c:func:`PyImport_ImportModule` since Python 3.3. "
"Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105396`: 弃用 :c:func:`PyImport_ImportModuleNoBlock` 函数，该函数自 Python 3.3 "
"起仅为 :c:func:`PyImport_ImportModule` 的别名。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:15359
msgid ""
":gh:`103968`: :c:func:`PyType_FromMetaclass` now allows metaclasses with "
"``tp_new`` set to ``NULL``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`103968`: :c:func:`PyType_FromMetaclass` 现在允许 ``tp_new`` 设置为 ``NULL`` "
"的元类。"

#: ../NEWS:15362
msgid ""
":gh:`105268`: Remove the old private, undocumented and untested "
"``_PyGC_FINALIZED()`` macro which was kept for backward compatibility with "
"Python 3.8 and older. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105268`: 移除旧的私有、未文档化和未测试的 ``_PyGC_FINALIZED()`` 宏，该宏是为了与 Python 3.8 "
"及更早版本保持向后兼容性而保留的。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:15366
