#: ../NEWS:16517
msgid ""
":gh:`88965`: typing: Fix a bug relating to substitution in custom classes "
"generic over a :class:`~typing.ParamSpec`. Previously, if the ``ParamSpec`` "
"was substituted with a parameters list that itself contained a "
":class:`~typing.TypeVar`, the ``TypeVar`` in the parameters list could not "
"be subsequently substituted. This is now fixed."
msgstr ""
