"bug。之前，如果 ``ParamSpec`` 被替换为一个自身包含 :class:`~typing.TypeVar` 的参数列表，参数列表中的 "
"``TypeVar`` 将无法被后续替换。现在这个问题已经修复。"

#: ../NEWS:16523
msgid "Patch by Nikita Sobolev."
msgstr "由 Nikita Sobolev 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:16525
msgid ""
":gh:`76846`: Fix issue where ``__new__()`` and ``__init__()`` methods of "
":class:`pathlib.PurePath` and :class:`~pathlib.Path` subclasses were not "
"called in some circumstances."
msgstr ""
":gh:`76846`: 修复了在某些情况下 :class:`pathlib.PurePath` 和 :class:`~pathlib.Path` "
"子类的 ``__new__()`` 和 ``__init__()`` 方法未被调用的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:16529
msgid ""
