msgstr ":gh:`102126`: 修复在关闭时清除线程状态时如果任何终结器尝试获取运行时头锁导致的死锁。由Kumar Aditya提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:16721
msgid ""
":gh:`102027`: Use ``GetCurrentProcessId`` on Windows when ``getpid`` is "
"unavailable. Patch by Max Bachmann."
msgstr ""
":gh:`102027`: 在Windows上 ``getpid`` 不可用时使用 ``GetCurrentProcessId``。由Max "
"Bachmann提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:16724
msgid ""
":gh:`102056`: Fix error handling bugs in interpreter's exception printing "
"code, which could cause a crash on infinite recursion."
msgstr ":gh:`102056`: 修复解释器异常打印代码中的错误处理漏洞，该漏洞可能在无限递归时导致崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:16727
msgid ""
":gh:`100982`: Restrict the scope of the :opcode:`FOR_ITER_RANGE` instruction"
" to the scope of the original :opcode:`FOR_ITER` instruction, to allow "
"instrumentation."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100982`: 限制 :opcode:`FOR_ITER_RANGE` 指令的范围到原始 :opcode:`FOR_ITER` "
"指令的范围，以允许插桩。"

#: ../NEWS:16731
msgid ""
":gh:`101967`: Fix possible segfault in ``positional_only_passed_as_keyword``"
" function, when new list created."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101967`: 修复在 ``positional_only_passed_as_keyword`` 函数中创建新列表时可能发生的段错误。"

#: ../NEWS:16734
msgid ""
":gh:`101952`: Fix possible segfault in ``BUILD_SET`` opcode, when new set "
"created."
msgstr ":gh:`101952`: 修复在 ``BUILD_SET`` 操作码创建新集合时可能发生的段错误。"

#: ../NEWS:16737
msgid ""
":gh:`74895`: :mod:`socket.getaddrinfo` no longer raises "
":class:`OverflowError` for :class:`int` **port** values outside of the C "
"long range. Out of range values are left up to the underlying string based C"
" library API to report. A :class:`socket.gaierror` ``SAI_SERVICE`` may occur"
" instead, or no error at all as not all platform C libraries generate an "
"error."
msgstr ""
":gh:`74895`: :mod:`socket.getaddrinfo` 不再为超出C long范围的 :class:`int` "
"**port**值抛出 :class:`OverflowError`。超出范围的值将由底层的基于字符串的C库API报告。可能会出现 "
":class:`socket.gaierror` ``SAI_SERVICE``，或者根本没有错误，因为并非所有平台的C库都会生成错误。"

#: ../NEWS:16744
msgid ""
":gh:`101799`: Add :opcode:`CALL_INTRINSIC_2` and use it instead of "
":opcode:`!PREP_RERAISE_STAR`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101799`: 添加 :opcode:`CALL_INTRINSIC_2` 并用其替代 "
":opcode:`!PREP_RERAISE_STAR`。"

#: ../NEWS:16747
msgid ""
":gh:`101857`: Fix xattr support detection on Linux systems by widening the "
"check to linux, not just glibc. This fixes support for musl."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101857`: 通过将检查范围扩大到linux而不仅仅是glibc来修复Linux系统上的xattr支持检测。这修复了对musl的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:16750
msgid ""
":gh:`84783`: Make the slice object hashable. Patch by Will Bradshaw and "
"Furkan Onder."
msgstr ":gh:`84783`: 使切片对象可哈希。由Will Bradshaw和Furkan Onder提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:16753
msgid ""
":gh:`87849`: Change the ``SEND`` instruction to leave the receiver on the "
"stack. This allows the specialized form of ``SEND`` to skip the chain of C "
"calls and jump directly to the ``RESUME`` in the generator or coroutine."
msgstr ""
":gh:`87849`: 更改 ``SEND`` 指令以将接收者留在堆栈上。这允许 ``SEND`` 的特殊形式跳过C调用链并直接跳转到生成器或协程中的"
" ``RESUME``。"

#: ../NEWS:16757
msgid ""
":gh:`101765`: Fix SystemError / segmentation fault in iter ``__reduce__`` "
"when internal access of ``builtins.__dict__`` keys mutates the iter object."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101765`: 修复在迭代 ``__reduce__`` 中当 ``builtins.__dict__`` "
"键的内部访问改变迭代对象时的SystemError / 段错误。"

#: ../NEWS:16761
msgid ""
":gh:`101430`: Update :mod:`tracemalloc` to handle presize of object "
"properly. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ":gh:`101430`: 更新 :mod:`tracemalloc` 以正确处理对象的预大小。由Donghee Na提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:16764
msgid ""
":gh:`101696`: Invalidate type version tag in ``_PyStaticType_Dealloc`` for "
"static types, avoiding bug where a false cache hit could crash the "
"interpreter. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101696`: 在 ``_PyStaticType_Dealloc`` "
"中使静态类型的类型版本标签无效，避免因虚假缓存命中导致解释器崩溃的错误。由 Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:16768
msgid ":gh:`101632`: Adds a new :opcode:`RETURN_CONST` instruction."
msgstr ":gh:`101632`: 添加一个新的 :opcode:`RETURN_CONST` 指令。"

#: ../NEWS:16770
msgid ""
":gh:`100719`: Remove gi_code field from generator (and coroutine and async "
"generator) objects as it is redundant. The frame already includes a "
"reference to the code object."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100719`: 从生成器（以及协程和异步生成器）对象中移除 gi_code 字段，因为它是多余的。框架已经包含了对代码对象的引用。"

#: ../NEWS:16774
msgid ""
":gh:`98627`: When an interpreter is configured to check (and only then), "
"importing an extension module will now fail when the extension does not "
"support multiple interpreters (i.e. doesn't implement PEP 489 multi-phase "
"init). This does not apply to the main interpreter, nor to subinterpreters "
"created with ``Py_NewInterpreter()``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`98627`: 当解释器配置为检查时（且仅在那时），导入扩展模块现在会在扩展不支持多解释器（即未实现 PEP 489 "
"多阶段初始化）时失败。这不适用于主解释器，也不适用于使用 ``Py_NewInterpreter()`` 创建的子解释器。"

#: ../NEWS:16783
msgid ""
":gh:`102302`: Micro-optimise hashing of :class:`inspect.Parameter`, reducing"
" the time it takes to hash an instance by around 40%."
msgstr ":gh:`102302`: 微优化 :class:`inspect.Parameter` 的哈希处理，将哈希实例所需的时间减少约 40%。"

#: ../NEWS:16786
msgid ""
":gh:`101979`: Fix a bug where parentheses in the ``metavar`` argument to "
":meth:`argparse.ArgumentParser.add_argument` were dropped. Patch by Yeojin "
"Kim."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101979`: 修复了一个错误，其中 :meth:`argparse.ArgumentParser.add_argument` 的 "
"``metavar`` 参数中的括号被丢弃。由 Yeojin Kim 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:16790
msgid ""
":gh:`91038`: :meth:`platform.platform` now has boolean default arguments."
msgstr ":gh:`91038`: :meth:`platform.platform` 现在有布尔默认参数。"

#: ../NEWS:16792
msgid ""
":gh:`81652`: Add :const:`mmap.MAP_ALIGNED_SUPER` FreeBSD and "
":const:`mmap.MAP_CONCEAL` OpenBSD constants to :mod:`mmap`. Patch by Yeojin "
"Kim."
msgstr ""
":gh:`81652`: 将 FreeBSD 的 :const:`mmap.MAP_ALIGNED_SUPER` 和 OpenBSD 的 "
":const:`mmap.MAP_CONCEAL` 常量添加到 :mod:`mmap` 中。由 Yeojin Kim 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:16796
msgid ":gh:`102179`: Fix :func:`os.dup2` error message for negative fds."
msgstr ":gh:`102179`: 修复 :func:`os.dup2` 对于负文件描述符的错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:16798
msgid ""
":gh:`101961`: For the binary mode, :func:`fileinput.hookcompressed` doesn't "
"set the ``encoding`` value even if the value is ``None``. Patch by Gihwan "
"Kim."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101961`: 对于二进制模式，:func:`fileinput.hookcompressed` 即使值为 ``None`` 也不设置 "
"``encoding`` 值。由 Gihwan Kim 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:16802
msgid ""
":gh:`101936`: The default value of ``fp`` becomes :class:`io.BytesIO` if "
":exc:`~urllib.error.HTTPError` is initialized without a designated ``fp`` "
"parameter. Patch by Long Vo."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101936`: 如果 :exc:`~urllib.error.HTTPError` 初始化时没有指定 ``fp`` 参数，则 ``fp`` "
"的默认值变为 :class:`io.BytesIO`。由 Long Vo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:16806
msgid ""
":gh:`101566`: In zipfile, sync Path with `zipp 3.14 "
"<https://zipp.readthedocs.io/en/latest/history.html#v3-14-0>`_, including "
"fix for extractall on the underlying zipfile after being wrapped in "
"``Path``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101566`: 在 zipfile 中，将 Path 与 `zipp 3.14 "
"<https://zipp.readthedocs.io/en/latest/history.html#v3-14-0>`_ 同步，包括修复在 "
"``Path`` 包装后对底层 zipfile 的 extractall 问题。"

#: ../NEWS:16811
msgid ""
":gh:`97930`: Apply changes from `importlib_resources 5.12 "
"<https://importlib-"
"resources.readthedocs.io/en/latest/history.html#v5-12-0>`_, including fix "
"for ``MultiplexedPath`` to support directories in multiple namespaces "
"(python/importlib_resources#265)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`97930`: 应用来自 `importlib_resources 5.12 <https://importlib-"
"resources.readthedocs.io/en/latest/history.html#v5-12-0>`_ 的更改，包括修复 "
"``MultiplexedPath`` 以支持多个命名空间中的目录 (python/importlib_resources#265)。"

#: ../NEWS:16816
msgid ":gh:`101997`: Upgrade pip wheel bundled with ensurepip (pip 23.0.1)"
msgstr ":gh:`101997`: 升级与 ensurepip 捆绑的 pip wheel (pip 23.0.1)"

#: ../NEWS:16818
msgid ""
":gh:`99108`: The built-in extension modules for :mod:`hashlib` SHA2 "
"algorithms, used when OpenSSL does not provide them, now live in a single "
"internal ``_sha2`` module instead of separate ``_sha256`` and ``_sha512`` "
"modules."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99108`: 当 OpenSSL 不提供时使用的 :mod:`hashlib` SHA2 算法的内置扩展模块，现在位于一个内部 "
"``_sha2`` 模块中，而不是单独的 ``_sha256`` 和 ``_sha512`` 模块。"

#: ../NEWS:16823
msgid ""
":gh:`101892`: Callable iterators no longer raise :class:`SystemError` when "
"the callable object exhausts the iterator but forgets to either return a "
"sentinel value or raise :class:`StopIteration`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101892`: 可调用迭代器在可调用对象耗尽迭代器但忘记返回哨兵值或引发 :class:`StopIteration` 时不再引发 "
":class:`SystemError`。"

#: ../NEWS:16827
msgid ""
":gh:`87634`: Remove locking behavior from :func:`functools.cached_property`."
msgstr ":gh:`87634`: 从 :func:`functools.cached_property` 中移除锁定行为。"

#: ../NEWS:16829
msgid ""
":gh:`97786`: Fix potential undefined behaviour in corner cases of floating-"
"point-to-time conversions."
msgstr ":gh:`97786`: 修复浮点数到时间转换在极端情况下潜在的未定义行为。"

#: ../NEWS:16832
msgid ""
":gh:`101517`: Fixed bug where :mod:`bdb` looks up the source line with "
":mod:`linecache` with a ``lineno=None``, which causes it to fail with an "
"unhandled exception."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101517`: 修复了 :mod:`bdb` 使用 ``lineno=None`` 与 :mod:`linecache` "
"查找源代码行时导致未处理异常失败的 bug。"

#: ../NEWS:16836
msgid ""
":gh:`101773`: Optimize :class:`fractions.Fraction` for small components. The"
" private argument ``_normalize`` of the :class:`fractions.Fraction` "
"constructor has been removed."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101773`: 为小部件优化 :class:`fractions.Fraction`。:class:`fractions.Fraction`"
" 构造函数的私有参数 ``_normalize`` 已被移除。"

#: ../NEWS:16840
msgid ""
":gh:`101693`: In :meth:`sqlite3.Cursor.execute`, :exc:`DeprecationWarning` "
"is now emitted when :ref:`named placeholders <sqlite3-placeholders>` are "
"used together with parameters supplied as a :term:`sequence` instead of as a"
" :class:`dict`. Starting from Python 3.14, using named placeholders with "
"parameters supplied as a sequence will raise a "
":exc:`~sqlite3.ProgrammingError`. Patch by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101693`: 在 :meth:`sqlite3.Cursor.execute` 中，当 :ref:`命名占位符 "
"<sqlite3-placeholders>` 与作为 :term:`sequence` 而不是 :class:`dict` "
"提供的参数一起使用时，现在会发出 :exc:`DeprecationWarning`。从 Python 3.14 "
"开始，使用命名占位符与作为序列提供的参数将引发 :exc:`~sqlite3.ProgrammingError`。 由 Erlend E. "
"Aasland 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:16847
msgid ""
":gh:`101446`: Change repr of :class:`collections.OrderedDict` to use regular"
" dictionary formatting instead of pairs of keys and values."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101446`: 更改 :class:`collections.OrderedDict` 的 repr 以使用常规字典格式，而不是键和值的对。"

#: ../NEWS:16850
msgid ""
":gh:`101362`: Speed up :class:`pathlib.PurePath` construction by handling "
"arguments more uniformly. When a :class:`pathlib.Path` argument is supplied,"
" we use its string representation rather than joining its parts with "
":func:`os.path.join`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101362`: 通过更统一地处理参数来加速 :class:`pathlib.PurePath` 的构造。当提供 "
":class:`pathlib.Path` 参数时，我们使用其字符串表示而不是用 :func:`os.path.join` 连接其部分。"

#: ../NEWS:16855
msgid ""
":gh:`101362`: Speed up :class:`pathlib.PurePath` construction by calling "
":func:`os.path.join` only when two or more arguments are given."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101362`: 通过仅在给出两个或更多参数时调用 :func:`os.path.join` 来加速 "
":class:`pathlib.PurePath` 的构造。"

#: ../NEWS:16858
msgid ""
":gh:`101362`: Speed up :class:`pathlib.Path` construction by running the "
"path flavour compatibility check only when pathlib is imported."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101362`: 通过仅在导入 pathlib 时运行路径风格兼容性检查来加速 :class:`pathlib.Path` 的构造。"

#: ../NEWS:16861
msgid ""
":gh:`85984`: Refactored the implementation of :func:`pty.fork` to use "
":func:`os.login_tty`."
msgstr ":gh:`85984`: 重构了 :func:`pty.fork` 的实现以使用 :func:`os.login_tty`。"

#: ../NEWS:16864
msgid ""
"A :exc:`DeprecationWarning` is now raised by ``pty.master_open()`` and "
"``pty.slave_open()``. They were undocumented and deprecated long long ago in"
" the docstring in favor of :func:`pty.openpty`."
msgstr ""
"现在 ``pty.master_open()`` 和 ``pty.slave_open()`` 会引发 "
":exc:`DeprecationWarning`。它们很久以前就在文档字符串中被弃用，并推荐使用 :func:`pty.openpty`。"

#: ../NEWS:16868
msgid ""
":gh:`101561`: Add a new decorator :func:`typing.override`. See :pep:`698` "
"for details. Patch by Steven Troxler."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101561`: 添加了一个新的装饰器 :func:`typing.override`。详情见 :pep:`698`。由 Steven "
"Troxler 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:16871
msgid ":gh:`63301`: Set exit code when :mod:`tabnanny` CLI exits on error."
msgstr ":gh:`63301`: 当 :mod:`tabnanny` CLI 因错误退出时设置退出代码。"

#: ../NEWS:16873
msgid ""
":gh:`101360`: Fix anchor matching in :meth:`pathlib.PureWindowsPath.match`. "
"Path and pattern anchors are now matched with :mod:`fnmatch`, just like "
"other path parts. This allows patterns such as ``\"*:/Users/*\"`` to be "
"matched."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101360`: 修复 :meth:`pathlib.PureWindowsPath.match` "
"中的锚点匹配。路径和模式的锚点现在像其他路径部分一样与 :mod:`fnmatch` 匹配。这使得可以匹配如 ``\"*:/Users/*\"`` "
"这样的模式。"

#: ../NEWS:16878
msgid ""
":gh:`101277`: Remove global state from :mod:`itertools` module (:pep:`687`)."
" Patches by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101277`: 从 :mod:`itertools` 模块中移除全局状态 (:pep:`687`)。由 Erlend E. Aasland "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:16881
msgid ""
":gh:`100809`: Fix handling of drive-relative paths (like 'C:' and 'C:foo') "
"in :meth:`pathlib.Path.absolute`. This method now uses the OS API to "
"retrieve the correct current working directory for the drive."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100809`: 修复 :meth:`pathlib.Path.absolute` 中对驱动器相对路径（如 'C:' 和 "
"'C:foo'）的处理。此方法现在使用操作系统 API 来检索驱动器的正确当前工作目录。"

#: ../NEWS:16885
msgid ""
":gh:`99138`: Apply :pep:`687` to :mod:`zoneinfo`. Patch by Erlend E. "
"Aasland."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99138`: 将 :pep:`687` 应用于 :mod:`zoneinfo`。由 Erlend E. Aasland 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:16887
msgid ""
":gh:`96764`: :func:`asyncio.wait_for` now uses :func:`asyncio.timeout` as "
"its underlying implementation. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`96764`: :func:`asyncio.wait_for` 现在使用 :func:`asyncio.timeout` "
"作为其底层实现。补丁由 Kumar Aditya 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:16890
msgid ""
":gh:`88233`: Correctly preserve \"extra\" fields in ``zipfile`` regardless "
"of their ordering relative to a zip64 \"extra.\""
msgstr ""
":gh:`88233`: 无论 \"extra\" 字段相对于 zip64 \"extra\" 的顺序如何，都能正确保留 ``zipfile`` 中的 "
"\"extra\" 字段。"

#: ../NEWS:16893
msgid ""
":issue:`23224`: Fix segfaults when creating :class:`lzma.LZMADecompressor` "
"and :class:`bz2.BZ2Decompressor` objects without calling ``__init__()``, and"
" fix leakage of locks and internal buffers when calling the ``__init__()`` "
"methods of :class:`lzma.LZMADecompressor`, :class:`lzma.LZMACompressor`, "
":class:`bz2.BZ2Compressor`, and :class:`bz2.BZ2Decompressor` objects "
"multiple times."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23224`: 修复在不调用 ``__init__()`` 的情况下创建 :class:`lzma.LZMADecompressor` "
"和 :class:`bz2.BZ2Decompressor` 对象时的段错误，以及修复多次调用 "
":class:`lzma.LZMADecompressor`、:class:`lzma.LZMACompressor`、:class:`bz2.BZ2Compressor`"
" 和 :class:`bz2.BZ2Decompressor` 对象的 ``__init__()`` 方法时的锁和内部缓冲区泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:16903
msgid ""
":gh:`85417`: Update :mod:`cmath` documentation to clarify behaviour on "
"branch cuts."
msgstr ":gh:`85417`: 更新 :mod:`cmath` 文档以澄清分支切割的行为。"

#: ../NEWS:16906
msgid ""
":gh:`97725`: Fix :meth:`asyncio.Task.print_stack` description for "
"``file=None``. Patch by Oleg Iarygin."
msgstr ""
":gh:`97725`: 修复 :meth:`asyncio.Task.print_stack` 对于 ``file=None`` 的描述。由Oleg "
"Iarygin提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:16912
msgid ""
":gh:`102019`: Fix deadlock on shutdown if "
"``test_current_{exception,frames}`` fails. Patch by Jacob Bower."
msgstr ""
":gh:`102019`: 修复如果 ``test_current_{exception,frames}`` 失败时在关闭时的死锁。由Jacob "
"Bower提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:16915
msgid ":gh:`85984`: Utilize new \"winsize\" functions from termios in pty tests."
msgstr ":gh:`85984`: 在pty测试中利用termios的新“winsize”函数。"

#: ../NEWS:16917
msgid ""
":gh:`89792`: ``test_tools`` now copies up to 10x less source data to a "
"temporary directory during the ``freeze`` test by ignoring git metadata and "
"other artifacts.  It also limits its python build parallelism based on "
"os.cpu_count instead of hard coding it as 8 cores."
msgstr ""
":gh:`89792`: ``test_tools`` 现在在 ``freeze`` "
"测试期间通过忽略git元数据和其他工件，将源数据复制到临时目录的数量减少了10倍。它还基于os.cpu_count而不是硬编码为8核心来限制其Python构建并行性。"

#: ../NEWS:16925
msgid ""
":gh:`99942`: On Android, in a static build, python-config in embed mode no "
"longer incorrectly reports a library to link to."
msgstr ":gh:`99942`: 在Android上，静态构建中，embed模式的python-config不再错误地报告要链接的库。"

#: ../NEWS:16928
msgid ""
":gh:`99942`: On Android, python.pc now correctly reports the library to link"
" to, the same as python-config.sh."
msgstr ":gh:`99942`: 在Android上，python.pc现在正确地报告要链接的库，与python-config.sh相同。"

#: ../NEWS:16931
msgid ""
":gh:`100221`: Fix creating install directories in ``make sharedinstall`` if "
"they exist outside ``DESTDIR`` already."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100221`: 修复如果安装目录在 ``DESTDIR`` 之外已经存在时，``make sharedinstall`` "
"创建安装目录的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:16934
msgid ""
":gh:`96821`: Explicitly mark C extension modules that need defined signed "
