#: ../NEWS:16954
msgid ""
":gh:`101763`: Updates copy of libffi bundled with Windows installs to 3.4.4."
msgstr ":gh:`101763`: 更新Windows安装包中捆绑的libffi版本至3.4.4。"

#: ../NEWS:16956
msgid ":gh:`101759`: Update Windows installer to SQLite 3.40.1."
msgstr ":gh:`101759`: 更新Windows安装程序中的SQLite至3.40.1版本。"

#: ../NEWS:16958
msgid ""
":gh:`101614`: Correctly handle extensions built against debug binaries that "
"reference ``python3_d.dll``."
msgstr ":gh:`101614`: 正确处理引用 ``python3_d.dll`` 的调试二进制文件构建的扩展。"

#: ../NEWS:16961
msgid ""
":gh:`101196`: The functions ``os.path.isdir``, ``os.path.isfile``, "
"``os.path.islink`` and ``os.path.exists`` are now 13% to 28% faster on "
