#: ../NEWS:16968
msgid ":gh:`101759`: Update macOS installer to SQLite 3.40.1."
msgstr ":gh:`101759`: 更新macOS安装程序中的SQLite至3.40.1版本。"

#: ../NEWS:16973
msgid ""
":gh:`101907`: Removes use of non-standard C++ extension in public header "
"files."
msgstr ":gh:`101907`: 移除公共头文件中非标准C++扩展的使用。"

#: ../NEWS:16976
msgid ""
":gh:`99293`: Document that the Py_TPFLAGS_VALID_VERSION_TAG is an internal "
"feature, should not be used, and will be removed."
msgstr ":gh:`99293`: 文档说明Py_TPFLAGS_VALID_VERSION_TAG是一个内部特性，不应使用，并将被移除。"

#: ../NEWS:16979
msgid ""
":gh:`101578`: Add :c:func:`PyErr_GetRaisedException` and "
":c:func:`PyErr_SetRaisedException` for saving and restoring the current "
"exception. These functions return and accept a single exception object, "
"rather than the triple arguments of the now-deprecated :c:func:`PyErr_Fetch`"
" and :c:func:`PyErr_Restore`. This is less error prone and a bit more "
"efficient."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101578`: 添加 :c:func:`PyErr_GetRaisedException` 和 "
":c:func:`PyErr_SetRaisedException` 用于保存和恢复当前异常。这些函数返回和接受一个单一的异常对象，而不是现已废弃的 "
":c:func:`PyErr_Fetch` 和 :c:func:`PyErr_Restore` 的三重参数。这减少了出错的可能性，效率也略有提高。"

#: ../NEWS:16986
msgid ""
"Add :c:func:`PyException_GetArgs` and :c:func:`PyException_SetArgs` as "
"convenience functions for retrieving and modifying the "
":attr:`~BaseException.args` passed to the exception's constructor."
msgstr ""
"添加 :c:func:`PyException_GetArgs` 和 :c:func:`PyException_SetArgs` "
"作为便捷函数，用于检索和修改传递给异常构造函数的 :attr:`~BaseException.args`。"

#: ../NEWS:16990
msgid ""
":gh:`91744`: Introduced the *Unstable C API tier*, marking APi that is "
"allowed to change in minor releases without a deprecation period. See "
":pep:`689` for details."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91744`: 引入了*不稳定C API层*，标记了允许在次要版本中更改而不经过弃用期的API。详情请参阅 :pep:`689`。"

#: ../NEWS:16996
msgid "Python 3.12.0 alpha 5"
msgstr "Python 3.12.0 alpha 5"

#: ../NEWS:16998
msgid "*Release date: 2023-02-07*"
msgstr "*发布日期：2023-02-07*"

#: ../NEWS:17003
msgid ""
":gh:`99108`: Replace the builtin :mod:`hashlib` implementations of SHA2-224 "
"and SHA2-256 originally from LibTomCrypt with formally verified, side-"
"channel resistant code from the `HACL* <https://github.com/hacl-star/hacl-"
"star/>`_ project. The builtins remain a fallback only used when OpenSSL does"
" not provide them."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99108`: 将内置的 :mod:`hashlib` "
"中最初来自LibTomCrypt的SHA2-224和SHA2-256实现替换为来自`HACL* <https://github.com/hacl-"
"star/hacl-star/>`_项目的经过正式验证、抗侧信道攻击的代码。内置实现仅在OpenSSL不提供这些功能时作为备用方案使用。"

#: ../NEWS:17012
msgid ""
":gh:`92173`: Fix the ``defs`` and ``kwdefs`` arguments to "
":c:func:`PyEval_EvalCodeEx` and a reference leak in that function."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92173`: 修复 :c:func:`PyEval_EvalCodeEx` 中的 ``defs`` 和 ``kwdefs`` "
"参数以及该函数中的引用泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:17015
msgid ""
":gh:`59956`: The GILState API is now partially compatible with "
"subinterpreters. Previously, ``PyThreadState_GET()`` and "
"``PyGILState_GetThisThreadState()`` would get out of sync, causing "
"inconsistent behavior and crashes."
msgstr ""
":gh:`59956`: GILState API 现在部分兼容子解释器。之前，``PyThreadState_GET()`` 和 "
"``PyGILState_GetThisThreadState()`` 会不同步，导致不一致的行为和崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:17020
msgid ""
":gh:`101400`: Fix wrong lineno in exception message on :keyword:`continue` "
"or :keyword:`break` which are not in a loop. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101400`: 修复不在循环中的 :keyword:`continue` 或 :keyword:`break` 异常消息中的错误行号。由 "
"Donghee Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:17023
msgid ""
":gh:`101372`: Fix :func:`~unicodedata.is_normalized` to properly handle the "
"UCD 3.2.0 cases. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101372`: 修复 :func:`~unicodedata.is_normalized` 以正确处理 UCD 3.2.0 的情况。由 "
"Donghee Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:17026
msgid ""
":gh:`101266`: Fix :func:`sys.getsizeof` reporting for :class:`int` "
"subclasses."
msgstr ":gh:`101266`: 修复 :func:`sys.getsizeof` 对 :class:`int` 子类的报告。"

#: ../NEWS:17029
msgid ""
":gh:`101291`: Refactor the ``PyLongObject`` struct into a normal Python "
"object header and a ``PyLongValue`` struct."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101291`: 将 ``PyLongObject`` 结构重构为一个普通的 Python 对象头和一个 ``PyLongValue`` "
"结构。"

#: ../NEWS:17032
msgid ""
":gh:`101046`: Fix a possible memory leak in the parser when raising "
":exc:`MemoryError`. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`101046`: 修复解析器在引发 :exc:`MemoryError` 时可能的内存泄漏。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:17035
msgid ""
":gh:`101037`: Fix potential memory underallocation issue for instances of "
":class:`int` subclasses with value zero."
msgstr ":gh:`101037`: 修复值为零的 :class:`int` 子类实例可能的内存分配不足问题。"

#: ../NEWS:17038
msgid ""
":gh:`100762`: Record the (virtual) exception block depth in the oparg of "
":opcode:`YIELD_VALUE`. Use this to avoid the expensive ``throw()`` when "
"closing generators (and coroutines) that can be closed trivially."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100762`: 在 :opcode:`YIELD_VALUE` 的 oparg "
"中记录（虚拟）异常块深度。使用这一点来避免在关闭可以轻松关闭的生成器（和协程）时昂贵的 ``throw()``。"

#: ../NEWS:17042
msgid ""
":gh:`100982`: Adds a new :opcode:`COMPARE_AND_BRANCH` instruction. This is a"
" bit more efficient when performing a comparison immediately followed by a "
"branch, and restores the design intent of PEP 659 that specializations are "
"local to a single instruction."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100982`: 添加了一个新的 :opcode:`COMPARE_AND_BRANCH` 指令。在执行比较紧接着分支时效率更高，恢复了 "
"PEP 659 的设计意图，即特化限于单个指令。"

#: ../NEWS:17047
msgid ""
":gh:`100942`: Fixed segfault in property.getter/setter/deleter that occurred"
" when a property subclass overrode the ``__new__`` method to return a non-"
"property instance."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100942`: 修复了当属性子类覆盖 ``__new__`` 方法以返回非属性实例时，在 "
"property.getter/setter/deleter 中发生的段错误。"

#: ../NEWS:17051
msgid ""
":gh:`100923`: Remove the ``mask`` cache entry for the :opcode:`COMPARE_OP` "
"instruction and embed the mask into the oparg."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100923`: 移除 :opcode:`COMPARE_OP` 指令的 ``mask`` 缓存条目，并将掩码嵌入到 oparg 中。"

#: ../NEWS:17054
msgid ""
":gh:`100892`: Fix race while iterating over thread states in clearing "
":class:`threading.local`. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100892`: 修复在清除 :class:`threading.local` 时迭代线程状态的竞争。由 Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:17057
msgid ""
":gh:`91351`: Fix a case where re-entrant imports could corrupt the import "
"deadlock detection code and cause a :exc:`KeyError` to be raised out of "
":mod:`importlib/_bootstrap`.  In addition to the straightforward cases, this"
" could also happen when garbage collection leads to a warning being emitted "
"-- as happens when it collects an open socket or file)"
msgstr ""
":gh:`91351`: 修复了一个案例，其中可重入的导入可能会破坏导入死锁检测代码，并导致从 :mod:`importlib/_bootstrap` "
"中抛出 :exc:`KeyError`。除了直接的情况外，当垃圾收集导致发出警告时也可能发生这种情况——就像它收集一个打开的套接字或文件时发生的那样。"

#: ../NEWS:17063
msgid ""
":gh:`100726`: Optimize construction of ``range`` object for medium size "
"integers."
msgstr ":gh:`100726`: 优化中等大小整数的 ``range`` 对象构造。"

#: ../NEWS:17066
msgid ""
":gh:`100712`: Added option to build cpython with specialization disabled, by"
" setting ``ENABLE_SPECIALIZATION=False`` in :mod:`opcode`, followed by "
"``make regen-all``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100712`: 添加了通过设置 :mod:`opcode` 中的 ``ENABLE_SPECIALIZATION=False``，然后执行 "
"``make regen-all`` 来禁用专业化构建 cpython 的选项。"

#: ../NEWS:17073
msgid ""
":issue:`32780`: Inter-field padding is now inserted into the PEP3118 format "
"strings obtained from :class:`ctypes.Structure` objects, reflecting their "
"true representation in memory."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32780`: 现在将从 :class:`ctypes.Structure` 对象获得的 PEP3118 "
"格式字符串中插入字段间填充，反映它们在内存中的真实表示。"

#: ../NEWS:17077
msgid ":gh:`101541`: [Enum] - fix psuedo-flag creation"
msgstr ":gh:`101541`: [Enum] - 修复伪标志创建。"

#: ../NEWS:17079
msgid ":gh:`101570`: Upgrade pip wheel bundled with ensurepip (pip 23.0)"
msgstr ":gh:`101570`: 升级与 ensurepip 捆绑的 pip wheel（pip 23.0）。"

#: ../NEWS:17081
msgid ""
":gh:`101323`: Fix a bug where errors where not thrown by "
"zlib._ZlibDecompressor if encountered during decompressing."
msgstr ":gh:`101323`: 修复了一个错误，其中如果在解压缩过程中遇到错误，zlib._ZlibDecompressor 不会抛出错误。"

#: ../NEWS:17084
msgid ""
":gh:`101317`: Add *ssl_shutdown_timeout* parameter for "
":meth:`asyncio.StreamWriter.start_tls`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101317`: 为 :meth:`asyncio.StreamWriter.start_tls` 添加了 "
"*ssl_shutdown_timeout* 参数。"

#: ../NEWS:17087
msgid ""
":gh:`101326`: Fix regression when passing ``None`` as second or third "
"argument to ``FutureIter.throw``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101326`: 修复了在将 ``None`` 作为第二个或第三个参数传递给 ``FutureIter.throw`` 时的回归问题。"

#: ../NEWS:17090
msgid ""
":gh:`92123`: Adapt the ``_elementtree`` extension module to multi-phase init"
" (:pep:`489`). Patches by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92123`: 使 ``_elementtree`` 扩展模块适应多阶段初始化 (:pep:`489`)。由 Erlend E. "
"Aasland 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:17093
msgid ""
":gh:`100795`: Avoid potential unexpected ``freeaddrinfo`` call (double free)"
" in :mod:`socket` when when a libc ``getaddrinfo()`` implementation leaves "
"garbage in an output pointer when returning an error. Original patch by "
"Sergey G. Brester."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100795`: 在 :mod:`socket` 中避免潜在的意外 ``freeaddrinfo`` 调用（双重释放），当 libc 的 "
"``getaddrinfo()`` 实现在返回错误时在输出指针中留下垃圾时。原始由 Sergey G. Brester 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:17098
msgid ""
":gh:`101143`: Remove unused references to :class:`~asyncio.TimerHandle` in "
"``asyncio.base_events.BaseEventLoop._add_callback``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101143`: 在 ``asyncio.base_events.BaseEventLoop._add_callback`` 中移除对 "
":class:`~asyncio.TimerHandle` 的未使用引用。"

#: ../NEWS:17101
msgid ""
":gh:`101144`: Make :func:`zipfile.Path.open` and "
":func:`zipfile.Path.read_text` also accept ``encoding`` as a positional "
"argument. This was the behavior in Python 3.9 and earlier.  3.10 introduced "
"a regression where supplying it as a positional argument would lead to a "
":exc:`TypeError`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101144`: 使 :func:`zipfile.Path.open` 和 :func:`zipfile.Path.read_text` "
"也接受 ``encoding`` 作为位置参数。这是 Python 3.9 及更早版本的行为。3.10 引入了回归，将其作为位置参数提供会导致 "
":exc:`TypeError`。"

#: ../NEWS:17107
msgid ""
":gh:`94518`: Group-related variables of ``_posixsubprocess`` module are "
"renamed to stress that supplementary group affinity is added to a fork, not "
"replace the inherited ones. Patch by Oleg Iarygin."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94518`: ``_posixsubprocess`` 模块中与组相关的变量被重命名，以强调补充组亲和性是被添加到 fork "
"中，而不是替换继承的组。由 Oleg Iarygin 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:17111
msgid ""
":gh:`101015`: Fix :func:`typing.get_type_hints` on ``'*tuple[...]'`` and "
"``*tuple[...]``. It must not drop the ``Unpack`` part."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101015`: 修复 :func:`typing.get_type_hints` 在 ``'*tuple[...]'`` 和 "
"``*tuple[...]`` 上的问题。它不应该丢弃 ``Unpack`` 部分。"

#: ../NEWS:17114
msgid ""
":gh:`101000`: Add :func:`os.path.splitroot`, which splits a path into a "
"3-item tuple ``(drive, root, tail)``. This new function is used by "
":mod:`pathlib` to improve the performance of path construction by up to a "
"third."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101000`: 添加 :func:`os.path.splitroot`，它将路径分割成一个 3 元组 ``(drive, root, "
"tail)``。这个新函数被 :mod:`pathlib` 用于将路径构建的性能提高多达三分之一。"

#: ../NEWS:17119
msgid ""
":gh:`100573`: Fix a Windows :mod:`asyncio` bug with named pipes where a "
"client doing ``os.stat()`` on the pipe would cause an error in the server "
"that disabled serving future requests."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100573`: 修复 Windows 上 :mod:`asyncio` 的一个关于命名管道的 bug，其中客户端对管道执行 "
"``os.stat()`` 会导致服务器中禁用未来请求服务的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:17123
msgid ""
":gh:`39615`: :func:`warnings.warn` now has the ability to skip stack frames "
"based on code filename prefix rather than only a numeric ``stacklevel`` via "
"the new ``skip_file_prefixes`` keyword argument."
msgstr ""
":gh:`39615`: :func:`warnings.warn` 现在能够基于代码文件名前缀跳过堆栈帧，而不仅仅是通过新的 "
"``skip_file_prefixes`` 关键字参数跳过数字 ``stacklevel``。"

#: ../NEWS:17127
msgid ":gh:`100750`: pass encoding kwarg to subprocess in platform"
msgstr ":gh:`100750`: 在平台中将 encoding 关键字参数传递给子进程"

#: ../NEWS:17129
msgid ""
":gh:`100160`: Emit a deprecation warning in "
":meth:`asyncio.DefaultEventLoopPolicy.get_event_loop` if there is no current"
" event loop set and it decides to create one."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100160`: 如果没有设置当前事件循环并且决定创建一个，则在 "
":meth:`asyncio.DefaultEventLoopPolicy.get_event_loop` 中发出弃用警告。"

#: ../NEWS:17133
msgid ""
":gh:`96290`: Fix handling of partial and invalid UNC drives in "
"``ntpath.splitdrive()``, and in ``ntpath.normpath()`` on non-Windows "
"systems. Paths such as '\\\\server' and '\\\\' are now considered by "
"``splitdrive()`` to contain only a drive, and consequently are not modified "
"by ``normpath()`` on non-Windows systems. The behaviour of ``normpath()`` on"
" Windows systems is unaffected, as native OS APIs are used. Patch by Eryk "
"Sun, with contributions by Barney Gale."
msgstr ""
":gh:`96290`: 修复 ``ntpath.splitdrive()`` 中部分和无效 UNC 驱动器的处理，以及在非 Windows 系统上的 "
"``ntpath.normpath()``。现在 ``splitdrive()`` 认为诸如 '\\\\server' 和 '\\\\' "
"的路径仅包含驱动器，因此在非 Windows 系统上不会被 ``normpath()`` 修改。Windows 系统上 ``normpath()`` "
"的行为不受影响，因为使用的是原生 OS API。由 Eryk Sun 提供补丁，Barney Gale 有贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:17141
msgid ""
":gh:`99952`: Fix a reference undercounting issue in "
":class:`ctypes.Structure` with ``from_param()`` results larger than a C "
"pointer."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99952`: 修复 :class:`ctypes.Structure` 中 ``from_param()`` 结果大于 C "
"指针时的引用计数不足问题。"

#: ../NEWS:17144
msgid ""
":gh:`67790`: Add float-style formatting support for "
":class:`fractions.Fraction` instances."
msgstr ":gh:`67790`: 为 :class:`fractions.Fraction` 实例添加浮点样式格式化支持。"

#: ../NEWS:17147
msgid ":gh:`99266`: Preserve more detailed error messages in :mod:`ctypes`."
msgstr ":gh:`99266`: 在 :mod:`ctypes` 中保留更详细的错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:17149
msgid ""
":gh:`86682`: Ensure runtime-created collections have the correct module name"
" using the newly added (internal) :func:`sys._getframemodulename`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`86682`: 使用新增的（内部）函数 :func:`sys._getframemodulename` "
"确保运行时创建的集合具有正确的模块名称。"

#: ../NEWS:17152
msgid ""
":gh:`88597`: :mod:`uuid` now has a command line interface. Try ``python -m "
"uuid -h``."
msgstr ":gh:`88597`: :mod:`uuid` 现在有了命令行界面。尝试 ``python -m uuid -h``。"

#: ../NEWS:17155
msgid ""
":gh:`60580`: :data:`ctypes.wintypes.BYTE` definition changed from "
":data:`~ctypes.c_byte` to :data:`~ctypes.c_ubyte` to match Windows SDK. "
"Patch by Anatoly Techtonik and Oleg Iarygin."
msgstr ""
":gh:`60580`: :data:`ctypes.wintypes.BYTE` 的定义从 :data:`~ctypes.c_byte` 改为 "
":data:`~ctypes.c_ubyte` 以匹配 Windows SDK。由 Anatoly Techtonik 和 Oleg Iarygin "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:17159
msgid ""
":gh:`94518`: ``_posixsubprocess`` now initializes all UID and GID variables "
"using a reserved ``-1`` value instead of a separate flag. Patch by Oleg "
"Iarygin."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94518`: ``_posixsubprocess`` 现在使用保留的 ``-1`` 值初始化所有 UID 和 GID "
"变量，而不是使用单独的标志。由 Oleg Iarygin 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:17163
msgid ""
":issue:`38941`: The :mod:`xml.etree.ElementTree` module now emits "
":exc:`DeprecationWarning` when testing the truth value of an "
":class:`xml.etree.ElementTree.Element`. Before, the Python implementation "
"emitted :exc:`FutureWarning`, and the C implementation emitted nothing."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38941`: :mod:`xml.etree.ElementTree` 模块现在在测试 "
":class:`xml.etree.ElementTree.Element` 的真值时发出 "
":exc:`DeprecationWarning`。之前，Python 实现发出 :exc:`FutureWarning`，而 C "
"实现没有发出任何警告。"

#: ../NEWS:17168
msgid ""
":issue:`40077`: Convert :mod:`elementtree` types to heap types. Patch by "
"Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40077`: 将 :mod:`elementtree` 类型转换为堆类型。由 Erlend E. Aasland 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:17171
msgid ""
":issue:`29847`: Fix a bug where :class:`pathlib.Path` accepted and ignored "
"keyword arguments. Patch provided by Yurii Karabas."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29847`: 修复了 :class:`pathlib.Path` 接受并忽略关键字参数的 bug。由 Yurii Karabas "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:17174
msgid ""
":gh:`77772`: :class:`ctypes.CDLL`, :class:`ctypes.OleDLL`, "
":class:`ctypes.WinDLL`, and :class:`ctypes.PyDLL` now accept :term:`path-"
"like objects <path-like object>` as their ``name`` argument. Patch by Robert"
" Hoelzl."
msgstr ""
":gh:`77772`: "
":class:`ctypes.CDLL`、:class:`ctypes.OleDLL`、:class:`ctypes.WinDLL` 和 "
":class:`ctypes.PyDLL` 现在接受 :term:`路径类对象 <path-like object>` 作为它们的 ``name`` "
"参数。由 Robert Hoelzl 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:17182
msgid ""
":gh:`88324`: Reword :mod:`subprocess` to emphasize default behavior of "
"*stdin*, *stdout*, and *stderr* arguments. Remove inaccurate statement about"
" child file handle inheritance."
msgstr ""
":gh:`88324`: 重写 :mod:`subprocess` 以强调 *stdin*、*stdout* 和 *stderr* "
"参数的默认行为。移除关于子进程文件句柄继承的不准确陈述。"

#: ../NEWS:17189
msgid ""
":gh:`101334`: ``test_tarfile`` has been updated to pass when run as a high "
"UID."
msgstr ":gh:`101334`: ``test_tarfile`` 已更新，以便在高 UID 下运行时通过。"

#: ../NEWS:17195
msgid ""
":gh:`101282`: Update BOLT configuration not to use deprecated usage of "
"``--split functions``. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101282`: 更新 BOLT 配置，不再使用已弃用的 ``--split functions`` 用法。由 Donghee Na "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:17198
msgid ""
":gh:`101522`: Allow overriding Windows dependencies versions and paths using"
" MSBuild properties."
msgstr ":gh:`101522`: 允许使用 MSBuild 属性覆盖 Windows 依赖项的版本和路径。"

#: ../NEWS:17201
msgid ""
":gh:`77532`: Minor fixes to allow building with ``PlatformToolset=ClangCL`` "
"on Windows."
msgstr ":gh:`77532`: 小修小补以允许在 Windows 上使用 ``PlatformToolset=ClangCL`` 构建。"

#: ../NEWS:17204
msgid ""
":gh:`101152`: In accordance with :PEP:`699`, the ``ma_version_tag`` field in"
" :c:type:`PyDictObject` is deprecated for extension modules. Accessing this "
"field will generate a compiler warning at compile time. This field will be "
"removed in Python 3.14."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101152`: 根据 :PEP:`699`，:c:type:`PyDictObject` 中的 ``ma_version_tag`` "
"字段对扩展模块已弃用。访问此字段将在编译时生成编译器警告。此字段将在 Python 3.14 中移除。"

#: ../NEWS:17209
msgid ""
":gh:`100340`: Allows -Wno-int-conversion for wasm-sdk 17 and onwards, thus "
"enables building WASI builds once against the latest sdk."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100340`: 允许 wasm-sdk 17 及更高版本使用 -Wno-int-conversion，从而能够针对最新 sdk 构建 "
"WASI 构建。"

#: ../NEWS:17212
msgid ""
":gh:`101060`: Conditionally add ``-fno-reorder-blocks-and-partition`` in "
"configure. Effectively fixes ``--enable-bolt`` when using Clang, as this "
"appears to be a GCC-only flag."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101060`: 在配置中有条件地添加 ``-fno-reorder-blocks-and-partition``。有效修复了使用 Clang"
" 时的 ``--enable-bolt``，因为这似乎是一个仅 GCC 的标志。"

#: ../NEWS:17216
msgid ""
":gh:`98705`: ``__bool__`` is defined in AIX system header files which breaks"
" the build in AIX, so undefine it."
msgstr ":gh:`98705`: AIX 系统头文件中定义了 ``__bool__``，这会破坏 AIX 中的构建，因此取消定义它。"

#: ../NEWS:17219
msgid ""
":gh:`98636`: Fix a regression in detecting ``gdbm_compat`` library for the "
"``_gdbm`` module build."
msgstr ":gh:`98636`: 修复了为 ``_gdbm`` 模块构建检测 ``gdbm_compat`` 库时的回归。"

#: ../NEWS:17222
msgid ""
":gh:`96305`: ``_aix_support`` now uses a simple code to get platform details"
" rather than the now non-existent ``_bootsubprocess`` during bootstrap."
msgstr ""
":gh:`96305`: ``_aix_support`` 现在使用简单的代码来获取平台详情，而不是在引导过程中使用现在不存在的 "
"``_bootsubprocess``。"

#: ../NEWS:17228
msgid ""
":gh:`101543`: Ensure the install path in the registry is only used when the "
"standard library hasn't been located in any other way."
msgstr ":gh:`101543`: 确保注册表中的安装路径仅在标准库尚未通过任何其他方式定位时使用。"

#: ../NEWS:17231
msgid ""
":gh:`101467`: The ``py.exe`` launcher now correctly filters when only a "
"single runtime is installed. It also correctly handles prefix matches on "
"tags so that ``-3.1`` does not match ``3.11``, but would still match "
"``3.1-32``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101467`: ``py.exe`` 启动器现在在仅安装单个运行时正确过滤。它还正确处理标签上的前缀匹配，以便 ``-3.1`` 不匹配 "
"``3.11``，但仍然匹配 ``3.1-32``。"

#: ../NEWS:17236
msgid ":gh:`99834`: Updates bundled copy of Tcl/Tk to 8.6.13.0"
msgstr ":gh:`99834`: 更新捆绑的 Tcl/Tk 到 8.6.13.0"

#: ../NEWS:17238
msgid ""
":gh:`101135`: Restore ability to launch older 32-bit versions from the "
":file:`py.exe` launcher when both 32-bit and 64-bit installs of the same "
"version are available."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101135`: 恢复从 :file:`py.exe` 启动器启动旧版 32 位版本的能力，当同一版本的 32 位和 64 位安装都可用时。"

#: ../NEWS:17242
msgid ""
":gh:`82052`: Fixed an issue where writing more than 32K of Unicode output to"
" the console screen in one go can result in mojibake."
msgstr ":gh:`82052`: 修复了向控制台屏幕一次性写入超过 32K Unicode 输出可能导致乱码的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:17245
msgid ""
":gh:`100320`: Ensures the ``PythonPath`` registry key from an install is "
"used when launching from a different copy of Python that relies on an "
"existing install to provide a copy of its modules and standard library."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100320`: 确保在从依赖现有安装提供其模块和标准库副本的不同 Python 副本启动时，使用安装中的 ``PythonPath`` "
"注册表键。"

#: ../NEWS:17249
msgid ""
":gh:`100247`: Restores support for the :file:`py.exe` launcher finding "
"shebang commands in its configuration file using the full command name."
msgstr ":gh:`100247`: 恢复对 :file:`py.exe` 启动器在其配置文件中使用完整命令名查找 shebang 命令的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:17254
msgid "Python 3.12.0 alpha 4"
msgstr "Python 3.12.0 alpha 4"

#: ../NEWS:17256
msgid "*Release date: 2023-01-10*"
msgstr "*发布日期：2023-01-10*"

#: ../NEWS:17261
msgid ""
":gh:`100776`: Fix misleading default value in :func:`input`'s "
"``__text_signature__``."
msgstr ":gh:`100776`: 修正了 :func:`input` 的 ``__text_signature__`` 中误导性的默认值。"

#: ../NEWS:17264
msgid ""
":gh:`99005`: Remove :opcode:`!UNARY_POSITIVE`, :opcode:`!ASYNC_GEN_WRAP` and"
" :opcode:`!LIST_TO_TUPLE`, replacing them with intrinsics."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99005`: 移除 :opcode:`!UNARY_POSITIVE`、:opcode:`!ASYNC_GEN_WRAP` 和 "
":opcode:`!LIST_TO_TUPLE`，用内建函数替代它们。"

#: ../NEWS:17267
msgid ""
":gh:`99005`: Add new :opcode:`CALL_INTRINSIC_1` instruction. Remove "
":opcode:`IMPORT_STAR`, :opcode:`PRINT_EXPR` and "
":opcode:`STOPITERATION_ERROR`, replacing them with the "
":opcode:`CALL_INTRINSIC_1` instruction."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99005`: 新增 :opcode:`CALL_INTRINSIC_1` 指令。移除 "
":opcode:`IMPORT_STAR`、:opcode:`PRINT_EXPR` 和 :opcode:`STOPITERATION_ERROR`，用"
" :opcode:`CALL_INTRINSIC_1` 指令替代它们。"

#: ../NEWS:17272
msgid ""
":gh:`100288`: Remove the LOAD_ATTR_METHOD_WITH_DICT specialized instruction."
" Stats show it is not useful."
msgstr ":gh:`100288`: 移除LOAD_ATTR_METHOD_WITH_DICT专用指令。统计显示它没有用处。"

#: ../NEWS:17275
msgid ""
":gh:`100720`: Added ``_PyFrame_NumSlotsForCodeObject``, which returns the "
"number of slots needed in a frame for a given code object."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100720`: 添加了 ``_PyFrame_NumSlotsForCodeObject``，它返回一个给定代码对象在帧中所需的槽位数量。"

#: ../NEWS:17278
msgid ""
":gh:`100719`: Removed the co_nplaincellvars field from the code object, as "
"it is redundant."
msgstr ":gh:`100719`: 从代码对象中移除了co_nplaincellvars字段，因为它是冗余的。"

#: ../NEWS:17281
msgid ""
":gh:`100637`: Fix :func:`int.__sizeof__` calculation to include the "
"1-element ``ob_digit`` array for ``0`` and ``False``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100637`: 修正 :func:`int.__sizeof__` 的计算，以包括 ``0`` 和 ``False`` 的1元素 "
"``ob_digit``数组。"

#: ../NEWS:17284
msgid ""
":gh:`100649`: Update the native_thread_id field of PyThreadState after fork."
msgstr ":gh:`100649`: 在fork后更新PyThreadState的native_thread_id字段。"

#: ../NEWS:17286
msgid ""
":gh:`100126`: Fix an issue where \"incomplete\" frames could be briefly "
"visible to C code while other frames are being torn down, possibly resulting"
" in corruption or hard crashes of the interpreter while running finalizers."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100126`: 修复了一个问题，即在其他帧被销毁时，“不完整”帧可能会短暂地对C代码可见，可能导致解释器在运行终结器时损坏或硬崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:17290
msgid ""
":gh:`87447`: Fix :exc:`SyntaxError` on comprehension rebind checking with "
"names that are not actually redefined."
msgstr ":gh:`87447`: 修复了在理解重新绑定检查中，对实际上未重新定义的名称抛出 :exc:`SyntaxError` 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:17293
msgid ""
"Now reassigning ``b`` in ``[(b := 1) for a, b.prop in some_iter]`` is "
"allowed. Reassigning ``a`` is still disallowed as per :pep:`572`."
msgstr ""
"现在在 ``[(b := 1) for a, b.prop in some_iter]`` 中重新分配 ``b`` 是被允许的。根据 "
":pep:`572`，重新分配 ``a`` 仍然不被允许。"

#: ../NEWS:17296
msgid ""
":gh:`100268`: Add :meth:`int.is_integer` to improve duck type compatibility "
"between :class:`int` and :class:`float`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100268`: 添加 :meth:`int.is_integer` 以提高 :class:`int` 和 :class:`float` "
"之间的鸭子类型兼容性。"

#: ../NEWS:17299
msgid ""
":gh:`100425`: Improve the accuracy of ``sum()`` with compensated summation."
msgstr ":gh:`100425`: 通过补偿求和提高了 ``sum()`` 的准确性。"

#: ../NEWS:17304
msgid ""
":gh:`100374`: Fix incorrect result and delay in :func:`socket.getfqdn`. "
"Patch by Dominic Socular."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100374`: 修正了 :func:`socket.getfqdn` 的错误结果和延迟。由Dominic Socular提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:17310
msgid ""
":gh:`100357`: Convert ``vars``, ``dir``, ``next``, ``getattr``, and ``iter``"
" to argument clinic."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100357`: 将 ``vars``、``dir``、``next``、``getattr`` 和 ``iter`` 转换为参数诊所。"

#: ../NEWS:17313
msgid ""
":gh:`100117`: Improve the output of :meth:`codeobject.co_lines` by emitting "
"only one entry for each line range."
msgstr ":gh:`100117`: 通过为每个行范围只发出一个条目来改进 :meth:`codeobject.co_lines` 的输出。"

#: ../NEWS:17316
msgid ""
":gh:`90043`: Handle NaNs when specializing :opcode:`COMPARE_OP` for "
":class:`float` values."
msgstr ":gh:`90043`: 在专门为 :class:`float` 值设计 :opcode:`COMPARE_OP` 时处理 NaNs。"

#: ../NEWS:17319
msgid ""
":gh:`100222`: Redefine the ``_Py_CODEUNIT`` typedef as a union to describe "
"its layout to the C compiler, avoiding type punning and improving clarity."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100222`: 将 ``_Py_CODEUNIT`` 类型定义重新定义为联合体，以描述其布局给 C 编译器，避免类型双关并提高清晰度。"

#: ../NEWS:17322
msgid ""
":gh:`99955`: Internal compiler functions (in compile.c) now consistently "
"return -1 on error and 0 on success."
msgstr ":gh:`99955`: 内部编译器函数（在 compile.c 中）现在一致地在错误时返回 -1，成功时返回 0。"

#: ../NEWS:17325
msgid ""
":gh:`100188`: The ``BINARY_SUBSCR_LIST_INT`` and ``BINARY_SUBSCR_TUPLE_INT``"
" instructions are no longer used for negative integers because those "
"instructions always miss when encountering negative integers."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100188`: ``BINARY_SUBSCR_LIST_INT`` 和 ``BINARY_SUBSCR_TUPLE_INT`` "
"指令不再用于负整数，因为这些指令在遇到负整数时总是失败。"

#: ../NEWS:17329
msgid ""
":gh:`99110`: Initialize frame->previous in frameobject.c to fix a "
"segmentation fault when accessing frames created by :c:func:`PyFrame_New`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99110`: 在 frameobject.c 中初始化 frame->previous，以修复访问由 "
":c:func:`PyFrame_New` 创建的帧时的段错误。"

#: ../NEWS:17332
msgid ""
":gh:`94155`: Improved the hashing algorithm for code objects, mitigating "
"some hash collisions."
msgstr ":gh:`94155`: 改进了代码对象的哈希算法，缓解了一些哈希冲突。"

#: ../NEWS:17335
msgid ""
":gh:`99540`: ``None`` now hashes to a constant value. This is not a "
"requirements change."
msgstr ":gh:`99540`: ``None`` 现在哈希为一个常数值。这不是需求变更。"

#: ../NEWS:17338
msgid ""
":gh:`100143`: When built with ``--enable-pystats``, stats collection is now "
"off by default. To enable it early at startup, pass the ``-Xpystats`` flag."
"  Stats are now always dumped, even if switched off."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100143`: 当使用 ``--enable-pystats`` 构建时，统计收集现在默认关闭。要在启动时早期启用它，请传递 "
"``-Xpystats`` 标志。即使关闭，统计信息现在也会被转储。"

#: ../NEWS:17342
msgid ""
":gh:`100146`: Improve ``BUILD_LIST`` opcode so that it works similarly to "
"the ``BUILD_TUPLE`` opcode, by stealing references from the stack rather "
"than repeatedly using stack operations to set list elements.  Implementation"
" details are in a new private API :c:func:`!_PyList_FromArraySteal`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100146`: 改进 ``BUILD_LIST`` 操作码，使其工作方式类似于 ``BUILD_TUPLE`` "
"操作码，通过从堆栈中窃取引用而不是重复使用堆栈操作来设置列表元素。实现细节在一个新的私有 API "
":c:func:`!_PyList_FromArraySteal` 中。"

#: ../NEWS:17347
msgid ":gh:`100110`: Specialize ``FOR_ITER`` for tuples."
msgstr ":gh:`100110`: 为元组专门设计 ``FOR_ITER``。"

#: ../NEWS:17349
msgid ""
":gh:`100050`: Honor existing errors obtained when searching for mismatching "
"parentheses in the tokenizer. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":gh:`100050`: 在标记器中搜索不匹配的括号时，尊重现有的错误。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:17352
msgid ""
":gh:`92216`: Improve the performance of :func:`hasattr` for type objects "
"with a missing attribute."
msgstr ":gh:`92216`: 提高 :func:`hasattr` 对于缺少属性的类型对象的性能。"

#: ../NEWS:17355
msgid ""
":gh:`99582`: Freeze :mod:`zipimport` module into ``_bootstrap_python``."
msgstr ":gh:`99582`: 将 :mod:`zipimport` 模块冻结到 ``_bootstrap_python`` 中。"

#: ../NEWS:17357
msgid ""
":gh:`99554`: Pack debugging location tables more efficiently during bytecode"
" compilation."
msgstr ":gh:`99554`: 在字节码编译期间更高效地打包调试位置表。"

#: ../NEWS:17360
msgid ""
":gh:`98522`: Add an internal version number to code objects, to give better "
"versioning of inner functions and comprehensions, and thus better "
"specialization of those functions. This change is invisible to both Python "
"and C extensions."
msgstr ""
":gh:`98522`: "
"向代码对象添加内部版本号，以便更好地对内部函数和推导式进行版本控制，从而更好地特化这些函数。这一变化对Python和C扩展都是不可见的。"

#: ../NEWS:17365
msgid ":gh:`94603`: Improve performance of ``list.pop`` for small lists."
msgstr ":gh:`94603`: 提高小列表的 ``list.pop`` 性能。"

#: ../NEWS:17370
msgid ":gh:`89051`: Add :const:`ssl.OP_LEGACY_SERVER_CONNECT`"
msgstr ":gh:`89051`: 添加 :const:`ssl.OP_LEGACY_SERVER_CONNECT`"

#: ../NEWS:17375
msgid ""
":issue:`32782`: ``ctypes`` arrays of length 0 now report a correct itemsize "
"when a ``memoryview`` is constructed from them, rather than always giving a "
"value of 0."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32782`: 从 ``ctypes`` 长度为0的数组构建 ``memoryview`` "
"时，现在会报告正确的itemsize，而不是总是给出0的值。"

#: ../NEWS:17382
msgid ""
":gh:`100833`: Speed up :func:`math.fsum` by removing defensive ``volatile`` "
"qualifiers."
msgstr ":gh:`100833`: 通过移除防御性的 ``volatile`` 限定符来加速 :func:`math.fsum`。"

#: ../NEWS:17385
msgid ""
":gh:`100805`: Modify :func:`random.choice` implementation to once again work"
" with NumPy arrays."
msgstr ":gh:`100805`: 修改 :func:`random.choice` 实现，使其再次与NumPy数组一起工作。"

#: ../NEWS:17388
msgid ":gh:`100813`: Add :const:`socket.IP_PKTINFO` constant."
msgstr ":gh:`100813`: 添加 :const:`socket.IP_PKTINFO` 常量。"

#: ../NEWS:17390
msgid ""
":gh:`100792`: Make :meth:`email.message.Message.__contains__` twice as fast."
msgstr ":gh:`100792`: 使 :meth:`email.message.Message.__contains__` 速度提高一倍。"

#: ../NEWS:17392
msgid ""
":gh:`91851`: Microoptimizations for :meth:`fractions.Fraction.__round__`, "
":meth:`fractions.Fraction.__ceil__` and "
":meth:`fractions.Fraction.__floor__`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91851`: 对 "
":meth:`fractions.Fraction.__round__`、:meth:`fractions.Fraction.__ceil__` 和 "
":meth:`fractions.Fraction.__floor__` 进行微优化。"

#: ../NEWS:17396
msgid ""
":gh:`90104`: Avoid RecursionError on ``repr`` if a dataclass field "
"definition has a cyclic reference."
msgstr ":gh:`90104`: 如果数据类字段定义有循环引用，则在 ``repr`` 上避免 RecursionError。"

#: ../NEWS:17399
msgid ""
":gh:`100689`: Fix crash in :mod:`pyexpat` by statically allocating "
"``PyExpat_CAPI`` capsule."
msgstr ":gh:`100689`: 通过静态分配 ``PyExpat_CAPI`` 胶囊来修复 :mod:`pyexpat` 中的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:17402
msgid ""
":gh:`100740`: Fix ``unittest.mock.Mock`` not respecting the spec for "
"attribute names prefixed with ``assert``."
msgstr ":gh:`100740`: 修复 ``unittest.mock.Mock`` 不尊重以 ``assert`` 前缀开头的属性名的规范。"

#: ../NEWS:17405
msgid ""
":gh:`91219`: Change ``SimpleHTTPRequestHandler`` to support subclassing to "
"provide a different set of index file names instead of using ``__init__`` "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91219`: 更改 ``SimpleHTTPRequestHandler`` 以支持子类化来提供一组不同的索引文件名，而不是使用 "
"``__init__`` 参数。"

#: ../NEWS:17409
msgid ""
":gh:`100690`: ``Mock`` objects which are not unsafe will now raise an "
"``AttributeError`` when accessing an attribute that matches the name of an "
"assertion but without the prefix ``assert_``, e.g. accessing ``called_once``"
" instead of ``assert_called_once``. This is in addition to this already "
"happening for accessing attributes with prefixes ``assert``, ``assret``, "
"``asert``, ``aseert``, and ``assrt``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100690`: 不安全的 ``Mock`` 对象现在将在访问与断言名称匹配但没有 ``assert_`` 前缀的属性时引发 "
"``AttributeError``，例如访问 ``called_once`` 而不是 ``assert_called_once``。除了已经对带有前缀"
" ``assert``、``assret``、``asert``、``aseert`` 和 ``assrt`` 的属性访问发生这种情况之外。"

#: ../NEWS:17416
msgid ""
":gh:`89727`: Simplify and optimize :func:`os.walk` by using "
":func:`isinstance` checks to check the top of the stack."
msgstr ":gh:`89727`: 通过使用 :func:`isinstance` 检查来检查栈顶，简化和优化 :func:`os.walk`。"

#: ../NEWS:17419
msgid ":gh:`100485`: Add math.sumprod() to compute the sum of products."
msgstr ":gh:`100485`: 添加 math.sumprod() 以计算乘积之和。"

#: ../NEWS:17421
msgid ""
":gh:`86508`: Fix :func:`asyncio.open_connection` to skip binding to local "
"addresses of different family. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`86508`: 修复 :func:`asyncio.open_connection` 跳过绑定到不同族的本地地址。由 Kumar Aditya"
" 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:17424
msgid ""
":gh:`97930`: ``importlib.resources.files`` now accepts a module as an anchor"
" instead of only accepting packages. If a module is passed, resources are "
"resolved adjacent to that module (in the same package or at the package "
"root). The parameter was renamed from ``package`` to ``anchor`` with a "
"compatibility shim for those passing by keyword. Additionally, the new "
"``anchor`` parameter is now optional and will default to the caller's "
"module."
msgstr ""
":gh:`97930`: ``importlib.resources.files`` "
"现在接受模块作为锚点，而不仅仅是包。如果传递了一个模块，资源将解析为该模块相邻的位置（在同一包中或在包根目录中）。该参数已从 ``package`` "
"重命名为 ``anchor``，并为那些通过关键字传递的提供了兼容性填充。此外，新的 ``anchor`` 参数现在是可选的，将默认为调用者的模块。"

#: ../NEWS:17432
msgid ""
":gh:`100585`: Fixed a bug where importlib.resources.as_file was leaving file"
" pointers open"
msgstr ":gh:`100585`: 修复了 importlib.resources.as_file 留下文件指针未关闭的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:17435
msgid ""
":gh:`100562`: Improve performance of :meth:`pathlib.Path.absolute` by nearly"
" 2x. This comes at the cost of a performance regression in "
":meth:`pathlib.Path.cwd`, which is generally used less frequently in user "
"code."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100562`: 将 :meth:`pathlib.Path.absolute` 的性能提高了近 2 倍。这是以 "
":meth:`pathlib.Path.cwd` 的性能退步为代价的，后者在用户代码中一般使用频率较低。"

#: ../NEWS:17440
msgid ""
":gh:`100519`: Small simplification of "
":func:`http.cookiejar.eff_request_host` that improves readability and better"
" matches the RFC wording."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100519`: 对 :func:`http.cookiejar.eff_request_host` "
"进行了小的简化，提高了可读性，并更好地匹配了 RFC 的措辞。"

#: ../NEWS:17443
msgid ""
":gh:`100287`: Fix the interaction of :func:`unittest.mock.seal` with "
":class:`unittest.mock.AsyncMock`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100287`: 修复了 :func:`unittest.mock.seal` 与 "
":class:`unittest.mock.AsyncMock` 的交互问题。"

#: ../NEWS:17446
msgid ""
":gh:`100488`: Add :meth:`Fraction.is_integer` to check whether a "
":class:`fractions.Fraction` is an integer. This improves duck type "
"compatibility with :class:`float` and :class:`int`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100488`: 添加 :meth:`Fraction.is_integer` 以检查 :class:`fractions.Fraction`"
" 是否为整数。这提高了与 :class:`float` 和 :class:`int` 的鸭子类型兼容性。"

#: ../NEWS:17450
msgid ""
":gh:`100474`: :mod:`http.server` now checks that an index page is actually a"
" regular file before trying to serve it.  This avoids issues with "
"directories named ``index.html``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100474`: :mod:`http.server` 现在在尝试提供索引页面之前会检查它是否确实是一个常规文件。这避免了名为 "
"``index.html`` 的目录引起的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:17454
msgid ""
":gh:`100363`: Speed up :func:`asyncio.get_running_loop` by removing "
"redundant ``getpid`` checks. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100363`: 通过移除冗余的 ``getpid`` 检查来加速 :func:`asyncio.get_running_loop`。补丁由 "
"Kumar Aditya 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:17457
msgid ""
":gh:`78878`: Fix crash when creating an instance of "
":class:`!_ctypes.CField`."
msgstr ":gh:`78878`: 修复了创建 :class:`!_ctypes.CField` 实例时崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:17459
msgid ""
":gh:`100348`: Fix ref cycle in :class:`!asyncio._SelectorSocketTransport` by"
" removing ``_read_ready_cb`` in ``close``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100348`: 通过在 ``close`` 中移除 ``_read_ready_cb`` 来修复 "
":class:`!asyncio._SelectorSocketTransport` 中的引用循环。"

#: ../NEWS:17462
msgid ""
":gh:`100344`: Provide C implementation for :func:`asyncio.current_task` for "
"a 4x-6x speedup."
msgstr ":gh:`100344`: 为 :func:`asyncio.current_task` 提供 C 实现，速度提升 4 到 6 倍。"

#: ../NEWS:17465
msgid ""
":gh:`100272`: Fix JSON serialization of OrderedDict.  It now preserves the "
"order of keys."
msgstr ":gh:`100272`: 修复 OrderedDict 的 JSON 序列化问题。现在它能保持键的顺序。"

#: ../NEWS:17468
msgid ""
":gh:`83076`: Instantiation of ``Mock()`` and ``AsyncMock()`` is now 3.8x "
"faster."
msgstr ":gh:`83076`: ``Mock()`` 和 ``AsyncMock()`` 的实例化现在快了 3.8 倍。"

#: ../NEWS:17471
msgid ""
":gh:`100234`: Set a default value of 1.0 for the ``lambd`` parameter in "
"random.expovariate()."
msgstr ":gh:`100234`: 为 random.expovariate() 的 ``lambd`` 参数设置了默认值 1.0。"

#: ../NEWS:17474
msgid ""
":gh:`100228`: A :exc:`DeprecationWarning` may be raised when :func:`os.fork`"
" or :func:`os.forkpty` is called from multi-threaded processes.  Forking "
"with threads is unsafe and can cause deadlocks, crashes and subtle problems."
" Lack of a warning does not indicate that the fork call was actually safe, "
"as Python may not be aware of all threads."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100228`: 当从多线程进程调用 :func:`os.fork` 或 :func:`os.forkpty` 时，可能会引发 "
":exc:`DeprecationWarning`。使用线程进行 fork 是不安全的，可能导致死锁、崩溃和难以察觉的问题。没有警告并不意味着 fork"
" 调用实际上是安全的，因为 Python 可能不知道所有线程。"

#: ../NEWS:17480
msgid ":gh:`100039`: Improve signatures for enums and flags."
msgstr ":gh:`100039`: 改进了枚举和标志的签名。"

#: ../NEWS:17482
msgid ""
":gh:`100133`: Fix regression in :mod:`asyncio` where a subprocess would "
"sometimes lose data received from pipe."
msgstr ":gh:`100133`: 修复了 :mod:`asyncio` 中的一个回归问题，其中子进程有时会丢失从管道接收的数据。"

#: ../NEWS:17485
msgid ""
":issue:`44592`: Fixes inconsistent handling of case sensitivity of "
"*extrasaction* arg in :class:`csv.DictWriter`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44592`: 修复了 :class:`csv.DictWriter` 中 *extrasaction* 参数大小写处理不一致的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:17488
msgid ""
":gh:`100098`: Fix ``tuple`` subclasses being cast to ``tuple`` when used as "
"enum values."
msgstr ":gh:`100098`: 修复了 ``tuple`` 子类在被用作枚举值时被强制转换为 ``tuple`` 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:17491
msgid ""
":gh:`85432`: Rename the *fmt* parameter of the pure-Python implementation of"
" :meth:`datetime.time.strftime` to *format*. Rename the *t* parameter of "
":meth:`datetime.datetime.fromtimestamp` to *timestamp*. These changes mean "
"the parameter names in the pure-Python implementation now match the "
"parameter names in the C implementation. Patch by Alex Waygood."
msgstr ""
":gh:`85432`: 将 :meth:`datetime.time.strftime` 的纯 Python 实现中的 *fmt* 参数重命名为 "
"*format*。将 :meth:`datetime.datetime.fromtimestamp` 的 *t* 参数重命名为 "
"*timestamp*。这些更改意味着纯 Python 实现中的参数名称现在与 C 实现中的参数名称匹配。由 Alex Waygood 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:17497
msgid ""
":gh:`98778`: Update :exc:`~urllib.error.HTTPError` to be initialized "
"properly, even if the ``fp`` is ``None``. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":gh:`98778`: 更新 :exc:`~urllib.error.HTTPError`，使其即使在 ``fp`` 为 ``None`` "
"时也能正确初始化。由 Donghee Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:17500
msgid ""
":gh:`99925`: Unify error messages in JSON serialization between "
"``json.dumps(float('nan'), allow_nan=False)`` and ``json.dumps(float('nan'),"
" allow_nan=False, indent=<SOMETHING>)``. Now both include the representation"
" of the value that could not be serialized."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99925`: 统一了 ``json.dumps(float('nan'), allow_nan=False)`` 和 "
"``json.dumps(float('nan'), allow_nan=False, indent=<SOMETHING>)`` 之间的 JSON "
"序列化错误消息。现在两者都包括无法序列化的值的表示。"

#: ../NEWS:17505
msgid ""
":gh:`89727`: Fix issue with :func:`os.walk` where a :exc:`RecursionError` "
"would occur on deep directory structures by adjusting the implementation of "
":func:`os.walk` to be iterative instead of recursive."
msgstr ""
":gh:`89727`: 通过调整 :func:`os.walk` 的实现方式，使其迭代而非递归，修复了在深层目录结构上会发生 "
":exc:`RecursionError` 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:17509
msgid ""
":gh:`94943`: Add :ref:`enum-dataclass-support` to the :class:`~enum.Enum` "
":meth:`~enum.Enum.__repr__`. When inheriting from a "
":class:`~dataclasses.dataclass`, only show the field names in the value "
"section of the member :func:`repr`, and not the dataclass' class name."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94943`: 向 :class:`~enum.Enum` 的 :meth:`~enum.Enum.__repr__` 添加 "
":ref:`enum-dataclass-support`。当从 :class:`~dataclasses.dataclass` 继承时，仅在成员的 "
":func:`repr` 的值部分显示字段名称，而不显示 dataclass 的类名。"

#: ../NEWS:17514
msgid ""
":gh:`83035`: Fix :func:`inspect.getsource` handling of decorator calls with "
"nested parentheses."
msgstr ":gh:`83035`: 修复 :func:`inspect.getsource` 对带有嵌套括号的装饰器调用的处理。"

#: ../NEWS:17517
msgid ""
":gh:`99576`: Fix ``.save()`` method for ``LWPCookieJar`` and "
"``MozillaCookieJar``: saved file was not truncated on repeated save."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99576`: 修复 ``LWPCookieJar`` 和 ``MozillaCookieJar`` 的 ``.save()`` "
"方法：在重复保存时未截断保存的文件。"

#: ../NEWS:17520
msgid ""
":gh:`94912`: Add :func:`inspect.markcoroutinefunction` decorator which "
"manually marks a function as a coroutine for the benefit of "
":func:`iscoroutinefunction`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94912`: 添加 :func:`inspect.markcoroutinefunction` 装饰器，手动将函数标记为协程，以利于 "
":func:`iscoroutinefunction`。"

#: ../NEWS:17524
msgid ""
":gh:`99509`: Add :pep:`585` support for "
":class:`multiprocessing.queues.Queue`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99509`: 为 :class:`multiprocessing.queues.Queue` 添加 :pep:`585` 支持。"

#: ../NEWS:17527
msgid ""
":gh:`99482`: Remove ``Jython`` partial compatibility code from several "
"stdlib modules."
msgstr ":gh:`99482`: 从多个 stdlib 模块中移除 ``Jython`` 部分兼容性代码。"

#: ../NEWS:17530
msgid ""
":gh:`99433`: Fix :mod:`doctest` failure on :class:`types.MethodWrapperType` "
"in modules."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99433`: 修复模块中对 :class:`types.MethodWrapperType` 的 :mod:`doctest` 失败。"

#: ../NEWS:17533
msgid ""
":gh:`85267`: Several improvements to :func:`inspect.signature`'s handling of"
" ``__text_signature``. - Fixes a case where :func:`inspect.signature` "
"dropped parameters - Fixes a case where :func:`inspect.signature` raised "
":exc:`tokenize.TokenError` - Allows :func:`inspect.signature` to understand "
"defaults involving binary operations of constants - "
":func:`inspect.signature` is documented as only raising :exc:`TypeError` or "
":exc:`ValueError`, but sometimes raised :exc:`RuntimeError`. These cases now"
" raise :exc:`ValueError` - Removed a dead code path"
msgstr ""
":gh:`85267`: 对 :func:`inspect.signature` 处理 ``__text_signature__`` 的多项改进。 - "
"修复了 :func:`inspect.signature` 丢弃参数的情况 - 修复了 :func:`inspect.signature` 引发 "
":exc:`tokenize.TokenError` 的情况 - 允许 :func:`inspect.signature` 理解涉及常量二元运算的默认值"
" - :func:`inspect.signature` 文档说明仅引发 :exc:`TypeError` 或 "
":exc:`ValueError`，但有时会引发 :exc:`RuntimeError`。这些情况现在会引发 :exc:`ValueError` - "
"移除了一个死代码路径"

#: ../NEWS:17542
msgid ""
":gh:`91166`: :mod:`asyncio` is optimized to avoid excessive copying when "
"writing to socket and use :meth:`~socket.socket.sendmsg` if the platform "
"supports it. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91166`: 优化 :mod:`asyncio` 以避免在写入套接字时过度复制，并在平台支持时使用 "
":meth:`~socket.socket.sendmsg`。由 Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:17546
msgid ""
":gh:`98030`: Add missing TCP socket options from Linux: ``TCP_MD5SIG``, "
"``TCP_THIN_LINEAR_TIMEOUTS``, ``TCP_THIN_DUPACK``, ``TCP_REPAIR``, "
"``TCP_REPAIR_QUEUE``, ``TCP_QUEUE_SEQ``, ``TCP_REPAIR_OPTIONS``, "
"``TCP_TIMESTAMP``, ``TCP_CC_INFO``, ``TCP_SAVE_SYN``, ``TCP_SAVED_SYN``, "
"``TCP_REPAIR_WINDOW``, ``TCP_FASTOPEN_CONNECT``, ``TCP_ULP``, "
"``TCP_MD5SIG_EXT``, ``TCP_FASTOPEN_KEY``, ``TCP_FASTOPEN_NO_COOKIE``, "
"``TCP_ZEROCOPY_RECEIVE``, ``TCP_INQ``, ``TCP_TX_DELAY``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`98030`: 从Linux添加缺失的TCP套接字选项: ``TCP_MD5SIG``, "
"``TCP_THIN_LINEAR_TIMEOUTS``, ``TCP_THIN_DUPACK``, ``TCP_REPAIR``, "
"``TCP_REPAIR_QUEUE``, ``TCP_QUEUE_SEQ``, ``TCP_REPAIR_OPTIONS``, "
"``TCP_TIMESTAMP``, ``TCP_CC_INFO``, ``TCP_SAVE_SYN``, ``TCP_SAVED_SYN``, "
"``TCP_REPAIR_WINDOW``, ``TCP_FASTOPEN_CONNECT``, ``TCP_ULP``, "
"``TCP_MD5SIG_EXT``, ``TCP_FASTOPEN_KEY``, ``TCP_FASTOPEN_NO_COOKIE``, "
"``TCP_ZEROCOPY_RECEIVE``, ``TCP_INQ``, ``TCP_TX_DELAY``."

#: ../NEWS:17554
msgid ""
":gh:`88500`: Reduced the memory usage of :func:`urllib.parse.unquote` and "
":func:`urllib.parse.unquote_to_bytes` on large values."
msgstr ""
":gh:`88500`: 减少了 :func:`urllib.parse.unquote` 和 "
":func:`urllib.parse.unquote_to_bytes` 在大值上的内存使用。"

#: ../NEWS:17557
msgid ""
":gh:`96127`: ``inspect.signature`` was raising ``TypeError`` on call with "
"mock objects. Now it correctly returns ``(*args, **kwargs)`` as inferred "
"signature."
msgstr ""
":gh:`96127`: ``inspect.signature`` 在使用模拟对象调用时会引发 ``TypeError``。现在它正确地返回 "
"``(*args, **kwargs)`` 作为推断签名。"

#: ../NEWS:17561
msgid ""
":gh:`95882`: Fix a 3.11 regression in "
":func:`~contextlib.asynccontextmanager`, which caused it to propagate "
"exceptions with incorrect tracebacks and fix a 3.11 regression in "
":func:`~contextlib.contextmanager`, which caused it to propagate exceptions "
"with incorrect tracebacks for :exc:`StopIteration`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95882`: 修复了 :func:`~contextlib.asynccontextmanager` "
"中的3.11回归问题，该问题导致它传播带有不正确回溯的异常；并修复了 :func:`~contextlib.contextmanager` "
"中的3.11回归问题，该问题导致它为 :exc:`StopIteration` 传播带有不正确回溯的异常。"

#: ../NEWS:17567
msgid ""
":gh:`78707`: Deprecate passing more than one positional argument to "
":meth:`pathlib.PurePath.relative_to` and "
":meth:`~pathlib.PurePath.is_relative_to`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`78707`: 弃用向 :meth:`pathlib.PurePath.relative_to` 和 "
":meth:`~pathlib.PurePath.is_relative_to` 传递多于一个位置参数。"

#: ../NEWS:17571
msgid ""
":gh:`92122`: Fix reStructuredText syntax errors in docstrings in the "
":mod:`enum` module."
msgstr ":gh:`92122`: 修复了 :mod:`enum` 模块中文档字符串的reStructuredText语法错误。"

#: ../NEWS:17574
msgid ""
":gh:`91851`: Optimize the :class:`~fractions.Fraction` arithmetics for small"
" components."
msgstr ":gh:`91851`: 优化了 :class:`~fractions.Fraction` 对小组件的算术运算。"

#: ../NEWS:17577
msgid ""
":issue:`24132`: Make :class:`pathlib.PurePath` and :class:`~pathlib.Path` "
"subclassable (private to start). Previously, attempting to instantiate a "
"subclass resulted in an :exc:`AttributeError` being raised. Patch by Barney "
"Gale."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24132`: 使 :class:`pathlib.PurePath` 和 :class:`~pathlib.Path` "
"可子类化（初始为私有）。之前，尝试实例化一个子类会引发 :exc:`AttributeError`。由Barney Gale提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:17582
msgid ""
":issue:`40447`: Accept :class:`os.PathLike` (such as :class:`pathlib.Path`) "
"in the ``stripdir`` arguments of :meth:`compileall.compile_file` and "
":meth:`compileall.compile_dir`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40447`: 在 :meth:`compileall.compile_file` 和 "
":meth:`compileall.compile_dir` 的 ``stripdir`` 参数中接受 :class:`os.PathLike` (如 "
":class:`pathlib.Path`) 。"

#: ../NEWS:17586
msgid ""
":issue:`36880`: Fix a reference counting issue when a :mod:`ctypes` callback"
" with return type :class:`~ctypes.py_object` returns ``None``, which could "
"cause crashes."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36880`: 修复了当 :mod:`ctypes` 回调返回类型为 :class:`~ctypes.py_object` 且返回 "
"``None`` 时的引用计数问题，该问题可能导致崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:17593
msgid ""
":gh:`100616`: Document existing ``attr`` parameter to "
":func:`curses.window.vline` function in :mod:`curses`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100616`: 在 :mod:`curses` 模块中，为 :func:`curses.window.vline` 函数记录现有的 "
"``attr`` 参数。"

#: ../NEWS:17596
msgid ""
":gh:`100472`: Remove claim in documentation that the ``stripdir``, "
"``prependdir`` and ``limit_sl_dest`` parameters of "
":func:`compileall.compile_dir` and :func:`compileall.compile_file` could be "
":class:`bytes`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100472`: 从文档中移除关于 :func:`compileall.compile_dir` 和 "
":func:`compileall.compile_file` 函数的 ``stripdir``、``prependdir`` 和 "
"``limit_sl_dest`` 参数可以是 :class:`bytes` 类型的声明。"

#: ../NEWS:17601
msgid ""
":issue:`25377`: Clarify use of octal format of mode argument in "
"help(os.chmod) as well as help(os.fchmod)"
msgstr ""
":issue:`25377`: 在 help(os.chmod) 和 help(os.fchmod) 中阐明 mode 参数的八进制格式使用。"

#: ../NEWS:17607
msgid ":gh:`100454`: Start running SSL tests with OpenSSL 3.1.0-beta1."
msgstr ":gh:`100454`: 开始使用 OpenSSL 3.1.0-beta1 运行 SSL 测试。"

#: ../NEWS:17609
msgid ""
":gh:`100086`: The Python test runner (libregrtest) now logs Python build "
"information like \"debug\" vs \"release\" build, or LTO and PGO "
"optimizations. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100086`: Python 测试运行器 (libregrtest) 现在会记录 Python "
"构建信息，如“debug”与“release”构建，或 LTO 和 PGO 优化。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:17613
msgid ""
":gh:`93018`: Make two tests forgiving towards host system libexpat with "
"backported security fixes applied."
msgstr ":gh:`93018`: 对应用了回溯安全修复的主机系统 libexpat 进行两项测试的宽容处理。"

#: ../NEWS:17619
msgid ""
":gh:`100540`: Removed the ``--with-system-ffi`` ``configure`` option; "
"``libffi`` must now always be supplied by the system on all non-Windows "
"platforms.  The option has had no effect on non-Darwin platforms for several"
" releases, and in 3.11 only had the non-obvious effect of invoking ``pkg-"
"config`` to find ``libffi`` and never setting ``-DUSING_APPLE_OS_LIBFFI``.  "
"Now on Darwin platforms ``configure`` will first check for the OS ``libffi``"
" and then fall back to the same processing as other platforms if it is not "
"found."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100540`: 移除了 ``configure`` 选项 ``--with-system-ffi``；现在在所有非 Windows "
"平台上，``libffi`` 必须始终由系统提供。该选项在非 Darwin 平台上多个版本以来已无效果，而在 3.11 "
"版本中仅有一个不明显的作用，即调用 ``pkg-config`` 来查找 ``libffi`` 且从未设置 "
"``-DUSING_APPLE_OS_LIBFFI``。现在在 Darwin 平台上，``configure`` 将首先检查操作系统 "
"``libffi``，如果未找到，则回退到与其他平台相同的处理方式。"

#: ../NEWS:17628
msgid ""
":gh:`88267`: Avoid exporting Python symbols in linked Windows applications "
"when the core is built as static."
msgstr ":gh:`88267`: 当核心作为静态构建时，避免在链接的 Windows 应用程序中导出 Python 符号。"

#: ../NEWS:17631
msgid ""
":issue:`41916`: Allow override of ac_cv_cxx_thread so that cross compiled "
"python can set -pthread for CXX."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41916`: 允许覆盖 ac_cv_cxx_thread，以便交叉编译的 Python 可以为 CXX 设置 -pthread。"

#: ../NEWS:17637
msgid ":gh:`100180`: Update Windows installer to OpenSSL 1.1.1s"
msgstr ":gh:`100180`: 将 Windows 安装程序更新至 OpenSSL 1.1.1s。"

#: ../NEWS:17639
msgid ""
":gh:`99191`: Use ``_MSVC_LANG >= 202002L`` instead of less-precise "
"``_MSC_VER >=1929`` to more accurately test for C++20 support in "
":file:`PC/_wmimodule.cpp`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99191`: 在 :file:`PC/_wmimodule.cpp` 中使用 ``_MSVC_LANG >= 202002L`` "
"而不是不太精确的 ``_MSC_VER >=1929`` 来更准确地测试 C++20 支持。"

#: ../NEWS:17643
msgid ""
":gh:`79218`: Define ``MS_WIN64`` for Mingw-w64 64bit, fix cython compilation"
" failure."
msgstr ":gh:`79218`: 为 Mingw-w64 64bit 定义 ``MS_WIN64``，修复 cython 编译失败。"

#: ../NEWS:17646
msgid ""
":gh:`99941`: Ensure that :func:`asyncio.Protocol.data_received` receives an "
"immutable :class:`bytes` object (as documented), instead of "
":class:`bytearray`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99941`: 确保 :func:`asyncio.Protocol.data_received` 接收一个不可变的 "
":class:`bytes` 对象（如文档所述），而不是 :class:`bytearray`。"

#: ../NEWS:17650
msgid ""
":issue:`43984`: :meth:`winreg.SetValueEx` now leaves the target value "
"untouched in the case of conversion errors. Previously, ``-1`` would be "
"written in case of such errors."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43984`: 现在，:meth:`winreg.SetValueEx` 在转换错误的情况下会保持目标值不变。此前，此类错误会写入 "
"``-1``。"

#: ../NEWS:17654
msgid ""
":issue:`34816`: ``hasattr(ctypes.windll, 'nonexistant')`` now returns "
"``False`` instead of raising :exc:`OSError`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34816`: 现在，``hasattr(ctypes.windll, 'nonexistant')`` 返回 ``False`` "
"而不是抛出 :exc:`OSError`。"

#: ../NEWS:17660
msgid ":gh:`100180`: Update macOS installer to OpenSSL 1.1.1s"
msgstr ":gh:`100180`: 将 macOS 安装程序更新至 OpenSSL 1.1.1s"

#: ../NEWS:17662
msgid ""
":gh:`100540`: Removed obsolete ``dlfcn.h`` shim from the ``_ctypes`` "
"extension module, which has not been necessary since Mac OS X 10.2."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100540`: 从 ``_ctypes`` 扩展模块中移除了自 Mac OS X 10.2 起就不再必要的过时 ``dlfcn.h`` "
"垫片。"

#: ../NEWS:17668
msgid ""
":issue:`45256`: Fix a bug that caused an :exc:`AttributeError` to be raised "
"in ``python-gdb.py`` when ``py-locals`` is used without a frame."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45256`: 修复了一个在 ``python-gdb.py`` 中当 ``py-locals`` 在没有帧的情况下使用时会导致抛出 "
":exc:`AttributeError` 的 bug。"

#: ../NEWS:17671
msgid ""
":gh:`100342`: Add missing ``NULL`` check for possible allocation failure in "
"``*args`` parsing in Argument Clinic."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100342`: 在 Argument Clinic 的 ``*args`` 解析中添加了对可能分配失败的缺失 ``NULL`` 检查。"

#: ../NEWS:17677
msgid ""
":gh:`99947`: Raising SystemError on import will now have its cause be set to"
" the original unexpected exception."
msgstr ":gh:`99947`: 现在，导入时引发的 SystemError 的原因会被设置为原始的意外异常。"

#: ../NEWS:17680
msgid ""
":gh:`99240`: In argument parsing, after deallocating newly allocated memory,"
" reset its pointer to NULL."
msgstr ":gh:`99240`: 在参数解析中，释放新分配的内存后，将其指针重置为 NULL。"

#: ../NEWS:17683
msgid ""
":gh:`98724`: The :c:macro:`Py_CLEAR`, :c:macro:`Py_SETREF` and "
":c:macro:`Py_XSETREF` macros now only evaluate their arguments once. If an "
"argument has side effects, these side effects are no longer duplicated. "
"Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`98724`: 现在，:c:macro:`Py_CLEAR`、:c:macro:`Py_SETREF` 和 "
":c:macro:`Py_XSETREF` 宏只对它们的参数求值一次。如果参数有副作用，这些副作用不再被重复。由 Victor Stinner "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:17690
msgid "Python 3.12.0 alpha 3"
msgstr "Python 3.12.0 alpha 3"

#: ../NEWS:17692
msgid "*Release date: 2022-12-06*"
msgstr "*发布日期：2022-12-06*"

#: ../NEWS:17697
msgid ""
":gh:`100001`: ``python -m http.server`` no longer allows terminal control "
"characters sent within a garbage request to be printed to the stderr server "
"log."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100001`: ``python -m http.server`` 不再允许垃圾请求中发送的终端控制字符被打印到 stderr "
"服务器日志中。"

#: ../NEWS:17701
msgid ""
"This is done by changing the :mod:`http.server` "
":class:`BaseHTTPRequestHandler` ``.log_message`` method to replace control "
"characters with a :samp:`\\\\x{HH}` hex escape before printing."
msgstr ""
"这是通过更改 :mod:`http.server` :class:`BaseHTTPRequestHandler` 的 ``.log_message``"
" 方法实现的，该方法在打印之前将控制字符替换为 :samp:`\\\\x{HH}` 十六进制转义。"

#: ../NEWS:17705
msgid ""
":gh:`87604`: Avoid publishing list of active per-interpreter audit hooks via"
" the :mod:`gc` module"
msgstr ":gh:`87604`: 避免通过 :mod:`gc` 模块发布每个解释器的活动审计钩子列表"

#: ../NEWS:17711
msgid ""
":gh:`99891`: Fix a bug in the tokenizer that could cause infinite recursion "
"when showing syntax warnings that happen in the first line of the source. "
"Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`99891`: 修复了分词器中的一个 bug，该 bug 在显示源代码第一行发生的语法警告时可能导致无限递归。由 Pablo Galindo "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:17715
msgid ""
":gh:`91054`: Add :c:func:`PyCode_AddWatcher` and "
":c:func:`PyCode_ClearWatcher` APIs to register callbacks to receive "
"notification on creation and destruction of code objects."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91054`: 添加 :c:func:`PyCode_AddWatcher` 和 :c:func:`PyCode_ClearWatcher` "
"API，用于注册回调以接收代码对象创建和销毁的通知。"

#: ../NEWS:17719
msgid ""
":gh:`99729`: Fix an issue that could cause frames to be visible to Python "
"code as they are being torn down, possibly leading to memory corruption or "
"hard crashes of the interpreter."
msgstr ":gh:`99729`: 修复一个问题，该问题可能导致帧在销毁时对 Python 代码可见，可能引发内存损坏或解释器硬崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:17723
msgid ""
":gh:`99708`: Fix bug where compiler crashes on an if expression with an "
"empty body block."
msgstr ":gh:`99708`: 修复编译器在遇到空体块的 if 表达式时崩溃的 bug。"

#: ../NEWS:17726
msgid ""
":gh:`99578`: Fix a reference bug in :func:`!_imp.create_builtin` after the "
"creation of the first sub-interpreter for modules ``builtins`` and ``sys``. "
"Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99578`: 修复 :func:`!_imp.create_builtin` 在第一个子解释器为模块 ``builtins`` 和 "
"``sys`` 创建后的引用 bug。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:17730
msgid ""
":gh:`99581`: Fixed a bug that was causing a buffer overflow if the tokenizer"
" copies a line missing the newline character from a file that is as long as "
"the available tokenizer buffer. Patch by Pablo galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`99581`: 修复了一个 bug，该 bug 会在标记器从文件中复制缺少换行符且长度与可用标记器缓冲区相同的行时导致缓冲区溢出。由 "
"Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:17734
msgid ""
":gh:`99553`: Fix bug where an :exc:`ExceptionGroup` subclass can wrap a "
":exc:`BaseException`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99553`: 修复 :exc:`ExceptionGroup` 子类可以包装 :exc:`BaseException` 的 bug。"

#: ../NEWS:17740
msgid ""
":gh:`99547`: Add a function to os.path to check if a path is a junction: "
"isjunction. Add similar functionality to pathlib.Path as is_junction."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99547`: 在 os.path 中添加一个函数来检查路径是否为连接点：isjunction。在 pathlib.Path "
"中添加类似功能作为 is_junction。"

#: ../NEWS:17743
msgid ""
":gh:`99370`: Fix zip path for venv created from a non-installed python on "
"POSIX platforms."
msgstr ":gh:`99370`: 为从非安装的 python 在 POSIX 平台上创建的 venv 修复 zip 路径。"

#: ../NEWS:17749
msgid ""
":gh:`99377`: Add audit events for thread creation and clear operations."
msgstr ":gh:`99377`: 为线程创建和清除操作添加审计事件。"

#: ../NEWS:17751
msgid ""
":gh:`98686`: Remove the ``BINARY_OP_GENERIC`` and ``COMPARE_OP_GENERIC`` "
"\"specializations\"."
msgstr ":gh:`98686`: 移除 ``BINARY_OP_GENERIC`` 和 ``COMPARE_OP_GENERIC`` 的“特化”。"

#: ../NEWS:17754
msgid ""
":gh:`99298`: Remove the remaining error paths for attribute specializations,"
" and refuse to specialize attribute accesses on types that haven't had "
":c:func:`PyType_Ready` called on them yet."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99298`: 移除属性特化的剩余错误路径，并拒绝在尚未调用 :c:func:`PyType_Ready` 的类型上进行属性访问特化。"

#: ../NEWS:17758
msgid ""
":gh:`99127`: Allow some features of :mod:`syslog` to the main interpreter "
"only. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ":gh:`99127`: 允许 :mod:`syslog` 的某些功能仅对主解释器可用。由 Donghee Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:17761
msgid ""
":gh:`91053`: Optimizing interpreters and JIT compilers may need to "
"invalidate internal metadata when functions are modified. This change adds "
"the ability to provide a callback that will be invoked each time a function "
"is created, modified, or destroyed."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91053`: 优化解释器和 JIT "
"编译器可能需要在函数被修改时使内部元数据无效。此更改增加了提供回调的能力，该回调将在每次函数创建、修改或销毁时被调用。"

#: ../NEWS:17766
msgid ""
":gh:`90994`: Improve error messages when there's a syntax error with call "
"arguments. The following three cases are covered: - No value is assigned to "
"a named argument, eg ``foo(a=)``. - A value is assigned to a star argument, "
"eg ``foo(*args=[0])``. - A value is assigned to a double-star keyword "
"argument, eg ``foo(**kwarg={'a': 0})``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`90994`: 改进调用参数语法错误时的错误信息。以下三种情况被覆盖：- 未给命名参数赋值，例如 ``foo(a=)``。- "
"给星号参数赋值，例如 ``foo(*args=[0])``。- 给双星号关键字参数赋值，例如 ``foo(**kwarg={'a': 0})``。"

#: ../NEWS:17772
msgid ""
":issue:`45026`: Optimize the :class:`range` object iterator. It is now "
"smaller, faster iteration of ranges containing large numbers. Smaller "
"pickles, faster unpickling."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45026`: 优化 :class:`range` 对象迭代器。现在对包含大数的范围进行迭代更小、更快。更小的 pickle，更快的 "
"unpickling。"

#: ../NEWS:17776
msgid ""
":issue:`31718`: Raise :exc:`ValueError` instead of :exc:`SystemError` when "
"methods of uninitialized :class:`io.IncrementalNewlineDecoder` objects are "
"called. Patch by Oren Milman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31718`: 当调用未初始化的 :class:`io.IncrementalNewlineDecoder` 对象的方法时，抛出 "
":exc:`ValueError` 而不是 :exc:`SystemError`。由 Oren Milman 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:17780
msgid ""
":issue:`38031`: Fix a possible assertion failure in :class:`io.FileIO` when "
"the opener returns an invalid file descriptor."
msgstr ":issue:`38031`: 修复 :class:`io.FileIO` 中当开启器返回无效文件描述符时可能出现的断言失败。"

#: ../NEWS:17786
msgid ""
":gh:`100001`: Also \\ escape \\s in the http.server "
"BaseHTTPRequestHandler.log_message so that it is technically possible to "
"parse the line and reconstruct what the original data was.  Without this a "
"\\xHH is ambiguous as to if it is a hex replacement we put in or the "
"characters r\"\\x\" came through in the original request line."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100001`: 在 http.server BaseHTTPRequestHandler.log_message 中也对 \\s "
"进行转义，以便技术上可以解析该行并重构原始数据是什么。没有这个，\\xHH 对于我们放入的十六进制替换或原始请求行中的字符 r\"\\x\" "
"来说是模糊的。"

#: ../NEWS:17792
msgid ""
":gh:`99957`: Add ``frozen_default`` parameter to "
":func:`typing.dataclass_transform`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99957`: 向 :func:`typing.dataclass_transform` 添加 ``frozen_default`` 参数。"

#: ../NEWS:17795
msgid ""
":gh:`79033`: Fix :func:`asyncio.Server.wait_closed` to actually do what the "
"docs promise -- wait for all existing connections to complete, after closing"
" the server."
msgstr ""
":gh:`79033`: 修复 :func:`asyncio.Server.wait_closed` "
"以实际执行文档承诺的操作——在关闭服务器后等待所有现有连接完成。"

#: ../NEWS:17799
msgid ""
":gh:`51524`: Fix bug when calling trace.CoverageResults with valid infile."
msgstr ":gh:`51524`: 修复在调用 trace.CoverageResults 时使用有效的 infile 时的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:17801
msgid ""
":gh:`99645`: Fix a bug in handling class cleanups in "
":class:`unittest.TestCase`.  Now ``addClassCleanup()`` uses separate lists "
"for different ``TestCase`` subclasses, and ``doClassCleanups()`` only cleans"
" up the particular class."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99645`: 修复 :class:`unittest.TestCase` 中处理类清理时的错误。现在 "
"``addClassCleanup()`` 为不同的 ``TestCase`` 子类使用单独的列表，而 ``doClassCleanups()`` "
"只清理特定的类。"

#: ../NEWS:17806
msgid ""
":gh:`99508`: Fix ``TypeError`` in ``Lib/importlib/_bootstrap_external.py`` "
"while calling ``_imp.source_hash()``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99508`: 修复在调用 ``_imp.source_hash()`` 时 "
"``Lib/importlib/_bootstrap_external.py`` 中的 ``TypeError``。"

#: ../NEWS:17809
msgid ""
":gh:`66285`: Fix :mod:`asyncio` to not share event loop and signal wakeupfd "
"in forked processes. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`66285`: 修复 :mod:`asyncio` 不在分叉进程中共享事件循环和信号 wakeupfd。由 Kumar Aditya "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:17812
msgid ""
":gh:`97001`: Release the GIL when calling termios APIs to avoid blocking "
"threads."
msgstr ":gh:`97001`: 在调用 termios API 时释放 GIL 以避免阻塞线程。"

#: ../NEWS:17815
msgid ""
":gh:`92647`: Use final status of an enum to determine lookup or creation "
"branch of functional API."
msgstr ":gh:`92647`: 使用枚举的最终状态来确定功能API的查找或创建分支。"

#: ../NEWS:17818
msgid ""
":gh:`99388`: Add *loop_factory* parameter to :func:`asyncio.run` to allow "
"specifying a custom event loop factory. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99388`: 向 :func:`asyncio.run` 添加 *loop_factory* 参数，允许指定自定义事件循环工厂。由 "
"Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:17821
msgid ""
":gh:`99341`: Fix :func:`ast.increment_lineno` to also cover "
":class:`ast.TypeIgnore` when changing line numbers."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99341`: 修复 :func:`ast.increment_lineno`，使其在更改行号时也能覆盖 "
":class:`ast.TypeIgnore`。"

#: ../NEWS:17824
msgid ""
":gh:`99382`: Check the number of arguments in substitution in user generics "
"containing a :class:`~typing.TypeVarTuple` and one or more "
":class:`~typing.TypeVar`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99382`: 在包含 :class:`~typing.TypeVarTuple` 和一个或多个 "
":class:`~typing.TypeVar` 的用户泛型中检查替换中的参数数量。"

#: ../NEWS:17828
msgid ""
":gh:`99379`: Fix substitution of :class:`~typing.ParamSpec` followed by "
":class:`~typing.TypeVarTuple` in generic aliases."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99379`: 修复泛型别名中 :class:`~typing.ParamSpec` 后跟 "
":class:`~typing.TypeVarTuple` 的替换问题。"

#: ../NEWS:17831
msgid ""
":gh:`99344`: Fix substitution of :class:`~typing.TypeVarTuple` and "
":class:`~typing.ParamSpec` together in user generics."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99344`: 修复用户泛型中 :class:`~typing.TypeVarTuple` 和 "
":class:`~typing.ParamSpec` 一起替换的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:17834
msgid ""
":gh:`99284`: Remove ``_use_broken_old_ctypes_structure_semantics_`` old "
"untested and undocumented hack from :mod:`ctypes`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99284`: 从 :mod:`ctypes` 中移除 "
"``_use_broken_old_ctypes_structure_semantics_`` 这个未经测试且未文档化的旧hack。"

#: ../NEWS:17837
msgid ""
":gh:`99201`: Fix :exc:`IndexError` when initializing the config variables on"
" Windows if ``HAVE_DYNAMIC_LOADING`` is not set."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99201`: 如果在 Windows 上没有设置 ``HAVE_DYNAMIC_LOADING``，初始化配置变量时修复 "
":exc:`IndexError`。"

#: ../NEWS:17840
msgid ""
":gh:`99240`: Fix double-free bug in Argument Clinic ``str_converter`` by "
"extracting memory clean up to a new ``post_parsing`` section."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99240`: 通过将内存清理提取到新的 ``post_parsing`` 部分来修复 Argument Clinic 的 "
"``str_converter`` 中的双重释放错误。"

#: ../NEWS:17843
msgid ""
":gh:`64490`: Fix refcount error when arguments are packed to tuple in "
"Argument Clinic."
msgstr ":gh:`64490`: 修复 Argument Clinic 中参数被打包到元组时的引用计数错误。"

#: ../NEWS:17846
msgid ""
":gh:`99029`: :meth:`pathlib.PurePath.relative_to` now treats naked Windows "
"drive paths as relative. This brings its behaviour in line with other parts "
"of pathlib."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99029`: :meth:`pathlib.PurePath.relative_to` 现在将裸的 Windows "
"驱动器路径视为相对路径。这使其行为与 pathlib 的其他部分保持一致。"

#: ../NEWS:17850
msgid ""
":gh:`98253`: The implementation of the typing module is now more resilient "
"to reference leaks in binary extension modules."
msgstr ":gh:`98253`: typing 模块的实现现在对二进制扩展模块中的引用泄漏更加健壮。"

#: ../NEWS:17853
msgid ""
"Previously, a reference leak in a typed C API-based extension module could "
"leak internals of the typing module, which could in turn introduce leaks in "
"essentially any other package with typed function signatures. Although the "
"typing package is not the original source of the problem, such non-local "
"dependences exacerbate debugging of large-scale projects, and the "
"implementation was therefore changed to reduce harm by providing better "
"isolation."
msgstr ""
"以前，基于类型化 C API 的扩展模块中的引用泄漏可能会泄漏 typing "
"模块的内部，这反过来又可能在几乎所有其他具有类型化函数签名的包中引入泄漏。虽然 typing "
"包不是问题的原始来源，但这种非局部依赖性加剧了大型项目的调试难度，因此实现进行了更改，通过提供更好的隔离来减少危害。"

#: ../NEWS:17861
msgid ""
":gh:`98458`: Fix infinite loop in unittest when a self-referencing chained "
"exception is raised"
msgstr ":gh:`98458`: 修复 unittest 中当引发自引用链式异常时的无限循环问题"

#: ../NEWS:17864
msgid ""
":gh:`93453`: :func:`asyncio.get_event_loop` and many other :mod:`asyncio` "
"functions like :func:`asyncio.ensure_future`, :func:`asyncio.shield` or "
":func:`asyncio.gather`, and also the "
":meth:`~asyncio.BaseDefaultEventLoopPolicy.get_event_loop` method of "
":class:`asyncio.BaseDefaultEventLoopPolicy` now raise a :exc:`RuntimeError` "
"if called when there is no running event loop and the current event loop was"
" not set. Previously they implicitly created and set a new current event "
"loop. :exc:`DeprecationWarning` is no longer emitted if there is no running "
"event loop but the current event loop was set."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93453`: :func:`asyncio.get_event_loop` 和其他许多 :mod:`asyncio` 函数，如 "
":func:`asyncio.ensure_future`、:func:`asyncio.shield` 或 "
":func:`asyncio.gather`，以及 :class:`asyncio.BaseDefaultEventLoopPolicy` 的 "
":meth:`~asyncio.BaseDefaultEventLoopPolicy.get_event_loop` "
"方法，现在在没有运行的事件循环且当前事件循环未设置时调用会引发 "
":exc:`RuntimeError`。以前它们会隐式创建并设置一个新的当前事件循环。如果当前事件循环已设置但没有运行的事件循环，则不再发出 "
":exc:`DeprecationWarning`。"

#: ../NEWS:17874
msgid ""
":gh:`97966`: On ``uname_result``, restored expectation that ``_fields`` and "
"``_asdict`` would include all six properties including ``processor``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`97966`: 在 ``uname_result`` 上，恢复了 ``_fields`` 和 ``_asdict`` 包括所有六个属性（包括 "
"``processor``）的期望。"

#: ../NEWS:17877
msgid ""
":gh:`98248`: Provide informative error messages in :func:`struct.pack` when "
"its integral arguments are not in range."
msgstr ":gh:`98248`: 在 :func:`struct.pack` 中，当其整数参数不在范围内时，提供信息性错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:17880
msgid ""
":gh:`98108`: ``zipfile.Path`` is now pickleable if its initialization "
"parameters were pickleable (e.g. for file system paths)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`98108`: 如果其初始化参数是可pickle的（例如文件系统路径），则 ``zipfile.Path`` 现在可pickle。"

#: ../NEWS:17883
msgid ""
":gh:`98098`: Created packages from zipfile and test_zipfile modules, "
"separating ``zipfile.Path`` functionality."
msgstr ":gh:`98098`: 从 zipfile 和 test_zipfile 模块创建包，分离 ``zipfile.Path`` 功能。"

#: ../NEWS:17886
msgid ""
":gh:`82836`: Fix :attr:`~ipaddress.IPv4Address.is_private` properties in the"
" :mod:`ipaddress` module. Previously non-private networks (0.0.0.0/0) would "
"return ``True`` from this method; now they correctly return ``False``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`82836`: 修复 :mod:`ipaddress` 模块中的 "
":attr:`~ipaddress.IPv4Address.is_private` 属性。以前非私有网络（0.0.0.0/0）会从此方法返回 "
"``True``；现在它们正确地返回 ``False``。"

#: ../NEWS:17890
msgid ""
":gh:`96828`: Add an :const:`~ssl.OP_ENABLE_KTLS` option for enabling the use"
" of the kernel TLS (kTLS). Patch by Illia Volochii."
msgstr ""
":gh:`96828`: 添加一个 :const:`~ssl.OP_ENABLE_KTLS` 选项，用于启用内核 TLS (kTLS)。由 Illia "
"Volochii 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:17893
msgid ""
":gh:`88863`: To avoid apparent memory leaks when "
":func:`asyncio.open_connection` raises, break reference cycles generated by "
"local exception and future instances (which has exception instance as its "
"member var). Patch by Dong Uk, Kang."
msgstr ""
":gh:`88863`: 为了避免 :func:`asyncio.open_connection` 引发时出现明显的内存泄漏，打破由局部异常和 "
"future 实例（其成员变量为异常实例）生成的引用循环。由 Dong Uk, Kang 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:17898
msgid ""
":gh:`91078`: :meth:`TarFile.next` now returns ``None`` when called on an "
"empty tarfile."
msgstr ":gh:`91078`: :meth:`TarFile.next` 现在在调用空的 tarfile 时返回 ``None``。"

#: ../NEWS:17901
msgid ""
":issue:`47220`: Document the optional *callback* parameter of "
":class:`WeakMethod`. Patch by Géry Ogam."
msgstr ""
":issue:`47220`: 文档化 :class:`WeakMethod` 的可选 *callback* 参数。由 Géry Ogam 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:17904
msgid ""
":issue:`44817`: Ignore WinError 53 (ERROR_BAD_NETPATH), 65 "
"(ERROR_NETWORK_ACCESS_DENIED) and 161 (ERROR_BAD_PATHNAME) when using "
"ntpath.realpath()."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44817`: 在使用 ntpath.realpath() 时忽略 WinError 53 (ERROR_BAD_NETPATH)、65"
" (ERROR_NETWORK_ACCESS_DENIED) 和 161 (ERROR_BAD_PATHNAME)。"

#: ../NEWS:17908
msgid ""
":issue:`41260`: Rename the *fmt* parameter of the pure Python implementation"
" of :meth:`datetime.date.strftime` to *format*."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41260`: 将 :meth:`datetime.date.strftime` 纯 Python 实现中的 *fmt* 参数重命名为 "
"*format*。"

#: ../NEWS:17911
msgid ""
":issue:`15999`: All built-in functions now accept arguments of any type "
"instead of just ``bool`` and ``int`` for boolean parameters."
msgstr ":issue:`15999`: 现在所有内置函数接受任何类型的参数，而不仅仅是 ``bool`` 和 ``int`` 用于布尔参数。"

#: ../NEWS:17917
msgid ""
":gh:`99931`: Use `sphinxext-opengraph <https://sphinxext-"
"opengraph.readthedocs.io/>`__ to generate `OpenGraph metadata "
"<https://ogp.me/>`__."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99931`: 使用 `sphinxext-opengraph <https://sphinxext-"
"opengraph.readthedocs.io/>`__ 生成 `OpenGraph metadata <https://ogp.me/>`__。"

#: ../NEWS:17921
msgid ""
":gh:`89682`: Reworded docstring of the default ``__contains__`` to clarify "
"that it returns a :class:`bool`."
msgstr ":gh:`89682`: 重写了默认 ``__contains__`` 的文档字符串，明确其返回一个 :class:`bool`。"

#: ../NEWS:17924
msgid ""
":gh:`88330`: Improved the description of what a resource is in "
"importlib.resources docs."
msgstr ":gh:`88330`: 改进了 importlib.resources 文档中对资源是什么的描述。"

#: ../NEWS:17927
msgid ""
":gh:`92892`: Document that calling variadic functions with ctypes requires "
"special care on macOS/arm64 (and possibly other platforms)."
msgstr ":gh:`92892`: 文档说明在 macOS/arm64（以及其他可能的平台）上使用 ctypes 调用可变参数函数需要特别注意。"

#: ../NEWS:17930
msgid ""
":issue:`41825`: Restructured the documentation for the :func:`os.wait* "
"<os.wait>` family of functions, and improved the docs for :func:`os.waitid` "
"with more explanation of the possible argument constants."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41825`: 重构了 :func:`os.wait* <os.wait>` 系列函数的文档，并通过更多解释可能的参数常量改进了 "
":func:`os.waitid` 的文档。"

#: ../NEWS:17938
msgid ""
":gh:`99892`: Skip test_normalization() of test_unicodedata if it fails to "
"download NormalizationTest.txt file from pythontest.net. Patch by Victor "
"Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99892`: 如果无法从 pythontest.net 下载 NormalizationTest.txt 文件，则跳过 "
"test_unicodedata 的 test_normalization()。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:17942
msgid ""
":gh:`99934`: Correct test_marsh on (32 bit) x86: test_deterministic sets was"
" failing."
msgstr ":gh:`99934`: 在（32 位）x86 上修正 test_marsh：test_deterministic sets 失败。"

#: ../NEWS:17945
msgid ""
":gh:`99741`: We've implemented multi-phase init (PEP 489/630/687) for the "
"internal (for testing) _xxsubinterpreters module."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99741`: 我们已经为内部（用于测试）的 _xxsubinterpreters 模块实现了多阶段初始化（PEP 489/630/687）。"

#: ../NEWS:17948
msgid ""
":gh:`99659`: Optional big memory tests in ``test_sqlite3`` now catch the "
"correct :exc:`sqlite.DataError` exception type in case of too large strings "
"and/or blobs passed."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99659`: ``test_sqlite3`` 中的可选大内存测试现在在传递过大的字符串和/或 blob 时捕获正确的 "
":exc:`sqlite.DataError` 异常类型。"

#: ../NEWS:17952
msgid ":gh:`99593`: Cover the Unicode C API with tests."
msgstr ":gh:`99593`: 为 Unicode C API 添加测试。"

#: ../NEWS:17954
msgid ":gh:`96002`: Add functional test for Argument Clinic."
msgstr ":gh:`96002`: 为 Argument Clinic 添加功能测试。"

#: ../NEWS:17959
msgid ""
":gh:`99086`: Fix ``-Wimplicit-int``, ``-Wstrict-prototypes``, and "
"``-Wimplicit-function-declaration`` compiler warnings in "
":program:`configure` checks."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99086`: 修复 :program:`configure` 检查中的 ``-Wimplicit-int``、``-Wstrict-"
"prototypes`` 和 ``-Wimplicit-function-declaration`` 编译器警告。"

#: ../NEWS:17963
msgid ":gh:`99337`: Fix a compilation issue with GCC 12 on macOS."
msgstr ":gh:`99337`: 修复在 macOS 上使用 GCC 12 时的编译问题。"

#: ../NEWS:17965
msgid ""
":gh:`99289`: Add a ``COMPILEALL_OPTS`` variable in Makefile to override "
":mod:`compileall` options (default: ``-j0``) in ``make install``. Also "
"merged the ``compileall`` commands into a single command building .pyc files"
" for the all optimization levels (0, 1, 2) at once. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99289`: 在Makefile中添加 ``COMPILEALL_OPTS`` 变量以覆盖 ``make install`` 中的 "
":mod:`compileall` 选项（默认：``-j0``）。同时将 ``compileall`` "
"命令合并为一个命令，一次性为所有优化级别（0、1、2）构建.pyc文件。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:17971
msgid ""
":gh:`98872`: Fix a possible fd leak in ``Programs/_freeze_module.c`` "
"introduced in Python 3.11."
msgstr ""
":gh:`98872`: 修复了Python 3.11中 ``Programs/_freeze_module.c`` 可能存在的文件描述符泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:17974
msgid ""
":gh:`88226`: Always define ``TARGET_*`` labels in ``Python/ceval.c``, even "
"if ``USE_COMPUTED_GOTOS`` is disabled.  This allows breakpoints to be set at"
" those labels in (for instance) ``gdb``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`88226`: 在 ``Python/ceval.c`` 中始终定义 ``TARGET_*`` 标签，即使 "
"``USE_COMPUTED_GOTOS`` 被禁用。这样可以在（例如）``gdb`` 中在这些标签处设置断点。"

#: ../NEWS:17981
msgid ""
":gh:`99345`: Use faster initialization functions to detect install location "
"for Windows Store package"
msgstr ":gh:`99345`: 使用更快的初始化函数来检测Windows Store包的安装位置"

#: ../NEWS:17984
msgid ""
":gh:`98629`: Fix initialization of :data:`sys.version` and ``sys._git`` on "
"Windows"
msgstr ":gh:`98629`: 修复Windows上 :data:`sys.version` 和 ``sys._git`` 的初始化问题"

#: ../NEWS:17987
msgid ""
":gh:`99442`: Fix handling in :ref:`launcher` when ``argv[0]`` does not "
"include a file extension."
msgstr ":gh:`99442`: 修复当 ``argv[0]`` 不包含文件扩展名时 :ref:`launcher` 中的处理问题。"

#: ../NEWS:17990
msgid ""
":issue:`40882`: Fix a memory leak in "
":class:`multiprocessing.shared_memory.SharedMemory` on Windows."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40882`: 修复Windows上 "
":class:`multiprocessing.shared_memory.SharedMemory` 中的内存泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:17996
msgid ""
":gh:`87235`: On macOS ``python3 /dev/fd/9 9</path/to/script.py`` failed for "
"any script longer than a couple of bytes."
msgstr ""
":gh:`87235`: 在macOS上 ``python3 /dev/fd/9 9</path/to/script.py`` "
"对于任何超过几个字节的脚本都会失败。"

#: ../NEWS:17999
msgid ":gh:`98940`: Fix ``Mac/Extras.install.py`` file filter bug."
msgstr ":gh:`98940`: 修复 ``Mac/Extras.install.py`` 文件过滤器错误。"

#: ../NEWS:18004
msgid ":gh:`64490`: Argument Clinic varargs bugfixes"
msgstr ":gh:`64490`: Argument Clinic varargs 错误修复"

#: ../NEWS:18006
msgid "Fix out-of-bounds error in :c:func:`!_PyArg_UnpackKeywordsWithVararg`."
msgstr "修复 :c:func:`!_PyArg_UnpackKeywordsWithVararg` 中的越界错误。"

#: ../NEWS:18007
msgid "Fix incorrect check which allowed more than one varargs in clinic.py."
msgstr "修复了允许在clinic.py中有多个varargs的错误检查。"

#: ../NEWS:18008
msgid "Fix miscalculation of ``noptargs`` in generated code."
msgstr "修复生成代码中 ``noptargs`` 的错误计算。"

#: ../NEWS:18009
msgid ""
"Do not generate ``noptargs`` when there is a vararg argument and no optional"
" argument."
msgstr "当存在vararg参数但没有可选参数时，不生成 ``noptargs``。"

#: ../NEWS:18014
msgid ""
":gh:`98680`: ``PyBUF_*`` constants were marked as part of Limited API of "
"Python 3.11+. These were available in 3.11.0 with :c:macro:`Py_LIMITED_API` "
"defined for 3.11, and are necessary to use the buffer API."
msgstr ""
":gh:`98680`: ``PyBUF_*`` 常量被标记为Python 3.11+的有限API的一部分。这些在3.11.0版本中可用，定义了 "
":c:macro:`Py_LIMITED_API` 为3.11，并且是使用缓冲区API所必需的。"

#: ../NEWS:18019
msgid ""
":gh:`99612`: Fix :c:func:`PyUnicode_DecodeUTF8Stateful` for ASCII-only data:"
" ``*consumed`` was not set."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99612`: 修复 :c:func:`PyUnicode_DecodeUTF8Stateful` "
"对于仅ASCII数据的问题：``*consumed`` 未被设置。"

#: ../NEWS:18022
msgid ""
":gh:`47146`: The ``structmember.h`` header is deprecated. Its non-deprecated"
" contents are now available just by including ``Python.h``, with a ``Py_`` "
"prefix added if it was missing. (Deprecated contents are "
":c:macro:`T_OBJECT`, :c:macro:`T_NONE`, and no-op flags.) Patch by Petr "
"Viktorin, based on earlier work by Alexander Belopolsky and Matthias Braun."
msgstr ""
":gh:`47146`: ``structmember.h`` 头文件已被弃用。其未弃用的内容现在只需包含 ``Python.h`` 即可使用，如果缺少"
" ``Py_`` 前缀则会添加。（已弃用的内容包括 :c:macro:`T_OBJECT`, :c:macro:`T_NONE`, 和无操作标志。）由 "
"Petr Viktorin 提供补丁，基于 Alexander Belopolsky 和 Matthias Braun 的早期工作。"

#: ../NEWS:18031
msgid "Python 3.12.0 alpha 2"
msgstr "Python 3.12.0 alpha 2"

#: ../NEWS:18033
msgid "*Release date: 2022-11-14*"
msgstr "*发布日期：2022-11-14*"

#: ../NEWS:18038
msgid ""
":gh:`98433`: The IDNA codec decoder used on DNS hostnames by :mod:`socket` "
"or :mod:`asyncio` related name resolution functions no longer involves a "
"quadratic algorithm. This prevents a potential CPU denial of service if an "
"out-of-spec excessive length hostname involving bidirectional characters "
"were decoded. Some protocols such as :mod:`urllib` http :samp:`3{xx}` "
"redirects potentially allow for an attacker to supply such a name."
msgstr ""
":gh:`98433`: 用于 :mod:`socket` 或 :mod:`asyncio` 相关名称解析函数的 DNS 主机名的 IDNA "
"编解码器解码器不再涉及二次算法。这防止了如果解码涉及双向字符的超长主机名时可能导致的 CPU 拒绝服务。某些协议，如 :mod:`urllib` "
"http :samp:`3{xx}` 重定向，可能允许攻击者提供这样的名称。"

#: ../NEWS:18045
msgid ""
"Individual labels within an IDNA encoded DNS name will now raise an error "
"early during IDNA decoding if they are longer than 1024 unicode characters "
"given that each decoded DNS label must be 63 or fewer characters and the "
"entire decoded DNS name is limited to 255. Only an application presenting a "
"hostname or label consisting primarily of :rfc:`3454` section 3.1 "
"\"Nothing\" characters to be removed would run into of this new limit. See "
"also :rfc:`5894` section 6 and :rfc:`3491`."
msgstr ""
"IDNA 编码的 DNS 名称中的单个标签现在在 IDNA 解码期间如果超过 1024 个 Unicode 字符会早期引发错误，因为每个解码的 DNS "
"标签必须为 63 或更少的字符，并且整个解码的 DNS 名称限制为 255。只有呈现主要由 :rfc:`3454` 第 3.1 节 "
"\"无\"字符组成的主机名或标签的应用程序才会遇到这个新限制。另请参见 :rfc:`5894` 第 6 节和 :rfc:`3491`。"

#: ../NEWS:18053
msgid ":gh:`98739`: Update bundled libexpat to 2.5.0"
msgstr ":gh:`98739`: 更新捆绑的 libexpat 到 2.5.0"

#: ../NEWS:18058
msgid ""
":gh:`81057`: The docs clearly say that :c:data:`PyImport_Inittab`, "
":c:func:`PyImport_AppendInittab`, and :c:func:`PyImport_ExtendInittab` "
"should not be used after :c:func:`Py_Initialize` has been called. We now "
"enforce this for the two functions.  Additionally, the runtime now uses an "
"internal copy of :c:data:`PyImport_Inittab`, to guard against modification."
msgstr ""
":gh:`81057`: 文档明确指出 :c:data:`PyImport_Inittab`, "
":c:func:`PyImport_AppendInittab` 和 :c:func:`PyImport_ExtendInittab` 不应在已调用 "
":c:func:`Py_Initialize` 之后再被使用。 我们现在对这两个函数强制执行此要求。 此外，运行时现在使用 "
":c:data:`PyImport_Inittab` 内部副本，以防止修改。"

#: ../NEWS:18065
msgid ""
":gh:`99298`: Fix an issue that could potentially cause incorrect error "
"handling for some bytecode instructions."
msgstr ":gh:`99298`: 修复可能导致某些字节码指令错误处理的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:18068
msgid ""
":gh:`99254`: The compiler now removes all unused constants from code objects"
" (except the first one, which may be a docstring)."
msgstr ":gh:`99254`: 编译器现在会从代码对象中移除所有未使用的常量（除了第一个可能是文档字符串的常量）。"

#: ../NEWS:18071
msgid ""
":gh:`99205`: Fix an issue that prevented :c:type:`PyThreadState` and "
":c:type:`PyInterpreterState` memory from being freed properly."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99205`: 修复了阻止 :c:type:`PyThreadState` 和 :c:type:`PyInterpreterState` "
"内存被正确释放的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:18074
msgid ""
":gh:`81057`: The 18 global C variables holding the state of the allocators "
"have been moved to ``_PyRuntimeState``.  This is a strictly internal change "
"with no change in behavior."
msgstr ""
":gh:`81057`: 持有分配器状态的18个全局C变量已被移动到 ``_PyRuntimeState``。这是一个严格内部更改，行为无变化。"

#: ../NEWS:18078
msgid ""
":gh:`99181`: Fix failure in :keyword:`except* <except_star>` with unhashable"
" exceptions."
msgstr ":gh:`99181`: 修复 :keyword:`except* <except_star>` 中不可哈希异常导致的失败。"

#: ../NEWS:18081
msgid ""
":gh:`99204`: Fix calculation of :data:`sys._base_executable` when inside a "
"POSIX virtual environment using copies of the python binary when the base "
"installation does not provide the executable name used by the venv. "
"Calculation will fall back to alternative names (\"python<MAJOR>\", "
"\"python<MAJOR>.<MINOR>\")."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99204`: "
"修复当在POSIX虚拟环境中使用python二进制副本且基础安装未提供venv使用的可执行名称时，:data:`sys._base_executable`"
" 的计算问题。计算将回退到替代名称（\"python<MAJOR>\", \"python<MAJOR>.<MINOR>\"）。"

#: ../NEWS:18087
msgid ""
":gh:`96055`: Update :mod:`faulthandler` to emit an error message with the "
"proper unexpected signal number. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":gh:`96055`: 更新 :mod:`faulthandler` 以发出包含正确意外信号号的错误消息。由Donghee Na提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:18090
msgid ""
":gh:`99153`: Fix location of :exc:`SyntaxError` for a :keyword:`try` block "
"with both :keyword:`except` and :keyword:`except* <except_star>`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99153`: 修复同时包含 :keyword:`except` 和 :keyword:`except* <except_star>` 的 "
":keyword:`try` 块的 :exc:`SyntaxError` 位置。"

#: ../NEWS:18093
msgid ""
":gh:`98686`: Merge the adaptive opcode logic into each instruction's "
"unquickened variant, and merge the logic in ``EXTENDED_ARG_QUICK`` into "
":opcode:`EXTENDED_ARG`. With these changes, the quickening that happens at "
"code object creation is now only responsible for initializing warmup "
"counters and inserting superinstructions."
msgstr ""
":gh:`98686`: 将自适应操作码逻辑合并到每个指令的非快速化变体中，并将 ``EXTENDED_ARG_QUICK`` 中的逻辑合并到 "
":opcode:`EXTENDED_ARG`。通过这些更改，代码对象创建时发生的快速化现在仅负责初始化预热计数器和插入超级指令。"

#: ../NEWS:18099
msgid ""
":gh:`99103`: Fix the error reporting positions of specialized traceback "
"anchors when the source line contains Unicode characters."
msgstr ":gh:`99103`: 修复当源代码行包含Unicode字符时，专用回溯锚点的错误报告位置。"

#: ../NEWS:18102
msgid ""
":gh:`99139`: Improve the error suggestion for :exc:`NameError` exceptions "
"for instances. Now if a :exc:`NameError` is raised in a method and the "
"instance has an attribute that's exactly equal to the name in the exception,"
" the suggestion will include ``self.<NAME>`` instead of the closest match in"
" the method scope. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`99139`: 改进对实例的 :exc:`NameError` 异常的错误建议。现在，如果在方法中引发 :exc:`NameError` "
"且实例具有与异常中名称完全相等的属性，建议将包括 ``self.<NAME>`` 而不是方法范围内最接近的匹配。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:18108
msgid ""
":gh:`98401`: Octal escapes with value larger than ``0o377`` (ex: "
"``\"\\477\"``), deprecated in Python 3.11, now produce a "
":exc:`SyntaxWarning`, instead of :exc:`DeprecationWarning`. In a future "
"Python version they will be eventually a :exc:`SyntaxError`. Patch by Victor"
" Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`98401`: 在Python 3.11中已弃用的八进制转义值大于 ``0o377`` (例如 ``\"\\477\"``) ，现在会产生 "
":exc:`SyntaxWarning`，而不是 :exc:`DeprecationWarning`。在未来的Python版本中，这些最终将成为 "
":exc:`SyntaxError`。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:18113
msgid ""
":gh:`98401`: A backslash-character pair that is not a valid escape sequence "
"now generates a :exc:`SyntaxWarning`, instead of :exc:`DeprecationWarning`."
"  For example, ``re.compile(\"\\d+\\.\\d+\")`` now emits a "
":exc:`SyntaxWarning` (``\"\\d\"`` is an invalid escape sequence), use raw "
"strings for regular expression: ``re.compile(r\"\\d+\\.\\d+\")``. In a "
"future Python version, :exc:`SyntaxError` will eventually be raised, instead"
" of :exc:`SyntaxWarning`. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`98401`: 不是有效转义序列的反斜杠字符对现在会生成 :exc:`SyntaxWarning`，而不是 "
":exc:`DeprecationWarning`。例如，``re.compile(\"\\d+\\.\\d+\")`` 现在会发出 "
":exc:`SyntaxWarning` (``\"\\d\"`` 是无效的转义序列) "
"，使用原始字符串进行正则表达式：``re.compile(r\"\\d+\\.\\d+\")``。在未来的Python版本中，最终将引发 "
":exc:`SyntaxError`，而不是 :exc:`SyntaxWarning`。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:18121
msgid ""
":gh:`96793`: Handle StopIteration and StopAsyncIteration raised in generator"
" or coroutines in the bytecode, rather than in wrapping C code."
msgstr ""
":gh:`96793`: "
"在字节码中处理生成器或协程中引发的StopIteration和StopAsyncIteration，而不是在包装的C代码中处理。"

#: ../NEWS:18124
msgid ""
":gh:`98931`: Improve the :exc:`SyntaxError` error message when the user "
"types ``import x from y`` instead of ``from y import x``. Patch by Pablo "
"Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`98931`: 当用户键入 ``import x from y`` 而不是 ``from y import x`` 时，改进 "
":exc:`SyntaxError` 错误消息。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:18127
msgid ""
":gh:`98852`: Fix subscription of type aliases containing bare generic types "
"or types like :class:`~typing.TypeVar`: for example ``tuple[A, T][int]`` and"
" ``tuple[TypeVar, T][int]``, where ``A`` is a generic type, and ``T`` is a "
"type variable."
msgstr ""
":gh:`98852`: 修复包含裸泛型类型或类似 :class:`~typing.TypeVar` 类型的类型别名的订阅：例如``tuple[A, "
"T][int]``和 ``tuple[TypeVar, T][int]``，其中 ``A`` 是泛型类型，``T`` 是类型变量。"

#: ../NEWS:18132
msgid ""
":gh:`98925`: Lower the recursion depth for marshal on WASI to support (in-"
"development) wasmtime 2.0."
msgstr ":gh:`98925`: 降低WASI上marshal的递归深度以支持（开发中的）wasmtime 2.0。"

#: ../NEWS:18135
msgid ""
":gh:`98783`: Fix multiple crashes in debug mode when ``str`` subclasses are "
"used instead of ``str`` itself."
msgstr ":gh:`98783`: 修复在调试模式下使用 ``str`` 子类而不是 ``str`` 本身时的多次崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:18138
msgid ""
":gh:`98811`: Use complete source locations to simplify detection of "
"``__future__`` imports which are not at the beginning of the file. Also "
"corrects the offset in the exception raised in one case, which was off by "
"one and impeded highlighting."
msgstr ""
":gh:`98811`: 使用完整的源位置来简化检测不在文件开头的 ``__future__`` "
"导入。同时修正了一种情况下引发的异常中的偏移量，该偏移量偏差一个并阻碍了高亮。"

#: ../NEWS:18143
msgid ""
":gh:`96793`: Add specialization of :opcode:`FOR_ITER` for generators. Saves "
"multiple layers of dispatch and checking to get from the :opcode:`FOR_ITER` "
"instruction in the caller to the :opcode:`RESUME` in the generator."
msgstr ""
":gh:`96793`: 为生成器添加 :opcode:`FOR_ITER` 的特殊化。保存从调用者中的 :opcode:`FOR_ITER` "
"指令到生成器中的 :opcode:`RESUME` 的多层调度和检查。"

#: ../NEWS:18148
msgid ":gh:`98762`: Fix source locations of :keyword:`match` sub-patterns."
msgstr ":gh:`98762`: 修复 :keyword:`match` 子模式源位置的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:18150
msgid ""
":gh:`98586`: Added the methods :c:func:`PyObject_Vectorcall` and "
":c:func:`PyObject_VectorcallMethod` to the :ref:`Limited API <stable>` along"
" with the auxiliary macro constant "
":c:macro:`PY_VECTORCALL_ARGUMENTS_OFFSET`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`98586`: 将方法 :c:func:`PyObject_Vectorcall` 和 "
":c:func:`PyObject_VectorcallMethod` 以及辅助宏常量 "
":c:macro:`PY_VECTORCALL_ARGUMENTS_OFFSET` 添加到 :ref:`Limited API <stable>` 中。"

#: ../NEWS:18155
msgid ""
"The availability of these functions enables more efficient :PEP:`590` vector"
" calls from binary extension modules that avoid argument boxing/unboxing "
"overheads."
msgstr "这些函数的可用性使得二进制扩展模块能够进行更高效的 :PEP:`590` 向量调用，避免了参数装箱/拆箱的开销。"

#: ../NEWS:18159
msgid ""
":gh:`99257`: Fix an issue where member descriptors (such as those for "
":attr:`~object.__slots__`) could behave incorrectly or crash instead of "
"raising a :exc:`TypeError` when accessed via an instance of an invalid type."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99257`: 修复了一个问题，即当通过无效类型的实例访问时，成员描述符（如 :attr:`~object.__slots__` "
"的描述符）可能会行为不正确或崩溃，而不是引发 :exc:`TypeError`。"

#: ../NEWS:18164
msgid ""
":gh:`93143`: Rather than changing :attr:`~types.CodeType.co_code`, the "
"interpreter will now display a :exc:`RuntimeWarning` and assign "
":const:`None` to any fast locals that are left unbound after jumps or "
":keyword:`del` statements executed while tracing."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93143`: 解释器现在不会更改 :attr:`~types.CodeType.co_code`，而是会显示 "
":exc:`RuntimeWarning` 并将 :const:`None` 赋给在跟踪执行跳转或 :keyword:`del` "
"语句后未绑定的任何快速局部变量。"

#: ../NEWS:18169
msgid ""
":gh:`96421`: When calling into Python code from C code, through "
":c:func:`PyEval_EvalFrameEx` or a related C-API function, a shim frame in "
"inserted into the call stack. This occurs in the "
"``_PyEval_EvalFrameDefault()`` function. The extra frame should be invisible"
" to all Python and most C extensions, but out-of-process profilers and "
"debuggers need to be aware of it. These shim frames can be detected by "
"checking ``frame->owner == FRAME_OWNED_BY_CSTACK``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`96421`: 当通过 :c:func:`PyEval_EvalFrameEx` 或相关的 C-API 函数从 C 代码调用 Python "
"代码时，会在调用堆栈中插入一个垫片帧。这发生在 ``_PyEval_EvalFrameDefault()`` 函数中。额外的帧对所有 Python "
"和大多数 C 扩展应该是不可见的，但进程外分析器和调试器需要知道它。这些垫片帧可以通过检查 ``frame->owner == "
"FRAME_OWNED_BY_CSTACK`` 来检测。"

#: ../NEWS:18177
msgid ""
"Extensions implementing their own interpreters using PEP 523 need to be "
"aware of this shim frame and the changes to the semantics of "
":opcode:`RETURN_VALUE`, :opcode:`YIELD_VALUE`, and "
":opcode:`RETURN_GENERATOR`, which now clear the frame."
msgstr ""
"使用 PEP 523 实现自己的解释器的扩展需要了解这个垫片帧以及对 "
":opcode:`RETURN_VALUE`、:opcode:`YIELD_VALUE` 和 :opcode:`RETURN_GENERATOR` "
"语义的更改，这些操作现在会清除帧。"

#: ../NEWS:18185
msgid ""
":gh:`98415`: Fix detection of MAC addresses for :mod:`uuid` on certain OSs. "
"Patch by Chaim Sanders"
msgstr ":gh:`98415`: 修复了在某些操作系统上对 :mod:`uuid` 的 MAC 地址检测。补丁由 Chaim Sanders 提供"

#: ../NEWS:18191
msgid ""
":gh:`98686`: Quicken all code objects, and specialize adaptive bytecode "
"instructions more aggressively."
msgstr ":gh:`98686`: 加速所有代码对象，并更积极地专门化自适应字节码指令。"

#: ../NEWS:18194
msgid ""
":gh:`92119`: Print exception class name instead of its string representation"
" when raising errors from :mod:`ctypes` calls."
msgstr ":gh:`92119`: 在从 :mod:`ctypes` 调用引发错误时，打印异常类名而不是其字符串表示。"

#: ../NEWS:18197
msgid ""
":gh:`91058`: :exc:`ImportError` raised from failed ``from <module> import "
"<name>`` now include suggestions for the value of ``<name>`` based on the "
"available names in ``<module>``. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`91058`: 当 ``from <module> import <name>`` 失败时，引发的 :exc:`ImportError` "
"现在会根据 ``<module>`` 中可用的名称提供 ``<name>`` 的建议值。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:18201
msgid ""
":gh:`96793`: The :opcode:`FOR_ITER` now leaves the iterator on the stack on "
"termination of the loop. This is to assist specialization of loops for "
"generators."
