":gh:`90716`: 添加 _pylong.py 模块。它包括可用于对多位数整数进行操作的渐近更快算法。longobject.c "
"使用它来加速一些操作。"

#: ../NEWS:18209
msgid ""
":gh:`95389`: Expose :const:`~socket.ETH_P_ALL` and some of the "
":ref:`ETHERTYPE_* constants <socket-ethernet-types>` in :mod:`socket`. Patch"
" by Noam Cohen."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95389`: 在 :mod:`socket` 中公开 :const:`~socket.ETH_P_ALL` 和一些 "
":ref:`ETHERTYPE_* 常量 <socket-ethernet-types>`。由 Noam Cohen 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:18216
msgid ""
":gh:`93696`: Allow :mod:`pdb` to locate source for frozen modules in the "
"standard library."
msgstr ":gh:`93696`: 允许 :mod:`pdb` 定位标准库中冻结模块的源代码。"

#: ../NEWS:18219
msgid ""
":gh:`99418`: Fix bug in :func:`urllib.parse.urlparse` that causes URL "
"schemes that begin with a digit, a plus sign, or a minus sign to be parsed "
