":class:`unittest.IsolatedAsyncioTestCase` 以始终设置事件循环，如同在 Python 3.10 "
"及更早版本中所做的那样。由 Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:19586
msgid ""
":gh:`94343`: Allow setting the attributes of ``reprlib.Repr`` during object "
"initialization"
msgstr ":gh:`94343`: 允许在对象初始化期间设置 ``reprlib.Repr`` 的属性"

#: ../NEWS:19589
msgid ""
":gh:`94382`: Port static types of ``_multiprocessing`` module to heap types."
" Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94382`: 将 ``_multiprocessing`` 模块的静态类型移植到堆类型。补丁由 Kumar Aditya 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:19592
msgid ""
":gh:`78724`: Fix crash in :class:`struct.Struct` when it was not completely "
