#: ../NEWS:19631
msgid ""
":gh:`94254`: Fixed types of :mod:`struct` module to be immutable. Patch by "
"Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ":gh:`94254`: 修正 :mod:`struct` 模块的类型为不可变。由 Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:19634
msgid ""
":gh:`93259`: Now raise ``ValueError`` when ``None`` or an empty string are "
"passed to ``Distribution.from_name`` (and other callers)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93259`: 现在当 ``None`` 或空字符串传递给 ``Distribution.from_name`` (及其他调用者) 时会引发 "
"``ValueError``。"

#: ../NEWS:19637
msgid ""
":gh:`74696`: :func:`shutil.make_archive` now passes the *root_dir* argument "
"to custom archivers which support it."
msgstr ""
":gh:`74696`: :func:`shutil.make_archive` 现在将 *root_dir* 参数传递给支持它的自定义归档器。"

#: ../NEWS:19640
msgid ""
":gh:`94216`: The :mod:`dis` module now has the opcodes for pseudo "
"instructions (those which are used by the compiler during code generation "
"but then removed or replaced by real opcodes before the final bytecode is "
"emitted)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94216`: :mod:`dis` "
"模块现在包含了伪指令的操作码（这些操作码在代码生成期间被编译器使用，但在最终字节码发出前被移除或替换为真实操作码）。"

#: ../NEWS:19645
msgid ""
":gh:`93096`: Removed undocumented ``python -m codecs``. Use ``python -m "
"unittest test.test_codecs.EncodedFileTest`` instead."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93096`: 移除了未文档化的 ``python -m codecs``。改用 ``python -m unittest "
"test.test_codecs.EncodedFileTest``。"

#: ../NEWS:19648
msgid ""
":gh:`94207`: Made :class:`!_struct.Struct` GC-tracked in order to fix a "
"reference leak in the :mod:`!_struct` module."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94207`: 使 :class:`!_struct.Struct` 被 GC 跟踪以修复 :mod:`!_struct` 模块中的引用泄漏。"

#: ../NEWS:19651
msgid ""
":gh:`93096`: Removed undocumented ``-t`` argument of ``python -m base64``. "
"Use ``python -m unittest "
"test.test_base64.LegacyBase64TestCase.test_encodebytes`` instead."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93096`: 移除了 ``python -m base64`` 的未文档化 ``-t`` 参数。改用 ``python -m "
"unittest test.test_base64.LegacyBase64TestCase.test_encodebytes``。"

#: ../NEWS:19655
msgid ""
":gh:`94226`: Remove the :func:`locale.format` function, deprecated in Python"
" 3.7: use :func:`locale.format_string` instead. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94226`: 移除 :func:`locale.format` 函数，该函数在 Python 3.7 中已弃用：改用 "
":func:`locale.format_string`。由 Victor Stinner 提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:19658
msgid ""
":gh:`94199`: Remove the :func:`ssl.match_hostname` function. The "
":func:`ssl.match_hostname` was deprecated in Python 3.7. OpenSSL performs "
"hostname matching since Python 3.7, Python no longer uses the "
":func:`ssl.match_hostname` function. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94199`: 移除 :func:`ssl.match_hostname` 函数。:func:`ssl.match_hostname` 在 "
"Python 3.7 中已弃用。自 Python 3.7 起，OpenSSL 执行主机名匹配，Python 不再使用 "
":func:`ssl.match_hostname` 函数。由 Victor Stinner 提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:19663
msgid ""
":gh:`94214`: Document the ``context`` object used in the ``venv.EnvBuilder``"
" class, and add the new environment's library path to it."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94214`: 文档化 ``venv.EnvBuilder`` 类中使用的 ``context`` 对象，并将新环境的库路径添加至其中。"

#: ../NEWS:19666
msgid ""
":gh:`94199`: Remove the :func:`ssl.wrap_socket` function, deprecated in "
"Python 3.7: instead, create a :class:`ssl.SSLContext` object and call its "
":class:`ssl.SSLContext.wrap_socket` method. Any package that still uses "
":func:`ssl.wrap_socket` is broken and insecure. The function neither sends a"
" SNI TLS extension nor validates server hostname. Code is subject to "
":cwe:`295` Improper Certificate Validation. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94199`: 移除 :func:`ssl.wrap_socket` 函数，该函数在 Python 3.7 中已弃用：改为创建一个 "
":class:`ssl.SSLContext` 对象并调用其 :class:`ssl.SSLContext.wrap_socket` 方法。任何仍使用 "
":func:`ssl.wrap_socket` 的包都是破损且不安全的。该函数既不发送 SNI TLS 扩展也不验证服务器主机名。代码易受 "
":cwe:`295` 不正确的证书验证影响。由 Victor Stinner 提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:19673
msgid ""
":gh:`94199`: Remove the :func:`ssl.RAND_pseudo_bytes` function, deprecated "
"in Python 3.6: use :func:`os.urandom` or :func:`ssl.RAND_bytes` instead. "
"Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94199`: 移除 :func:`ssl.RAND_pseudo_bytes` 函数，该函数在 Python 3.6 中已弃用：改用 "
":func:`os.urandom` 或 :func:`ssl.RAND_bytes`。由 Victor Stinner 提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:19677
msgid ""
":gh:`94199`: :mod:`hashlib`: Remove the pure Python implementation of "
":func:`hashlib.pbkdf2_hmac`, deprecated in Python 3.10. Python 3.10 and "
"newer requires OpenSSL 1.1.1 (:pep:`644`): this OpenSSL version provides a C"
" implementation of :func:`~hashlib.pbkdf2_hmac` which is faster. Patch by "
"Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94199`: :mod:`hashlib`: 移除 :func:`hashlib.pbkdf2_hmac` 的纯 Python "
"实现，该实现在 Python 3.10 中已弃用。Python 3.10 及更高版本需要 OpenSSL 1.1.1 (:pep:`644`)：此 "
"OpenSSL 版本提供了 :func:`~hashlib.pbkdf2_hmac` 的 C 实现，速度更快。由 Victor Stinner "
"提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:19683
msgid ""
":gh:`94196`: :mod:`gzip`: Remove the ``filename`` attribute of "
":class:`gzip.GzipFile`, deprecated since Python 2.6, use the "
":attr:`~gzip.GzipFile.name` attribute instead. In write mode, the "
"``filename`` attribute added ``'.gz'`` file extension if it was not present."
" Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94196`: :mod:`gzip`: 移除 :class:`gzip.GzipFile` 的 ``filename`` 属性，该属性自 "
"Python 2.6 起已弃用，改用 :attr:`~gzip.GzipFile.name` 属性。在写入模式下，``filename`` "
"属性会在文件扩展名不存在时添加 ``'.gz'``。由 Victor Stinner 提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:19689
msgid ""
":gh:`94182`: run the :class:`asyncio.PidfdChildWatcher` on the running loop,"
" this allows event loops to run subprocesses when there is no default event "
"loop running on the main thread"
msgstr ""
":gh:`94182`: 在运行循环上运行 "
":class:`asyncio.PidfdChildWatcher`，这允许事件循环在主线程上没有默认事件循环运行时运行子进程。"

#: ../NEWS:19693
msgid ""
":gh:`94169`: Remove ``io.OpenWrapper`` and ``_pyio.OpenWrapper``, deprecated"
" in Python 3.10: just use :func:`open` instead. The :func:`open` "
"(:func:`io.open`) function is a built-in function. Since Python 3.10, "
":func:`!_pyio.open` is also a static method. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94169`: 移除 ``io.OpenWrapper`` 和 ``_pyio.OpenWrapper``，这两个在 Python 3.10 "
"中已被弃用：只需使用 :func:`open` 替代。:func:`open` (:func:`io.open`) 函数是一个内置函数。自 Python"
" 3.10 起，:func:`!_pyio.open` 也是一个静态方法。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:19698
msgid ""
":gh:`91742`: Fix :mod:`pdb` crash after jump caused by a null pointer "
"dereference. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ":gh:`91742`: 修复 :mod:`pdb` 因空指针解引用导致的跳转后崩溃问题。补丁由 Kumar Aditya 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:19701
msgid ""
":gh:`94101`: Manual instantiation of :class:`ssl.SSLSession` objects is no "
"longer allowed as it lead to misconfigured instances that crashed the "
"interpreter when attributes where accessed on them."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94101`: 不再允许手动实例化 :class:`ssl.SSLSession` "
"对象，因为这会导致配置错误的实例，在访问其属性时解释器崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:19705
msgid ""
":gh:`84753`: :func:`inspect.iscoroutinefunction`, "
":func:`inspect.isgeneratorfunction`, and :func:`inspect.isasyncgenfunction` "
"now properly return ``True`` for duck-typed function-like objects like "
"instances of :class:`unittest.mock.AsyncMock`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`84753`: "
":func:`inspect.iscoroutinefunction`、:func:`inspect.isgeneratorfunction` 和 "
":func:`inspect.isasyncgenfunction` 现在能正确地为鸭子类型的函数式对象（如 "
":class:`unittest.mock.AsyncMock` 的实例）返回 ``True``。"

#: ../NEWS:19711
msgid ""
"This makes :func:`inspect.iscoroutinefunction` consistent with the behavior "
"of :func:`asyncio.iscoroutinefunction`.  Patch by Mehdi ABAAKOUK."
msgstr ""
"这使得 :func:`inspect.iscoroutinefunction` 的行为与 "
":func:`asyncio.iscoroutinefunction` 保持一致。由 Mehdi ABAAKOUK 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:19714
msgid ""
":gh:`94028`: Fix a regression in the :mod:`sqlite3` where statement objects "
"were not properly cleared and reset after use in cursor iters. The "
"regression was introduced by PR 27884 in Python 3.11a1. Patch by Erlend E. "
"Aasland."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94028`: 修复 :mod:`sqlite3` 中的一个回归问题，其中语句对象在游标迭代器使用后未被正确清除和重置。该回归问题由 "
"Python 3.11a1 中的 PR 27884 引入。由 Erlend E. Aasland 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:19719
msgid ""
":gh:`93973`: Add keyword argument ``all_errors`` to "
"``asyncio.create_connection`` so that multiple connection errors can be "
"raised as an ``ExceptionGroup``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93973`: 向 ``asyncio.create_connection`` 添加关键字参数 "
"``all_errors``，以便多个连接错误可以作为 ``ExceptionGroup`` 抛出。"

#: ../NEWS:19723
msgid ""
":gh:`93963`: Officially deprecate from ``importlib.abc`` classes moved to "
"``importlib.resources.abc``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93963`: 正式弃用从 ``importlib.abc`` 迁移到 ``importlib.resources.abc`` 的类。"

#: ../NEWS:19726
msgid ""
":gh:`93858`: Prevent error when activating venv in nested fish instances."
msgstr ":gh:`93858`: 防止在嵌套的 fish 实例中激活 venv 时出错。"

#: ../NEWS:19728
msgid ":gh:`93820`: Pickle :class:`enum.Flag` by name."
msgstr ":gh:`93820`: 通过名称 Pickle :class:`enum.Flag`。"

#: ../NEWS:19730
msgid ":gh:`93847`: Fix repr of enum of generic aliases."
msgstr ":gh:`93847`: 修复泛型别名枚举的 repr。"

#: ../NEWS:19732
msgid ""
":gh:`91404`: Revert the :mod:`re` memory leak when a match is terminated by "
"a signal or memory allocation failure as the implemented fix caused a major "
"performance regression."
msgstr ":gh:`91404`: 恢复 :mod:`re` 在匹配被信号或内存分配失败终止时的内存泄漏，因为已实现的修复导致了严重的性能回归。"

#: ../NEWS:19736
msgid ""
":gh:`83499`: Fix double closing of file description in :mod:`tempfile`."
msgstr ":gh:`83499`: 修复 :mod:`tempfile` 中文件描述符的双重关闭问题。"

#: ../NEWS:19738
msgid ""
":gh:`93820`: Fixed a regression when :func:`copy.copy`-ing "
":class:`enum.Flag` with multiple flag members."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93820`: 修复了一个回归问题，当 :func:`copy.copy`-ing 带有多个标志成员的 :class:`enum.Flag` "
"时。"

#: ../NEWS:19741
msgid ""
":gh:`79512`: Fixed names and ``__module__`` value of :mod:`weakref` classes "
":class:`~weakref.ReferenceType`, :class:`~weakref.ProxyType`, "
":class:`~weakref.CallableProxyType`. It makes them pickleable."
msgstr ""
":gh:`79512`: 修复了 :mod:`weakref` 模块中 "
":class:`~weakref.ReferenceType`、:class:`~weakref.ProxyType`、:class:`~weakref.CallableProxyType`"
" 类的名称和 ``__module__`` 值，使它们可以被 pickle。"

#: ../NEWS:19745
msgid ""
":gh:`91389`: Fix an issue where :mod:`dis` utilities could report missing or"
" incorrect position information in the presence of ``CACHE`` entries."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91389`: 修复了一个问题，其中 :mod:`dis` 工具在存在 ``CACHE`` 条目时可能会报告缺失或不正确的位置信息。"

#: ../NEWS:19748
msgid ""
":gh:`93626`: Set ``__future__.annotations`` to have a ``None`` "
"mandatoryRelease to indicate that it is currently 'TBD'."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93626`: 将 ``__future__.annotations`` 的 ``None`` mandatoryRelease "
"设置为表示当前为“待定”。"

#: ../NEWS:19751
msgid ""
":gh:`90473`: Emscripten and WASI have no home directory and cannot provide "
":pep:`370` user site directory."
msgstr ":gh:`90473`: Emscripten 和 WASI 没有主目录，无法提供 :pep:`370` 用户站点目录。"

#: ../NEWS:19754
msgid ""
":gh:`90494`: :func:`copy.copy` and :func:`copy.deepcopy` now always raise a "
"TypeError if ``__reduce__()`` returns a tuple with length 6 instead of "
"silently ignore the 6th item or produce incorrect result."
msgstr ""
":gh:`90494`: 如果 ``__reduce__()`` 返回长度为6的元组，:func:`copy.copy` 和 "
":func:`copy.deepcopy` 现在总是会引发 TypeError，而不是静默忽略第6项或产生不正确的结果。"

#: ../NEWS:19758
msgid ""
":gh:`90549`: Fix a multiprocessing bug where a global named resource (such "
"as a semaphore) could leak when a child process is spawned (as opposed to "
"forked)."
msgstr ":gh:`90549`: 修复了一个多进程错误，其中在创建子进程（与 fork 相对）时，全局命名资源（如信号量）可能会泄漏。"

#: ../NEWS:19762
msgid ""
":gh:`93521`: Fixed a case where dataclasses would try to add ``__weakref__``"
" into the ``__slots__`` for a dataclass that specified ``weakref_slot=True``"
" when it was already defined in one of its bases. This resulted in a "
"``TypeError`` upon the new class being created."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93521`: 修复了一个情况，其中数据类会尝试将 ``__weakref__`` 添加到已经在其基类中定义了 "
"``weakref_slot=True`` 的数据类的 ``__slots__`` 中。这会导致在创建新类时引发 ``TypeError``。"

#: ../NEWS:19767
msgid ""
":gh:`79579`: :mod:`sqlite3` now correctly detects DML queries with leading "
"comments. Patch by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":gh:`79579`: :mod:`sqlite3` 现在能正确检测带有前导注释的 DML 查询。由 Erlend E. Aasland 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:19770
msgid ""
":gh:`93421`: Update :data:`sqlite3.Cursor.rowcount` when a DML statement has"
" run to completion. This fixes the row count for SQL queries like ``UPDATE "
"... RETURNING``. Patch by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93421`: 当 DML 语句运行完成时更新 :data:`sqlite3.Cursor.rowcount`。这修复了像 ``UPDATE "
"... RETURNING`` 这样的 SQL 查询的行计数。由 Erlend E. Aasland 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:19774
msgid ""
":gh:`93475`: Expose ``FICLONE`` and ``FICLONERANGE`` constants in "
":mod:`fcntl`. Patch by Illia Volochii."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93475`: 在 :mod:`fcntl` 中公开 ``FICLONE`` 和 ``FICLONERANGE`` 常量。由 Illia "
"Volochii 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:19777
msgid ":gh:`93370`: Deprecate :data:`!version` and :data:`!version_info`."
msgstr ":gh:`93370`: 弃用 :data:`!version` 和 :data:`!version_info`。"

#: ../NEWS:19779
msgid ""
":gh:`91810`: Suppress writing an XML declaration in open files in "
"``ElementTree.write()`` with ``encoding='unicode'`` and "
"``xml_declaration=None``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91810`: 在使用 ``encoding='unicode'`` 和 ``xml_declaration=None`` 的 "
"``ElementTree.write()`` 中，抑制在打开的文件中写入 XML 声明。"

#: ../NEWS:19783
msgid ""
":gh:`91162`: Support splitting of unpacked arbitrary-length tuple over "
"``TypeVar`` and ``TypeVarTuple`` parameters. For example:"
msgstr ":gh:`91162`: 支持在 ``TypeVar`` 和 ``TypeVarTuple`` 参数上解包任意长度的元组拆分。例如："

#: ../NEWS:19786
msgid "``A[T, *Ts][*tuple[int, ...]]`` -> ``A[int, *tuple[int, ...]]``"
msgstr "``A[T, *Ts][*tuple[int, ...]]`` -> ``A[int, *tuple[int, ...]]``"

#: ../NEWS:19787
msgid "``A[*Ts, T][*tuple[int, ...]]`` -> ``A[*tuple[int, ...], int]``"
msgstr "``A[*Ts, T][*tuple[int, ...]]`` -> ``A[*tuple[int, ...], int]``"

#: ../NEWS:19789
msgid ""
":gh:`93353`: Fix the :func:`importlib.resources.as_file` context manager to "
"remove the temporary file if destroyed late during Python finalization: keep"
" a local reference to the :func:`os.remove` function. Patch by Victor "
"Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93353`: 修复 :func:`importlib.resources.as_file` "
"上下文管理器，在Python最终化过程中如果被延迟销毁则删除临时文件：保留对 :func:`os.remove` 函数的本地引用。由 Victor "
"Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:19794
msgid ""
":gh:`83658`: Make :class:`multiprocessing.Pool` raise an exception if "
"``maxtasksperchild`` is not ``None`` or a positive int."
msgstr ""
":gh:`83658`: 如果 ``maxtasksperchild`` 不是 ``None`` 或正整数，则使 "
":class:`multiprocessing.Pool` 抛出异常。"

#: ../NEWS:19797
msgid ""
":gh:`93312`: Add :const:`os.PIDFD_NONBLOCK` flag to open a file descriptor "
"for a process with :func:`os.pidfd_open` in non-blocking mode. Patch by "
"Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93312`: 添加 :const:`os.PIDFD_NONBLOCK` 标志，用于以非阻塞模式通过 "
":func:`os.pidfd_open` 打开进程的文件描述符。由 Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:19801
msgid ""
":gh:`88123`: Implement ``Enum.__contains__`` that returns ``True`` or "
"``False`` to replace the deprecated behaviour that would sometimes raise a "
":exc:`TypeError`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`88123`: 实现 ``Enum.__contains__``，返回 ``True`` 或 ``False``，以取代有时会引发 "
":exc:`TypeError` 的废弃行为。"

#: ../NEWS:19805
msgid ""
":gh:`93297`: Make asyncio task groups prevent child tasks from being GCed"
msgstr ":gh:`93297`: 使 asyncio 任务组阻止子任务被垃圾回收。"

#: ../NEWS:19807
msgid ""
":gh:`85308`: Changed :class:`argparse.ArgumentParser` to use "
":term:`filesystem encoding and error handler` instead of default text "
"encoding to read arguments from file (e.g. ``fromfile_prefix_chars`` "
"option). This change affects Windows; argument file should be encoded with "
"UTF-8 instead of ANSI Codepage."
msgstr ""
":gh:`85308`: 更改 :class:`argparse.ArgumentParser` 使用 :term:`filesystem "
"encoding and error handler` 而非默认文本编码从文件读取参数（例如 ``fromfile_prefix_chars`` "
"选项）。此更改影响 Windows；参数文件应使用 UTF-8 而非 ANSI 代码页编码。"

#: ../NEWS:19813
msgid ""
":gh:`93156`: Accessing the :attr:`pathlib.PurePath.parents` sequence of an "
"absolute path using negative index values produced incorrect results."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93156`: 使用负索引值访问绝对路径的 :attr:`pathlib.PurePath.parents` 序列会产生不正确的结果。"

#: ../NEWS:19816
msgid ""
":gh:`93162`: Add the ability for :func:`logging.config.dictConfig` to "
"usefully configure :class:`~logging.handlers.QueueHandler` and "
":class:`~logging.handlers.QueueListener` as a pair, and add "
":func:`logging.getHandlerByName` and :func:`logging.getHandlerNames` APIs to"
" allow access to handlers by name."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93162`: 为 :func:`logging.config.dictConfig` 添加能力，以有效配置 "
":class:`~logging.handlers.QueueHandler` 和 "
":class:`~logging.handlers.QueueListener` 作为一对，并添加 "
":func:`logging.getHandlerByName` 和 :func:`logging.getHandlerNames` API "
"以允许按名称访问处理器。"

#: ../NEWS:19822
msgid ""
":gh:`93243`: The :mod:`!smtpd` module was removed per the schedule in "
":pep:`594`."
msgstr ":gh:`93243`: 根据 :pep:`594` 中的计划移除了 :mod:`!smtpd` 模块。"

#: ../NEWS:19825
msgid ""
":gh:`92886`: Replace ``assert`` statements with ``raise AssertionError()`` "
"in :class:`~wsgiref.BaseHandler` so that the tested behaviour is maintained "
"running with optimizations ``(-O)``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92886`: 在 :class:`~wsgiref.BaseHandler` 中用 ``raise AssertionError()`` "
"替换 ``assert`` 语句，以便在使用优化 ``(-O)`` 运行时维护测试行为。"

#: ../NEWS:19829
msgid ""
":gh:`90155`: Fix broken :class:`asyncio.Semaphore` when acquire is "
"cancelled."
msgstr ":gh:`90155`: 修复当获取被取消时损坏的 :class:`asyncio.Semaphore`。"

#: ../NEWS:19831
msgid ""
":gh:`90817`: The :func:`locale.resetlocale` function is deprecated and will "
"be removed in Python 3.13. Use ``locale.setlocale(locale.LC_ALL, \"\")`` "
"instead. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`90817`: :func:`locale.resetlocale` 函数已被弃用，并将在 Python 3.13 中移除。请改用 "
"``locale.setlocale(locale.LC_ALL, \"\")``。由 Victor Stinner 提交补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:19835
msgid ""
":gh:`91513`: Added ``taskName`` attribute to :mod:`logging` module for use "
"with :mod:`asyncio` tasks."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91513`: 在 :mod:`logging` 模块中为与 :mod:`asyncio` 任务一起使用添加了 ``taskName`` "
"属性。"

#: ../NEWS:19838
msgid ""
":gh:`74696`: :func:`shutil.make_archive` no longer temporarily changes the "
"current working directory during creation of standard ``.zip`` or tar "
"archives."
msgstr ""
":gh:`74696`: :func:`shutil.make_archive` 在创建标准 ``.zip`` 或 tar "
"归档文件时不再临时更改当前工作目录。"

#: ../NEWS:19842
msgid ""
":gh:`92728`: The :func:`re.template` function and the corresponding "
":const:`re.TEMPLATE` and :const:`re.T` flags are restored after they were "
"removed in 3.11.0b1, but they are now deprecated, so they might be removed "
"from Python 3.13."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92728`: :func:`re.template` 函数及对应的 :const:`re.TEMPLATE` 和 :const:`re.T`"
" 标志在 3.11.0b1 中被移除后已恢复，但它们现在已被弃用，因此可能会在 Python 3.13 中移除。"

#: ../NEWS:19847
msgid ""
":gh:`93033`: Search in some strings (platform dependent i.e [U+0xFFFF, "
"U+0x0100] on Windows or [U+0xFFFFFFFF, U+0x00010000] on Linux 64-bit) are "
"now up to 10 times faster."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93033`: 在某些字符串中的搜索（平台相关，如 Windows 上的 [U+0xFFFF, U+0x0100] 或 Linux 64 "
"位上的 [U+0xFFFFFFFF, U+0x00010000]）现在快了 10 倍。"

#: ../NEWS:19851
msgid ""
":gh:`89973`: Fix :exc:`re.error` raised in :mod:`fnmatch` if the pattern "
"contains a character range with upper bound lower than lower bound (e.g. "
"``[c-a]``). Now such ranges are interpreted as empty ranges."
msgstr ""
":gh:`89973`: 修复了如果在模式中包含上限低于下限的字符范围（例如 ``[c-a]``）时 :mod:`fnmatch` 中引发的 "
":exc:`re.error`。现在这样的范围被解释为空范围。"

#: ../NEWS:19855
msgid ""
":gh:`93044`: No longer convert the database argument of "
":func:`sqlite3.connect` to bytes before passing it to the factory."
msgstr ":gh:`93044`: 不再在将数据库参数传递给工厂之前将其转换为字节。"

#: ../NEWS:19858
msgid ""
":gh:`93010`: In a very special case, the email package tried to append the "
"nonexistent ``InvalidHeaderError`` to the defect list. It should have been "
"``InvalidHeaderDefect``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93010`: 在一种非常特殊的情况下，email 包尝试将不存在的 ``InvalidHeaderError`` 添加到缺陷列表中。应该是 "
"``InvalidHeaderDefect``。"

#: ../NEWS:19862
msgid ""
":gh:`92986`: Fix :func:`ast.unparse` when ``ImportFrom.level`` is ``None``"
msgstr ""
":gh:`92986`: 修复当 ``ImportFrom.level`` 为 ``None`` 时的 :func:`ast.unparse`。"

#: ../NEWS:19864
msgid ""
":gh:`92932`: Now :func:`~dis.dis` and :func:`~dis.get_instructions` handle "
"operand values for instructions prefixed by ``EXTENDED_ARG_QUICK``. Patch by"
" Sam Gross and Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92932`: 现在 :func:`~dis.dis` 和 :func:`~dis.get_instructions` 处理以 "
"``EXTENDED_ARG_QUICK`` 为前缀的指令的操作数值。补丁由 Sam Gross 和 Donghee Na 提交。"

#: ../NEWS:19868
msgid ""
":gh:`92675`: Fix :func:`venv.ensure_directories` to accept "
":class:`pathlib.Path` arguments in addition to :class:`str` paths. Patch by "
"David Foster."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92675`: 修复 :func:`venv.ensure_directories` 以接受 :class:`pathlib.Path` "
"参数以及 :class:`str` 路径。补丁由 David Foster 提交。"

#: ../NEWS:19872
msgid ""
":gh:`87901`: Removed the ``encoding`` argument from :func:`os.popen` that "
"was added in 3.11b1."
msgstr ":gh:`87901`: 从 :func:`os.popen` 中移除了在 3.11b1 中添加的 ``encoding`` 参数。"

#: ../NEWS:19875
msgid ""
":gh:`91922`: Fix function :func:`sqlite.connect` and the "
":class:`sqlite.Connection` constructor on non-UTF-8 locales. Also, they now "
"support bytes paths non-decodable with the current FS encoding."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91922`: 修复了在非UTF-8语言环境下 :func:`sqlite.connect` 函数和 "
":class:`sqlite.Connection` 构造函数的问题。此外，它们现在支持无法用当前文件系统编码解码的字节路径。"

#: ../NEWS:19879
msgid ""
":gh:`92869`: Added :class:`~ctypes.c_time_t` to :mod:`ctypes`, which has the"
" same size as the :c:type:`time_t` type in C."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92869`: 在 :mod:`ctypes` 中添加了 :class:`~ctypes.c_time_t`，其大小与C中的 "
":c:type:`time_t` 类型相同。"

#: ../NEWS:19882
msgid ""
":gh:`92839`: Fixed crash resulting from calling bisect.insort() or "
"bisect.insort_left() with the key argument not equal to ``None``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92839`: 修复了当调用 bisect.insort() 或 bisect.insort_left() 时，key 参数不等于 "
"``None`` 导致的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:19885
msgid ""
":gh:`90473`: :mod:`subprocess` now fails early on Emscripten and WASI "
"platforms to work around missing :func:`os.pipe` on WASI."
msgstr ""
":gh:`90473`: :mod:`subprocess` 现在在Emscripten和WASI平台上早期失败，以解决WASI上缺少 "
":func:`os.pipe` 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:19888
msgid ""
":gh:`89325`: Removed many old deprecated :mod:`unittest` features: "
":class:`~unittest.TestCase` method aliases, undocumented and broken "
":class:`~unittest.TestCase` method ``assertDictContainsSubset``, "
"undocumented :meth:`TestLoader.loadTestsFromModule "
"<unittest.TestLoader.loadTestsFromModule>` parameter *use_load_tests*, and "
"an underscored alias of the :class:`~unittest.TextTestResult` class."
msgstr ""
":gh:`89325`: 移除了许多旧的已弃用的 :mod:`unittest` 特性：:class:`~unittest.TestCase` "
"方法别名、未记录且损坏的 :class:`~unittest.TestCase` 方法 "
"``assertDictContainsSubset``、未记录的 :meth:`TestLoader.loadTestsFromModule "
"<unittest.TestLoader.loadTestsFromModule>` 参数 *use_load_tests*，以及 "
":class:`~unittest.TextTestResult` 类的一个下划线别名。"

#: ../NEWS:19895
msgid ""
":gh:`92734`: Allow multi-element reprs emitted by :mod:`reprlib` to be "
"pretty-printed using configurable indentation."
msgstr ":gh:`92734`: 允许 :mod:`reprlib` 发出的多元素 repr 使用可配置的缩进进行漂亮打印。"

#: ../NEWS:19898
msgid ""
":gh:`92671`: Fixed :func:`ast.unparse` for empty tuples in the assignment "
"target context."
msgstr ":gh:`92671`: 修复了在赋值目标上下文中 :func:`ast.unparse` 对于空元组的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:19901
msgid ""
":gh:`91581`: :meth:`~datetime.datetime.utcfromtimestamp` no longer attempts "
"to resolve ``fold`` in the pure Python implementation, since the fold is "
"never 1 in UTC. In addition to being slightly faster in the common case, "
"this also prevents some errors when the timestamp is close to "
":attr:`datetime.min <datetime.datetime.min>`.  Patch by Paul Ganssle."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91581`: :meth:`~datetime.datetime.utcfromtimestamp` 在纯Python实现中不再尝试解析 "
"``fold``，因为在UTC中fold永远不会是1。除了在常见情况下稍微快一些之外，这还防止了当时间戳接近 :attr:`datetime.min "
"<datetime.datetime.min>` 时的一些错误。由Paul Ganssle提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:19907
msgid ""
":gh:`86388`: Removed randrange() functionality deprecated since Python 3.10."
" Formerly, randrange(10.0) losslessly converted to randrange(10). Now, it "
"raises a TypeError. Also, the exception raised for non-integral values such "
"as randrange(10.5) or randrange('10') has been changed from ValueError to "
"TypeError."
msgstr ""
":gh:`86388`: 移除了自Python "
"3.10以来已弃用的randrange()功能。以前，randrange(10.0)无损转换为randrange(10)。现在，它会引发TypeError。此外，对于非整数值如randrange(10.5)或randrange('10')引发的异常已从ValueError更改为TypeError。"

#: ../NEWS:19913
msgid ""
":gh:`90385`: Add :meth:`pathlib.Path.walk` as an alternative to "
":func:`os.walk`."
msgstr ":gh:`90385`: 添加 :meth:`pathlib.Path.walk` 作为 :func:`os.walk` 的替代方案。"

#: ../NEWS:19916
msgid ":gh:`92550`: Fix :meth:`pathlib.Path.rglob` for empty pattern."
msgstr ":gh:`92550`: 修复了 :meth:`pathlib.Path.rglob` 对于空模式的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:19918
msgid ""
":gh:`92591`: Allow :mod:`logging` filters to return a "
":class:`logging.LogRecord` instance so that filters attached to "
":class:`logging.Handler`\\ s can enrich records without side effects on "
"other handlers."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92591`: 允许 :mod:`logging` 过滤器返回一个 :class:`logging.LogRecord` 实例，以便附加到 "
":class:`logging.Handler`\\ 的过滤器可以在不影响其他处理程序的情况下丰富记录。"

#: ../NEWS:19923
msgid ""
":gh:`92445`: Fix a bug in :mod:`argparse` where ``nargs=\"*\"`` would raise "
"an error instead of returning an empty list when 0 arguments were supplied "
"if choice was also defined in ``parser.add_argument``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92445`: 修复了 :mod:`argparse` 中的一个错误，其中 ``nargs=\"*\"`` "
"在提供0个参数时会引发错误而不是返回空列表，如果 ``parser.add_argument`` 中也定义了选择。"

#: ../NEWS:19927
msgid ""
":gh:`92547`: Remove undocumented :mod:`sqlite3` features deprecated in "
"Python 3.10:"
msgstr ":gh:`92547`: 移除了在 Python 3.10 中弃用的未文档化 :mod:`sqlite3` 功能："

#: ../NEWS:19930
msgid "``sqlite3.enable_shared_cache()``"
msgstr "``sqlite3.enable_shared_cache()``"

#: ../NEWS:19931
msgid "``sqlite3.OptimizedUnicode``"
msgstr "``sqlite3.OptimizedUnicode``"

#: ../NEWS:19935
msgid ""
":gh:`92530`: Fix an issue that occurred after interrupting "
":func:`threading.Condition.notify`."
msgstr ":gh:`92530`: 修复了在中断 :func:`threading.Condition.notify` 后出现的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:19938
msgid ""
":gh:`92531`: The statistics.median_grouped() function now always return a "
"float. Formerly, it did not convert the input type when for sequences of "
"length one."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92531`: statistics.median_grouped() "
"函数现在总是返回一个浮点数。以前，对于长度为1的序列，它不会转换输入类型。"

#: ../NEWS:19942
msgid ""
":gh:`84131`: The :class:`pathlib.Path` deprecated method ``link_to`` has "
"been removed. Use 3.10's :meth:`~pathlib.Path.hardlink_to` method instead as"
" its semantics are consistent with that of :meth:`~pathlib.Path.symlink_to`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`84131`: :class:`pathlib.Path` 弃用的方法 ``link_to`` 已被移除。使用 3.10 的 "
":meth:`~pathlib.Path.hardlink_to` 方法代替，因为其语义与 "
":meth:`~pathlib.Path.symlink_to` 一致。"

#: ../NEWS:19947
msgid ""
":gh:`89336`: Removed :mod:`configparser` module APIs: the "
"``SafeConfigParser`` class alias, the ``ParsingError.filename`` property and"
" parameter, and the ``ConfigParser.readfp`` method, all of which were "
"deprecated since Python 3.2."
msgstr ""
":gh:`89336`: 移除了 :mod:`configparser` 模块的 API：``SafeConfigParser`` "
"类别别名、``ParsingError.filename`` 属性和参数，以及 ``ConfigParser.readfp`` 方法，所有这些自 "
"Python 3.2 起已被弃用。"

#: ../NEWS:19952
msgid ""
":gh:`92391`: Add :meth:`~object.__class_getitem__` to "
":class:`csv.DictReader` and :class:`csv.DictWriter`, allowing them to be "
"parameterized at runtime. Patch by Marc Mueller."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92391`: 向 :class:`csv.DictReader` 和 :class:`csv.DictWriter` 添加了 "
":meth:`~object.__class_getitem__`，允许它们在运行时被参数化。由 Marc Mueller 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:19956
msgid ""
":gh:`91968`: Add ``SO_RTABLE`` and ``SO_USER_COOKIE`` constants to "
":mod:`socket`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91968`: 向 :mod:`socket` 添加了 ``SO_RTABLE`` 和 ``SO_USER_COOKIE`` 常量。"

#: ../NEWS:19959
msgid ""
":gh:`91810`: :class:`~xml.etree.ElementTree.ElementTree` method "
":meth:`~xml.etree.ElementTree.ElementTree.write` and function "
":func:`~xml.etree.ElementTree.tostring` now use the text file's encoding "
"(\"UTF-8\" if not available) instead of locale encoding in XML declaration "
"when ``encoding=\"unicode\"`` is specified."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91810`: :class:`~xml.etree.ElementTree.ElementTree` 方法 "
":meth:`~xml.etree.ElementTree.ElementTree.write` 和函数 "
":func:`~xml.etree.ElementTree.tostring` 现在在指定 ``encoding=\"unicode\"`` "
"时使用文本文件的编码（如果不可用则为 \"UTF-8\"）而不是 XML 声明中的区域设置编码。"

#: ../NEWS:19965
msgid ""
":gh:`81790`: :func:`os.path.splitdrive` now understands DOS device paths "
"with UNC links (beginning ``\\\\?\\UNC\\``). Contributed by Barney Gale."
msgstr ""
":gh:`81790`: :func:`os.path.splitdrive` 现在理解带有 UNC 链接的 DOS 设备路径（以 "
"``\\\\?\\UNC\\`` 开头）。由 Barney Gale 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:19968
msgid ""
":gh:`91760`: Apply more strict rules for numerical group references and "
"group names in regular expressions. Only sequence of ASCII digits is now "
"accepted as a numerical reference. The group name in bytes patterns and "
"replacement strings can now only contain ASCII letters and digits and "
"underscore."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91760`: "
"对正则表达式中的数字组引用和组名应用更严格的规则。现在仅接受ASCII数字序列作为数字引用。字节模式和替换字符串中的组名现在只能包含ASCII字母、数字和下划线。"

#: ../NEWS:19974
msgid ""
":gh:`90622`: Worker processes for "
":class:`concurrent.futures.ProcessPoolExecutor` are no longer spawned on "
"demand (a feature added in 3.9) when the multiprocessing context start "
"method is ``\"fork\"`` as that can lead to deadlocks in the child processes "
"due to a fork happening while threads are running."
msgstr ""
":gh:`90622`: 当多进程上下文启动方法为 "
"``\"fork\"``时，:class:`concurrent.futures.ProcessPoolExecutor` "
"的工作进程不再按需生成（这是3.9版本中添加的特性），因为这可能会导致子进程中的死锁，因为在线程运行时发生了fork。"

#: ../NEWS:19980
msgid ""
":gh:`91577`: Move imports in :class:`~multiprocessing.SharedMemory` methods "
"to module level so that they can be executed late in python finalization."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91577`: 将 :class:`~multiprocessing.SharedMemory` "
"方法中的导入移动到模块级别，以便它们可以在Python终止的后期执行。"

#: ../NEWS:19983
msgid ""
":gh:`91581`: Remove an unhandled error case in the C implementation of calls"
" to :meth:`datetime.fromtimestamp <datetime.datetime.fromtimestamp>` with no"
" time zone (i.e. getting a local time from an epoch timestamp). This should "
"have no user-facing effect other than giving a possibly more accurate error "
"message when called with timestamps that fall on 10000-01-01 in the local "
"time. Patch by Paul Ganssle."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91581`: 移除了在调用没有时区的 :meth:`datetime.fromtimestamp "
"<datetime.datetime.fromtimestamp>` "
"的C实现中未处理的错误情况（即从epoch时间戳获取本地时间）。这除了在调用落在本地时间10000-01-01的时间戳时可能给出更准确的错误消息外，应该不会对用户产生影响。由Paul"
" Ganssle提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:19990
msgid ""
":gh:`91539`: Improve performance of "
"``urllib.request.getproxies_environment`` when there are many environment "
"variables"
msgstr ""
":gh:`91539`: 当有许多环境变量时，提高 ``urllib.request.getproxies_environment`` 的性能。"

#: ../NEWS:19993
msgid ""
":gh:`91524`: Speed up the regular expression substitution (functions "
":func:`re.sub` and :func:`re.subn` and corresponding :class:`re.Pattern` "
"methods) for replacement strings containing group references by 2--3 times."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91524`: 对于包含组引用的替换字符串，通过2--3倍的速度提高了正则表达式替换（函数 :func:`re.sub` 和 "
":func:`re.subn` 以及相应的 :class:`re.Pattern` 方法）的性能。"

#: ../NEWS:19998
msgid ""
":gh:`91447`: Fix findtext in the xml module to only give an empty string "
"when the text attribute is set to ``None``."
msgstr ":gh:`91447`: 修复xml模块中的findtext，仅在文本属性设置为 ``None`` 时给出空字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:20001
msgid ""
":gh:`91456`: Deprecate current default auto() behavior:  In 3.13 the default"
" will be for for auto() to always return the largest member value "
"incremented by 1, and to raise if incompatible value types are used."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91456`: "
"弃用当前的默认auto()行为：在3.13版本中，auto()的默认行为将始终返回最大成员值加1，并在使用不兼容的值类型时引发错误。"

#: ../NEWS:20005
msgid ""
":issue:`47231`: Fixed an issue with inconsistent trailing slashes in tarfile"
" longname directories."
msgstr ":issue:`47231`: 修复了tarfile长名字目录中不一致的尾部斜杠问题。"

#: ../NEWS:20008
msgid ""
":issue:`39064`: :class:`zipfile.ZipFile` now raises "
":exc:`zipfile.BadZipFile` instead of ``ValueError`` when reading a corrupt "
"zip file in which the central directory offset is negative."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39064`: :class:`zipfile.ZipFile` 现在在读取损坏的 zip 文件时，如果中央目录偏移为负，会引发 "
":exc:`zipfile.BadZipFile` 而不是 ``ValueError``。"

#: ../NEWS:20012
msgid ""
":issue:`41287`: Fix handling of the ``doc`` argument in subclasses of "
":func:`property`."
msgstr ":issue:`41287`: 修复了 :func:`property` 子类中 ``doc`` 参数的处理。"

#: ../NEWS:20015
msgid ""
":gh:`90005`: :mod:`ctypes` dependency ``libffi`` is now detected with ``pkg-"
"config``."
msgstr ":gh:`90005`: :mod:`ctypes` 依赖项 ``libffi`` 现在通过 ``pkg-config`` 检测。"

#: ../NEWS:20018
msgid ""
":issue:`32547`: The constructors for :class:`~csv.DictWriter` and "
":class:`~csv.DictReader` now coerce the ``fieldnames`` argument to a "
":class:`list` if it is an iterator."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32547`: :class:`~csv.DictWriter` 和 :class:`~csv.DictReader` 的构造函数现在将"
" ``fieldnames`` 参数强制转换为 :class:`list`，如果它是一个迭代器的话。"

#: ../NEWS:20022
msgid ""
":issue:`35540`: Fix :func:`dataclasses.asdict` crash when "
":class:`collections.defaultdict` is present in the attributes."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35540`: 修复了当 :class:`collections.defaultdict` 出现在属性中时 "
":func:`dataclasses.asdict` 崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:20025
msgid ""
":issue:`47063`: Add an index_pages parameter to support using non-default "
"index page names."
msgstr ":issue:`47063`: 添加了一个 index_pages 参数以支持使用非默认的索引页面名称。"

#: ../NEWS:20028
msgid ":issue:`47025`: Drop support for :class:`bytes` on :data:`sys.path`."
msgstr ":issue:`47025`: 取消了对 :data:`sys.path` 上 :class:`bytes` 的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:20030
msgid ""
":issue:`46951`: Order the contents of zipapp archives, to make builds more "
"reproducible."
msgstr ":issue:`46951`: 对 zipapp 归档的内容进行排序，以使构建更具可重现性。"

#: ../NEWS:20033
msgid ""
":issue:`42777`: Implement :meth:`pathlib.Path.is_mount` for Windows paths."
msgstr ":issue:`42777`: 为 Windows 路径实现了 :meth:`pathlib.Path.is_mount`。"

#: ../NEWS:20035
msgid ""
":issue:`46755`: In :class:`QueueHandler`, clear ``stack_info`` from "
":class:`LogRecord` to prevent stack trace from being written twice."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46755`: 在 :class:`QueueHandler` 中，清除 :class:`LogRecord` 中的 "
"``stack_info`` 以防止堆栈跟踪被写入两次。"

#: ../NEWS:20038
msgid ""
":issue:`45393`: Fix the formatting for ``await x`` and ``not x`` in the "
"operator precedence table when using the :func:`help` system."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45393`: 在使用 :func:`help` 系统时，修复了操作符优先级表中 ``await x`` 和 ``not x`` "
"的格式化。"

#: ../NEWS:20041
msgid ""
":issue:`46642`: Improve error message when trying to subclass an instance of"
" :data:`typing.TypeVar`, :data:`typing.ParamSpec`, "
":data:`typing.TypeVarTuple`, etc. Based on patch by Gregory Beauregard."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46642`: 当尝试子类化 "
":data:`typing.TypeVar`、:data:`typing.ParamSpec`、:data:`typing.TypeVarTuple` "
"等的实例时，改进了错误消息。基于 Gregory Beauregard 的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:20045
msgid ""
":issue:`46364`: Restrict use of sockets instead of pipes for stdin of "
"subprocesses created by :mod:`asyncio` to AIX platform only."
msgstr ":issue:`46364`: 限制使用套接字而不是管道作为 :mod:`asyncio` 创建的子进程的标准输入，仅限于 AIX 平台。"

#: ../NEWS:20048
msgid ""
":issue:`28249`: Set :attr:`doctest.DocTest.lineno` to ``None`` when an "
"object does not have :attr:`~definition.__doc__`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28249`: 当对象没有 :attr:`~definition.__doc__` 时，将 "
":attr:`doctest.DocTest.lineno` 设置为 ``None``。"

#: ../NEWS:20051
msgid ""
":issue:`46197`: Fix :mod:`ensurepip` environment isolation for subprocess "
"running ``pip``."
msgstr ":issue:`46197`: 修复了 :mod:`ensurepip` 对运行 ``pip`` 的子进程的环境隔离。"

#: ../NEWS:20054
msgid ""
":issue:`45924`: Fix :mod:`asyncio` incorrect traceback when future's "
"exception is raised multiple times. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45924`: 修复了 :mod:`asyncio` 在多次引发 future 的异常时的错误回溯。由 Kumar Aditya "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:20057
msgid ""
":issue:`45046`: Add support of context managers in :mod:`unittest`: methods "
":meth:`~unittest.TestCase.enterContext` and "
":meth:`~unittest.TestCase.enterClassContext` of class "
":class:`~unittest.TestCase`, method "
":meth:`~unittest.IsolatedAsyncioTestCase.enterAsyncContext` of class "
":class:`~unittest.IsolatedAsyncioTestCase` and function "
":func:`unittest.enterModuleContext`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45046`: 在 :mod:`unittest` 中添加对上下文管理器的支持：类 "
":class:`~unittest.TestCase` 的方法 :meth:`~unittest.TestCase.enterContext` 和 "
":meth:`~unittest.TestCase.enterClassContext`，类 "
":class:`~unittest.IsolatedAsyncioTestCase` 的方法 "
":meth:`~unittest.IsolatedAsyncioTestCase.enterAsyncContext` 以及函数 "
