"ignores the :ref:`Python UTF-8 Mode <utf8-mode>`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`47000`: 添加 :func:`locale.getencoding` 以获取当前区域编码。它类似于 "
"``locale.getpreferredencoding(False)``，但忽略 :ref:`Python UTF-8 模式 "
"<utf8-mode>`。"

#: ../NEWS:21221
msgid ""
":issue:`42012`: Add :mod:`wsgiref.types`, containing WSGI-specific types for"
" static type checking."
msgstr ":issue:`42012`: 添加 :mod:`wsgiref.types`，包含用于静态类型检查的 WSGI 特定类型。"

#: ../NEWS:21224
msgid ""
":issue:`47227`: Suppress expression chaining for more :mod:`re` parsing "
"errors."
msgstr ":issue:`47227`: 对更多 :mod:`re` 解析错误抑制表达式链。"

#: ../NEWS:21226
msgid ""
":issue:`47211`: Remove undocumented and never working function "
"``re.template()`` and flag ``re.TEMPLATE``. This was later reverted in "
"3.11.0b2 and deprecated instead."
msgstr ""
":issue:`47211`: 移除未文档化且从未工作的函数 ``re.template()`` 和标志 ``re.TEMPLATE``。这在 "
"3.11.0b2 中被撤销并改为废弃。"

#: ../NEWS:21230
msgid ""
":issue:`47135`: :meth:`decimal.localcontext` now accepts context attributes "
"via keyword arguments"
msgstr ":issue:`47135`: :meth:`decimal.localcontext` 现在通过关键字参数接受上下文属性。"

#: ../NEWS:21233
msgid ""
":issue:`43323`: Fix errors in the :mod:`email` module if the charset itself "
"contains undecodable/unencodable characters."
msgstr ":issue:`43323`: 修复 :mod:`email` 模块中如果字符集本身包含不可解码/不可编码字符时的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:21236
msgid ":issue:`46841`: Disassembly of quickened code."
msgstr ":issue:`46841`: 快速代码的反汇编。"

#: ../NEWS:21238
msgid ":issue:`46681`: Forward gzip.compress() compresslevel to zlib."
msgstr ":issue:`46681`: 将 gzip.compress() 的 compresslevel 参数传递给 zlib。"

#: ../NEWS:21240
msgid ""
":issue:`45100`: Add :func:`typing.get_overloads` and "
":func:`typing.clear_overloads`. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45100`: 添加 :func:`typing.get_overloads` 和 "
":func:`typing.clear_overloads`。由 Jelle Zijlstra 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:21243
msgid ""
":issue:`44807`: :class:`typing.Protocol` no longer silently replaces "
":meth:`__init__` methods defined on subclasses. Patch by Adrian Garcia "
"Badaracco."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44807`: :class:`typing.Protocol` 不再静默替换子类上定义的 :meth:`__init__` 方法。由 "
"Adrian Garcia Badaracco 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:21247
msgid ""
":issue:`46787`: Fix :class:`concurrent.futures.ProcessPoolExecutor` "
"exception memory leak"
msgstr ""
":issue:`46787`: 修复 :class:`concurrent.futures.ProcessPoolExecutor` 异常内存泄漏"

#: ../NEWS:21250
msgid ""
":issue:`46720`: Add support for path-like objects to "
":func:`multiprocessing.set_executable` for Windows to be on a par with Unix-"
"like systems. Patch by Géry Ogam."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46720`: 为 Windows 添加对路径类对象的支持到 "
":func:`multiprocessing.set_executable`，以与类 Unix 系统保持一致。由 Géry Ogam 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:21254
msgid ":issue:`46696`: Add ``SO_INCOMING_CPU`` constant to :mod:`socket`."
msgstr ":issue:`46696`: 添加 ``SO_INCOMING_CPU`` 常量到 :mod:`socket`。"

#: ../NEWS:21256
msgid ":issue:`46053`: Fix OSS audio support on NetBSD."
msgstr ":issue:`46053`: 修复 NetBSD 上的 OSS 音频支持。"

#: ../NEWS:21258
msgid ""
":issue:`45639`: ``image/avif`` and ``image/webp`` were added to "
":mod:`mimetypes`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45639`: 添加 ``image/avif`` 和 ``image/webp`` 到 :mod:`mimetypes`。"

#: ../NEWS:21261
msgid ""
":issue:`46285`: Add command-line option ``-p``/``--protocol`` to module "
":mod:`http.server` which specifies the HTTP version to which the server is "
"conformant (HTTP/1.1 conformant servers can now be run from the command-line"
" interface of module :mod:`http.server`). Patch by Géry Ogam."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46285`: 为模块 :mod:`http.server` 添加命令行选项 "
"``-p``/``--protocol``，指定服务器符合的 HTTP 版本（HTTP/1.1 兼容的服务器现在可以从模块 "
":mod:`http.server` 的命令行界面运行）。由 Géry Ogam 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:21266
msgid ""
":issue:`44791`: Accept ellipsis as the last argument of "
":data:`typing.Concatenate`."
msgstr ":issue:`44791`: 接受省略号作为 :data:`typing.Concatenate` 的最后一个参数。"

#: ../NEWS:21269
msgid ""
":issue:`46547`: Remove variables leaking into ``pydoc.Helper`` class "
"namespace."
msgstr ":issue:`46547`: 移除泄漏到 ``pydoc.Helper`` 类命名空间的变量。"

#: ../NEWS:21271
msgid ""
":issue:`46415`: Fix ipaddress.ip_{address,interface,network} raising "
"TypeError instead of ValueError if given invalid tuple as address parameter."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46415`: 修复 ipaddress.ip_{address,interface,network} 在给定无效元组作为地址参数时抛出"
" TypeError 而不是 ValueError 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:21274
msgid ""
":issue:`46075`: ``CookieJar`` with ``DefaultCookiePolicy`` now can process "
"cookies from localhost with domain=localhost explicitly specified in Set-"
"Cookie header."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46075`: 带有 ``DefaultCookiePolicy`` 的 ``CookieJar`` 现在可以处理来自 "
"localhost 的 cookie，这些 cookie 在 Set-Cookie 头中明确指定了 domain=localhost。"

#: ../NEWS:21278
msgid ""
":issue:`45995`: Add a \"z\" option to the string formatting specification "
"that coerces negative zero floating-point values to positive zero after "
"rounding to the format precision.  Contributed by John Belmonte."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45995`: 在字符串格式化规范中添加 \"z\" 选项，该选项在四舍五入到格式精度后，将负零浮点值强制转换为正零。由 John "
"Belmonte 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:21282
msgid ""
":issue:`26175`: Fully implement the :class:`io.BufferedIOBase` or "
":class:`io.TextIOBase` interface for :class:`tempfile.SpooledTemporaryFile` "
"objects. This lets them work correctly with higher-level layers (like "
"compression modules). Patch by Carey Metcalfe."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26175`: 为 :class:`tempfile.SpooledTemporaryFile` 对象完全实现 "
":class:`io.BufferedIOBase` 或 :class:`io.TextIOBase` "
"接口。这使得它们能与更高层次的模块（如压缩模块）正确协作。由 Carey Metcalfe 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:21288
msgid ""
":issue:`45138`: Fix a regression in the :mod:`sqlite3` trace callback where "
"bound parameters were not expanded in the passed statement string. The "
"regression was introduced in Python 3.10 by :issue:`40318`. Patch by Erlend "
"E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45138`: 修复 :mod:`sqlite3` 跟踪回调中的一处回归问题，其中绑定参数未在传递的语句字符串中展开。此回归问题由 "
"Python 3.10 中的 :issue:`40318` 引入。补丁由 Erlend E. Aasland 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:21293
msgid ""
":issue:`44863`: Allow :class:`~typing.TypedDict` subclasses to also include "
":class:`~typing.Generic` as a base class in class based syntax. Thereby "
"allowing the user to define a generic ``TypedDict``, just like a user-"
"defined generic but with ``TypedDict`` semantics."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44863`: 允许 :class:`~typing.TypedDict` 子类在基于类的语法中也包含 "
":class:`~typing.Generic` 作为基类。从而允许用户定义一个泛型 ``TypedDict``，就像用户定义的泛型一样，但具有 "
"``TypedDict`` 语义。"

#: ../NEWS:21298
msgid ""
":issue:`44587`: Fix BooleanOptionalAction to not automatically add a default"
" string.  If a default string is desired, use a formatter to add it."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44587`: 修复 BooleanOptionalAction 不自动添加默认字符串的问题。如果需要默认字符串，使用格式化程序添加。"

#: ../NEWS:21301
msgid ""
":issue:`43827`: All positional-or-keyword parameters to ``ABCMeta.__new__`` "
"are now positional-only to avoid conflicts with keyword arguments to be "
"passed to :meth:`__init_subclass__`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43827`: ``ABCMeta.__new__`` 的所有位置或关键字参数现在都是仅位置的，以避免与要传递给 "
":meth:`__init_subclass__` 的关键字参数冲突。"

#: ../NEWS:21305
msgid ""
":issue:`43218`: Prevent creation of a venv whose path contains the PATH "
"separator. This could affect the usage of the activate script. Patch by "
"Dustin Rodrigues."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43218`: 防止创建路径包含 PATH 分隔符的 venv。这可能会影响激活脚本的使用。由 Dustin Rodrigues "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:21309
msgid ""
":issue:`38435`: Add a ``process_group`` parameter to "
":class:`subprocess.Popen` to help move more things off of the unsafe "
"``preexec_fn`` parameter."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38435`: 向 :class:`subprocess.Popen` 添加一个 ``process_group`` "
"参数，以帮助将更多内容从不安全的 ``preexec_fn`` 参数中移出。"

#: ../NEWS:21312
msgid ""
":issue:`42066`: Fix cookies getting sorted in :func:`CookieJar.__iter__` "
"which is an extra behavior and not mentioned in RFC 2965 or Netscape cookie "
"protocol. Now the cookies in ``CookieJar`` follows the order of the ``Set-"
"Cookie`` header. Patch by Iman Kermani."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42066`: 修复 :func:`CookieJar.__iter__` 中对 cookie 进行排序的问题，这是一个额外的行为，且在"
" RFC 2965 或 Netscape cookie 协议中未提及。现在 ``CookieJar`` 中的 cookie 遵循 ``Set-"
"Cookie`` 头的顺序。由 Iman Kermani 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:21317
msgid ""
":issue:`40617`: Add :meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.create_window_function` to "
":class:`sqlite3.Connection` for creating aggregate window functions. Patch "
"by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40617`: 向 :class:`sqlite3.Connection` 添加 "
":meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.create_window_function` 用于创建聚合窗口函数。由 Erlend E. "
"Aasland 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:21321
msgid ""
":issue:`40676`: Convert :mod:`csv` to use Argument Clinic for "
":func:`csv.field_size_limit`, :func:`csv.get_dialect`, "
":func:`csv.unregister_dialect` and :func:`csv.list_dialects`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40676`: 将 :mod:`csv` 模块的 "
":func:`csv.field_size_limit`、:func:`csv.get_dialect`、:func:`csv.unregister_dialect`"
" 和 :func:`csv.list_dialects` 转换为使用 Argument Clinic。"

#: ../NEWS:21325
msgid ""
":issue:`39716`: Raise an ``ArgumentError`` when the same subparser name is "
"added twice to an ``argparse.ArgumentParser``.  This is consistent with the "
"(default) behavior when the same option string is added twice to an "
"``ArgumentParser``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39716`: 当相同的子解析器名称被两次添加到 ``argparse.ArgumentParser`` 时，引发一个 "
"``ArgumentError``。这与当相同的选项字符串被两次添加到 ``ArgumentParser`` 时的（默认）行为一致。"

#: ../NEWS:21330
msgid ""
":issue:`36073`: Raise :exc:`~sqlite3.ProgrammingError` instead of "
"segfaulting on recursive usage of cursors in :mod:`sqlite3` converters. "
"Patch by Sergey Fedoseev."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36073`: 在 :mod:`sqlite3` 转换器中递归使用游标时，引发 "
":exc:`~sqlite3.ProgrammingError` 而不是段错误。由 Sergey Fedoseev 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:21334
msgid ""
":issue:`34975`: Adds a ``start_tls()`` method to "
":class:`~asyncio.streams.StreamWriter`, which upgrades the connection with "
"TLS using the given :class:`~ssl.SSLContext`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34975`: 向 :class:`~asyncio.streams.StreamWriter` 添加了一个 "
"``start_tls()`` 方法，该方法使用给定的 :class:`~ssl.SSLContext` 升级连接为 TLS。"

#: ../NEWS:21338
msgid ""
":issue:`22276`: :class:`~pathlib.Path` methods :meth:`~pathlib.Path.glob` "
"and :meth:`~pathlib.Path.rglob` return only directories if *pattern* ends "
"with a pathname components separator (``/`` or :data:`~os.sep`). Patch by "
"Eisuke Kawashima."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22276`: :class:`~pathlib.Path` 的方法 :meth:`~pathlib.Path.glob` 和 "
":meth:`~pathlib.Path.rglob` 如果 *pattern* 以路径名组件分隔符（``/`` 或 "
":data:`~os.sep`）结尾，则仅返回目录。由 Eisuke Kawashima 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:21343
msgid ""
":issue:`24905`: Add :meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.blobopen` to "
":class:`sqlite3.Connection`. :class:`sqlite3.Blob` allows incremental I/O "
"operations on blobs. Patch by Aviv Palivoda and Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24905`: 向 :class:`sqlite3.Connection` 添加了 "
":meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.blobopen`。:class:`sqlite3.Blob` 允许对 blob 进行增量 I/O"
" 操作。由 Aviv Palivoda 和 Erlend E. Aasland 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:21350
msgid ""
":gh:`91888`: Add a new ``gh`` role to the documentation to link to GitHub "
"issues."
msgstr ":gh:`91888`: 向文档添加一个新的 ``gh`` 角色，以链接到 GitHub 问题。"

#: ../NEWS:21353
msgid ""
":gh:`91783`: Document security issues concerning the use of the function "
":meth:`shutil.unpack_archive`"
msgstr ":gh:`91783`: 记录关于使用函数 :meth:`shutil.unpack_archive` 的安全问题。"

#: ../NEWS:21356
msgid ":gh:`91547`: Remove \"Undocumented modules\" page."
msgstr ":gh:`91547`: 移除“未记录模块”页面。"

#: ../NEWS:21358
msgid ""
":gh:`91298`: In ``importlib.resources.abc``, refined the documentation of "
"the Traversable Protocol, applying changes from importlib_resources 5.7.1."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91298`: 在 ``importlib.resources.abc`` 中，完善了 Traversable 协议的文档，应用了从 "
"importlib_resources 5.7.1 的更改。"

#: ../NEWS:21361
msgid ""
":issue:`44347`: Clarify the meaning of *dirs_exist_ok*, a kwarg of "
":func:`shutil.copytree`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44347`: 澄清了 *dirs_exist_ok* 的含义，这是 :func:`shutil.copytree` 的一个关键字参数。"

#: ../NEWS:21364
msgid ""
":issue:`36329`: Remove 'make -C Doc serve' in favour of 'make -C Doc "
"htmlview'"
msgstr ":issue:`36329`: 移除 'make -C Doc serve'，支持 'make -C Doc htmlview'。"

#: ../NEWS:21366
msgid ""
":issue:`47189`: Add a What's New in Python 3.11 entry for the Faster CPython"
" project. Documentation by Ken Jin and Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":issue:`47189`: 为 Faster CPython 项目添加 Python 3.11 新特性条目。文档由 Ken Jin 和 Kumar "
"Aditya 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:21369
msgid ""
":issue:`38668`: Update the introduction to documentation for :mod:`os.path` "
"to remove warnings that became irrelevant after the implementations of "
":pep:`383` and :pep:`529`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38668`: 更新 :mod:`os.path` 文档的引言，移除在实现了 :pep:`383` 和 :pep:`529` "
"后变得无关紧要的警告。"

#: ../NEWS:21373
msgid ""
":issue:`47115`: The documentation now lists which members of C structs are "
"part of the :ref:`Limited API/Stable ABI <stable>`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`47115`: 文档现在列出了C结构体的哪些成员是 :ref:`Limited API/Stable ABI <stable>` "
"的一部分。"

#: ../NEWS:21376
msgid ""
":issue:`46962`: All docstrings in code snippets are now wrapped into "
":c:macro:`PyDoc_STR` to follow the guideline of :pep:`PEP 7's Documentation "
"Strings paragraph <0007#documentation-strings>`. Patch by Oleg Iarygin."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46962`: 现在所有代码片段中的文档字符串都被包装进 :c:macro:`PyDoc_STR`，以遵循 :pep:`PEP "
"7的文档字符串段落<0007#documentation-strings>` 的指导。由Oleg Iarygin提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:21381
msgid ""
":issue:`26792`: Improve the docstrings of :func:`runpy.run_module` and "
":func:`runpy.run_path`. Original patch by Andrew Brezovsky."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26792`: 改进 :func:`runpy.run_module` 和 :func:`runpy.run_path` "
"的文档字符串。原始补丁由Andrew Brezovsky提供。"

#: ../NEWS:21387
msgid ""
":gh:`92169`: Use ``warnings_helper.import_deprecated()`` to import "
"deprecated modules uniformly in tests. Patch by Hugo van Kemenade."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92169`: 在测试中统一使用 ``warnings_helper.import_deprecated()`` "
"来导入已弃用的模块。补丁由Hugo van Kemenade提供。"

#: ../NEWS:21390
msgid ""
":gh:`84461`: When multiprocessing is enabled, libregrtest can now use a "
"Python executable other than :code:`sys.executable` via the ``--python`` "
"flag."
msgstr ""
":gh:`84461`: 当启用多进程时，libregrtest现在可以通过 ``--python`` 标志使用除 "
":code:`sys.executable` 之外的Python可执行文件。"

#: ../NEWS:21394
msgid ""
":gh:`91904`: Fix initialization of :envvar:`PYTHONREGRTEST_UNICODE_GUARD` "
"which prevented running regression tests on non-UTF-8 locale."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91904`: 修复 :envvar:`PYTHONREGRTEST_UNICODE_GUARD` "
"的初始化，该问题阻止了在非UTF-8语言环境下运行回归测试。"

#: ../NEWS:21397
msgid ""
":gh:`91752`: Added @requires_zlib to test.test_tools.test_freeze.TestFreeze."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91752`: 在test.test_tools.test_freeze.TestFreeze中添加了@requires_zlib。"

#: ../NEWS:21399
msgid ""
":gh:`91607`: Fix ``test_concurrent_futures`` to test the correct "
"multiprocessing start method context in several cases where the test logic "
"mixed this up."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91607`: 修复 ``test_concurrent_futures``，在测试逻辑混淆的情况下测试正确的多进程启动方法上下文。"

#: ../NEWS:21403
msgid ""
":issue:`40280`: Threading tests are now skipped on WASM targets without "
"pthread support."
msgstr ":issue:`40280`: 现在在没有pthread支持的WASM目标上跳过线程测试。"

#: ../NEWS:21406
msgid ""
":issue:`47109`: Test for :mod:`ctypes.macholib.dyld`, "
":mod:`ctypes.macholib.dylib`, and :mod:`ctypes.macholib.framework` are "
"brought from manual pre-:mod:`unittest` times to :mod:`ctypes.test` location"
" and structure. Patch by Oleg Iarygin."
msgstr ""
":issue:`47109`: 将 :mod:`ctypes.macholib.dyld`、:mod:`ctypes.macholib.dylib` 和"
" :mod:`ctypes.macholib.framework` 的测试从手动的前 :mod:`unittest` 时代带到 "
":mod:`ctypes.test` 的位置和结构。由Oleg Iarygin提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:21411
msgid ""
":issue:`29890`: Add tests for :class:`ipaddress.IPv4Interface` and "
":class:`ipaddress.IPv6Interface` construction with tuple arguments. Original"
" patch and tests by louisom."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29890`: 为 :class:`ipaddress.IPv4Interface` 和 "
":class:`ipaddress.IPv6Interface` 添加了使用元组参数构造的测试。原始补丁和测试由louisom提供。"

#: ../NEWS:21418
msgid ""
":gh:`89452`: gdbm-compat is now preferred over ndbm if both are available on"
" the system. This allows avoiding the problematic ndbm.h on macOS."
msgstr ""
":gh:`89452`: 如果系统中同时存在gdbm-compat和ndbm，现在优先选择gdbm-"
"compat。这样可以避免在macOS上使用有问题的ndbm.h。"

#: ../NEWS:21421
msgid ""
":gh:`91731`: Python is now built with ``-std=c11`` compiler option, rather "
"than ``-std=c99``. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91731`: Python 现在使用 ``-std=c11`` 编译器选项构建，而不是 ``-std=c99``。由 Victor "
"Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:21424
msgid ""
":issue:`47152`: Add script and make target for generating "
"``sre_constants.h``."
msgstr ":issue:`47152`: 添加用于生成 ``sre_constants.h`` 的脚本和 make 目标。"

#: ../NEWS:21426
msgid ""
":issue:`47103`: Windows ``PGInstrument`` builds now copy a required DLL into"
" the output directory, making it easier to run the profile stage of a PGO "
"build."
msgstr ""
":issue:`47103`: Windows ``PGInstrument`` 构建现在会将一个必需的 DLL 复制到输出目录，使得运行 PGO "
"构建的分析阶段更加容易。"

#: ../NEWS:21433
msgid ":issue:`46907`: Update Windows installer to use SQLite 3.38.3."
msgstr ":issue:`46907`: 更新 Windows 安装程序以使用 SQLite 3.38.3。"

#: ../NEWS:21435
msgid ""
":issue:`47239`: Fixed --list and --list-paths output for :ref:`launcher` "
"when used in an active virtual environment."
msgstr ""
":issue:`47239`: 修复了在活动虚拟环境中使用 :ref:`launcher` 时的 --list 和 --list-paths 输出。"

#: ../NEWS:21438
msgid ":issue:`46907`: Update Windows installer to use SQLite 3.38.2."
msgstr ":issue:`46907`: 更新 Windows 安装程序以使用 SQLite 3.38.2。"

#: ../NEWS:21440
msgid ""
":issue:`46785`: Fix race condition between :func:`os.stat` and unlinking a "
"file on Windows, by using errors codes returned by ``FindFirstFileW()`` when"
" appropriate in ``win32_xstat_impl``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46785`: 通过适当在 ``win32_xstat_impl`` 中使用 ``FindFirstFileW()`` "
"返回的错误代码，修复了 Windows 上 :func:`os.stat` 和取消链接文件之间的竞态条件。"

#: ../NEWS:21444
msgid ":issue:`40859`: Update Windows build to use xz-5.2.5"
msgstr ":issue:`40859`: 更新 Windows 构建以使用 xz-5.2.5。"

#: ../NEWS:21449
msgid ":issue:`46907`: Update macOS installer to SQLite 3.38.4."
msgstr ":issue:`46907`: 更新 macOS 安装程序以使用 SQLite 3.38.4。"

#: ../NEWS:21454
msgid ""
":gh:`91583`: Fix regression in the code generated by Argument Clinic for "
"functions with the ``defining_class`` parameter."
msgstr ""
