":c:func:`PyErr_SetHandledException` 作为 :c:func:`PyErr_GetExcInfo` 和 "
":c:func:`PyErr_SetExcInfo` 的更简单替代。"

#: ../NEWS:21509
msgid "They are included in the stable ABI."
msgstr "它们被包含在稳定 ABI 中。"

#: ../NEWS:21513
msgid "Python 3.11.0 alpha 7"
msgstr "Python 3.11.0 alpha 7"

#: ../NEWS:21515
msgid "*Release date: 2022-04-05*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2022-04-05*"

#: ../NEWS:21520
msgid ""
":issue:`47212`: Raise :exc:`IndentationError` instead of :exc:`SyntaxError` "
"for a bare ``except`` with no following indent. Improve :exc:`SyntaxError` "
"locations for an un-parenthesized generator used as arguments. Patch by "
"Matthieu Dartiailh."
msgstr ""
":issue:`47212`: 对于没有后续缩进的裸 ``except``，抛出 :exc:`IndentationError` 而不是 "
":exc:`SyntaxError`。对于用作参数的无括号生成器，改进 :exc:`SyntaxError` 的位置。由 Matthieu "
"Dartiailh 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:21525
msgid ""
":issue:`47186`: Replace :opcode:`JUMP_IF_NOT_EG_MATCH` by "
":opcode:`CHECK_EG_MATCH` + jump."
msgstr ""
":issue:`47186`: 用 :opcode:`CHECK_EG_MATCH` + 跳转替换 "
":opcode:`JUMP_IF_NOT_EG_MATCH`。"

#: ../NEWS:21528
msgid ""
":issue:`47176`: Emscripten builds cannot handle signals in the usual way due"
" to platform limitations. Python can now handle signals. To use, set "
"Module.Py_EmscriptenSignalBuffer to be a single byte SharedArrayBuffer and "
"set Py_EMSCRIPTEN_SIGNAL_HANDLING to 1. Writing a number into the "
"SharedArrayBuffer will cause the corresponding signal to be raised into the "
"Python thread."
msgstr ""
":issue:`47176`: 由于平台限制，Emscripten 构建不能以通常的方式处理信号。Python 现在可以处理信号。要使用，设置 "
"Module.Py_EmscriptenSignalBuffer 为单个字节的 SharedArrayBuffer 并设置 "
"Py_EMSCRIPTEN_SIGNAL_HANDLING 为 1。向 SharedArrayBuffer 写入一个数字将导致相应的信号被提升到 "
"Python 线程中。"

#: ../NEWS:21535
msgid ""
":issue:`47186`: Replace :opcode:`JUMP_IF_NOT_EXC_MATCH` by "
":opcode:`CHECK_EXC_MATCH` + jump."
msgstr ""
":issue:`47186`: 用 :opcode:`CHECK_EXC_MATCH` + jump 替换 "
":opcode:`JUMP_IF_NOT_EXC_MATCH`。"

#: ../NEWS:21538
msgid ""
":issue:`47120`: Replace the absolute jump opcode :opcode:`JUMP_NO_INTERRUPT`"
" by the relative :opcode:`JUMP_BACKWARD_NO_INTERRUPT`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`47120`: 用相对的 :opcode:`JUMP_BACKWARD_NO_INTERRUPT` 替换绝对跳转操作码 "
":opcode:`JUMP_NO_INTERRUPT`。"

#: ../NEWS:21541
msgid ""
":issue:`46841`: Avoid unnecessary allocations when comparing code objects."
msgstr ":issue:`46841`: 比较代码对象时避免不必要的分配。"

#: ../NEWS:21543
msgid ""
":issue:`47182`: Fix a crash when using a named unicode character like "
"``\"\\N{digit nine}\"`` after the main interpreter has been initialized a "
"second time."
msgstr ""
":issue:`47182`: 修复在主解释器第二次初始化后使用命名Unicode字符如 ``\"\\N{digit nine}\"`` 时崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:21547
msgid ""
":issue:`47162`: WebAssembly cannot deal with bad function pointer casts "
"(different count or types of arguments). Python can now use call trampolines"
" to mitigate the problem. Define :c:macro:`PY_CALL_TRAMPOLINE` to enable "
"call trampolines."
msgstr ""
":issue:`47162`: WebAssembly 无法处理错误的函数指针转换（参数数量或类型不同）。Python "
"现在可以使用调用蹦床来缓解这个问题。定义 :c:macro:`PY_CALL_TRAMPOLINE` 来启用调用蹦床。"

#: ../NEWS:21552
msgid ""
":issue:`46775`: Some Windows system error codes(>= 10000) are now mapped "
"into the correct errno and may now raise a subclass of :exc:`OSError`. Patch"
" by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46775`: 现在一些Windows系统错误代码(>= 10000)被正确映射到errno，并可能引发 :exc:`OSError` "
"的子类。由Donghee Na提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:21556
msgid ""
":issue:`47129`: Improve error messages in f-string syntax errors concerning "
"empty expressions."
msgstr ":issue:`47129`: 改进关于空表达式的f-string语法错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:21559
msgid ""
":issue:`47117`: Fix a crash if we fail to decode characters in interactive "
"mode if the tokenizer buffers are uninitialized. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":issue:`47117`: 修复在交互模式下如果分词器缓冲区未初始化时解码字符失败导致的崩溃。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:21562
msgid ""
":issue:`47127`: Speed up calls to c functions with keyword arguments by 25% "
"with specialization. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ":issue:`47127`: 通过特殊化，将带有关键字参数的c函数调用速度提高25%。由Kumar Aditya提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:21565
msgid ""
":issue:`47120`: Replaced :opcode:`JUMP_ABSOLUTE` by the relative jump "
":opcode:`JUMP_BACKWARD`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`47120`: 用相对跳转 :opcode:`JUMP_BACKWARD` 替换 :opcode:`JUMP_ABSOLUTE`。"

#: ../NEWS:21568
msgid ""
":issue:`42197`: :c:func:`!PyFrame_FastToLocalsWithError` and "
":c:func:`!PyFrame_LocalsToFast` are no longer called during profiling nor "
"tracing. C code can access the ``f_locals`` attribute of "
":c:type:`PyFrameObject` by calling :c:func:`PyFrame_GetLocals`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42197`: :c:func:`!PyFrame_FastToLocalsWithError` 和 "
":c:func:`!PyFrame_LocalsToFast` 在性能分析或跟踪期间不再被调用。C代码可以通过调用 "
":c:func:`PyFrame_GetLocals` 来访问 :c:type:`PyFrameObject` 的 ``f_locals`` 属性。"

#: ../NEWS:21573
msgid ""
":issue:`47070`: Improve performance of ``array_inplace_repeat`` by reducing "
"the number of invocations of ``memcpy``. Refactor the ``repeat`` and inplace"
" ``repeat`` methods of ``array``, ``bytes``, ``bytearray`` and "
"``unicodeobject`` to use the common ``_PyBytes_Repeat``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`47070`: 通过减少 ``memcpy`` 的调用次数来提高 ``array_inplace_repeat`` 的性能。重构 "
"``array``, ``bytes``, ``bytearray`` 和 ``unicodeobject`` 的 ``repeat`` 和原地 "
"``repeat`` 方法以使用共同的 ``_PyBytes_Repeat``。"

#: ../NEWS:21578
msgid ""
":issue:`47053`: Reduce de-optimization in the specialized "
"``BINARY_OP_INPLACE_ADD_UNICODE`` opcode."
msgstr ":issue:`47053`: 减少专业化的 ``BINARY_OP_INPLACE_ADD_UNICODE`` 操作码中的去优化。"

#: ../NEWS:21581
msgid ""
":issue:`47045`: Remove the ``f_state`` field from the _PyInterpreterFrame "
"struct. Add the ``owner`` field to the _PyInterpreterFrame struct to make "
"ownership explicit to simplify clearing and deallocing frames and "
"generators."
msgstr ""
":issue:`47045`: 从 _PyInterpreterFrame 结构中移除 ``f_state`` 字段。向 "
"_PyInterpreterFrame 结构添加 ``owner`` 字段，以明确所有权，简化帧和生成器的清理和释放。"

#: ../NEWS:21589
msgid ""
":issue:`46968`: Check for the existence of the \"sys/auxv.h\" header in "
":mod:`faulthandler` to avoid compilation problems in systems where this "
"header doesn't exist. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":issue:`46968`: 在 :mod:`faulthandler` 中检查 \"sys/auxv.h\" "
"头文件的存在，以避免在不存在此头文件的系统中出现编译问题。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:21596
msgid ""
":issue:`46329`: Use low bit of ``LOAD_GLOBAL`` to indicate whether to push a"
" ``NULL`` before the global. Helps streamline the call sequence a bit."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46329`: 使用 ``LOAD_GLOBAL`` 的低位来指示是否在全局变量之前推送一个 ``NULL``。有助于稍微简化调用序列。"

#: ../NEWS:21599
msgid ""
":issue:`46841`: Quicken bytecode in-place by storing it as part of the "
"corresponding ``PyCodeObject``."
msgstr ":issue:`46841`: 通过将快速字节码存储为相应的 ``PyCodeObject`` 的一部分，原地快速化字节码。"

#: ../NEWS:21602
msgid ""
":issue:`47012`: Speed up iteration of :class:`bytes` and :class:`bytearray` "
"by 30%. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":issue:`47012`: 通过 Kumar Aditya 的补丁，将 :class:`bytes` 和 :class:`bytearray` "
"的迭代速度提高了 30%。"

#: ../NEWS:21605
msgid ""
":issue:`47009`: Improved the performance of :meth:`list.append` and list "
"comprehensions by optimizing for the common case, where no resize is needed."
" Patch by Dennis Sweeney."
msgstr ""
":issue:`47009`: 通过优化常见情况（无需调整大小的情况），提高了 :meth:`list.append` 和列表推导式的性能。由 "
"Dennis Sweeney 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:21609
msgid ""
":issue:`47005`: Improve performance of ``bytearray_repeat`` and "
"``bytearray_irepeat`` by reducing the number of invocations of ``memcpy``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`47005`: 通过减少 ``memcpy`` 的调用次数，提高了 ``bytearray_repeat`` 和 "
"``bytearray_irepeat`` 的性能。"

#: ../NEWS:21615
msgid ""
":issue:`46829`: Deprecate passing a message into "
":meth:`asyncio.Future.cancel` and :meth:`asyncio.Task.cancel`"
msgstr ""
":issue:`46829`: 弃用在 :meth:`asyncio.Future.cancel` 和 "
":meth:`asyncio.Task.cancel` 中传递消息的做法。"

#: ../NEWS:21621
msgid ""
":issue:`46993`: Speed up :class:`bytearray` creation from :class:`list` and "
":class:`tuple` by 40%. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46993`: 通过 Kumar Aditya 的补丁，将 :class:`bytearray` 从 :class:`list` 和 "
":class:`tuple` 创建的速度提高了 40%。"

#: ../NEWS:21624
msgid ""
":issue:`39829`: Removed the ``__len__()`` call when initializing a list and "
"moved initializing to ``list_extend``. Patch by Jeremiah Pascual."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39829`: 移除了初始化列表时的 ``__len__()`` 调用，并将初始化移至 ``list_extend``。由 "
"Jeremiah Pascual 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:21627
msgid ""
":issue:`46944`: Speed up throwing exception in generator with "
":c:macro:`METH_FASTCALL` calling convention. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46944`: 通过 :c:macro:`METH_FASTCALL` 调用约定，加快了在生成器中抛出异常的速度。补丁由 Kumar "
"Aditya 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:21630
msgid ""
":issue:`46841`: Modify :opcode:`STORE_SUBSCR` to use an inline cache entry "
"(rather than its oparg) as an adaptive counter."
msgstr ":issue:`46841`: 修改 :opcode:`STORE_SUBSCR` 以使用内联缓存条目（而非其操作数）作为自适应计数器。"

#: ../NEWS:21633
msgid ""
":issue:`46841`: Use inline caching for :opcode:`!PRECALL` and "
":opcode:`CALL`, and remove the internal machinery for managing the (now "
"unused) non-inline caches."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46841`: 为 :opcode:`!PRECALL` 和 :opcode:`CALL` "
"使用内联缓存，并移除用于管理（现在未使用的）非内联缓存的内部机制。"

#: ../NEWS:21637
msgid ""
":issue:`46881`: Statically allocate and initialize the latin1 characters."
msgstr ":issue:`46881`: 静态分配并初始化 latin1 字符。"

#: ../NEWS:21639
msgid ""
":issue:`46838`: Improve syntax errors for incorrect function definitions. "
"Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":issue:`46838`: 改进不正确函数定义的语法错误。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:21642
msgid ""
":issue:`43721`: Fix docstrings of :attr:`~property.getter`, "
":attr:`~property.setter`, and :attr:`~property.deleter` to clarify that they"
" create a new copy of the property."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43721`: 修复 :attr:`~property.getter`, :attr:`~property.setter`, 和 "
":attr:`~property.deleter` 的文档字符串，以明确它们创建属性的新副本。"

#: ../NEWS:21646
msgid ":issue:`43224`: Make grammar changes required for PEP 646."
msgstr ":issue:`43224`: 为PEP 646做出所需的语法更改。"

#: ../NEWS:21651
msgid ""
":issue:`47208`: Allow vendors to override :const:`CTYPES_MAX_ARGCOUNT`."
msgstr ":issue:`47208`: 允许供应商覆盖 :const:`CTYPES_MAX_ARGCOUNT`。"

#: ../NEWS:21653
msgid ""
":issue:`23689`: :mod:`re` module: fix memory leak when a match is terminated"
" by a signal or memory allocation failure. Patch by Ma Lin."
msgstr ":issue:`23689`: :mod:`re` 模块: 修复当匹配因信号或内存分配失败而终止时的内存泄漏。由Ma Lin提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:21656
msgid ""
":issue:`47167`: Allow overriding a future compliance check in "
":class:`asyncio.Task`."
msgstr ":issue:`47167`: 允许在 :class:`asyncio.Task` 中覆盖未来的合规性检查。"

#: ../NEWS:21659
msgid ""
":issue:`47151`: When subprocess tries to use vfork, it now falls back to "
"fork if vfork returns an error. This allows use in situations where vfork "
"isn't allowed by the OS kernel."
msgstr ""
":issue:`47151`: "
"当子进程尝试使用vfork时，如果vfork返回错误，现在会回退到fork。这允许在操作系统内核不允许vfork的情况下使用。"

#: ../NEWS:21663
msgid ""
":issue:`47152`: Convert the :mod:`re` module into a package. Deprecate "
"modules ``sre_compile``, ``sre_constants`` and ``sre_parse``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`47152`: 将 :mod:`re` 模块转换为包。弃用模块 ``sre_compile``, ``sre_constants`` 和"
" ``sre_parse``。"

#: ../NEWS:21666
msgid ":issue:`4833`: Add :meth:`ZipFile.mkdir`"
msgstr ":issue:`4833`: 添加 :meth:`ZipFile.mkdir`"

#: ../NEWS:21668
msgid ""
":issue:`27929`: Fix :meth:`asyncio.loop.sock_connect` to only resolve names "
"for :const:`socket.AF_INET` or :const:`socket.AF_INET6` families. Resolution"
" may not make sense for other families, like :const:`socket.AF_BLUETOOTH` "
