":issue:`47101`: :const:`hashlib.algorithms_available` 现在仅列出由OpenSSL "
"3.0上激活的加密提供者提供的算法。除非将遗留提供者加载到默认的OSSL上下文中，否则不会列出遗留算法。"

#: ../NEWS:21684
msgid ""
":issue:`47099`: All :exc:`URLError` exception messages raised in "
":class:`urllib.request.URLopener` now contain a colon between ``ftp error`` "
"and the rest of the message. Previously, "
":func:`~urllib.request.URLopener.open_ftp` missed the colon. Patch by Oleg "
"Iarygin."
msgstr ""
":issue:`47099`: :class:`urllib.request.URLopener` 中引发的所有 :exc:`URLError` "
"异常消息现在在 ``ftp error`` "
"和消息的其余部分之间包含冒号。之前，:func:`~urllib.request.URLopener.open_ftp` 缺少冒号。由Oleg "
"Iarygin提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:21690
msgid ""
":issue:`47099`: Exception chaining is changed from "
":func:`Exception.with_traceback`/:func:`sys.exc_info` to :pep:`3134`. Patch "
"by Oleg Iarygin."
msgstr ""
":issue:`47099`: 异常链的机制从 "
":func:`Exception.with_traceback`/:func:`sys.exc_info` 更改为 :pep:`3134`。由 Oleg"
" Iarygin 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:21694
msgid ""
":issue:`47095`: :mod:`hashlib`'s internal ``_blake2`` module now prefers "
"``libb2`` from https://www.blake2.net/ over Python's vendored copy of "
"blake2."
msgstr ""
":issue:`47095`: :mod:`hashlib` 的内部 ``_blake2`` 模块现在优先使用来自 "
"https://www.blake2.net/ 的 ``libb2`` 而不是 Python 自带的 blake2 副本。"

#: ../NEWS:21698
msgid ""
":issue:`47098`: The Keccak Code Package for :mod:`hashlib`'s internal "
"``_sha3`` module has been replaced with tiny_sha3. The module is used as "
"fallback when Python is built without OpenSSL."
msgstr ""
":issue:`47098`: :mod:`hashlib` 内部 ``_sha3`` 模块的 Keccak 代码包已被替换为 "
"tiny_sha3。该模块在 Python 构建时不带 OpenSSL 时作为回退使用。"

#: ../NEWS:21702
msgid ""
":issue:`47088`: Implement :data:`typing.LiteralString`, part of :pep:`675`. "
"Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":issue:`47088`: 实现了 :data:`typing.LiteralString`，这是 :pep:`675` 的一部分。由 Jelle "
"Zijlstra 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:21705
msgid ""
":issue:`42885`: Optimize :func:`re.search`, :func:`re.split`, "
":func:`re.findall`, :func:`re.finditer` and :func:`re.sub` for regular "
"expressions starting with ``\\A`` or ``^``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42885`: 对以 ``\\A`` 或 ``^`` 开始的正则表达式优化了 "
":func:`re.search`、:func:`re.split`、:func:`re.findall`、:func:`re.finditer` 和 "
":func:`re.sub`。"

#: ../NEWS:21709
msgid ""
":issue:`23691`: Protect the :func:`re.finditer` iterator from re-entering."
msgstr ":issue:`23691`: 保护 :func:`re.finditer` 迭代器不被重新进入。"

#: ../NEWS:21711
msgid ""
":issue:`47067`: Optimize calling ``GenericAlias`` objects by using "
":pep:`590` ``vectorcall`` and by replacing ``PyObject_SetAttrString`` with "
"``PyObject_SetAttr``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`47067`: 通过使用 :pep:`590` ``vectorcall`` 并用 ``PyObject_SetAttr`` 替换 "
"``PyObject_SetAttrString``，优化了对 ``GenericAlias`` 对象的调用。"

#: ../NEWS:21715
msgid ""
":issue:`28080`: Add the *metadata_encoding* parameter in the "
":class:`zipfile.ZipFile` constructor and the ``--metadata-encoding`` option "
"in the :mod:`zipfile` CLI to allow reading zipfiles using non-standard "
"codecs to encode the filenames within the archive."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28080`: 在 :class:`zipfile.ZipFile` 构造函数中添加了 *metadata_encoding* "
"参数，并在 :mod:`zipfile` CLI 中添加了 ``--metadata-encoding`` "
"选项，以允许使用非标准编解码器读取压缩包中的文件名。"

#: ../NEWS:21720
msgid ""
":issue:`47000`: Make :func:`io.text_encoding` returns \"utf-8\" when UTF-8 "
"mode is enabled."
msgstr ":issue:`47000`: 当启用 UTF-8 模式时，使 :func:`io.text_encoding` 返回 \"utf-8\"。"

#: ../NEWS:21723
msgid ""
":issue:`42369`: Fix thread safety of :meth:`zipfile._SharedFile.tell` to "
"avoid a \"zipfile.BadZipFile: Bad CRC-32 for file\" exception when reading a"
" :class:`ZipFile` from multiple threads."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42369`: 修复 :meth:`zipfile._SharedFile.tell` 的线程安全性，以避免在多线程读取 "
":class:`ZipFile` 时出现 \"zipfile.BadZipFile: Bad CRC-32 for file\" 异常。"

#: ../NEWS:21727
msgid ""
":issue:`38256`: Fix :func:`binascii.crc32` when it is compiled to use zlib'c"
" crc32 to work properly on inputs 4+GiB in length instead of returning the "
"wrong result. The workaround prior to this was to always feed the function "
"data in increments smaller than 4GiB or to just call the zlib module "
"function."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38256`: 修复了当编译使用 zlib 的 crc32 时的 :func:`binascii.crc32`，使其正确处理长度超过 "
"4GiB 的输入而不是返回错误结果。在此之前的解决方法是始终以小于 4GiB 的增量向函数提供数据，或直接调用 zlib 模块函数。"

#: ../NEWS:21733
msgid ""
"We also have :func:`binascii.crc32` release the GIL when computing on larger"
" inputs as :func:`zlib.crc32` and :mod:`hashlib` do."
msgstr ""
"我们还让 :func:`binascii.crc32` 在处理较大输入时释放 GIL，就像 :func:`zlib.crc32` 和 "
":mod:`hashlib` 所做的那样。"

#: ../NEWS:21736
msgid ""
"This also boosts performance on Windows as it now uses the zlib crc32 "
"implementation for :func:`binascii.crc32` for a 2-3x speedup."
msgstr ""
"这也提升了Windows上的性能，因为现在 :func:`binascii.crc32` 使用了zlib crc32实现，速度提升了2-3倍。"

#: ../NEWS:21739
msgid ""
"That the stdlib has a crc32 API in two modules is a known historical oddity."
" This moves us closer to a single implementation behind them."
msgstr "标准库在两个模块中都有crc32 API是一个已知的历史遗留问题。这使我们更接近于它们背后的单一实现。"

#: ../NEWS:21742
msgid ""
":issue:`47066`: Global inline flags (e.g. ``(?i)``) can now only be used at "
"the start of the regular expressions.  Using them not at the start of "
"expression was deprecated since Python 3.6."
msgstr ""
":issue:`47066`: 全局内联标志（例如 ``(?i)``）现在只能在正则表达式的开头使用。从Python "
"3.6开始，不在表达式开头使用它们已被弃用。"

#: ../NEWS:21746
msgid ""
":issue:`39394`: A warning about inline flags not at the start of the regular"
" expression now contains the position of the flag."
msgstr ":issue:`39394`: 关于不在正则表达式开头的内联标志的警告现在包含标志的位置。"

#: ../NEWS:21749
msgid ""
":issue:`433030`: Add support of atomic grouping (``(?>...)``) and possessive"
" quantifiers (``*+``, ``++``, ``?+``, ``{m,n}+``) in :mod:`regular "
"expressions <re>`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`433030`: 在 :mod:`正则表达式 <re>` 中添加了对原子分组（``(?>...)``）和占有量词（``*+``, "
"``++``, ``?+``, ``{m,n}+``）的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:21753
