"为asyncio添加了原始数据报套接字函数：:meth:`~asyncio.AbstractEventLoop.sock_sendto`、:meth:`~asyncio.AbstractEventLoop.sock_recvfrom`"
" 和 :meth:`~asyncio.AbstractEventLoop.sock_recvfrom_into`。"

#: ../NEWS:21844
msgid ""
":issue:`46644`: No longer require valid typeforms to be callable. This "
