msgstr ""
"如果 SQL 查询包含空字符，抛出 :exc:`~sqlite3.ProgrammingError` 而非 :exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../NEWS:21933
msgid ":issue:`44493`: Add missing terminated NUL in sockaddr_un's length"
msgstr ":issue:`44493`: 在 sockaddr_un 的长度中添加缺失的终止 NUL。"

#: ../NEWS:21935
msgid ""
"This was potentially observable when using non-abstract AF_UNIX datagram "
