"Python 3.13."
msgstr ":issue:`46864`: 弃用 ``PyBytesObject.ob_shash``。它将在 Python 3.13 中被移除。"

#: ../NEWS:22167
msgid ":issue:`46841`: Use inline caching for :opcode:`UNPACK_SEQUENCE`."
msgstr ":issue:`46841`: 对 :opcode:`UNPACK_SEQUENCE` 使用内联缓存。"

#: ../NEWS:22169
msgid ""
":issue:`46845`: Reduces dict size by removing hash value from hash table "
"when all inserted keys are Unicode. For example, "
"``sys.getsizeof(dict.fromkeys(\"abcdefg\"))`` becomes 272 bytes from 352 "
"bytes on 64bit platform."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46845`: 当所有插入的键都是 Unicode 时，通过从哈希表中移除哈希值来减小字典大小。例如，在 64 "
"位平台上，``sys.getsizeof(dict.fromkeys(\"abcdefg\"))`` 从 352 字节变为 272 字节。"

#: ../NEWS:22174
msgid ":issue:`46841`: Use inline cache for :opcode:`LOAD_GLOBAL`."
msgstr ":issue:`46841`: 对 :opcode:`LOAD_GLOBAL` 使用内联缓存。"

#: ../NEWS:22176
msgid ""
":issue:`46852`: Rename the private undocumented ``float.__set_format__()`` "
"method to ``float.__setformat__()`` to fix a typo introduced in Python 3.7. "
"The method is only used by test_float. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46852`: 将私有的未文档化的 ``float.__set_format__()`` 方法重命名为 "
"``float.__setformat__()``，以修复 Python 3.7 中引入的拼写错误。该方法仅由 test_float 使用。由 "
"Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22180
msgid ""
":issue:`46852`: Remove the undocumented private ``float.__set_format__()`` "
"method, previously known as ``float.__setformat__()`` in Python 3.7. Its "
"docstring said: \"You probably don't want to use this function. It exists "
"mainly to be used in Python's test suite.\" Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46852`: 移除未文档化的私有 ``float.__set_format__()`` 方法，该方法在 Python 3.7 "
"中曾被称为 ``float.__setformat__()``。其文档字符串说明：\"您可能不想使用此函数。它主要存在于 Python "
"的测试套件中使用。\" 由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22185
msgid ""
":issue:`40116`: Fix regression that dict.update(other) may don't respect "
"iterate order of other when other is key sharing dict."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40116`: 修复了当 other 是键共享字典时，dict.update(other) 可能不尊重 other "
"的迭代顺序的回归问题。"

#: ../NEWS:22188
msgid ""
":issue:`46712`: Share global string identifiers in deep-frozen modules."
msgstr ":issue:`46712`: 在深度冻结模块中共享全局字符串标识符。"

#: ../NEWS:22190
msgid ""
":issue:`46430`: Fix memory leak in interned strings of deep-frozen modules."
msgstr ":issue:`46430`: 修复深度冻结模块中内部字符串的内存泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:22192
msgid ""
":issue:`46841`: Store :opcode:`BINARY_OP` caches inline using a new "
":opcode:`CACHE` instruction."
msgstr ":issue:`46841`: 使用新的 :opcode:`CACHE` 指令将 :opcode:`BINARY_OP` 缓存内联存储。"

#: ../NEWS:22195
msgid ":issue:`45107`: Specialize ``LOAD_METHOD`` for instances with a dict."
msgstr ":issue:`45107`: 为具有字典的实例专门化 ``LOAD_METHOD``。"

#: ../NEWS:22197
msgid ""
":issue:`44337`: Reduce the memory usage of specialized :opcode:`LOAD_ATTR` "
"and :opcode:`STORE_ATTR` instructions."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44337`: 减少专门化的 :opcode:`LOAD_ATTR` 和 :opcode:`STORE_ATTR` 指令的内存使用。"

#: ../NEWS:22200
msgid ""
":issue:`46729`: Add number of sub-exceptions to "
":meth:`BaseException.__str__`."
msgstr ":issue:`46729`: 在 :meth:`BaseException.__str__` 中添加子异常的数量。"

#: ../NEWS:22202
msgid ""
":issue:`45885`: Don't un-adapt :opcode:`COMPARE_OP` when collecting "
"specialization stats."
msgstr ":issue:`45885`: 在收集专门化统计信息时不要取消适配 :opcode:`COMPARE_OP`。"

#: ../NEWS:22205
msgid ""
":issue:`46329`: Fix specialization stats gathering for :opcode:`!PRECALL` "
"instructions."
msgstr ":issue:`46329`: 修复 :opcode:`!PRECALL` 指令的专门化统计信息收集。"

#: ../NEWS:22211
msgid ":issue:`46794`: Bump up the libexpat version into 2.4.6"
msgstr ":issue:`46794`: 将 libexpat 版本提升至 2.4.6。"

#: ../NEWS:22216
msgid ""
":issue:`46823`: Implement a specialized combined opcode "
"``LOAD_FAST__LOAD_ATTR_INSTANCE_VALUE``.  Patch by Dennis Sweeney."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46823`: 实现一个专门的组合操作码 ``LOAD_FAST__LOAD_ATTR_INSTANCE_VALUE``。由 "
"Dennis Sweeney 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22219
msgid ""
":issue:`46820`: Fix parsing a numeric literal immediately (without spaces) "
"followed by \"not in\" keywords, like in ``1not in x``. Now the parser only "
"emits a warning, not a syntax error."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46820`: 修复在数字字面量后紧跟着（无空格）\"not in\" 关键字时的解析问题，例如 ``1not in "
"x``。现在解析器仅发出警告，而非语法错误。"

#: ../NEWS:22223
msgid ""
":issue:`46329`: Move ``KW_NAMES`` before ``PRECALL`` instruction in call "
"sequence. Change ``operand`` of ``CALL`` to match ``PRECALL`` for easier "
"specialization."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46329`: 在调用序列中将 ``KW_NAMES`` 移动到 ``PRECALL`` 指令之前。更改 ``CALL`` 的 "
"``operand`` 以匹配 ``PRECALL``，便于专门化。"

#: ../NEWS:22227
msgid ""
":issue:`46808`: Remove the ``NEXT_BLOCK`` macro from compile.c, and make the"
" compiler automatically generate implicit blocks when they are needed."
msgstr ":issue:`46808`: 从 compile.c 中移除 ``NEXT_BLOCK`` 宏，并使编译器在需要时自动生成隐式块。"

#: ../NEWS:22230
msgid ""
":issue:`46329`: Add ``PUSH_NULL`` instruction. This is used as a prefix when"
" evaluating a callable, so that the stack has the same shape for methods and"
" other calls. ``PRECALL_FUNCTION`` and ``PRECALL_METHOD`` are merged into a "
"single ``PRECALL`` instruction."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46329`: 添加 ``PUSH_NULL`` "
"指令。这在评估可调用对象时用作前缀，以便堆栈对于方法和其他调用具有相同的形状。``PRECALL_FUNCTION`` 和 "
"``PRECALL_METHOD`` 被合并为单一的 ``PRECALL`` 指令。"

#: ../NEWS:22235 ../NEWS:22630
msgid "There is no change in semantics."
msgstr "语义上没有变化。"

#: ../NEWS:22237
msgid ""
":issue:`46762`: Fix an assert failure in debug builds when a '<', '>', or "
"'=' is the last character in an f-string that's missing a closing right "
"brace."
msgstr ":issue:`46762`: 修复在调试版本中，当 '<'、'>' 或 '=' 是 f 字符串中缺失右大括号的最后一个字符时的断言失败。"

#: ../NEWS:22240
msgid ""
":issue:`46730`: Message of AttributeError caused by getting, setting or "
"deleting a property without the corresponding function now mentions that the"
" attribute is in fact a property and also specifies type of the class that "
"it belongs to."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46730`: 由于获取、设置或删除没有相应函数的属性而导致的 AttributeError "
"消息现在会提到该属性实际上是一个属性，并且还指定了它所属的类的类型。"

#: ../NEWS:22245
msgid ""
":issue:`46724`: Make sure that all backwards jumps use the ``JUMP_ABSOLUTE``"
" instruction, rather than ``JUMP_FORWARD`` with an argument of "
"``(2**32)+offset``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46724`: 确保所有向后跳转都使用 ``JUMP_ABSOLUTE`` 指令，而不是使用参数为 ``(2**32)+offset``"
" 的 ``JUMP_FORWARD``。"

#: ../NEWS:22249
msgid ""
":issue:`46732`: Correct the docstring for the :meth:`~object.__bool__` "
"method. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46732`: 更正 :meth:`~object.__bool__` 方法的文档字符串。补丁由 Jelle Zijlstra 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:22252
msgid ""
":issue:`46072`: Add more detailed specialization failure statistics for "
":opcode:`BINARY_OP`."
msgstr ":issue:`46072`: 为 :opcode:`BINARY_OP` 添加更详细的特化失败统计信息。"

#: ../NEWS:22255
msgid ""
":issue:`46707`: Avoid potential exponential backtracking when producing some"
" syntax errors involving lots of brackets. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":issue:`46707`: 避免在产生涉及大量括号的某些语法错误时可能出现的指数级回溯。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22261
msgid ""
":issue:`46323`: :mod:`ctypes` now allocates memory on the stack instead of "
"on the heap to pass arguments while calling a Python callback function. "
"Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46323`: :mod:`ctypes` 现在在调用 Python 回调函数时在栈上而非堆上分配内存以传递参数。由 Donghee "
"Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22268
msgid ""
":issue:`45923`: Add a quickened form of :opcode:`RESUME` that skips "
"quickening checks."
msgstr ":issue:`45923`: 添加一种跳过快速检查的 :opcode:`RESUME` 快速形式。"

#: ../NEWS:22271
msgid ""
":issue:`46702`: Specialize :opcode:`UNPACK_SEQUENCE` for :class:`tuple` and "
":class:`list` unpackings."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46702`: 为 :class:`tuple` 和 :class:`list` 解包特化 "
":opcode:`UNPACK_SEQUENCE`。"

#: ../NEWS:22274
msgid ""
":issue:`46072`: Opcode pair stats are now gathered with ``--enable-"
"pystats``. Defining ``DYNAMIC_EXECUTION_PROFILE`` or  ``DXPAIRS`` no longer "
"has any effect."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46072`: 现在使用 ``--enable-pystats`` 收集操作码对统计信息。定义 "
"``DYNAMIC_EXECUTION_PROFILE`` 或 ``DXPAIRS`` 不再有任何效果。"

#: ../NEWS:22278
msgid ""
":issue:`46675`: Allow more than 16 items in a split dict before it is "
"combined. The limit is now 254."
msgstr ":issue:`46675`: 允许拆分字典在合并前包含超过 16 个项目。现在限制为 254 个。"

#: ../NEWS:22284
msgid ""
":issue:`40479`: Add a missing call to ``va_end()`` in "
"``Modules/_hashopenssl.c``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40479`: 在 ``Modules/_hashopenssl.c`` 中添加一个遗漏的 ``va_end()`` 调用。"

#: ../NEWS:22287
msgid ""
":issue:`46323`: Use :c:func:`PyObject_Vectorcall` while calling ctypes "
"callback function. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46323`: 调用 ctypes 回调函数时使用 :c:func:`PyObject_Vectorcall`。由 Donghee Na"
" 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22293
msgid ""
":issue:`46615`: When iterating over sets internally in ``setobject.c``, "
"acquire strong references to the resulting items from the set.  This "
"prevents crashes in corner-cases of various set operations where the set "
"gets mutated."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46615`: 在 ``setobject.c`` "
"中内部迭代集合时，对集合中的结果项获取强引用。这防止了在各种集合操作的边角情况下集合被修改导致的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:22298
msgid ""
":issue:`45828`: The bytecode compiler now attempts to apply runtime stack "
"manipulations at compile-time (whenever it is feasible to do so)."
msgstr ":issue:`45828`: 字节码编译器现在尝试在编译时应用运行时栈操作（只要这样做是可行的）。"

#: ../NEWS:22301
msgid ""
":issue:`30496`: Fixed a minor portability issue in the implementation of "
":c:func:`PyLong_FromLong`, and added a fast path for single-digit integers "
"to :c:func:`PyLong_FromLongLong`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30496`: 修复了 :c:func:`PyLong_FromLong` 实现中的一个小的可移植性问题，并为 "
":c:func:`PyLong_FromLongLong` 添加了单数字整数的快速路径。"

#: ../NEWS:22308
msgid ""
":issue:`25707`: Fixed a file leak in :func:`xml.etree.ElementTree.iterparse`"
" when the iterator is not exhausted. Patch by Jacob Walls."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25707`: 修复了 :func:`xml.etree.ElementTree.iterparse` "
"中当迭代器未被耗尽时的文件泄露问题。由 Jacob Walls 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22311
msgid ""
":issue:`46877`: Export :func:`unittest.doModuleCleanups` in :mod:`unittest`."
" Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46877`: 在 :mod:`unittest` 中导出 :func:`unittest.doModuleCleanups`。由 "
"Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22314
msgid ""
":issue:`46848`: For performance, use the optimized string-searching "
"implementations from :meth:`~bytes.find` and :meth:`~bytes.rfind` for "
":meth:`~mmap.find` and :meth:`~mmap.rfind`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46848`: 出于性能考虑，使用来自 :meth:`~bytes.find` 和 :meth:`~bytes.rfind` "
"的优化字符串搜索实现替代 :meth:`~mmap.find` 和 :meth:`~mmap.rfind`。"

#: ../NEWS:22318
msgid ""
":issue:`46736`: :class:`~http.server.SimpleHTTPRequestHandler` now uses "
"HTML5 grammar. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46736`: :class:`~http.server.SimpleHTTPRequestHandler` 现在使用 HTML5 "
"语法。由 Donghee Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22321
msgid ""
":issue:`44886`: Inherit asyncio proactor datagram transport from "
":class:`asyncio.DatagramTransport`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44886`: 将 asyncio proactor 数据报传输继承自 "
":class:`asyncio.DatagramTransport`。"

#: ../NEWS:22324
msgid ""
":issue:`46827`: Support UDP sockets in  :meth:`asyncio.loop.sock_connect` "
"for selector-based event loops.  Patch by Thomas Grainger."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46827`: 在基于选择器的事件循环中支持 :meth:`asyncio.loop.sock_connect` 的 UDP 套接字。由"
" Thomas Grainger 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22327
msgid ":issue:`46811`: Make test suite support Expat >=2.4.5"
msgstr ":issue:`46811`: 使测试套件支持 Expat >=2.4.5。"

#: ../NEWS:22329
msgid ""
":issue:`46252`: Raise :exc:`TypeError` if :class:`ssl.SSLSocket` is passed "
"to transport-based APIs."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46252`: 如果 :class:`ssl.SSLSocket` 被传递给基于传输的 API，则抛出 "
":exc:`TypeError`。"

#: ../NEWS:22332
msgid ""
":issue:`46784`: Fix libexpat symbols collisions with user dynamically loaded"
" or statically linked libexpat in embedded Python."
msgstr ":issue:`46784`: 修复了在嵌入式 Python 中与用户动态加载或静态链接的 libexpat 库的符号冲突。"

#: ../NEWS:22335
msgid ""
":issue:`46786`: The HTML serialisation in xml.etree.ElementTree now writes "
"``embed``, ``source``, ``track`` and ``wbr`` as empty tags, as defined in "
"HTML 5."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46786`: xml.etree.ElementTree 中的 HTML 序列化现在将 "
"``embed``、``source``、``track`` 和 ``wbr`` 写为空标签，符合 HTML5 的定义。"

#: ../NEWS:22339
msgid ""
":issue:`39327`: :func:`shutil.rmtree` can now work with VirtualBox shared "
"folders when running from the guest operating-system."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39327`: :func:`shutil.rmtree` 现在可以在客户操作系统中运行时与 VirtualBox 共享文件夹一起工作。"

#: ../NEWS:22342
msgid ""
":issue:`45390`: Propagate :exc:`asyncio.CancelledError` message from inner "
"task to outer awaiter."
msgstr ":issue:`45390`: 将 :exc:`asyncio.CancelledError` 消息从内部任务传播到外部等待者。"

#: ../NEWS:22345
msgid ""
":issue:`46756`: Fix a bug in "
":meth:`urllib.request.HTTPPasswordMgr.find_user_password` and "
":meth:`urllib.request.HTTPPasswordMgrWithPriorAuth.is_authenticated` which "
"allowed to bypass authorization. For example, access to URI "
"``example.org/foobar`` was allowed if the user was authorized for URI "
"``example.org/foo``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46756`: 修复了 "
":meth:`urllib.request.HTTPPasswordMgr.find_user_password` 和 "
":meth:`urllib.request.HTTPPasswordMgrWithPriorAuth.is_authenticated` "
"中的一个漏洞，该漏洞允许绕过授权。例如，如果用户被授权访问 URI ``example.org/foo``，则允许访问 URI "
"``example.org/foobar``。"

#: ../NEWS:22352
msgid ""
":issue:`46737`: :func:`random.gauss` and :func:`random.normalvariate` now "
"have default arguments."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46737`: :func:`random.gauss` 和 :func:`random.normalvariate` 现在有默认参数。"

#: ../NEWS:22355
msgid ""
":issue:`46752`: Add task groups to asyncio (structured concurrency, inspired"
" by Trio's nurseries). This also introduces a change to task cancellation, "
"where a cancelled task can't be cancelled again until it calls .uncancel()."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46752`: 向 asyncio 添加任务组（结构化并发，灵感来自 Trio 的 "
"nurseries）。这也引入了任务取消的变化，其中被取消的任务在调用 .uncancel() 之前不能被再次取消。"

#: ../NEWS:22360
msgid ":issue:`46724`: Fix :mod:`dis` behavior on negative jump offsets."
msgstr ":issue:`46724`: 修复 :mod:`dis` 在负跳转偏移上的行为。"

#: ../NEWS:22362
msgid ""
":issue:`46333`: The :meth:`__repr__` method of :class:`typing.ForwardRef` "
"now includes the ``module`` parameter of :class:`typing.ForwardRef` when it "
"is set."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46333`: 当设置 ``module`` 参数时，:class:`typing.ForwardRef` 的 "
":meth:`__repr__` 方法现在会包含 :class:`typing.ForwardRef` 的 ``module`` 参数。"

#: ../NEWS:22366
msgid ""
":issue:`46643`: In :func:`typing.get_type_hints`, support evaluating "
"stringified ``ParamSpecArgs`` and ``ParamSpecKwargs`` annotations. Patch by "
"Gregory Beauregard."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46643`: 在 :func:`typing.get_type_hints` 中，支持评估字符串化的 "
"``ParamSpecArgs`` 和 ``ParamSpecKwargs`` 注解。由 Gregory Beauregard 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22370
msgid ""
":issue:`45863`: When the :mod:`tarfile` module creates a pax format archive,"
" it will put an integer representation of timestamps in the ustar header (if"
" possible) for the benefit of older unarchivers, in addition to the existing"
" full-precision timestamps in the pax extended header."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45863`: 当 :mod:`tarfile` 模块创建 pax 格式的存档时，它会在 ustar "
"头中放置时间戳的整数表示（如果可能的话），以便于旧的解档工具使用，此外还会在 pax 扩展头中放置现有的全精度时间戳。"

#: ../NEWS:22375
msgid ""
":issue:`46066`: Deprecate kwargs-based syntax for :class:`typing.TypedDict` "
"definitions. It had confusing semantics when specifying totality, and was "
"largely unused. Patch by Jingchen Ye."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46066`: 弃用基于 kwargs 的 :class:`typing.TypedDict` "
"定义语法。在指定完全性时它有着令人困惑的语义，并且很大程度上未被使用。由 Jingchen Ye 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22379
msgid ""
":issue:`46676`: Make :data:`typing.ParamSpec` args and kwargs equal to "
"themselves. Patch by Gregory Beauregard."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46676`: 使 :data:`typing.ParamSpec` 的 args 和 kwargs 等于它们自己。由 Gregory "
"Beauregard 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22382
msgid ""
":issue:`46323`: ``ctypes.CFUNCTYPE()`` and ``ctypes.WINFUNCTYPE()`` now fail"
" to create the type if its ``_argtypes_`` member contains too many "
"arguments. Previously, the error was only raised when calling a function. "
"Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46323`: ``ctypes.CFUNCTYPE()`` 和 ``ctypes.WINFUNCTYPE()`` 现在会在其 "
"``_argtypes_`` 成员包含太多参数时创建类型失败。以前，错误仅在调用函数时引发。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22387
msgid ""
":issue:`46672`: Fix ``NameError`` in :func:`asyncio.gather` when initial "
"type check fails."
msgstr ":issue:`46672`: 修复 :func:`asyncio.gather` 中初始类型检查失败时的 ``NameError``。"

#: ../NEWS:22390
msgid ""
":issue:`46659`: The :class:`calendar.LocaleTextCalendar` and "
":class:`calendar.LocaleHTMLCalendar` classes now use "
":func:`locale.getlocale`, instead of using :func:`locale.getdefaultlocale`, "
"if no locale is specified. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46659`: 如果未指定区域设置，:class:`calendar.LocaleTextCalendar` 和 "
":class:`calendar.LocaleHTMLCalendar` 类现在会使用 :func:`locale.getlocale`，而不是使用 "
":func:`locale.getdefaultlocale`。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22396
msgid ""
":issue:`46659`: The :func:`locale.getdefaultlocale` function is deprecated "
"and will be removed in Python 3.13. Use :func:`locale.setlocale`, "
":func:`locale.getpreferredencoding(False) <locale.getpreferredencoding>` and"
" :func:`locale.getlocale` functions instead.  Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46659`: :func:`locale.getdefaultlocale` 函数已被弃用，并将在 Python 3.13 "
"中移除。请使用 :func:`locale.setlocale`、:func:`locale.getpreferredencoding(False) "
"<locale.getpreferredencoding>` 和 :func:`locale.getlocale` 函数代替。由 Victor "
"Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22401
msgid ""
":issue:`46655`: In :func:`typing.get_type_hints`, support evaluating bare "
"stringified ``TypeAlias`` annotations. Patch by Gregory Beauregard."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46655`: 在 :func:`typing.get_type_hints` 中，支持评估裸字符串化的 ``TypeAlias`` "
"注解。由 Gregory Beauregard 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22404
msgid ""
":issue:`45948`: Fixed a discrepancy in the C implementation of the "
":mod:`xml.etree.ElementTree` module. Now, instantiating an "
":class:`xml.etree.ElementTree.XMLParser` with a ``target=None`` keyword "
"provides a default :class:`xml.etree.ElementTree.TreeBuilder` target as the "
"Python implementation does."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45948`: 修复了 :mod:`xml.etree.ElementTree` 模块 C 实现中的一个不一致之处。现在，实例化 "
":class:`xml.etree.ElementTree.XMLParser` 时使用 ``target=None`` 关键字参数会像 Python "
"实现一样提供一个默认的 :class:`xml.etree.ElementTree.TreeBuilder` 目标。"

#: ../NEWS:22410
msgid ""
":issue:`46626`: Expose Linux's ``IP_BIND_ADDRESS_NO_PORT`` option in "
":mod:`socket`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46626`: 在 :mod:`socket` 中公开了 Linux 的 ``IP_BIND_ADDRESS_NO_PORT`` 选项。"

#: ../NEWS:22413
msgid ""
":issue:`46521`: Fix a bug in the :mod:`codeop` module that was incorrectly "
"identifying invalid code involving string quotes as valid code."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46521`: 修复了 :mod:`codeop` 模块中的一个 bug，该 bug 错误地将涉及字符串引号的无效代码识别为有效代码。"

#: ../NEWS:22416
msgid ":issue:`46571`: Improve :func:`typing.no_type_check`."
msgstr ":issue:`46571`: 改进了 :func:`typing.no_type_check`。"

#: ../NEWS:22418
msgid ""
"Now it does not modify external classes and functions. We also now correctly"
" mark classmethods as not to be type checked."
msgstr "现在它不会修改外部的类和函数。我们还正确地标记了类方法为不被类型检查。"

#: ../NEWS:22421
msgid ":issue:`46400`: expat: Update libexpat from 2.4.1 to 2.4.4"
msgstr ":issue:`46400`: expat: 将 libexpat 从 2.4.1 更新至 2.4.4"

#: ../NEWS:22423
msgid ""
":issue:`46556`: Deprecate undocumented support for using a "
":class:`pathlib.Path` object as a context manager."
msgstr ":issue:`46556`: 弃用将 :class:`pathlib.Path` 对象用作上下文管理器的未文档化支持。"

#: ../NEWS:22426
msgid ""
":issue:`46534`: Implement :pep:`673` :class:`typing.Self`. Patch by James "
"Hilton-Balfe."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46534`: 实现了 :pep:`673` :class:`typing.Self`。由 James Hilton-Balfe "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22429
msgid ""
":issue:`46522`: Make various module ``__getattr__`` AttributeErrors more "
"closely match a typical AttributeError"
msgstr ""
":issue:`46522`: 使多个模块的 ``__getattr__`` AttributeErrors 更接近典型的 AttributeError"

#: ../NEWS:22432
msgid ""
":issue:`46475`: Add :data:`typing.Never` and :func:`typing.assert_never`. "
"Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46475`: 添加了 :data:`typing.Never` 和 :func:`typing.assert_never`。由 "
"Jelle Zijlstra 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22435
msgid ""
":issue:`46333`: The :meth:`__eq__` and :meth:`__hash__` methods of "
":class:`typing.ForwardRef` now honor the ``module`` parameter of "
":class:`typing.ForwardRef`. Forward references from different modules are "
"now differentiated."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46333`: :class:`typing.ForwardRef` 的 :meth:`__eq__` 和 "
":meth:`__hash__` 方法现在尊重 :class:`typing.ForwardRef` 的 ``module`` "
"参数。现在可以区分来自不同模块的前向引用。"

#: ../NEWS:22440
msgid ""
":issue:`46246`: Add missing ``__slots__`` to "
"``importlib.metadata.DeprecatedList``. Patch by Arie Bovenberg."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46246`: 为 ``importlib.metadata.DeprecatedList`` 添加了缺失的 "
"``__slots__``。由 Arie Bovenberg 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22443
msgid ""
":issue:`46232`: The :mod:`ssl` module now handles certificates with bit "
"strings in DN correctly."
msgstr ":issue:`46232`: :mod:`ssl` 模块现在能正确处理 DN 中包含位字符串的证书。"

#: ../NEWS:22446
msgid ""
":issue:`46195`: :func:`typing.get_type_hints` no longer adds ``Optional`` to"
" parameters with ``None`` as a default. This aligns to changes to PEP 484 in"
" https://github.com/python/peps/pull/689"
msgstr ""
":issue:`46195`: :func:`typing.get_type_hints` 不再为默认值为 ``None`` 的参数添加 "
"``Optional``。这与 PEP 484 在 https://github.com/python/peps/pull/689 中的更改一致。"

#: ../NEWS:22450
msgid ""
":issue:`31369`: Add :class:`~re.RegexFlag` to ``re.__all__`` and documented "
"it. Add :data:`~re.RegexFlag.NOFLAG` to indicate no flags being set."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31369`: 将 :class:`~re.RegexFlag` 添加到 ``re.__all__`` 并进行了文档化。添加 "
":data:`~re.RegexFlag.NOFLAG` 以表示没有设置任何标志。"

#: ../NEWS:22453
msgid ""
":issue:`45898`: :mod:`ctypes` no longer defines ``ffi_type_*`` symbols in "
"``cfield.c``. The symbols have been provided by libffi for over a decade."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45898`: :mod:`ctypes` 不再在 ``cfield.c`` 中定义 ``ffi_type_*`` 符号。这些符号由 "
"libffi 提供已有十余年。"

#: ../NEWS:22456
msgid ""
":issue:`44953`: Calling ``operator.itemgetter`` objects and "
"``operator.attrgetter`` objects is now faster due to use of the vectorcall "
"calling convention."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44953`: 调用 ``operator.itemgetter`` 对象和 ``operator.attrgetter`` "
"对象现在更快，因为使用了 vectorcall 调用约定。"

#: ../NEWS:22460
msgid ""
":issue:`44289`: Fix an issue with :meth:`~tarfile.is_tarfile` method when "
"using *fileobj* argument: position in the *fileobj* was advanced forward "
"which made it unreadable with :meth:`tarfile.TarFile.open`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44289`: 修复了 :meth:`~tarfile.is_tarfile` 方法在使用 *fileobj* "
"参数时的一个问题：*fileobj* 中的位置被向前推进，使得它无法通过 :meth:`tarfile.TarFile.open` 读取。"

#: ../NEWS:22464
msgid ""
":issue:`44011`: Reimplement SSL/TLS support in asyncio, borrow the "
"implementation from uvloop library."
msgstr ":issue:`44011`: 在 asyncio 中重新实现 SSL/TLS 支持，借用 uvloop 库的实现。"

#: ../NEWS:22467
msgid ""
":issue:`41086`: Make the :class:`configparser.ConfigParser` constructor "
"raise :exc:`TypeError` if the ``interpolation`` parameter is not of type "
":class:`!configparser.Interpolation`"
msgstr ""
":issue:`41086`: 如果 ``interpolation`` 参数不是 "
":class:`!configparser.Interpolation` 类型，:class:`configparser.ConfigParser` "
"构造函数将引发 :exc:`TypeError`。"

#: ../NEWS:22471
msgid ""
":issue:`29418`: Implement :func:`inspect.ismethodwrapper` and fix "
":func:`inspect.isroutine` for cases where methodwrapper is given. Patch by "
"Hakan Çelik."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29418`: 实现 :func:`inspect.ismethodwrapper` 并修复 "
":func:`inspect.isroutine` 对于给定 methodwrapper 的情况。由 Hakan Çelik 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22475
msgid ""
":issue:`14156`: argparse.FileType now supports an argument of '-' in binary "
"mode, returning the .buffer attribute of sys.stdin/sys.stdout as "
"appropriate. Modes including 'x' and 'a' are treated equivalently to 'w' "
"when argument is '-'. Patch contributed by Josh Rosenberg"
msgstr ""
":issue:`14156`: argparse.FileType 现在支持二进制模式下的 '-' 参数，根据情况返回 "
"sys.stdin/sys.stdout 的 .buffer 属性。当参数为 '-' 时，包含 'x' 和 'a' 的模式被视为等同于 'w'。补丁由 "
"Josh Rosenberg 贡献"

#: ../NEWS:22483
msgid ""
":issue:`42238`: ``Doc/tools/rstlint.py`` has moved to its own repository and"
" is now packaged on PyPI as ``sphinx-lint``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42238`: ``Doc/tools/rstlint.py`` 已移至其自己的仓库，现在在 PyPI 上打包为 ``sphinx-"
"lint``。"

#: ../NEWS:22489
msgid ""
":issue:`46913`: Fix test_faulthandler.test_sigfpe() if Python is built with "
"undefined behavior sanitizer (UBSAN): disable UBSAN on the "
"faulthandler_sigfpe() function. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46913`: 如果 Python 是用未定义行为消毒剂 (UBSAN) 构建的，修复 "
"test_faulthandler.test_sigfpe()：在 faulthandler_sigfpe() 函数上禁用 UBSAN。由 Victor"
" Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22493
msgid ""
":issue:`46760`: Remove bytecode offsets from expected values in "
"test.test_dis module. Reduces the obstacles to modifying the VM or compiler."
msgstr ":issue:`46760`: 从 test.test_dis 模块中的期望值中移除字节码偏移。减少修改虚拟机或编译器的障碍。"

#: ../NEWS:22496
msgid ""
":issue:`46708`: Prevent default asyncio event loop policy modification "
"warning after ``test_asyncio`` execution."
msgstr ":issue:`46708`: 防止 ``test_asyncio`` 执行后默认 asyncio 事件循环策略修改警告。"

#: ../NEWS:22499
msgid ""
":issue:`46678`: The function ``make_legacy_pyc`` in "
"``Lib/test/support/import_helper.py`` no longer fails when "
"``PYTHONPYCACHEPREFIX`` is set to a directory on a different device from "
"where tempfiles are stored."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46678`: ``Lib/test/support/import_helper.py`` 中的函数 "
"``make_legacy_pyc`` 不再在 ``PYTHONPYCACHEPREFIX`` 设置为与存储临时文件不同的设备上的目录时失败。"

#: ../NEWS:22504
msgid ""
":issue:`46623`: Skip test_pair() and test_speech128() of test_zlib on s390x "
"since they fail if zlib uses the s390x hardware accelerator. Patch by Victor"
" Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46623`: "
"在s390x上跳过test_zlib的test_pair()和test_speech128()测试，因为如果zlib使用s390x硬件加速器，这些测试会失败。由Victor"
" Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22511
msgid ""
":issue:`46860`: Respect ``--with-suffix`` when building on case-insensitive "
"file systems."
msgstr ":issue:`46860`: 在大小写不敏感的文件系统上构建时，尊重 ``--with-suffix`` 选项。"

#: ../NEWS:22514
msgid ""
":issue:`46656`: Building Python now requires a C11 compiler. Optional C11 "
"features are not required. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ":issue:`46656`: 现在构建Python需要一个C11编译器。不需要可选C11功能。补丁由Victor Stinner提供。"

#: ../NEWS:22517
msgid ""
":issue:`46656`: Building Python now requires support for floating-point Not-"
"a-Number (NaN): remove the ``Py_NO_NAN`` macro. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46656`: 现在构建Python需要支持浮点数Not-a-Number (NaN)：移除 ``Py_NO_NAN`` "
"宏。补丁由Victor Stinner提供。"

#: ../NEWS:22521
msgid ""
":issue:`46640`: Building Python now requires a C99 ``<math.h>`` header file "
"providing a ``NAN`` constant, or the ``__builtin_nan()`` built-in function. "
"Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46640`: 现在构建Python需要一个提供 ``NAN`` 常量的C99 ``<math.h>`` "
"头文件，或者``__builtin_nan()``内置函数。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22525
msgid ""
":issue:`46608`: Exclude marshalled-frozen data if deep-freezing to save 300 "
"KB disk space. This includes adding a new ``is_package`` field to "
":c:struct:`_frozen`. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46608`: 如果深度冻结，排除已封装的冻结数据以节省300 KB磁盘空间。这包括向 :c:struct:`_frozen` "
"添加一个新的 ``is_package`` 字段。由Kumar Aditya提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22529
msgid ""
":issue:`40280`: Fix wasm32-emscripten test failures and platform issues. - "
"Disable syscalls that are not supported or don't work, e.g.   wait, "
"getrusage, prlimit, mkfifo, mknod, setres[gu]id, setgroups. - Use fd_count "
"to count open fds. - Add more checks for subprocess and fork. - Add "
"workarounds for missing _multiprocessing and failing socket.accept(). - "
"Enable bzip2. - Disable large file support. - Disable signal.alarm."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40280`: 修复wasm32-emscripten测试失败和平台问题。- "
"禁用不支持或不起作用的系统调用，例如wait、getrusage、prlimit、mkfifo、mknod、setres[gu]id、setgroups。-"
" 使用fd_count计算打开的文件描述符。- 为子进程和fork添加更多检查。- "
"为缺少_multiprocessing和失败的socket.accept()添加解决方法。- 启用bzip2。- 禁用大文件支持。- "
"禁用signal.alarm。"

#: ../NEWS:22536
msgid ""
":issue:`46430`: Intern strings in deep-frozen modules. Patch by Kumar "
"Aditya."
msgstr ":issue:`46430`: 在深度冻结的模块中内部化字符串。由Kumar Aditya提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22541
msgid ""
":issue:`46744`: The default all users install directory for ARM64 is now "
"under the native ``Program Files`` folder, rather than ``Program Files "
"(Arm)`` which is intended for ARM (32-bit) files."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46744`: ARM64的默认所有用户安装目录现在位于原生的 ``Program Files`` "
"文件夹下，而不是用于ARM（32位）文件的 ``Program Files (Arm)``。"

#: ../NEWS:22545
msgid ""
":issue:`46567`: Adds Tcl and Tk support for Windows ARM64. This also adds "
"IDLE to the installation."
msgstr ":issue:`46567`: 为Windows ARM64添加Tcl和Tk支持。这也将IDLE添加到安装中。"

#: ../NEWS:22548
msgid ""
":issue:`46638`: Ensures registry virtualization is consistently disabled. "
"For 3.10 and earlier, it remains enabled (some registry writes are "
"protected), while for 3.11 and later it is disabled (registry modifications "
"affect all applications)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46638`: "
"确保注册表虚拟化一致禁用。对于3.10及更早版本，它保持启用（某些注册表写入受到保护），而对于3.11及更高版本，它被禁用（注册表修改影响所有应用程序）。"

#: ../NEWS:22556
msgid ""
":issue:`46630`: Make query dialogs on Windows start with a cursor in the "
"entry box."
msgstr ":issue:`46630`: 使 Windows 上的查询对话框开始时光标在输入框中。"

#: ../NEWS:22559
msgid ""
":issue:`45447`: Apply IDLE syntax highlighting to ``.pyi`` files. Patch by "
"Alex Waygood and Terry Jan Reedy."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45447`: 将 IDLE 语法高亮应用到 ``.pyi`` 文件。由 Alex Waygood 和 Terry Jan Reedy "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22565
msgid ""
":issue:`46748`: Python's public headers no longer import ``<stdbool.h>``, "
"leaving code that embeds/extends Python free to define ``bool``, ``true`` "
"and ``false``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46748`: Python 的公共头文件不再导入 ``<stdbool.h>``，使得嵌入/扩展 Python 的代码可以自由定义 "
"``bool``、``true`` 和 ``false``。"

#: ../NEWS:22569
msgid ""
":issue:`46836`: Move the :c:type:`PyFrameObject` type definition (``struct "
"_frame``) to the internal C API ``pycore_frame.h`` header file. Patch by "
"Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46836`: 将 :c:type:`PyFrameObject` 类型定义（``struct _frame``）移动到内部 C API"
" ``pycore_frame.h`` 头文件中。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22573
msgid ""
":issue:`45459`: Rename ``Include/buffer.h`` header file to "
"``Include/pybuffer.h`` to avoid conflicts with projects having an existing "
"``buffer.h`` header file. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45459`: 将 ``Include/buffer.h`` 头文件重命名为 ``Include/pybuffer.h`` 以避免与已有"
" ``buffer.h`` 头文件的项目冲突。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22577
msgid ""
":issue:`45412`: Remove the ``HAVE_PY_SET_53BIT_PRECISION`` macro (moved to "
"the internal C API). Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45412`: 移除 ``HAVE_PY_SET_53BIT_PRECISION`` 宏（已移至内部 C API）。由 Victor "
"Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22580
msgid ""
":issue:`46613`: Added function :c:func:`PyType_GetModuleByDef`, which allows"
" access to module state when a method's defining class is not available."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46613`: 添加了函数 :c:func:`PyType_GetModuleByDef`，允许在方法的定义类不可用时访问模块状态。"

#: ../NEWS:22585
msgid "Python 3.11.0 alpha 5"
msgstr "Python 3.11.0 第 5 个 alpha 版本"

#: ../NEWS:22587
msgid "*Release date: 2022-02-03*"
msgstr "*发布日期：2022-02-03*"

#: ../NEWS:22592
msgid ""
":issue:`45773`: Remove two invalid \"peephole\" optimizations from the "
"bytecode compiler."
msgstr ":issue:`45773`: 从字节码编译器中移除两个无效的 \"peephole\" 优化。"

#: ../NEWS:22595
msgid ""
":issue:`46564`: Do not create frame objects when creating :class:`super` "
"object. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ":issue:`46564`: 创建 :class:`super` 对象时不创建帧对象。由 Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22598
msgid ""
":issue:`45885`: Added more fined-grained specialization failure stats "
"regarding the ``COMPARE_OP`` bytecode."
msgstr ":issue:`45885`: 关于 ``COMPARE_OP`` 字节码，添加了更细粒度的特化失败统计。"

#: ../NEWS:22601
msgid ""
":issue:`44977`: The delegation of :func:`int` to :meth:`__trunc__` is now "
"deprecated. Calling ``int(a)`` when ``type(a)`` implements :meth:`__trunc__`"
" but not :meth:`__int__` or :meth:`__index__` now raises a "
":exc:`DeprecationWarning`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44977`: :func:`int` 委托给 :meth:`__trunc__` 的做法现在已被弃用。当 ``type(a)`` "
"实现了 :meth:`__trunc__` 但没有实现 :meth:`__int__` 或 :meth:`__index__` 时，调用 "
"``int(a)`` 现在会引发 :exc:`DeprecationWarning`。"

#: ../NEWS:22606
msgid ""
":issue:`46458`: Reorder code emitted by the compiler for a "
":keyword:`try`-:keyword:`except` block so that the :keyword:`else` block's "
"code immediately follows the :keyword:`try` body (without a jump). This is "
"more optimal for the happy path."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46458`: 重新排序编译器为 :keyword:`try`-:keyword:`except` 块生成的代码，使得 "
":keyword:`else` 块的代码紧随 :keyword:`try` 体之后（无需跳转）。这对快乐路径更优。"

#: ../NEWS:22611
msgid ""
":issue:`46527`: Allow passing ``iterable`` as a keyword argument to "
":func:`enumerate` again. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46527`: 再次允许将 ``iterable`` 作为关键字参数传递给 :func:`enumerate`。由 Jelle "
"Zijlstra 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22614
msgid ""
":issue:`46528`: Replace several stack manipulation instructions "
"(``DUP_TOP``, ``DUP_TOP_TWO``, ``ROT_TWO``, ``ROT_THREE``, ``ROT_FOUR``, and"
" ``ROT_N``) with new :opcode:`COPY` and :opcode:`SWAP` instructions."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46528`: 用新的 :opcode:`COPY` 和 :opcode:`SWAP` "
"指令替换多个堆栈操作指令（``DUP_TOP``、``DUP_TOP_TWO``、``ROT_TWO``、``ROT_THREE``、``ROT_FOUR``"
" 和 ``ROT_N``）。"

#: ../NEWS:22618
msgid ":issue:`46329`: Use two or three bytecodes to implement most calls."
msgstr ":issue:`46329`: 使用两个或三个字节码来实现大多数调用。"

#: ../NEWS:22620
msgid ""
"Calls without named arguments are implemented as a sequence of two "
"instructions: ``PRECALL; CALL``. Calls with named arguments are implemented "
"as a sequence of three instructions: ``PRECALL; KW_NAMES; CALL``. There are "
"two different ``PRECALL`` instructions: ``PRECALL_FUNTION`` and "
"``PRECALL_METHOD``. The latter pairs with ``LOAD_METHOD``."
msgstr ""
"没有命名参数的调用作为两个指令的序列实现：``PRECALL; CALL``。有命名参数的调用作为三个指令的序列实现：``PRECALL; "
"KW_NAMES; CALL``。有两种不同的 ``PRECALL`` 指令：``PRECALL_FUNTION`` 和 "
"``PRECALL_METHOD``。后者与 ``LOAD_METHOD`` 配对使用。"

#: ../NEWS:22627
msgid ""
"This partition into pre-call and call allows better specialization, and thus"
" better performance ultimately."
msgstr "这种将调用分为预调用和调用的分区允许更好的专门化，从而最终获得更好的性能。"

#: ../NEWS:22632
msgid ""
":issue:`46503`: Fix an assert when parsing some invalid \\N escape sequences"
" in f-strings."
msgstr ":issue:`46503`: 修复在解析 f-strings 中一些无效的 \\N 转义序列时的断言。"

#: ../NEWS:22635
msgid ""
":issue:`46431`: Improve error message on invalid calls to "
":meth:`BaseExceptionGroup.__new__`."
msgstr ":issue:`46431`: 改进对无效调用 :meth:`BaseExceptionGroup.__new__` 时的错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:22638
msgid ""
":issue:`46476`: Fix memory leak in code objects generated by deepfreeze. "
"Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ":issue:`46476`: 修复由 deepfreeze 生成的代码对象中的内存泄漏。由 Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22641
msgid ""
":issue:`46481`: Speed up calls to :meth:`weakref.ref.__call__` by using the "
":pep:`590` ``vectorcall`` calling convention. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46481`: 通过使用 :pep:`590` ``vectorcall`` 调用约定加速对 "
":meth:`weakref.ref.__call__` 的调用。由 Donghee Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22644
msgid ""
":issue:`46417`: Fix a race condition on setting a type ``__bases__`` "
"attribute: the internal function ``add_subclass()`` now gets the "
"``PyTypeObject.tp_subclasses`` member after calling "
":c:func:`PyWeakref_NewRef` which can trigger a garbage collection which can "
"indirectly modify ``PyTypeObject.tp_subclasses``. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46417`: 修复设置类型 ``__bases__`` 属性时的竞争条件：内部函数 ``add_subclass()`` 现在在调用 "
":c:func:`PyWeakref_NewRef` 后获取 ``PyTypeObject.tp_subclasses`` "
"成员，这可以触发垃圾回收，间接修改 ``PyTypeObject.tp_subclasses``。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22651
msgid ""
":issue:`46417`: ``python -X showrefcount`` now shows the total reference "
"count after clearing and destroyed the main Python interpreter. Previously, "
"it was shown before. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46417`: ``python -X showrefcount`` 现在在清除并销毁主 Python "
"解释器后显示总引用计数。之前是在之前显示的。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22655
msgid ""
":issue:`43683`: Add ASYNC_GEN_WRAP opcode to wrap the value to be yielded in"
" async generators. Removes the need to special case async generators in the "
"``YIELD_VALUE`` instruction."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43683`: 添加 ASYNC_GEN_WRAP 操作码来包装异步生成器中要产生的值。移除了在 ``YIELD_VALUE`` "
"指令中特殊处理异步生成器的需要。"

#: ../NEWS:22659
msgid ""
":issue:`46407`: Optimize some modulo operations in ``Objects/longobject.c``."
" Patch by Jeremiah Vivian."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46407`: 优化 ``Objects/longobject.c`` 中的一些模运算。补丁由 Jeremiah Vivian 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:22662
msgid ""
":issue:`46409`: Add new ``RETURN_GENERATOR`` bytecode to make generators. "
"Simplifies calling Python functions in the VM, as they no longer any need to"
" special case generator functions."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46409`: 添加新的 ``RETURN_GENERATOR`` "
"字节码以生成器。简化了在虚拟机中调用Python函数的过程，因为它们不再需要特别处理生成器函数。"

#: ../NEWS:22666
msgid ""
"Also add ``JUMP_NO_INTERRUPT`` bytecode that acts like ``JUMP_ABSOLUTE``, "
"but does not check for interrupts."
msgstr "同时添加 ``JUMP_NO_INTERRUPT`` 字节码，其行为类似于 ``JUMP_ABSOLUTE``，但不检查中断。"

#: ../NEWS:22669
msgid ""
":issue:`46406`: The integer division ``//`` implementation has been "
"optimized to better let the compiler understand its constraints. It can be "
"20% faster on the amd64 platform when dividing an int by a value smaller "
"than ``2**30``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46406`: 整数除法 ``//`` 的实现已优化，以便编译器更好地理解其约束。在amd64平台上，当除以小于 ``2**30`` "
"的值时，速度可以提高20%。"

#: ../NEWS:22677
msgid ""
":issue:`46383`: Fix invalid signature of ``_zoneinfo``'s ``module_free`` "
"function to resolve a crash on wasm32-emscripten platform."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46383`: 修复 ``_zoneinfo`` 的 ``module_free`` "
"函数的无效签名，以解决wasm32-emscripten平台上的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:22683
msgid ""
":issue:`46361`: Ensure that \"small\" integers created by "
":meth:`int.from_bytes` and :class:`decimal.Decimal` are properly cached."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46361`: 确保通过 :meth:`int.from_bytes` 和 :class:`decimal.Decimal` "
"创建的“小”整数被正确缓存。"

#: ../NEWS:22686
msgid ""
":issue:`46161`: Fix the class building error when the arguments are "
"constants and CALL_FUNCTION_EX is used."
msgstr ":issue:`46161`: 修复当参数为常量且使用 CALL_FUNCTION_EX 时的类构建错误。"

#: ../NEWS:22689
msgid ""
":issue:`46028`: Fixes calculation of :data:`sys._base_executable` when "
"inside a virtual environment that uses symlinks with different binary names "
"than the base environment provides."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46028`: 修复在虚拟环境中使用与基础环境提供的不同二进制名称的符号链接时 :data:`sys._base_executable`"
" 的计算。"

#: ../NEWS:22693
msgid ""
":issue:`46091`: Correctly calculate indentation levels for lines with "
"whitespace character that are ended by line continuation characters. Patch "
"by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":issue:`46091`: 正确计算以行继续字符结尾的带有空白字符的行的缩进级别。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22700
msgid ":issue:`30512`: Add CAN Socket support for NetBSD."
msgstr ":issue:`30512`: 为NetBSD添加CAN Socket支持。"

#: ../NEWS:22710
msgid ""
":issue:`44024`: Improve the :exc:`TypeError` message for non-string second "
"arguments passed to the built-in functions :func:`getattr` and "
":func:`hasattr`. Patch by Géry Ogam."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44024`: 改进内置函数 :func:`getattr` 和 :func:`hasattr` 传递非字符串第二个参数时的 "
":exc:`TypeError` 消息。由Géry Ogam提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22717
msgid ""
":issue:`46624`: Restore support for non-integer arguments of "
":func:`random.randrange` and :func:`random.randint`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46624`: 恢复对 :func:`random.randrange` 和 :func:`random.randint` "
"非整数参数的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:22720
msgid ""
":issue:`46591`: Make the IDLE doc URL on the About IDLE dialog clickable."
msgstr ":issue:`46591`: 使About IDLE对话框中的IDLE文档URL可点击。"

#: ../NEWS:22722
msgid ""
":issue:`46565`: Remove loop variables that are leaking into modules' "
"namespaces."
msgstr ":issue:`46565`: 移除泄漏到模块命名空间中的循环变量。"

#: ../NEWS:22725
msgid ""
":issue:`46553`: In :func:`typing.get_type_hints`, support evaluating bare "
"stringified ``ClassVar`` annotations. Patch by Gregory Beauregard."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46553`: 在 :func:`typing.get_type_hints` 中，支持评估裸字符串化的 ``ClassVar`` "
"注解。由Gregory Beauregard提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22728
msgid ""
":issue:`46544`: Don't leak ``x`` & ``uspace`` intermediate vars in "
":class:`textwrap.TextWrapper`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46544`: 不要在 :class:`textwrap.TextWrapper` 中泄漏 ``x`` 和 ``uspace`` "
"中间变量。"

#: ../NEWS:22731
msgid ""
":issue:`46487`: Add the ``get_write_buffer_limits`` method to "
":class:`asyncio.transports.WriteTransport` and to the SSL transport."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46487`: 在 :class:`asyncio.transports.WriteTransport` 和 SSL 传输中添加 "
"``get_write_buffer_limits`` 方法。"

#: ../NEWS:22734
msgid ""
":issue:`45173`: Note the configparser deprecations will be removed in Python"
" 3.12."
msgstr ":issue:`45173`: 注意 configparser 的弃用将在 Python 3.12 中移除。"

#: ../NEWS:22737
msgid ""
":issue:`45162`: The deprecated :mod:`unittest` APIs removed in 3.11a1 have "
"been temporarily restored to be removed in 3.12 while cleanups in external "
"projects go in."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45162`: 在 3.11a1 中移除的已弃用的 :mod:`unittest` API 已被临时恢复，将在外部项目清理完成后于 "
"3.12 中移除。"

#: ../NEWS:22741
msgid ""
":issue:`46539`: In :func:`typing.get_type_hints`, support evaluating "
"stringified ``ClassVar`` and ``Final`` annotations inside ``Annotated``. "
"Patch by Gregory Beauregard."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46539`: 在 :func:`typing.get_type_hints` 中，支持在 ``Annotated`` "
"内部评估字符串化的 ``ClassVar`` 和 ``Final`` 注解。由 Gregory Beauregard 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22745
msgid ""
":issue:`46510`: Add missing test for :class:`types.TracebackType` and "
":class:`types.FrameType`. Calculate them directly from the caught exception "
"without calling :func:`sys.exc_info`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46510`: 添加 :class:`types.TracebackType` 和 :class:`types.FrameType` "
"的缺失测试。直接从捕获的异常中计算它们，而不调用 :func:`sys.exc_info`。"

#: ../NEWS:22749
msgid ""
":issue:`46491`: Allow :data:`typing.Annotated` to wrap :data:`typing.Final` "
"and :data:`typing.ClassVar`. Patch by Gregory Beauregard."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46491`: 允许 :data:`typing.Annotated` 包装 :data:`typing.Final` 和 "
":data:`typing.ClassVar`。由 Gregory Beauregard 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22752
msgid ""
":issue:`46483`: Remove :meth:`~object.__class_getitem__` from "
":class:`pathlib.PurePath` as this class was not supposed to be generic."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46483`: 从 :class:`pathlib.PurePath` 中移除 "
":meth:`~object.__class_getitem__`，因为该类不应是泛型的。"

#: ../NEWS:22755
msgid ""
":issue:`46436`: Fix command-line option ``-d``/``--directory`` in module "
":mod:`http.server` which is ignored when combined with command-line option "
"``--cgi``. Patch by Géry Ogam."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46436`: 修复模块 :mod:`http.server` 中的命令行选项 "
"``-d``/``--directory``，当与命令行选项 ``--cgi`` 结合使用时被忽略的问题。由 Géry Ogam 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22759
msgid ""
":issue:`41403`: Make :meth:`mock.patch` raise a :exc:`TypeError` with a "
"relevant error message on invalid arg. Previously it allowed a cryptic "
":exc:`AttributeError` to escape."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41403`: 使 :meth:`mock.patch` 在无效参数上引发带有相关错误信息的 "
":exc:`TypeError`。之前它允许一个难以理解的 :exc:`AttributeError` 逃逸。"

#: ../NEWS:22763
msgid ""
":issue:`46474`: In ``importlib.metadata.EntryPoint.pattern``, avoid "
"potential REDoS by limiting ambiguity in consecutive whitespace."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46474`: 在 ``importlib.metadata.EntryPoint.pattern`` "
"中，通过限制连续空白字符的歧义性来避免潜在的 REDoS。"

#: ../NEWS:22766
msgid ""
":issue:`46474`: Removed private method from ``importlib.metadata.Path``. "
"Sync with importlib_metadata 4.10.0."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46474`: 从 ``importlib.metadata.Path`` 中移除了私有方法。与 importlib_metadata "
"4.10.0 同步。"

#: ../NEWS:22769
msgid ""
":issue:`46470`: Remove unused branch from ``typing._remove_dups_flatten``"
msgstr ":issue:`46470`: 从 ``typing._remove_dups_flatten`` 中移除未使用的分支。"

#: ../NEWS:22771
msgid ""
":issue:`46469`: :mod:`asyncio` generic classes now return "
":class:`types.GenericAlias` in ``__class_getitem__`` instead of the same "
"class."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46469`: :mod:`asyncio` 泛型类现在在 ``__class_getitem__`` 中返回 "
":class:`types.GenericAlias` 而不是同一个类。"

#: ../NEWS:22775
msgid ""
":issue:`41906`: Support passing filter instances in the ``filters`` values "
"of ``handlers`` and ``loggers`` in the dictionary passed to "
":func:`logging.config.dictConfig`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41906`: 支持在传递给 :func:`logging.config.dictConfig` 的字典中的 ``handlers`` "
"和 ``loggers`` 的 ``filters`` 值中传递过滤器实例。"

#: ../NEWS:22779
msgid ""
":issue:`46422`: Use ``dis.Positions`` in ``dis.Instruction`` instead of a "
"regular ``tuple``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46422`: 在 ``dis.Instruction`` 中使用 ``dis.Positions`` 而不是常规的 "
"``tuple``。"

#: ../NEWS:22782
msgid ""
":issue:`46434`: :mod:`pdb` now gracefully handles ``help`` when "
":attr:`~module.__doc__` is missing, for example when run with pregenerated "
"optimized ``.pyc`` files."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46434`: :mod:`pdb` 现在优雅地处理 ``help`` 当 :attr:`~module.__doc__` "
"缺失时，例如当运行预生成的优化 ``.pyc`` 文件时。"

#: ../NEWS:22786
msgid ""
":issue:`43869`: Python uses the same time Epoch on all platforms. Add an "
"explicit unit test to ensure that it's the case. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43869`: Python 在所有平台上使用相同的时间纪元。添加一个明确的单元测试以确保这一点。由 Victor Stinner "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22789
msgid ""
":issue:`46414`: Add :func:`typing.reveal_type`. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ":issue:`46414`: 添加 :func:`typing.reveal_type`。由 Jelle Zijlstra 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22791
msgid ""
":issue:`40280`: :mod:`subprocess` now imports Windows-specific imports when "
"``msvcrt`` module is available, and POSIX-specific imports on all other "
"platforms. This gives a clean exception when ``_posixsubprocess`` is not "
"available (e.g. Emscripten browser target)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40280`: :mod:`subprocess` 现在在有 ``msvcrt`` 模块可用时导入特定于 Windows "
"的导入，在所有其他平台上导入特定于 POSIX 的导入。这提供了一个干净的异常当 ``_posixsubprocess`` 不可用时（例如 "
"Emscripten 浏览器目标）。"

#: ../NEWS:22796
msgid ""
":issue:`40066`: ``IntEnum``, ``IntFlag``, and ``StrEnum`` use the mixed-in "
"type for their ``str()`` and ``format()`` output."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40066`: ``IntEnum``, ``IntFlag``, 和 ``StrEnum`` 使用混合类型作为它们的 "
"``str()`` 和 ``format()`` 输出。"

#: ../NEWS:22799
msgid ""
":issue:`46316`: Optimize :meth:`pathlib.Path.iterdir` by removing an "
"unnecessary check for special entries."
msgstr ":issue:`46316`: 通过移除对特殊条目不必要的检查来优化 :meth:`pathlib.Path.iterdir`。"

#: ../NEWS:22802
msgid ""
":issue:`29688`: Document :meth:`pathlib.Path.absolute` (which has always "
"existed)."
msgstr ":issue:`29688`: 记录 :meth:`pathlib.Path.absolute` (一直存在) 。"

#: ../NEWS:22805
msgid ""
":issue:`43012`: The pathlib module's obsolete and internal ``_Accessor`` "
"class has been removed to prepare the terrain for upcoming enhancements to "
"the module."
msgstr ":issue:`43012`: pathlib 模块中过时且内部的 ``_Accessor`` 类已被移除，为模块即将到来的增强做准备。"

#: ../NEWS:22809
msgid ""
":issue:`46258`: Speed up :func:`math.isqrt` for small positive integers by "
"replacing two division steps with a lookup table."
msgstr ":issue:`46258`: 通过用查找表替换两个除法步骤来加速小正整数的 :func:`math.isqrt`。"

#: ../NEWS:22812
msgid ""
":issue:`46242`: Improve error message when creating a new :class:`enum.Enum`"
" type subclassing an existing ``Enum`` with ``_member_names_`` using "
":meth:`enum.Enum.__call__`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46242`: 当使用 :meth:`enum.Enum.__call__` 创建一个新的 :class:`enum.Enum` "
"类型，该类型继承了一个带有 ``_member_names_`` 的现有 ``Enum`` 时，改进错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:22816
msgid ""
":issue:`43118`: Fix a bug in :func:`inspect.signature` that was causing it "
"to fail on some subclasses of classes with a ``__text_signature__`` "
"referencing module globals. Patch by Weipeng Hong."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43118`: 修复 :func:`inspect.signature` 中的一个 bug，该 bug 导致它在某些引用模块全局的 "
"``__text_signature__`` 的类的子类上失败。由 Weipeng Hong 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22820
msgid ""
":issue:`26552`: Fixed case where failing :func:`asyncio.ensure_future` did "
"not close the coroutine. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26552`: 修复了 :func:`asyncio.ensure_future` 失败时未关闭协程的情况。由 Kumar Aditya"
" 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22823
msgid ""
":issue:`21987`: Fix an issue with :meth:`tarfile.TarFile.getmember` getting "
"a directory name with a trailing slash."
msgstr ":issue:`21987`: 修复 :meth:`tarfile.TarFile.getmember` 获取带有尾随斜杠的目录名的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:22826
msgid ""
":issue:`46124`: Update :mod:`zoneinfo` to rely on importlib.resources "
"traversable API."
msgstr ":issue:`46124`: 更新 :mod:`zoneinfo` 以依赖 importlib.resources 的可遍历 API。"

#: ../NEWS:22829
msgid ""
":issue:`46103`: Now :func:`inspect.getmembers` only gets :attr:`__bases__` "
"attribute from class type. Patch by Weipeng Hong."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46103`: 现在 :func:`inspect.getmembers` 仅从类类型获取 :attr:`__bases__` "
"属性。补丁由 Weipeng Hong 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:22832
msgid ""
":issue:`46080`: Fix exception in argparse help text generation if a "
":class:`argparse.BooleanOptionalAction` argument's default is "
"``argparse.SUPPRESS`` and it has ``help`` specified.  Patch by Felix "
"Fontein."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46080`: 修复了如果 :class:`argparse.BooleanOptionalAction` 参数的默认值为 "
"``argparse.SUPPRESS`` 并且指定了 ``help`` 时，在 argparse 帮助文本生成中出现的异常。补丁由 Felix "
"Fontein 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:22837
msgid ""
":issue:`44791`: Fix substitution of :class:`~typing.ParamSpec` in "
":data:`~typing.Concatenate` with different parameter expressions. "
"Substitution with a list of types returns now a tuple of types. Substitution"
" with ``Concatenate`` returns now a ``Concatenate`` with concatenated lists "
"of arguments."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44791`: 修复了在不同参数表达式中 :class:`~typing.ParamSpec` 在 "
":data:`~typing.Concatenate` 中的替换问题。现在用类型列表替换会返回一个类型元组。用 ``Concatenate`` "
"替换现在会返回一个带有连接参数列表的 ``Concatenate``。"

#: ../NEWS:22846
msgid ""
":issue:`46463`: Fixes :file:`escape4chm.py` script used when building the "
"CHM documentation file"
msgstr ":issue:`46463`: 修复了构建 CHM 文档文件时使用的 :file:`escape4chm.py` 脚本。"

#: ../NEWS:22852
msgid ""
":issue:`43478`: Mocks can no longer be provided as the specs for other "
"Mocks. As a result, an already-mocked object cannot be passed to "
"``mock.Mock()``. This can uncover bugs in tests since these Mock-derived "
"Mocks will always pass certain tests (e.g. isinstance) and builtin assert "
"functions (e.g. assert_called_once_with) will unconditionally pass."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43478`: Mock 不能再作为其他 Mock 的规范提供。因此，已经 mock 的对象不能传递给 "
"``mock.Mock()``。这可以揭示测试中的错误，因为这些 Mock 派生的 Mock 总是会通过某些测试（例如 "
"isinstance），并且内置的断言函数（例如 assert_called_once_with）将无条件通过。"

#: ../NEWS:22858
msgid ""
":issue:`46616`: Ensures ``test_importlib.test_windows`` cleans up registry "
"keys after completion."
msgstr ":issue:`46616`: 确保 ``test_importlib.test_windows`` 在完成后清理注册表键。"

#: ../NEWS:22861
msgid ""
":issue:`44359`: test_ftplib now silently ignores socket errors to prevent "
"logging unhandled threading exceptions. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44359`: test_ftplib 现在默默地忽略套接字错误，以防止记录未处理的线程异常。由 Victor Stinner "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22864
msgid ""
":issue:`46600`: Fix test_gdb.test_pycfunction() for Python built with "
"``clang -Og``. Tolerate inlined functions in the gdb traceback. Patch by "
"Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46600`: 修复了使用 ``clang -Og`` 构建的 Python 的 "
"test_gdb.test_pycfunction()。在 gdb 回溯中容忍内联函数。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22868
msgid ""
":issue:`46542`: Fix a Python crash in test_lib2to3 when using Python built "
"in debug mode: limit the recursion limit. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46542`: 修复了在使用调试模式构建的 Python 中 test_lib2to3 的 Python 崩溃：限制递归限制。由 "
"Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22871
msgid ""
":issue:`46576`: test_peg_generator now disables compiler optimization when "
"testing compilation of its own C extensions to significantly speed up the "
"testing on non-debug builds of CPython."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46576`: test_peg_generator 现在在测试其自己的 C 扩展的编译时禁用编译器优化，以显著加快在 CPython "
"的非调试构建上的测试速度。"

#: ../NEWS:22875
msgid ""
":issue:`46542`: Fix ``test_json`` tests checking for :exc:`RecursionError`: "
"modify these tests to use ``support.infinite_recursion()``. Patch by Victor "
"Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46542`: 修复 ``test_json`` 测试中对 :exc:`RecursionError` 的检查：修改这些测试以使用 "
"``support.infinite_recursion()``。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22879
msgid ""
":issue:`13886`: Skip test_builtin PTY tests on non-ASCII characters if the "
"readline module is loaded. The readline module changes input() behavior, but"
" test_builtin is not intended to test the readline module. Patch by Victor "
"Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`13886`: 如果加载了 readline 模块，则在非 ASCII 字符上跳过 test_builtin PTY "
"测试。readline 模块会改变 input() 的行为，但 test_builtin 并不旨在测试 readline 模块。由 Victor "
"Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22884
msgid ""
":issue:`40280`: Add :func:`test.support.requires_fork` decorators to mark "
"tests that require a working :func:`os.fork`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40280`: 添加 :func:`test.support.requires_fork` 装饰器以标记需要 "
":func:`os.fork` 正常工作的测试。"

#: ../NEWS:22887
msgid ""
":issue:`40280`: Add :func:`test.support.requires_subprocess` decorator to "
"mark tests which require working :mod:`subprocess` module or ``os.spawn*``. "
"The wasm32-emscripten platform has no support for processes."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40280`: 添加 :func:`test.support.requires_subprocess` 装饰器以标记需要 "
":mod:`subprocess` 模块或 ``os.spawn*`` 正常工作的测试。wasm32-emscripten 平台不支持进程。"

#: ../NEWS:22891
msgid ":issue:`46126`: Disable 'descriptions' when running tests internally."
msgstr ":issue:`46126`: 在内部运行测试时禁用 'descriptions'。"

#: ../NEWS:22896
msgid ""
":issue:`46602`: Tidied up configure.ac so that conftest.c is truncated "
"rather than appended. This assists in the case where the 'rm' of conftest.c "
"fails to happen between tests.  Downstream issues such as a clobbered SOABI "
"can result."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46602`: 整理 configure.ac 使得 conftest.c 被截断而非追加。这在 'rm' conftest.c "
"在测试之间未能发生时有所帮助。可能导致诸如 SOABI 被破坏的下游问题。"

#: ../NEWS:22901
msgid ""
":issue:`46600`: Fix the test checking if the C compiler supports ``-Og`` "
"option in the ``./configure`` script to also use ``-Og`` on clang which "
"supports it. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46600`: 修复 ``./configure`` 脚本中检查 C 编译器是否支持 ``-Og`` 选项的测试，以同样在支持 "
"``-Og`` 的 clang 上使用该选项。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22905
msgid ""
":issue:`38472`: Fix GCC detection in setup.py when cross-compiling. The C "
"compiler is now run with LC_ALL=C. Previously, the detection failed with a "
"German locale."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38472`: 修复交叉编译时 setup.py 中的 GCC 检测。现在 C 编译器以 LC_ALL=C "
"运行。之前，检测在德语环境下会失败。"

#: ../NEWS:22909
msgid ""
":issue:`46513`: :program:`configure` no longer uses ``AC_C_CHAR_UNSIGNED`` "
"macro and ``pyconfig.h`` no longer defines reserved symbol "
"``__CHAR_UNSIGNED__``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46513`: :program:`configure` 不再使用 ``AC_C_CHAR_UNSIGNED`` 宏，且 "
"``pyconfig.h`` 不再定义保留符号 ``__CHAR_UNSIGNED__``。"

#: ../NEWS:22913
msgid ""
":issue:`46471`: Use global singletons for single byte bytes objects in "
"deepfreeze."
msgstr ":issue:`46471`: 在 deepfreeze 中使用全局单例作为单字节 bytes 对象。"

#: ../NEWS:22916
msgid ""
":issue:`46443`: Deepfreeze now uses cached small integers as it saves some "
"space for common small integers."
msgstr ":issue:`46443`: Deepfreeze 现在使用缓存的小整数，因为它为常见的小整数节省了一些空间。"

#: ../NEWS:22919
msgid ""
":issue:`46429`: Merge all deep-frozen files into one for space savings. "
"Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ":issue:`46429`: 将所有深度冻结文件合并为一个以节省空间。由 Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22922
msgid ""
":issue:`45569`: The build now defaults to using 30-bit digits for Python "
"integers. Previously either 15-bit or 30-bit digits would be selected, "
"depending on the platform. 15-bit digits may still be selected using the "
"``--enable-big-digits=15`` option to the ``configure`` script, or by "
"defining ``PYLONG_BITS_IN_DIGIT`` in ``pyconfig.h``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45569`: Python 整数的构建现在默认使用 30 位数字。之前会根据平台选择 15 位或 30 位数字。仍然可以通过在 "
"``configure`` 脚本中使用 ``--enable-big-digits=15`` 选项，或在 ``pyconfig.h`` 中定义 "
"``PYLONG_BITS_IN_DIGIT`` 来选择 15 位数字。"

#: ../NEWS:22928
msgid ":issue:`45925`: Update Windows installer to use SQLite 3.37.2."
msgstr ":issue:`45925`: 更新 Windows 安装程序以使用 SQLite 3.37.2。"

#: ../NEWS:22930
msgid ""
":issue:`43112`: Detect musl libc as a separate SOABI (tagged as ``linux-"
"musl``)."
msgstr ":issue:`43112`: 检测 musl libc 作为一个单独的 SOABI（标记为 ``linux-musl``）。"

#: ../NEWS:22936
msgid ""
":issue:`33125`: The traditional EXE/MSI based installer for Windows is now "
"available for ARM64"
msgstr ":issue:`33125`: 传统的基于 EXE/MSI 的 Windows 安装程序现在可用于 ARM64。"

#: ../NEWS:22939
msgid ""
":issue:`46362`: os.path.abspath(\"C:\\CON\") is now fixed to return "
"\"\\\\.\\CON\", not the same path. The regression was true of all legacy DOS"
" devices such as COM1, LPT1, or NUL."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46362`: os.path.abspath(\"C:\\CON\") 现在修正为返回 "
"\"\\\\.\\CON\"，而不是相同的路径。这个回归问题存在于所有遗留的 DOS 设备如 COM1、LPT1 或 NUL。"

#: ../NEWS:22943
msgid ""
":issue:`44934`: The installer now offers a command-line only option to add "
"the installation directory to the end of :envvar:`PATH` instead of at the "
"start."
msgstr ":issue:`44934`: 安装程序现在提供了一个仅限命令行的选项，将安装目录添加到 :envvar:`PATH` 的末尾而不是开头。"

#: ../NEWS:22950
msgid ":issue:`45925`: Update macOS installer to SQLite 3.37.2."
msgstr ":issue:`45925`: 更新 macOS 安装程序到 SQLite 3.37.2。"

#: ../NEWS:22955
msgid ""
":issue:`45296`: Clarify close, quit, and exit in IDLE.  In the File menu, "
"'Close' and 'Exit' are now 'Close Window' (the current one) and 'Exit' is "
"now 'Exit IDLE' (by closing all windows).  In Shell, 'quit()' and 'exit()' "
"mean 'close Shell'. If there are no other windows, this also exits IDLE."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45296`: 在 IDLE 中明确了关闭、退出和退出的区别。在文件菜单中，'关闭' 和 '退出' 现在是 '关闭窗口'（当前窗口）和 "
"'退出 IDLE'（通过关闭所有窗口）。在 Shell 中，'quit()' 和 'exit()' 意思是 '关闭 "
"Shell'。如果没有其他窗口，这也将退出 IDLE。"

#: ../NEWS:22963
msgid ""
":issue:`40170`: Remove the ``PyHeapType_GET_MEMBERS()`` macro. It was "
"exposed in the public C API by mistake, it must only be used by Python "
"internally. Use the ``PyTypeObject.tp_members`` member instead. Patch by "
"Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40170`: 移除了 ``PyHeapType_GET_MEMBERS()`` 宏。它被错误地暴露在公共 C API 中，必须仅由 "
"Python 内部使用。使用 ``PyTypeObject.tp_members`` 成员代替。由 Victor Stinner 提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22968
msgid ""
":issue:`40170`: Move _Py_GetAllocatedBlocks() and "
"_PyObject_DebugMallocStats() private functions to the internal C API. Patch "
"by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40170`: 将 _Py_GetAllocatedBlocks() 和 _PyObject_DebugMallocStats() "
"私有函数移动到内部 C API。由 Victor Stinner 提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22971
msgid ""
":issue:`46433`: The internal function _PyType_GetModuleByDef now correctly "
"handles inheritance patterns involving static types."
msgstr ":issue:`46433`: 内部函数 _PyType_GetModuleByDef 现在正确处理涉及静态类型的继承模式。"

#: ../NEWS:22974
msgid ""
":issue:`45459`: :c:type:`Py_buffer` and various ``Py_buffer`` related "
"functions are now part of the limited API and stable ABI."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45459`: :c:type:`Py_buffer` 和各种 ``Py_buffer`` 相关函数现在是有限 API 和稳定 ABI "
"的一部分。"

#: ../NEWS:22977
msgid ""
":issue:`14916`: Fixed bug in the tokenizer that prevented "
"``PyRun_InteractiveOne`` from parsing from the provided FD."
msgstr ""
":issue:`14916`: 修复了 tokenizer 中的一个错误，该错误阻止了 ``PyRun_InteractiveOne`` 从提供的 FD"
" 解析。"

#: ../NEWS:22982
msgid "Python 3.11.0 alpha 4"
msgstr "Python 3.11.0 alpha 4"

#: ../NEWS:22984
msgid "*Release date: 2022-01-13*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2022-01-13*"

#: ../NEWS:22989
msgid ""
":issue:`46070`: :c:func:`Py_EndInterpreter` now explicitly untracks all "
"objects currently tracked by the GC. Previously, if an object was used later"
" by another interpreter, calling :c:func:`PyObject_GC_UnTrack` on the object"
" crashed if the previous or the next object of the :c:type:`!PyGC_Head` "
"structure became a dangling pointer. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46070`: :c:func:`Py_EndInterpreter` "
"现在明确地取消跟踪当前由GC跟踪的所有对象。之前，如果一个对象后来被另一个解释器使用，调用 :c:func:`PyObject_GC_UnTrack` "
"在该对象上如果 :c:type:`!PyGC_Head` 结构的前一个或下一个对象成为悬挂指针时会崩溃。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:22995
msgid ":issue:`46347`: Fix memory leak in PyEval_EvalCodeEx."
msgstr ":issue:`46347`: 修复PyEval_EvalCodeEx中的内存泄漏。"

#: ../NEWS:22997
msgid ""
":issue:`46339`: Fix a crash in the parser when retrieving the error text for"
" multi-line f-strings expressions that do not start in the first line of the"
" string. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":issue:`46339`: 修复解析器在检索多行f-strings表达式的错误文本时崩溃的问题，这些表达式不在字符串的第一行开始。由Pablo "
"Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:23001
msgid ""
":issue:`46331`: Do not set line number of instruction storing doc-string. "
"Fixes regression introduced in 3.11 alpha."
msgstr ":issue:`46331`: 不要设置存储文档字符串的指令的行号。修复了在3.11 alpha中引入的回归问题。"

#: ../NEWS:23004
msgid ""
":issue:`46314`: Remove spurious \"call\" event when creating a lambda "
"function that was accidentally introduced in 3.11a4."
msgstr ":issue:`46314`: 移除在创建lambda函数时意外引入的虚假“call”事件，该事件是在3.11a4中意外引入的。"

#: ../NEWS:23007
msgid ""
":issue:`46289`: ASDL declaration of ``FormattedValue`` has changed to "
"reflect ``conversion`` field is not optional."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46289`: ``FormattedValue`` 的ASDL声明已更改，以反映 ``conversion`` 字段不是可选的。"

#: ../NEWS:23010
msgid ""
":issue:`46297`: Fixed an interpreter crash on bootup with multiple "
"PythonPaths set in the Windows registry. Patch by Derzsi Dániel."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46297`: 修复了在启动时在Windows注册表中设置多个PythonPaths时解释器崩溃的问题。补丁由Derzsi "
"Dániel提供。"

#: ../NEWS:23013
msgid ""
":issue:`46237`: Fix the line number of tokenizer errors inside f-strings. "
"Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":issue:`46237`: 修复f-strings内部标记器错误的行号。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:23016
msgid ""
":issue:`46263`: We always expect the \"use_frozen_modules\" config to be "
"set, now that getpath.c was rewritten in pure Python and the logic improved."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46263`: "
"我们现在总是期望“use_frozen_modules”配置被设置，因为getpath.c已经在纯Python中重写并且逻辑得到了改进。"

#: ../NEWS:23019
msgid ""
":issue:`46006`: Fix a regression when a type method like ``__init__()`` is "
"modified in a subinterpreter. Fix a regression in "
"``_PyUnicode_EqualToASCIIId()`` and type ``update_slot()``. Revert the "
"change which made the Unicode dictionary of interned strings compatible with"
" subinterpreters: the internal interned dictionary is shared again by all "
"interpreters. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46006`: 修复当类型方法如 ``__init__()`` 在子解释器中被修改时的回归问题。修复 "
"``_PyUnicode_EqualToASCIIId()`` 和类型 ``update_slot()`` "
"中的回归问题。恢复使Unicode内部字符串字典与子解释器兼容的更改：内部内部字符串字典再次由所有解释器共享。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:23026
msgid ""
":issue:`45923`: Add RESUME opcode. This is a logical no-op. It is emitted by"
" the compiler anywhere a Python function can be entered. It is used by the "
"interpreter to perform tracing and optimizer checks."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45923`: "
"添加RESUME操作码。这是一个逻辑上的无操作。它由编译器在可以进入Python函数的任何地方发出。它被解释器用于执行跟踪和优化器检查。"

#: ../NEWS:23033
msgid ""
":issue:`46208`: Fix the regression of os.path.normpath(\"A/../../B\") not "
"returning expected \"../B\" but \"B\"."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46208`: 修复 os.path.normpath(\"A/../../B\") 未返回预期的 \"../B\" 而是返回 "
"\"B\" 的回归问题。"

#: ../NEWS:23039
msgid ""
":issue:`46240`: Correct the error message for unclosed parentheses when the "
"tokenizer doesn't reach the end of the source when the error is reported. "
"Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":issue:`46240`: 当错误报告时，如果标记器未到达源代码的末尾，则修正未闭合括号的错误消息。补丁由 Pablo Galindo 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:23043
msgid ":issue:`46009`: Remove the ``GEN_START`` opcode."
msgstr ":issue:`46009`: 移除 ``GEN_START`` 操作码。"

#: ../NEWS:23045
msgid ""
":issue:`46235`: Certain sequence multiplication operations like ``[0] * "
"1_000`` are now faster due to reference-counting optimizations. Patch by "
"Dennis Sweeney."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46235`: 由于引用计数优化，现在某些序列乘法操作如 ``[0] * 1_000`` 更快了。由 Dennis Sweeney "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:23049
msgid ""
":issue:`46221`: :opcode:`!PREP_RERAISE_STAR` no longer pushes ``lasti`` to "
"the stack."
msgstr ":issue:`46221`: :opcode:`!PREP_RERAISE_STAR` 不再将 ``lasti`` 推送到堆栈。"

#: ../NEWS:23052
msgid ""
":issue:`46202`: Remove :opcode:`!POP_EXCEPT_AND_RERAISE` and replace it by "
"an equivalent sequence of other opcodes."
msgstr ":issue:`46202`: 移除 :opcode:`!POP_EXCEPT_AND_RERAISE` 并用其他操作码的等价序列替代。"

#: ../NEWS:23058
msgid ":issue:`46085`: Fix iterator cache mechanism of :class:`OrderedDict`."
msgstr ":issue:`46085`: 修复 :class:`OrderedDict` 的迭代器缓存机制。"

#: ../NEWS:23063
msgid ""
":issue:`46055`: Speed up shifting operation involving integers less than "
":c:macro:`PyLong_BASE`. Patch by Xinhang Xu."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46055`: 加速涉及小于 :c:macro:`PyLong_BASE` 的整数的移位操作。补丁由 Xinhang Xu 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:23066
msgid ""
":issue:`46110`: Add a maximum recursion check to the PEG parser to avoid "
"stack overflow. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":issue:`46110`: 向 PEG 解析器添加最大递归检查以避免堆栈溢出。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:23069
msgid ""
":issue:`46107`: Fix bug where :meth:`ExceptionGroup.split` and "
":meth:`ExceptionGroup.subgroup` did not copy the exception group's "
"``__note__`` field to the parts."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46107`: 修复 :meth:`ExceptionGroup.split` 和 "
":meth:`ExceptionGroup.subgroup` 未将异常组的 ``__note__`` 字段复制到部分的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:23073
msgid ""
":issue:`45711`: The interpreter state's representation of handled exceptions"
" (a.k.a exc_info, or _PyErr_StackItem) now has only the ``exc_value`` field,"
" ``exc_type`` and ``exc_traceback`` have been removed as their values can be"
" derived from ``exc_value``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45711`: 解释器状态的处理异常表示（又称 exc_info 或 _PyErr_StackItem）现在只有 "
"``exc_value`` 字段，``exc_type`` 和 ``exc_traceback`` 已被移除，因为它们的值可以从 "
"``exc_value`` 派生。"

#: ../NEWS:23078
msgid ""
":issue:`44525`: Replace the four call bytecode instructions which one pre-"
"call instruction and two call instructions."
msgstr ":issue:`44525`: 用一个预调用指令和两个调用指令替换四个调用字节码指令。"

#: ../NEWS:23081
msgid ""
"Removes ``CALL_FUNCTION``, ``CALL_FUNCTION_KW``, ``CALL_METHOD`` and "
"``CALL_METHOD_KW``."
msgstr ""
"移除 ``CALL_FUNCTION``, ``CALL_FUNCTION_KW``, ``CALL_METHOD`` 和 "
"``CALL_METHOD_KW``。"

#: ../NEWS:23084
msgid ""
"Adds ``CALL_NO_KW`` and ``CALL_KW`` call instructions, and "
"``PRECALL_METHOD`` prefix for pairing with ``LOAD_METHOD``."
msgstr ""
"添加 ``CALL_NO_KW`` 和 ``CALL_KW`` 调用指令，以及 ``PRECALL_METHOD`` 前缀与 "
"``LOAD_METHOD`` 配对。"

#: ../NEWS:23087
msgid ""
":issue:`46039`: Remove the ``YIELD_FROM`` instruction and replace it with "
"the ``SEND`` instruction which performs the same operation, but without the "
"loop."
msgstr ":issue:`46039`: 移除 ``YIELD_FROM`` 指令并用执行相同操作但不带循环的 ``SEND`` 指令替代。"

#: ../NEWS:23091
msgid ""
":issue:`45635`: The code called from :c:func:`!_PyErr_Display` was "
"refactored to improve error handling. It now exits immediately upon an "
"unrecoverable error."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45635`: 从 :c:func:`!_PyErr_Display` "
"调用的代码被重构以改进错误处理。现在在遇到不可恢复的错误时立即退出。"

#: ../NEWS:23095
msgid ""
":issue:`46054`: Fix parser error when parsing non-utf8 characters in source "
"files. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":issue:`46054`: 修复解析源文件中非utf8字符时的解析器错误。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:23098
msgid ""
":issue:`46042`: Improve the location of the caret in :exc:`SyntaxError` "
"exceptions emitted by the symbol table. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46042`: 改进符号表发出的 :exc:`SyntaxError` 异常中插入符号的位置。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:23101
msgid ""
":issue:`46049`: Ensure :file:`._pth` files work as intended on platforms "
"other than Windows."
msgstr ":issue:`46049`: 确保 :file:`._pth` 文件在非Windows平台上按预期工作。"

#: ../NEWS:23104
msgid ""
":issue:`46048`: Fixes parsing of :file:`._pth` files on startup so that "
"single-character paths are correctly read."
msgstr ":issue:`46048`: 修复启动时 :file:`._pth` 文件的解析，以便正确读取单字符路径。"

#: ../NEWS:23107
msgid ""
":issue:`37971`: Fix a bug where the line numbers given in a traceback when a"
" decorator application raised an exception were wrong."
msgstr ":issue:`37971`: 修复一个错误，该错误导致装饰器应用引发异常时，回溯中给出的行号错误。"

#: ../NEWS:23110
msgid ""
":issue:`46031`: Add :opcode:`POP_JUMP_IF_NOT_NONE` and "
":opcode:`POP_JUMP_IF_NONE` opcodes to speed up conditional jumps."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46031`: 添加 :opcode:`POP_JUMP_IF_NOT_NONE` 和 "
":opcode:`POP_JUMP_IF_NONE` 操作码以加速条件跳转。"

#: ../NEWS:23113
msgid ":issue:`45654`: Deepfreeze :mod:`runpy`, patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ":issue:`45654`: 深度冻结 :mod:`runpy`，由Kumar Aditya提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:23115
msgid ""
":issue:`46025`: Fix a crash in the :mod:`atexit` module involving functions "
"that unregister themselves before raising exceptions. Patch by Pablo "
"Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46025`: 修复 :mod:`atexit` 模块中的一个崩溃问题，涉及在引发异常前自行注销的函数。由Pablo "
"Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:23122
msgid ""
":issue:`46000`: Improve compatibility of the :mod:`curses` module with "
"NetBSD curses."
msgstr ":issue:`46000`: 提高 :mod:`curses` 模块与NetBSD curses的兼容性。"

#: ../NEWS:23128
msgid ""
":issue:`44525`: Specialize the CALL_FUNCTION instruction for calls to "
"builtin types with a single argument. Speeds up ``range(x)``, ``list(x)``, "
"and specifically ``type(obj)``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44525`: 为调用带单一参数的内置类型专门化CALL_FUNCTION指令。加速 ``range(x)``, "
"``list(x)``，特别是 ``type(obj)``。"

#: ../NEWS:23132
msgid ""
":issue:`42918`: Fix bug where the built-in :func:`compile` function did not "
"always raise a :exc:`SyntaxError` when passed multiple statements in "
"'single' mode. Patch by Weipeng Hong."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42918`: 修复内置 :func:`compile` 函数在'single'模式下传递多个语句时并不总是引发 "
":exc:`SyntaxError` 的错误。由Weipeng Hong提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:23136
msgid ""
":issue:`45953`: The main interpreter in _PyRuntimeState.interpreters is now "
"statically allocated (as part of _PyRuntime).  Likewise for the initial "
"thread state of each interpreter.  This means less allocation during runtime"
" init, as well as better memory locality for these key state objects."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45953`: "
"_PyRuntimeState.interpreters中的主解释器现在是静态分配的（作为_PyRuntime的一部分）。每个解释器的初始线程状态也是如此。这意味着运行时初始化期间分配更少，以及这些关键状态对象更好的内存局部性。"

#: ../NEWS:23142
msgid ""
":issue:`45292`: Complete the :pep:`654` implementation: add ``except*``."
msgstr ":issue:`45292`: 完成 :pep:`654` 实现：添加 ``except*``。"

#: ../NEWS:23144
msgid ""
":issue:`43413`: Revert changes in ``set.__init__``. Subclass of :class:`set`"
" needs to define a ``__init__()`` method if it defines a ``__new__()`` "
"method with additional keyword parameters."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43413`: 恢复 ``set.__init__`` 中的更改。:class:`set` 的子类如果定义了带有额外关键字参数的 "
"``__new__()`` 方法，那么它需要定义一个 ``__init__()`` 方法。"

#: ../NEWS:23148
msgid ""
":issue:`43931`: Added the :c:data:`Py_Version` constant which bears the same"
" value as :c:macro:`PY_VERSION_HEX`. Patch by Gabriele N. Tornetta."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43931`: 添加了 :c:data:`Py_Version` 常量，其值与 :c:macro:`PY_VERSION_HEX` "
"相同。由 Gabriele N. Tornetta 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:23154
msgid ""
":issue:`46342`: The ``@typing.final`` decorator now sets the ``__final__`` "
"attribute on the decorated object to allow runtime introspection. Patch by "
"Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46342`: ``@typing.final`` 装饰器现在会在被装饰的对象上设置 ``__final__`` "
"属性，以允许运行时内省。由 Jelle Zijlstra 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:23158
msgid ""
":issue:`46328`: Added the :meth:`sys.exception` method which returns the "
"active exception instance."
msgstr ":issue:`46328`: 添加了 :meth:`sys.exception` 方法，该方法返回活动的异常实例。"

#: ../NEWS:23161
msgid ""
":issue:`46307`: Add :meth:`string.Template.is_valid` and "
":meth:`string.Template.get_identifiers` methods."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46307`: 添加 :meth:`string.Template.is_valid` 和 "
":meth:`string.Template.get_identifiers` 方法。"

#: ../NEWS:23164
msgid ""
":issue:`46306`: Assume that :class:`types.CodeType` always has "
":attr:`types.CodeType.co_firstlineno` in :mod:`doctest`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46306`: 在 :mod:`doctest` 中假设 :class:`types.CodeType` 总是有 "
":attr:`types.CodeType.co_firstlineno`。"

#: ../NEWS:23167
msgid ""
":issue:`40479`: Fix :mod:`hashlib` *usedforsecurity* option to work "
"correctly with OpenSSL 3.0.0 in FIPS mode."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40479`: 修复 :mod:`hashlib` *usedforsecurity* 选项，使其在 FIPS 模式下与 OpenSSL"
" 3.0.0 正确工作。"

#: ../NEWS:23170
msgid ""
":issue:`46070`: Fix possible segfault when importing the :mod:`asyncio` "
"module from different sub-interpreters in parallel. Patch by Erlend E. "
"Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46070`: 修复了从不同的子解释器并行导入 :mod:`asyncio` 模块时可能出现的段错误。补丁由 Erlend E. "
"Aasland 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:23173
msgid ""
":issue:`46244`: Removed ``__slots__`` from :class:`typing.ParamSpec` and "
":class:`typing.TypeVar`. They served no purpose. Patch by Arie Bovenberg."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46244`: 从 :class:`typing.ParamSpec` 和 :class:`typing.TypeVar` 中移除了 "
"``__slots__``。它们没有任何作用。由 Arie Bovenberg 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:23176
msgid ""
":issue:`46278`: Reflect ``context`` argument in "
"``AbstractEventLoop.call_*()`` methods. Loop implementations already support"
" it."
msgstr ""
