#: ../NEWS:23423
msgid ""
":issue:`45855`: Replaced deprecated usage of "
":c:func:`PyImport_ImportModuleNoBlock` with :c:func:`PyImport_ImportModule` "
"in stdlib modules. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45855`: 在stdlib模块中，用 :c:func:`PyImport_ImportModule` 替换了已弃用的 "
":c:func:`PyImport_ImportModuleNoBlock` 的使用。由Kumar Aditya提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:23427
msgid ""
":issue:`46007`: The :c:func:`!PyUnicode_CHECK_INTERNED` macro has been "
"excluded from the limited C API. It was never usable there, because it used "
"internal structures which are not available in the limited C API. Patch by "
"Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46007`: :c:func:`!PyUnicode_CHECK_INTERNED` 宏已被排除在有限的C "
"API之外。它在那里从来不可用，因为它使用了在有限的C API中不可用的内部结构。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:23434
msgid "Python 3.11.0 alpha 3"
msgstr "Python 3.11.0 alpha 3"

#: ../NEWS:23436
msgid "*Release date: 2021-12-08*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2021-12-08*"

#: ../NEWS:23441
msgid ""
":issue:`46009`: Restore behavior from 3.9 and earlier when sending non-None "
"to newly started generator. In 3.9 this did not affect the state of the "
"generator. In 3.10.0 and 3.10.1 ``gen_func().send(0)`` is equivalent to "
"``gen_func().throw(TypeError(...)`` which exhausts the generator. In 3.10.2 "
"onward, the behavior has been reverted to that of 3.9."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46009`: "
"恢复3.9及更早版本中向新启动的生成器发送非None时的行为。在3.9中，这不影响生成器的状态。在3.10.0和3.10.1中，``gen_func().send(0)``等同于``gen_func().throw(TypeError(...)``，这会耗尽生成器。在3.10.2及以后版本中，行为已恢复到3.9的状态。"

#: ../NEWS:23447
msgid ""
":issue:`46004`: Fix the :exc:`SyntaxError` location for errors involving for"
" loops with invalid targets. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":issue:`46004`: 修复了涉及带有无效目标的for循环的 :exc:`SyntaxError` 位置错误。由Pablo "
"Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:23450
msgid ""
":issue:`45711`: :c:func:`!_PyErr_ChainStackItem` no longer normalizes "
"``exc_info`` (including setting the traceback on the exception instance) "
"because ``exc_info`` is always normalized."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45711`: :c:func:`!_PyErr_ChainStackItem` 不再规范化 ``exc_info`` "
"(包括在异常实例上设置回溯) ，因为 ``exc_info`` 总是被规范化的。"

#: ../NEWS:23454
msgid ""
":issue:`45607`: The ``__note__`` field was added to :exc:`BaseException`. It"
" is ``None`` by default but can be set to a string which is added to the "
"exception's traceback."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45607`: 向 :exc:`BaseException` 添加了 ``__note__`` 字段。默认情况下为 "
"``None``，但可以设置为字符串，该字符串将添加到异常的跟踪信息中。"

#: ../NEWS:23458
msgid ""
":issue:`45947`: Place pointers to dict and values immediately before GC "
"header. This reduces number of dependent memory loads to access either dict "
"or values from 3 to 1."
msgstr ":issue:`45947`: 将指向字典和值的指针立即放置在GC头之前。这将访问字典或值时的依赖内存加载次数从3次减少到1次。"

#: ../NEWS:23462
msgid ""
":issue:`45915`: ``is_valid_fd`` now uses faster ``fcntl(fd, F_GETFD)`` on "
"Linux, macOS, and Windows."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45915`: 在Linux、macOS和Windows上，``is_valid_fd`` 现在使用更快的 ``fcntl(fd, "
"F_GETFD)``。"

#: ../NEWS:23465
msgid ""
":issue:`44530`: Reverts a change to the ``code.__new__`` :ref:`audit event "
"<audit-events>` from an earlier prerelease."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44530`: 恢复了对 ``code.__new__`` :ref:`audit event <audit-events>` "
"的早期预发布版本的更改。"

#: ../NEWS:23468
msgid ""
":issue:`42268`: Fail the configure step if the selected compiler doesn't "
"support memory sanitizer. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":issue:`42268`: 如果所选编译器不支持内存清理器，则配置步骤失败。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:23471
msgid ""
":issue:`45711`: The three values of ``exc_info`` are now always consistent "
"with each other. In particular, the ``type`` and ``traceback`` fields are "
"now derived from the exception instance. This impacts the return values of "
":func:`sys.exc_info` and :c:func:`PyErr_GetExcInfo()` if the exception "
"instance is modified while the exception is handled, as well as "
":c:func:`PyErr_SetExcInfo()`, which now ignores the ``type`` and "
"``traceback`` arguments provided to it."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45711`: ``exc_info`` 的三个值现在总是相互一致。特别是，``type`` 和 ``traceback`` "
"字段现在是从异常实例派生的。这会影响 :func:`sys.exc_info` 和 :c:func:`PyErr_GetExcInfo()` "
"的返回值，如果在处理异常时修改了异常实例，以及 :c:func:`PyErr_SetExcInfo()`，现在它会忽略提供给它的 ``type`` 和 "
"``traceback`` 参数。"

#: ../NEWS:23479
msgid ""
":issue:`45727`: Refine the custom syntax error that suggests that a comma "
"may be missing to trigger only when the expressions are detected between "
"parentheses or brackets. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":issue:`45727`: 改进了自定义语法错误，只有当表达式在括号或方括号之间被检测到时，才触发可能缺少逗号的建议。由Pablo "
"Galindo提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:23483
msgid ""
":issue:`45885`: Specialized the ``COMPARE_OP`` opcode using the PEP 659 "
"machinery."
msgstr ":issue:`45885`: 使用PEP 659机制专门化了 ``COMPARE_OP`` 操作码。"

#: ../NEWS:23486
msgid ""
":issue:`45786`: Allocate space for the interpreter frame in the frame "
"object, to avoid an additional allocation when the frame object outlives the"
" frame activation."
msgstr ":issue:`45786`: 在帧对象中为解释器帧分配空间，以避免当帧对象比帧激活更持久时进行额外的分配。"

#: ../NEWS:23493
msgid ""
":issue:`45614`: Fix :mod:`traceback` display for exceptions with invalid "
"module name."
msgstr ":issue:`45614`: 修复了 :mod:`traceback` 对于模块名称无效的异常的显示。"

#: ../NEWS:23499
msgid ""
":issue:`45813`: Fix crash when calling coro.cr_frame.clear() after coroutine"
" has been freed."
msgstr ":issue:`45813`: 修复了在协程被释放后调用 coro.cr_frame.clear() 时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:23502
msgid ""
":issue:`45811`: Improve the tokenizer errors when encountering invisible "
"control characters in the parser. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":issue:`45811`: 改进解析器在遇到不可见控制字符时的分词器错误。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:23505
msgid ""
":issue:`45848`: Allow the parser to obtain error lines directly from encoded"
" files. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":issue:`45848`: 允许解析器直接从编码文件中获取错误行。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:23508
msgid ""
":issue:`45709`: Restore behavior from 3.10 when tracing an exception raised "
"within a with statement."
msgstr ":issue:`45709`: 恢复3.10版本中追踪在with语句内引发的异常时的行为。"

#: ../NEWS:23511
msgid ""
":issue:`44525`: Adds new :opcode:`COPY_FREE_VARS` opcode, to make copying of"
" free variables from function to frame explicit. Helps optimization of calls"
" to Python function."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44525`: 新增 :opcode:`COPY_FREE_VARS` "
"操作码，使从函数到框架的自由变量复制变得明确。有助于优化Python函数的调用。"

#: ../NEWS:23515
msgid ""
":issue:`45829`: Specialize :opcode:`BINARY_SUBSCR` for classes with a "
"``__getitem__`` method implemented in Python"
msgstr ""
":issue:`45829`: 为类中实现 ``__getitem__`` 方法的 :opcode:`BINARY_SUBSCR` 操作码进行特化"

#: ../NEWS:23518
msgid ""
":issue:`45826`: Fixed a crash when calling ``.with_traceback(None)`` on "
"``NameError``. This occurs internally in "
"``unittest.TestCase.assertRaises()``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45826`: 修复了在 ``NameError`` 上调用 ``.with_traceback(None)`` "
"时发生的崩溃。这内部发生在 ``unittest.TestCase.assertRaises()`` 中。"

#: ../NEWS:23522
msgid ""
":issue:`45822`: Fixed a bug in the parser that was causing it to not respect"
" :pep:`263` coding cookies when no flags are provided. Patch by Pablo "
"Galindo"
msgstr ""
":issue:`45822`: 修复了解析器中的一个错误，该错误导致在没有提供标志时不尊重 :pep:`263` 编码声明。由Pablo "
"Galindo提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:23526
msgid ""
":issue:`45820`: Fix a segfault when the parser fails without reading any "
"input. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":issue:`45820`: 修复了当解析器在未读取任何输入时失败时的段错误。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:23529
msgid ""
":issue:`45636`: Simplify the implementation of :opcode:`BINARY_OP` by "
"indexing into an array of function pointers (rather than switching on the "
"oparg)."
msgstr ":issue:`45636`: 通过索引到函数指针数组（而不是根据oparg切换）来简化 :opcode:`BINARY_OP` 的实现。"

#: ../NEWS:23532
msgid ""
":issue:`42540`: Fix crash when :func:`os.fork` is called with an active non-"
"default memory allocator."
msgstr ":issue:`42540`: 修复了在调用 :func:`os.fork` 时存在活跃的非默认内存分配器时的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:23535
msgid ""
":issue:`45738`: Fix computation of error location for invalid continuation "
"characters in the parser. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":issue:`45738`: 修复解析器中无效连续字符错误位置的计算。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:23538
msgid ""
":issue:`45636`: Remove an existing \"fast path\" for old-style string "
"formatting, since it no longer appears to have any measurable impact."
msgstr ":issue:`45636`: 移除旧式字符串格式化的现有“快速路径”，因为它不再有任何可测量的影响。"

#: ../NEWS:23541
msgid ""
":issue:`45753`: Make recursion checks a bit more efficient by tracking "
"amount of calls left before overflow."
msgstr ":issue:`45753`: 通过跟踪溢出前的调用次数，使递归检查更加高效。"

#: ../NEWS:23544
msgid ""
":issue:`45773`: Fix a compiler hang when attempting to optimize certain jump"
" patterns."
msgstr ":issue:`45773`: 修复尝试优化某些跳转模式时的编译器挂起问题。"

#: ../NEWS:23547
msgid ""
":issue:`45764`: The parser now gives a better error message when leaving out"
" the opening parenthesis ``(`` after a ``def``-statement::"
msgstr ":issue:`45764`: 现在，当在 ``def`` 语句后省略开括号 ``(`` 时，解析器会给出更好的错误信息::"

#: ../NEWS:23550
msgid ""
">>> def f:\n"
"  File \"<stdin>\", line 1\n"
"    def f:\n"
"         ^\n"
"SyntaxError: expected '('"
msgstr ""
">>> def f:\n"
"  File \"<stdin>\", line 1\n"
"    def f:\n"
"         ^\n"
"SyntaxError: expected '('"

#: ../NEWS:23556
msgid ""
":issue:`45609`: Specialized the ``STORE_SUBSCR`` opcode using the PEP 659 "
"machinery."
msgstr ":issue:`45609`: 使用PEP 659机制专门化了 ``STORE_SUBSCR`` 操作码。"

#: ../NEWS:23559
msgid ""
":issue:`45636`: Replace all numeric ``BINARY_*`` and ``INPLACE_*`` "
"instructions with a single :opcode:`BINARY_OP` implementation."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45636`: 将所有数字型的 ``BINARY_*`` 和 ``INPLACE_*`` 指令替换为单一的 "
":opcode:`BINARY_OP` 实现。"

#: ../NEWS:23562
msgid ""
":issue:`45582`: Path calculation (known as ``getpath``) has been "
"reimplemented as a frozen Python module. This should have no visible impact,"
" but may affect calculation of all paths referenced in :mod:`sys` and "
":mod:`sysconfig`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45582`: 路径计算（称为 ``getpath``）已被重新实现为一个冻结的Python模块。这应该不会有可见的影响，但可能会影响 "
":mod:`sys` 和 :mod:`sysconfig` 中引用的所有路径的计算。"

#: ../NEWS:23567
msgid ""
":issue:`45450`: Improve the syntax error message for parenthesized "
"arguments. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":issue:`45450`: 为带括号的参数改进了语法错误消息。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:23573
msgid ""
":issue:`27946`: Fix possible crash when getting an attribute of "
":class:`xml.etree.ElementTree.Element` simultaneously with replacing the "
"``attrib`` dict."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27946`: 修复了在替换 ``attrib`` 字典的同时获取 "
":class:`xml.etree.ElementTree.Element` 属性时可能发生的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:23577
msgid ""
":issue:`45711`: Make :mod:`asyncio` normalize exceptions as soon as they are"
" captured with :c:func:`PyErr_Fetch`, and before they are stored as an "
"exc_info triplet. This brings :mod:`asyncio` in line with the rest of the "
"codebase, where an exc_info triplet is always normalized."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45711`: 让 :mod:`asyncio` 在通过 :c:func:`PyErr_Fetch` "
"捕获异常后立即规范化异常，并在它们被存储为exc_info三元组之前。这使得 :mod:`asyncio` "
"与代码库的其余部分保持一致，其中exc_info三元组总是被规范化的。"

#: ../NEWS:23582
msgid ""
":issue:`23819`: Replaced asserts with exceptions in asyncio, patch by Kumar "
"Aditya."
msgstr ":issue:`23819`: 在asyncio中用异常替换了断言，由Kumar Aditya提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:23585
msgid ""
":issue:`13236`: :class:`unittest.TextTestResult` and "
":class:`unittest.TextTestRunner` flush now the output stream more often."
msgstr ""
":issue:`13236`: :class:`unittest.TextTestResult` 和 "
":class:`unittest.TextTestRunner` 现在更频繁地刷新输出流。"

#: ../NEWS:23588
msgid ""
":issue:`45917`: Added :func:`math.exp2`:, which returns 2 raised to the "
"power of x."
msgstr ":issue:`45917`: 添加了 :func:`math.exp2`，它返回2的x次幂。"

#: ../NEWS:23591
msgid ""
":issue:`37658`: Fix issue when on certain conditions ``asyncio.wait_for()`` "
"may allow a coroutine to complete successfully, but fail to return the "
"result, potentially causing memory leaks or other issues."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37658`: 修复了在某些条件下 ``asyncio.wait_for()`` "
"可能允许协程成功完成，但未能返回结果，可能导致内存泄漏或其他问题的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:23595
msgid ""
":issue:`45876`: Improve the accuracy of stdev() and pstdev() in the "
"statistics module.  When the inputs are floats or fractions, the output is a"
" correctly rounded float"
msgstr ""
":issue:`45876`: "
"提高了statistics模块中stdev()和pstdev()的准确性。当输入是浮点数或分数时，输出是一个正确舍入的浮点数"

#: ../NEWS:23599
msgid ""
":issue:`44649`: Handle dataclass(slots=True) with a field that has default a"
" default value, but for which init=False."
msgstr ":issue:`44649`: 处理了dataclass(slots=True)与一个字段有默认值，但init=False的情况。"

#: ../NEWS:23602
msgid ""
":issue:`45803`: Added missing kw_only parameter to "
"dataclasses.make_dataclass()."
msgstr ":issue:`45803`: 向dataclasses.make_dataclass()添加了缺失的kw_only参数。"

#: ../NEWS:23605
msgid ""
":issue:`45837`: The :meth:`!turtle.RawTurtle.settiltangle` is deprecated "
"since Python 3.1, it now emits a deprecation warning and will be removed in "
"Python 3.13."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45837`: :meth:`!turtle.RawTurtle.settiltangle` 自Python "
"3.1起已被弃用，现在会发出弃用警告，并将在Python 3.13中移除。"

#: ../NEWS:23609
msgid "Use :meth:`turtle.RawTurtle.tiltangle` instead."
msgstr "请使用 :meth:`turtle.RawTurtle.tiltangle` 代替。"

#: ../NEWS:23611
msgid ""
":meth:`turtle.RawTurtle.tiltangle` was earlier incorrectly marked as "
"deprecated, its docstring has been corrected."
msgstr ":meth:`turtle.RawTurtle.tiltangle` 之前被错误地标记为弃用，其文档字符串已被更正。"

#: ../NEWS:23616
msgid ""
":issue:`45831`: :mod:`faulthandler` can now write ASCII-only strings (like "
"filenames and function names) with a single write() syscall when dumping a "
"traceback. It reduces the risk of getting an unreadable dump when two "
"threads or two processes dump a traceback to the same file (like stderr) at "
"the same time. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45831`: :mod:`faulthandler` 现在可以在转储回溯时，通过一次 write() 系统调用写入仅包含 ASCII "
"的字符串（如文件名和函数名）。这减少了当两个线程或两个进程同时向同一文件（如 stderr）转储回溯时，产生不可读转储的风险。由 Victor "
"Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:23622
msgid ""
":issue:`45828`: :mod:`sqlite` C callbacks now use unraisable exceptions if "
"callback tracebacks are enabled. Patch by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45828`: :mod:`sqlite` 的 C 回调现在在启用回调回溯时使用不可引发异常。由 Erlend E. Aasland "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:23625
msgid ""
":issue:`41735`: Fix thread lock in ``zlib.Decompress.flush()`` method before"
" ``PyObject_GetBuffer``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41735`: 在 ``PyObject_GetBuffer`` 之前修复了 ``zlib.Decompress.flush()`` "
"方法中的线程锁。"

#: ../NEWS:23628
msgid ""
":issue:`45235`: Reverted an argparse bugfix that caused regression in the "
"handling of default arguments for subparsers.  This prevented leaf level "
"arguments from taking precedence over root level arguments."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45235`: 恢复了 argparse 的一个错误修复，该修复导致了处理子解析器默认参数时的回归。这防止了叶级参数优先于根级参数。"

#: ../NEWS:23632
msgid ""
":issue:`45754`: Fix a regression in Python 3.11a1 and 3.11a2 where "
":mod:`sqlite3` incorrectly would use ``SQLITE_LIMIT_LENGTH`` when checking "
"SQL statement lengths. Now, ``SQLITE_LIMIT_SQL_LENGTH`` is used. Patch by "
"Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45754`: 修复了 Python 3.11a1 和 3.11a2 中的一个回归问题，其中 :mod:`sqlite3` 在检查 "
"SQL 语句长度时会错误地使用 ``SQLITE_LIMIT_LENGTH``。现在使用 ``SQLITE_LIMIT_SQL_LENGTH``。由 "
"Erlend E. Aasland 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:23637
msgid ""
":issue:`45766`: Added *proportional* option to "
":meth:`statistics.linear_regression`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45766`: 向 :meth:`statistics.linear_regression` 添加了 *proportional* "
"选项。"

#: ../NEWS:23640
msgid ""
":issue:`45765`: In importlib.metadata, fix distribution discovery for an "
"empty path."
msgstr ":issue:`45765`: 在 importlib.metadata 中，修复了对于空路径的发行版发现。"

#: ../NEWS:23643
msgid ""
":issue:`45757`: Fix bug where :mod:`dis` produced an incorrect oparg when "
":opcode:`EXTENDED_ARG` is followed by an opcode that does not use its "
"argument."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45757`: 修复了一个 bug，其中 :mod:`dis` 在 :opcode:`EXTENDED_ARG` "
"后跟一个不使用其参数的操作码时会产生错误的 oparg。"

#: ../NEWS:23647
msgid ""
":issue:`45644`: In-place JSON file formatting using ``python3 -m json.tool "
"infile infile`` now works correctly, previously it left the file empty. "
"Patch by Chris Wesseling."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45644`: 使用 ``python3 -m json.tool infile infile`` 进行原地 JSON "
"文件格式化现在可以正常工作，之前会导致文件为空。由 Chris Wesseling 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:23651
msgid ""
":issue:`45703`: When a namespace package is imported before another module "
"from the same namespace is created/installed in a different :data:`sys.path`"
" location while the program is running, calling the "
":func:`importlib.invalidate_caches` function will now also guarantee the new"
" module is noticed."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45703`: 当在程序运行时，一个命名空间包在另一个来自同一命名空间的模块被创建/安装在不同的 :data:`sys.path` "
"位置之前被导入时，调用 :func:`importlib.invalidate_caches` 函数现在也能保证新模块被注意到。"

#: ../NEWS:23657
msgid ":issue:`45535`: Improve output of ``dir()`` with Enums."
msgstr ":issue:`45535`: 改进 ``dir()`` 对枚举的输出。"

#: ../NEWS:23659
msgid ""
":issue:`45664`: Fix :func:`types.resolve_bases` and :func:`types.new_class` "
"for :class:`types.GenericAlias` instance as a base."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45664`: 修复 :func:`types.resolve_bases` 和 :func:`types.new_class` "
"对于作为基类的 :class:`types.GenericAlias` 实例的处理。"

#: ../NEWS:23662
msgid ""
":issue:`45663`: Fix :func:`dataclasses.is_dataclass` for dataclasses which "
"are subclasses of :class:`types.GenericAlias`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45663`: 修复 :func:`dataclasses.is_dataclass` 对于是 "
":class:`types.GenericAlias` 子类的数据类的处理。"

#: ../NEWS:23665
msgid ""
":issue:`45662`: Fix the repr of :data:`dataclasses.InitVar` with a type "
"alias to the built-in class, e.g. ``InitVar[list[int]]``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45662`: 修复 :data:`dataclasses.InitVar` 与内置类类型别名的 repr，例如 "
"``InitVar[list[int]]``。"

#: ../NEWS:23668
msgid ""
":issue:`43137`: Launch GNOME web browsers via gio tool instead of obsolete "
"gvfs-open"
msgstr ":issue:`43137`: 通过 gio 工具而非过时的 gvfs-open 启动 GNOME 网页浏览器。"

#: ../NEWS:23671
msgid ""
":issue:`45429`: On Windows, :func:`time.sleep` now uses a waitable timer "
"which supports high-resolution timers. Patch by Donghee Na and Eryk Sun."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45429`: 在 Windows 上，:func:`time.sleep` 现在使用支持高分辨率计时器的可等待计时器。由 "
"Donghee Na 和 Eryk Sun 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:23674
