":program:`_freeze_module` 不再使用LTO构建。"

#: ../NEWS:23767
msgid ""
":issue:`45881`: The :program:`configure` script now accepts ``--with-build-"
"python`` and ``--with-freeze-module`` options to make cross compiling "
"easier."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45881`: :program:`configure` 脚本现在接受 ``--with-build-python`` 和 "
"``--with-freeze-module`` 选项，使交叉编译更容易。"

#: ../NEWS:23771
msgid ""
":issue:`40280`: Emscripten platform now uses ``.wasm`` suffix by default."
msgstr ":issue:`40280`: Emscripten 平台现在默认使用 ``.wasm`` 后缀。"

#: ../NEWS:23773
msgid ""
":issue:`40280`: Disable unusable core extension modules on WASM/Emscripten "
"targets."
msgstr ":issue:`40280`: 在 WASM/Emscripten 目标上禁用不可用的核心扩展模块。"

#: ../NEWS:23776
msgid ""
":issue:`40280`: ``configure`` now checks for socket ``shutdown`` function. "
"The check makes it possible to disable ``SYS_shutdown`` with "
"``ac_cv_func_shutdown=no`` in CONFIG_SITE."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40280`: ``configure`` 现在检查 socket ``shutdown`` 函数。该检查使得可以在 "
"CONFIG_SITE 中用 ``ac_cv_func_shutdown=no`` 禁用 ``SYS_shutdown``。"

#: ../NEWS:23780
msgid ""
":issue:`40280`: ``configure`` now checks for functions ``fork1, getegid, "
"geteuid, getgid, getppid, getuid, opendir, pipe, system, wait, ttyname``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40280`: ``configure`` 现在检查函数 ``fork1, getegid, geteuid, getgid, "
"getppid, getuid, opendir, pipe, system, wait, ttyname``。"

#: ../NEWS:23783
msgid ""
":issue:`33393`: Update ``config.guess`` to 2021-06-03 and ``config.sub`` to "
"2021-08-14. ``Makefile`` now has an ``update-config`` target to make "
"updating more convenient."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33393`: 更新 ``config.guess`` 至 2021-06-03 和 ``config.sub`` 至 "
"2021-08-14。``Makefile`` 现在有一个 ``update-config`` 目标，使更新更加方便。"

#: ../NEWS:23787
msgid ""
":issue:`45866`: ``make regen-all`` now produces the same output when run "
"from a directory other than the source tree: when building Python out of the"
" source tree. pegen now strips directory of the \"generated by pygen from "
"<FILENAME>\" header Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45866`: ``make regen-all`` 现在在源树之外的目录运行时产生相同的输出：当在源树之外构建 Python "
"时。pegen 现在去除 \"generated by pygen from <FILENAME>\" 头部的目录。由 Victor Stinner "
"提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:23792
msgid ""
":issue:`40280`: ``configure`` now accepts machine ``wasm32`` or ``wasm64`` "
"and OS ``wasi`` or ``emscripten`` for cross building, e.g. ``wasm32-unknown-"
"emscripten``, ``wasm32-wasi``, or ``wasm32-unknown-wasi``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40280`: ``configure`` 现在接受机器 ``wasm32`` 或 ``wasm64`` 和操作系统 ``wasi`` "
"或 ``emscripten`` 以进行交叉构建，例如 ``wasm32-unknown-emscripten``、``wasm32-wasi`` 或 "
"``wasm32-unknown-wasi``。"

#: ../NEWS:23797
msgid ""
":issue:`41498`: Python now compiles on platforms without ``sigset_t``. "
"Several functions in :mod:`signal` are not available when ``sigset_t`` is "
"missing."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41498`: Python 现在可以在没有 ``sigset_t`` 的平台上编译。当 ``sigset_t`` "
"缺失时，:mod:`signal` 中的几个函数不可用。"

#: ../NEWS:23800
msgid "Based on patch by Roman Yurchak for pyodide."
msgstr "基于 Roman Yurchak 为 pyodide 提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:23802
msgid ""
":issue:`45881`: ``setup.py`` now uses ``CC`` from environment first to "
"discover multiarch and cross compile paths."
msgstr ":issue:`45881`: ``setup.py`` 现在首先使用环境中的 ``CC`` 来发现多架构和交叉编译路径。"

#: ../NEWS:23805
msgid ""
":issue:`45886`: The ``_freeze_module`` program path can now be overridden on"
" the command line, e.g. ``make "
"FREEZE_MODULE=../x86_64/Program/_freeze_module``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45886`: ``_freeze_module`` 程序的路径现在可以在命令行中覆盖，例如 ``make "
"FREEZE_MODULE=../x86_64/Program/_freeze_module``。"

#: ../NEWS:23809
msgid ""
":issue:`45873`: Get rid of the ``_bootstrap_python`` build step. The "
"deepfreeze.py script is now run using ``$(PYTHON_FOR_REGEN)`` which can be "
"Python 3.7 or newer (on Windows, 3.8 or newer)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45873`: 去除 ``_bootstrap_python`` 构建步骤。deepfreeze.py 脚本现在使用 "
"``$(PYTHON_FOR_REGEN)`` 运行，可以是 Python 3.7 或更新版本（在 Windows 上，3.8 或更新版本）。"

#: ../NEWS:23813
msgid ""
":issue:`45847`: Port builtin hashlib extensions to ``PY_STDLIB_MOD`` macro "
"and ``addext()``."
msgstr ":issue:`45847`: 将内置的 hashlib 扩展移植到 ``PY_STDLIB_MOD`` 宏和 ``addext()``。"

#: ../NEWS:23816
msgid ""
":issue:`45723`: Add ``autoconf`` helpers for saving and restoring "
"environment variables:"
msgstr ":issue:`45723`: 为保存和恢复环境变量添加 ``autoconf`` 助手:"

#: ../NEWS:23819
msgid ""
"``SAVE_ENV``: Save ``$CFLAGS``, ``$LDFLAGS``, ``$LIBS``, and ``$CPPFLAGS``."
msgstr "``SAVE_ENV``: 保存 ``$CFLAGS``、``$LDFLAGS``、``$LIBS`` 和 ``$CPPFLAGS``。"

#: ../NEWS:23821
msgid ""
"``RESTORE_ENV``: Restore ``$CFLAGS``, ``$LDFLAGS``, ``$LIBS``, and "
"``$CPPFLAGS``."
msgstr ""
"``RESTORE_ENV``: 恢复 ``$CFLAGS``、``$LDFLAGS``、``$LIBS`` 和 ``$CPPFLAGS``。"

#: ../NEWS:23823
msgid ""
"``WITH_SAVE_ENV([SCRIPT])``: Run ``SCRIPT`` wrapped with ``SAVE_ENV`` and "
"``RESTORE_ENV``."
msgstr ""
"``WITH_SAVE_ENV([SCRIPT])``: 使用 ``SAVE_ENV`` 和 ``RESTORE_ENV`` 包装运行 "
"``SCRIPT``。"

#: ../NEWS:23828
msgid ""
":issue:`45573`: Mandatory core modules, that are required to bootstrap "
"Python, are now in ``Modules/Setup.bootstrap``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45573`: 启动 Python 所需的强制核心模块现在位于 ``Modules/Setup.bootstrap`` 中。"

#: ../NEWS:23831
msgid ""
":issue:`45573`: ``configure`` now creates ``Modules/Setup.stdlib`` with "
"conditionally enabled/disabled extension module lines. The file is not used,"
" yet."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45573`: ``configure`` 现在创建 "
"``Modules/Setup.stdlib``，其中包含有条件启用/禁用的扩展模块行。该文件尚未使用。"

#: ../NEWS:23835
msgid ""
":issue:`45573`: ``configure`` now uses a unified format to set state, "
"compiler flags, and linker flags in Makefile. The new macro "
"``PY_STDLIB_MOD`` sets three variables that are consumed by "
"``Modules/Setup`` and ``setup.py``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45573`: ``configure`` 现在使用统一的格式来设置 Makefile 中的状态、编译器标志和链接器标志。新的宏 "
"``PY_STDLIB_MOD`` 设置了三个变量，由 ``Modules/Setup`` 和 ``setup.py`` 使用。"

#: ../NEWS:23839
msgid ""
":issue:`45816`: Python now supports building with Visual Studio 2022 (MSVC "
"v143, VS Version 17.0). Patch by Jeremiah Vivian."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45816`: Python 现在支持使用 Visual Studio 2022 (MSVC v143, VS 版本 17.0) "
"构建。补丁由 Jeremiah Vivian 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:23842
msgid ""
":issue:`45800`: Settings for :mod:`pyexpat` C extension are now detected by "
"``configure``. The bundled ``expat`` library is built in ``Makefile``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45800`: :mod:`pyexpat` C 扩展的设置现在由 ``configure`` 检测。捆绑的 ``expat`` 库在 "
"``Makefile`` 中构建。"

#: ../NEWS:23845
msgid ""
":issue:`45798`: Settings for :mod:`decimal` internal C extension are now "
"detected by ``configure``. The bundled ``libmpdec`` library is built in "
"``Makefile``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45798`: :mod:`decimal` 内部 C 扩展的设置现在由 ``configure`` 检测。捆绑的 "
"``libmpdec`` 库在 ``Makefile`` 中构建。"

#: ../NEWS:23849
msgid ""
":issue:`45723`: :program:`configure` has a new option ``--with-pkg-config`` "
"to disable or require pkg-config."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45723`: :program:`configure` 有一个新选项 ``--with-pkg-config`` 来禁用或要求 "
"pkg-config。"

#: ../NEWS:23852
msgid ""
":issue:`45774`: The build dependencies for :mod:`sqlite3` are now detected "
"by ``configure`` and ``pkg-config``. Patch by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45774`: :mod:`sqlite3` 的构建依赖现在由 ``configure`` 和 ``pkg-config`` "
"检测。补丁由 Erlend E. Aasland 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:23855
msgid ""
":issue:`45763`: The build dependencies for :mod:`zlib`, :mod:`bz2`, and "
":mod:`lzma` are now detected by ``configure``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45763`: :mod:`zlib`、:mod:`bz2` 和 :mod:`lzma` 的构建依赖现在由 ``configure`` "
"检测。"

#: ../NEWS:23858
msgid ""
":issue:`45747`: gdbm and dbm build dependencies are now detected by "
"``configure``."
msgstr ":issue:`45747`: gdbm 和 dbm 的构建依赖现在由 ``configure`` 检测。"

#: ../NEWS:23861
msgid ""
":issue:`45743`: On macOS, the build system no longer passes "
"``search_paths_first`` to the linker. The flag has been the default since "
"Xcode 4 / macOS 10.6."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45743`: 在 macOS 上，构建系统不再向链接器传递 ``search_paths_first``。自 Xcode 4 / "
"macOS 10.6 以来，该标志已成为默认设置。"

#: ../NEWS:23865
msgid ""
":issue:`45723`: ``configure.ac`` is now compatible with autoconf 2.71. "
"Deprecated checks ``STDC_HEADERS`` and ``AC_HEADER_TIME`` have been removed."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45723`: ``configure.ac`` 现在兼容 autoconf 2.71。已移除过时的检查 "
"``STDC_HEADERS`` 和 ``AC_HEADER_TIME``。"

#: ../NEWS:23869
msgid ""
":issue:`45723`: ``configure`` now prints a warning when pkg-config is "
"missing."
msgstr ":issue:`45723`: ``configure`` 现在会在 pkg-config 缺失时打印警告。"

#: ../NEWS:23871
msgid ""
":issue:`45731`: ``configure --enable-loadable-sqlite-extensions`` is now "
"handled by new ``PY_SQLITE_ENABLE_LOAD_EXTENSION`` macro instead of logic in"
" setup.py."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45731`: ``configure --enable-loadable-sqlite-extensions`` 现在由新的 "
"``PY_SQLITE_ENABLE_LOAD_EXTENSION`` 宏处理，而非 setup.py 中的逻辑。"

#: ../NEWS:23875
msgid ""
":issue:`45723`: configure.ac now uses custom helper macros and "
"``AC_CACHE_CHECK`` to simplify and speed up configure runs."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45723`: configure.ac 现在使用自定义辅助宏和 ``AC_CACHE_CHECK`` 来简化和加速 configure"
