"Pablo Galindo 提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:24720
msgid ":issue:`44732`: Rename ``types.Union`` to ``types.UnionType``."
msgstr ":issue:`44732`: 将 ``types.Union`` 重命名为 ``types.UnionType``。"

#: ../NEWS:24722
msgid ""
":issue:`44725`: Expose specialization stats in python via "
