msgstr ""
":issue:`44589`: ``match`` 语句中具有两个或更多相等字面键的映射模式现在会在编译时引发 :exc:`SyntaxError`。"

#: ../NEWS:24785
msgid ""
":issue:`44606`: Fix ``__instancecheck__`` and ``__subclasscheck__`` for the "
"union type."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44606`: 修复联合类型的 ``__instancecheck__`` 和 ``__subclasscheck__``。"

#: ../NEWS:24788
msgid ""
":issue:`42073`: The ``@classmethod`` decorator can now wrap other "
"classmethod-like descriptors."
msgstr ":issue:`42073`: ``@classmethod`` 装饰器现在可以包装其他类似 classmethod 的描述符。"

#: ../NEWS:24791
msgid ""
":issue:`41972`: Tuned the string-searching algorithm of fastsearch.h to have"
" a shorter inner loop for most cases."
msgstr ":issue:`41972`: 调整了 fastsearch.h 的字符串搜索算法，使其在大多数情况下具有更短的内循环。"

#: ../NEWS:24794
msgid ""
":issue:`44590`: All necessary data for executing a Python function (local "
"variables, stack, etc) is now kept in a per-thread stack. Frame objects are "
"lazily allocated on demand. This increases performance by about 7% on the "
"standard benchmark suite. Introspection and debugging are unaffected as "
"frame objects are always available when needed. Patch by Mark Shannon."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44590`: "
"现在，执行Python函数所需的所有数据（局部变量、栈等）都保存在每线程栈中。帧对象是按需延迟分配的。这使得标准基准测试套件的性能提高了约7%。自省和调试不受影响，因为帧对象在需要时总是可用的。由Mark"
" Shannon提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:24800
msgid ""
":issue:`44584`: The threading debug (:envvar:`!PYTHONTHREADDEBUG` "
"environment variable) is deprecated in Python 3.10 and will be removed in "
"Python 3.12. This feature requires a debug build of Python. Patch by Victor "
"Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44584`: Python 3.10中已弃用线程调试（:envvar:`!PYTHONTHREADDEBUG` "
"环境变量），并将在Python 3.12中移除。此功能需要Python的调试版本。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:24804
msgid ""
":issue:`43895`: An obsolete internal cache of shared object file handles "
"added in 1995 that attempted, but did not guarantee, that a .so would not be"
" dlopen'ed twice to work around flaws in mid-1990s posix-ish operating "
"systems has been removed from dynload_shlib.c."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43895`: "
"1995年添加的一个过时的共享对象文件句柄内部缓存已被从dynload_shlib.c中移除。该缓存尝试（但未保证）不会对同一.so文件执行两次dlopen，以解决1990年代中期posix类操作系统的缺陷。"

#: ../NEWS:24812
msgid ""
":issue:`44490`: :mod:`typing` now searches for type parameters in "
"``types.Union`` objects. ``get_type_hints`` will also properly resolve "
"annotations with nested ``types.Union`` objects. Patch provided by Yurii "
"Karabas."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44490`: :mod:`typing` 现在会在 ``types.Union`` "
"对象中搜索类型参数。``get_type_hints``也将正确解析带有嵌套 ``types.Union`` 对象的注解。由Yurii "
"Karabas提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:24820
msgid ""
":issue:`43950`: Code objects can now provide the column information for "
"instructions when available. This is levaraged during traceback printing to "
"show the expressions responsible for errors."
msgstr ":issue:`43950`: 代码对象现在可以在可用时提供指令的列信息。这在回溯打印过程中被利用，以显示导致错误的表达式。"

#: ../NEWS:24824
msgid ""
"Contributed by Pablo Galindo, Batuhan Taskaya and Ammar Askar as part of "
":pep:`657`."
msgstr "由Pablo Galindo、Batuhan Taskaya和Ammar Askar作为 :pep:`657` 的一部分贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:24827
msgid ""
":issue:`44562`: Remove uses of :c:func:`PyObject_GC_Del` in error path when "
"initializing :class:`types.GenericAlias`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44562`: 在初始化 :class:`types.GenericAlias` 时，错误路径中移除 "
":c:func:`PyObject_GC_Del` 的使用。"

#: ../NEWS:24833
msgid ""
":issue:`41486`: Fix a memory consumption and copying performance regression "
"in earlier 3.10 beta releases if someone used an output buffer larger than "
"4GiB with zlib.decompress on input data that expands that large."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41486`: 修复了早期3.10 "
"beta版本中，如果有人在输入数据扩展超过4GiB时使用大于4GiB的输出缓冲区与zlib.decompress一起使用时出现的内存消耗和复制性能回归。"

#: ../NEWS:24840
msgid ""
":issue:`43908`: Heap types with the :c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_IMMUTABLETYPE` flag"
" can now inherit the :pep:`590` vectorcall protocol.  Previously, this was "
"only possible for :ref:`static types <static-types>`.  Patch by Erlend E. "
"Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43908`: 带有 :c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_IMMUTABLETYPE` 标志的堆类型现在可以继承 "
":pep:`590` 向量调用协议。以前，该特性仅支持 :ref:`static types <static-types>` 。由Erlend E. "
"Aasland提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:24845
msgid ""
":issue:`44553`: Implement GC methods for ``types.Union`` to break reference "
"cycles and prevent memory leaks."
msgstr ":issue:`44553`: 为 ``types.Union`` 实现 GC 方法以打破引用循环并防止内存泄漏。"

#: ../NEWS:24848
msgid ""
":issue:`44490`: Add ``__parameters__`` attribute and ``__getitem__`` "
"operator to ``types.Union``. Patch provided by Yurii Karabas."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44490`: 向 ``types.Union`` 添加 ``__parameters__`` 属性和 ``__getitem__`` "
"操作符。由 Yurii Karabas 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:24851
msgid ""
":issue:`44523`: Remove the pass-through for :func:`hash` of "
":class:`weakref.proxy` objects to prevent unintended consequences when the "
"original referred object dies while the proxy is part of a hashable object. "
"Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44523`: 移除 :func:`hash` 对 :class:`weakref.proxy` "
"对象的透传，以防止当原始引用对象死亡而代理是可哈希对象的一部分时产生意外后果。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:24856
msgid ""
":issue:`44483`: Fix a crash in ``types.Union`` objects when creating a union"
" of an object with bad ``__module__`` field."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44483`: 修复在创建具有不良 ``__module__`` 字段的对象的联合时 ``types.Union`` 对象的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:24859
msgid ""
":issue:`44486`: Modules will always have a dictionary, even when created by "
"``types.ModuleType.__new__()``"
msgstr ":issue:`44486`: 模块即使是通过 ``types.ModuleType.__new__()`` 创建的也将始终拥有一个字典。"

#: ../NEWS:24862
msgid ""
":issue:`44472`: Fix ltrace functionality when exceptions are raised. Patch "
"by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":issue:`44472`: 修复当异常被抛出时的 ltrace 功能。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:24865
msgid ""
":issue:`12022`: A :exc:`TypeError` is now raised instead of an "
":exc:`AttributeError` in :keyword:`with` and :keyword:`async with` "
"statements for objects which do not support the :term:`context manager` or "
":term:`asynchronous context manager` protocols correspondingly."
msgstr ""
":issue:`12022`: 对于不支持 :term:`上下文管理器 <context manager>` 或 异步上下文管理器` 协议的对象，在 "
":keyword:`with` 和 :keyword:`async with` 语句中现在会抛出 :exc:`TypeError` 而不是 "
":exc:`AttributeError`。"

#: ../NEWS:24870
msgid ""
":issue:`44297`: Make sure that the line number is set when entering a "
"comprehension scope. This ensures that backtraces including generator "
"expressions show the correct line number."
msgstr ":issue:`44297`: 确保在进入理解作用域时设置行号。这确保了包括生成器表达式在内的回溯显示正确的行号。"

#: ../NEWS:24874
msgid ""
":issue:`44456`: Improve the syntax error when mixing positional and keyword "
"patterns. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":issue:`44456`: 改进当混合位置和关键字模式时的语法错误。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:24877
msgid ""
":issue:`44409`: Fix error location information for tokenizer errors raised "
"on initialization of the tokenizer. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":issue:`44409`: 修复在初始化分词器时抛出的分词器错误的位置信息。补丁由 Pablo Galindo 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:24880
msgid ""
":issue:`44396`: Fix a possible crash in the tokenizer when raising syntax "
"errors for unclosed strings. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":issue:`44396`: 修复分词器在抛出未闭合字符串的语法错误时可能崩溃的问题。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:24883
msgid ""
":issue:`44376`: Exact integer exponentiation (like ``i**2`` or ``pow(i, "
"2)``) with a small exponent is much faster, due to reducing overhead in such"
" cases."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44376`: 对于小指数的精确整数指数运算（如 ``i**2`` 或 ``pow(i, "
"2)``），由于减少了此类情况下的开销，运算速度大大提高。"

#: ../NEWS:24887
msgid ""
":issue:`44313`: Directly imported objects and modules (through import and "
"from import statements) don't generate ``LOAD_METHOD``/``CALL_METHOD`` for "
"directly accessed objects on their namespace. They now use the regular "
"``LOAD_ATTR``/``CALL_FUNCTION``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44313`: 直接导入的对象和模块（通过 import 和 from import 语句）不会为它们命名空间上直接访问的对象生成 "
"``LOAD_METHOD``/``CALL_METHOD``。现在它们使用常规的 ``LOAD_ATTR``/``CALL_FUNCTION``。"

#: ../NEWS:24892
