msgstr ":issue:`44335`: 修复识别语法错误中不正确字符时的回归问题。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:24921
msgid ""
":issue:`43693`: Computation of the offsets of cell variables is done in the "
"compiler instead of at runtime. This reduces the overhead of handling cell "
"and free variables, especially in the case where a variable is both an "
"argument and cell variable."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43693`: "
"单元格变量的偏移量计算在编译器中完成，而不是在运行时。这减少了处理单元格和自由变量的开销，特别是在变量既是参数又是单元格变量的情况下。"

#: ../NEWS:24926
msgid ""
":issue:`44317`: Improve tokenizer error with improved locations. Patch by "
"Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":issue:`44317`: 使用改进的位置信息改进分词器错误。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:24932
msgid ""
":issue:`44304`: Fix a crash in the :mod:`sqlite3` module that happened when "
"the garbage collector clears :class:`sqlite.Statement` objects. Patch by "
"Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":issue:`44304`: 修复 :mod:`sqlite3` 模块中垃圾回收器清除 :class:`sqlite.Statement` "
"对象时发生的崩溃。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:24939
msgid ""
":issue:`44305`: Improve error message for ``try`` blocks without ``except`` "
"or ``finally`` blocks. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44305`: 为没有 ``except`` 或 ``finally`` 块的 ``try`` 块改进错误消息。由 Pablo "
"Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:24942
msgid ""
":issue:`43413`: Constructors of subclasses of some builtin classes (e.g. "
":class:`tuple`, :class:`list`, :class:`frozenset`) no longer accept "
"arbitrary keyword arguments. [reverted in 3.11a4] Subclass of :class:`set` "
"can now define a ``__new__()`` method with additional keyword parameters "
"without overriding also ``__init__()``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43413`: 一些内置类（如 :class:`tuple`, :class:`list`, "
":class:`frozenset`）的子类的构造函数不再接受任意关键字参数。[在 3.11a4 中恢复] :class:`set` "
"的子类现在可以定义一个带有额外关键字参数的 ``__new__()`` 方法，而无需同时覆盖 ``__init__()``。"

#: ../NEWS:24948
msgid ""
":issue:`43667`: Improve Unicode support in non-UTF locales on Oracle "
"Solaris. This issue does not affect other Solaris systems."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43667`: 在 Oracle Solaris 上的非 UTF 语言环境中改进 Unicode 支持。此问题不影响其他 Solaris"
" 系统。"

#: ../NEWS:24951
msgid ""
":issue:`43693`: A new opcode MAKE_CELL has been added that effectively moves"
" some of the work done on function entry into the compiler and into the eval"
" loop.  In addition to creating the required cell objects, the new opcode "
"converts relevant arguments (and other locals) to cell variables on function"
" entry."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43693`: 新增了一个操作码 "
"MAKE_CELL，该操作码有效地将函数入口处完成的部分工作转移到编译器和评估循环中。除了创建所需的单元对象外，新操作码还在函数入口处将相关参数（及其他局部变量）转换为单元变量。"

#: ../NEWS:24957
msgid ""
":issue:`44232`: Fix a regression in :func:`type` when a metaclass raises an "
"exception. The C function :c:func:`type_new` must properly report the "
"exception when a metaclass constructor raises an exception and the winner "
"class is not the metaclass. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44232`: 修复了当元类引发异常时 :func:`type` 的回归问题。C 函数 :c:func:`type_new` "
"必须在元类构造函数引发异常且获胜类不是元类时正确报告异常。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:24962
msgid ""
":issue:`44201`: Avoid side effects of checking for specialized syntax errors"
" in the REPL that was causing it to ask for extra tokens after a syntax "
"error had been detected. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":issue:`44201`: 避免在 REPL 中检查特殊语法错误时的副作用，这些副作用导致在检测到语法错误后要求额外的标记。由 Pablo "
"Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:24966
msgid ""
":issue:`43693`: ``PyCodeObject`` gained ``co_fastlocalnames`` and "
"``co_fastlocalkinds`` as the authoritative source of fast locals info. "
"Marshaled code objects have changed accordingly."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43693`: ``PyCodeObject`` 增加了 ``co_fastlocalnames`` 和 "
"``co_fastlocalkinds`` 作为快速局部变量信息的权威来源。序列化的代码对象也相应发生了变化。"

#: ../NEWS:24970
msgid ""
":issue:`44184`: Fix a crash at Python exit when a deallocator function "
"removes the last strong reference to a heap type. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44184`: 修复了当解构函数移除堆类型最后一个强引用时 Python 退出的崩溃问题。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:24973
msgid ""
":issue:`44187`: Implement quickening in the interpreter. This offers no "
"advantages as yet, but is an enabler of future optimizations. See PEP 659 "
"for full explanation."
msgstr ":issue:`44187`: 在解释器中实现了快速化。目前这没有任何优势，但为未来的优化奠定了基础。完整解释请参见 PEP 659。"

#: ../NEWS:24977
msgid ""
":issue:`44180`: The parser doesn't report generic syntax errors that happen "
"in a position further away that the one it reached in the first pass. Patch "
"by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":issue:`44180`: 解析器不再报告在首次到达位置更远处发生的通用语法错误。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:24981
msgid ""
":issue:`44168`: Fix error message in the parser involving keyword arguments "
"with invalid expressions. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":issue:`44168`: 修复了解析器中涉及带有无效表达式的关键字参数的错误消息。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:24984
msgid ""
":issue:`44156`: String caches in ``compile.c`` are now subinterpreter "
"compatible."
msgstr ":issue:`44156`: ``compile.c`` 中的字符串缓存现在与子解释器兼容。"

#: ../NEWS:24987
msgid ""
":issue:`44143`: Fixed a crash in the parser that manifest when raising "
"tokenizer errors when an existing exception was present. Patch by Pablo "
"Galindo."
msgstr ":issue:`44143`: 修复了当存在现有异常时引发标记化错误时出现的解析器崩溃问题。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:24991
msgid ""
":issue:`44032`: Move 'fast' locals and other variables from the frame object"
" to a per-thread datastack."
msgstr ":issue:`44032`: 将 'fast' 局部变量和其他变量从帧对象移动到每线程的数据栈。"

#: ../NEWS:24994
msgid ""
":issue:`44114`: Fix incorrect dictkeys_reversed and dictitems_reversed "
"function signatures in C code, which broke webassembly builds."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44114`: 修复 C 代码中错误的 dictkeys_reversed 和 dictitems_reversed 函数签名，这破坏了"
" webassembly 构建。"

#: ../NEWS:24997
msgid ":issue:`44110`: Improve :func:`str.__getitem__` error message"
msgstr ":issue:`44110`: 改进 :func:`str.__getitem__` 的错误信息"

#: ../NEWS:24999
msgid ""
":issue:`26110`: Add ``CALL_METHOD_KW`` opcode to speed up method calls with "
"keyword arguments.  Idea originated from PyPy.  A side effect is executing "
"``CALL_METHOD`` is now branchless in the evaluation loop."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26110`: 添加 ``CALL_METHOD_KW`` 操作码以加速带有关键字参数的方法调用。想法源自 "
"PyPy。一个副作用是在评估循环中执行 ``CALL_METHOD`` 现在是无分支的。"

#: ../NEWS:25003
msgid ""
":issue:`28307`: Compiler now optimizes simple C-style formatting with "
"literal format containing only format codes %s, %r and %a by converting them"
" to f-string expressions."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28307`: 编译器现在通过将简单的 C 风格格式化转换为 f-string 表达式来优化仅包含格式代码 %s、%r 和 %a "
"的文字格式。"

#: ../NEWS:25007
msgid ""
":issue:`43149`: Correct the syntax error message regarding multiple "
"exception types to not refer to \"exception groups\". Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":issue:`43149`: 更正关于多种异常类型的语法错误消息，不再提及“异常组”。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:25010
msgid ""
":issue:`43822`: The parser will prioritize tokenizer errors over custom "
"syntax errors when raising exceptions. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":issue:`43822`: 当引发异常时，解析器将优先考虑分词器错误而非自定义语法错误。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:25013
msgid ":issue:`40222`: \"Zero cost\" exception handling."
msgstr ":issue:`40222`: “零成本”异常处理。"

#: ../NEWS:25015
msgid "Uses a lookup table to determine how to handle exceptions."
msgstr "使用查找表来确定如何处理异常。"

#: ../NEWS:25016
msgid ""
"Removes SETUP_FINALLY and POP_TOP block instructions, eliminating the "
"runtime overhead of try statements."
msgstr "移除 SETUP_FINALLY 和 POP_TOP 块指令，消除了 try 语句的运行时开销。"

#: ../NEWS:25017
msgid "Reduces the size of the frame object by about 60%."
msgstr "将帧对象的大小减少了约 60%。"

#: ../NEWS:25019
msgid "Patch by Mark Shannon"
msgstr "由 Mark Shannon 提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:25021
msgid ""
":issue:`43918`: Document the signature and ``default`` argument in the "
"docstring of the new ``anext`` builtin."
msgstr ":issue:`43918`: 在新的 ``anext`` 内置函数的文档字符串中记录签名和 ``default`` 参数。"

#: ../NEWS:25024
msgid ""
":issue:`43833`: Emit a deprecation warning if the numeric literal is "
"immediately followed by one of keywords: and, else, for, if, in, is, or. "
"Raise a syntax error with more informative message if it is immediately "
"followed by other keyword or identifier."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43833`: "
"如果数字字面量紧跟着关键字之一：and、else、for、if、in、is、or，则发出弃用警告。如果紧跟着其他关键字或标识符，则引发带有更丰富信息的语法错误。"

#: ../NEWS:25029
msgid ""
":issue:`43879`: Add native_thread_id to PyThreadState. Patch by Gabriele N. "
"Tornetta."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43879`: 向 PyThreadState 添加 native_thread_id。由 Gabriele N. Tornetta "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:25032
msgid ""
":issue:`43693`: Compute cell offsets relative to locals in compiler. Allows "
"the interpreter to treats locals and cells a single array, which is slightly"
" more efficient. Also make the LOAD_CLOSURE opcode an alias for LOAD_FAST. "
"Preserving LOAD_CLOSURE helps keep bytecode a bit more readable."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43693`: 在编译器中计算相对于局部变量的单元格偏移量。允许解释器将局部变量和单元格视为单个数组，这稍微提高了效率。同时使 "
"LOAD_CLOSURE 操作码成为 LOAD_FAST 的别名。保留 LOAD_CLOSURE 有助于使字节码更具可读性。"

#: ../NEWS:25037
msgid ""
":issue:`17792`: More accurate error messages for access of unbound locals or"
" free vars."
msgstr ":issue:`17792`: 为未绑定的局部变量或自由变量的访问提供更准确的错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:25040
msgid ":issue:`28146`: Fix a confusing error message in :func:`str.format`."
msgstr ":issue:`28146`: 修复 :func:`str.format` 中一个令人困惑的错误信息。"

#: ../NEWS:25042
msgid ""
":issue:`11105`: When compiling :class:`ast.AST` objects with recursive "
"references through :func:`compile`, the interpreter doesn't crash anymore "
"instead it raises a :exc:`RecursionError`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`11105`: 当通过 :func:`compile` 编译带有递归引用的 :class:`ast.AST` "
"对象时，解释器不再崩溃，而是引发 :exc:`RecursionError`。"

#: ../NEWS:25046
msgid ""
":issue:`39091`: Fix crash when using passing a non-exception to a "
"generator's ``throw()`` method. Patch by Noah Oxer"
msgstr ":issue:`39091`: 修复向生成器的 ``throw()`` 方法传递非异常对象时导致的崩溃。由 Noah Oxer 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:25049
msgid ""
":issue:`33346`: Asynchronous comprehensions are now allowed inside "
"comprehensions in asynchronous functions.  Outer comprehensions implicitly "
"become asynchronous."
msgstr ":issue:`33346`: 现在允许在异步函数的推导式中使用异步推导式。外部推导式隐式变为异步。"

#: ../NEWS:25056
msgid ""
":issue:`45371`: Fix clang rpath issue in ``distutils``. The UnixCCompiler "
"now uses correct clang option to add a runtime library directory (rpath) to "
"a shared library."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45371`: 修复 ``distutils`` 中的 clang rpath 问题。UnixCCompiler 现在使用正确的 "
"clang 选项向共享库添加运行时库目录 (rpath)。"

#: ../NEWS:25060
msgid ""
":issue:`45329`: Fix freed memory access in :class:`pyexpat.xmlparser` when "
"building it with an installed expat library <= 2.2.0."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45329`: 修复当使用已安装的 expat 库 <= 2.2.0 构建 :class:`pyexpat.xmlparser` "
"时访问已释放内存的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:25063
msgid ""
":issue:`41710`: On Unix, if the ``sem_clockwait()`` function is available in"
" the C library (glibc 2.30 and newer), the :meth:`threading.Lock.acquire` "
"method now uses the monotonic clock (:const:`time.CLOCK_MONOTONIC`) for the "
"timeout, rather than using the system clock (:const:`time.CLOCK_REALTIME`), "
"to not be affected by system clock changes. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41710`: 在 Unix 上，如果 C 库（glibc 2.30 及更新版本）中可用 ``sem_clockwait()`` "
"函数，:meth:`threading.Lock.acquire` 方法现在使用单调时钟 (:const:`time.CLOCK_MONOTONIC`)"
" 来处理超时，而不是使用系统时钟 (:const:`time.CLOCK_REALTIME`)，以避免受系统时钟变化影响。由 Victor "
"Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:25070
msgid ""
":issue:`1596321`: Fix the :func:`threading._shutdown` function when the "
":mod:`threading` module was imported first from a thread different than the "
"main thread: no longer log an error at Python exit."
msgstr ""
":issue:`1596321`: 修复当 :mod:`threading` 模块首次从非主线程导入时 "
":func:`threading._shutdown` 函数的问题：在 Python 退出时不再记录错误。"

#: ../NEWS:25074
msgid ""
":issue:`45274`: Fix a race condition in the :meth:`Thread.join() "
"<threading.Thread.join>` method of the :mod:`threading` module. If the "
"function is interrupted by a signal and the signal handler raises an "
"exception, make sure that the thread remains in a consistent state to "
"prevent a deadlock. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45274`: 修复 :mod:`threading` 模块中 :meth:`Thread.join() "
"<threading.Thread.join>` 方法的竞态条件。如果函数被信号中断并且信号处理程序引发异常，确保线程保持在一个一致的状态以防止死锁。由"
" Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:25080
msgid ""
":issue:`21302`: In Unix operating systems, :func:`time.sleep` now uses the "
"``nanosleep()`` function, if ``clock_nanosleep()`` is not available but "
"``nanosleep()`` is available. ``nanosleep()`` allows to sleep with "
"nanosecond precision."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21302`: 在 Unix 操作系统中，如果 ``clock_nanosleep()`` 不可用但 ``nanosleep()`` "
"可用，:func:`time.sleep` 现在使用 ``nanosleep()`` 函数。``nanosleep()`` 允许以纳秒精度睡眠。"

#: ../NEWS:25085
msgid ""
":issue:`21302`: On Windows, :func:`time.sleep` now uses a waitable timer "
"which has a resolution of 100 nanoseconds (10\\ :sup:`-7` seconds). "
"Previously, it had a resolution of 1 millisecond (10\\ :sup:`-3` seconds). "
"Patch by Benjamin Szőke and Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21302`: 在Windows上，:func:`time.sleep` 现在使用了一个可等待的计时器，其分辨率为100纳秒（10\\ "
":sup:`-7` 秒）。之前，它的分辨率为1毫秒（10\\ :sup:`-3` 秒）。由Benjamin Szőke和Victor "
"Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:25090
msgid ""
":issue:`45238`: Fix :meth:`unittest.IsolatedAsyncioTestCase.debug`: it runs "
"now asynchronous methods and callbacks."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45238`: 修复 "
":meth:`unittest.IsolatedAsyncioTestCase.debug`：现在可以运行异步方法和回调。"

#: ../NEWS:25093
msgid ""
":issue:`36674`: :meth:`unittest.TestCase.debug` raises now a "
":class:`unittest.SkipTest` if the class or the test method are decorated "
"with the skipping decorator."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36674`: :meth:`unittest.TestCase.debug` 现在如果类或测试方法被跳过装饰器装饰，会引发 "
":class:`unittest.SkipTest`。"

#: ../NEWS:25097
msgid ""
":issue:`45235`: Fix an issue where argparse would not preserve values in a "
"provided namespace when using a subparser with defaults."
msgstr ":issue:`45235`: 修复了一个问题，即当使用带有默认值的子解析器时，argparse不会保留提供的命名空间中的值。"

#: ../NEWS:25100
msgid ""
":issue:`45183`: Have zipimport.zipimporter.find_spec() not raise an "
"exception when the underlying zip file has been deleted and the internal "
"cache has been reset via invalidate_cache()."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45183`: 让 zipimport.zipimporter.find_spec() 在底层的zip文件已被删除且内部缓存已通过 "
"invalidate_cache() 重置时不抛出异常。"

#: ../NEWS:25104
msgid ""
":issue:`45234`: Fixed a regression in :func:`~shutil.copyfile`, "
":func:`~shutil.copy`, :func:`~shutil.copy2` raising :exc:`FileNotFoundError`"
" when source is a directory, which should raise :exc:`IsADirectoryError`"
msgstr ""
":issue:`45234`: 修复了 :func:`~shutil.copyfile`, :func:`~shutil.copy`, "
":func:`~shutil.copy2` 中的一个回归问题，当源是目录时不应抛出 :exc:`FileNotFoundError` 而应抛出 "
":exc:`IsADirectoryError`。"

#: ../NEWS:25109
msgid ""
":issue:`45228`: Fix stack buffer overflow in parsing J1939 network address."
msgstr ":issue:`45228`: 修复解析J1939网络地址时的栈缓冲区溢出问题。"

#: ../NEWS:25111
msgid ":issue:`45225`: use map function instead of genexpr in capwords."
msgstr ":issue:`45225`: 在capwords中使用map函数代替genexpr。"

#: ../NEWS:25113
msgid ""
":issue:`42135`: Fix typo: ``importlib.find_loader`` is really slated for "
"removal in Python 3.12 not 3.10, like the others in PR 25169."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42135`: 修复拼写错误：``importlib.find_loader`` 实际上计划在Python "
"3.12中移除，而不是3.10，与PR 25169中的其他内容一样。"

#: ../NEWS:25118
msgid ""
":issue:`20524`: Improves error messages on ``.format()`` operation for "
"``str``, ``float``, ``int``, and ``complex``. New format now shows the "
"problematic pattern and the object type."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20524`: 改进了 ``.format()`` 操作对于 ``str``, ``float``, ``int``, 和 "
"``complex`` 的错误消息。新的格式现在显示有问题的模式和对象类型。"

#: ../NEWS:25122
msgid ""
":issue:`45168`: Change :func:`dis.dis` output to omit op arg values that "
"cannot be resolved due to ``co_consts``, ``co_names`` etc not being "
"provided. Previously the oparg itself was repeated in the value field, which"
" is not useful and can be confusing."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45168`: 更改 :func:`dis.dis` 输出，以省略由于没有提供 ``co_consts``, ``co_names`` "
"等而无法解析的操作参数值。之前操作参数本身会在值字段中重复，这不仅没有用而且可能会造成混淆。"

#: ../NEWS:25127
msgid ""
":issue:`21302`: In Unix operating systems, :func:`time.sleep` now uses the "
"``clock_nanosleep()`` function, if available, which allows to sleep for an "
"interval specified with nanosecond precision."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21302`: 在Unix操作系统中，:func:`time.sleep` 现在使用 ``clock_nanosleep()`` "
"函数（如果可用），该函数允许以纳秒精度指定的间隔睡眠。"

#: ../NEWS:25131
msgid ""
":issue:`45173`: Remove from the :mod:`configparser` module: the "
":class:`!SafeConfigParser` class, the :attr:`!filename` property of the "
":class:`~configparser.ParsingError` class, the :meth:`!readfp` method of the"
" :class:`~configparser.ConfigParser` class, deprecated since Python 3.2."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45173`: 从 :mod:`configparser` 模块中移除：:class:`!SafeConfigParser` "
"类、:class:`~configparser.ParsingError` 类的 :attr:`!filename` "
"属性、:class:`~configparser.ConfigParser` 类的 :meth:`!readfp` 方法，这些自 Python 3.2 "
"起已被弃用。"

#: ../NEWS:25139
msgid ""
":issue:`44987`: Pure ASCII strings are now normalized in constant time by "
":func:`unicodedata.normalize`. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44987`: 纯 ASCII 字符串现在通过 :func:`unicodedata.normalize` 在常数时间内完成规范化。由 "
"Donghee Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:25142
msgid ""
":issue:`35474`: Calling :func:`mimetypes.guess_all_extensions` with "
"``strict=False`` no longer affects the result of the following call with "
"``strict=True``. Also, mutating the returned list no longer affects the "
"global state."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35474`: 使用 ``strict=False`` 调用 "
":func:`mimetypes.guess_all_extensions` 不再影响后续使用 ``strict=True`` "
"调用的结果。同时，修改返回的列表不再影响全局状态。"

#: ../NEWS:25147
msgid ""
":issue:`45166`: :func:`typing.get_type_hints` now works with "
":data:`~typing.Final` wrapped in :class:`~typing.ForwardRef`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45166`: :func:`typing.get_type_hints` 现在可以与 :data:`~typing.Final` "
"包裹在 :class:`~typing.ForwardRef` 中的情况一起工作。"

#: ../NEWS:25150
msgid ":issue:`45162`: Remove many old deprecated :mod:`unittest` features:"
msgstr ":issue:`45162`: 移除许多旧的已弃用的 :mod:`unittest` 功能："

#: ../NEWS:25152
msgid ""
"\"``fail*``\" and \"``assert*``\" aliases of :class:`~unittest.TestCase` "
"methods."
msgstr ":class:`~unittest.TestCase` 方法的 \"``fail*``\" 和 \"``assert*``\" 别名。"

#: ../NEWS:25153
msgid ""
"Broken from start :class:`~unittest.TestCase` method "
"``assertDictContainsSubset()``."
msgstr ""
"从一开始就损坏的 :class:`~unittest.TestCase` 方法 ``assertDictContainsSubset()``。"

#: ../NEWS:25154
msgid ""
"Ignored :meth:`<unittest.TestLoader.loadTestsFromModule> "
"TestLoader.loadTestsFromModule` parameter *use_load_tests*."
msgstr ""
"被忽略的 :meth:`<unittest.TestLoader.loadTestsFromModule> "
"TestLoader.loadTestsFromModule` 参数 *use_load_tests*。"

#: ../NEWS:25155
msgid "Old alias ``_TextTestResult`` of :class:`~unittest.TextTestResult`."
msgstr ":class:`~unittest.TextTestResult` 的旧别名 ``_TextTestResult``。"

#: ../NEWS:25157
msgid ""
":issue:`38371`: Remove the deprecated ``split()`` method of "
":class:`!_tkinter.TkappType`. Patch by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38371`: 移除已弃用的 :class:`!_tkinter.TkappType` 的 ``split()`` 方法。由 "
"Erlend E. Aasland 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:25160
msgid ""
":issue:`20499`: Improve the speed and accuracy of statistics.pvariance()."
msgstr ":issue:`20499`: 提高 statistics.pvariance() 的速度和准确性。"

#: ../NEWS:25162
msgid ""
":issue:`45132`: Remove :meth:`~object.__getitem__` methods of "
":class:`xml.dom.pulldom.DOMEventStream`, :class:`wsgiref.util.FileWrapper` "
"and :class:`fileinput.FileInput`, deprecated since Python 3.9."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45132`: 移除 "
":class:`xml.dom.pulldom.DOMEventStream`、:class:`wsgiref.util.FileWrapper` 和 "
":class:`fileinput.FileInput` 的 :meth:`~object.__getitem__` 方法，这些自 Python 3.9"
" 起已被弃用。"

#: ../NEWS:25168
msgid ""
":issue:`45129`: Due to significant security concerns, the *reuse_address* "
"parameter of :meth:`asyncio.loop.create_datagram_endpoint`, disabled in "
"Python 3.9, is now entirely removed. This is because of the behavior of the "
"socket option ``SO_REUSEADDR`` in UDP."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45129`: 由于重大的安全隐患，:meth:`asyncio.loop.create_datagram_endpoint` 的 "
"*reuse_address* 参数在 Python 3.9 中被禁用，现在已被完全移除。这是因为 UDP 中 socket 选项 "
"``SO_REUSEADDR`` 的行为。"

#: ../NEWS:25175
msgid ""
":issue:`45124`: The ``bdist_msi`` command, deprecated in Python 3.9, is now "
"removed."
msgstr ":issue:`45124`: 在 Python 3.9 中弃用的 ``bdist_msi`` 命令现已被移除。"

#: ../NEWS:25178
msgid "Use ``bdist_wheel`` (wheel packages) instead."
msgstr "请改用 ``bdist_wheel`` (wheel 包) 。"

#: ../NEWS:25182
msgid ""
":issue:`30856`: :class:`unittest.TestResult` methods "
":meth:`~unittest.TestResult.addFailure`, "
":meth:`~unittest.TestResult.addError`, :meth:`~unittest.TestResult.addSkip` "
"and :meth:`~unittest.TestResult.addSubTest` are now called immediately after"
" raising an exception in test or finishing a subtest. Previously they were "
"called only after finishing the test clean up."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30856`: :class:`unittest.TestResult` 的方法 "
":meth:`~unittest.TestResult.addFailure`, "
":meth:`~unittest.TestResult.addError`, :meth:`~unittest.TestResult.addSkip` "
"和 :meth:`~unittest.TestResult.addSubTest` "
"现在会在测试中引发异常或完成子测试后立即调用。之前它们仅在完成测试清理后被调用。"

#: ../NEWS:25190
msgid ""
":issue:`45034`: Changes how error is formatted for ``struct.pack`` with "
"``'H'`` and ``'h'`` modes and too large / small numbers. Now it shows the "
"actual numeric limits, while previously it was showing arithmetic "
"expressions."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45034`: 修改了 ``struct.pack`` 在 ``'H'`` 和 ``'h'`` "
"模式下对于过大/过小数字的错误格式化方式。现在它会显示实际的数字限制，而之前显示的是算术表达式。"

#: ../NEWS:25194
msgid ""
":issue:`25894`: :mod:`unittest` now always reports skipped and failed "
"subtests separately: separate characters in default mode and separate lines "
"in verbose mode. Also the test description is now output for errors in test "
"method, class and module cleanups."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25894`: :mod:`unittest` "
"现在总是单独报告跳过的和失败的子测试：默认模式下为单独的字符，详细模式下为单独的行。同时，现在在测试方法、类和模块清理的错误中也会输出测试描述。"

#: ../NEWS:25199
msgid ""
":issue:`45081`: Fix issue when dataclasses that inherit from "
"``typing.Protocol`` subclasses have wrong ``__init__``. Patch provided by "
"Yurii Karabas."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45081`: 修复了继承自 ``typing.Protocol`` 子类的数据类具有错误 ``__init__`` 的问题。由 "
"Yurii Karabas 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:25203
msgid ""
":issue:`45085`: The ``binhex`` module, deprecated in Python 3.9, is now "
"removed. The following :mod:`binascii` functions, deprecated in Python 3.9, "
"are now also removed:"
msgstr ""
":issue:`45085`: 在 Python 3.9 中已弃用的 ``binhex`` 模块现已被移除。以下在 Python 3.9 中已弃用的 "
":mod:`binascii` 函数现在也被移除了："

#: ../NEWS:25207
msgid "``a2b_hqx()``, ``b2a_hqx()``;"
msgstr "``a2b_hqx()``, ``b2a_hqx()``;"

#: ../NEWS:25208
msgid "``rlecode_hqx()``, ``rledecode_hqx()``."
msgstr "``rlecode_hqx()``, ``rledecode_hqx()``."

#: ../NEWS:25210
msgid "The :func:`binascii.crc_hqx` function remains available."
msgstr ":func:`binascii.crc_hqx` 函数仍然可用。"

#: ../NEWS:25214
msgid ""
":issue:`40360`: The :mod:`!lib2to3` package is now deprecated and may not be"
" able to parse Python 3.10 or newer. See the :pep:`617` (New PEG parser for "
"CPython). Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40360`: :mod:`!lib2to3` 包现在已被弃用，可能无法解析 Python 3.10 或更新版本。参见 "
":pep:`617` (CPython 的新 PEG 解析器) 。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:25218
msgid ""
":issue:`45075`: Rename :meth:`traceback.StackSummary.format_frame` to "
":meth:`traceback.StackSummary.format_frame_summary`. This method was added "
"for 3.11 so it was not released yet."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45075`: 将 :meth:`traceback.StackSummary.format_frame` 重命名为 "
":meth:`traceback.StackSummary.format_frame_summary`。此方法是为 3.11 添加的，因此尚未发布。"

#: ../NEWS:25222
msgid "Updated code and docs to better distinguish frame and FrameSummary."
msgstr "更新了代码和文档以更好地区分 frame 和 FrameSummary。"

#: ../NEWS:25224
msgid ""
":issue:`31299`: Add option to completely drop frames from a traceback by "
"returning ``None`` from a :meth:`~traceback.StackSummary.format_frame` "
"override."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31299`: 添加了通过从 :meth:`~traceback.StackSummary.format_frame` 覆盖返回 "
"``None`` 来完全从回溯中删除帧的选项。"

#: ../NEWS:25228
msgid ""
":issue:`41620`: :meth:`~unittest.TestCase.run` now always return a "
":class:`~unittest.TestResult` instance. Previously it returned ``None`` if "
"the test class or method was decorated with a skipping decorator."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41620`: :meth:`~unittest.TestCase.run` 现在总是返回一个 "
":class:`~unittest.TestResult` 实例。之前如果测试类或方法使用了跳过装饰器，它会返回 ``None``。"

#: ../NEWS:25232
msgid ""
":issue:`45021`: Fix a potential deadlock at shutdown of forked children when"
" using :mod:`concurrent.futures` module"
msgstr ""
":issue:`45021`: 修复了在使用 :mod:`concurrent.futures` 模块时，fork 的子进程在关闭时可能出现的死锁问题。"

#: ../NEWS:25235
msgid ""
":issue:`43913`: Fix bugs in cleaning up classes and modules in "
":mod:`unittest`:"
msgstr ":issue:`43913`: 修复了在 :mod:`unittest` 中清理类和模块时的错误："

#: ../NEWS:25237
msgid ""
"Functions registered with :func:`~unittest.addModuleCleanup` were not called"
" unless the user defines ``tearDownModule()`` in their test module."
msgstr ""
"使用 :func:`~unittest.addModuleCleanup` 注册的函数不会被调用，除非用户在测试模块中定义了 "
"``tearDownModule()``。"

#: ../NEWS:25238
msgid ""
"Functions registered with :meth:`~unittest.TestCase.addClassCleanup` were "
"not called if ``tearDownClass`` is set to ``None``."
msgstr ""
"如果 ``tearDownClass`` 设置为 ``None``，使用 "
":meth:`~unittest.TestCase.addClassCleanup` 注册的函数不会被调用。"

#: ../NEWS:25239
msgid ""
"Buffering in :class:`~unittest.TestResult` did not work with functions "
"registered with ``addClassCleanup()`` and ``addModuleCleanup()``."
msgstr ""
":class:`~unittest.TestResult` 中的缓冲功能对使用 ``addClassCleanup()`` 和 "
"``addModuleCleanup()`` 注册的函数无效。"

#: ../NEWS:25240
msgid ""
"Errors in functions registered with ``addClassCleanup()`` and "
"``addModuleCleanup()`` were not handled correctly in buffered and debug "
"modes."
msgstr ""
"在缓冲和调试模式下，使用 ``addClassCleanup()`` 和 ``addModuleCleanup()`` 注册的函数中的错误未被正确处理。"

#: ../NEWS:25241
msgid ""
"Errors in ``setUpModule()`` and functions registered with "
"``addModuleCleanup()`` were reported in wrong order."
msgstr "``setUpModule()`` 和使用 ``addModuleCleanup()`` 注册的函数中的错误以错误的顺序报告。"

#: ../NEWS:25242
msgid "And several lesser bugs."
msgstr "以及几个较小的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:25244
msgid ""
":issue:`45030`: Fix integer overflow in pickling and copying the range "
"iterator."
msgstr ":issue:`45030`: 修复了在序列化和复制 range 迭代器时的整数溢出问题。"

#: ../NEWS:25247
msgid ""
":issue:`45001`: Made email date parsing more robust against malformed input,"
" namely a whitespace-only ``Date:`` header. Patch by Wouter Bolsterlee."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45001`: 使电子邮件日期解析对格式错误的输入更加健壮，特别是针对仅包含空白的 ``Date:`` 头。由 Wouter "
"Bolsterlee 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:25250
msgid ""
":issue:`45010`: Remove support of special method ``__div__`` in "
":mod:`unittest.mock`. It is not used in Python 3."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45010`: 移除了 :mod:`unittest.mock` 中对特殊方法 ``__div__`` 的支持。它在 Python 3 "
"中未使用。"

#: ../NEWS:25253
msgid ""
":issue:`39218`: Improve accuracy of variance calculations by using ``x*x`` "
"instead of ``x**2``."
msgstr ":issue:`39218`: 通过使用 ``x*x`` 而非 ``x**2`` 来提高方差计算的准确性。"

#: ../NEWS:25256
msgid ""
":issue:`43613`: Improve the speed of :func:`gzip.compress` and "
":func:`gzip.decompress` by compressing and decompressing at once in memory "
"instead of in a streamed fashion."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43613`: 通过一次性在内存中压缩和解压缩，而不是流式处理，提高了 :func:`gzip.compress` 和 "
":func:`gzip.decompress` 的速度。"

#: ../NEWS:25260
msgid ""
":issue:`37596`: Ensure that :class:`set` and :class:`frozenset` objects are "
"always :mod:`marshalled <marshal>` reproducibly."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37596`: 确保 :class:`set` 和 :class:`frozenset` 对象总是可以重复 "
":mod:`marshalled <marshal>`。"

#: ../NEWS:25263
msgid ""
":issue:`44019`: A new function ``operator.call`` has been added, such that "
"``operator.call(obj, *args, **kwargs) == obj(*args, **kwargs)``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44019`: 新增了一个函数 ``operator.call``，使得 ``operator.call(obj, *args, "
"**kwargs) == obj(*args, **kwargs)``。"

#: ../NEWS:25266
msgid ""
":issue:`42255`: :class:`!webbrowser.MacOSX` is deprecated and will be "
"removed in Python 3.13. It is untested and undocumented and also not used by"
" :mod:`webbrowser` itself. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42255`: 类 :class:`!webbrowser.MacOSX` 已被弃用，并将在 Python 3.13 "
"中移除。它未经测试、未记录，且未被 :mod:`webbrowser` 自身使用。由 Donghee Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:25270
msgid ""
":issue:`44955`: Method :meth:`~unittest.TestResult.stopTestRun` is now "
"always called in pair with method :meth:`~unittest.TestResult.startTestRun` "
"for :class:`~unittest.TestResult` objects implicitly created in "
":meth:`~unittest.TestCase.run`. Previously it was not called for test "
"methods and classes decorated with a skipping decorator."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44955`: 对于 :meth:`~unittest.TestCase.run` 中隐式创建的 "
":class:`~unittest.TestResult` 对象，方法 :meth:`~unittest.TestResult.stopTestRun`"
" 现在总是与方法 :meth:`~unittest.TestResult.startTestRun` "
"成对调用。之前，对于使用跳过装饰器装饰的测试方法和类，它不会被调用。"

#: ../NEWS:25276
msgid ""
":issue:`39039`: tarfile.open raises :exc:`~tarfile.ReadError` when a zlib "
"error occurs during file extraction."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39039`: 当文件提取过程中发生 zlib 错误时，tarfile.open 会引发 "
":exc:`~tarfile.ReadError`。"

#: ../NEWS:25279
msgid ""
":issue:`44935`: :mod:`subprocess` on Solaris now also uses "
":func:`os.posix_spawn` for better performance."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44935`: Solaris 上的 :mod:`subprocess` 现在也使用 :func:`os.posix_spawn` "
"以提高性能。"

#: ../NEWS:25282
msgid ""
":issue:`44911`: :class:`~unittest.IsolatedAsyncioTestCase` will no longer "
"throw an exception while cancelling leaked tasks. Patch by Bar Harel."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44911`: :class:`~unittest.IsolatedAsyncioTestCase` 在取消泄漏任务时将不再抛出异常。由"
" Bar Harel 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:25285
msgid ""
":issue:`41322`: Added ``DeprecationWarning`` for tests and async tests that "
"return a value!=None (as this may indicate an improperly written test, for "
"example a test written as a generator function)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41322`: 为返回值!=None 的测试和异步测试添加了 ``DeprecationWarning`` "
"(因为这可能表明测试编写不当，例如将测试编写为生成器函数) 。"

#: ../NEWS:25289
msgid ""
":issue:`44524`: Make exception message more useful when subclass from typing"
" special form alias. Patch provided by Yurii Karabas."
msgstr ":issue:`44524`: 当从 typing 特殊形式别名子类化时，使异常消息更有用。由 Yurii Karabas 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:25292
msgid ""
":issue:`38956`: :class:`argparse.BooleanOptionalAction`'s default value is "
"no longer printed twice when used with "
":class:`argparse.ArgumentDefaultsHelpFormatter`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38956`: 当与 :class:`argparse.ArgumentDefaultsHelpFormatter` "
"一起使用时，:class:`argparse.BooleanOptionalAction` 的默认值不再打印两次。"

#: ../NEWS:25296
msgid ""
":issue:`44860`: Fix the ``posix_user`` scheme in :mod:`sysconfig` to not "
"depend on :data:`sys.platlibdir`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44860`: 修复 :mod:`sysconfig` 中的 ``posix_user`` 方案，使其不依赖于 "
":data:`sys.platlibdir`。"

#: ../NEWS:25299
msgid ""
":issue:`44859`: Improve error handling in :mod:`sqlite3` and raise more "
"accurate exceptions."
msgstr ":issue:`44859`: 改进 :mod:`sqlite3` 中的错误处理，并引发更准确的异常。"

#: ../NEWS:25302
msgid ""
":exc:`MemoryError` is now raised instead of :exc:`sqlite3.Warning` when "
"memory is not enough for encoding a statement to UTF-8 in "
"``Connection.__call__()`` and ``Cursor.execute()``."
msgstr ""
"在 ``Connection.__call__()`` 和 ``Cursor.execute()`` 中，当内存不足以将语句编码为 UTF-8 "
"时，现在会引发 :exc:`MemoryError` 而不是 :exc:`sqlite3.Warning`。"

#: ../NEWS:25303
msgid ""
":exc:`UnicodEncodeError` is now raised instead of :exc:`sqlite3.Warning` "
"when the statement contains surrogate characters in "
"``Connection.__call__()`` and ``Cursor.execute()``."
msgstr ""
"在 ``Connection.__call__()`` 和 ``Cursor.execute()`` 中，当语句包含代理字符时，现在会引发 "
":exc:`UnicodEncodeError` 而不是 :exc:`sqlite3.Warning`。"

#: ../NEWS:25304
msgid ""
":exc:`TypeError` is now raised instead of :exc:`ValueError` for non-string "
"script argument in ``Cursor.executescript()``."
msgstr ""
"在 ``Cursor.executescript()`` 中，对于非字符串脚本参数，现在会引发 :exc:`TypeError` 而不是 "
":exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../NEWS:25305
msgid ""
":exc:`ValueError` is now raised for script containing the null character "
"instead of truncating it in ``Cursor.executescript()``."
msgstr ""
"在 ``Cursor.executescript()`` 中，对于包含空字符的脚本，现在会引发 :exc:`ValueError` 而不是截断它。"

#: ../NEWS:25306
msgid ""
"Correctly handle exceptions raised when getting boolean value of the result "
"of the progress handler."
msgstr "正确处理获取进度处理器结果的布尔值时引发的异常。"

#: ../NEWS:25307
msgid "Add many tests covering different corner cases."
msgstr "添加了许多测试，覆盖了不同的边缘情况。"

#: ../NEWS:25309
msgid ":issue:`44581`: Upgrade bundled pip to 21.2.3 and setuptools to 57.4.0"
msgstr ":issue:`44581`: 将捆绑的 pip 升级到 21.2.3 和 setuptools 到 57.4.0。"

#: ../NEWS:25311
msgid ""
":issue:`44849`: Fix the :func:`os.set_inheritable` function on FreeBSD 14 "
"for file descriptor opened with the :const:`~os.O_PATH` flag: ignore the "
":const:`~errno.EBADF` error on ``ioctl()``, fallback on the ``fcntl()`` "
"implementation. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44849`: 修复 FreeBSD 14 上 :func:`os.set_inheritable` 函数对于以 "
":const:`~os.O_PATH` 标志打开的文件描述符的问题：忽略 ``ioctl()`` 上的 :const:`~errno.EBADF` "
"错误，回退到 ``fcntl()`` 实现。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:25316
msgid ""
":issue:`44605`: The @functools.total_ordering() decorator now works with "
"metaclasses."
msgstr ":issue:`44605`: @functools.total_ordering() 装饰器现在可以与元类一起工作。"

#: ../NEWS:25319
msgid ""
":issue:`44524`: Fixed an issue wherein the ``__name__`` and ``__qualname__``"
" attributes of subscribed specialforms could be ``None``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44524`: 修复了一个问题，其中订阅的特殊形式的 ``__name__`` 和 ``__qualname__`` 属性可能是 "
"``None``。"

#: ../NEWS:25322
msgid ""
":issue:`44839`: :class:`MemoryError` raised in user-defined functions will "
"now produce a ``MemoryError`` in :mod:`sqlite3`. :class:`OverflowError` will"
" now be converted to :class:`~sqlite3.DataError`. Previously "
":class:`~sqlite3.OperationalError` was produced in these cases."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44839`: 在用户定义函数中引发的 :class:`MemoryError` 现在会在 :mod:`sqlite3` 中产生一个 "
"``MemoryError``。:class:`OverflowError` 现在会被转换为 "
":class:`~sqlite3.DataError`。以前在这些情况下会产生 :class:`~sqlite3.OperationalError`。"

#: ../NEWS:25327
msgid ""
":issue:`44822`: :mod:`sqlite3` user-defined functions and aggregators "
"returning :class:`strings <str>` with embedded NUL characters are no longer "
"truncated. Patch by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44822`: :mod:`sqlite3` 用户定义的函数和聚合器返回带有嵌入 NUL 字符的 :class:`strings "
"<str>` 不再被截断。由 Erlend E. Aasland 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:25331
msgid ""
":issue:`44801`: Ensure that the :class:`~typing.ParamSpec` variable in "
"Callable can only be substituted with a parameters expression (a list of "
"types, an ellipsis, ParamSpec or Concatenate)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44801`: 确保 Callable 中的 :class:`~typing.ParamSpec` "
"变量只能被参数表达式（类型列表、省略号、ParamSpec 或 Concatenate）替换。"

#: ../NEWS:25335
msgid ""
":issue:`44806`: Non-protocol subclasses of :class:`typing.Protocol` ignore "
"now the ``__init__`` method inherited from protocol base classes."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44806`: :class:`typing.Protocol` 的非协议子类现在会忽略从协议基类继承的 ``__init__`` "
"方法。"

#: ../NEWS:25338
msgid ""
":issue:`27275`: :meth:`collections.OrderedDict.popitem` and "
":meth:`collections.OrderedDict.pop` no longer call ``__getitem__`` and "
"``__delitem__`` methods of the OrderedDict subclasses."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27275`: :meth:`collections.OrderedDict.popitem` 和 "
":meth:`collections.OrderedDict.pop` 不再调用 OrderedDict 子类的 ``__getitem__`` 和 "
"``__delitem__`` 方法。"

#: ../NEWS:25342
msgid ""
":issue:`44793`: Fix checking the number of arguments when subscribe a "
"generic type with ``ParamSpec`` parameter."
msgstr ":issue:`44793`: 修复在订阅带有 ``ParamSpec`` 参数的泛型类型时检查参数数量的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:25345
msgid ""
":issue:`44784`: In importlib.metadata tests, override warnings behavior "
"under expected DeprecationWarnings (importlib_metadata 4.6.3)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44784`: 在 importlib.metadata 测试中，覆盖在预期的 DeprecationWarnings "
"下的警告行为（importlib_metadata 4.6.3）。"

#: ../NEWS:25348
msgid ""
":issue:`44667`: The :func:`tokenize.tokenize` doesn't incorrectly generate a"
" ``NEWLINE`` token if the source doesn't end with a new line character but "
"the last line is a comment, as the function is already generating a ``NL`` "
"token. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":issue:`44667`: :func:`tokenize.tokenize` 不会在源代码不以换行符结束但最后一行是注释时错误地生成 "
"``NEWLINE`` 令牌，因为该函数已经生成了一个 ``NL`` 令牌。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:25353
msgid ""
":issue:`44771`: Added ``importlib.simple`` module implementing adapters from"
" a low-level resources reader interface to a ``TraversableResources`` "
"interface. Legacy API (``path``, ``contents``, ...) is now supported "
"entirely by the ``.files()`` API with a compatibility shim supplied for "
"resource loaders without that functionality. Feature parity with "
"``importlib_resources`` 5.2."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44771`: 添加了 ``importlib.simple`` 模块，实现了从低级资源读取器接口到 "
"``TraversableResources`` 接口的适配器。旧版 API（``path``、``contents`` 等）现在完全由 "
"``.files()`` API 支持，并为不具备该功能的资源加载器提供了兼容性垫片。与 ``importlib_resources`` 5.2 "
"功能对等。"

#: ../NEWS:25360
msgid ""
":issue:`44752`: :mod:`rcompleter` does not call :func:`getattr` on "
":class:`property` objects to avoid the side-effect of  evaluating the "
"corresponding method."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44752`: :mod:`rcompleter` 不在 :class:`property` 对象上调用 :func:`getattr`"
" 以避免评估相应方法的副作用。"

#: ../NEWS:25364
msgid ""
":issue:`44747`: Refactor usage of ``sys._getframe`` in ``typing`` module. "
"Patch provided by Yurii Karabas."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44747`: 重构 ``typing`` 模块中 ``sys._getframe`` 的使用。补丁由 Yurii Karabas "
"提供。"

#: ../NEWS:25367
msgid ""
":issue:`42378`: Fixes the issue with log file being overwritten when "
":class:`logging.FileHandler` is used in :mod:`atexit` with *filemode* set to"
" ``'w'``. Note this will cause the message in *atexit* not being logged if "
"the log stream is already closed due to shutdown of logging."
