msgstr ":issue:`44852`: 添加了在运行回归测试套件时全面静默 DeprecationWarnings 的能力。"

#: ../NEWS:26065
msgid ""
":issue:`40928`: Notify users running test_decimal regression tests on macOS "
"of potential harmless \"malloc can't allocate region\" messages spewed by "
"test_decimal."
msgstr ""
