msgid ":issue:`44734`: Fixed floating-point precision issue in turtle tests."
msgstr ":issue:`44734`: 修复了 turtle 测试中的浮点精度问题。"

#: ../NEWS:26071
msgid ""
":issue:`44708`: Regression tests, when run with -w, are now re-running only "
"the affected test methods instead of re-running the entire test file."
msgstr ":issue:`44708`: 回归测试现在在使用 -w 运行时，仅重新运行受影响的测试方法，而不是重新运行整个测试文件。"

#: ../NEWS:26074
msgid ""
":issue:`42095`: Added interop tests for Apple plists: generate plist files "
"with Python plistlib and parse with Apple plutil; and the other way round."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42095`: 添加了 Apple plists 的互操作性测试：用 Python plistlib 生成 plist 文件并用 "
"Apple plutil 解析；反之亦然。"

#: ../NEWS:26077
msgid ""
":issue:`44647`: Added a permanent Unicode-valued environment variable to "
"regression tests to ensure they handle this use case in the future. If your "
"test environment breaks because of that, report a bug to us, and temporarily"
" set PYTHONREGRTEST_UNICODE_GUARD=0 in your test environment."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44647`: 向回归测试添加了一个永久的 Unicode "
"值环境变量，以确保它们将来能处理这种用例。如果您的测试环境因此中断，请向我们报告错误，并在测试环境中临时设置 "
"PYTHONREGRTEST_UNICODE_GUARD=0。"

#: ../NEWS:26082
msgid ""
":issue:`44515`: Adjust recently added contextlib tests to avoid assuming the"
" use of a refcounted GC"
msgstr ":issue:`44515`: 调整最近添加的contextlib测试，避免假设使用引用计数的垃圾回收。"

#: ../NEWS:26085
msgid ""
":issue:`44287`: Fix asyncio test_popen() of test_windows_utils by using a "
"longer timeout. Use military grade battle-tested "
":data:`test.support.SHORT_TIMEOUT` timeout rather than a hardcoded timeout "
"of 10 seconds: it's 30 seconds by default, but it is made longer on slow "
"buildbots. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44287`: "
"通过使用更长的超时时间来修复asyncio的test_popen()测试_windows_utils。使用军用级经过实战检验的 "
":data:`test.support.SHORT_TIMEOUT` "
"超时而不是硬编码的10秒超时：默认为30秒，但在慢速构建机器人上会更长。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:26091
msgid ""
":issue:`44451`: Reset ``DeprecationWarning`` filters in "
"``test.test_importlib.test_metadata_api.APITests.test_entry_points_by_index``"
" to avoid ``StopIteration`` error if ``DeprecationWarnings`` are ignored."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44451`: "
"在``test.test_importlib.test_metadata_api.APITests.test_entry_points_by_index``中重置``DeprecationWarning``过滤器，以避免如果"
" ``DeprecationWarnings`` 被忽略时出现``StopIteration``错误。"

#: ../NEWS:26095
msgid ""
":issue:`44363`: Account for address sanitizer in test_capi. test_capi now "
"passes when run GCC address sanitizer."
msgstr ":issue:`44363`: 在test_capi中考虑地址消毒器。当运行GCC地址消毒器时，test_capi现在可以通过。"

#: ../NEWS:26098
msgid ":issue:`44364`: Add non integral tests for :func:`math.sqrt` function."
msgstr ":issue:`44364`: 为 :func:`math.sqrt` 函数添加非整数测试。"

#: ../NEWS:26100
msgid ""
":issue:`43921`: Fix test_ssl.test_wrong_cert_tls13(): use "
"``suppress_ragged_eofs=False``, since ``read()`` can raise "
":exc:`ssl.SSLEOFError` on Windows. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
