#: ../NEWS:26104
msgid ""
":issue:`43921`: Fix test_pha_required_nocert() of test_ssl: catch two more "
"EOF cases (when the ``recv()`` method returns an empty string). Patch by "
"Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43921`: "
