" Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:26108
msgid ""
":issue:`44131`: Add test_frozenmain to test_embed to test the "
":c:func:`Py_FrozenMain` C function. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44131`: 在test_embed中添加test_frozenmain以测试 :c:func:`Py_FrozenMain` "
"C函数。补丁由Victor Stinner提供。"

#: ../NEWS:26111
msgid ":issue:`31904`: Ignore error string case in test_file_not_exists()."
msgstr ":issue:`31904`: 在test_file_not_exists()中忽略错误字符串的大小写。"

#: ../NEWS:26113
msgid ""
":issue:`42083`: Add test to check that ``PyStructSequence_NewType`` accepts "
"a ``PyStructSequence_Desc`` with ``doc`` field set to ``NULL``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42083`: 添加测试以检查 ``PyStructSequence_NewType`` 是否接受 ``doc`` "
"字段设置为``NULL``的 ``PyStructSequence_Desc``。"

#: ../NEWS:26116
msgid ""
":issue:`35753`: Fix crash in doctest when doctest parses modules that "
"include unwrappable functions by skipping those functions."
msgstr ":issue:`35753`: 通过跳过那些函数来修复doctest在解析包含不可包装函数的模块时的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:26119
msgid ""
":issue:`30256`: Add test for nested queues when using ``multiprocessing`` "
"shared objects ``AutoProxy[Queue]`` inside ``ListProxy`` and ``DictProxy``"
msgstr ""
":issue:`30256`: 添加嵌套队列的测试，当在 ``ListProxy`` 和 ``DictProxy`` "
"中使用``multiprocessing``共享对象 ``AutoProxy[Queue]`` 时。"

#: ../NEWS:26125
msgid ""
":issue:`45220`: Avoid building with the Windows 11 SDK previews "
