"by-one assertion problem. The assert was not correct."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40263`: 这是 https://bugs.python.org/issue26903 "
"的后续错误。一旦应用了该修复，我们会遇到一个差一的断言问题。该断言不正确。"

#: ../NEWS:26199
msgid ":issue:`45007`: Update macOS installer builds to use OpenSSL 1.1.1l."
msgstr ":issue:`45007`: 更新 macOS 安装程序构建以使用 OpenSSL 1.1.1l。"

