":issue:`34932`: 为 macOS 添加 socket.TCP_KEEPALIVE 支持。由 Shane Harvey 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:26225
msgid ""
":issue:`45296`: On Windows, change exit/quit message to suggest Ctrl-D, "
