#: ../NEWS:26228
msgid ":issue:`45193`: Make completion boxes appear on Ubuntu again."
msgstr ":issue:`45193`: 使完成框在 Ubuntu 上再次出现。"

#: ../NEWS:26230
msgid ""
":issue:`40128`: Mostly fix completions on macOS when not using tcl/tk 8.6.11"
