"patterns>`。然而，这种高亮显示并不完美，在某些罕见情况下会不正确，包括一些 ``case`` 模式中的 ``_``。"

#: ../NEWS:26253
msgid ""
":issue:`44026`: Include interpreter's typo fix suggestions in message line "
"for NameErrors and AttributeErrors.  Patch by E. Paine."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44026`: 在NameErrors和AttributeErrors的消息行中包含解释器的拼写修正建议。由E. Paine提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:26259
msgid ""
":issue:`44786`: Fix a warning in regular expression in the c-analyzer "
"script."
msgstr ":issue:`44786`: 修复c-analyzer脚本中正则表达式的警告。"

#: ../NEWS:26261
msgid ""
":issue:`44967`: pydoc now returns a non-zero status code when a module "
"cannot be found."
msgstr ":issue:`44967`: 当模块无法找到时，pydoc现在返回非零状态码。"

#: ../NEWS:26264
msgid ""
":issue:`44978`: Allow the Argument Clinic tool to handle ``__complex__`` "
"special methods."
msgstr ":issue:`44978`: 允许Argument Clinic工具处理 ``__complex__`` 特殊方法。"

#: ../NEWS:26267
msgid ""
":issue:`43425`: Removed the 'test2to3' demo project that demonstrated using "
"lib2to3 to support Python 2.x and Python 3.x from a single source in a "
"distutils package. Patch by Donghee Na"
msgstr ""
