#: ../NEWS:26294
msgid ""
":issue:`45061`: Add a deallocator to the :class:`bool` type to detect "
"refcount bugs in C extensions which call ``Py_DECREF(Py_True);`` or "
"``Py_DECREF(Py_False);`` by mistake. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45061`: 为 :class:`bool` 类型添加一个析构器，以检测 C 扩展中错误调用 "
"``Py_DECREF(Py_True);`` 或 ``Py_DECREF(Py_False);`` 的引用计数错误。由 Victor Stinner "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:26298
msgid ""
":issue:`42035`: Add a new :c:func:`PyType_GetQualName` function to get "
"type's qualified name."
msgstr ":issue:`42035`: 添加一个新的 :c:func:`PyType_GetQualName` 函数以获取类型的限定名称。"

#: ../NEWS:26301
msgid ""
":issue:`41103`: Reverts removal of the old buffer protocol because they are "
"part of stable ABI."
msgstr ":issue:`41103`: 恢复旧缓冲区协议的移除，因为它们是稳定 ABI 的一部分。"

#: ../NEWS:26304
msgid ""
":issue:`44751`: Remove ``crypt.h`` include from the public ``Python.h`` "
"header."
msgstr ":issue:`44751`: 从公共 ``Python.h`` 头文件中移除 ``crypt.h`` 包含。"

#: ../NEWS:26306
msgid ""
":issue:`42747`: The ``Py_TPFLAGS_HAVE_VERSION_TAG`` type flag now does "
"nothing. The ``Py_TPFLAGS_HAVE_AM_SEND`` flag (which was added in 3.10) is "
"removed. Both were unnecessary because it is not possible to have type "
"objects with the relevant fields missing."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42747`: ``Py_TPFLAGS_HAVE_VERSION_TAG`` "
"类型标志现在不做任何事情。``Py_TPFLAGS_HAVE_AM_SEND`` 标志（在 3.10 "
"中添加）被移除。这两者都是不必要的，因为不可能有相关字段缺失的类型对象。"

#: ../NEWS:26311
msgid ""
":issue:`44530`: Added the ``co_qualname`` to the ``PyCodeObject`` structure "
"to propagate the qualified name from the compiler to code objects."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44530`: 向 ``PyCodeObject`` 结构添加 ``co_qualname``，以将限定名称从编译器传播到代码对象。"

#: ../NEWS:26314
msgid "Patch by Gabriele N. Tornetta"
msgstr "由 Gabriele N. Tornetta 提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:26316
msgid ""
":issue:`44441`: :c:func:`Py_RunMain` now resets :c:data:`PyImport_Inittab` "
"to its initial value at exit. It must be possible to call "
":c:func:`PyImport_AppendInittab` or :c:func:`PyImport_ExtendInittab` at each"
" Python initialization. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44441`: 现在 :c:func:`Py_RunMain` 会在退出时将 :c:data:`PyImport_Inittab` "
"重围为其初始值。 必须能够在每次 Python 初始化时调用 :c:func:`PyImport_AppendInittab` 或 "
":c:func:`PyImport_ExtendInittab`。 由 Victor Stinner 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:26321
msgid ""
":issue:`39947`: Remove 4 private trashcan C API functions which were only "
"kept for the backward compatibility of the stable ABI with Python 3.8 and "
"older, since the trashcan API was not usable with the limited C API on "
"Python 3.8 and older. The trashcan API was excluded from the limited C API "
"in Python 3.9."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39947`: 移除 4 个私有的 trashcan C API 函数，这些函数仅为了保持与 Python 3.8 及更早版本的稳定 "
"ABI 的向后兼容性而保留，因为在 Python 3.8 及更早版本中，trashcan API 无法与有限的 C API 一起使用。trashcan "
"API 在 Python 3.9 中被排除在有限的 C API 之外。"

#: ../NEWS:26327
msgid "Removed functions:"
msgstr "已移除的函数："

#: ../NEWS:26329
msgid "_PyTrash_deposit_object()"
msgstr "_PyTrash_deposit_object()"

#: ../NEWS:26330
msgid "_PyTrash_destroy_chain()"
msgstr "_PyTrash_destroy_chain()"

#: ../NEWS:26331
msgid "_PyTrash_thread_deposit_object()"
msgstr "_PyTrash_thread_deposit_object()"

#: ../NEWS:26332
msgid "_PyTrash_thread_destroy_chain()"
msgstr "_PyTrash_thread_destroy_chain()"

#: ../NEWS:26334
msgid ""
"The trashcan C API was never usable with the limited C API, since old "
"trashcan macros accessed directly :c:type:`PyThreadState` members like "
"``_tstate->trash_delete_nesting``, whereas the :c:type:`PyThreadState` "
"structure is opaque in the limited C API."
msgstr ""
"垃圾回收C API从未能与有限的C API一起使用，因为旧的垃圾回收宏直接访问了 :c:type:`PyThreadState` 成员如 "
"``_tstate->trash_delete_nesting``，而 :c:type:`PyThreadState` 结构在有限的C "
"API中是不透明的。"

#: ../NEWS:26339
msgid "Exclude also the ``PyTrash_UNWIND_LEVEL`` constant from the C API."
msgstr "同时从C API中排除 ``PyTrash_UNWIND_LEVEL`` 常量。"

#: ../NEWS:26343
msgid ""
":issue:`40939`: Removed documentation for the removed ``PyParser_*`` C API."
msgstr ":issue:`40939`: 移除了关于已移除的 ``PyParser_*`` C API的文档。"

#: ../NEWS:26345
msgid ""
":issue:`43795`: The list in :ref:`limited-api-list` now shows the public "
"name :c:struct:`PyFrameObject` rather than ``_frame``. The non-existing "
"entry ``_node`` no longer appears in the list."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43795`: :ref:`limited-api-list` 中的列表现在显示公共名称 "
":c:struct:`PyFrameObject` 而非 ``_frame``。列表中不再出现不存在的条目 ``_node``。"

#: ../NEWS:26349
msgid ""
":issue:`44378`: :c:func:`Py_IS_TYPE` no longer uses :c:func:`Py_TYPE` to "
"avoid a compiler warning: no longer cast ``const PyObject*`` to "
"``PyObject*``. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44378`: :c:func:`Py_IS_TYPE` 不再使用 :c:func:`Py_TYPE` "
"以避免编译器警告：不再将``const PyObject*``强制转换为 ``PyObject*``。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:26353
msgid ""
":issue:`39573`: Convert the :c:func:`Py_TYPE` and :c:func:`Py_SIZE` macros "
"to static inline functions. The :c:func:`Py_SET_TYPE` and "
":c:func:`Py_SET_SIZE` functions must now be used to set an object type and "
"size. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39573`: 将 :c:func:`Py_TYPE` 和 :c:func:`Py_SIZE` 宏转换为静态内联函数。现在必须使用 "
":c:func:`Py_SET_TYPE` 和 :c:func:`Py_SET_SIZE` 函数来设置对象类型和大小。由Victor "
"Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:26358
msgid ""
":issue:`44263`: The :c:func:`PyType_Ready` function now raises an error if a"
" type is defined with the :c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_HAVE_GC` flag set but has no "
"traverse function (:c:member:`PyTypeObject.tp_traverse`). Patch by Victor "
"Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44263`: 如果类型定义时设置了 :c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_HAVE_GC` "
"标志但没有遍历函数(:c:member:`PyTypeObject.tp_traverse`)，:c:func:`PyType_Ready` "
"函数现在会引发错误。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:26363
msgid ""
":issue:`43795`: The undocumented function :c:func:`Py_FrozenMain` is removed"
" from the Limited API."
msgstr ":issue:`43795`: 未记录的函数 :c:func:`Py_FrozenMain` 已从有限API中移除。"

