msgstr ""
":gh:`47383`: :class:`typing.ParamSpec` 的 ``P.args`` 和 ``P.kwargs`` 属性现在是新类 "
":class:`typing.ParamSpecArgs` 和 :class:`typing.ParamSpecKwargs` 的实例，这使得 "
"``repr()`` 更加有用。由 Jelle Zijlstra 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:26791
msgid ""
":issue:`43731`: Add an ``encoding`` parameter :func:`logging.fileConfig`."
msgstr ":issue:`43731`: 为 :func:`logging.fileConfig` 添加了一个 ``encoding`` 参数。"

#: ../NEWS:26793
msgid ""
":issue:`43712`: Add ``encoding`` and ``errors`` parameters to "
":func:`fileinput.input` and :class:`fileinput.FileInput`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43712`: 为 :func:`fileinput.input` 和 :class:`fileinput.FileInput` 添加了"
" ``encoding`` 和 ``errors`` 参数。"

#: ../NEWS:26796
msgid ""
":issue:`38659`: A ``simple_enum`` decorator is added to the ``enum`` module "
"to convert a normal class into an Enum. ``test_simple_enum`` added to test "
"simple enums against a corresponding normal Enum.  Standard library modules "
"updated to use ``simple_enum``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38659`: 向 ``enum`` 模块添加了一个 ``simple_enum`` 装饰器，用于将普通类转换为 Enum。添加了 "
"``test_simple_enum`` 来测试简单枚举与相应的普通枚举。更新了标准库模块以使用 ``simple_enum``。"

#: ../NEWS:26801
msgid ""
":issue:`43764`: Fix an issue where :data:`~object.__match_args__` generation"
" could fail for some :mod:`dataclasses`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43764`: 修复了某些 :mod:`dataclasses` 中 :data:`~object.__match_args__` "
"生成可能失败的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:26804
msgid ""
":issue:`43752`: Fix :mod:`sqlite3` regression for zero-sized blobs with "
"converters, where ``b\"\"`` was returned instead of ``None``. The regression"
" was introduced by PR 24723. Patch by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43752`: 修复了带有转换器的零大小 blob 的 :mod:`sqlite3` 回归问题，其中返回了 ``b\"\"`` 而不是 "
"``None``。这个回归是由 PR 24723 引入的。由 Erlend E. Aasland 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:26808
msgid ""
":issue:`43655`: :mod:`tkinter` dialog windows are now recognized as dialogs "
"by window managers on macOS and X Window."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43655`: :mod:`tkinter` 对话框窗口现在被 macOS 和 X Window 上的窗口管理器识别为对话框。"

