#: ../NEWS:26932
msgid ""
":issue:`36076`: Added SNI support to :func:`ssl.get_server_certificate`."
msgstr ":issue:`36076`: 为 :func:`ssl.get_server_certificate` 添加了 SNI 支持。"

#: ../NEWS:26934
