#: ../NEWS:26952
msgid ""
":issue:`43959`: The documentation on the PyContextVar C-API was clarified."
msgstr ":issue:`43959`: 澄清了关于 PyContextVar C-API 的文档。"

#: ../NEWS:26954
msgid ""
":issue:`43938`: Update dataclasses documentation to express that "
