#: ../NEWS:26970
msgid ""
":issue:`43961`: Fix test_logging.test_namer_rotator_inheritance() on "
"Windows: use :func:`os.replace` rather than :func:`os.rename`. Patch by "
"Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43961`: 在 Windows 上修复 "
"test_logging.test_namer_rotator_inheritance()：使用 :func:`os.replace` 而不是 "
":func:`os.rename`。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:26974
msgid ""
":issue:`43842`: Fix a race condition in the SMTP test of test_logging. Don't"
