"现在如果一个线程抛出异常但没有捕获它，则将测试标记为ENV_CHANGED（改变了执行环境）。它在 "
":func:`threading.excepthook` 上设置了一个钩子。使用``--fail-env-"
"changed``选项将测试标记为失败。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:26984
msgid ""
":issue:`43811`: Tests multiple OpenSSL versions on GitHub Actions. Use "
"ccache to speed up testing."
msgstr ":issue:`43811`: 在GitHub Actions上测试多个OpenSSL版本。使用ccache加速测试。"

#: ../NEWS:26987
msgid ""
":issue:`43791`: OpenSSL 3.0.0: Disable testing of legacy protocols TLS 1.0 "
"and 1.1. Tests are failing with TLSV1_ALERT_INTERNAL_ERROR."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43791`: OpenSSL 3.0.0：禁用对旧协议TLS "
"1.0和1.1的测试。测试因TLSV1_ALERT_INTERNAL_ERROR而失败。"

#: ../NEWS:26993
msgid ""
":issue:`43567`: Improved generated code refresh "
"(AST/tokens/opcodes/keywords) on Windows."
msgstr ":issue:`43567`: 改进了Windows上生成的代码刷新（AST/tokens/opcodes/keywords）。"

#: ../NEWS:26996
msgid ""
":issue:`43669`: Implement :pep:`644`. Python now requires OpenSSL 1.1.1 or "
"newer."
msgstr ":issue:`43669`: 实现 :pep:`644`。Python现在需要OpenSSL 1.1.1或更新版本。"

#: ../NEWS:27002
msgid ""
":issue:`35306`: Adds additional arguments to :func:`os.startfile` function."
msgstr ":issue:`35306`: 向 :func:`os.startfile` 函数添加额外的参数。"

#: ../NEWS:27004
msgid ""
":issue:`43538`: Avoid raising errors from :meth:`pathlib.Path.exists` when "
"passed an invalid filename."
msgstr ":issue:`43538`: 避免在传递无效文件名时从 :meth:`pathlib.Path.exists` 引发错误。"

#: ../NEWS:27007
msgid ""
":issue:`38822`: Fixed :func:`os.stat` failing on inaccessible directories "
"with a trailing slash, rather than falling back to the parent directory's "
"metadata. This implicitly affected :func:`os.path.exists` and "
":func:`os.path.isdir`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38822`: 修复了 :func:`os.stat` "
"在无法访问的目录（带有尾部斜杠）上失败的问题，而不是回退到父目录的元数据。这隐式影响了 :func:`os.path.exists` 和 "
":func:`os.path.isdir`。"

#: ../NEWS:27012
msgid ""
":issue:`26227`: Fixed decoding of host names in :func:`socket.gethostbyaddr`"
" and :func:`socket.gethostbyname_ex`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26227`: 修复了 :func:`socket.gethostbyaddr` 和 "
":func:`socket.gethostbyname_ex` 中主机名的解码。"

#: ../NEWS:27015
msgid ""
":issue:`40432`: Updated pegen regeneration script on Windows to find and use"
" Python 3.8 or higher.  Prior to this, pegen regeneration already required "
"3.8 or higher, but the script may have used lower versions of Python."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40432`: 更新了Windows上的pegen再生脚本，以查找并使用Python "
"3.8或更高版本。在此之前，pegen再生已经需要3.8或更高版本，但脚本可能使用了较低版本的Python。"

#: ../NEWS:27019
msgid ""
":issue:`43745`: Actually updates Windows release to OpenSSL 1.1.1k. Earlier "
"releases were mislabelled and actually included 1.1.1i again."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43745`: 实际上将Windows版本更新到OpenSSL 1.1.1k。早期的版本被错误标记，实际上再次包含了1.1.1i。"

#: ../NEWS:27022
msgid ":issue:`43652`: Update Tcl and Tk to 8.6.11 in Windows installer."
msgstr ":issue:`43652`: 在Windows安装程序中更新Tcl和Tk到8.6.11版本。"

#: ../NEWS:27024
msgid ":issue:`43492`: Upgrade Windows installer to use SQLite 3.35.5."
msgstr ":issue:`43492`: 升级Windows安装程序以使用SQLite 3.35.5。"

#: ../NEWS:27026
msgid ""
":issue:`30555`: Fix ``WindowsConsoleIO`` errors in the presence of fd "
"redirection. Patch by Segev Finer."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30555`: 修复在存在文件描述符重定向时的 ``WindowsConsoleIO`` 错误。由Segev Finer提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:27032
msgid ""
":issue:`42119`: Fix check for macOS SDK paths when building Python. Narrow "
"search to match contents of SDKs, namely only files in ``/System/Library``, "
"``/System/IOSSupport``, and ``/usr`` other than ``/usr/local``. Previously, "
"anything under ``/System`` was assumed to be in an SDK which causes problems"
" with the new file system layout in 10.15+ where user file systems may "
"appear to be mounted under ``/System``.  Paths in ``/Library`` were also "
"incorrectly treated as SDK locations."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42119`: 修复构建Python时对macOS SDK路径的检查。缩小搜索范围以匹配SDKs的内容，即仅包括 "
"``/System/Library``、``/System/IOSSupport``和 ``/usr`` 中除 ``/usr/local`` "
"外的文件。之前，任何在 ``/System`` "
"下的内容都被假定为在SDK中，这在10.15+的新文件系统布局中会导致问题，因为用户文件系统可能看似挂载在 ``/System`` "
"下。``/Library`` 中的路径也被错误地视为SDK位置。"

#: ../NEWS:27040
msgid ":issue:`43568`: Drop support for MACOSX_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET < 10.3"
msgstr ":issue:`43568`: 放弃对MACOSX_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET < 10.3的支持"

#: ../NEWS:27042
msgid ""
":issue:`44009`: Provide \"python3.x-intel64\" executable to allow reliably "
"forcing macOS universal2 framework builds to run under Rosetta 2 Intel-64 "
"emulation on Apple Silicon Macs.  This can be useful for testing or when "
"universal2 wheels are not yet available."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44009`: 提供\"python3.x-intel64\"可执行文件，以便在Apple Silicon Mac上可靠地强制macOS"
" universal2框架构建在Rosetta 2 Intel-64仿真下运行。这对于测试或当universal2 wheel尚不可用时非常有用。"

#: ../NEWS:27047
msgid ""
":issue:`43851`: Build SQLite with ``SQLITE_OMIT_AUTOINIT`` on macOS. Patch "
"by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43851`: 在macOS上使用 ``SQLITE_OMIT_AUTOINIT`` 构建SQLite。由Erlend E. "
"Aasland提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:27050
msgid ":issue:`43492`: Update macOS installer to use SQLite 3.35.4."
msgstr ":issue:`43492`: 更新macOS安装程序以使用SQLite 3.35.4。"

#: ../NEWS:27052
msgid ""
":issue:`42235`: ``Mac/BuildScript/build-installer.py`` will now use \"--"
"enable-optimizations\" and ``--with-lto`` when building on macOS 10.15 or "
"later."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42235`: ``Mac/BuildScript/build-installer.py`` 现在在macOS "
"10.15或更高版本上构建时将使用\"--enable-optimizations\"和 ``--with-lto``。"

#: ../NEWS:27059
msgid ""
":issue:`37903`: Add mouse actions to the shell sidebar.  Left click and "
"optional drag selects one or more lines, as with the editor line number "
"sidebar.  Right click after selecting raises a context menu with 'copy with "
"prompts'.  This zips together prompts from the sidebar with lines from the "
"selected text."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37903`: "
"向shell侧边栏添加鼠标操作。左键点击和可选拖动选择一个或多个行，与编辑器行号侧边栏相同。选择后右键点击会弹出一个带有'copy with "
"prompts'的上下文菜单。这将侧边栏的提示与所选文本的行压缩在一起。"

#: ../NEWS:27065
msgid ""
":issue:`43981`: Fix reference leak in test_sidebar and test_squeezer. "
"Patches by Terry Jan Reedy and Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":issue:`43981`: 修复test_sidebar和test_squeezer中的引用泄漏。由Terry Jan Reedy和Pablo "
"Galindo提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:27068
msgid ":issue:`37892`: Indent IDLE Shell input with spaces instead of tabs"
msgstr ":issue:`37892`: 使用空格而非制表符缩进IDLE Shell输入"

#: ../NEWS:27070
msgid ""
":issue:`43655`: IDLE dialog windows are now recognized as dialogs by window "
"managers on macOS and X Window."
msgstr ":issue:`43655`: IDLE对话框窗口现在被macOS和X Window的窗口管理器识别为对话框。"

#: ../NEWS:27073
msgid ":issue:`37903`: IDLE's shell now shows prompts in a separate side-bar."
msgstr ":issue:`37903`: IDLE的shell现在在一个单独的侧边栏中显示提示。"

#: ../NEWS:27078
msgid ""
":issue:`43916`: Add a new :c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_DISALLOW_INSTANTIATION` type "
"flag to disallow creating type instances. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43916`: 添加一个新的 :c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_DISALLOW_INSTANTIATION` "
"类型标志，以禁止创建类型实例。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:27081
msgid ""
":issue:`43774`: Remove the now unused ``PYMALLOC_DEBUG`` macro. Debug hooks "
"on memory allocators are now installed by default if Python is built in "
"debug mode (if ``Py_DEBUG`` macro is defined). Moreover, they can now be "
"used on Python build in release mode (ex: using ``PYTHONMALLOC=debug`` "
"environment variable)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43774`: 移除现在未使用的 ``PYMALLOC_DEBUG`` 宏。如果Python是以调试模式构建的（如果定义了 "
"``Py_DEBUG`` 宏），现在默认安装内存分配器的调试钩子。此外，它们现在可以在发布模式的Python构建中使用（例如：使用 "
"``PYTHONMALLOC=debug`` 环境变量）。"

#: ../NEWS:27087
msgid ""
":issue:`43962`: _PyInterpreterState_IDIncref() now calls "
"_PyInterpreterState_IDInitref() and always increments id_refcount. "
"Previously, calling _xxsubinterpreters.get_current() could create an "
"id_refcount inconsistency when a _xxsubinterpreters.InterpreterID object was"
" deallocated. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43962`: _PyInterpreterState_IDIncref() 现在调用 "
"_PyInterpreterState_IDInitref() 并且总是增加 id_refcount。之前，调用 "
"_xxsubinterpreters.get_current() 在 _xxsubinterpreters.InterpreterID "
"对象被释放时可能会创建一个 id_refcount 不一致。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:27093
msgid ""
":issue:`28254`: Add new C-API functions to control the state of the garbage "
"collector: :c:func:`PyGC_Enable()`, :c:func:`PyGC_Disable()`, "
":c:func:`PyGC_IsEnabled()`, corresponding to the functions in the :mod:`gc` "
"module."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28254`: 添加新的C-"
"API函数来控制垃圾收集器的状态：:c:func:`PyGC_Enable()`、:c:func:`PyGC_Disable()`、:c:func:`PyGC_IsEnabled()`，对应于"
" :mod:`gc` 模块中的函数。"

#: ../NEWS:27098
msgid ""
":issue:`43908`: Introduce :c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_IMMUTABLETYPE` flag for "
"immutable type objects, and modify :c:func:`PyType_Ready` to set it for "
"static types. Patch by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43908`: 为不可变类型对象引入 :c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_IMMUTABLETYPE` 标志，并修改 "
":c:func:`PyType_Ready` 为静态类型设置它。由Erlend E. Aasland提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:27102
msgid ""
":issue:`43795`: :c:func:`PyMem_Calloc` is now available in the limited C API"
" (``Py_LIMITED_API``)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43795`: :c:func:`PyMem_Calloc` 现在在有限C API（``Py_LIMITED_API``）中可用。"

#: ../NEWS:27105
msgid ""
":issue:`43868`: :c:func:`PyOS_ReadlineFunctionPointer` is no longer exported"
" by limited C API headers and by ``python3.dll`` on Windows. Like any "
"function that takes ``FILE*``, it is not part of the stable ABI."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43868`: :c:func:`PyOS_ReadlineFunctionPointer` 不再由有限C "
"API头文件和Windows上的 ``python3.dll`` 导出。像任何接受 ``FILE*`` 的函数一样，它不是稳定ABI的一部分。"

#: ../NEWS:27109
msgid ""
":issue:`43795`: Stable ABI and limited API definitions are generated from a "
"central manifest (:pep:`652`)."
msgstr ":issue:`43795`: 稳定的ABI和有限API定义现在从一个中心清单生成（:pep:`652`）。"

#: ../NEWS:27112
msgid ""
":issue:`43753`: Add the :c:func:`Py_Is(x, y) <Py_Is>` function to test if "
"the *x* object is the *y* object, the same as ``x is y`` in Python. Add also"
" the :c:func:`Py_IsNone`, :c:func:`Py_IsTrue`, :c:func:`Py_IsFalse` "
"functions to test if an object is, respectively, the ``None`` singleton, the"
" ``True`` singleton or the ``False`` singleton. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43753`: 添加 :c:func:`Py_Is(x, y) <Py_Is>` 函数来测试 *x* 对象是否为 *y* "
"对象，等同于Python中的 ``x is y``。还添加了 "
":c:func:`Py_IsNone`、:c:func:`Py_IsTrue`、:c:func:`Py_IsFalse` 函数来分别测试对象是否为 "
"``None`` 单例、``True`` 单例或 ``False`` 单例。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:27121
msgid "Python 3.10.0 alpha 7"
msgstr "Python 3.10.0 alpha 7"

#: ../NEWS:27123
msgid "*Release date: 2021-04-05*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2021-04-05*"

#: ../NEWS:27128
msgid ""
":issue:`42988`: :cve:`2021-3426`: Remove the ``getfile`` feature of the "
":mod:`pydoc` module which could be abused to read arbitrary files on the "
"disk (directory traversal vulnerability). Moreover, even source code of "
"Python modules can contain sensitive data like passwords. Vulnerability "
"reported by David Schwörer."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42988`: :cve:`2021-3426`: 移除 :mod:`pydoc` 模块的 ``getfile`` "
"功能，该功能可能被滥用来读取磁盘上的任意文件（目录遍历漏洞）。此外，即使是 Python 模块的源代码也可能包含敏感数据，如密码。漏洞由 David "
"Schwörer 报告。"

#: ../NEWS:27134
msgid ""
":issue:`43285`: :mod:`ftplib` no longer trusts the IP address value returned"
" from the server in response to the PASV command by default.  This prevents "
"a malicious FTP server from using the response to probe IPv4 address and "
"port combinations on the client network."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43285`: :mod:`ftplib` 默认不再信任服务器响应 PASV 命令返回的 IP 地址值。这可以防止恶意 FTP "
"服务器利用响应探测客户端网络的 IPv4 地址和端口组合。"

#: ../NEWS:27139
msgid ""
"Code that requires the former vulnerable behavior may set a "
"``trust_server_pasv_ipv4_address`` attribute on their :class:`ftplib.FTP` "
"instances to ``True`` to re-enable it."
msgstr ""
"需要之前易受攻击行为的代码可以在它们的 :class:`ftplib.FTP` 实例上设置 "
"``trust_server_pasv_ipv4_address`` 属性为 ``True`` 以重新启用它。"

#: ../NEWS:27143
msgid ""
":issue:`43439`: Add audit hooks for :func:`gc.get_objects`, "
":func:`gc.get_referrers` and :func:`gc.get_referents`. Patch by Pablo "
"Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43439`: 为 :func:`gc.get_objects`、:func:`gc.get_referrers` 和 "
":func:`gc.get_referents` 添加审计钩子。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:27150
msgid ":issue:`27129`: Update CPython bytecode magic number."
msgstr ":issue:`27129`: 更新 CPython 字节码魔法数字。"

#: ../NEWS:27152
msgid ":issue:`43672`: Raise ImportWarning when calling find_loader()."
msgstr ":issue:`43672`: 当调用 find_loader() 时，发出 ImportWarning。"

#: ../NEWS:27154
msgid ""
":issue:`43660`: Fix crash that happens when replacing ``sys.stderr`` with a "
"callable that can remove the object while an exception is being printed. "
"Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43660`: 修复在替换 ``sys.stderr`` 为一个可在打印异常时删除对象的可调用对象时发生的崩溃。由 Pablo "
"Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:27158
msgid ""
":issue:`27129`: The bytecode interpreter uses instruction, rather byte, "
"offsets internally. This reduces the number of EXTENDED_ARG instructions "
"needed and streamlines instruction dispatch a bit."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27129`: 字节码解释器内部使用指令偏移而非字节偏移。这减少了所需的 EXTENDED_ARG 指令数量并稍微简化了指令分发。"

#: ../NEWS:27165
msgid ""
":issue:`40645`: Fix reference leak in the :mod:`!_hashopenssl` extension. "
"Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40645`: 修复 :mod:`!_hashopenssl` 扩展中的引用泄漏。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:27171
msgid ""
":issue:`42134`: Calls to find_module() by the import system now raise "
"ImportWarning."
msgstr ":issue:`42134`: 导入系统对 find_module() 的调用现在会发出 ImportWarning。"

#: ../NEWS:27174
msgid ""
":issue:`41064`: Improve the syntax error for invalid usage of double starred"
" elements ('**') in f-strings. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41064`: 改进了在 f-strings 中无效使用双星号元素（'**'）的语法错误提示。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:27177
msgid ""
":issue:`43575`: Speed up calls to ``map()`` by using the :pep:`590` "
"``vectorcall`` calling convention. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43575`: 通过使用 :pep:`590` ``vectorcall`` 调用约定，加速 ``map()`` 调用。由 "
"Donghee Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:27180
msgid ""
":issue:`42137`: The import system now prefers using ``__spec__`` for "
"``ModuleType.__repr__`` over ``module_repr()``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42137`: 导入系统现在更倾向于使用 ``__spec__`` 而非 ``module_repr()`` 来进行 "
"``ModuleType.__repr__``。"

#: ../NEWS:27183
msgid ""
":issue:`43452`: Added micro-optimizations to ``_PyType_Lookup()`` to improve"
" cache lookup performance in the common case of cache hits."
msgstr ":issue:`43452`: 对 ``_PyType_Lookup()`` 进行了微优化，以提高缓存命中的常见情况下的查找性能。"

#: ../NEWS:27186
msgid ""
":issue:`43555`: Report the column offset for :exc:`SyntaxError` for invalid "
"line continuation characters. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43555`: 为无效的行继续字符报告 :exc:`SyntaxError` 的列偏移。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:27189
msgid ""
":issue:`43517`: Fix misdetection of circular imports when using ``from "
"pkg.mod import attr``, which caused false positives in non-trivial multi-"
"threaded code."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43517`: 修复了在使用 ``from pkg.mod import attr`` "
"时循环导入的错误检测，这导致了非平凡的多线程代码中的假阳性。"

#: ../NEWS:27193
msgid ""
":issue:`43497`: Emit SyntaxWarnings for assertions with tuple constants, "
"this is a regression introduced in python3.7"
msgstr ":issue:`43497`: 对带有元组常量的断言发出 SyntaxWarnings，这是在 python3.7 中引入的回归问题。"

#: ../NEWS:27196
msgid ""
":issue:`39316`: Tracing now has correct line numbers for attribute accesses "
"when the attribute is on a different line from the object. Improves "
"debugging and profiling for multi-line method chains."
msgstr ":issue:`39316`: 当属性位于对象的另一行时，跟踪现在具有正确的行号。改进了多行方法链的调试和分析。"

#: ../NEWS:27200
msgid ""
":issue:`35883`: Python no longer fails at startup with a fatal error if a "
"command line argument contains an invalid Unicode character. The "
":c:func:`Py_DecodeLocale` function now escapes byte sequences which would be"
" decoded as Unicode characters outside the [U+0000; U+10ffff] range."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35883`: 如果命令行参数包含无效的 Unicode 字符，Python "
"不再在启动时以致命错误失败。:c:func:`Py_DecodeLocale` 函数现在会转义将被解码为 [U+0000; U+10ffff] "
"范围之外的 Unicode 字符的字节序列。"

#: ../NEWS:27205
msgid ""
":issue:`43410`: Fix a bug that was causing the parser to crash when emitting"
" syntax errors when reading input from stdin. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":issue:`43410`: 修复了一个在从标准输入读取输入时发出语法错误导致解析器崩溃的错误。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:27208
msgid ""
":issue:`43406`: Fix a possible race condition where ``PyErr_CheckSignals`` "
"tries to execute a non-Python signal handler."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43406`: 修复了一个可能的竞态条件，其中 ``PyErr_CheckSignals`` 尝试执行非 Python 信号处理程序。"

#: ../NEWS:27211
msgid ""
":issue:`42128`: Add ``__match_args__`` to :ref:`struct sequence objects "
"<struct-sequence-objects>`. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42128`: 向 :ref:`struct sequence objects <struct-sequence-objects>` "
"添加了 ``__match_args__``。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:27214
msgid ""
":issue:`43390`: CPython now sets the ``SA_ONSTACK`` flag in ``PyOS_setsig`` "
"for the VM's default signal handlers.  This is friendlier to other in-"
"process code that an extension module or embedding use could pull in (such "
"as Golang's cgo) where tiny thread stacks are the norm and ``sigaltstack()``"
" has been used to provide for signal handlers.  This is a no-op change for "
"the vast majority of processes that don't use sigaltstack."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43390`: CPython 现在在 ``PyOS_setsig`` 中为 VM 的默认信号处理程序设置了 "
"``SA_ONSTACK`` 标志。这对于扩展模块或嵌入使用可能引入的其他进程内代码（如 Golang 的 "
"cgo）更为友好，其中小线程栈是常态，并且使用了 ``sigaltstack()`` 来为信号处理程序提供支持。对于绝大多数不使用 "
"sigaltstack 的进程来说，这是一个无操作更改。"

#: ../NEWS:27221
msgid ""
":issue:`43287`: Speed up calls to ``filter()`` by using the :pep:`590` "
"``vectorcall`` calling convention. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43287`: 通过使用 :pep:`590` ``vectorcall`` 调用约定，加快了对 ``filter()`` 的调用。由 "
"Donghee Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:27224
msgid ""
":issue:`37448`: Add a radix tree based memory map to track in-use obmalloc "
"arenas. Use to replace the old implementation of address_in_range(). The "
"radix tree approach makes it easy to increase pool sizes beyond the OS page "
"size. Boosting the pool and arena size allows obmalloc to handle a "
"significantly higher percentage of requests from its ultra-fast paths."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37448`：添加基于基数树的内存映射来跟踪使用中的obmalloc竞技场。用于替换旧的address_in_range()实现。基数树方法使得可以轻松将池大小增加到超过操作系统页面大小。增加池和竞技场大小使得obmalloc能够从其超快速路径处理显著更高比例的请求。"

#: ../NEWS:27230
msgid ""
"It also has the advantage of eliminating the memory unsanitary behavior of "
"the previous address_in_range(). The old address_in_range() was marked with "
"the annotations _Py_NO_SANITIZE_ADDRESS, _Py_NO_SANITIZE_THREAD, and "
"_Py_NO_SANITIZE_MEMORY. Those annotations are no longer needed."
msgstr ""
"它还有消除之前address_in_range()的内存不卫生行为的优势。旧的address_in_range()被标记为_Py_NO_SANITIZE_ADDRESS、_Py_NO_SANITIZE_THREAD和_Py_NO_SANITIZE_MEMORY注释。这些注释不再需要。"

#: ../NEWS:27235
msgid ""
"To disable the radix tree map, set a preprocessor flag as follows: "
"``-DWITH_PYMALLOC_RADIX_TREE=0``."
msgstr "要禁用基数树映射，设置如下预处理器标志：``-DWITH_PYMALLOC_RADIX_TREE=0``。"

#: ../NEWS:27238
msgid "Co-authored-by: Tim Peters <tim.peters@gmail.com>"
msgstr "合著者：Tim Peters <tim.peters@gmail.com>"

#: ../NEWS:27240
msgid ""
":issue:`29988`: Only handle asynchronous exceptions and requests to drop the"
" GIL when returning from a call or on the back edges of loops. Makes sure "
"that :meth:`~object.__exit__` is always called in with statements, even for "
"interrupts."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29988`：仅在从调用返回或循环的后边缘时处理异步异常和请求放弃GIL。确保在with语句中总是调用 "
":meth:`~object.__exit__`，即使对于中断也是如此。"

#: ../NEWS:27248
msgid ""
":issue:`43720`: Document various stdlib deprecations in imp, pkgutil, and "
"importlib.util for removal in Python 3.12."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43720`：记录imp、pkgutil和importlib.util中各种标准库的弃用，计划在Python 3.12中移除。"

#: ../NEWS:27251
msgid ""
":issue:`43433`: :class:`xmlrpc.client.ServerProxy` no longer ignores query "
"and fragment in the URL of the server."
msgstr ":issue:`43433`：:class:`xmlrpc.client.ServerProxy` 不再忽略服务器URL中的查询和片段。"

#: ../NEWS:27254
msgid ""
":issue:`31956`: The :meth:`~array.array.index` method of "
":class:`array.array` now has optional *start* and *stop* parameters."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31956`：:class:`array.array` 的 :meth:`~array.array.index` 方法现在有可选的 "
"*start*和*stop* 形参。"

#: ../NEWS:27257
msgid ""
":issue:`40066`: Enum: adjust ``repr()`` to show only enum and member name "
"(not value, nor angle brackets) and ``str()`` to show only member name.  "
"Update and improve documentation to match."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40066`：Enum：调整 ``repr()`` "
"仅显示枚举和成员名称（不显示值，也不显示尖括号），``str()``仅显示成员名称。更新并改进文档以匹配。"

#: ../NEWS:27261
msgid ""
":issue:`42136`: Deprecate all module_repr() methods found in importlib as "
"their use is being phased out by Python 3.12."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42136`：弃用importlib中找到的所有module_repr()方法，因为它们的使用将在Python 3.12中逐步淘汰。"

#: ../NEWS:27264
msgid ""
":issue:`35930`: Raising an exception raised in a \"future\" instance will "
"create reference cycles."
msgstr ":issue:`35930`：在“future”实例中引发的异常将创建引用循环。"

#: ../NEWS:27267
msgid ""
":issue:`41369`: Finish updating the vendored libmpdec to version 2.5.1.  "
"Patch by Stefan Krah."
msgstr ":issue:`41369`：完成更新vendored libmpdec到版本2.5.1。由Stefan Krah提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:27270
msgid ""
":issue:`43422`: Revert the _decimal C API which was added in :issue:`41324`."
msgstr ":issue:`43422`：恢复在问题编号`41324`中添加的_decimal C API。"

#: ../NEWS:27272
msgid ""
":issue:`43577`: Fix deadlock when using :class:`ssl.SSLContext` debug "
"callback with :meth:`ssl.SSLContext.sni_callback`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43577`: 修复了在使用 :class:`ssl.SSLContext` 调试回调与 "
":meth:`ssl.SSLContext.sni_callback` 时出现的死锁问题。"

#: ../NEWS:27275
msgid ""
":issue:`43571`: It's now possible to create MPTCP sockets with IPPROTO_MPTCP"
msgstr ":issue:`43571`: 现在可以使用 IPPROTO_MPTCP 创建 MPTCP 套接字。"

#: ../NEWS:27277
msgid ""
":issue:`43542`: ``image/heic`` and ``image/heif`` were added to "
":mod:`mimetypes`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43542`: ``image/heic`` 和 ``image/heif`` 已被添加到 :mod:`mimetypes`。"

#: ../NEWS:27280
msgid ""
":issue:`40645`: The :mod:`hmac` module now uses OpenSSL's HMAC "
"implementation when digestmod argument is a hash name or builtin hash "
"function."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40645`: 当 digestmod 参数是哈希名称或内置哈希函数时，:mod:`hmac` 模块现在使用 OpenSSL 的 "
"HMAC 实现。"

#: ../NEWS:27283
msgid ""
":issue:`43510`: Implement :pep:`597`: Add ``EncodingWarning`` warning, ``-X "
"warn_default_encoding`` option, :envvar:`PYTHONWARNDEFAULTENCODING` "
"environment variable and ``encoding=\"locale\"`` argument value."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43510`: 实现了 :pep:`597`: 添加了 ``EncodingWarning`` 警告，``-X "
"warn_default_encoding`` 选项，:envvar:`PYTHONWARNDEFAULTENCODING` 环境变量和 "
"``encoding=\"locale\"`` 参数值。"

#: ../NEWS:27287
msgid ":issue:`43521`: ``ast.unparse`` can now render NaNs and empty sets."
msgstr ":issue:`43521`: ``ast.unparse`` 现在可以渲染 NaNs 和空集。"

#: ../NEWS:27289
msgid ""
":issue:`42914`: :func:`pprint.pprint` gains a new boolean "
"``underscore_numbers`` optional argument to emit integers with thousands "
"separated by an underscore character for improved readability (for example "
"``1_000_000`` instead of ``1000000``)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42914`: :func:`pprint.pprint` 新增了一个布尔型 ``underscore_numbers`` "
"可选参数，用于输出用下划线分隔千位的整数以提高可读性（例如 ``1_000_000`` 而不是 ``1000000``）。"

#: ../NEWS:27294
msgid ""
":issue:`41361`: :meth:`~collections.deque.rotate` calls are now slightly "
"faster due to faster argument parsing."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41361`: 由于参数解析速度的提升，:meth:`~collections.deque.rotate` 调用现在稍微快一些。"

#: ../NEWS:27297
msgid ""
":issue:`43423`: :func:`subprocess.communicate` no longer raises an "
"IndexError when there is an empty stdout or stderr IO buffer during a "
"timeout on Windows."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43423`: 在 Windows 上超时期间，当 stdout 或 stderr IO "
"缓冲区为空时，:func:`subprocess.communicate` 不再引发 IndexError。"

#: ../NEWS:27301
msgid ""
":issue:`27820`: Fixed long-standing bug of smtplib.SMTP where doing AUTH "
"LOGIN with initial_response_ok=False will fail."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27820`: 修复了 smtplib.SMTP 的一个长期存在的 bug，即在 initial_response_ok=False "
"时进行 AUTH LOGIN 会失败。"

#: ../NEWS:27304
msgid ""
"The cause is that SMTP.auth_login _always_ returns a password if provided "
"with a challenge string, thus non-compliant with the standard for AUTH "
"LOGIN."
msgstr "原因是 SMTP.auth_login _总是_ 在提供挑战字符串时返回密码，因此不符合 AUTH LOGIN 的标准。"

#: ../NEWS:27308
msgid "Also fixes bug with the test for smtpd."
msgstr "同时修复了 smtpd 的测试中的 bug。"

#: ../NEWS:27310
msgid ""
":issue:`43445`: Add frozen modules to :data:`sys.stdlib_module_names`. For "
"example, add ``\"_frozen_importlib\"`` and "
"``\"_frozen_importlib_external\"`` names."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43445`: 将冻结模块添加到 :data:`sys.stdlib_module_names`。例如，添加 "
"``\"_frozen_importlib\"`` 和 ``\"_frozen_importlib_external\"`` 名称。"

#: ../NEWS:27314
msgid ""
":issue:`43245`: Add keyword arguments support to ``ChainMap.new_child()``."
msgstr ":issue:`43245`: 向 ``ChainMap.new_child()`` 添加了关键字参数支持。"

#: ../NEWS:27316
msgid ""
":issue:`29982`: Add optional parameter *ignore_cleanup_errors* to "
":func:`tempfile.TemporaryDirectory` and allow multiple :func:`cleanup` "
"attempts. Contributed by C.A.M. Gerlach."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29982`: 向 :func:`tempfile.TemporaryDirectory` 添加了可选参数 "
"*ignore_cleanup_errors*，并允许多次 :func:`cleanup` 尝试。由 C.A.M. Gerlach 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:27320
msgid ""
":issue:`43428`: Include changes from `importlib_metadata 3.7 "
"<https://importlib-metadata.readthedocs.io/en/latest/history.html#v3-7-0>`_:"
msgstr ""
":issue:`43428`: 包含来自 `importlib_metadata 3.7 <https://importlib-"
"metadata.readthedocs.io/en/latest/history.html#v3-7-0>`_ 的更改："

#: ../NEWS:27323
msgid "Performance enhancements to distribution discovery."
msgstr "性能优化以改进发行版发现。"

#: ../NEWS:27325
msgid "``entry_points`` only returns unique distributions."
msgstr "``entry_points`` 现在只返回唯一的发行版。"

#: ../NEWS:27327
msgid ""
"Introduces new ``EntryPoints`` object for containing a set of entry points "
"with convenience methods for selecting entry points by group or name. "
"``entry_points`` now returns this object if selection parameters are "
"supplied but continues to return a dict object for compatibility. Users are "
"encouraged to rely on the selection interface. The dict object result is "
"likely to be deprecated in the future."
msgstr ""
"引入了新的 ``EntryPoints`` "
"对象，用于包含一组入口点，并提供了便捷方法来按组或名称选择入口点。如果提供了选择参数，``entry_points`` "
"现在会返回此对象，但为了兼容性，继续返回字典对象。鼓励用户依赖选择接口。字典对象的结果将来可能会被弃用。"

#: ../NEWS:27334
msgid ""
"Added packages_distributions function to return a mapping of packages to the"
" distributions that provide them."
msgstr "添加了 packages_distributions 函数，返回包到提供它们的发行版的映射。"

#: ../NEWS:27337
msgid ""
":issue:`43332`: Improves the networking efficiency of :mod:`http.client` "
"when using a proxy via :meth:`~HTTPConnection.set_tunnel`.  Fewer small send"
" calls are made during connection setup."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43332`: 通过 :meth:`~HTTPConnection.set_tunnel` 使用代理时，提高了 "
":mod:`http.client` 的网络效率。在连接设置过程中减少了小发送调用的次数。"

#: ../NEWS:27341
msgid ""
":issue:`43420`: Improve performance of :class:`fractions.Fraction` "
"arithmetics for large components.  Contributed by Sergey B. Kirpichev."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43420`: 提高 :class:`fractions.Fraction` 对大组件的算术性能。由 Sergey B. "
"Kirpichev 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:27344
msgid ""
":issue:`43356`: Allow passing a signal number to "
"``_thread.interrupt_main()``."
msgstr ":issue:`43356`: 允许传递信号编号给 ``_thread.interrupt_main()``。"

#: ../NEWS:27346
msgid ""
":issue:`43399`: Fix ``ElementTree.extend`` not working on iterators when "
"using the Python implementation"
msgstr ":issue:`43399`: 修复 ``ElementTree.extend`` 在使用 Python 实现时不适用于迭代器的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:27349
msgid ""
":issue:`43369`: Improve :mod:`sqlite3` error handling: If "
"``sqlite3_column_text()`` and ``sqlite3_column_blob()`` set "
"``SQLITE_NOMEM``, :exc:`MemoryError` is now raised. Patch by Erlend E. "
"Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43369`: 改进 :mod:`sqlite3` 错误处理：如果 ``sqlite3_column_text()`` 和 "
"``sqlite3_column_blob()`` 设置 ``SQLITE_NOMEM``，现在会引发 :exc:`MemoryError`。由 "
"Erlend E. Aasland 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:27354
msgid ""
":issue:`43368`: Fix a regression introduced in PR 24562, where an empty "
"bytestring was fetched as ``None`` instead of ``b''`` in :mod:`sqlite3`. "
"Patch by Mariusz Felisiak."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43368`: 修复 PR 24562 引入的回归问题，其中在 :mod:`sqlite3` 中，空字节串被获取为 ``None`` "
"而不是 ``b''``。由 Mariusz Felisiak 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:27358
msgid ""
":issue:`41282`: Fixed stacklevel of ``DeprecationWarning`` emitted from "
"``import distutils``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41282`: 修复了从 ``import distutils`` 发出的 ``DeprecationWarning`` 的堆栈级别。"

#: ../NEWS:27361
msgid ""
":issue:`42129`: ``importlib.resources`` now honors namespace packages, "
"merging resources from each location in the namespace as introduced in "
"``importlib_resources`` 3.2 and including incidental changes through 5.0.3."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42129`: ``importlib.resources`` 现在尊重命名空间包，合并来自命名空间中每个位置的资源，如 "
"``importlib_resources`` 3.2 中引入的，包括通过 5.0.3 的附带更改。"

#: ../NEWS:27366
msgid ""
":issue:`43295`: :meth:`datetime.datetime.strptime` now raises ``ValueError``"
" instead of ``IndexError`` when matching ``'z'`` with the ``%z`` format "
"specifier."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43295`: :meth:`datetime.datetime.strptime` 现在在匹配 ``'z'`` 和 ``%z`` "
"格式说明符时引发 ``ValueError`` 而不是 ``IndexError``。"

#: ../NEWS:27370
msgid ""
":issue:`43125`: Return empty string if base64mime.body_encode receive empty "
"bytes"
msgstr ":issue:`43125`: 如果 base64mime.body_encode 接收到空字节，返回空字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:27373
msgid ""
":issue:`43084`: :func:`curses.window.enclose` returns now ``True`` or "
"``False`` (as was documented) instead of ``1`` or ``0``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43084`: :func:`curses.window.enclose` 现在返回 ``True`` 或 ``False`` "
"(如文档所述) 而不是 ``1`` 或 ``0``。"

#: ../NEWS:27376
msgid ":issue:`42994`: Add MIME types for opus, AAC, 3gpp and 3gpp2"
msgstr ":issue:`42994`: 为 opus、AAC、3gpp 和 3gpp2 添加 MIME 类型。"

#: ../NEWS:27378
msgid ""
":issue:`14678`: Add an invalidate_caches() method to the "
"zipimport.zipimporter class to support importlib.invalidate_caches(). Patch "
"by Desmond Cheong."
msgstr ""
":issue:`14678`: 向 zipimport.zipimporter 类添加 invalidate_caches() 方法以支持 "
"importlib.invalidate_caches()。由 Desmond Cheong 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:27381
msgid ""
":issue:`42782`: Fail fast in :func:`shutil.move` to avoid creating "
"destination directories on failure."
msgstr ":issue:`42782`: 在 :func:`shutil.move` 中快速失败，以避免在失败时创建目标目录。"

#: ../NEWS:27384
msgid ""
":issue:`40066`: Enum's ``repr()`` and ``str()`` have changed: ``repr()`` is "
"now *EnumClass.MemberName* and ``str()`` is *MemberName*.  Additionally, "
"stdlib Enum's whose contents are available as module attributes, such as "
"``RegexFlag.IGNORECASE``, have their ``repr()`` as *module.name*, e.g. "
"``re.IGNORECASE``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40066`: Enum 的 ``repr()`` 和 ``str()`` 已更改：``repr()`` 现在是 "
"*EnumClass.MemberName*，而 ``str()`` 是 *MemberName*。此外，标准库中 Enum "
"的内容可作为模块属性使用，例如 ``RegexFlag.IGNORECASE``，其 ``repr()`` 为 *module.name*，例如 "
"``re.IGNORECASE``。"

#: ../NEWS:27390
msgid ""
":issue:`26053`: Fixed bug where the :mod:`pdb` interactive run command "
"echoed the args from the shell command line, even if those have been "
"overridden at the pdb prompt."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26053`: 修复了 :mod:`pdb` 交互式运行命令回显 shell 命令行参数的错误，即使这些参数已在 pdb "
"提示符下被覆盖。"

#: ../NEWS:27394
msgid ""
":issue:`24160`: Fixed bug where breakpoints did not persist across multiple "
"debugger sessions in :mod:`pdb`'s interactive mode."
msgstr ":issue:`24160`: 修复了在 :mod:`pdb` 的交互模式下断点不跨多个调试会话持续的 bug。"

#: ../NEWS:27397
msgid ""
":issue:`40701`: When the :data:`tempfile.tempdir` global variable is set to "
"a value of type bytes, it is now handled consistently.  Previously "
"exceptions could be raised from some tempfile APIs when the directory did "
"not already exist in this situation.  Also ensures that the "
":func:`tempfile.gettempdir` and :func:`tempfile.gettempdirb` functions "
"*always* return ``str`` and ``bytes`` respectively."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40701`: 当 :data:`tempfile.tempdir` 全局变量设置为 bytes "
"类型的值时，现在会一致处理。以前在这种情况下，如果目录不存在，一些 tempfile API 可能会引发异常。同时确保 "
":func:`tempfile.gettempdir` 和 :func:`tempfile.gettempdirb` 函数 *总是* 分别返回 "
"``str`` 和 ``bytes``。"

#: ../NEWS:27404
msgid ""
":issue:`39342`: Expose ``X509_V_FLAG_ALLOW_PROXY_CERTS`` as "
":const:`~ssl.VERIFY_ALLOW_PROXY_CERTS` to allow proxy certificate validation"
" as explained in https://docs.openssl.org/1.1.1/man7/proxy-certificates/."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39342`: 将 ``X509_V_FLAG_ALLOW_PROXY_CERTS`` 暴露为 "
":const:`~ssl.VERIFY_ALLOW_PROXY_CERTS`，以允许代理证书验证，如 "
"https://docs.openssl.org/1.1.1/man7/proxy-certificates/ 所述。"

#: ../NEWS:27409
msgid ""
":issue:`31861`: Add builtins.aiter and builtins.anext. Patch by Joshua "
"Bronson (@jab), Daniel Pope (@lordmauve), and Justin Wang (@justin39)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31861`: 添加 builtins.aiter 和 builtins.anext。由 Joshua Bronson "
"(@jab)、Daniel Pope (@lordmauve) 和 Justin Wang (@justin39) 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:27415
msgid ""
":issue:`43199`: Answer \"Why is there no goto?\" in the Design and History "
"FAQ."
msgstr ":issue:`43199`: 在设计与历史常见问题中回答“为什么没有 goto？”。"

#: ../NEWS:27417
msgid ""
":issue:`43407`: Clarified that a result from :func:`time.monotonic`, "
":func:`time.perf_counter`, :func:`time.process_time`, or "
":func:`time.thread_time` can be compared with the result from any following "
"call to the same function - not just the next immediate call."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43407`: 明确了 "
":func:`time.monotonic`、:func:`time.perf_counter`、:func:`time.process_time` 或"
" :func:`time.thread_time` 的结果可以与任何后续调用同一函数的结果进行比较 - 不仅仅是下一个立即调用。"

#: ../NEWS:27422
msgid ""
":issue:`43354`: Fix type documentation for ``Fault.faultCode``; the type has"
" to be ``int`` instead of ``str``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43354`: 修复 ``Fault.faultCode`` 的类型文档；类型必须是 ``int`` 而不是 ``str``。"

#: ../NEWS:27425
msgid ""
":issue:`41933`: Clarified wording of s * n in the Common Sequence Operations"
msgstr ":issue:`41933`: 澄清了 Common Sequence Operations 中 s * n 的措辞。"

#: ../NEWS:27430
msgid ""
":issue:`37945`: Fix test_getsetlocale_issue1813() of test_locale: skip the "
"test if ``setlocale()`` fails. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37945`: 修复 test_locale 的 test_getsetlocale_issue1813()：如果 "
"``setlocale()`` 失败，跳过测试。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:27433
msgid ""
":issue:`41561`: Add workaround for Ubuntu's custom OpenSSL security level "
"policy."
msgstr ":issue:`41561`: 为 Ubuntu 自定义的 OpenSSL 安全级别策略添加变通方案。"

#: ../NEWS:27439
msgid ""
":issue:`43179`: Introduce and correctly use ALIGNOF_X in place of SIZEOF_X "
"for alignment-related code in optimized string routines. Patch by Jessica "
"Clarke."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43179`: 在优化字符串例程的对齐相关代码中引入并正确使用 ALIGNOF_X 代替 SIZEOF_X。补丁由 Jessica "
"Clarke 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:27443
msgid ":issue:`43631`: Update macOS, Windows, and CI to OpenSSL 1.1.1k."
msgstr ":issue:`43631`: 将 macOS、Windows 和 CI 更新至 OpenSSL 1.1.1k。"

#: ../NEWS:27445
msgid ""
":issue:`43617`: Improve configure.ac: Check for presence of autoconf-archive"
" package and remove our copies of M4 macros."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43617`: 改进 configure.ac：检查 autoconf-archive 包的存在并移除我们拷贝的 M4 宏。"

#: ../NEWS:27448
msgid ""
":issue:`43466`: The ``configure`` script now supports ``--with-openssl-"
"rpath`` option."
msgstr ":issue:`43466`: ``configure`` 脚本现在支持 ``--with-openssl-rpath`` 选项。"

#: ../NEWS:27451
msgid ""
":issue:`43372`: Use ``_freeze_importlib`` to generate code for the "
"``__hello__`` module. This approach ensures the code matches the interpreter"
" version.  Previously, PYTHON_FOR_REGEN was used to generate the code, which"
" might be wrong.  The marshal format for code objects has changed with "
":issue:`42246`, commit 877df851. Update the code and the expected code sizes"
" in ctypes test_frozentable."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43372`: 使用 ``_freeze_importlib`` 为 ``__hello__`` "
"模块生成代码。这种方法确保代码与解释器版本匹配。之前使用 PYTHON_FOR_REGEN 生成代码，可能是错误的。代码对象的 marshal 格式已随"
" :issue:`42246`，提交 877df851 更改。更新代码和 ctypes test_frozentable 中的预期代码大小。"

#: ../NEWS:27461
msgid ""
":issue:`43440`: Build :mod:`sqlite3` with the ``R*Tree`` module enabled. "
"Patch by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43440`: 构建启用了 ``R*Tree`` 模块的 :mod:`sqlite3`。补丁由 Erlend E. Aasland "
"提供。"

#: ../NEWS:27467
msgid ""
":issue:`42225`: Document that IDLE can fail on Unix either from "
"misconfigured IP masquerade rules or failure displaying complex colored "
"(non-ascii) characters."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42225`: 文档说明 IDLE 在 Unix 上可能因配置错误的 IP 伪装规则或无法显示复杂的彩色（非 ASCII）字符而失败。"

#: ../NEWS:27474
msgid ""
":issue:`43688`: The limited C API is now supported if Python is built in "
"debug mode (if the ``Py_DEBUG`` macro is defined). In the limited C API, the"
" :c:func:`Py_INCREF` and :c:func:`Py_DECREF` functions are now implemented "
"as opaque function calls, rather than accessing directly the "
":c:member:`PyObject.ob_refcnt` member, if Python is built in debug mode and "
"the ``Py_LIMITED_API`` macro targets Python 3.10 or newer. It became "
"possible to support the limited C API in debug mode because the "
":c:type:`PyObject` structure is the same in release and debug mode since "
"Python 3.8 (see :issue:`36465`)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43688`: 如果 Python 是以调试模式构建的（如果定义了 ``Py_DEBUG`` 宏），现在支持有限的 C API。在有限的"
" C API 中，如果 Python 是以调试模式构建的，并且 ``Py_LIMITED_API`` 宏的目标是 Python 3.10 "
"或更新版本，:c:func:`Py_INCREF` 和 :c:func:`Py_DECREF` 函数现在被实现为不透明的函数调用，而不是直接访问 "
":c:member:`PyObject.ob_refcnt` 成员。之所以能够在调试模式下支持有限的 C API，是因为从 Python 3.8 "
"开始，:c:type:`PyObject` 结构在发布和调试模式下是相同的（见 :issue:`36465`）。"

