"Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40956`: 修复在未提供参数时 :meth:`sqlite3.Connection.backup` 中的段错误。该回归由PR "
"23838引入。由Erlend E. Aasland提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:27670
msgid ""
":issue:`43172`: The readline module now passes its tests when built directly"
