"Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":issue:`43163`: 修复 :mod:`codeop` 中的一个bug，该bug导致它在多行片段有未闭合的括号时不请求更多输入。由Pablo "
"Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:27679
msgid ""
":issue:`43162`: deprecate unsupported ability to access enum members as "
