#: ../NEWS:27701
msgid ""
":issue:`29753`: In ctypes, now packed bitfields are calculated properly and "
"the first item of packed bitfields is now shrank correctly."
msgstr ":issue:`29753`: 在ctypes中，现在正确计算了打包位字段，并且打包位字段的第一项现在正确地缩小了。"

#: ../NEWS:27707
msgid ""
":issue:`27646`: Clarify that 'yield from <expr>' works with any iterable, "
"not just iterators."
msgstr ":issue:`27646`: 澄清了'yield from <expr>'可以与任何可迭代对象一起使用，而不仅仅是迭代器。"

#: ../NEWS:27710
msgid ""
":issue:`36346`: Update some deprecated unicode APIs which are documented as "
