" ``python.o`` object file."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43103`: 添加了一个新的配置选项 ``--without-static-"
"libpython``，用于不构建``libpythonMAJOR.MINOR.a``静态库且不安装 ``python.o`` 对象文件。"

#: ../NEWS:27728
msgid ""
":issue:`13501`: The configure script can now use *libedit* instead of "
"*readline* with the command line option ``--with-readline=editline``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`13501`: 配置脚本现在可以使用命令行选项 ``--with-readline=editline`` 来使用 *libedit* "
