#: ../NEWS:27798
msgid "Python 3.10.0 alpha 5"
msgstr "Python 3.10.0 alpha 5"

#: ../NEWS:27800
msgid "*Release date: 2021-02-02*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2021-02-02*"

#: ../NEWS:27805
msgid ""
":issue:`42938`: Avoid static buffers when computing the repr of "
":class:`ctypes.c_double` and :class:`ctypes.c_longdouble` values."
