":issue:`42938`: 在计算 :class:`ctypes.c_double` 和 :class:`ctypes.c_longdouble` "
"值的repr时避免使用静态缓冲区。"

#: ../NEWS:27811
msgid ":issue:`42990`: Refactor the ``PyEval_`` family of functions."
msgstr ":issue:`42990`: 重构 ``PyEval_`` 系列函数。"

#: ../NEWS:27813
msgid ""
"An new function ``_PyEval_Vector`` is added to simplify calls to Python from"
" C."
msgstr "新增函数 ``_PyEval_Vector`` 以简化从C调用Python的过程。"

#: ../NEWS:27814
msgid "``_PyEval_EvalCodeWithName`` is removed"
msgstr "``_PyEval_EvalCodeWithName``已被移除"

#: ../NEWS:27815
msgid ""
"``PyEval_EvalCodeEx`` is retained as part of the API, but is not used "
"internally"
msgstr "``PyEval_EvalCodeEx``作为API的一部分被保留，但在内部未被使用"

#: ../NEWS:27817
msgid ""
":issue:`38631`: Replace :c:func:`Py_FatalError` calls in the compiler with "
"regular :exc:`SystemError` exceptions. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38631`: 将编译器中的 :c:func:`Py_FatalError` 调用替换为常规的 :exc:`SystemError` "
"异常。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:27820
msgid ""
":issue:`42997`: Improve error message for missing \":\" before blocks. Patch"
" by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":issue:`42997`: 为块前缺少的\":\"改进错误信息。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:27823
msgid ""
":issue:`43017`: Improve error message in the parser when using un-"
"parenthesised tuples in comprehensions. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":issue:`43017`: 在解析器中使用未加括号的元组时改善了错误信息。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:27826
msgid ""
":issue:`42986`: Fix parser crash when reporting syntax errors in f-string "
"with newlines. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":issue:`42986`: 修复了在报告包含换行符的f字符串中的语法错误时解析器崩溃的问题。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:27829
msgid ""
":issue:`40176`: Syntax errors for unterminated string literals now point to "
"the start of the string instead of reporting EOF/EOL."
msgstr ":issue:`40176`: 现在，对于未终止的字符串字面量的语法错误会指向字符串的开始，而不是报告EOF/EOL。"

#: ../NEWS:27832
msgid ""
":issue:`42927`: The inline cache for ``LOAD_ATTR`` now also optimizes access"
" to attributes defined by ``__slots__``. This makes reading such attribute "
"up to 30% faster."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42927`: ``LOAD_ATTR`` 的内联缓存现在也优化了对通过 ``__slots__`` "
"定义的属性的访问。这使得读取此类属性的速度提高了30%。"

#: ../NEWS:27836
msgid ""
":issue:`42864`: Improve error messages in the parser when parentheses are "
"not closed. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":issue:`42864`: 当括号未关闭时，改善了解析器中的错误信息。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:27839
msgid ""
":issue:`42924`: Fix ``bytearray`` repetition incorrectly copying data from "
"the start of the buffer, even if the data is offset within the buffer (e.g. "
"after reassigning a slice at the start of the ``bytearray`` to a shorter "
"byte string)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42924`: 修复了 ``bytearray`` 重复错误地从缓冲区开始复制数据的问题，即使数据在缓冲区中偏移（例如，在将 "
"``bytearray`` 开始的切片重新分配给较短的字节字符串后）。"

#: ../NEWS:27844
msgid ""
":issue:`42882`: Fix the :c:func:`!_PyUnicode_FromId` function "
"(_Py_IDENTIFIER(var) API) when :c:func:`Py_Initialize` / "
":c:func:`Py_Finalize` is called multiple times: preserve "
"``_PyRuntime.unicode_ids.next_index`` value."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42882`: 修复了 :c:func:`!_PyUnicode_FromId` 函数（_Py_IDENTIFIER(var) "
"API）在多次调用 :c:func:`Py_Initialize` / :c:func:`Py_Finalize` "
"时的问题：保留了``_PyRuntime.unicode_ids.next_index``值。"

#: ../NEWS:27849
msgid ""
":issue:`42827`: Fix a crash when working out the error line of a "
":exc:`SyntaxError` in some multi-line expressions."
msgstr ":issue:`42827`: 修复了在某些多行表达式中处理 :exc:`SyntaxError` 的错误行时崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:27852
