":issue:`32381`: 现在在传递给 :option:`-c` 命令行选项的命令中忽略编码cookie（例如：``# coding: "
"latin1``）。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:28100
msgid ""
":issue:`30858`: Improve error location in expressions that contain "
"assignments. Patch by Pablo Galindo and Lysandros Nikolaou."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30858`: 改进包含赋值的表达式中的错误位置。由Pablo Galindo和Lysandros Nikolaou提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:28103
