msgstr ":issue:`40521`: 使内联字符串的 Unicode 字典与子解释器兼容。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:28152
msgid ""
":issue:`39465`: Make :c:func:`!_PyUnicode_FromId` function compatible with "
