msgstr ""
":issue:`42772`: randrange() 现在在指定步长而没有停止参数时引发 TypeError。以前，它会默默地忽略步长参数。"

#: ../NEWS:28165
msgid ""
":issue:`42759`: Fixed equality comparison of :class:`tkinter.Variable` and "
":class:`tkinter.font.Font`. Objects which belong to different Tcl "
