#: ../NEWS:28175
msgid ""
":issue:`42740`: :func:`typing.get_args` and :func:`typing.get_origin` now "
"support :pep:`604` union types and :pep:`612` additions to ``Callable``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42740`: :func:`typing.get_args` 和 :func:`typing.get_origin` 现在支持 "
":pep:`604` 联合类型和 :pep:`612` 对 ``Callable`` 的补充。"

#: ../NEWS:28178
msgid ""
":issue:`42655`: :mod:`subprocess` *extra_groups* is now correctly passed "
"into setgroups() system call."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42655`: :mod:`subprocess` 的 *extra_groups* 现在正确地传递到 setgroups() "
"系统调用中。"

#: ../NEWS:28181
msgid ""
":issue:`42727`: ``EnumMeta.__prepare__`` now accepts ``**kwds`` to properly "
"support ``__init_subclass__``"
msgstr ""
":issue:`42727`: ``EnumMeta.__prepare__`` 现在接受 ``**kwds`` 以正确支持 "
"``__init_subclass__``。"

#: ../NEWS:28184
msgid ""
":issue:`38308`: Add optional *weights* to *statistics.harmonic_mean()*."
msgstr ":issue:`38308`: 向 *statistics.harmonic_mean()* 添加了可选的 *weights* 参数。"

#: ../NEWS:28186
msgid ""
":issue:`42721`: When simple query dialogs (:mod:`tkinter.simpledialog`), "
"message boxes (:mod:`tkinter.messagebox`) or color choose dialog "
"(:mod:`tkinter.colorchooser`) are created without arguments *master* and "
"*parent*, and the default root window is not yet created, and "
":func:`~tkinter.NoDefaultRoot` was not called, a new temporal hidden root "
"window will be created automatically. It will not be set as the default root"
" window and will be destroyed right after closing the dialog window. It will"
" help to use these simple dialog windows in programs which do not need other"
" GUI."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42721`: 当创建简单查询对话框 (:mod:`tkinter.simpledialog`)、消息框 "
"(:mod:`tkinter.messagebox`) 或颜色选择对话框 (:mod:`tkinter.colorchooser`) 时，如果没有提供 "
"*master* 和 *parent* 参数，且默认根窗口尚未创建，并且未调用 "
":func:`~tkinter.NoDefaultRoot`，将自动创建一个新的临时隐藏根窗口。它不会被设置为默认根窗口，并在对话框窗口关闭后立即销毁。这将有助于在不需要其他"
" GUI 的程序中使用这些简单对话框窗口。"

#: ../NEWS:28196
msgid ":issue:`25246`: Optimized :meth:`collections.deque.remove`."
msgstr ":issue:`25246`: 优化了 :meth:`collections.deque.remove`。"

#: ../NEWS:28198
msgid ""
":issue:`35728`: Added a root parameter to :func:`tkinter.font.nametofont`."
msgstr ":issue:`35728`: 向 :func:`tkinter.font.nametofont` 添加了一个 root 参数。"

#: ../NEWS:28200
msgid ""
":issue:`15303`: :mod:`tkinter` supports now widgets with boolean value "
"False."
msgstr ":issue:`15303`: :mod:`tkinter` 现在支持值为布尔 False 的小部件。"

#: ../NEWS:28202
msgid ""
":issue:`42681`: Fixed range checks for color and pair numbers in "
":mod:`curses`."
msgstr ":issue:`42681`: 修复了 :mod:`curses` 中颜色和配对数字的范围检查。"

#: ../NEWS:28204
msgid ""
":issue:`42685`: Improved placing of simple query windows in Tkinter (such as"
" :func:`tkinter.simpledialog.askinteger`). They are now centered at the "
"center of the parent window if it is specified and shown, otherwise at the "
"center of the screen."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42685`: 改进了 Tkinter 中简单查询窗口（如 "
":func:`tkinter.simpledialog.askinteger`）的放置位置。如果指定了父窗口并显示，则现在将窗口居中于父窗口的中心，否则居中于屏幕中心。"

#: ../NEWS:28209
msgid ""
":issue:`9694`: Argparse help no longer uses the confusing phrase, \"optional"
" arguments\". It uses \"options\" instead."
msgstr ":issue:`9694`: Argparse 帮助不再使用令人困惑的短语“可选参数”，而是使用“选项”。"

#: ../NEWS:28212
msgid ""
":issue:`1635741`: Port the :mod:`!_thread` extension module to the "
"multiphase initialization API (:pep:`489`) and convert its static types to "
"heap types."
msgstr ""
":issue:`1635741`: 将 :mod:`!_thread` 扩展模块移植到多阶段初始化 API "
"(:pep:`489`)，并将其静态类型转换为堆类型。"

#: ../NEWS:28216
msgid ""
":issue:`37961`: Fix crash in :func:`tracemalloc.Traceback.__repr__` "
"(regressed in Python 3.9)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37961`: 修复 :func:`tracemalloc.Traceback.__repr__` 中的崩溃问题（在 Python "
"3.9 中回归）。"

#: ../NEWS:28219
msgid ""
":issue:`42630`: :mod:`tkinter` functions and constructors which need a "
"default root window raise now :exc:`RuntimeError` with descriptive message "
"instead of obscure :exc:`AttributeError` or :exc:`NameError` if it is not "
"created yet or cannot be created automatically."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42630`: 需要默认根窗口的 :mod:`tkinter` 函数和构造函数现在会引发带有描述性消息的 "
":exc:`RuntimeError`，而不是晦涩的 :exc:`AttributeError` 或 "
":exc:`NameError`，如果它尚未创建或无法自动创建。"

#: ../NEWS:28224
msgid ""
":issue:`42639`: :func:`atexit._run_exitfuncs` now logs callback exceptions "
"using :data:`sys.unraisablehook`, rather than logging them directly into "
":data:`sys.stderr` and raise the last exception."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42639`: :func:`atexit._run_exitfuncs` 现在使用 "
":data:`sys.unraisablehook` 记录回调异常，而不是直接将它们记录到 :data:`sys.stderr` 并引发最后一个异常。"

#: ../NEWS:28228
msgid ""
":issue:`42644`: ``logging.disable`` will now validate the types and value of"
" its parameter. It also now accepts strings representing the levels (as does"
" ``logging.setLevel``) instead of only the numerical values."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42644`: ``logging.disable`` 现在会验证其参数的类型和值。它还接受表示级别的字符串（如 "
"``logging.setLevel`` 所做的那样），而不仅仅是数值。"

#: ../NEWS:28232
msgid ""
":issue:`42639`: At Python exit, if a callback registered with "
":func:`atexit.register` fails, its exception is now logged. Previously, only"
" some exceptions were logged, and the last exception was always silently "
"ignored."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42639`: 在 Python 退出时，如果使用 :func:`atexit.register` "
"注册的回调失败，现在会记录其异常。以前，只有一些异常被记录，最后一个异常总是被默默忽略。"

#: ../NEWS:28237
msgid ""
":issue:`36541`: Fixed lib2to3.pgen2 to be able to parse PEP-570 positional "
"only argument syntax."
msgstr ":issue:`36541`: 修复了 lib2to3.pgen2 能够解析 PEP-570 仅位置参数语法的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:28240
msgid ""
":issue:`42382`: In ``importlib.metadata``: -  ``EntryPoint`` objects now "
"expose a ``.dist`` object referencing the ``Distribution`` when constructed "
"from a ``Distribution``. - Add support for package discovery under package "
"normalization rules. - The object returned by ``metadata()`` now has a "
"formally defined protocol called ``PackageMetadata`` with declared support "
"for the ``.get_all()`` method. - Synced with importlib_metadata 3.3."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42382`: 在 ``importlib.metadata`` 中： - ``EntryPoint`` 对象现在在从 "
"``Distribution`` 构造时公开一个 ``.dist`` 对象引用 ``Distribution``。 - "
"添加了对包发现规则下的包发现的支持。 - 由 ``metadata()`` 返回的对象现在有一个正式定义的协议，称为 "
"``PackageMetadata``，并声明支持 ``.get_all()`` 方法。 - 与 importlib_metadata 3.3 同步。"

#: ../NEWS:28247
msgid ""
":issue:`41877`: A check is added against misspellings of autospect, "
"auto_spec and set_spec being passed as arguments to patch, patch.object and "
"create_autospec."
msgstr ""
