":c:member:`PyConfig.install_signal_handlers` 等于 0，或 "
"``Py_InitializeEx(0)``），现在也会创建 ``SIGINT`` 事件 ``_PyOS_SigintEvent()``。"

#: ../NEWS:28511
msgid ""
":issue:`42381`: Allow assignment expressions in set literals and set "
"comprehensions as per PEP 572. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
