#: ../NEWS:28521
msgid ":issue:`42316`: Allow an unparenthesized walrus in subscript indexes."
msgstr ":issue:`42316`: 允许在下标索引中使用未加括号的海象运算符。"

#: ../NEWS:28523
msgid ""
":issue:`42349`: Make sure that the compiler front-end produces a well-formed"
" control flow graph. Be more aggressive in the compiler back-end, as it is "
"now safe to do so."
msgstr ":issue:`42349`: 确保编译器前端产生格式良好的控制流图。在编译器后端更加积极，因为现在这样做是安全的。"

#: ../NEWS:28527
msgid ""
":issue:`42296`: On Windows, fix a regression in signal handling which "
"prevented to interrupt a program using CTRL+C. The signal handler can be run"
" in a thread different than the Python thread, in which case the test "
"deciding if the thread can handle signals is wrong."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42296`: "
"在Windows上，修复了信号处理中的一个回归问题，该问题阻止了使用CTRL+C中断程序。信号处理程序可以在与Python线程不同的线程中运行，在这种情况下，判断线程是否可以处理信号的测试是错误的。"

#: ../NEWS:28532
msgid ""
":issue:`42332`: :class:`types.GenericAlias` objects can now be the targets "
"of weakrefs."
msgstr ":issue:`42332`: :class:`types.GenericAlias` 对象现在可以作为弱引用的目标。"

#: ../NEWS:28535
msgid ""
":issue:`42282`: Optimise constant subexpressions that appear as part of "
"named expressions (previously the AST optimiser did not descend into named "
"expressions). Patch by Nick Coghlan."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42282`: 优化作为命名表达式一部分出现的常量子表达式（之前AST优化器没有深入到命名表达式中）。由Nick "
"Coghlan提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:28539
msgid ""
":issue:`42266`: Fixed a bug with the LOAD_ATTR opcode cache that was not "
"respecting monkey-patching a class-level attribute to make it a descriptor. "
"Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42266`: 修复了LOAD_ATTR操作码缓存的一个错误，该错误没有尊重将一个类级别属性猴子补丁为描述符。由Pablo "
"Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:28546
msgid ":issue:`40077`: Convert :mod:`queue` to use heap types."
msgstr ":issue:`40077`: 将 :mod:`queue` 转换为使用堆类型。"

#: ../NEWS:28551
msgid ""
":issue:`42246`: Improved accuracy of line tracing events and f_lineno "
"attribute of Frame objects. See PEP 626 for details."
msgstr ":issue:`42246`: 提高了行跟踪事件和Frame对象的f_lineno属性的准确性。详见PEP 626。"

#: ../NEWS:28557
msgid ":issue:`40077`: Convert :mod:`mmap` to use heap types."
msgstr ":issue:`40077`: 将 :mod:`mmap` 转换为使用堆类型。"

#: ../NEWS:28562
msgid ""
":issue:`42233`: Allow ``GenericAlias`` objects to use :ref:`union type "
"expressions <types-union>`. This allows expressions like ``list[int] | "
"dict[float, str]`` where previously a ``TypeError`` would have been thrown."
"  This also fixes union type expressions not de-duplicating ``GenericAlias``"
" objects. (Contributed by Ken Jin in :issue:`42233`.)"
msgstr ""
":issue:`42233`: 允许 ``GenericAlias`` 对象使用 :ref:`union type expressions "
"<types-union>`。这使得像 ``list[int] | dict[float, str]`` 这样的表达式成为可能，而之前会抛出 "
"``TypeError``。这也修复了联合类型表达式未去重 ``GenericAlias`` 对象的问题。（由Ken Jin在 "
":issue:`42233` 中贡献。）"

#: ../NEWS:28568
msgid ""
":issue:`26131`: The import system triggers a ``ImportWarning`` when it falls"
" back to using ``load_module()``."
msgstr ":issue:`26131`: 当导入系统回退到使用 ``load_module()`` 时，会触发 ``ImportWarning``。"

#: ../NEWS:28574
msgid ""
":issue:`5054`: CGIHTTPRequestHandler.run_cgi() HTTP_ACCEPT improperly "
"parsed. Replace the special purpose getallmatchingheaders with generic "
"get_all method and add relevant tests."
msgstr ""
":issue:`5054`: CGIHTTPRequestHandler.run_cgi() 中 HTTP_ACCEPT 解析不当。用通用的 "
"get_all 方法替换特殊用途的 getallmatchingheaders，并添加相关测试。"

#: ../NEWS:28578
msgid "Original Patch by Martin Panter. Modified by Senthil Kumaran."
msgstr "原始由 Martin Panter 提供补丁，由 Senthil Kumaran 修改。"

#: ../NEWS:28580
msgid ""
":issue:`42562`: Fix issue when dis failed to parse function that has no line"
" numbers. Patch provided by Yurii Karabas."
msgstr ":issue:`42562`: 修复了当 dis 无法解析没有行号的函数时的问题。由 Yurii Karabas 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:28583
msgid ""
":issue:`17735`: :func:`inspect.findsource` now raises :exc:`OSError` instead"
" of :exc:`IndexError` when :attr:`co_lineno` of a code object is greater "
"than the file length. This can happen, for example, when a file is edited "
"after it was imported.  PR by Irit Katriel."
msgstr ""
":issue:`17735`: :func:`inspect.findsource` 现在在代码对象的 :attr:`co_lineno` "
"大于文件长度时，会引发 :exc:`OSError` 而不是 :exc:`IndexError`。例如，当文件在导入后被编辑时可能会发生此情况。PR 由"
" Irit Katriel 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:28588
msgid ""
":issue:`42116`: Fix handling of trailing comments by "
":func:`inspect.getsource`."
msgstr ":issue:`42116`: 修复了 :func:`inspect.getsource` 处理尾部注释的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:28590
msgid ""
":issue:`42532`: Remove unexpected call of ``__bool__`` when passing a "
"``spec_arg`` argument to a Mock."
msgstr ":issue:`42532`: 当向 Mock 传递 ``spec_arg`` 参数时，移除了对 ``__bool__`` 的意外调用。"

#: ../NEWS:28593
msgid ":issue:`38200`: Added itertools.pairwise()"
msgstr ":issue:`38200`: 添加了 itertools.pairwise()"

#: ../NEWS:28595
msgid ""
":issue:`41818`: Fix test_master_read() so that it succeeds on all platforms "
"that either raise OSError or return b\"\" upon reading from master."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41818`: 修复了 test_master_read()，使其在所有平台上都能成功，这些平台在从主设备读取时要么引发 "
"OSError，要么返回 b\"\"。"

#: ../NEWS:28598
msgid ""
":issue:`42487`: ChainMap.__iter__ no longer calls __getitem__ on underlying "
"maps"
msgstr ":issue:`42487`: ChainMap.__iter__ 不再调用底层映射的 __getitem__"

#: ../NEWS:28601
msgid ""
":issue:`42482`: :class:`~traceback.TracebackException` no longer holds a "
"reference to the exception's traceback object. Consequently, instances of "
"TracebackException for equivalent but non-equal exceptions now compare as "
"equal."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42482`: :class:`~traceback.TracebackException` "
"不再持有对异常回溯对象的引用。因此，对于等效但不相等的异常，TracebackException 的实例现在比较为相等。"

#: ../NEWS:28606
msgid ""
":issue:`41818`: Make test_openpty() avoid unexpected success due to number "
"of rows and/or number of columns being == 0."
msgstr ":issue:`41818`: 使 test_openpty() 避免由于行数和/或列数 == 0 而导致的意外成功。"

#: ../NEWS:28609
msgid ""
":issue:`42392`: Remove loop parameter from ``asyncio.subprocess`` and "
"``asyncio.tasks`` functions. Patch provided by Yurii Karabas."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42392`: 从 ``asyncio.subprocess`` 和 ``asyncio.tasks`` 函数中移除 loop "
"参数。补丁由 Yurii Karabas 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:28612
msgid ""
":issue:`42392`: Remove loop parameter from ``asyncio.open_connection`` and "
"``asyncio.start_server`` functions. Patch provided by Yurii Karabas."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42392`: 从 ``asyncio.open_connection`` 和 ``asyncio.start_server`` "
"函数中移除 loop 参数。由 Yurii Karabas 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:28615
msgid ""
":issue:`28468`: Add :func:`platform.freedesktop_os_release` function to "
"parse freedesktop.org ``os-release`` files."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28468`: 添加了 :func:`platform.freedesktop_os_release` 函数以解析 "
"freedesktop.org 的 ``os-release`` 文件。"

#: ../NEWS:28618
msgid ""
":issue:`42299`: Removed the ``formatter`` module, which was deprecated in "
"Python 3.4. It is somewhat obsolete, little used, and not tested. It was "
"originally scheduled to be removed in Python 3.6, but such removals were "
"delayed until after Python 2.7 EOL. Existing users should copy whatever "
"classes they use into their code. Patch by Donghee Na and and Terry J. "
"Reedy."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42299`: 移除了在Python 3.4中已弃用的 ``formatter`` "
"模块。该模块有些过时，使用较少，且未经测试。原计划在Python 3.6中移除，但此类移除被推迟到Python 2.7 "
"EOL之后。现有用户应将其使用的任何类复制到自己的代码中。由Donghee Na和Terry J. Reedy提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:28625
msgid ""
":issue:`26131`: Deprecate zipimport.zipimporter.load_module() in favour of "
"exec_module()."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26131`: 弃用zipimport.zipimporter.load_module()，推荐使用exec_module()。"

#: ../NEWS:28628
msgid ""
":issue:`41818`: Updated tests for the pty library. test_basic() has been "
"changed to test_openpty(); this additionally checks if slave termios and "
"slave winsize are being set properly by pty.openpty(). In order to add "
"support for FreeBSD, NetBSD, OpenBSD, and Darwin, this also adds "
"test_master_read(), which demonstrates that pty.spawn() should not depend on"
" an OSError to exit from its copy loop."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41818`: 更新了pty库的测试。test_basic()已改为test_openpty()；此外还检查了slave "
"termios和slave "
"winsize是否被pty.openpty()正确设置。为了增加对FreeBSD、NetBSD、OpenBSD和Darwin的支持，还增加了test_master_read()，演示了pty.spawn()不应依赖于OSError从其复制循环中退出。"

#: ../NEWS:28635
msgid ""
":issue:`42392`: Remove loop parameter from ``__init__`` in all "
"``asyncio.locks`` and ``asyncio.Queue`` classes. Patch provided by Yurii "
"Karabas."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42392`: 从所有 ``asyncio.locks``和 ``asyncio.Queue`` 类的 ``__init__`` "
"中移除loop参数。由Yurii Karabas提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:28639
msgid ""
":issue:`15450`: Make :class:`filecmp.dircmp` respect subclassing. Now the "
":attr:`filecmp.dircmp.subdirs` behaves as expected when subclassing dircmp."
msgstr ""
":issue:`15450`: 使 :class:`filecmp.dircmp` 尊重子类化。现在 "
":attr:`filecmp.dircmp.subdirs` 在子类化dircmp时的行为符合预期。"

#: ../NEWS:28643
msgid ""
":issue:`42413`: The exception :exc:`socket.timeout` is now an alias of "
":exc:`TimeoutError`."
msgstr ":issue:`42413`: 异常 :exc:`socket.timeout` 现在是 :exc:`TimeoutError` 的别名。"

#: ../NEWS:28646
msgid ":issue:`31904`: Support signal module on VxWorks."
msgstr ":issue:`31904`: 在VxWorks上支持signal模块。"

#: ../NEWS:28648
msgid ""
":issue:`42406`: We fixed an issue in ``pickle.whichmodule`` in which "
"importing ``multiprocessing`` could change the how pickle identifies which "
"module an object belongs to, potentially breaking the unpickling of those "
"objects."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42406`: 我们修复了 ``pickle.whichmodule`` 中的一个问题，其中导入 "
"``multiprocessing``可能会改变pickle如何识别对象属于哪个模块，潜在地破坏这些对象的unpickling。"

#: ../NEWS:28652
msgid ""
":issue:`42403`: Simplify the :mod:`importlib` external bootstrap code: "
"``importlib._bootstrap_external`` now uses regular imports to import builtin"
" modules. When it is imported, the builtin :func:`__import__` function is "
"already fully working and so can be used to import builtin modules like "
":mod:`sys`. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42403`: 简化 :mod:`importlib` 外部引导代码：``importlib._bootstrap_external``"
" 现在使用常规导入来导入内置模块。当它被导入时，内置的 :func:`__import__` 函数已经完全可以工作，因此可以用来导入如 "
":mod:`sys` 这样的内置模块。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:28658
msgid ""
":issue:`1635741`: Convert _sre module types to heap types (PEP 384). Patch "
"by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ":issue:`1635741`: 将_sre模块类型转换为堆类型（PEP 384）。由Erlend E. Aasland提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:28661
msgid ":issue:`42375`: subprocess module update for DragonFlyBSD support."
msgstr ":issue:`42375`: subprocess 模块更新以支持 DragonFlyBSD。"

#: ../NEWS:28663
msgid ""
":issue:`41713`: Port the ``_signal`` extension module to the multi-phase "
"initialization API (:pep:`489`). Patch by Victor Stinner and Mohamed Koubaa."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41713`: 将 ``_signal`` 扩展模块移植到多阶段初始化 API (:pep:`489`)。由 Victor "
"Stinner 和 Mohamed Koubaa 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:28667
msgid ""
":issue:`37205`: :func:`time.time`, :func:`time.perf_counter` and "
":func:`time.monotonic` functions can no longer fail with a Python fatal "
"error, instead raise a regular Python exception on failure."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37205`: :func:`time.time`、:func:`time.perf_counter` 和 "
":func:`time.monotonic` 函数不再因 Python 致命错误而失败，而是在失败时引发常规的 Python 异常。"

#: ../NEWS:28671
msgid ""
":issue:`42328`: Fixed :meth:`tkinter.ttk.Style.map`. The function accepts "
"now the representation of the default state as empty sequence (as returned "
"by ``Style.map()``). The structure of the result is now the same on all "
"platform and does not depend on the value of ``wantobjects``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42328`: 修复了 :meth:`tkinter.ttk.Style.map`。该函数现在接受默认状态的表示为空序列（由 "
"``Style.map()`` 返回）。结果的结构现在在所有平台上都是相同的，不依赖于 ``wantobjects`` 的值。"

#: ../NEWS:28676
msgid ""
":issue:`42345`: Fix various issues with ``typing.Literal`` parameter "
"handling (flatten, deduplicate, use type to cache key). Patch provided by "
"Yurii Karabas."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42345`: 修复了 ``typing.Literal`` 参数处理中的各种问题（扁平化、去重、使用类型缓存键）。由 Yurii "
"Karabas 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:28680
msgid ""
":issue:`37205`: :func:`time.perf_counter` on Windows and "
":func:`time.monotonic` on macOS are now system-wide. Previously, they used "
"an offset computed at startup to reduce the precision loss caused by the "
"float type. Use :func:`time.perf_counter_ns` and :func:`time.monotonic_ns` "
"added in Python 3.7 to avoid this precision loss."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37205`: Windows 上的 :func:`time.perf_counter` 和 macOS 上的 "
":func:`time.monotonic` 现在是系统范围的。以前，它们使用启动时计算的偏移量来减少由浮点类型引起的精度损失。使用 Python "
"3.7 中添加的 :func:`time.perf_counter_ns` 和 :func:`time.monotonic_ns` 来避免这种精度损失。"

#: ../NEWS:28686
msgid ""
":issue:`42318`: Fixed support of non-BMP characters in :mod:`tkinter` on "
"macOS."
msgstr ":issue:`42318`: 在 macOS 上修复了 :mod:`tkinter` 中对非 BMP 字符的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:28688
msgid ""
":issue:`42350`: Fix the :class:`threading.Thread` class at fork: do nothing "
"if the thread is already stopped (ex: fork called at Python exit). "
"Previously, an error was logged in the child process."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42350`: 修复了 :class:`threading.Thread` 类在 fork 时的问题：如果线程已经停止（例如：在 "
"Python 退出时调用 fork），则不执行任何操作。以前，在子进程中会记录一个错误。"

#: ../NEWS:28692
msgid ":issue:`42333`: Port _ssl extension module to heap types."
msgstr ":issue:`42333`: 将 _ssl 扩展模块移植到堆类型。"

#: ../NEWS:28694
msgid ""
":issue:`42014`: The ``onerror`` callback from ``shutil.rmtree`` now receives"
" correct function when ``os.open`` fails."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42014`: 现在，当 ``os.open`` 失败时，``shutil.rmtree`` 的 ``onerror`` "
"回调会接收到正确的函数。"

#: ../NEWS:28697
msgid ":issue:`42237`: Fix ``os.sendfile()`` on illumos."
msgstr ":issue:`42237`: 在 illumos 上修复了 ``os.sendfile()``。"

#: ../NEWS:28699
msgid ""
":issue:`42308`: Add :data:`threading.__excepthook__` to allow retrieving the"
" original value of :func:`threading.excepthook` in case it is set to a "
"broken or a different value. Patch by Mario Corchero."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42308`: 添加 :data:`threading.__excepthook__` 以允许在 "
":func:`threading.excepthook` 被设置为损坏或不同的值时检索其原始值。由 Mario Corchero 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:28703
msgid ""
":issue:`42131`: Implement PEP 451/spec methods on zipimport.zipimporter: "
"find_spec(), create_module(), and exec_module()."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42131`: 在 zipimport.zipimporter 上实现 PEP "
"451/规范方法：find_spec()、create_module() 和 exec_module()。"

#: ../NEWS:28706
msgid ""
"This also allows for the documented deprecation of find_loader(), "
"find_module(), and load_module()."
msgstr "这也允许了对find_loader()、find_module()和load_module()的文档化弃用。"

#: ../NEWS:28709
msgid ""
":issue:`41877`: Mock objects which are not unsafe will now raise an "
"AttributeError if an attribute with the prefix asert, aseert, or assrt is "
"accessed, in addition to this already happening for the prefixes assert or "
"assret."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41877`：非不安全的Mock对象现在如果访问带有前缀asert、aseert或assrt的属性，将引发AttributeError，此外，对于前缀assert或assret，这种情况已经发生。"

#: ../NEWS:28714
msgid ""
":issue:`42264`: ``sqlite3.OptimizedUnicode`` has been undocumented and "
"obsolete since Python 3.3, when it was made an alias to :class:`str`.  It is"
" now deprecated, scheduled for removal in Python 3.12."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42264`：``sqlite3.OptimizedUnicode``自Python 3.3起已无文档且过时，当时它被设为 "
":class:`str` 的别名。现在它已被弃用，计划在Python 3.12中移除。"

#: ../NEWS:28718
msgid ""
":issue:`42251`: Added :func:`threading.gettrace` and "
":func:`threading.getprofile` to retrieve the functions set by "
":func:`threading.settrace` and :func:`threading.setprofile` respectively. "
"Patch by Mario Corchero."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42251`：添加了 :func:`threading.gettrace` 和 :func:`threading.getprofile`"
" 以分别获取由 :func:`threading.settrace` 和 :func:`threading.setprofile` "
"设置的函数。由Mario Corchero提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:28723
msgid ":issue:`42249`: Fixed writing binary Plist files larger than 4 GiB."
msgstr ":issue:`42249`：修复了写入大于4 GiB的二进制Plist文件的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:28725
msgid ""
":issue:`42236`: On Unix, the :func:`os.device_encoding` function now returns"
" ``'UTF-8'`` rather than the device encoding if the :ref:`Python UTF-8 Mode "
"<utf8-mode>` is enabled."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42236`：在Unix上，如果启用了 :ref:`Python UTF-8模式 "
"<utf8-mode>`，:func:`os.device_encoding` 函数现在返回 ``'UTF-8'`` 而不是设备编码。"

#: ../NEWS:28729
msgid ""
":issue:`41754`: webbrowser: Ignore *NotADirectoryError* when calling ``xdg-"
"settings``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41754`：webbrowser：调用 ``xdg-settings`` 时忽略*NotADirectoryError*。"

#: ../NEWS:28732
msgid ""
":issue:`42183`: Fix a stack overflow error for asyncio Task or Future "
"repr()."
msgstr ":issue:`42183`：修复了asyncio任务或Future的repr()导致的堆栈溢出错误。"

#: ../NEWS:28734
msgid ""
"The overflow occurs under some circumstances when a Task or Future "
"recursively returns itself."
msgstr "在 Task 或 Future 递归返回自身的情形下会导致栈溢出。"

#: ../NEWS:28737
msgid ""
":issue:`42140`: Improve asyncio.wait function to create the futures set just"
" one time."
msgstr ":issue:`42140`：改进asyncio.wait函数，使其仅创建一次futures集合。"

#: ../NEWS:28740
msgid ""
":issue:`42133`: Update various modules in the stdlib to fall back on "
"``__spec__.loader`` when ``__loader__`` isn't defined on a module."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42133`：更新标准库中的各个模块，以便在模块上未定义 ``__loader__`` 时回退到``__spec__.loader``。"

#: ../NEWS:28743
msgid ""
":issue:`26131`: The ``load_module()`` methods found in ``importlib`` now "
"trigger a ``DeprecationWarning``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26131`：现在在 ``importlib`` 中找到的 ``load_module()`` "
"方法会触发``DeprecationWarning``。"

#: ../NEWS:28746
msgid ""
":issue:`39825`: Windows: Change ``sysconfig.get_config_var('EXT_SUFFIX')`` "
"to the expected full ``platform_tag.extension`` format. Previously it was "
"hard-coded to ``.pyd``, now it is compatible with ``distutils.sysconfig`` "
"and will result in something like ``.cp38-win_amd64.pyd``. This brings "
"windows into conformance with the other platforms."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39825`：Windows：将 ``sysconfig.get_config_var('EXT_SUFFIX')`` "
"更改为预期的完整``platform_tag.extension``格式。之前它被硬编码为 ``.pyd``，现在它与 "
"``distutils.sysconfig``兼容，将产生类似 ``.cp38-win_amd64.pyd`` "
"的结果。这使Windows与其他平台一致。"

#: ../NEWS:28752
msgid ""
":issue:`26389`: The :func:`traceback.format_exception`, "
":func:`traceback.format_exception_only`, and "
":func:`traceback.print_exception` functions can now take an exception object"
" as a positional-only argument."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26389`: "
":func:`traceback.format_exception`、:func:`traceback.format_exception_only` 和"
" :func:`traceback.print_exception` 函数现在可以接受异常对象作为仅位置参数。"

#: ../NEWS:28757
msgid ""
":issue:`41889`: Enum: fix regression involving inheriting a multiply "
"inherited enum"
msgstr ":issue:`41889`: Enum: 修复涉及继承多重继承枚举的回归问题"

#: ../NEWS:28760
msgid ""
":issue:`41861`: Convert :mod:`sqlite3` to use heap types (PEP 384). Patch by"
" Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41861`: 将 :mod:`sqlite3` 转换为使用堆类型（PEP 384）。由Erlend E. Aasland提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:28763
msgid ""
":issue:`40624`: Added support for the XPath ``!=`` operator in xml.etree"
msgstr ":issue:`40624`: 在xml.etree中增加了对XPath ``!=`` 操作符的支持"

#: ../NEWS:28765
msgid ""
":issue:`28850`: Fix :meth:`pprint.PrettyPrinter.format` overrides being "
"ignored for contents of small containers. The :func:`pprint._safe_repr` "
"function was removed."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28850`: 修复 :meth:`pprint.PrettyPrinter.format` "
"对小容器内容的覆盖被忽略的问题。:func:`pprint._safe_repr` 函数已被移除。"

#: ../NEWS:28769
msgid ""
":issue:`41625`: Expose the :c:func:`splice` as :func:`os.splice` in the "
":mod:`os` module. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":issue:`41625`: 将 :c:func:`splice` 作为 :func:`os.splice` 暴露在 :mod:`os` "
"模块中。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

