msgstr ":issue:`42085`: 为发送值添加了 PyAsyncMethods 的专用条目"

#: ../NEWS:29020
msgid ""
":issue:`41073`: :c:func:`PyType_GetSlot()` can now accept static types."
msgstr ":issue:`41073`: :c:func:`PyType_GetSlot()` 现在可以接受静态类型。"

#: ../NEWS:29022
msgid ""
":issue:`30459`: :c:func:`PyList_SET_ITEM`, :c:func:`PyTuple_SET_ITEM` and "
":c:func:`PyCell_SET` macros can no longer be used as l-value or r-value. For"
" example, ``x = PyList_SET_ITEM(a, b, c)`` and ``PyList_SET_ITEM(a, b, c) = "
"x`` now fail with a compiler error. It prevents bugs like ``if "
"(PyList_SET_ITEM (a, b, c) < 0) ...`` test. Patch by Zackery Spytz and "
"Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30459`: :c:func:`PyList_SET_ITEM`, :c:func:`PyTuple_SET_ITEM` 和 "
":c:func:`PyCell_SET` 宏不能再被用作左值或右值。例如，``x = PyList_SET_ITEM(a, b, c)`` 和 "
"``PyList_SET_ITEM(a, b, c) = x`` 现在会引发编译器错误。这防止了像 ``if (PyList_SET_ITEM (a, "
"b, c) < 0) ...`` 这样的测试。由 Zackery Spytz 和 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:29031
msgid "Python 3.10.0 alpha 2"
msgstr "Python 3.10.0 alpha 2"

#: ../NEWS:29033
msgid "*Release date: 2020-11-03*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2020-11-03*"

#: ../NEWS:29038
msgid ""
":issue:`42103`: Prevented potential DoS attack via CPU and RAM exhaustion "
"when processing malformed Apple Property List files in binary format."
msgstr ":issue:`42103`: 防止了处理格式错误的二进制格式Apple属性列表文件时可能通过CPU和RAM耗尽导致的DoS攻击。"

#: ../NEWS:29041
msgid ""
":issue:`42051`: The :mod:`plistlib` module no longer accepts entity "
"declarations in XML plist files to avoid XML vulnerabilities. This should "
"not affect users as entity declarations are not used in regular plist files."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42051`: :mod:`plistlib` 模块不再接受XML "
"plist文件中的实体声明，以避免XML漏洞。这对用户应该没有影响，因为实体声明在常规的plist文件中并未使用。"

#: ../NEWS:29049
msgid ""
":issue:`42236`: If the ``nl_langinfo(CODESET)`` function returns an empty "
"string, Python now uses UTF-8 as the filesystem encoding. Patch by Victor "
"Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42236`: 如果 ``nl_langinfo(CODESET)`` "
"函数返回空字符串，Python现在使用UTF-8作为文件系统编码。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:29053
msgid ""
":issue:`42218`: Fixed a bug in the PEG parser that was causing crashes in "
"debug mode. Now errors are checked in left-recursive rules to avoid cases "
"where such errors do not get handled in time and appear as long-distance "
"crashes in other places."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42218`: "
"修复了PEG解析器中导致调试模式下崩溃的一个错误。现在在左递归规则中检查错误，以避免这些错误未能及时处理并在其他地方表现为长距离崩溃的情况。"

#: ../NEWS:29058
msgid ""
":issue:`42214`: Fixed a possible crash in the PEG parser when checking for "
"the '!=' token in the ``barry_as_flufl`` rule. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42214`: 修复了在 ``barry_as_flufl`` 规则中检查 '!=' 标记时PEG解析器可能崩溃的问题。由 Pablo "
"Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:29061
msgid ""
":issue:`42206`: Propagate and raise the errors caused by "
":c:func:`PyAST_Validate` in the parser."
msgstr ":issue:`42206`: 在解析器中传播并引发由 :c:func:`PyAST_Validate` 引起的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:29064
msgid ""
":issue:`41796`: The :mod:`ast` module internal state is now per interpreter."
" Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ":issue:`41796`: :mod:`ast` 模块的内部状态现在是每个解释器独立的。补丁由 Victor Stinner 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:29067
msgid ""
":issue:`42143`: Fix handling of errors during creation of "
"``PyFunctionObject``, which resulted in operations on uninitialized memory. "
"Patch by Yonatan Goldschmidt."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42143`: 修复了在创建 ``PyFunctionObject`` 过程中错误处理的问题，该问题导致了对未初始化内存的操作。由 "
"Yonatan Goldschmidt 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:29071
msgid ""
":issue:`41659`: Fix a bug in the parser, where a curly brace following a "
"``primary`` didn't fail immediately. This led to invalid expressions like "
"``a {b}`` to throw a :exc:`SyntaxError` with a wrong offset, or invalid "
"expressions ending with a curly brace like ``a {`` to not fail immediately "
"in the REPL."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41659`: 修复解析器中的一个错误，其中在 ``primary`` 后跟随一个大括号时未立即失败。这导致像 ``a {b}`` "
"这样的无效表达式抛出 :exc:`SyntaxError` 时带有错误的偏移量，或者像 ``a {`` 这样以大括号结尾的无效表达式在 REPL "
"中未立即失败。"

#: ../NEWS:29077
msgid ""
":issue:`42150`: Fix possible buffer overflow in the new parser when checking"
" for continuation lines. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":issue:`42150`: 修复新解析器在检查续行时可能出现的缓冲区溢出。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:29080
msgid ""
":issue:`42123`: Run the parser two times. On the first run, disable all the "
"rules that only generate better error messages to gain performance. If "
"there's a parse failure, run the parser a second time with those enabled."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42123`: 运行解析器两次。第一次运行时，禁用所有仅生成更好错误消息的规则以提高性能。如果解析失败，则第二次运行时启用这些规则。"

#: ../NEWS:29084
msgid ""
":issue:`42093`: The ``LOAD_ATTR`` instruction now uses new \"per opcode "
"cache\" mechanism and it is about 36% faster now. Patch by Pablo Galindo and"
" Yury Selivanov."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42093`: ``LOAD_ATTR`` 指令现在使用新的“每个操作码缓存”机制，速度提高了约 36%。补丁由 Pablo "
"Galindo 和 Yury Selivanov 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:29088
msgid ""
":issue:`42030`: Support for the legacy AIX-specific shared library loading "
"support has been removed. All versions of AIX since 4.3 have supported and "
"defaulted to using the common Unix mechanism instead."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42030`: 移除了对旧版 AIX 特定共享库加载的支持。自 4.3 版本以来，所有 AIX 版本都支持并默认使用通用的 Unix "
"机制。"

#: ../NEWS:29092
msgid ""
":issue:`41984`: The garbage collector now tracks all user-defined classes. "
"Patch by Brandt Bucher."
msgstr ":issue:`41984`: 垃圾收集器现在跟踪所有用户定义的类。由 Brandt Bucher 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:29095
msgid ""
":issue:`41993`: Fixed potential issues with removing not completely "
"initialized module from ``sys.modules`` when import fails."
msgstr ":issue:`41993`: 修复了在导入失败时从 ``sys.modules`` 中删除未完全初始化的模块可能引发的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:29098
msgid ""
":issue:`41979`: Star-unpacking is now allowed for with item's targets in the"
" PEG parser."
msgstr ":issue:`41979`: PEG 解析器现在允许在 with 项目的目标中使用星号解包。"

#: ../NEWS:29101
msgid ""
":issue:`41974`: Removed special methods ``__int__``, ``__float__``, "
"``__floordiv__``, ``__mod__``, ``__divmod__``, ``__rfloordiv__``, "
"``__rmod__`` and ``__rdivmod__`` of the :class:`complex` class.  They always"
" raised a :exc:`TypeError`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41974`: 移除了 :class:`complex` 类的特殊方法 ``__int__``, ``__float__``, "
"``__floordiv__``, ``__mod__``, ``__divmod__``, ``__rfloordiv__``, "
"``__rmod__`` 和 ``__rdivmod__``。这些方法总是抛出 :exc:`TypeError`。"

#: ../NEWS:29106
msgid ""
":issue:`41902`: Micro optimization when compute "
":c:member:`~PySequenceMethods.sq_item` and "
":c:member:`~PyMappingMethods.mp_subscript` of :class:`range`. Patch by "
"Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41902`: 在计算 :class:`range` 的 :c:member:`~PySequenceMethods.sq_item` "
"和 :c:member:`~PyMappingMethods.mp_subscript` 时进行了微优化。由 Donghee Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:29111
msgid ""
":issue:`41894`: When loading a native module and a load failure occurs, "
"prevent a possible UnicodeDecodeError when not running in a UTF-8 locale by "
"decoding the load error message using the current locale's encoding."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41894`: 在加载本地模块并且加载失败时，防止在不使用 UTF-8 语言环境运行时可能出现的 "
"UnicodeDecodeError，通过使用当前语言环境的编码解码加载错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:29115
msgid ""
":issue:`41902`: Micro optimization for range.index if step is 1. Patch by "
"Donghee Na."
msgstr ":issue:`41902`: 如果步长为1，对range.index进行微优化。由Donghee Na提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:29121
msgid ""
":issue:`41435`: Add ``sys._current_exceptions()`` function to retrieve a "
"dictionary mapping each thread's identifier to the topmost exception "
"currently active in that thread at the time the function is called."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41435`: 添加 ``sys._current_exceptions()`` "
"函数，用于检索一个字典，该字典将每个线程的标识符映射到调用该函数时该线程中当前活动的顶层异常。"

#: ../NEWS:29128
msgid ""
":issue:`38605`: Enable ``from __future__ import annotations`` (:pep:`563`) "
"by default. The values found in :attr:`~object.__annotations__` dicts are "
"now strings, for example ``{\"x\": \"int\"}`` instead of ``{\"x\": int}``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38605`: 默认启用 ``from __future__ import annotations`` (:pep:`563`)。现在 "
":attr:`~object.__annotations__` 字典中的值是字符串，例如 ``{\"x\": \"int\"}`` "
"而不是``{\"x\": int}``。"

#: ../NEWS:29135
msgid ""
":issue:`35455`: On Solaris, :func:`~time.thread_time` is now implemented "
"with ``gethrvtime()`` because ``clock_gettime(CLOCK_THREAD_CPUTIME_ID)`` is "
"not always available. Patch by Jakub Kulik."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35455`: 在Solaris上，:func:`~time.thread_time` 现在通过 ``gethrvtime()`` "
"实现，因为``clock_gettime(CLOCK_THREAD_CPUTIME_ID)``并不总是可用。由Jakub Kulik提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:29139
msgid ""
":issue:`42233`: The :func:`repr` of :mod:`typing` types containing "
":ref:`Generic Alias Types <types-genericalias>` previously did not show the "
"parameterized types in the ``GenericAlias``.  They have now been changed to "
"do so."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42233`:对于包含 :ref:`Generic Alias Types <types-genericalias>` 的 "
":mod:`typing` 类型，其 :func:`repr` 表示形式此前不会在 ``GenericAlias`` "
"中显示参数化类型。现在这一行为已调整为会显示参数化类型。"

#: ../NEWS:29144
msgid ""
":issue:`29566`: ``binhex.binhex()`` consistently writes macOS 9 line "
"endings."
msgstr ":issue:`29566`: ``binhex.binhex()`` 一致地写入macOS 9行结束符。"

#: ../NEWS:29146
msgid ""
":issue:`26789`: The :class:`logging.FileHandler` class now keeps a reference"
" to the builtin :func:`open` function to be able to open or reopen the file "
"during Python finalization. Fix errors like: ``NameError: name 'open' is not"
" defined``. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26789`: :class:`logging.FileHandler` 类现在保留对内置 :func:`open` "
"函数的引用，以便在Python终止期间能够打开或重新打开文件。修复如 ``NameError: name 'open' is not defined``"
" 的错误。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:29151
msgid ""
":issue:`42157`: Removed the ``unicodedata.ucnhash_CAPI`` attribute which was"
" an internal PyCapsule object. The related private ``_PyUnicode_Name_CAPI`` "
"structure was moved to the internal C API. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42157`: 移除了 ``unicodedata.ucnhash_CAPI`` 属性，这是一个内部的PyCapsule对象。相关的私有"
" ``_PyUnicode_Name_CAPI`` 结构被移动到内部C API。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:29155
msgid ""
":issue:`42157`: Convert the :mod:`unicodedata` extension module to the "
"multiphase initialization API (:pep:`489`) and convert the "
"``unicodedata.UCD`` static type to a heap type. Patch by Mohamed Koubaa and "
"Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42157`: 将 :mod:`unicodedata` 扩展模块转换为多阶段初始化API "
"(:pep:`489`)，并将``unicodedata.UCD``静态类型转换为堆类型。由Mohamed Koubaa和Victor "
"Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:29160
msgid ""
":issue:`42146`: Fix memory leak in :func:`subprocess.Popen` in case an uid "
"(gid) specified in ``user`` (``group``, ``extra_groups``) overflows "
"``uid_t`` (``gid_t``)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42146`: 修复 :func:`subprocess.Popen` 在 ``user``(``group``, "
"``extra_groups``)中指定的uid(gid)溢出 ``uid_t``(``gid_t``)时的内存泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:29164
msgid ""
":issue:`42103`: :exc:`~plistlib.InvalidFileException` and "
":exc:`RecursionError` are now the only errors caused by loading malformed "
"binary Plist file (previously ValueError and TypeError could be raised in "
"some specific cases)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42103`: :exc:`~plistlib.InvalidFileException` 和 "
":exc:`RecursionError` 现在是加载损坏的二进制 Plist 文件时仅会引发的错误（在之前的一些特定情况下可能会引发 "
"ValueError 和 TypeError）。"

#: ../NEWS:29169
msgid ""
":issue:`41490`: In ``importlib.resources``, ``.path`` method is more "
"aggressive about releasing handles to zipfile objects early, enabling use-"
"cases like certifi to leave the context open but delete the underlying zip "
"file."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41490`: 在 ``importlib.resources`` 中，``.path`` 方法更加积极地提前释放对 zipfile "
"对象的句柄，使得像 certifi 这样的用例可以在保持上下文打开的同时删除底层的 zip 文件。"

#: ../NEWS:29173
msgid ""
":issue:`41052`: Pickling heap types implemented in C with protocols 0 and 1 "
"raises now an error instead of producing incorrect data."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41052`: 现在，使用协议 0 和 1 对 C 中实现的堆类型进行 Pickle 操作会引发错误，而不是产生不正确的数据。"

#: ../NEWS:29176
msgid ""
":issue:`42089`: In ``importlib.metadata.PackageNotFoundError``, make "
"reference to the package metadata being missing to improve the user "
"experience."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42089`: 在 ``importlib.metadata.PackageNotFoundError`` "
"中，引用缺失的包元数据以改善用户体验。"

#: ../NEWS:29179
msgid ""
":issue:`41491`: plistlib: fix parsing XML plists with hexadecimal integer "
"values"
msgstr ":issue:`41491`: plistlib: 修复解析带有十六进制整数值的 XML plists 的问题"

#: ../NEWS:29182
msgid ""
":issue:`42065`: Fix an incorrectly formatted error from "
":meth:`!_codecs.charmap_decode` when called with a mapped value outside the "
"range of valid Unicode code points. PR by Max Bernstein."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42065`: 修复了当使用一个超出有效 Unicode 码点范围的映射值调用 "
":meth:`!_codecs.charmap_decode` 时错误格式化的问题。由 Max Bernstein 提交的 PR。"

#: ../NEWS:29186
msgid ""
":issue:`41966`: Fix pickling pure Python :class:`datetime.time` subclasses. "
"Patch by Dean Inwood."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41966`: 修复纯 Python :class:`datetime.time` 子类的 Pickle 操作。由 Dean "
"Inwood 提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:29189
msgid ""
":issue:`19270`: :meth:`sched.scheduler.cancel` will now cancel the correct "
"event, if two events with same priority are scheduled for the same time. "
"Patch by Bar Harel."
msgstr ""
":issue:`19270`: :meth:`sched.scheduler.cancel` "
"现在会取消正确的事件，如果两个具有相同优先级的事件被安排在相同的时间。由 Bar Harel 提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:29193
msgid ""
":issue:`28660`: :func:`textwrap.wrap` now attempts to break long words after"
" hyphens when ``break_long_words=True`` and ``break_on_hyphens=True``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28660`: :func:`textwrap.wrap` 现在在 ``break_long_words=True`` 和 "
"``break_on_hyphens=True`` 时尝试在连字符后断开长单词。"

#: ../NEWS:29196
msgid ""
":issue:`35823`: Use ``vfork()`` instead of ``fork()`` for "
":func:`subprocess.Popen` on Linux to improve performance in cases where it "
"is deemed safe."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35823`: 在 Linux 上为 :func:`subprocess.Popen` 使用 ``vfork()`` 替代 "
"``fork()``，以提高在认为安全的情况下的性能。"

#: ../NEWS:29200
msgid ""
":issue:`42043`: Add support for ``zipfile.Path`` inheritance. "
"``zipfile.Path.is_file()`` now returns False for non-existent names. "
"``zipfile.Path`` objects now expose a ``.filename`` attribute and rely on "
"that to resolve ``.name`` and ``.parent`` when the ``Path`` object is at the"
" root of the zipfile."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42043`: 添加对 ``zipfile.Path`` 继承的支持。``zipfile.Path.is_file()`` "
"现在对于不存在的名称返回 False。``zipfile.Path`` 对象现在暴露一个 ``.filename`` 属性，并依赖该属性在 "
"``Path`` 对象位于 zipfile 根目录时解析 ``.name`` 和 ``.parent``。"

#: ../NEWS:29206
msgid ":issue:`42021`: Fix possible ref leaks in :mod:`sqlite3` module init."
msgstr ":issue:`42021`: 修复 :mod:`sqlite3` 模块初始化中可能的内存泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:29208
msgid ""
":issue:`39101`: Fixed tests using IsolatedAsyncioTestCase from hanging on "
"BaseExceptions."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39101`: 修复了使用 IsolatedAsyncioTestCase 的测试在遇到 BaseExceptions 时挂起的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:29211
msgid ""
":issue:`41976`: Fixed a bug that was causing "
":func:`ctypes.util.find_library` to return ``None`` when triying to locate a"
" library in an environment when gcc>=9 is available and ``ldconfig`` is not."
" Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":issue:`41976`: 修复了一个导致 :func:`ctypes.util.find_library` 在尝试在 gcc>=9 可用但 "
"``ldconfig`` 不可用的环境中定位库时返回 ``None`` 的 bug。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:29215
msgid ""
":issue:`41943`: Fix bug where TestCase.assertLogs doesn't correctly filter "
"messages by level."
msgstr ":issue:`41943`: 修复了 TestCase.assertLogs 不能正确按级别过滤消息的 bug。"

#: ../NEWS:29218
msgid ""
":issue:`41923`: Implement :pep:`613`, introducing :data:`typing.TypeAlias` "
"annotation."
msgstr ":issue:`41923`: 实现了 :pep:`613`，引入了 :data:`typing.TypeAlias` 注解。"

#: ../NEWS:29221
msgid ""
":issue:`41905`: A new function in abc: *update_abstractmethods* to re-"
"calculate an abstract class's abstract status. In addition, *dataclass* has "
"been changed to call this function."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41905`: 在 abc 中添加了一个新函数 *update_abstractmethods* "
"以重新计算抽象类的抽象状态。此外，*dataclass* 已被修改为调用此函数。"

#: ../NEWS:29225
msgid ""
":issue:`23706`: Added *newline* parameter to ``pathlib.Path.write_text()``."
msgstr ":issue:`23706`: 为 ``pathlib.Path.write_text()`` 添加了 *newline* 参数。"

#: ../NEWS:29227
msgid ":issue:`41876`: Tkinter font class repr uses font name"
msgstr ":issue:`41876`: Tkinter 字体类的 repr 使用字体名称。"

#: ../NEWS:29229
msgid ""
":issue:`41831`: ``str()`` for the ``type`` attribute of the "
"``tkinter.Event`` object always returns now the numeric code returned by Tk "
"instead of the name of the event type."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41831`: ``tkinter.Event`` 对象的 ``type`` 属性的 ``str()`` 现在总是返回由 Tk "
"返回的数字代码，而不是事件类型的名称。"

#: ../NEWS:29233
msgid ""
":issue:`39337`: :func:`encodings.normalize_encoding` now ignores non-ASCII "
"characters."
msgstr ":issue:`39337`: :func:`encodings.normalize_encoding` 现在忽略非 ASCII 字符。"

#: ../NEWS:29236
msgid ""
":issue:`41747`: Ensure all methods that generated from "
":func:`dataclasses.dataclass` objects now have the proper ``__qualname__`` "
"attribute referring to the class they belong to. Patch by Batuhan Taskaya."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41747`: 确保所有由 :func:`dataclasses.dataclass` 对象生成的方法现在都有正确的 "
"``__qualname__`` 属性，引用它们所属的类。由 Batuhan Taskaya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:29240
msgid ""
":issue:`30681`: Handle exceptions caused by unparsable date headers when "
"using email \"default\" policy.  Patch by Tim Bell, Georges Toth"
msgstr ""
":issue:`30681`: 在使用 email \"default\" 策略时处理由不可解析的日期头引起的异常。由 Tim Bell 和 "
"Georges Toth 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:29243
msgid ""
":issue:`41586`: Add F_SETPIPE_SZ and F_GETPIPE_SZ to fcntl module. Allow "
"setting pipesize on subprocess.Popen."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41586`: 向 fcntl 模块添加 F_SETPIPE_SZ 和 F_GETPIPE_SZ。允许在 "
"subprocess.Popen 上设置管道大小。"

#: ../NEWS:29246
msgid ""
":issue:`41229`: Add ``contextlib.aclosing`` for deterministic cleanup of "
"async generators which is analogous to ``contextlib.closing`` for non-async "
"generators. Patch by Joongi Kim and John Belmonte."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41229`: 添加 ``contextlib.aclosing`` 用于异步生成器的确定性清理，类似于 "
"``contextlib.closing`` 对于非异步生成器的作用。由 Joongi Kim 和 John Belmonte 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:29250
msgid ""
":issue:`16396`: Allow ``ctypes.wintypes`` to be imported on non-Windows "
"systems."
msgstr ":issue:`16396`: 允许在非 Windows 系统上导入 ``ctypes.wintypes``。"

#: ../NEWS:29253
msgid ":issue:`4356`: Add a key function to the bisect module."
msgstr ":issue:`4356`: 向 bisect 模块添加一个键函数。"

#: ../NEWS:29255
msgid ""
":issue:`40592`: :func:`shutil.which` now ignores empty entries in "
":envvar:`PATHEXT` instead of treating them as a match."
msgstr ""
