msgstr ":issue:`41784`: 将 ``PyUnicode_AsUTF8AndSize`` 添加到有限的 C API 中。"

#: ../NEWS:29387
msgid "Python 3.10.0 alpha 1"
msgstr "Python 3.10.0 alpha 1"

#: ../NEWS:29389
msgid "*Release date: 2020-10-05*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2020-10-05*"

#: ../NEWS:29394
msgid ""
":issue:`41304`: Fixes ``python3x._pth`` being ignored on Windows, caused by "
"the fix for :issue:`29778` (:cve:`2020-15801`)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41304`: 修复了在 Windows 上 ``python3x._pth`` 被忽略的问题，该问题由对 :issue:`29778`"
" 的修复引起 (:cve:`2020-15801`)。"

#: ../NEWS:29397
msgid ""
":issue:`41162`: Audit hooks are now cleared later during finalization to "
"avoid missing events."
msgstr ":issue:`41162`: 审计钩子现在在最终化过程的后期被清除，以避免错过事件。"

#: ../NEWS:29400
msgid ""
":issue:`29778`: Ensure :file:`python3.dll` is loaded from correct locations "
"when Python is embedded (:cve:`2020-15523`)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29778`: 确保当 Python 被嵌入时 :file:`python3.dll` 从正确的位置加载 "
"(:cve:`2020-15523`)。"

#: ../NEWS:29403
msgid ""
":issue:`41004`: The __hash__() methods of  ipaddress.IPv4Interface and "
"ipaddress.IPv6Interface incorrectly generated constant hash values of 32 and"
" 128 respectively. This resulted in always causing hash collisions. The fix "
"uses hash() to generate hash values for the tuple of (address, mask length, "
"network address)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41004`: ipaddress.IPv4Interface 和 ipaddress.IPv6Interface 的 "
"__hash__() 方法错误地生成了分别为 32 和 128 的常量哈希值。这导致了总是发生哈希冲突。修复使用 hash() 来为 (地址, "
"掩码长度, 网络地址) 的元组生成哈希值。"

#: ../NEWS:29409
msgid ""
":issue:`39603`: Prevent http header injection by rejecting control "
"characters in http.client.putrequest(...)."
msgstr ":issue:`39603`: 通过拒绝 http.client.putrequest(...) 中的控制字符来防止 http 头注入。"

#: ../NEWS:29415
msgid ""
":issue:`41909`: Fixed stack overflow in :func:`issubclass` and "
":func:`isinstance` when getting the ``__bases__`` attribute leads to "
"infinite recursion."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41909`: 修复了在 :func:`issubclass` 和 :func:`isinstance` 中当获取 "
"``__bases__`` 属性导致无限递归时的堆栈溢出问题。"

#: ../NEWS:29419
msgid ""
":issue:`41922`: Speed up calls to ``reversed()`` by using the :pep:`590` "
"``vectorcall`` calling convention. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41922`: 通过使用 :pep:`590` ``vectorcall`` 调用约定来加速对 ``reversed()`` 的调用。由"
" Donghee Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:29422
msgid ""
":issue:`41873`: Calls to ``float()`` are now faster due to the "
"``vectorcall`` calling convention. Patch by Dennis Sweeney."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41873`: 由于 ``vectorcall`` 调用约定，对 ``float()`` 的调用现在更快。由 Dennis "
"Sweeney 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:29425
msgid ""
":issue:`41870`: Speed up calls to ``bool()`` by using the :pep:`590` "
"``vectorcall`` calling convention. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41870`: 通过使用 :pep:`590` ``vectorcall`` 调用约定来加速对 ``bool()`` 的调用。补丁由 "
"Donghee Na 提供。"

