msgid ""
":issue:`38156`: Handle interrupts that come after EOF correctly in "
"``PyOS_StdioReadline``."
msgstr ":issue:`38156`: 正确处理在 ``PyOS_StdioReadline`` 中 EOF 之后到来的中断。"

#: ../NEWS:29568
msgid ""
":issue:`41342`: :func:`round` with integer argument is now faster (9--60%)."
msgstr ":issue:`41342`: 现在使用整数参数的 :func:`round` 更快（9--60%）。"

#: ../NEWS:29570
msgid ""
":issue:`41334`: Constructors :func:`str`, :func:`bytes` and "
":func:`bytearray` are now faster (around 30--40% for small objects)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41334`: 构造函数 :func:`str`、:func:`bytes` 和 :func:`bytearray` "
"现在更快（对于小对象大约快 30--40%）。"

#: ../NEWS:29573
msgid ""
":issue:`41295`: Resolve a regression in CPython 3.8.4 where defining "
"\"__setattr__\" in a multi-inheritance setup and calling up the hierarchy "
"chain could fail if builtins/extension types were involved in the base "
"types."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41295`: 解决了 CPython 3.8.4 中的一个回归问题，即在多重继承设置中定义 \"__setattr__\" "
"并调用层次链时，如果基类型涉及内置/扩展类型，可能会失败。"

#: ../NEWS:29578
msgid ""
":issue:`41323`: Bytecode optimizations are performed directly on the control"
" flow graph. This will result in slightly more compact code objects in some "
"circumstances."
msgstr ":issue:`41323`: 字节码优化直接在控制流图上执行。这将在某些情况下使代码对象稍微更紧凑。"

#: ../NEWS:29582
msgid ""
":issue:`41247`: Always cache the running loop holder when running "
"``asyncio.set_running_loop``."
msgstr ":issue:`41247`: 运行 ``asyncio.set_running_loop`` 时，始终缓存运行循环持有者。"

#: ../NEWS:29585
msgid ""
":issue:`41252`: Fix incorrect refcounting in _ssl.c's "
"``_servername_callback()``."
msgstr ":issue:`41252`: 修复 _ssl.c 中 ``_servername_callback()`` 的错误引用计数。"

#: ../NEWS:29588
msgid ""
":issue:`1635741`: Port :mod:`multiprocessing` to multi-phase initialization"
msgstr ":issue:`1635741`: 将 :mod:`multiprocessing` 移植到多阶段初始化。"

#: ../NEWS:29593
msgid ":issue:`1635741`: Port :mod:`winapi` to multiphase initialization"
msgstr ":issue:`1635741`: 将 :mod:`winapi` 移植到多阶段初始化。"

#: ../NEWS:29598
msgid ""
":issue:`41215`: Use non-NULL default values in the PEG parser keyword list "
"to overcome a bug that was preventing Python from being properly compiled "
"when using the XLC compiler. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41215`: 在 PEG 解析器的关键字列表中使用非 NULL 默认值，以克服在使用 XLC 编译器时阻止 Python "
"正确编译的错误。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:29602
msgid ""
":issue:`41218`: Python 3.8.3 had a regression where compiling with "
"ast.PyCF_ALLOW_TOP_LEVEL_AWAIT would aggressively mark list comprehension "
"with CO_COROUTINE. Now only list comprehension making use of async/await "
"will tagged as so."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41218`: Python 3.8.3 有一个回归问题，即使用 ast.PyCF_ALLOW_TOP_LEVEL_AWAIT "
"编译时，会激进地将列表推导标记为 CO_COROUTINE。现在只有使用 async/await 的列表推导才会被这样标记。"

#: ../NEWS:29610
msgid ""
":issue:`1635741`: Port :mod:`faulthandler` to multiphase initialization."
msgstr ":issue:`1635741`: 将 :mod:`faulthandler` 移植到多阶段初始化。"

#: ../NEWS:29612
msgid ":issue:`1635741`: Port :mod:`sha256` to multiphase initialization"
msgstr ":issue:`1635741`: 将 :mod:`sha256` 移植到多阶段初始化。"

#: ../NEWS:29617
msgid ""
":issue:`41175`: Guard against a NULL pointer dereference within "
"bytearrayobject triggered by the ``bytearray() + bytearray()`` operation."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41175`: 防止 ``bytearray() + bytearray()`` 操作触发的 bytearrayobject 内的 "
"NULL 指针解引用。"

#: ../NEWS:29620
msgid ""
":issue:`41100`: add arm64 to the allowable Mac OS arches in mpdecimal.h"
msgstr ":issue:`41100`: 在 mpdecimal.h 中将 arm64 添加到允许的 Mac OS 架构中。"

#: ../NEWS:29622
msgid ""
":issue:`41094`: Fix decoding errors with audit when open files with non-"
"ASCII names on non-UTF-8 locale."
msgstr ":issue:`41094`: 修复在非 UTF-8 语言环境下打开非 ASCII 名称文件时的解码错误。"

#: ../NEWS:29625
msgid ""
":issue:`39960`: The \"hackcheck\" that prevents sneaking around a type's "
"__setattr__() by calling the superclass method was rewritten to allow C "
"implemented heap types."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39960`: 防止通过调用超类方法绕过类型的 __setattr__() 的“hackcheck”被重写，以允许 C 实现的堆类型。"

#: ../NEWS:29629
msgid ""
":issue:`41084`: Prefix the error message with 'f-string: ', when parsing an "
"f-string expression which throws a :exc:`SyntaxError`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41084`: 在解析抛出 :exc:`SyntaxError` 的 f-string 表达式时，在错误消息前加上 'f-string:"
" '。"

#: ../NEWS:29632
msgid ":issue:`40521`: Empty frozensets are no longer singletons."
msgstr ":issue:`40521`: 空的 frozensets 不再是单例。"

#: ../NEWS:29634
msgid ""
":issue:`41076`: Pre-feed the parser with the location of the f-string "
"expression, not the f-string itself, which allows us to skip the shifting of"
" the AST node locations after the parsing is completed."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41076`: 预填充解析器时提供 f-string 表达式的位置，而不是 f-string 本身，这允许我们在解析完成后跳过 AST "
"节点位置的移动。"

#: ../NEWS:29638
msgid ""
":issue:`41056`: Fixes a reference to deallocated stack space during startup "
"when constructing sys.path involving a relative symlink when code was "
"supplied via -c.  (discovered via Coverity)"
msgstr ""
":issue:`41056`: 修复了在启动时通过 -c 提供代码时，涉及相对符号链接构造 sys.path 过程中引用已释放堆栈空间的问题。（通过 "
"Coverity 发现）"

#: ../NEWS:29642
msgid ""
":issue:`41061`: Fix incorrect expressions and asserts in hashtable code and "
"tests."
msgstr ":issue:`41061`: 修复了哈希表代码和测试中的错误表达式和断言。"

#: ../NEWS:29645
msgid ""
":issue:`41052`: Opt out serialization/deserialization for _random.Random"
msgstr ":issue:`41052`: 为 _random.Random 选择退出序列化/反序列化。"

#: ../NEWS:29647
msgid ""
":issue:`40939`: Rename ``PyPegen*`` functions to ``PyParser*``, so that we "
"can remove the old set of ``PyParser*`` functions that were using the old "
"parser, but keep everything backwards-compatible."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40939`: 将 ``PyPegen*`` 函数重命名为 ``PyParser*``，以便我们可以移除使用旧解析器的那组 "
"``PyParser*`` 函数，但保持一切向后兼容。"

#: ../NEWS:29651
msgid ""
":issue:`35975`: Stefan Behnel reported that cf_feature_version is used even "
"when PyCF_ONLY_AST is not set. This is against the intention and against the"
" documented behavior, so it's been fixed."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35975`: Stefan Behnel 报告称，即使 PyCF_ONLY_AST 未设置，也会使用 "
"cf_feature_version。这与意图和文档行为相违背，因此已修复。"

#: ../NEWS:29655
msgid ""
":issue:`40939`: Remove the remaining files from the old parser and the "
":mod:`symbol` module."
msgstr ":issue:`40939`: 移除旧解析器和 :mod:`symbol` 模块的剩余文件。"

#: ../NEWS:29661
msgid ":issue:`40077`: Convert :mod:`!_bz2` to use :c:func:`PyType_FromSpec`."
msgstr ":issue:`40077`: 将 :mod:`!_bz2` 转换为使用 :c:func:`PyType_FromSpec`。"

#: ../NEWS:29666
msgid ""
":issue:`41006`: The ``encodings.latin_1`` module is no longer imported at "
"startup. Now it is only imported when it is the filesystem encoding or the "
"stdio encoding."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41006`: ``encodings.latin_1`` 模块不再在启动时导入。现在仅当它是文件系统编码或 stdio 编码时才导入。"

#: ../NEWS:29670
msgid ""
":issue:`40636`: :func:`zip` now supports :pep:`618`'s ``strict`` parameter, "
"which raises a :exc:`ValueError` if the arguments are exhausted at different"
" lengths. Patch by Brandt Bucher."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40636`: :func:`zip` 现在支持 :pep:`618` 的 ``strict`` 参数，如果参数长度不同，则会引发 "
":exc:`ValueError`。由 Brandt Bucher 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:29674
msgid ":issue:`1635741`: Port :mod:`!_gdbm` to multiphase initialization."
msgstr ":issue:`1635741`: 将 :mod:`!_gdbm` 移植到多阶段初始化。"

#: ../NEWS:29676
msgid ""
":issue:`40985`: Fix a bug that caused the :exc:`SyntaxError` text to be "
"empty when a file ends with a line ending in a line continuation character "
"(i.e. backslash). The error text should contain the text of the last line."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40985`: 修复了一个导致文件以行继续字符（即反斜杠）结尾时，:exc:`SyntaxError` "
"文本为空的错误。错误文本应包含最后一行的文本。"

#: ../NEWS:29680
msgid ""
":issue:`40958`: Fix a possible buffer overflow in the PEG parser when "
"gathering information for emitting syntax errors. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40958`: 修复了 PEG 解析器在收集信息以发出语法错误时可能存在的缓冲区溢出。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:29683
msgid ":issue:`1635741`: Port :mod:`!_dbm` to multiphase initialization."
msgstr ":issue:`1635741`: 将 :mod:`!_dbm` 移植到多阶段初始化。"

#: ../NEWS:29685
msgid ""
":issue:`40957`: Fix refleak in _Py_fopen_obj() when PySys_Audit() fails"
msgstr ":issue:`40957`: 修复 _Py_fopen_obj() 在 PySys_Audit() 失败时的反射泄漏"

#: ../NEWS:29690
msgid ""
":issue:`40950`: Add a state to the :mod:`!nis` module (:pep:`3121`) and "
"apply the multiphase initialization. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40950`: 为 :mod:`!nis` 模块添加状态 (:pep:`3121`) 并应用多阶段初始化。由 Donghee Na "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:29696
msgid ""
":issue:`40947`: The Python :ref:`Path Configuration <init-path-config>` now "
"takes :c:member:`PyConfig.platlibdir` in account."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40947`: Python 的 :ref:`Path Configuration <init-path-config>` 现在考虑了 "
":c:member:`PyConfig.platlibdir`。"

#: ../NEWS:29699
msgid ""
":issue:`40939`: Remove the old parser, the :mod:`parser` module and all "
"associated support code, command-line options and environment variables. "
"Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40939`: 移除了旧解析器、:mod:`parser` 模块以及所有相关的支持代码、命令行选项和环境变量。由 Pablo "
"Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:29703
msgid ""
":issue:`40847`: Fix a bug where a line with only a line continuation "
"character is not considered a blank line at tokenizer level. In such cases, "
"more than a single ``NEWLINE`` token was emitted. The old parser was working"
" around the issue, but the new parser threw a :exc:`SyntaxError` for valid "
"input due to this. For example, an empty line following a line continuation "
"character was interpreted as a :exc:`SyntaxError`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40847`: 修复了一个错误，即在分词器级别，仅包含行继续符的行不被视为空行。在这种情况下，会发出多个 ``NEWLINE`` "
"令牌。旧解析器绕过了这个问题，但新解析器因此对有效输入抛出了 :exc:`SyntaxError`。例如，行继续符后的空行被解释为 "
":exc:`SyntaxError`。"

#: ../NEWS:29710
msgid ""
":issue:`40890`: Each dictionary view now has a ``mapping`` attribute that "
"provides a :class:`types.MappingProxyType` wrapping the original dictionary."
"  Patch contributed by Dennis Sweeney."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40890`: 现在每个字典视图都有一个 ``mapping`` 属性，该属性提供了一个包装原始字典的 "
":class:`types.MappingProxyType`。补丁由 Dennis Sweeney 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:29714
msgid ""
":issue:`40889`: Improved the performance of symmetric difference operations "
"on dictionary item views.  Patch by Dennis Sweeney."
msgstr ":issue:`40889`: 改进了字典项视图上对称差异操作的性能。由 Dennis Sweeney 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:29717
msgid ""
":issue:`40904`: Fix possible segfault in the new PEG parser when parsing "
"f-string containing yield statements with no value (:code:`f\"{yield}\"`). "
"Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":issue:`40904`: 修复了在解析包含无值 yield 语句的 f-string（如 :code:`f\"{yield}\"`）时，新的 "
"PEG 解析器可能出现的段错误。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:29721
msgid ""
":issue:`40903`: Fixed a possible segfault in the new PEG parser when "
"producing error messages for invalid assignments of the form :code:`p=p=`. "
"Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":issue:`40903`: 修复了新的 PEG 解析器在为形式如 :code:`p=p=` 的无效赋值生成错误消息时可能出现的段错误。由 Pablo"
" Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:29725
msgid ""
":issue:`40880`: Fix invalid memory read in the new parser when checking "
"newlines in string literals. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40880`: 修复了在检查字符串字面量中的换行符时，新解析器中的无效内存读取问题。补丁由 Pablo Galindo 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:29728
msgid ""
":issue:`40883`: Fix memory leak in when parsing f-strings in the new parser."
" Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":issue:`40883`: 修复了在新解析器中解析 f-strings 时的内存泄漏问题。补丁由 Pablo Galindo 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:29731
msgid ""
":issue:`40870`: Raise :exc:`ValueError` when validating custom AST's where "
"the constants ``True``, ``False`` and ``None`` are used within a "
":class:`ast.Name` node."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40870`: 在验证自定义 AST 时，如果常量 ``True``、``False`` 和 ``None`` 在 "
":class:`ast.Name` 节点中使用，则抛出 :exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../NEWS:29735
msgid ""
":issue:`40854`: Allow overriding :data:`sys.platlibdir` via a new "
":envvar:`PYTHONPLATLIBDIR` environment variable."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40854`: 允许通过新的环境变量 :envvar:`PYTHONPLATLIBDIR` 覆盖 "
":data:`sys.platlibdir`。"

#: ../NEWS:29738
msgid ""
":issue:`40826`: Fix GIL usage in :c:func:`PyOS_Readline`: lock the GIL to "
"set an exception and pass the Python thread state when checking if there is "
"a pending signal."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40826`: 修复 :c:func:`PyOS_Readline` "
"中的GIL使用：锁定GIL以设置异常，并在检查是否有待处理信号时传递Python线程状态。"

#: ../NEWS:29742
msgid ":issue:`1635741`: Port :mod:`fcntl` to multiphase initialization."
msgstr ":issue:`1635741`: 将 :mod:`fcntl` 移植到多阶段初始化。"

#: ../NEWS:29744
msgid ""
":issue:`19468`: Delete unnecessary instance check in importlib.reload(). "
"Patch by Furkan Önder."
msgstr ":issue:`19468`: 删除 importlib.reload() 中不必要的实例检查。由Furkan Önder提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:29747
msgid ""
":issue:`40824`: Unexpected errors in calling the ``__iter__`` method are no "
"longer masked by ``TypeError`` in the :keyword:`in` operator and functions "
":func:`~operator.contains`, :func:`~operator.indexOf` and "
":func:`~operator.countOf` of the :mod:`operator` module."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40824`: 在 :keyword:`in` 操作符和 :mod:`operator` 模块的函数 "
":func:`~operator.contains`、:func:`~operator.indexOf` 和 "
":func:`~operator.countOf` 中，调用 ``__iter__`` 方法时不再因 ``TypeError`` 而掩盖意外错误。"

#: ../NEWS:29752
msgid ""
":issue:`40792`: Attributes ``start``, ``stop`` and ``step`` of the "
":class:`range` object now always has exact type :class:`int`.  Previously, "
"they could have been an instance of a subclass of ``int``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40792`: :class:`range` 对象的属性 ``start``、``stop`` 和 ``step`` 现在总是具有确切的"
" :class:`int` 类型。之前，它们可能是 ``int`` 子类的实例。"

#: ../NEWS:29756
msgid ""
":issue:`40780`: Fix a corner case where g-style string formatting of a float"
" failed to remove trailing zeros."
msgstr ":issue:`40780`: 修复了浮点数g风格字符串格式化未能移除尾部零的一个边缘情况。"

#: ../NEWS:29759
msgid ""
":issue:`38964`: When there's a :exc:`SyntaxError` in the expression part of "
"an fstring, the filename attribute of the :exc:`SyntaxError` gets correctly "
"set to the name of the file the fstring resides in."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38964`: 当fstring的表达式部分出现 :exc:`SyntaxError` 时，:exc:`SyntaxError` "
"的filename属性现在被正确设置为fstring所在文件的名称。"

#: ../NEWS:29763
msgid ""
":issue:`40750`: Support the \"-d\" debug flag in the new PEG parser. Patch "
"by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":issue:`40750`: 在新的PEG解析器中支持 \"-d\" 调试标志。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:29766
msgid ""
":issue:`40217`: Instances of types created with "
":c:func:`PyType_FromSpecWithBases` will no longer automatically visit their "
"class object when traversing references in the garbage collector. The user "
"is expected to manually visit the object's class. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40217`: 使用 :c:func:`PyType_FromSpecWithBases` "
"创建的类型实例在垃圾收集器中遍历引用时将不再自动访问其类对象。用户需要手动访问对象的类。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:29772
msgid ""
":issue:`39573`: :c:func:`Py_TYPE()` is changed to the inline static "
"function. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ":issue:`39573`: :c:func:`Py_TYPE()` 被改为内联静态函数。由Donghee Na提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:29775
msgid ""
":issue:`40696`: Fix a hang that can arise after :meth:`generator.throw` due "
"to a cycle in the exception context chain."
msgstr ":issue:`40696`: 修复了由于异常上下文链中的循环而在 :meth:`generator.throw` 后可能出现的挂起问题。"

#: ../NEWS:29778
msgid ""
":issue:`40521`: Each interpreter now its has own free lists, singletons and "
"caches:"
msgstr ":issue:`40521`: 每个解释器现在都有自己的空闲列表、单例和缓存："

#: ../NEWS:29781
msgid ""
"Free lists: float, tuple, list, dict, frame, context, asynchronous "
"generator, MemoryError."
msgstr "空闲列表：float、tuple、list、dict、frame、context、异步生成器、MemoryError。"

#: ../NEWS:29783
msgid ""
"Singletons: empty tuple, empty bytes string, empty Unicode string, single "
"byte character, single Unicode (latin1) character."
msgstr "单例：空元组、空字节字符串、空Unicode字符串、单字节字符、单个Unicode（latin1）字符。"

#: ../NEWS:29785
msgid "Slice cache."
msgstr "切片缓存。"

#: ../NEWS:29787
msgid "They are no longer shared by all interpreters."
msgstr "它们不再被所有解释器共享。"

#: ../NEWS:29789
msgid ""
":issue:`40679`: Certain :exc:`TypeError` messages about missing or extra "
"arguments now include the function's :term:`qualified name`.  Patch by "
"Dennis Sweeney."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40679`: 某些关于缺少或多余参数的 :exc:`TypeError` 消息现在包括函数的 :term:`qualified "
"name`。由 Dennis Sweeney 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:29793
msgid ""
":issue:`29590`: Make the stack trace correct after calling "
":meth:`generator.throw` on a generator that has yielded from a ``yield "
"from``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29590`: 在生成器上调用 :meth:`generator.throw` 后，使堆栈跟踪正确，该生成器已经从 ``yield "
"from`` 中产出。"

#: ../NEWS:29797
msgid ""
":issue:`4022`: Improve performance of generators by not raising internal "
"StopIteration."
msgstr ":issue:`4022`: 通过不引发内部 StopIteration 来提高生成器的性能。"

#: ../NEWS:29803
msgid ":issue:`1635741`: Port :mod:`mmap` to multiphase initialization."
msgstr ":issue:`1635741`: 将 :mod:`mmap` 移植到多阶段初始化。"

#: ../NEWS:29805
msgid ":issue:`1635741`: Port :mod:`!_lzma` to multiphase initialization."
msgstr ":issue:`1635741`: 将 :mod:`!_lzma` 移植到多阶段初始化。"

#: ../NEWS:29810
msgid ""
":issue:`37999`: Builtin and extension functions that take integer arguments "
"no longer accept :class:`~decimal.Decimal`\\ s, "
":class:`~fractions.Fraction`\\ s and other objects that can be converted to "
"integers only with a loss (e.g. that have the :meth:`~object.__int__` method"
" but do not have the :meth:`~object.__index__` method)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37999`: 接受整数参数的内置和扩展函数不再接受 :class:`~decimal.Decimal`\\ "
"s、:class:`~fractions.Fraction`\\ s 和其他只能以损失方式转换为整数的对象（例如，具有 "
":meth:`~object.__int__` 方法但不具有 :meth:`~object.__index__` 方法的对象）。"

#: ../NEWS:29816
msgid ""
":issue:`29882`: Add :meth:`int.bit_count`, counting the number of ones in "
"the binary representation of an integer. Patch by Niklas Fiekas."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29882`: 添加 :meth:`int.bit_count`，计算整数二进制表示中1的数量。由 Niklas Fiekas "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:29822
msgid ""
":issue:`36982`: Use ncurses extended color functions when available to "
"support terminals with 256 colors, and add the new function "
":func:`curses.has_extended_color_support` to indicate whether extended color"
" support is provided by the underlying ncurses library."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36982`: 当可用时使用 ncurses 扩展颜色功能以支持具有256色的终端，并添加新函数 "
":func:`curses.has_extended_color_support` 以指示底层 ncurses 库是否提供扩展颜色支持。"

#: ../NEWS:29830
msgid ""
":issue:`19569`: Add the private macros ``_Py_COMP_DIAG_PUSH``, "
"``_Py_COMP_DIAG_IGNORE_DEPR_DECLS``, and ``_Py_COMP_DIAG_POP``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`19569`: 添加私有宏 "
"``_Py_COMP_DIAG_PUSH``、``_Py_COMP_DIAG_IGNORE_DEPR_DECLS`` 和 "
"``_Py_COMP_DIAG_POP``。"

#: ../NEWS:29833
msgid ""
":issue:`26680`: The int type now supports the x.is_integer() method for "
"compatibility with float."
msgstr ":issue:`26680`: int 类型现在支持 x.is_integer() 方法以与 float 兼容。"

#: ../NEWS:29839
msgid ""
":issue:`41900`: C14N 2.0 serialisation in xml.etree.ElementTree failed for "
"unprefixed attributes when a default namespace was defined."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41900`: 在 xml.etree.ElementTree 中的 C14N 2.0 "
"序列化在定义了默认命名空间时，对于未加前缀的属性失败。"

#: ../NEWS:29842
msgid ""
":issue:`41887`: Strip leading spaces and tabs on :func:`ast.literal_eval`. "
"Also document stripping of spaces and tabs for :func:`eval`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41887`: 在 :func:`ast.literal_eval` 上移除前导空格和制表符。同时记录 :func:`eval` "
"对空格和制表符的移除。"

#: ../NEWS:29845
msgid ""
":issue:`41773`: Note in documentation that :func:`random.choices` doesn't "
"support non-finite weights, raise :exc:`ValueError` when given non-finite "
"weights."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41773`: 在文档中注明 :func:`random.choices` 不支持非有限权重，当给定非有限权重时引发 "
":exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../NEWS:29849
msgid ""
":issue:`41840`: Fix a bug in the :mod:`symtable` module that was causing "
"module-scope global variables to not be reported as both local and global. "
"Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41840`: 修复 :mod:`symtable` 模块中的一个 bug，该 bug "
"导致模块作用域的全局变量未被同时报告为局部和全局。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:29853
msgid ""
":issue:`41842`: Add :func:`codecs.unregister` function to unregister a codec"
" search function."
msgstr ":issue:`41842`: 添加 :func:`codecs.unregister` 函数以注销编解码器搜索函数。"

#: ../NEWS:29856
msgid ""
":issue:`40564`: In ``zipfile.Path``, mutate the passed ZipFile object type "
"instead of making a copy. Prevents issues when both the local copy and the "
"caller’s copy attempt to close the same file handle."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40564`: 在 ``zipfile.Path`` 中，改变传递的 ZipFile "
"对象类型而不是制作副本。防止本地副本和调用者的副本尝试关闭同一个文件句柄时出现问题。"

#: ../NEWS:29860
msgid ""
":issue:`40670`: More reliable validation of statements in "
":class:`timeit.Timer`. It now accepts \"empty\" statements (only whitespaces"
" and comments) and rejects misindentent statements."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40670`: 对 :class:`timeit.Timer` "
"中的语句进行更可靠的验证。现在接受“空”语句（仅空白和注释）并拒绝缩进错误的语句。"

#: ../NEWS:29864
msgid ""
":issue:`41833`: The :class:`threading.Thread` constructor now uses the "
"target name if the *target* argument is specified but the *name* argument is"
" omitted."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41833`: :class:`threading.Thread` 构造函数现在在指定 *target* 参数但省略 *name* "
"参数时使用目标名称。"

#: ../NEWS:29868
msgid ""
":issue:`41817`: fix ``tkinter.EventType`` Enum so all members are strings, "
"and none are tuples"
msgstr ":issue:`41817`: 修复 ``tkinter.EventType`` 枚举，使所有成员都是字符串，没有元组。"

#: ../NEWS:29871
msgid ""
":issue:`41810`: :data:`types.EllipsisType`, :data:`types.NotImplementedType`"
" and :data:`types.NoneType` have been reintroduced, providing a new set of "
"types readily interpretable by static type checkers."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41810`: 重新引入了 "
":data:`types.EllipsisType`、:data:`types.NotImplementedType` 和 "
":data:`types.NoneType`，提供了一组新的类型，静态类型检查器可以轻松解释。"

#: ../NEWS:29875
msgid ""
":issue:`41815`: Fix SQLite3 segfault when backing up closed database. Patch "
"contributed by Peter David McCormick."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41815`: 修复 SQLite3 在备份已关闭数据库时的段错误。补丁由 Peter David McCormick 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:29878
msgid ""
":issue:`41816`: StrEnum added: it ensures that all members are already "
"strings or string candidates"
msgstr ":issue:`41816`: 添加了 StrEnum：确保所有成员已经是字符串或字符串候选。"

#: ../NEWS:29881
msgid ""
":issue:`41517`: fix bug allowing Enums to be extended via multiple "
"inheritance"
msgstr ":issue:`41517`: 修复允许通过多重继承扩展枚举的 bug。"

#: ../NEWS:29883
msgid ""
":issue:`39587`: use the correct mix-in data type when constructing Enums"
msgstr ":issue:`39587`: 在构造枚举时使用正确的混合数据类型。"

#: ../NEWS:29885
msgid ""
":issue:`41792`: Add is_typeddict function to typing.py to check if a type is"
" a TypedDict class"
msgstr ":issue:`41792`: 在 typing.py 中添加 is_typeddict 函数以检查类型是否为 TypedDict 类。"

#: ../NEWS:29888
msgid ""
"Previously there was no way to check that without using private API. See the"
" `relevant issue in python/typing "
"<https://github.com/python/typing/issues/751>`_."
msgstr ""
"以前没有不使用私有 API 的方法来检查这一点。参见 `python/typing 中的相关问题 "
"<https://github.com/python/typing/issues/751>`_。"

#: ../NEWS:29892
msgid ""
":issue:`41789`: Honor ``object`` overrides in ``Enum`` class creation "
"(specifically, ``__str__``, ``__repr__``, ``__format__``, and "
"``__reduce_ex__``)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41789`: 在 ``Enum`` 类创建中尊重 ``object`` 覆盖（特别是 "
"``__str__``、``__repr__``、``__format__`` 和 ``__reduce_ex__``）。"

#: ../NEWS:29896
msgid ""
":issue:`32218`: ``enum.Flag`` and ``enum.IntFlag`` members are now iterable."
msgstr ":issue:`32218`: ``enum.Flag`` 和 ``enum.IntFlag`` 成员现在是可迭代的。"

#: ../NEWS:29898
msgid ""
":issue:`39651`: Fix a race condition in the ``call_soon_threadsafe()`` "
"method of ``asyncio.ProactorEventLoop``: do nothing if the self-pipe socket "
"has been closed."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39651`: 修复了 ``asyncio.ProactorEventLoop`` 的 "
"``call_soon_threadsafe()`` 方法中的一个竞态条件：如果自管道套接字已关闭，则不执行任何操作。"

#: ../NEWS:29902
msgid ""
":issue:`1635741`: Port the ``mashal`` extension module to the multi-phase "
"initialization API (:pep:`489`)."
msgstr ":issue:`1635741`: 将 ``mashal`` 扩展模块移植到多阶段初始化API (:pep:`489`)。"

#: ../NEWS:29905
msgid ""
":issue:`1635741`: Port the ``_string`` extension module to the multi-phase "
"initialization API (:pep:`489`)."
msgstr ":issue:`1635741`: 将 ``_string`` 扩展模块移植到多阶段初始化API (:pep:`489`)。"

#: ../NEWS:29908
msgid ":issue:`41732`: Added an :term:`iterator` to :class:`memoryview`."
msgstr ":issue:`41732`: 为 :class:`memoryview` 添加了一个迭代器`。"

#: ../NEWS:29910
msgid ""
":issue:`41720`: Fixed :meth:`turtle.Vec2D.__rmul__` for arguments which are "
"not int or float."
msgstr ":issue:`41720`: 修复了:turtle.Vec2D.__rmul__`对于非int或float参数的处理。"

#: ../NEWS:29913
msgid ""
":issue:`41696`: Fix handling of debug mode in :func:`asyncio.run`. This "
"allows setting ``PYTHONASYNCIODEBUG`` or ``-X dev`` to enable asyncio debug "
"mode when using :func:`asyncio.run`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41696`: 修复了在 :func:`asyncio.run` "
"中调试模式的处理。现在可以通过设置``PYTHONASYNCIODEBUG``或 ``-X dev`` 来在使用 :func:`asyncio.run`"
" 时启用asyncio调试模式。"

#: ../NEWS:29917
msgid ""
":issue:`41687`: Fix implementation of sendfile to be compatible with "
"Solaris."
msgstr ":issue:`41687`: 修复了sendfile的实现以兼容Solaris。"

#: ../NEWS:29919
msgid ""
":issue:`41662`: No longer override exceptions raised in ``__len__()`` of a "
"sequence of parameters in :mod:`sqlite3` with "
":exc:`~sqlite3.ProgrammingError`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41662`: 不再覆盖在 :mod:`sqlite3` 中参数序列的 ``__len__()`` 中引发的异常，而是使用 "
":exc:`~sqlite3.ProgrammingError`。"

#: ../NEWS:29923
msgid ""
":issue:`39010`: Restarting a ``ProactorEventLoop`` on Windows no longer logs"
" spurious ``ConnectionResetErrors``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39010`: 在Windows上重启 ``ProactorEventLoop`` "
"不再记录虚假的``ConnectionResetErrors``。"

#: ../NEWS:29926
msgid ""
":issue:`41638`: :exc:`~sqlite3.ProgrammingError` message for absent "
"parameter in :mod:`sqlite3` contains now the name of the parameter instead "
"of its index when parameters are supplied as a dict."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41638`: 当参数以字典形式提供时，:mod:`sqlite3` 中对于缺少参数的 "
":exc:`~sqlite3.ProgrammingError` 消息现在包含参数名称而不是其索引。"

#: ../NEWS:29930
msgid ""
":issue:`41662`: Fixed crash when mutate list of parameters during iteration "
"in :mod:`sqlite3`."
msgstr ":issue:`41662`: 修复了在 :mod:`sqlite3` 中迭代期间突变参数列表时崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:29933
msgid ""
":issue:`41513`: Improved the accuracy of math.hypot().  Internally, each "
"step is computed with extra precision so that the result is now almost "
"always correctly rounded."
msgstr ":issue:`41513`: 提高了math.hypot()的准确性。内部每一步计算都使用额外的精度，因此结果现在几乎总是正确舍入。"

#: ../NEWS:29937
msgid ""
":issue:`41609`: The pdb whatis command correctly reports instance methods as"
" 'Method' rather than 'Function'."
msgstr ":issue:`41609`: pdb的whatis命令现在正确地将实例方法报告为'Method'而不是'Function'。"

#: ../NEWS:29940
msgid ""
":issue:`39994`: Fixed pprint's handling of dict subclasses that override "
"__repr__."
msgstr ":issue:`39994`: 修复了pprint对于重写__repr__的dict子类的处理。"

#: ../NEWS:29943
msgid ""
":issue:`32751`: When cancelling the task due to a timeout, "
":meth:`asyncio.wait_for` will now wait until the cancellation is complete "
"also in the case when *timeout* is <= 0, like it does with positive "
"timeouts."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32751`: 当由于超时取消任务时，:meth:`asyncio.wait_for` 现在也会在*timeout* <= "
"0的情况下等待取消完成，就像对正超时那样。"

#: ../NEWS:29948
msgid ""
":issue:`37658`: :meth:`asyncio.wait_for` now properly handles races between "
"cancellation of itself and the completion of the wrapped awaitable."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37658`: :meth:`asyncio.wait_for` 现在正确处理了自身取消与包装的可等待对象完成之间的竞争条件。"

#: ../NEWS:29951
msgid ""
":issue:`40782`: Change the method asyncio.AbstractEventLoop.run_in_executor "
"to not be a coroutine."
msgstr ":issue:`40782`: 将方法 asyncio.AbstractEventLoop.run_in_executor 改为不是协程。"

#: ../NEWS:29954
msgid ""
":issue:`41520`: Fix :mod:`codeop` regression that prevented turning compile "
"warnings into errors."
msgstr ":issue:`41520`: 修复 :mod:`codeop` 回归问题，该问题阻止了将编译警告转为错误。"

#: ../NEWS:29957
msgid ""
":issue:`41528`: turtle uses math module functions to convert degrees to "
"radians and vice versa and to calculate vector norm"
msgstr ":issue:`41528`: turtle 使用数学模块函数来转换度与弧度，以及计算向量范数。"

#: ../NEWS:29960
msgid ""
":issue:`41513`: Minor algorithmic improvement to math.hypot() and "
"math.dist() giving small gains in speed and accuracy."
msgstr ":issue:`41513`: 对 math.hypot() 和 math.dist() 进行了小的算法改进，略微提高了速度和准确性。"

#: ../NEWS:29963
msgid ""
":issue:`41503`: Fixed a race between setTarget and flush in "
"logging.handlers.MemoryHandler."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41503`: 修复了 logging.handlers.MemoryHandler 中 setTarget 和 flush "
"之间的竞争条件。"

#: ../NEWS:29966
msgid ":issue:`41497`: Fix potential UnicodeDecodeError in dis module."
msgstr ":issue:`41497`: 修复 dis 模块中潜在的 UnicodeDecodeError。"

#: ../NEWS:29968
msgid ""
":issue:`41467`: On Windows, fix asyncio ``recv_into()`` return value when "
"the socket/pipe is closed (:exc:`BrokenPipeError`): return ``0`` rather than"
" an empty byte string (``b''``)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41467`: 在 Windows 上，修复 asyncio ``recv_into()`` 当套接字/管道关闭时的返回值 "
"(:exc:`BrokenPipeError`): 返回 ``0`` 而不是空字节串 (``b''``)。"

#: ../NEWS:29972
msgid ":issue:`41425`: Make tkinter doc example runnable."
msgstr ":issue:`41425`: 使 tkinter 文档示例可运行。"

#: ../NEWS:29974
msgid ""
":issue:`41421`: Make an algebraic simplification to random.paretovariate()."
"  It now is slightly less subject to round-off error and is slightly faster."
" Inputs that used to cause ZeroDivisionError now cause an OverflowError "
"instead."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41421`: 对 random.paretovariate() 进行了代数简化。现在它略微减少了舍入误差，速度也略有提升。之前导致 "
"ZeroDivisionError 的输入现在会导致 OverflowError。"

#: ../NEWS:29979
msgid ":issue:`41440`: Add :func:`os.cpu_count` support for VxWorks RTOS."
msgstr ":issue:`41440`: 为 VxWorks RTOS 添加 :func:`os.cpu_count` 支持。"

#: ../NEWS:29981
msgid ""
":issue:`41316`: Fix the :mod:`tarfile` module to write only basename of TAR "
"file to GZIP compression header."
msgstr ":issue:`41316`: 修复 :mod:`tarfile` 模块，使其仅将 TAR 文件的基本名写入 GZIP 压缩头。"

#: ../NEWS:29984
msgid ""
":issue:`41384`: Raise TclError instead of TypeError when an unknown option "
"is passed to tkinter.OptionMenu."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41384`: 当向 tkinter.OptionMenu 传递未知选项时，抛出 TclError 而不是 TypeError。"

#: ../NEWS:29987
msgid ""
":issue:`41317`: Use add_done_callback() in asyncio.loop.sock_accept() to "
"unsubscribe reader early on cancellation."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41317`: 在 asyncio.loop.sock_accept() 中使用 add_done_callback() "
"以在取消时尽早取消订阅读取器。"

#: ../NEWS:29990
msgid ":issue:`41364`: Reduce import overhead of :mod:`uuid`."
msgstr ":issue:`41364`: 减少 :mod:`uuid` 的导入开销。"

#: ../NEWS:29992
msgid ""
":issue:`35328`: Set the environment variable ``VIRTUAL_ENV_PROMPT`` at "
":mod:`venv` activation."
msgstr ":issue:`35328`: 在 :mod:`venv` 激活时设置环境变量 ``VIRTUAL_ENV_PROMPT``。"

#: ../NEWS:29995
msgid ""
":issue:`41341`: Recursive evaluation of ``typing.ForwardRef`` in "
"``get_type_hints``."
msgstr ":issue:`41341`: 在 ``get_type_hints`` 中递归评估 ``typing.ForwardRef``。"

#: ../NEWS:29998
msgid ""
":issue:`41344`: Prevent creating :class:`shared_memory.SharedMemory` objects"
" with :code:`size=0`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41344`: 防止创建 :code:`size=0` 的 :class:`shared_memory.SharedMemory` "
"对象。"

#: ../NEWS:30001
msgid ""
":issue:`41333`: :meth:`collections.OrderedDict.pop` is now 2 times faster."
msgstr ":issue:`41333`: :meth:`collections.OrderedDict.pop` 现在速度提高了 2 倍。"

#: ../NEWS:30003
msgid ""
":issue:`41288`: Unpickling invalid NEWOBJ_EX opcode with the C "
"implementation raises now UnpicklingError instead of crashing."
msgstr ":issue:`41288`: 使用C实现时，反序列化无效的NEWOBJ_EX操作码现在会引发UnpicklingError，而不是崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:30006
msgid ""
":issue:`39017`: Avoid infinite loop when reading specially crafted TAR files"
" using the tarfile module (:cve:`2019-20907`)."
msgstr ":issue:`39017`: 避免在使用tarfile模块读取特制的TAR文件时出现无限循环（:cve:`2019-20907`）。"

#: ../NEWS:30009
msgid ""
":issue:`41273`: Speed up any transport using ``_ProactorReadPipeTransport`` "
"by calling ``recv_into`` instead of ``recv``, thus not creating a new buffer"
" for each ``recv`` call in the transport's read loop."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41273`: 通过调用 ``recv_into`` 而非 ``recv``，加快使用 "
"``_ProactorReadPipeTransport``的任何传输速度，从而不在传输的读取循环中为每次 ``recv`` 调用创建新缓冲区。"

#: ../NEWS:30013
msgid ""
":issue:`41235`: Fix the error handling in "
":meth:`ssl.SSLContext.load_dh_params`."
msgstr ":issue:`41235`: 修复了 :meth:`ssl.SSLContext.load_dh_params` 中的错误处理。"

#: ../NEWS:30016
msgid ""
":issue:`41207`: In distutils.spawn, restore expectation that "
"DistutilsExecError is raised when the command is not found."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41207`: 在distutils.spawn中，恢复了当命令未找到时引发DistutilsExecError的预期行为。"

#: ../NEWS:30019
msgid ""
":issue:`29727`: Register :class:`array.array` as a "
":class:`~collections.abc.MutableSequence`. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29727`: 将 :class:`array.array` 注册为 "
":class:`~collections.abc.MutableSequence`。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:30022
msgid ""
":issue:`39168`: Remove the ``__new__`` method of :class:`typing.Generic`."
msgstr ":issue:`39168`: 移除了 :class:`typing.Generic` 的 ``__new__`` 方法。"

#: ../NEWS:30024
msgid ""
":issue:`41194`: Fix a crash in the ``_ast`` module: it can no longer be "
"loaded more than once. It now uses a global state rather than a module "
"state."
msgstr ":issue:`41194`: 修复了 ``_ast`` 模块中的崩溃问题：它现在不能被多次加载。它现在使用全局状态而非模块状态。"

#: ../NEWS:30027
msgid ""
":issue:`41195`: Add read-only ssl.SSLContext.security_level attribute to "
"retrieve the context's security level."
msgstr ":issue:`41195`: 添加了只读的ssl.SSLContext.security_level属性，用于检索上下文的安全级别。"

#: ../NEWS:30030
msgid ""
":issue:`41193`: The ``write_history()`` atexit function of the readline "
"completer now ignores any :exc:`OSError` to ignore error if the filesystem "
"is read-only, instead of only ignoring :exc:`FileNotFoundError` and "
":exc:`PermissionError`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41193`: readline completer的 ``write_history()`` atexit函数现在忽略任何 "
":exc:`OSError`，以在文件系统为只读时忽略错误，而不仅仅是忽略 :exc:`FileNotFoundError` 和 "
":exc:`PermissionError`。"

#: ../NEWS:30035
msgid ""
":issue:`41182`: selector: use DefaultSelector based upon implementation"
msgstr ":issue:`41182`: selector: 根据实现使用DefaultSelector"

#: ../NEWS:30037
msgid ""
":issue:`41161`: The decimal module now requires libmpdec-2.5.0. Users of "
"--with-system-libmpdec should update their system library."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41161`: decimal模块现在需要libmpdec-2.5.0。使用--with-system-"
"libmpdec的用户应更新其系统库。"

#: ../NEWS:30040
msgid ":issue:`40874`: The decimal module now requires libmpdec-2.5.0."
msgstr ":issue:`40874`: decimal模块现在需要libmpdec-2.5.0。"

#: ../NEWS:30042
msgid ""
":issue:`41138`: Fixed the :mod:`trace` module CLI for Python source files "
"with non-UTF-8 encoding."
msgstr ":issue:`41138`: 修复了 :mod:`trace` 模块CLI对于非UTF-8编码的Python源文件的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:30045
msgid ""
":issue:`31082`: Use the term \"iterable\" in the docstring for "
":func:`functools.reduce`."
msgstr ":issue:`31082`: 在 :func:`functools.reduce` 的文档字符串中使用术语“可迭代对象”。"

#: ../NEWS:30048
msgid ":issue:`40521`: Remove freelist from collections.deque()."
msgstr ":issue:`40521`: 从collections.deque()中移除freelist。"

#: ../NEWS:30050
msgid ""
":issue:`31938`: Fix default-value signatures of several functions in the "
":mod:`select` module - by Anthony Sottile."
msgstr ":issue:`31938`: 修复了 :mod:`select` 模块中几个函数的默认值签名 - 由Anthony Sottile提供。"

#: ../NEWS:30053
msgid ""
":issue:`41068`: Fixed reading files with non-ASCII names from ZIP archive "
"directly after writing them."
msgstr ":issue:`41068`: 修复了直接从ZIP存档中读取非ASCII名称文件后立即写入的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:30056
msgid ""
":issue:`41058`: :func:`pdb.find_function` now correctly determines the "
"source file encoding."
msgstr ":issue:`41058`: :func:`pdb.find_function` 现在能正确确定源文件的编码。"

#: ../NEWS:30059
msgid ""
":issue:`41056`: Invalid file descriptor values are now prevented from being "
"passed to os.fpathconf. (discovered by Coverity)"
msgstr ":issue:`41056`: 现在阻止将无效的文件描述符值传递给os.fpathconf。(由Coverity发现)"

#: ../NEWS:30062
msgid ""
":issue:`41056`: Fix a NULL pointer dereference within the ssl module during "
"a MemoryError in the keylog callback. (discovered by Coverity)"
msgstr ""
":issue:`41056`: 修复了ssl模块中在keylog回调中发生MemoryError时的NULL指针解引用问题。(由Coverity发现)"

#: ../NEWS:30065
msgid ""
":issue:`41056`: Fixed an instance where a MemoryError within the zoneinfo "
"module might not be reported or not reported at its source. (found by "
"Coverity)"
msgstr ""
":issue:`41056`: 修复了zoneinfo模块中MemoryError可能未被报告或未在其源头报告的情况。(由Coverity发现)"

#: ../NEWS:30069
msgid ""
":issue:`41048`: :func:`mimetypes.read_mime_types` function reads the rule "
"file using UTF-8 encoding, not the locale encoding. Patch by Srinivas Reddy "
"Thatiparthy."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41048`: :func:`mimetypes.read_mime_types` "
"函数现在使用UTF-8编码而非本地编码读取规则文件。由Srinivas Reddy Thatiparthy提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:30073
msgid ""
":issue:`41043`: Fixed the use of :func:`~glob.glob` in the stdlib: literal "
"part of the path is now always correctly escaped."
msgstr ":issue:`41043`: 修复了stdlib中 :func:`~glob.glob` 的使用：路径的字面部分现在总是被正确转义。"

#: ../NEWS:30076
