":issue:`41689`: 使用 :c:func:`PyType_FromSpec` 创建的类型现在可以从 "
"``__text_signature__`` 访问其 ``tp_doc`` 槽中的任何签名。"

#: ../NEWS:30554
msgid ""
":issue:`41524`: Fix bug in :c:func:`PyOS_mystrnicmp` and "
":c:func:`PyOS_mystricmp` that incremented pointers beyond the end of a "
"string."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41524`: 修复Fix bug in :c:func:`PyOS_mystrnicmp` 和 "
":c:func:`PyOS_mystricmp` 中增加指针超出字符串末尾的程序缺陷。"

#: ../NEWS:30558
msgid ""
":issue:`41324`: Add a minimal decimal capsule API.  The API supports fast "
"conversions between Decimals up to 38 digits and their triple representation"
" as a C struct."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41324`: 添加一个最小的十进制胶囊 API。该 API 支持最多 38 位数字的 Decimal 与其作为 C "
"结构体的三元表示之间的快速转换。"

#: ../NEWS:30562
msgid ""
":issue:`30155`: Add :c:func:`PyDateTime_DATE_GET_TZINFO` and "
":c:func:`PyDateTime_TIME_GET_TZINFO` macros for accessing the ``tzinfo`` "
"attributes of :class:`datetime.datetime` and :class:`datetime.time` objects."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30155`: 添加 :c:func:`PyDateTime_DATE_GET_TZINFO` 和 "
":c:func:`PyDateTime_TIME_GET_TZINFO` 宏，用于访问 :class:`datetime.datetime` 和 "
":class:`datetime.time` 对象的 ``tzinfo`` 属性。"

#: ../NEWS:30567
msgid ""
":issue:`40170`: Revert :c:func:`PyType_HasFeature` change: it reads again "
"directly the :c:member:`PyTypeObject.tp_flags` member when the limited C API"
" is not used, rather than always calling :c:func:`PyType_GetFlags` which "
"hides implementation details."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40170`: 回滚 :c:func:`PyType_HasFeature` 更改：当不使用有限的 C API 时，它再次直接读取 "
":c:member:`PyTypeObject.tp_flags` 成员，而不是总是调用隐藏实现细节的 "
":c:func:`PyType_GetFlags`。"

#: ../NEWS:30572
msgid ":issue:`41123`: Remove ``PyUnicode_AsUnicodeCopy``."
msgstr ":issue:`41123`: 移除 ``PyUnicode_AsUnicodeCopy``。"

#: ../NEWS:30574
msgid ":issue:`41123`: Removed ``PyLong_FromUnicode()``."
msgstr ":issue:`41123`: 移除 ``PyLong_FromUnicode()``。"

#: ../NEWS:30576
msgid ":issue:`41123`: Removed ``PyUnicode_GetMax()``."
msgstr ":issue:`41123`: 移除 ``PyUnicode_GetMax()``。"

#: ../NEWS:30578
msgid ""
":issue:`41123`: Removed ``Py_UNICODE_str*`` functions manipulating "
"``Py_UNICODE*`` strings."
msgstr ":issue:`41123`: 移除操作 ``Py_UNICODE*`` 字符串的 ``Py_UNICODE_str*`` 函数。"

#: ../NEWS:30581
msgid ""
":issue:`41103`: ``PyObject_AsCharBuffer()``, ``PyObject_AsReadBuffer()``, "
"``PyObject_CheckReadBuffer()``, and ``PyObject_AsWriteBuffer()`` are "
"removed. Please migrate to new buffer protocol; :c:func:`PyObject_GetBuffer`"
" and :c:func:`PyBuffer_Release`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41103`: 移除 "
"``PyObject_AsCharBuffer()``、``PyObject_AsReadBuffer()``、``PyObject_CheckReadBuffer()``"
" 和 ``PyObject_AsWriteBuffer()``。请迁移到新的缓冲区协议；:c:func:`PyObject_GetBuffer` 和 "
":c:func:`PyBuffer_Release`。"

#: ../NEWS:30586
msgid ""
":issue:`36346`: Raises DeprecationWarning for ``PyUnicode_FromUnicode(NULL, "
"size)`` and ``PyUnicode_FromStringAndSize(NULL, size)`` with ``size > 0``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36346`: 对于 ``PyUnicode_FromUnicode(NULL, size)`` 和 "
"``PyUnicode_FromStringAndSize(NULL, size)`` 当 ``size > 0`` 时引发 "
"DeprecationWarning。"

#: ../NEWS:30589
msgid ""
":issue:`36346`: Mark ``Py_UNICODE_COPY``, ``Py_UNICODE_FILL``, "
"``PyUnicode_WSTR_LENGTH``, ``PyUnicode_FromUnicode``, "
"``PyUnicode_AsUnicode``, and ``PyUnicode_AsUnicodeAndSize`` as deprecated in"
" C. Remove ``Py_UNICODE_MATCH`` which was deprecated and broken since Python"
" 3.3."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36346`: 在 C 中标记 "
"``Py_UNICODE_COPY``、``Py_UNICODE_FILL``、``PyUnicode_WSTR_LENGTH``、``PyUnicode_FromUnicode``、``PyUnicode_AsUnicode``"
" 和 ``PyUnicode_AsUnicodeAndSize`` 为弃用。移除自 Python 3.3 以来已被弃用且损坏的 "
"``Py_UNICODE_MATCH``。"

#: ../NEWS:30595
msgid ""
":issue:`40989`: The :c:func:`PyObject_INIT` and :c:func:`PyObject_INIT_VAR` "
"macros become aliases to, respectively, :c:func:`PyObject_Init` and "
":c:func:`PyObject_InitVar` functions."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40989`: :c:func:`PyObject_INIT` 和 :c:func:`PyObject_INIT_VAR` 宏分别成为 "
":c:func:`PyObject_Init` 和 :c:func:`PyObject_InitVar` 函数的别名。"

#: ../NEWS:30599
msgid ""
":issue:`36020`: On Windows, ``#include \"pyerrors.h\"`` no longer defines "
"``snprintf`` and ``vsnprintf`` macros."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36020`: 在 Windows 上，``#include \"pyerrors.h\"`` 不再定义 ``snprintf`` 和 "
"``vsnprintf`` 宏。"

#: ../NEWS:30602
msgid ""
":issue:`40943`: The ``PY_SSIZE_T_CLEAN`` macro must now be defined to use "
":c:func:`PyArg_ParseTuple` and :c:func:`Py_BuildValue` formats which use "
"``#``: ``es#``, ``et#``, ``s#``, ``u#``, ``y#``, ``z#``, ``U#`` and ``Z#``. "
"See :ref:`Parsing arguments and building values <arg-parsing>` and the "
":pep:`353`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40943`: 现在必须定义 ``PY_SSIZE_T_CLEAN`` 宏才能使用 :c:func:`PyArg_ParseTuple`"
" 和 :c:func:`Py_BuildValue` 格式，这些格式使用 ``#``: ``es#``、 ``et#``、 ``s#``、 "
"``u#``、 ``y#``、 ``z#``、 ``U#`` 和 ``Z#``。参见 :ref:`Parsing arguments and "
"building values <arg-parsing>` 和 :pep:`353`。"

#: ../NEWS:30608
msgid ""
":issue:`40910`: Export explicitly the :c:func:`Py_GetArgcArgv` function to "
"the C API and document the function. Previously, it was exported implicitly "
"which no longer works since Python is built with ``-fvisibility=hidden``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40910`: 显式地将 :c:func:`Py_GetArgcArgv` 函数导出到 C API "
"并记录该函数。之前，它是隐式导出的，由于 Python 是用 ``-fvisibility=hidden`` 构建的，这种方式不再有效。"

#: ../NEWS:30612
msgid ":issue:`40724`: Allow defining buffer slots in type specs."
msgstr ":issue:`40724`: 允许在类型规范中定义缓冲区槽。"

#: ../NEWS:30614
msgid ""
":issue:`40679`: Fix a ``_PyEval_EvalCode()`` crash if *qualname* argument is"
" NULL."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40679`: 修复了如果 *qualname* 参数为 NULL 时 ``_PyEval_EvalCode()`` 的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:30617
msgid ""
":issue:`40839`: Calling :c:func:`PyDict_GetItem` without :term:`GIL` held "
"had been allowed for historical reason. It is no longer allowed."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40839`: 由于历史原因，允许在不持有 :term:`GIL` 的情况下调用 "
":c:func:`PyDict_GetItem`。现在不再允许这样做。"

#: ../NEWS:30620
msgid ""
":issue:`40826`: :c:func:`PyOS_InterruptOccurred` now fails with a fatal "
"error if it is called with the GIL released."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40826`: 现在如果在 GIL 释放的情况下调用 "
":c:func:`PyOS_InterruptOccurred`，将会失败并产生致命错误。"

#: ../NEWS:30623
msgid ""
":issue:`40792`: The result of :c:func:`PyNumber_Index` now always has exact "
"type :class:`int`. Previously, the result could have been an instance of a "
"subclass of ``int``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40792`: :c:func:`PyNumber_Index` 的结果现在总是具有确切的 :class:`int` "
"类型。以前，结果可能是 ``int`` 的子类的实例。"

#: ../NEWS:30627
msgid ""
":issue:`39573`: Convert :c:func:`Py_REFCNT` and :c:func:`Py_SIZE` macros to "
"static inline functions. They cannot be used as l-value anymore: use "
":c:func:`Py_SET_REFCNT` and :c:func:`Py_SET_SIZE` to set an object reference"
" count and size. This change is backward incompatible on purpose, to prepare"
" the C API for an opaque :c:type:`PyObject` structure."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39573`: 将 :c:func:`Py_REFCNT` 和 :c:func:`Py_SIZE` "
"宏转换为静态内联函数。它们不能再被用作左值：使用 :c:func:`Py_SET_REFCNT` 和 :c:func:`Py_SET_SIZE` "
"来设置对象的引用计数和大小。这一变化是有意为之的不兼容更改，目的是为 C API 准备一个不透明的 :c:type:`PyObject` 结构。"

#: ../NEWS:30633
msgid ""
":issue:`40703`: The PyType_FromSpec*() functions no longer overwrite the "
"type's \"__module__\" attribute if it is set via \"Py_tp_members\" or "
"\"Py_tp_getset\"."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40703`: PyType_FromSpec*() 函数不再覆盖类型的 \"__module__\" 属性，如果该属性是通过 "
"\"Py_tp_members\" 或 \"Py_tp_getset\" 设置的。"

#: ../NEWS:30636
msgid ""
":issue:`39583`: Remove superfluous \"extern C\" declarations from "
"``Include/cpython/*.h``."
msgstr ":issue:`39583`: 从 ``Include/cpython/*.h`` 中删除了多余的 \"extern C\" 声明。"

#: ../NEWS:30641
msgid "Python 3.9.0 beta 1"
msgstr "Python 3.9.0 beta 1"

#: ../NEWS:30643
msgid "*Release date: 2020-05-19*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2020-05-19*"

#: ../NEWS:30648
msgid ""
":issue:`40501`: :mod:`uuid` no longer uses :mod:`ctypes` to load "
":file:`libuuid` or :file:`rpcrt4.dll` at runtime."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40501`: :mod:`uuid` 不再使用 :mod:`ctypes` 在运行时加载 :file:`libuuid` 或 "
":file:`rpcrt4.dll`。"

#: ../NEWS:30654
msgid ""
":issue:`40663`: Correctly generate annotations where parentheses are omitted"
" but required (e.g: ``Type[(str, int, *other))]``."
msgstr ":issue:`40663`: 正确生成省略了括号但需要的地方的注释（例如：``Type[(str, int, *other))]``）。"

#: ../NEWS:30657
msgid ""
":issue:`40596`: Fixed :meth:`str.isidentifier` for non-canonicalized strings"
" containing non-BMP characters on Windows."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40596`: 修复了 Windows 上 :meth:`str.isidentifier` 对于包含非 BMP "
"字符的非规范化字符串的处理。"

#: ../NEWS:30660
msgid ""
":issue:`40593`: Improved syntax errors for invalid characters in source "
"code."
msgstr ":issue:`40593`: 改进了源代码中无效字符的语法错误提示。"

#: ../NEWS:30662
msgid ""
":issue:`40585`: Fixed a bug when using :func:`codeop.compile_command` that "
"was causing exceptions to be swallowed with the new parser. Patch by Pablo "
"Galindo"
msgstr ""
":issue:`40585`: 修复了使用 :func:`codeop.compile_command` 时的一个 bug，该 bug "
"导致新解析器吞没了异常。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:30666
msgid ":issue:`40566`: Apply :pep:`573` to :mod:`abc`."
msgstr ":issue:`40566`: 将 :pep:`573` 应用到 :mod:`abc`。"

#: ../NEWS:30668
msgid ""
":issue:`40502`: Initialize ``n->n_col_offset``. (Patch by Joannah Nanjekye)"
msgstr ":issue:`40502`: 初始化 ``n->n_col_offset``。（由 Joannah Nanjekye 提供补丁）"

#: ../NEWS:30670
msgid ""
":issue:`40527`: Fix command line argument parsing: no longer write errors "
"multiple times into stderr."
msgstr ":issue:`40527`: 修复命令行参数解析：不再多次将错误写入 stderr。"

#: ../NEWS:30673
msgid ""
":issue:`1635741`: Port :mod:`errno` to multiphase initialization "
"(:pep:`489`)."
msgstr ":issue:`1635741`: 将 :mod:`errno` 移植到多阶段初始化 (:pep:`489`)。"

#: ../NEWS:30675
msgid ""
":issue:`40523`: Add pass-throughs for :func:`hash` and :func:`reversed` to "
":class:`weakref.proxy` objects. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40523`: 为 :class:`weakref.proxy` 对象添加 :func:`hash` 和 "
":func:`reversed` 的透传。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:30678
msgid ""
":issue:`1635741`: Port :mod:`syslog` to multiphase initialization "
"(:pep:`489`)."
msgstr ":issue:`1635741`: 将 :mod:`syslog` 移植到多阶段初始化 (:pep:`489`)。"

#: ../NEWS:30680
msgid ""
":issue:`40246`: Reporting a specialised error message for invalid string "
"prefixes, which was introduced in :issue:`40246`, is being reverted due to "
"backwards compatibility concerns for strings that immediately follow a "
"reserved keyword without whitespace between them. Constructs like "
"``bg=\"#d00\" if clear else\"#fca\"`` were failing to parse, which is not an"
" acceptable breakage on such short notice."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40246`: 由于向后兼容性的考虑，对于紧跟在保留关键字后且两者之间没有空格的字符串，撤销了在 :issue:`40246` "
"中引入的针对无效字符串前缀的专门错误消息报告。像 ``bg=\"#d00\" if clear else\"#fca\"`` "
"这样的构造无法解析，这在如此短的通知时间内是不可接受的破坏。"

#: ../NEWS:30687
msgid ""
":issue:`40417`: Fix imp module deprecation warning when "
"PyImport_ReloadModule is called. Patch by Robert Rouhani."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40417`: 修复了当调用 PyImport_ReloadModule 时 imp 模块的弃用警告。由 Robert Rouhani "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:30690
msgid ""
":issue:`40408`: Fixed support of nested type variables in GenericAlias (e.g."
" ``list[list[T]]``)."
msgstr ":issue:`40408`: 修复了在 GenericAlias 中嵌套类型变量（如 ``list[list[T]]``）的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:30693
msgid ""
":issue:`1635741`: Port _stat module to multiphase initialization "
"(:pep:`489`)."
msgstr ":issue:`1635741`: 将 _stat 模块移植到多阶段初始化 (:pep:`489`)。"

#: ../NEWS:30695
msgid ""
":issue:`29587`: Enable implicit exception chaining when calling "
":meth:`generator.throw`."
msgstr ":issue:`29587`: 在调用 :meth:`generator.throw` 时启用隐式异常链。"

#: ../NEWS:30698
msgid ""
":issue:`40328`: Add tools for generating mappings headers for CJKCodecs."
msgstr ":issue:`40328`: 为 CJKCodecs 添加生成映射头文件的工具。"

#: ../NEWS:30700
msgid ""
":issue:`40228`: Setting frame.f_lineno is now robust w.r.t. changes in the "
"source-to-bytecode compiler"
msgstr ":issue:`40228`: 现在设置 frame.f_lineno 对于源代码到字节码编译器的变化是健壮的。"

#: ../NEWS:30703
msgid ""
":issue:`38880`: Added the ability to list interpreters associated with "
"channel ends in the internal subinterpreters module."
msgstr ":issue:`38880`: 在内置子解释器模块中添加了列出与通道端相关联的解释器的能力。"

#: ../NEWS:30706
msgid ""
":issue:`37986`: Improve performance of :c:func:`PyLong_FromDouble` for "
"values that fit into :c:expr:`long`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37986`: 对于适合 :c:expr:`long` 的值，提高 :c:func:`PyLong_FromDouble` 的性能。"

#: ../NEWS:30712
msgid ""
":issue:`40662`: Fixed :func:`ast.get_source_segment` for ast nodes that have"
" incomplete location information. Patch by Irit Katriel."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40662`: 修复了 :func:`ast.get_source_segment` 对于具有不完整位置信息的 ast 节点的问题。由 "
"Irit Katriel 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:30715
msgid ":issue:`40665`: Convert :mod:`bisect` to use Argument Clinic."
msgstr ":issue:`40665`: 转换 :mod:`bisect` 以使用 Argument Clinic。"

#: ../NEWS:30717
msgid ""
":issue:`40536`: Added the :func:`~zoneinfo.available_timezones` function to "
"the :mod:`zoneinfo` module. Patch by Paul Ganssle."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40536`: 在 :mod:`zoneinfo` 模块中增加了 "
":func:`~zoneinfo.available_timezones` 函数。由 Paul Ganssle 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:30720
msgid ""
":issue:`40645`: The :class:`hmac.HMAC` exposes internal implementation "
"details. The attributes ``digest_cons``, ``inner``, and ``outer`` are "
"deprecated and will be removed in the future."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40645`: :class:`hmac.HMAC` 暴露了内部实现细节。属性 ``digest_cons``、``inner`` 和 "
"``outer`` 已被弃用，并将在未来移除。"

#: ../NEWS:30724
msgid ""
":issue:`40645`: The internal module ``_hashlib`` wraps and exposes OpenSSL's"
" HMAC API. The new code will be used in Python 3.10 after the internal "
"implementation details of the pure Python HMAC module are no longer part of "
"the public API."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40645`: 内部模块 ``_hashlib`` 包装并暴露了 OpenSSL 的 HMAC API。新的代码将在 Python "
"3.10 中使用，在纯 Python HMAC 模块的内部实现细节不再作为公共 API 的一部分之后。"

#: ../NEWS:30729
msgid ""
":issue:`40637`: Builtin hash modules can now be disabled or selectively "
"enabled with ``configure --with-builtin-hashlib-hashes=sha3,blake1`` or "
"``--without-builtin-hashlib-hashes``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40637`: 现在可以通过 ``configure --with-builtin-hashlib-"
"hashes=sha3,blake1`` 或 ``--without-builtin-hashlib-hashes`` 禁用或有选择地启用内置哈希模块。"

#: ../NEWS:30733
msgid ""
":issue:`37630`: The :mod:`hashlib` module can now use SHA3 hashes and SHAKE "
"XOF from OpenSSL when available."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37630`: :mod:`hashlib` 模块现在可以在可用时使用 OpenSSL 的 SHA3 哈希和 SHAKE XOF。"

#: ../NEWS:30736
msgid ""
":issue:`40479`: The :mod:`hashlib` now compiles with OpenSSL 3.0.0-alpha2."
msgstr ":issue:`40479`: :mod:`hashlib` 现在可以与 OpenSSL 3.0.0-alpha2 一起编译。"

#: ../NEWS:30738
msgid ":issue:`40257`: Revert changes to :func:`inspect.getdoc`."
msgstr ":issue:`40257`: 恢复对 :func:`inspect.getdoc` 的更改。"

#: ../NEWS:30740
msgid ""
":issue:`40607`: When cancelling a task due to timeout, "
":meth:`asyncio.wait_for` will now propagate the exception if an error "
"happens during cancellation. Patch by Roman Skurikhin."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40607`: 当由于超时取消任务时，:meth:`asyncio.wait_for` 现在会在取消过程中发生错误时传播异常。由 "
"Roman Skurikhin 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:30744
msgid ""
":issue:`40612`: Fix edge cases in SyntaxError formatting. If the offset is "
"<= 0, no caret is printed. If the offset is > line length, the caret is "
"printed pointing just after the last character."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40612`: 修复了 SyntaxError 格式化中的边缘情况。如果偏移量 <= 0，则不打印插入符号。如果偏移量 > "
"行长度，则打印指向最后一个字符之后的插入符号。"

#: ../NEWS:30748
msgid ""
":issue:`40597`: If text content lines are longer than "
"policy.max_line_length, always use a content-encoding to make sure they are "
"wrapped."
msgstr ":issue:`40597`: 如果文本内容行比 policy.max_line_length 长，则始终使用内容编码以确保它们被换行。"

#: ../NEWS:30751
msgid ""
":issue:`40571`: Added functools.cache() as a simpler, more discoverable way "
"to access the unbounded cache variant of lru_cache(maxsize=None)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40571`: 添加了 functools.cache() 作为访问 lru_cache(maxsize=None) "
"的无界缓存变体的更简单、更易发现的方式。"

#: ../NEWS:30754
msgid ""
":issue:`40503`: :pep:`615`, the :mod:`zoneinfo` module. Adds support for the"
" IANA time zone database."
msgstr ":issue:`40503`: :pep:`615`，:mod:`zoneinfo` 模块。增加了对 IANA 时区数据库的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:30757
msgid ""
":issue:`40397`: Removed attributes ``__args__`` and ``__parameters__`` from "
"special generic aliases like ``typing.List`` (not subscripted)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40397`: 从特殊泛型别名如 ``typing.List`` (未下标) 中移除了属性 ``__args__`` 和 "
"``__parameters__``。"

#: ../NEWS:30760
msgid ""
":issue:`40549`: Convert posixmodule.c (\"posix\" or \"nt\" module) to the "
"multiphase initialization (PEP 489)."
msgstr ":issue:`40549`: 将 posixmodule.c（\"posix\" 或 \"nt\" 模块）转换为多阶段初始化（PEP 489）。"

#: ../NEWS:30763
msgid ""
":issue:`31033`: Add a ``msg`` argument to :meth:`Future.cancel` and "
":meth:`Task.cancel`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31033`: 向 :meth:`Future.cancel` 和 :meth:`Task.cancel` 添加了一个 ``msg`` "
"参数。"

#: ../NEWS:30766
msgid ""
":issue:`40541`: Added an optional *counts* parameter to random.sample()."
msgstr ":issue:`40541`: 向 random.sample() 添加了一个可选的 *counts* 参数。"

#: ../NEWS:30768
msgid ""
":issue:`40515`: The :mod:`ssl` and :mod:`hashlib` modules now actively check"
" that OpenSSL is build with thread support. Python 3.7.0 made thread support"
" mandatory and no longer works safely with a no-thread builds."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40515`: :mod:`ssl` 和 :mod:`hashlib` 模块现在主动检查 OpenSSL "
"是否构建了线程支持。Python 3.7.0 使线程支持成为强制性要求，不再安全地工作于无线程构建。"

#: ../NEWS:30772
msgid ""
":issue:`31033`: When a :class:`asyncio.Task` is cancelled, the exception "
"traceback now chains all the way back to where the task was first "
"interrupted."
msgstr ":issue:`31033`: 当一个 :class:`asyncio.Task` 被取消时，异常回溯现在一直链接回任务首次被中断的地方。"

#: ../NEWS:30776
msgid ""
":issue:`40504`: :func:`functools.lru_cache` objects can now be the targets "
"of weakrefs."
msgstr ":issue:`40504`: :func:`functools.lru_cache` 对象现在可以是弱引用的目标。"

#: ../NEWS:30779
msgid ""
":issue:`40559`: Fix possible memory leak in the C implementation of "
":class:`asyncio.Task`."
msgstr ":issue:`40559`: 修复了 :class:`asyncio.Task` 的 C 实现中可能的内存泄漏。"

#: ../NEWS:30782
msgid ""
":issue:`40480`: ``fnmatch.fnmatch()`` could take exponential time in the "
"presence of multiple ``*`` pattern characters.  This was repaired by "
"generating more elaborate regular expressions to avoid futile backtracking."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40480`: ``fnmatch.fnmatch()`` 在存在多个 ``*`` "
"模式字符时可能花费指数时间。通过生成更复杂的正则表达式来避免无用的回溯，修复了这一问题。"

#: ../NEWS:30787
msgid ""
":issue:`40495`: :mod:`compileall` is now able to use hardlinks to prevent "
"duplicates in a case when ``.pyc`` files for different optimization levels "
"have the same content."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40495`: :mod:`compileall` 现在能够使用硬链接来防止在不同优化级别的 ``.pyc`` "
"文件内容相同的情况下产生重复。"

#: ../NEWS:30791
msgid ""
":issue:`40457`: The ssl module now support OpenSSL builds without TLS 1.0 "
"and 1.1 methods."
msgstr ":issue:`40457`: ssl 模块现在支持不包含 TLS 1.0 和 1.1 方法的 OpenSSL 构建。"

#: ../NEWS:30794
msgid ""
":issue:`40355`: Improve error reporting in :func:`ast.literal_eval` in the "
"presence of malformed :class:`ast.Dict` nodes instead of silently ignoring "
"any non-conforming elements. Patch by Curtis Bucher."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40355`: 在存在格式错误的 :class:`ast.Dict` 节点时，改进 :func:`ast.literal_eval` "
"的错误报告，而不是静默忽略任何不符合要求的元素。由 Curtis Bucher 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:30798
msgid ""
":issue:`40465`: Deprecated the optional *random* argument to "
"*random.shuffle()*."
msgstr ":issue:`40465`: 弃用了 *random.shuffle()* 的可选 *random* 参数。"

#: ../NEWS:30801
msgid ""
":issue:`40459`: :func:`platform.win32_ver` now produces correct *ptype* "
"strings instead of empty strings."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40459`: :func:`platform.win32_ver` 现在生成正确的 *ptype* 字符串而不是空字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:30804
msgid ""
":issue:`39435`: The first argument of :func:`pickle.loads` is now "
"positional-only."
msgstr ":issue:`39435`: :func:`pickle.loads` 的第一个参数现在是仅位置参数。"

#: ../NEWS:30807
msgid ""
":issue:`39305`: Update :mod:`!nntplib` to merge :class:`!nntplib.NNTP` and "
":class:`!nntplib._NNTPBase`. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39305`: 更新 :mod:`!nntplib` 以合并 :class:`!nntplib.NNTP` 和 "
":class:`!nntplib._NNTPBase`。由 Donghee Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:30810
msgid ""
":issue:`32494`: Update :mod:`dbm.gnu` to use gdbm_count if possible when "
"calling :func:`len`. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32494`: 更新 :mod:`dbm.gnu` 在调用 :func:`len` 时尽可能使用 gdbm_count。由 "
"Donghee Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:30813
msgid ""
":issue:`40453`: Add ``isolated=True`` keyword-only parameter to "
"``_xxsubinterpreters.create()``. An isolated subinterpreter cannot spawn "
"threads, spawn a child process or call ``os.fork()``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40453`: 添加 ``isolated=True`` 关键字参数到 "
"``_xxsubinterpreters.create()``。一个孤立的子解释器不能生成线程、生成子进程或调用 ``os.fork()``。"

#: ../NEWS:30817
msgid ""
":issue:`40286`: Remove ``_random.Random.randbytes()``: the C implementation "
"of ``randbytes()``. Implement the method in Python to ease subclassing: "
"``randbytes()`` now directly reuses ``getrandbits()``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40286`: 移除 ``_random.Random.randbytes()``：``randbytes()`` 的 C "
"实现。为实现子类化，该方法现在直接在 Python 中实现：``randbytes()`` 现在直接重用 ``getrandbits()``。"

#: ../NEWS:30821
msgid ""
":issue:`40394`: Added default arguments to "
":meth:`difflib.SequenceMatcher.find_longest_match`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40394`: 为 :meth:`difflib.SequenceMatcher.find_longest_match` "
"添加了默认参数。"

#: ../NEWS:30824
msgid ""
":issue:`39995`: Fix a race condition in concurrent.futures._ThreadWakeup: "
"access to _ThreadWakeup is now protected with the shutdown lock."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39995`: 修复 concurrent.futures._ThreadWakeup 中的竞争条件：现在对 _ThreadWakeup"
" 的访问受到关闭锁的保护。"

#: ../NEWS:30827
msgid ""
":issue:`30966`: ``Process.shutdown(wait=True)`` of :mod:`concurrent.futures`"
" now closes explicitly the result queue."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30966`: :mod:`concurrent.futures` 的 ``Process.shutdown(wait=True)`` "
"现在显式关闭结果队列。"

#: ../NEWS:30830
msgid ""
":issue:`30966`: Add a new :meth:`~multiprocessing.SimpleQueue.close` method "
"to the :class:`~multiprocessing.SimpleQueue` class to explicitly close the "
"queue."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30966`: 为 :class:`~multiprocessing.SimpleQueue` 类添加一个新的 "
":meth:`~multiprocessing.SimpleQueue.close` 方法以显式关闭队列。"

#: ../NEWS:30834
msgid ""
":issue:`39966`: Revert :issue:`25597`. :class:`unittest.mock.MagicMock` with"
" wraps' set uses default return values for magic methods."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39966`: 撤销 :issue:`25597`。设置了 wraps 的 "
":class:`unittest.mock.MagicMock` 对魔术方法使用默认返回值。"

#: ../NEWS:30837
msgid ""
":issue:`39791`: Added ``files()`` function to importlib.resources with "
"support for subdirectories in package data, matching backport in "
"importlib_resources 1.5."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39791`: 向 importlib.resources 添加了 ``files()`` 函数，支持包数据中的子目录，与 "
"importlib_resources 1.5 中的回传匹配。"

#: ../NEWS:30841
msgid ""
":issue:`40375`: :meth:`imaplib.IMAP4.unselect` is added. Patch by Donghee "
"Na."
msgstr ":issue:`40375`: 添加了 :meth:`imaplib.IMAP4.unselect`。由 Donghee Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:30843
msgid ""
":issue:`40389`: ``repr()`` now returns ``typing.Optional[T]`` when called "
"for ``typing.Union`` of two types, one of which is ``NoneType``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40389`: ``repr()`` 现在当被调用于 ``typing.Union`` 两个类型之一为 ``NoneType`` 时返回"
" ``typing.Optional[T]``。"

#: ../NEWS:30846
msgid ""
":issue:`40291`: Add support for CAN_J1939 sockets (available on Linux 5.4+)"
msgstr ":issue:`40291`: 添加对 CAN_J1939 套接字的支持（Linux 5.4+ 可用）"

#: ../NEWS:30848
msgid ":issue:`40273`: :class:`types.MappingProxyType` is now reversible."
msgstr ":issue:`40273`: :class:`types.MappingProxyType` 现在是可逆的。"

#: ../NEWS:30850
msgid ""
":issue:`39075`: The repr for :class:`types.SimpleNamespace` is now insertion"
" ordered rather than alphabetical."
msgstr ":issue:`39075`: :class:`types.SimpleNamespace` 的 repr 现在是插入顺序而非字母顺序。"

#: ../NEWS:30853
msgid ""
":issue:`40192`: On AIX, :func:`~time.thread_time` is now implemented with "
"``thread_cputime()`` which has nanosecond resolution, rather than "
"``clock_gettime(CLOCK_THREAD_CPUTIME_ID)`` which has a resolution of 10 "
"milliseconds. Patch by Batuhan Taskaya."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40192`: 在AIX上，:func:`~time.thread_time` "
"现在通过具有纳秒级分辨率的``thread_cputime()``实现，而非之前具有10毫秒分辨率的``clock_gettime(CLOCK_THREAD_CPUTIME_ID)``。由Batuhan"
" Taskaya提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:30858
msgid ""
":issue:`40025`: Raise TypeError when _generate_next_value_ is defined after "
"members. Patch by Ethan Onstott."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40025`: 当_generate_next_value_在成员之后定义时，抛出TypeError。由Ethan "
"Onstott提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:30861
msgid ""
":issue:`39058`: In the argparse module, the repr for Namespace() and other "
"argument holders now displayed in the order attributes were added. Formerly,"
" it displayed in alphabetical order even though argument order is preserved "
"the user visible parts of the module."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39058`: "
"在argparse模块中，Namespace()和其他参数持有者的repr现在按照属性添加的顺序显示。以前，尽管模块的用户可见部分保留了参数顺序，但它是按字母顺序显示的。"

#: ../NEWS:30866
msgid ""
":issue:`24416`: The ``isocalendar()`` methods of :class:`datetime.date` and "
":class:`datetime.datetime` now return a :term:`named tuple` instead of a "
":class:`tuple`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24416`: :class:`datetime.date` 和 :class:`datetime.datetime` 的 "
"``isocalendar()`` 方法现在返回一个 :term:`named tuple` 而不是 :class:`tuple`。"

#: ../NEWS:30873
msgid ""
":issue:`34790`: Add version of removal for explicit passing of coros to "
"``asyncio.wait()``'s documentation"
msgstr ":issue:`34790`: 在 ``asyncio.wait()`` 的文档中添加了显式传递coros的移除版本说明。"

#: ../NEWS:30876
msgid ":issue:`40561`: Provide docstrings for webbrowser open functions."
msgstr ":issue:`40561`: 为webbrowser的open函数提供文档字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:30878
msgid ""
":issue:`40499`: Mention that :func:`asyncio.wait` requires a non-empty set "
"of awaitables."
msgstr ":issue:`40499`: 提到 :func:`asyncio.wait` 需要一个非空的awaitables集合。"

#: ../NEWS:30881
msgid ""
":issue:`39705`: Tutorial example for sorted() in the Loop Techniques section"
" is given a better explanation. Also a new example is included to explain "
"sorted()'s basic behavior."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39705`: 在循环技术部分，为sorted()的教程示例提供了更好的解释。还包括一个新示例来解释sorted()的基本行为。"

#: ../NEWS:30885
msgid ""
":issue:`39435`: Fix an incorrect signature for :func:`pickle.loads` in the "
"docs"
msgstr ":issue:`39435`: 修正了文档中 :func:`pickle.loads` 的错误签名。"

#: ../NEWS:30890
msgid ""
":issue:`40055`: distutils.tests now saves/restores warnings filters to leave"
" them unchanged. Importing tests imports docutils which imports "
"pkg_resources which adds a warnings filter."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40055`: "
"distutils.tests现在保存/恢复警告过滤器，使其保持不变。导入测试会导入docutils，后者导入pkg_resources，这会添加一个警告过滤器。"

#: ../NEWS:30894
msgid ""
":issue:`40436`: test_gdb and test.pythoninfo now check gdb command exit "
"code."
msgstr ":issue:`40436`: test_gdb和test.pythoninfo现在检查gdb命令的退出代码。"

#: ../NEWS:30899
msgid ""
":issue:`40653`: Move _dirnameW out of HAVE_SYMLINK to fix a potential "
"compiling issue."
msgstr ":issue:`40653`: 将_dirnameW移出HAVE_SYMLINK以修复潜在的编译问题。"

#: ../NEWS:30902
msgid ""
":issue:`40514`: Add ``--with-experimental-isolated-subinterpreters`` build "
"option to ``configure``: better isolate subinterpreters, experimental build "
"mode."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40514`: 向 ``configure`` 添加 ``--with-experimental-isolated-"
"subinterpreters`` 构建选项：更好地隔离子解释器，实验性构建模式。"

#: ../NEWS:30909
msgid ":issue:`40650`: Include winsock2.h in pytime.c for timeval."
msgstr ":issue:`40650`: 在pytime.c中包含winsock2.h以获取timeval。"

#: ../NEWS:30911
msgid ""
":issue:`40458`: Increase reserved stack space to prevent overflow crash on "
"Windows."
msgstr ":issue:`40458`: 增加保留堆栈空间以防止Windows上的溢出崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:30914
msgid ""
":issue:`39148`: Add IPv6 support to :mod:`asyncio` datagram endpoints in "
"ProactorEventLoop. Change the raised exception for unknown address families "
"to ValueError as it's not coming from Windows API."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39148`: 为ProactorEventLoop中的 :mod:`asyncio` "
"数据报端点添加IPv6支持。将未知地址族引发的异常更改为ValueError，因为它不是来自Windows API。"

#: ../NEWS:30921
msgid ""
":issue:`34956`: When building Python on macOS from source, ``_tkinter`` now "
"links with non-system Tcl and Tk frameworks if they are installed in "
"``/Library/Frameworks``, as had been the case on older releases of macOS. If"
" a macOS SDK is explicitly configured, by using ``--enable-universalsdk=`` "
"or ``-isysroot``, only the SDK itself is searched. The default behavior can "
"still be overridden with ``--with-tcltk-includes`` and ``--with-tcltk-"
"libs``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34956`: 当在macOS上从源代码构建Python时，``_tkinter``现在链接到非系统的Tcl和Tk框架，如果它们安装在 "
"``/Library/Frameworks`` 中，就像旧版macOS上的情况一样。如果通过使用``--enable-universalsdk=``或 "
"``-isysroot`` 明确配置了macOS SDK，则仅搜索SDK本身。默认行为仍然可以通过 ``--with-tcltk-includes`` "
"和 ``--with-tcltk-libs`` 覆盖。"

#: ../NEWS:30929
msgid ":issue:`35569`: Expose RFC 3542 IPv6 socket options."
msgstr ":issue:`35569`: 公开RFC 3542 IPv6套接字选项。"

#: ../NEWS:30934
msgid ""
":issue:`40479`: Update multissltest helper to test with latest OpenSSL "
"1.0.2, 1.1.0, 1.1.1, and 3.0.0-alpha."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40479`: 更新multissltest助手以测试最新的OpenSSL 1.0.2、1.1.0、1.1.1和3.0.0-alpha。"

#: ../NEWS:30937
msgid ""
":issue:`40431`: Fix a syntax typo in ``turtledemo`` that now raises a "
"``SyntaxError``."
msgstr ":issue:`40431`: 修复 ``turtledemo`` 中的一个语法错误，现在会引发 ``SyntaxError``。"

#: ../NEWS:30940
msgid ""
":issue:`40163`: Fix multissltest tool. OpenSSL has changed download URL for "
"old releases. The multissltest tool now tries to download from current and "
"old download URLs."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40163`: "
"修复multissltest工具。OpenSSL已更改旧版本的下载URL。multissltest工具现在尝试从当前和旧的下载URL下载。"

#: ../NEWS:30947
msgid ""
":issue:`39465`: Remove the ``_PyUnicode_ClearStaticStrings()`` function from"
" the C API."
msgstr ":issue:`39465`: 从C API中移除 ``_PyUnicode_ClearStaticStrings()`` 函数。"

#: ../NEWS:30950
msgid ""
":issue:`38787`: Add PyCFunction_CheckExact() macro for exact type checks now"
" that we allow subtypes of PyCFunction, as well as PyCMethod_CheckExact() "
"and PyCMethod_Check() for the new PyCMethod subtype."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38787`: "
"添加PyCFunction_CheckExact()宏用于精确类型检查，现在我们允许PyCFunction的子类型，以及PyCMethod_CheckExact()和PyCMethod_Check()用于新的PyCMethod子类型。"

#: ../NEWS:30954
msgid ""
":issue:`40545`: Declare ``_PyErr_GetTopmostException()`` with "
"``PyAPI_FUNC()`` to properly export the function in the C API. The function "
"remains private (``_Py``) prefix."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40545`: 使用 ``PyAPI_FUNC()`` 声明 ``_PyErr_GetTopmostException()`` 以在C "
"API中正确导出函数。该函数保持私有（``_Py``前缀）。"

#: ../NEWS:30958
msgid ""
":issue:`40412`: Nullify inittab_copy during finalization, preventing future "
"interpreter initializations in an embedded situation from crashing. Patch by"
" Gregory Szorc."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40412`: 在最终化期间将inittab_copy置空，防止在嵌入式情况下未来的解释器初始化崩溃。由Gregory "
"Szorc提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:30962
msgid ""
":issue:`40429`: The :c:func:`PyThreadState_GetFrame` function now returns a "
"strong reference to the frame."
msgstr ":issue:`40429`: :c:func:`PyThreadState_GetFrame` 函数现在返回一个对帧的强引用。"

#: ../NEWS:30965
msgid ""
":issue:`40428`: Remove the following functions from the C API. Call "
":c:func:`PyGC_Collect` explicitly to free all free lists."
msgstr ":issue:`40428`: 从C API中移除以下函数。显式调用 :c:func:`PyGC_Collect` 以释放所有自由列表。"

#: ../NEWS:30968
msgid "``PyAsyncGen_ClearFreeLists()``"
msgstr "``PyAsyncGen_ClearFreeLists()``"

#: ../NEWS:30969
msgid "``PyContext_ClearFreeList()``"
msgstr "``PyContext_ClearFreeList()``"

#: ../NEWS:30970
msgid "``PyDict_ClearFreeList()``"
msgstr "``PyDict_ClearFreeList()``"

#: ../NEWS:30971
msgid "``PyFloat_ClearFreeList()``"
msgstr "``PyFloat_ClearFreeList()``"

#: ../NEWS:30972
msgid "``PyFrame_ClearFreeList()``"
msgstr "``PyFrame_ClearFreeList()``"

#: ../NEWS:30973
msgid "``PyList_ClearFreeList()``"
msgstr "``PyList_ClearFreeList()``"

#: ../NEWS:30974
msgid "``PySet_ClearFreeList()``"
msgstr "``PySet_ClearFreeList()``"

#: ../NEWS:30975
msgid "``PyTuple_ClearFreeList()``"
msgstr "``PyTuple_ClearFreeList()``"

#: ../NEWS:30977
msgid ""
":issue:`40421`: New :c:func:`PyFrame_GetBack` function: get the frame next "
"outer frame."
msgstr ":issue:`40421`: 新增 :c:func:`PyFrame_GetBack` 函数：获取外层框架的下一个框架。"

#: ../NEWS:30980
msgid ""
":issue:`40421`: New :c:func:`PyFrame_GetCode` function: return a borrowed "
"reference to the frame code."
msgstr ":issue:`40421`: 新增 :c:func:`PyFrame_GetCode` 函数：返回框架代码的一个借用引用。"

#: ../NEWS:30983
msgid ""
":issue:`40217`: Ensure that instances of types created with "
":c:func:`PyType_FromSpecWithBases` will visit its class object when "
"traversing references in the garbage collector (implemented as an extension "
"of the provided :c:member:`~PyTypeObject.tp_traverse`). Patch by Pablo "
"Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40217`: 确保使用 :c:func:`PyType_FromSpecWithBases` "
"创建的类型实例在垃圾收集器中遍历引用时会访问其类对象（作为提供的 :c:member:`~PyTypeObject.tp_traverse` "
"的扩展实现）。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:30989
msgid ""
":issue:`38787`: Module C state is now accessible from C-defined heap type "
"methods (:pep:`573`). Patch by Marcel Plch and Petr Viktorin."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38787`: 现在可以从C定义的堆类型方法访问模块C状态（:pep:`573`）。由 Marcel Plch 和 Petr "
"Viktorin 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:30994
msgid "Python 3.9.0 alpha 6"
msgstr "Python 3.9.0 alpha 6"

#: ../NEWS:30996
msgid "*Release date: 2020-04-27*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2020-04-27*"

#: ../NEWS:31001
msgid ":issue:`40121`: Fixes audit events raised on creating a new socket."
msgstr ":issue:`40121`: 修复了在创建新套接字时引发的审计事件。"

#: ../NEWS:31003
msgid ""
":issue:`39073`: Disallow CR or LF in email.headerregistry.Address arguments "
"to guard against header injection attacks."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39073`: 禁止在 email.headerregistry.Address 参数中使用 CR 或 LF，以防止头部注入攻击。"

#: ../NEWS:31006
msgid ""
":issue:`39503`: :cve:`2020-8492`: The "
":class:`~urllib.request.AbstractBasicAuthHandler` class of the "
":mod:`urllib.request` module uses an inefficient regular expression which "
"can be exploited by an attacker to cause a denial of service. Fix the regex "
"to prevent the catastrophic backtracking. Vulnerability reported by Ben "
"Caller and Matt Schwager."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39503`: :cve:`2020-8492`: :mod:`urllib.request` 模块的 "
":class:`~urllib.request.AbstractBasicAuthHandler` "
"类使用了一个低效的正则表达式，攻击者可以利用此漏洞导致拒绝服务。修复正则表达式以防止灾难性回溯。漏洞由 Ben Caller 和 Matt "
"Schwager 报告。"

#: ../NEWS:31016
msgid ":issue:`40313`: Improve the performance of bytes.hex()."
msgstr ":issue:`40313`: 提高 bytes.hex() 的性能。"

#: ../NEWS:31018
msgid ""
":issue:`40334`: Switch to a new parser, based on PEG.  For more details see "
"PEP 617. To temporarily switch back to the old parser, use ``-X oldparser`` "
"or ``PYTHONOLDPARSER=1``.  In Python 3.10 we will remove the old parser "
"completely, including the ``parser`` module (already deprecated) and "
"anything that depends on it."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40334`: 切换到基于 PEG 的新解析器。更多详情见 PEP 617。要暂时切换回旧解析器，使用 ``-X oldparser``"
" 或 ``PYTHONOLDPARSER=1``。在 Python 3.10 中，我们将完全移除旧解析器，包括 ``parser`` "
"模块（已弃用）以及依赖于它的任何内容。"

#: ../NEWS:31024
msgid ""
":issue:`40267`: Fix the tokenizer to display the correct error message, when"
" there is a ``SyntaxError`` on the last input character and no newline "
"follows. It used to be ``unexpected EOF while parsing``, while it should be "
"``invalid syntax``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40267`: 修复了分词器以显示正确的错误消息，当最后一个输入字符上有 ``SyntaxError`` 且没有换行符时。过去显示的是 "
"``unexpected EOF while parsing``，而应该是 ``invalid syntax``。"

#: ../NEWS:31029
msgid ""
":issue:`39522`: Correctly unparse explicit ``u`` prefix for strings when "
"postponed evaluation for annotations activated. Patch by Batuhan Taskaya."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39522`: 当激活注释的延迟评估时，正确反解析字符串的显式 ``u`` 前缀。由 Batuhan Taskaya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:31032
msgid ""
":issue:`40246`: Report a specialized error message, ``invalid string "
"prefix``, when the tokenizer encounters a string with an invalid prefix."
msgstr ":issue:`40246`: 当标记器遇到带有无效前缀的字符串时，报告专门的错误消息“无效字符串前缀”。"

#: ../NEWS:31035
msgid ""
":issue:`40082`: Fix the signal handler: it now always uses the main "
"interpreter, rather than trying to get the current Python thread state."
msgstr ":issue:`40082`: 修复信号处理程序：现在总是使用主解释器，而不是尝试获取当前的Python线程状态。"

#: ../NEWS:31038
msgid ""
":issue:`37388`: str.encode() and str.decode() no longer check the encoding "
"and errors in development mode or in debug mode during Python finalization. "
"The codecs machinery can no longer work on very late calls to str.encode() "
"and str.decode()."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37388`: "
"str.encode()和str.decode()在开发模式或Python终止期间的调试模式下不再检查编码和错误。编解码器机制在非常晚调用str.encode()和str.decode()时不再工作。"

#: ../NEWS:31043
msgid ""
