":c:func:`PyThreadState_Clear()`。“PyThreadState.frame”是一个借用引用，不是强引用：“PyThreadState_Clear()”不能调用“Py_CLEAR(tstate->frame)”。"

#: ../NEWS:31074
msgid ""
":issue:`1635741`: Port time module to multiphase initialization "
"(:pep:`489`). Patch by Paulo Henrique Silva."
msgstr ""
":issue:`1635741`: 将time模块移植到多阶段初始化(:PEP:`489`)。由Paulo Henrique Silva提供补丁。"

