msgstr ":issue:`40020`: 修复parsetok.c中由于在罕见代码路径上错误使用realloc导致的泄漏和随后的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:31083
msgid ""
":issue:`39939`: Added str.removeprefix and str.removesuffix methods and "
"corresponding bytes, bytearray, and collections.UserString methods to remove"
" affixes from a string if present. See :pep:`616` for a full description. "
"Patch by Dennis Sweeney."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39939`: "
"添加了str.removeprefix和str.removesuffix方法以及相应的bytes、bytearray和collections.UserString方法，用于移除字符串中可能存在的前缀和后缀。完整描述请参见"
" :pep:`616`。由Dennis Sweeney提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:31088
msgid ""
":issue:`39481`: Implement PEP 585. This supports list[int], tuple[str, ...] "
"etc."
msgstr ":issue:`39481`: 实现了PEP 585。这支持了list[int]、tuple[str, ...]等类型注解。"

#: ../NEWS:31091
msgid ""
":issue:`32894`: Support unparsing of infinity numbers in postponed "
"annotations. Patch by Batuhan Taşkaya."
msgstr ":issue:`32894`: 支持在延迟注解中解析无穷大数。由Batuhan Taşkaya提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:31094
msgid ""
":issue:`37207`: Speed up calls to ``list()`` by using the :pep:`590` "
"``vectorcall`` calling convention. Patch by Mark Shannon."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37207`: 通过使用 :pep:`590` ``vectorcall`` 调用约定，加快了对 ``list()`` "
"的调用速度。由Mark Shannon提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:31100
msgid ""
":issue:`40398`: :func:`typing.get_args` now always returns an empty tuple "
"for special generic aliases."
msgstr ":issue:`40398`: :func:`typing.get_args` 现在对于特殊的通用别名总是返回一个空元组。"

#: ../NEWS:31103
msgid ""
":issue:`40396`: Functions :func:`typing.get_origin`, :func:`typing.get_args`"
" and :func:`typing.get_type_hints` support now generic aliases like "
"``list[int]``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40396`: 函数 :func:`typing.get_origin`、:func:`typing.get_args` 和 "
":func:`typing.get_type_hints` 现在支持如 ``list[int]`` 这样的通用别名。"

#: ../NEWS:31107
msgid ""
":issue:`38061`: Optimize the :mod:`subprocess` module on FreeBSD using "
"``closefrom()``. A single ``close(fd)`` syscall is cheap, but when "
"``sysconf(_SC_OPEN_MAX)`` is high, the loop calling ``close(fd)`` on each "
"file descriptor can take several milliseconds."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38061`: 在FreeBSD上使用 ``closefrom()`` 优化了 :mod:`subprocess` 模块。单个 "
"``close(fd)`` 系统调用是廉价的，但当 ``sysconf(_SC_OPEN_MAX)`` 很高时，循环调用 ``close(fd)`` "
"在每个文件描述符上可能会花费几毫秒。"

#: ../NEWS:31112
msgid ""
"The workaround on FreeBSD to improve performance was to load and mount the "
"fdescfs kernel module, but this is not enabled by default."
msgstr "在FreeBSD上提高性能的解决方法是加载并挂载fdescfs内核模块，但默认情况下未启用此功能。"

#: ../NEWS:31115 ../NEWS:31123
msgid ""
"Initial patch by Ed Maste (emaste), Conrad Meyer (cem), Kyle Evans (kevans) "
"and Kubilay Kocak (koobs): "
"https://bugs.freebsd.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=242274"
msgstr ""
"初始由Ed Maste (emaste)、Conrad Meyer (cem)、Kyle Evans (kevans) 和 Kubilay Kocak "
"(koobs) 提供补丁：https://bugs.freebsd.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=242274"

#: ../NEWS:31119
msgid ""
":issue:`38061`: On FreeBSD, ``os.closerange(fd_low, fd_high)`` now calls "
"``closefrom(fd_low)`` if *fd_high* is greater than or equal to "
"``sysconf(_SC_OPEN_MAX)``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38061`: 在FreeBSD上，``os.closerange(fd_low, fd_high)`` 现在如果 *fd_high* "
"大于或等于 ``sysconf(_SC_OPEN_MAX)`` 则调用 ``closefrom(fd_low)``。"

#: ../NEWS:31127
msgid ""
":issue:`40360`: The :mod:`!lib2to3` module is pending deprecation due to "
":pep:`617`."
msgstr ":issue:`40360`: 由于 :pep:`617`，:mod:`!lib2to3` 模块即将被弃用。"

#: ../NEWS:31130
msgid ""
":issue:`40138`: Fix the Windows implementation of :func:`os.waitpid` for "
"exit code larger than ``INT_MAX >> 8``. The exit status is now interpreted "
"as an unsigned number."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40138`: 修复了 :func:`os.waitpid` 在Windows上对于退出码大于 ``INT_MAX >> 8`` "
"的实现。退出状态现在被解释为一个无符号数。"

#: ../NEWS:31134
msgid ""
":issue:`39942`: Set \"__main__\" as the default module name when "
"\"__name__\" is missing in :class:`typing.TypeVar`. Patch by Weipeng Hong."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39942`: 当 :class:`typing.TypeVar` 中缺少 \"__name__\" 时，将 \"__main__\" "
"设置为默认模块名。由Weipeng Hong提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:31137
msgid ""
":issue:`40275`: The :mod:`logging` package is now imported lazily in "
":mod:`unittest` only when the :meth:`~unittest.TestCase.assertLogs` "
"assertion is used."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40275`: 现在，:mod:`logging` 包在 :mod:`unittest` 中仅当使用 "
":meth:`~unittest.TestCase.assertLogs` 断言时才会被延迟导入。"

#: ../NEWS:31141
msgid ""
":issue:`40275`: The :mod:`asyncio` package is now imported lazily in "
":mod:`unittest` only when the :class:`~unittest.IsolatedAsyncioTestCase` "
"class is used."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40275`: 现在，:mod:`asyncio` 包在 :mod:`unittest` 中仅当使用 "
":class:`~unittest.IsolatedAsyncioTestCase` 类时才会被延迟导入。"

#: ../NEWS:31145
msgid ""
":issue:`40330`: In :meth:`ShareableList.__setitem__`, check the size of a "
"new string item after encoding it to utf-8, not before."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40330`: 在 :meth:`ShareableList.__setitem__` 中，检查新字符串项的大小是在将其编码为 "
"utf-8 之后，而不是之前。"

#: ../NEWS:31148
msgid ""
":issue:`40148`: Added :meth:`pathlib.Path.with_stem` to create a new Path "
"with the stem replaced."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40148`: 新增了 :meth:`pathlib.Path.with_stem` 方法来创建一个新路径，其中 stem 被替换。"

#: ../NEWS:31151
msgid ":issue:`40325`: Deprecated support for set objects in random.sample()."
msgstr ":issue:`40325`: 弃用了在 random.sample() 中对集合对象的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:31153
msgid ""
":issue:`40257`: Improved help for the :mod:`typing` module. Docstrings are "
"now shown for all special forms and special generic aliases (like ``Union`` "
"and ``List``). Using ``help()`` with generic alias like ``List[int]`` will "
"show the help for the correspondent concrete type (``list`` in this case)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40257`: 改进了 :mod:`typing` 模块的帮助信息。现在所有特殊形式和特殊泛型别名（如 ``Union`` 和 "
"``List``）的文档字符串都会被显示。使用 ``help()`` 查看像 ``List[int]`` "
"这样的泛型别名时，会显示相应具体类型（在这个例子中是 ``list``）的帮助信息。"

#: ../NEWS:31158
msgid ""
":issue:`40257`: :func:`inspect.getdoc` no longer returns docstring inherited"
" from the type of the object or from parent class if it is a class if it is "
"not defined in the object itself. In :mod:`pydoc` the documentation string "
"is now shown not only for class, function, method etc, but for any object "
"that has its own ``__doc__`` attribute."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40257`: :func:`inspect.getdoc` "
"不再返回从对象类型或父类继承的文档字符串，如果这些文档字符串不是在对象本身定义的。在 :mod:`pydoc` "
"中，现在不仅对类、函数、方法等显示文档字符串，对任何拥有自己的 ``__doc__`` 属性的对象也会显示。"

#: ../NEWS:31164
msgid ""
":issue:`40287`: Fixed ``SpooledTemporaryFile.seek()`` to return the "
"position."
msgstr ":issue:`40287`: 修复了 ``SpooledTemporaryFile.seek()`` 返回位置的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:31166
msgid ":issue:`40290`: Added zscore() to statistics.NormalDist()."
msgstr ":issue:`40290`: 在 statistics.NormalDist() 中添加了 zscore() 方法。"

#: ../NEWS:31168
msgid ""
":issue:`40282`: Allow ``random.getrandbits(0)`` to succeed and to return 0."
msgstr ":issue:`40282`: 允许 ``random.getrandbits(0)`` 成功执行并返回 0。"

#: ../NEWS:31170
msgid ""
":issue:`40286`: Add :func:`random.randbytes` function and "
":meth:`random.Random.randbytes` method to generate random bytes."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40286`: 新增了 :func:`random.randbytes` 函数和 "
":meth:`random.Random.randbytes` 方法来生成随机字节。"

#: ../NEWS:31173
msgid ""
":issue:`40277`: :func:`collections.namedtuple` now provides a human-readable"
" repr for its field accessors."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40277`: :func:`collections.namedtuple` 现在为其字段访问器提供了一个人类可读的 repr。"

#: ../NEWS:31176
msgid ""
":issue:`40270`: The included copy of sqlite3 on Windows is now compiled with"
" the json extension. This allows the use of functions such as "
"``json_object``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40270`: 现在 Windows 上包含的 sqlite3 编译时带有 json 扩展。这使得可以使用诸如 "
"``json_object`` 这样的函数。"

#: ../NEWS:31180
msgid ""
":issue:`29255`: Wait in ``KqueueSelector.select`` when no fds are registered"
msgstr ":issue:`29255`: 在 ``KqueueSelector.select`` 中，当没有注册的 fds 时等待。"

#: ../NEWS:31182
msgid ""
":issue:`40260`: Ensure :mod:`modulefinder` uses :func:`io.open_code` and "
"respects coding comments."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40260`: 确保 :mod:`modulefinder` 使用 :func:`io.open_code` 并遵守编码注释。"

#: ../NEWS:31185
msgid ""
":issue:`40234`: Allow again to spawn daemon threads in subinterpreters "
"(revert change which denied them)."
msgstr ":issue:`40234`: 再次允许在子解释器中生成守护线程（撤销之前禁止它们的更改）。"

#: ../NEWS:31188
msgid ""
":issue:`39207`: Workers in :class:`~concurrent.futures.ProcessPoolExecutor` "
"are now spawned on demand, only when there are no available idle workers to "
"reuse. This optimizes startup overhead and reduces the amount of lost CPU "
"time to idle workers. Patch by Kyle Stanley."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39207`: 现在 :class:`~concurrent.futures.ProcessPoolExecutor` "
"中的工作器是按需生成的，只有在没有可用的空闲工作器可以重用时才会生成。这优化了启动开销并减少了因空闲工作器而损失的CPU时间。由Kyle "
"Stanley提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:31193
msgid ""
":issue:`40091`: Fix a hang at fork in the logging module: the new private "
"_at_fork_reinit() method is now used to reinitialize locks at fork in the "
"child process."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40091`: 修复了日志模块中的fork挂起问题：现在使用新的私有方法 _at_fork_reinit() "
"在子进程中fork时重新初始化锁。"

#: ../NEWS:31197
msgid ""
":issue:`40149`: Implement traverse and clear slots in _abc._abc_data type."
msgstr ":issue:`40149`: 在 _abc._abc_data 类型中实现了遍历和清除槽。"

#: ../NEWS:31199
msgid ""
":issue:`40208`: Remove deprecated :meth:`!symtable.SymbolTable.has_exec`."
msgstr ":issue:`40208`: 移除了已弃用的 :meth:`!symtable.SymbolTable.has_exec`。"

#: ../NEWS:31201
msgid ""
":issue:`40196`: Fix a bug in the :mod:`symtable` module that was causing "
"incorrectly report global variables as local. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40196`: 修复了 :mod:`symtable` 模块中的一个错误，该错误导致错误地将全局变量报告为局部变量。由Pablo "
"Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:31204
msgid ""
":issue:`40190`: Add support for ``_SC_AIX_REALMEM`` to "
":func:`posix.sysconf`."
msgstr ":issue:`40190`: 向 :func:`posix.sysconf` 添加了对 ``_SC_AIX_REALMEM`` 的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:31206
msgid ""
":issue:`40182`: Removed the ``_field_types`` attribute of the "
":class:`typing.NamedTuple` class."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40182`: 移除了 :class:`typing.NamedTuple` 类的 ``_field_types`` 属性。"

#: ../NEWS:31209
msgid ""
":issue:`36517`: Multiple inheritance with :class:`typing.NamedTuple` now "
"raises an error instead of silently ignoring other types."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36517`: 现在使用 :class:`typing.NamedTuple` 进行多重继承时会引发错误，而不是静默忽略其他类型。"

#: ../NEWS:31212
msgid ""
":issue:`40126`: Fixed reverting multiple patches in unittest.mock. Patcher's"
" ``__exit__()`` is now never called if its ``__enter__()`` is failed. "
"Returning true from ``__exit__()`` silences now the exception."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40126`: 修复了在unittest.mock中还原多个补丁的问题。如果补丁的 ``__enter__()`` 失败，其 "
"``__exit__()`` 现在永远不会被调用。现在从 ``__exit__()`` 返回true会静默异常。"

#: ../NEWS:31216
msgid ""
":issue:`40094`: CGIHTTPRequestHandler of http.server now logs the CGI script"
" exit code, rather than the CGI script exit status of os.waitpid(). For "
"example, if the script is killed by signal 11, it now logs: \"CGI script "
"exit code -11.\""
msgstr ""
":issue:`40094`: "
"http.server的CGIHTTPRequestHandler现在记录CGI脚本的退出代码，而不是os.waitpid()的CGI脚本退出状态。例如，如果脚本被信号11杀死，现在会记录：“CGI脚本退出代码"
" -11。”"

#: ../NEWS:31221
msgid ""
":issue:`40108`: Improve the error message when triying to import a module "
"using :mod:`runpy` and incorrectly using the \".py\" extension at the end of"
" the module name. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40108`: 当尝试使用 :mod:`runpy` 导入模块并在模块名称末尾错误地使用“.py”扩展名时，改进了错误消息。由Pablo"
" Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:31225
msgid ""
":issue:`40094`: Add :func:`os.waitstatus_to_exitcode` function: convert a "
"wait status to an exit code."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40094`: 添加了 :func:`os.waitstatus_to_exitcode` 函数：将等待状态转换为退出代码。"

#: ../NEWS:31228
msgid ""
":issue:`40089`: Fix threading._after_fork(): if fork was not called by a "
"thread spawned by threading.Thread, threading._after_fork() now creates a "
"_MainThread instance for _main_thread, instead of a _DummyThread instance."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40089`: 修复 threading._after_fork(): 如果 fork 不是由 threading.Thread "
"生成的线程调用的，threading._after_fork() 现在会为 _main_thread 创建一个 _MainThread 实例，而不是 "
"_DummyThread 实例。"

#: ../NEWS:31232
msgid ""
":issue:`40089`: Add a private ``_at_fork_reinit()`` method to "
":class:`!_thread.Lock`, :class:`!_thread.RLock`, :class:`threading.RLock` "
"and :class:`threading.Condition` classes: reinitialize the lock at fork in "
"the child process, reset the lock to the unlocked state. Rename also the "
"private ``_reset_internal_locks()`` method of :class:`threading.Event` to "
"``_at_fork_reinit()``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40089`: 为 "
":class:`!_thread.Lock`、:class:`!_thread.RLock`、:class:`threading.RLock` 和 "
":class:`threading.Condition` 类添加一个私有的 ``_at_fork_reinit()`` 方法：在子进程的 fork "
"时重新初始化锁，将锁重置为未锁定状态。同时将 :class:`threading.Event` 的私有方法 "
"``_reset_internal_locks()`` 重命名为 ``_at_fork_reinit()``。"

#: ../NEWS:31239
msgid ""
":issue:`25780`: Expose :const:`~socket.CAN_RAW_JOIN_FILTERS` in the "
":mod:`socket` module."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25780`: 在 :mod:`socket` 模块中公开 :const:`~socket.CAN_RAW_JOIN_FILTERS`。"

#: ../NEWS:31242
msgid ""
":issue:`39503`: :class:`~urllib.request.AbstractBasicAuthHandler` of "
":mod:`urllib.request` now parses all WWW-Authenticate HTTP headers and "
"accepts multiple challenges per header: use the realm of the first Basic "
"challenge."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39503`: :mod:`urllib.request` 的 "
":class:`~urllib.request.AbstractBasicAuthHandler` 现在解析所有 WWW-Authenticate "
"HTTP 头部，并接受每个头部多个挑战：使用第一个 Basic 挑战的领域。"

#: ../NEWS:31247
msgid ""
":issue:`39812`: Removed daemon threads from :mod:`concurrent.futures` by "
"adding an internal ``threading._register_atexit()``, which calls registered "
"functions prior to joining all non-daemon threads. This allows for "
"compatibility with subinterpreters, which don't support daemon threads."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39812`: 通过添加一个内部的 ``threading._register_atexit()``，从 "
":mod:`concurrent.futures` "
"中移除了守护线程，该函数在加入所有非守护线程之前调用注册的函数。这允许与不支持守护线程的子解释器兼容。"

#: ../NEWS:31252
msgid ""
":issue:`40050`: Fix ``importlib._bootstrap_external``: avoid creating a new "
"``winreg`` builtin module if it's already available in :data:`sys.modules`, "
"and remove redundant imports."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40050`: 修复 ``importlib._bootstrap_external``: 如果 ``winreg`` 内置模块已经在 "
":data:`sys.modules` 中可用，避免创建新的 ``winreg`` 内置模块，并移除冗余导入。"

#: ../NEWS:31256
msgid ""
":issue:`40014`: Fix ``os.getgrouplist()``: if ``getgrouplist()`` function "
"fails because the group list is too small, retry with a larger group list. "
"On failure, the glibc implementation of ``getgrouplist()`` sets ``ngroups`` "
"to the total number of groups. For other implementations, double the group "
"list size."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40014`: 修复 ``os.getgrouplist()``: 如果 ``getgrouplist()`` "
"函数因为组列表太小而失败，尝试使用更大的组列表。在失败时，glibc 实现的 ``getgrouplist()`` 将 ``ngroups`` "
"设置为组的总数。对于其他实现，将组列表大小加倍。"

#: ../NEWS:31262
msgid ""
":issue:`40017`: Add :const:`time.CLOCK_TAI` constant if the operating system"
" support it."
msgstr ":issue:`40017`: 如果操作系统支持，添加 :const:`time.CLOCK_TAI` 常量。"

#: ../NEWS:31265
msgid ""
":issue:`40016`: In re docstring, clarify the relationship between inline and"
" argument compile flags."
msgstr ":issue:`40016`: 在 re 文档字符串中，阐明内联和参数编译标志之间的关系。"

#: ../NEWS:31268
msgid ""
":issue:`39953`: Update internal table of OpenSSL error codes in the ``ssl`` "
"module."
msgstr ":issue:`39953`: 更新 ``ssl`` 模块中 OpenSSL 错误代码的内部表。"

