msgstr ""
":issue:`40170`: 将 :c:func:`!PyObject_GET_WEAKREFS_LISTPTR` "
"宏转换为函数以隐藏实现细节：该宏直接访问 :c:member:`PyTypeObject.tp_weaklistoffset` 成员。"

#: ../NEWS:31433
msgid ""
":issue:`40170`: Convert :c:func:`PyObject_CheckBuffer` macro to a function "
"to hide implementation details: the macro accessed directly the "
":c:member:`PyTypeObject.tp_as_buffer` member."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40170`: 将 :c:func:`PyObject_CheckBuffer` 宏转换为函数以隐藏实现细节：该宏直接访问 "
":c:member:`PyTypeObject.tp_as_buffer` 成员。"

#: ../NEWS:31437
