"``PyInterpreterState.ceval.tracing_possible``：每个解释器现在拥有自己的变量。"

#: ../NEWS:31502
msgid ""
":issue:`37207`: Speed up calls to ``set()`` by using the :pep:`590` "
"``vectorcall`` calling convention. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37207`: 通过使用 :pep:`590` ``vectorcall`` 调用约定，加速对 ``set()`` 的调用。补丁由 "
"Donghee Na 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:31505
