msgid ""
":issue:`38894`: Fix a bug that was causing incomplete results when calling "
"``pathlib.Path.glob`` in the presence of symlinks that point to files where "
"the user does not have read access. Patch by Pablo Galindo and Matt "
"Wozniski."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38894`: 修复了一个错误，该错误在存在指向用户没有读取权限的文件的符号链接时，调用 ``pathlib.Path.glob`` "
"会导致结果不完整。由 Pablo Galindo 和 Matt Wozniski 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:31537
msgid ""
":issue:`39877`: Fix :c:func:`PyEval_RestoreThread` random crash at exit with"
" daemon threads. It now accesses the ``_PyRuntime`` variable directly "
"instead of using ``tstate->interp->runtime``, since ``tstate`` can be a "
"dangling pointer after :c:func:`Py_Finalize` has been called. Moreover, the "
"daemon thread now exits before trying to take the GIL."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39877`: 修复 :c:func:`PyEval_RestoreThread` 在退出时由于守护线程导致的随机崩溃问题。现在直接访问"
" ``_PyRuntime`` 变量，而不是使用 ``tstate->interp->runtime``，因为在调用 "
":c:func:`Py_Finalize` 后 ``tstate`` 可能成为悬垂指针。此外，守护线程现在在尝试获取 GIL 之前退出。"

#: ../NEWS:31543
msgid ""
":issue:`39871`: Fix a possible :exc:`SystemError` in "
"``math.{atan2,copysign,remainder}()`` when the first argument cannot be "
"converted to a :class:`float`. Patch by Zackery Spytz."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39871`: 修复 ``math.{atan2,copysign,remainder}()`` 中当第一个参数无法转换为 "
":class:`float` 时可能出现的 :exc:`SystemError`。由 Zackery Spytz 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:31547
msgid ""
":issue:`39776`: Fix race condition where threads created by "
"PyGILState_Ensure() could get a duplicate id."
msgstr ":issue:`39776`: 修复由 PyGILState_Ensure() 创建的线程可能获得重复 ID 的竞态条件。"

#: ../NEWS:31550
msgid ""
"This affects consumers of tstate->id like the contextvar caching machinery, "
"which could return invalid cached objects under heavy thread load (observed "
"in embedded scenarios)."
msgstr ""
"这影响了像 contextvar 缓存机制这样的 tstate->id 的消费者，在高线程负载下（在嵌入场景中观察到）可能返回无效的缓存对象。"

#: ../NEWS:31554
msgid ""
":issue:`39778`: Fixed a crash due to incorrect handling of weak references "
"in ``collections.OrderedDict`` classes. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39778`: 修复了由于 ``collections.OrderedDict`` 类中弱引用处理不当导致的崩溃。补丁由 Pablo "
"Galindo 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:31557
msgid ""
":issue:`1635741`: Port audioop extension module to multiphase initialization"
" (:pep:`489`)."
msgstr ":issue:`1635741`: 将 audioop 扩展模块移植到多阶段初始化 (:pep:`489`)。"

#: ../NEWS:31560
msgid ""
":issue:`39702`: Relax :term:`decorator` grammar restrictions to allow any "
"valid expression (:pep:`614`)."
msgstr ":issue:`39702`: 放宽 :term:`decorator` 语法限制，允许任何有效的表达式 (:pep:`614`)。"

#: ../NEWS:31563
msgid ""
":issue:`38091`: Tweak import deadlock detection code to not deadlock itself."
msgstr ":issue:`38091`: 调整导入死锁检测代码以避免自身死锁。"

#: ../NEWS:31565
msgid ""
":issue:`1635741`: Port _locale extension module to multiphase initialization"
" (:pep:`489`)."
msgstr ":issue:`1635741`: 将 _locale 扩展模块移植到多阶段初始化 (:pep:`489`)。"

#: ../NEWS:31568
msgid ""
":issue:`39087`: Optimize :c:func:`PyUnicode_AsUTF8` and "
":c:func:`PyUnicode_AsUTF8AndSize` slightly when they need to create internal"
" UTF-8 cache."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39087`: 在需要创建内部 UTF-8 缓存时，轻微优化 :c:func:`PyUnicode_AsUTF8` 和 "
":c:func:`PyUnicode_AsUTF8AndSize`。"

#: ../NEWS:31572
msgid ""
":issue:`39520`: Fix unparsing of ext slices with no items (``foo[:,]``). "
"Patch by Batuhan Taskaya."
msgstr ":issue:`39520`: 修复无项的外部切片（``foo[:,]``）的反解析问题。补丁由 Batuhan Taskaya 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:31575
msgid ""
":issue:`39220`: Do not optimize annotations if 'from __future__ import "
"annotations' is used. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39220`: 如果使用了 'from __future__ import annotations'，则不优化注释。由 Pablo "
"Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:31578
msgid ""
":issue:`35712`: Using :data:`NotImplemented` in a boolean context has been "
"deprecated. Patch contributed by Josh Rosenberg."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35712`: 在布尔上下文中使用 :data:`NotImplemented` 已被弃用。补丁由 Josh Rosenberg 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:31581
msgid ""
":issue:`22490`: Don't leak environment variable ``__PYVENV_LAUNCHER__`` into"
" the interpreter session on macOS."
msgstr ":issue:`22490`: 在 macOS 上，不将环境变量 ``__PYVENV_LAUNCHER__`` 泄漏到解释器会话中。"

#: ../NEWS:31587
msgid ""
":issue:`39830`: Add :class:`zipfile.Path` to ``__all__`` in the "
":mod:`zipfile` module."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39830`: 在 :mod:`zipfile` 模块的 ``__all__`` 中添加 :class:`zipfile.Path`。"

#: ../NEWS:31590
msgid ""
":issue:`40000`: Improved error messages for validation of ``ast.Constant`` "
"nodes. Patch by Batuhan Taskaya."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40000`: 改进了对 ``ast.Constant`` 节点验证的错误消息。由 Batuhan Taskaya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:31593
msgid ""
":issue:`39999`: ``__module__`` of the AST node classes is now set to \"ast\""
" instead of \"_ast\". Added docstrings for dummy AST node classes and "
"deprecated attributes."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39999`: AST 节点类的 ``__module__`` 现在设置为 \"ast\" 而不是 \"_ast\"。为虚拟 AST "
"节点类和弃用的属性添加了文档字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:31597
msgid ""
":issue:`39991`: :func:`uuid.getnode` now skips IPv6 addresses with the same "
"string length than a MAC address (17 characters): only use MAC addresses."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39991`: :func:`uuid.getnode` 现在跳过与 MAC 地址相同字符串长度（17个字符）的 IPv6 地址：仅使用"
" MAC 地址。"

#: ../NEWS:31600
msgid ""
":issue:`39988`: Deprecated ``ast.AugLoad`` and ``ast.AugStore`` node classes"
" because they are no longer used."
msgstr ":issue:`39988`: 弃用了 ``ast.AugLoad`` 和 ``ast.AugStore`` 节点类，因为它们不再被使用。"

#: ../NEWS:31603
msgid ""
":issue:`39656`: Ensure ``bin/python3.#`` is always present in virtual "
"environments on POSIX platforms - by Anthony Sottile."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39656`: 确保在 POSIX 平台的虚拟环境中始终存在 ``bin/python3.#`` - 由 Anthony Sottile"
" 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:31606
msgid ""
":issue:`39969`: Deprecated ``ast.Param`` node class because it's no longer "
"used. Patch by Batuhan Taskaya."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39969`: 弃用了 ``ast.Param`` 节点类，因为它不再被使用。由 Batuhan Taskaya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:31609
msgid ""
":issue:`39360`: Ensure all workers exit when finalizing a "
":class:`multiprocessing.Pool` implicitly via the module finalization "
"handlers of multiprocessing. This fixes a deadlock situation that can be "
"experienced when the Pool is not properly finalized via the context manager "
"or a call to ``multiprocessing.Pool.terminate``. Patch by Batuhan Taskaya "
"and Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39360`: 确保所有工作线程在通过多处理模块的最终化处理程序隐式完成 :class:`multiprocessing.Pool` "
"时退出。这修复了当 Pool 没有通过上下文管理器或调用 ``multiprocessing.Pool.terminate`` "
"正确完成时可能遇到的死锁情况。由 Batuhan Taskaya 和 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:31616
msgid ""
":issue:`35370`: sys.settrace(), sys.setprofile() and "
"_lsprof.Profiler.enable() now properly report :c:func:`PySys_Audit` error if"
" \"sys.setprofile\" or \"sys.settrace\" audit event is denied."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35370`: sys.settrace()、sys.setprofile() 和 _lsprof.Profiler.enable() "
"现在如果 \"sys.setprofile\" 或 \"sys.settrace\" 审计事件被拒绝，会正确报告 "
":c:func:`PySys_Audit` 错误。"

#: ../NEWS:31620
msgid ""
":issue:`39936`: AIX: Fix _aix_support module when the subprocess is not "
"available, when building Python from scratch. It now uses new private "
"_bootsubprocess module, rather than having two implementations depending if "
"subprocess is available or not. So _aix_support.aix_platform() result is now"
" the same if subprocess is available or not."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39936`: AIX：在从头构建 Python 时，修复了当子进程不可用时的 _aix_support 模块。现在它使用新的私有 "
"_bootsubprocess 模块，而不是根据子进程是否可用有两个实现。因此，_aix_support.aix_platform() "
"的结果现在在子进程是否可用时是相同的。"

#: ../NEWS:31626
msgid ""
":issue:`36144`: :class:`collections.OrderedDict` now implements ``|`` and "
"``|=`` (:pep:`584`)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36144`: :class:`collections.OrderedDict` 现在实现了 ``|`` 和 ``|=`` "
"(:pep:`584`)。"

#: ../NEWS:31629
msgid ""
":issue:`39652`: The column name found in ``sqlite3.Cursor.description`` is "
"now truncated on the first '[' only if the PARSE_COLNAMES option is set."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39652`: 在 ``sqlite3.Cursor.description`` 中找到的列名现在仅在设置了 "
"PARSE_COLNAMES 选项时在第一个 '[' 处截断。"

#: ../NEWS:31632
msgid ""
":issue:`39915`: Ensure :attr:`unittest.mock.AsyncMock.await_args_list` has "
"call objects in the order of awaited arguments instead of using "
":attr:`unittest.mock.Mock.call_args` which has the last value of the call. "
"Patch by Karthikeyan Singaravelan."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39915`: 确保 :attr:`unittest.mock.AsyncMock.await_args_list` "
"中的调用对象按照等待参数的顺序排列，而不是使用 :attr:`unittest.mock.Mock.call_args`，后者具有调用的最后一个值。由 "
"Karthikeyan Singaravelan 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:31637
msgid ""
":issue:`36144`: Updated :data:`os.environ` and :data:`os.environb` to "
"support :pep:`584`'s merge (``|``) and update (``|=``) operators."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36144`: 更新了 :data:`os.environ` 和 :data:`os.environb` 以支持 :pep:`584` "
"的合并（``|``）和更新（``|=``）操作符。"

#: ../NEWS:31640
msgid ""
":issue:`38662`: The ``ensurepip`` module now invokes ``pip`` via the "
"``runpy`` module. Hence it is no longer tightly coupled with the internal "
"API of the bundled ``pip`` version, allowing easier updates to a newer "
"``pip`` version both internally and for distributors."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38662`: ``ensurepip`` 模块现在通过 ``runpy`` 模块调用 ``pip``。因此，它不再与捆绑的 "
"``pip`` 版本的内部 API 紧密耦合，使得内部和分发者都更容易更新到新版本的 ``pip``。"

#: ../NEWS:31645
msgid ""
":issue:`38075`: Fix the :meth:`random.Random.seed` method when a "
":class:`bool` is passed as the seed."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38075`: 修复了当 :class:`bool` 作为种子传递时 :meth:`random.Random.seed` 方法的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:31648
msgid ""
":issue:`39916`: More reliable use of ``os.scandir()`` in ``Path.glob()``. It"
" no longer emits a ResourceWarning when interrupted."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39916`: 在 ``Path.glob()`` 中更可靠地使用 ``os.scandir()``。当被中断时，它不再发出 "
"ResourceWarning。"

#: ../NEWS:31651
msgid ""
":issue:`39850`: :mod:`multiprocessing` now supports abstract socket "
"addresses (if abstract sockets are supported in the running platform). When "
"creating arbitrary addresses (like when default-constructing "
":class:`multiprocessing.connection.Listener` objects) abstract sockets are "
"preferred to avoid the case when the temporary-file-generated address is too"
" large for an AF_UNIX socket address. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39850`: :mod:`multiprocessing` "
"现在支持抽象套接字地址（如果运行的平台支持抽象套接字）。在创建任意地址时（如默认构造 "
":class:`multiprocessing.connection.Listener` 对象时），优先选择抽象套接字以避免临时文件生成的地址对于 "
"AF_UNIX 套接字地址来说过大的情况。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:31658
msgid ""
":issue:`36287`: :func:`ast.dump` no longer outputs optional fields and "
"attributes with default values. The default values for optional fields and "
"attributes of AST nodes are now set as class attributes (e.g. "
"``Constant.kind`` is set to ``None``)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36287`: :func:`ast.dump` 不再输出具有默认值的可选字段和属性。AST "
"节点的可选字段和属性的默认值现在设置为类属性（例如，``Constant.kind`` 设置为 ``None``）。"

#: ../NEWS:31663
msgid ""
":issue:`39889`: Fixed :func:`ast.unparse` for extended slices containing a "
"single element (e.g. ``a[i:j,]``). Remove redundant tuples when index with a"
" tuple (e.g. ``a[i, j]``)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39889`: 修复了 :func:`ast.unparse` 对于包含单个元素的扩展切片（例如 "
"``a[i:j,]``）的问题。当使用元组索引时（例如 ``a[i, j]``），移除冗余的元组。"

#: ../NEWS:31667
msgid ""
":issue:`39828`: Fix :mod:`json.tool` to catch :exc:`BrokenPipeError`. Patch "
"by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39828`: 修复 :mod:`json.tool` 以捕获 :exc:`BrokenPipeError`。由 Donghee Na "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:31670
msgid ""
":issue:`13487`: Avoid a possible *\"RuntimeError: dictionary changed size "
"during iteration\"* from :func:`inspect.getmodule` when it tried to loop "
"through :data:`sys.modules`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`13487`: 避免了当 :func:`inspect.getmodule` 尝试遍历 :data:`sys.modules` "
"时可能出现的 *\"RuntimeError: dictionary changed size during iteration\"*。"

#: ../NEWS:31674
msgid ""
":issue:`39674`: Revert \":issue:`37330`: open() no longer accept 'U' in file"
" mode\". The \"U\" mode of open() is kept in Python 3.9 to ease transition "
"from Python 2.7, but will be removed in Python 3.10."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39674`: 恢复 \":issue:`37330`: open() 不再接受文件模式中的 'U'\"。为了便于从 Python "
"2.7 过渡，Python 3.9 中保留了 open() 的 \"U\" 模式，但将在 Python 3.10 中移除。"

#: ../NEWS:31678
msgid ""
":issue:`28577`: The hosts method on 32-bit prefix length IPv4Networks and "
"128-bit prefix IPv6Networks now returns a list containing the single Address"
" instead of an empty list."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28577`: 32位前缀长度的 IPv4Networks 和 128位前缀的 IPv6Networks 的 hosts "
"方法现在返回包含单个 Address 的列表，而不是空列表。"

#: ../NEWS:31682
msgid ""
":issue:`39826`: Add getConnection method to logging HTTPHandler to enable "
"custom connections."
msgstr ":issue:`39826`: 向 logging HTTPHandler 添加 getConnection 方法，以启用自定义连接。"

#: ../NEWS:31685
msgid ""
":issue:`39763`: Reimplement ``distutils.spawn.spawn`` function with the "
":mod:`subprocess` module."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39763`: 使用 :mod:`subprocess` 模块重新实现 ``distutils.spawn.spawn`` 函数。"

#: ../NEWS:31688
msgid ""
":issue:`39794`: Add --without-decimal-contextvar build option.  This enables"
" a thread-local rather than a coroutine local context."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39794`: 添加 --without-decimal-contextvar 构建选项。这启用了线程本地而非协程本地的上下文。"

#: ../NEWS:31691
msgid ""
":issue:`36144`: :class:`collections.defaultdict` now implements ``|`` "
"(:pep:`584`)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36144`: :class:`collections.defaultdict` 现在实现了 ``|`` 操作符 "
"(:pep:`584`)。"

#: ../NEWS:31694
msgid ":issue:`39517`: Fix runpy.run_path() when using pathlike objects"
msgstr ":issue:`39517`: 修复 runpy.run_path() 在使用路径类对象时的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:31696
msgid ""
":issue:`39775`: Change ``inspect.Signature.parameters`` back to "
"``collections.OrderedDict``. This was changed to ``dict`` in Python 3.9.0a4."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39775`: 将 ``inspect.Signature.parameters`` 改回 "
"``collections.OrderedDict``。在 Python 3.9.0a4 中，这被改为 ``dict``。"

#: ../NEWS:31700
msgid ""
":issue:`39678`: Refactor queue_manager in "
":class:`concurrent.futures.ProcessPoolExecutor` to make it easier to "
"maintain."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39678`: 重构 :class:`concurrent.futures.ProcessPoolExecutor` 中的 "
"queue_manager，使其更易于维护。"

#: ../NEWS:31704
msgid ""
":issue:`39764`: Fix AttributeError when calling get_stack on a "
"PyAsyncGenObject Task"
msgstr ""
":issue:`39764`: 修复在 PyAsyncGenObject Task 上调用 get_stack 时的 AttributeError。"

#: ../NEWS:31707
msgid ""
":issue:`39769`: The :func:`compileall.compile_dir` function's *ddir* "
"parameter and the compileall command line flag ``-d`` no longer write the "
"wrong pathname to the generated pyc file for submodules beneath the root of "
"the directory tree being compiled.  This fixes a regression introduced with "
"Python 3.5."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39769`: :func:`compileall.compile_dir` 函数的 *ddir* 参数和 compileall "
"命令行标志 ``-d`` 不再为正在编译的目录树根下的子模块生成错误的路径名到 pyc 文件中。这修复了自 Python 3.5 引入的回归问题。"

#: ../NEWS:31713
msgid ""
":issue:`36144`: :class:`types.MappingProxyType` objects now support the "
"merge (``|``) operator from :pep:`584`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36144`: :class:`types.MappingProxyType` 对象现在支持来自 :pep:`584` 的合并 "
"(``|``) 操作符。"

#: ../NEWS:31716
msgid ""
":issue:`38691`: The :mod:`importlib` module now ignores the "
":envvar:`PYTHONCASEOK` environment variable when the :option:`-E` or "
":option:`-I` command line options are being used."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38691`: 当使用 :option:`-E` 或 :option:`-I` 命令行选项时，:mod:`importlib` "
"模块现在忽略 :envvar:`PYTHONCASEOK` 环境变量。"

#: ../NEWS:31720
msgid ""
":issue:`39719`: Remove :meth:`tempfile.SpooledTemporaryFile.softspace` as "
"files no longer have the ``softspace`` attribute in Python 3. Patch by "
"Shantanu."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39719`: 移除 :meth:`tempfile.SpooledTemporaryFile.softspace`，因为文件在 "
"Python 3 中不再有 ``softspace`` 属性。由 Shantanu 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:31723
msgid ""
":issue:`39667`: Improve pathlib.Path compatibility on zipfile.Path and "
"correct performance degradation as found in zipp 3.0."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39667`: 提升zipfile.Path与pathlib.Path的兼容性，并修复zipp 3.0中发现的性能下降问题。"

#: ../NEWS:31726
msgid ""
":issue:`39638`: Keep ASDL signatures in the docstrings for ``AST`` nodes. "
"Patch by Batuhan Taskaya"
msgstr ":issue:`39638`: 保留 ``AST`` 节点文档字符串中的ASDL签名。由Batuhan Taskaya提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:31729
msgid ""
":issue:`39639`: Deprecated ``ast.Suite`` node class because it's no longer "
"used. Patch by Batuhan Taskaya."
msgstr ":issue:`39639`: 弃用 ``ast.Suite`` 节点类，因为它不再被使用。由Batuhan Taskaya提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:31732
msgid ":issue:`39609`: Add thread_name_prefix to default asyncio executor"
msgstr ":issue:`39609`: 向默认的asyncio执行器添加thread_name_prefix。"

#: ../NEWS:31734
msgid ""
":issue:`39548`: Fix handling of header in "
":class:`urllib.request.AbstractDigestAuthHandler` when the optional ``qop`` "
"parameter is not present."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39548`: 修复 :class:`urllib.request.AbstractDigestAuthHandler` 中当可选参数 "
"``qop`` 不存在时的头部处理问题。"

#: ../NEWS:31738
msgid ""
":issue:`39509`: HTTP status codes ``103 EARLY_HINTS`` and ``425 TOO_EARLY`` "
"are added to :class:`http.HTTPStatus`. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39509`: HTTP状态码 ``103 EARLY_HINTS`` 和 ``425 TOO_EARLY`` 被添加到 "
":class:`http.HTTPStatus` 中。由Donghee Na提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:31741
msgid ""
":issue:`39507`: Adding HTTP status 418 \"I'm a Teapot\" to HTTPStatus in "
"http library. Patch by Ross Rhodes."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39507`: 向http库的HTTPStatus添加HTTP状态418 \"I'm a Teapot\"。由Ross "
"Rhodes提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:31744
msgid ""
":issue:`39495`: Remove default value from *attrs* parameter of "
":meth:`xml.etree.ElementTree.TreeBuilder.start` for consistency between "
"Python and C implementations."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39495`: 为保持Python和C实现之间的一致性，移除 "
":meth:`xml.etree.ElementTree.TreeBuilder.start` 中 *attrs* 参数的默认值。"

#: ../NEWS:31748
msgid ""
":issue:`38971`: Open issue in the BPO indicated a desire to make the "
"implementation of codecs.open() at parity with io.open(), which implements a"
" try/except to assure file stream gets closed before an exception is raised."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38971`: "
"BPO中的开放问题表明希望使codecs.open()的实现与io.open()保持一致，后者实现了try/except以确保在引发异常之前关闭文件流。"

#: ../NEWS:31753
msgid ""
":issue:`38641`: Added starred expressions support to ``return`` and "
"``yield`` statements for ``lib2to3``. Patch by Vlad Emelianov."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38641`: 向 ``lib2to3``添加了对 ``return`` 和 ``yield`` 语句中星号表达式的支持。由Vlad "
"Emelianov提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:31756
msgid ""
":issue:`37534`: When using minidom module to generate XML documents the "
"ability to add Standalone Document Declaration is added. All the changes are"
" made to generate a document in compliance with Extensible Markup Language "
"(XML) 1.0 (Fifth Edition) W3C Recommendation (available here: "
"https://www.w3.org/TR/xml/#sec-prolog-dtd)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37534`: "
