#: ../NEWS:31765
msgid ""
":issue:`34822`: Simplified AST for subscription. Simple indices are now "
"represented by their value, extended slices are represented as tuples. "
":mod:`ast` classes ``Index`` and ``ExtSlice`` are considered deprecated and "
"will be removed in future Python versions. In the meantime, ``Index(value)``"
" now returns a ``value`` itself, ``ExtSlice(slices)`` returns "
"``Tuple(slices, Load())``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34822`: 简化了订阅的AST。简单索引现在由其值表示，扩展切片表示为元组。:mod:`ast` 类 ``Index`` 和 "
"``ExtSlice`` 被认为已弃用，将在未来的Python版本中移除。在此期间，``Index(value)`` 现在返回 ``value`` "
"本身，``ExtSlice(slices)`` 返回 ``Tuple(slices, Load())``。"

