#: ../NEWS:31816
msgid ""
":issue:`1294959`: Add ``--with-platlibdir`` option to the configure script: "
"name of the platform-specific library directory, stored in the new "
":data:`sys.platlibdir` attribute. It is used to build the path of platform-"
"specific extension modules and the path of the standard library. It is equal"
" to ``\"lib\"`` on most platforms. On Fedora and SuSE, it is equal to "
"``\"lib64\"`` on 64-bit platforms. Patch by Jan Matějek, Matěj Cepl, "
"Charalampos Stratakis and Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`1294959`: 在配置脚本中添加 ``--with-platlibdir`` 选项：平台特定的库目录名称，存储在新的 "
":data:`sys.platlibdir` 属性中。它用于构建平台特定的扩展模块路径和标准库路径。在大多数平台上，它等于 ``\"lib\"``。在 "
"Fedora 和 SuSE 上，64位平台上它等于 ``\"lib64\"``。补丁由 Jan Matějek、Matěj "
"Cepl、Charalampos Stratakis 和 Victor Stinner 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:31827
