":issue:`1635741`: Port _codecs extension module to multiphase initialization"
" (:pep:`489`)."
msgstr ":issue:`1635741`: 将 _codecs 扩展模块移植到多阶段初始化 (:pep:`489`)。"

#: ../NEWS:32014
msgid ""
":issue:`1635741`: Port _bz2 extension module to multiphase initialization "
"(:pep:`489`)."
msgstr ":issue:`1635741`: 将 _bz2 扩展模块移植到多阶段初始化 (:pep:`489`)。"

#: ../NEWS:32017
msgid ""
":issue:`1635741`: Port _abc extension module to multiphase initialization "
"(:pep:`489`)."
msgstr ":issue:`1635741`: 将 _abc 扩展模块移植到多阶段初始化 (:pep:`489`)。"

#: ../NEWS:32020
msgid ""
":issue:`39320`: Replace two complex bytecodes for building dicts with two "
"simpler ones. The new bytecodes ``DICT_MERGE`` and ``DICT_UPDATE`` have been"
" added The old bytecodes ``BUILD_MAP_UNPACK`` and "
"``BUILD_MAP_UNPACK_WITH_CALL`` have been removed."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39320`: 用两个更简单的字节码替换构建字典的两个复杂字节码。添加了新的字节码 ``DICT_MERGE`` 和 "
"``DICT_UPDATE``，移除了旧的字节码 ``BUILD_MAP_UNPACK`` 和 "
"``BUILD_MAP_UNPACK_WITH_CALL``。"

#: ../NEWS:32025
msgid ""
":issue:`39219`: Syntax errors raised in the tokenizer now always set correct"
" \"text\" and \"offset\" attributes."
msgstr ":issue:`39219`: 分词器中引发的语法错误现在总是设置正确的 \"text\" 和 \"offset\" 属性。"

#: ../NEWS:32028
msgid ""
":issue:`36051`: Drop the GIL during large ``bytes.join`` operations. Patch "
"by Bruce Merry."
msgstr ":issue:`36051`: 在大型 ``bytes.join`` 操作期间释放 GIL。由 Bruce Merry 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32031
msgid ""
":issue:`38960`: Fix DTrace build issues on FreeBSD. Patch by David Carlier."
msgstr ":issue:`38960`: 修复 FreeBSD 上的 DTrace 构建问题。由 David Carlier 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32033
msgid ""
":issue:`37207`: Speed up calls to ``range()`` by about 30%, by using the PEP"
" 590 ``vectorcall`` calling convention. Patch by Mark Shannon."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37207`: 通过使用 PEP 590 的 ``vectorcall`` 调用约定，将 ``range()`` 的调用速度提高约 "
"30%。由 Mark Shannon 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32036
msgid ""
":issue:`36144`: :class:`dict` (and :class:`collections.UserDict`) objects "
"now support PEP 584's merge (``|``) and update (``|=``) operators. Patch by "
"Brandt Bucher."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36144`: :class:`dict` (和 :class:`collections.UserDict`) 对象现在支持 PEP "
"584 的合并（``|``）和更新（``|=``）操作符。由 Brandt Bucher 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32040
msgid ""
":issue:`32856`: Optimized the idiom for assignment a temporary variable in "
"comprehensions. Now ``for y in [expr]`` in comprehensions is as fast as a "
"simple assignment ``y = expr``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32856`: 优化了在推导式中赋值临时变量的惯用法。现在在推导式中使用 ``for y in [expr]`` 与简单赋值 ``y ="
" expr`` 一样快。"

#: ../NEWS:32047
msgid ""
":issue:`30566`: Fix :exc:`IndexError` when trying to decode an invalid "
"string with punycode codec."
msgstr ":issue:`30566`: 修复尝试使用 punycode 编解码器解码无效字符串时的 :exc:`IndexError`。"

#: ../NEWS:32050
msgid ""
":issue:`39649`: Remove obsolete check for ``__args__`` in "
"``bdb.Bdb.format_stack_entry``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39649`: 移除 ``bdb.Bdb.format_stack_entry`` 中对 ``__args__`` 的过时检查。"

#: ../NEWS:32053
msgid ""
":issue:`39648`: Expanded :func:`math.gcd` and :func:`math.lcm` to handle "
"multiple arguments."
msgstr ":issue:`39648`: 扩展 :func:`math.gcd` 和 :func:`math.lcm` 以处理多个参数。"

#: ../NEWS:32056
msgid ""
":issue:`39681`: Fix a regression where the C pickle module wouldn't allow "
"unpickling from a file-like object that doesn't expose a readinto() method."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39681`: 修复一个回归问题，即 C pickle 模块不允许从没有暴露 readinto() 方法的类文件对象中反序列化。"

#: ../NEWS:32060
msgid ""
":issue:`35950`: Raise :exc:`io.UnsupportedOperation` in "
":meth:`io.BufferedReader.truncate` when it is called on a read-only "
":class:`io.BufferedReader` instance."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35950`: 在只读的 :class:`io.BufferedReader` 实例上调用 "
":meth:`io.BufferedReader.truncate` 时抛出 :exc:`io.UnsupportedOperation`。"

#: ../NEWS:32064
msgid ":issue:`39479`: Add :func:`math.lcm` function: least common multiple."
msgstr ":issue:`39479`: 添加 :func:`math.lcm` 函数：最小公倍数。"

#: ../NEWS:32066
msgid ""
":issue:`39674`: Revert \"Do not expose abstract collection classes in the "
"collections module\" change (:issue:`25988`). Aliases to ABC like "
"collections.Mapping are kept in Python 3.9 to ease transition from Python "
"2.7, but will be removed in Python 3.10."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39674`: 撤销“不在 collections 模块中暴露抽象集合类”的更改（:issue:`25988`）。像 "
"collections.Mapping 这样的 ABC 别名在 Python 3.9 中保留以方便从 Python 2.7 过渡，但将在 Python "
"3.10 中移除。"

#: ../NEWS:32071
msgid ""
":issue:`39104`: Fix hanging ProcessPoolExcutor on ``shutdown(wait=False)`` "
"when a task has failed pickling."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39104`: 修复当任务序列化失败时 ``shutdown(wait=False)`` 上的 ProcessPoolExecutor "
"挂起问题。"

#: ../NEWS:32074
msgid ":issue:`39627`: Fixed TypedDict totality check for inherited keys."
msgstr ":issue:`39627`: 修复了 TypedDict 对继承键的总体验证。"

#: ../NEWS:32076
msgid ""
":issue:`39474`: Fixed starting position of AST for expressions like "
"``(a)(b)``, ``(a)[b]`` and ``(a).b``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39474`: 修复了像 ``(a)(b)``、``(a)[b]`` 和 ``(a).b`` 这类表达式的 AST 起始位置。"

#: ../NEWS:32079
msgid ""
":issue:`21016`: The :mod:`pydoc` and :mod:`trace` modules now use the "
":mod:`sysconfig` module to get the path to the Python standard library, to "
"support uncommon installation path like ``/usr/lib64/python3.9/`` on Fedora."
" Patch by Jan Matějek."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21016`: :mod:`pydoc` 和 :mod:`trace` 模块现在使用 :mod:`sysconfig` 模块来获取 "
"Python 标准库的路径，以支持像 Fedora 上的 ``/usr/lib64/python3.9/`` 这样的不常见安装路径。由 Jan "
"Matějek 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32084
msgid ""
":issue:`39590`: Collections.deque now holds strong references during "
"deque.__contains__ and deque.count, fixing crashes."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39590`: Collections.deque 现在在 deque.__contains__ 和 deque.count "
"期间保持强引用，修复了崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:32087
msgid ""
":issue:`39586`: The distutils ``bdist_msi`` command is deprecated in Python "
"3.9, use ``bdist_wheel`` (wheel packages) instead."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39586`: Python 3.9 中已弃用 distutils 的 ``bdist_msi`` 命令，改用 "
"``bdist_wheel`` (wheel 包) 。"

#: ../NEWS:32090
msgid ""
":issue:`39595`: Improved performance of zipfile.Path for files with a large "
"number of entries. Also improved performance and fixed minor issue as "
"published with `importlib_metadata 1.5 <https://importlib-"
"metadata.readthedocs.io/en/latest/history.html#v1-5-0>`_."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39595`: 提高了 zipfile.Path 对于包含大量条目的文件的性能。同时提高了性能并修复了与 "
"`importlib_metadata 1.5 <https://importlib-"
"metadata.readthedocs.io/en/latest/history.html#v1-5-0>`_ 发布的小问题。"

#: ../NEWS:32095
msgid ""
":issue:`39350`: Fix regression in :class:`fractions.Fraction` if the "
"numerator and/or the denominator is an :class:`int` subclass. The "
":func:`math.gcd` function is now used to normalize the *numerator* and "
"*denominator*. :func:`math.gcd` always return a :class:`int` type. "
"Previously, the GCD type depended on *numerator* and *denominator*."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39350`: 修复了 :class:`fractions.Fraction` 如果分子和/或分母是 :class:`int` "
"子类时的回归问题。现在使用 :func:`math.gcd` 函数来规范化 *分子* 和 *分母*。:func:`math.gcd` 总是返回 "
":class:`int` 类型。以前，GCD 类型依赖于 *分子* 和 *分母*。"

#: ../NEWS:32101
msgid ""
":issue:`39567`: Added audit for :func:`os.walk`, :func:`os.fwalk`, "
":meth:`pathlib.Path.glob` and :meth:`pathlib.Path.rglob`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39567`: 为 :func:`os.walk`、:func:`os.fwalk`、:meth:`pathlib.Path.glob`"
" 和 :meth:`pathlib.Path.rglob` 添加了审计。"

#: ../NEWS:32104
msgid ""
":issue:`39559`: Remove unused, undocumented argument ``getters`` from "
":func:`uuid.getnode`"
msgstr ":issue:`39559`: 从 :func:`uuid.getnode` 中移除了未使用的、未记录的参数 ``getters``。"

#: ../NEWS:32107
msgid ""
":issue:`38149`: :func:`sys.audit` is now called only once per call of "
":func:`glob.glob` and :func:`glob.iglob`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38149`: 现在每次调用 :func:`glob.glob` 和 :func:`glob.iglob` "
"时，:func:`sys.audit` 只被调用一次。"

#: ../NEWS:32110
msgid ""
":issue:`39546`: Fix a regression in :class:`~argparse.ArgumentParser` where "
"``allow_abbrev=False`` was ignored for long options that used a prefix "
"character other than \"-\"."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39546`: 修复了 :class:`~argparse.ArgumentParser` 中的一个回归问题，其中 "
"``allow_abbrev=False`` 对于使用除 \"-\" 之外的前缀字符的长选项被忽略。"

#: ../NEWS:32114
msgid ""
":issue:`39450`: Striped whitespace from docstring before returning it from "
":func:`unittest.case.shortDescription`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39450`: 在从 :func:`unittest.case.shortDescription` 返回之前，去除了文档字符串中的空白。"

#: ../NEWS:32117
msgid ""
":issue:`12915`: A new function ``resolve_name`` has been added to the "
"``pkgutil`` module. This resolves a string of the form ``'a.b.c.d'`` or "
"``'a.b:c.d'`` to an object. In the example, ``a.b`` is a package/module and "
"``c.d`` is an object within that package/module reached via recursive "
"attribute access."
msgstr ""
":issue:`12915`: 在 ``pkgutil`` 模块中添加了一个新函数 ``resolve_name``。该函数将形如 "
"``'a.b.c.d'`` 或 ``'a.b:c.d'`` 的字符串解析为一个对象。在示例中，``a.b`` 是一个包/模块，而 ``c.d`` "
"是通过递归属性访问到达的该包/模块内的一个对象。"

#: ../NEWS:32123
msgid ""
":issue:`39353`: The :func:`binascii.crc_hqx` function is no longer "
"deprecated."
msgstr ":issue:`39353`: :func:`binascii.crc_hqx` 函数不再被弃用。"

#: ../NEWS:32125
msgid ":issue:`39493`: Mark ``typing.IO.closed`` as a property"
msgstr ":issue:`39493`: 将 ``typing.IO.closed`` 标记为属性"

#: ../NEWS:32127
msgid ""
":issue:`39491`: Add :data:`typing.Annotated` and ``include_extras`` "
"parameter to :func:`typing.get_type_hints` as part of :pep:`593`. Patch by "
"Till Varoquaux, documentation by Till Varoquaux and Konstantin Kashin."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39491`: 添加 :data:`typing.Annotated` 和 ``include_extras`` 参数到 "
":func:`typing.get_type_hints` 作为 :pep:`593` 的一部分。由 Till Varoquaux 提供补丁，文档由 "
"Till Varoquaux 和 Konstantin Kashin 编写。"

#: ../NEWS:32131
msgid ""
":issue:`39485`: Fix a bug in :func:`unittest.mock.create_autospec` that "
"would complain about the wrong number of arguments for custom descriptors "
"defined in an extension module returning functions."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39485`: 修复 :func:`unittest.mock.create_autospec` "
"中的一个错误，该错误会抱怨在扩展模块中定义的自定义描述符返回函数时的参数数量不正确。"

#: ../NEWS:32135
msgid ""
":issue:`38932`: Mock fully resets child objects on reset_mock(). Patch by "
"Vegard Stikbakke"
msgstr ":issue:`38932`: Mock 在 reset_mock() 时完全重置子对象。由 Vegard Stikbakke 提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:32138
msgid ""
":issue:`39082`: Allow AsyncMock to correctly patch static/class methods"
msgstr ":issue:`39082`: 允许 AsyncMock 正确修补静态/类方法"

#: ../NEWS:32140
msgid ""
":issue:`39432`: Implement PEP-489 algorithm for non-ascii \"PyInit\\_...\" "
"symbol names in distutils to make it export the correct init symbol also on "
"Windows."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39432`: 在 distutils 中实现了 PEP-489 算法，用于非 ASCII \"PyInit\\_...\" "
"符号名称，以确保在 Windows 上也导出正确的初始化符号。"

#: ../NEWS:32144
msgid ""
":issue:`18819`: Omit ``devmajor`` and ``devminor`` fields for non-device "
"files in :mod:`tarfile` archives, enabling bit-for-bit compatibility with "
"GNU ``tar(1)``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`18819`: 在 :mod:`tarfile` 存档中为非设备文件省略 ``devmajor`` 和 ``devminor`` "
"字段，实现与 GNU ``tar(1)`` 的比特级兼容。"

#: ../NEWS:32148
msgid ""
":issue:`39349`: Added a new *cancel_futures* parameter to "
":meth:`concurrent.futures.Executor.shutdown` that cancels all pending "
"futures which have not started running, instead of waiting for them to "
"complete before shutting down the executor."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39349`: 向 :meth:`concurrent.futures.Executor.shutdown` 添加了一个新的 "
"*cancel_futures* 参数，该参数会取消所有尚未开始运行的待处理期货，而不是在关闭执行器之前等待它们完成。"

#: ../NEWS:32153
msgid ""
":issue:`39274`: ``bool(fraction.Fraction)`` now returns a boolean even if "
"(numerator != 0) does not return a boolean (ex: numpy number)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39274`: ``bool(fraction.Fraction)`` 现在即使 (numerator != 0) 不返回布尔值（例如 "
"numpy 数字），也会返回一个布尔值。"

#: ../NEWS:32156
msgid ""
":issue:`34793`: Remove support for ``with (await asyncio.lock):`` and ``with"
" (yield from asyncio.lock):``.  The same is correct for "
"``asyncio.Condition`` and ``asyncio.Semaphore``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34793`: 移除了对 ``with (await asyncio.lock):`` 和 ``with (yield from "
"asyncio.lock):`` 的支持。对于 ``asyncio.Condition`` 和 ``asyncio.Semaphore`` 同样适用。"

#: ../NEWS:32160
msgid ""
":issue:`25597`: Ensure, if ``wraps`` is supplied to "
":class:`unittest.mock.MagicMock`, it is used to calculate return values for "
"the magic methods instead of using the default return values. Patch by "
"Karthikeyan Singaravelan."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25597`: 确保在向 :class:`unittest.mock.MagicMock` 提供 ``wraps`` "
"时，它被用于计算魔术方法的返回值，而不是使用默认返回值。由Karthikeyan Singaravelan提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32165
msgid ""
":issue:`36350`: ``inspect.Signature.parameters`` and "
"``inspect.BoundArguments.arguments`` are now dicts instead of OrderedDicts. "
"Patch contributed by Rémi Lapeyre."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36350`: ``inspect.Signature.parameters`` 和 "
"``inspect.BoundArguments.arguments`` 现在是字典而不是有序字典。由Rémi Lapeyre贡献的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32169
msgid ""
":issue:`35727`: Fix sys.exit() and sys.exit(None) exit code propagation when"
" used in multiprocessing.Process."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35727`: "
"修复了在multiprocessing.Process中使用sys.exit()和sys.exit(None)时的退出代码传播问题。"

#: ../NEWS:32172
msgid ""
":issue:`32173`: * Add ``lazycache`` function to ``__all__``. * Use "
"``dict.clear`` to clear the cache. * Refactoring ``getline`` function and "
"``checkcache`` function."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32173`: * 将 ``lazycache``函数添加到 ``__all__`` 中。 * 使用 ``dict.clear`` "
"来清除缓存。 * 重构 ``getline`` 函数和 ``checkcache`` 函数。"

#: ../NEWS:32179
msgid ""
":issue:`17422`: The language reference now specifies restrictions on class "
"namespaces. Adapted from a patch by Ethan Furman."
msgstr ":issue:`17422`: 语言参考现在指定了对类命名空间的限制。基于Ethan Furman的补丁改编。"

#: ../NEWS:32182
msgid ""
":issue:`39572`: Updated documentation of ``total`` flag of ``TypedDict``."
msgstr ":issue:`39572`: 更新了 ``TypedDict`` 的 ``total`` 标志的文档。"

#: ../NEWS:32184
msgid ""
":issue:`39654`: In pyclbr doc, update 'class' to 'module' where appropriate "
"and add readmodule comment. Patch by Hakan Çelik."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39654`: 在pyclbr文档中，将'class'更新为'module'并在适当的地方添加readmodule注释。由Hakan "
"Çelik提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32187
msgid ""
":issue:`39153`: Clarify refcounting semantics for the following functions: -"
" PyObject_SetItem - PyMapping_SetItemString - PyDict_SetItem - "
"PyDict_SetItemString"
msgstr ""
":issue:`39153`: 澄清了以下函数的引用计数语义：- PyObject_SetItem - PyMapping_SetItemString "
"- PyDict_SetItem - PyDict_SetItemString"

#: ../NEWS:32191
msgid ""
":issue:`39392`: Explain that when filling with turtle, overlap regions may "
"be left unfilled."
msgstr ":issue:`39392`: 解释在使用turtle填充时，重叠区域可能不会被填充。"

#: ../NEWS:32194
msgid ""
":issue:`39369`: Update mmap readline method description. The fact that the "
"readline method does update the file position should not be ignored since "
"this might give the impression for the programmer that it doesn't update it."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39369`: 更新mmap "
"readline方法的描述。readline方法确实会更新文件位置，这一点不应被忽视，因为这可能会给程序员留下它不更新的印象。"

#: ../NEWS:32199
msgid ":issue:`9056`: Include subsection in TOC for PDF version of docs."
msgstr ":issue:`9056`: 在文档的PDF版本中为子章节添加目录。"

#: ../NEWS:32204
msgid ":issue:`38325`: Skip tests on non-BMP characters of test_winconsoleio."
msgstr ":issue:`38325`: 在test_winconsoleio的非BMP字符测试中跳过测试。"

#: ../NEWS:32206
msgid ""
":issue:`39502`: Skip test_zipfile.test_add_file_after_2107() if "
":func:`time.localtime` fails with :exc:`OverflowError`. It is the case on "
"AIX 6.1 for example."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39502`: 如果 :func:`time.localtime` 因 :exc:`OverflowError` "
"失败，则跳过test_zipfile.test_add_file_after_2107()。例如在AIX 6.1上就是这种情况。"

#: ../NEWS:32213
msgid ":issue:`39489`: Remove ``COUNT_ALLOCS`` special build."
msgstr ":issue:`39489`: 移除 ``COUNT_ALLOCS`` 特殊构建。"

#: ../NEWS:32218
msgid ":issue:`39553`: Delete unused code related to SxS manifests."
msgstr ":issue:`39553`: 删除与SxS清单相关的未使用代码。"

#: ../NEWS:32220
msgid ""
":issue:`39439`: Honor the Python path when a virtualenv is active on "
"Windows."
msgstr ":issue:`39439`: 在Windows上激活virtualenv时，尊重Python路径。"

#: ../NEWS:32222
msgid ""
":issue:`39393`: Improve the error message when attempting to load a DLL with"
" unresolved dependencies."
msgstr ":issue:`39393`: 改进尝试加载具有未解决依赖项的DLL时的错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:32225
msgid ""
":issue:`38883`: :meth:`~pathlib.Path.home` and "
":meth:`~pathlib.Path.expanduser` on Windows now prefer :envvar:`USERPROFILE`"
" and no longer use :envvar:`HOME`, which is not normally set for regular "
"user accounts. This makes them again behave like :func:`os.path.expanduser`,"
" which was changed to ignore :envvar:`HOME` in 3.8, see :issue:`36264`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38883`: :meth:`~pathlib.Path.home` 和 "
":meth:`~pathlib.Path.expanduser` 在Windows上现在更倾向于使用 "
":envvar:`USERPROFILE`，不再使用 :envvar:`HOME`，因为普通用户账户通常不设置后者。这使得它们再次表现得像 "
":func:`os.path.expanduser`，后者在3.8版本中被改为忽略 :envvar:`HOME`，参见 :issue:`36264`。"

#: ../NEWS:32231
msgid ""
":issue:`39185`: The build.bat script has additional options for very-quiet "
"output (-q) and very-verbose output (-vv)"
msgstr ":issue:`39185`: build.bat脚本新增了非常安静的输出选项(-q)和非常详细的输出选项(-vv)。"

#: ../NEWS:32237
msgid ":issue:`39663`: Add tests for pyparse find_good_parse_start()."
msgstr ":issue:`39663`: 为pyparse的find_good_parse_start()添加测试。"

#: ../NEWS:32239
msgid ""
":issue:`39600`: In the font configuration window, remove duplicated font "
"names."
msgstr ":issue:`39600`: 在字体配置窗口中，移除重复的字体名称。"

#: ../NEWS:32241
msgid ""
":issue:`30780`: Add remaining configdialog tests for buttons and highlights "
"and keys tabs."
msgstr ":issue:`30780`: 为按钮、高亮和键标签页添加剩余的配置对话框测试。"

#: ../NEWS:32244
msgid ""
":issue:`39388`: IDLE Settings Cancel button now cancels pending changes"
msgstr ":issue:`39388`: IDLE设置的取消按钮现在会取消待处理的更改。"

#: ../NEWS:32246
msgid ""
":issue:`38792`: Close an IDLE shell calltip if a :exc:`KeyboardInterrupt` or"
" shell restart occurs.  Patch by Zackery Spytz."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38792`: 如果发生 :exc:`KeyboardInterrupt` 或shell重启，关闭IDLE "
"shell的调用提示。由Zackery Spytz提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32252
msgid ""
":issue:`35081`: Move the ``bytes_methods.h`` header file to the internal C "
"API as ``pycore_bytes_methods.h``: it only contains private symbols "
"(prefixed by ``_Py``), except of the ``PyDoc_STRVAR_shared()`` macro."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35081`: 将 ``bytes_methods.h`` 头文件移动到内部C API中，更名为 "
"``pycore_bytes_methods.h``：它仅包含私有符号（前缀为 ``_Py``），除了 "
"``PyDoc_STRVAR_shared()`` 宏。"

#: ../NEWS:32256
msgid ""
":issue:`35081`: Move the ``dtoa.h`` header file to the internal C API as "
"``pycore_dtoa.h``: it only contains private functions (prefixed by ``_Py``)."
" The :mod:`math` and :mod:`cmath` modules must now be compiled with the "
"``Py_BUILD_CORE`` macro defined."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35081`: 将 ``dtoa.h`` 头文件移动到内部C API中，更名为 "
"``pycore_dtoa.h``：它仅包含私有函数（前缀为 ``_Py``）。现在编译 :mod:`math` 和 :mod:`cmath` "
"模块时必须定义 ``Py_BUILD_CORE`` 宏。"

#: ../NEWS:32261
msgid ""
":issue:`39573`: Add :c:func:`Py_SET_SIZE` function to set the size of an "
"object."
msgstr ":issue:`39573`: 添加 :c:func:`Py_SET_SIZE` 函数以设置对象的大小。"

#: ../NEWS:32264
msgid ""
":issue:`39500`: :c:func:`PyUnicode_IsIdentifier` does not call "
":c:func:`Py_FatalError` anymore if the string is not ready."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39500`: :c:func:`PyUnicode_IsIdentifier` 不再在字符串未准备好时调用 "
":c:func:`Py_FatalError`。"

#: ../NEWS:32267
msgid ""
":issue:`39573`: Add :c:func:`Py_SET_TYPE` function to set the type of an "
"object."
msgstr ":issue:`39573`: 添加 :c:func:`Py_SET_TYPE` 函数以设置对象的类型。"

#: ../NEWS:32270
msgid ""
":issue:`39573`: Add a :c:func:`Py_SET_REFCNT` function to set the reference "
"counter of an object."
msgstr ":issue:`39573`: 添加 :c:func:`Py_SET_REFCNT` 函数以设置对象的引用计数器。"

#: ../NEWS:32273
msgid ""
":issue:`39542`: Convert :c:func:`PyType_HasFeature`, :c:func:`PyType_Check` "
"and :c:func:`PyType_CheckExact` macros to static inline functions."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39542`: 将 :c:func:`PyType_HasFeature`、:c:func:`PyType_Check` 和 "
":c:func:`PyType_CheckExact` 宏转换为静态内联函数。"

#: ../NEWS:32276
msgid ""
":issue:`39542`: In the limited C API, ``PyObject_INIT()`` and "
"``PyObject_INIT_VAR()`` are now defined as aliases to "
":c:func:`PyObject_Init` and :c:func:`PyObject_InitVar` to make their "
"implementation opaque. It avoids to leak implementation details in the "
"limited C API. Exclude the following functions from the limited C API: "
"``_Py_NewReference()``, ``_Py_ForgetReference()``, "
"``_PyTraceMalloc_NewReference()`` and ``_Py_GetRefTotal()``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39542`: 在受限 C API 中，``PyObject_INIT()`` 和 ``PyObject_INIT_VAR()`` "
"现在被定义为 :c:func:`PyObject_Init` 和 :c:func:`PyObject_InitVar` "
"的别名，以使它们的实现变得不透明。这避免了在受限 C API 中泄露实现细节。将以下函数从受限 C API "
"中排除：``_Py_NewReference()``、``_Py_ForgetReference()``、``_PyTraceMalloc_NewReference()``"
" 和 ``_Py_GetRefTotal()``。"

#: ../NEWS:32284
msgid ""
":issue:`39542`: Exclude trashcan mechanism from the limited C API: it "
"requires access to PyTypeObject and PyThreadState structure fields, whereas "
"these structures are opaque in the limited C API."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39542`: 将垃圾回收机制从受限 C API 中排除：它需要访问 PyTypeObject 和 PyThreadState "
"结构体字段，而这些结构在受限 C API 中是不透明的。"

#: ../NEWS:32288
msgid ""
":issue:`39511`: The :c:func:`PyThreadState_Clear` function now calls the "
":c:member:`PyThreadState.on_delete` callback. Previously, that happened in "
":c:func:`PyThreadState_Delete`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39511`: :c:func:`PyThreadState_Clear` 函数现在会调用 "
":c:member:`PyThreadState.on_delete` 回调。在此之前，这是在 "
":c:func:`PyThreadState_Delete` 中进行的。"

#: ../NEWS:32292
msgid ""
":issue:`38076`: Fix to clear the interpreter state only after clearing "
"module globals to guarantee module state access from C Extensions during "
"runtime destruction"
msgstr ":issue:`38076`: 修复了仅在清除模块全局变量后清除解释器状态的问题，以保证在运行时销毁期间从 C 扩展访问模块状态。"

#: ../NEWS:32296
msgid ""
":issue:`39245`: The Vectorcall API (PEP 590) was made public, adding the "
"functions ``PyObject_Vectorcall``, ``PyObject_VectorcallMethod``, "
"``PyVectorcall_Function``, ``PyObject_CallOneArg``, "
"``PyObject_CallMethodNoArgs``, ``PyObject_CallMethodOneArg``, "
"``PyObject_FastCallDict``, and the flag ``Py_TPFLAGS_HAVE_VECTORCALL``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39245`: Vectorcall API (PEP 590) 被公开，增加了函数 "
"``PyObject_Vectorcall``、``PyObject_VectorcallMethod``、``PyVectorcall_Function``、``PyObject_CallOneArg``、``PyObject_CallMethodNoArgs``、``PyObject_CallMethodOneArg``、``PyObject_FastCallDict``，以及标志"
" ``Py_TPFLAGS_HAVE_VECTORCALL``。"

#: ../NEWS:32304
msgid "Python 3.9.0 alpha 3"
msgstr "Python 3.9.0 alpha 3"

#: ../NEWS:32306
msgid "*Release date: 2020-01-24*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2020-01-24*"

#: ../NEWS:32311
msgid ""
":issue:`39427`: Document all possibilities for the ``-X`` options in the "
"command line help section. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":issue:`39427`: 在命令行帮助部分记录了 ``-X`` 选项的所有可能性。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32314
msgid ""
":issue:`39421`: Fix possible crashes when operating with the functions in "
"the :mod:`heapq` module and custom comparison operators."
msgstr ":issue:`39421`: 修复了在使用 :mod:`heapq` 模块中的函数和自定义比较运算符时可能出现的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:32317
msgid ":issue:`39386`: Prevent double awaiting of async iterator."
msgstr ":issue:`39386`: 防止异步迭代器的双重等待。"

#: ../NEWS:32319
msgid ""
":issue:`17005`: Add :class:`functools.TopologicalSorter` to the "
":mod:`functools` module to offers functionality to perform topological "
"sorting of graphs. Patch by Pablo Galindo, Tim Peters and Larry Hastings."
msgstr ""
":issue:`17005`: 向 :mod:`functools` 模块添加 "
":class:`functools.TopologicalSorter`，以提供执行图拓扑排序的功能。由 Pablo Galindo、Tim "
"Peters 和 Larry Hastings 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32323
msgid ""
":issue:`39320`: Replace four complex bytecodes for building sequences with "
"three simpler ones."
msgstr ":issue:`39320`: 用三个更简单的字节码替换四个用于构建序列的复杂字节码。"

#: ../NEWS:32326
msgid "The following four bytecodes have been removed:"
msgstr "以下四个字节码已被移除："

#: ../NEWS:32328
msgid "BUILD_LIST_UNPACK"
msgstr "BUILD_LIST_UNPACK"

#: ../NEWS:32329
msgid "BUILD_TUPLE_UNPACK"
msgstr "BUILD_TUPLE_UNPACK"

#: ../NEWS:32330
msgid "BUILD_SET_UNPACK"
msgstr "BUILD_SET_UNPACK"

#: ../NEWS:32331
msgid "BUILD_TUPLE_UNPACK_WITH_CALL"
msgstr "BUILD_TUPLE_UNPACK_WITH_CALL"

#: ../NEWS:32333
msgid "The following three bytecodes have been added:"
msgstr "新增了以下三个字节码："

#: ../NEWS:32335
msgid "LIST_TO_TUPLE"
msgstr "LIST_TO_TUPLE"

#: ../NEWS:32336
msgid "LIST_EXTEND"
msgstr "LIST_EXTEND"

#: ../NEWS:32337
msgid "SET_UPDATE"
msgstr "SET_UPDATE"

#: ../NEWS:32339
msgid ""
":issue:`39336`: Import loaders which publish immutable module objects can "
"now publish immutable packages in addition to individual modules."
msgstr ":issue:`39336`: 发布不可变模块对象的导入加载器现在除了可以发布单个模块外，还可以发布不可变包。"

#: ../NEWS:32342
msgid ""
":issue:`39322`: Added a new function :func:`gc.is_finalized` to check if an "
"object has been finalized by the garbage collector. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39322`: 新增了一个函数 :func:`gc.is_finalized` 用于检查对象是否已被垃圾收集器终结。由Pablo "
"Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32346
msgid ""
":issue:`39048`: Improve the displayed error message when incorrect types are"
" passed to ``async with`` statements by looking up the :meth:`__aenter__` "
"special method before the :meth:`__aexit__` special method when entering an "
"asynchronous context manager. Patch by Géry Ogam."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39048`: 通过查找 :meth:`__aenter__` 特殊方法在 :meth:`__aexit__` "
"特殊方法之前进入异步上下文管理器时，改进了当传递错误类型给 ``async with`` 语句时显示的错误消息。由Géry Ogam提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32351
msgid ""
":issue:`39235`: Fix AST end location for lone generator expression in "
"function call, e.g. f(i for i in a)."
msgstr ":issue:`39235`: 修复了函数调用中单独生成器表达式的AST结束位置，例如 f(i for i in a)。"

#: ../NEWS:32354
msgid ""
":issue:`39209`: Correctly handle multi-line tokens in interactive mode. "
"Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":issue:`39209`: 正确处理交互模式下的多行令牌。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32357
msgid ""
":issue:`1635741`: Port _json extension module to multiphase initialization "
"(:pep:`489`)."
msgstr ":issue:`1635741`: 将_json扩展模块移植到多阶段初始化（:pep:`489`）。"

#: ../NEWS:32360
msgid ""
":issue:`39216`: Fix constant folding optimization for positional only "
"arguments - by Anthony Sottile."
msgstr ":issue:`39216`: 修复了仅位置参数的常量折叠优化 - 由Anthony Sottile提供。"

#: ../NEWS:32363
msgid ""
":issue:`39215`: Fix ``SystemError`` when nested function has annotation on "
"positional-only argument - by Anthony Sottile."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39215`: 修复了当嵌套函数在仅位置参数上有注释时引发的 ``SystemError`` - 由Anthony Sottile提供。"

#: ../NEWS:32366
msgid ""
":issue:`39200`: Correct the error message when calling the :func:`min` or "
":func:`max` with no arguments. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39200`: 修正了在没有参数的情况下调用 :func:`min` 或 :func:`max` 时的错误消息。补丁由Donghee "
"Na提供。"

#: ../NEWS:32369
msgid ""
":issue:`39200`: Correct the error message when trying to construct "
":class:`range` objects with no arguments. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39200`: 修正了尝试在没有参数的情况下构造 :class:`range` 对象时的错误消息。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32372
msgid ""
":issue:`39166`: Fix incorrect line execution reporting in trace functions "
"when tracing the last iteration of asynchronous for loops. Patch by Pablo "
"Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39166`: 修复了在跟踪异步for循环的最后一次迭代时，跟踪函数中错误的行执行报告。补丁由Pablo Galindo提供。"

#: ../NEWS:32376
msgid ""
":issue:`39114`: Fix incorrect line execution reporting in trace functions "
"when tracing exception handlers with name binding. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39114`: 修复了在跟踪带有名称绑定的异常处理程序时，跟踪函数中错误的行执行报告。补丁由Pablo Galindo提供。"

#: ../NEWS:32379
msgid ""
":issue:`39156`: Split the COMPARE_OP bytecode instruction into four distinct"
" instructions."
msgstr ":issue:`39156`: 将COMPARE_OP字节码指令拆分成四个不同的指令。"

#: ../NEWS:32382
msgid "COMPARE_OP for rich comparisons"
msgstr "用于富比较的COMPARE_OP"

#: ../NEWS:32383
msgid "IS_OP for 'is' and 'is not' tests"
msgstr "用于'is'和'is not'测试的IS_OP"

#: ../NEWS:32384
msgid "CONTAINS_OP for 'in' and 'is not' tests"
msgstr "用于'in'和'is not'测试的CONTAINS_OP"

#: ../NEWS:32385
msgid ""
"JUMP_IF_NOT_EXC_MATCH for checking exceptions in 'try-except' statements."
msgstr "JUMP_IF_NOT_EXC_MATCH 用于在 'try-except' 语句中检查异常。"

#: ../NEWS:32387
msgid ""
"This improves the clarity of the interpreter and should provide a modest "
"speedup."
msgstr "这提高了解释器的清晰度，并应提供适度的加速。"

#: ../NEWS:32390
msgid ""
":issue:`38588`: Fix possible crashes in dict and list when calling "
":c:func:`PyObject_RichCompareBool`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38588`: 修复了在调用 :c:func:`PyObject_RichCompareBool` 时 dict 和 list "
"可能崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:32393
msgid ""
":issue:`13601`: By default, ``sys.stderr`` is line-buffered now, even if "
"``stderr`` is redirected to a file. You can still make ``sys.stderr`` "
"unbuffered by passing the :option:`-u` command-line option or setting the "
":envvar:`PYTHONUNBUFFERED` environment variable."
msgstr ""
":issue:`13601`: 默认情况下，``sys.stderr`` 现在是行缓冲的，即使 ``stderr`` 被重定向到文件。你仍然可以通过传递"
" :option:`-u` 命令行选项或设置 :envvar:`PYTHONUNBUFFERED` 环境变量来使 ``sys.stderr`` 无缓冲。"

#: ../NEWS:32398
msgid "(Contributed by Jendrik Seipp in :issue:`13601`.)"
msgstr "(由 Jendrik Seipp 在 :issue:`13601` 中贡献。)"

#: ../NEWS:32400
msgid ""
":issue:`38610`: Fix possible crashes in several list methods by holding "
"strong references to list elements when calling "
":c:func:`PyObject_RichCompareBool`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38610`: 通过在调用 :c:func:`PyObject_RichCompareBool` "
"时保持对列表元素的强引用，修复了几个列表方法可能崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:32404
msgid ":issue:`32021`: Include brotli .br encoding in mimetypes encodings_map"
msgstr ":issue:`32021`: 在 mimetypes encodings_map 中包括 brotli .br 编码。"

#: ../NEWS:32409
msgid ""
":issue:`39430`: Fixed race condition in lazy imports in :mod:`tarfile`."
msgstr ":issue:`39430`: 修复了 :mod:`tarfile` 中懒加载导入的竞态条件。"

#: ../NEWS:32411
msgid ""
":issue:`39413`: The :func:`os.unsetenv` function is now also available on "
"Windows."
msgstr ":issue:`39413`: :func:`os.unsetenv` 函数现在在 Windows 上也可用。"

#: ../NEWS:32414
msgid ""
":issue:`39390`: Fixed a regression with the ``ignore`` callback of "
":func:`shutil.copytree`. The argument types are now ``str`` and "
"``List[str]`` again."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39390`: 修复了 :func:`shutil.copytree` 的 ``ignore`` 回调的一个回归问题。参数类型现在再次为"
" ``str`` 和 ``List[str]``。"

#: ../NEWS:32418
msgid ""
":issue:`39395`: The :func:`os.putenv` and :func:`os.unsetenv` functions are "
"now always available."
msgstr ":issue:`39395`: :func:`os.putenv` 和 :func:`os.unsetenv` 函数现在总是可用。"

#: ../NEWS:32421
msgid ""
":issue:`39406`: If ``setenv()`` C function is available, :func:`os.putenv` "
"is now implemented with ``setenv()`` instead of ``putenv()``, so Python "
"doesn't have to handle the environment variable memory."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39406`: 如果 ``setenv()`` C 函数可用，:func:`os.putenv` 现在用 ``setenv()`` "
"而不是 ``putenv()`` 实现，因此 Python 不必处理环境变量内存。"

#: ../NEWS:32425
msgid ":issue:`39396`: Fix ``math.nextafter(-0.0, +0.0)`` on AIX 7.1."
msgstr ":issue:`39396`: 在 AIX 7.1 上修复 ``math.nextafter(-0.0, +0.0)``。"

#: ../NEWS:32427
msgid ""
":issue:`29435`: Allow :func:`tarfile.is_tarfile` to be used with file and "
"file-like objects, like :func:`zipfile.is_zipfile`. Patch by William "
"Woodruff."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29435`: 允许 :func:`tarfile.is_tarfile` 与文件和类文件对象一起使用，就像 "
":func:`zipfile.is_zipfile` 一样。由 William Woodruff 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32431
msgid ""
":issue:`39377`: Removed ``encoding`` option from :func:`json.loads`.  It has"
" been deprecated since Python 3.1."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39377`: 从 :func:`json.loads` 中移除了 ``encoding`` 选项。自 Python 3.1 "
"起已被弃用。"

#: ../NEWS:32434
msgid ""
":issue:`39389`: Write accurate compression level metadata in :mod:`gzip` "
"archives, rather than always signaling maximum compression."
msgstr ":issue:`39389`: 在 :mod:`gzip` 存档中写入准确的压缩级别元数据，而不是总是信号最大压缩。"

#: ../NEWS:32437
msgid ""
":issue:`39366`: The previously deprecated ``xpath()`` and ``xgtitle()`` "
"methods of :class:`!nntplib.NNTP` have been removed."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39366`: 之前弃用的 :class:`!nntplib.NNTP` 的 ``xpath()`` 和 ``xgtitle()`` "
"方法已被移除。"

#: ../NEWS:32440
msgid ""
":issue:`39357`: Remove the *buffering* parameter of :class:`bz2.BZ2File`. "
"Since Python 3.0, it was ignored and using it was emitting "
":exc:`DeprecationWarning`. Pass an open file object, to control how the file"
" is opened. The *compresslevel* parameter becomes keyword-only."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39357`: 移除 :class:`bz2.BZ2File` 的 *buffering* 参数。自 Python 3.0 "
"起，该参数被忽略，使用它会发出 "
":exc:`DeprecationWarning`。传递一个已打开的文件对象以控制文件的打开方式。*compresslevel* 参数变为仅关键字参数。"

#: ../NEWS:32445
msgid ""
":issue:`39353`: Deprecate binhex4 and hexbin4 standards. Deprecate the "
":mod:`binhex` module and the following :mod:`binascii` functions: "
":func:`~binascii.b2a_hqx`, :func:`~binascii.a2b_hqx`, "
":func:`~binascii.rlecode_hqx`, :func:`~binascii.rledecode_hqx`, "
":func:`~binascii.crc_hqx`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39353`: 弃用 binhex4 和 hexbin4 标准。弃用 :mod:`binhex` 模块以及以下 "
":mod:`binascii` "
"函数：:func:`~binascii.b2a_hqx`、:func:`~binascii.a2b_hqx`、:func:`~binascii.rlecode_hqx`、:func:`~binascii.rledecode_hqx`、:func:`~binascii.crc_hqx`。"

#: ../NEWS:32451
msgid ""
":issue:`39351`: Remove ``base64.encodestring()`` and "
"``base64.decodestring()``, aliases deprecated since Python 3.1: use "
":func:`base64.encodebytes` and :func:`base64.decodebytes` instead."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39351`: 移除 ``base64.encodestring()`` 和 "
"``base64.decodestring()``，这两个别名自 Python 3.1 起已被弃用：改用 "
":func:`base64.encodebytes` 和 :func:`base64.decodebytes`。"

#: ../NEWS:32455
msgid ""
":issue:`39350`: Remove ``fractions.gcd()`` function, deprecated since Python"
" 3.5 (:issue:`22486`): use :func:`math.gcd` instead."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39350`: 移除 ``fractions.gcd()`` 函数，该函数自 Python 3.5 起已被弃用 "
"(:issue:`22486`)：改用 :func:`math.gcd`。"

#: ../NEWS:32458
msgid ""
":issue:`39329`: :class:`~smtplib.LMTP` constructor now has an optional "
"*timeout* parameter. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39329`: :class:`~smtplib.LMTP` 构造函数现在有一个可选的 *timeout* 参数。由 Donghee "
"Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32461
msgid ""
":issue:`39313`: Add a new ``exec_function`` option (*--exec-function* in the"
" CLI) to ``RefactoringTool`` for making ``exec`` a function. Patch by "
"Batuhan Taskaya."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39313`: 为 ``RefactoringTool`` 添加一个新的 ``exec_function`` 选项（CLI 中的 "
"*--exec-function*）以使 ``exec`` 成为函数。由 Batuhan Taskaya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32465
msgid ""
":issue:`39259`: :class:`~ftplib.FTP_TLS` and :class:`~ftplib.FTP_TLS` now "
"raise a :class:`ValueError` if the given timeout for their constructor is "
"zero to prevent the creation of a non-blocking socket. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39259`: :class:`~ftplib.FTP_TLS` 和 :class:`~ftplib.FTP_TLS` "
"现在如果构造函数的给定超时为零，则会引发 :class:`ValueError`，以防止创建非阻塞套接字。由 Donghee Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32469
msgid ""
":issue:`39259`: :class:`~smtplib.SMTP` and :class:`~smtplib.SMTP_SSL` now "
"raise a :class:`ValueError` if the given timeout for their constructor is "
"zero to prevent the creation of a non-blocking socket. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39259`: :class:`~smtplib.SMTP` 和 :class:`~smtplib.SMTP_SSL` "
"现在如果构造函数的给定超时为零，则会引发 :class:`ValueError`，以防止创建非阻塞套接字。由 Donghee Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32473
msgid ""
":issue:`39310`: Add :func:`math.ulp`: return the value of the least "
"significant bit of a float."
msgstr ":issue:`39310`: 添加 :func:`math.ulp`：返回一个浮点数的最低有效位的值。"

#: ../NEWS:32476
msgid ""
":issue:`39297`: Improved performance of importlib.metadata distribution "
"discovery and resilients to inaccessible sys.path entries "
"(importlib_metadata v1.4.0)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39297`: 提高了 importlib.metadata 分发发现的性能以及对无法访问的 sys.path "
"条目的恢复能力（importlib_metadata v1.4.0）。"

#: ../NEWS:32480
msgid ""
":issue:`39259`: :class:`!NNTP` and :class:`!NNTP_SSL` now raise a "
":class:`ValueError` if the given timeout for their constructor is zero to "
"prevent the creation of a non-blocking socket. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39259`: 现在，如果给 :class:`!NNTP` 和 :class:`!NNTP_SSL` "
"的构造函数的超时时间为零，它们会抛出一个 :class:`ValueError`，以防止创建非阻塞套接字。由Donghee Na提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32484
msgid ""
":issue:`38901`: When you specify prompt='.' or equivalently python -m venv "
"--prompt . ... the basename of the current directory is used to set the "
"created venv's prompt when it's activated."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38901`: 当您指定prompt='.'或等效地使用python -m venv --prompt . "
"...时，当前目录的basename将被用来设置创建的venv在激活时的提示符。"

#: ../NEWS:32488
msgid ""
":issue:`39288`: Add :func:`math.nextafter`: return the next floating-point "
"value after *x* towards *y*."
msgstr ":issue:`39288`: 添加 :func:`math.nextafter`: 返回 *x* 向 *y* 方向的下一个浮点数值。"

#: ../NEWS:32491
msgid ""
":issue:`39259`: :class:`~poplib.POP3` and :class:`~poplib.POP3_SSL` now "
"raise a :class:`ValueError` if the given timeout for their constructor is "
"zero to prevent the creation of a non-blocking socket. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39259`: 现在，如果给 :class:`~poplib.POP3` 和 :class:`~poplib.POP3_SSL` "
"的构造函数的超时时间为零，它们会抛出一个 :class:`ValueError`，以防止创建非阻塞套接字。补丁由Donghee Na提供。"

#: ../NEWS:32495
