msgstr ""
":issue:`38473`: 对通过 :func:`unittest.mock.attach_mock` 附加的自动指定方法使用内部模拟的签名。由 "
"Karthikeyan Singaravelan 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32585
msgid ""
":issue:`38361`: Fixed an issue where ``ident`` could include a leading path "
"separator when :func:`syslog.openlog` was called without arguments."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38361`: 修复了一个问题，即在没有参数调用 :func:`syslog.openlog` 时，``ident`` "
"可能包含前导路径分隔符。"

#: ../NEWS:32588
msgid ""
":issue:`38293`: Add :func:`copy.copy` and :func:`copy.deepcopy` support to "
":func:`property` objects."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38293`: 向 :func:`property` 对象添加 :func:`copy.copy` 和 "
