#: ../NEWS:32639
msgid ""
":issue:`39372`: Clean header files of interfaces defined but with no "
"implementation. The public API symbols being removed are: "
"``_PyBytes_InsertThousandsGroupingLocale``, "
"``_PyBytes_InsertThousandsGrouping``, ``_Py_InitializeFromArgs``, "
"``_Py_InitializeFromWideArgs``, ``_PyFloat_Repr``, ``_PyFloat_Digits``, "
"``_PyFloat_DigitsInit``, ``PyFrame_ExtendStack``, ``_PyAIterWrapper_Type``, "
"``PyNullImporter_Type``, ``PyCmpWrapper_Type``, ``PySortWrapper_Type``, "
"``PyNoArgsFunction``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39372`: "
"清理定义了但未实现的接口的头文件。被移除的公共API符号有：``_PyBytes_InsertThousandsGroupingLocale``、``_PyBytes_InsertThousandsGrouping``、``_Py_InitializeFromArgs``、``_Py_InitializeFromWideArgs``、``_PyFloat_Repr``、``_PyFloat_Digits``、``_PyFloat_DigitsInit``、``PyFrame_ExtendStack``、``_PyAIterWrapper_Type``、``PyNullImporter_Type``、``PyCmpWrapper_Type``、``PySortWrapper_Type``、``PyNoArgsFunction``。"

#: ../NEWS:32648
msgid ""
":issue:`39164`: Add a private ``_PyErr_GetExcInfo()`` function to retrieve "
"exception information of the specified Python thread state."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39164`: 添加一个私有的 ``_PyErr_GetExcInfo()`` 函数来检索指定Python线程状态的异常信息。"

#: ../NEWS:32653
msgid "Python 3.9.0 alpha 2"
msgstr "Python 3.9.0 alpha 2"

#: ../NEWS:32655
msgid "*Release date: 2019-12-18*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2019-12-18*"

#: ../NEWS:32660
msgid ""
":issue:`38945`: Newline characters have been escaped when performing uu "
"encoding to prevent them from overflowing into to content section of the "
"encoded file. This prevents malicious or accidental modification of data "
"during the decoding process."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38945`: "
"为了防止换行符溢出到编码文件的内容部分，在进行uu编码时已对换行符进行了转义。这可以防止在解码过程中数据被恶意或意外修改。"

#: ../NEWS:32665
msgid ""
":issue:`37228`: Due to significant security concerns, the *reuse_address* "
"parameter of :meth:`asyncio.loop.create_datagram_endpoint` is no longer "
"supported. This is because of the behavior of ``SO_REUSEADDR`` in UDP. For "
"more details, see the documentation for ``loop.create_datagram_endpoint()``."
" (Contributed by Kyle Stanley, Antoine Pitrou, and Yury Selivanov in "
":issue:`37228`.)"
msgstr ""
":issue:`37228`: 由于重大的安全问题，:meth:`asyncio.loop.create_datagram_endpoint` 的 "
"*reuse_address* 参数不再被支持。这是因为UDP中 ``SO_REUSEADDR`` 的行为。更多详情，请参见 "
"``loop.create_datagram_endpoint()`` 的文档。（由Kyle Stanley、Antoine Pitrou和Yury "
"Selivanov在 :issue:`37228` 中贡献。）"

#: ../NEWS:32672
msgid ""
":issue:`38804`: Fixes a ReDoS vulnerability in :mod:`http.cookiejar`. Patch "
"by Ben Caller."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38804`: 修复了 :mod:`http.cookiejar` 中的一个ReDoS漏洞。由Ben Caller提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32678
msgid ""
":issue:`39028`: Slightly improve the speed of keyword argument parsing with "
"many kwargs by strengthening the assumption that kwargs are interned "
"strings."
msgstr ":issue:`39028`: 通过加强kwargs是interned字符串的假设，略微提高了在有许多kwargs时关键字参数解析的速度。"

#: ../NEWS:32682
msgid ""
":issue:`39080`: Fix the value of *end_col_offset* for Starred Expression AST"
" nodes when they are among the elements in the *args* attribute of Call AST "
"nodes."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39080`: 当Starred Expression AST节点位于Call AST节点的 *args* 属性中的元素之间时，修复了 "
"*end_col_offset* 的值。"

#: ../NEWS:32686
msgid ""
":issue:`39031`: When parsing an \"elif\" node, lineno and col_offset of the "
"node now point to the \"elif\" keyword and not to its condition, making it "
"consistent with the \"if\" node. Patch by Lysandros Nikolaou."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39031`: "
"当解析一个\"elif\"节点时，节点的lineno和col_offset现在指向\"elif\"关键字而不是其条件，使其与\"if\"节点保持一致。由Lysandros"
" Nikolaou提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32690
msgid ""
":issue:`20443`: In Python 3.9.0a1, sys.argv[0] was made an absolute path if "
"a filename was specified on the command line. Revert this change, since most"
" users expect sys.argv to be unmodified."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20443`: 在Python "
"3.9.0a1中，如果在命令行中指定了文件名，sys.argv[0]会被设置为绝对路径。撤销这一更改，因为大多数用户期望sys.argv保持不变。"

#: ../NEWS:32694
msgid ""
":issue:`39008`: :c:func:`PySys_Audit` now requires ``Py_ssize_t`` to be used"
" for size arguments in the format string, regardless of whether "
"``PY_SSIZE_T_CLEAN`` was defined at include time."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39008`: :c:func:`PySys_Audit` 现在要求在格式字符串中使用 ``Py_ssize_t`` "
"作为大小参数，不管在包含时是否定义了 ``PY_SSIZE_T_CLEAN``。"

#: ../NEWS:32698
msgid ""
":issue:`38673`: In REPL mode, don't switch to PS2 if the line starts with "
"comment or whitespace. Based on work by Batuhan Taşkaya."
msgstr ":issue:`38673`: 在REPL模式下，如果行以注释或空白开始，不切换到PS2。基于Batuhan Taşkaya的工作。"

#: ../NEWS:32701
msgid ""
":issue:`38922`: Calling ``replace`` on a code object now raises the "
"``code.__new__`` audit event."
msgstr ":issue:`38922`: 现在在代码对象上调用 ``replace`` 会引发 ``code.__new__`` 审计事件。"

#: ../NEWS:32704
msgid ""
":issue:`38920`: Add audit hooks for when :func:`sys.excepthook` and "
":func:`sys.unraisablehook` are invoked."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38920`: 添加了当 :func:`sys.excepthook` 和 :func:`sys.unraisablehook` "
"被调用时的审计钩子。"

#: ../NEWS:32707
msgid ""
":issue:`38892`: Improve documentation for audit events table and functions."
msgstr ":issue:`38892`: 改进审计事件表格和函数的文档。"

#: ../NEWS:32709
msgid ""
":issue:`38852`: Set the thread stack size to 8 Mb for debug builds on "
"android platforms."
msgstr ":issue:`38852`: 在安卓平台的调试版本中将线程堆栈大小设置为8 Mb。"

#: ../NEWS:32712
msgid ""
":issue:`38858`: Each Python subinterpreter now has its own \"small integer "
"singletons\": numbers in [-5; 257] range. It is no longer possible to change"
" the number of small integers at build time by overriding ``NSMALLNEGINTS`` "
"and ``NSMALLPOSINTS`` macros: macros should now be modified manually in "
"``pycore_pystate.h`` header file."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38858`: 每个Python子解释器现在都有自己的“小整数单例”：范围在[-5; 257]的数字。现在不再可能通过在构建时覆盖 "
"``NSMALLNEGINTS`` 和 ``NSMALLPOSINTS`` 宏来更改小整数的数量：宏现在应该在 ``pycore_pystate.h``"
" 头文件中手动修改。"

#: ../NEWS:32718
msgid ""
":issue:`36854`: The garbage collector state becomes per interpreter "
"(``PyInterpreterState.gc``), rather than being global "
"(``_PyRuntimeState.gc``)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36854`: "
"垃圾收集器状态变为每个解释器（``PyInterpreterState.gc``），而不是全局的（``_PyRuntimeState.gc``）。"

#: ../NEWS:32722
msgid ""
":issue:`38835`: The ``PyFPE_START_PROTECT()`` and ``PyFPE_END_PROTECT()`` "
"macros are empty: they have been doing nothing for the last year, so stop "
"using them."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38835`: ``PyFPE_START_PROTECT()`` 和 ``PyFPE_END_PROTECT()`` "
"宏为空：它们在过去一年中什么也没做，因此停止使用它们。"

#: ../NEWS:32726
msgid ""
":issue:`38328`: Sped up the creation time of constant :class:`list` and "
":class:`set` displays. Patch by Brandt Bucher."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38328`: 加速了常量 :class:`list` 和 :class:`set` 显示的创建时间。由Brandt "
"Bucher提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32729
msgid ""
":issue:`38707`: ``MainThread.native_id`` is now correctly reset in child "
"processes spawned using :class:`multiprocessing.Process`, instead of "
"retaining the parent's value."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38707`: ``MainThread.native_id`` 现在在使用 "
":class:`multiprocessing.Process` 生成的子进程中被正确重置，而不是保留父进程的值。"

#: ../NEWS:32733
msgid ""
":issue:`38629`: Added ``__floor__`` and ``__ceil__`` methods to float "
"object. Patch by Batuhan Taşkaya."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38629`: 向float对象添加了 ``__floor__`` 和 ``__ceil__`` 方法。由Batuhan "
"Taşkaya提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32736
msgid ""
":issue:`27145`: int + int and int - int operators can now return small "
"integer singletons. Patch by hongweipeng."
msgstr ":issue:`27145`: int + int和int - int操作符现在可以返回小整数单例。由hongweipeng提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32739
msgid ""
":issue:`38021`: Provide a platform tag for AIX that is sufficient for PEP425"
" binary distribution identification. Patch by Michael Felt."
msgstr ":issue:`38021`: 为AIX提供一个足以用于PEP425二进制分发识别的平台标签。由Michael Felt提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32742
msgid ""
":issue:`35409`: Ignore GeneratorExit exceptions when throwing an exception "
"into the aclose coroutine of an asynchronous generator."
msgstr ":issue:`35409`: 在向异步生成器的aclose协程抛出异常时忽略GeneratorExit异常。"

#: ../NEWS:32745
msgid ""
":issue:`33387`: Removed WITH_CLEANUP_START, WITH_CLEANUP_FINISH, "
"BEGIN_FINALLY, END_FINALLY, CALL_FINALLY and POP_FINALLY bytecodes. Replaced"
" with RERAISE and WITH_EXCEPT_START bytecodes. The compiler now generates "
"different code for exceptional and non-exceptional branches for 'with' and "
"'try-except' statements. For 'try-finally' statements the 'finally' block is"
" replicated for each exit from the 'try' body."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33387`: "
"移除了WITH_CLEANUP_START、WITH_CLEANUP_FINISH、BEGIN_FINALLY、END_FINALLY、CALL_FINALLY和POP_FINALLY字节码。替换为RERAISE和WITH_EXCEPT_START字节码。编译器现在为'with'和'try-"
"except'语句的异常和非异常分支生成不同的代码。对于'try-finally'语句，'finally'块为'try'主体的每次退出复制。"

#: ../NEWS:32755
msgid ""
":issue:`39033`: Fix :exc:`NameError` in :mod:`zipimport`. Patch by "
"Karthikeyan Singaravelan."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39033`: 修复 :mod:`zipimport` 中的 :exc:`NameError`。由Karthikeyan "
"Singaravelan提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32758
msgid ""
":issue:`39022`: Update importlib.metadata to include improvements from "
"importlib_metadata 1.3 including better serialization of EntryPoints and "
"improved documentation for custom finders."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39022`: 更新importlib.metadata以包含来自importlib_metadata "
"1.3的改进，包括EntryPoints的更好的序列化和自定义查找器的改进文档。"

#: ../NEWS:32762
msgid ""
":issue:`39006`: Fix asyncio when the ssl module is missing: only check for "
"ssl.SSLSocket instance if the ssl module is available."
msgstr ":issue:`39006`: 修复当ssl模块缺失时的asyncio问题：仅在ssl模块可用时检查ssl.SSLSocket实例。"

#: ../NEWS:32765
msgid ""
":issue:`38708`: Fix a potential IndexError in email parser when parsing an "
"empty msg-id."
msgstr ":issue:`38708`: 修复电子邮件解析器在解析空msg-id时可能出现的IndexError。"

#: ../NEWS:32768
msgid ""
":issue:`38698`: Add a new ``InvalidMessageID`` token to email parser to "
"represent invalid Message-ID headers.  Also, add defects when there is "
"remaining value after parsing the header."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38698`: 向电子邮件解析器添加一个新的 ``InvalidMessageID`` 标记，以表示无效的Message-"
"ID头。此外，在解析头之后还有剩余值时添加缺陷。"

#: ../NEWS:32772
msgid ""
":issue:`38994`: Implement ``__class_getitem__`` for ``os.PathLike``, "
"``pathlib.Path``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38994`: 为 ``os.PathLike``、``pathlib.Path`` 实现 ``__class_getitem__``。"

#: ../NEWS:32775
msgid ""
":issue:`38979`: Return class from ``ContextVar.__class_getitem__`` to "
"simplify subclassing."
msgstr ":issue:`38979`: 从 ``ContextVar.__class_getitem__`` 返回类以简化子类化。"

#: ../NEWS:32778
msgid ""
":issue:`38978`: Implement ``__class_getitem__`` on asyncio objects (Future, "
"Task, Queue). Patch by Batuhan Taskaya."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38978`: 在asyncio对象（Future, Task, Queue）上实现 "
"``__class_getitem__``。由Batuhan Taskaya提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32781
msgid ""
":issue:`38916`: :class:`array.array`: Remove ``tostring()`` and "
"``fromstring()`` methods. They were aliases to ``tobytes()`` and "
"``frombytes()``, deprecated since Python 3.2."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38916`: :class:`array.array`: 移除 ``tostring()`` 和 ``fromstring()`` "
"方法。它们是``tobytes()``和 ``frombytes()`` 的别名，自Python 3.2起已弃用。"

#: ../NEWS:32785
msgid ""
":issue:`38986`: Make repr of C accelerated TaskWakeupMethWrapper the same as"
" of pure Python version."
msgstr ":issue:`38986`: 使C加速的TaskWakeupMethWrapper的repr与纯Python版本的相同。"

#: ../NEWS:32788
msgid ""
":issue:`38982`: Fix asyncio ``PidfdChildWatcher``: handle ``waitpid()`` "
"error. If ``waitpid()`` is called elsewhere, ``waitpid()`` call fails with "
":exc:`ChildProcessError`: use return code 255 in this case, and log a "
"warning. It ensures that the pidfd file descriptor is closed if this error "
"occurs."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38982`: 修复asyncio ``PidfdChildWatcher``：处理 ``waitpid()`` "
"错误。如果在其他地方调用 ``waitpid()``，``waitpid()`` 调用会失败并抛出 "
":exc:`ChildProcessError`：在这种情况下使用返回码255，并记录一个警告。这确保了如果此错误发生，pidfd文件描述符会被关闭。"

#: ../NEWS:32794
msgid ""
":issue:`38529`: Drop too noisy asyncio warning about deletion of a stream "
"without explicit ``.close()`` call."
msgstr ":issue:`38529`: 取消关于未显式调用 ``.close()`` 删除流的过于嘈杂的asyncio警告。"

#: ../NEWS:32797
msgid ""
":issue:`27413`: Added ability to pass through ``ensure_ascii`` options to "
"json.dumps in the ``json.tool`` command-line interface."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27413`: 增加了在 ``json.tool`` 命令行界面中将 ``ensure_ascii`` "
"选项传递给json.dumps的能力。"

#: ../NEWS:32800
msgid ""
":issue:`38634`: The :mod:`readline` module now detects if Python is linked "
"to libedit at runtime on all platforms.  Previously, the check was only done"
" on macOS."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38634`: :mod:`readline` "
"模块现在在所有平台上运行时检测Python是否链接到libedit。以前，此检查仅在macOS上进行。"

#: ../NEWS:32804
msgid ""
":issue:`33684`: Fix ``json.tool`` failed to read a JSON file with non-ASCII "
"characters when locale encoding is not UTF-8."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33684`: 修复当区域编码不是UTF-8时，``json.tool`` 无法读取包含非ASCII字符的JSON文件的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:32807
msgid ""
":issue:`38698`: Prevent UnboundLocalError to pop up in parse_message_id."
msgstr ":issue:`38698`: 防止在parse_message_id中出现UnboundLocalError。"

#: ../NEWS:32809
msgid ""
"parse_message_id() was improperly using a token defined inside an exception "
"handler, which was raising ``UnboundLocalError`` on parsing an invalid "
"value. Patch by Claudiu Popa."
msgstr ""
"parse_message_id() 不适当地使用了在异常处理程序中定义的令牌，这会在解析无效值时引发 "
"``UnboundLocalError``。由Claudiu Popa提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32813
msgid ""
":issue:`38927`: Use ``python -m pip`` instead of ``pip`` to upgrade "
"dependencies in venv."
msgstr ":issue:`38927`: 在venv中使用 ``python -m pip`` 而不是 ``pip`` 来升级依赖。"

#: ../NEWS:32816
msgid ""
":issue:`26730`: Fix ``SpooledTemporaryFile.rollover()`` might corrupt the "
"file when it is in text mode. Patch by Serhiy Storchaka."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26730`: 修复 ``SpooledTemporaryFile.rollover()`` "
"在文本模式下可能会损坏文件的问题。由Serhiy Storchaka提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32819
msgid ""
":issue:`38881`: random.choices() now raises a ValueError when all the "
"weights are zero."
msgstr ":issue:`38881`: 当所有权重为零时，random.choices() 现在会引发 ValueError。"

#: ../NEWS:32822
msgid ""
":issue:`38876`: Raise pickle.UnpicklingError when loading an item from memo "
"for invalid input."
msgstr ":issue:`38876`: 当从memo加载无效输入的项时，引发pickle.UnpicklingError。"

#: ../NEWS:32825
msgid ""
"The previous code was raising a ``KeyError`` for both the Python and C "
"implementation. This was caused by the specified index of an invalid input "
"which did not exist in the memo structure, where the pickle stores what "
"objects it has seen. The malformed input would have caused either a "
"``BINGET`` or ``LONG_BINGET`` load from the memo, leading to a ``KeyError`` "
"as the determined index was bogus. Patch by Claudiu Popa."
msgstr ""
"之前的代码在Python和C实现中都引发了 "
"``KeyError``。这是由于指定的无效输入索引在memo结构中不存在，而pickle在此结构中存储了它所见过的对象。格式错误的输入会导致从memo中进行"
" ``BINGET`` 或 ``LONG_BINGET`` 加载，由于确定的索引是伪造的，因此会引发 ``KeyError``。由Claudiu "
"Popa提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32832
msgid ""
":issue:`38688`: Calling func:``shutil.copytree`` to copy a directory tree "
"from one directory to another subdirectory resulted in an endless loop and a"
" RecursionError. A fix was added to consume an iterator and create the list "
"of the entries to be copied, avoiding the recursion for newly created "
"directories. Patch by Bruno P. Kinoshita."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38688`: 调用函数 ``shutil.copytree`` "
"将目录树从一个目录复制到另一个子目录会导致无限循环和RecursionError。添加了一个修复，消耗迭代器并创建要复制的条目列表，避免对新创建的目录进行递归。由Bruno"
" P. Kinoshita提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32838
msgid ""
":issue:`38863`: Improve :func:`is_cgi` function in :mod:`http.server`, which"
" enables processing the case that cgi directory is a child of another "
"directory other than root."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38863`: 改进 :mod:`http.server` 中的 :func:`is_cgi` "
"函数，使其能够处理cgi目录是除根目录外的另一个目录的子目录的情况。"

#: ../NEWS:32842
msgid ""
":issue:`37838`: :meth:`typing.get_type_hints` properly handles functions "
"decorated with :meth:`functools.wraps`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37838`: :meth:`typing.get_type_hints` 正确处理了用 :meth:`functools.wraps`"
" 装饰的函数。"

#: ../NEWS:32845
msgid ""
":issue:`38870`: Expose :func:`ast.unparse` as a function of the :mod:`ast` "
"module that can be used to unparse an :class:`ast.AST` object and produce a "
"string with code that would produce an equivalent :class:`ast.AST` object "
"when parsed. Patch by Pablo Galindo and Batuhan Taskaya."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38870`: 将 :func:`ast.unparse` 作为 :mod:`ast` 模块的一个函数公开，可用于反解析一个 "
":class:`ast.AST` 对象，并生成一个字符串，该字符串在被解析时会生成一个等效的 :class:`ast.AST` 对象。由 Pablo "
"Galindo 和 Batuhan Taskaya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32850
msgid ""
":issue:`38859`: AsyncMock now returns StopAsyncIteration on the exhaustion "
"of a side_effects iterable. Since PEP-479 its Impossible to raise a "
"StopIteration exception from a coroutine."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38859`: AsyncMock 现在在 side_effects 可迭代对象耗尽时返回 StopAsyncIteration。由于 "
"PEP-479，从协程中引发 StopIteration 异常是不可能的。"

#: ../NEWS:32854
msgid ""
":issue:`38857`: AsyncMock fix for return values that are awaitable types.  "
"This also covers side_effect iterable values that happened to be awaitable, "
"and wraps callables that return an awaitable type. Before these awaitables "
"were being awaited instead of being returned as is."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38857`: AsyncMock 修复了返回值为可等待类型的问题。这还包括了那些恰好是可等待的 side_effect "
"可迭代值，并包装了返回可等待类型的可调用对象。在此之前，这些可等待对象是被等待而不是原样返回。"

#: ../NEWS:32859
msgid ""
":issue:`38834`: :class:`typing.TypedDict` subclasses now track which keys "
"are optional using the ``__required_keys__`` and ``__optional_keys__`` "
"attributes, to enable runtime validation by downstream projects.  Patch by "
"Zac Hatfield-Dodds."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38834`: :class:`typing.TypedDict` 子类现在使用 ``__required_keys__`` 和 "
"``__optional_keys__`` 属性来跟踪哪些键是可选的，以便下游项目进行运行时验证。由 Zac Hatfield-Dodds 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32864
msgid ""
":issue:`38821`: Fix unhandled exceptions in :mod:`argparse` when "
"internationalizing error messages for arguments with ``nargs`` set to "
"special (non-integer) values. Patch by Federico Bond."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38821`: 修复了 :mod:`argparse` 在国际化错误消息时对于 ``nargs`` "
"设置为特殊（非整数）值的参数未处理的异常。由 Federico Bond 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32868
msgid ""
":issue:`38820`: Make Python compatible with OpenSSL 3.0.0. "
":func:`ssl.SSLSocket.getpeercert` no longer returns IPv6 addresses with a "
"trailing new line."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38820`: 使 Python 与 OpenSSL 3.0.0 "
"兼容。:func:`ssl.SSLSocket.getpeercert` 不再返回带有尾随换行符的 IPv6 地址。"

#: ../NEWS:32872
msgid ""
":issue:`38811`: Fix an unhandled exception in :mod:`pathlib` when "
":meth:`os.link` is missing. Patch by Toke Høiland-Jørgensen."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38811`: 修复了 :mod:`pathlib` 在 :meth:`os.link` 缺失时的未处理异常。由 Toke "
"Høiland-Jørgensen 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32875
msgid ""
":issue:`38686`: Added support for multiple ``qop`` values in "
":class:`urllib.request.AbstractDigestAuthHandler`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38686`: 在 :class:`urllib.request.AbstractDigestAuthHandler` 中添加了对多个 "
"``qop`` 值的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:32878
msgid ""
":issue:`38712`: Add the Linux-specific :func:`signal.pidfd_send_signal` "
"function, which allows sending a signal to a process identified by a file "
"descriptor rather than a pid."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38712`: 添加了 Linux 特有的 :func:`signal.pidfd_send_signal` "
"函数，该函数允许向由文件描述符而非 pid 标识的进程发送信号。"

#: ../NEWS:32882
msgid ""
":issue:`38348`: Add ``-i`` and ``--indent`` (indentation level), and ``--no-"
"type-comments`` (type comments) command line options to ast parsing tool."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38348`: 向 ast 解析工具添加了 ``-i`` 和 ``--indent`` (缩进级别) 以及 ``--no-type-"
"comments`` (类型注释) 命令行选项。"

#: ../NEWS:32886
msgid ""
":issue:`37523`: Change :class:`zipfile.ZipExtFile` to raise ``ValueError`` "
"when trying to access the underlying file object after it has been closed. "
"This new behavior is consistent with how accessing closed files is handled "
"in other parts of Python."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37523`: 修改 :class:`zipfile.ZipExtFile` 在尝试访问已关闭的底层文件对象时抛出 "
"``ValueError``。这一新行为与 Python 其他部分处理访问已关闭文件的方式保持一致。"

#: ../NEWS:32891
msgid ""
":issue:`38045`: Improve the performance of :func:`enum._decompose` in "
":mod:`enum`. Patch by hongweipeng."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38045`: 提高 :mod:`enum` 中 :func:`enum._decompose` 的性能。由 hongweipeng "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32894
msgid ""
":issue:`36820`: Break cycle generated when saving an exception in socket.py,"
" codeop.py and dyld.py as they keep alive not only the exception but user "
"objects through the ``__traceback__`` attribute. Patch by Mario Corchero."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36820`: 在 socket.py、codeop.py 和 dyld.py 中保存异常时生成的循环被打破，因为它们不仅通过 "
"``__traceback__`` 属性保持异常活跃，还保持了用户对象。由 Mario Corchero 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32898
msgid ""
":issue:`36406`: Handle namespace packages in :mod:`doctest`. Patch by "
"Karthikeyan Singaravelan."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36406`: 在 :mod:`doctest` 中处理命名空间包。由 Karthikeyan Singaravelan 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32901
msgid ""
":issue:`34776`: Fix dataclasses to support forward references in type "
"annotations"
msgstr ":issue:`34776`: 修复数据类以支持类型注解中的前向引用。"

#: ../NEWS:32904
msgid ""
":issue:`20928`: ElementTree supports recursive XInclude processing.  Patch "
"by Stefan Behnel."
msgstr ":issue:`20928`: ElementTree 支持递归 XInclude 处理。由 Stefan Behnel 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32907
msgid ""
":issue:`29636`: Add whitespace options for formatting JSON with the "
"``json.tool`` CLI. The following mutually exclusive options are now "
"supported: ``--indent`` for setting the indent level in spaces; ``--tab`` "
"for indenting with tabs; ``--no-indent`` for suppressing newlines; and "
"``--compact`` for suppressing all whitespace. The default behavior remains "
"the same as ``--indent=4``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29636`: 为 ``json.tool`` CLI 添加格式化 JSON 的空格选项。现在支持以下互斥选项：``--indent``"
" 用于设置空格缩进级别；``--tab`` 用于使用制表符缩进；``--no-indent`` 用于抑制换行；``--compact`` "
"用于抑制所有空格。默认行为仍与 ``--indent=4`` 相同。"

#: ../NEWS:32917
msgid ""
":issue:`38928`: Correct when venv's ``upgrade_dependencies()`` and "
"``--upgrade-deps`` are added."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38928`: 更正 venv 的 ``upgrade_dependencies()`` 和 ``--upgrade-deps`` "
"的添加时机。"

#: ../NEWS:32920
msgid ""
":issue:`38899`: Update documentation to state that to activate virtual "
"environments under fish one should use ``source``, not ``.`` as documented "
"at https://fishshell.com/docs/current/cmds/source.html."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38899`: 更新文档，说明在 fish 下激活虚拟环境应使用 ``source``，而非 ``.``，如 "
"https://fishshell.com/docs/current/cmds/source.html 所述。"

#: ../NEWS:32924
msgid ""
":issue:`22377`: Improves documentation of the values that "
":meth:`datetime.datetime.strptime` accepts for ``%Z``. Patch by Karl Dubost."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22377`: 改进 :meth:`datetime.datetime.strptime` 接受的 ``%Z`` 值的文档。由 Karl"
" Dubost 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32931
msgid ""
":issue:`38546`: Fix test_ressources_gced_in_workers() of "
"test_concurrent_futures: explicitly stop the manager to prevent leaking a "
"child process running in the background after the test completes."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38546`: 修复 test_concurrent_futures 的 "
"test_ressources_gced_in_workers()：显式停止管理器以防止测试完成后泄漏在后台运行的子进程。"

#: ../NEWS:32935
msgid ""
":issue:`38546`: Multiprocessing and concurrent.futures tests now stop the "
"resource tracker process when tests complete."
msgstr ":issue:`38546`: 多处理和 concurrent.futures 测试现在在测试完成时停止资源跟踪器进程。"

#: ../NEWS:32938
msgid ""
":issue:`38614`: Replace hardcoded timeout constants in tests with new "
":mod:`test.support` constants: :data:`~test.support.LOOPBACK_TIMEOUT`, "
":data:`~test.support.INTERNET_TIMEOUT`, :data:`~test.support.SHORT_TIMEOUT` "
"and :data:`~test.support.LONG_TIMEOUT`. It becomes easier to adjust these "
"four timeout constants for all tests at once, rather than having to adjust "
"every single test file."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38614`: 在测试中用新的 :mod:`test.support` "
"常量替换硬编码的超时常量：:data:`~test.support.LOOPBACK_TIMEOUT`、:data:`~test.support.INTERNET_TIMEOUT`、:data:`~test.support.SHORT_TIMEOUT`"
" 和 :data:`~test.support.LONG_TIMEOUT`。这样更容易一次性为所有测试调整这四个超时常量，而不必调整每一个测试文件。"

#: ../NEWS:32946
msgid ""
":issue:`38547`: Fix test_pty: if the process is the session leader, closing "
"the master file descriptor raises a SIGHUP signal: simply ignore SIGHUP when"
" running the tests."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38547`: 修复 test_pty：如果进程是会话领导者，关闭主文件描述符会引发 SIGHUP 信号：在运行测试时简单地忽略 "
"SIGHUP。"

#: ../NEWS:32950
msgid ""
":issue:`38992`: Fix a test for :func:`math.fsum` that was failing due to "
"constant folding."
msgstr ":issue:`38992`: 修复一个因常数折叠而失败的 :func:`math.fsum` 测试。"

#: ../NEWS:32953
msgid ""
":issue:`38991`: :mod:`test.support`: "
":func:`~test.support.run_python_until_end`, "
":func:`~test.support.assert_python_ok` and "
":func:`~test.support.assert_python_failure` functions no longer strip "
"whitespaces from stderr. Remove ``test.support.strip_python_stderr()`` "
"function."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38991`: "
":mod:`test.support`：:func:`~test.support.run_python_until_end`、:func:`~test.support.assert_python_ok`"
" 和 :func:`~test.support.assert_python_failure` 函数不再从 stderr 中去除空格。移除 "
"``test.support.strip_python_stderr()`` 函数。"

#: ../NEWS:32960
msgid ""
":issue:`38965`: Fix test_faulthandler on GCC 10. Use the \"volatile\" "
"keyword in ``faulthandler._stack_overflow()`` to prevent tail call "
"optimization on any compiler, rather than relying on compiler specific "
"pragma."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38965`: 在 GCC 10 上修复 test_faulthandler。在 "
"``faulthandler._stack_overflow()`` 中使用 \"volatile\" "
"关键字来防止在任何编译器上进行尾调用优化，而不是依赖于编译器特定的编译指示。"

#: ../NEWS:32964
msgid ""
":issue:`38875`: test_capi: trashcan tests now require the test \"cpu\" "
"resource."
msgstr ":issue:`38875`: test_capi：垃圾回收测试现在需要测试 \"cpu\" 资源。"

#: ../NEWS:32966
msgid ""
":issue:`38841`: Skip asyncio "
"test_create_datagram_endpoint_existing_sock_unix on platforms lacking a "
"functional bind() for named unix domain sockets."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38841`: 在缺乏对命名 Unix 域套接字有功能 bind() 的平台上跳过 asyncio "
"test_create_datagram_endpoint_existing_sock_unix。"

#: ../NEWS:32969
msgid ""
":issue:`38692`: Skip the test_posix.test_pidfd_open() test if "
"``os.pidfd_open()`` fails with a :exc:`PermissionError`. This situation can "
"happen in a Linux sandbox using a syscall whitelist which doesn't allow the "
"``pidfd_open()`` syscall yet."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38692`: 如果 ``os.pidfd_open()`` 因为 :exc:`PermissionError` 失败，则跳过 "
"test_posix.test_pidfd_open() 测试。这种情况可能发生在使用系统调用白名单但不允许 ``pidfd_open()`` "
"系统调用的 Linux 沙箱中。"

#: ../NEWS:32974
msgid ""
":issue:`38839`: Fix some unused functions in tests. Patch by Adam Johnson."
msgstr ":issue:`38839`: 修复测试中一些未使用的函数。由 Adam Johnson 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32976
msgid ""
":issue:`38669`: Raise :exc:`TypeError` when passing target as a string with "
":meth:`unittest.mock.patch.object`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38669`: 当用字符串传递目标时，:meth:`unittest.mock.patch.object` 抛出 "
":exc:`TypeError`。"

#: ../NEWS:32979
msgid ""
":issue:`37957`: test.regrtest now can receive a list of test patterns to "
"ignore (using the -i/--ignore argument) or a file with a list of patterns to"
" ignore (using the --ignore-file argument). Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37957`: test.regrtest 现在可以接收一个要忽略的测试模式列表（使用 -i/--ignore "
"参数）或一个包含要忽略模式列表的文件（使用 --ignore-file 参数）。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32986
msgid ""
":issue:`37404`: :mod:`asyncio` now raises :exc:`TypeError` when calling "
"incompatible methods with an :class:`ssl.SSLSocket` socket.  Patch by Ido "
"Michael."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37404`: :mod:`asyncio` 现在在调用与 :class:`ssl.SSLSocket` 套接字不兼容的方法时会引发 "
":exc:`TypeError`。由 Ido Michael 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:32990
msgid ""
":issue:`36500`: Added an optional \"regen\" project to the Visual Studio "
"solution that will regenerate all grammar, tokens, and opcodes."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36500`: 在 Visual Studio 解决方案中添加了一个可选的 \"regen\" "
"项目，该项目将重新生成所有语法、标记和操作码。"

#: ../NEWS:32996
msgid ":issue:`39007`: Add auditing events to functions in :mod:`winreg`."
msgstr ":issue:`39007`: 向 :mod:`winreg` 中的函数添加审计事件。"

#: ../NEWS:32998
msgid ""
":issue:`33125`: Add support for building and releasing Windows ARM64 "
"packages."
msgstr ":issue:`33125`: 添加对构建和发布 Windows ARM64 包的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:33003
msgid ""
":issue:`37931`: Fixed a crash on OSX dynamic builds that occurred when re-"
"initializing the posix module after a Py_Finalize if the environment had "
"changed since the previous ``import posix``. Patch by Benoît Hudson."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37931`: 修复了 OSX 动态构建中的一个崩溃问题，该问题发生在 Py_Finalize 后重新初始化 posix "
"模块时，如果环境自上次 ``import posix`` 以来发生了变化。补丁由 Benoît Hudson 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:33010
msgid ""
":issue:`38944`: Escape key now closes IDLE completion windows.  Patch by "
"Johnny Najera."
msgstr ":issue:`38944`: 现在按 Escape 键可以关闭 IDLE 的补全窗口。由 Johnny Najera 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33013
msgid ""
":issue:`38943`: Fix IDLE autocomplete windows not always appearing on some "
"systems. Patch by Johnny Najera."
msgstr ":issue:`38943`: 修复了在某些系统上 IDLE 自动补全窗口不总是出现的问题。由 Johnny Najera 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33016
msgid ""
":issue:`38862`: 'Strip Trailing Whitespace' on the Format menu removes extra"
" newlines at the end of non-shell files."
msgstr ":issue:`38862`: 格式菜单上的 '去除尾部空白' 现在会去除非 shell 文件末尾的额外换行符。"

#: ../NEWS:33019
msgid ""
":issue:`38636`: Fix IDLE Format menu tab toggle and file indent width. These"
" functions (default shortcuts Alt-T and Alt-U) were mistakenly disabled in "
"3.7.5 and 3.8.0."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38636`: 修复 IDLE 格式菜单的标签切换和文件缩进宽度。这些功能（默认快捷键 Alt-T 和 Alt-U）在 3.7.5 和 "
"3.8.0 中被错误地禁用。"

#: ../NEWS:33026
msgid ""
":issue:`38896`: Remove ``PyUnicode_ClearFreeList()`` function: the Unicode "
"free list has been removed in Python 3.3."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38896`: 移除 ``PyUnicode_ClearFreeList()`` 函数：Unicode 空闲列表已在 Python "
"3.3 中移除。"

#: ../NEWS:33029
msgid ""
":issue:`37340`: Remove ``PyMethod_ClearFreeList()`` and "
"``PyCFunction_ClearFreeList()`` functions: the free lists of bound method "
"objects have been removed."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37340`: 移除 ``PyMethod_ClearFreeList()`` 和 "
"``PyCFunction_ClearFreeList()`` 函数：绑定方法对象的空闲列表已被移除。"

#: ../NEWS:33033
msgid ""
":issue:`38835`: Exclude ``PyFPE_START_PROTECT()`` and "
"``PyFPE_END_PROTECT()`` macros of ``pyfpe.h`` from ``Py_LIMITED_API`` "
"(stable API)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38835`: 从 ``Py_LIMITED_API`` (稳定 API) 中排除 ``pyfpe.h`` 的 "
"``PyFPE_START_PROTECT()`` 和 ``PyFPE_END_PROTECT()`` 宏。"

#: ../NEWS:33038
msgid "Python 3.9.0 alpha 1"
msgstr "Python 3.9.0 alpha 1"

#: ../NEWS:33040
msgid "*Release date: 2019-11-19*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2019-11-19*"

#: ../NEWS:33045
msgid ""
":issue:`38722`: :mod:`runpy` now uses :meth:`io.open_code` to open code "
"files. Patch by Jason Killen."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38722`: :mod:`runpy` 现在使用 :meth:`io.open_code` 来打开代码文件。由 Jason "
"Killen 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33048
msgid ""
":issue:`38622`: Add additional audit events for the :mod:`ctypes` module."
msgstr ":issue:`38622`: 为 :mod:`ctypes` 模块添加额外的审计事件。"

#: ../NEWS:33050
msgid ""
":issue:`38418`: Fixes audit event for :func:`os.system` to be named "
"``os.system``."
msgstr ":issue:`38418`: 修复 :func:`os.system` 的审计事件名称为 ``os.system``。"

#: ../NEWS:33053
msgid ""
":issue:`38243`: Escape the server title of "
":class:`xmlrpc.server.DocXMLRPCServer` when rendering the document page as "
"HTML. (Contributed by Donghee Na in :issue:`38243`.)"
msgstr ""
":issue:`38243`: 在将文档页面渲染为 HTML 时，对 :class:`xmlrpc.server.DocXMLRPCServer` "
"的服务器标题进行转义。（由 Donghee Na 在 :issue:`38243` 中贡献。）"

#: ../NEWS:33057
msgid ""
":issue:`38174`: Update vendorized expat library version to 2.2.8, which "
"resolves :cve:`2019-15903`."
msgstr ":issue:`38174`: 将供应商化的 expat 库版本更新至 2.2.8，解决了 :cve:`2019-15903`。"

#: ../NEWS:33060
msgid ""
":issue:`37764`: Fixes email._header_value_parser.get_unstructured going into"
" an infinite loop for a specific case in which the email header does not "
"have trailing whitespace, and the case in which it contains an invalid "
"encoded word. Patch by Ashwin Ramaswami."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37764`: 修复了 email._header_value_parser.get_unstructured "
"在特定情况下进入无限循环的问题，这些情况包括电子邮件头部没有尾随空白，以及包含无效编码字的情况。由 Ashwin Ramaswami 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33065
msgid ""
":issue:`37461`: Fix an infinite loop when parsing specially crafted email "
"headers. Patch by Abhilash Raj."
msgstr ":issue:`37461`: 修复解析特别构造的电子邮件头部时出现的无限循环问题。补丁由 Abhilash Raj 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:33068
msgid ""
":issue:`37363`: Adds audit events for the range of supported run commands "
"(see :ref:`using-on-general`)."
msgstr ":issue:`37363`: 为一系列支持的运行命令添加审计事件（参见 :ref:`using-on-general`）。"

#: ../NEWS:33071
msgid ""
":issue:`37463`: ssl.match_hostname() no longer accepts IPv4 addresses with "
"additional text after the address and only quad-dotted notation without "
"trailing whitespaces. Some inet_aton() implementations ignore whitespace and"
" all data after whitespace, e.g. '127.0.0.1 whatever'."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37463`: ssl.match_hostname() 不再接受 IPv4 "
"地址后面附加额外文本，且仅接受不带尾随空格的四点表示法。某些 inet_aton() 实现会忽略空格及空格后的所有数据，例如 '127.0.0.1 "
"whatever'。"

#: ../NEWS:33076
msgid ""
":issue:`37363`: Adds audit events for :mod:`ensurepip`, :mod:`ftplib`, "
":mod:`glob`, :mod:`imaplib`, :mod:`!nntplib`, :mod:`pdb`, :mod:`poplib`, "
":mod:`shutil`, :mod:`smtplib`, :mod:`sqlite3`, :mod:`subprocess`, "
":mod:`!telnetlib`, :mod:`tempfile` and :mod:`webbrowser`, as well as "
":func:`os.listdir`, :func:`os.scandir` and :func:`breakpoint`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37363`: 为 "
":mod:`ensurepip`、:mod:`ftplib`、:mod:`glob`、:mod:`imaplib`、:mod:`!nntplib`、:mod:`pdb`、:mod:`poplib`、:mod:`shutil`、:mod:`smtplib`、:mod:`sqlite3`、:mod:`subprocess`、:mod:`!telnetlib`、:mod:`tempfile`"
" 和 :mod:`webbrowser`，以及 :func:`os.listdir`、:func:`os.scandir` 和 "
":func:`breakpoint` 添加审计事件。"

#: ../NEWS:33082
msgid ""
":issue:`37364`: :func:`io.open_code` is now used when reading :file:`.pth` "
"files."
msgstr ":issue:`37364`: 现在在读取 :file:`.pth` 文件时使用 :func:`io.open_code`。"

#: ../NEWS:33085
msgid ":issue:`34631`: Updated OpenSSL to 1.1.1c in Windows installer"
msgstr ":issue:`34631`: 在 Windows 安装程序中更新 OpenSSL 至 1.1.1c。"

#: ../NEWS:33087
msgid ""
":issue:`34155`: Fix parsing of invalid email addresses with more than one "
"``@`` (e.g. a@b@c.com.) to not return the part before 2nd ``@`` as valid "
"email address. Patch by maxking & jpic."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34155`: 修复解析包含多个 ``@`` 的无效电子邮件地址（例如 a@b@c.com）时的问题，确保不会将第二个 ``@`` "
"之前的部分作为有效电子邮件地址返回。由 maxking 和 jpic 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33094
msgid ""
":issue:`38631`: Replace ``Py_FatalError()`` call with a regular "
":exc:`RuntimeError` exception in :meth:`float.__getformat__`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38631`: 在 :meth:`float.__getformat__` 中将 ``Py_FatalError()`` "
"调用替换为常规的 :exc:`RuntimeError` 异常。"

#: ../NEWS:33097
msgid ""
":issue:`38639`: Optimized :func:`math.floor`, :func:`math.ceil` and "
":func:`math.trunc` for floats."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38639`: 对 :func:`math.floor`、:func:`math.ceil` 和 :func:`math.trunc` "
"针对浮点数进行了优化。"

#: ../NEWS:33100
msgid ""
":issue:`38640`: Fixed a bug in the compiler that was causing to raise in the"
" presence of break statements and continue statements inside always false "
"while loops. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38640`: "
"修复了编译器中的一个bug，该bug在总是为假的while循环中存在break语句和continue语句时会引发错误。由Pablo "
"Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33104
msgid ""
":issue:`38613`: Optimized some set operations (e.g. ``|``, ``^``, and ``-``)"
" of ``dict_keys``. ``d.keys() | other`` was slower than ``set(d) | other`` "
"but they are almost same performance for now."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38613`: 优化了 ``dict_keys`` 的一些集合操作（例如 ``|``、``^``、和 ``-``）。``d.keys()"
" | other``之前比 ``set(d) | other`` 慢，但现在它们的性能几乎相同。"

#: ../NEWS:33108
msgid ""
":issue:`28029`: ``\"\".replace(\"\", s, n)`` now returns ``s`` instead of an"
" empty string for all non-zero ``n``.  There are similar changes for "
":class:`bytes` and :class:`bytearray` objects."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28029`: ``\"\".replace(\"\", s, n)``现在对于所有非零 ``n`` 返回 ``s`` "
"而不是空字符串。:class:`bytes` 和 :class:`bytearray` 对象也有类似的更改。"

#: ../NEWS:33112
msgid ""
":issue:`38535`: Fixed line numbers and column offsets for AST nodes for "
"calls without arguments in decorators."
msgstr ":issue:`38535`: 修复了装饰器中无参数调用的AST节点的行号和列偏移。"

#: ../NEWS:33115
msgid ""
":issue:`38525`: Fix a segmentation fault when using reverse iterators of "
"empty ``dict`` objects. Patch by Donghee Na and Inada Naoki."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38525`: 修复了在使用空 ``dict`` 对象的反向迭代器时出现的段错误。由Donghee Na和Inada "
"Naoki提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33118
msgid ""
":issue:`38465`: :class:`bytearray`, :class:`~array.array` and "
":class:`~mmap.mmap` objects allow now to export more than ``2**31`` buffers "
"at a time."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38465`: :class:`bytearray`、:class:`~array.array` 和 "
":class:`~mmap.mmap` 对象现在允许一次导出超过 ``2**31`` 个缓冲区。"

#: ../NEWS:33122
msgid ""
":issue:`38469`: Fixed a bug where the scope of named expressions was not "
"being resolved correctly in the presence of the *global* keyword. Patch by "
"Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38469`: 修复了一个bug，即在存在 *global* 关键字时，命名表达式的作用域未被正确解析。由Pablo "
"Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33126
msgid ""
":issue:`38437`: Activate the ``GC_DEBUG`` macro for debug builds of the "
"interpreter (when ``Py_DEBUG`` is set). Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38437`: 为解释器的调试版本（当设置 ``Py_DEBUG`` 时）激活 ``GC_DEBUG`` 宏。由Pablo "
"Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33129
msgid ""
":issue:`38379`: When the garbage collector makes a collection in which some "
"objects resurrect (they are reachable from outside the isolated cycles after"
" the finalizers have been executed), do not block the collection of all "
"objects that are still unreachable. Patch by Pablo Galindo and Tim Peters."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38379`: "
"当垃圾回收器进行回收时，其中一些对象复活（在执行完终结器后可以从隔离的循环外部访问），不要阻止回收所有仍然无法访问的对象。由Pablo "
"Galindo和Tim Peters提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33135
msgid ""
":issue:`38379`: When cyclic garbage collection (gc) runs finalizers that "
"resurrect unreachable objects, the current gc run ends, without collecting "
"any cyclic trash.  However, the statistics reported by ``collect()`` and "
"``get_stats()`` claimed that all cyclic trash found was collected, and that "
"the resurrected objects were collected.   Changed the stats to report that "
"none were collected."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38379`: "
"当循环垃圾回收（gc）运行终结器使无法访问的对象复活时，当前的gc运行结束，不收集任何循环垃圾。然而，``collect()``和 "
"``get_stats()`` 报告的统计信息声称所有发现的循环垃圾都被回收了，并且复活的对象也被回收了。更改了统计信息以报告没有收集到任何对象。"

#: ../NEWS:33142
msgid ""
":issue:`38392`: In debug mode, :c:func:`PyObject_GC_Track` now calls "
"``tp_traverse()`` of the object type to ensure that the object is valid: "
"test that objects visited by ``tp_traverse()`` are valid."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38392`: 在调试模式下，:c:func:`PyObject_GC_Track` 现在会调用对象类型的 "
"``tp_traverse()`` 以确保对象有效：测试被 ``tp_traverse()`` 访问的对象是否有效。"

#: ../NEWS:33146
msgid ""
":issue:`38210`: Remove unnecessary intersection and update set operation in "
"dictview with empty set. (Contributed by Donghee Na in :issue:`38210`.)"
msgstr ""
":issue:`38210`: 移除字典视图与空集之间不必要的交集和更新集操作。（由 Donghee Na 在 :issue:`38210` 中贡献。）"

#: ../NEWS:33149
msgid ""
":issue:`38402`: Check the error from the system's underlying ``crypt`` or "
"``crypt_r``."
msgstr ":issue:`38402`: 检查系统底层 ``crypt`` 或 ``crypt_r`` 的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:33152
msgid ""
":issue:`37474`: On FreeBSD, Python no longer calls ``fedisableexcept()`` at "
"startup to control the floating-point control mode. The call became useless "
"since FreeBSD 6: it became the default mode."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37474`: 在 FreeBSD 上，Python 不再在启动时调用 ``fedisableexcept()`` "
"来控制浮点控制模式。自 FreeBSD 6 起，这个调用变得无用：它成为了默认模式。"

#: ../NEWS:33156
msgid ""
":issue:`38006`: Fix a bug due to the interaction of weakrefs and the cyclic "
"garbage collector. We must clear any weakrefs in garbage in order to prevent"
" their callbacks from executing and causing a crash."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38006`: 修复了一个由于弱引用和循环垃圾收集器交互导致的错误。我们必须清除垃圾中的任何弱引用，以防止它们的回调执行并导致崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:33160
msgid ""
":issue:`38317`: Fix warnings options priority: ``PyConfig.warnoptions`` has "
"the highest priority, as stated in the :pep:`587`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38317`: 修复警告选项的优先级：``PyConfig.warnoptions`` 拥有最高优先级，如 :pep:`587` 所述。"

#: ../NEWS:33163
msgid ""
":issue:`38310`: Predict ``BUILD_MAP_UNPACK_WITH_CALL`` -> "
"``CALL_FUNCTION_EX`` opcode pairs in the main interpreter loop. Patch by "
"Brandt Bucher."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38310`: 在主解释器循环中预测 ``BUILD_MAP_UNPACK_WITH_CALL`` -> "
"``CALL_FUNCTION_EX`` 操作码对。由 Brandt Bucher 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33166
msgid ""
":issue:`36871`: Improve error handling for the assert_has_calls and "
"assert_has_awaits methods of mocks. Fixed a bug where any errors encountered"
" while binding the expected calls to the mock's spec were silently "
"swallowed, leading to misleading error output."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36871`: 改进了对模拟的 assert_has_calls 和 assert_has_awaits "
"方法的错误处理。修复了一个错误，其中在将预期调用绑定到模拟的规范时遇到的任何错误都被静默吞噬，导致误导性的错误输出。"

#: ../NEWS:33171
msgid ""
":issue:`11410`: Better control over symbol visibility is provided through "
"use of the visibility attributes available in gcc >= 4.0, provided in a "
"uniform way across POSIX and Windows. The POSIX build files have been "
"updated to compile with -fvisibility=hidden, minimising exported symbols."
msgstr ""
":issue:`11410`: 通过使用 gcc >= 4.0 中可用的可见性属性，在 POSIX 和 Windows "
"上以统一的方式提供了更好的符号可见性控制。POSIX 构建文件已更新，以使用 -fvisibility=hidden 编译，最小化导出的符号。"

#: ../NEWS:33176
msgid ""
":issue:`38219`: Optimized the :class:`dict` constructor and the "
":meth:`~dict.update` method for the case when the argument is a dict."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38219`: 针对参数为字典的情况优化了 :class:`dict` 构造函数和 :meth:`~dict.update` 方法。"

#: ../NEWS:33179
msgid ""
":issue:`38236`: Python now dumps path configuration if it fails to import "
"the Python codecs of the filesystem and stdio encodings."
msgstr ":issue:`38236`: 如果 Python 无法导入文件系统和标准 IO 编码的 Python 编解码器，现在会转储路径配置。"

#: ../NEWS:33182
msgid ""
":issue:`38013`: Allow to call ``async_generator_athrow().throw(...)`` even "
"for non-started async generator helper. It fixes annoying warning at the end"
" of :func:`asyncio.run` call."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38013`: 允许为未启动的异步生成器助手调用 "
"``async_generator_athrow().throw(...)``。这修复了在 :func:`asyncio.run` "
"调用结束时出现的烦人警告。"

#: ../NEWS:33186
msgid ""
":issue:`38124`: Fix an off-by-one error in PyState_AddModule that could "
"cause out-of-bounds memory access."
msgstr ":issue:`38124`: 修复了 PyState_AddModule 中的一个差一错误，该错误可能导致内存越界访问。"

#: ../NEWS:33189
msgid ""
":issue:`38116`: The select module is now PEP-384 compliant and no longer has"
" static state"
msgstr ":issue:`38116`: select 模块现在符合 PEP-384 标准，不再有静态状态。"

#: ../NEWS:33192
msgid ":issue:`38113`: ast module updated to PEP-384 and all statics removed"
msgstr ":issue:`38113`: ast 模块已更新至 PEP-384 标准，所有静态内容已被移除。"

#: ../NEWS:33194
msgid ":issue:`38076`: The struct module is now PEP-384 compatible"
msgstr ":issue:`38076`: struct 模块现在兼容 PEP-384。"

#: ../NEWS:33196
msgid ":issue:`38075`: The random module is now PEP-384 compatible"
msgstr ":issue:`38075`: random 模块现在兼容 PEP-384。"

#: ../NEWS:33198
msgid ":issue:`38074`: zlib module made PEP-384 compatible"
msgstr ":issue:`38074`: zlib 模块已兼容 PEP-384。"

#: ../NEWS:33200
msgid ":issue:`38073`: Make pwd extension module PEP-384 compatible"
msgstr ":issue:`38073`: 使 pwd 扩展模块兼容 PEP-384。"

#: ../NEWS:33202
msgid ":issue:`38072`: grp module made PEP-384 compatible"
msgstr ":issue:`38072`: grp 模块已兼容 PEP-384。"

#: ../NEWS:33204
msgid ":issue:`38069`: Make _posixsubprocess PEP-384 compatible"
msgstr ":issue:`38069`: 使 _posixsubprocess 兼容 PEP-384。"

#: ../NEWS:33206
msgid ":issue:`38071`: Make termios extension module PEP-384 compatible"
msgstr ":issue:`38071`: 使 termios 扩展模块兼容 PEP-384。"

#: ../NEWS:33208
msgid ""
":issue:`38005`: Fixed comparing and creating of InterpreterID and ChannelID."
msgstr ":issue:`38005`: 修复了 InterpreterID 和 ChannelID 的比较和创建。"

#: ../NEWS:33210
msgid ""
":issue:`36946`: Fix possible signed integer overflow when handling slices. "
"Patch by hongweipeng."
msgstr ":issue:`36946`: 修复了处理切片时可能发生的有符号整数溢出。由 hongweipeng 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33213
msgid ""
":issue:`37994`: Fixed silencing arbitrary errors if an attribute lookup "
"fails in several sites. Only AttributeError should be silenced."
msgstr ":issue:`37994`: 修复了在多个站点中如果属性查找失败时静默任意错误的问题。只有 AttributeError 应该被静默。"

#: ../NEWS:33216
msgid ""
":issue:`8425`: Optimize set difference_update for the case when the other "
"set is much larger than the base set.  (Suggested by Evgeny Kapun with code "
"contributed by Michele Orrù)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`8425`: 优化了当另一个集合远大于基础集合时的集合 difference_update 操作。（由 Evgeny Kapun "
"建议，Michele Orrù 贡献代码）。"

#: ../NEWS:33220
msgid ""
":issue:`37966`: The implementation of :func:`~unicodedata.is_normalized` has"
" been greatly sped up on strings that aren't normalized, by implementing the"
" full normalization-quick-check algorithm from the Unicode standard."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37966`: :func:`~unicodedata.is_normalized` "
"的实现对于未规范化的字符串已经大大加速，这是通过实现 Unicode 标准中的完整规范化快速检查算法完成的。"

#: ../NEWS:33224
msgid ""
":issue:`37947`: Adjust correctly the recursion level in the symtable "
"generation for named expressions. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":issue:`37947`: 正确调整了命名表达式符号表生成中的递归级别。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33227
msgid ""
":issue:`37812`: The ``CHECK_SMALL_INT`` macro used inside "
":file:`Object/longobject.c` has been replaced with an explicit ``return`` at"
" each call site."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37812`: :file:`Object/longobject.c` 中使用的 ``CHECK_SMALL_INT`` "
"宏已被替换为在每个调用站点显式的 ``return``。"

#: ../NEWS:33231
msgid ""
":issue:`37751`: Fix :func:`codecs.lookup` to normalize the encoding name the"
" same way than :func:`encodings.normalize_encoding`, except that "
":func:`codecs.lookup` also converts the name to lower case."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37751`: 修复 :func:`codecs.lookup` 以与 "
":func:`encodings.normalize_encoding` 相同的方式标准化编码名称，除了 :func:`codecs.lookup` "
"还将名称转换为小写。"

#: ../NEWS:33235
msgid ""
":issue:`37830`: Fixed compilation of :keyword:`break` and "
":keyword:`continue` in the :keyword:`finally` block when the corresponding "
":keyword:`try` block contains :keyword:`return` with a non-constant value."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37830`: 修复了当相应的 :keyword:`try` 块包含带有非常量值的 :keyword:`return` 时，在 "
":keyword:`finally` 块中编译 :keyword:`break` 和 :keyword:`continue` 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:33239
msgid ""
":issue:`20490`: Improve import error message for partially initialized "
"module on circular ``from`` imports - by Anthony Sottile."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20490`: 通过Anthony Sottile的贡献，改进了循环 ``from`` 导入时部分初始化模块的导入错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:33242
msgid ""
":issue:`37840`: Fix handling of negative indices in "
":c:member:`~PySequenceMethods.sq_item` of :class:`bytearray`. Patch by "
"Sergey Fedoseev."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37840`: 修复了 :class:`bytearray` 的 "
":c:member:`~PySequenceMethods.sq_item` 中负索引的处理。由Sergey Fedoseev提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33246
msgid ""
":issue:`37802`: Slightly improve performance of "
":c:func:`PyLong_FromUnsignedLong`, :c:func:`PyLong_FromUnsignedLongLong` and"
" :c:func:`PyLong_FromSize_t`. Patch by Sergey Fedoseev."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37802`: 略微提高了 "
":c:func:`PyLong_FromUnsignedLong`、:c:func:`PyLong_FromUnsignedLongLong` 和 "
":c:func:`PyLong_FromSize_t` 的性能。由Sergey Fedoseev提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33250
msgid ""
":issue:`37409`: Ensure explicit relative imports from interactive sessions "
"and scripts (having no parent package) always raise ImportError, rather than"
" treating the current module as the package. Patch by Ben Lewis."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37409`: 确保在交互式会话和没有父包的脚本中，显式相对导入总是引发ImportError，而不是将当前模块视为包。由Ben "
"Lewis提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33254
msgid ""
":issue:`32912`: Reverted :issue:`32912`: emitting :exc:`SyntaxWarning` "
"instead of :exc:`DeprecationWarning` for invalid escape sequences in string "
"and bytes literals."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32912`: 回退了 :issue:`32912`：对于字符串和字节字面量中的无效转义序列，现在发出 "
":exc:`SyntaxWarning` 而不是 :exc:`DeprecationWarning`。"

#: ../NEWS:33258
msgid ""
":issue:`37757`: :pep:`572`: As described in the PEP, assignment expressions "
"now raise :exc:`SyntaxError` when their interaction with comprehension "
"scoping results in an ambiguous target scope."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37757`: :pep:`572`: 如PEP所述，当赋值表达式与理解作用域的交互导致目标作用域不明确时，现在会引发 "
":exc:`SyntaxError`。"

#: ../NEWS:33262
msgid ""
"The ``TargetScopeError`` subclass originally proposed by the PEP has been "
"removed in favour of just raising regular syntax errors for the disallowed "
"cases."
msgstr "最初由PEP提出的 ``TargetScopeError`` 子类已被移除，改为仅对不允许的情况引发常规语法错误。"

#: ../NEWS:33266
msgid ""
":issue:`36279`: Fix potential use of uninitialized memory in "
":func:`os.wait3`."
msgstr ":issue:`36279`: 修复了 :func:`os.wait3` 中可能使用未初始化内存的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:33268
msgid ""
":issue:`36311`: Decoding bytes objects larger than 2GiB is faster and no "
"longer fails when a multibyte characters spans a chunk boundary."
msgstr ":issue:`36311`: 解码大于2GiB的字节对象更快，并且当多字节字符跨越块边界时不再失败。"

#: ../NEWS:33271
msgid ""
":issue:`34880`: The :keyword:`assert` statement now works properly if the "
":exc:`AssertionError` exception is being shadowed. Patch by Zackery Spytz."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34880`: 如果 :exc:`AssertionError` 异常被遮蔽，:keyword:`assert` "
"语句现在可以正常工作。由Zackery Spytz提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33274
msgid ""
":issue:`37340`: Removed object cache (``free_list``) for bound method "
"objects. Temporary bound method objects are less used than before thanks to "
"the ``LOAD_METHOD`` opcode and the ``_PyObject_VectorcallMethod`` C API."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37340`: 移除了绑定方法对象（``free_list``）的对象缓存。由于 ``LOAD_METHOD`` 操作码和 "
"``_PyObject_VectorcallMethod`` C API 的存在，临时绑定方法对象的使用比以前少。"

#: ../NEWS:33278
msgid ""
":issue:`37648`: Fixed minor inconsistency in :meth:`list.__contains__`, "
":meth:`tuple.__contains__` and a few other places. The collection's item is "
"now always at the left and the needle is on the right of ``==``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37648`: 修复了 :meth:`list.__contains__`、:meth:`tuple.__contains__` "
"及其他几处的小不一致性。集合的项现在始终位于 ``==`` 的左侧，而针位于右侧。"

#: ../NEWS:33282
msgid ""
":issue:`37444`: Update differing exception between "
":meth:`builtins.__import__` and :meth:`importlib.__import__`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37444`: 更新了 :meth:`builtins.__import__` 和 "
":meth:`importlib.__import__` 之间的异常差异。"

#: ../NEWS:33285
msgid ""
":issue:`37619`: When adding a wrapper descriptor from one class to a "
"different class (for example, setting ``__add__ = str.__add__`` on an "
"``int`` subclass), an exception is correctly raised when the operator is "
"called."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37619`: 当将包装描述符从一个类添加到另一个类时（例如，在 ``int`` 子类上设置 ``__add__ = "
"str.__add__``），调用操作符时会正确引发异常。"

#: ../NEWS:33289
msgid ""
":issue:`37593`: Swap the positions of the *posonlyargs* and *args* "
"parameters in the constructor of :class:`ast.parameters` nodes."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37593`: 在 :class:`ast.parameters` 节点的构造函数中交换了 *posonlyargs* 和 *args*"
" 参数的位置。"

#: ../NEWS:33292
msgid ":issue:`37543`: Optimized pymalloc for non PGO build."
msgstr ":issue:`37543`: 为非 PGO 构建优化了 pymalloc。"

#: ../NEWS:33294
msgid ""
":issue:`37537`: Compute allocated pymalloc blocks inside "
"_Py_GetAllocatedBlocks().  This slows down _Py_GetAllocatedBlocks() but "
"gives a small speedup to _PyObject_Malloc() and _PyObject_Free()."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37537`: 在 _Py_GetAllocatedBlocks() 内部计算分配的 pymalloc 块。这减慢了 "
"_Py_GetAllocatedBlocks() 的速度，但为 _PyObject_Malloc() 和 _PyObject_Free() "
"带来了小幅加速。"

#: ../NEWS:33298
msgid ""
":issue:`37467`: Fix :func:`sys.excepthook` and :c:func:`PyErr_Display` if a "
"filename is a bytes string. For example, for a SyntaxError exception where "
"the filename attribute is a bytes string."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37467`: 修复了 :func:`sys.excepthook` 和 "
":c:func:`PyErr_Display`，如果文件名是字节字符串。例如，对于文件名属性是字节字符串的 SyntaxError 异常。"

#: ../NEWS:33302
msgid ""
":issue:`37433`: Fix ``SyntaxError`` indicator printing too many spaces for "
"multi-line strings - by Anthony Sottile."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37433`: 修复了 ``SyntaxError`` 指示器在多行字符串中打印过多空格的问题 - 由 Anthony Sottile "
"提供。"

#: ../NEWS:33305
msgid ""
":issue:`37417`: :meth:`bytearray.extend` now correctly handles errors that "
"arise during iteration. Patch by Brandt Bucher."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37417`: :meth:`bytearray.extend` 现在正确处理了迭代过程中出现的错误。由 Brandt Bucher "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33308
msgid ""
":issue:`37414`: The undocumented ``sys.callstats()`` function has been "
"removed. Since Python 3.7, it was deprecated and always returned ``None``. "
"It required a special build option ``CALL_PROFILE`` which was already "
"removed in Python 3.7."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37414`: 未文档化的 ``sys.callstats()`` 函数已被移除。自 Python 3.7 起，它已被弃用，并总是返回 "
"``None``。它需要一个特殊的构建选项 ``CALL_PROFILE``，该选项已在 Python 3.7 中移除。"

#: ../NEWS:33313
msgid ""
":issue:`37392`: Remove ``sys.getcheckinterval()`` and "
"``sys.setcheckinterval()`` functions. They were deprecated since Python 3.2."
" Use :func:`sys.getswitchinterval` and :func:`sys.setswitchinterval` "
"instead. Remove also ``check_interval`` field of the ``PyInterpreterState`` "
"structure."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37392`: 移除 ``sys.getcheckinterval()`` 和 ``sys.setcheckinterval()`` "
"函数。这两个函数自 Python 3.2 起已被弃用。请改用 :func:`sys.getswitchinterval` 和 "
":func:`sys.setswitchinterval`。同时移除 ``PyInterpreterState`` 结构中的 "
"``check_interval`` 字段。"

#: ../NEWS:33319
msgid ""
":issue:`37388`: In development mode and in debug build, *encoding* and "
"*errors* arguments are now checked on string encoding and decoding "
"operations. Examples: :func:`open`, :meth:`str.encode` and "
":meth:`bytes.decode`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37388`: 在开发模式和调试构建中，现在会对字符串编码和解码操作的 *encoding* 和 *errors* "
"参数进行检查。例如：:func:`open`、:meth:`str.encode` 和 :meth:`bytes.decode`。"

#: ../NEWS:33323
msgid ""
"By default, for best performances, the *errors* argument is only checked at "
"the first encoding/decoding error, and the *encoding* argument is sometimes "
"ignored for empty strings."
msgstr "默认情况下，为了获得最佳性能，*errors* 参数仅在第一次编码/解码错误时检查，*encoding* 参数有时会为空字符串忽略。"

#: ../NEWS:33327
msgid ""
":issue:`37348`: Optimized decoding short ASCII string with UTF-8 and ascii "
"codecs. ``b\"foo\".decode()`` is about 15% faster.  Patch by Inada Naoki."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37348`: 优化了使用 UTF-8 和 ASCII 编解码器解码短 ASCII "
"字符串的性能。``b\"foo\".decode()`` 大约快了 15%。由 Inada Naoki 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33330
msgid ""
":issue:`24214`: Improved support of the surrogatepass error handler in the "
"UTF-8 and UTF-16 incremental decoders."
msgstr ":issue:`24214`: 改进了 UTF-8 和 UTF-16 增量解码器中对 surrogatepass 错误处理程序的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:33333
msgid ""
":issue:`37330`: :func:`open`, :func:`io.open`, :func:`codecs.open` and "
":class:`fileinput.FileInput` no longer accept ``'U'`` (\"universal "
"newline\") in the file mode. This flag was deprecated since Python 3.3."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37330`: :func:`open`、:func:`io.open`、:func:`codecs.open` 和 "
":class:`fileinput.FileInput` 不再接受文件模式中的 ``'U'`` (\"通用换行\") 。此标志自 Python 3.3 "
"起已被弃用。"

#: ../NEWS:33337
msgid ""
":issue:`35224`: Reverse evaluation order of key: value in dict "
"comprehensions as proposed in PEP 572. I.e. in ``{k: v for ...}``, ``k`` "
"will be evaluated before ``v``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35224`: 按照 PEP 572 的提议，反向评估字典推导式中 key: value 的求值顺序。即在 ``{k: v for "
"...}`` 中，``k`` 将在 ``v`` 之前被评估。"

#: ../NEWS:33341
msgid ""
":issue:`37316`: Fix the :c:func:`PySys_Audit` call in :class:`mmap.mmap`."
msgstr ":issue:`37316`: 修复了 :class:`mmap.mmap` 中的 :c:func:`PySys_Audit` 调用。"

#: ../NEWS:33343
msgid ":issue:`37300`: Remove an unnecessary Py_XINCREF in classobject.c."
msgstr ":issue:`37300`: 移除了 classobject.c 中一个不必要的 Py_XINCREF。"

#: ../NEWS:33345
msgid ""
":issue:`37269`: Fix a bug in the peephole optimizer that was not treating "
"correctly constant conditions with binary operators. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37269`: 修复了窥孔优化器中的一个错误，该错误未正确处理带有二元运算符的常量条件。补丁由 Pablo Galindo 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:33349
msgid ""
":issue:`20443`: Python now gets the absolute path of the script filename "
"specified on the command line (ex: \"python3 script.py\"): the __file__ "
"attribute of the __main__ module and sys.path[0] become an absolute path, "
"rather than a relative path."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20443`: Python 现在获取命令行中指定的脚本文件名的绝对路径（例如：“python3 "
"script.py”）：__main__ 模块的 __file__ 属性和 sys.path[0] 现在变为绝对路径，而非相对路径。"

#: ../NEWS:33354
msgid ""
":issue:`37257`: Python's small object allocator (``obmalloc.c``) now allows "
"(no more than) one empty arena to remain available for immediate reuse, "
"without returning it to the OS.  This prevents thrashing in simple loops "
"where an arena could be created and destroyed anew on each iteration."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37257`: "
"Python的小对象分配器（``obmalloc.c``）现在允许（不超过）一个空arena保持可用以便立即重用，而不将其返回给操作系统。这防止了在简单循环中可能每次迭代都创建和销毁一个新arena的颠簸现象。"

#: ../NEWS:33359
msgid ""
":issue:`37231`: The dispatching of type slots to special methods (for "
"example calling ``__mul__`` when doing ``x * y``) has been made faster."
msgstr ":issue:`37231`: 类型槽到特殊方法的派发（例如在执行 ``x * y`` 时调用 ``__mul__``）已经变得更快。"

#: ../NEWS:33362
msgid ""
":issue:`36974`: Implemented separate vectorcall functions for every calling "
"convention of builtin functions and methods. This improves performance for "
"calls."
msgstr ":issue:`36974`: 为内置函数和方法的所有调用约定实现了单独的vectorcall函数。这提高了调用的性能。"

#: ../NEWS:33366
msgid ""
":issue:`37213`: Handle correctly negative line offsets in the peephole "
"optimizer. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":issue:`37213`: 在窥孔优化器中正确处理负的行偏移。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33369
msgid ""
":issue:`37219`: Remove erroneous optimization for empty set differences."
msgstr ":issue:`37219`: 移除了空集差异的错误优化。"

#: ../NEWS:33371
msgid ""
":issue:`15913`: Implement :c:func:`PyBuffer_SizeFromFormat()` function "
"(previously documented but not implemented): call :func:`struct.calcsize`. "
"Patch by Joannah Nanjekye."
msgstr ""
":issue:`15913`: 实现了 :c:func:`PyBuffer_SizeFromFormat()` 函数（之前有文档记录但未实现）：调用 "
":func:`struct.calcsize`。由Joannah Nanjekye提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33375
msgid ""
":issue:`36922`: Slot functions optimize any callable with "
"``Py_TPFLAGS_METHOD_DESCRIPTOR`` instead of only instances of ``function``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36922`: 槽函数优化了任何带有 ``Py_TPFLAGS_METHOD_DESCRIPTOR`` 的可调用对象，而不仅仅是 "
"``function`` 的实例。"

#: ../NEWS:33379
msgid ""
":issue:`36974`: The slot ``tp_vectorcall_offset`` is inherited "
"unconditionally to support ``super().__call__()`` when the base class uses "
"vectorcall."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36974`: 槽 ``tp_vectorcall_offset`` "
"被无条件继承以支持当基类使用vectorcall时的``super().__call__()``。"

#: ../NEWS:33382
msgid ""
":issue:`37160`: :func:`threading.get_native_id` now also supports NetBSD."
msgstr ":issue:`37160`: :func:`threading.get_native_id` 现在也支持NetBSD。"

#: ../NEWS:33384
msgid ""
":issue:`37077`: Add :func:`threading.get_native_id` support for AIX. Patch "
"by M. Felt"
msgstr ""
":issue:`37077`: 为AIX添加了 :func:`threading.get_native_id` 支持。由M. Felt提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:33387
msgid ":issue:`36781`: :func:`sum` has been optimized for boolean values."
msgstr ":issue:`36781`: :func:`sum` 已经为布尔值进行了优化。"

#: ../NEWS:33389
msgid ""
":issue:`34556`: Add ``--upgrade-deps`` to venv module. Patch by Cooper Ry "
"Lees"
msgstr ":issue:`34556`: 向venv模块添加了 ``--upgrade-deps``。由Cooper Ry Lees提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:33391
msgid ""
":issue:`20523`: ``pdb.Pdb`` supports ~/.pdbrc in Windows 7. Patch by Tim "
"Hopper and Dan Lidral-Porter."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20523`: ``pdb.Pdb`` 支持Windows 7中的~/.pdbrc。由Tim Hopper和Dan Lidral-"
"Porter提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33394
msgid ""
":issue:`35551`: Updated encodings: - Removed the \"tis260\" encoding, which "
"was an alias for the nonexistent \"tactis\" codec. - Added \"mac_centeuro\" "
"as an alias for the mac_latin2 encoding."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35551`: 更新了编码：- 移除了“tis260”编码，这是一个不存在的“tactis”编解码器的别名。- "
"添加了“mac_centeuro”作为mac_latin2编码的别名。"

#: ../NEWS:33398
msgid ""
":issue:`19072`: The :class:`classmethod` decorator can now wrap other "
"descriptors such as property objects.  Adapted from a patch written by "
"Graham Dumpleton."
msgstr ""
":issue:`19072`: :class:`classmethod` 装饰器现在可以包装其他描述符，如property对象。根据Graham "
"Dumpleton编写的补丁改编。"

#: ../NEWS:33402
msgid ""
":issue:`27575`: Improve speed of dictview intersection by directly using set"
" intersection logic. Patch by David Su."
msgstr ":issue:`27575`: 通过直接使用集合交集逻辑提高字典视图交集的速度。由David Su提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33405
msgid ""
":issue:`30773`: Prohibit parallel running of aclose() / asend() / athrow(). "
"Fix ag_running to reflect the actual running status of the AG."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30773`: 禁止并行运行aclose() / asend() / "
"athrow()。修复ag_running以反映AG的实际运行状态。"

#: ../NEWS:33411
msgid ""
":issue:`36589`: The :func:`curses.update_lines_cols` function now returns "
"``None`` instead of ``1`` on success."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36589`: 现在，:func:`curses.update_lines_cols` 函数在成功时返回 ``None`` "
"而不是``1``。"

#: ../NEWS:33414
msgid ""
":issue:`38807`: Update :exc:`TypeError` messages for :meth:`os.path.join` to"
" include :class:`os.PathLike` objects as acceptable input types."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38807`: 更新 :exc:`TypeError` 消息，为 :meth:`os.path.join` 包括 "
":class:`os.PathLike` 对象作为可接受的输入类型。"

#: ../NEWS:33417
msgid ""
":issue:`38724`: Add a repr for ``subprocess.Popen`` objects. Patch by Andrey"
" Doroschenko."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38724`: 为 ``subprocess.Popen`` 对象添加repr。由Andrey Doroschenko提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33420
msgid ""
":issue:`38786`: pydoc now recognizes and parses HTTPS URLs. Patch by "
"python273."
msgstr ":issue:`38786`: pydoc现在可以识别并解析HTTPS URL。由python273提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33422
msgid ""
":issue:`38785`: Prevent asyncio from crashing if parent ``__init__`` is not "
"called from a constructor of object derived from ``asyncio.Future``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38785`: 如果从 ``asyncio.Future`` 派生的对象的构造函数中没有调用父 "
"``__init__``，则防止asyncio崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:33425
msgid ""
":issue:`38723`: :mod:`pdb` now uses :meth:`io.open_code` to trigger auditing"
" events."
msgstr ":issue:`38723`: :mod:`pdb` 现在使用 :meth:`io.open_code` 来触发审计事件。"

#: ../NEWS:33428
msgid ""
":issue:`27805`: Allow opening pipes and other non-seekable files in append "
"mode with :func:`open`."
msgstr ":issue:`27805`: 允许以追加模式打开管道和其他不可寻址的文件，使用 :func:`open`。"

#: ../NEWS:33431
msgid ""
":issue:`38438`: Simplify the :mod:`argparse` usage message for "
"``nargs=\"*\"``."
msgstr ":issue:`38438`: 简化 :mod:`argparse` 对于 ``nargs=\"*\"`` 的使用信息。"

#: ../NEWS:33433
msgid ""
":issue:`38761`: WeakSet is now registered as a collections.abc.MutableSet."
msgstr ":issue:`38761`: WeakSet现在被注册为collections.abc.MutableSet。"

#: ../NEWS:33435
msgid ""
":issue:`38716`: logging: change RotatingHandler namer and rotator to class-"
"level attributes. This stops __init__ from setting them to None in the case "
"where a subclass defines them with eponymous methods."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38716`: logging: "
"将RotatingHandler的namer和rotator更改为类级别属性。这会阻止__init__在子类用同名方法定义它们的情况下将它们设置为None。"

#: ../NEWS:33439
msgid ""
":issue:`38713`: Add :const:`os.P_PIDFD` constant, which may be passed to "
":func:`os.waitid` to wait on a Linux process file descriptor."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38713`: 添加 :const:`os.P_PIDFD` 常量，可以传递给 :func:`os.waitid` "
"以等待Linux进程文件描述符。"

#: ../NEWS:33442
msgid ""
":issue:`38692`: Add :class:`asyncio.PidfdChildWatcher`, a Linux-specific "
"child watcher implementation that polls process file descriptors."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38692`: 添加 "
":class:`asyncio.PidfdChildWatcher`，一个特定于Linux的子监视器实现，它轮询进程文件描述符。"

#: ../NEWS:33445
msgid ""
":issue:`38692`: Expose the Linux ``pidfd_open`` syscall as "
":func:`os.pidfd_open`."
msgstr ":issue:`38692`: 将Linux的 ``pidfd_open`` 系统调用暴露为 :func:`os.pidfd_open`。"

#: ../NEWS:33448
msgid ""
":issue:`38602`: Added constants :const:`~fcntl.F_OFD_GETLK`, "
":const:`~fcntl.F_OFD_SETLK` and :const:`~fcntl.F_OFD_SETLKW` to the "
":mod:`fcntl` module. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38602`: 向 :mod:`fcntl` 模块添加常量 "
":const:`~fcntl.F_OFD_GETLK`、:const:`~fcntl.F_OFD_SETLK` 和 "
":const:`~fcntl.F_OFD_SETLKW`。由Donghee Na提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33452
msgid ""
":issue:`38334`: Fixed seeking backward on an encrypted "
":class:`zipfile.ZipExtFile`."
msgstr ":issue:`38334`: 修复了在加密的 :class:`zipfile.ZipExtFile` 上向后查找的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:33455
msgid ""
":issue:`38312`: Add :func:`curses.get_escdelay`, "
":func:`curses.set_escdelay`, :func:`curses.get_tabsize`, and "
":func:`curses.set_tabsize` functions - by Anthony Sottile."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38312`: 添加 "
":func:`curses.get_escdelay`、:func:`curses.set_escdelay`、:func:`curses.get_tabsize`"
" 和 :func:`curses.set_tabsize` 函数 - 由 Anthony Sottile 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:33459
msgid ""
":issue:`38586`: Now :func:`~logging.config.fileConfig` correctly sets the "
".name of handlers loaded."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38586`: 现在 :func:`~logging.config.fileConfig` 正确设置了加载的处理程序的 .name。"

#: ../NEWS:33462
msgid ""
":issue:`38565`: Add new cache_parameters() method for functools.lru_cache() "
"to better support pickling."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38565`: 为 functools.lru_cache() 添加新的 cache_parameters() 方法，以更好地支持 "
"pickle。"

#: ../NEWS:33465
msgid ""
":issue:`34679`: asynci.ProactorEventLoop.close() now only calls "
"signal.set_wakeup_fd() in the main thread."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34679`: asynci.ProactorEventLoop.close() 现在只在主线程中调用 "
"signal.set_wakeup_fd()。"

#: ../NEWS:33468
msgid ""
":issue:`31202`: The case the result of :func:`pathlib.WindowsPath.glob` "
"matches now the case of the pattern for literal parts."
msgstr ":issue:`31202`: :func:`pathlib.WindowsPath.glob` 的结果现在匹配字面部分的大小写。"

#: ../NEWS:33471
msgid ""
":issue:`36321`: Remove misspelled attribute.  The 3.8 changelog noted that "
"this would be removed in 3.9."
msgstr ":issue:`36321`: 移除拼写错误的属性。3.8 的变更日志指出这将在 3.9 中移除。"

#: ../NEWS:33474
msgid ""
":issue:`38521`: Fixed erroneous equality comparison in "
"statistics.NormalDist()."
msgstr ":issue:`38521`: 修复了 statistics.NormalDist() 中的错误等式比较。"

#: ../NEWS:33476
msgid ""
":issue:`38493`: Added :const:`~os.CLD_KILLED` and :const:`~os.CLD_STOPPED` "
"for :attr:`si_code`. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38493`: 为 :attr:`si_code` 添加了 :const:`~os.CLD_KILLED` 和 "
":const:`~os.CLD_STOPPED`。由 Donghee Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33479
msgid ""
":issue:`38478`: Fixed a bug in :meth:`inspect.signature.bind` that was "
"causing it to fail when handling a keyword argument with same name as "
"positional-only parameter. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38478`: 修复了 :meth:`inspect.signature.bind` 中的一个 bug，该 bug "
"导致处理与位置唯一参数同名的关键字参数时失败。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33483
msgid ""
":issue:`33604`: Fixed ``hmac.new`` and ``hmac.HMAC`` to raise TypeError "
"instead of ValueError when the digestmod parameter, now required in 3.8, is "
"omitted. Also clarified the hmac module documentation and docstrings."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33604`: 修复了 ``hmac.new`` 和 ``hmac.HMAC``，当省略了 3.8 中现在必需的 digestmod "
"参数时，抛出 TypeError 而不是 ValueError。同时澄清了 hmac 模块的文档和文档字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:33487
msgid ""
":issue:`38378`: Parameters *out* and *in* of :func:`os.sendfile` was renamed"
" to *out_fd* and *in_fd*."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38378`: :func:`os.sendfile` 的参数 *out* 和 *in* 被重命名为 *out_fd* 和 "
"*in_fd*。"

#: ../NEWS:33490
msgid ""
":issue:`38417`: Added support for setting the umask in the child process to "
"the subprocess module on POSIX systems."
msgstr ":issue:`38417`: 在 POSIX 系统上为子进程添加了设置 umask 的支持到 subprocess 模块。"

#: ../NEWS:33493
msgid ""
":issue:`38449`: Revert PR 15522, which introduces a regression in "
":meth:`mimetypes.guess_type` due to improper handling of filenames as urls."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38449`: 撤销 PR 15522，由于对文件名作为 url 的不正确处理，导致 "
":meth:`mimetypes.guess_type` 中的回归。"

#: ../NEWS:33497
msgid ""
":issue:`38431`: Fix ``__repr__`` method for :class:`dataclasses.InitVar` to "
"support typing objects, patch by Samuel Colvin."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38431`: 修复 :class:`dataclasses.InitVar` 的 ``__repr__`` 方法以支持类型对象，补丁由"
" Samuel Colvin 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:33500
msgid ""
":issue:`38109`: Add missing :const:`stat.S_IFDOOR`, :const:`stat.S_IFPORT`, "
":const:`stat.S_IFWHT`, :func:`stat.S_ISDOOR`, :func:`stat.S_ISPORT`, and "
":func:`stat.S_ISWHT` values to the Python implementation of :mod:`stat`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38109`: 在 Python 的 :mod:`stat` 模块实现中添加缺失的 :const:`stat.S_IFDOOR`, "
":const:`stat.S_IFPORT`, :const:`stat.S_IFWHT`, :func:`stat.S_ISDOOR`, "
":func:`stat.S_ISPORT`, 和 :func:`stat.S_ISWHT` 值。"

#: ../NEWS:33504
msgid ":issue:`38422`: Clarify docstrings of pathlib suffix(es)"
msgstr ":issue:`38422`: 澄清 pathlib 后缀(es) 的文档字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:33506
msgid ""
":issue:`38405`: Nested subclasses of :class:`typing.NamedTuple` are now "
"pickleable."
msgstr ":issue:`38405`: 现在 :class:`typing.NamedTuple` 的嵌套子类可以被 pickle。"

#: ../NEWS:33509
msgid ""
":issue:`38332`: Prevent :exc:`KeyError` thrown by "
":func:`!_encoded_words.decode` when given an encoded-word with invalid "
"content-type encoding from propagating all the way to "
":func:`email.message.get`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38332`: 防止当 :func:`!_encoded_words.decode` 给定一个内容类型编码无效的编码字时抛出的 "
":exc:`KeyError` 一直传播到 :func:`email.message.get`。"

#: ../NEWS:33514
msgid ""
":issue:`38371`: Deprecated the ``split()`` method in "
":class:`!_tkinter.TkappType` in favour of the ``splitlist()`` method which "
"has more consistent and predictable behavior."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38371`: 弃用了 :class:`!_tkinter.TkappType` 中的 ``split()`` 方法，转而支持 "
"``splitlist()`` 方法，因为后者有更一致和可预测的行为。"

#: ../NEWS:33518
msgid ""
":issue:`38341`: Add :exc:`smtplib.SMTPNotSupportedError` to the "
":mod:`smtplib` exported names."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38341`: 将 :exc:`smtplib.SMTPNotSupportedError` 添加到 :mod:`smtplib` "
"的导出名称中。"

#: ../NEWS:33521
msgid ""
":issue:`38319`: sendfile() used in socket and shutil modules was raising "
"OverflowError for files >= 2GiB on 32-bit architectures.  (patch by "
"Giampaolo Rodola)"
msgstr ""
":issue:`38319`: 在 socket 和 shutil 模块中使用的 sendfile() 在 32 位架构上对于 >= 2GiB "
"的文件会引发 OverflowError。（由 Giampaolo Rodola 提供补丁）"

#: ../NEWS:33525
msgid ":issue:`38242`: Revert the new asyncio Streams API"
msgstr ":issue:`38242`: 回滚新的 asyncio Streams API"

#: ../NEWS:33527
msgid ""
":issue:`13153`: OS native encoding is now used for converting between Python"
" strings and Tcl objects.  This allows to display, copy and paste to "
"clipboard emoji and other non-BMP characters.  Converting strings from Tcl "
"to Python and back now never fails (except MemoryError)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`13153`: 现在使用操作系统原生编码在 Python 字符串和 Tcl 对象之间进行转换。这允许显示、复制和粘贴到剪贴板的 "
"emoji 和其他非 BMP 字符。从现在开始，从 Tcl 到 Python 以及反向的字符串转换永远不会失败（除了 MemoryError）。"

#: ../NEWS:33532
msgid ""
":issue:`38019`: Correctly handle pause/resume reading of closed asyncio unix"
" pipe."
msgstr ":issue:`38019`: 正确处理已关闭的 asyncio unix 管道的暂停/恢复读取。"

#: ../NEWS:33535
msgid ""
":issue:`38163`: Child mocks will now detect their type as either synchronous"
" or asynchronous, asynchronous child mocks will be AsyncMocks and "
"synchronous child mocks will be either MagicMock or Mock (depending on their"
" parent type)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38163`: 子 mock 现在会检测它们的类型是同步还是异步的，异步子 mock 将是 AsyncMocks，同步子 mock 将是"
" MagicMock 或 Mock（取决于它们的父类型）。"

#: ../NEWS:33540
msgid ":issue:`38161`: Removes _AwaitEvent from AsyncMock."
msgstr ":issue:`38161`: 从 AsyncMock 中移除 _AwaitEvent。"

#: ../NEWS:33542
msgid ""
":issue:`38216`: Allow the rare code that wants to send invalid http requests"
" from the ``http.client`` library a way to do so.  The fixes for "
":issue:`30458` led to breakage for some projects that were relying on this "
"ability to test their own behavior in the face of bad requests."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38216`: 允许那些罕见的代码从 ``http.client`` 库发送无效的 http 请求。:issue:`30458` "
"的修复导致了一些项目在测试它们在面对错误请求时的行为时依赖此能力的项目出现问题。"

#: ../NEWS:33547
msgid ""
":issue:`28286`: Deprecate opening :class:`~gzip.GzipFile` for writing "
"implicitly.  Always specify the *mode* argument for writing."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28286`: 弃用隐式打开 :class:`~gzip.GzipFile` 进行写入的操作。 写入时始终指定 *mode* 参数。"

#: ../NEWS:33550
msgid ""
":issue:`38108`: Any synchronous magic methods on an AsyncMock now return a "
"MagicMock. Any asynchronous magic methods on a MagicMock now return an "
"AsyncMock."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38108`: 现在，AsyncMock 上的任何同步魔术方法都返回一个 MagicMock。MagicMock "
"上的任何异步魔术方法都返回一个 AsyncMock。"

#: ../NEWS:33554
msgid ""
":issue:`38265`: Update the *length* parameter of :func:`os.pread` to accept "
":c:type:`Py_ssize_t` instead of :c:expr:`int`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38265`: 更新 :func:`os.pread` 的 *length* 参数，接受 :c:type:`Py_ssize_t` "
"而不是 :c:expr:`int`。"

#: ../NEWS:33557
msgid ""
":issue:`38112`: :mod:`compileall` has a higher default recursion limit and "
"new command-line arguments for path manipulation, symlinks handling, and "
"multiple optimization levels."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38112`: :mod:`compileall` 具有更高的默认递归限制和新的命令行参数，用于路径操作、符号链接处理和多级优化。"

#: ../NEWS:33561
msgid ":issue:`38248`: asyncio: Fix inconsistent immediate Task cancellation"
msgstr ":issue:`38248`: asyncio: 修复了立即任务取消不一致的问题"

#: ../NEWS:33563
msgid ""
":issue:`38237`: The arguments for the builtin pow function are more "
"descriptive. They can now also be passed in as keywords."
msgstr ":issue:`38237`: 内置 pow 函数的参数更具描述性。现在也可以通过关键字传递这些参数。"

#: ../NEWS:33566
msgid ""
":issue:`34002`: Improve efficiency in parts of email package by changing "
"while-pop to a for loop, using isdisjoint instead of set intersections."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34002`: 通过将 while-pop 改为 for 循环，使用 isdisjoint 而不是集合交集，提高了 email "
"包中部分的效率。"

#: ../NEWS:33569
msgid ""
":issue:`38191`: Constructors of :class:`~typing.NamedTuple` and "
":class:`~typing.TypedDict` types now accept arbitrary keyword argument "
"names, including \"cls\", \"self\", \"typename\", \"_typename\", \"fields\" "
"and \"_fields\"."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38191`: :class:`~typing.NamedTuple` 和 :class:`~typing.TypedDict` "
"类型的构造函数现在接受任意关键字参数名称，包括 "
"\"cls\"、\"self\"、\"typename\"、\"_typename\"、\"fields\" 和 \"_fields\"。"

#: ../NEWS:33574
msgid ""
":issue:`38155`: Add ``__all__`` to  :mod:`datetime`. Patch by Tahia Khan."
msgstr ":issue:`38155`: 向 :mod:`datetime` 添加 ``__all__``。由 Tahia Khan 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33576
msgid ""
":issue:`38185`: Fixed case-insensitive string comparison in "
":class:`sqlite3.Row` indexing."
msgstr ":issue:`38185`: 修复了 :class:`sqlite3.Row` 索引中不区分大小写的字符串比较。"

#: ../NEWS:33579
msgid ""
":issue:`38136`: Changes AsyncMock call count and await count to be two "
"different counters. Now await count only counts when a coroutine has been "
"awaited, not when it has been called, and vice-versa. Update the "
"documentation around this."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38136`: 将 AsyncMock "
"的调用计数和等待计数更改为两个不同的计数器。现在等待计数仅在协程被等待时计数，而不是在被调用时，反之亦然。更新了相关文档。"

#: ../NEWS:33584
msgid ""
":issue:`37828`: Fix default mock name in "
":meth:`unittest.mock.Mock.assert_called` exceptions. Patch by Abraham Toriz "
"Cruz."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37828`: 修复了 :meth:`unittest.mock.Mock.assert_called` 异常中的默认模拟名称。补丁由 "
"Abraham Toriz Cruz 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:33588
msgid ""
":issue:`38175`: Fix a memory leak in comparison of :class:`sqlite3.Row` "
"objects."
msgstr ":issue:`38175`: 修复了 :class:`sqlite3.Row` 对象比较中的内存泄漏。"

#: ../NEWS:33591
msgid ""
":issue:`33936`: _hashlib no longer calls obsolete OpenSSL initialization "
"function with OpenSSL 1.1.0+."
msgstr ":issue:`33936`: _hashlib 不再调用 OpenSSL 1.1.0+ 中过时的 OpenSSL 初始化函数。"

#: ../NEWS:33594
msgid ""
":issue:`34706`: Preserve subclassing in inspect.Signature.from_callable."
msgstr ":issue:`34706`: 在 inspect.Signature.from_callable 中保留子类化。"

#: ../NEWS:33596
msgid ""
":issue:`38153`: Names of hashing algorithms from OpenSSL are now normalized "
"to follow Python's naming conventions. For example OpenSSL uses sha3-512 "
"instead of sha3_512 or blake2b512 instead of blake2b."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38153`: "
"OpenSSL的哈希算法名称现在被规范化以遵循Python的命名约定。例如，OpenSSL使用sha3-512而不是sha3_512，或使用blake2b512而不是blake2b。"

#: ../NEWS:33600
msgid ""
":issue:`38115`: Fix a bug in dis.findlinestarts() where it would return "
"invalid bytecode offsets. Document that a code object's co_lnotab can "
"contain invalid bytecode offsets."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38115`: "
"修复了dis.findlinestarts()中的一个错误，该错误会导致返回无效的字节码偏移量。记录了代码对象的co_lnotab可能包含无效字节码偏移量的情况。"

#: ../NEWS:33604
msgid ""
":issue:`38148`: Add slots to :mod:`asyncio` transport classes, which can "
"reduce memory usage."
msgstr ":issue:`38148`: 向 :mod:`asyncio` 传输类添加插槽，可以减少内存使用。"

#: ../NEWS:33607
msgid ""
":issue:`38142`: The _hashlib OpenSSL wrapper extension module is now PEP-384"
" compliant."
msgstr ":issue:`38142`: _hashlib OpenSSL包装器扩展模块现在符合PEP-384标准。"

#: ../NEWS:33610
msgid ""
":issue:`9216`: hashlib constructors now support usedforsecurity flag to "
"signal that a hashing algorithm is not used in a security context."
msgstr ":issue:`9216`: hashlib构造函数现在支持usedforsecurity标志，以指示哈希算法不用于安全上下文。"

#: ../NEWS:33613
msgid ""
":issue:`36991`: Fixes a potential incorrect AttributeError exception "
"escaping ZipFile.extract() in some unsupported input error situations."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36991`: "
"修复了在某些不支持的输入错误情况下，ZipFile.extract()可能错误地抛出AttributeError异常的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:33616
msgid ""
":issue:`38134`: Remove obsolete copy of PBKDF2_HMAC_fast. All supported "
"OpenSSL versions contain a fast implementation."
msgstr ":issue:`38134`: 移除了过时的PBKDF2_HMAC_fast副本。所有支持的OpenSSL版本都包含快速实现。"

#: ../NEWS:33619
msgid ""
":issue:`38132`: The OpenSSL hashlib wrapper uses a simpler implementation. "
"Several Macros and pointless caches are gone. The hash name now comes from "
"OpenSSL's EVP. The algorithm name stays the same, except it is now always "
"lower case."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38132`: "
"OpenSSL的hashlib包装器使用了更简单的实现。几个宏和无用的缓存已被移除。哈希名称现在来自OpenSSL的EVP。算法名称保持不变，除了现在总是小写。"

#: ../NEWS:33624
msgid ""
":issue:`38008`: Fix parent class check in protocols to correctly identify "
"the module that provides a builtin protocol, instead of assuming they all "
"come from the :mod:`collections.abc` module"
msgstr ""
":issue:`38008`: 修复了协议中的父类检查，以正确识别提供内置协议的模块，而不是假设它们都来自 :mod:`collections.abc`"
" 模块。"

#: ../NEWS:33628
msgid ""
":issue:`34037`: For :mod:`asyncio`, add a new coroutine "
":meth:`loop.shutdown_default_executor`. The new coroutine provides an API to"
" schedule an executor shutdown that waits on the threadpool to finish "
"closing. Also, :func:`asyncio.run` has been updated to utilize the new "
"coroutine. Patch by Kyle Stanley."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34037`: 对于 :mod:`asyncio`，添加了一个新的协程 "
":meth:`loop.shutdown_default_executor`。这个新协程提供了一个API来安排执行器的关闭，等待线程池关闭完成。此外，:func:`asyncio.run`"
" 已被更新以利用这个新协程。补丁由Kyle Stanley提供。"

#: ../NEWS:33634
msgid ""
":issue:`37405`: Fixed regression bug for socket.getsockname() for non-"
"CAN_ISOTP AF_CAN address family sockets by returning a 1-tuple instead of "
"string."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37405`: 通过返回1元组而不是字符串，修复了非CAN_ISOTP "
"AF_CAN地址族套接字的socket.getsockname()的回归错误。"

#: ../NEWS:33637
msgid ""
":issue:`38121`: Update parameter names on functions in importlib.metadata "
"matching the changes in the 0.22 release of importlib_metadata."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38121`: 更新了importlib.metadata中函数的参数名称，与importlib_metadata "
"0.22版本的更改相匹配。"

#: ../NEWS:33640
msgid ""
":issue:`38110`: The os.closewalk() implementation now uses the libc fdwalk()"
" API on platforms where it is available."
msgstr ":issue:`38110`: os.closewalk() 实现现在在可用平台上使用 libc fdwalk() API。"

#: ../NEWS:33643
msgid ""
