msgid ""
":issue:`37685`: Fixed ``__eq__``, ``__lt__`` etc implementations in some "
"classes. They now return :data:`NotImplemented` for unsupported type of the "
"other operand. This allows the other operand to play role (for example the "
"equality comparison with :data:`~unittest.mock.ANY` will return ``True``)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37685`: 修复了一些类中的 ``__eq__``, ``__lt__`` 等实现。对于不支持的其他操作数类型，现在返回 "
":data:`NotImplemented`。这允许其他操作数发挥作用（例如与 :data:`~unittest.mock.ANY` 的相等比较将返回 "
"``True``）。"

#: ../NEWS:33875
msgid ""
":issue:`37354`: Make Activate.ps1 Powershell script static to allow for "
"signing it."
msgstr ":issue:`37354`: 将 Activate.ps1 Powershell 脚本设为静态，以允许对其进行签名。"

#: ../NEWS:33878
msgid ""
":issue:`37664`: Update wheels bundled with ensurepip (pip 19.2.3 and "
"setuptools 41.2.0)"
msgstr ""
":issue:`37664`: 更新了与 ensurepip 捆绑的 wheels（pip 19.2.3 和 setuptools 41.2.0）。"

#: ../NEWS:33881
msgid ""
":issue:`37663`: Bring consistency to venv shell activation scripts by always"
" using __VENV_PROMPT__."
msgstr ":issue:`37663`: 通过始终使用 __VENV_PROMPT__ 来使 venv shell 激活脚本保持一致。"

#: ../NEWS:33884
msgid ""
":issue:`37642`: Allowed the pure Python implementation of "
":class:`datetime.timezone` to represent sub-minute offsets close to minimum "
"and maximum boundaries, specifically in the ranges (23:59, 24:00) and "
"(-23:59, 24:00). Patch by Ngalim Siregar"
msgstr ""
":issue:`37642`: 允许 :class:`datetime.timezone` 的纯 Python "
"实现在接近最小和最大边界时表示亚分钟偏移，特别是在 (23:59, 24:00) 和 (-23:59, 24:00) 的范围内。补丁由 Ngalim "
"Siregar 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:33889
msgid ""
":issue:`36161`: In :mod:`posix`, use ``ttyname_r`` instead of ``ttyname`` "
"for thread safety."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36161`: 在 :mod:`posix` 中，使用 ``ttyname_r`` 代替 ``ttyname`` 以实现线程安全。"

#: ../NEWS:33892
msgid ""
":issue:`36324`: Make internal attributes for statistics.NormalDist() "
"private."
msgstr ":issue:`36324`: 将 statistics.NormalDist() 的内部属性设为私有。"

#: ../NEWS:33894
msgid ""
":issue:`37555`: Fix ``NonCallableMock._call_matcher`` returning tuple "
"instead of ``_Call`` object when ``self._spec_signature`` exists. Patch by "
"Elizabeth Uselton"
msgstr ""
":issue:`37555`: 修复 ``NonCallableMock._call_matcher`` 当 "
"``self._spec_signature`` 存在时返回元组而不是 ``_Call`` 对象的问题。由 Elizabeth Uselton "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33898
msgid ""
":issue:`29446`: Make ``from tkinter import *`` import only the expected "
"objects."
msgstr ":issue:`29446`: 使 ``from tkinter import *`` 仅导入预期的对象。"

#: ../NEWS:33901
msgid ""
":issue:`16970`: Adding a value error when an invalid value in passed to "
"nargs Patch by Robert Leenders"
msgstr ":issue:`16970`: 当传递无效值给 nargs 时添加一个值错误。由 Robert Leenders 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33904
msgid ""
":issue:`34443`: Exceptions from :mod:`enum` now use the ``__qualname`` of "
"the enum class in the exception message instead of the ``__name__``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34443`: :mod:`enum` 的异常现在在异常消息中使用枚举类的 ``__qualname__`` 而不是 "
"``__name__``。"

#: ../NEWS:33907
msgid ""
":issue:`37491`: Fix ``IndexError`` when parsing email headers with "
"unexpectedly ending bare-quoted string value. Patch by Abhilash Raj."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37491`: 修复在解析具有意外结束的裸引用字符串值的电子邮件头时出现的 ``IndexError``。由 Abhilash Raj "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33910
msgid ""
":issue:`37587`: Make json.loads faster for long strings. (Patch by Marco "
"Paolini)"
msgstr ":issue:`37587`: 使 json.loads 对长字符串的处理更快。（由 Marco Paolini 提供补丁）"

#: ../NEWS:33913
msgid ""
":issue:`18378`: Recognize \"UTF-8\" as a valid value for LC_CTYPE in "
"locale._parse_localename."
msgstr ":issue:`18378`: 将 \"UTF-8\" 识别为 locale._parse_localename 中 LC_CTYPE 的有效值。"

#: ../NEWS:33916
msgid ""
":issue:`37579`: Return :exc:`NotImplemented` in Python implementation of "
"``__eq__`` for :class:`~datetime.timedelta` and :class:`~datetime.time` when"
" the other object being compared is not of the same type to match C "
"implementation. Patch by Karthikeyan Singaravelan."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37579`: 在Python的 ``__eq__`` 实现中，当比较的对象不是同一类型时，对于 "
":class:`~datetime.timedelta` 和 :class:`~datetime.time` 返回 "
":exc:`NotImplemented`，以匹配C实现。由Karthikeyan Singaravelan提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33921
msgid ""
":issue:`21478`: Record calls to parent when autospecced object is attached "
"to a mock using :func:`unittest.mock.attach_mock`. Patch by Karthikeyan "
"Singaravelan."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21478`: 当使用 :func:`unittest.mock.attach_mock` "
"将自动模拟对象附加到模拟时，记录对父级的调用。由Karthikeyan Singaravelan提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33925
msgid ""
":issue:`37531`: \"python3 -m test -jN --timeout=TIMEOUT\" now kills a worker"
" process if it runs longer than *TIMEOUT* seconds."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37531`: \"python3 -m test -jN --timeout=TIMEOUT\" 现在会在工作进程运行超过 "
"*TIMEOUT* 秒时终止该进程。"

#: ../NEWS:33928
msgid ""
":issue:`37482`: Fix serialization of display name in originator or "
"destination address fields with both encoded words and special chars."
msgstr ":issue:`37482`: 修复了在发件人或收件人地址字段中同时包含编码字和特殊字符时显示名称的序列化问题。"

#: ../NEWS:33931
msgid ""
":issue:`36993`: Improve error reporting for corrupt zip files with bad zip64"
" extra data. Patch by Daniel Hillier."
msgstr ":issue:`36993`: 改进了对带有坏zip64额外数据的损坏zip文件的错误报告。补丁由Daniel Hillier提供。"

#: ../NEWS:33934
msgid ""
":issue:`37502`: pickle.loads() no longer raises TypeError when the buffers "
"argument is set to None"
msgstr ":issue:`37502`: 当buffers参数设置为None时，pickle.loads() 不再抛出TypeError。"

#: ../NEWS:33937
msgid ""
":issue:`37520`: Correct behavior for zipfile.Path.parent when the path "
"object identifies a subdirectory."
msgstr ":issue:`37520`: 修正了当路径对象标识子目录时zipfile.Path.parent的行为。"

#: ../NEWS:33940
msgid ""
":issue:`18374`: Fix the ``.col_offset`` attribute of nested "
":class:`ast.BinOp` instances which had a too large value in some situations."
msgstr ""
":issue:`18374`: 修复了在某些情况下，嵌套的 :class:`ast.BinOp` 实例的 ``.col_offset`` "
"属性值过大的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:33943
msgid ""
":issue:`37424`: Fixes a possible hang when using a timeout on "
"``subprocess.run()`` while capturing output.  If the child process spawned "
"its own children or otherwise connected its stdout or stderr handles with "
"another process, we could hang after the timeout was reached and our child "
"was killed when attempting to read final output from the pipes."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37424`: 修复了在使用 ``subprocess.run()`` "
"进行超时设置并捕获输出时可能出现的挂起问题。如果子进程生成了自己的子进程或以其他方式将其stdout或stderr句柄与另一个进程连接，我们可能会在达到超时并杀死子进程后，在尝试从管道读取最终输出时挂起。"

#: ../NEWS:33949
msgid ""
":issue:`37421`: Fix :func:`multiprocessing.util.get_temp_dir` finalizer: "
"clear also the 'tempdir' configuration of the current process, so next call "
"to ``get_temp_dir()`` will create a new temporary directory, rather than "
"reusing the removed temporary directory."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37421`: 修复 :func:`multiprocessing.util.get_temp_dir` "
"的终结器：同时清除当前进程的'tempdir'配置，以便下次调用 ``get_temp_dir()`` "
"时将创建新的临时目录，而不是重用已删除的临时目录。"

#: ../NEWS:33954
msgid ""
":issue:`37481`: The distutils ``bdist_wininst`` command is deprecated in "
"Python 3.8, use ``bdist_wheel`` (wheel packages) instead."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37481`: Python 3.8中已弃用distutils的 ``bdist_wininst`` 命令，改用 "
"``bdist_wheel`` (wheel包) 。"

#: ../NEWS:33957
msgid ""
":issue:`37479`: When ``Enum.__str__`` is overridden in a derived class, the "
"override will be used by ``Enum.__format__`` regardless of whether mixin "
"classes are present."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37479`: 当在派生类中重写 ``Enum.__str__`` 时，无论是否存在混入类，``Enum.__format__`` "
"都将使用该重写。"

#: ../NEWS:33961
msgid ""
":issue:`37440`: http.client now enables TLS 1.3 post-handshake "
"authentication for default context or if a cert_file is passed to "
"HTTPSConnection."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37440`: http.client 现在为默认上下文或如果向 HTTPSConnection 传递了 cert_file，则启用 "
"TLS 1.3 握手后认证。"

#: ../NEWS:33964
msgid ":issue:`37437`: Update vendorized expat version to 2.2.7."
msgstr ":issue:`37437`: 更新了供应商化的 expat 版本到 2.2.7。"

#: ../NEWS:33966
msgid ""
":issue:`37428`: SSLContext.post_handshake_auth = True no longer sets "
"SSL_VERIFY_POST_HANDSHAKE verify flag for client connections. Although the "
"option is documented as ignored for clients, OpenSSL implicitly enables cert"
" chain validation when the flag is set."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37428`: SSLContext.post_handshake_auth = True 不再为客户端连接设置 "
"SSL_VERIFY_POST_HANDSHAKE 验证标志。虽然该选项被记录为对客户端忽略，但当该标志设置时，OpenSSL 隐式启用了证书链验证。"

#: ../NEWS:33971
msgid ""
":issue:`37420`: :func:`os.sched_setaffinity` now correctly handles errors "
"that arise during iteration over its ``mask`` argument. Patch by Brandt "
"Bucher."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37420`: :func:`os.sched_setaffinity` 现在正确处理了在其 ``mask`` "
"参数迭代过程中出现的错误。由 Brandt Bucher 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33974
msgid ""
":issue:`37412`: The :func:`os.getcwdb` function now uses the UTF-8 encoding "
"on Windows, rather than the ANSI code page: see :pep:`529` for the "
"rationale. The function is no longer deprecated on Windows."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37412`: :func:`os.getcwdb` 函数现在在 Windows 上使用 UTF-8 编码，而不是 ANSI "
"代码页：参见 :pep:`529` 的理由。该函数在 Windows 上不再被弃用。"

#: ../NEWS:33978
msgid ""
":issue:`37406`: The sqlite3 module now raises TypeError, rather than "
"ValueError, if operation argument type is not str: execute(), executemany() "
"and calling a connection."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37406`: 如果操作参数类型不是 str，sqlite3 模块现在会抛出 TypeError，而不是 "
"ValueError：execute()、executemany() 和调用连接时。"

#: ../NEWS:33982
msgid ""
":issue:`29412`: Fix IndexError in parsing a header value ending "
"unexpectedly. Patch by Abhilash Raj."
msgstr ":issue:`29412`: 修复了在解析意外结束的头值时引发的 IndexError。由 Abhilash Raj 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33985
msgid ""
":issue:`36546`: The *dist* argument for statistics.quantiles() is now "
"positional only. The current name doesn't reflect that the argument can be "
"either a dataset or a distribution.  Marking the parameter as positional "
"avoids confusion and makes it possible to change the name later."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36546`: statistics.quantiles() 的 *dist* "
"参数现在仅为位置参数。当前名称没有反映该参数可以是数据集或分布。将参数标记为位置参数避免了混淆，并使得以后可以更改名称。"

#: ../NEWS:33990
msgid ""
":issue:`37394`: Fix a bug that was causing the :mod:`queue` module to fail "
"if the accelerator module was not available. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37394`: 修复了一个导致 :mod:`queue` 模块在加速器模块不可用时失败的 bug。由 Pablo Galindo "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33993
msgid ""
":issue:`37376`: :mod:`pprint` now has support for "
":class:`types.SimpleNamespace`. Patch by Carl Bordum Hansen."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37376`: :mod:`pprint` 现在支持 :class:`types.SimpleNamespace`。由 Carl "
"Bordum Hansen 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:33996
msgid ""
":issue:`26967`: An :class:`~argparse.ArgumentParser` with "
"``allow_abbrev=False`` no longer disables grouping of short flags, such as "
"``-vv``, but only disables abbreviation of long flags as documented. Patch "
"by Zac Hatfield-Dodds."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26967`: 一个带有 ``allow_abbrev=False`` 的 "
":class:`~argparse.ArgumentParser` 不再禁用短标志的分组，例如 ``-vv``，但仅禁用长标志的缩写，如文档所述。由 "
"Zac Hatfield-Dodds 提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:34001
msgid ""
":issue:`37212`: :func:`unittest.mock.call` now preserves the order of "
"keyword arguments in repr output. Patch by Karthikeyan Singaravelan."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37212`: :func:`unittest.mock.call` 现在保留关键字参数在 repr 输出中的顺序。由 "
"Karthikeyan Singaravelan 提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:34004
msgid ""
":issue:`37372`: Fix error unpickling datetime.time objects from Python 2 "
"with seconds>=24. Patch by Justin Blanchard."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37372`: 修复从 Python 2 中解封秒数>=24 的 datetime.time 对象时的错误。由 Justin "
"Blanchard 提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:34007
msgid ""
":issue:`37345`: Add formal support for UDPLITE sockets. Support was present "
"before, but it is now easier to detect support with ``hasattr(socket, "
"'IPPROTO_UDPLITE')`` and there are constants defined for each of the values "
"needed: ``socket.IPPROTO_UDPLITE``, ``UDPLITE_SEND_CSCOV``, and "
"``UDPLITE_RECV_CSCOV``. Patch by Gabe Appleton."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37345`: 为 UDPLITE 套接字添加正式支持。之前已有支持，但现在更容易通过 ``hasattr(socket, "
"'IPPROTO_UDPLITE')`` "
"检测支持，并为每个需要的值定义了常量：``socket.IPPROTO_UDPLITE``、``UDPLITE_SEND_CSCOV`` 和 "
"``UDPLITE_RECV_CSCOV``。由 Gabe Appleton 提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:34013
msgid ":issue:`37358`: Optimized ``functools.partial`` by using vectorcall."
msgstr ":issue:`37358`: 通过使用 vectorcall 优化了 ``functools.partial``。"

#: ../NEWS:34015
msgid ""
":issue:`37347`: :meth:`sqlite3.Connection.create_aggregate`, "
":meth:`sqlite3.Connection.create_function`, "
":meth:`sqlite3.Connection.set_authorizer`, "
":meth:`sqlite3.Connection.set_progress_handler` "
":meth:`sqlite3.Connection.set_trace_callback` methods lead to segfaults if "
"some of these methods are called twice with an equal object but not the "
"same. Now callbacks are stored more carefully. Patch by Aleksandr Balezin."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37347`: 如果 "
":meth:`sqlite3.Connection.create_aggregate`、:meth:`sqlite3.Connection.create_function`、:meth:`sqlite3.Connection.set_authorizer`、:meth:`sqlite3.Connection.set_progress_handler`"
" 和 :meth:`sqlite3.Connection.set_trace_callback` "
"方法被用相同的对象但不是同一个对象调用两次，会导致段错误。现在回调的存储更加谨慎。由 Aleksandr Balezin 提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:34023
msgid ""
":issue:`37163`: The *obj* argument of :func:`dataclasses.replace` is "
"positional-only now."
msgstr ":issue:`37163`: :func:`dataclasses.replace` 的 *obj* 参数现在是仅位置参数。"

#: ../NEWS:34026
msgid ""
":issue:`37085`: Add the optional Linux SocketCAN Broadcast Manager "
"constants, used as flags to configure the BCM behaviour, in the socket "
"module.  Patch by Karl Ding."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37085`: 在 socket 模块中添加了可选的 Linux SocketCAN 广播管理器常量，用作配置 BCM 行为的标志。由 "
"Karl Ding 提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:34030
msgid ""
":issue:`37328`: ``HTMLParser.unescape`` is removed.  It was undocumented and"
" deprecated since Python 3.4."
msgstr ":issue:`37328`: ``HTMLParser.unescape`` 已被移除。它自 Python 3.4 起未记录且被弃用。"

#: ../NEWS:34033
msgid ""
":issue:`37305`: Add .webmanifest -> application/manifest+json to list of "
"recognized file types and content type headers"
msgstr ""
":issue:`37305`: 将 .webmanifest -> application/manifest+json "
"添加到识别的文件类型和内容类型头列表中。"

#: ../NEWS:34036
msgid ""
":issue:`37320`: ``aifc.openfp()`` alias to ``aifc.open()``, "
"``sunau.openfp()`` alias to ``sunau.open()``, and ``wave.openfp()`` alias to"
" ``wave.open()`` have been removed. They were deprecated since Python 3.7."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37320`: ``aifc.openfp()`` 到 ``aifc.open()`` 的别名、``sunau.openfp()`` 到"
" ``sunau.open()`` 的别名、以及 ``wave.openfp()`` 到 ``wave.open()`` 的别名已被移除。它们自 "
"Python 3.7 起被弃用。"

#: ../NEWS:34040
msgid ""
":issue:`37315`: Deprecated accepting floats with integral value (like "
"``5.0``) in :func:`math.factorial`."
msgstr ":issue:`37315`: 弃用在 :func:`math.factorial` 中接受整数值的浮点数（如 ``5.0``）。"

#: ../NEWS:34043
msgid ""
":issue:`37312`: ``_dummy_thread`` and ``dummy_threading`` modules have been "
"removed. These modules were deprecated since Python 3.7 which requires "
"threading support."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37312`: ``_dummy_thread`` 和 ``dummy_threading`` 模块已被移除。这些模块自 Python "
"3.7 起已被弃用，因为 Python 3.7 需要线程支持。"

#: ../NEWS:34047
msgid ""
":issue:`33972`: Email with single part but content-type set to "
"``multipart/*`` doesn't raise AttributeError anymore."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33972`: 对于设置为 ``multipart/*`` 但只有单一部分的电子邮件，不再引发 AttributeError。"

#: ../NEWS:34050
msgid ""
":issue:`37280`: Use threadpool for reading from file for sendfile fallback "
"mode."
msgstr ":issue:`37280`: 在 sendfile 后备模式中，使用线程池从文件读取。"

#: ../NEWS:34053
msgid ""
":issue:`37279`: Fix asyncio sendfile support when sendfile sends extra data "
"in fallback mode."
msgstr ":issue:`37279`: 修复在 sendfile 后备模式中发送额外数据时的 asyncio sendfile 支持。"

#: ../NEWS:34056
msgid ""
":issue:`19865`: :func:`ctypes.create_unicode_buffer` now also supports non-"
"BMP characters on platforms with 16-bit :c:type:`wchar_t` (for example, "
"Windows and AIX)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`19865`: :func:`ctypes.create_unicode_buffer` 现在也支持在 "
":c:type:`wchar_t` 为 16 位的平台（例如 Windows 和 AIX）上使用非 BMP 字符。"

#: ../NEWS:34060
msgid ""
":issue:`37266`: In a subinterpreter, spawning a daemon thread now raises an "
"exception. Daemon threads were never supported in subinterpreters. "
"Previously, the subinterpreter finalization crashed with a Python fatal "
"error if a daemon thread was still running."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37266`: 在子解释器中，现在尝试生成守护线程会引发异常。子解释器从未支持守护线程。之前，如果守护线程仍在运行，子解释器终止时会因 "
"Python 致命错误而崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:34065
msgid ""
":issue:`37210`: Allow pure Python implementation of :mod:`pickle` to work "
"even when the C :mod:`!_pickle` module is unavailable."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37210`: 允许 :mod:`pickle` 的纯 Python 实现在 C :mod:`!_pickle` 模块不可用时也能工作。"

#: ../NEWS:34068
msgid ""
":issue:`21872`: Fix :mod:`lzma`: module decompresses data incompletely. When"
" decompressing a FORMAT_ALONE format file, and it doesn't have the end "
"marker, sometimes the last one to dozens bytes can't be output. Patch by Ma "
"Lin."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21872`: 修复 :mod:`lzma` 模块解压数据不完整的问题。当解压 FORMAT_ALONE "
"格式的文件且没有结束标记时，有时最后的一些字节无法输出。由马林提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:34073
msgid ""
":issue:`35922`: Fix :meth:`RobotFileParser.crawl_delay` and "
":meth:`RobotFileParser.request_rate` to return ``None`` rather than raise "
":exc:`AttributeError` when no relevant rule is defined in the robots.txt "
"file.  Patch by Rémi Lapeyre."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35922`: 修复 :meth:`RobotFileParser.crawl_delay` 和 "
":meth:`RobotFileParser.request_rate`，当 robots.txt 文件中没有定义相关规则时返回 ``None`` "
"而不是引发 :exc:`AttributeError`。由 Rémi Lapeyre 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:34078
msgid ""
":issue:`35766`: Change the format of feature_version to be a (major, minor) "
"tuple."
msgstr ":issue:`35766`: 将 feature_version 的格式更改为 (major, minor) 元组。"

#: ../NEWS:34081
msgid ""
":issue:`36607`: Eliminate :exc:`RuntimeError` raised by "
":func:`asyncio.all_tasks` if internal tasks weak set is changed by another "
"thread during iteration."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36607`: 消除 :func:`asyncio.all_tasks` 在迭代期间如果内部任务的弱引用集被另一个线程更改时引发的 "
":exc:`RuntimeError`。"

#: ../NEWS:34085
msgid ""
":issue:`18748`: :class:`!_pyio.IOBase` destructor now does nothing if "
"getting the ``closed`` attribute fails to better mimic :class:`!_io.IOBase` "
"finalizer."
msgstr ""
":issue:`18748`: :class:`!_pyio.IOBase` 析构函数现在在获取 ``closed`` "
"属性失败时不执行任何操作，以更好地模拟 :class:`!_io.IOBase` 终结器。"

#: ../NEWS:34089
msgid ""
":issue:`36402`: Fix a race condition at Python shutdown when waiting for "
"threads. Wait until the Python thread state of all non-daemon threads get "
"deleted (join all non-daemon threads), rather than just wait until non-"
"daemon Python threads complete."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36402`: 修复 Python 关闭时等待线程的竞争条件。等待所有非守护线程的 Python "
"线程状态被删除（加入所有非守护线程），而不仅仅是等待非守护 Python 线程完成。"

#: ../NEWS:34094
msgid ""
":issue:`37206`: Default values which cannot be represented as Python objects"
" no longer improperly represented as ``None`` in function signatures."
msgstr ":issue:`37206`: 无法表示为 Python 对象的默认值不再在函数签名中错误地表示为 ``None``。"

#: ../NEWS:34097
msgid ""
":issue:`37111`: Added ``encoding`` and ``errors`` keyword parameters to "
"``logging.basicConfig``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37111`: 向 ``logging.basicConfig`` 添加了 ``encoding`` 和 ``errors`` "
"关键字参数。"

