"``_PyImport_FindSharedFuncptrWindows()``. Patch by Srinivas Nyayapati."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36266`: 在 ``_PyImport_FindSharedFuncptrWindows()`` 中模块导入期间发生 DLL "
