":issue:`37672`: 将 Windows Store 包的 pip 切换到使用捆绑的 :file:`pip.ini` 而不是 "
":envvar:`PIP_USER` 变量。"

#: ../NEWS:34695
msgid ""
":issue:`10945`: Officially drop support for creating bdist_wininst "
"installers on non-Windows systems."
msgstr ":issue:`10945`: 正式放弃在非 Windows 系统上创建 bdist_wininst 安装程序的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:34698
msgid ""
":issue:`37445`: Include the ``FORMAT_MESSAGE_IGNORE_INSERTS`` flag in "
"``FormatMessageW()`` calls."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37445`: 在 ``FormatMessageW()`` 调用中包含 "
"``FORMAT_MESSAGE_IGNORE_INSERTS`` 标志。"

#: ../NEWS:34701
msgid ""
":issue:`37369`: Fixes path for :data:`sys.executable` when running from the "
"Microsoft Store."
msgstr ":issue:`37369`: 修复从 Microsoft Store 运行时 :data:`sys.executable` 的路径。"

#: ../NEWS:34704
msgid ""
":issue:`37380`: Don't collect unfinished processes with "
"``subprocess._active`` on Windows to cleanup later. Patch by Ruslan "
"Kuprieiev."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37380`: 在Windows上，不再通过 ``subprocess._active`` 收集未完成的进程以供后续清理。由Ruslan"
" Kuprieiev提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:34707
msgid ""
":issue:`37351`: Removes libpython38.a from standard Windows distribution."
msgstr ":issue:`37351`: 从标准的Windows发行版中移除libpython38.a。"

#: ../NEWS:34709
msgid ":issue:`35360`: Update Windows builds to use SQLite 3.28.0."
msgstr ":issue:`35360`: 更新Windows构建以使用SQLite 3.28.0。"

#: ../NEWS:34711
msgid ""
":issue:`37267`: On Windows, :func:`os.dup` no longer creates an inheritable "
"fd when handling a character file."
msgstr ":issue:`37267`: 在Windows上，:func:`os.dup` 处理字符文件时不再创建可继承的文件描述符。"

#: ../NEWS:34714
msgid ""
":issue:`36779`: Ensure ``time.tzname`` is correct on Windows when the active"
" code page is set to CP_UTF7 or CP_UTF8."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36779`: 确保在活动代码页设置为CP_UTF7或CP_UTF8时，Windows上的 ``time.tzname`` 是正确的。"

#: ../NEWS:34717
msgid ""
":issue:`32587`: Make :const:`winreg.REG_MULTI_SZ` support zero-length "
"strings."
msgstr ":issue:`32587`: 使 :const:`winreg.REG_MULTI_SZ` 支持零长度字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:34719
msgid ""
":issue:`28269`: Replace use of :c:func:`strcasecmp` for the system function "
":c:func:`!_stricmp`. Patch by Minmin Gong."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28269`: 将 :c:func:`strcasecmp` 的使用替换为系统函数 "
":c:func:`!_stricmp`。由Minmin Gong提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:34722
msgid ":issue:`36590`: Add native Bluetooth RFCOMM support to socket module."
msgstr ":issue:`36590`: 向socket模块添加原生蓝牙RFCOMM支持。"

#: ../NEWS:34727
msgid ":issue:`38117`: Updated OpenSSL to 1.1.1d in macOS installer."
msgstr ":issue:`38117`: 在macOS安装程序中更新OpenSSL至1.1.1d。"

#: ../NEWS:34729
msgid ""
":issue:`38089`: Move Azure Pipelines to latest VM versions and make macOS "
"tests optional"
msgstr ":issue:`38089`: 将Azure Pipelines迁移至最新的VM版本，并使macOS测试变为可选。"

#: ../NEWS:34732
msgid ""
":issue:`18049`: Increase the default stack size of threads from 5MB to 16MB "
"on macOS, to match the stack size of the main thread. This avoids crashes on"
" deep recursion in threads."
msgstr ""
":issue:`18049`: 在macOS上将线程的默认堆栈大小从5MB增加到16MB，以匹配主线程的堆栈大小。这避免了线程深度递归时的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:34736
msgid ""
":issue:`34602`: Avoid test suite failures on macOS by no longer calling "
"resource.setrlimit to increase the process stack size limit at runtime. The "
"runtime change is no longer needed since the interpreter is being built with"
" a larger default stack size."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34602`: "
"通过在运行时不再调用resource.setrlimit来增加进程堆栈大小限制，避免在macOS上的测试套件失败。由于解释器正在构建为更大的默认堆栈大小，运行时更改不再需要。"

#: ../NEWS:34741
msgid ":issue:`35360`: Update macOS installer to use SQLite 3.28.0."
msgstr ":issue:`35360`: 更新macOS安装程序以使用SQLite 3.28.0。"

#: ../NEWS:34743
msgid ":issue:`34631`: Updated OpenSSL to 1.1.1c in macOS installer."
msgstr ":issue:`34631`: 在macOS安装程序中更新OpenSSL至1.1.1c。"

#: ../NEWS:34748
msgid ":issue:`26353`: Stop adding newline when saving an IDLE shell window."
msgstr ":issue:`26353`: 停止在保存IDLE shell窗口时添加新行。"

#: ../NEWS:34750
msgid ""
":issue:`4630`: Add an option to toggle IDLE's cursor blink for shell, "
"editor, and output windows.  See Settings, General, Window Preferences, "
"Cursor Blink. Patch by Zackery Spytz."
msgstr ""
":issue:`4630`: 添加一个选项来切换IDLE的shell、编辑器和输出窗口的光标闪烁。参见设置、常规、窗口首选项、光标闪烁。由Zackery"
" Spytz提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:34754
msgid ":issue:`38598`: Do not try to compile IDLE shell or output windows"
msgstr ":issue:`38598`: 不尝试编译IDLE shell或输出窗口"

#: ../NEWS:34756
msgid ""
":issue:`36698`: IDLE no longer fails when write non-encodable characters to "
"stderr.  It now escapes them with a backslash, as the regular Python "
"interpreter. Added the ``errors`` field to the standard streams."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36698`: "
"IDLE在向stderr写入不可编码的字符时不再失败。现在它会像常规的Python解释器一样用反斜杠转义它们。添加了标准流的 ``errors`` "
"字段。"

#: ../NEWS:34760
msgid ""
":issue:`35379`: When exiting IDLE, catch any AttributeError.  One happens "
"when EditorWindow.close is called twice.  Printing a traceback, when IDLE is"
" run from a terminal, is useless and annoying."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35379`: "
"退出IDLE时，捕获任何AttributeError。当EditorWindow.close被调用两次时会发生一次。当IDLE从终端运行时，打印回溯是无用且烦人的。"

#: ../NEWS:34764
msgid ""
":issue:`38183`: To avoid problems, test_idle ignores the user config "
"directory. It no longer tries to create or access .idlerc or any files "
"within. Users must run IDLE to discover problems with saving settings."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38183`: "
"为避免问题，test_idle忽略用户配置目录。它不再尝试创建或访问.idlerc或其中的任何文件。用户必须运行IDLE来发现保存设置时的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:34768
msgid ""
":issue:`38077`: IDLE no longer adds 'argv' to the user namespace when "
"initializing it.  This bug only affected 3.7.4 and 3.8.0b2 to 3.8.0b4."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38077`: IDLE在初始化用户命名空间时不再添加'argv'。此错误仅影响3.7.4和3.8.0b2至3.8.0b4版本。"

#: ../NEWS:34771
msgid ""
":issue:`38041`: Shell restart lines now fill the window width, always start "
"with '=', and avoid wrapping unnecessarily. The line will still wrap if the "
"included file name is long relative to the width."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38041`: Shell重启行现在填满窗口宽度，始终以'='开头，并避免不必要的换行。如果包含的文件名相对于宽度较长，行仍会换行。"

#: ../NEWS:34775
msgid ""
":issue:`35771`: To avoid occasional spurious test_idle failures on slower "
"machines, increase the ``hover_delay`` in test_tooltip."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35771`: "
"为避免在较慢的机器上偶尔出现的虚假test_idle失败，增加test_tooltip中的``hover_delay``。"

#: ../NEWS:34778
msgid ""
":issue:`37824`: Properly handle user input warnings in IDLE shell. Cease "
"turning SyntaxWarnings into SyntaxErrors."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37824`: 正确处理IDLE shell中的用户输入警告。停止将SyntaxWarnings转为SyntaxErrors。"

#: ../NEWS:34781
msgid ""
":issue:`37929`: IDLE Settings dialog now closes properly when there is no "
"shell window."
msgstr ":issue:`37929`: 当没有shell窗口时，IDLE设置对话框现在能正确关闭。"

#: ../NEWS:34784
msgid ""
":issue:`37902`: Add mousewheel scrolling for IDLE module, path, and stack "
"browsers. Patch by George Zhang."
msgstr ":issue:`37902`: 为IDLE模块、路径和堆栈浏览器添加鼠标滚轮滚动。由George Zhang提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:34787
msgid ""
":issue:`37849`: Fixed completions list appearing too high or low when shown "
"above the current line."
msgstr ":issue:`37849`: 修复了补全列表在当前行上方显示时过高或过低的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:34790
msgid ":issue:`36419`: Refactor IDLE autocomplete and improve testing."
msgstr ":issue:`36419`: 重构IDLE自动补全并改进测试。"

#: ../NEWS:34792
msgid ""
":issue:`37748`: Reorder the Run menu.  Put the most common choice, Run "
"Module, at the top."
msgstr ":issue:`37748`: 重新排序运行菜单。将最常见的选择，运行模块，放在顶部。"

#: ../NEWS:34795
msgid ""
":issue:`37692`: Improve highlight config sample with example shell "
