"was marked for removal in 3.8, but has been delayed to 3.9; documentation "
"and ``DeprecationWarning`` clarified."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36952`: 从 Python 3.3 开始，从 :mod:`collections` 导入 ABCs 已被弃用，应从 "
":mod:`collections.abc` 导入。仍然能够从 :mod:`collections` 导入的功能原计划在 3.8 中移除，但已推迟到 "
"3.9；文档和 ``DeprecationWarning`` 已明确说明。"

#: ../NEWS:35299
msgid ":issue:`36949`: Implement __repr__ for WeakSet objects."
msgstr ":issue:`36949`: 为 WeakSet 对象实现 __repr__。"

#: ../NEWS:35301
msgid ""
":issue:`36948`: Fix :exc:`NameError` in "
":meth:`urllib.request.URLopener.retrieve`. Patch by Karthikeyan "
"Singaravelan."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36948`: 修复 :meth:`urllib.request.URLopener.retrieve` 中的 "
":exc:`NameError`。补丁由 Karthikeyan Singaravelan 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:35305
msgid ""
":issue:`33524`: Fix the folding of email header when the max_line_length is "
"0 or None and the header contains non-ascii characters.  Contributed by "
"Licht Takeuchi (@Licht-T)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33524`: 当 max_line_length 为 0 或 None 且标题包含非 ASCII 字符时，修复电子邮件标题的折叠。由 "
"Licht Takeuchi (@Licht-T) 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:35309
msgid ""
":issue:`24564`: :func:`shutil.copystat` now ignores :const:`errno.EINVAL` on"
" :func:`os.setxattr` which may occur when copying files on filesystems "
"without extended attributes support."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24564`: :func:`shutil.copystat` 现在忽略 :func:`os.setxattr` 上的 "
":const:`errno.EINVAL`，这可能在复制不支持扩展属性的文件系统上的文件时发生。"

#: ../NEWS:35313
msgid "Original patch by Giampaolo Rodola, updated by Ying Wang."
msgstr "原始由 Giampaolo Rodola 提供补丁，由 Ying Wang 更新。"

#: ../NEWS:35315
msgid ""
":issue:`36888`: Python child processes can now access the status of their "
"parent process using multiprocessing.process.parent_process"
msgstr ""
":issue:`36888`: Python 子进程现在可以使用 multiprocessing.process.parent_process "
"访问其父进程的状态。"

#: ../NEWS:35318
msgid ":issue:`36921`: Deprecate ``@coroutine`` for sake of ``async def``."
msgstr ":issue:`36921`: 弃用 ``@coroutine`` 以支持 ``async def``。"

#: ../NEWS:35320
msgid ""
":issue:`25652`: Fix bug in ``__rmod__`` of ``UserString`` - by Batuhan "
"Taskaya."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25652`: 修复 ``UserString`` 的 ``__rmod__`` 中的错误 - 由 Batuhan Taskaya "
"提供。"

#: ../NEWS:35322
msgid ""
":issue:`36916`: Remove a message about an unhandled exception in a task when"
" writer.write() is used without await and writer.drain() fails with an "
"exception."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36916`: 当 writer.write() 在没有 await 的情况下使用且 writer.drain() "
"因异常失败时，移除关于任务中未处理异常的消息。"

#: ../NEWS:35326
msgid ""
":issue:`36889`: Introduce :class:`asyncio.Stream` class that merges "
":class:`asyncio.StreamReader` and :class:`asyncio.StreamWriter` "
"functionality. :class:`asyncio.Stream` can work in readonly, writeonly and "
"readwrite modes. Provide :func:`asyncio.connect`, "
":func:`asyncio.connect_unix`, :func:`asyncio.connect_read_pipe` and "
":func:`asyncio.connect_write_pipe` factories to open :class:`asyncio.Stream`"
" connections. Provide :class:`asyncio.StreamServer` and "
":class:`UnixStreamServer` to serve servers with asyncio.Stream API. Modify "
":func:`asyncio.create_subprocess_shell` and "
":func:`asyncio.create_subprocess_exec` to use :class:`asyncio.Stream` "
"instead of deprecated :class:`StreamReader` and :class:`StreamWriter`. "
"Deprecate :class:`asyncio.StreamReader` and :class:`asyncio.StreamWriter`. "
"Deprecate usage of private classes, e.g. :class:`asyncio.FlowControlMixing` "
"and :class:`asyncio.StreamReaderProtocol` outside of asyncio package."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36889`: 引入 :class:`asyncio.Stream` 类，合并了 "
":class:`asyncio.StreamReader` 和 :class:`asyncio.StreamWriter` "
"的功能。:class:`asyncio.Stream` 可以在只读、只写和读写模式下工作。提供 "
":func:`asyncio.connect`、:func:`asyncio.connect_unix`、:func:`asyncio.connect_read_pipe`"
" 和 :func:`asyncio.connect_write_pipe` 工厂函数来打开 :class:`asyncio.Stream` 连接。提供 "
":class:`asyncio.StreamServer` 和 :class:`UnixStreamServer` 来使用 asyncio.Stream"
" API 服务服务器。修改 :func:`asyncio.create_subprocess_shell` 和 "
":func:`asyncio.create_subprocess_exec` 以使用 :class:`asyncio.Stream` 替代已弃用的 "
":class:`StreamReader` 和 :class:`StreamWriter`。弃用 "
":class:`asyncio.StreamReader` 和 :class:`asyncio.StreamWriter`。弃用在 asyncio "
"包之外使用私有类，例如 :class:`asyncio.FlowControlMixing` 和 "
":class:`asyncio.StreamReaderProtocol`。"

#: ../NEWS:35342
msgid ""
":issue:`36845`: Added validation of integer prefixes to the construction of "
"IP networks and interfaces in the ipaddress module."
msgstr ":issue:`36845`: 在 ipaddress 模块中增加了对 IP 网络和接口构造时的整数前缀的验证。"

#: ../NEWS:35345
msgid ":issue:`23378`: Add an extend action to argparser."
msgstr ":issue:`23378`: 向 argparser 添加了一个扩展动作。"

#: ../NEWS:35347
msgid ""
":issue:`36867`: Fix a bug making a SharedMemoryManager instance and its "
"parent process use two separate resource_tracker processes."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36867`: 修复了一个错误，该错误使得 SharedMemoryManager 实例及其父进程使用两个独立的 "
"resource_tracker 进程。"

#: ../NEWS:35350
msgid ""
":issue:`23896`: Adds a grammar to lib2to3.pygram that contains exec as a "
"function not as statement."
msgstr ":issue:`23896`: 向 lib2to3.pygram 添加了一个语法，其中包含作为函数而非语句的 exec。"

#: ../NEWS:35353
msgid ""
":issue:`36895`: The function ``time.clock()`` was deprecated in 3.3 in favor"
" of ``time.perf_counter()`` and marked for removal in 3.8, it has removed."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36895`: 函数 ``time.clock()`` 在 3.3 版本中被弃用，推荐使用 "
"``time.perf_counter()``，并在 3.8 版本中标记为移除，现已被移除。"

#: ../NEWS:35356
msgid ""
":issue:`35545`: Fix asyncio discarding IPv6 scopes when ensuring hostname "
"resolutions internally"
msgstr ":issue:`35545`: 修复 asyncio 在内部确保主机名解析时丢弃 IPv6 范围的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:35359
msgid ""
":issue:`36887`: Add new function :func:`math.isqrt` to compute integer "
"square roots."
msgstr ":issue:`36887`: 添加新函数 :func:`math.isqrt` 来计算整数平方根。"

#: ../NEWS:35362
msgid ""
":issue:`34632`: Introduce the ``importlib.metadata`` module with "
"(provisional) support for reading metadata from third-party packages."
msgstr ":issue:`34632`: 引入 ``importlib.metadata`` 模块，提供（临时）支持从第三方包读取元数据。"

#: ../NEWS:35365
msgid ""
":issue:`36878`: When using ``type_comments=True`` in ``ast.parse``, treat "
"``# type: ignore`` followed by a non-alphanumeric character and then "
"arbitrary text as a type ignore, instead of requiring nothing but whitespace"
" or another comment. This is to permit formations such as ``# type: "
"ignore[E1000]``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36878`: 当在 ``ast.parse`` 中使用 ``type_comments=True`` 时，将 ``# type: "
"ignore`` 后跟非字母数字字符和任意文本的情况视为类型忽略，而不是仅允许空白或其他注释。这是为了允许像 ``# type: "
"ignore[E1000]`` 这样的形式。"

#: ../NEWS:35371
msgid ""
":issue:`36778`: ``cp65001`` encoding (Windows code page 65001) becomes an "
"alias to ``utf_8`` encoding."
msgstr ":issue:`36778`: ``cp65001`` 编码（Windows 代码页 65001）成为 ``utf_8`` 编码的别名。"

#: ../NEWS:35374
msgid ""
":issue:`36867`: The multiprocessing.resource_tracker replaces the "
"multiprocessing.semaphore_tracker module. Other than semaphores, "
"resource_tracker also tracks shared_memory segments."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36867`: multiprocessing.resource_tracker 替换了 "
"multiprocessing.semaphore_tracker 模块。除了信号量，resource_tracker 还跟踪 "
"shared_memory 段。"

#: ../NEWS:35378
msgid ""
":issue:`30262`: The ``Cache`` and ``Statement`` objects of the "
":mod:`sqlite3` module are not exposed to the user.  Patch by Aviv Palivoda."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30262`: :mod:`sqlite3` 模块的 ``Cache`` 和 ``Statement`` 对象不向用户公开。由 Aviv"
" Palivoda 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:35381
msgid ""
":issue:`24538`: In ``shutil.copystat()``, first copy extended file "
"attributes and then file permissions, since extended attributes can only be "
"set on the destination while it is still writeable."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24538`: 在 ``shutil.copystat()`` "
"中，首先复制扩展文件属性，然后复制文件权限，因为扩展属性只能在目标仍然可写时设置。"

#: ../NEWS:35385
msgid ""
":issue:`36829`: Add new :func:`sys.unraisablehook` function which can be "
"overridden to control how \"unraisable exceptions\" are handled. It is "
"called when an exception has occurred but there is no way for Python to "
"handle it. For example, when a destructor raises an exception or during "
"garbage collection (:func:`gc.collect`)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36829`: 新增 :func:`sys.unraisablehook` 函数，可被重写以控制如何处理“无法处理的异常”。当异常发生但"
" Python 无法处理时调用该函数。例如，当析构函数引发异常或垃圾回收期间（:func:`gc.collect`）。"

#: ../NEWS:35391
msgid ""
":issue:`36832`: Introducing ``zipfile.Path``, a pathlib-compatible wrapper "
"for traversing zip files."
msgstr ":issue:`36832`: 引入 ``zipfile.Path``，一个兼容 pathlib 的包装器，用于遍历 zip 文件。"

#: ../NEWS:35394
msgid ""
":issue:`36814`: Fix an issue where os.posix_spawnp() would incorrectly raise"
" a TypeError when file_actions is None."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36814`: 修复 os.posix_spawnp() 在 file_actions 为 None 时错误地引发 TypeError "
"的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:35397
msgid ""
":issue:`33110`: Handle exceptions raised by functions added by "
"concurrent.futures add_done_callback correctly when the Future has already "
"completed."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33110`: 当 Future 已经完成时，正确处理由 concurrent.futures 的 add_done_callback "
"添加的函数引发的异常。"

#: ../NEWS:35401
msgid ""
":issue:`26903`: Limit ``max_workers`` in ``ProcessPoolExecutor`` to 61 to "
"work around a WaitForMultipleObjects limitation."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26903`: 将 ``ProcessPoolExecutor`` 中的 ``max_workers`` 限制为 61，以绕过 "
"WaitForMultipleObjects 的限制。"

#: ../NEWS:35404
msgid ""
":issue:`36813`: Fix :class:`~logging.handlers.QueueListener` to call "
"``queue.task_done()`` upon stopping. Patch by Bar Harel."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36813`: 修复 :class:`~logging.handlers.QueueListener` 在停止时调用 "
"``queue.task_done()`` 的问题。由 Bar Harel 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:35407
msgid ""
":issue:`36806`: Forbid creation of asyncio stream objects like StreamReader,"
" StreamWriter, Process, and their protocols outside of asyncio package."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36806`: "
"禁止在asyncio包之外创建像StreamReader、StreamWriter、Process这样的异步流对象及其协议。"

#: ../NEWS:35410
msgid ""
":issue:`36802`: Provide both sync and async calls for StreamWriter.write() "
"and StreamWriter.close()"
msgstr ":issue:`36802`: 为StreamWriter.write()和StreamWriter.close()提供同步和异步调用。"

#: ../NEWS:35413
msgid ""
":issue:`36801`: Properly handle SSL connection closing in asyncio "
"StreamWriter.drain() call."
msgstr ":issue:`36801`: 在asyncio StreamWriter.drain()调用中正确处理SSL连接的关闭。"

#: ../NEWS:35416
msgid ""
":issue:`36785`: Implement PEP 574 (pickle protocol 5 with out-of-band "
"buffers)."
msgstr ":issue:`36785`: 实现PEP 574（带有带外缓冲区的pickle协议5）。"

#: ../NEWS:35418
msgid ""
":issue:`36772`: functools.lru_cache() can now be used as a straight "
"decorator in addition to its existing usage as a function that returns a "
"decorator."
msgstr ":issue:`36772`: functools.lru_cache()现在可以直接用作装饰器，除了它现有的作为返回装饰器的函数的用法。"

#: ../NEWS:35421
msgid ""
":issue:`6584`: Add a :exc:`~gzip.BadGzipFile` exception to the :mod:`gzip` "
"module."
msgstr ":issue:`6584`: 在 :mod:`gzip` 模块中添加一个 :exc:`~gzip.BadGzipFile` 异常。"

#: ../NEWS:35424
msgid ""
":issue:`36748`: Optimized write buffering in C implementation of "
"``TextIOWrapper``. Writing ASCII string to ``TextIOWrapper`` with ascii, "
"latin1, or utf-8 encoding is about 20% faster.  Patch by Inada Naoki."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36748`: 在 ``TextIOWrapper`` "
"的C实现中优化了写缓冲。使用ascii、latin1或utf-8编码向``TextIOWrapper``写入ASCII字符串的速度提高了约20%。由Inada"
" Naoki提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:35428
msgid ""
":issue:`8138`: Don't mark ``wsgiref.simple_server.SimpleServer`` as multi-"
"threaded since ``wsgiref.simple_server.WSGIServer`` is single-threaded."
msgstr ""
":issue:`8138`: 不要将 ``wsgiref.simple_server.SimpleServer`` "
"标记为多线程，因为``wsgiref.simple_server.WSGIServer``是单线程的。"

#: ../NEWS:35432
msgid ""
":issue:`22640`: :func:`py_compile.compile` now supports silent mode. Patch "
"by Joannah Nanjekye"
msgstr ""
":issue:`22640`: :func:`py_compile.compile` 现在支持静默模式。由Joannah Nanjekye提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:35435
msgid ""
":issue:`29183`: Fix double exceptions in "
":class:`wsgiref.handlers.BaseHandler` by calling its "
":meth:`~wsgiref.handlers.BaseHandler.close` method only when no exception is"
" raised."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29183`: 通过仅在未引发异常时调用 :meth:`~wsgiref.handlers.BaseHandler.close` "
"方法，修复了 :class:`wsgiref.handlers.BaseHandler` 中的双重异常。"

#: ../NEWS:35439
msgid ":issue:`36548`: Improved the repr of regular expression flags."
msgstr ":issue:`36548`: 改进了正则表达式标志的repr。"

#: ../NEWS:35441
msgid ""
":issue:`36542`: The signature of Python functions can now be overridden by "
"specifying the ``__text_signature__`` attribute."
msgstr ":issue:`36542`: 现在可以通过指定 ``__text_signature__`` 属性来覆盖Python函数的签名。"

#: ../NEWS:35444
msgid ""
":issue:`36533`: Reinitialize logging.Handler locks in forked child processes"
" instead of attempting to acquire them all in the parent before forking only"
" to be released in the child process.  The acquire/release pattern was "
"leading to deadlocks in code that has implemented any form of chained "
"logging handlers that depend upon one another as the lock acquisition order "
"cannot be guaranteed."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36533`: "
"在fork的子进程中重新初始化logging.Handler锁，而不是尝试在父进程中获取所有锁，仅在子进程中释放。获取/释放模式导致在实现了任何形式的相互依赖的链式日志处理程序的代码中出现死锁，因为无法保证锁的获取顺序。"

#: ../NEWS:35451
msgid ""
":issue:`35252`: Throw a TypeError instead of an AssertionError when using an"
" invalid type annotation with singledispatch."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35252`: 当使用singledispatch时，如果类型注释无效，抛出TypeError而不是AssertionError。"

#: ../NEWS:35454
msgid ""
":issue:`35900`: Allow reduction methods to return a 6-item tuple where the "
"6th item specifies a custom state-setting method that's called instead of "
"the regular ``__setstate__`` method."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35900`: 允许缩减方法返回一个6项元组，其中第6项指定一个自定义的状态设置方法，该方法将被调用以替代常规的 "
"``__setstate__`` 方法。"

#: ../NEWS:35458
msgid ""
":issue:`35900`: enable custom reduction callback registration for functions "
"and classes in _pickle.c, using the new Pickler's attribute "
"``reducer_override``"
msgstr ""
":issue:`35900`: "
"在_pickle.c中为函数和类启用自定义缩减回调注册，使用新的Pickler属性``reducer_override``"

#: ../NEWS:35462
msgid ""
":issue:`36368`: Fix a bug crashing SharedMemoryManager instances in "
"interactive sessions after a ctrl-c (KeyboardInterrupt) was sent"
msgstr ""
":issue:`36368`: "
"修复在交互式会话中发送ctrl-c（KeyboardInterrupt）后导致SharedMemoryManager实例崩溃的错误"

#: ../NEWS:35465
msgid ":issue:`31904`: Fix mmap fail for VxWorks"
msgstr ":issue:`31904`: 修复VxWorks的mmap失败问题"

#: ../NEWS:35467
msgid ""
":issue:`27497`: :meth:`csv.DictWriter.writeheader` now returns the return "
"value of the underlying :meth:`csv.Writer.writerow` method. Patch "
"contributed by Ashish Nitin Patil."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27497`: :meth:`csv.DictWriter.writeheader` 现在返回底层 "
