#: ../NEWS:35759
msgid ""
":issue:`30458`: Address :cve:`2019-9740` by disallowing URL paths with "
"embedded whitespace or control characters through into the underlying http "
"client request.  Such potentially malicious header injection URLs now cause "
"an http.client.InvalidURL exception to be raised."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30458`: 通过不允许带有嵌入空格或控制字符的URL路径进入底层http客户端请求来解决 "
":cve:`2019-9740`。此类潜在的恶意头部注入URL现在会导致抛出http.client.InvalidURL异常。"

#: ../NEWS:35764
msgid ""
":issue:`35755`: :func:`shutil.which` now uses ``os.confstr(\"CS_PATH\")`` if"
" available and if the :envvar:`PATH` environment variable is not set. Remove"
" also the current directory from :data:`posixpath.defpath`. On Unix, "
":func:`shutil.which` and the :mod:`subprocess` module no longer search the "
"executable in the current directory if the :envvar:`PATH` environment "
"variable is not set."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35755`: :func:`shutil.which` 现在如果可用且 :envvar:`PATH` 环境变量未设置时，会使用 "
"``os.confstr(\"CS_PATH\")``。同时从 :data:`posixpath.defpath` 中移除当前目录。在 Unix "
"上，如果 :envvar:`PATH` 环境变量未设置，:func:`shutil.which` 和 :mod:`subprocess` "
"模块不再在当前目录中搜索可执行文件。"

#: ../NEWS:35774
msgid ""
":issue:`36722`: In debug build, import now also looks for C extensions "
"compiled in release mode and for C extensions compiled in the stable ABI."
msgstr ":issue:`36722`: 在调试构建中，导入现在也会查找以发布模式编译的 C 扩展和以稳定 ABI 编译的 C 扩展。"

#: ../NEWS:35777
msgid ""
":issue:`32849`: Fix Python Initialization code on FreeBSD to detect properly"
" when stdin file descriptor (fd 0) is invalid."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32849`: 修复 FreeBSD 上的 Python 初始化代码，以正确检测 stdin 文件描述符（fd 0）何时无效。"

#: ../NEWS:35780
msgid ""
":issue:`36623`: Remove parser headers and related function declarations that"
" lack implementations after the removal of pgen."
msgstr ":issue:`36623`: 移除解析器头部和移除 pgen 后缺乏实现的函数声明。"

#: ../NEWS:35783
msgid ""
":issue:`20180`: ``dict.pop()`` is now up to 33% faster thanks to Argument "
"Clinic. Patch by Inada Naoki."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20180`: 由于 Argument Clinic 的贡献，``dict.pop()`` 现在快了 33%。由 Inada Naoki"
" 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:35786
msgid ""
":issue:`36611`: Debug memory allocators: disable serialno field by default "
"from debug hooks on Python memory allocators to reduce the memory footprint "
"by 5%. Enable :mod:`tracemalloc` to get the traceback where a memory block "
"has been allocated when a fatal memory error is logged to decide where to "
"put a breakpoint. Compile Python with ``PYMEM_DEBUG_SERIALNO`` defined to "
"get back the field."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36611`: 调试内存分配器：默认从 Python 内存分配器的调试钩子中禁用 serialno 字段，以减少内存占用 "
"5%。当记录致命内存错误时，启用 :mod:`tracemalloc` 以获取内存块分配的跟踪信息，以决定在哪里放置断点。编译 Python 时定义 "
"``PYMEM_DEBUG_SERIALNO`` 以恢复该字段。"

#: ../NEWS:35793
msgid ""
":issue:`36588`: On AIX, :data:`sys.platform` doesn't contain the major "
"version anymore. Always return ``'aix'``, instead of ``'aix3'`` .. "
"``'aix7'``. Since older Python versions include the version number, it is "
"recommended to always use ``sys.platform.startswith('aix')``. Contributed by"
" M. Felt."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36588`: 在 AIX 上，:data:`sys.platform` 不再包含主版本号。总是返回 ``'aix'``，而不是 "
"``'aix3'`` .. ``'aix7'``。由于旧的 Python 版本包含版本号，建议总是使用 "
"``sys.platform.startswith('aix')``。由 M. Felt 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:35798
msgid ""
":issue:`36549`: Change str.capitalize to use titlecase for the first "
"character instead of uppercase."
msgstr ":issue:`36549`: 将 str.capitalize 改为对第一个字符使用标题大小写而不是大写。"

#: ../NEWS:35801
msgid ""
":issue:`36540`: Implement :pep:`570` (Python positional-only parameters). "
"Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":issue:`36540`: 实现 :pep:`570` (Python 位置参数) 。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:35804
msgid ""
":issue:`36475`: :c:func:`!PyEval_AcquireLock` and "
":c:func:`!PyEval_AcquireThread` now terminate the current thread if called "
"while the interpreter is finalizing, making them consistent with "
":c:func:`PyEval_RestoreThread`, :c:func:`Py_END_ALLOW_THREADS`, and "
":c:func:`PyGILState_Ensure`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36475`: :c:func:`!PyEval_AcquireLock` 和 "
":c:func:`!PyEval_AcquireThread` 现在如果解释器正在终止时被调用，将终止当前线程，使其与 "
":c:func:`PyEval_RestoreThread`、:c:func:`Py_END_ALLOW_THREADS` 和 "
":c:func:`PyGILState_Ensure` 保持一致。"

#: ../NEWS:35810
msgid ""
":issue:`36504`: Fix signed integer overflow in _ctypes.c's "
"``PyCArrayType_new()``."
msgstr ":issue:`36504`: 修复了 _ctypes.c 中 ``PyCArrayType_new()`` 的有符号整数溢出问题。"

#: ../NEWS:35813
msgid ""
":issue:`20844`: Fix running script with encoding cookie and LF line ending "
"may fail on Windows."
msgstr ":issue:`20844`: 修复了在 Windows 上运行带有编码 cookie 和 LF 行结尾的脚本可能失败的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:35816
msgid ""
":issue:`24214`: Fixed support of the surrogatepass error handler in the "
"UTF-8 incremental decoder."
msgstr ":issue:`24214`: 修复了 UTF-8 增量解码器中 surrogatpass 错误处理程序的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:35819
msgid ""
":issue:`36452`: Changing ``dict`` keys during iteration of the dict itself, "
"``keys()``, ``values()``, or ``items()`` will now be detected in certain "
"corner cases where keys are deleted/added so that the number of keys isn't "
"changed. A ``RuntimeError`` will be raised after ``len(dict)`` iterations. "
"Contributed by Thomas Perl."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36452`: 在迭代字典自身、``keys()``、``values()`` 或 ``items()`` 时更改 ``dict`` "
"键，现在在某些键被删除/添加的情况下会被检测到，因此键的数量没有改变。在 ``len(dict)`` 次迭代后将引发 "
"``RuntimeError``。由 Thomas Perl 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:35825
msgid ""
":issue:`36459`: Fix a possible double ``PyMem_FREE()`` due to tokenizer.c's "
"``tok_nextc()``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36459`: 修复了 tokenizer.c 的 ``tok_nextc()`` 可能导致的双重 ``PyMem_FREE()`` "
"问题。"

#: ../NEWS:35828
msgid ":issue:`36433`: Fixed TypeError message in classmethoddescr_call."
msgstr ":issue:`36433`: 修复了 classmethoddescr_call 中的 TypeError 消息。"

#: ../NEWS:35830
msgid ""
":issue:`36430`: Fix a possible reference leak in :func:`itertools.count`."
msgstr ":issue:`36430`: 修复了 :func:`itertools.count` 中可能存在的引用泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:35832
msgid ""
":issue:`36440`: Include node names in ``ParserError`` messages, instead of "
"numeric IDs. Patch by A. Skrobov."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36440`: 在 ``ParserError`` 消息中包含节点名称，而不是数字 ID。由 A. Skrobov 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:35835
msgid ""
":issue:`36143`: Regenerate :mod:`keyword` from the Grammar and Tokens file "
"using pgen. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36143`: 使用 pgen 从 Grammar 和 Tokens 文件重新生成 :mod:`keyword`。由 Pablo "
"Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:35838
msgid ""
":issue:`18372`: Add missing :c:func:`PyObject_GC_Track` calls in the "
":mod:`pickle` module. Patch by Zackery Spytz."
msgstr ""
":issue:`18372`: 在 :mod:`pickle` 模块中添加缺失的 :c:func:`PyObject_GC_Track` 调用。由 "
"Zackery Spytz 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:35844
msgid ":issue:`35952`: Fix pythoninfo when the compiler is missing."
msgstr ":issue:`35952`: 修复了当编译器缺失时的 pythoninfo。"

#: ../NEWS:35846
msgid ""
":issue:`28238`: The ``.find*()`` methods of xml.etree.ElementTree can now "
"search for wildcards like ``{*}tag`` and ``{ns}*`` that match a tag in any "
"namespace or all tags in a namespace.  Patch by Stefan Behnel."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28238`: xml.etree.ElementTree 的 ``.find*()`` 方法现在可以搜索像 ``{*}tag`` 和 "
"``{ns}*`` 这样的通配符，它们可以匹配任何命名空间中的标签或命名空间中的所有标签。由 Stefan Behnel 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:35850
msgid ""
":issue:`26978`: ``pathlib.path.link_to()`` is now implemented. It creates a "
"hard link pointing to a path."
msgstr ":issue:`26978`: ``pathlib.path.link_to()`` 现在已实现。它创建一个指向路径的硬链接。"

#: ../NEWS:35853
msgid ""
":issue:`1613500`: :class:`fileinput.FileInput` now uses the input file mode "
"to correctly set the output file mode (previously it was hardcoded to "
"``'w'``)  when ``inplace=True`` is passed to its constructor."
msgstr ""
":issue:`1613500`: 当向构造函数传递 ``inplace=True`` 时，:class:`fileinput.FileInput` "
"现在使用输入文件模式来正确设置输出文件模式（之前是硬编码为 ``'w'``）。"

#: ../NEWS:35857
msgid ""
":issue:`36734`: Fix compilation of ``faulthandler.c`` on HP-UX. Initialize "
"``stack_t current_stack`` to zero using ``memset()``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36734`: 修复在 HP-UX 上编译 ``faulthandler.c`` 的问题。使用 ``memset()`` 将 "
"``stack_t current_stack`` 初始化为零。"

#: ../NEWS:35860
msgid ""
":issue:`13611`: The xml.etree.ElementTree packages gained support for C14N "
"2.0 serialisation. Patch by Stefan Behnel."
msgstr ""
":issue:`13611`: xml.etree.ElementTree 包增加了对 C14N 2.0 序列化的支持。由 Stefan Behnel "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:35863
msgid ""
":issue:`36669`: Add missing matrix multiplication operator support to "
"weakref.proxy."
msgstr ":issue:`36669`: 向 weakref.proxy 添加缺失的矩阵乘法运算符支持。"

#: ../NEWS:35866
msgid ""
":issue:`36676`: The XMLParser() in xml.etree.ElementTree provides namespace "
"prefix context to the parser target if it defines the callback methods "
"\"start_ns()\" and/or \"end_ns()\". Patch by Stefan Behnel."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36676`: 如果解析器目标定义了回调方法 \"start_ns()\" 和/或 "
"\"end_ns()\"，xml.etree.ElementTree 中的 XMLParser() 会向解析器目标提供命名空间前缀上下文。由 "
"Stefan Behnel 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:35870
msgid ""
":issue:`36673`: The TreeBuilder and XMLPullParser in xml.etree.ElementTree "
"gained support for parsing comments and processing instructions. Patch by "
"Stefan Behnel."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36673`: xml.etree.ElementTree 中的 TreeBuilder 和 XMLPullParser "
"增加了对解析注释和处理指令的支持。由 Stefan Behnel 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:35874
msgid ""
":issue:`36650`: The C version of functools.lru_cache() was treating calls "
"with an empty ``**kwargs`` dictionary as being distinct from calls with no "
"keywords at all. This did not result in an incorrect answer, but it did "
"trigger an unexpected cache miss."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36650`: functools.lru_cache() 的 C 版本将带有空 ``**kwargs`` "
"字典的调用视为与完全没有关键字的调用不同。这不会导致错误的答案，但确实会触发意外的缓存未命中。"

#: ../NEWS:35879
msgid ""
":issue:`28552`: Fix ``distutils.sysconfig`` if :data:`sys.executable` is "
"``None`` or an empty string: use :func:`os.getcwd` to initialize "
"``project_base``.  Fix also the distutils build command: don't use "
":data:`sys.executable` if it is ``None`` or an empty string."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28552`: 如果 :data:`sys.executable` 为 ``None`` 或空字符串，修复 "
"``distutils.sysconfig``：使用 :func:`os.getcwd` 来初始化 ``project_base``。同时修复 "
"distutils build 命令：如果 :data:`sys.executable` 为 ``None`` 或空字符串，则不使用它。"

#: ../NEWS:35884
msgid ""
":issue:`35755`: :func:`shutil.which` and ``distutils.spawn.find_executable``"
" now use ``os.confstr(\"CS_PATH\")`` if available instead of "
":data:`os.defpath`, if the ``PATH`` environment variable is not set. "
"Moreover, don't use ``os.confstr(\"CS_PATH\")`` nor :data:`os.defpath` if "
"the ``PATH`` environment variable is set to an empty string."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35755`: 如果 ``PATH`` 环境变量未设置，:func:`shutil.which` 和 "
"``distutils.spawn.find_executable`` 现在使用 ``os.confstr(\"CS_PATH\")`` (如果可用) "
"代替 :data:`os.defpath`。此外，如果 ``PATH`` 环境变量设置为空字符串，则不使用 "
"``os.confstr(\"CS_PATH\")`` 或 :data:`os.defpath`。"

#: ../NEWS:35890
msgid ":issue:`25430`: improve performance of ``IPNetwork.__contains__()``"
msgstr ":issue:`25430`: 提高 ``IPNetwork.__contains__()`` 的性能。"

#: ../NEWS:35892
msgid ""
":issue:`30485`: Path expressions in xml.etree.ElementTree can now avoid "
"explicit namespace prefixes for tags (or the \"{namespace}tag\" notation) by"
" passing a default namespace with an empty string prefix."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30485`: "
"xml.etree.ElementTree中的路径表达式现在可以通过传递一个空字符串前缀的默认命名空间，避免为标签使用显式的命名空间前缀（或“{命名空间}标签”符号）。"

#: ../NEWS:35896
msgid ""
":issue:`36613`: Fix :mod:`asyncio` wait() not removing callback if exception"
msgstr ":issue:`36613`: 修复 :mod:`asyncio` wait()在异常情况下不删除回调的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:35898
msgid ""
":issue:`36598`: Fix ``isinstance`` check for Mock objects with spec when the"
" code is executed under tracing. Patch by Karthikeyan Singaravelan."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36598`: 修复当代码在追踪下执行时，Mock对象与spec的 ``isinstance`` 检查。由Karthikeyan "
"Singaravelan提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:35901
msgid ""
":issue:`18748`: In development mode (:option:`-X` ``dev``) and in debug "
"build, the :class:`io.IOBase` destructor now logs ``close()`` exceptions. "
"These exceptions are silent by default in release mode."
msgstr ""
":issue:`18748`: 在开发模式(:option:`-X` ``dev``)和调试版本中，:class:`io.IOBase` "
"析构函数现在会记录 ``close()`` 异常。在发布模式下，这些异常默认是静默的。"

#: ../NEWS:35905
msgid ""
":issue:`36575`: The ``_lsprof`` module now uses internal timer same to "
"``time.perf_counter()`` by default. ``gettimeofday(2)`` was used on Unix. "
"New timer has better resolution on most Unix platforms and timings are no "
"longer impacted by system clock updates since ``perf_counter()`` is "
"monotonic. Patch by Inada Naoki."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36575`: ``_lsprof`` 模块现在默认使用与 ``time.perf_counter()`` "
"相同的内部计时器。Unix上以前使用 "
"``gettimeofday(2)``。新计时器在大多数Unix平台上具有更好的分辨率，并且由于``perf_counter()``是单调的，计时不再受系统时钟更新的影响。由Inada"
" Naoki提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:35911
msgid ""
":issue:`33461`: ``json.loads`` now emits ``DeprecationWarning`` when "
"``encoding`` option is specified.  Patch by Matthias Bussonnier."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33461`: 当指定 ``encoding`` 选项时，``json.loads`` 现在会发出 "
"``DeprecationWarning``。由Matthias Bussonnier提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:35914
msgid ""
":issue:`36559`: The random module now prefers the lean internal _sha512 "
"module over hashlib for seed(version=2) to optimize import time."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36559`: "
"为了优化导入时间，random模块现在在seed(version=2)时更倾向于使用精简的内部_sha512模块，而不是hashlib。"

#: ../NEWS:35917
msgid ""
":issue:`17561`: Set backlog=None as the default for socket.create_server."
msgstr ":issue:`17561`: 将backlog=None设置为socket.create_server的默认值。"

#: ../NEWS:35919
msgid ""
":issue:`34373`: Fix :func:`time.mktime` error handling on AIX for year "
"before 1970."
msgstr ":issue:`34373`: 修复 :func:`time.mktime` 在AIX上对1970年之前年份的错误处理。"

#: ../NEWS:35922
msgid ""
":issue:`36232`: Improve error message when trying to open existing DBM "
"database that actually doesn't exist. Patch by Marco Rougeth."
msgstr ":issue:`36232`: 当尝试打开实际上不存在的现有DBM数据库时，改进错误消息。由Marco Rougeth提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:35925
msgid ":issue:`36546`: Add statistics.quantiles()"
msgstr ":issue:`36546`: 添加statistics.quantiles()"

#: ../NEWS:35927
msgid ""
":issue:`36050`: Optimized ``http.client.HTTPResponse.read()`` for large "
"response. Patch by Inada Naoki."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36050`: 优化 ``http.client.HTTPResponse.read()`` 以处理大响应。补丁由Inada "
"Naoki提供。"

#: ../NEWS:35930
msgid ""
":issue:`36522`: If *debuglevel* is set to >0 in :mod:`http.client`, print "
"all values for headers with multiple values for the same header name. Patch "
"by Matt Houglum."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36522`: 如果在 :mod:`http.client` 中 *debuglevel* "
"设置为>0，打印同一头部名称下多个值的所有值。由Matt Houglum提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:35934
msgid ""
":issue:`36492`: Deprecated passing required arguments like *func* as keyword"
" arguments in functions which should accept arbitrary keyword arguments and "
"pass them to other function. Arbitrary keyword arguments (even with names "
"\"self\" and \"func\") can now be passed to these functions if the required "
"arguments are passed as positional arguments."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36492`: 弃用在应接受任意关键字参数并将其传递给其他函数的函数中，将必需参数（如 "
"*func*）作为关键字参数传递的做法。现在，如果必需参数作为位置参数传递，则可以向这些函数传递任意关键字参数（即使名称是\"self\"和\"func\"）。"

#: ../NEWS:35940
msgid ":issue:`27181`: Add statistics.geometric_mean()."
msgstr ":issue:`27181`: 添加 statistics.geometric_mean()。"

#: ../NEWS:35942
msgid ""
":issue:`30427`: ``os.path.normcase()`` relies on ``os.fspath()`` to check "
"the type of its argument. Redundant checks have been removed from its "
"``posixpath.normcase()`` and ``ntpath.normcase()`` implementations. Patch by"
" Wolfgang Maier."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30427`: ``os.path.normcase()`` 依赖 ``os.fspath()`` 来检查其参数的类型。其 "
"``posixpath.normcase()`` 和 ``ntpath.normcase()`` 实现中的冗余检查已被移除。由 Wolfgang "
"Maier 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:35947
msgid ""
":issue:`36385`: Stop rejecting IPv4 octets for being ambiguously octal. "
"Leading zeros are ignored, and no longer are assumed to specify octal "
"octets. Octets are always decimal numbers. Octets must still be no more than"
" three digits, including leading zeroes."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36385`: "
"停止因IPv4八位组可能为八进制而拒绝它们。前导零被忽略，不再假定为指定八进制八位组。八位组始终是十进制数字。八位组仍必须不超过三位数字，包括前导零。"

#: ../NEWS:35952
msgid ""
":issue:`36434`: Errors during writing to a ZIP file no longer prevent to "
"properly close it."
msgstr ":issue:`36434`: 写入ZIP文件时的错误不再阻止其正确关闭。"

#: ../NEWS:35955
msgid ""
":issue:`36407`: Fixed wrong indentation writing for CDATA section in "
"xml.dom.minidom. Patch by Vladimir Surjaninov."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36407`: 修复了xml.dom.minidom中CDATA部分写入时的错误缩进。由Vladimir Surjaninov提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:35958
msgid ""
":issue:`36326`: inspect.getdoc() can now find docstrings for member objects "
"when __slots__ is a dictionary."
msgstr ":issue:`36326`: inspect.getdoc()现在可以在__slots__是字典时为成员对象找到文档字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:35961
msgid ""
":issue:`36366`: Calling ``stop()`` on an unstarted or stopped "
":func:`unittest.mock.patch` object will now return ``None`` instead of "
"raising :exc:`RuntimeError`, making the method idempotent. Patch by "
"Karthikeyan Singaravelan."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36366`: 在未启动或已停止的 :func:`unittest.mock.patch` 对象上调用 ``stop()`` 现在会返回"
" ``None`` 而不是引发 :exc:`RuntimeError`，使该方法幂等。补丁由Karthikeyan Singaravelan提供。"

#: ../NEWS:35966
msgid ""
":issue:`36348`: The :meth:`imap.IMAP4.logout` method no longer ignores "
"silently arbitrary exceptions."
msgstr ":issue:`36348`: :meth:`imap.IMAP4.logout` 方法不再静默忽略任意异常。"

#: ../NEWS:35969
msgid ""
":issue:`31904`: Add time module support and fix test_time failures for "
"VxWorks."
msgstr ":issue:`31904`: 为VxWorks添加时间模块支持并修复test_time失败。"

#: ../NEWS:35971
msgid ""
":issue:`36227`: Added support for keyword arguments ``default_namespace`` "
"and ``xml_declaration`` in functions ``ElementTree.tostring()`` and "
"``ElementTree.tostringlist()``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36227`: 在函数 ``ElementTree.tostring()`` 和 "
"``ElementTree.tostringlist()`` 中添加了对关键字参数 ``default_namespace`` 和 "
"``xml_declaration`` 的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:35975
msgid ""
":issue:`36004`: Added new alternate constructors "
":meth:`datetime.date.fromisocalendar` and "
":meth:`datetime.datetime.fromisocalendar`, which construct date objects from"
" ISO year, week number and weekday; these are the inverse of each class's "
"``isocalendar`` method. Patch by Paul Ganssle."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36004`: 新增了替代构造函数 :meth:`datetime.date.fromisocalendar` 和 "
":meth:`datetime.datetime.fromisocalendar`，这些函数可以从ISO年、周数和工作日构建日期对象；这些是每个类的 "
"``isocalendar`` 方法的逆操作。由Paul Ganssle提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:35981
msgid ""
