#: ../NEWS:36611
msgid "Python 3.8.0 alpha 2"
msgstr "Python 3.8.0 alpha 2"

#: ../NEWS:36613
msgid "*Release date: 2019-02-25*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2019-02-25*"

#: ../NEWS:36618
msgid ""
":issue:`36052`: Raise a :exc:`SyntaxError` when assigning a value to "
"``__debug__`` with the Assignment Operator. Contributed by Stéphane Wirtel "
"and Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36052`: 当使用赋值运算符给 ``__debug__`` 赋值时，抛出 :exc:`SyntaxError`。由 Stéphane"
" Wirtel 和 Pablo Galindo 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:36622
msgid ""
":issue:`36012`: Doubled the speed of class variable writes.  When a non-"
"dunder attribute was updated, there was an unnecessary call to update slots."
msgstr ":issue:`36012`: 类变量写入速度提高了一倍。当更新非双下划线属性时，减少了一次不必要的更新槽的调用。"

#: ../NEWS:36625
msgid ""
":issue:`35942`: The error message emitted when returning invalid types from "
"``__fspath__`` in interfaces that allow passing :class:`~os.PathLike` "
"objects has been improved and now it does explain the origin of the error."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35942`: 改进了在允许传递 :class:`~os.PathLike` 对象的接口中，从 ``__fspath__`` "
"返回无效类型时发出的错误信息，现在它会解释错误的来源。"

#: ../NEWS:36629
msgid ""
":issue:`36016`: ``gc.get_objects`` can now receive an optional parameter "
"indicating a generation to get objects from. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36016`: ``gc.get_objects`` 现在可以接收一个可选参数，指定从哪个代获取对象。由 Pablo Galindo "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:36632
msgid ""
":issue:`1054041`: When the main interpreter exits due to an uncaught "
"KeyboardInterrupt, the process now exits in the appropriate manner for its "
"parent process to detect that a SIGINT or ^C terminated the process.  This "
"allows shells and batch scripts to understand that the user has asked them "
"to stop."
msgstr ""
":issue:`1054041`: 当主解释器由于未捕获的 KeyboardInterrupt "
"退出时，进程现在会以适当的方式退出，以便其父进程能够检测到是由于 SIGINT 或 ^C 终止的进程。这使得 shell "
"和批处理脚本能够理解用户要求它们停止。"

#: ../NEWS:36638
msgid ""
":issue:`35992`: Fix ``__class_getitem__()`` not being called on a class with"
" a custom non-subscriptable metaclass."
msgstr ":issue:`35992`: 修复了在具有自定义不可下标元类的类上不调用 ``__class_getitem__()`` 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:36641
msgid ""
":issue:`35993`: Fix a crash on fork when using subinterpreters. Contributed "
"by Stéphane Wirtel"
msgstr ":issue:`35993`: 修复了在使用子解释器时 fork 导致的崩溃。由 Stéphane Wirtel 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:36644
msgid ""
":issue:`35991`: Fix a potential double free in Modules/_randommodule.c."
msgstr ":issue:`35991`: 修复了 Modules/_randommodule.c 中的潜在双重释放问题。"

#: ../NEWS:36646
msgid ""
":issue:`35961`: Fix a crash in slice_richcompare(): use strong references "
"rather than stolen references for the two temporary internal tuples."
msgstr ":issue:`35961`: 修复了 slice_richcompare() 中的崩溃：对两个临时内部元组使用强引用而非偷取的引用。"

#: ../NEWS:36649
msgid ""
":issue:`35911`: Enable the creation of cell objects by adding a "
"``cell.__new__`` method, and expose the type ``cell`` in ``Lib/types.py`` "
"under the name CellType. Patch by Pierre Glaser."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35911`: 通过添加 ``cell.__new__`` 方法启用 cell 对象的创建，并在 ``Lib/types.py`` 中以"
" CellType 的名称公开 ``cell`` 类型。由 Pierre Glaser 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:36653
msgid ""
":issue:`12822`: Use monotonic clock for ``pthread_cond_timedwait`` when "
"``pthread_condattr_setclock`` and ``CLOCK_MONOTONIC`` are available."
msgstr ""
":issue:`12822`: 当 ``pthread_condattr_setclock`` 和 ``CLOCK_MONOTONIC`` "
"可用时，使用单调时钟进行 ``pthread_cond_timedwait``。"

#: ../NEWS:36656
msgid ""
":issue:`15248`: The compiler emits now syntax warnings in the case when a "
"comma is likely missed before tuple or list."
msgstr ":issue:`15248`: 编译器现在在可能遗漏逗号之前元组或列表的情况下发出语法警告。"

#: ../NEWS:36659
msgid ""
":issue:`35886`: The implementation of PyInterpreterState has been moved into"
" the internal header files (guarded by Py_BUILD_CORE)."
msgstr ":issue:`35886`: PyInterpreterState 的实现已移至内部头文件中（由 Py_BUILD_CORE 保护）。"

#: ../NEWS:36662
msgid ""
":issue:`31506`: Clarify the errors reported when ``object.__new__`` and "
"``object.__init__`` receive more than one argument. Contributed by Sanyam "
"Khurana."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31506`: 澄清当 ``object.__new__`` 和 ``object.__init__`` "
"接收到多于一个参数时报告的错误。由 Sanyam Khurana 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:36666
msgid ""
":issue:`35724`: Signal-handling is now guaranteed to happen relative to the "
"main interpreter."
msgstr ":issue:`35724`: 现在保证信号处理相对于主解释器进行。"

#: ../NEWS:36669
msgid ""
":issue:`33608`: We added a new internal _Py_AddPendingCall() that operates "
"relative to the provided interpreter.  This allows us to use the existing "
"implementation to ask another interpreter to do work that cannot be done in "
"the current interpreter, like decref an object the other interpreter owns.  "
"The existing Py_AddPendingCall() only operates relative to the main "
"interpreter."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33608`: 我们新增了一个内部的 "
"_Py_AddPendingCall()，它相对于提供的解释器进行操作。这使得我们可以使用现有的实现来请求另一个解释器执行在当前解释器中无法完成的工作，比如减少另一个解释器拥有的对象的引用计数。现有的"
" Py_AddPendingCall() 仅相对于主解释器进行操作。"

#: ../NEWS:36676
msgid ""
":issue:`33989`: Fix a possible crash in :meth:`list.sort` when sorting "
"objects with ``ob_type->tp_richcompare == NULL``.  Patch by Zackery Spytz."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33989`: 修复了在 :meth:`list.sort` 中对 ``ob_type->tp_richcompare == "
"NULL`` 的对象进行排序时可能发生的崩溃。由 Zackery Spytz 提供补丁。"

