msgid ""
":issue:`35378`: Fix a reference issue inside :class:`multiprocessing.Pool` "
"that caused the pool to remain alive if it was deleted without being closed "
"or terminated explicitly. A new strong reference is added to the pool "
"iterators to link the lifetime of the pool to the lifetime of its iterators "
"so the pool does not get destroyed if a pool iterator is still alive."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35378`: 修复 :class:`multiprocessing.Pool` "
"内部的一个引用问题，该问题导致如果池在没有显式关闭或终止的情况下被删除，池将保持活动状态。为池迭代器添加了一个新的强引用，将池的生命周期与其迭代器的生命周期联系起来，因此如果池迭代器仍然存活，池不会被销毁。"

#: ../NEWS:36724
msgid ""
":issue:`34294`: re module, fix wrong capturing groups in rare cases. "
":func:`re.search`, :func:`re.findall`, :func:`re.sub` and other functions "
"that scan through string looking for a match, should reset capturing groups "
"between two match attempts. Patch by Ma Lin."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34294`: "
"re模块，在罕见情况下修复错误的捕获组。:func:`re.search`、:func:`re.findall`、:func:`re.sub` "
"和其他扫描字符串寻找匹配的函数，应在两次匹配尝试之间重置捕获组。由Ma Lin提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:36729
msgid ""
":issue:`35615`: :mod:`weakref`: Fix a RuntimeError when copying a "
"WeakKeyDictionary or a WeakValueDictionary, due to some keys or values "
"disappearing while iterating."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35615`: :mod:`weakref`: "
"修复在复制WeakKeyDictionary或WeakValueDictionary时由于某些键或值在迭代过程中消失而导致的RuntimeError。"

#: ../NEWS:36733
msgid ""
":issue:`35606`: Implement :func:`math.prod` as analogous function to "
":func:`sum` that returns the product of a 'start' value (default: 1) times "
"an iterable of numbers. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35606`: 实现 :func:`math.prod` 作为 :func:`sum` "
"的类似函数，返回'start'值（默认：1）乘以数字可迭代对象的乘积。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:36737
msgid ""
":issue:`32417`: Performing arithmetic between :class:`datetime.datetime` "
"subclasses and :class:`datetime.timedelta` now returns an object of the same"
" type as the :class:`datetime.datetime` subclass. As a result, "
":meth:`datetime.datetime.astimezone` and alternate constructors like "
":meth:`datetime.datetime.now` and :meth:`datetime.fromtimestamp` called with"
" a ``tz`` argument now *also* retain their subclass."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32417`: 在 :class:`datetime.datetime` 子类和 :class:`datetime.timedelta`"
" 之间执行算术现在返回与 :class:`datetime.datetime` "
"子类相同类型的对象。因此，:meth:`datetime.datetime.astimezone` 和替代构造函数如 "
":meth:`datetime.datetime.now` 和带``tz`` 参数调用的 :meth:`datetime.fromtimestamp` "
"现在 *也* 保留它们的子类。"

#: ../NEWS:36744
msgid ""
":issue:`35153`: Add *headers* optional keyword-only parameter to "
":class:`xmlrpc.client.ServerProxy`, :class:`xmlrpc.client.Transport` and "
":class:`xmlrpc.client.SafeTransport`.  Patch by Cédric Krier."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35153`: 向 "
":class:`xmlrpc.client.ServerProxy`、:class:`xmlrpc.client.Transport` 和 "
":class:`xmlrpc.client.SafeTransport` 添加 *headers* 可选仅关键字参数。补丁由Cédric "
"Krier提供。"

#: ../NEWS:36748
msgid ""
":issue:`34572`: Fix C implementation of pickle.loads to use importlib's "
"locking mechanisms, and thereby avoid using partially loaded modules. Patch "
"by Tim Burgess."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34572`: 修复 pickle.loads 的 C 实现以使用 importlib 的锁定机制，从而避免使用部分加载的模块。由 "
"Tim Burgess 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:36755
msgid ""
":issue:`36083`: Fix formatting of --check-hash-based-pycs options in the "
"manpage Synopsis."
msgstr ":issue:`36083`: 修复手册页 Synopsis 中 --check-hash-based-pycs 选项的格式。"

#: ../NEWS:36758
msgid ""
":issue:`36007`: Bump minimum sphinx version to 1.8.  Patch by Anthony "
"Sottile."
msgstr ":issue:`36007`: 将最低 sphinx 版本提升至 1.8。由 Anthony Sottile 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:36760
msgid ""
":issue:`22062`: Update documentation and docstrings for pathlib. Original "
"patch by Mike Short."
msgstr ":issue:`22062`: 更新 pathlib 的文档和文档字符串。原始由 Mike Short 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:36766
msgid ""
":issue:`27313`: Avoid test_ttk_guionly ComboboxTest failure with macOS Cocoa"
" Tk."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27313`: 避免 test_ttk_guionly ComboboxTest 在 macOS Cocoa Tk 上失败。"

#: ../NEWS:36769
msgid ""
":issue:`36019`: Add test.support.TEST_HTTP_URL and replace references of "
"http://www.example.com by this new constant. Contributed by Stéphane Wirtel."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36019`: 添加 test.support.TEST_HTTP_URL 并用此新常量替换对 "
"http://www.example.com 的引用。由 Stéphane Wirtel 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:36773
msgid ""
":issue:`36037`: Fix test_ssl for strict OpenSSL configuration like RHEL8 "
"strict crypto policy. Use older TLS version for minimum TLS version of the "
"server SSL context if needed, to test TLS version older than default minimum"
" TLS version."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36037`: 为严格的 OpenSSL 配置（如 RHEL8 严格加密策略）修复 test_ssl。如果需要，为服务器 SSL "
"上下文的最低 TLS 版本使用较旧的 TLS 版本，以测试比默认最低 TLS 版本更旧的 TLS 版本。"

#: ../NEWS:36778
msgid ":issue:`35798`: Added :func:`test.support.check_syntax_warning`."
msgstr ":issue:`35798`: 添加了 :func:`test.support.check_syntax_warning`。"

#: ../NEWS:36780
msgid ""
":issue:`35505`: Make test_imap4_host_default_value independent on whether "
"the local IMAP server is running."
msgstr ":issue:`35505`: 使 test_imap4_host_default_value 不依赖于本地 IMAP 服务器是否运行。"

#: ../NEWS:36783
msgid ""
":issue:`35917`: multiprocessing: provide unit tests for SyncManager and "
"SharedMemoryManager classes + all the shareable types which are supposed to "
"be supported by them.  (patch by Giampaolo Rodola)"
msgstr ""
":issue:`35917`: multiprocessing：为 SyncManager 和 SharedMemoryManager 类提供单元测试 "
"+ 所有应该由它们支持的共享类型。（由 Giampaolo Rodola 提供补丁）"

#: ../NEWS:36787
msgid ""
":issue:`35704`: Skip ``test_shutil.test_unpack_archive_xztar`` to prevent a "
"MemoryError on 32-bit AIX when MAXDATA setting is less than 0x20000000."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35704`: 跳过 ``test_shutil.test_unpack_archive_xztar`` 以防止在 32 位 AIX "
"上当 MAXDATA 设置小于 0x20000000 时发生 MemoryError。"

#: ../NEWS:36790
msgid "Patch by Michael Felt (aixtools)"
msgstr "由 Michael Felt (aixtools) 提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:36792
msgid ""
":issue:`34720`: Assert m_state != NULL to mimic GC traversal functions that "
"do not correctly handle module creation when the module state has not been "
"created."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34720`: 断言 m_state != NULL 以模仿 GC 遍历函数，这些函数在模块状态尚未创建时不正确处理模块创建。"

#: ../NEWS:36799
msgid ""
":issue:`35976`: Added ARM build support to Windows build files in PCBuild."
msgstr ":issue:`35976`: 在 PCBuild 的 Windows 构建文件中添加 ARM 构建支持。"

#: ../NEWS:36801
msgid ""
":issue:`35692`: ``pathlib`` no longer raises when checking file and "
"directory existence on drives that are not ready"
msgstr ":issue:`35692`: ``pathlib`` 在检查未准备好驱动器上的文件和目录存在时不再引发异常"

#: ../NEWS:36804
msgid ""
":issue:`35872`: Uses the base Python executable when invoking venv in a "
"virtual environment"
msgstr ":issue:`35872`: 在虚拟环境中调用 venv 时使用基础 Python 可执行文件"

#: ../NEWS:36807
msgid ":issue:`35873`: Prevents venv paths being inherited by child processes"
msgstr ":issue:`35873`: 防止 venv 路径被子进程继承"

#: ../NEWS:36809
msgid ""
":issue:`35299`: Fix sysconfig detection of the source directory and "
"distutils handling of pyconfig.h during PGO profiling"
msgstr ":issue:`35299`: 修复在PGO分析期间sysconfig对源目录的检测以及distutils对pyconfig.h的处理。"

#: ../NEWS:36815
msgid ":issue:`24310`: IDLE -- Document settings dialog font tab sample."
msgstr ":issue:`24310`: IDLE —— 文档设置对话框字体标签示例。"

#: ../NEWS:36817
msgid ""
":issue:`35833`: Revise IDLE doc for control codes sent to Shell. Add a code "
"example block."
msgstr ":issue:`35833`: 修订IDLE文档关于发送到Shell的控制码。添加一个代码示例块。"

#: ../NEWS:36820
msgid ":issue:`35689`: Add docstrings and unittests for colorizer.py."
msgstr ":issue:`35689`: 为colorizer.py添加文档字符串和单元测试。"

#: ../NEWS:36824
msgid "Python 3.8.0 alpha 1"
msgstr "Python 3.8.0 alpha 1"

#: ../NEWS:36826
msgid "*Release date: 2019-02-03*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2019-02-03*"

#: ../NEWS:36831
msgid ""
":issue:`35746`: :cve:`2019-5010`: Fix a NULL pointer deref in ssl module. "
"The cert parser did not handle CRL distribution points with empty DP or URI "
"correctly. A malicious or buggy certificate can result into segfault. "
"Vulnerability (TALOS-2018-0758) reported by Colin Read and Nicolas Edet of "
"Cisco."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35746`: :cve:`2019-5010`: "
"修复ssl模块中的NULL指针解引用问题。证书解析器未能正确处理具有空DP或URI的CRL分发点。恶意或错误的证书可能导致段错误。漏洞（TALOS-2018-0758）由Cisco的Colin"
" Read和Nicolas Edet报告。"

#: ../NEWS:36837
msgid ""
":issue:`34812`: The :option:`-I` command line option (run Python in isolated"
" mode) is now also copied by the :mod:`multiprocessing` and ``distutils`` "
"modules when spawning child processes. Previously, only :option:`-E` and "
":option:`-s` options (enabled by :option:`-I`) were copied."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34812`: :option:`-I` 命令行选项（在隔离模式下运行Python）现在在生成子进程时也被 "
":mod:`multiprocessing` 和 ``distutils`` 模块复制。以前，只有由 :option:`-I` 启用的 "
":option:`-E` 和 :option:`-s` 选项被复制。"

#: ../NEWS:36842
msgid ""
":issue:`34791`: The xml.sax and xml.dom.domreg no longer use environment "
"variables to override parser implementations when "
"sys.flags.ignore_environment is set by -E or -I arguments."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34791`: 当sys.flags.ignore_environment由-E或-"
"I参数设置时，xml.sax和xml.dom.domreg不再使用环境变量来覆盖解析器实现。"

#: ../NEWS:36846
msgid ""
":issue:`17239`: The xml.sax and xml.dom.minidom parsers no longer processes "
"external entities by default. External DTD and ENTITY declarations no longer"
" load files or create network connections."
msgstr ""
":issue:`17239`: "
"xml.sax和xml.dom.minidom解析器默认不再处理外部实体。外部DTD和ENTITY声明不再加载文件或创建网络连接。"

#: ../NEWS:36850
msgid ""
":issue:`34623`: :cve:`2018-14647`: The C accelerated _elementtree module now"
" initializes hash randomization salt from _Py_HashSecret instead of "
"libexpat's default CSPRNG."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34623`: :cve:`2018-14647`: "
"C加速的_elementtree模块现在从_Py_HashSecret初始化哈希随机化盐，而不是libexpat的默认CSPRNG。"

#: ../NEWS:36854
msgid ":issue:`34405`: Updated to OpenSSL 1.1.0i for Windows builds."
msgstr ":issue:`34405`: 更新Windows构建的OpenSSL至1.1.0i版本。"

#: ../NEWS:36856
msgid ""
":issue:`33871`: Fixed sending the part of the file in :func:`os.sendfile` on"
" macOS.  Using the *trailers* argument could cause sending more bytes from "
"the input file than was specified."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33871`: 修复在macOS上 :func:`os.sendfile` 中发送文件部分的问题。使用 *trailers* "
"参数可能导致从输入文件发送的字节数多于指定数量。"

#: ../NEWS:36860
msgid ":issue:`32533`: Fixed thread-safety of error handling in _ssl."
msgstr ":issue:`32533`: 修复_ssl中错误处理的线程安全性。"

#: ../NEWS:36862 ../NEWS:40361
msgid ""
":issue:`33136`: Harden ssl module against LibreSSL :cve:`2018-8970`. "
"X509_VERIFY_PARAM_set1_host() is called with an explicit namelen. A new test"
" ensures that NULL bytes are not allowed."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33136`: 加固ssl模块以抵御LibreSSL的 "
":cve:`2018-8970`。调用X509_VERIFY_PARAM_set1_host()时使用明确的namelen。新增测试确保不允许NULL字节。"

#: ../NEWS:36866 ../NEWS:40365 ../NEWS:44760
msgid ""
":issue:`33001`: Minimal fix to prevent buffer overrun in os.symlink on "
"Windows"
msgstr ":issue:`33001`: Windows 上 os.symlink 防止缓冲区溢出的最小修复。"

#: ../NEWS:36868 ../NEWS:40367 ../NEWS:44762
msgid ""
":issue:`32981`: Regexes in difflib and poplib were vulnerable to "
"catastrophic backtracking. These regexes formed potential DOS vectors "
"(REDOS). They have been refactored. This resolves :cve:`2018-1060` and "
":cve:`2018-1061`. Patch by Jamie Davis."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32981`: difflib 和 poplib 中的正则表达式容易受到灾难性回溯的影响。这些正则表达式构成了潜在的 DOS "
"向量（REDOS）。它们已被重构。这解决了 :cve:`2018-1060` 和 :cve:`2018-1061`。由 Jamie Davis "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:36873 ../NEWS:40579
msgid ""
":issue:`28414`: The ssl module now allows users to perform their own IDN "
"en/decoding when using SNI."
msgstr ":issue:`28414`: ssl 模块现在允许用户在使用 SNI 时执行自己的 IDN 编码/解码。"

#: ../NEWS:36879
msgid ""
":issue:`35877`: Make parenthesis optional for named expressions in while "
"statement. Patch by Karthikeyan Singaravelan."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35877`: 在 while 语句中使括号对于命名表达式可选。由 Karthikeyan Singaravelan 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:36882
msgid ""
":issue:`35814`: Allow same right hand side expressions in annotated "
"assignments as in normal ones. In particular, ``x: Tuple[int, int] = 1, 2`` "
"(without parentheses on the right) is now allowed."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35814`: 允许注解赋值中的右侧表达式与普通赋值中的相同。特别是，``x: Tuple[int, int] = 1, 2`` "
"(右侧不带括号) 现在是被允许的。"

#: ../NEWS:36886
msgid ""
":issue:`35766`: Add the option to parse PEP 484 type comments in the ast "
"module. (Off by default.) This is merging the key functionality of the third"
" party fork thereof, [typed_ast](https://github.com/python/typed_ast)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35766`: 添加了在 ast 模块中解析 PEP 484 类型注释的选项。（默认关闭。）这是合并了其第三方分支 "
"[typed_ast](https://github.com/python/typed_ast) 的关键功能。"

#: ../NEWS:36891
msgid ""
":issue:`35713`: Reorganize Python initialization to get working exceptions "
"and sys.stderr earlier."
msgstr ":issue:`35713`: 重新组织 Python 初始化以更早地获得工作异常和 sys.stderr。"

#: ../NEWS:36894
msgid ""
":issue:`33416`: Add end line and end column position information to the "
"Python AST nodes. This is a C-level backwards incompatible change."
msgstr ":issue:`33416`: 向 Python AST 节点添加结束行和结束列位置信息。这是一个 C 级别的向后不兼容的更改。"

#: ../NEWS:36897
msgid ""
":issue:`35720`: Fixed a minor memory leak in pymain_parse_cmdline_impl "
"function in Modules/main.c"
msgstr ""
":issue:`35720`: 修复了 Modules/main.c 中 pymain_parse_cmdline_impl 函数的一个小内存泄漏。"

#: ../NEWS:36900
msgid ""
":issue:`35634`: ``func(**kwargs)`` will now raise an error when ``kwargs`` "
"is a mapping containing multiple entries with the same key. An error was "
"already raised when other keyword arguments are passed before ``**kwargs`` "
"since Python 3.6."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35634`: ``func(**kwargs)`` 现在会在 ``kwargs`` 是一个包含多个相同键的映射时引发错误。自 "
"Python 3.6 起，当其他关键字参数在 ``**kwargs`` 之前传递时，已经会引发错误。"

#: ../NEWS:36905
msgid ""
":issue:`35623`: Fix a crash when sorting very long lists. Patch by Stephan "
"Hohe."
msgstr ":issue:`35623`: 修复了排序非常长的列表时的一个崩溃。由 Stephan Hohe 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:36908
msgid ""
":issue:`35214`: clang Memory Sanitizer build instrumentation was added to "
"work around false positives from posix, socket, time, test_io, and "
"test_faulthandler."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35214`: 添加了 clang Memory Sanitizer 构建工具，以解决来自 "
"posix、socket、time、test_io 和 test_faulthandler 的误报。"

#: ../NEWS:36912
msgid ""
":issue:`35560`: Fix an assertion error in :func:`format` in debug build for "
"floating-point formatting with \"n\" format, zero padding and small width. "
"Release build is not impacted. Patch by Karthikeyan Singaravelan."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35560`: 修复了调试构建中 :func:`format` 对于使用 \"n\" "
"格式、零填充和小宽度的浮点格式化的断言错误。发布构建不受影响。由 Karthikeyan Singaravelan 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:36916
msgid ""
":issue:`35552`: Format characters ``%s`` and ``%V`` in "
":c:func:`PyUnicode_FromFormat` and ``%s`` in :c:func:`PyBytes_FromFormat` no"
" longer read memory past the limit if *precision* is specified."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35552`: 在 :c:func:`PyUnicode_FromFormat` 中的格式字符 ``%s`` 和 ``%V`` 以及 "
":c:func:`PyBytes_FromFormat` 中的 ``%s`` 不再读取超过 *precision* 指定限制的内存。"

#: ../NEWS:36920
msgid ""
":issue:`35504`: Fix segfaults and :exc:`SystemError`\\ s when deleting "
"certain attributes. Patch by Zackery Spytz."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35504`: 修复了删除某些属性时的段错误和 :exc:`SystemError`\\ s。由 Zackery Spytz 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:36923
msgid ""
":issue:`35504`: Fixed a SystemError when delete the characters_written "
"attribute of an OSError."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35504`: 修复了删除 OSError 的 characters_written 属性时出现的 SystemError。"

#: ../NEWS:36926
msgid ""
":issue:`35494`: Improved syntax error messages for unbalanced parentheses in"
" f-string."
msgstr ":issue:`35494`: 改进了 f-string 中括号不匹配的语法错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:36929
msgid ""
":issue:`35444`: Fixed error handling in pickling methods when fail to look "
"up builtin \"getattr\". Sped up pickling iterators."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35444`: 修复了在无法查找内置 \"getattr\" 时，pickling 方法中的错误处理。加快了 pickling "
"迭代器的速度。"

#: ../NEWS:36932
msgid ""
":issue:`35436`: Fix various issues with memory allocation error handling. "
"Patch by Zackery Spytz."
msgstr ":issue:`35436`: 修复了内存分配错误处理中的多个问题。由 Zackery Spytz 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:36935
msgid ""
":issue:`35423`: Separate the signal handling trigger in the eval loop from "
"the \"pending calls\" machinery. There is no semantic change and the "
"difference in performance is insignificant."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35423`: 将 eval 循环中的信号处理触发器与 \"pending calls\" "
"机制分离。没有语义上的变化，性能差异也不显著。"

#: ../NEWS:36939
msgid ""
":issue:`35357`: Internal attributes' names of unittest.mock._Call and "
"unittest.mock.MagicProxy (name, parent & from_kall) are now prefixed with "
"_mock_ in order to prevent clashes with widely used object attributes. Fixed"
" minor typo in test function name."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35357`: unittest.mock._Call 和 unittest.mock.MagicProxy 的内部属性名（name, "
"parent & from_kall）现在以 _mock_ 为前缀，以防止与广泛使用的对象属性冲突。修复了测试函数名称中的小错字。"

#: ../NEWS:36944
msgid ""
":issue:`35372`: Fixed the code page decoder for input longer than 2 GiB "
"containing undecodable bytes."
msgstr ":issue:`35372`: 修复了对于长度超过 2 GiB 且包含不可解码字节的输入的代码页解码器。"

#: ../NEWS:36947
msgid ""
":issue:`35336`: Fix PYTHONCOERCECLOCALE=1 environment variable: only coerce "
"the C locale if the LC_CTYPE locale is \"C\"."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35336`: 修复 PYTHONCOERCECLOCALE=1 环境变量：仅当 LC_CTYPE 区域设置为 \"C\" 时才强制使用"
" C 区域设置。"

#: ../NEWS:36950
msgid ""
":issue:`31241`: The *lineno* and *col_offset* attributes of AST nodes for "
"list comprehensions, generator expressions and tuples are now point to the "
"opening parenthesis or square brace. For tuples without parenthesis they "
"point to the position of the first item."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31241`: 列表推导式、生成器表达式和元组的 AST 节点的 *lineno* 和 *col_offset* "
"属性现在指向开括号或方括号。对于没有括号的元组，它们指向第一个项目的位置。"

#: ../NEWS:36955
msgid ""
":issue:`33954`: For :meth:`str.format`, :meth:`float.__format__` and "
":meth:`complex.__format__` methods for non-ASCII decimal point when using "
"the \"n\" formatter."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33954`: 对于 :meth:`str.format`、:meth:`float.__format__` 和 "
":meth:`complex.__format__` 方法，当使用 \"n\" 格式化器时处理非 ASCII 小数点。"

#: ../NEWS:36959
msgid ""
":issue:`35269`: Fix a possible segfault involving a newly created coroutine."
" Patch by Zackery Spytz."
msgstr ":issue:`35269`: 修复了涉及新创建的协程的可能段错误。由 Zackery Spytz 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:36962
msgid ""
":issue:`35224`: Implement :pep:`572` (assignment expressions). Patch by "
"Emily Morehouse."
msgstr ":issue:`35224`: 实现了 :pep:`572` (赋值表达式) 。由 Emily Morehouse 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:36965
msgid ""
":issue:`32492`: Speed up :func:`namedtuple` attribute access by 1.6x using a"
" C fast-path for the name descriptors. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32492`: 通过为名称描述符使用C快速路径，将 :func:`namedtuple` 属性访问速度提高了1.6倍。由Pablo "
"Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:36968
msgid ""
":issue:`35214`: Fixed an out of bounds memory access when parsing a "
"truncated unicode escape sequence at the end of a string such as ``'\\N'``."
"  It would read one byte beyond the end of the memory allocation."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35214`: 修复了在解析字符串末尾被截断的Unicode转义序列（如 "
"``'\\N'``）时超出边界的内存访问问题。它会读取超出内存分配末尾的一个字节。"

#: ../NEWS:36972
msgid ""
":issue:`35214`: The interpreter and extension modules have had annotations "
"added so that they work properly under clang's Memory Sanitizer.  A new "
"configure flag --with-memory-sanitizer has been added to make test builds of"
" this nature easier to perform."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35214`: 解释器和扩展模块已添加注释，以便它们在clang的内存清理器下正常工作。新增了一个配置标志--with-memory-"
"sanitizer，使得执行此类测试构建更加容易。"

#: ../NEWS:36977
msgid ""
":issue:`35193`: Fix an off by one error in the bytecode peephole optimizer "
"where it could read bytes beyond the end of bounds of an array when removing"
" unreachable code. This bug was present in every release of Python 3.6 and "
"3.7 until now."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35193`: 修复了字节码窥孔优化器中的一个偏差一个错误，该错误在移除不可达代码时可能会读取数组边界之外的字节。这个错误在Python"
" 3.6和3.7的每个版本中都存在，直到现在。"

#: ../NEWS:36982
msgid ":issue:`35169`: Improved error messages for forbidden assignments."
msgstr ":issue:`35169`: 改进了禁止赋值的错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:36984
msgid ""
":issue:`34022`: Fix handling of hash-based bytecode files in "
":mod:`zipimport`. Patch by Elvis Pranskevichus."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34022`: 修复了在 :mod:`zipimport` 中处理基于哈希的字节码文件的问题。由Elvis "
"Pranskevichus提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:36987
msgid ""
":issue:`28401`: Debug builds will no longer to attempt to import extension "
"modules built for the ABI as they were never compatible to begin with. Patch"
" by Stefano Rivera."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28401`: 调试构建将不再尝试导入为ABI构建的扩展模块，因为它们从一开始就不兼容。补丁由Stefano Rivera提供。"

#: ../NEWS:36991
msgid ""
":issue:`29341`: Clarify in the docstrings of :mod:`os` methods that path-"
"like objects are also accepted as input parameters."
msgstr ":issue:`29341`: 在 :mod:`os` 方法的文档字符串中明确说明，路径样式的对象也被接受作为输入参数。"

#: ../NEWS:36994
msgid ""
":issue:`35050`: :mod:`socket`: Fix off-by-one bug in length check for "
"``AF_ALG`` name and type."
msgstr ":issue:`35050`: :mod:`socket`: 修复了 ``AF_ALG`` 名称和类型长度检查中的一个偏差一个错误。"

#: ../NEWS:36997
msgid ""
":issue:`29743`: Raise :exc:`ValueError` instead of :exc:`OverflowError` in "
"case of a negative ``_length_`` in a :class:`ctypes.Array` subclass.  Also "
"raise :exc:`TypeError` instead of :exc:`AttributeError` for non-integer "
"``_length_``. Original patch by Oren Milman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29743`: 在 :class:`ctypes.Array` 子类中，对于负的 ``_length_``，现在会引发 "
":exc:`ValueError` 而不是 :exc:`OverflowError`。对于非整数的 ``_length_``，也会引发 "
":exc:`TypeError` 而不是 :exc:`AttributeError`。原始由Oren Milman提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37002
msgid ""
":issue:`16806`: Fix ``lineno`` and ``col_offset`` for multi-line string "
"tokens."
msgstr ":issue:`16806`: 修复了多行字符串标记的 ``lineno`` 和 ``col_offset``。"

#: ../NEWS:37004
msgid ""
":issue:`35029`: :exc:`SyntaxWarning` raised as an exception at code "
"generation time will be now replaced with a :exc:`SyntaxError` for better "
"error reporting."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35029`: 在代码生成时作为异常引发的 :exc:`SyntaxWarning` 现在将被替换为 "
":exc:`SyntaxError`，以便更好地报告错误。"

#: ../NEWS:37008
msgid ""
":issue:`34983`: Expose :meth:`symtable.Symbol.is_nonlocal` in the symtable "
"module. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34983`: 在 symtable 模块中公开 :meth:`symtable.Symbol.is_nonlocal` 方法。由 "
"Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37011
msgid ""
":issue:`34974`: :class:`bytes` and :class:`bytearray` constructors no longer"
" convert unexpected exceptions (e.g. :exc:`MemoryError` and "
":exc:`KeyboardInterrupt`) to :exc:`TypeError`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34974`: :class:`bytes` 和 :class:`bytearray` 构造函数不再将意外异常（如 "
":exc:`MemoryError` 和 :exc:`KeyboardInterrupt`）转换为 :exc:`TypeError`。"

#: ../NEWS:37015
msgid ""
":issue:`34939`: Allow annotated names in module namespace that are declared "
"global before the annotation happens. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":issue:`34939`: 允许在模块命名空间中使用在注解前声明为全局的注解名称。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37018
msgid ""
":issue:`34973`: Fixed crash in :func:`bytes` when the :class:`list` argument"
" is mutated while it is iterated."
msgstr ":issue:`34973`: 修复了在 :func:`bytes` 中当 :class:`list` 参数在迭代时被修改导致的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:37021
msgid ""
":issue:`34876`: The *lineno* and *col_offset* attributes of the AST for "
"decorated function and class refer now to the position of the corresponding "
"``def``, ``async def`` and ``class`` instead of the position of the first "
"decorator. This leads to more correct line reporting in tracing. This is the"
" only case when the position of child AST nodes can precede the position of "
"the parent AST node."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34876`: AST 中装饰函数和类的 *lineno* 和 *col_offset* 属性现在指向对应的 "
"``def``、``async def`` 和 ``class`` 的位置，而不是第一个装饰器的位置。这使得在跟踪时行号报告更加准确。这是唯一一种子 "
"AST 节点的位置可能先于父 AST 节点位置的情况。"

#: ../NEWS:37028
msgid ""
":issue:`34879`: Fix a possible null pointer dereference in bytesobject.c. "
"Patch by Zackery Spytz."
msgstr ":issue:`34879`: 修复了 bytesobject.c 中可能的空指针解引用问题。由 Zackery Spytz 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37031
msgid ""
":issue:`34784`: Fix the implementation of PyStructSequence_NewType in order "
"to create heap allocated StructSequences."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34784`: 修复了 PyStructSequence_NewType 的实现，以便创建堆分配的 StructSequences。"

#: ../NEWS:37034
msgid ""
":issue:`32912`: A :exc:`SyntaxWarning` is now emitted instead of a "
":exc:`DeprecationWarning` for invalid escape sequences in string and bytes "
"literals."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32912`: 现在对于字符串和字节字面量中的无效转义序列，会发出 :exc:`SyntaxWarning` 而不是 "
":exc:`DeprecationWarning`。"

#: ../NEWS:37038
msgid ""
":issue:`34854`: Fixed a crash in compiling string annotations containing a "
"lambda with a keyword-only argument that doesn't have a default value."
msgstr ":issue:`34854`: 修复了在编译包含有关键字唯一参数但没有默认值的 lambda 的字符串注解时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:37041
msgid ""
":issue:`34850`: The compiler now produces a :exc:`SyntaxWarning` when "
"identity checks (``is`` and ``is not``) are used with certain types of "
"literals (e.g. strings, ints).  These can often work by accident in CPython,"
" but are not guaranteed by the language spec.  The warning advises users to "
"use equality tests (``==`` and ``!=``) instead."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34850`: 当身份检查（``is`` 和 ``is "
"not``）与某些类型的字面量（例如字符串、整数）一起使用时，编译器现在会产生一个 :exc:`SyntaxWarning`。这些在 CPython "
"中可能偶然工作，但语言规范不保证。警告建议用户改用相等测试（``==`` 和 ``!=``）。"

#: ../NEWS:37047
msgid ""
":issue:`34824`: Fix a possible null pointer dereference in Modules/_ssl.c. "
"Patch by Zackery Spytz."
msgstr ":issue:`34824`: 修复了 Modules/_ssl.c 中可能的空指针解引用问题。补丁由 Zackery Spytz 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:37050
msgid ""
":issue:`30156`: The C function ``property_descr_get()`` uses a \"cached\" "
"tuple to optimize function calls. But this tuple can be discovered in debug "
"mode with :func:`sys.getobjects`. Remove the optimization, it's not really "
"worth it and it causes 3 different crashes last years."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30156`: C函数 ``property_descr_get()`` "
"使用了一个\"缓存\"元组来优化函数调用。但这个元组在调试模式下可以通过 :func:`sys.getobjects` "
"发现。移除这一优化，它并不真正值得，并且在过去几年中导致了3次不同的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:37055
msgid ":issue:`34762`: Fix contextvars C API to use PyObject* pointer types."
msgstr ":issue:`34762`: 修复contextvars C API以使用PyObject*指针类型。"

#: ../NEWS:37057
msgid ""
":issue:`34751`: The hash function for tuples is now based on xxHash which "
"gives better collision results on (formerly) pathological cases. "
"Additionally, on 64-bit systems it improves tuple hashes in general. Patch "
"by Jeroen Demeyer with substantial contributions by Tim Peters."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34751`: "
"元组的哈希函数现在基于xxHash，这在（以前的）病态情况下提供了更好的碰撞结果。此外，在64位系统上，它总体上改善了元组的哈希。由Jeroen "
"Demeyer提供补丁，Tim Peters做出了重要贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:37062
msgid ""
":issue:`34735`: Fix a memory leak in Modules/timemodule.c.  Patch by Zackery"
" Spytz."
msgstr ":issue:`34735`: 修复Modules/timemodule.c中的内存泄漏。由Zackery Spytz提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37065
msgid ""
":issue:`34683`: Fixed a bug where some SyntaxError error pointed to "
"locations that were off-by-one."
msgstr ":issue:`34683`: 修复了一个错误，其中一些SyntaxError错误指向了位置偏移一位的位置。"

#: ../NEWS:37068
msgid ""
":issue:`34651`: Only allow the main interpreter to fork.  The avoids the "
"possibility of affecting the main interpreter, which is critical to "
"operation of the runtime."
msgstr ":issue:`34651`: 只允许主解释器进行fork。这避免了影响主解释器的可能性，这对运行时的操作至关重要。"

#: ../NEWS:37072
msgid ""
":issue:`34653`: Remove unused function PyParser_SimpleParseStringFilename."
msgstr ":issue:`34653`: 移除未使用的函数PyParser_SimpleParseStringFilename。"

#: ../NEWS:37074
msgid ""
":issue:`32236`: Warn that line buffering is not supported if :func:`open` is"
" called with binary mode and ``buffering=1``."
msgstr ":issue:`32236`: 警告如果以二进制模式和 ``buffering=1`` 调用 :func:`open`，则不支持行缓冲。"

#: ../NEWS:37077
msgid ""
":issue:`34641`: Further restrict the syntax of the left-hand side of keyword"
" arguments in function calls. In particular, ``f((keyword)=arg)`` is now "
"disallowed."
msgstr ":issue:`34641`: 进一步限制函数调用中关键字参数左侧的语法。特别是，``f((keyword)=arg)``现在是不允许的。"

#: ../NEWS:37081
msgid ""
":issue:`34637`: Make the *start* argument to *sum()* visible as a keyword "
"argument."
msgstr ":issue:`34637`: 使 *sum()* 的 *start* 参数作为关键字参数可见。"

#: ../NEWS:37084
msgid ""
":issue:`1621`: Do not assume signed integer overflow behavior (C undefined "
"behavior) when performing set hash table resizing."
msgstr ":issue:`1621`: 在执行集合哈希表调整大小时，不假定有符号整数溢出行为（C未定义行为）。"

#: ../NEWS:37087
msgid ""
":issue:`34588`: Fix an off-by-one in the recursive call pruning feature of "
"traceback formatting."
msgstr ":issue:`34588`: 修复回溯格式化中递归调用修剪特性的一个偏移一位的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:37090
msgid ""
":issue:`34485`: On Windows, the LC_CTYPE is now set to the user preferred "
"locale at startup. Previously, the LC_CTYPE locale was \"C\" at startup, but"
" changed when calling setlocale(LC_CTYPE, \"\") or setlocale(LC_ALL, \"\")."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34485`: "
"在Windows上，LC_CTYPE现在在启动时设置为用户首选区域设置。以前，LC_CTYPE区域设置在启动时为\"C\"，但在调用setlocale(LC_CTYPE,"
" \"\")或setlocale(LC_ALL, \"\")时会更改。"

#: ../NEWS:37094
msgid ""
":issue:`34485`: Standard streams like sys.stdout now use the "
"\"surrogateescape\" error handler, instead of \"strict\", on the POSIX "
"locale (when the C locale is not coerced and the UTF-8 Mode is disabled)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34485`: "
"在POSIX区域设置（当C区域未被强制且UTF-8模式被禁用时），像sys.stdout这样的标准流现在使用\"surrogateescape\"错误处理程序，而不是\"strict\"。"

#: ../NEWS:37098
msgid ""
":issue:`34485`: Fix the error handler of standard streams like sys.stdout: "
"PYTHONIOENCODING=\":\" is now ignored instead of setting the error handler "
"to \"strict\"."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34485`: "
"修复像sys.stdout这样的标准流的错误处理程序：PYTHONIOENCODING=\":\"现在被忽略，而不是将错误处理程序设置为\"strict\"。"

#: ../NEWS:37102
msgid ""
":issue:`34485`: Python now gets the locale encoding with C code to "
"initialize the encoding of standard streams like sys.stdout. Moreover, the "
"encoding is now initialized to the Python codec name to get a normalized "
"encoding name and to ensure that the codec is loaded. The change avoids "
"importing _bootlocale and _locale modules at startup by default."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34485`: "
"Python现在使用C代码获取区域编码，以初始化像sys.stdout这样的标准流的编码。此外，编码现在初始化为Python编解码器名称，以获取规范化的编码名称并确保编解码器被加载。这一改变默认避免了在启动时导入_bootlocale和_locale模块。"

#: ../NEWS:37108
msgid ""
":issue:`34527`: On FreeBSD, Py_DecodeLocale() and Py_EncodeLocale() now also"
" forces the ASCII encoding if the LC_CTYPE locale is \"POSIX\", not only if "
"the LC_CTYPE locale is \"C\"."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34527`: "
"在FreeBSD上，如果LC_CTYPE区域是\"POSIX\"，Py_DecodeLocale()和Py_EncodeLocale()现在也会强制使用ASCII编码，而不仅仅是当LC_CTYPE区域是\"C\"时。"

#: ../NEWS:37112
msgid ""
":issue:`34527`: The UTF-8 Mode is now also enabled by the \"POSIX\" locale, "
"not only by the \"C\" locale."
msgstr ":issue:`34527`: UTF-8模式现在也由\"POSIX\"区域启用，而不仅仅是\"C\"区域。"

#: ../NEWS:37115
msgid ""
":issue:`34403`: On HP-UX with C or POSIX locale, sys.getfilesystemencoding()"
" now returns \"ascii\" instead of \"roman8\" (when the UTF-8 Mode is "
"disabled and the C locale is not coerced)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34403`: 在HP-"
"UX上，如果使用C或POSIX区域设置，sys.getfilesystemencoding()现在返回\"ascii\"而不是\"roman8\"（当UTF-8模式被禁用且C区域未被强制时）。"

#: ../NEWS:37119
msgid ""
":issue:`34523`: The Python filesystem encoding is now read earlier during "
"the Python initialization."
msgstr ":issue:`34523`: Python文件系统编码现在在Python初始化期间更早地读取。"

#: ../NEWS:37122
msgid ""
":issue:`12458`: Tracebacks show now correct line number for subexpressions "
"in multiline expressions. Tracebacks show now the line number of the first "
"line for multiline expressions instead of the line number of the last "
"subexpression."
msgstr ""
":issue:`12458`: 回溯现在显示多行表达式中子表达式的正确行号。回溯现在显示多行表达式的第一行的行号，而不是最后一个子表达式的行号。"

#: ../NEWS:37127
msgid ""
":issue:`34408`: Prevent a null pointer dereference and resource leakage in "
"``PyInterpreterState_New()``."
msgstr ":issue:`34408`: 防止 ``PyInterpreterState_New()`` 中的空指针解引用和资源泄漏。"

#: ../NEWS:37130
msgid ""
":issue:`34400`: Fix undefined behavior in parsetok.c.  Patch by Zackery "
"Spytz."
msgstr ":issue:`34400`: 修复parsetok.c中的未定义行为。由Zackery Spytz提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37132
msgid ""
":issue:`33073`: Added as_integer_ratio to ints to make them more "
"interoperable with floats."
msgstr ":issue:`33073`: 向ints添加了as_integer_ratio，以使它们更易于与floats互操作。"

#: ../NEWS:37135
msgid ""
":issue:`34377`: Update valgrind suppression list to use "
"``_PyObject_Free``/``_PyObject_Realloc`` instead of "
"``PyObject_Free``/``PyObject_Realloc``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34377`: 更新valgrind抑制列表，使用 ``_PyObject_Free``/``_PyObject_Realloc`` "
"代替``PyObject_Free``/``PyObject_Realloc``。"

#: ../NEWS:37139
msgid ""
":issue:`34353`: Added the \"socket\" option in the ``stat.filemode()`` "
"Python implementation to match the C implementation."
msgstr ":issue:`34353`: 在Python实现的 ``stat.filemode()`` 中添加了\"socket\"选项以匹配C实现。"

#: ../NEWS:37142
msgid ""
":issue:`34320`: Fix ``dict(od)`` didn't copy iteration order of OrderedDict."
msgstr ":issue:`34320`: 修复了 ``dict(od)`` 未复制OrderedDict的迭代顺序的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:37144
msgid ""
":issue:`34113`: Fixed crash on debug builds when opcode stack was adjusted "
"with negative numbers. Patch by Constantin Petrisor."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34113`: 修复了在调试版本中，当操作码堆栈被调整为负数时崩溃的问题。由Constantin Petrisor提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37147
msgid ""
":issue:`34100`: Compiler now merges constants in tuples and frozensets "
"recursively. Code attributes like ``co_names`` are merged too."
msgstr ":issue:`34100`: 编译器现在递归合并元组和冻结集合中的常量。代码属性如 ``co_names`` 也被合并。"

#: ../NEWS:37150
msgid ""
":issue:`34151`: Performance of list concatenation, repetition and slicing "
"operations is slightly improved. Patch by Sergey Fedoseev."
msgstr ":issue:`34151`: 列表连接、重复和切片操作的性能略有提升。由Sergey Fedoseev提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37153
msgid ""
":issue:`34170`: -X dev: it is now possible to override the memory allocator "
"using PYTHONMALLOC even if the developer mode is enabled."
msgstr ":issue:`34170`: -X dev: 现在即使启用了开发者模式，也可以使用PYTHONMALLOC覆盖内存分配器。"

#: ../NEWS:37156
msgid ""
":issue:`33237`: Improved :exc:`AttributeError` message for partially "
"initialized module."
msgstr ":issue:`33237`: 改进了部分初始化模块的 :exc:`AttributeError` 消息。"

#: ../NEWS:37159
msgid ""
":issue:`34149`: Fix min and max functions to get default behavior when key "
"is None."
msgstr ":issue:`34149`: 修复min和max函数在key为None时获取默认行为的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:37162
msgid ""
":issue:`34125`: Profiling of unbound built-in methods now works when "
"``**kwargs`` is given."
msgstr ":issue:`34125`: 当给出 ``**kwargs`` 时，现在可以对未绑定的内置方法进行性能分析。"

#: ../NEWS:37165
msgid ""
":issue:`34141`: Optimized pickling atomic types (None, bool, int, float, "
"bytes, str)."
msgstr ":issue:`34141`: 优化了原子类型（None, bool, int, float, bytes, str）的pickling。"

#: ../NEWS:37168
msgid ""
":issue:`34126`: Fix crashes when profiling certain invalid calls of unbound "
"methods. Patch by Jeroen Demeyer."
msgstr ":issue:`34126`: 修复了在分析某些无效调用的未绑定方法时的崩溃问题。由Jeroen Demeyer提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37171
msgid ""
":issue:`24618`: Fixed reading invalid memory when create the code object "
"with too small varnames tuple or too large argument counts."
msgstr ":issue:`24618`: 修复了在创建代码对象时，当varnames元组过小或参数计数过大时读取无效内存的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:37174
msgid ""
":issue:`34068`: In :meth:`io.IOBase.close`, ensure that the "
":attr:`~io.IOBase.closed` attribute is not set with a live exception. Patch "
"by Zackery Spytz and Serhiy Storchaka."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34068`: 在 :meth:`io.IOBase.close` 中，确保在存在活动异常时不设置 "
":attr:`~io.IOBase.closed` 属性。由Zackery Spytz和Serhiy Storchaka提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37178
msgid ""
":issue:`34087`: Fix buffer overflow while converting unicode to numeric "
"values."
msgstr ":issue:`34087`: 修复了将unicode转换为数值时的缓冲区溢出问题。"

#: ../NEWS:37180
msgid ""
":issue:`34080`: Fixed a memory leak in the compiler when it raised some "
"uncommon errors during tokenizing."
msgstr ":issue:`34080`: 修复了编译器在词法分析过程中引发一些不常见错误时的内存泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:37183
msgid ""
":issue:`34066`: Disabled interruption by Ctrl-C between calling ``open()`` "
"and entering a **with** block in ``with open()``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34066`: 在 ``with open()`` 中，禁止在调用 ``open()`` 和进入 **with** 块之间通过Ctrl-"
"C中断。"

#: ../NEWS:37186
msgid ""
":issue:`34042`: Fix dict.copy() to maintain correct total refcount (as "
"reported by sys.gettotalrefcount())."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34042`: 修复dict.copy()以维持正确的总引用计数（如sys.gettotalrefcount()报告的那样）。"

#: ../NEWS:37189
msgid ""
":issue:`33418`: Fix potential memory leak in function object when it creates"
" reference cycle."
msgstr ":issue:`33418`: 修复了函数对象在创建引用循环时潜在的内存泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:37192
msgid ":issue:`33985`: Implement contextvars.ContextVar.name attribute."
msgstr ":issue:`33985`: 实现 contextvars.ContextVar.name 属性。"

#: ../NEWS:37194
msgid ":issue:`33956`: Update vendored Expat library copy to version 2.2.5."
msgstr ":issue:`33956`: 将集成的 Expat 库更新至版本 2.2.5。"

#: ../NEWS:37196
msgid ""
":issue:`24596`: Decref the module object in "
":c:func:`PyRun_SimpleFileExFlags` before calling :c:func:`PyErr_Print()`.  "
"Patch by Zackery Spytz."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24596`: 在调用 :c:func:`PyErr_Print()` 之前，先在 "
":c:func:`PyRun_SimpleFileExFlags` 中减少模块对象的引用计数。由 Zackery Spytz 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37199
msgid ""
":issue:`33451`: Close directly executed pyc files before calling "
"``PyEval_EvalCode()``."
msgstr ":issue:`33451`: 在调用 ``PyEval_EvalCode()`` 之前关闭直接执行的 pyc 文件。"

#: ../NEWS:37202
msgid ""
":issue:`1617161`: The hash of :class:`BuiltinMethodType` instances (methods "
"of built-in classes) now depends on the hash of the identity of *__self__* "
"instead of its value. The hash and equality of :class:`ModuleType` and "
":class:`MethodWrapperType` instances (methods of user-defined classes and "
"some methods of built-in classes like ``str.__add__``) now depend on the "
"hash and equality of the identity of *__self__* instead of its value. "
":class:`MethodWrapperType` instances no longer support ordering."
msgstr ""
":issue:`1617161`: :class:`BuiltinMethodType` 实例（内置类的方法）的哈希现在依赖于 *__self__* "
"的身份哈希而非其值。:class:`ModuleType` 和 :class:`MethodWrapperType` "
"实例（用户定义类的方法和一些内置类的方法如 ``str.__add__``）的哈希和相等性现在依赖于 *__self__* "
"的身份哈希和相等性而非其值。:class:`MethodWrapperType` 实例不再支持排序。"

#: ../NEWS:37210
msgid ""
":issue:`33824`: Fix \"LC_ALL=C python3.7 -V\": reset properly the command "
"line parser when the encoding changes after reading the Python "
"configuration."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33824`: 修复 \"LC_ALL=C python3.7 -V\"：在读取 Python 配置后编码更改时正确重置命令行解析器。"

#: ../NEWS:37213 ../NEWS:39859
msgid ""
":issue:`33803`: Fix a crash in hamt.c caused by enabling GC tracking for an "
"object that hadn't all of its fields set to NULL."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33803`: 修复 hamt.c 中的一个崩溃问题，该问题是由于为一个对象启用 GC 跟踪时，其所有字段未设置为 NULL 引起的。"

#: ../NEWS:37216
msgid ""
":issue:`33738`: Seven macro incompatibilities with the Limited API were "
"fixed, and the macros :c:func:`PyIter_Check`, :c:func:`PyIndex_Check` and "
":c:func:`PyExceptionClass_Name` were added as functions. A script for "
"automatic macro checks was added."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33738`: 修复了七个与有限 API 不兼容的宏，并将宏 "
":c:func:`PyIter_Check`、:c:func:`PyIndex_Check` 和 "
":c:func:`PyExceptionClass_Name` 作为函数添加。添加了一个用于自动检查宏的脚本。"

#: ../NEWS:37221 ../NEWS:44433
msgid ""
":issue:`33786`: Fix asynchronous generators to handle GeneratorExit in "
"athrow() correctly"
msgstr ":issue:`33786`: 修复异步生成器以正确处理 athrow() 中的 GeneratorExit。"

#: ../NEWS:37224
msgid ""
":issue:`30167`: ``PyRun_SimpleFileExFlags`` removes ``__cached__`` from "
"module in addition to ``__file__``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30167`: ``PyRun_SimpleFileExFlags`` 除了移除模块中的 ``__file__`` 外，还移除了 "
"``__cached__``。"

#: ../NEWS:37227 ../NEWS:39862
msgid ""
":issue:`33706`: Fix a crash in Python initialization when parsing the "
"command line options. Thanks Christoph Gohlke for the bug report and the "
"fix!"
msgstr ""
":issue:`33706`: 修复解析命令行选项时 Python 初始化过程中的崩溃问题。感谢 Christoph Gohlke 的报告和修复！"

#: ../NEWS:37230
msgid ":issue:`33597`: Reduce ``PyGC_Head`` size from 3 words to 2 words."
msgstr ":issue:`33597`: 将 ``PyGC_Head`` 的大小从 3 个字减少到 2 个字。"

#: ../NEWS:37232 ../NEWS:39865 ../NEWS:44436
msgid ""
":issue:`30654`: Fixed reset of the SIGINT handler to SIG_DFL on interpreter "
"shutdown even when there was a custom handler set previously. Patch by "
"Philipp Kerling."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30654`: 修复了即使之前设置了自定义处理程序，在解释器关闭时 SIGINT 处理程序重置为 SIG_DFL 的问题。由 "
"Philipp Kerling 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37236 ../NEWS:39971 ../NEWS:44440
msgid ""
":issue:`33622`: Fixed a leak when the garbage collector fails to add an "
"object with the ``__del__`` method or referenced by it into the "
":data:`gc.garbage` list. :c:func:`PyGC_Collect` can now be called when an "
"exception is set and preserves it."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33622`: 修复了当垃圾收集器无法将带有 ``__del__`` 方法或被其引用的对象添加到 :data:`gc.garbage` "
"列表时的内存泄漏问题。现在可以在设置异常时调用 :c:func:`PyGC_Collect`，并保留异常。"

#: ../NEWS:37241
msgid ""
":issue:`33462`: Make dict and dict views reversible. Patch by Rémi Lapeyre."
msgstr ":issue:`33462`: 使字典和字典视图可逆。由 Rémi Lapeyre 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37243
msgid ""
":issue:`23722`: A :exc:`RuntimeError` is now raised when the custom "
"metaclass doesn't provide the ``__classcell__`` entry in the namespace "
"passed to ``type.__new__``.  A :exc:`DeprecationWarning` was emitted in "
"Python 3.6--3.7."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23722`: 当自定义元类没有在传递给 ``type.__new__`` 的命名空间中提供 ``__classcell__`` "
"条目时，现在会引发 :exc:`RuntimeError`。在 Python 3.6--3.7 中会发出 "
":exc:`DeprecationWarning`。"

#: ../NEWS:37248
msgid ""
":issue:`33499`: Add :envvar:`PYTHONPYCACHEPREFIX` environment variable and "
":option:`-X` ``pycache_prefix`` command-line option to set an alternate root"
" directory for writing module bytecode cache files."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33499`: 添加了 :envvar:`PYTHONPYCACHEPREFIX` 环境变量和 :option:`-X` "
"``pycache_prefix`` 命令行选项，用于设置写入模块字节码缓存文件的备用根目录。"

#: ../NEWS:37252
msgid ""
":issue:`25711`: The :mod:`zipimport` module has been rewritten in pure "
"Python."
msgstr ":issue:`25711`: :mod:`zipimport` 模块已用纯 Python 重写。"

#: ../NEWS:37254 ../NEWS:39976
msgid ""
":issue:`33509`: Fix module_globals parameter of warnings.warn_explicit(): "
"don't crash if module_globals is not a dict."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33509`: 修复了 warnings.warn_explicit() 的 module_globals 参数：如果 "
"module_globals 不是字典，不会崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:37257 ../NEWS:39869 ../NEWS:44445
msgid ":issue:`31849`: Fix signed/unsigned comparison warning in pyhash.c."
msgstr ":issue:`31849`: 修复了 pyhash.c 中的有符号/无符号比较警告。"

#: ../NEWS:37259 ../NEWS:39983
msgid ""
":issue:`33475`: Fixed miscellaneous bugs in converting annotations to "
"strings and optimized parentheses in the string representation."
msgstr ":issue:`33475`: 修复了将注释转换为字符串时的杂项错误，并优化了字符串表示中的括号。"

#: ../NEWS:37262
msgid ""
":issue:`20104`: Added support for the ``setpgroup``, ``resetids``, "
"``setsigmask``, ``setsigdef`` and ``scheduler`` parameters of "
"``posix_spawn``. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20104`: 添加了对 ``posix_spawn`` 的 "
"``setpgroup``、``resetids``、``setsigmask``、``setsigdef`` 和 ``scheduler`` "
"参数的支持。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37266 ../NEWS:39986 ../NEWS:44447
msgid ":issue:`33391`: Fix a leak in set_symmetric_difference()."
msgstr ":issue:`33391`: 修复了 set_symmetric_difference() 中的内存泄漏。"

#: ../NEWS:37268 ../NEWS:40184
msgid ""
":issue:`33363`: Raise a SyntaxError for ``async with`` and ``async for`` "
"statements outside of async functions."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33363`: 对于异步函数外的 ``async with`` 和 ``async for`` 语句，现在会引发 "
"SyntaxError。"

#: ../NEWS:37271 ../NEWS:39988 ../NEWS:44449
msgid ""
":issue:`28055`: Fix unaligned accesses in siphash24(). Patch by Rolf Eike "
"Beer."
msgstr ":issue:`28055`: 修复了 siphash24() 中的未对齐访问。由 Rolf Eike Beer 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37273 ../NEWS:40187
msgid ""
":issue:`33128`: Fix a bug that causes PathFinder to appear twice on "
"sys.meta_path. Patch by Pablo Galindo Salgado."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33128`: 修复了一个导致 PathFinder 在 sys.meta_path 上出现两次的 bug。由 Pablo "
"Galindo Salgado 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37276
msgid ""
":issue:`33331`: Modules imported last are now cleared first at interpreter "
"shutdown."
msgstr ":issue:`33331`: 现在在解释器关闭时，最后导入的模块会首先被清除。"

#: ../NEWS:37279 ../NEWS:40190
msgid ""
":issue:`33312`: Fixed clang ubsan (undefined behavior sanitizer) warnings in"
" dictobject.c by adjusting how the internal struct _dictkeysobject shared "
"keys structure is declared."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33312`: 通过调整内部结构 _dictkeysobject 共享键结构的声明方式，修复了 dictobject.c 中的 "
"clang ubsan（未定义行为消毒剂）警告。"

#: ../NEWS:37283
msgid ""
":issue:`33305`: Improved syntax error messages for invalid numerical "
"literals."
msgstr ":issue:`33305`: 改进了无效数值字面量的语法错误提示信息。"

#: ../NEWS:37285
msgid ""
":issue:`33306`: Improved syntax error messages for unbalanced parentheses."
msgstr ":issue:`33306`: 改进了不平衡括号的语法错误提示信息。"

#: ../NEWS:37287
msgid ""
":issue:`33234`: The list constructor will pre-size and not over-allocate "
"when the input length is known."
msgstr ":issue:`33234`: 当输入长度已知时，列表构造函数会预分配大小而不会过度分配。"

#: ../NEWS:37290
msgid ""
":issue:`33270`: Intern the names for all anonymous code objects.  Patch by "
"Zackery Spytz."
msgstr ":issue:`33270`: 为所有匿名代码对象内部化名称。由Zackery Spytz提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37293
msgid ""
":issue:`30455`: The C and Python code and the documentation related to "
"tokens are now generated from a single source file :file:`Grammar/Tokens`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30455`: 现在，与令牌相关的C和Python代码以及文档都从一个单一源文件 :file:`Grammar/Tokens` 生成。"

#: ../NEWS:37296
msgid ":issue:`33176`: Add a ``toreadonly()`` method to memoryviews."
msgstr ":issue:`33176`: 向memoryviews添加了一个 ``toreadonly()`` 方法。"

#: ../NEWS:37298 ../NEWS:40194 ../NEWS:44451
msgid ":issue:`33231`: Fix potential memory leak in ``normalizestring()``."
msgstr ":issue:`33231`: 修复了 ``normalizestring()`` 中潜在的内存泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:37300 ../NEWS:40196
msgid ""
":issue:`33205`: Change dict growth function from "
"``round_up_to_power_2(used*2+hashtable_size/2)`` to "
"``round_up_to_power_2(used*3)``.  Previously, dict is shrunk only when "
"``used == 0``. Now dict has more chance to be shrunk."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33205`: 将字典增长函数从 ``round_up_to_power_2(used*2+hashtable_size/2)`` "
"更改为``round_up_to_power_2(used*3)``。以前，字典仅在 ``used == 0`` 时收缩。现在字典有更多机会被收缩。"

#: ../NEWS:37305 ../NEWS:40201 ../NEWS:44453
msgid ""
":issue:`29922`: Improved error messages in 'async with' when "
"``__aenter__()`` or ``__aexit__()`` return non-awaitable object."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29922`: 改进了'async with'中当 ``__aenter__()`` 或 ``__aexit__()`` "
"返回不可等待对象时的错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:37308 ../NEWS:40204 ../NEWS:44456
msgid ""
":issue:`33199`: Fix ``ma_version_tag`` in dict implementation is "
"uninitialized when copying from key-sharing dict."
msgstr ":issue:`33199`: 修复了在从键共享字典复制时，字典实现中的 ``ma_version_tag`` 未初始化的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:37311 ../NEWS:40375
msgid ""
":issue:`33053`: When using the -m switch, sys.path[0] is now explicitly "
"expanded as the *starting* working directory, rather than being left as the "
"empty path (which allows imports from the current working directory at the "
"time of the import)"
msgstr ""
":issue:`33053`: 当使用-m开关时，sys.path[0]现在明确扩展为 *起始* "
"工作目录，而不是保留为空路径（允许在导入时从当前工作目录导入）。"

#: ../NEWS:37316
msgid ""
":issue:`33138`: Changed standard error message for non-pickleable and non-"
"copyable types. It now says \"cannot pickle\" instead of \"can't pickle\" or"
" \"cannot serialize\"."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33138`: 更改了不可pickle和不可复制类型的标准错误消息。现在显示\"cannot pickle\"而不是\"can't "
"pickle\"或\"cannot serialize\"。"

#: ../NEWS:37320 ../NEWS:40380
msgid ""
":issue:`33018`: Improve consistency of errors raised by ``issubclass()`` "
"when called with a non-class and an abstract base class as the first and "
"second arguments, respectively. Patch by Josh Bronson."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33018`: 提高了当 ``issubclass()`` 的第一个参数是非类而第二个参数是抽象基类时引发错误的一致性。由Josh "
"Bronson提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37324
msgid ""
":issue:`33083`: ``math.factorial`` no longer accepts arguments that are not "
"int-like. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33083`: ``math.factorial`` 不再接受非int-like的参数。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37327
msgid ""
":issue:`33041`: Added new opcode :opcode:`END_ASYNC_FOR` and fixes the "
"following issues:"
msgstr ":issue:`33041`: 添加了新操作码 :opcode:`END_ASYNC_FOR` 并修复了以下问题："

#: ../NEWS:37330
msgid ""
"Setting global :exc:`StopAsyncIteration` no longer breaks ``async for`` "
"loops."
msgstr "设置全局 :exc:`StopAsyncIteration` 不再破坏 ``async for`` 循环。"

#: ../NEWS:37332
msgid "Jumping into an ``async for`` loop is now disabled."
msgstr "跳入一个 ``async for`` 循环现在被禁止了。"

#: ../NEWS:37333
msgid "Jumping out of an ``async for`` loop no longer corrupts the stack."
msgstr "跳出一个 ``async for`` 循环不再会破坏堆栈了。"

#: ../NEWS:37335
msgid ""
":issue:`25750`: Fix rare Python crash due to bad refcounting in "
"``type_getattro()`` if a descriptor deletes itself from the class. Patch by "
"Jeroen Demeyer."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25750`: "
"修复了由于描述符从类中删除自身时`type_getattro()`中的引用计数错误导致的Python罕见崩溃。由Jeroen Demeyer提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37339
msgid ""
":issue:`33041`: Fixed bytecode generation for \"async for\" with a complex "
"target. A StopAsyncIteration raised on assigning or unpacking will be now "
"propagated instead of stopping the iteration."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33041`: 修复了带有复杂目标的“async "
"for”的字节码生成问题。现在，在赋值或解包时引发的StopAsyncIteration将被传播，而不是停止迭代。"

#: ../NEWS:37343 ../NEWS:40386 ../NEWS:44770
msgid ":issue:`33026`: Fixed jumping out of \"with\" block by setting f_lineno."
msgstr ":issue:`33026`: 通过设置f_lineno修复了跳出“with”块的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:37345 ../NEWS:40388
msgid ""
":issue:`33005`: Fix a crash on fork when using a custom memory allocator "
"(ex: using PYTHONMALLOC env var). _PyGILState_Reinit() and "
"_PyInterpreterState_Enable() now use the default RAW memory allocator to "
"allocate a new interpreters mutex on fork."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33005`: "
"修复了在使用自定义内存分配器（例如：使用PYTHONMALLOC环境变量）时fork导致的崩溃。_PyGILState_Reinit()和_PyInterpreterState_Enable()现在使用默认的RAW内存分配器在fork时分配新的解释器互斥锁。"

#: ../NEWS:37350 ../NEWS:39990
msgid ""
":issue:`32911`: Due to unexpected compatibility issues discovered during "
"downstream beta testing, reverted :issue:`29463`. ``docstring`` field is "
"removed from Module, ClassDef, FunctionDef, and AsyncFunctionDef ast nodes "
"which was added in 3.7a1.  Docstring expression is restored as a first "
"statement in their body. Based on patch by Inada Naoki."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32911`: 由于在下游beta测试期间发现的意外兼容性问题，恢复了 "
":issue:`29463`。从Module、ClassDef、FunctionDef和AsyncFunctionDef "
"ast节点中移除了在3.7a1中添加的`docstring` 字段。docstring表达式被恢复为其主体的第一条语句。基于Inada "
"Naoki的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37356 ../NEWS:40393 ../NEWS:44772
msgid ""
":issue:`17288`: Prevent jumps from 'return' and 'exception' trace events."
msgstr ":issue:`17288`: 防止从'return'和'exception'跟踪事件跳转。"

#: ../NEWS:37358
msgid ""
":issue:`32946`: Importing names from already imported module with \"from ..."
" import ...\" is now 30% faster if the module is not a package."
msgstr ":issue:`32946`: 如果模块不是包，从已导入模块中使用“from ... import ...”导入名称现在快30%。"

#: ../NEWS:37361
msgid ""
":issue:`32932`: Make error message more revealing when there are non-str "
"objects in ``__all__``."
msgstr ":issue:`32932`: 当`__all__`中有非str对象时，使错误消息更加揭示问题。"

#: ../NEWS:37364
msgid ""
":issue:`32925`: Optimized iterating and containing test for literal lists "
"consisting of non-constants: ``x in [a, b]`` and ``for x in [a, b]``. The "
"case of all constant elements already was optimized."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32925`: 优化了对由非常量组成的字面列表的迭代和包含测试：`x in [a, b]`和`for x in [a, "
"b]`。所有元素均为常量的情况已经被优化。"

#: ../NEWS:37368 ../NEWS:40585 ../NEWS:44774
msgid ""
":issue:`32889`: Update Valgrind suppression list to account for the rename "
"of ``Py_ADDRESS_IN_RANG`` to ``address_in_range``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32889`: "
"更新Valgrind抑制列表，以考虑`Py_ADDRESS_IN_RANG`重命名为`address_in_range`的情况。"

#: ../NEWS:37371 ../NEWS:40395
msgid ""
":issue:`32836`: Don't use temporary variables in cases of list/dict/set "
"comprehensions"
msgstr ":issue:`32836`: 在列表/字典/集合推导式的情况下不使用临时变量。"

#: ../NEWS:37374 ../NEWS:40588
msgid ""
":issue:`31356`: Remove the new API added in :issue:`31356` "
"(gc.ensure_disabled() context manager)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31356`: 移除了在 :issue:`31356` 中添加的新API（gc.ensure_disabled()上下文管理器）。"

#: ../NEWS:37377 ../NEWS:40591
msgid ""
":issue:`32305`: For namespace packages, ensure that both ``__file__`` and "
"``__spec__.origin`` are set to None."
msgstr ":issue:`32305`: 对于命名空间包，确保`__file__`和`__spec__.origin`都被设置为None。"

#: ../NEWS:37380 ../NEWS:40594
msgid ""
":issue:`32303`: Make sure ``__spec__.loader`` matches ``__loader__`` for "
"namespace packages."
msgstr ":issue:`32303`: 确保对于命名空间包，``__spec__.loader`` 与 ``__loader__`` 相匹配。"

#: ../NEWS:37383 ../NEWS:40597
msgid ""
":issue:`32711`: Fix the warning messages for Python/ast_unparse.c. Patch by "
"Stéphane Wirtel"
msgstr ""
":issue:`32711`: 修复 Python/ast_unparse.c 中的警告信息。由 Stéphane Wirtel 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37386 ../NEWS:40600 ../NEWS:44785
msgid ""
":issue:`32583`: Fix possible crashing in builtin Unicode decoders caused by "
"write out-of-bound errors when using customized decode error handlers."
msgstr ":issue:`32583`: 修复在使用自定义解码错误处理程序时，内置 Unicode 解码器可能因越界写入错误而崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:37389
msgid ""
":issue:`32489`: A :keyword:`continue` statement is now allowed in the "
":keyword:`finally` clause."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32489`: 现在允许在 :keyword:`finally` 子句中使用 :keyword:`continue` 语句。"

#: ../NEWS:37392
msgid ""
":issue:`17611`: Simplified the interpreter loop by moving the logic of "
"unrolling the stack of blocks into the compiler. The compiler emits now "
"explicit instructions for adjusting the stack of values and calling the "
"cleaning up code for :keyword:`break`, :keyword:`continue` and "
":keyword:`return`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`17611`: 通过将展开块栈的逻辑移至编译器，简化了解释器循环。编译器现在会为调整值栈和调用 "
":keyword:`break`、:keyword:`continue` 及 :keyword:`return` 的清理代码发出明确的指令。"

#: ../NEWS:37398
msgid ""
"Removed opcodes :opcode:`BREAK_LOOP`, :opcode:`CONTINUE_LOOP`, "
":opcode:`SETUP_LOOP` and :opcode:`SETUP_EXCEPT`. Added new opcodes "
":opcode:`ROT_FOUR`, :opcode:`BEGIN_FINALLY` and :opcode:`CALL_FINALLY` and "
":opcode:`POP_FINALLY`. Changed the behavior of :opcode:`END_FINALLY` and "
":opcode:`WITH_CLEANUP_START`."
msgstr ""
"移除了操作码 :opcode:`BREAK_LOOP`、:opcode:`CONTINUE_LOOP`、:opcode:`SETUP_LOOP` 和 "
":opcode:`SETUP_EXCEPT`。新增了操作码 "
":opcode:`ROT_FOUR`、:opcode:`BEGIN_FINALLY`、:opcode:`CALL_FINALLY` 和 "
":opcode:`POP_FINALLY`。改变了 :opcode:`END_FINALLY` 和 "
":opcode:`WITH_CLEANUP_START` 的行为。"

#: ../NEWS:37404
msgid ""
":issue:`32285`: New function unicodedata.is_normalized, which can check "
"whether a string is in a specific normal form."
msgstr ":issue:`32285`: 新增函数 unicodedata.is_normalized，可用于检查字符串是否符合特定的正规形式。"

#: ../NEWS:37407
msgid ""
":issue:`10544`: Yield expressions are now disallowed in comprehensions and "
"generator expressions except the expression for the outermost iterable."
msgstr ":issue:`10544`: 现在禁止在推导式和生成器表达式中使用 yield 表达式，除了最外层可迭代对象的表达式。"

#: ../NEWS:37410
msgid ""
":issue:`32117`: Iterable unpacking is now allowed without parentheses in "
"yield and return statements, e.g. ``yield 1, 2, 3, *rest``. Thanks to David "
"Cuthbert for the change and Jordan Chapman for added tests."
msgstr ""
