#: ../NEWS:37433
msgid ":issue:`35845`: Add 'order' parameter to memoryview.tobytes()."
msgstr ":issue:`35845`: 向memoryview.tobytes()添加'order'参数。"

#: ../NEWS:37435
msgid ""
":issue:`35864`: The _asdict() method for collections.namedtuple now returns "
"a regular dict instead of an OrderedDict."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35864`: "
"collections.namedtuple的_asdict()方法现在返回一个常规的dict而不是OrderedDict。"

#: ../NEWS:37438
msgid ""
":issue:`35537`: An ExitStack is now used internally within subprocess.Popen "
