"之一，则不调用原始实现并返回使用 side effect 的结果，与使用 return_value 的方式相同。"

#: ../NEWS:37600
msgid ""
":issue:`35346`: Drop Mac OS 9 and Rhapsody support from the :mod:`platform` "
"module. Rhapsody last release was in 2000. Mac OS 9 last release was in "
"2001."
msgstr ""
