#: ../NEWS:37604
msgid ""
":issue:`10496`: :func:`~distutils.utils.check_environ` of "
"``distutils.utils`` now catches :exc:`KeyError` on calling "
":func:`pwd.getpwuid`: don't create the ``HOME`` environment variable in this"
