#: ../NEWS:37619
msgid ":issue:`35394`: Add empty slots to asyncio abstract protocols."
msgstr ":issue:`35394`: 向 asyncio 抽象协议添加空槽。"

#: ../NEWS:37621
msgid ""
":issue:`35310`: Fix a bug in :func:`select.select` where, in some cases, the"
" file descriptor sequences were returned unmodified after a signal "
"interruption, even though the file descriptors might not be ready yet. "
":func:`select.select` will now always return empty lists if a timeout has "
"occurred.  Patch by Oran Avraham."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35310`: 修复 :func:`select.select` "
"中的一个错误，在某些情况下，文件描述符序列在信号中断后未修改返回，即使文件描述符可能尚未准备就绪。现在，如果发生超时，:func:`select.select`"
" 将始终返回空列表。由 Oran Avraham 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37627
msgid ""
":issue:`35380`: Enable TCP_NODELAY on Windows for proactor asyncio event "
"loop."
msgstr ":issue:`35380`: 为 proactor asyncio 事件循环在 Windows 上启用 TCP_NODELAY。"

#: ../NEWS:37629
msgid ""
":issue:`35341`: Add generic version of ``collections.OrderedDict`` to the "
"``typing`` module. Patch by Ismo Toijala."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35341`: 向 ``typing`` 模块添加 ``collections.OrderedDict`` 的通用版本。由 Ismo "
"Toijala 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37632
msgid ""
":issue:`35371`: Fixed possible crash in ``os.utime()`` on Windows when pass "
"incorrect arguments."
msgstr ":issue:`35371`: 修复了在 Windows 上传递不正确参数时 ``os.utime()`` 可能崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:37635
msgid ""
":issue:`35346`: :func:`platform.uname` now redirects ``stderr`` to "
":data:`os.devnull` when running external programs like ``cmd /c ver``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35346`: :func:`platform.uname` 现在在运行外部程序（如 ``cmd /c ver``）时将 "
"``stderr`` 重定向到 :data:`os.devnull`。"

#: ../NEWS:37638
msgid ""
":issue:`35066`: Previously, calling the strftime() method on a datetime "
"object with a trailing '%' in the format string would result in an "
"exception. However, this only occurred when the datetime C module was being "
"used; the python implementation did not match this behavior. Datetime is now"
" PEP-399 compliant, and will not throw an exception on a trailing '%'."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35066`: 之前，在格式字符串中带有尾随 '%' 的 datetime 对象上调用 strftime() "
"方法会导致异常。然而，这仅在 datetime C 模块被使用时发生；Python 实现不匹配此行为。现在 datetime 符合 "
"PEP-399，不会在尾随 '%' 上抛出异常。"

#: ../NEWS:37644
msgid ""
":issue:`35345`: The function ``platform.popen`` has been removed, it was "
"deprecated since Python 3.3: use :func:`os.popen` instead."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35345`: 函数 ``platform.popen`` 已被移除，自 Python 3.3 起已弃用：请改用 "
":func:`os.popen`。"

#: ../NEWS:37647
msgid ""
":issue:`35344`: On macOS, :func:`platform.platform` now uses "
":func:`platform.mac_ver`, if it returns a non-empty release string, to get "
"the macOS version rather than the darwin version."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35344`: 在 macOS 上，:func:`platform.platform` 现在使用 "
":func:`platform.mac_ver`，如果它返回一个非空的发布字符串，以获取 macOS 版本而非 darwin 版本。"

#: ../NEWS:37651
msgid ""
":issue:`35312`: Make ``lib2to3.pgen2.parse.ParseError`` round-trip pickle-"
"able. Patch by Anthony Sottile."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35312`: 使 ``lib2to3.pgen2.parse.ParseError`` 可往返 pickle。由 Anthony "
"Sottile 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37654
msgid ""
":issue:`35308`: Fix regression in ``webbrowser`` where default browsers may "
"be preferred over browsers in the ``BROWSER`` environment variable."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35308`: 修复 ``webbrowser`` 中的回归问题，其中默认浏览器可能优先于 ``BROWSER`` 环境变量中的浏览器。"

#: ../NEWS:37657
msgid ""
":issue:`24746`: Avoid stripping trailing whitespace in doctest fancy diff. "
"Original patch by R. David Murray & Jairo Trad. Enhanced by Sanyam Khurana."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24746`: 避免在 doctest 花式差异中去除尾部空格。原始由 R. David Murray 和 Jairo Trad "
"提供补丁。由 Sanyam Khurana 增强。"

#: ../NEWS:37661
msgid ""
":issue:`28604`: :func:`locale.localeconv` now sets temporarily the "
"``LC_CTYPE`` locale to the ``LC_MONETARY`` locale if the two locales are "
"different and monetary strings are non-ASCII. This temporary change affects "
"other threads."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28604`: :func:`locale.localeconv` 现在如果两个区域设置不同且货币字符串非 ASCII，会临时将 "
"``LC_CTYPE`` 区域设置改为 ``LC_MONETARY`` 区域设置。这一临时更改会影响其他线程。"

#: ../NEWS:37666
msgid ""
":issue:`35277`: Update ensurepip to install pip 18.1 and setuptools 40.6.2."
msgstr ":issue:`35277`: 更新 ensurepip 以安装 pip 18.1 和 setuptools 40.6.2。"

#: ../NEWS:37668
msgid ":issue:`24209`: Adds IPv6 support when invoking http.server directly."
msgstr ":issue:`24209`: 直接调用 http.server 时增加 IPv6 支持。"

#: ../NEWS:37670
msgid ""
":issue:`35226`: Recursively check arguments when testing for equality of "
":class:`unittest.mock.call` objects and add note that tracking of parameters"
" used to create ancestors of mocks in ``mock_calls`` is not possible."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35226`: 在测试 :class:`unittest.mock.call` 对象相等性时递归检查参数，并添加说明，在 "
"``mock_calls`` 中追踪用于创建模拟祖先的参数是不可能的。"

#: ../NEWS:37675
msgid ""
":issue:`29564`: The warnings module now suggests to enable tracemalloc if "
"the source is specified, the tracemalloc module is available, but "
"tracemalloc is not tracing memory allocations."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29564`: warnings 模块现在建议如果指定了源，tracemalloc 模块可用但 tracemalloc "
"未跟踪内存分配时启用 tracemalloc。"

#: ../NEWS:37679
msgid ""
":issue:`35189`: Modify the following fnctl function to retry if interrupted "
"by a signal (EINTR): flock, lockf, fnctl"
msgstr ":issue:`35189`: 修改以下 fnctl 函数，在信号中断 (EINTR) 时重试：flock, lockf, fnctl"

#: ../NEWS:37682
msgid ""
":issue:`30064`: Use add_done_callback() in sock_* asyncio API to unsubscribe"
" reader/writer early on calcellation."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30064`: 在 sock_* asyncio API 中使用 add_done_callback() 以在取消时早期取消订阅 "
"reader/writer。"

#: ../NEWS:37685
msgid ""
":issue:`35186`: Removed the \"built with\" comment added when ``setup.py "
"upload`` is used with either ``bdist_rpm`` or ``bdist_dumb``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35186`: 移除当 ``setup.py upload`` 与 ``bdist_rpm`` 或 ``bdist_dumb`` "
"一起使用时添加的“built with”注释。"

#: ../NEWS:37688
msgid ""
":issue:`35152`: Allow sending more than 2 GB at once on a multiprocessing "
"connection on non-Windows systems."
msgstr ":issue:`35152`: 允许在非 Windows 系统上的多进程连接中一次发送超过 2 GB 的数据。"

#: ../NEWS:37691
msgid ""
":issue:`35062`: Fix incorrect parsing of "
":class:`io.IncrementalNewlineDecoder`'s *translate* argument."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35062`: 修复了对 :class:`io.IncrementalNewlineDecoder` 的 *translate* "
"参数的错误解析。"

#: ../NEWS:37694
msgid ""
":issue:`35065`: Remove ``StreamReaderProtocol._untrack_reader``. The call to"
" ``_untrack_reader`` is currently performed too soon, causing the protocol "
"to forget about the reader before ``connection_lost`` can run and feed the "
"EOF to the reader."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35065`: 移除了 ``StreamReaderProtocol._untrack_reader``。当前对 "
"``_untrack_reader``的调用执行得过早，导致协议在 ``connection_lost`` "
"能够运行并将EOF传递给读取器之前就忘记了读取器。"

#: ../NEWS:37699
msgid ""
":issue:`34160`: ElementTree and minidom now preserve the attribute order "
"specified by the user."
msgstr ":issue:`34160`: ElementTree和minidom现在保留了用户指定的属性顺序。"

#: ../NEWS:37702
msgid ""
":issue:`35079`: Improve difflib.SequenceManager.get_matching_blocks doc by "
"adding 'non-overlapping' and changing '!=' to '<'."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35079`: 通过添加'non-"
"overlapping'和将'!='改为'<'来改进difflib.SequenceManager.get_matching_blocks的文档。"

#: ../NEWS:37705
msgid ""
":issue:`33710`: Deprecated ``l*gettext()`` functions and methods in the "
":mod:`gettext` module. They return encoded bytes instead of Unicode strings "
"and are artifacts from Python 2 times. Also deprecated functions and methods"
" related to setting the charset for ``l*gettext()`` functions and methods."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33710`: 弃用了 :mod:`gettext` 模块中的 ``l*gettext()`` "
"函数和方法。它们返回编码的字节而不是Unicode字符串，是Python 2时代的产物。同时也弃用了与设置 ``l*gettext()`` "
"函数和方法字符集相关的函数和方法。"

#: ../NEWS:37711
msgid ""
":issue:`35017`: :meth:`socketserver.BaseServer.serve_forever` now exits "
"immediately if it's :meth:`~socketserver.BaseServer.shutdown` method is "
"called while it is polling for new events."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35017`: 现在，如果 :socketserver.BaseServer.serve_forever`的 "
":meth:`~socketserver.BaseServer.shutdown` 方法在轮询新事件时被调用，它会立即退出。"

#: ../NEWS:37715
msgid ""
":issue:`35024`: ``importlib`` no longer logs ``wrote <bytecode path>`` "
"redundantly after ``(created|could not create) <bytecode path>`` is already "
"logged. Patch by Quentin Agren."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35024`: ``importlib`` 不再在 ``(created|could not create) <bytecode "
"path>`` 已经被记录后冗余地记录 ``wrote <bytecode path>``。由Quentin Agren提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37719
msgid ""
":issue:`35047`: ``unittest.mock`` now includes mock calls in exception "
"messages if ``assert_not_called``, ``assert_called_once``, or "
"``assert_called_once_with`` fails. Patch by Petter Strandmark."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35047`: 现在，如果 ``assert_not_called``、``assert_called_once`` "
"或``assert_called_once_with``失败，``unittest.mock``会在异常消息中包含模拟调用。由Petter "
"Strandmark提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37723
msgid ""
":issue:`31047`: Fix ``ntpath.abspath`` regression where it didn't remove a "
"trailing separator on Windows. Patch by Tim Graham."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31047`: 修复了 ``ntpath.abspath`` 在Windows上未移除尾部分隔符的回归问题。由Tim "
"Graham提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37726
msgid ""
":issue:`35053`: tracemalloc now tries to update the traceback when an object"
