"used by the builtin list type for example)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35053`: tracemalloc现在尝试在对象从\"自由列表\"（用于更快创建对象的优化，例如内置列表类型使用）中重用时更新回溯。"

#: ../NEWS:37730
msgid ""
":issue:`31553`: Add the --json-lines option to json.tool. Patch by "
"hongweipeng."
msgstr ":issue:`31553`: 向json.tool添加了--json-lines选项。由hongweipeng提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37732
msgid ""
":issue:`34794`: Fixed a leak in Tkinter when pass the Python wrapper around "
"Tcl_Obj back to Tcl/Tk."
msgstr ":issue:`34794`: 修复了在将Tcl_Obj的Python包装器传回Tcl/Tk时Tkinter中的泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:37735
msgid ""
":issue:`34909`: Enum: fix grandchildren subclassing when parent mixed with "
"concrete data types."
msgstr ":issue:`34909`: 枚举：修复当父类与具体数据类型混合时子类的子类化问题。"

#: ../NEWS:37738
msgid ""
":issue:`35022`: :class:`unittest.mock.MagicMock` now supports the "
"``__fspath__`` method (from :class:`os.PathLike`)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35022`: :class:`unittest.mock.MagicMock` 现在支持 ``__fspath__`` 方法（来自 "
":class:`os.PathLike`）。"

#: ../NEWS:37741
msgid ""
":issue:`35008`: Fixed references leaks when call the ``__setstate__()`` "
"method of :class:`xml.etree.ElementTree.Element` in the C implementation for"
" already initialized element."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35008`: 修复了在 C 实现中调用已初始化元素的 :class:`xml.etree.ElementTree.Element` 的"
" ``__setstate__()`` 方法时的引用泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:37745
msgid ""
":issue:`23420`: Verify the value for the parameter '-s' of the cProfile CLI."
" Patch by Robert Kuska"
msgstr ":issue:`23420`: 验证 cProfile CLI 的 '-s' 参数的值。由 Robert Kuska 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37748
msgid ""
":issue:`33947`: dataclasses now handle recursive reprs without raising "
"RecursionError."
msgstr ":issue:`33947`: 数据类现在可以处理递归 repr 而不会引发 RecursionError。"

#: ../NEWS:37751
msgid ""
":issue:`34890`: Make :func:`inspect.iscoroutinefunction`, "
":func:`inspect.isgeneratorfunction` and :func:`inspect.isasyncgenfunction` "
"work with :func:`functools.partial`. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34890`: 使 "
":func:`inspect.iscoroutinefunction`、:func:`inspect.isgeneratorfunction` 和 "
":func:`inspect.isasyncgenfunction` 与 :func:`functools.partial` 一起工作。由 Pablo "
"Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37755
msgid ""
":issue:`34521`: Use :func:`socket.CMSG_SPACE` to calculate ancillary data "
"size instead of :func:`socket.CMSG_LEN` in "
":func:`multiprocessing.reduction.recvfds` as :rfc:`3542` requires the use of"
