msgstr ""
":issue:`34521`: 使用 :func:`socket.CMSG_SPACE` 而不是 :func:`socket.CMSG_LEN` 在 "
":func:`multiprocessing.reduction.recvfds` 中计算辅助数据大小，因为 :rfc:`3542` "
"要求便携式应用程序使用前者。"

#: ../NEWS:37760
msgid ""
":issue:`31522`: The ``mailbox.mbox.get_string`` function *from_* parameter "
"can now successfully be set to a non-default value."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31522`: ``mailbox.mbox.get_string`` 函数的 *from_* 参数现在可以成功设置为非默认值。"

#: ../NEWS:37763
msgid ""
":issue:`34970`: Protect tasks weak set manipulation in "
"``asyncio.all_tasks()``"
msgstr ":issue:`34970`: 在 ``asyncio.all_tasks()`` 中保护任务弱集操作。"

#: ../NEWS:37765
msgid ""
":issue:`34969`: gzip: Add --fast, --best on the gzip CLI, these parameters "
"will be used for the fast compression method (quick) or the best method "
"compress (slower, but smaller file). Also, change the default compression "
"level to 6 (tradeoff)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34969`: gzip：在 gzip CLI 上添加 --fast、--best "
"参数，这些参数将用于快速压缩方法（quick）或最佳压缩方法（较慢，但文件更小）。同时，将默认压缩级别更改为 6（折中）。"

#: ../NEWS:37770
msgid ""
":issue:`16965`: The 2to3 ``execfile`` fixer now opens the file with mode "
"``'rb'``.  Patch by Zackery Spytz."
msgstr ""
":issue:`16965`: 2to3 的 ``execfile`` 修复器现在以 ``'rb'`` 模式打开文件。由 Zackery Spytz "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37773
msgid ""
":issue:`34966`: :mod:`pydoc` now supports aliases not only to methods "
"defined in the end class, but also to inherited methods.  The docstring is "
"not duplicated for aliases."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34966`: :mod:`pydoc` 现在不仅支持对最终类中定义的方法的别名，还支持对继承的方法的别名。文档字符串不会为别名重复。"

#: ../NEWS:37777
msgid ""
":issue:`34926`: :meth:`mimetypes.MimeTypes.guess_type` now accepts "
