"``selection_from``、``selection_range``、``selection_present`` 和 "
"``selection_to`` 方法。由 Juliette Monsel 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37801
msgid ""
":issue:`34911`: Added *secure_protocols* argument to "
"*http.cookiejar.DefaultCookiePolicy* to allow for tweaking of protocols and "
"also to add support by default for *wss*, the secure websocket protocol."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34911`: 向 *http.cookiejar.DefaultCookiePolicy* 添加了 "
"*secure_protocols* 参数，以允许调整协议，并默认支持 *wss*（安全的 websocket 协议）。"

#: ../NEWS:37806
msgid ""
":issue:`34922`: Fixed integer overflow in the :meth:`~hashlib.shake.digest` "
"and :meth:`~hashlib.shake.hexdigest` methods for the SHAKE algorithm in the "
":mod:`hashlib` module."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34922`: 修复了 :mod:`hashlib` 模块中 SHAKE 算法的 "
":meth:`~hashlib.shake.digest` 和 :meth:`~hashlib.shake.hexdigest` 方法的整数溢出问题。"

#: ../NEWS:37810
msgid ""
":issue:`34925`: 25% speedup in argument parsing for the functions in the "
"bisect module."
msgstr ":issue:`34925`: bisect 模块中函数的参数解析速度提高了 25%。"

#: ../NEWS:37813
msgid ""
":issue:`34900`: Fixed :meth:`unittest.TestCase.debug` when used to call test"
" methods with subtests.  Patch by Bruno Oliveira."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34900`: 修复了 :meth:`unittest.TestCase.debug` 在调用带有子测试的测试方法时的问题。由 "
"Bruno Oliveira 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37816
msgid ""
":issue:`34844`: logging.Formatter enhancement - Ensure styles and fmt "
"matches in logging.Formatter - Added validate method in each format style "
"class: StrFormatStyle, PercentStyle, StringTemplateStyle. - This method is "
"called in the constructor of logging.Formatter class - Also re-raise the "
"KeyError in the format method of each style class, so it would a bit clear "
"that it's an error with the invalid format fields."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34844`: logging.Formatter 增强 - 确保 logging.Formatter 中的样式和 fmt 匹配 - "
"在每个格式样式类（StrFormatStyle、PercentStyle、StringTemplateStyle）中添加了 validate 方法。 -"
" 此方法在 logging.Formatter 类的构造函数中调用 - 同时在每个样式类的 format 方法中重新引发 "
"KeyError，以便更清楚地表明这是无效格式字段的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:37823
msgid ""
":issue:`34897`: Adjust test.support.missing_compiler_executable check so "
"that a nominal command name of \"\" is ignored. Patch by Michael Felt."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34897`: 调整 test.support.missing_compiler_executable 检查，以便忽略名义命令名为 "
"\"\" 的情况。由 Michael Felt 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37826
msgid ""
":issue:`34871`: Fix inspect module polluted ``sys.modules`` when parsing "
"``__text_signature__`` of callable."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34871`: 修复 inspect 模块在解析可调用对象的 ``__text_signature__`` 时污染 "
"``sys.modules`` 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:37829
msgid ""
":issue:`34898`: Add ``mtime`` argument to ``gzip.compress`` for reproducible"
" output. Patch by Guo Ci Teo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34898`: 向 ``gzip.compress`` 添加 ``mtime`` 参数以实现可重现的输出。由 Guo Ci Teo "
"提交补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37832
msgid ""
":issue:`28441`: On Cygwin and MinGW, ensure that ``sys.executable`` always "
"includes the full filename in the path, including the ``.exe`` suffix "
"(unless it is a symbolic link)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28441`: 在 Cygwin 和 MinGW 上，确保 ``sys.executable`` 始终包含路径中的完整文件名，包括 "
"``.exe`` 后缀（除非它是符号链接）。"

#: ../NEWS:37836
msgid ""
":issue:`34866`: Adding ``max_num_fields`` to ``cgi.FieldStorage`` to make "
"DOS attacks harder by limiting the number of ``MiniFieldStorage`` objects "
"created by ``FieldStorage``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34866`: 向 ``cgi.FieldStorage`` 添加 ``max_num_fields``，通过限制 "
"``FieldStorage`` 创建的 ``MiniFieldStorage`` 对象数量来增加 DOS 攻击的难度。"

#: ../NEWS:37840
msgid ""
":issue:`34711`: http.server ensures it reports HTTPStatus.NOT_FOUND when the"
" local path ends with \"/\" and is not a directory, even if the underlying "
"OS (e.g. AIX) accepts such paths as a valid file reference. Patch by Michael"
" Felt."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34711`: http.server 确保当本地路径以 \"/\" 结尾且不是目录时报告 "
"HTTPStatus.NOT_FOUND，即使底层操作系统（如 AIX）接受此类路径作为有效文件引用。由 Michael Felt 提交补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37845
msgid ""
":issue:`34872`: Fix self-cancellation in C implementation of asyncio.Task"
msgstr ":issue:`34872`: 修复 asyncio.Task 的 C 实现中的自我取消问题。"

#: ../NEWS:37847
msgid ""
":issue:`34849`: Don't log waiting for ``selector.select`` in asyncio loop "
"iteration. The waiting is pretty normal for any asyncio program, logging its"
" time just adds a noise to logs without any useful information provided."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34849`: 不在 asyncio 循环迭代中记录等待 ``selector.select``。等待对于任何 asyncio "
"程序来说都是非常正常的，记录其时间只会给日志添加噪音而不提供任何有用信息。"

#: ../NEWS:37852
msgid ""
":issue:`34022`: The :envvar:`SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH` environment variable no "
"longer overrides the value of the *invalidation_mode* argument to "
":func:`py_compile.compile`, and determines its default value instead."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34022`: 环境变量 :envvar:`SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH` 不再覆盖 "
":func:`py_compile.compile` 的 *invalidation_mode* 参数的值，而是决定其默认值。"

#: ../NEWS:37856
msgid ""
":issue:`34819`: Use a monotonic clock to compute timeouts in "
":meth:`Executor.map` and :func:`as_completed`, in order to prevent timeouts "
"from deviating when the system clock is adjusted."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34819`: 在 :meth:`Executor.map` 和 :func:`as_completed` "
"中使用单调时钟计算超时，以防止系统时钟调整时超时偏离。"

#: ../NEWS:37860
msgid ""
":issue:`34758`: Add .wasm -> application/wasm to list of recognized file "
"types and content type headers"
msgstr ":issue:`34758`: 将 .wasm -> application/wasm 添加到识别的文件类型和内容类型头列表中。"

#: ../NEWS:37863
msgid ""
":issue:`34789`: :func:`xml.sax.make_parser` now accepts any iterable as its "
"*parser_list* argument.  Patch by Andrés Delfino."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34789`: :func:`xml.sax.make_parser` 现在接受任何可迭代对象作为其 *parser_list* "
"参数。由 Andrés Delfino 提交补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37866
msgid ""
":issue:`34334`: In :class:`QueueHandler`, clear ``exc_text`` from "
":class:`LogRecord` to prevent traceback from being written twice."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34334`: 在 :class:`QueueHandler` 中，清除 :class:`LogRecord` 中的 "
"``exc_text`` 以防止追踪信息被写入两次。"

#: ../NEWS:37869
msgid ""
":issue:`34687`: On Windows, asyncio now uses ProactorEventLoop, instead of "
"SelectorEventLoop, by default."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34687`: 在 Windows 上，asyncio 现在默认使用 ProactorEventLoop，而不是 "
"SelectorEventLoop。"

#: ../NEWS:37872
msgid ""
":issue:`5950`: Support reading zip files with archive comments in "
":mod:`zipimport`."
msgstr ":issue:`5950`: 支持在 :mod:`zipimport` 中读取带有归档注释的 zip 文件。"

#: ../NEWS:37875
msgid ""
":issue:`32892`: The parser now represents all constants as "
":class:`ast.Constant` instead of using specific constant AST types (``Num``,"
" ``Str``, ``Bytes``, ``NameConstant`` and ``Ellipsis``). These classes are "
"considered deprecated and will be removed in future Python versions."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32892`: 解析器现在将所有常量表示为 :class:`ast.Constant`，而不是使用特定的常量 AST "
"类型（``Num``、``Str``、``Bytes``、``NameConstant`` 和 "
"``Ellipsis``）。这些类被视为已弃用，将在未来的 Python 版本中移除。"

#: ../NEWS:37881
msgid ""
":issue:`34728`: Add deprecation warning when ``loop`` is used in methods: "
"``asyncio.sleep``, ``asyncio.wait`` and ``asyncio.wait_for``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34728`: 当在方法 ``asyncio.sleep``、``asyncio.wait`` 和 "
"``asyncio.wait_for`` 中使用 ``loop`` 时，添加弃用警告。"

#: ../NEWS:37884
msgid ""
":issue:`34738`: ZIP files created by ``distutils`` will now include entries "
"for directories."
msgstr ":issue:`34738`: 由 ``distutils`` 创建的 ZIP 文件现在将包含目录条目。"

#: ../NEWS:37887
msgid ""
":issue:`34659`: Add an optional *initial* argument to "
"itertools.accumulate()."
msgstr ":issue:`34659`: 向 itertools.accumulate() 添加一个可选的 *initial* 参数。"

#: ../NEWS:37889
msgid ":issue:`29577`: Support multiple mixin classes when creating Enums."
msgstr ":issue:`29577`: 支持在创建 Enums 时使用多个混合类。"

#: ../NEWS:37891
msgid ""
":issue:`34670`: Add SSLContext.post_handshake_auth and "
"SSLSocket.verify_client_post_handshake for TLS 1.3's post handshake "
"authentication feature."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34670`: 为 TLS 1.3 的握手后认证功能添加 SSLContext.post_handshake_auth 和 "
"SSLSocket.verify_client_post_handshake。"

#: ../NEWS:37895
msgid ""
":issue:`32718`: The Activate.ps1 script from venv works with PowerShell Core"
" 6.1 and is now available under all operating systems."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32718`: venv 的 Activate.ps1 脚本现在可以与 PowerShell Core 6.1 "
"一起使用，并且在所有操作系统下都可用。"

#: ../NEWS:37898
msgid ""
":issue:`31177`: Fix bug that prevented using :meth:`reset_mock "
"<unittest.mock.Mock.reset_mock>` on mock instances with deleted attributes"
msgstr ""
":issue:`31177`: 修复了在使用 :meth:`reset_mock <unittest.mock.Mock.reset_mock>` "
"时，无法在删除属性的模拟实例上使用的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:37901
msgid ""
":issue:`34672`: Add a workaround, so the ``'Z'`` :func:`time.strftime` "
"specifier on the musl C library can work in some cases."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34672`: 添加一个变通方法，使得在某些情况下，musl C 库上的 ``'Z'`` :func:`time.strftime` "
"说明符可以工作。"

#: ../NEWS:37904
msgid ""
":issue:`34666`: Implement ``asyncio.StreamWriter.awrite`` and "
"``asyncio.StreamWriter.aclose()`` coroutines.  Methods are needed for "
"providing a consistent stream API with control flow switched on by default."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34666`: 实现 ``asyncio.StreamWriter.awrite`` 和 "
"``asyncio.StreamWriter.aclose()`` 协程。这些方法是为了提供一致的流 API，默认情况下开启控制流。"

#: ../NEWS:37909
msgid ""
":issue:`6721`: Acquire the logging module's commonly used internal locks "
"while fork()ing to avoid deadlocks in the child process."
msgstr ":issue:`6721`: 在 fork() 过程中获取日志模块常用的内部锁，以避免子进程中的死锁。"

#: ../NEWS:37912
msgid ""
":issue:`34658`: Fix a rare interpreter unhandled exception state SystemError"
" only seen when using subprocess with a preexec_fn while an after_parent "
"handler has been registered with os.register_at_fork and the fork system "
"call fails."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34658`: 修复了一个罕见的解释器未处理异常状态 SystemError，仅在以下情况下出现：使用 subprocess 与 "
"preexec_fn 同时，os.register_at_fork 注册了 after_parent 处理程序，并且 fork 系统调用失败。"

#: ../NEWS:37917
msgid ":issue:`34652`: Ensure :func:`os.lchmod` is never defined on Linux."
msgstr ":issue:`34652`: 确保 :func:`os.lchmod` 永远不会在 Linux 上定义。"

#: ../NEWS:37919
msgid ""
":issue:`34638`: Store a weak reference to stream reader to break strong "
"references loop between reader and protocol.  It allows to detect and close "
"the socket if the stream is deleted (garbage collected) without ``close()`` "
"call."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34638`: 存储对流读取器的弱引用，以打破读取器和协议之间的强引用循环。这允许在流被删除（垃圾回收）而未调用 ``close()``"
" 时检测并关闭套接字。"

#: ../NEWS:37924
msgid ""
":issue:`34536`: ``Enum._missing_``:  raise ``ValueError`` if None returned "
"and ``TypeError`` if non-member is returned."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34536`: ``Enum._missing_``: 如果返回None则抛出 "
"``ValueError``，如果返回非成员则抛出``TypeError``。"

#: ../NEWS:37927
msgid ""
":issue:`34636`: Speed up re scanning of many non-matching characters for \\s"
" \\w and \\d within bytes objects. (microoptimization)"
msgstr ":issue:`34636`: 加快对字节对象中\\s \\w和\\d的多次不匹配字符的重新扫描。（微优化）"

#: ../NEWS:37930
msgid ""
":issue:`24412`: Add :func:`~unittest.addModuleCleanup` and "
":meth:`~unittest.TestCase.addClassCleanup` to unittest to support cleanups "
"for :func:`~unittest.setUpModule` and :meth:`~unittest.TestCase.setUpClass`."
" Patch by Lisa Roach."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24412`: 向unittest添加 :func:`~unittest.addModuleCleanup` 和 "
":meth:`~unittest.TestCase.addClassCleanup` 以支持 :func:`~unittest.setUpModule`"
" 和 :meth:`~unittest.TestCase.setUpClass` 的清理工作。由Lisa Roach提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37935
msgid ""
":issue:`34630`: Don't log SSL certificate errors in asyncio code (connection"
" error logging is skipped already)."
msgstr ":issue:`34630`: 不在asyncio代码中记录SSL证书错误（连接错误记录已被跳过）。"

#: ../NEWS:37938
msgid ""
":issue:`32490`: Prevent filename duplication in :mod:`subprocess` exception "
"messages.  Patch by Zackery Spytz."
msgstr ":issue:`32490`: 防止在 :mod:`subprocess` 异常消息中文件名重复。由Zackery Spytz提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37941
msgid ""
":issue:`34363`: dataclasses.asdict() and .astuple() now handle namedtuples "
"correctly."
msgstr ":issue:`34363`: dataclasses.asdict()和.astuple()现在能正确处理命名元组。"

#: ../NEWS:37944
msgid ":issue:`34625`: Update vendorized expat library version to 2.2.6."
msgstr ":issue:`34625`: 更新供应商化的expat库版本至2.2.6。"

#: ../NEWS:37946
msgid ""
":issue:`32270`: The subprocess module no longer mistakenly closes redirected"
" fds even when they were in pass_fds when outside of the default {0, 1, 2} "
"set."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32270`: subprocess模块不再错误地关闭被重定向的文件描述符，即使它们在pass_fds中且不在默认的{0, 1, "
"2}集合内。"

#: ../NEWS:37950
msgid ""
":issue:`34622`: Create a dedicated ``asyncio.CancelledError``, "
"``asyncio.InvalidStateError`` and ``asyncio.TimeoutError`` exception "
"classes.  Inherit them from corresponding exceptions from "
"``concurrent.futures`` package. Extract ``asyncio`` exceptions into a "
"separate file."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34622`: 创建专用的 "
"``asyncio.CancelledError``、``asyncio.InvalidStateError`` "
"和``asyncio.TimeoutError``异常类。使它们继承自 ``concurrent.futures`` "
"包中对应的异常。将``asyncio``异常提取到一个单独的文件中。"

#: ../NEWS:37956
msgid ""
":issue:`34610`: Fixed iterator of "
":class:`multiprocessing.managers.DictProxy`."
msgstr ":issue:`34610`: 修复了 :class:`multiprocessing.managers.DictProxy` 的迭代器。"

#: ../NEWS:37958
msgid ""
":issue:`34421`: Fix distutils logging for non-ASCII strings.  This caused "
"installation issues on Windows."
msgstr ":issue:`34421`: 修复distutils对非ASCII字符串的日志记录。这曾导致Windows上的安装问题。"

#: ../NEWS:37961
msgid ""
":issue:`34604`: Fix possible mojibake in the error message of "
"``pwd.getpwnam`` and ``grp.getgrnam`` using string representation because of"
" invisible characters or trailing whitespaces. Patch by William Grzybowski."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34604`: 修复了由于不可见字符或尾部空格导致的 ``pwd.getpwnam`` 和 ``grp.getgrnam`` "
"错误消息中可能的乱码问题，通过使用字符串表示。由William Grzybowski提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37965
msgid ""
":issue:`30977`: Make uuid.UUID use ``__slots__`` to reduce its memory "
"footprint. Based on original patch by Wouter Bolsterlee."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30977`: 使uuid.UUID使用 ``__slots__`` 以减少其内存占用。基于Wouter "
"Bolsterlee的原始补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37968
msgid ""
":issue:`34574`: OrderedDict iterators are not exhausted during pickling "
"anymore. Patch by Sergey Fedoseev."
msgstr ":issue:`34574`: OrderedDict迭代器在pickling时不再耗尽。由Sergey Fedoseev提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37971
msgid ""
":issue:`8110`: Refactored :mod:`subprocess` to check for Windows-specific "
"modules rather than ``sys.platform == 'win32'``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`8110`: 重构 :mod:`subprocess` 以检查Windows特定模块，而非``sys.platform == "
"'win32'``。"

#: ../NEWS:37974
msgid ""
":issue:`34530`: ``distutils.spawn.find_executable()`` now falls back on "
":data:`os.defpath` if the ``PATH`` environment variable is not set."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34530`: ``distutils.spawn.find_executable()`` 现在在没有设置 ``PATH`` "
"环境变量时回退到 :data:`os.defpath`。"

#: ../NEWS:37977
msgid ""
":issue:`34563`: On Windows, fix multiprocessing.Connection for very large "
"read: fix _winapi.PeekNamedPipe() and _winapi.ReadFile() for read larger "
"than INT_MAX (usually ``2**31-1``)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34563`: "
"在Windows上，修复multiprocessing.Connection对于非常大的读取的修复：修复_winapi.PeekNamedPipe()和_winapi.ReadFile()对于大于INT_MAX（通常是"
" ``2**31-1``）的读取。"

#: ../NEWS:37981
msgid ":issue:`34558`: Correct typo in Lib/ctypes/_aix.py"
msgstr ":issue:`34558`: 修正Lib/ctypes/_aix.py中的拼写错误。"

#: ../NEWS:37983
msgid ""
":issue:`34282`: Move ``Enum._convert`` to ``EnumMeta._convert_`` and fix "
"enum members getting shadowed by parent attributes."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34282`: 将 ``Enum._convert`` 移动到 ``EnumMeta._convert_`` "
"并修复枚举成员被父属性遮蔽的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:37986
msgid ""
":issue:`22872`: When the queue is closed, :exc:`ValueError` is now raised by"
" :meth:`multiprocessing.Queue.put` and :meth:`multiprocessing.Queue.get` "
"instead of :exc:`AssertionError` and :exc:`OSError`, respectively. Patch by "
"Zackery Spytz."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22872`: 当队列关闭时，:meth:`multiprocessing.Queue.put` 和 "
":meth:`multiprocessing.Queue.get` 现在分别抛出 :exc:`ValueError` 而不是 "
":exc:`AssertionError` 和 :exc:`OSError`。由Zackery Spytz提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:37991
msgid ""
":issue:`34515`: Fix parsing non-ASCII identifiers in "
":mod:`!lib2to3.pgen2.tokenize` (:pep:`3131`)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34515`: 修复 :mod:`!lib2to3.pgen2.tokenize` "
"中解析非ASCII标识符的问题（:pep:`3131`）。"

#: ../NEWS:37994
msgid ""
":issue:`13312`: Avoids a possible integer underflow (undefined behavior) in "
"the time module's year handling code when passed a very low negative year "
"value."
msgstr ":issue:`13312`: 避免时间模块的年处理代码在传递非常低的负年值时可能出现的整数下溢（未定义行为）。"

#: ../NEWS:37998
msgid ""
":issue:`34472`: Improved compatibility for streamed files in :mod:`zipfile`."
" Previously an optional signature was not being written and certain ZIP "
"applications were not supported. Patch by Silas Sewell."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34472`: 提高 :mod:`zipfile` 中流式文件的兼容性。之前未写入可选签名，不支持某些ZIP应用程序。由Silas "
"Sewell提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38002
msgid ""
":issue:`34454`: Fix the .fromisoformat() methods of datetime types crashing "
"when given unicode with non-UTF-8-encodable code points.  Specifically, "
"datetime.fromisoformat() now accepts surrogate unicode code points used as "
"the separator. Report and tests by Alexey Izbyshev, patch by Paul Ganssle."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34454`: "
"修复datetime类型的.fromisoformat()方法在给定非UTF-8可编码的Unicode时崩溃的问题。具体来说，datetime.fromisoformat()现在接受用作分隔符的代理Unicode码点。报告和测试由Alexey"
" Izbyshev提供，由Paul Ganssle提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38007
msgid ""
":issue:`6700`: Fix inspect.getsourcelines for module level "
"frames/tracebacks. Patch by Vladimir Matveev."
msgstr ""
":issue:`6700`: 修复inspect.getsourcelines对于模块级别的帧/回溯的问题。由Vladimir Matveev提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38010
msgid ""
":issue:`34171`: Running the :mod:`trace` module no longer creates the "
"``trace.cover`` file."
msgstr ":issue:`34171`: 运行 :mod:`trace` 模块不再创建 ``trace.cover`` 文件。"

#: ../NEWS:38013
msgid ""
":issue:`34441`: Fix crash when an ``ABC``-derived class with invalid "
"``__subclasses__`` is passed as the second argument to :func:`issubclass`. "
"Patch by Alexey Izbyshev."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34441`: 修复当传递一个具有无效 ``__subclasses__`` 的 ``ABC`` 派生类作为 "
":func:`issubclass` 的第二个参数时崩溃的问题。由 Alexey Izbyshev 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38017
msgid ""
":issue:`34427`: Fix infinite loop in ``a.extend(a)`` for ``MutableSequence``"
" subclasses."
msgstr ":issue:`34427`: 修复 ``MutableSequence`` 子类中 ``a.extend(a)`` 导致的无限循环问题。"

#: ../NEWS:38020
msgid ""
":issue:`34412`: Make :func:`signal.strsignal` work on HP-UX. Patch by "
"Michael Osipov."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34412`: 使 :func:`signal.strsignal` 在 HP-UX 上工作。由 Michael Osipov "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38023
msgid ""
":issue:`20849`: shutil.copytree now accepts a new ``dirs_exist_ok`` keyword "
"argument. Patch by Josh Bronson."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20849`: shutil.copytree 现在接受一个新的 ``dirs_exist_ok`` 关键字参数。由 Josh "
"Bronson 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38026
msgid ""
":issue:`31715`: Associate ``.mjs`` file extension with "
"``application/javascript`` MIME Type."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31715`: 将 ``.mjs`` 文件扩展名与 ``application/javascript`` MIME 类型关联。"

#: ../NEWS:38029
msgid ""
":issue:`34384`: :func:`os.readlink` now accepts :term:`path-like <path-like "
"object>` and :class:`bytes` objects on Windows."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34384`: :func:`os.readlink` 现在在 Windows 上接受 :term:`路径类 <path-like "
"object>` 和 :class:`bytes` 对象。"

#: ../NEWS:38032
msgid ""
":issue:`22602`: The UTF-7 decoder now raises :exc:`UnicodeDecodeError` for "
"ill-formed sequences starting with \"+\" (as specified in RFC 2152).  Patch "
"by Zackery Spytz."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22602`: UTF-7 解码器现在对以 \"+\" 开头的不良序列（如 RFC 2152 中指定）引发 "
":exc:`UnicodeDecodeError`。由 Zackery Spytz 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38036
msgid ""
":issue:`2122`: The :meth:`mmap.flush() <mmap.mmap.flush>` method now returns"
" ``None`` on success, raises an exception on error under all platforms."
msgstr ""
":issue:`2122`: :meth:`mmap.flush() <mmap.mmap.flush>` 方法现在在成功时返回 "
"``None``，在所有平台上的错误时引发异常。"

#: ../NEWS:38039
msgid ""
":issue:`34341`: Appending to the ZIP archive with the ZIP64 extension no "
"longer grows the size of extra fields of existing entries."
msgstr ":issue:`34341`: 使用 ZIP64 扩展附加到 ZIP 存档不再增加现有条目的额外字段的大小。"

#: ../NEWS:38042
msgid ""
":issue:`34333`: Fix %-formatting in :meth:`pathlib.PurePath.with_suffix` "
"when formatting an error message."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34333`: 修复 :meth:`pathlib.PurePath.with_suffix` 中格式化错误消息时的 %-格式化问题。"

#: ../NEWS:38045
msgid ""
":issue:`18540`: The :class:`imaplib.IMAP4` and :class:`imaplib.IMAP4_SSL` "
"classes now resolve to the local host IP correctly when the default value of"
" *host* parameter (``''``) is used."
msgstr ""
":issue:`18540`: :class:`imaplib.IMAP4` 和 :class:`imaplib.IMAP4_SSL` 类现在在使用 "
"*host* 参数的默认值（``''``）时正确解析到本地主机 IP。"

#: ../NEWS:38049
msgid ""
":issue:`26502`: Implement ``traceback.FrameSummary.__len__()`` method to "
"preserve compatibility with the old tuple API."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26502`: 实现 ``traceback.FrameSummary.__len__()`` 方法以保持与旧元组 API 的兼容性。"

#: ../NEWS:38052
msgid ""
":issue:`34318`: :func:`~unittest.TestCase.assertRaises`, "
":func:`~unittest.TestCase.assertRaisesRegex`, "
":func:`~unittest.TestCase.assertWarns` and "
":func:`~unittest.TestCase.assertWarnsRegex` no longer success if the passed "
"callable is None. They no longer ignore unknown keyword arguments in the "
"context manager mode. A DeprecationWarning was raised in these cases since "
"Python 3.5."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34318`: :func:`~unittest.TestCase.assertRaises`, "
":func:`~unittest.TestCase.assertRaisesRegex`, "
":func:`~unittest.TestCase.assertWarns` 和 "
":func:`~unittest.TestCase.assertWarnsRegex` 如果传递的可调用对象为 None "
"则不再成功。它们在上下文管理器模式下不再忽略未知关键字参数。自 Python 3.5 以来，在这些情况下会引发 DeprecationWarning。"

#: ../NEWS:38060
msgid ""
":issue:`9372`: Deprecate :meth:`~object.__getitem__` methods of "
":class:`xml.dom.pulldom.DOMEventStream`, :class:`wsgiref.util.FileWrapper` "
"and :class:`fileinput.FileInput`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`9372`: 弃用 "
":class:`xml.dom.pulldom.DOMEventStream`、:class:`wsgiref.util.FileWrapper` 和 "
":class:`fileinput.FileInput` 的 :meth:`~object.__getitem__` 方法。"

#: ../NEWS:38064
msgid ""
":issue:`33613`: Fix a race condition in "
"``multiprocessing.semaphore_tracker`` when the tracker receives SIGINT "
"before it can register signal handlers for ignoring it."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33613`: 修复 ``multiprocessing.semaphore_tracker`` 中的竞态条件，该条件发生在追踪器接收到"
" SIGINT 信号但尚未注册信号处理程序以忽略它之前。"

#: ../NEWS:38068
msgid ""
":issue:`34248`: Report filename in the exception raised when the database "
"file cannot be opened by :func:`dbm.gnu.open` and :func:`dbm.ndbm.open` due "
"to OS-related error. Patch by Zsolt Cserna."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34248`: 当由于操作系统相关错误 :func:`dbm.gnu.open` 和 :func:`dbm.ndbm.open` "
"无法打开数据库文件时，在引发的异常中报告文件名。由 Zsolt Cserna 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38072
msgid ""
":issue:`33089`: Add math.dist() to compute the Euclidean distance between "
"two points."
msgstr ":issue:`33089`: 添加 math.dist() 以计算两点之间的欧几里得距离。"

#: ../NEWS:38075
msgid ""
":issue:`34246`: :meth:`smtplib.SMTP.send_message` no longer modifies the "
"content of the *mail_options* argument. Patch by Pablo S. Blum de Aguiar."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34246`: :meth:`smtplib.SMTP.send_message` 不再修改 *mail_options* "
"参数的内容。补丁由 Pablo S. Blum de Aguiar 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:38078
msgid ""
":issue:`31047`: Fix ``ntpath.abspath`` for invalid paths on windows. Patch "
"by Franz Woellert."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31047`: 修复 Windows 上无效路径的 ``ntpath.abspath``。由 Franz Woellert 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38081
msgid ""
":issue:`32321`: Add pure Python fallback for functools.reduce. Patch by "
"Robert Wright."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32321`: 为 functools.reduce 添加纯 Python 回退。由 Robert Wright 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38084
msgid ""
":issue:`34270`: The default asyncio task class now always has a name which "
"can be get or set using two new methods (:meth:`~asyncio.Task.get_name` and "
":meth:`~asyncio.Task.set_name`) and is visible in the :func:`repr` output. "
"An initial name can also be set using the new ``name`` keyword argument to "
":func:`asyncio.create_task` or the "
":meth:`~asyncio.AbstractEventLoop.create_task` method of the event loop. If "
"no initial name is set, the default Task implementation generates a name "
"like ``Task-1`` using a monotonic counter."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34270`: 默认的 asyncio 任务类现在始终有一个名称，可以使用两个新方法 "
"(:meth:`~asyncio.Task.get_name` 和 :meth:`~asyncio.Task.set_name`) 获取或设置，并且在 "
":func:`repr` 输出中可见。初始名称也可以使用 :func:`asyncio.create_task` 的新 ``name`` "
"关键字参数或事件循环的 :meth:`~asyncio.AbstractEventLoop.create_task` "
"方法设置。如果未设置初始名称，默认的任务实现会使用单调计数器生成类似 ``Task-1`` 的名称。"

#: ../NEWS:38093
msgid ""
":issue:`34263`: asyncio's event loop will not pass timeouts longer than one "
"day to epoll/select etc."
msgstr ":issue:`34263`: asyncio 的事件循环不会将超过一天的超时传递给 epoll/select 等。"

#: ../NEWS:38096
msgid ""
":issue:`34035`: Fix several AttributeError in zipfile seek() methods. Patch "
"by Mickaël Schoentgen."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34035`: 修复 zipfile seek() 方法中的几个 AttributeError。由 Mickaël Schoentgen"
" 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38099
msgid ""
":issue:`32215`: Fix performance regression in :mod:`sqlite3` when a DML "
"statement appeared in a different line than the rest of the SQL query."
msgstr ":issue:`32215`: 修复 :mod:`sqlite3` 中的性能回归，当 DML 语句出现在 SQL 查询的其余部分不同行时。"

#: ../NEWS:38102
msgid ""
":issue:`34075`: Deprecate passing non-ThreadPoolExecutor instances to "
":meth:`AbstractEventLoop.set_default_executor`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34075`: 弃用将非 ThreadPoolExecutor 实例传递给 "
":meth:`AbstractEventLoop.set_default_executor`。"

#: ../NEWS:38105
msgid ""
":issue:`34251`: Restore ``msilib.Win64`` to preserve backwards compatibility"
" since it's already used by ``distutils``' ``bdist_msi`` command."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34251`: 恢复 ``msilib.Win64`` 以保持向后兼容性，因为它已经被 ``distutils`` 的 "
"``bdist_msi`` 命令使用。"

#: ../NEWS:38108
msgid ""
":issue:`19891`: Ignore errors caused by missing / non-writable homedir while"
" writing history during exit of an interactive session.  Patch by Anthony "
"Sottile."
msgstr ""
":issue:`19891`: 在交互式会话退出时写入历史记录时，忽略由于主目录缺失或不可写导致的错误。补丁由 Anthony Sottile 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:38112
msgid ""
":issue:`33089`: Enhanced math.hypot() to support more than two dimensions."
msgstr ":issue:`33089`: 增强了 math.hypot() 以支持超过两个维度。"

#: ../NEWS:38114
msgid ""
":issue:`34228`: tracemalloc: PYTHONTRACEMALLOC=0 environment variable and -X"
" tracemalloc=0 command line option are now allowed to disable explicitly "
"tracemalloc at startup."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34228`: tracemalloc: PYTHONTRACEMALLOC=0 环境变量和 -X tracemalloc=0 "
"命令行选项现在可以用来在启动时显式禁用 tracemalloc。"

#: ../NEWS:38118
msgid ""
":issue:`13041`: Use :func:`shutil.get_terminal_size` to calculate the "
"terminal width correctly in the ``argparse.HelpFormatter`` class.  Initial "
"patch by Zbyszek Jędrzejewski-Szmek."
msgstr ""
":issue:`13041`: 使用 :func:`shutil.get_terminal_size` 在 "
"``argparse.HelpFormatter`` 类中正确计算终端宽度。初始由 Zbyszek Jędrzejewski-Szmek 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38122
msgid ""
":issue:`34213`: Allow frozen dataclasses to have a field named \"object\". "
"Previously this conflicted with an internal use of \"object\"."
msgstr ":issue:`34213`: 允许冻结的数据类有一个名为“object”的字段。之前这与内部使用的“object”冲突。"

#: ../NEWS:38125
msgid ""
":issue:`34052`: :meth:`sqlite3.Connection.create_aggregate`, "
":meth:`sqlite3.Connection.create_function`, "
":meth:`sqlite3.Connection.set_authorizer`, "
":meth:`sqlite3.Connection.set_progress_handler` methods raises TypeError "
"when unhashable objects are passed as callable. These methods now don't pass"
" such objects to SQLite API. Previous behavior could lead to segfaults. "
"Patch by Sergey Fedoseev."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34052`: :meth:`sqlite3.Connection.create_aggregate`, "
":meth:`sqlite3.Connection.create_function`, "
":meth:`sqlite3.Connection.set_authorizer`, "
":meth:`sqlite3.Connection.set_progress_handler` 方法在传递不可哈希对象作为可调用对象时抛出 "
"TypeError。这些方法现在不会将这样的对象传递给 SQLite API。之前的行为可能导致段错误。由 Sergey Fedoseev 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38133
msgid ""
":issue:`34197`: Attributes *skipinitialspace*, *doublequote* and *strict* of"
" the *dialect* attribute of the :mod:`csv` reader are now :class:`bool` "
"instances instead of integers 0 or 1."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34197`: :mod:`csv` 读取器的 *dialect* 属性的 *skipinitialspace*, "
"*doublequote* 和 *strict* 属性现在是 :class:`bool` 实例，而不是整数 0 或 1。"

#: ../NEWS:38137
msgid ""
":issue:`32788`: Errors other than :exc:`TypeError` raised in methods "
"``__adapt__()`` and ``__conform__()`` in the :mod:`sqlite3` module are now "
"propagated to the user."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32788`: 在 :mod:`sqlite3` 模块中的 ``__adapt__()`` 和 ``__conform__()`` "
"方法中引发的除 :exc:`TypeError` 以外的错误现在会传播给用户。"

#: ../NEWS:38141
msgid ""
":issue:`21446`: The ``reload`` fixer now uses :func:`importlib.reload` "
"instead of deprecated :func:`!imp.reload`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21446`: ``reload`` 修复器现在使用 :func:`importlib.reload` 而不是已弃用的 "
":func:`!imp.reload`。"

#: ../NEWS:38144
msgid ""
":issue:`940286`: pydoc's ``Helper.showtopic()`` method now prints the cross "
"references of a topic correctly."
msgstr ":issue:`940286`: pydoc 的 ``Helper.showtopic()`` 方法现在正确打印主题的交叉引用。"

#: ../NEWS:38147
msgid ""
":issue:`34164`: :func:`base64.b32decode` could raise UnboundLocalError or "
"OverflowError for incorrect padding.  Now it always raises "
":exc:`base64.Error` in these cases."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34164`: :func:`base64.b32decode` 可能会因错误的填充引发 UnboundLocalError 或 "
"OverflowError。现在在这些情况下总是引发 :exc:`base64.Error`。"

#: ../NEWS:38151
msgid ":issue:`33729`: Fixed issues with arguments parsing in :mod:`hashlib`."
msgstr ":issue:`33729`: 修复了 :mod:`hashlib` 中参数解析的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:38153
msgid ""
":issue:`34097`: ZipFile can zip files older than 1980-01-01 and newer than "
"2107-12-31 using a new ``strict_timestamps`` parameter at the cost of "
"setting the timestamp to the limit."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34097`: ZipFile 现在可以通过新的 ``strict_timestamps`` 参数压缩早于 1980-01-01 和晚于"
" 2107-12-31 的文件，代价是将时间戳设置为限制值。"

#: ../NEWS:38157
msgid ":issue:`34108`: Remove extraneous CR in 2to3 refactor."
msgstr ":issue:`34108`: 在 2to3 重构中移除了多余的 CR。"

#: ../NEWS:38159
msgid ""
":issue:`34070`: Make sure to only check if the handle is a tty, when opening"
" a file with ``buffering=-1``."
msgstr ":issue:`34070`: 确保在打开文件时 ``buffering=-1`` 的情况下，仅检查句柄是否为 tty。"

#: ../NEWS:38162
msgid ""
":issue:`27494`: Reverted :issue:`27494`. 2to3 rejects now a trailing comma "
"in generator expressions."
msgstr ":issue:`27494`: 恢复了 :issue:`27494`。2to3 现在拒绝在生成器表达式中使用尾随逗号。"

#: ../NEWS:38165
msgid ""
":issue:`33967`: functools.singledispatch now raises TypeError instead of "
"IndexError when no positional arguments are passed."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33967`: functools.singledispatch 现在在没有传递位置参数时抛出 TypeError 而不是 "
"IndexError。"

#: ../NEWS:38168
msgid ""
":issue:`34041`: Add the parameter *deterministic* to the "
":meth:`sqlite3.Connection.create_function` method. Patch by Sergey Fedoseev."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34041`: 向 :meth:`sqlite3.Connection.create_function` 方法添加了 "
"*deterministic* 参数。由 Sergey Fedoseev 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38172
msgid ""
":issue:`34056`: Ensure the loader shim created by ``imp.load_module`` always"
" returns bytes from its ``get_data()`` function. This fixes using "
"``imp.load_module`` with :pep:`552` hash-based pycs."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34056`: 确保由 ``imp.load_module`` 创建的加载器 shim 总是从其 ``get_data()`` "
"函数返回字节。这修复了 ``imp.load_module`` 与基于 :pep:`552` 哈希的 pycs 一起使用的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:38176
msgid ""
":issue:`34054`: The multiprocessing module now uses the monotonic clock "
":func:`time.monotonic` instead of the system clock :func:`time.time` to "
"implement timeout."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34054`: multiprocessing 模块现在使用单调时钟 :func:`time.monotonic` 而不是系统时钟 "
":func:`time.time` 来实现超时。"

#: ../NEWS:38180
msgid ""
":issue:`34043`: Optimize tarfile uncompress performance about 15% when gzip "
"is used."
msgstr ":issue:`34043`: 当使用 gzip 时，优化 tarfile 解压性能约 15%。"

#: ../NEWS:38183
msgid ""
":issue:`34044`: ``subprocess.Popen`` now copies the *startupinfo* argument "
"to leave it unchanged: it will modify the copy, so that the same "
"``STARTUPINFO`` object can be used multiple times."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34044`: ``subprocess.Popen`` 现在复制 *startupinfo* "
"参数以保持其不变：它将修改副本，因此同一个 ``STARTUPINFO`` 对象可以被多次使用。"

#: ../NEWS:38187
msgid ""
":issue:`34010`: Fixed a performance regression for reading streams with "
"tarfile. The buffered read should use a list, instead of appending to a "
"bytes object."
msgstr ":issue:`34010`: 修复了使用 tarfile 读取流时的性能回归。缓冲读取应使用列表，而不是追加到字节对象。"

#: ../NEWS:38191
msgid ""
":issue:`34019`: webbrowser: Correct the arguments passed to Opera Browser "
"when opening a new URL using the ``webbrowser`` module. Patch by Bumsik Kim."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34019`: webbrowser: 使用 ``webbrowser`` 模块打开新 URL 时，正确传递参数给 Opera "
"浏览器。由 Bumsik Kim 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38194
msgid ""
":issue:`34003`: csv.DictReader now creates dicts instead of OrderedDicts. "
"Patch by Michael Selik."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34003`: csv.DictReader 现在创建 dicts 而不是 OrderedDicts。补丁由 Michael Selik"
" 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:38197
msgid ""
":issue:`33978`: Closed existing logging handlers before reconfiguration via "
"fileConfig and dictConfig. Patch by Karthikeyan Singaravelan."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33978`: 在通过 fileConfig 和 dictConfig 重新配置之前关闭现有的日志处理程序。补丁由 "
"Karthikeyan Singaravelan 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:38200
msgid ""
":issue:`14117`: Make minor tweaks to turtledemo. The 'wikipedia' example is "
"now 'rosette', describing what it draws.  The 'penrose' print output is "
"reduced. The'1024' output of 'tree' is eliminated."
msgstr ""
":issue:`14117`: "
"对turtledemo进行小幅调整。'wikipedia'示例现更名为'rosette'，以更准确描述其绘制内容。'penrose'的打印输出已减少。'tree'的'1024'输出已被移除。"

#: ../NEWS:38204
msgid ""
":issue:`33974`: Fixed passing lists and tuples of strings containing special"
" characters ``\"``, ``\\``, ``{``, ``}`` and ``\\n`` as options to "
":mod:`~tkinter.ttk` widgets."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33974`: 修复了将包含特殊字符 ``\"``, ``\\``, ``{``, ``}`` 和 ``\\n`` "
"的字符串列表或元组作为选项传递给 :mod:`~tkinter.ttk` 部件的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:38208
msgid ":issue:`27500`: Fix getaddrinfo to resolve IPv6 addresses correctly."
msgstr ":issue:`27500`: 修复getaddrinfo以正确解析IPv6地址。"

#: ../NEWS:38210
msgid ""
":issue:`24567`: Improve random.choices() to handle subnormal input weights "
"that could occasionally trigger an IndexError."
msgstr ":issue:`24567`: 改进random.choices()以处理偶尔会触发IndexError的次正规输入权重。"

#: ../NEWS:38213
msgid ""
":issue:`33871`: Fixed integer overflow in :func:`os.readv`, "
":func:`os.writev`, :func:`os.preadv` and :func:`os.pwritev` and in "
":func:`os.sendfile` with *headers* or *trailers* arguments (on BSD-based "
"OSes and macOS)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33871`: 修复了 :func:`os.readv`, :func:`os.writev`, :func:`os.preadv` 和"
" :func:`os.pwritev` 以及 :func:`os.sendfile` (在基于BSD的操作系统和macOS上，带有 *headers* "
"或 *trailers* 参数时) 中的整数溢出问题。"

#: ../NEWS:38217
msgid ""
":issue:`25007`: Add :func:`copy.copy` and :func:`copy.deepcopy` support to "
"zlib compressors and decompressors.  Patch by Zackery Spytz."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25007`: 为zlib压缩器和解压缩器添加 :func:`copy.copy` 和 :func:`copy.deepcopy` "
"支持。补丁由Zackery Spytz提供。"

#: ../NEWS:38220
msgid ""
":issue:`33929`: multiprocessing: Fix a race condition in Popen of "
"multiprocessing.popen_spawn_win32. The child process now duplicates the read"
" end of pipe instead of \"stealing\" it. Previously, the read end of pipe "
"was \"stolen\" by the child process, but it leaked a handle if the child "
"process had been terminated before it could steal the handle from the parent"
" process."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33929`: "
"多进程处理：修复了multiprocessing.popen_spawn_win32中Popen的一个竞态条件。子进程现在复制管道的读取端而不是“窃取”它。之前，子进程会“窃取”管道的读取端，但如果子进程在从父进程窃取句柄之前被终止，则会泄漏一个句柄。"

#: ../NEWS:38227
msgid ""
":issue:`33899`: Tokenize module now implicitly emits a NEWLINE when provided"
" with input that does not have a trailing new line.  This behavior now "
"matches what the C tokenizer does internally.  Contributed by Ammar Askar."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33899`: Tokenize模块现在在提供的输入没有尾随换行符时隐式发出NEWLINE。此行为现在与C "
"tokenizer内部的行为匹配。由Ammar Askar贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:38231
msgid ""
":issue:`33897`: Added a 'force' keyword argument to logging.basicConfig()."
msgstr ":issue:`33897`: 向logging.basicConfig()添加了一个'force'关键字参数。"

#: ../NEWS:38233
msgid ""
":issue:`33695`: :func:`shutil.copytree` uses :func:`os.scandir` function and"
" all copy functions depending from it use cached :func:`os.stat` values. The"
" speedup for copying a directory with 8000 files is around +9% on Linux, "
"+20% on Windows and + 30% on a Windows SMB share. Also the number of "
":func:`os.stat` syscalls is reduced by 38% making :func:`shutil.copytree` "
"especially faster on network filesystems. (Contributed by Giampaolo Rodola' "
"in :issue:`33695`.)"
msgstr ""
":issue:`33695`: :func:`shutil.copytree` 使用 :func:`os.scandir` "
"函数以及所有依赖于它的复制函数都使用了缓存的 :func:`os.stat` "
"值。在Linux上复制一个包含8000个文件的目录时，速度提升约+9%，在Windows上约+20%，在Windows "
"SMB共享上约+30%。同时，:func:`os.stat` 系统调用的次数减少了38%，使得 :func:`shutil.copytree` "
"在网络文件系统上特别快。（由Giampaolo Rodola'在 :issue:`33695` 中贡献。）"

#: ../NEWS:38241
msgid ""
":issue:`33916`: bz2 and lzma: When Decompressor.__init__() is called twice, "
"free the old lock to not leak memory."
msgstr ":issue:`33916`: bz2和lzma：当Decompressor.__init__()被调用两次时，释放旧的锁以防止内存泄漏。"

#: ../NEWS:38244
msgid ""
":issue:`32568`: Make select.epoll() and its documentation consistent "
"regarding *sizehint* and *flags*."
msgstr ":issue:`32568`: 使select.epoll()及其文档在 *sizehint* 和 *flags* 方面保持一致。"

#: ../NEWS:38247
msgid ""
":issue:`33833`: Fixed bug in asyncio where ProactorSocketTransport logs "
"AssertionError if force closed during write."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33833`: "
"修复了asyncio中的一个bug，该bug导致ProactorSocketTransport在写操作期间强制关闭时会记录AssertionError。"

#: ../NEWS:38250
msgid ""
":issue:`33663`: Convert content length to string before putting to header."
msgstr ":issue:`33663`: 在将内容长度放入头部之前，将其转换为字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:38252
msgid ""
":issue:`33721`: :mod:`os.path` functions that return a boolean result like "
":func:`~os.path.exists`, :func:`~os.path.lexists`, :func:`~os.path.isdir`, "
":func:`~os.path.isfile`, :func:`~os.path.islink`, and "
":func:`~os.path.ismount`, and :mod:`pathlib.Path` methods that return a "
"boolean result like :meth:`~pathlib.Path.exists`, "
":meth:`~pathlib.Path.is_dir`, :meth:`~pathlib.Path.is_file`, "
":meth:`~pathlib.Path.is_mount`, :meth:`~pathlib.Path.is_symlink`, "
":meth:`~pathlib.Path.is_block_device`, :meth:`~pathlib.Path.is_char_device`,"
" :meth:`~pathlib.Path.is_fifo`, :meth:`~pathlib.Path.is_socket` now return "
"``False`` instead of raising :exc:`ValueError` or its subclasses "
":exc:`UnicodeEncodeError` and :exc:`UnicodeDecodeError` for paths that "
"contain characters or bytes unrepresentable at the OS level."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33721`: :mod:`os.path` 函数如 :func:`~os.path.exists`, "
":func:`~os.path.lexists`, :func:`~os.path.isdir`, :func:`~os.path.isfile`, "
":func:`~os.path.islink`, 和 :func:`~os.path.ismount`，以及 :mod:`pathlib.Path` "
"方法如 :meth:`~pathlib.Path.exists`, :meth:`~pathlib.Path.is_dir`, "
":meth:`~pathlib.Path.is_file`, :meth:`~pathlib.Path.is_mount`, "
":meth:`~pathlib.Path.is_symlink`, :meth:`~pathlib.Path.is_block_device`, "
":meth:`~pathlib.Path.is_char_device`, :meth:`~pathlib.Path.is_fifo`, "
":meth:`~pathlib.Path.is_socket` 现在对于在操作系统级别无法表示的字符或字节的路径返回 ``False``，而不是引发 "
":exc:`ValueError` 或其子类 :exc:`UnicodeEncodeError` 和 "
":exc:`UnicodeDecodeError`。"

#: ../NEWS:38266
msgid ""
":issue:`26544`: Fixed implementation of :func:`platform.libc_ver`. It almost"
" always returned version '2.9' for glibc."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26544`: 修正了 :func:`platform.libc_ver` 的实现。它几乎总是为glibc返回版本'2.9'。"

#: ../NEWS:38269
msgid ""
":issue:`33843`: Remove deprecated ``cgi.escape``, ``cgi.parse_qs`` and "
"``cgi.parse_qsl``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33843`: 移除了已弃用的 ``cgi.escape``, ``cgi.parse_qs`` 和 "
"``cgi.parse_qsl``。"

#: ../NEWS:38272
msgid ""
":issue:`33842`: Remove ``tarfile.filemode`` which is deprecated since Python"
" 3.3."
msgstr ":issue:`33842`: 移除了自Python 3.3以来已弃用的 ``tarfile.filemode``。"

#: ../NEWS:38275 ../NEWS:39874 ../NEWS:44470
msgid ""
":issue:`30167`: Prevent site.main() exception if PYTHONSTARTUP is set. Patch"
" by Steve Weber."
msgstr ":issue:`30167`: 如果设置了PYTHONSTARTUP，防止site.main()异常。由Steve Weber提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38278
msgid ""
":issue:`33805`: Improve error message of dataclasses.replace() when an "
"InitVar is not specified"
msgstr ":issue:`33805`: 当未指定InitVar时，改进dataclasses.replace()的错误消息"

#: ../NEWS:38281
msgid ""
":issue:`33687`: Fix the call to ``os.chmod()`` for ``uu.decode()`` if a mode"
" is given or decoded. Patch by Timo Furrer."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33687`: 如果给定或解码了模式，修复 ``uu.decode()`` 对 ``os.chmod()`` 的调用。由Timo "
"Furrer提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38284 ../NEWS:39877 ../NEWS:44473
msgid ""
":issue:`33812`: Datetime instance d with non-None tzinfo, but with "
"d.tzinfo.utcoffset(d) returning None is now treated as naive by the "
"astimezone() method."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33812`: "
"对于tzinfo非None但d.tzinfo.utcoffset(d)返回None的Datetime实例d，现在astimezone()方法将其视为naive。"

#: ../NEWS:38288
msgid ""
":issue:`32108`: In configparser, don't clear section when it is assigned to "
"itself."
msgstr ":issue:`32108`: 在configparser中，当节被分配给自己时不清除它。"

#: ../NEWS:38291
msgid ""
":issue:`27397`: Make email module properly handle invalid-length base64 "
"strings."
msgstr ":issue:`27397`: 使email模块正确处理长度无效的base64字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:38294
msgid ":issue:`33578`: Implement multibyte encoder/decoder state methods"
msgstr ":issue:`33578`: 实现多字节编码器/解码器状态方法"

#: ../NEWS:38296 ../NEWS:39881 ../NEWS:44477
msgid ":issue:`30805`: Avoid race condition with debug logging"
msgstr ":issue:`30805`: 避免调试日志记录中的竞态条件"

#: ../NEWS:38298
msgid ""
":issue:`33476`: Fix _header_value_parser.py when address group is missing "
"final ';'. Contributed by Enrique Perez-Terron"
msgstr ""
":issue:`33476`: 当地址组缺少最后的';'时，修复_header_value_parser.py。由Enrique Perez-"
"Terron贡献"

#: ../NEWS:38301 ../NEWS:39883
msgid ""
":issue:`33694`: asyncio: Fix a race condition causing data loss on "
"pause_reading()/resume_reading() when using the ProactorEventLoop."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33694`: asyncio: "
"修复在使用ProactorEventLoop时，pause_reading()/resume_reading()导致数据丢失的竞态条件。"

#: ../NEWS:38304 ../NEWS:39886
msgid ""
":issue:`32493`: Correct test for ``uuid_enc_be`` availability in "
"``configure.ac``. Patch by Michael Felt."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32493`: 在 ``configure.ac`` 中更正对 ``uuid_enc_be`` 可用性的测试。由Michael "
"Felt提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38307 ../NEWS:39889
msgid ""
":issue:`33792`: Add asyncio.WindowsSelectorEventLoopPolicy and "
"asyncio.WindowsProactorEventLoopPolicy."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33792`: "
"添加asyncio.WindowsSelectorEventLoopPolicy和asyncio.WindowsProactorEventLoopPolicy。"

#: ../NEWS:38310
msgid ""
":issue:`33274`: W3C DOM Level 1 specifies return value of "
"Element.removeAttributeNode() as \"The Attr node that was removed.\" "
"xml.dom.minidom now complies with this requirement."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33274`: W3C DOM Level 1指定Element.removeAttributeNode()的返回值为\"The "
"Attr node that was removed.\" xml.dom.minidom现在符合这一要求。"

#: ../NEWS:38314 ../NEWS:39892
msgid ""
":issue:`33778`: Update ``unicodedata``'s database to Unicode version 11.0.0."
msgstr ":issue:`33778`: 更新 ``unicodedata`` 的数据库至Unicode版本11.0.0。"

#: ../NEWS:38316
msgid ""
":issue:`33165`: Added a stacklevel parameter to logging calls to allow use "
"of wrapper/helper functions for logging APIs."
msgstr ":issue:`33165`: 为日志记录调用添加了stacklevel参数，以允许使用包装器/辅助函数进行日志记录API的调用。"

#: ../NEWS:38319 ../NEWS:39894
msgid ""
":issue:`33770`: improve base64 exception message for encoded inputs of "
"invalid length"
msgstr ":issue:`33770`: 针对长度无效的编码输入，改进base64异常消息"

#: ../NEWS:38322 ../NEWS:39897
msgid ""
":issue:`33769`: asyncio/start_tls: Fix error message; cancel callbacks in "
"case of an unhandled error; mark SSLTransport as closed if it is aborted."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33769`: asyncio/start_tls: "
"修复错误消息；在未处理错误的情况下取消回调；如果SSLTransport被中止，则标记为已关闭。"

#: ../NEWS:38325 ../NEWS:39900 ../NEWS:44479
msgid ""
":issue:`33767`: The concatenation (``+``) and repetition (``*``) sequence "
"operations now raise :exc:`TypeError` instead of :exc:`SystemError` when "
"performed on :class:`mmap.mmap` objects.  Patch by Zackery Spytz."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33767`: 在 :class:`mmap.mmap` 对象上执行时，连接（``+``）和重复（``*``）序列操作现在会引发 "
":exc:`TypeError` 而不是 :exc:`SystemError`。由 Zackery Spytz 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38329 ../NEWS:39904
msgid ""
":issue:`33734`: asyncio/ssl: Fix AttributeError, increase default handshake "
"timeout"
msgstr ":issue:`33734`: asyncio/ssl：修复 AttributeError，增加默认的握手超时时间"

#: ../NEWS:38332
msgid ""
":issue:`31014`: Fixed creating a controller for :mod:`webbrowser` when a "
"user specifies a path to an entry in the BROWSER environment variable.  "
"Based on patch by John Still."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31014`: 修复了当用户在 BROWSER 环境变量中指定条目路径时为 :mod:`webbrowser` 创建控制器的问题。基于 "
"John Still 的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38336
msgid ":issue:`2504`: Add gettext.pgettext() and variants."
msgstr ":issue:`2504`: 添加 gettext.pgettext() 及其变体。"

#: ../NEWS:38338
msgid ":issue:`33197`: Add description property for _ParameterKind"
msgstr ":issue:`33197`: 为 _ParameterKind 添加描述属性"

#: ../NEWS:38340 ../NEWS:40002
msgid ""
":issue:`32751`: When cancelling the task due to a timeout, "
":meth:`asyncio.wait_for` will now wait until the cancellation is complete."
msgstr ":issue:`32751`: 当由于超时取消任务时，:meth:`asyncio.wait_for` 现在将等待直到取消完成。"

#: ../NEWS:38343 ../NEWS:40005 ../NEWS:44483
msgid ""
":issue:`32684`: Fix gather to propagate cancellation of itself even with "
"return_exceptions."
msgstr ":issue:`32684`: 修复 gather 即使在 return_exceptions 的情况下也能传播自身的取消。"

#: ../NEWS:38346 ../NEWS:40008
msgid ""
":issue:`33654`: Support protocol type switching in "
"SSLTransport.set_protocol()."
msgstr ":issue:`33654`: 在 SSLTransport.set_protocol() 中支持协议类型切换。"

#: ../NEWS:38348 ../NEWS:40010
msgid ""
":issue:`33674`: Pause the transport as early as possible to further reduce "
"the risk of data_received() being called before connection_made()."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33674`: 尽早暂停传输，以进一步降低在 connection_made() 之前调用 data_received() 的风险。"

#: ../NEWS:38351
msgid ""
":issue:`33671`: :func:`shutil.copyfile`, :func:`shutil.copy`, "
":func:`shutil.copy2`, :func:`shutil.copytree` and :func:`shutil.move` use "
"platform-specific fast-copy syscalls on Linux and macOS in order to copy the"
" file more efficiently. On Windows :func:`shutil.copyfile` uses a bigger "
"default buffer size (1 MiB instead of 16 KiB) and a :func:`memoryview`-based"
" variant of :func:`shutil.copyfileobj` is used. The speedup for copying a "
"512MiB file is about +26% on Linux, +50% on macOS and +40% on Windows. Also,"
" much less CPU cycles are consumed. (Contributed by Giampaolo Rodola' in "
":issue:`25427`.)"
msgstr ""
":issue:`33671`: "
":func:`shutil.copyfile`、:func:`shutil.copy`、:func:`shutil.copy2`、:func:`shutil.copytree`"
" 和 :func:`shutil.move` 在 Linux 和 macOS 上使用平台特定的快速复制系统调用，以更高效地复制文件。在 Windows "
"上，:func:`shutil.copyfile` 使用更大的默认缓冲区大小（1 MiB 而不是 16 KiB），并且使用了基于 "
":func:`memoryview` 的 :func:`shutil.copyfileobj` 变体。复制 512MiB 文件的速度在 Linux "
"上提高了约 +26%，在 macOS 上提高了 +50%，在 Windows 上提高了 +40%。同时，消耗的 CPU 周期大大减少。（由 "
"Giampaolo Rodola' 在 :issue:`25427` 中贡献。）"

#: ../NEWS:38361 ../NEWS:40013 ../NEWS:44486
msgid ""
":issue:`33674`: Fix a race condition in SSLProtocol.connection_made() of "
"asyncio.sslproto: start immediately the handshake instead of using "
"call_soon(). Previously, data_received() could be called before the "
"handshake started, causing the handshake to hang or fail."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33674`: 修复 asyncio.sslproto 中 SSLProtocol.connection_made() "
"的竞态条件：立即开始握手而不是使用 call_soon()。之前，data_received() 可能在握手开始前被调用，导致握手挂起或失败。"

#: ../NEWS:38366 ../NEWS:40018 ../NEWS:44491
msgid ""
":issue:`31647`: Fixed bug where calling write_eof() on a "
"_SelectorSocketTransport after it's already closed raises AttributeError."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31647`: 修复了在 _SelectorSocketTransport 已经关闭后调用 write_eof() 会引发 "
"AttributeError 的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:38369 ../NEWS:40021
msgid ":issue:`32610`: Make asyncio.all_tasks() return only pending tasks."
msgstr ":issue:`32610`: 使 asyncio.all_tasks() 仅返回待处理的任务。"

#: ../NEWS:38371 ../NEWS:40023
msgid ":issue:`32410`: Avoid blocking on file IO in sendfile fallback code"
msgstr ":issue:`32410`: 在 sendfile 回退代码中避免阻塞文件 IO。"

#: ../NEWS:38373 ../NEWS:40025 ../NEWS:44496
msgid ""
":issue:`33469`: Fix RuntimeError after closing loop that used "
"run_in_executor"
msgstr ":issue:`33469`: 修复了使用 run_in_executor 后关闭循环时引发的 RuntimeError。"

#: ../NEWS:38375 ../NEWS:40027 ../NEWS:44494
msgid ":issue:`33672`: Fix Task.__repr__ crash with Cython's bogus coroutines"
msgstr ":issue:`33672`: 修复 Task.__repr__ 与 Cython 的虚假协程一起使用时崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:38377 ../NEWS:40029
msgid ""
":issue:`33654`: Fix transport.set_protocol() to support switching between "
"asyncio.Protocol and asyncio.BufferedProtocol.  Fix loop.start_tls() to work"
" with asyncio.BufferedProtocols."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33654`: 修复 transport.set_protocol() 以支持在 asyncio.Protocol 和 "
"asyncio.BufferedProtocol 之间切换。修复 loop.start_tls() 以支持 "
"asyncio.BufferedProtocols。"

#: ../NEWS:38381 ../NEWS:40033
msgid ""
":issue:`33652`: Pickles of type variables and subscripted generics are now "
"future-proof and compatible with older Python versions."
msgstr ":issue:`33652`: 类型变量和下标泛型的 pickle 现在具有未来兼容性，并与旧版 Python 兼容。"

#: ../NEWS:38384 ../NEWS:40036
msgid ":issue:`32493`: Fixed :func:`uuid.uuid1` on FreeBSD."
msgstr ":issue:`32493`: 修复了 FreeBSD 上的 :func:`uuid.uuid1`。"

#: ../NEWS:38386
msgid ""
":issue:`33238`: Add ``InvalidStateError`` to :mod:`concurrent.futures`. "
"``Future.set_result`` and ``Future.set_exception`` now raise "
"``InvalidStateError`` if the futures are not pending or running. Patch by "
"Jason Haydaman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33238`: 将 ``InvalidStateError`` 添加到 :mod:`concurrent.futures`。如果 "
"futures 不是待处理或运行状态，``Future.set_result`` 和 ``Future.set_exception`` 现在会引发 "
"``InvalidStateError``。由 Jason Haydaman 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38391 ../NEWS:40038
msgid ""
":issue:`33618`: Finalize and document preliminary and experimental TLS 1.3 "
"support with OpenSSL 1.1.1"
msgstr ":issue:`33618`: 完成并记录与 OpenSSL 1.1.1 的初步和实验性 TLS 1.3 支持。"

#: ../NEWS:38394
msgid ""
":issue:`33625`: Release GIL on ``grp.getgrnam``, ``grp.getgrgid``, "
"``pwd.getpwnam`` and ``pwd.getpwuid`` if reentrant variants of these "
"functions are available. Patch by William Grzybowski."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33625`: 如果这些函数的可重入变体可用，则在 "
"``grp.getgrnam``、``grp.getgrgid``、``pwd.getpwnam`` 和 ``pwd.getpwuid`` 上释放 "
"GIL。由 William Grzybowski 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38398 ../NEWS:40041
msgid ""
":issue:`33623`: Fix possible SIGSGV when asyncio.Future is created in "
"__del__"
msgstr ":issue:`33623`: 修复在 __del__ 中创建 asyncio.Future 时可能出现的 SIGSGV。"

#: ../NEWS:38400 ../NEWS:39907 ../NEWS:44498
msgid ""
":issue:`11874`: Use a better regex when breaking usage into wrappable parts."
" Avoids bogus assertion errors from custom metavar strings."
msgstr ":issue:`11874`: 当将用法分解为可包装部分时使用更好的正则表达式。避免来自自定义 metavar 字符串的错误断言错误。"

#: ../NEWS:38403 ../NEWS:40043 ../NEWS:44501
msgid ""
":issue:`30877`: Fixed a bug in the Python implementation of the JSON decoder"
" that prevented the cache of parsed strings from clearing after finishing "
"the decoding. Based on patch by c-fos."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30877`: 修复了 JSON 解码器 Python 实现中的一个错误，该错误阻止了在完成解码后清除已解析字符串的缓存。基于 "
"c-fos 的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38407
msgid ""
":issue:`33604`: Remove HMAC default to md5 marked for removal in 3.8 "
"(removal originally planned in 3.6, bump to 3.8 in PR 7062)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33604`: 移除标记为在 3.8 中移除的 HMAC 默认 md5（原计划在 3.6 中移除，PR 7062 中推迟到 3.8）。"

#: ../NEWS:38410 ../NEWS:39910
msgid ":issue:`33582`: Emit a deprecation warning for inspect.formatargspec"
msgstr ":issue:`33582`: 为 inspect.formatargspec 发出弃用警告。"

#: ../NEWS:38412
msgid ""
":issue:`21145`: Add ``functools.cached_property`` decorator, for computed "
"properties cached for the life of the instance."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21145`: 添加 ``functools.cached_property`` "
"装饰器，用于计算属性，这些属性在实例的生命周期内被缓存。"

#: ../NEWS:38415 ../NEWS:40047
msgid ""
":issue:`33570`: Change TLS 1.3 cipher suite settings for compatibility with "
"OpenSSL 1.1.1-pre6 and newer. OpenSSL 1.1.1 will have TLS 1.3 ciphers "
"enabled by default."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33570`: 更改 TLS 1.3 密码套件设置，以兼容 OpenSSL 1.1.1-pre6 及更新版本。OpenSSL 1.1.1"
" 将默认启用 TLS 1.3 密码。"

#: ../NEWS:38419 ../NEWS:40051
msgid ""
":issue:`28556`: Do not simplify arguments to ``typing.Union``. Now "
"``Union[Manager, Employee]`` is not simplified to ``Employee`` at runtime. "
"Such simplification previously caused several bugs and limited possibilities"
" for introspection."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28556`: 不再简化 ``typing.Union`` 的参数。现在 ``Union[Manager, Employee]`` "
"在运行时不会简化为 ``Employee``。之前的简化导致了一些错误，并限制了内省的可能性。"

#: ../NEWS:38424
msgid ""
":issue:`12486`: :func:`tokenize.generate_tokens` is now documented as a "
"public API to tokenize unicode strings. It was previously present but "
"undocumented."
msgstr ""
":issue:`12486`: :func:`tokenize.generate_tokens` 现在被记录为一个公共 API，用于对 Unicode "
"字符串进行分词。它之前存在但未被记录。"

#: ../NEWS:38428 ../NEWS:40056
msgid ""
":issue:`33540`: Add a new ``block_on_close`` class attribute to "
"``ForkingMixIn`` and ``ThreadingMixIn`` classes of :mod:`socketserver`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33540`: 向 :mod:`socketserver` 的 ``ForkingMixIn`` 和 "
"``ThreadingMixIn`` 类添加一个新的 ``block_on_close`` 类属性。"

#: ../NEWS:38431 ../NEWS:40059 ../NEWS:44505
msgid ""
":issue:`33548`: tempfile._candidate_tempdir_list should consider common TEMP"
" locations"
msgstr ":issue:`33548`: tempfile._candidate_tempdir_list 应考虑常见的 TEMP 位置"

#: ../NEWS:38434 ../NEWS:40062
msgid ""
":issue:`33109`: argparse subparsers are once again not required by default, "
"reverting the change in behavior introduced by :issue:`26510` in 3.7.0a2."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33109`: argparse 子解析器默认再次不需要，恢复了在 3.7.0a2 中由 :issue:`26510` 引入的行为变化。"

#: ../NEWS:38437
msgid ""
":issue:`33541`: Remove unused private method ``_strptime.LocaleTime.__pad`` "
"(a.k.a. ``_LocaleTime__pad``)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33541`: 移除未使用的私有方法 ``_strptime.LocaleTime.__pad``（又名 "
"``_LocaleTime__pad``）。"

#: ../NEWS:38440 ../NEWS:40065
msgid ""
":issue:`33536`: dataclasses.make_dataclass now checks for invalid field "
"names and duplicate fields. Also, added a check for invalid field "
"specifications."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33536`: dataclasses.make_dataclass "
"现在检查无效的字段名和重复的字段。此外，添加了对无效字段规范的检查。"

#: ../NEWS:38444 ../NEWS:40069 ../NEWS:44508
msgid ""
":issue:`33542`: Prevent ``uuid.get_node`` from using a DUID instead of a MAC"
" on Windows. Patch by Zvi Effron"
msgstr ""
":issue:`33542`: 防止 ``uuid.get_node`` 在 Windows 上使用 DUID 而不是 MAC。由 Zvi Effron"
" 提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:38447 ../NEWS:40072 ../NEWS:44511
msgid ""
":issue:`26819`: Fix race condition with ``ReadTransport.resume_reading`` in "
"Windows proactor event loop."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26819`: 修复 Windows proactor 事件循环中 ``ReadTransport.resume_reading`` "
"的竞争条件。"

#: ../NEWS:38450 ../NEWS:40075
msgid ""
"Fix failure in ``typing.get_type_hints()`` when ClassVar was provided as a "
"string forward reference."
msgstr "修复当 ClassVar 作为字符串前向引用提供时 ``typing.get_type_hints()`` 的失败。"

#: ../NEWS:38453
msgid ""
":issue:`33516`: :class:`unittest.mock.MagicMock` now supports the "
"``__round__`` magic method."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33516`: :class:`unittest.mock.MagicMock` 现在支持 ``__round__`` 魔术方法。"

#: ../NEWS:38456
msgid ""
":issue:`28612`: Added support for Site Maps to urllib's ``RobotFileParser`` "
"as :meth:`RobotFileParser.site_maps() "
"<urllib.robotparser.RobotFileParser.site_maps>`. Patch by Lady Red, based on"
" patch by Peter Wirtz."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28612`: 向 urllib 的 ``RobotFileParser`` 添加了对站点地图的支持，作为 "
":meth:`RobotFileParser.site_maps() "
"<urllib.robotparser.RobotFileParser.site_maps>`。补丁由 Lady Red 提供，基于 Peter "
"Wirtz 的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38461
msgid ""
":issue:`28167`: Remove platform.linux_distribution, which was deprecated "
"since 3.5."
msgstr ":issue:`28167`: 移除自3.5版起已弃用的platform.linux_distribution。"

#: ../NEWS:38464
msgid ""
":issue:`33504`: Switch the default dictionary implementation for "
":mod:`configparser` from :class:`collections.OrderedDict` to the standard "
":class:`dict` type."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33504`: 将 :mod:`configparser` 的默认字典实现从 "
":class:`collections.OrderedDict` 切换为标准 :class:`dict` 类型。"

#: ../NEWS:38468 ../NEWS:40078
msgid ""
":issue:`33505`: Optimize asyncio.ensure_future() by reordering if checks: "
"1.17x faster."
msgstr ":issue:`33505`: 通过重新排序if检查优化asyncio.ensure_future()：速度提升1.17倍。"

#: ../NEWS:38471 ../NEWS:40081
msgid ""
":issue:`33497`: Add errors param to cgi.parse_multipart and make an encoding"
" in FieldStorage use the given errors (needed for Twisted).  Patch by Amber "
"Brown."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33497`: "
"向cgi.parse_multipart添加errors参数，并使FieldStorage中的编码使用给定的errors（Twisted所需）。由Amber"
" Brown提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38475
msgid ""
":issue:`29235`: The :class:`cProfile.Profile` class can now be used as a "
"context manager. Patch by Scott Sanderson."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29235`: :class:`cProfile.Profile` 类现在可用作上下文管理器。补丁由Scott Sanderson提供。"

#: ../NEWS:38478 ../NEWS:40085
msgid ""
":issue:`33495`: Change dataclasses.Fields repr to use the repr of each of "
"its members, instead of str.  This makes it more clear what each field "
"actually represents.  This is especially true for the 'type' member."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33495`: "
"更改dataclasses.Fields的repr以使用其每个成员的repr，而非str。这使得每个字段实际代表的内容更加清晰。这对于'type'成员尤为明显。"

#: ../NEWS:38482
msgid ""
":issue:`26103`: Correct ``inspect.isdatadescriptor`` to look for ``__set__``"
" or ``__delete__``.  Patch by Aaron Hall."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26103`: 修正 ``inspect.isdatadescriptor`` 以查找 ``__set__`` 或 "
"``__delete__``。由Aaron Hall提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38485
msgid ""
":issue:`29209`: Removed the ``doctype()`` method and the *html* parameter of"
" the constructor of :class:`~xml.etree.ElementTree.XMLParser`.  The "
"``doctype()`` method defined in a subclass will no longer be called. "
"Deprecated methods ``getchildren()`` and ``getiterator()`` in the "
":mod:`~xml.etree.ElementTree` module emit now a :exc:`DeprecationWarning` "
"instead of :exc:`PendingDeprecationWarning`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29209`: 移除了 :class:`~xml.etree.ElementTree.XMLParser` 构造函数的 "
"``doctype()`` 方法和 *html* 参数。子类中定义的 ``doctype()`` "
"方法将不再被调用。:mod:`~xml.etree.ElementTree` 模块中已弃用的方法 ``getchildren()`` 和 "
"``getiterator()`` 现在发出 :exc:`DeprecationWarning` 而非 "
":exc:`PendingDeprecationWarning`。"

#: ../NEWS:38492 ../NEWS:40089
msgid ""
":issue:`33453`: Fix dataclasses to work if using literal string type "
"annotations or if using PEP 563 \"Postponed Evaluation of Annotations\". "
"Only specific string prefixes are detected for both ClassVar (\"ClassVar\" "
"and \"typing.ClassVar\") and InitVar (\"InitVar\" and "
"\"dataclasses.InitVar\")."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33453`: 修复dataclasses以在使用字面字符串类型注解或使用PEP "
"563“推迟的注解评估”时工作。仅为ClassVar（\"ClassVar\"和\"typing.ClassVar\"）和InitVar（\"InitVar\"和\"dataclasses.InitVar\"）检测特定的字符串前缀。"

#: ../NEWS:38497 ../NEWS:40094 ../NEWS:44514
msgid ""
":issue:`28556`: Minor fixes in typing module: add annotations to "
"``NamedTuple.__new__``, pass ``*args`` and ``**kwds`` in "
"``Generic.__new__``.  Original PRs by Paulius Šarka and Chad Dombrova."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28556`: typing模块中的小修复：向 ``NamedTuple.__new__`` "
"添加注解，在``Generic.__new__``中传递 ``*args`` 和 ``**kwds``。原始PR由Paulius Šarka和Chad "
"Dombrova提供。"

#: ../NEWS:38501
msgid ""
":issue:`33365`: Print the header values besides the header keys instead just"
" the header keys if *debuglevel* is set to >0 in :mod:`http.client`. Patch "
"by Marco Strigl."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33365`: 如果在 :mod:`http.client` 中将 *debuglevel* "
"设置为>0，除了头键外还打印头值。补丁由Marco Strigl提供。"

#: ../NEWS:38505 ../NEWS:40098 ../NEWS:44518
msgid ""
":issue:`20087`: Updated alias mapping with glibc 2.27 supported locales."
msgstr ":issue:`20087`: 更新了支持glibc 2.27地区设置的别名映射。"

#: ../NEWS:38507 ../NEWS:40100 ../NEWS:44520
msgid ""
":issue:`33422`: Fix trailing quotation marks getting deleted when looking up"
" byte/string literals on pydoc. Patch by Andrés Delfino."
msgstr ":issue:`33422`: 修复在pydoc上查找字节/字符串字面量时尾随引号被删除的问题。由Andrés Delfino提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38510 ../NEWS:40103
msgid ""
":issue:`28167`: The function ``platform.linux_distribution`` and "
"``platform.dist`` now trigger a ``DeprecationWarning`` and have been marked "
"for removal in Python 3.8"
msgstr ""
":issue:`28167`: 函数 ``platform.linux_distribution`` 和 ``platform.dist`` "
"现在触发``DeprecationWarning``，并已被标记为在Python 3.8中移除。"

#: ../NEWS:38514 ../NEWS:40210
msgid ":issue:`33281`: Fix ctypes.util.find_library regression on macOS."
msgstr ":issue:`33281`: 修复macOS上ctypes.util.find_library的回归问题。"

#: ../NEWS:38516
msgid ""
":issue:`33311`: Text and html output generated by cgitb does not display "
"parentheses if the current call is done directly in the module. Patch by "
"Stéphane Blondon."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33311`: 由cgitb生成的文本和html输出现在如果当前调用直接在模块中进行时不会显示括号。由Stéphane "
"Blondon提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38520
msgid ""
":issue:`27300`: The file classes in *tempfile* now accept an *errors* "
"parameter that complements the already existing *encoding*.  Patch by "
"Stephan Hohe."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27300`: *tempfile*中的文件类现在接受一个 *errors* 参数，补充了已经存在的 *encoding* "
"参数。由Stephan Hohe提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38523
msgid ""
":issue:`32933`: :func:`unittest.mock.mock_open` now supports iteration over "
"the file contents. Patch by Tony Flury."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32933`: :func:`unittest.mock.mock_open` 现在支持对文件内容进行迭代。由Tony "
"Flury提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38526
msgid ""
":issue:`33217`: Raise :exc:`TypeError` when looking up non-Enum objects in "
"Enum classes and Enum members."
msgstr ":issue:`33217`: 当在Enum类和Enum成员中查找非Enum对象时，抛出 :exc:`TypeError`。"

#: ../NEWS:38529 ../NEWS:40107 ../NEWS:44523
msgid ""
":issue:`33197`: Update error message when constructing invalid "
"inspect.Parameters Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ":issue:`33197`: 更新构造无效inspect.Parameters时的错误信息。由Donghee Na提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38532 ../NEWS:40212 ../NEWS:44526
msgid ""
":issue:`33383`: Fixed crash in the get() method of the :mod:`dbm.ndbm` "
"database object when it is called with a single argument."
msgstr ":issue:`33383`: 修复了当使用单个参数调用 :mod:`dbm.ndbm` 数据库对象的get()方法时崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:38535
msgid ""
":issue:`33375`: The warnings module now finds the Python file associated "
"with a warning from the code object, rather than the frame's global "
"namespace. This is consistent with how tracebacks and pdb find filenames, "
"and should work better for dynamically executed code."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33375`: "
"warnings模块现在从代码对象而非帧的全局命名空间找到与警告相关联的Python文件。这与tracebacks和pdb如何查找文件名一致，应该能更好地处理动态执行的代码。"

#: ../NEWS:38540
msgid ""
":issue:`33336`: ``imaplib`` now allows ``MOVE`` command in ``IMAP4.uid()`` "
"(RFC 6851: IMAP MOVE Extension) and potentially as a name of supported "
"method of ``IMAP4`` object."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33336`: ``imaplib``现在允许在 ``IMAP4.uid()`` 中使用 ``MOVE`` 命令（RFC 6851: "
"IMAP MOVE扩展）并可能作为 ``IMAP4`` 对象支持的方法名称。"

#: ../NEWS:38544
msgid ":issue:`32455`: Added *jump* parameter to :func:`dis.stack_effect`."
msgstr ":issue:`32455`: 向 :func:`dis.stack_effect` 添加了 *jump* 参数。"

#: ../NEWS:38546
msgid ""
":issue:`27485`: Rename and deprecate undocumented functions in "
":func:`urllib.parse`."
msgstr ":issue:`27485`: 重命名并弃用 :func:`urllib.parse` 中未文档化的函数。"

#: ../NEWS:38549
msgid ""
":issue:`33332`: Add ``signal.valid_signals()`` to expose the POSIX "
"sigfillset() functionality."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33332`: 添加 ``signal.valid_signals()`` 以暴露POSIX sigfillset()功能。"

#: ../NEWS:38552
msgid ""
":issue:`33251`: ``ConfigParser.items()`` was fixed so that key-value pairs "
"passed in via :func:`vars` are not included in the resulting output."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33251`: 修复了 ``ConfigParser.items()``，使其不再将通过 :func:`vars` "
"传递的键值对包含在结果输出中。"

#: ../NEWS:38555 ../NEWS:40215 ../NEWS:44529
msgid ":issue:`33329`: Fix multiprocessing regression on newer glibcs"
msgstr ":issue:`33329`: 修复了在新版 glibc 上的多进程回归问题。"

#: ../NEWS:38557
msgid ""
":issue:`33334`: :func:`dis.stack_effect` now supports all defined opcodes "
"including NOP and EXTENDED_ARG."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33334`: :func:`dis.stack_effect` 现在支持所有定义的 opcode，包括 NOP 和 "
"EXTENDED_ARG。"

#: ../NEWS:38560 ../NEWS:40217 ../NEWS:44531
msgid ""
":issue:`991266`: Fix quoting of the ``Comment`` attribute of "
":class:`http.cookies.SimpleCookie`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`991266`: 修复了 :class:`http.cookies.SimpleCookie` 的 ``Comment`` "
"属性的引用问题。"

#: ../NEWS:38563 ../NEWS:40220 ../NEWS:44534
msgid ":issue:`33131`: Upgrade bundled version of pip to 10.0.1."
msgstr ":issue:`33131`: 将捆绑的 pip 版本升级至 10.0.1。"

#: ../NEWS:38565 ../NEWS:40222 ../NEWS:44536
msgid ""
":issue:`33308`: Fixed a crash in the :mod:`parser` module when converting an"
" ST object to a tree of tuples or lists with ``line_info=False`` and "
"``col_info=True``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33308`: 修复了 :mod:`parser` 模块在将 ST 对象转换为元组或列表树时，当 ``line_info=False``"
" 且 ``col_info=True`` 时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:38569
msgid ""
":issue:`23403`: lib2to3 now uses pickle protocol 4 for pre-computed "
"grammars."
msgstr ":issue:`23403`: lib2to3 现在对预计算的语法使用 pickle 协议 4。"

#: ../NEWS:38571 ../NEWS:40226
msgid ":issue:`33266`: lib2to3 now recognizes ``rf'...'`` strings."
msgstr ":issue:`33266`: lib2to3 现在能识别 ``rf'...'`` 字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:38573 ../NEWS:40228
msgid ":issue:`11594`: Ensure line-endings are respected when using lib2to3."
msgstr ":issue:`11594`: 确保在使用 lib2to3 时尊重行尾。"

#: ../NEWS:38575 ../NEWS:40230
msgid ""
":issue:`33254`: Have :func:`importlib.resources.contents` and "
":meth:`!importlib.abc.ResourceReader.contents` return an :term:`iterable` "
"instead of an :term:`iterator`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33254`: 使 :func:`importlib.resources.contents` 和 "
":meth:`!importlib.abc.ResourceReader.contents` 返回 :term:`iterable` 而非 "
":term:`iterator`。"

#: ../NEWS:38579
msgid ""
":issue:`33265`: ``contextlib.ExitStack`` and ``contextlib.AsyncExitStack`` "
"now use a method instead of a wrapper function for exit callbacks."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33265`: ``contextlib.ExitStack`` 和 ``contextlib.AsyncExitStack`` "
"现在使用方法而不是包装函数来处理退出回调。"

#: ../NEWS:38582 ../NEWS:40110 ../NEWS:44540
msgid ""
":issue:`33263`: Fix FD leak in ``_SelectorSocketTransport``  Patch by Vlad "
"Starostin."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33263`: 修复了 ``_SelectorSocketTransport`` 中的文件描述符泄漏问题。由 Vlad "
"Starostin 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38585 ../NEWS:40234 ../NEWS:44543
msgid ""
":issue:`33256`: Fix display of ``<module>`` call in the html produced by "
"``cgitb.html()``. Patch by Stéphane Blondon."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33256`: 修复了 ``cgitb.html()`` 生成的 html 中 ``<module>`` 调用的显示问题。补丁由 "
"Stéphane Blondon 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:38588
msgid ""
":issue:`33144`: ``random.Random()`` and its subclassing mechanism got "
"optimized to check only once at class/subclass instantiation time whether "
"its ``getrandbits()`` method can be relied on by other methods, including "
"``randrange()``, for the generation of arbitrarily large random integers. "
"Patch by Wolfgang Maier."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33144`: 优化了 ``random.Random()`` 及其子类机制，仅在类/子类实例化时检查一次其 "
"``getrandbits()`` 方法是否可以被其他方法（包括 ``randrange()``）依赖，用于生成任意大的随机整数。由 Wolfgang "
"Maier 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38594
msgid ""
":issue:`33185`: Fixed regression when running pydoc with the :option:`-m` "
"switch. (The regression was introduced in 3.7.0b3 by the resolution of "
":issue:`33053`)"
msgstr ""
":issue:`33185`: 修复了使用 :option:`-m` 开关运行 pydoc 时的回归问题。（此回归问题由解决 "
":issue:`33053` 在 3.7.0b3 版本引入）"

#: ../NEWS:38598
msgid ""
"This fix also changed pydoc to add ``os.getcwd()`` to :data:`sys.path` when "
"necessary, rather than adding ``\".\"``."
msgstr ""
"此修复还改变了 pydoc，使其在必要时将 ``os.getcwd()`` 添加到 :data:`sys.path` 中，而不是添加 "
"``\".\"``。"

#: ../NEWS:38601
msgid ""
":issue:`29613`: Added support for the ``SameSite`` cookie flag to the "
"``http.cookies`` module."
msgstr ":issue:`29613`: 在 ``http.cookies`` 模块中添加了对 ``SameSite`` cookie 标志的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:38604 ../NEWS:40242
msgid ""
":issue:`33169`: Delete entries of ``None`` in "
":data:`sys.path_importer_cache` when "
":meth:`importlib.machinery.invalidate_caches` is called."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33169`: 当调用 :meth:`importlib.machinery.invalidate_caches` 时，删除 "
":data:`sys.path_importer_cache` 中的 ``None`` 条目。"

#: ../NEWS:38607 ../NEWS:40248 ../NEWS:44546
msgid ""
":issue:`33203`: ``random.Random.choice()`` now raises ``IndexError`` for "
"empty sequences consistently even when called from subclasses without a "
"``getrandbits()`` implementation."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33203`: ``random.Random.choice()`` 现在对于空序列会一致地引发 "
"``IndexError``，即使是从没有 ``getrandbits()`` 实现的子类中调用也是如此。"

#: ../NEWS:38611 ../NEWS:40252 ../NEWS:44550
msgid ""
":issue:`33224`: Update difflib.mdiff() for :pep:`479`.  Convert an uncaught "
"StopIteration in a generator into a return-statement."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33224`: 为 :pep:`479` 更新 difflib.mdiff()。将生成器中未捕获的 StopIteration 转换为 "
"return 语句。"

#: ../NEWS:38614 ../NEWS:40255 ../NEWS:44553
msgid ""
":issue:`33209`: End framing at the end of C implementation of "
":func:`pickle.Pickler.dump`."
msgstr ":issue:`33209`: 在 :func:`pickle.Pickler.dump` 的 C 实现结束时结束帧。"

#: ../NEWS:38617
msgid ""
":issue:`32861`: The urllib.robotparser's ``__str__`` representation now "
"includes wildcard entries and the \"Crawl-delay\" and \"Request-rate\" "
"fields. Also removes extra newlines that were being appended to the end of "
"the string. Patch by Michael Lazar."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32861`: urllib.robotparser 的 ``__str__`` 表示现在包括通配符条目和 \"Crawl-"
"delay\" 和 \"Request-rate\" 字段。还移除了被附加到字符串末尾的额外换行符。由 Michael Lazar 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38622
msgid ""
":issue:`23403`: ``DEFAULT_PROTOCOL`` in :mod:`pickle` was bumped to 4. "
"Protocol 4 is described in :pep:`3154` and available since Python 3.4. It "
"offers better performance and smaller size compared to protocol 3 introduced"
" in Python 3.0."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23403`: :mod:`pickle` 中的 ``DEFAULT_PROTOCOL`` 被提升到 4。协议 4 在 "
":pep:`3154` 中有描述，自 Python 3.4 起可用。与 Python 3.0 中引入的协议 3 相比，它提供了更好的性能和更小的尺寸。"

#: ../NEWS:38627 ../NEWS:40258
msgid ""
":issue:`20104`: Improved error handling and fixed a reference leak in "
":func:`os.posix_spawn`."
msgstr ":issue:`20104`: 改进了 :func:`os.posix_spawn` 中的错误处理并修复了一个引用泄漏。"

#: ../NEWS:38630
msgid ""
":issue:`33106`: Deleting a key from a read-only dbm database raises module "
"specific error instead of KeyError."
msgstr ":issue:`33106`: 从只读 dbm 数据库中删除键会引发模块特定的错误，而不是 KeyError。"

#: ../NEWS:38633 ../NEWS:40261
msgid ""
":issue:`33175`: In dataclasses, Field.__set_name__ now looks up the "
"__set_name__ special method on the class, not the instance, of the default "
"value."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33175`: 在数据类中，Field.__set_name__ 现在查找默认值的类上的 __set_name__ "
"特殊方法，而不是实例上的。"

#: ../NEWS:38637
msgid ""
":issue:`32380`: Create functools.singledispatchmethod to support generic "
"single dispatch on descriptors and methods."
msgstr ":issue:`32380`: 创建 functools.singledispatchmethod 以支持对描述符和方法的通用单分派。"

#: ../NEWS:38640 ../NEWS:40401
msgid ""
":issue:`33141`: Have Field objects pass through __set_name__ to their "
"default values, if they have their own __set_name__."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33141`: 如果 Field 对象有自己的 __set_name__，则让它们将 __set_name__ 传递给它们的默认值。"

#: ../NEWS:38643 ../NEWS:40404 ../NEWS:44560
msgid ""
":issue:`33096`: Allow ttk.Treeview.insert to insert iid that has a false "
"boolean value. Note iid=0 and iid=False would be same. Patch by Garvit "
"Khatri."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33096`: 允许 ttk.Treeview.insert 插入具有假布尔值的 iid。注意 iid=0 和 iid=False "
"会是相同的。由 Garvit Khatri 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38647 ../NEWS:40408
msgid ""
":issue:`32873`: Treat type variables and special typing forms as immutable "
"by copy and pickle.  This fixes several minor issues and inconsistencies, "
"and improves backwards compatibility with Python 3.6."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32873`: 通过复制和pickle操作将类型变量和特殊类型形式视为不可变。这修复了几个小问题和不一致性，并提高了与Python "
"3.6的向后兼容性。"

#: ../NEWS:38651 ../NEWS:40412
msgid ""
":issue:`33134`: When computing dataclass's __hash__, use the lookup table to"
" contain the function which returns the __hash__ value.  This is an "
"improvement over looking up a string, and then testing that string to see "
"what to do."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33134`: "
"在计算数据类的__hash__时，使用查找表包含返回__hash__值的函数。这比查找字符串然后测试该字符串以决定做什么有所改进。"

#: ../NEWS:38656 ../NEWS:40417 ../NEWS:44564
msgid ":issue:`33127`: The ssl module now compiles with LibreSSL 2.7.1."
msgstr ":issue:`33127`: ssl模块现在可以编译使用LibreSSL 2.7.1。"

#: ../NEWS:38658 ../NEWS:40419
msgid ""
":issue:`32505`: Raise TypeError if a member variable of a dataclass is of "
"type Field, but doesn't have a type annotation."
msgstr ":issue:`32505`: 如果数据类的成员变量是Field类型但没有类型注解，则抛出TypeError。"

#: ../NEWS:38661 ../NEWS:40422
msgid ""
":issue:`33078`: Fix the failure on OSX caused by the tests relying on "
"sem_getvalue"
msgstr ":issue:`33078`: 修复了由于测试依赖sem_getvalue而在OSX上导致的失败。"

#: ../NEWS:38664 ../NEWS:40425
msgid ":issue:`33116`: Add 'Field' to dataclasses.__all__."
msgstr ":issue:`33116`: 将'Field'添加到dataclasses.__all__中。"

#: ../NEWS:38666 ../NEWS:40427
msgid ""
":issue:`32896`: Fix an error where subclassing a dataclass with a field that"
" uses a default_factory would generate an incorrect class."
msgstr ":issue:`32896`: 修复了一个错误，即当子类化一个使用default_factory字段的数据类时会生成一个不正确的类。"

#: ../NEWS:38669 ../NEWS:40430
msgid ""
":issue:`33100`: Dataclasses: If a field has a default value that's a "
"MemberDescriptorType, then it's from that field being in __slots__, not an "
"actual default value."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33100`: "
"数据类：如果一个字段有一个默认值是MemberDescriptorType，那么它是因为该字段在__slots__中，而不是一个实际的默认值。"

#: ../NEWS:38673 ../NEWS:40434
msgid ""
":issue:`32953`: If a non-dataclass inherits from a frozen dataclass, allow "
"attributes to be added to the derived class.  Only attributes from the "
"frozen dataclass cannot be assigned to.  Require all dataclasses in a "
"hierarchy to be either all frozen or all non-frozen."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32953`: "
"如果一个非数据类继承自一个冻结的数据类，允许向派生类添加属性。只有来自冻结数据类的属性不能被赋值。要求层次结构中的所有数据类要么全部冻结，要么全部非冻结。"

#: ../NEWS:38678 ../NEWS:40265
msgid ""
":issue:`33097`: Raise RuntimeError when ``executor.submit`` is called during"
" interpreter shutdown."
msgstr ":issue:`33097`: 在解释器关闭期间调用 ``executor.submit`` 时抛出RuntimeError。"

#: ../NEWS:38681
msgid ""
":issue:`32968`: Modulo and floor division involving Fraction and float "
"should return float."
msgstr ":issue:`32968`: 涉及Fraction和float的模和地板除法应返回float。"

#: ../NEWS:38684 ../NEWS:40439
msgid ":issue:`33061`: Add missing ``NoReturn`` to ``__all__`` in typing.py"
msgstr ":issue:`33061`: 在typing.py的 ``__all__`` 中添加缺失的 ``NoReturn``。"

#: ../NEWS:38686 ../NEWS:40441
msgid ""
":issue:`33078`: Fix the size handling in multiprocessing.Queue when a "
"pickling error occurs."
msgstr ":issue:`33078`: 修复当发生pickling错误时multiprocessing.Queue中的大小处理。"

#: ../NEWS:38689 ../NEWS:40444 ../NEWS:44816
msgid ""
":issue:`33064`: lib2to3 now properly supports trailing commas after "
"``*args`` and ``**kwargs`` in function signatures."
msgstr ":issue:`33064`: lib2to3现在正确支持函数签名中 ``*args`` 和 ``**kwargs`` 后的尾随逗号。"

#: ../NEWS:38692 ../NEWS:40447
msgid ""
":issue:`33056`: FIX properly close leaking fds in "
"concurrent.futures.ProcessPoolExecutor."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33056`: 修复concurrent.futures.ProcessPoolExecutor中泄漏的文件描述符未正确关闭的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:38695 ../NEWS:40450 ../NEWS:44566
msgid ""
":issue:`33021`: Release the GIL during fstat() calls, avoiding hang of all "
"threads when calling mmap.mmap(), os.urandom(), and random.seed().  Patch by"
" Nir Soffer."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33021`: "
"在fstat()调用期间释放GIL，避免在调用mmap.mmap()、os.urandom()和random.seed()时所有线程挂起。由Nir "
"Soffer提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38699 ../NEWS:40454 ../NEWS:44819
msgid ""
":issue:`31804`: Avoid failing in multiprocessing.Process if the standard "
"streams are closed or None at exit."
msgstr ":issue:`31804`: 避免在标准流在退出时被关闭或为None时，multiprocessing.Process失败。"

#: ../NEWS:38702
msgid ""
":issue:`33034`: Providing an explicit error message when casting the port "
"property to anything that is not an integer value using ``urlparse()`` and "
"``urlsplit()``. Patch by Matt Eaton."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33034`: 当使用 ``urlparse()`` 和 ``urlsplit()`` "
"将port属性转换为非整数值时，提供明确的错误消息。由Matt Eaton提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38706
msgid ""
":issue:`30249`: Improve struct.unpack_from() exception messages for problems"
" with the buffer size and offset."
msgstr ":issue:`30249`: 改进struct.unpack_from()在缓冲区大小和偏移量问题上的异常消息。"

#: ../NEWS:38709 ../NEWS:40457 ../NEWS:44822
msgid ""
":issue:`33037`: Skip sending/receiving data after SSL transport closing."
msgstr ":issue:`33037`: 在SSL传输关闭后跳过发送/接收数据。"

#: ../NEWS:38711 ../NEWS:40459 ../NEWS:44570
msgid ""
":issue:`27683`: Fix a regression in :mod:`ipaddress` that result of "
":meth:`hosts` is empty when the network is constructed by a tuple containing"
" an integer mask and only 1 bit left for addresses."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27683`: 修复 :mod:`ipaddress` "
"中的一个回归问题，当网络由包含整数掩码且仅剩1位地址的元组构造时，:meth:`hosts` 的结果为空。"

#: ../NEWS:38715
msgid ""
":issue:`22674`: Add the strsignal() function in the signal module that "
"returns the system description of the given signal, as returned by "
"strsignal(3)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22674`: "
"在signal模块中添加strsignal()函数，该函数返回给定信号的系统描述，如同strsignal(3)返回的那样。"

#: ../NEWS:38718 ../NEWS:40463
msgid ""
":issue:`32999`: Fix C implementation of ``ABC.__subclasscheck__(cls, "
"subclass)`` crashed when ``subclass`` is not a type object."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32999`: 修复 ``ABC.__subclasscheck__(cls, subclass)`` 的C实现，在 "
"``subclass`` 不是类型对象时崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:38721 ../NEWS:40466 ../NEWS:44826
msgid ""
":issue:`33009`: Fix inspect.signature() for single-parameter partialmethods."
msgstr ":issue:`33009`: 修复inspect.signature()对于单参数partialmethods的处理。"

#: ../NEWS:38723 ../NEWS:40468 ../NEWS:44828
msgid ""
":issue:`32969`: Expose several missing constants in zlib and fix "
"corresponding documentation."
msgstr ":issue:`32969`: 在zlib中暴露几个缺失的常量并修复相应的文档。"

#: ../NEWS:38726 ../NEWS:40471
msgid ""
":issue:`32056`: Improved exceptions raised for invalid number of channels "
"and sample width when read an audio file in modules :mod:`!aifc`, "
":mod:`wave` and :mod:`!sunau`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32056`: 改进在模块 :mod:`!aifc`、:mod:`wave` 和 :mod:`!sunau` "
"中读取音频文件时，对于无效通道数和样本宽度引发的异常。"

#: ../NEWS:38730
msgid ":issue:`32970`: Improved disassembly of the MAKE_FUNCTION instruction."
msgstr ":issue:`32970`: 改进MAKE_FUNCTION指令的反汇编。"

#: ../NEWS:38732 ../NEWS:40475 ../NEWS:44574
msgid ""
":issue:`32844`: Fix wrong redirection of a low descriptor (0 or 1) to stderr"
" in subprocess if another low descriptor is closed."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32844`: 修复在subprocess中如果另一个低描述符被关闭时，将低描述符（0或1）错误重定向到stderr的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:38735 ../NEWS:40606
msgid ""
":issue:`32960`: For dataclasses, disallow inheriting frozen from non-frozen "
"classes, and also disallow inheriting non-frozen from frozen classes. This "
"restriction will be relaxed at a future date."
msgstr ":issue:`32960`: 对于数据类，禁止从非冻结类继承冻结类，也禁止从冻结类继承非冻结类。这一限制将在未来放宽。"

#: ../NEWS:38739 ../NEWS:40610 ../NEWS:44831
msgid ""
":issue:`32713`: Fixed tarfile.itn handling of out-of-bounds float values. "
"Patch by Joffrey Fuhrer."
msgstr ":issue:`32713`: 修复tarfile.itn对超出界限的浮点值的处理。由Joffrey Fuhrer提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38742 ../NEWS:40117
msgid ""
":issue:`32257`: The ssl module now contains OP_NO_RENEGOTIATION constant, "
"available with OpenSSL 1.1.0h or 1.1.1."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32257`: ssl模块现在包含OP_NO_RENEGOTIATION常量，适用于OpenSSL 1.1.0h或1.1.1版本。"

#: ../NEWS:38745 ../NEWS:40613
msgid ""
":issue:`32951`: Direct instantiation of SSLSocket and SSLObject objects is "
"now prohibited. The constructors were never documented, tested, or designed "
"as public constructors. Users were suppose to use ssl.wrap_socket() or "
"SSLContext."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32951`: "
"现在禁止直接实例化SSLSocket和SSLObject对象。这些构造函数从未被记录、测试或设计为公共构造函数。用户应该使用ssl.wrap_socket()或SSLContext。"

#: ../NEWS:38750 ../NEWS:40618
msgid ""
":issue:`32929`: Remove the tri-state parameter \"hash\", and add the boolean"
" \"unsafe_hash\". If unsafe_hash is True, add a __hash__ function, but if a "
"__hash__ exists, raise TypeError.  If unsafe_hash is False, add a __hash__ "
"based on the values of eq= and frozen=.  The unsafe_hash=False behavior is "
"the same as the old hash=None behavior.  unsafe_hash=False is the default, "
"just as hash=None used to be."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32929`: "
"移除了三态参数\"hash\"，并添加了布尔型\"unsafe_hash\"。如果unsafe_hash为True，添加一个__hash__函数，但如果__hash__已存在，则抛出TypeError。如果unsafe_hash为False，根据eq=和frozen=的值添加__hash__。unsafe_hash=False的行为与旧的hash=None行为相同。unsafe_hash=False是默认值，就像hash=None曾经是默认值一样。"

#: ../NEWS:38757 ../NEWS:40625
msgid ""
":issue:`32947`: Add OP_ENABLE_MIDDLEBOX_COMPAT and test workaround for "
"TLSv1.3 for future compatibility with OpenSSL 1.1.1."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32947`: 添加OP_ENABLE_MIDDLEBOX_COMPAT和测试解决方法，以便未来与OpenSSL "
"1.1.1兼容的TLSv1.3。"

#: ../NEWS:38760
msgid ""
":issue:`32146`: Document the interaction between frozen executables and the "
"spawn and forkserver start methods in multiprocessing."
msgstr ":issue:`32146`: 记录了冻结可执行文件与multiprocessing中spawn和forkserver启动方法之间的交互。"

#: ../NEWS:38763 ../NEWS:40628 ../NEWS:44834
msgid ""
":issue:`30622`: The ssl module now detects missing NPN support in LibreSSL."
msgstr ":issue:`30622`: ssl模块现在能检测到LibreSSL中缺少的NPN支持。"

#: ../NEWS:38765 ../NEWS:40630 ../NEWS:44836
msgid ""
":issue:`32922`: dbm.open() now encodes filename with the filesystem encoding"
" rather than default encoding."
msgstr ":issue:`32922`: dbm.open()现在使用文件系统编码而不是默认编码对文件名进行编码。"

#: ../NEWS:38768
msgid ":issue:`32759`: Free unused arenas in multiprocessing.heap."
msgstr ":issue:`32759`: 在multiprocessing.heap中释放未使用的竞技场。"

#: ../NEWS:38770 ../NEWS:40633 ../NEWS:44839
msgid ""
":issue:`32859`: In ``os.dup2``, don't check every call whether the ``dup3`` "
"syscall exists or not."
msgstr ":issue:`32859`: 在 ``os.dup2`` 中，不再每次调用时检查 ``dup3`` 系统调用是否存在。"

#: ../NEWS:38773 ../NEWS:40636
msgid ""
":issue:`32556`: nt._getfinalpathname, nt._getvolumepathname and "
"nt._getdiskusage now correctly convert from bytes."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32556`: "
"nt._getfinalpathname、nt._getvolumepathname和nt._getdiskusage现在能正确地从字节转换。"

#: ../NEWS:38776 ../NEWS:40642 ../NEWS:44842
msgid ""
":issue:`21060`: Rewrite confusing message from setup.py upload from \"No "
"dist file created in earlier command\" to the more helpful \"Must create and"
" upload files in one command\"."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21060`: 将setup.py upload中令人困惑的消息从\"No dist file created in earlier "
"command\"重写为更有帮助的\"Must create and upload files in one command\"。"

#: ../NEWS:38780 ../NEWS:40478 ../NEWS:44846
msgid ""
":issue:`32857`: In :mod:`tkinter`, ``after_cancel(None)`` now raises a "
":exc:`ValueError` instead of canceling the first scheduled function. Patch "
"by Cheryl Sabella."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32857`: 在 :mod:`tkinter` 中，``after_cancel(None)`` 现在会引发 "
":exc:`ValueError` 异常，而不是取消第一个预定的函数。由Cheryl Sabella提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38784 ../NEWS:40646 ../NEWS:44850
msgid ""
":issue:`32852`: Make sure sys.argv remains as a list when running trace."
msgstr ":issue:`32852`: 确保在运行trace时sys.argv保持为列表。"

#: ../NEWS:38786
msgid ""
":issue:`31333`: ``_abc`` module is added.  It is a speedup module with C "
"implementations for various functions and methods in ``abc``.  Creating an "
"ABC subclass and calling ``isinstance`` or ``issubclass`` with an ABC "
"subclass are up to 1.5x faster. In addition, this makes Python start-up up "
"to 10% faster."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31333`: 添加了 ``_abc`` 模块。这是一个加速模块，为 ``abc`` "
"中的各种函数和方法提供了C语言实现。创建ABC子类及调用 ``isinstance`` 或 ``issubclass`` "
"与ABC子类的速度提高了1.5倍。此外，这使得Python的启动速度提高了10%。"

#: ../NEWS:38792
msgid ""
"Note that the new implementation hides internal registry and caches, "
"previously accessible via private attributes ``_abc_registry``, "
"``_abc_cache``, and ``_abc_negative_cache``.  There are three debugging "
"helper methods that can be used instead ``_dump_registry``, "
"``_abc_registry_clear``, and ``_abc_caches_clear``."
msgstr ""
"注意，新实现隐藏了内部注册表和缓存，之前可以通过私有属性 ``_abc_registry``、``_abc_cache`` 和 "
"``_abc_negative_cache`` "
"访问。有三个调试辅助方法可以替代使用：``_dump_registry``、``_abc_registry_clear`` 和 "
"``_abc_caches_clear``。"

#: ../NEWS:38798 ../NEWS:40658 ../NEWS:44852
msgid ""
":issue:`32841`: Fixed ``asyncio.Condition`` issue which silently ignored "
"cancellation after notifying and cancelling a conditional lock. Patch by Bar"
" Harel."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32841`: 修复了 ``asyncio.Condition`` 问题，该问题在通知并取消条件锁后默默忽略了取消。由Bar "
"Harel提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38802 ../NEWS:40662
msgid ""
":issue:`32819`: ssl.match_hostname() has been simplified and no longer "
"depends on re and ipaddress module for wildcard and IP addresses. Error "
"reporting for invalid wildcards has been improved."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32819`: ssl.match_hostname() 已被简化，不再依赖 re 和 ipaddress "
"模块处理通配符和IP地址。对于无效通配符的错误报告已改进。"

#: ../NEWS:38806
msgid ""
":issue:`19675`: ``multiprocessing.Pool`` no longer leaks processes if its "
"initialization fails."
msgstr ":issue:`19675`: 如果初始化失败，``multiprocessing.Pool`` 不再泄漏进程。"

#: ../NEWS:38809 ../NEWS:40666
msgid ""
":issue:`32394`: socket: Remove "
"TCP_FASTOPEN,TCP_KEEPCNT,TCP_KEEPIDLE,TCP_KEEPINTVL flags on older version "
"Windows during run-time."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32394`: socket: "
"在旧版本Windows运行时移除TCP_FASTOPEN、TCP_KEEPCNT、TCP_KEEPIDLE、TCP_KEEPINTVL标志。"

#: ../NEWS:38813 ../NEWS:40670 ../NEWS:44856
msgid ""
":issue:`31787`: Fixed refleaks of ``__init__()`` methods in various modules."
" (Contributed by Oren Milman)"
msgstr ":issue:`31787`: 修复了多个模块中 ``__init__()`` 方法的内存泄漏问题。(由Oren Milman贡献)"

#: ../NEWS:38816 ../NEWS:40673 ../NEWS:44859
msgid ""
":issue:`30157`: Fixed guessing quote and delimiter in csv.Sniffer.sniff() "
"when only the last field is quoted.  Patch by Jake Davis."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30157`: 修复了在只有最后一个字段被引用时，csv.Sniffer.sniff() 中猜测引用和分隔符的问题。由Jake "
"Davis提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38819
msgid ""
":issue:`30688`: Added support of ``\\N{name}`` escapes in regular "
"expressions. Based on patch by Jonathan Eunice."
msgstr ":issue:`30688`: 在正则表达式中添加了对 ``\\N{name}`` 转义的支持。基于Jonathan Eunice的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38822 ../NEWS:40676
msgid ""
":issue:`32792`: collections.ChainMap() preserves the order of the underlying"
" mappings."
msgstr ":issue:`32792`: collections.ChainMap() 保留了底层映射的顺序。"

#: ../NEWS:38825 ../NEWS:40679
msgid ""
":issue:`32775`: :func:`fnmatch.translate` no longer produces patterns which "
"contain set operations. Sets starting with '[' or containing '--', '&&', "
"'~~' or '||' will be interpreted differently in regular expressions in "
"future versions. Currently they emit warnings. fnmatch.translate() now "
"avoids producing patterns containing such sets by accident."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32775`: :func:`fnmatch.translate` "
"不再生成包含集合操作的模式。以'['开头或包含'--'、'&&'、'~~'或'||'的集合在未来版本的正则表达式中将被不同解释。目前它们会发出警告。fnmatch.translate()"
" 现在避免意外生成包含此类集合的模式。"

#: ../NEWS:38831 ../NEWS:40685
msgid ""
":issue:`32622`: Implement native fast sendfile for Windows proactor event "
"loop."
msgstr ":issue:`32622`: 为Windows proactor事件循环实现原生快速发送文件功能。"

#: ../NEWS:38833 ../NEWS:40687 ../NEWS:44865
msgid ""
":issue:`32777`: Fix a rare but potential pre-exec child process deadlock in "
"subprocess on POSIX systems when marking file descriptors inheritable on "
"exec in the child process.  This bug appears to have been introduced in 3.4."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32777`: "
"修复了在POSIX系统的子进程中，当标记文件描述符为可继承时，subprocess中一个罕见但潜在的子进程死锁问题。此bug似乎是在3.4版本中引入的。"

#: ../NEWS:38838 ../NEWS:40692 ../NEWS:44870
msgid ""
":issue:`32647`: The ctypes module used to depend on indirect linking for "
"dlopen. The shared extension is now explicitly linked against libdl on "
"platforms with dl."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32647`: ctypes模块过去依赖间接链接来使用dlopen。现在，在支持dl的平台上，共享扩展已明确链接到libdl。"

#: ../NEWS:38842
msgid ""
":issue:`32749`: A :mod:`dbm.dumb` database opened with flags 'r' is now "
"read-only. :func:`dbm.dumb.open` with flags 'r' and 'w' no longer creates a "
"database if it does not exist."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32749`: 使用'r'标志打开的 :mod:`dbm.dumb` 数据库现在变为只读。使用'r'和'w'标志的 "
":func:`dbm.dumb.open` 如果数据库不存在，将不再创建数据库。"

#: ../NEWS:38846 ../NEWS:40696
msgid ":issue:`32741`: Implement ``asyncio.TimerHandle.when()`` method."
msgstr ":issue:`32741`: 实现 ``asyncio.TimerHandle.when()`` 方法。"

#: ../NEWS:38848 ../NEWS:40698
msgid ":issue:`32691`: Use mod_spec.parent when running modules with pdb"
msgstr ":issue:`32691`: 在使用pdb运行模块时使用mod_spec.parent。"

#: ../NEWS:38850 ../NEWS:40700 ../NEWS:44874
msgid ""
":issue:`32734`: Fixed ``asyncio.Lock()`` safety issue which allowed "
"acquiring and locking the same lock multiple times, without it being free. "
"Patch by Bar Harel."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32734`: 修复了 ``asyncio.Lock()`` 的安全问题，该问题允许多次获取和锁定同一个锁，而锁并未释放。由Bar "
"Harel提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38854 ../NEWS:40704 ../NEWS:44878
msgid ""
":issue:`32727`: Do not include name field in SMTP envelope from address. "
"Patch by Stéphane Wirtel"
msgstr ":issue:`32727`: 不在SMTP信封的发送地址中包含名字字段。由Stéphane Wirtel提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38857 ../NEWS:40707
msgid ""
":issue:`31453`: Add TLSVersion constants and SSLContext.maximum_version / "
"minimum_version attributes. The new API wraps OpenSSL 1.1 "
"https://web.archive.org/web/20180309043602/https://www.openssl.org/docs/man1.1.0/ssl/SSL_CTX_set_min_proto_version.html"
" feature."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31453`: 添加TLSVersion常量和SSLContext.maximum_version / "
"minimum_version属性。新API封装了OpenSSL 1.1 "
"https://web.archive.org/web/20180309043602/https://www.openssl.org/docs/man1.1.0/ssl/SSL_CTX_set_min_proto_version.html"
" 的特性。"

#: ../NEWS:38862 ../NEWS:40712
msgid ""
":issue:`24334`: Internal implementation details of ssl module were cleaned "
"up. The SSLSocket has one less layer of indirection. Owner and session "
"information are now handled by the SSLSocket and SSLObject constructor. "
"Channel binding implementation has been simplified."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24334`: "
"清理了ssl模块的内部实现细节。SSLSocket减少了一层间接引用。所有者与会话信息现在由SSLSocket和SSLObject的构造函数处理。通道绑定实现已被简化。"

#: ../NEWS:38867 ../NEWS:40717 ../NEWS:44891
msgid ""
":issue:`31848`: Fix the error handling in Aifc_read.initfp() when the SSND "
"chunk is not found. Patch by Zackery Spytz."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31848`: 修复Aifc_read.initfp()中当SSND块未找到时的错误处理。补丁由Zackery Spytz提供。"

#: ../NEWS:38870 ../NEWS:40720
msgid ""
":issue:`32585`: Add Ttk spinbox widget to :mod:`tkinter.ttk`.  Patch by Alan"
" D Moore."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32585`: 向 :mod:`tkinter.ttk` 添加Ttk spinbox小部件。由Alan D Moore提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38873
msgid ""
":issue:`32512`: :mod:`profile` CLI accepts ``-m module_name`` as an "
"alternative to script path."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32512`: :mod:`profile` 命令行界面接受 ``-m module_name`` 作为脚本路径的替代选项。"

#: ../NEWS:38876
msgid ""
":issue:`8525`: help() on a type now displays builtin subclasses. This is "
"intended primarily to help with notification of more specific exception "
"subclasses."
msgstr ":issue:`8525`: 现在，一个类型上的help()会显示内置的子类。这主要是为了帮助通知更具体的异常子类。"

#: ../NEWS:38880
msgid "Patch by Sanyam Khurana."
msgstr "由Sanyam Khurana提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38882
msgid ""
":issue:`31639`: http.server now exposes a ThreadingHTTPServer class and uses"
" it when the module is run with ``-m`` to cope with web browsers pre-opening"
" sockets."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31639`: http.server现在公开了一个ThreadingHTTPServer类，并在使用 ``-m`` "
"运行模块时使用它，以应对web浏览器预打开套接字的情况。"

#: ../NEWS:38886
msgid ""
":issue:`29877`: compileall: import ProcessPoolExecutor only when needed, "
"preventing hangs on low resource platforms"
msgstr ":issue:`29877`: compileall: 仅在需要时导入ProcessPoolExecutor，防止在资源低的平台上挂起"

#: ../NEWS:38889 ../NEWS:40723
msgid ""
":issue:`32221`: Various functions returning tuple containing IPv6 addresses "
"now omit ``%scope`` part since the same information is already encoded in "
"*scopeid* tuple item. Especially this speeds up :func:`socket.recvfrom` when"
" it receives multicast packet since useless resolving of network interface "
"name is omitted."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32221`: 现在，返回包含IPv6地址的元组的各种函数省略了 ``%scope`` 部分，因为相同的信息已经在 *scopeid* "
"元组项中编码。特别是这加快了 :func:`socket.recvfrom` 在接收多播数据包时的速度，因为省略了无用的网络接口名称解析。"

#: ../NEWS:38895
msgid ""
":issue:`32147`: :func:`binascii.unhexlify` is now up to 2 times faster. "
"Patch by Sergey Fedoseev."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32147`: :func:`binascii.unhexlify` 现在快了2倍。由Sergey Fedoseev提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38898 ../NEWS:40729
msgid ""
":issue:`30693`: The TarFile class now recurses directories in a reproducible"
" way."
msgstr ":issue:`30693`: TarFile类现在以一种可重复的方式递归目录。"

#: ../NEWS:38901 ../NEWS:40732
msgid ""
":issue:`30693`: The ZipFile class now recurses directories in a reproducible"
" way."
msgstr ":issue:`30693`: ZipFile类现在以一种可重复的方式递归目录。"

#: ../NEWS:38904
msgid ":issue:`31680`: Added :data:`curses.ncurses_version`."
msgstr ":issue:`31680`: 添加了 :data:`curses.ncurses_version`。"

#: ../NEWS:38906 ../NEWS:40268 ../NEWS:44577
msgid ""
":issue:`31908`: Fix output of cover files for ``trace`` module command-line "
"tool. Previously emitted cover files only when ``--missing`` option was "
"used. Patch by Michael Selik."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31908`: 修复了 ``trace`` 模块命令行工具的封面文件输出。之前仅在使用了 ``--missing`` "
"选项时才会发出封面文件。由Michael Selik提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38910
msgid ""
":issue:`31608`: Raise a ``TypeError`` instead of crashing if a "
"``collections.deque`` subclass returns a non-deque from ``__new__``. Patch "
"by Oren Milman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31608`: 如果 ``collections.deque`` 子类从 ``__new__`` "
"返回非队列，现在会引发一个``TypeError``而不是崩溃。由Oren Milman提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38914
msgid ""
":issue:`31425`: Add support for sockets of the AF_QIPCRTR address family, "
"supported by the Linux kernel. This is used to communicate with services, "
"such as GPS or radio, running on Qualcomm devices. Patch by Bjorn Andersson."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31425`: "
"添加了对AF_QIPCRTR地址族套接字的支持，这是Linux内核支持的。这用于与运行在Qualcomm设备上的服务（如GPS或无线电）通信。由Bjorn"
" Andersson提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38919
msgid ""
":issue:`22005`: Implemented unpickling instances of "
":class:`~datetime.datetime`, :class:`~datetime.date` and "
":class:`~datetime.time` pickled by Python 2. ``encoding='latin1'`` should be"
" used for successful decoding."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22005`: 实现了对Python 2腌制的 "
":class:`~datetime.datetime`、:class:`~datetime.date` 和 "
":class:`~datetime.time` 实例的解腌。应该使用 ``encoding='latin1'`` 以成功解码。"

#: ../NEWS:38924 ../NEWS:40486
msgid ""
":issue:`27645`: :class:`sqlite3.Connection` now exposes a "
":class:`~sqlite3.Connection.backup` method, if the underlying SQLite library"
" is at version 3.6.11 or higher.  Patch by Lele Gaifax."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27645`: 如果底层的SQLite库版本为3.6.11或更高，:class:`sqlite3.Connection` 现在公开了一个"
" :class:`~sqlite3.Connection.backup` 方法。由Lele Gaifax提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38928 ../NEWS:40120 ../NEWS:44584
msgid ""
":issue:`16865`: Support arrays >=2GiB in :mod:`ctypes`.  Patch by Segev "
"Finer."
msgstr ":issue:`16865`: 在 :mod:`ctypes` 中支持>=2GiB的数组。由Segev Finer提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38930
msgid ""
":issue:`31508`: Removed support of arguments in "
"``tkinter.ttk.Treeview.selection``. It was deprecated in 3.6.  Use "
"specialized methods like ``selection_set`` for changing the selection."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31508`: 移除了 ``tkinter.ttk.Treeview.selection`` "
"中对参数的支持。这在3.6中已被弃用。使用像 ``selection_set`` 这样的专门方法来更改选择。"

#: ../NEWS:38934
msgid ""
":issue:`29456`: Fix bugs in hangul normalization: u1176, u11a7 and u11c3"
msgstr ":issue:`29456`: 修复韩文音节标准化中的漏洞：u1176、u11a7和u11c3。"

#: ../NEWS:38939
msgid ":issue:`21257`: Document :func:`http.client.parse_headers`."
msgstr ":issue:`21257`: 文档化 :func:`http.client.parse_headers`。"

#: ../NEWS:38941
msgid ":issue:`34764`: Improve example of iter() with 2nd sentinel argument."
msgstr ":issue:`34764`: 改进了iter()带有第二个哨兵参数的示例。"

#: ../NEWS:38943
msgid ""
":issue:`35564`: Explicitly set master_doc variable in conf.py for compliance"
" with Sphinx 2.0"
msgstr ":issue:`35564`: 为了符合Sphinx 2.0，明确设置了conf.py中的master_doc变量。"

#: ../NEWS:38946
msgid ""
":issue:`35511`: Specified that profile.Profile class doesn't not support "
"enable or disable methods. Also, elaborated that Profile object as a context"
" manager is only supported in cProfile module."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35511`: "
"指定了profile.Profile类不支持enable或disable方法。并且详细说明了Profile对象作为上下文管理器仅在cProfile模块中支持。"

#: ../NEWS:38950
msgid ":issue:`10536`: Enhance the gettext docs. Patch by Éric Araujo"
msgstr ":issue:`10536`: 增强gettext文档。由Éric Araujo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38952
msgid ""
":issue:`35089`: Remove mention of ``typing.io`` and ``typing.re``. Their "
"types should be imported from ``typing`` directly."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35089`: 移除了对 ``typing.io`` 和 ``typing.re`` 的提及。它们的类型应该直接从 "
"``typing``导入。"

#: ../NEWS:38955
msgid ""
":issue:`35038`: Fix the documentation about an unexisting ``f_restricted`` "
"attribute in the frame object. Patch by Stéphane Wirtel"
msgstr ""
":issue:`35038`: 修复了关于frame对象中不存在的 ``f_restricted`` 属性的文档。由Stéphane "
"Wirtel提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38958
msgid ""
":issue:`35042`: Replace PEP XYZ by the pep role and allow to use the direct "
"links to the PEPs."
msgstr ":issue:`35042`: 用pep角色替换PEP XYZ，并允许直接链接到PEPs。"

#: ../NEWS:38961
msgid ""
":issue:`35044`: Fix the documentation with the role ``exc`` for the "
"appropriated exception. Patch by Stéphane Wirtel"
msgstr ":issue:`35044`: 修复了文档中使用 ``exc`` 角色指向适当异常的错误。由Stéphane Wirtel提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:38964
msgid ""
":issue:`35035`: Rename documentation for :mod:`email.utils` to "
"``email.utils.rst``."
msgstr ":issue:`35035`: 将 :mod:`email.utils` 的文档重命名为 ``email.utils.rst``。"

