msgstr ":issue:`34225`: 确保INCLUDE和LIB目录不以反斜杠结尾。"

#: ../NEWS:39437
msgid ""
":issue:`34011`: A suite of code has been changed which copied across DLLs "
"and init.tcl from the running Python location into a venv being created. "
"These copies are needed only when running from a Python source build, and "
"the copying code is now only run when that is the case, rather than whenever"
" a venv is created."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34011`: "
"一套代码已被更改，这些代码从运行的Python位置复制DLLs和init.tcl到正在创建的venv中。这些复制仅在从Python源代码构建运行时需要，现在复制代码仅在这种情况下运行，而不是在创建venv时总是运行。"

#: ../NEWS:39443
msgid ""
":issue:`34006`: Revert line length limit for Windows help docs. The line-"
"length limit is not needed because the pages appear in a separate app rather"
" than on a browser tab.  It can also interact badly with the DPI setting."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34006`: "
"恢复Windows帮助文档的行长度限制。行长度限制不需要，因为页面显示在单独的应用程序中而不是浏览器标签中。它也可能与DPI设置产生不良互动。"

#: ../NEWS:39447
msgid ""
":issue:`31546`: Restore running PyOS_InputHook while waiting for user input "
"at the prompt. The restores integration of interactive GUI windows (such as "
"Matplotlib figures) with the prompt on Windows."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31546`: "
"恢复在提示符等待用户输入时运行PyOS_InputHook。这恢复了交互式GUI窗口（如Matplotlib图形）与Windows上提示符的集成。"

#: ../NEWS:39451
msgid ""
":issue:`30237`: Output error when ReadConsole is canceled by "
"CancelSynchronousIo instead of crashing."
msgstr ":issue:`30237`: 当ReadConsole被CancelSynchronousIo取消时输出错误而不是崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:39454
msgid ""
":issue:`33895`: GIL is released while calling functions that acquire Windows"
" loader lock."
msgstr ":issue:`33895`: 在调用获取Windows加载器锁的函数时释放GIL。"

#: ../NEWS:39457 ../NEWS:39934
msgid ""
":issue:`33720`: Reduces maximum marshal recursion depth on release builds."
msgstr ":issue:`33720`: 减少发布版本上的最大marshal递归深度。"

#: ../NEWS:39459
msgid ""
":issue:`29097`: Fix bug where :meth:`datetime.fromtimestamp` erroneously "
"throws an :exc:`OSError` on Windows for values between 0 and 86400. Patch by"
" Ammar Askar."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29097`: 修复 :meth:`datetime.fromtimestamp` 在Windows上对0到86400之间的值错误抛出 "
":exc:`OSError` 的bug。由Ammar Askar提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:39463
msgid ":issue:`33316`: PyThread_release_lock always fails"
msgstr ":issue:`33316`: PyThread_release_lock总是失败"

#: ../NEWS:39465 ../NEWS:40317
msgid ":issue:`33184`: Update Windows installer to use OpenSSL 1.1.0h."
msgstr ":issue:`33184`: 更新Windows安装程序以使用OpenSSL 1.1.0h。"

#: ../NEWS:39467
msgid ""
":issue:`32890`: Fix usage of GetLastError() instead of errno in os.execve() "
"and os.truncate()."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32890`: 修复os.execve()和os.truncate()中使用GetLastError()而不是errno的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:39470 ../NEWS:40525 ../NEWS:44990
msgid ""
":issue:`33016`: Fix potential use of uninitialized memory in "
"nt._getfinalpathname"
msgstr ":issue:`33016`: 修复nt._getfinalpathname中潜在使用未初始化内存的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:39473 ../NEWS:40528 ../NEWS:44993
msgid ""
":issue:`32903`: Fix a memory leak in os.chdir() on Windows if the current "
"directory is set to a UNC path."
msgstr ":issue:`32903`: 修复如果当前目录设置为UNC路径时Windows上os.chdir()的内存泄漏。"

#: ../NEWS:39476 ../NEWS:40772
msgid ":issue:`32901`: Update Tcl and Tk versions to 8.6.8"
msgstr ":issue:`32901`: 将Tcl和Tk版本更新到8.6.8"

#: ../NEWS:39478 ../NEWS:40774 ../NEWS:44996
msgid ":issue:`31966`: Fixed WindowsConsoleIO.write() for writing empty data."
msgstr ":issue:`31966`: 修复WindowsConsoleIO.write()写入空数据的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:39480 ../NEWS:40776 ../NEWS:44998
msgid ":issue:`32409`: Ensures activate.bat can handle Unicode contents."
msgstr ":issue:`32409`: 确保activate.bat可以处理Unicode内容。"

#: ../NEWS:39482 ../NEWS:40778 ../NEWS:45000
msgid ""
":issue:`32457`: Improves handling of denormalized executable path when "
"launching Python."
msgstr ":issue:`32457`: 改进启动Python时对非规范化可执行路径的处理。"

#: ../NEWS:39485 ../NEWS:40781 ../NEWS:45003
msgid ""
":issue:`32370`: Use the correct encoding for ipconfig output in the uuid "
"module. Patch by Segev Finer."
msgstr ":issue:`32370`: 在uuid模块中为ipconfig输出使用正确的编码。由Segev Finer提交补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:39488 ../NEWS:40784 ../NEWS:45006
msgid ""
":issue:`29248`: Fix :func:`os.readlink` on Windows, which was mistakenly "
"treating the ``PrintNameOffset`` field of the reparse data buffer as a "
"number of characters instead of bytes. Patch by Craig Holmquist and SSE4."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29248`: 修复Windows上的 "
":func:`os.readlink`，它错误地将重新解析数据缓冲区的``PrintNameOffset`` 字段视为字符数而非字节数。由Craig "
"Holmquist和SSE4提交补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:39492
msgid ""
":issue:`1104`: Correctly handle string length in "
"``msilib.SummaryInfo.GetProperty()`` to prevent it from truncating the last "
"character."
msgstr ""
":issue:`1104`: 正确处 ``msilib.SummaryInfo.GetProperty()`` "
"中的字符串长度，以防止其截断最后一个字符。"

#: ../NEWS:39499
msgid ":issue:`35401`: Update macOS installer to use OpenSSL 1.1.0j."
msgstr ":issue:`35401`: 更新macOS安装程序以使用OpenSSL 1.1.0j。"

#: ../NEWS:39501
msgid ""
":issue:`35025`: Properly guard the use of the ``CLOCK_GETTIME`` et al. "
"macros in ``timemodule`` on macOS."
msgstr ":issue:`35025`: 在macOS上正确保护 ``timemodule`` 中使用 ``CLOCK_GETTIME`` 等宏。"

#: ../NEWS:39504
msgid ""
":issue:`24658`: On macOS, fix reading from and writing into a file with a "
"size larger than 2 GiB."
msgstr ":issue:`24658`: 在macOS上，修复从大小超过2 GiB的文件读取和写入的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:39507
msgid ":issue:`34405`: Update to OpenSSL 1.1.0i for macOS installer builds."
msgstr ":issue:`34405`: 为macOS安装程序构建更新至OpenSSL 1.1.0i。"

#: ../NEWS:39509
msgid ""
":issue:`33635`: In macOS stat on some file descriptors (/dev/fd/3 f.e) will "
"result in bad file descriptor OSError. Guard against this exception was "
"added in is_dir, is_file and similar methods. DirEntry.is_dir can also throw"
" this exception so _RecursiveWildcardSelector._iterate_directories was also "
"extended with the same error ignoring pattern."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33635`: "
"在macOS上，某些文件描述符（例如/dev/fd/3）的stat将导致坏文件描述符OSError。在is_dir、is_file及类似方法中添加了对这一异常的防护。DirEntry.is_dir也可能抛出此异常，因此_RecursiveWildcardSelector._iterate_directories也扩展了相同的错误忽略模式。"

#: ../NEWS:39515 ../NEWS:40162
msgid ""
":issue:`13631`: The .editrc file in user's home directory is now processed "
"correctly during the readline initialization through editline emulation on "
"macOS."
msgstr ""
":issue:`13631`: 在macOS上通过editline模拟初始化readline时，现在可以正确处理用户主目录中的.editrc文件。"

#: ../NEWS:39519 ../NEWS:40322
msgid ":issue:`33184`: Update macOS installer build to use OpenSSL 1.1.0h."
msgstr ":issue:`33184`: 更新macOS安装程序构建以使用OpenSSL 1.1.0h。"

#: ../NEWS:39521 ../NEWS:40534
msgid ""
":issue:`32726`: Build and link with private copy of Tcl/Tk 8.6 for the macOS"
" 10.6+ installer. The 10.9+ installer variant already does this.  This means"
" that the Python 3.7 provided by the python.org macOS installers no longer "
"need or use any external versions of Tcl/Tk, either system-provided or user-"
"installed, such as ActiveTcl."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32726`: 为macOS 10.6+安装程序构建并链接Tcl/Tk "
"8.6的私有副本。10.9+安装程序变体已经这样做了。这意味着python.org macOS安装程序提供的Python "
"3.7不再需要或使用任何外部版本的Tcl/Tk，无论是系统提供的还是用户安装的，如ActiveTcl。"

#: ../NEWS:39527 ../NEWS:40791
msgid ":issue:`32901`: Update macOS 10.9+ installer to Tcl/Tk 8.6.8."
msgstr ":issue:`32901`: 将macOS 10.9+安装程序更新至Tcl/Tk 8.6.8。"

#: ../NEWS:39529
msgid ""
":issue:`31903`: In :mod:`!_scproxy`, drop the GIL when calling into "
"``SystemConfiguration`` to avoid deadlocks."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31903`: 在 :mod:`!_scproxy` 中，调用 ``SystemConfiguration`` 时释放GIL以避免死锁。"

