msgstr ":issue:`33987`: 为ttk小部件使用ttk框架。"

#: ../NEWS:39548
msgid ""
":issue:`34055`: Fix erroneous 'smart' indents and newlines in IDLE Shell."
msgstr ":issue:`34055`: 修复IDLE Shell中错误的'智能'缩进和换行。"

