msgstr ":issue:`32635`: 修复当系统提供的是 libxcrypt 而不是 libcrypt 时 crypt 模块的段错误。"

#: ../NEWS:41099
msgid ""
":issue:`32598`: Use autoconf to detect OpenSSL libs, headers and supported "
