":issue:`32598`: 使用 autoconf 检测 OpenSSL 库、头文件和支持的特性。ax_check_openssl M4 宏使用 "
"pkg-config 定位 OpenSSL，并回退到手动搜索。"

#: ../NEWS:41103
msgid ":issue:`32593`: Drop support of FreeBSD 9 and older."
msgstr ":issue:`32593`: 放弃对 FreeBSD 9 及更旧版本的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:41105
msgid ""
":issue:`29708`: If the :envvar:`SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH` environment variable is "
"set, :mod:`py_compile` will always create hash-based ``.pyc`` files."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29708`: 如果设置了 :envvar:`SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH` 环境变量，:mod:`py_compile` "
"将始终创建基于哈希的 ``.pyc`` 文件。"

#: ../NEWS:41111
msgid ""
":issue:`32588`: Create standalone _distutils_findvs module and add missing "
"_queue module to installer."
msgstr ":issue:`32588`: 创建独立的 _distutils_findvs 模块，并将缺失的 _queue 模块添加到安装程序中。"

#: ../NEWS:41114
msgid ""
":issue:`29911`: Ensure separate Modify and Uninstall buttons are displayed."
msgstr ":issue:`29911`: 确保显示单独的修改和卸载按钮。"

#: ../NEWS:41116
msgid ""
":issue:`32507`: Use app-local UCRT install rather than the proper update for"
" old versions of Windows."
msgstr ":issue:`32507`: 对于旧版本的 Windows，使用应用本地的 UCRT 安装，而不是正确的更新。"

#: ../NEWS:41122
msgid ""
":issue:`32726`: Provide an additional, more modern macOS installer variant "
"that supports macOS 10.9+ systems in 64-bit mode only.  Upgrade the supplied"
" third-party libraries to OpenSSL 1.1.0g and to SQLite 3.22.0.  The 10.9+ "
"installer now links with and supplies its own copy of Tcl/Tk 8.6."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32726`: 提供一个额外的、更现代的 macOS 安装程序变体，仅支持 64 位模式下的 macOS 10.9+ "
"系统。将提供的第三方库升级到 OpenSSL 1.1.0g 和 SQLite 3.22.0。10.9+ 安装程序现在链接并提供其自己的 Tcl/Tk "
"8.6 副本。"

#: ../NEWS:41127
msgid ""
":issue:`28440`: No longer add /Library/Python/3.x/site-packages to sys.path "
"for macOS framework builds to avoid future conflicts."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28440`: 不再将 /Library/Python/3.x/site-packages 添加到 macOS 框架构建的 "
"sys.path 中，以避免未来的冲突。"

#: ../NEWS:41133
msgid ""
":issue:`32681`: Fix uninitialized variable 'res' in the C implementation of "
"os.dup2. Patch by Stéphane Wirtel"
msgstr ""
":issue:`32681`: 修复 os.dup2 的 C 实现中未初始化的变量 'res'。补丁由 Stéphane Wirtel 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:41136
msgid ""
":issue:`10381`: Add C API access to the ``datetime.timezone`` constructor "
"and ``datetime.timezone.UTC`` singleton."
msgstr ""
":issue:`10381`: 添加对 ``datetime.timezone`` 构造函数和 ``datetime.timezone.UTC`` "
"单例的 C API 访问。"

#: ../NEWS:41141
msgid "Python 3.7.0 alpha 4"
msgstr "Python 3.7.0 alpha 4"

#: ../NEWS:41143
msgid "*Release date: 2018-01-08*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2018-01-08*"

#: ../NEWS:41148
msgid ""
":issue:`31975`: The default warning filter list now starts with a "
"\"default::DeprecationWarning:__main__\" entry, so deprecation warnings are "
"once again shown by default in single-file scripts and at the interactive "
"prompt."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31975`: 默认的警告过滤器列表现在以 \"default::DeprecationWarning:__main__\" "
"条目开始，因此在单文件脚本和交互式提示符中，弃用警告默认再次显示。"

#: ../NEWS:41153
msgid ""
":issue:`32226`: ``__class_getitem__`` is now an automatic class method."
msgstr ":issue:`32226`: ``__class_getitem__`` 现在是一个自动类方法。"

#: ../NEWS:41155
msgid ""
":issue:`32399`: Add AIX uuid library support for RFC4122 using uuid_create()"
" in libc.a"
msgstr ":issue:`32399`: 使用 libc.a 中的 uuid_create() 为 AIX 添加 RFC4122 uuid 库支持。"

#: ../NEWS:41158
msgid ""
":issue:`32390`: Fix the compilation failure on AIX after the f_fsid field "
"has been added to the object returned by os.statvfs() (:issue:`32143`). "
"Original patch by Michael Felt."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32390`: 修复在 os.statvfs() 返回的对象中添加 f_fsid 字段后在 AIX 上的编译失败问题 "
"(:issue:`32143`)。原始由 Michael Felt 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:41162
msgid ""
":issue:`32379`: Make MRO computation faster when a class inherits from a "
"single base."
msgstr ":issue:`32379`: 当一个类继承自单一基类时，使 MRO 计算更快。"

#: ../NEWS:41165
msgid ""
":issue:`32259`: The error message of a TypeError raised when unpack non-"
"iterable is now more specific."
msgstr ":issue:`32259`: 解包不可迭代对象时引发的 TypeError 错误消息现在更加具体。"

#: ../NEWS:41168 ../NEWS:44791
msgid ""
":issue:`27169`: The ``__debug__`` constant is now optimized out at compile "
"time. This fixes also :issue:`22091`."
msgstr ":issue:`27169`: ``__debug__`` 常量现在在编译时被优化掉。这也修复了 :issue:`22091`。"

#: ../NEWS:41171
msgid ""
":issue:`32329`: The :option:`-R` option now turns on hash randomization when"
" the :envvar:`PYTHONHASHSEED` environment variable is set to ``0``. "
"Previously, the option was ignored. Moreover, "
"``sys.flags.hash_randomization`` is now properly set to 0 when hash "
"randomization is turned off by ``PYTHONHASHSEED=0``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32329`: 当 :envvar:`PYTHONHASHSEED` 环境变量设置为 ``0`` 时，:option:`-R` "
"选项现在会开启哈希随机化。之前，该选项被忽略。此外，当哈希随机化被 ``PYTHONHASHSEED=0`` "
"关闭时，``sys.flags.hash_randomization`` 现在被正确设置为 0。"

#: ../NEWS:41177
msgid ""
":issue:`30416`: The optimizer is now protected from spending much time doing"
" complex calculations and consuming much memory for creating large constants"
" in constant folding. Increased limits for constants that can be produced in"
" constant folding."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30416`: "
"优化器现在受到保护，不会花费大量时间进行复杂计算和在常量折叠中创建大常量时消耗大量内存。增加了在常量折叠中可以产生的常量的限制。"

#: ../NEWS:41182 ../NEWS:44461
msgid ""
":issue:`32282`: Fix an unnecessary ifdef in the include of VersionHelpers.h "
"in socketmodule on Windows."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32282`: 修复 Windows 上 socketmodule 中 VersionHelpers.h 包含的不必要的 ifdef。"

#: ../NEWS:41185
msgid ""
":issue:`30579`: Implement TracebackType.__new__ to allow Python-level "
"creation of traceback objects, and make TracebackType.tb_next mutable."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30579`: 实现 TracebackType.__new__ 以允许在 Python 级别创建回溯对象，并使 "
"TracebackType.tb_next 可变。"

#: ../NEWS:41188
msgid ""
":issue:`32260`: Don't byte swap the input keys to the SipHash algorithm on "
"big-endian platforms. This should ensure siphash gives consistent results "
"across platforms."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32260`: 不要在大端平台上对 SipHash 算法的输入键进行字节交换。这应确保 siphash 在不同平台上给出一致的结果。"

#: ../NEWS:41192
msgid ""
":issue:`31506`: Improve the error message logic for object.__new__ and "
"object.__init__. Patch by Sanyam Khurana."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31506`: 改进 object.__new__ 和 object.__init__ 的错误消息逻辑。由 Sanyam Khurana"
" 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:41195
msgid ""
":issue:`20361`: ``-b`` and ``-bb`` now inject ``'default::BytesWarning'`` "
"and ``error::BytesWarning`` entries into ``sys.warnoptions``, ensuring that "
"they take precedence over any other warning filters configured via the "
"``-W`` option or the ``PYTHONWARNINGS`` environment variable."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20361`: ``-b`` 和 ``-bb`` 现在会在 ``sys.warnoptions`` 中注入 "
"``'default::BytesWarning'`` 和 ``error::BytesWarning`` 条目，确保它们优先于通过 ``-W`` "
"选项或 ``PYTHONWARNINGS`` 环境变量配置的任何其他警告过滤器。"

#: ../NEWS:41200
msgid ""
":issue:`32230`: ``-X dev`` now injects a ``'default'`` entry into "
"sys.warnoptions, ensuring that it behaves identically to actually passing "
"``-Wdefault`` at the command line."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32230`: ``-X dev`` 现在会在 ``sys.warnoptions`` 中注入一个 ``'default'`` "
"条目，确保其行为与在命令行中实际传递 ``-Wdefault`` 相同。"

#: ../NEWS:41204
msgid ""
":issue:`29240`: Add a new UTF-8 mode: implementation of the :pep:`540`."
msgstr ":issue:`29240`: 添加新的 UTF-8 模式：实现了 :pep:`540`。"

#: ../NEWS:41206
msgid ""
":issue:`32226`: :pep:`560`: Add support for ``__mro_entries__`` and "
"``__class_getitem__``. Implemented by Ivan Levkivskyi."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32226`: :pep:`560`: 添加对 ``__mro_entries__`` 和 ``__class_getitem__`` "
"的支持。由 Ivan Levkivskyi 实现。"

#: ../NEWS:41209
msgid ""
":issue:`32225`: :pep:`562`: Add support for module ``__getattr__`` and "
"``__dir__``. Implemented by Ivan Levkivskyi."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32225`: :pep:`562`: 添加对模块 ``__getattr__`` 和 ``__dir__`` 的支持。由 Ivan "
"Levkivskyi 实现。"

#: ../NEWS:41212
msgid ""
":issue:`31901`: The ``atexit`` module now has its callback stored per "
"interpreter."
msgstr ":issue:`31901`: ``atexit`` 模块现在每个解释器都有其回调存储。"

#: ../NEWS:41215
msgid ""
":issue:`31650`: Implement :pep:`552` (Deterministic pycs). Python now "
"supports invalidating bytecode cache files bashed on a source content hash "
"rather than source last-modified time."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31650`: 实现 :pep:`552` (确定性 pycs) 。Python "
"现在支持基于源内容哈希而非源最后修改时间使字节码缓存文件失效。"

#: ../NEWS:41219
msgid ""
":issue:`29469`: Move constant folding from bytecode layer to AST layer. "
"Original patch by Eugene Toder."
msgstr ":issue:`29469`: 将常量折叠从字节码层移动到 AST 层。原始由 Eugene Toder 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:41225
msgid ""
":issue:`32506`: Now that dict is defined as keeping insertion order, drop "
"OrderedDict and just use plain dict."
msgstr ":issue:`32506`: 既然 dict 被定义为保持插入顺序，那么放弃 OrderedDict，直接使用普通 dict。"

#: ../NEWS:41228
msgid ""
":issue:`32279`: Add params to dataclasses.make_dataclasses(): init, repr, "
"eq, order, hash, and frozen.  Pass them through to dataclass()."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32279`: 向 dataclasses.make_dataclasses() "
"添加参数：init、repr、eq、order、hash 和 frozen。将它们传递给 dataclass()。"

#: ../NEWS:41231
msgid ""
":issue:`32278`: Make type information optional on "
"dataclasses.make_dataclass(). If omitted, the string 'typing.Any' is used."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32278`: 使 dataclasses.make_dataclass() 上的类型信息可选。如果省略，则使用字符串 "
"'typing.Any'。"

#: ../NEWS:41234
msgid ""
":issue:`32499`: Add dataclasses.is_dataclass(obj), which returns True if obj"
" is a dataclass or an instance of one."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32499`: 添加 dataclasses.is_dataclass(obj)，如果 obj 是数据类或其实例，则返回 True。"

#: ../NEWS:41237
msgid ""
":issue:`32468`: Improve frame repr() to mention filename, code name and "
"current line number."
msgstr ":issue:`32468`: 改进 frame repr() 以提及文件名、代码名称和当前行号。"

#: ../NEWS:41240
msgid ":issue:`23749`: asyncio: Implement loop.start_tls()"
msgstr ":issue:`23749`: asyncio: 实现 loop.start_tls()"

#: ../NEWS:41242
msgid ""
":issue:`32441`: Return the new file descriptor (i.e., the second argument) "
"from ``os.dup2``. Previously, ``None`` was always returned."
msgstr ":issue:`32441`: 从 ``os.dup2`` 返回新的文件描述符（即第二个参数）。以前总是返回 ``None``。"

#: ../NEWS:41245
msgid ""
":issue:`32422`: ``functools.lru_cache`` uses less memory (3 words for each "
"cached key) and takes about 1/3 time for cyclic GC."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32422`: ``functools.lru_cache`` 使用更少的内存（每个缓存键3个单词）并且循环GC时间大约减少到1/3。"

#: ../NEWS:41248
msgid ""
":issue:`31721`: Prevent Python crash from happening when "
"Future._log_traceback is set to True manually.  Now it can only be set to "
"False, or a ValueError is raised."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31721`: "
"防止当Future._log_traceback被手动设置为True时Python崩溃。现在它只能被设置为False，否则会引发ValueError。"

#: ../NEWS:41252
msgid ":issue:`32415`: asyncio: Add Task.get_loop() and Future.get_loop()"
msgstr ":issue:`32415`: asyncio: 添加Task.get_loop()和Future.get_loop()"

#: ../NEWS:41254 ../NEWS:44909
msgid ""
":issue:`26133`: Don't unsubscribe signals in asyncio UNIX event loop on "
"interpreter shutdown."
msgstr ":issue:`26133`: 在解释器关闭时不要在asyncio UNIX事件循环中取消订阅信号。"

#: ../NEWS:41257
msgid ""
":issue:`32363`: Make asyncio.Task.set_exception() and set_result() raise "
"NotImplementedError. Task._step() and Future.__await__() raise proper "
"exceptions when they are in an invalid state, instead of raising an "
"AssertionError."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32363`: "
"使asyncio.Task.set_exception()和set_result()引发NotImplementedError。Task._step()和Future.__await__()在无效状态时引发适当的异常，而不是AssertionError。"

#: ../NEWS:41262
msgid ""
":issue:`32357`: Optimize asyncio.iscoroutine() and loop.create_task() for "
"non-native coroutines (e.g. async/await compiled with Cython). "
"'loop.create_task(python_coroutine)' used to be 20% faster than "
"'loop.create_task(cython_coroutine)'.  Now, the latter is as fast."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32357`: "
"为非原生协程（如用Cython编译的async/await）优化asyncio.iscoroutine()和loop.create_task()。'loop.create_task(python_coroutine)'过去比'loop.create_task(cython_coroutine)'快20%。现在，后者一样快。"

#: ../NEWS:41267
msgid ""
":issue:`32356`: asyncio.transport.resume_reading() and pause_reading() are "
"now idempotent. New transport.is_reading() method is added."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32356`: "
"asyncio.transport.resume_reading()和pause_reading()现在是幂等的。新增transport.is_reading()方法。"

#: ../NEWS:41270
msgid ":issue:`32355`: Optimize asyncio.gather(); now up to 15% faster."
msgstr ":issue:`32355`: 优化asyncio.gather(); 现在快达15%。"

#: ../NEWS:41272
msgid ":issue:`32351`: Use fastpath in asyncio.sleep if delay<0 (2x boost)"
msgstr ":issue:`32351`: 如果delay<0，在asyncio.sleep中使用fastpath（2倍加速）"

#: ../NEWS:41274
msgid ""
":issue:`32348`: Optimize asyncio.Future schedule/add/remove callback.  The "
"optimization shows 3-6% performance improvements of async/await code."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32348`: 优化asyncio.Future "
"schedule/add/remove回调。该优化显示async/await代码性能提升3-6%。"

#: ../NEWS:41277
msgid ""
":issue:`32331`: Fix socket.settimeout() and socket.setblocking() to keep "
"socket.type as is. Fix socket.socket() constructor to reset any bit flags "
"applied to socket's type.  This change only affects OSes that have "
"SOCK_NONBLOCK and/or SOCK_CLOEXEC."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32331`: "
"修复socket.settimeout()和socket.setblocking()以保持socket.type不变。修复socket.socket()构造函数以重置应用于socket类型的任何位标志。此更改仅影响具有SOCK_NONBLOCK和/或SOCK_CLOEXEC的操作系统。"

#: ../NEWS:41282
msgid ""
":issue:`32248`: Add :class:`!importlib.abc.ResourceReader` as an ABC for "
"loaders to provide a unified API for reading resources contained within "
"packages.  Also add :mod:`importlib.resources` as the port of "
"``importlib_resources``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32248`: 添加 :class:`!importlib.abc.ResourceReader` 作为加载器提供读取包中资源的统一 "
"API 的 ABC。同时添加 :mod:`importlib.resources` 作为 ``importlib_resources`` 的移植版本。"

#: ../NEWS:41287
msgid ":issue:`32311`: Implement asyncio.create_task(coro) shortcut"
msgstr ":issue:`32311`: 实现asyncio.create_task(coro)快捷方式"

#: ../NEWS:41289
msgid ""
":issue:`32327`: Convert asyncio functions that were documented as coroutines"
" to coroutines. Affected functions: loop.sock_sendall, loop.sock_recv, "
"loop.sock_accept, loop.getaddrinfo, loop.getnameinfo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32327`: "
"将文档中标记为协程的asyncio函数转换为协程。受影响的函数包括：loop.sock_sendall、loop.sock_recv、loop.sock_accept、loop.getaddrinfo、loop.getnameinfo。"

#: ../NEWS:41293 ../NEWS:44915
msgid ""
":issue:`32323`: :func:`urllib.parse.urlsplit` does not convert zone-id "
"(scope) to lower case for scoped IPv6 addresses in hostnames now."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32323`: :func:`urllib.parse.urlsplit` "
"现在不会将作用域IPv6地址的主机名中的区域ID（作用域）转换为小写。"

#: ../NEWS:41296 ../NEWS:44918
msgid ""
":issue:`32302`: Fix bdist_wininst of distutils for CRT v142: it binary "
"compatible with CRT v140."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32302`: 修复了distutils的bdist_wininst对于CRT v142的支持：它二进制兼容于CRT v140。"

#: ../NEWS:41299
msgid ""
":issue:`29711`: Fix ``stop_serving`` in asyncio proactor loop kill all "
"listening servers"
msgstr ""
":issue:`29711`: 修复了asyncio proactor循环中的 ``stop_serving`` 会杀死所有监听服务器的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:41302
msgid ""
":issue:`32308`: :func:`re.sub` now replaces empty matches adjacent to a "
"previous non-empty match."
msgstr ":issue:`32308`: :func:`re.sub` 现在会替换与前一个非空匹配相邻的空匹配。"

#: ../NEWS:41305
msgid ""
":issue:`29970`: Abort asyncio SSLProtocol connection if handshake not "
"complete within 10 seconds."
msgstr ":issue:`29970`: 如果握手在10秒内未完成，则中止asyncio SSLProtocol连接。"

#: ../NEWS:41308
msgid ":issue:`32314`: Implement asyncio.run()."
msgstr ":issue:`32314`: 实现了asyncio.run()。"

#: ../NEWS:41310
msgid ""
":issue:`17852`: Revert incorrect fix based on misunderstanding of "
"_Py_PyAtExit() semantics."
msgstr ":issue:`17852`: 基于对_Py_PyAtExit()语义的误解，撤销了不正确的修复。"

#: ../NEWS:41313
msgid ""
":issue:`32296`: Implement asyncio._get_running_loop() and get_event_loop() "
"in C. This makes them 4x faster."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32296`: "
"在C中实现了asyncio._get_running_loop()和get_event_loop()。这使得它们的速度提高了4倍。"

#: ../NEWS:41316
msgid ""
":issue:`32250`: Implement ``asyncio.current_task()`` and "
"``asyncio.all_tasks()``. Add helpers intended to be used by alternative task"
" implementations: ``asyncio._register_task``, ``asyncio._enter_task``, "
"``asyncio._leave_task`` and ``asyncio._unregister_task``. Deprecate "
"``asyncio.Task.current_task()`` and ``asyncio.Task.all_tasks()``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32250`: 实现了 ``asyncio.current_task()`` 和 "
"``asyncio.all_tasks()``。添加了旨在供替代任务实现使用的助手：``asyncio._register_task``、``asyncio._enter_task``、``asyncio._leave_task``和"
" ``asyncio._unregister_task``。弃用了``asyncio.Task.current_task()``和 "
"``asyncio.Task.all_tasks()``。"

#: ../NEWS:41322 ../NEWS:44921
msgid ""
":issue:`32255`: A single empty field is now always quoted when written into "
"a CSV file. This allows to distinguish an empty row from a row consisting of"
" a single empty field. Patch by Licht Takeuchi."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32255`: 现在，当写入CSV文件时，单个空字段总是会被引用。这允许区分空行和由单个空字段组成的行。由Licht "
"Takeuchi提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:41326 ../NEWS:44925
msgid ""
":issue:`32277`: Raise ``NotImplementedError`` instead of ``SystemError`` on "
"platforms where ``chmod(..., follow_symlinks=False)`` is not supported. "
"Patch by Anthony Sottile."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32277`: 在不支持 ``chmod(..., follow_symlinks=False)`` "
"的平台上，引发``NotImplementedError``而不是 ``SystemError``。由Anthony Sottile提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:41330
msgid ""
":issue:`30050`: New argument warn_on_full_buffer to signal.set_wakeup_fd "
"lets you control whether Python prints a warning on stderr when the wakeup "
"fd buffer overflows."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30050`: "
"signal.set_wakeup_fd的新参数warn_on_full_buffer让你控制当唤醒fd缓冲区溢出时Python是否在stderr上打印警告。"

#: ../NEWS:41334
msgid ""
":issue:`29137`: The ``fpectl`` library has been removed. It was never "
"enabled by default, never worked correctly on x86-64, and it changed the "
"Python ABI in ways that caused unexpected breakage of C extensions."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29137`: ``fpectl`` 库已被移除。它从未默认启用，在 x86-64 上从未正确工作，并且它以导致 C "
"扩展意外中断的方式改变了 Python ABI。"

#: ../NEWS:41338
msgid ":issue:`32273`: Move asyncio.test_utils to test.test_asyncio."
msgstr ":issue:`32273`: 将 asyncio.test_utils 移动到 test.test_asyncio。"

#: ../NEWS:41340
msgid ":issue:`32272`: Remove asyncio.async() function."
msgstr ":issue:`32272`: 移除 asyncio.async() 函数。"

#: ../NEWS:41342
msgid ":issue:`32269`: Add asyncio.get_running_loop() function."
msgstr ":issue:`32269`: 添加 asyncio.get_running_loop() 函数。"

#: ../NEWS:41344
msgid ""
":issue:`32265`: All class and static methods of builtin types now are "
"correctly classified by inspect.classify_class_attrs() and grouped in pydoc "
"output. Added types.ClassMethodDescriptorType for unbound class methods of "
"builtin types."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32265`: 内置类型的所有类和静态方法现在被 inspect.classify_class_attrs() 正确分类并在 pydoc"
" 输出中分组。添加了 types.ClassMethodDescriptorType 用于内置类型的未绑定类方法。"

#: ../NEWS:41349
msgid ""
":issue:`32253`: Deprecate ``yield from lock``, ``await lock``, ``with (yield"
" from lock)`` and ``with await lock`` for asyncio synchronization "
"primitives."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32253`: 弃用 ``yield from lock``, ``await lock``, ``with (yield from "
"lock)`` 和 ``with await lock`` 用于 asyncio 同步原语。"

#: ../NEWS:41353
msgid ""
":issue:`22589`: Changed MIME type of .bmp from 'image/x-ms-bmp' to "
"'image/bmp'"
msgstr ":issue:`22589`: 将 .bmp 的 MIME 类型从 'image/x-ms-bmp' 改为 'image/bmp'。"

#: ../NEWS:41355
msgid ""
":issue:`32193`: Convert asyncio to use *async/await* syntax. Old styled "
"``yield from`` is still supported too."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32193`: 将 asyncio 转换为使用 *async/await* 语法。旧式的 ``yield from`` 仍然支持。"

#: ../NEWS:41358
msgid ":issue:`32206`: Add support to run modules with pdb"
msgstr ":issue:`32206`: 添加支持以使用 pdb 运行模块。"

#: ../NEWS:41360
msgid ""
":issue:`32227`: ``functools.singledispatch`` now supports registering "
"implementations using type annotations."
msgstr ":issue:`32227`: ``functools.singledispatch`` 现在支持使用类型注释注册实现。"

#: ../NEWS:41363
msgid ""
":issue:`15873`: Added new alternate constructors "
":meth:`datetime.datetime.fromisoformat`, :meth:`datetime.time.fromisoformat`"
" and :meth:`datetime.date.fromisoformat` as the inverse operation of each "
"classes's respective ``isoformat`` methods."
msgstr ""
":issue:`15873`: 添加了新的替代构造函数 :meth:`datetime.datetime.fromisoformat`, "
":meth:`datetime.time.fromisoformat` 和 :meth:`datetime.date.fromisoformat` "
"作为各自类 ``isoformat`` 方法的逆操作。"

#: ../NEWS:41369 ../NEWS:44929
msgid ""
":issue:`32199`: The getnode() ip getter now uses 'ip link' instead of 'ip "
"link list'."
msgstr ":issue:`32199`: getnode() ip 获取器现在使用 'ip link' 而不是 'ip link list'。"

#: ../NEWS:41372
msgid ":issue:`32143`: os.statvfs() includes the f_fsid field from statvfs(2)"
msgstr ":issue:`32143`: os.statvfs() 包含来自 statvfs(2) 的 f_fsid 字段。"

#: ../NEWS:41374
msgid ""
":issue:`26439`: Fix ctypes.util.find_library() for AIX by implementing "
"ctypes._aix.find_library() Patch by: Michael Felt"
msgstr ""
":issue:`26439`: 通过实现 ctypes._aix.find_library() 修复 "
"ctypes.util.find_library() 在 AIX 上的问题。补丁由：Michael Felt"

#: ../NEWS:41377
msgid ""
":issue:`31993`: The pickler now uses less memory when serializing large "
"bytes and str objects into a file.  Pickles created with protocol 4 will "
"require less memory for unpickling large bytes and str objects."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31993`: 当将大的 bytes 和 str 对象序列化到文件时，pickler 现在使用更少的内存。使用协议 4 创建的 "
"pickle 将需要更少的内存来反序列化大的 bytes 和 str 对象。"

#: ../NEWS:41381 ../NEWS:44932
msgid ""
":issue:`27456`: Ensure TCP_NODELAY is set on Linux. Tests by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ":issue:`27456`: 确保在 Linux 上设置 TCP_NODELAY。测试由 Victor Stinner 完成。"

#: ../NEWS:41383
msgid ""
":issue:`31778`: ast.literal_eval() is now more strict. Addition and "
"subtraction of arbitrary numbers no longer allowed."
msgstr ":issue:`31778`: 现在ast.literal_eval()更加严格。不再允许任意数字的加减法。"

#: ../NEWS:41386 ../NEWS:44943
msgid ""
":issue:`31802`: Importing native path module (``posixpath``, ``ntpath``) now"
" works even if the ``os`` module still is not imported."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31802`: 即使`os`模块尚未导入，导入原生路径模块(``posixpath``, ``ntpath``)现在也能正常工作。"

#: ../NEWS:41389
msgid ""
":issue:`30241`: Add contextlib.AbstractAsyncContextManager. Patch by Jelle "
"Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30241`: 添加contextlib.AbstractAsyncContextManager。由Jelle "
"Zijlstra提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:41392
msgid ""
":issue:`31699`: Fix deadlocks in "
":class:`concurrent.futures.ProcessPoolExecutor` when task arguments or "
"results cause pickling or unpickling errors. This should make sure that "
"calls to the :class:`ProcessPoolExecutor` API always eventually return."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31699`: 修复了当任务参数或结果导致pickling或unpickling错误时 "
":class:`concurrent.futures.ProcessPoolExecutor` 中的死锁问题。这应确保对 "
":class:`ProcessPoolExecutor` API的调用最终总能返回。"

#: ../NEWS:41397
msgid ""
":issue:`15216`: ``TextIOWrapper.reconfigure()`` supports changing "
"*encoding*, *errors*, and *newline*."
msgstr ""
":issue:`15216`: ``TextIOWrapper.reconfigure()`` 支持更改*encoding*, *errors*, "
"和*newline*。"

#: ../NEWS:41403
msgid ""
":issue:`32418`: Add get_loop() method to Server and AbstractServer classes."
msgstr ":issue:`32418`: 向Server和AbstractServer类添加get_loop()方法。"

#: ../NEWS:41408 ../NEWS:44974
msgid ""
":issue:`32252`: Fix faulthandler_suppress_crash_report() used to prevent "
"core dump files when testing crashes. getrlimit() returns zero on success."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32252`: "
"修复用于在测试崩溃时防止核心转储文件的faulthandler_suppress_crash_report()。getrlimit()在成功时返回零。"

#: ../NEWS:41411
msgid ""
":issue:`32002`: Adjust C locale coercion testing for the empty locale and "
"POSIX locale cases to more readily adjust to platform dependent behaviour."
msgstr ":issue:`32002`: 调整C语言环境强制测试，针对空语言环境和POSIX语言环境情况，更容易适应平台依赖行为。"

#: ../NEWS:41417
msgid ""
":issue:`19764`: Implement support for ``subprocess.Popen(close_fds=True)`` "
"on Windows. Patch by Segev Finer."
msgstr ""
":issue:`19764`: 在Windows上实现支持 ``subprocess.Popen(close_fds=True)``。由Segev "
"Finer提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:41423 ../NEWS:45055
msgid ""
":issue:`24960`: 2to3 and lib2to3 can now read pickled grammar files using "
"pkgutil.get_data() rather than probing the filesystem. This lets 2to3 and "
"lib2to3 work when run from a zipfile."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24960`: "
"2to3和lib2to3现在可以使用pkgutil.get_data()读取pickled语法文件，而不是探测文件系统。这使得2to3和lib2to3在从zipfile运行时也能工作。"

#: ../NEWS:41430
msgid ""
":issue:`32030`: Py_Initialize() doesn't reset the memory allocators to "
"default if the ``PYTHONMALLOC`` environment variable is not set."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32030`: 如果未设置 ``PYTHONMALLOC`` 环境变量，Py_Initialize()不会将内存分配器重置为默认值。"

#: ../NEWS:41433 ../NEWS:45065
msgid ""
":issue:`29084`: Undocumented C API for OrderedDict has been excluded from "
"the limited C API. It was added by mistake and actually never worked in the "
"limited C API."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29084`: OrderedDict的未记录C API已从有限C API中排除。它是被错误添加的，实际上在有限C API中从未工作过。"

#: ../NEWS:41437
msgid ""
":issue:`32264`: Moved the pygetopt.h header into internal/, since it has no "
"public APIs."
msgstr ":issue:`32264`: 将pygetopt.h头文件移动到internal/，因为它没有公共API。"

#: ../NEWS:41440
msgid ""
":issue:`32241`: :c:func:`!Py_SetProgramName` and :c:func:`!Py_SetPythonHome`"
" now take the ``const wchar *`` arguments instead of ``wchar *``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32241`: :c:func:`!Py_SetProgramName` 和 :c:func:`!Py_SetPythonHome` "
"现在接受``const wchar *``参数而不是 ``wchar *``。"

#: ../NEWS:41445
msgid "Python 3.7.0 alpha 3"
msgstr "Python 3.7.0 alpha 3"

#: ../NEWS:41447 ../NEWS:45082
msgid "*Release date: 2017-12-05*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2017-12-05*"

#: ../NEWS:41452 ../NEWS:45087
msgid ""
":issue:`32176`: co_flags.CO_NOFREE is now always set correctly by the code "
"object constructor based on freevars and cellvars, rather than needing to be"
" set correctly by the caller. This ensures it will be cleared automatically "
"when additional cell references are injected into a modified code object and"
" function."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32176`: "
"现在，代码对象构造函数会根据freevars和cellvars正确设置co_flags.CO_NOFREE，而不是需要调用者正确设置。这确保了当额外的cell引用被注入到修改后的代码对象和函数中时，它会自动清除。"

#: ../NEWS:41458
msgid ""
":issue:`10544`: Yield expressions are now deprecated in comprehensions and "
"generator expressions. They are still permitted in the definition of the "
"outermost iterable, as that is evaluated directly in the enclosing scope."
msgstr ""
":issue:`10544`: "
"现在在推导式和生成器表达式中不推荐使用yield表达式。它们仍然允许在最外层可迭代对象的定义中使用，因为那是在封闭作用域中直接评估的。"

#: ../NEWS:41462 ../NEWS:44810
msgid ""
":issue:`32137`: The repr of deeply nested dict now raises a RecursionError "
"instead of crashing due to a stack overflow."
msgstr ":issue:`32137`: 现在，深度嵌套字典的repr会引发RecursionError，而不是因为堆栈溢出而崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:41465
msgid ""
":issue:`32096`: Revert memory allocator changes in the C API: move "
"structures back from _PyRuntime to Objects/obmalloc.c. The memory allocators"
" are once again initialized statically, and so PyMem_RawMalloc() and "
"Py_DecodeLocale() can be called before _PyRuntime_Initialize()."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32096`: 在C "
"API中恢复内存分配器的更改：将结构体从_PyRuntime移回Objects/obmalloc.c。内存分配器再次静态初始化，因此PyMem_RawMalloc()和Py_DecodeLocale()可以在_PyRuntime_Initialize()之前调用。"

#: ../NEWS:41470
msgid ""
":issue:`32043`: Add a new \"developer mode\": new \"-X dev\" command line "
"option to enable debug checks at runtime."
msgstr ":issue:`32043`: 添加了一个新的“开发者模式”：新的“-X dev”命令行选项，用于在运行时启用调试检查。"

#: ../NEWS:41473
msgid ""
":issue:`32023`: SyntaxError is now correctly raised when a generator "
"expression without parenthesis is used instead of an inheritance list in a "
"class definition. The duplication of the parentheses can be omitted only on "
"calls."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32023`: "
"现在，当在类定义中使用没有括号的生成器表达式代替继承列表时，会正确引发SyntaxError。只有在调用时可以省略括号的重复。"

#: ../NEWS:41478
msgid ""
":issue:`32012`: SyntaxError is now correctly raised when a generator "
"expression without parenthesis is passed as an argument, but followed by a "
"trailing comma. A generator expression always needs to be directly inside a "
"set of parentheses and cannot have a comma on either side."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32012`: "
"现在，当传递一个没有括号的生成器表达式作为参数，但后面跟着一个尾随逗号时，会正确引发SyntaxError。生成器表达式总是需要直接在一组括号内，并且不能在两边有任何逗号。"

#: ../NEWS:41483
msgid ""
":issue:`28180`: A new internal ``_Py_SetLocaleFromEnv(category)`` helper "
"function has been added in order to improve the consistency of behaviour "
"across different ``libc`` implementations (e.g. Android doesn't support "
"setting the locale from the environment by default)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28180`: 添加了一个新的内部 ``_Py_SetLocaleFromEnv(category)`` "
"辅助函数，以提高不同``libc``实现之间行为的一致性（例如，Android默认不支持从环境设置区域设置）。"

#: ../NEWS:41488 ../NEWS:45093
msgid ""
":issue:`31949`: Fixed several issues in printing tracebacks "
"(PyTraceBack_Print()). Setting sys.tracebacklimit to 0 or less now "
"suppresses printing tracebacks. Setting sys.tracebacklimit to None now "
"causes using the default limit. Setting sys.tracebacklimit to an integer "
"larger than LONG_MAX now means using the limit LONG_MAX rather than the "
"default limit. Fixed integer overflows in the case of more than ``2**31`` "
"traceback items on Windows. Fixed output errors handling."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31949`: "
"修复了打印回溯（PyTraceBack_Print()）中的若干问题。现在将sys.tracebacklimit设置为0或更小会抑制回溯的打印。将sys.tracebacklimit设置为None现在会导致使用默认限制。将sys.tracebacklimit设置为大于LONG_MAX的整数现在意味着使用LONG_MAX限制而不是默认限制。修复了Windows上超过"
" ``2**31`` 个回溯项时的整数溢出问题。修复了输出错误处理。"

#: ../NEWS:41496 ../NEWS:45101
msgid ""
":issue:`30696`: Fix the interactive interpreter looping endlessly when no "
"memory."
msgstr ":issue:`30696`: 修复了在没有内存时交互式解释器无限循环的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:41499 ../NEWS:45104
msgid ""
":issue:`20047`: Bytearray methods partition() and rpartition() now accept "
"only bytes-like objects as separator, as documented.  In particular they now"
" raise TypeError rather of returning a bogus result when an integer is "
"passed as a separator."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20047`: "
"Bytearray方法partition()和rpartition()现在仅接受类似字节的对象作为分隔符，如文档所述。特别是，现在当传递整数作为分隔符时，它们会引发TypeError而不是返回一个虚假的结果。"

#: ../NEWS:41504 ../NEWS:45112
msgid ""
":issue:`21720`: BytesWarning no longer emitted when the *fromlist* argument "
"of ``__import__()`` or the ``__all__`` attribute of the module contain bytes"
" instances."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21720`: 当 ``__import__()`` 的 *fromlist* 参数或模块的 ``__all__`` "
"属性包含bytes实例时，不再发出BytesWarning。"

#: ../NEWS:41508
msgid ""
":issue:`31845`: Environment variables are once more read correctly at "
"interpreter startup."
msgstr ":issue:`31845`: 环境变量在解释器启动时再次被正确读取。"

#: ../NEWS:41511
msgid ""
":issue:`28936`: Ensure that lexically first syntax error involving a "
"parameter and ``global`` or ``nonlocal`` is detected first at a given scope."
" Patch by Ivan Levkivskyi."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28936`: 确保在给定范围内首先检测到涉及参数和 ``global`` 或 ``nonlocal`` "
"的词法上第一个语法错误。由Ivan Levkivskyi提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:41515 ../NEWS:45116
msgid ""
":issue:`31825`: Fixed OverflowError in the 'unicode-escape' codec and in "
"codecs.escape_decode() when decode an escaped non-ascii byte."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31825`: 修复了在解码转义的非ascii字节时'unicode-"
"escape'编解码器和codecs.escape_decode()中的OverflowError。"

#: ../NEWS:41518
msgid ""
":issue:`31618`: The per-frame tracing logic added in 3.7a1 has been altered "
"so that ``frame->f_lineno`` is updated before either ``\"line\"`` or "
"``\"opcode\"`` events are emitted. Previously, opcode events were emitted "
"first, and therefore would occasionally see stale line numbers on the frame."
" The behavior of this feature has changed slightly as a result: when both "
"``f_trace_lines`` and ``f_trace_opcodes`` are enabled, line events now occur"
" first."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31618`: 3.7a1中添加的每帧跟踪逻辑已更改，以便在发出 ``\"line\"`` 或 ``\"opcode\"`` "
"事件之前更新 ``frame->f_lineno``。以前，操作码事件首先发出，因此偶尔会在帧上看到过时的行号。此功能的行为因此略有变化：当同时启用 "
"``f_trace_lines`` 和 ``f_trace_opcodes`` 时，行事件现在首先发生。"

#: ../NEWS:41526 ../NEWS:45119
msgid ""
":issue:`28603`: Print the full context/cause chain of exceptions on "
"interpreter exit, even if an exception in the chain is unhashable or "
"compares equal to later ones. Patch by Zane Bitter."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28603`: 在解释器退出时打印异常的完整上下文/原因链，即使链中的异常不可哈希或与后面的异常相等。由Zane Bitter提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:41530 ../NEWS:45123
msgid ""
":issue:`31786`: Fix timeout rounding in the select module to round correctly"
" negative timeouts between -1.0 and 0.0. The functions now block waiting for"
" events as expected. Previously, the call was incorrectly non-blocking. "
"Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31786`: 修复 select 模块中负超时时间在 -1.0 和 0.0 "
"之间的正确舍入问题。现在函数会按预期阻塞等待事件。此前，调用错误地是非阻塞的。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:41535
msgid ""
":issue:`31781`: Prevent crashes when calling methods of an uninitialized "
"``zipimport.zipimporter`` object. Patch by Oren Milman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31781`: 防止在调用未初始化的 ``zipimport.zipimporter`` 对象方法时崩溃。由 Oren Milman "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:41538
msgid ""
":issue:`30399`: Standard repr() of BaseException with a single argument no "
"longer contains redundant trailing comma."
msgstr ":issue:`30399`: 单一参数的 BaseException 的标准 repr() 不再包含多余的尾随逗号。"

#: ../NEWS:41541 ../NEWS:45131
msgid ""
":issue:`31626`: Fixed a bug in debug memory allocator.  There was a write to"
" freed memory after shrinking a memory block."
msgstr ":issue:`31626`: 修复了调试内存分配器中的一个错误。在缩小内存块后存在对已释放内存的写入。"

#: ../NEWS:41544 ../NEWS:45176
msgid ""
":issue:`30817`: ``PyErr_PrintEx()`` clears now the ignored exception that "
"may be raised by ``_PySys_SetObjectId()``, for example when no memory."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30817`: ``PyErr_PrintEx()`` 现在会清除可能由 ``_PySys_SetObjectId()`` "
"引发的忽略异常，例如在没有内存时。"

#: ../NEWS:41550 ../NEWS:45182
msgid ""
":issue:`28556`: Two minor fixes for ``typing`` module: allow shallow copying"
" instances of generic classes, improve interaction of ``__init_subclass__`` "
"with generics. Original PRs by Ivan Levkivskyi."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28556`: 对 ``typing`` 模块的两项小修复：允许浅复制泛型类的实例，改进 ``__init_subclass__`` "
"与泛型的交互。原始 PR 由 Ivan Levkivskyi 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:41554
msgid ""
":issue:`32214`: PEP 557, Data Classes. Provides a decorator which adds "
"boilerplate methods to classes which use type annotations so specify fields."
msgstr ":issue:`32214`: PEP 557，数据类。提供了一个装饰器，为使用类型注解指定字段的类添加样板方法。"

#: ../NEWS:41558 ../NEWS:45186
msgid ""
":issue:`27240`: The header folding algorithm for the new email policies has "
"been rewritten, which also fixes :issue:`30788`, :issue:`31831`, and "
":issue:`32182`.  In particular, RFC2231 folding is now done correctly."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27240`: 新电子邮件策略的头部折叠算法已被重写，这也修复了 :issue:`30788`、:issue:`31831` 和 "
":issue:`32182`。特别是，现在可以正确进行 RFC2231 折叠。"

#: ../NEWS:41562 ../NEWS:45190
msgid ""
":issue:`32186`: io.FileIO.readall() and io.FileIO.read() now release the GIL"
" when getting the file size. Fixed hang of all threads with inaccessible NFS"
" server. Patch by Nir Soffer."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32186`: io.FileIO.readall() 和 io.FileIO.read() 现在在获取文件大小时释放 "
"GIL。修复了所有线程因无法访问的 NFS 服务器而挂起的问题。由 Nir Soffer 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:41566
msgid ":issue:`32101`: Add :attr:`sys.flags.dev_mode` flag"
msgstr ":issue:`32101`: 添加 :attr:`sys.flags.dev_mode` 标志"

#: ../NEWS:41568
msgid ""
":issue:`32154`: The ``asyncio.windows_utils.socketpair()`` function has been"
" removed: use directly :func:`socket.socketpair` which is available on all "
"platforms since Python 3.5 (before, it wasn't available on Windows). "
"``asyncio.windows_utils.socketpair()`` was just an alias to "
"``socket.socketpair`` on Python 3.5 and newer."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32154`: 已移除 ``asyncio.windows_utils.socketpair()`` 函数：直接使用 "
":func:`socket.socketpair`，该函数自 Python 3.5 起在所有平台上可用（此前在 Windows "
"上不可用）。``asyncio.windows_utils.socketpair()`` 在 Python 3.5 及更新版本上只是 "
"``socket.socketpair`` 的别名。"

#: ../NEWS:41574
msgid ""
":issue:`32089`: warnings: In development (-X dev) and debug mode (pydebug "
"build), use the \"default\" action for ResourceWarning, rather than the "
"\"always\" action, in the default warnings filters."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32089`: 警告：在开发（-X dev）和调试模式（pydebug 构建）中，默认警告过滤器中对 ResourceWarning "
"使用“default”操作，而非“always”操作。"

#: ../NEWS:41578
msgid ""
":issue:`32107`: ``uuid.getnode()`` now preferentially returns universally "
"administered MAC addresses if available, over locally administered MAC "
"addresses.  This makes a better guarantee for global uniqueness of UUIDs "
"returned from ``uuid.uuid1()``.  If only locally administered MAC addresses "
"are available, the first such one found is returned."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32107`: ``uuid.getnode()`` 现在优先返回普遍管理的 MAC 地址（如果可用），而不是本地管理的 MAC "
"地址。这为 ``uuid.uuid1()`` 返回的 UUID 提供了更好的全局唯一性保证。如果只有本地管理的 MAC "
"地址可用，则返回找到的第一个此类地址。"

#: ../NEWS:41584
msgid ""
":issue:`23033`: Wildcard is now supported in hostname when it is one and "
"only character in the left most segment of hostname in second argument of "
":meth:`ssl.match_hostname`.  Patch by Mandeep Singh."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23033`: 在 :meth:`ssl.match_hostname` "
"的第二个参数中，当主机名的最左侧段是且仅是一个字符时，现在支持通配符。由 Mandeep Singh 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:41588 ../NEWS:45194
msgid ""
":issue:`12239`: Make :meth:`!msilib.SummaryInformation.GetProperty` return "
"``None`` when the value of property is ``VT_EMPTY``.  Initial patch by Mark "
"Mc Mahon."
msgstr ""
":issue:`12239`: 当属性的值为 ``VT_EMPTY`` 时，使 "
":meth:`!msilib.SummaryInformation.GetProperty` 返回 ``None``。初始由 Mark Mc Mahon"
" 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:41592
msgid ""
":issue:`28334`: Use :func:`os.path.expanduser` to find the ``~/.netrc`` file"
" in :class:`netrc.netrc`.  If it does not exist, :exc:`FileNotFoundError` is"
" raised.  Patch by Dimitri Merejkowsky."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28334`: 在 :class:`netrc.netrc` 中使用 :func:`os.path.expanduser` 来查找 "
"``~/.netrc`` 文件。如果文件不存在，则抛出 :exc:`FileNotFoundError`。由 Dimitri Merejkowsky "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:41596
msgid ""
":issue:`32121`: Made ``tracemalloc.Traceback`` behave more like the "
"traceback module, sorting the frames from oldest to most recent. "
"``Traceback.format()`` now accepts negative *limit*, truncating the result "
"to the ``abs(limit)`` oldest frames. To get the old behaviour, one can use "
"the new *most_recent_first* argument to ``Traceback.format()``. (Patch by "
"Jesse Bakker.)"
msgstr ""
":issue:`32121`: 使 ``tracemalloc.Traceback`` 的行为更类似于 traceback "
"模块，将帧从最旧到最新排序。``Traceback.format()`` 现在接受负的 *limit* 参数，将结果截断为 ``abs(limit)``"
" 个最旧的帧。要获得旧的行为，可以使用 ``Traceback.format()`` 的新参数 *most_recent_first*。（补丁由 "
"Jesse Bakker 提供。）"

#: ../NEWS:41603 ../NEWS:45198
msgid ""
":issue:`31325`: Fix wrong usage of :func:`collections.namedtuple` in the "
":meth:`RobotFileParser.parse() <urllib.robotparser.RobotFileParser.parse>` "
"method. Initial patch by Robin Wellner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31325`: 修复了 :meth:`RobotFileParser.parse() "
"<urllib.robotparser.RobotFileParser.parse>` 方法中 "
":func:`collections.namedtuple` 的错误用法。初始由 Robin Wellner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:41607 ../NEWS:45202
msgid ""
":issue:`12382`: :func:`!msilib.OpenDatabase` now raises a better exception "
"message when it couldn't open or create an MSI file.  Initial patch by "
"William Tisäter."
msgstr ""
":issue:`12382`: :func:`!msilib.OpenDatabase` 现在在无法打开或创建 MSI 文件时引发更好的异常消息。初始由"
" William Tisäter 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:41611
msgid ""
":issue:`19610`: ``setup()`` now warns about invalid types for some fields. "
"The ``distutils.dist.Distribution`` class now warns when ``classifiers``, "
"``keywords`` and ``platforms`` fields are not specified as a list or a "
"string."
msgstr ""
":issue:`19610`: ``setup()`` 现在会对某些字段的无效类型发出警告。当 ``classifiers``、``keywords``"
" 和 ``platforms`` 字段未指定为列表或字符串时，``distutils.dist.Distribution`` 类现在会发出警告。"

#: ../NEWS:41616
msgid ""
":issue:`32071`: Added the ``-k`` command-line option to ``python -m "
"unittest`` to run only tests that match the given pattern(s)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32071`: 为 ``python -m unittest`` 添加了 ``-k`` 命令行选项，以仅运行与给定模式匹配的测试。"

#: ../NEWS:41619
msgid ""
":issue:`10049`: Added *nullcontext* no-op context manager to contextlib. "
"This provides a simpler and faster alternative to ExitStack() when handling "
"optional context managers."
msgstr ""
":issue:`10049`: 向 contextlib 添加了 *nullcontext* 无操作上下文管理器。这为处理可选上下文管理器时提供了比 "
"ExitStack() 更简单、更快的替代方案。"

#: ../NEWS:41623
msgid ""
":issue:`28684`: The new test.support.skip_unless_bind_unix_socket() "
"decorator is used here to skip asyncio tests that fail because the platform "
"lacks a functional bind() function for unix domain sockets (as it is the "
"case for non root users on the recent Android versions that run now SELinux "
"in enforcing mode)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28684`: 这里使用了新的 test.support.skip_unless_bind_unix_socket() 装饰器来跳过 "
"asyncio 测试，这些测试因为平台缺少对 unix 域套接字的功能性 bind() 函数而失败（如在现在以强制模式运行 SELinux 的较新 "
"Android 版本上的非 root 用户就是这种情况）。"

#: ../NEWS:41629 ../NEWS:45206
msgid ""
":issue:`32110`: ``codecs.StreamReader.read(n)`` now returns not more than "
"*n* characters/bytes for non-negative *n*. This makes it compatible with "
"``read()`` methods of other file-like objects."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32110`: ``codecs.StreamReader.read(n)`` 现在对于非负的 *n*，返回不超过 *n* "
"个字符/字节。这使得它与其他类似文件对象的 ``read()`` 方法兼容。"

#: ../NEWS:41633
msgid ""
":issue:`27535`: The warnings module doesn't leak memory anymore in the "
"hidden warnings registry for the \"ignore\" action of warnings filters. "
"warn_explicit() function doesn't add the warning key to the registry anymore"
" for the \"ignore\" action."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27535`: warnings 模块在警告过滤器的 \"ignore\" "
"操作的隐藏警告注册表中不再泄漏内存。warn_explicit() 函数不再为 \"ignore\" 操作将警告键添加到注册表中。"

#: ../NEWS:41638
msgid ""
":issue:`32088`: warnings:  When Python is build is debug mode "
"(``Py_DEBUG``), :exc:`DeprecationWarning`, :exc:`PendingDeprecationWarning` "
"and :exc:`ImportWarning` warnings are now displayed by default."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32088`: warnings: 当 Python "
"以调试模式构建（``Py_DEBUG``）时，:exc:`DeprecationWarning`、:exc:`PendingDeprecationWarning`"
" 和 :exc:`ImportWarning` 警告现在默认显示。"

#: ../NEWS:41642
msgid ""
":issue:`1647489`: Fixed searching regular expression patterns that could "
"match an empty string. Non-empty string can now be correctly found after "
"matching an empty string."
msgstr ":issue:`1647489`: 修复了可以匹配空字符串的正则表达式模式的搜索。现在可以在匹配空字符串后正确找到非空字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:41646
msgid ""
":issue:`25054`: Added support of splitting on a pattern that could match an "
"empty string."
msgstr ":issue:`25054`: 添加了对可以匹配空字符串的模式进行拆分的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:41649 ../NEWS:45210 ../NEWS:49889
msgid ""
":issue:`32072`: Fixed issues with binary plists: Fixed saving bytearrays. "
"Identical objects will be saved only once. Equal references will be load as "
"identical objects. Added support for saving and loading recursive data "
"structures."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32072`: 修复了二进制 plists 的问题：修复了保存 "
"bytearrays。相同的对象将只保存一次。相等的引用将作为相同的对象加载。添加了对保存和加载递归数据结构的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:41654
msgid ""
":issue:`32069`: Drop legacy SSL transport from asyncio, ssl.MemoryBIO is "
"always used anyway."
msgstr ":issue:`32069`: 从asyncio中移除遗留的SSL传输，反正总是使用ssl.MemoryBIO。"

#: ../NEWS:41657
msgid ""
":issue:`32066`: asyncio: Support pathlib.Path in create_unix_connection; "
"sock arg should be optional"
msgstr ""
":issue:`32066`: asyncio: 在create_unix_connection中支持pathlib.Path；sock参数应为可选的"

#: ../NEWS:41660
msgid ""
":issue:`32046`: Updates 2to3 to convert from operator.isCallable(obj) to "
"callable(obj). Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32046`: 更新2to3，将operator.isCallable(obj)转换为callable(obj)。由Donghee "
"Na提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:41663
msgid ""
":issue:`32018`: inspect.signature should follow :pep:`8`, if the parameter "
"has an annotation and a default value. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32018`: inspect.signature应遵循 :PEP:`8`，如果参数有注解和默认值。由Donghee Na提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:41666
msgid ":issue:`32025`: Add time.thread_time() and time.thread_time_ns()"
msgstr ":issue:`32025`: 添加time.thread_time()和time.thread_time_ns()"

#: ../NEWS:41668
msgid ""
":issue:`32037`: Integers that fit in a signed 32-bit integer will be now "
"pickled with protocol 0 using the INT opcode.  This will decrease the size "
"of a pickle, speed up pickling and unpickling, and make these integers be "
"unpickled as int instances in Python 2."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32037`: "
"适应有符号32位整数的整数现在将使用协议0的INT操作码进行pickle。这将减少pickle的大小，加快pickle和unpickle的速度，并使这些整数在Python"
" 2中作为int实例被unpickle。"

#: ../NEWS:41673 ../NEWS:45215
msgid ""
":issue:`32034`: Make asyncio.IncompleteReadError and LimitOverrunError "
"pickleable."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32034`: 使asyncio.IncompleteReadError和LimitOverrunError可pickle。"

#: ../NEWS:41676 ../NEWS:45218
msgid ""
":issue:`32015`: Fixed the looping of asyncio in the case of reconnection the"
" socket during waiting async read/write from/to the socket."
msgstr ":issue:`32015`: 修复了在等待异步读写套接字期间重新连接套接字时asyncio的循环问题。"

#: ../NEWS:41679 ../NEWS:45221
msgid ""
":issue:`32011`: Restored support of loading marshal files with the "
"TYPE_INT64 code. These files can be produced in Python 2.7."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32011`: 恢复了对加载带有TYPE_INT64代码的marshal文件的支持。这些文件可以在Python 2.7中生成。"

#: ../NEWS:41682
msgid ""
":issue:`28369`: Enhance add_reader/writer check that socket is not used by "
"some transport. Before, only cases when add_reader/writer were called with "
"an int FD were supported.  Now the check is implemented correctly for all "
"file-like objects."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28369`: 增强add_reader/writer检查，确保套接字未被某些传输使用。之前，仅支持使用int "
"FD调用add_reader/writer的情况。现在，对所有类文件对象都正确实现了检查。"

#: ../NEWS:41687
msgid ""
":issue:`31976`: Fix race condition when flushing a file is slow, which can "
"cause a segfault if closing the file from another thread."
msgstr ":issue:`31976`: 修复了当文件刷新缓慢时可能导致的竞态条件，如果从另一个线程关闭文件可能会导致段错误。"

#: ../NEWS:41690
msgid ""
":issue:`31985`: Formally deprecated aifc.openfp, sunau.openfp, and "
"wave.openfp. Since change 7bc817d5ba917528e8bd07ec461c635291e7b06a in 1993, "
"openfp in each of the three modules had been pointing to that module's open "
"function as a matter of backwards compatibility, though it had been both "
"untested and undocumented."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31985`: "
"正式弃用aifc.openfp、sunau.openfp和wave.openfp。自1993年的变更7bc817d5ba917528e8bd07ec461c635291e7b06a以来，这三个模块中的openfp作为向后兼容性问题，一直指向该模块的open函数，尽管它既未经测试也无文档记录。"

#: ../NEWS:41696
msgid ""
":issue:`21862`: cProfile command line now accepts ``-m module_name`` as an "
"alternative to script path. Patch by Sanyam Khurana."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21862`: cProfile命令行现在接受 ``-m module_name`` 作为脚本路径的替代方案。由Sanyam "
"Khurana提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:41699 ../NEWS:45224
msgid ":issue:`31970`: Reduce performance overhead of asyncio debug mode."
msgstr ":issue:`31970`: 降低asyncio调试模式的性能开销。"

#: ../NEWS:41701
msgid ""
":issue:`31843`: *database* argument of sqlite3.connect() now accepts a "
":term:`path-like object`, instead of just a string."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31843`: sqlite3.connect()的 *database* 参数现在接受一个 :term:`path-like "
"object`，而不仅仅是一个字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:41704
msgid ""
":issue:`31945`: Add Configurable *blocksize* to ``HTTPConnection`` and "
"``HTTPSConnection`` for improved upload throughput.  Patch by Nir Soffer."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31945`: 为 ``HTTPConnection`` 和 ``HTTPSConnection`` 添加可配置的 "
"*blocksize* 以提高上传吞吐量。由Nir Soffer提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:41707
msgid ""
":issue:`31943`: Add a ``cancelled()`` method to :class:`asyncio.Handle`.  "
"Patch by Marat Sharafutdinov."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31943`: 向 :class:`asyncio.Handle` 添加一个 ``cancelled()`` 方法。由Marat "
"Sharafutdinov提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:41710 ../NEWS:45226
msgid ""
":issue:`9678`: Fixed determining the MAC address in the uuid module: Using "
"ifconfig on NetBSD and OpenBSD. Using arp on Linux, FreeBSD, NetBSD and "
"OpenBSD. Based on patch by Takayuki Shimizukawa."
msgstr ""
":issue:`9678`: "
"修复了uuid模块中确定MAC地址的问题：在NetBSD和OpenBSD上使用ifconfig。在Linux、FreeBSD、NetBSD和OpenBSD上使用arp。基于Takayuki"
" Shimizukawa的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:41714 ../NEWS:45230
msgid ":issue:`30057`: Fix potential missed signal in signal.signal()."
msgstr ":issue:`30057`: 修复了signal.signal()中潜在的信号丢失问题。"

#: ../NEWS:41716 ../NEWS:45232
msgid ""
":issue:`31933`: Fix Blake2 params leaf_size and node_offset on big endian "
"platforms. Patch by Jack O'Connor."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31933`: 修复Blake2参数leaf_size和node_offset在大端平台上的问题。由Jack O'Connor提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:41719
msgid ""
":issue:`21423`: Add an initializer argument to {Process,Thread}PoolExecutor"
msgstr ":issue:`21423`: 向{Process,Thread}PoolExecutor添加一个初始化参数。"

#: ../NEWS:41721 ../NEWS:45235
msgid ""
":issue:`31927`: Fixed compilation of the socket module on NetBSD 8.  Fixed "
"assertion failure or reading arbitrary data when parse a AF_BLUETOOTH "
"address on NetBSD and DragonFly BSD."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31927`: 修复了socket模块在NetBSD 8上的编译问题。修复了在NetBSD和DragonFly "
"BSD上解析AF_BLUETOOTH地址时的断言失败或读取任意数据的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:41725 ../NEWS:45239
msgid ""
":issue:`27666`: Fixed stack corruption in curses.box() and "
"curses.ungetmouse() when the size of types chtype or mmask_t is less than "
"the size of C long. curses.box() now accepts characters as arguments.  Based"
" on patch by Steve Fink."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27666`: 修复了当类型chtype或mmask_t的大小小于C "
"long的大小时，curses.box()和curses.ungetmouse()中的堆栈损坏问题。curses.box()现在接受字符作为参数。基于Steve"
" Fink的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:41730
msgid ""
":issue:`31917`: Add 3 new clock identifiers: :const:`time.CLOCK_BOOTTIME`, "
":const:`time.CLOCK_PROF` and :const:`time.CLOCK_UPTIME`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31917`: "
"添加3个新的时钟标识符：:const:`time.CLOCK_BOOTTIME`、:const:`time.CLOCK_PROF` 和 "
":const:`time.CLOCK_UPTIME`。"

#: ../NEWS:41733 ../NEWS:45244
msgid ""
":issue:`31897`: plistlib now catches more errors when read binary plists and"
" raises InvalidFileException instead of unexpected exceptions."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31897`: "
"plistlib现在在读取二进制plist时会捕获更多错误，并抛出InvalidFileException而不是意外的异常。"

#: ../NEWS:41736 ../NEWS:45247
msgid ""
":issue:`25720`: Fix the method for checking pad state of curses WINDOW. "
"Patch by Masayuki Yamamoto."
msgstr ":issue:`25720`: 修复了检查curses WINDOW填充状态的方法。由Masayuki Yamamoto提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:41739 ../NEWS:45250
msgid ""
":issue:`31893`: Fixed the layout of the kqueue_event structure on OpenBSD "
"and NetBSD. Fixed the comparison of the kqueue_event objects."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31893`: 修复了OpenBSD和NetBSD上kqueue_event结构的布局。修复了kqueue_event对象的比较。"

#: ../NEWS:41742 ../NEWS:45253
msgid ":issue:`31891`: Fixed building the curses module on NetBSD."
msgstr ":issue:`31891`: 修复了在NetBSD上构建curses模块的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:41744
msgid ""
":issue:`31884`: added required constants to subprocess module for setting "
"priority on windows"
msgstr ":issue:`31884`: 向subprocess模块添加了在Windows上设置优先级所需的常量。"

#: ../NEWS:41747
msgid ""
":issue:`28281`: Remove year (1-9999) limits on the Calendar.weekday() "
"function. Patch by Mark Gollahon."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28281`: 移除了Calendar.weekday()函数对年份(1-9999)的限制。由Mark Gollahon提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:41750
msgid ""
":issue:`31702`: crypt.mksalt() now allows to specify the number of rounds "
"for SHA-256 and SHA-512 hashing."
msgstr ":issue:`31702`: crypt.mksalt() 现在允许指定 SHA-256 和 SHA-512 哈希的轮数。"

#: ../NEWS:41753
msgid ""
":issue:`30639`: :func:`inspect.getfile` no longer computes the repr of "
"unknown objects to display in an error message, to protect against badly "
"behaved custom reprs."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30639`: :func:`inspect.getfile` 不再计算未知对象的 repr 以显示在错误消息中，以防止不良行为的自定义"
" repr。"

#: ../NEWS:41757
msgid ""
":issue:`30768`: Fix the pthread+semaphore implementation of "
"PyThread_acquire_lock_timed() when called with timeout > 0 and intr_flag=0: "
"recompute the timeout if sem_timedwait() is interrupted by a signal (EINTR)."
" See also the :pep:`475`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30768`: 修复了当 timeout > 0 和 intr_flag=0 时 "
"PyThread_acquire_lock_timed() 的 pthread+semaphore 实现：如果 sem_timedwait() "
"被信号（EINTR）中断，则重新计算超时。另见 :pep:`475`。"

#: ../NEWS:41762
msgid ":issue:`31854`: Add ``mmap.ACCESS_DEFAULT`` constant."
msgstr ":issue:`31854`: 添加 ``mmap.ACCESS_DEFAULT`` 常量。"

#: ../NEWS:41764
msgid ""
":issue:`31834`: Use optimized code for BLAKE2 only with SSSE3+. The pure "
"SSE2 implementation is slower than the pure C reference implementation."
msgstr ":issue:`31834`: 仅在 SSSE3+ 上使用优化的 BLAKE2 代码。纯 SSE2 实现比纯 C 参考实现慢。"

#: ../NEWS:41767
msgid ""
":issue:`28292`: Calendar.itermonthdates() will now consistently raise an "
"exception when a date falls outside of the 0001-01-01 through 9999-12-31 "
"range.  To support applications that cannot tolerate such exceptions, the "
"new methods itermonthdays3() and itermonthdays4() are added.  The new "
"methods return tuples and are not restricted by the range supported by "
"datetime.date."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28292`: 当日期超出 0001-01-01 到 9999-12-31 范围时，Calendar.itermonthdates() "
"将始终引发异常。为了支持不能容忍此类异常的应用程序，添加了新方法 itermonthdays3() 和 "
"itermonthdays4()。新方法返回元组，不受 datetime.date 支持的范围限制。"

#: ../NEWS:41774
msgid ""
":issue:`28564`: The shutil.rmtree() function has been sped up to 20--40%. "
"This was done using the os.scandir() function."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28564`: shutil.rmtree() 函数的速度提高了 20--40%。这是通过使用 os.scandir() 函数实现的。"

#: ../NEWS:41777 ../NEWS:45255
msgid ""
":issue:`28416`: Instances of pickle.Pickler subclass with the "
"persistent_id() method and pickle.Unpickler subclass with the "
"persistent_load() method no longer create reference cycles."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28416`: 具有 persistent_id() 方法的 pickle.Pickler 子类和具有 "
"persistent_load() 方法的 pickle.Unpickler 子类的实例不再创建引用循环。"

#: ../NEWS:41781
msgid ""
":issue:`31653`: Don't release the GIL if we can acquire a multiprocessing "
"semaphore immediately."
msgstr ":issue:`31653`: 如果可以立即获取多处理信号量，则不释放 GIL。"

#: ../NEWS:41784 ../NEWS:45259
msgid ""
":issue:`28326`: Fix multiprocessing.Process when stdout and/or stderr is "
"closed or None."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28326`: 修复当 stdout 和/或 stderr 关闭或为 None 时的 multiprocessing.Process。"

#: ../NEWS:41787
msgid ""
":issue:`20825`: Add ``subnet_of`` and ``superset_of`` containment tests to "
":class:`ipaddress.IPv6Network` and :class:`ipaddress.IPv4Network`. Patch by "
"Michel Albert and Cheryl Sabella."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20825`: 向 :class:`ipaddress.IPv6Network` 和 "
":class:`ipaddress.IPv4Network` 添加 ``subnet_of`` 和 ``superset_of`` 包含测试。由 "
"Michel Albert 和 Cheryl Sabella 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:41791
msgid ""
":issue:`31827`: Remove the os.stat_float_times() function. It was introduced"
" in Python 2.3 for backward compatibility with Python 2.2, and was "
"deprecated since Python 3.1."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31827`: 移除 os.stat_float_times() 函数。该函数在 Python 2.3 中引入，用于向后兼容 "
"Python 2.2，并从 Python 3.1 开始弃用。"

#: ../NEWS:41795
msgid ""
":issue:`31756`: Add a ``subprocess.Popen(text=False)`` keyword argument to "
"``subprocess`` functions to be more explicit about when the library should "
"attempt to decode outputs into text. Patch by Andrew Clegg."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31756`: 向 ``subprocess`` 函数添加一个 ``subprocess.Popen(text=False)`` "
"关键字参数，以更明确地指示库何时应尝试将输出解码为文本。由 Andrew Clegg 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:41799
msgid ":issue:`31819`: Add AbstractEventLoop.sock_recv_into()."
msgstr ":issue:`31819`: 添加 AbstractEventLoop.sock_recv_into()。"

#: ../NEWS:41801 ../NEWS:44581 ../NEWS:45262
msgid ""
":issue:`31457`: If nested log adapters are used, the inner ``process()`` "
"methods are no longer omitted."
msgstr ":issue:`31457`: 如果使用嵌套的日志适配器，内部 ``process()`` 方法不再被省略。"

#: ../NEWS:41804 ../NEWS:45265
msgid ""
":issue:`31457`: The ``manager`` property on LoggerAdapter objects is now "
"properly settable."
msgstr ":issue:`31457`: LoggerAdapter 对象的 ``manager`` 属性现在可以正确设置了。"

#: ../NEWS:41807 ../NEWS:45268
msgid ""
":issue:`31806`: Fix timeout rounding in time.sleep(), "
"threading.Lock.acquire() and socket.socket.settimeout() to round correctly "
"negative timeouts between -1.0 and 0.0. The functions now block waiting for "
"events as expected. Previously, the call was incorrectly non-blocking. Patch"
" by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31806`: 修复 time.sleep(), threading.Lock.acquire() 和 "
"socket.socket.settimeout() 中的超时舍入，以正确舍入 -1.0 和 0.0 "
"之间的负超时。这些函数现在会按预期阻塞等待事件。之前，调用错误地是非阻塞的。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:41813
msgid ""
":issue:`31803`: time.clock() and time.get_clock_info('clock') now emit a "
"DeprecationWarning warning."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31803`: time.clock() 和 time.get_clock_info('clock') 现在会发出 "
"DeprecationWarning 警告。"

#: ../NEWS:41816
msgid ""
":issue:`31800`: Extended support for parsing UTC offsets. strptime '%z' can "
"now parse the output generated by datetime.isoformat, including seconds and "
"microseconds."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31800`: 扩展了对解析 UTC 偏移的支持。strptime '%z' 现在可以解析由 datetime.isoformat "
"生成的输出，包括秒和微秒。"

#: ../NEWS:41820 ../NEWS:45274
msgid ""
":issue:`28603`: traceback: Fix a TypeError that occurred during printing of "
"exception tracebacks when either the current exception or an exception in "
"its context/cause chain is unhashable. Patch by Zane Bitter."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28603`: traceback: 修复了在打印异常回溯时，当当前异常或其上下文/原因链中的异常不可哈希时发生的 "
"TypeError。由 Zane Bitter 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:41824
msgid ""
":issue:`30541`: Add new function to seal a mock and prevent the "
"automatically creation of child mocks. Patch by Mario Corchero."
msgstr ":issue:`30541`: 添加新功能以密封模拟对象并防止自动创建子模拟对象。由 Mario Corchero 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:41827
msgid ""
":issue:`31784`: Implement the :pep:`564`, add new 6 new functions with "
"nanosecond resolution to the :mod:`time` module: "
":func:`~time.clock_gettime_ns`, :func:`~time.clock_settime_ns`, "
":func:`~time.monotonic_ns`, :func:`~time.perf_counter_ns`, "
":func:`~time.process_time_ns`, :func:`~time.time_ns`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31784`: 实现 :pep:`564`，向 :mod:`time` 模块添加 6 "
"个具有纳秒分辨率的新函数：:func:`~time.clock_gettime_ns`, :func:`~time.clock_settime_ns`,"
" :func:`~time.monotonic_ns`, :func:`~time.perf_counter_ns`, "
":func:`~time.process_time_ns`, :func:`~time.time_ns`。"

#: ../NEWS:41833
msgid ""
":issue:`30143`: 2to3 now generates a code that uses abstract collection "
"classes from collections.abc rather than collections."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30143`: 2to3 现在生成的代码使用 collections.abc 中的抽象集合类而不是 collections。"

#: ../NEWS:41836 ../NEWS:45280
msgid ""
":issue:`31770`: Prevent a crash when calling the ``__init__()`` method of a "
"``sqlite3.Cursor`` object more than once. Patch by Oren Milman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31770`: 防止多次调用 ``sqlite3.Cursor`` 对象的 ``__init__()`` 方法时崩溃。由 Oren "
"Milman 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:41839 ../NEWS:45287
msgid ""
":issue:`31764`: Prevent a crash in ``sqlite3.Cursor.close()`` in case the "
"``Cursor`` object is uninitialized. Patch by Oren Milman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31764`: 防止在 `sqlite3.Cursor.close()` 中当 `Cursor` 对象未初始化时发生崩溃。补丁由 "
"Oren Milman 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:41842 ../NEWS:45290
msgid ""
":issue:`31752`: Fix possible crash in timedelta constructor called with "
"custom integers."
msgstr ":issue:`31752`: 修复在调用自定义整数的 timedelta 构造函数时可能发生的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:41845 ../NEWS:45299
msgid ""
":issue:`31620`: an empty asyncio.Queue now doesn't leak memory when "
"queue.get pollers timeout"
msgstr ":issue:`31620`: 空的 asyncio.Queue 现在在队列获取轮询超时时不会泄漏内存。"

#: ../NEWS:41848
msgid ""
":issue:`31690`: Allow the flags re.ASCII, re.LOCALE, and re.UNICODE to be "
"used as group flags for regular expressions."
msgstr ":issue:`31690`: 允许将 re.ASCII、re.LOCALE 和 re.UNICODE 标志用作正则表达式的组标志。"

#: ../NEWS:41851
msgid ""
":issue:`30349`: FutureWarning is now emitted if a regular expression "
"contains character set constructs that will change semantically in the "
"future (nested sets and set operations)."
msgstr ":issue:`30349`: 如果正则表达式包含将来会语义变化的字符集构造（嵌套集和集操作），现在会发出 FutureWarning。"

#: ../NEWS:41855
msgid ""
":issue:`31664`: Added support for the Blowfish hashing in the crypt module."
msgstr ":issue:`31664`: 在 crypt 模块中添加了对 Blowfish 哈希的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:41857 ../NEWS:45302
msgid ""
":issue:`31632`: Fix method set_protocol() of class _SSLProtocolTransport in "
"asyncio module. This method was previously modifying a wrong reference to "
"the protocol."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31632`: 修复 asyncio 模块中 _SSLProtocolTransport 类的 set_protocol() "
"方法。此方法之前修改了错误的协议引用。"

#: ../NEWS:41861 ../NEWS:45313
msgid ""
":issue:`15037`: Added a workaround for getkey() in curses for ncurses 5.7 "
"and earlier."
msgstr ":issue:`15037`: 为 ncurses 5.7 及更早版本的 curses 中的 getkey() 添加了一个变通方案。"

#: ../NEWS:41864
msgid ""
":issue:`31307`: Allow use of bytes objects for arguments to "
":meth:`configparser.ConfigParser.read`. Patch by Vincent Michel."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31307`: 允许使用字节对象作为 :meth:`configparser.ConfigParser.read` 的参数。补丁由 "
"Vincent Michel 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:41867 ../NEWS:45333
msgid ""
":issue:`31334`: Fix ``poll.poll([timeout])`` in the ``select`` module for "
"arbitrary negative timeouts on all OSes where it can only be a non-negative "
"integer or -1. Patch by Riccardo Coccioli."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31334`: 修复 `select` 模块中的 "
"`poll.poll([timeout])`，在所有操作系统上对于任意的负超时值，现在可以仅接受非负整数或 -1。由 Riccardo Coccioli"
" 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:41871 ../NEWS:45337
msgid ""
":issue:`31310`: multiprocessing's semaphore tracker should be launched again"
" if crashed."
msgstr ":issue:`31310`: 如果崩溃，multiprocessing 的信号量跟踪器应该重新启动。"

#: ../NEWS:41874 ../NEWS:45340
msgid ""
":issue:`31308`: Make multiprocessing's forkserver process immune to Ctrl-C "
"and other user interruptions. If it crashes, restart it when necessary."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31308`: 使 multiprocessing 的 forkserver 进程免受 Ctrl-C "
"和其他用户中断的影响。如果崩溃，必要时重启它。"

#: ../NEWS:41877
msgid ""
":issue:`31245`: Added support for AF_UNIX socket in asyncio "
"``create_datagram_endpoint``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31245`: 在 asyncio 的 `create_datagram_endpoint` 中添加了对 AF_UNIX 套接字的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:41880
msgid ""
":issue:`30553`: Add HTTP/2 status code 421 (Misdirected Request) to "
":class:`http.HTTPStatus`. Patch by Vitor Pereira."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30553`: 将 HTTP/2 状态码 421（Misdirected Request）添加到 "
":class:`http.HTTPStatus`。由 Vitor Pereira 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:41886 ../NEWS:45346
msgid ""
":issue:`32105`: Added asyncio.BaseEventLoop.connect_accepted_socket "
"versionadded marker."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32105`: 添加了 asyncio.BaseEventLoop.connect_accepted_socket 的 "
"versionadded 标记。"

#: ../NEWS:41892 ../NEWS:45359
msgid ""
":issue:`31380`: Skip test_httpservers test_undecodable_file on macOS: fails "
"on APFS."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31380`: 在 macOS 上跳过 test_httpservers 的 test_undecodable_file 测试：在 "
"APFS 上失败。"

#: ../NEWS:41895 ../NEWS:45362
msgid ""
":issue:`31705`: Skip test_socket.test_sha256() on Linux kernel older than "
"4.5. The test fails with ENOKEY on kernel 3.10 (on ppc64le). A fix was "
"merged into the kernel 4.5."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31705`: "
"在早于4.5版本的Linux内核上跳过test_socket.test_sha256()测试。该测试在内核3.10（ppc64le架构）上会因ENOKEY而失败。此问题已在4.5内核中修复。"

#: ../NEWS:41899
msgid ""
":issue:`32138`: Skip on Android test_faulthandler tests that raise SIGSEGV "
"and remove the test.support.requires_android_level decorator."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32138`: "
"在Android上跳过引发SIGSEGV的test_faulthandler测试，并移除test.support.requires_android_level装饰器。"

#: ../NEWS:41902
msgid ""
":issue:`32136`: The runtime embedding tests have been split out from "
"``Lib/test/test_capi.py`` into a new ``Lib/test/test_embed.py`` file."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32136`: 运行时嵌入测试已从 ``Lib/test/test_capi.py`` "
"分离出来，移至新文件``Lib/test/test_embed.py``。"

#: ../NEWS:41905
msgid ""
":issue:`28668`: test.support.requires_multiprocessing_queue is removed. Skip"
" tests with test.support.import_module('multiprocessing.synchronize') "
"instead when the semaphore implementation is broken or missing."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28668`: "
"移除了test.support.requires_multiprocessing_queue。当信号量实现损坏或缺失时，改用test.support.import_module('multiprocessing.synchronize')跳过测试。"

#: ../NEWS:41909
msgid ""
":issue:`32126`: Skip test_get_event_loop_new_process in "
"test.test_asyncio.test_events when sem_open() is not functional."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32126`: "
"当sem_open()功能不正常时，跳过test.test_asyncio.test_events中的test_get_event_loop_new_process测试。"

#: ../NEWS:41912 ../NEWS:45366
msgid ""
":issue:`31174`: Fix test_tools.test_unparse: DirectoryTestCase now stores "
"the names sample to always test the same files. It prevents false alarms "
"when hunting reference leaks."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31174`: "
"修复test_tools.test_unparse：DirectoryTestCase现在存储样本名称以始终测试相同的文件。这避免了在查找引用泄漏时产生误报。"

#: ../NEWS:41919
msgid ""
":issue:`28538`: Revert the previous changes, the if_nameindex structure is "
"defined by Unified Headers."
msgstr ":issue:`28538`: 撤销之前的更改，if_nameindex结构由统一头文件定义。"

#: ../NEWS:41922
msgid ""
":issue:`28762`: Revert the last commit, the F_LOCK macro is defined by "
"Android Unified Headers."
msgstr ":issue:`28762`: 撤销最后一次提交，F_LOCK宏由Android统一头文件定义。"

#: ../NEWS:41925
msgid ""
":issue:`29040`: Support building Android with Unified Headers. The first NDK"
" release to support Unified Headers is android-ndk-r14."
msgstr ":issue:`29040`: 支持使用统一头文件构建Android。首个支持统一头文件的NDK版本是android-ndk-r14。"

#: ../NEWS:41928 ../NEWS:45376
msgid ""
":issue:`32059`: ``detect_modules()`` in ``setup.py`` now also searches the "
"sysroot paths when cross-compiling."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32059`: ``setup.py`` 中的 ``detect_modules()`` 现在在交叉编译时也会搜索sysroot路径。"

#: ../NEWS:41931 ../NEWS:45379
msgid ""
":issue:`31957`: Fixes Windows SDK version detection when building for "
"Windows."
msgstr ":issue:`31957`: 修复为Windows构建时的Windows SDK版本检测。"

#: ../NEWS:41933 ../NEWS:45381
msgid ":issue:`31609`: Fixes quotes in PCbuild/clean.bat"
msgstr ":issue:`31609`: 修复PCbuild/clean.bat中的引号问题。"

#: ../NEWS:41935 ../NEWS:45383
msgid ""
":issue:`31934`: Abort the build when building out of a not clean source "
"tree."
msgstr ":issue:`31934`: 当构建源树不干净时中止构建。"

#: ../NEWS:41937 ../NEWS:45385
msgid ""
":issue:`31926`: Fixed Argument Clinic sometimes causing compilation errors "
"when there was more than one function and/or method in a .c file with the "
"same name."
msgstr ":issue:`31926`: 修复了当.c文件中有多个同名函数和/或方法时，Argument Clinic有时会导致编译错误的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:41941 ../NEWS:45389
msgid ":issue:`28791`: Update Windows builds to use SQLite 3.21.0."
msgstr ":issue:`28791`: 更新Windows构建以使用SQLite 3.21.0。"

#: ../NEWS:41943 ../NEWS:45391
msgid ":issue:`28791`: Update OS X installer to use SQLite 3.21.0."
msgstr ":issue:`28791`: 更新OS X安装程序以使用SQLite 3.21.0。"

#: ../NEWS:41945
msgid ":issue:`28643`: Record profile-opt build progress with stamp files."
msgstr ":issue:`28643`: 使用stamp文件记录profile-opt构建进度。"

#: ../NEWS:41947
msgid ":issue:`31866`: Finish removing support for AtheOS."
msgstr ":issue:`31866`: 完成移除对AtheOS的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:41952 ../NEWS:45401
msgid ""
":issue:`1102`: Return ``None`` when ``View.Fetch()`` returns "
"``ERROR_NO_MORE_ITEMS`` instead of raising ``MSIError``. Initial patch by "
"Anthony Tuininga."
msgstr ""
":issue:`1102`: 当 ``View.Fetch()`` 返回 ``ERROR_NO_MORE_ITEMS`` 时返回 "
"``None``，而不是引发``MSIError``。初始由Anthony Tuininga提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:41956 ../NEWS:45405
msgid ":issue:`31944`: Fixes Modify button in Apps and Features dialog."
msgstr ":issue:`31944`: 修复应用和功能对话框中的修改按钮。"

#: ../NEWS:41958
msgid ""
":issue:`20486`: Implement the ``Database.Close()`` method to help closing "
"MSI database objects."
msgstr ":issue:`20486`: 实现 ``Database.Close()`` 方法以帮助关闭MSI数据库对象。"

#: ../NEWS:41961
msgid ""
":issue:`31857`: Make the behavior of USE_STACKCHECK deterministic in a "
"multi-threaded environment."
msgstr ":issue:`31857`: 在多线程环境中使USE_STACKCHECK的行为变得确定。"

#: ../NEWS:41967 ../NEWS:45410
msgid ":issue:`31392`: Update macOS installer to use OpenSSL 1.0.2m"
msgstr ":issue:`31392`: 更新macOS安装程序以使用OpenSSL 1.0.2m。"

#: ../NEWS:41972 ../NEWS:45415
msgid ""
":issue:`32207`: Improve tk event exception tracebacks in IDLE. When tk event"
" handling is driven by IDLE's run loop, a confusing and distracting "
"queue.EMPTY traceback context is no longer added to tk event exception "
"tracebacks.  The traceback is now the same as when event handling is driven "
"by user code.  Patch based on a suggestion by Serhiy Storchaka."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32207`: "
"在IDLE中改进tk事件异常回溯。当tk事件处理由IDLE的运行循环驱动时，不再向tk事件异常回溯中添加令人困惑和分散注意力的queue.EMPTY回溯上下文。现在，回溯与事件处理由用户代码驱动时相同。基于Serhiy"
" Storchaka的建议的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:41978 ../NEWS:45421
msgid ""
":issue:`32164`: Delete unused file idlelib/tabbedpages.py. Use of "
"TabbedPageSet in configdialog was replaced by ttk.Notebook."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32164`: "
"删除未使用的文件idlelib/tabbedpages.py。在configdialog中使用TabbedPageSet已被ttk.Notebook替代。"

#: ../NEWS:41981 ../NEWS:45424
msgid ""
":issue:`32100`: IDLE: Fix old and new bugs in pathbrowser; improve tests. "
"Patch mostly by Cheryl Sabella."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32100`: IDLE: 修复pathbrowser中的旧错误和新错误；改进测试。补丁主要由Cheryl Sabella提供。"

#: ../NEWS:41984 ../NEWS:45427
msgid ""
":issue:`31858`: IDLE -- Restrict shell prompt manipulation to the shell. "
"Editor and output windows only see an empty last prompt line.  This "
"simplifies the code and fixes a minor bug when newline is inserted. Sys.ps1,"
" if present, is read on Shell start-up, but is not set or changed."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31858`: IDLE -- "
"将shell提示符操作限制在shell中。编辑器和输出窗口仅看到一个空的最后提示行。这简化了代码并修复了插入换行时的一个小错误。如果存在Sys.ps1，则在Shell启动时读取，但不设置或更改。"

#: ../NEWS:41989 ../NEWS:45432
msgid ""
":issue:`31860`: The font sample in the IDLE configuration dialog is now "
"editable. Changes persist while IDLE remains open"
msgstr ":issue:`31860`: IDLE配置对话框中的字体样本现在可编辑。更改在IDLE保持打开时持续存在。"

#: ../NEWS:41992 ../NEWS:45435
msgid ""
":issue:`31836`: Test_code_module now passes if run after test_idle, which "
"sets ps1. The code module uses sys.ps1 if present or sets it to '>>> ' if "
"not. Test_code_module now properly tests both behaviors.  Ditto for ps2."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31836`: "
"现在如果在设置ps1的test_idle之后运行，Test_code_module将通过。代码模块如果存在则使用sys.ps1，如果不存在则设置为'>>>"
" '。Test_code_module现在正确测试了这两种行为。ps2同理。"

#: ../NEWS:41996 ../NEWS:45439
msgid ""
":issue:`28603`: Fix a TypeError that caused a shell restart when printing a "
"traceback that includes an exception that is unhashable. Patch by Zane "
"Bitter."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28603`: 修复了一个TypeError，该错误在打印包含不可哈希异常的追溯时导致shell重启。补丁由Zane Bitter提供。"

#: ../NEWS:42000
msgid ""
":issue:`13802`: Use non-Latin characters in the IDLE's Font settings sample."
" Even if one selects a font that defines a limited subset of the unicode "
"Basic Multilingual Plane, tcl/tk will use other fonts that define a "
"character. The expanded example give users of non-Latin characters a better "
"idea of what they might see in IDLE's shell and editors. To make room for "
"the expanded sample, frames on the Font tab are re-arranged.  The Font/Tabs "
"help explains a bit about the additions."
msgstr ""
":issue:`13802`: "
"在IDLE的字体设置示例中使用非拉丁字符。即使用户选择的字体仅定义了Unicode基本多语言平面的一个有限子集，tcl/tk也会使用定义了该字符的其他字体。扩展后的示例让使用非拉丁字符的用户更清楚地了解他们在IDLE的shell和编辑器中可能会看到的内容。为了给扩展后的示例腾出空间，字体标签页上的框架被重新排列。字体/标签帮助文档对这些新增内容进行了一些说明。"

#: ../NEWS:42011
msgid ""
":issue:`32159`: Remove CVS and Subversion tools: remove svneol.py and "
"treesync.py scripts. CPython migrated from CVS to Subversion, to Mercurial, "
"and then to Git. CVS and Subversion are no longer used to develop CPython."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32159`: "
"移除CVS和Subversion工具：删除svneol.py和treesync.py脚本。CPython已经从CVS迁移到Subversion，再到Mercurial，最后到Git。CVS和Subversion已不再用于CPython的开发。"

#: ../NEWS:42016 ../NEWS:45478
msgid ""
":issue:`30722`: Make redemo work with Python 3.6 and newer versions. Also, "
"remove the ``LOCALE`` option since it doesn't work with string patterns in "
"Python 3. Patch by Christoph Sarnowski."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30722`: 使redemo能够在Python 3.6及更新版本中工作。同时，移除 ``LOCALE`` "
"选项，因为它不适用于Python 3中的字符串模式。由Christoph Sarnowski提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42023 ../NEWS:45485
msgid ""
":issue:`20891`: Fix PyGILState_Ensure(). When PyGILState_Ensure() is called "
"in a non-Python thread before PyEval_InitThreads(), only call "
"PyEval_InitThreads() after calling PyThreadState_New() to fix a crash."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20891`: "
"修复PyGILState_Ensure()。当PyGILState_Ensure()在非Python线程中且在PyEval_InitThreads()之前被调用时，仅在调用PyThreadState_New()之后调用PyEval_InitThreads()，以修复崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:42027
msgid ""
":issue:`32125`: The ``Py_UseClassExceptionsFlag`` flag has been removed. It "
"was deprecated and wasn't used anymore since Python 2.0."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32125`: 已移除 ``Py_UseClassExceptionsFlag`` 标志。该标志自Python "
"2.0以来已被弃用且不再使用。"

#: ../NEWS:42030
msgid ""
":issue:`25612`: Move the current exception state from the frame object to "
"the co-routine. This simplifies the interpreter and fixes a couple of "
"obscure bugs caused by having swap exception state when entering or exiting "
"a generator."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25612`: 将当前的异常状态从帧对象移动到协程。这简化了解释器，并修复了一些由于在进入或退出生成器时交换异常状态而导致的晦涩错误。"

#: ../NEWS:42035
msgid ""
":issue:`23699`: Add Py_RETURN_RICHCOMPARE macro to reduce boilerplate code "
"in rich comparison functions."
msgstr ":issue:`23699`: 添加Py_RETURN_RICHCOMPARE宏以减少富比较函数中的样板代码。"

#: ../NEWS:42038 ../NEWS:45492
msgid ""
":issue:`30697`: The ``PyExc_RecursionErrorInst`` singleton is removed and "
"``PyErr_NormalizeException()`` does not use it anymore. This singleton is "
"persistent and its members being never cleared may cause a segfault during "
"finalization of the interpreter. See also :issue:`22898`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30697`: 移除了 ``PyExc_RecursionErrorInst`` "
"单例，``PyErr_NormalizeException()`` "
"也不再使用它。这个单例是持久的，其成员从未被清除可能会导致解释器在最终化期间出现段错误。另见 :issue:`22898`。"

#: ../NEWS:42045
msgid "Python 3.7.0 alpha 2"
msgstr "Python 3.7.0 alpha 2"

#: ../NEWS:42047
msgid "*Release date: 2017-10-16*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2017-10-16*"

#: ../NEWS:42052
msgid ""
":issue:`31558`: ``gc.freeze()`` is a new API that allows for moving all "
"objects currently tracked by the garbage collector to a permanent "
"generation, effectively removing them from future collection events. This "
"can be used to protect those objects from having their PyGC_Head mutated. In"
" effect, this enables great copy-on-write stability at fork()."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31558`: ``gc.freeze()`` "
"是一个新的API，它允许将垃圾收集器当前跟踪的所有对象移动到永久代，从而有效地将它们从未来的收集事件中移除。这可以用来保护这些对象的PyGC_Head不被改变。实际上，这为fork()提供了极佳的写时复制稳定性。"

#: ../NEWS:42058 ../NEWS:45128
msgid ""
":issue:`31642`: Restored blocking \"from package import module\" by setting "
"sys.modules[\"package.module\"] to None."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31642`: 通过将sys.modules[\"package.module\"]设置为None，恢复了阻塞的\"from "
"package import module\"。"

#: ../NEWS:42061
msgid ""
":issue:`31708`: Allow use of asynchronous generator expressions in "
"synchronous functions."
msgstr ":issue:`31708`: 允许在同步函数中使用异步生成器表达式。"

#: ../NEWS:42064
msgid ":issue:`31709`: Drop support of asynchronous __aiter__."
msgstr ":issue:`31709`: 放弃对异步__aiter__的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:42066
msgid ""
":issue:`30404`: The -u option now makes the stdout and stderr streams "
"unbuffered rather than line-buffered."
msgstr ":issue:`30404`: -u选项现在使stdout和stderr流变为无缓冲而非行缓冲。"

#: ../NEWS:42069 ../NEWS:45134
msgid ""
":issue:`31619`: Fixed a ValueError when convert a string with large number "
"of underscores to integer with binary base."
msgstr ":issue:`31619`: 修复了将带有大量下划线的字符串转换为二进制基数整数时的ValueError。"

#: ../NEWS:42072
msgid ""
":issue:`31602`: Fix an assertion failure in ``zipimporter.get_source()`` in "
"case of a bad ``zlib.decompress()``. Patch by Oren Milman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31602`: 修复了在 ``zlib.decompress()`` 出错时 ``zipimporter.get_source()`` "
"中的断言失败。由Oren Milman提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42075 ../NEWS:45137
msgid ""
":issue:`31592`: Fixed an assertion failure in Python parser in case of a bad"
" ``unicodedata.normalize()``. Patch by Oren Milman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31592`: 修复了在 ``unicodedata.normalize()`` 出错时Python解析器中的断言失败。由Oren "
"Milman提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42078 ../NEWS:45140
msgid ""
":issue:`31588`: Raise a ``TypeError`` with a helpful error message when "
"class creation fails due to a metaclass with a bad ``__prepare__()`` method."
" Patch by Oren Milman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31588`: 当类创建由于元类的 ``__prepare__()`` 方法出错而失败时，抛出一个带有有用错误信息的 "
"``TypeError``。由Oren Milman提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42082
msgid ""
":issue:`31574`: Importlib was instrumented with two dtrace probes to profile"
" import timing."
msgstr ":issue:`31574`: 为importlib装备了两个dtrace探针以分析导入时间。"

#: ../NEWS:42085 ../NEWS:45144
msgid ""
":issue:`31566`: Fix an assertion failure in ``_warnings.warn()`` in case of "
"a bad ``__name__`` global. Patch by Oren Milman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31566`: 修复了在 ``__name__`` 全局变量出错时 ``_warnings.warn()`` 中的断言失败。由Oren "
"Milman提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42088
msgid ""
":issue:`31506`: Improved the error message logic for ``object.__new__`` and "
"``object.__init__``."
msgstr ":issue:`31506`: 改进了 ``object.__new__`` 和 ``object.__init__`` 的错误消息逻辑。"

#: ../NEWS:42091 ../NEWS:45147
msgid ""
":issue:`31505`: Fix an assertion failure in ``json``, in case "
"``_json.make_encoder()`` received a bad ``encoder()`` argument. Patch by "
"Oren Milman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31505`: 修复了在 ``_json.make_encoder()``接收到错误的 ``encoder()`` 参数时 "
"``json`` 中的断言失败。由Oren Milman提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42095 ../NEWS:45151
msgid ""
":issue:`31492`: Fix assertion failures in case of failing to import from a "
"module with a bad ``__name__`` attribute, and in case of failing to access "
"an attribute of such a module. Patch by Oren Milman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31492`: 修复了在从具有错误 ``__name__`` 属性的模块导入失败时，以及在访问此类模块的属性失败时的断言失败。由Oren"
" Milman提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42099 ../NEWS:45159
msgid ""
":issue:`31478`: Fix an assertion failure in ``_random.Random.seed()`` in "
"case the argument has a bad ``__abs__()`` method. Patch by Oren Milman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31478`: 修复 ``_random.Random.seed()`` 中当参数有坏的 ``__abs__()`` "
"方法时的断言失败。由 Oren Milman 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42102
msgid ""
":issue:`31336`: Speed up class creation by 10-20% by reducing the overhead "
"in the necessary special method lookups.  Patch by Stefan Behnel."
msgstr ":issue:`31336`: 通过减少必要的特殊方法查找的开销，加快类创建速度10-20%。由 Stefan Behnel 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42105
msgid ""
":issue:`31415`: Add ``-X importtime`` option to show how long each import "
"takes. It can be used to optimize application's startup time.  Support the "
":envvar:`PYTHONPROFILEIMPORTTIME` as an equivalent way to enable this."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31415`: 添加 ``-X importtime`` 选项以显示每个导入花费的时间。可用于优化应用程序的启动时间。支持使用 "
":envvar:`PYTHONPROFILEIMPORTTIME` 作为启用此功能的等效方式。"

#: ../NEWS:42109
msgid ":issue:`31410`: Optimized calling wrapper and classmethod descriptors."
msgstr ":issue:`31410`: 优化了调用包装器和类方法描述符。"

#: ../NEWS:42111
msgid ""
":issue:`31353`: :pep:`553` - Add a new built-in called ``breakpoint()`` "
"which calls ``sys.breakpointhook()``.  By default this imports ``pdb`` and "
"calls ``pdb.set_trace()``, but users may override ``sys.breakpointhook()`` "
"to call whatever debugger they want.  The original value of the hook is "
"saved in ``sys.__breakpointhook__``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31353`: :pep:`553` - 添加一个名为 ``breakpoint()`` 的新内置函数，它会调用 "
"``sys.breakpointhook()``。默认情况下，这会导入 ``pdb`` 并调用 ``pdb.set_trace()``，但用户可以覆盖 "
"``sys.breakpointhook()`` 来调用他们想要的任何调试器。钩子的原始值保存在 ``sys.__breakpointhook__`` "
"中。"

#: ../NEWS:42117
msgid ""
":issue:`17852`: Maintain a list of open buffered files, flush them before "
"exiting the interpreter.  Based on a patch from Armin Rigo."
msgstr ":issue:`17852`: 维护一个打开的缓冲文件列表，在退出解释器之前刷新它们。基于 Armin Rigo 的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42120 ../NEWS:45162
msgid ""
":issue:`31315`: Fix an assertion failure in imp.create_dynamic(), when "
"spec.name is not a string. Patch by Oren Milman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31315`: 修复 imp.create_dynamic() 中当 spec.name 不是字符串时的断言失败。由 Oren "
"Milman 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42123 ../NEWS:45165
msgid ""
":issue:`31311`: Fix a crash in the ``__setstate__()`` method of "
"``ctypes._CData``, in case of a bad ``__dict__``. Patch by Oren Milman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31311`: 修复 ``ctypes._CData`` 的 ``__setstate__()`` 方法在 ``__dict__`` "
"有问题时的崩溃。由 Oren Milman 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42126 ../NEWS:45168
msgid ""
":issue:`31293`: Fix crashes in true division and multiplication of a "
"timedelta object by a float with a bad as_integer_ratio() method. Patch by "
"Oren Milman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31293`: 修复 timedelta 对象与具有坏的 as_integer_ratio() 方法的浮点数进行真除法和乘法时的崩溃。由"
" Oren Milman 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42130 ../NEWS:45172
msgid ""
":issue:`31285`: Fix an assertion failure in ``warnings.warn_explicit``, when"
" the return value of the received loader's ``get_source()`` has a bad "
"``splitlines()`` method. Patch by Oren Milman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31285`: 修复 ``warnings.warn_explicit`` 中当接收的加载器的 ``get_source()`` "
"的返回值有坏的 ``splitlines()`` 方法时的断言失败。由 Oren Milman 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42134
msgid ""
":issue:`30406`: Make ``async`` and ``await`` proper keywords, as specified "
"in :pep:`492`."
msgstr ":issue:`30406`: 使 ``async`` 和 ``await`` 成为合适的关键字，如 :pep:`492` 所规定。"

#: ../NEWS:42140 ../NEWS:45278
msgid ":issue:`30058`: Fixed buffer overflow in select.kqueue.control()."
msgstr ":issue:`30058`: 修复 select.kqueue.control() 中的缓冲区溢出。"

#: ../NEWS:42142 ../NEWS:45283
msgid ""
":issue:`31672`: ``idpattern`` in ``string.Template`` matched some non-ASCII "
"characters. Now it uses ``-i`` regular expression local flag to avoid non-"
"ASCII characters."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31672`: ``string.Template`` 中的 ``idpattern`` 匹配了一些非ASCII字符。现在它使用 "
"``-i`` 正则表达式本地标志来避免非ASCII字符。"

#: ../NEWS:42146 ../NEWS:45293
msgid ""
":issue:`31701`: On Windows, faulthandler.enable() now ignores MSC and COM "
"exceptions."
msgstr ":issue:`31701`: 在Windows上，faulthandler.enable()现在会忽略MSC和COM异常。"

#: ../NEWS:42149 ../NEWS:45296
msgid ""
":issue:`31728`: Prevent crashes in ``_elementtree`` due to unsafe cleanup of"
" ``Element.text`` and ``Element.tail``. Patch by Oren Milman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31728`: 防止由于 ``Element.text`` 和 ``Element.tail`` "
"的不安全清理导致的``_elementtree``崩溃。由Oren Milman提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42152
msgid ""
":issue:`31671`: Now ``re.compile()`` converts passed RegexFlag to normal int"
" object before compiling. bm_regex_compile benchmark shows 14% performance "
"improvements."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31671`: 现在 ``re.compile()`` "
"在编译前将传递的RegexFlag转换为普通的int对象。bm_regex_compile基准测试显示性能提升了14%。"

#: ../NEWS:42156
msgid ""
":issue:`30397`: The types of compiled regular objects and match objects are "
"now exposed as ``re.Pattern`` and ``re.Match``.  This adds information in "
"pydoc output for the ``re`` module."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30397`: 编译的正则表达式对象和匹配对象的类型现在暴露为 ``re.Pattern`` 和``re.Match``。这为 "
"``re`` 模块的pydoc输出增加了信息。"

#: ../NEWS:42160 ../NEWS:45306
msgid ""
":issue:`31675`: Fixed memory leaks in Tkinter's methods splitlist() and "
"split() when pass a string larger than 2 GiB."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31675`: 修复了Tkinter的splitlist()和split()方法在传递大于2 GiB的字符串时的内存泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:42163 ../NEWS:45309
msgid ""
":issue:`31673`: Fixed typo in the name of Tkinter's method adderrorinfo()."
msgstr ":issue:`31673`: 修复了Tkinter方法adderrorinfo()名称中的拼写错误。"

#: ../NEWS:42165
msgid ""
":issue:`31648`: Improvements to path predicates in ElementTree: Allow "
"whitespace around predicate parts, i.e. \"[a = 'text']\" instead of "
"requiring the less readable \"[a='text']\". Add support for text comparison "
"of the current node, like \"[.='text']\". Patch by Stefan Behnel."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31648`: 对ElementTree中的路径谓词进行了改进：允许谓词部分周围有空格，例如\"[a = "
"'text']\"，而不是要求不太可读的\"[a='text']\"。添加了对当前节点文本比较的支持，如\"[.='text']\"。由Stefan "
"Behnel提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42170 ../NEWS:45311
msgid ":issue:`30806`: Fix the string representation of a netrc object."
msgstr ":issue:`30806`: 修复了netrc对象的字符串表示。"

#: ../NEWS:42172
msgid ""
":issue:`31638`: Add optional argument ``compressed`` to "
"``zipapp.create_archive``, and add option ``--compress`` to the command line"
" interface of ``zipapp``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31638`: 向 ``zipapp.create_archive`` 添加可选参数 ``compressed``，并向 "
"``zipapp`` 的命令行界面添加选项 ``--compress``。"

#: ../NEWS:42176 ../NEWS:45316
msgid ":issue:`25351`: Avoid venv activate failures with undefined variables"
msgstr ":issue:`25351`: 避免venv激活时因未定义变量而失败。"

#: ../NEWS:42178
msgid ""
":issue:`20519`: Avoid ctypes use (if possible) and improve import time for "
"uuid."
msgstr ":issue:`20519`: 尽可能避免使用ctypes并提高uuid的导入时间。"

#: ../NEWS:42181
msgid ""
":issue:`28293`: The regular expression cache is no longer completely dumped "
"when it is full."
msgstr ":issue:`28293`: 当正则表达式缓存满时，不再完全清空。"

#: ../NEWS:42184
msgid ":issue:`31596`: Added pthread_getcpuclockid() to the time module"
msgstr ":issue:`31596`: 向time模块添加了pthread_getcpuclockid()。"

#: ../NEWS:42186
msgid ""
":issue:`27494`: Make 2to3 accept a trailing comma in generator expressions. "
"For example, ``set(x for x in [],)`` is now allowed."
msgstr ":issue:`27494`: 使2to3接受生成器表达式中的尾随逗号。例如，现在允许``set(x for x in [],)``。"

#: ../NEWS:42189 ../NEWS:45322
msgid ""
":issue:`30347`: Stop crashes when concurrently iterate over "
"itertools.groupby() iterators."
msgstr ":issue:`30347`: 修复了在并发迭代itertools.groupby()迭代器时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:42192
msgid ""
":issue:`30346`: An iterator produced by itertools.groupby() iterator now "
"becomes exhausted after advancing the groupby iterator."
msgstr ":issue:`30346`: 由itertools.groupby()迭代器生成的迭代器现在在推进groupby迭代器后会耗尽。"

#: ../NEWS:42195
msgid ":issue:`31556`: Cancel asyncio.wait_for future faster if timeout <= 0"
msgstr ":issue:`31556`: 如果超时<=0，则更快地取消asyncio.wait_for未来。"

#: ../NEWS:42197
msgid ""
":issue:`31540`: Allow passing a context object in "
":class:`concurrent.futures.ProcessPoolExecutor` constructor. Also, free job "
"resources in :class:`concurrent.futures.ProcessPoolExecutor` earlier to "
"improve memory usage when a worker waits for new jobs."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31540`: 允许在 :class:`concurrent.futures.ProcessPoolExecutor` "
"构造函数中传递上下文对象。同时，提前释放 :class:`concurrent.futures.ProcessPoolExecutor` "
"中的作业资源，以改善工作线程等待新作业时的内存使用情况。"

#: ../NEWS:42202 ../NEWS:45325
msgid ""
":issue:`31516`: ``threading.current_thread()`` should not return a dummy "
"thread at shutdown."
msgstr ":issue:`31516`: ``threading.current_thread()`` 在关闭时不应返回一个虚拟线程。"

#: ../NEWS:42205
msgid ""
":issue:`31525`: In the sqlite module, require the sqlite3_prepare_v2 API. "
"Thus, the sqlite module now requires sqlite version at least 3.3.9."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31525`: 在 sqlite 模块中，要求 sqlite3_prepare_v2 API。因此，sqlite 模块现在要求 "
"sqlite 版本至少为 3.3.9。"

#: ../NEWS:42208
msgid ""
":issue:`26510`: argparse subparsers are now required by default.  This "
"matches behaviour in Python 2. For optional subparsers, use the new "
"parameter ``add_subparsers(required=False)``. Patch by Anthony Sottile. (As "
"of 3.7.0rc1, the default was changed to not required as had been the case "
"since Python 3.3.)"
msgstr ""
":issue:`26510`: argparse 子解析器现在默认是必需的。这与 Python 2 的行为一致。对于可选的子解析器，使用新参数 "
"``add_subparsers(required=False)``。由 Anthony Sottile 提供补丁。（截至 "
"3.7.0rc1，默认值更改为非必需，这是自 Python 3.3 以来的情况。）"

#: ../NEWS:42214
msgid ""
":issue:`27541`: Reprs of subclasses of some collection and iterator classes "
"(``bytearray``, ``array.array``, ``collections.deque``, "
"``collections.defaultdict``, ``itertools.count``, ``itertools.repeat``) now "
"contain actual type name instead of hardcoded names of the base class."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27541`: "
"一些集合和迭代器类的子类（``bytearray``、``array.array``、``collections.deque``、``collections.defaultdict``、``itertools.count``、``itertools.repeat``）的"
" repr 现在包含实际的类型名，而不是基类的硬编码名称。"

#: ../NEWS:42219 ../NEWS:45328
msgid ""
":issue:`31351`: python -m ensurepip now exits with non-zero exit code if pip"
" bootstrapping has failed."
msgstr ":issue:`31351`: 如果 pip 引导失败，python -m ensurepip 现在会以非零退出代码退出。"

#: ../NEWS:42222
msgid ""
":issue:`31389`: ``pdb.set_trace()`` now takes an optional keyword-only "
"argument ``header``. If given, this is printed to the console just before "
"debugging begins."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31389`: ``pdb.set_trace()`` 现在接受一个可选的关键字参数 "
"``header``。如果提供，这将在调试开始前打印到控制台。"

#: ../NEWS:42229 ../NEWS:45349
msgid ""
":issue:`31537`: Fix incorrect usage of ``get_history_length`` in readline "
"documentation example code. Patch by Brad Smith."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31537`: 修复了 readline 文档示例代码中 ``get_history_length`` 的不正确用法。补丁由 Brad "
"Smith 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:42232 ../NEWS:45352
msgid ""
":issue:`30085`: The operator functions without double underscores are "
"preferred for clarity. The one with underscores are only kept for back-"
"compatibility."
msgstr ":issue:`30085`: 为了清晰起见，优先使用没有双下划线的操作符函数。带有下划线的仅为了向后兼容而保留。"

#: ../NEWS:42239
msgid ""
":issue:`31696`: Improve compiler version information in :data:`sys.version` "
"when Python is built with Clang."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31696`: 当 Python 使用 Clang 构建时，改进 :data:`sys.version` 中的编译器版本信息。"

#: ../NEWS:42242
msgid ""
":issue:`31625`: Stop using ranlib on static libraries. Instead, we assume ar"
" supports the 's' flag."
msgstr ":issue:`31625`: 停止在静态库上使用 ranlib。相反，我们假设 ar 支持 's' 标志。"

#: ../NEWS:42245
msgid ":issue:`31624`: Remove support for BSD/OS."
msgstr ":issue:`31624`: 移除对 BSD/OS 的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:42247 ../NEWS:45393
msgid ""
":issue:`22140`: Prevent double substitution of prefix in python-config.sh."
msgstr ":issue:`22140`: 防止在 python-config.sh 中双重替换前缀。"

#: ../NEWS:42249
msgid ""
":issue:`31569`: Correct PCBuild/ case to PCbuild/ in build scripts and "
"documentation."
msgstr ":issue:`31569`: 在构建脚本和文档中将PCBuild/更正为PCbuild/。"

#: ../NEWS:42252 ../NEWS:45395
msgid ""
":issue:`31536`: Avoid wholesale rebuild after ``make regen-all`` if nothing "
"changed."
msgstr ":issue:`31536`: 如果没有任何更改，避免在 ``make regen-all`` 后进行全面重建。"

#: ../NEWS:42258 ../NEWS:45451
msgid ""
":issue:`31460`: Simplify the API of IDLE's Module Browser. Passing a widget "
"instead of an flist with a root widget opens the option of creating a "
"browser frame that is only part of a window.  Passing a full file name "
"instead of pieces assumed to come from a .py file opens the possibility of "
"browsing python files that do not end in .py."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31460`: "
"简化IDLE模块浏览器的API。传递一个小部件而不是带有根部件的flist，开启了创建一个仅是窗口一部分的浏览器框架的可能性。传递一个完整的文件名而不是假定来自.py文件的片段，开启了浏览不以.py结尾的python文件的可能性。"

#: ../NEWS:42264 ../NEWS:45457
msgid ":issue:`31649`: IDLE - Make _htest, _utest parameters keyword only."
msgstr ":issue:`31649`: IDLE - 使_htest, _utest参数仅关键字。"

#: ../NEWS:42266 ../NEWS:45459
msgid ""
":issue:`31559`: Remove test order dependence in idle_test.test_browser."
msgstr ":issue:`31559`: 在idle_test.test_browser中移除测试顺序依赖。"

#: ../NEWS:42268 ../NEWS:45461
msgid ""
":issue:`31459`: Rename IDLE's module browser from Class Browser to Module "
"Browser. The original module-level class and method browser became a module "
"browser, with the addition of module-level functions, years ago. Nested "
"classes and functions were added yesterday.  For back-compatibility, the "
"virtual event <<open-class-browser>>, which appears on the Keys tab of the "
"Settings dialog, is not changed. Patch by Cheryl Sabella."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31459`: "
"将IDLE的模块浏览器从类浏览器重命名为模块浏览器。原始的模块级类和方法浏览器多年前就变成了一个模块浏览器，增加了模块级函数。昨天又增加了嵌套类和函数。为了向后兼容，设置对话框的键标签上出现的虚拟事件<<open-"
"class-browser>>没有被更改。补丁由Cheryl Sabella提供。"

#: ../NEWS:42276 ../NEWS:45469
msgid ":issue:`31500`: Default fonts now are scaled on HiDPI displays."
msgstr ":issue:`31500`: 现在默认字体在高DPI显示器上会进行缩放。"

#: ../NEWS:42278 ../NEWS:45471
msgid ""
":issue:`1612262`: IDLE module browser now shows nested classes and "
"functions. Original patches for code and tests by Guilherme Polo and Cheryl "
"Sabella, respectively."
msgstr ""
":issue:`1612262`: IDLE模块浏览器现在显示嵌套类和函数。代码和测试的原始补丁分别由Guilherme Polo和Cheryl "
"Sabella提供。"

#: ../NEWS:42285
msgid ""
":issue:`28280`: Make ``PyMapping_Keys()``, ``PyMapping_Values()`` and "
"``PyMapping_Items()`` always return a ``list`` (rather than a ``list`` or a "
"``tuple``). Patch by Oren Milman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28280`: 使 ``PyMapping_Keys()``、``PyMapping_Values()`` 和 "
"``PyMapping_Items()`` 总是返回一个 ``list`` (而不是一个 ``list`` 或一个 ``tuple``) 。由Oren "
"Milman提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42289 ../NEWS:45489
msgid ""
":issue:`31532`: Fix memory corruption due to allocator mix in getpath.c "
"between Py_GetPath() and Py_SetPath()"
msgstr ""
":issue:`31532`: 修复由于在getpath.c中Py_GetPath()和Py_SetPath()之间的分配器混合导致的内存损坏。"

#: ../NEWS:42292
msgid ""
":issue:`25658`: Implement :pep:`539` for Thread Specific Storage (TSS) API: "
"it is a new Thread Local Storage (TLS) API to CPython which would supersede "
"use of the existing TLS API within the CPython interpreter, while "
"deprecating the existing API. PEP written by Erik M. Bray, patch by Masayuki"
" Yamamoto."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25658`: 实现线程特定存储（TSS）API的 "
":pep:`539`：这是CPython的一个新的线程本地存储（TLS）API，将取代CPython解释器中现有的TLS "
"API的使用，同时弃用现有的API。PEP由Erik M. Bray撰写，由Masayuki Yamamoto提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42300
msgid "Python 3.7.0 alpha 1"
msgstr "Python 3.7.0 alpha 1"

#: ../NEWS:42302
msgid "*Release date: 2017-09-19*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2017-09-19*"

#: ../NEWS:42307 ../NEWS:45527
msgid ""
":issue:`29781`: SSLObject.version() now correctly returns None when "
"handshake over BIO has not been performed yet."
msgstr ":issue:`29781`: 当尚未通过 BIO 执行握手时，SSLObject.version() 现在正确返回 None。"

#: ../NEWS:42310
msgid ""
":issue:`29505`: Add fuzz tests for float(str), int(str), unicode(str); for "
"oss-fuzz."
msgstr ":issue:`29505`: 为 oss-fuzz 添加 float(str)、int(str)、unicode(str) 的模糊测试。"

#: ../NEWS:42313 ../NEWS:45530 ../NEWS:49877
msgid ""
":issue:`30947`: Upgrade libexpat embedded copy from version 2.2.1 to 2.2.3 "
"to get security fixes."
msgstr ":issue:`30947`: 将内嵌的 libexpat 从版本 2.2.1 升级到 2.2.3 以获取安全修复。"

#: ../NEWS:42316 ../NEWS:45991 ../NEWS:49919
msgid ""
":issue:`30730`: Prevent environment variables injection in subprocess on "
"Windows.  Prevent passing other environment variables and command arguments."
msgstr ":issue:`30730`: 在 Windows 上防止子进程中的环境变量注入。防止传递其他环境变量和命令参数。"

#: ../NEWS:42320 ../NEWS:45995 ../NEWS:49923
msgid ""
":issue:`30694`: Upgrade expat copy from 2.2.0 to 2.2.1 to get fixes of "
"multiple security vulnerabilities including: :cve:`2017-9233` (External "
"entity infinite loop DoS), :cve:`2016-9063` (Integer overflow, re-fix), "
":cve:`2016-0718` (Fix regression bugs from 2.2.0's fix to :cve:`2016-0718`) "
"and :cve:`2012-0876` (Counter hash flooding with SipHash). Note: the "
":cve:`2016-5300` (Use os-specific entropy sources like getrandom) doesn't "
"impact Python, since Python already gets entropy from the OS to set the "
"expat secret using ``XML_SetHashSalt()``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30694`: 将 expat 从 2.2.0 升级到 2.2.1 "
"以修复多个安全漏洞，包括：:cve:`2017-9233`（外部实体无限循环 DoS）、:cve:`2016-9063` (整数溢出，重新修复) "
"、:cve:`2016-0718`（修复 2.2.0 对 :cve:`2016-0718` 的修复引起的回归错误）和 "
":cve:`2012-0876`（使用 SipHash 抵御哈希洪水攻击）。注意：:cve:`2016-5300` (使用操作系统特定的熵源如 "
"getrandom) 不影响 Python，因为 Python 已经通过 ``XML_SetHashSalt()`` 从操作系统获取熵来设置 expat"
" 的密钥。"

#: ../NEWS:42329 ../NEWS:46004 ../NEWS:49932
msgid ""
":issue:`30500`: Fix urllib.parse.splithost() to correctly parse fragments. "
"For example, ``splithost('//127.0.0.1#@evil.com/')`` now correctly returns "
"the ``127.0.0.1`` host, instead of treating ``@evil.com`` as the host in an "
"authentication (``login@host``)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30500`: 修复 urllib.parse.splithost() "
"正确解析片段。例如，``splithost('//127.0.0.1#@evil.com/')`` 现在正确返回 ``127.0.0.1`` "
"主机，而不是将 ``@evil.com`` 视为认证中的主机（``login@host``）。"

#: ../NEWS:42334 ../NEWS:46018 ../NEWS:49937
msgid ""
":issue:`29591`: Update expat copy from 2.1.1 to 2.2.0 to get fixes of "
":cve:`2016-0718` and :cve:`2016-4472`. See "
"https://sourceforge.net/p/expat/bugs/537/ for more information."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29591`: 将 expat 从 2.1.1 更新到 2.2.0 以修复 :cve:`2016-0718` 和 "
":cve:`2016-4472`。更多信息请见 https://sourceforge.net/p/expat/bugs/537/。"

#: ../NEWS:42341 ../NEWS:45155
msgid ""
":issue:`31490`: Fix an assertion failure in ``ctypes`` class definition, in "
"case the class has an attribute whose name is specified in ``_anonymous_`` "
"but not in ``_fields_``. Patch by Oren Milman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31490`: 修复 ``ctypes`` 类定义中的断言失败，当类有一个属性其名称在 ``_anonymous_`` 中指定但不在 "
"``_fields_`` 中时。由 Oren Milman 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42345 ../NEWS:45536
msgid ""
":issue:`31471`: Fix an assertion failure in ``subprocess.Popen()`` on "
"Windows, in case the env argument has a bad ``keys()`` method. Patch by Oren"
" Milman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31471`: 修复 Windows 上 ``subprocess.Popen()`` 中的断言失败，当 env 参数有一个坏的 "
"``keys()`` 方法时。由 Oren Milman 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42349 ../NEWS:45540
msgid ""
":issue:`31418`: Fix an assertion failure in ``PyErr_WriteUnraisable()`` in "
"case of an exception with a bad ``__module__`` attribute. Patch by Oren "
"Milman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31418`: 修复 ``PyErr_WriteUnraisable()`` 中的断言失败，当异常有一个坏的 "
"``__module__`` 属性时。由 Oren Milman 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42352 ../NEWS:45543
msgid ""
":issue:`31416`: Fix assertion failures in case of a bad warnings.filters or "
"warnings.defaultaction. Patch by Oren Milman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31416`: 修复当warnings.filters或warnings.defaultaction错误时的断言失败。由Oren "
"Milman提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42355
msgid ""
":issue:`28411`: Change direct usage of PyInterpreterState.modules to "
"PyImport_GetModuleDict(). Also introduce more uniformity in other code that "
"deals with sys.modules. This helps reduce complications when working on "
"sys.modules."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28411`: "
"将直接使用PyInterpreterState.modules改为使用PyImport_GetModuleDict()。同时，在处理sys.modules的其他代码中引入更多一致性。这有助于减少在处理sys.modules时的复杂性。"

#: ../NEWS:42360
msgid ""
":issue:`28411`: Switch to the abstract API when dealing with "
"``PyInterpreterState.modules``. This allows later support for all dict "
"subclasses and other Mapping implementations.  Also add a "
"``PyImport_GetModule()`` function to reduce a bunch of duplicated code."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28411`: 在处理 ``PyInterpreterState.modules`` "
"时切换到抽象API。这为以后支持所有字典子类和其他映射实现提供了可能。同时添加了一个 ``PyImport_GetModule()`` "
"函数以减少大量重复代码。"

#: ../NEWS:42365 ../NEWS:45546
msgid ""
":issue:`31411`: Raise a TypeError instead of SystemError in case "
"warnings.onceregistry is not a dictionary. Patch by Oren Milman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31411`: 当warnings.onceregistry不是字典时，抛出TypeError而不是SystemError。由Oren "
"Milman提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42368
msgid ""
":issue:`31344`: For finer control of tracing behaviour when testing the "
"interpreter, two new frame attributes have been added to control the "
"emission of particular trace events: ``f_trace_lines`` (``True`` by default)"
" to turn off per-line trace events; and ``f_trace_opcodes`` (``False`` by "
"default) to turn on per-opcode trace events."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31344`: "
"为了更精细地控制测试解释器时的跟踪行为，添加了两个新的帧属性来控制特定跟踪事件的发出：``f_trace_lines``（默认为 "
"``True``）用于关闭每行跟踪事件；``f_trace_opcodes`` (默认为 ``False``) 用于开启每操作码跟踪事件。"

#: ../NEWS:42374 ../NEWS:45549
msgid ""
":issue:`31373`: Fix several possible instances of undefined behavior due to "
"floating-point demotions."
msgstr ":issue:`31373`: 修复了几个由于浮点降级可能导致的未定义行为实例。"

#: ../NEWS:42377 ../NEWS:45552
msgid ""
":issue:`30465`: Location information (``lineno`` and ``col_offset``) in "
"f-strings is now (mostly) correct.  This fixes tools like flake8 from "
"showing warnings on the wrong line (typically the first line of the file)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30465`: f-字符串中的位置信息（``lineno``和 "
"``col_offset``）现在（大部分）正确。这修复了像flake8这样的工具在错误行（通常是文件的第一行）显示警告的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:42381
msgid ""
":issue:`30860`: Consolidate CPython's global runtime state under a single "
"struct.  This improves discoverability of the runtime state."
msgstr ":issue:`30860`: 将CPython的全局运行时状态整合到一个结构体中。这提高了运行时状态的可发现性。"

#: ../NEWS:42384
msgid ""
":issue:`31347`: Fix possible undefined behavior in "
"_PyObject_FastCall_Prepend."
msgstr ":issue:`31347`: 修复了_PyObject_FastCall_Prepend中可能存在的未定义行为。"

#: ../NEWS:42386 ../NEWS:45556
msgid ""
":issue:`31343`: Include sys/sysmacros.h for major(), minor(), and makedev()."
" GNU C library plans to remove the functions from sys/types.h."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31343`: 包含sys/sysmacros.h以获取major()、minor()和makedev()。GNU "
"C库计划从sys/types.h中移除这些函数。"

#: ../NEWS:42389 ../NEWS:45559
msgid ""
":issue:`31291`: Fix an assertion failure in "
"``zipimport.zipimporter.get_data`` on Windows, when the return value of "
"``pathname.replace('/','\\\\')`` isn't a string. Patch by Oren Milman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31291`: 修复了Windows上 ``zipimport.zipimporter.get_data`` "
"中的一个断言失败，当``pathname.replace('/','\\\\')``的返回值不是字符串时。由Oren Milman提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42393 ../NEWS:45563
msgid ""
":issue:`31271`: Fix an assertion failure in the ``write()`` method of "
"``io.TextIOWrapper``, when the encoder doesn't return a bytes object. Patch "
"by Oren Milman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31271`: 修复当编码器未返回字节对象时，``io.TextIOWrapper``的 ``write()`` "
"方法中的断言失败。由Oren Milman提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42397 ../NEWS:45567
msgid ""
":issue:`31243`: Fix a crash in some methods of ``io.TextIOWrapper``, when "
"the decoder's state is invalid. Patch by Oren Milman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31243`: 修复当解码器状态无效时，``io.TextIOWrapper``的某些方法中的崩溃问题。由Oren "
"Milman提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42400 ../NEWS:45570
msgid ""
":issue:`30721`: ``print`` now shows correct usage hint for using Python 2 "
"redirection syntax.  Patch by Sanyam Khurana."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30721`: ``print`` 现在显示使用Python 2重定向语法的正确用法提示。由Sanyam Khurana提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42403 ../NEWS:45573
msgid ":issue:`31070`: Fix a race condition in importlib _get_module_lock()."
msgstr ":issue:`31070`: 修复importlib中_get_module_lock()的竞态条件。"

#: ../NEWS:42405
msgid ""
":issue:`30747`: Add a non-dummy implementation of _Py_atomic_store and "
"_Py_atomic_load on MSVC."
msgstr ":issue:`30747`: 在MSVC上添加_Py_atomic_store和_Py_atomic_load的非虚拟实现。"

#: ../NEWS:42408 ../NEWS:45575 ../NEWS:49883
msgid ""
":issue:`31095`: Fix potential crash during GC caused by ``tp_dealloc`` which"
" doesn't call ``PyObject_GC_UnTrack()``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31095`: 修复由未调用 ``PyObject_GC_UnTrack()`` 的 ``tp_dealloc`` "
"引起的GC期间潜在崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:42411 ../NEWS:45578
msgid ""
":issue:`31071`: Avoid masking original TypeError in call with * unpacking "
"when other arguments are passed."
msgstr ":issue:`31071`: 当传递其他参数时，避免在使用*解包调用中掩盖原始TypeError。"

#: ../NEWS:42414 ../NEWS:45581
msgid ""
":issue:`30978`: str.format_map() now passes key lookup exceptions through. "
"Previously any exception was replaced with a KeyError exception."
msgstr ":issue:`30978`: str.format_map()现在传递键查找异常。之前任何异常都被替换为KeyError异常。"

#: ../NEWS:42417 ../NEWS:45584
msgid ""
":issue:`30808`: Use _Py_atomic API for concurrency-sensitive signal state."
msgstr ":issue:`30808`: 对并发敏感的信号状态使用_Py_atomic API。"

#: ../NEWS:42419 ../NEWS:45586 ../NEWS:49944
msgid ""
":issue:`30876`: Relative import from unloaded package now reimports the "
"package instead of failing with SystemError.  Relative import from non-"
"package now fails with ImportError rather than SystemError."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30876`: "
"从未加载的包中进行相对导入现在会重新导入包，而不是因SystemError失败。从非包中进行相对导入现在会因ImportError而非SystemError失败。"

#: ../NEWS:42423 ../NEWS:45590
msgid ""
":issue:`30703`: Improve signal delivery. Avoid using Py_AddPendingCall from "
"signal handler, to avoid calling signal-unsafe functions. The tests I'm "
"adding here fail without the rest of the patch, on Linux and OS X. This "
"means our signal delivery logic had defects (some signals could be lost)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30703`: "
"改进信号传递。避免在信号处理程序中使用Py_AddPendingCall，以避免调用信号不安全函数。这里添加的测试在没有补丁的其他部分的情况下，在Linux和OS"
" X上失败。这意味着我们的信号传递逻辑存在缺陷（某些信号可能会丢失）。"

#: ../NEWS:42428 ../NEWS:45595 ../NEWS:49948
msgid ""
":issue:`30765`: Avoid blocking in pthread_mutex_lock() when "
"PyThread_acquire_lock() is asked not to block."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30765`: 当PyThread_acquire_lock()被要求不阻塞时，避免在pthread_mutex_lock()中阻塞。"

#: ../NEWS:42431 ../NEWS:45598
msgid ""
":issue:`31161`: Make sure the 'Missing parentheses' syntax error message is "
"only applied to SyntaxError, not to subclasses. Patch by Martijn Pieters."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31161`: 确保'Missing "
"parentheses'语法错误消息仅应用于SyntaxError，而不是子类。补丁由Martijn Pieters提供。"

#: ../NEWS:42434 ../NEWS:45601
msgid ""
":issue:`30814`: Fixed a race condition when import a submodule from a "
"package."
msgstr ":issue:`30814`: 修复从包中导入子模块时的竞态条件。"

#: ../NEWS:42436
msgid ""
":issue:`30736`: The internal unicodedata database has been upgraded to "
"Unicode 10.0."
msgstr ":issue:`30736`: 内部unicodedata数据库已升级到Unicode 10.0。"

#: ../NEWS:42439
msgid ""
":issue:`30604`: Move co_extra_freefuncs from per-thread to per-interpreter "
"to avoid crashes."
msgstr ":issue:`30604`: 将 co_extra_freefuncs 从每线程转移到每解释器以避免崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:42442 ../NEWS:45603
msgid ""
":issue:`30597`: ``print`` now shows expected input in custom error message "
"when used as a Python 2 statement. Patch by Sanyam Khurana."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30597`: ``print`` 现在在作为 Python 2 语句使用时，自定义错误消息中显示预期的输入。由 Sanyam "
"Khurana 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42445 ../NEWS:46025
msgid ""
":issue:`30682`: Removed a too-strict assertion that failed for certain "
"f-strings, such as eval(\"f'\\\\\\n'\") and eval(\"f'\\\\\\r'\")."
msgstr ":issue:`30682`: 移除了对某些 f-字符串过于严格的断言，例如 eval(\"f'\\\\\\n'\") 和 eval(\"f'\\\\\\r'\")。"

#: ../NEWS:42448
msgid ""
":issue:`30501`: The compiler now produces more optimal code for complex "
"condition expressions in the \"if\", \"while\" and \"assert\" statement, the"
" \"if\" expression, and generator expressions and comprehensions."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30501`: 编译器现在为 \"if\"、\"while\" 和 \"assert\" 语句、\"if\" "
"表达式、生成器表达式和推导式中的复杂条件表达式生成更优化的代码。"

#: ../NEWS:42452
msgid ""
":issue:`28180`: Implement :pep:`538` (legacy C locale coercion). This means "
"that when a suitable coercion target locale is available, both the core "
"interpreter and locale-aware C extensions will assume the use of UTF-8 as "
"the default text encoding, rather than ASCII."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28180`: 实现 :pep:`538`（传统 C "
"语言环境强制）。这意味着当有合适的强制目标区域设置可用时，核心解释器和区域设置感知的 C 扩展将假定使用 UTF-8 作为默认文本编码，而不是 "
"ASCII。"

#: ../NEWS:42457
msgid ""
":issue:`30486`: Allows setting cell values for __closure__. Patch by Lisa "
"Roach."
msgstr ":issue:`30486`: 允许为 __closure__ 设置单元格值。由 Lisa Roach 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42460
msgid ""
":issue:`30537`: itertools.islice now accepts integer-like objects (having an"
" __index__ method) as start, stop, and slice arguments"
msgstr ""
":issue:`30537`: itertools.islice 现在接受类似整数的对象（具有 __index__ 方法）作为开始、停止和切片参数"

#: ../NEWS:42463
msgid ""
":issue:`25324`: Tokens needed for parsing in Python moved to C. ``COMMENT``,"
" ``NL`` and ``ENCODING``. This way the tokens and tok_names in the token "
"module don't get changed when you import the tokenize module."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25324`: Python 解析所需的令牌已移至 C。 ``COMMENT``、``NL`` 和 "
"``ENCODING``。这样，当导入 tokenize 模块时，token 模块中的令牌和 tok_names 不会被更改。"

#: ../NEWS:42467 ../NEWS:46030
msgid ":issue:`29104`: Fixed parsing backslashes in f-strings."
msgstr ":issue:`29104`: 修复了 f-字符串中反斜杠的解析。"

#: ../NEWS:42469 ../NEWS:46032 ../NEWS:49951
msgid ""
":issue:`27945`: Fixed various segfaults with dict when input collections are"
" mutated during searching, inserting or comparing.  Based on patches by "
"Duane Griffin and Tim Mitchell."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27945`: 修复了在搜索、插入或比较过程中输入集合被修改时，字典的各种段错误。基于 Duane Griffin 和 Tim "
"Mitchell 的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42473 ../NEWS:46036 ../NEWS:49955
msgid ""
":issue:`25794`: Fixed type.__setattr__() and type.__delattr__() for non-"
"interned attribute names.  Based on patch by Eryk Sun."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25794`: 修复了 type.__setattr__() 和 type.__delattr__() 对于非 interned "
"属性名称的问题。基于 Eryk Sun 的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42476 ../NEWS:46039
msgid ""
":issue:`30039`: If a KeyboardInterrupt happens when the interpreter is in "
"the middle of resuming a chain of nested 'yield from' or 'await' calls, it's"
" now correctly delivered to the innermost frame."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30039`: 如果解释器在恢复一系列嵌套的 'yield from' 或 'await' 调用过程中发生 "
"KeyboardInterrupt，现在会正确地传递到最内层的帧。"

#: ../NEWS:42480
msgid ""
":issue:`28974`: ``object.__format__(x, '')`` is now equivalent to ``str(x)``"
" rather than ``format(str(self), '')``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28974`: ``object.__format__(x, '')`` 现在等同于 ``str(x)`` 而不是 "
"``format(str(self), '')``。"

#: ../NEWS:42483
msgid ""
":issue:`30024`: Circular imports involving absolute imports with binding a "
"submodule to a name are now supported."
msgstr ":issue:`30024`: 现在支持涉及绝对导入并将子模块绑定到名称的循环导入。"

#: ../NEWS:42486 ../NEWS:46043
msgid ""
":issue:`12414`: sys.getsizeof() on a code object now returns the sizes which"
" includes the code struct and sizes of objects which it references. Patch by"
" Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`12414`: sys.getsizeof() 在代码对象上现在返回的大小包括代码结构及其引用对象的大小。由 Donghee Na "
"提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42490
msgid ""
":issue:`29839`: len() now raises ValueError rather than OverflowError if "
"__len__() returned a large negative integer."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29839`: 如果 __len__() 返回一个大的负整数，len() 现在会引发 ValueError 而不是 "
"OverflowError。"

#: ../NEWS:42493
msgid ""
":issue:`11913`: README.rst is now included in the list of distutils standard"
" READMEs and therefore included in source distributions."
msgstr ""
":issue:`11913`: README.rst 现在被包含在 distutils 标准 README 列表中，因此也包含在源代码分发中。"

#: ../NEWS:42496
msgid ""
":issue:`29914`: Fixed default implementations of __reduce__ and "
"__reduce_ex__(). object.__reduce__() no longer takes arguments, "
"object.__reduce_ex__() now requires one argument."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29914`: 修复了 __reduce__ 和 __reduce_ex__() 的默认实现。object.__reduce__() "
"不再接受参数，object.__reduce_ex__() 现在需要一个参数。"

#: ../NEWS:42500 ../NEWS:46047
msgid ""
":issue:`29949`: Fix memory usage regression of set and frozenset object."
msgstr ":issue:`29949`: 修复了 set 和 frozenset 对象的内存使用回归问题。"

#: ../NEWS:42502 ../NEWS:46049 ../NEWS:49958
msgid ""
":issue:`29935`: Fixed error messages in the index() method of tuple, list "
"and deque when pass indices of wrong type."
msgstr ":issue:`29935`: 修复了在传递错误类型的索引时，tuple、list 和 deque 的 index() 方法中的错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:42505
msgid ""
":issue:`29816`: Shift operation now has less opportunity to raise "
"OverflowError. ValueError always is raised rather than OverflowError for "
"negative counts. Shifting zero with non-negative count always returns zero."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29816`: 移位操作现在引发 OverflowError 的机会更少。对于负计数，总是引发 ValueError 而不是 "
"OverflowError。用非负计数移位零总是返回零。"

#: ../NEWS:42510
msgid ""
":issue:`24821`: Fixed the slowing down to 25 times in the searching of some "
"unlucky Unicode characters."
msgstr ":issue:`24821`: 修复了在某些不幸的 Unicode 字符搜索中减慢到 25 倍的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:42513
msgid ""
":issue:`29102`: Add a unique ID to PyInterpreterState.  This makes it easier"
" to identify each subinterpreter."
msgstr ":issue:`29102`: 向 PyInterpreterState 添加了一个唯一 ID。这使得更容易识别每个子解释器。"

#: ../NEWS:42516
msgid ""
":issue:`29894`: The deprecation warning is emitted if __complex__ returns an"
" instance of a strict subclass of complex.  In a future versions of Python "
"this can be an error."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29894`: 如果 __complex__ 返回一个严格子类的实例，则会发出弃用警告。在 Python "
"的未来版本中，这可能是一个错误。"

#: ../NEWS:42520 ../NEWS:46052
msgid ""
":issue:`29859`: Show correct error messages when any of the pthread_* calls "
"in thread_pthread.h fails."
msgstr ":issue:`29859`: 当 thread_pthread.h 中的任何 pthread_* 调用失败时，显示正确的错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:42523
msgid ""
":issue:`29849`: Fix a memory leak when an ImportError is raised during from "
"import."
msgstr ":issue:`29849`: 修复了在从导入期间引发 ImportError 时的内存泄漏。"

#: ../NEWS:42526 ../NEWS:46060
msgid ""
":issue:`28856`: Fix an oversight that %b format for bytes should support "
"objects follow the buffer protocol."
msgstr ":issue:`28856`: 修复了一个疏忽，即 %b 格式的字节应支持遵循缓冲区协议的对象。"

#: ../NEWS:42529 ../NEWS:46367
msgid ""
":issue:`29723`: The ``sys.path[0]`` initialization change for :issue:`29139`"
" caused a regression by revealing an inconsistency in how sys.path is "
"initialized when executing ``__main__`` from a zipfile, directory, or other "
"import location. The interpreter now consistently avoids ever adding the "
"import location's parent directory to ``sys.path``, and ensures no other "
"``sys.path`` entries are inadvertently modified when inserting the import "
"location named on the command line."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29723`: :issue:`29139` 中对 ``sys.path[0]`` 初始化的更改导致了一个回归问题，暴露了在执行来自 "
"zip 文件、目录或其他导入位置的 ``__main__`` 时 ``sys.path`` "
"初始化方式的不一致性。解释器现在一致避免将导入位置的父目录添加到 ``sys.path`` 中，并确保在插入命令行中指定的导入位置时不会无意中修改其他 "
"``sys.path`` 条目。"

#: ../NEWS:42537
msgid ""
":issue:`29568`: Escaped percent \"%%\" in the format string for classic "
"string formatting no longer allows any characters between two percents."
msgstr ":issue:`29568`: 经典字符串格式化格式字符串中的转义百分号 \"%%\" 不再允许两个百分号之间存在任何字符。"

#: ../NEWS:42540 ../NEWS:46063
msgid ""
":issue:`29714`: Fix a regression that bytes format may fail when containing "
"zero bytes inside."
msgstr ":issue:`29714`: 修复了一个回归问题，即当包含零字节时，字节格式可能会失败。"

#: ../NEWS:42543
msgid ""
":issue:`29695`: bool(), float(), list() and tuple() no longer take keyword "
"arguments. The first argument of int() can now be passes only as positional "
"argument."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29695`: bool()、float()、list() 和 tuple() 不再接受关键字参数。int() "
"的第一个参数现在只能作为位置参数传递。"

#: ../NEWS:42547 ../NEWS:46391
msgid ""
":issue:`28893`: Set correct __cause__ for errors about invalid awaitables "
"returned from __aiter__ and __anext__."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28893`: 为从 __aiter__ 和 __anext__ 返回的无效可等待对象引发的错误设置了正确的 __cause__。"

#: ../NEWS:42550 ../NEWS:46055 ../NEWS:49961
msgid ""
":issue:`28876`: ``bool(range)`` works even if ``len(range)`` raises "
":exc:`OverflowError`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28876`: 即使 ``len(range)`` 引发 :exc:`OverflowError`，``bool(range)`` "
"也能正常工作。"

#: ../NEWS:42553 ../NEWS:46394
msgid ""
":issue:`29683`: Fixes to memory allocation in _PyCode_SetExtra.  Patch by "
"Brian Coleman."
msgstr ":issue:`29683`: 修复了 _PyCode_SetExtra 中的内存分配问题。由 Brian Coleman 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42556 ../NEWS:46397
msgid ""
":issue:`29684`: Fix minor regression of PyEval_CallObjectWithKeywords. It "
"should raise TypeError when kwargs is not a dict.  But it might cause segv "
"when args=NULL and kwargs is not a dict."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29684`: 修复了 PyEval_CallObjectWithKeywords 的一个小回归问题。当 kwargs "
"不是字典时，它应该引发 TypeError。但当 args=NULL 且 kwargs 不是字典时，可能会导致段错误。"

#: ../NEWS:42560 ../NEWS:46401 ../NEWS:49972
msgid ""
":issue:`28598`: Support __rmod__ for subclasses of str being called before "
"str.__mod__. Patch by Martijn Pieters."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28598`: 支持在调用 str.__mod__ 之前调用 str 子类的 __rmod__。由 Martijn Pieters "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42563 ../NEWS:46404
msgid ""
":issue:`29607`: Fix stack_effect computation for CALL_FUNCTION_EX. Patch by "
"Matthieu Dartiailh."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29607`: 修复了 CALL_FUNCTION_EX 的 stack_effect 计算。补丁由 Matthieu "
"Dartiailh 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:42566 ../NEWS:46407 ../NEWS:49975
msgid ""
":issue:`29602`: Fix incorrect handling of signed zeros in complex "
"constructor for complex subclasses and for inputs having a __complex__ "
"method. Patch by Serhiy Storchaka."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29602`: 修复了在复杂子类的构造函数和具有 __complex__ 方法的输入中对有符号零的错误处理。由 Serhiy "
"Storchaka 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42570 ../NEWS:46411 ../NEWS:49979
msgid ""
":issue:`29347`: Fixed possibly dereferencing undefined pointers when "
"creating weakref objects."
msgstr ":issue:`29347`: 修复了在创建弱引用对象时可能解引用未定义指针的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:42573
msgid ""
":issue:`29463`: Add ``docstring`` field to Module, ClassDef, FunctionDef, "
"and AsyncFunctionDef ast nodes.  docstring is not first stmt in their body "
"anymore.  It affects ``co_firstlineno`` and ``co_lnotab`` of code object for"
" module and class. (Reverted in :issue:`32911`.)"
msgstr ""
":issue:`29463`: 向Module、ClassDef、FunctionDef和AsyncFunctionDef ast节点添加 "
"``docstring``字段。docstring不再是它们体中的第一个stmt。这影响了模块和类的代码对象的 ``co_firstlineno``和 "
"``co_lnotab``。（在 :issue:`32911` 中恢复。）"

#: ../NEWS:42578 ../NEWS:46414 ../NEWS:49982
msgid ":issue:`29438`: Fixed use-after-free problem in key sharing dict."
msgstr ":issue:`29438`: 修复了key sharing dict中的use-after-free问题。"

#: ../NEWS:42580
msgid ""
":issue:`29546`: Set the 'path' and 'name' attribute on ImportError for "
"``from ... import ...``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29546`: 为 ``from ... import ...`` 设置了ImportError的'path'和'name'属性。"

#: ../NEWS:42583
msgid ":issue:`29546`: Improve from-import error message with location"
msgstr ":issue:`29546`: 使用位置改进了from-import错误消息"

#: ../NEWS:42585 ../NEWS:46066 ../NEWS:49989
msgid ""
":issue:`29478`: If max_line_length=None is specified while using the "
"Compat32 policy, it is no longer ignored.  Patch by Mircea Cosbuc."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29478`: 在使用Compat32策略时，如果指定了max_line_length=None，它将不再被忽略。补丁由Mircea "
"Cosbuc提供。"

#: ../NEWS:42588 ../NEWS:46416 ../NEWS:49984
msgid ":issue:`29319`: Prevent RunMainFromImporter overwriting sys.path[0]."
msgstr ":issue:`29319`: 防止RunMainFromImporter覆盖sys.path[0]。"

#: ../NEWS:42590 ../NEWS:46418 ../NEWS:49986
msgid ""
":issue:`29337`: Fixed possible BytesWarning when compare the code objects. "
"Warnings could be emitted at compile time."
msgstr ":issue:`29337`: 修复了比较代码对象时可能出现的BytesWarning。警告可能在编译时发出。"

#: ../NEWS:42593 ../NEWS:46421
msgid ""
":issue:`29327`: Fixed a crash when pass the iterable keyword argument to "
"sorted()."
msgstr ":issue:`29327`: 修复了将可迭代关键字参数传递给sorted()时崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:42596 ../NEWS:46424
msgid ""
":issue:`29034`: Fix memory leak and use-after-free in os module "
"(path_converter)."
msgstr ":issue:`29034`: 修复了os模块(path_converter)中的内存泄漏和use-after-free问题。"

#: ../NEWS:42599 ../NEWS:46427
msgid ""
":issue:`29159`: Fix regression in bytes(x) when x.__index__() raises "
"Exception."
msgstr ":issue:`29159`: 修复了当x.__index__()引发异常时bytes(x)的回归问题。"

#: ../NEWS:42601
msgid ""
":issue:`29049`: Call _PyObject_GC_TRACK() lazily when calling Python "
"function. Calling function is up to 5% faster."
msgstr ":issue:`29049`: 在调用Python函数时懒惰地调用_PyObject_GC_TRACK()。调用函数速度提高了5%。"

#: ../NEWS:42604
msgid ""
":issue:`28927`: bytes.fromhex() and bytearray.fromhex() now ignore all ASCII"
" whitespace, not only spaces.  Patch by Robert Xiao."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28927`: "
"bytes.fromhex()和bytearray.fromhex()现在忽略所有ASCII空白字符，而不仅仅是空格。由Robert Xiao提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42607 ../NEWS:46429 ../NEWS:50347
msgid ":issue:`28932`: Do not include <sys/random.h> if it does not exist."
msgstr ":issue:`28932`: 如果不存在<sys/random.h>，则不包含它。"

#: ../NEWS:42609 ../NEWS:46431 ../NEWS:50352
msgid ""
":issue:`25677`: Correct the positioning of the syntax error caret for "
"indented blocks. Based on patch by Michael Layzell."
msgstr ":issue:`25677`: 修正了缩进块语法错误提示符的位置。基于Michael Layzell的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42612 ../NEWS:46434 ../NEWS:50355
msgid ""
":issue:`29000`: Fixed bytes formatting of octals with zero padding in "
"alternate form."
msgstr ":issue:`29000`: 修复了八进制数在交替形式下零填充的bytes格式化。"

#: ../NEWS:42615
msgid ""
":issue:`18896`: Python function can now have more than 255 parameters. "
"collections.namedtuple() now supports tuples with more than 255 elements."
msgstr ""
":issue:`18896`: "
"Python函数现在可以有超过255个参数。collections.namedtuple()现在支持超过255个元素的元组。"

#: ../NEWS:42618
msgid ""
":issue:`28596`: The preferred encoding is UTF-8 on Android. Patch written by"
" Chi Hsuan Yen."
msgstr ":issue:`28596`: 在Android上，首选编码是UTF-8。补丁由Chi Hsuan Yen编写。"

#: ../NEWS:42621
msgid ":issue:`22257`: Clean up interpreter startup (see :pep:`432`)."
msgstr ":issue:`22257`: 清理解释器启动（参见 :pep:`432`）。"

#: ../NEWS:42623 ../NEWS:46437
msgid ""
":issue:`26919`: On Android, operating system data is now always "
"encoded/decoded to/from UTF-8, instead of the locale encoding to avoid "
"inconsistencies with os.fsencode() and os.fsdecode() which are already using"
" UTF-8."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26919`: "
"在Android上，操作系统数据现在总是以UTF-8编码/解码，而不是使用区域设置编码，以避免与已经使用UTF-8的os.fsencode()和os.fsdecode()不一致。"

#: ../NEWS:42627 ../NEWS:46441
msgid ""
":issue:`28991`: functools.lru_cache() was susceptible to an obscure "
"reentrancy bug triggerable by a monkey-patched len() function."
msgstr ":issue:`28991`: functools.lru_cache()容易受到一个由猴子补丁len()函数触发的晦涩的重入错误的影响。"

#: ../NEWS:42630 ../NEWS:46715
msgid ""
":issue:`28147`: Fix a memory leak in split-table dictionaries: setattr() "
"must not convert combined table into split table. Patch written by INADA "
"Naoki."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28147`: 修复了分割表字典中的内存泄漏：setattr()不能将合并表转换为分割表。补丁由INADA Naoki编写。"

#: ../NEWS:42633 ../NEWS:46444
msgid ""
":issue:`28739`: f-string expressions are no longer accepted as docstrings "
"and by ast.literal_eval() even if they do not include expressions."
msgstr ":issue:`28739`: f字符串表达式不再被接受为文档字符串和由ast.literal_eval()处理，即使它们不包含表达式。"

#: ../NEWS:42636 ../NEWS:46447 ../NEWS:50358
msgid ""
":issue:`28512`: Fixed setting the offset attribute of SyntaxError by "
"PyErr_SyntaxLocationEx() and PyErr_SyntaxLocationObject()."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28512`: "
"修复了通过PyErr_SyntaxLocationEx()和PyErr_SyntaxLocationObject()设置SyntaxError的offset属性。"

#: ../NEWS:42639 ../NEWS:46450
msgid ""
":issue:`28918`: Fix the cross compilation of xxlimited when Python has been "
"built with Py_DEBUG defined."
msgstr ":issue:`28918`: 修复了当Python使用Py_DEBUG定义构建时，xxlimited的交叉编译问题。"

#: ../NEWS:42642 ../NEWS:46745
msgid ""
":issue:`23722`: Rather than silently producing a class that doesn't support "
"zero-argument ``super()`` in methods, failing to pass the new "
"``__classcell__`` namespace entry up to ``type.__new__`` now results in a "
"``DeprecationWarning`` and a class that supports zero-argument ``super()``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23722`: 而不是无声地产生一个不支持方法中零参数 ``super()`` "
"的类，未能将新的``__classcell__``命名空间条目传递给 ``type.__new__`` 现在会导致一个 "
"``DeprecationWarning`` 和一个支持零参数 ``super()`` 的类。"

#: ../NEWS:42648 ../NEWS:46751
msgid ""
":issue:`28797`: Modifying the class __dict__ inside the __set_name__ method "
"of a descriptor that is used inside that class no longer prevents calling "
"the __set_name__ method of other descriptors."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28797`: "
"修改类__dict__在一个描述符的__set_name__方法内部，该描述符在那个类内部使用，不再阻止调用其他描述符的__set_name__方法。"

#: ../NEWS:42652
msgid ""
":issue:`28799`: Remove the ``PyEval_GetCallStats()`` function and deprecate "
"the untested and undocumented ``sys.callstats()`` function. Remove the "
"``CALL_PROFILE`` special build: use the :func:`sys.setprofile` function, "
":mod:`cProfile` or :mod:`profile` to profile function calls."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28799`: 移除 ``PyEval_GetCallStats()`` "
"函数并弃用未测试和未文档化的``sys.callstats()``函数。移除 ``CALL_PROFILE`` 特殊构建：使用 "
":func:`sys.setprofile` 函数、:mod:`cProfile` 或 :mod:`profile` 来分析函数调用。"

#: ../NEWS:42657
msgid ""
":issue:`12844`: More than 255 arguments can now be passed to a function."
msgstr ":issue:`12844`: 现在可以向一个函数传递超过255个参数。"

#: ../NEWS:42659 ../NEWS:46755
msgid ""
":issue:`28782`: Fix a bug in the implementation ``yield from`` when checking"
" if the next instruction is YIELD_FROM. Regression introduced by WORDCODE "
"(:issue:`26647`)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28782`: 修复了在检查下一条指令是否为YIELD_FROM时 ``yield from`` "
"实现中的一个错误。由WORDCODE(:issue:`26647`)引入的回归问题。"

#: ../NEWS:42663
msgid ""
":issue:`28774`: Fix error position of the unicode error in ASCII and Latin1 "
"encoders when a string returned by the error handler contains multiple non-"
"encodable characters (non-ASCII for the ASCII codec, characters out of the "
"U+0000-U+00FF range for Latin1)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28774`: "
"修复ASCII和Latin1编码器中当错误处理程序返回的字符串包含多个不可编码字符（对于ASCII编解码器是非ASCII字符，对于Latin1是超出U+0000-U+00FF范围的字符）时的错误位置。"

#: ../NEWS:42668 ../NEWS:46453
msgid ""
":issue:`28731`: Optimize _PyDict_NewPresized() to create correct size dict. "
"Improve speed of dict literal with constant keys up to 30%."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28731`: 优化_PyDict_NewPresized()以创建正确大小的字典。将具有常量键的字典字面量的速度提高至30%。"

#: ../NEWS:42671 ../NEWS:46809
msgid ":issue:`28532`: Show sys.version when -V option is supplied twice."
msgstr ":issue:`28532`: 当提供-V选项两次时显示sys.version。"

#: ../NEWS:42673 ../NEWS:46811
msgid ""
":issue:`27100`: The with-statement now checks for __enter__ before it checks"
" for __exit__. This gives less confusing error messages when both methods "
"are missing. Patch by Jonathan Ellington."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27100`: "
"with语句现在在检查__exit__之前先检查__enter__。当两种方法都缺失时，这会给出不那么令人困惑的错误信息。由Jonathan "
"Ellington提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42677 ../NEWS:46815
msgid ""
":issue:`28746`: Fix the set_inheritable() file descriptor method on "
"platforms that do not have the ioctl FIOCLEX and FIONCLEX commands."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28746`: 在没有ioctl FIOCLEX和FIONCLEX命令的平台上修复set_inheritable()文件描述符方法。"

#: ../NEWS:42680 ../NEWS:46818
msgid ""
":issue:`26920`: Fix not getting the locale's charset upon initializing the "
"interpreter, on platforms that do not have langinfo."
msgstr ":issue:`26920`: 在没有langinfo的平台上修复初始化解释器时未获取区域设置的字符集的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:42683 ../NEWS:46821 ../NEWS:50364
msgid ""
":issue:`28648`: Fixed crash in Py_DecodeLocale() in debug build on Mac OS X "
"when decode astral characters.  Patch by Xiang Zhang."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28648`: 修复了在Mac OS X上调试版本中解码星体字符时Py_DecodeLocale()崩溃的问题。补丁由Xiang "
"Zhang提供。"

#: ../NEWS:42686 ../NEWS:46827
msgid ":issue:`28665`: Improve speed of the STORE_DEREF opcode by 40%."
msgstr ":issue:`28665`: 将STORE_DEREF操作码的速度提高40%。"

#: ../NEWS:42688 ../NEWS:46824 ../NEWS:50367
msgid ""
":issue:`19398`: Extra slash no longer added to sys.path components in case "
"of empty compile-time PYTHONPATH components."
msgstr ":issue:`19398`: 在编译时PYTHONPATH组件为空的情况下，不再向sys.path组件添加额外的斜杠。"

#: ../NEWS:42691
msgid ""
":issue:`28621`: Sped up converting int to float by reusing faster bits "
"counting implementation.  Patch by Adrian Wielgosik."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28621`: 通过重用更快的位数计数实现，加快了将int转换为float的速度。由Adrian Wielgosik提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42694
msgid ""
":issue:`28580`: Optimize iterating split table values. Patch by Xiang Zhang."
msgstr ":issue:`28580`: 优化了迭代分割表值。由Xiang Zhang提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42696 ../NEWS:46829
msgid ""
":issue:`28583`: PyDict_SetDefault didn't combine split table when needed. "
"Patch by Xiang Zhang."
msgstr ":issue:`28583`: PyDict_SetDefault在需要时未合并分割表。由Xiang Zhang提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42699 ../NEWS:46923
msgid ""
":issue:`28128`: Deprecation warning for invalid str and byte escape "
"sequences now prints better information about where the error occurs. Patch "
"by Serhiy Storchaka and Eric Smith."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28128`: 无效的str和byte转义序列的弃用警告现在会打印出关于错误发生位置的更好信息。由Serhiy "
"Storchaka和Eric Smith提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42703 ../NEWS:46927
msgid ""
":issue:`28509`: dict.update() no longer allocate unnecessary large memory."
msgstr ":issue:`28509`: dict.update()不再分配不必要的大内存。"

#: ../NEWS:42705 ../NEWS:46929 ../NEWS:50370
msgid ""
":issue:`28426`: Fixed potential crash in PyUnicode_AsDecodedObject() in "
"debug build."
msgstr ":issue:`28426`: 修复了调试版本中PyUnicode_AsDecodedObject()潜在的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:42708 ../NEWS:46932
msgid ""
":issue:`28517`: Fixed of-by-one error in the peephole optimizer that caused "
"keeping unreachable code."
msgstr ":issue:`28517`: 修复了窥孔优化器中的一个偏移错误，该错误导致保留无法到达的代码。"

#: ../NEWS:42711 ../NEWS:46935
msgid ""
":issue:`28214`: Improved exception reporting for problematic __set_name__ "
"attributes."
msgstr ":issue:`28214`: 改进了对有问题的 __set_name__ 属性的异常报告。"

#: ../NEWS:42714 ../NEWS:46938 ../NEWS:50373
msgid ""
":issue:`23782`: Fixed possible memory leak in _PyTraceback_Add() and "
"exception loss in PyTraceBack_Here()."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23782`: 修复了 _PyTraceback_Add() 中可能的内存泄漏和 PyTraceBack_Here() "
"中的异常丢失问题。"

#: ../NEWS:42717 ../NEWS:47047
msgid ":issue:`28183`: Optimize and cleanup dict iteration."
msgstr ":issue:`28183`: 优化并清理了字典迭代。"

#: ../NEWS:42719 ../NEWS:47049
msgid ""
":issue:`26081`: Added C implementation of asyncio.Future. Original patch by "
"Yury Selivanov."
msgstr ":issue:`26081`: 添加了 asyncio.Future 的 C 实现。原始由 Yury Selivanov 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42722 ../NEWS:47052 ../NEWS:50376
msgid ""
":issue:`28379`: Added sanity checks and tests for "
"PyUnicode_CopyCharacters(). Patch by Xiang Zhang."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28379`: 为 PyUnicode_CopyCharacters() 添加了健全性检查和测试。由 Xiang Zhang 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42725 ../NEWS:47055 ../NEWS:50379
msgid ""
":issue:`28376`: The type of long range iterator is now registered as "
"Iterator. Patch by Oren Milman."
msgstr ":issue:`28376`: 长范围迭代器的类型现在注册为 Iterator。由 Oren Milman 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42728
msgid ""
":issue:`28376`: Creating instances of range_iterator by calling "
"range_iterator type now is disallowed.  Calling iter() on range instance is "
"the only way. Patch by Oren Milman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28376`: 现在不允许通过调用 range_iterator 类型来创建 range_iterator 实例。调用 iter() "
"方法是唯一的方式。由 Oren Milman 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42732 ../NEWS:47064 ../NEWS:50385
msgid ""
":issue:`26906`: Resolving special methods of uninitialized type now causes "
"implicit initialization of the type instead of a fail."
msgstr ":issue:`26906`: 现在解析未初始化类型的特殊方法会导致类型的隐式初始化而不是失败。"

#: ../NEWS:42735 ../NEWS:47067 ../NEWS:50388
msgid ""
":issue:`18287`: PyType_Ready() now checks that tp_name is not NULL. Original"
" patch by Niklas Koep."
msgstr ""
":issue:`18287`: PyType_Ready() 现在检查 tp_name 是否为 NULL。原始由 Niklas Koep 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42738 ../NEWS:47070 ../NEWS:50391
msgid ""
":issue:`24098`: Fixed possible crash when AST is changed in process of "
"compiling it."
msgstr ":issue:`24098`: 修复了在编译过程中 AST 被更改时可能发生的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:42741 ../NEWS:47073
msgid ""
":issue:`28201`: Dict reduces possibility of 2nd conflict in hash table when "
"hashes have same lower bits."
msgstr ":issue:`28201`: 当哈希值具有相同的低位时，字典减少了哈希表中第二次冲突的可能性。"

#: ../NEWS:42744 ../NEWS:47076 ../NEWS:50394
msgid ""
":issue:`28350`: String constants with null character no longer interned."
msgstr ":issue:`28350`: 不再对含有空字符的字符串常量进行内部化。"

#: ../NEWS:42746 ../NEWS:47078 ../NEWS:50396
msgid ":issue:`26617`: Fix crash when GC runs during weakref callbacks."
msgstr ":issue:`26617`: 修复了在弱引用回调过程中运行垃圾收集时发生的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:42748 ../NEWS:47080 ../NEWS:50398
msgid ""
":issue:`27942`: String constants now interned recursively in tuples and "
"frozensets."
msgstr ":issue:`27942`: 现在在元组和冻结集合中递归内部化字符串常量。"

#: ../NEWS:42751
msgid ""
":issue:`28289`: ImportError.__init__ now resets not specified attributes."
msgstr ":issue:`28289`: ImportError.__init__ 现在重置未指定的属性。"

#: ../NEWS:42753 ../NEWS:47083 ../NEWS:50401
msgid ""
":issue:`21578`: Fixed misleading error message when ImportError called with "
"invalid keyword args."
msgstr ":issue:`21578`: 修复了当 ImportError 使用无效关键字参数调用时误导性的错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:42756 ../NEWS:47086
msgid ""
":issue:`28203`: Fix incorrect type in complex(1.0, {2:3}) error message. "
"Patch by Soumya Sharma."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28203`: 修复了 complex(1.0, {2:3}) 错误消息中的不正确类型。补丁由 Soumya Sharma 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:42759 ../NEWS:47089
msgid ""
":issue:`28086`: Single var-positional argument of tuple subtype was passed "
"unscathed to the C-defined function.  Now it is converted to exact tuple."
msgstr ":issue:`28086`: 元组子类型的单个可变位置参数现在被转换为确切的元组，而不是原封不动地传递给 C 定义的函数。"

#: ../NEWS:42762 ../NEWS:47092
msgid ""
":issue:`28214`: Now __set_name__ is looked up on the class instead of the "
"instance."
msgstr ":issue:`28214`: 现在 __set_name__ 是在类上查找而不是在实例上查找。"

#: ../NEWS:42765 ../NEWS:47095 ../NEWS:50407
msgid ""
":issue:`27955`: Fallback on reading /dev/urandom device when the getrandom()"
" syscall fails with EPERM, for example when blocked by SECCOMP."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27955`: 当 getrandom() 系统调用因 EPERM 失败时（例如被 SECCOMP 阻止时），回退读取 "
"/dev/urandom 设备。"

#: ../NEWS:42768 ../NEWS:47098
msgid ":issue:`28192`: Don't import readline in isolated mode."
msgstr ":issue:`28192`: 在隔离模式下不导入readline。"

#: ../NEWS:42770
msgid ""
":issue:`27441`: Remove some redundant assignments to ob_size in "
"longobject.c. Thanks Oren Milman."
msgstr ":issue:`27441`: 移除longobject.c中一些对ob_size的冗余赋值。感谢Oren Milman。"

#: ../NEWS:42773
msgid ""
":issue:`27222`: Clean up redundant code in long_rshift function. Thanks Oren"
" Milman."
msgstr ":issue:`27222`: 清理long_rshift函数中的冗余代码。感谢Oren Milman。"

#: ../NEWS:42776 ../NEWS:47100
msgid "Upgrade internal unicode databases to Unicode version 9.0.0."
msgstr "升级内部unicode数据库至Unicode 9.0.0版本。"

#: ../NEWS:42778 ../NEWS:47102 ../NEWS:50410
msgid ""
":issue:`28131`: Fix a regression in zipimport's compile_source().  zipimport"
" should use the same optimization level as the interpreter."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28131`: 修复zipimport的compile_source()中的回归问题。zipimport应使用与解释器相同的优化级别。"

#: ../NEWS:42781 ../NEWS:47105
msgid ""
":issue:`28126`: Replace Py_MEMCPY with memcpy(). Visual Studio can properly "
"optimize memcpy()."
msgstr ":issue:`28126`: 用memcpy()替换Py_MEMCPY。Visual Studio能正确优化memcpy()。"

#: ../NEWS:42784 ../NEWS:47108
msgid ""
":issue:`28120`: Fix dict.pop() for split dictionary when trying to remove a "
"\"pending key\" (Not yet inserted in split-table). Patch by Xiang Zhang."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28120`: 当尝试移除\"待定键\"（尚未插入分裂表的键）时，修复split字典的dict.pop()。由Xiang "
"Zhang提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42787 ../NEWS:47111
msgid ""
":issue:`26182`: Raise DeprecationWarning when async and await keywords are "
"used as variable/attribute/class/function name."
msgstr ":issue:`26182`: 当async和await关键字被用作变量/属性/类/函数名时，发出DeprecationWarning。"

#: ../NEWS:42790 ../NEWS:46836
msgid ":issue:`26182`: Fix a refleak in code that raises DeprecationWarning."
msgstr ":issue:`26182`: 修复在引发DeprecationWarning的代码中的内存泄漏。"

#: ../NEWS:42792 ../NEWS:46838
msgid ""
":issue:`28721`: Fix asynchronous generators aclose() and athrow() to handle "
"StopAsyncIteration propagation properly."
msgstr ":issue:`28721`: 修复异步生成器的aclose()和athrow()以正确处理StopAsyncIteration传播。"

#: ../NEWS:42795
msgid ""
":issue:`26110`: Speed-up method calls: add LOAD_METHOD and CALL_METHOD "
"opcodes."
msgstr ":issue:`26110`: 加速方法调用：添加LOAD_METHOD和CALL_METHOD操作码。"

#: ../NEWS:42800 ../NEWS:45609
msgid ""
":issue:`31499`: xml.etree: Fix a crash when a parser is part of a reference "
"cycle."
msgstr ":issue:`31499`: xml.etree：修复当解析器是引用循环的一部分时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:42803 ../NEWS:45331
msgid ":issue:`31482`: ``random.seed()`` now works with bytes in version=1"
msgstr ":issue:`31482`: ``random.seed()`` 现在在version=1时可以与bytes一起工作。"

#: ../NEWS:42805 ../NEWS:45612
msgid ""
":issue:`28556`: typing.get_type_hints now finds the right globalns for "
"classes and modules by default (when no ``globalns`` was specified by the "
"caller)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28556`: typing.get_type_hints现在默认（当调用者未指定 ``globalns`` "
"时）为类和模块找到正确的globalns。"

#: ../NEWS:42808 ../NEWS:45615
msgid ""
":issue:`28556`: Speed improvements to the ``typing`` module.  Original PRs "
"by Ivan Levkivskyi and Mitar."
msgstr ":issue:`28556`: 对 ``typing`` 模块的速度改进。原始PR由Ivan Levkivskyi和Mitar提供。"

#: ../NEWS:42811 ../NEWS:45618
msgid ""
":issue:`31544`: The C accelerator module of ElementTree ignored exceptions "
"raised when looking up TreeBuilder target methods in XMLParser()."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31544`: ElementTree的C加速器模块忽略了在XMLParser()中查找TreeBuilder目标方法时引发的异常。"

#: ../NEWS:42814 ../NEWS:45621
msgid ""
":issue:`31234`: socket.create_connection() now fixes manually a reference "
"cycle: clear the variable storing the last exception on success."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31234`: socket.create_connection()现在手动修复了一个引用循环：成功时清除存储最后一个异常的变量。"

#: ../NEWS:42817 ../NEWS:45624
msgid ":issue:`31457`: LoggerAdapter objects can now be nested."
msgstr ":issue:`31457`: LoggerAdapter对象现在可以嵌套。"

#: ../NEWS:42819
msgid ""
":issue:`31431`: SSLContext.check_hostname now automatically sets "
"SSLContext.verify_mode to ssl.CERT_REQUIRED instead of failing with a "
"ValueError."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31431`: "
"SSLContext.check_hostname现在自动将SSLContext.verify_mode设置为ssl.CERT_REQUIRED，而不是以ValueError失败。"

#: ../NEWS:42823
msgid ""
":issue:`31233`: socketserver.ThreadingMixIn now keeps a list of non-daemonic"
" threads to wait until all these threads complete in server_close()."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31233`: socketserver.ThreadingMixIn 现在维护一个非守护线程列表，在 server_close() "
"中等待所有这些线程完成。"

#: ../NEWS:42826
msgid ""
":issue:`28638`: Changed the implementation strategy for "
"collections.namedtuple() to substantially reduce the use of exec() in favor "
"of precomputed methods. As a result, the *verbose* parameter and *_source* "
"attribute are no longer supported.  The benefits include 1) having a smaller"
" memory footprint for applications using multiple named tuples, 2) faster "
"creation of the named tuple class (approx 4x to 6x depending on how it is "
"measured), and 3) minor speed-ups for instance creation using __new__, "
"_make, and _replace.  (The primary patch contributor is Jelle Zijlstra with "
"further improvements by INADA Naoki, Serhiy Storchaka, and Raymond "
"Hettinger.)"
msgstr ""
":issue:`28638`: 改变了 collections.namedtuple() 的实现策略，大幅减少了 exec() "
"的使用，转而采用预计算的方法。因此，不再支持 *verbose* 参数和 *_source* 属性。这一变化带来了以下好处：1) "
"对于使用多个命名元组的应用程序，内存占用更小；2) 命名元组类的创建速度更快（大约快 4 到 6 倍，具体取决于测量方式）；3) 使用 "
"__new__、_make 和 _replace 创建实例时的速度略有提升。（主要补丁贡献者是 Jelle Zijlstra，INADA "
"Naoki、Serhiy Storchaka 和 Raymond Hettinger 进一步改进。）"

#: ../NEWS:42837 ../NEWS:45626
msgid ""
":issue:`31400`: Improves SSL error handling to avoid losing error numbers."
msgstr ":issue:`31400`: 改进了 SSL 错误处理，避免丢失错误编号。"

#: ../NEWS:42839
msgid ""
":issue:`27629`: Make return types of SSLContext.wrap_bio() and "
"SSLContext.wrap_socket() customizable."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27629`: 使 SSLContext.wrap_bio() 和 SSLContext.wrap_socket() 的返回类型可定制。"

#: ../NEWS:42842 ../NEWS:45628
msgid ""
":issue:`28958`: ssl.SSLContext() now uses OpenSSL error information when a "
"context cannot be instantiated."
msgstr ":issue:`28958`: ssl.SSLContext() 现在在无法实例化上下文时使用 OpenSSL 错误信息。"

#: ../NEWS:42845
msgid ""
":issue:`28182`: The SSL module now raises SSLCertVerificationError when "
"OpenSSL fails to verify the peer's certificate. The exception contains more "
"information about the error."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28182`: 当 OpenSSL 无法验证对等证书时，SSL 模块现在会引发 SSLCertVerificationError "
"异常。该异常包含更多关于错误的信息。"

#: ../NEWS:42849 ../NEWS:45631
msgid ""
":issue:`27340`: SSLSocket.sendall() now uses memoryview to create slices of "
"data. This fixes support for all bytes-like object. It is also more "
"efficient and avoids costly copies."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27340`: SSLSocket.sendall() 现在使用 memoryview "
"来创建数据切片。这修复了对所有类似于字节对象的支持。同时，这也更高效，避免了昂贵的复制。"

#: ../NEWS:42853
msgid ""
":issue:`14191`: A new function "
"``argparse.ArgumentParser.parse_intermixed_args`` provides the ability to "
"parse command lines where there user intermixes options and positional "
"arguments."
msgstr ""
":issue:`14191`: 新增函数 ``argparse.ArgumentParser.parse_intermixed_args`` "
"提供了解析命令行中用户混合选项和位置参数的能力。"

#: ../NEWS:42858 ../NEWS:45635
msgid ""
":issue:`31178`: Fix string concatenation bug in rare error path in the "
"subprocess module"
msgstr ":issue:`31178`: 修复了 subprocess 模块中在罕见错误路径下的字符串连接错误"

#: ../NEWS:42861 ../NEWS:45638
msgid ""
":issue:`31350`: Micro-optimize :func:`asyncio._get_running_loop` to become "
"up to 10% faster."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31350`: 对 :func:`asyncio._get_running_loop` 进行微优化，使其速度提升高达 10%。"

#: ../NEWS:42864 ../NEWS:45641 ../NEWS:49894
msgid ""
":issue:`31170`: expat: Update libexpat from 2.2.3 to 2.2.4. Fix copying of "
"partial characters for UTF-8 input (libexpat bug 115): "
"https://github.com/libexpat/libexpat/issues/115"
msgstr ""
":issue:`31170`: expat: 将 libexpat 从 2.2.3 更新至 2.2.4。修复了 UTF-8 "
"输入部分字符的复制问题（libexpat bug "
"115）：https://github.com/libexpat/libexpat/issues/115"

#: ../NEWS:42868 ../NEWS:45645
msgid ":issue:`29136`: Add TLS 1.3 cipher suites and OP_NO_TLSv1_3."
msgstr ":issue:`29136`: 添加 TLS 1.3 密码套件和 OP_NO_TLSv1_3。"

#: ../NEWS:42870
msgid ""
":issue:`1198569`: ``string.Template`` subclasses can optionally define "
"``braceidpattern`` if they want to specify different placeholder patterns "
"inside and outside the braces.  If None (the default) it falls back to "
"``idpattern``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`1198569`: ``string.Template`` 子类可以选择性地定义 "
"``braceidpattern``，如果它们想要在花括号内外指定不同的占位符模式。如果为 None（默认值），则回退到 ``idpattern``。"

#: ../NEWS:42875
msgid ""
":issue:`31326`: concurrent.futures.ProcessPoolExecutor.shutdown() now "
"explicitly closes the call queue. Moreover, shutdown(wait=True) now also "
"join the call queue thread, to prevent leaking a dangling thread."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31326`: concurrent.futures.ProcessPoolExecutor.shutdown() "
"现在显式关闭调用队列。此外，shutdown(wait=True) 现在也会加入调用队列线程，以防止泄漏悬挂线程。"

#: ../NEWS:42879 ../NEWS:45656
msgid ""
":issue:`27144`: The ``map()`` and ``as_completed()`` iterators in "
"``concurrent.futures`` now avoid keeping a reference to yielded objects."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27144`: ``concurrent.futures`` 中的 ``map()`` 和 ``as_completed()`` "
"迭代器现在避免保留对生成对象的引用。"

#: ../NEWS:42882
msgid ""
":issue:`31281`: Fix ``fileinput.FileInput(files, inplace=True)`` when "
"``files`` contain ``pathlib.Path`` objects."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31281`: 修复 ``fileinput.FileInput(files, inplace=True)`` 当 ``files`` "
"包含 ``pathlib.Path`` 对象时的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:42885 ../NEWS:45659
msgid ""
":issue:`10746`: Fix ctypes producing wrong :pep:`3118` type codes for "
"integer types."
msgstr ":issue:`10746`: 修复 ctypes 为整数类型生成错误的 :pep:`3118` 类型代码的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:42888
msgid ""
":issue:`27584`: ``AF_VSOCK`` has been added to the socket interface which "
"allows communication between virtual machines and their host."
msgstr ":issue:`27584`: ``AF_VSOCK`` 已被添加到套接字接口中，允许虚拟机与其主机之间的通信。"

#: ../NEWS:42891 ../NEWS:45662
msgid ""
":issue:`22536`: The subprocess module now sets the filename when "
"FileNotFoundError is raised on POSIX systems due to the executable or cwd "
"not being found."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22536`: 在 POSIX 系统上由于找不到可执行文件或 cwd 而引发 FileNotFoundError "
"时，子进程模块现在会设置文件名。"

#: ../NEWS:42895
msgid ""
":issue:`29741`: Update some methods in the _pyio module to also accept "
"integer types. Patch by Oren Milman."
msgstr ":issue:`29741`: 更新 _pyio 模块中的一些方法，以也接受整数类型。由 Oren Milman 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42898 ../NEWS:45666
msgid ""
":issue:`31249`: concurrent.futures: WorkItem.run() used by "
"ThreadPoolExecutor now breaks a reference cycle between an exception object "
"and the WorkItem object."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31249`: concurrent.futures: ThreadPoolExecutor 使用的 WorkItem.run() "
"现在打破了异常对象和 WorkItem 对象之间的循环引用。"

#: ../NEWS:42902 ../NEWS:45670
msgid ""
":issue:`31247`: xmlrpc.server now explicitly breaks reference cycles when "
"using sys.exc_info() in code handling exceptions."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31247`: xmlrpc.server 现在在处理异常的代码中使用 sys.exc_info() 时显式地打破循环引用。"

#: ../NEWS:42905
msgid ""
":issue:`23835`: configparser: reading defaults in the ``ConfigParser()`` "
"constructor is now using ``read_dict()``, making its behavior consistent "
"with the rest of the parser.  Non-string keys and values in the defaults "
"dictionary are now being implicitly converted to strings.  Patch by James "
"Tocknell."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23835`: configparser: 现在在 ``ConfigParser()`` 构造器中读取默认值使用 "
"``read_dict()``，使其行为与解析器的其余部分一致。默认字典中的非字符串键和值现在被隐式转换为字符串。由 James Tocknell "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42911 ../NEWS:44586
msgid ""
":issue:`31238`: pydoc: the stop() method of the private ServerThread class "
"now waits until DocServer.serve_until_quit() completes and then explicitly "
"sets its docserver attribute to None to break a reference cycle."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31238`: pydoc: 私有 ServerThread 类的 stop() 方法现在会等待 "
"DocServer.serve_until_quit() 完成，然后显式将其 docserver 属性设置为 None 以打破循环引用。"

#: ../NEWS:42915
msgid ""
":issue:`5001`: Many asserts in ``multiprocessing`` are now more informative,"
" and some error types have been changed to more specific ones."
msgstr ""
":issue:`5001`: ``multiprocessing`` 中的许多断言现在提供了更多信息，并且一些错误类型已更改为更具体的类型。"

#: ../NEWS:42918
msgid ":issue:`31109`: Convert zipimport to use Argument Clinic."
msgstr ":issue:`31109`: 将 zipimport 转换为使用 Argument Clinic。"

#: ../NEWS:42920 ../NEWS:45673
msgid ""
":issue:`30102`: The ssl and hashlib modules now call "
"OPENSSL_add_all_algorithms_noconf() on OpenSSL < 1.1.0. The function detects"
" CPU features and enables optimizations on some CPU architectures such as "
"POWER8. Patch is based on research from Gustavo Serra Scalet."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30102`: ssl 和 hashlib 模块现在在 OpenSSL < 1.1.0 时调用 "
"OPENSSL_add_all_algorithms_noconf()。该函数检测 CPU 特性并在一些 CPU 架构（如 "
"POWER8）上启用优化。补丁基于 Gustavo Serra Scalet 的研究。"

#: ../NEWS:42925
msgid ""
":issue:`18966`: Non-daemonic threads created by a multiprocessing.Process "
"are now joined on child exit."
msgstr ":issue:`18966`: 由 multiprocessing.Process 创建的非守护线程现在在子进程退出时被 join。"

#: ../NEWS:42928
msgid ""
":issue:`31183`: ``dis`` now works with asynchronous generator and coroutine "
"objects. Patch by George Collins based on diagnosis by Luciano Ramalho."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31183`: ``dis`` 现在可以与异步生成器和协程对象一起工作。由 George Collins 提供补丁，基于 Luciano"
" Ramalho 的诊断。"

#: ../NEWS:42931
msgid ""
":issue:`5001`: There are a number of uninformative asserts in the "
"``multiprocessing`` module, as noted in issue 5001. This change fixes two of"
" the most potentially problematic ones, since they are in error-reporting "
"code, in the ``multiprocessing.managers.convert_to_error`` function. (It "
"also makes more informative a ValueError message.) The only potentially "
"problematic change is that the AssertionError is now a TypeError; however, "
"this should also help distinguish it from an AssertionError being *reported*"
" by the function/its caller (such as in issue 31169). - Patch by Allen W. "
"Smith (drallensmith on github)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`5001`: 如问题 5001 所述，``multiprocessing`` "
"模块中有许多不提供信息的断言。此更改修复了其中两个最有可能造成问题的断言，因为它们位于错误报告代码中，在 "
"``multiprocessing.managers.convert_to_error`` 函数中。（它还使 ValueError "
"消息更具信息性。）唯一可能造成问题的变化是 AssertionError 现在是一个 TypeError；然而，这也应该有助于将其与函数/其调用者报告的"
" AssertionError 区分开来（如问题 31169 中）。 - 由 Allen W. Smith（github 上的 "
"drallensmith）提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42941 ../NEWS:45678
msgid ":issue:`31185`: Fixed miscellaneous errors in asyncio speedup module."
msgstr ":issue:`31185`: 修复了 asyncio 加速模块中的杂项错误。"

#: ../NEWS:42943
msgid ""
":issue:`31151`: socketserver.ForkingMixIn.server_close() now waits until all"
" child processes completed to prevent leaking zombie processes."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31151`: socketserver.ForkingMixIn.server_close() "
"现在会等待所有子进程完成，以防止僵尸进程泄漏。"

#: ../NEWS:42946
msgid ""
":issue:`31072`: Add an ``include_file`` parameter to "
"``zipapp.create_archive()``"
msgstr ""
":issue:`31072`: 向 ``zipapp.create_archive()`` 添加一个 ``include_file`` 形参。"

#: ../NEWS:42949
msgid ""
":issue:`24700`: Optimize array.array comparison. It is now from 10x up to "
"70x faster when comparing arrays holding values of the same integer type."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24700`: 优化 array.array 比较。当比较持有相同整数类型值的数组时，现在速度提高了 10 倍到 70 倍。"

#: ../NEWS:42952 ../NEWS:45680
msgid ""
":issue:`31135`: ttk: fix the destroy() method of LabeledScale and OptionMenu"
" classes. Call the parent destroy() method even if the used attribute "
"doesn't exist. The LabeledScale.destroy() method now also explicitly clears "
"label and scale attributes to help the garbage collector to destroy all "
"widgets."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31135`: "
"ttk：修复LabeledScale和OptionMenu类的destroy()方法。即使使用的属性不存在，也调用父类的destroy()方法。LabeledScale.destroy()方法现在还显式清除了label和scale属性，以帮助垃圾回收器销毁所有小部件。"

#: ../NEWS:42958 ../NEWS:45686
msgid ""
":issue:`31107`: Fix ``copyreg._slotnames()`` mangled attribute calculation "
"for classes whose name begins with an underscore. Patch by Shane Harvey."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31107`: 修复 ``copyreg._slotnames()`` 对于名称以下划线开头的类的损坏属性计算。由Shane "
"Harvey提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42961
msgid ""
":issue:`31080`: Allow ``logging.config.fileConfig`` to accept kwargs and/or "
"args."
msgstr ":issue:`31080`: 允许 ``logging.config.fileConfig`` 接受kwargs和/或args。"

#: ../NEWS:42964
msgid ""
":issue:`30897`: ``pathlib.Path`` objects now include an ``is_mount()`` "
"method (only implemented on POSIX).  This is similar to "
"``os.path.ismount(p)``. Patch by Cooper Ry Lees."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30897`: ``pathlib.Path`` 对象现在包含一个 ``is_mount()`` 方法（仅在POSIX上实现）。这与 "
"``os.path.ismount(p)`` 类似。由Cooper Ry Lees提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42968 ../NEWS:45689
msgid ":issue:`31061`: Fixed a crash when using asyncio and threads."
msgstr ":issue:`31061`: 修复了在使用asyncio和线程时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:42970
msgid ""
":issue:`30987`: Added support for CAN ISO-TP protocol in the socket module."
msgstr ":issue:`30987`: 在socket模块中增加了对CAN ISO-TP协议的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:42972
msgid ""
":issue:`30522`: Added a ``setStream`` method to ``logging.StreamHandler`` to"
" allow the stream to be set after creation."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30522`: 向 ``logging.StreamHandler`` 添加了一个 ``setStream`` "
"方法，允许在创建后设置流。"

#: ../NEWS:42975 ../NEWS:45691
msgid ""
":issue:`30502`: Fix handling of long oids in ssl.  Based on patch by "
"Christian Heimes."
msgstr ":issue:`30502`: 修复了ssl中长oids的处理。基于Christian Heimes的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42978
msgid ":issue:`5288`: Support tzinfo objects with sub-minute offsets."
msgstr ":issue:`5288`: 支持具有不足一分钟偏移的tzinfo对象。"

#: ../NEWS:42980
msgid ""
":issue:`30919`: Fix shared memory performance regression in multiprocessing "
"in 3.x. Shared memory used anonymous memory mappings in 2.x, while 3.x mmaps"
" actual files. Try to be careful to do as little disk I/O as possible."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30919`: 修复了Python 3.x版本中多进程模块（multiprocessing）的共享内存性能回归问题。在Python "
"2.x中，共享内存使用匿名内存映射实现，而Python 3.x则改为映射实际文件。本次修复尝试尽可能减少磁盘I/O操作以提升性能。"

#: ../NEWS:42984
msgid ""
":issue:`26732`: Fix too many fds in processes started with the "
"\"forkserver\" method. A child process would inherit as many fds as the "
"number of still-running children."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26732`: 修复了使用“forkserver”方法启动的进程中fd过多的问题。子进程会继承与仍在运行的子进程数量一样多的fd。"

#: ../NEWS:42988 ../NEWS:45701 ../NEWS:49995
msgid ""
":issue:`29403`: Fix ``unittest.mock``'s autospec to not fail on method-bound"
" builtin functions.  Patch by Aaron Gallagher."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29403`: 修复``unittest.mock``模块的autospec功能，使其不再对绑定到方法的内置函数报错。由Aaron "
"Gallagher提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:42991 ../NEWS:45704 ../NEWS:49998
msgid ":issue:`30961`: Fix decrementing a borrowed reference in tracemalloc."
msgstr ":issue:`30961`: 修复了tracemalloc中借用引用的递减问题。"

#: ../NEWS:42993
msgid ""
":issue:`19896`: Fix multiprocessing.sharedctypes to recognize typecodes "
"``'q'`` and ``'Q'``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`19896`: 修复multiprocessing.sharedctypes以识别类型码 ``'q'`` 和 ``'Q'``。"

#: ../NEWS:42996
msgid ""
":issue:`30946`: Remove obsolete code in readline module for platforms where "
"GNU readline is older than 2.1 or where select() is not available."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30946`: 移除了readline模块中对于GNU readline版本低于2.1或select()不可用平台的过时代码。"

#: ../NEWS:42999 ../NEWS:45706
msgid ""
":issue:`25684`: Change ``ttk.OptionMenu`` radiobuttons to be unique across "
"instances of ``OptionMenu``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25684`: 修改 ``ttk.OptionMenu`` 单选按钮，使其在不同 ``OptionMenu`` 实例间保持唯一。"

#: ../NEWS:43002 ../NEWS:45709 ../NEWS:50000
msgid ""
":issue:`30886`: Fix multiprocessing.Queue.join_thread(): it now waits until "
"the thread completes, even if the thread was started by the same process "
"which created the queue."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30886`: 修复 "
"multiprocessing.Queue.join_thread()：现在即使线程是由创建队列的同一进程启动的，它也会等待线程完成。"

#: ../NEWS:43006 ../NEWS:45713 ../NEWS:50004
msgid ""
":issue:`29854`: Fix segfault in readline when using readline's history-size "
"option.  Patch by Nir Soffer."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29854`: 修复使用 readline 的 history-size 选项时 readline 中的段错误。由 Nir Soffer"
" 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43009
msgid ""
":issue:`30794`: Added multiprocessing.Process.kill method to terminate using"
" the SIGKILL signal on Unix."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30794`: 在 Unix 上添加了 multiprocessing.Process.kill 方法，用于使用 SIGKILL "
"信号终止。"

#: ../NEWS:43012 ../NEWS:45716
msgid ":issue:`30319`: socket.close() now ignores ECONNRESET error."
msgstr ":issue:`30319`: socket.close() 现在忽略 ECONNRESET 错误。"

#: ../NEWS:43014 ../NEWS:45718
msgid ""
":issue:`30828`: Fix out of bounds write in "
"``asyncio.CFuture.remove_done_callback()``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30828`: 修复 ``asyncio.CFuture.remove_done_callback()`` 中的越界写入问题。"

#: ../NEWS:43017
msgid ""
":issue:`30302`: Use keywords in the ``repr`` of ``datetime.timedelta``."
msgstr ":issue:`30302`: 在 ``datetime.timedelta`` 的 ``repr`` 中使用关键字。"

#: ../NEWS:43019 ../NEWS:45721 ../NEWS:50007
msgid ""
":issue:`30807`: signal.setitimer() may disable the timer when passed a tiny "
"value. Tiny values (such as 1e-6) are valid non-zero values for setitimer(),"
" which is specified as taking microsecond-resolution intervals. However, on "
"some platform, our conversion routine could convert 1e-6 into a zero "
"interval, therefore disabling the timer instead of (re-)scheduling it."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30807`: 当传递一个极小的值时，signal.setitimer() 可能会禁用计时器。极小的值（如 1e-6）是 "
"setitimer() 有效的非零值，它被指定为采取微秒级间隔。然而，在某些平台上，我们的转换例程可能将 1e-6 "
"转换为零间隔，从而禁用计时器而不是（重新）调度它。"

#: ../NEWS:43026 ../NEWS:45728 ../NEWS:50014
msgid ""
":issue:`30441`: Fix bug when modifying os.environ while iterating over it"
msgstr ":issue:`30441`: 修复在迭代 os.environ 时修改它导致的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:43028
msgid ""
":issue:`29585`: Avoid importing ``sysconfig`` from ``site`` to improve "
"startup speed. Python startup is about 5% faster on Linux and 30% faster on "
"macOS."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29585`: 避免从 ``site`` 导入 ``sysconfig`` 以提高启动速度。Python 在 Linux "
"上的启动速度提高了约 5%，在 macOS 上提高了约 30%。"

#: ../NEWS:43031
msgid ""
":issue:`29293`: Add missing parameter \"n\" on "
"multiprocessing.Condition.notify(). The doc claims multiprocessing.Condition"
" behaves like threading.Condition, but its notify() method lacked the "
"optional \"n\" argument (to specify the number of sleepers to wake up) that "
"threading.Condition.notify() accepts."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29293`: 在 multiprocessing.Condition.notify() 上添加缺失的参数 \"n\"。文档声称 "
"multiprocessing.Condition 的行为类似于 threading.Condition，但其 notify() 方法缺少 "
"threading.Condition.notify() 接受的 \"n\" 参数（指定要唤醒的睡眠者数量）。"

#: ../NEWS:43037 ../NEWS:45730 ../NEWS:50016
msgid ""
":issue:`30532`: Fix email header value parser dropping folding white space "
"in certain cases."
msgstr ":issue:`30532`: 修复电子邮件头值解析器在某些情况下丢弃折叠空白的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:43040
msgid ""
":issue:`30596`: Add a ``close()`` method to ``multiprocessing.Process``."
msgstr ":issue:`30596`: 向 ``multiprocessing.Process`` 添加一个 ``close()`` 方法。"

#: ../NEWS:43042 ../NEWS:45652
msgid ""
":issue:`9146`: Fix a segmentation fault in _hashopenssl when standard hash "
"functions such as md5 are not available in the linked OpenSSL library.  As "
"in some special FIPS-140 build environments."
msgstr ""
":issue:`9146`: 修复 _hashopenssl 在链接的 OpenSSL 库中不可用标准哈希函数（如 md5）时的段错误。如在某些特殊的 "
"FIPS-140 构建环境中。"

#: ../NEWS:43046 ../NEWS:46459 ../NEWS:50019
msgid ":issue:`29169`: Update zlib to 1.2.11."
msgstr ":issue:`29169`: 将 zlib 更新至 1.2.11。"

#: ../NEWS:43048 ../NEWS:45694 ../NEWS:49907
msgid ""
":issue:`30119`: ftplib.FTP.putline() now throws ValueError on commands that "
"contains CR or LF. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30119`: ftplib.FTP.putline() 现在会在命令包含 CR 或 LF 时抛出 ValueError。由 "
"Donghee Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43051 ../NEWS:45733 ../NEWS:50021
msgid ""
":issue:`30879`: os.listdir() and os.scandir() now emit bytes names when "
"called with bytes-like argument."
msgstr ":issue:`30879`: os.listdir() 和 os.scandir() 现在在使用字节类参数调用时会发出字节名称。"

#: ../NEWS:43054 ../NEWS:45736 ../NEWS:50024
msgid ""
":issue:`30746`: Prohibited the '=' character in environment variable names "
"in ``os.putenv()`` and ``os.spawn*()``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30746`: 禁止在 ``os.putenv()`` 和 ``os.spawn*()`` 的环境变量名中使用 '=' 字符。"

#: ../NEWS:43057
msgid ""
":issue:`30664`: The description of a unittest subtest now preserves the "
"order of keyword arguments of TestCase.subTest()."
msgstr ":issue:`30664`: unittest 子测试的描述现在会保留 TestCase.subTest() 的关键字参数的顺序。"

#: ../NEWS:43060
msgid ""
":issue:`21071`: struct.Struct.format type is now :class:`str` instead of "
":class:`bytes`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21071`: struct.Struct.format 类型现在是 :class:`str` 而非 :class:`bytes`。"

#: ../NEWS:43063 ../NEWS:45647
msgid ""
":issue:`29212`: Fix concurrent.futures.thread.ThreadPoolExecutor threads to "
"have a non repr() based thread name by default when no thread_name_prefix is"
" supplied. They will now identify themselves as \"ThreadPoolExecutor-y_n\"."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29212`: 修复 concurrent.futures.thread.ThreadPoolExecutor 线程在没有提供 "
"thread_name_prefix 时默认使用非 repr() 基础的线程名。它们现在会自称为 \"ThreadPoolExecutor-y_n\"。"

#: ../NEWS:43068 ../NEWS:45739 ../NEWS:50027
msgid ""
":issue:`29755`: Fixed the lgettext() family of functions in the gettext "
"module. They now always return bytes."
msgstr ":issue:`29755`: 修复了 gettext 模块中的 lgettext() 系列函数。它们现在总是返回字节。"

#: ../NEWS:43071 ../NEWS:46072
msgid ""
":issue:`30616`: Functional API of enum allows to create empty enums. Patched"
" by Donghee Na"
msgstr ":issue:`30616`: enum 的功能 API 允许创建空的枚举。由 Donghee Na 提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:43074 ../NEWS:46075
msgid ""
":issue:`30038`: Fix race condition between signal delivery and wakeup file "
"descriptor. Patch by Nathaniel Smith."
msgstr ":issue:`30038`: 修复了信号传递和唤醒文件描述符之间的竞争条件。补丁由 Nathaniel Smith 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:43077 ../NEWS:46078
msgid ""
":issue:`23894`: lib2to3 now recognizes ``rb'...'`` and ``f'...'`` strings."
msgstr ":issue:`23894`: lib2to3 现在能识别 ``rb'...'`` 和 ``f'...'`` 字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:43079
msgid ""
":issue:`24744`: pkgutil.walk_packages function now raises ValueError if "
"*path* is a string. Patch by Sanyam Khurana."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24744`: pkgutil.walk_packages 函数现在会在 *path* 是字符串时抛出 ValueError。补丁由 "
"Sanyam Khurana 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:43082 ../NEWS:50044
msgid ":issue:`24484`: Avoid race condition in multiprocessing cleanup."
msgstr ":issue:`24484`: 避免多进程清理中的竞争条件。"

#: ../NEWS:43084
msgid ""
":issue:`30589`: Fix multiprocessing.Process.exitcode to return the opposite "
"of the signal number when the process is killed by a signal (instead of 255)"
" when using the \"forkserver\" method."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30589`: 修复 multiprocessing.Process.exitcode 在使用 \"forkserver\" "
"方法时，当进程被信号杀死时返回信号数的相反数（而不是 255）。"

#: ../NEWS:43088 ../NEWS:46099 ../NEWS:50046
msgid ""
":issue:`28994`: The traceback no longer displayed for SystemExit raised in a"
" callback registered by atexit."
msgstr ":issue:`28994`: 对于由 atexit 注册的回调中引发的 SystemExit，不再显示回溯。"

#: ../NEWS:43091 ../NEWS:46102 ../NEWS:50049
msgid ""
":issue:`30508`: Don't log exceptions if Task/Future \"cancel()\" method was "
"called."
msgstr ":issue:`30508`: 如果调用了 Task/Future 的 \"cancel()\" 方法，则不记录异常。"

#: ../NEWS:43094
msgid ""
":issue:`30645`: Fix path calculation in ``imp.load_package()``, fixing it "
"for cases when a package is only shipped with bytecodes. Patch by Alexandru "
"Ardelean."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30645`: 修复 ``imp.load_package()`` 中的路径计算，修复了当包仅随字节码提供时的情况。由 "
"Alexandru Ardelean 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43098
msgid ""
":issue:`11822`: The dis.dis() function now is able to disassemble nested "
"code objects."
msgstr ":issue:`11822`: dis.dis() 函数现在能够反汇编嵌套的代码对象。"

#: ../NEWS:43101
msgid ""
":issue:`30624`: selectors does not take KeyboardInterrupt and SystemExit "
"into account, leaving a fd in a bad state in case of error. Patch by "
"Giampaolo Rodola'."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30624`: selectors 没有考虑到 KeyboardInterrupt 和 "
"SystemExit，导致在出错时文件描述符处于不良状态。由 Giampaolo Rodola' 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43105 ../NEWS:45697
msgid ""
":issue:`30595`: multiprocessing.Queue.get() with a timeout now polls its "
"reader in non-blocking mode if it succeeded to acquire the lock but the "
"acquire took longer than the timeout."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30595`: multiprocessing.Queue.get() "
"现在在非阻塞模式下轮询其读取器，如果成功获取锁但获取时间超过了超时时间。"

#: ../NEWS:43109 ../NEWS:46105 ../NEWS:50052
msgid ""
":issue:`28556`: Updates to typing module: Add generic AsyncContextManager, "
"add support for ContextManager on all versions. Original PRs by Jelle "
"Zijlstra and Ivan Levkivskyi"
msgstr ""
":issue:`28556`: typing 模块的更新：添加通用的 AsyncContextManager，为所有版本添加对 "
"ContextManager 的支持。原始 PR 由 Jelle Zijlstra 和 Ivan Levkivskyi 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:43113 ../NEWS:46094
msgid ""
":issue:`30605`: re.compile() no longer raises a BytesWarning when compiling "
"a bytes instance with misplaced inline modifier.  Patch by Roy Williams."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30605`: re.compile() 在编译带有错误放置的内联修饰符的 bytes 实例时不再引发 BytesWarning。由 "
"Roy Williams 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43116 ../NEWS:46109 ../NEWS:50056
msgid ""
":issue:`29870`: Fix ssl sockets leaks when connection is aborted in "
"asyncio/ssl implementation. Patch by Michaël Sghaïer."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29870`: 修复 asyncio/ssl 实现中当连接被中止时 SSL 套接字的泄漏问题。由 Michaël Sghaïer "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43119 ../NEWS:46112 ../NEWS:50059
msgid ""
":issue:`29743`: Closing transport during handshake process leaks open "
"socket. Patch by Nikolay Kim"
msgstr ":issue:`29743`: 在握手过程中关闭传输会导致打开的套接字泄漏。由 Nikolay Kim 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43122 ../NEWS:46115 ../NEWS:50062
msgid ""
":issue:`27585`: Fix waiter cancellation in asyncio.Lock. Patch by Mathieu "
"Sornay."
msgstr ":issue:`27585`: 修复 asyncio.Lock 中的等待者取消问题。由 Mathieu Sornay 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43125
msgid ""
":issue:`30014`: modify() method of poll(), epoll() and devpoll() based "
"classes of selectors module is around 10% faster.  Patch by Giampaolo "
"Rodola'."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30014`: selectors 模块中基于 poll()、epoll() 和 devpoll() 的类的 modify() "
"方法现在快了约 10%。由 Giampaolo Rodola' 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43128 ../NEWS:46118 ../NEWS:50065
msgid ""
":issue:`30418`: On Windows, subprocess.Popen.communicate() now also ignore "
"EINVAL on stdin.write() if the child process is still running but closed the"
" pipe."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30418`: 在 Windows 上，如果子进程仍在运行但关闭了管道，subprocess.Popen.communicate() "
"现在也会忽略 stdin.write() 上的 EINVAL。"

#: ../NEWS:43132
msgid ""
":issue:`30463`: Added empty __slots__ to abc.ABC.  This allows subclassers "
"to deny __dict__ and __weakref__ creation.  Patch by Aaron Hall."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30463`: 向 abc.ABC 添加了空的 __slots__。这允许子类拒绝 __dict__ 和 __weakref__ "
"的创建。由 Aaron Hall 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43135
msgid ":issue:`30520`: Loggers are now pickleable."
msgstr ":issue:`30520`: 现在 Logger 可以被 pickle 序列化。"

#: ../NEWS:43137 ../NEWS:46129
msgid ""
":issue:`30557`: faulthandler now correctly filters and displays exception "
"codes on Windows"
msgstr ":issue:`30557`: faulthandler 现在能够正确过滤和显示 Windows 上的异常代码。"

#: ../NEWS:43140
msgid ""
":issue:`30526`: Add TextIOWrapper.reconfigure() and a "
"TextIOWrapper.write_through attribute."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30526`: 添加了 TextIOWrapper.reconfigure() 和 "
"TextIOWrapper.write_through 属性。"

#: ../NEWS:43143
msgid ""
":issue:`30245`: Fix possible overflow when organize struct.pack_into error "
"message.  Patch by Yuan Liu."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30245`: 修复在组织 struct.pack_into 错误消息时可能出现的溢出问题。由 Yuan Liu 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43146 ../NEWS:46132 ../NEWS:50069
msgid ""
":issue:`30378`: Fix the problem that logging.handlers.SysLogHandler cannot "
"handle IPv6 addresses."
msgstr ":issue:`30378`: 修复 logging.handlers.SysLogHandler 无法处理 IPv6 地址的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:43149
msgid ":issue:`16500`: Allow registering at-fork handlers."
msgstr ":issue:`16500`: 允许注册 at-fork 处理程序。"

#: ../NEWS:43151
msgid ""
":issue:`30470`: Deprecate invalid ctypes call protection on Windows.  Patch "
"by Mariatta Wijaya."
msgstr ":issue:`30470`: 弃用 Windows 上的无效 ctypes 调用保护。由 Mariatta Wijaya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43154 ../NEWS:46138 ../NEWS:50075
msgid ""
":issue:`30414`: multiprocessing.Queue._feed background running thread do not"
" break from main loop on exception."
msgstr ":issue:`30414`: multiprocessing.Queue._feed 后台运行线程在异常时不从主循环中中断。"

#: ../NEWS:43157 ../NEWS:46141 ../NEWS:50078
msgid ""
":issue:`30003`: Fix handling escape characters in HZ codec.  Based on patch "
"by Ma Lin."
msgstr ":issue:`30003`: 修复HZ编解码器中转义字符的处理。基于Ma Lin的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43160 ../NEWS:46083 ../NEWS:50037
msgid ""
":issue:`30149`: inspect.signature() now supports callables with variable-"
"argument parameters wrapped with partialmethod. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30149`: inspect.signature() "
"现在支持带有被partialmethod包装的可变参数参数的可调用对象。由Donghee Na提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43164
msgid ""
":issue:`30436`: importlib.find_spec() raises ModuleNotFoundError instead of "
"AttributeError if the specified parent module is not a package (i.e. lacks a"
" __path__ attribute)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30436`: 如果指定的父模块不是一个包（即缺少__path__属性），importlib.find_spec() "
"现在会引发ModuleNotFoundError而不是AttributeError。"

#: ../NEWS:43168 ../NEWS:46144 ../NEWS:50081
msgid ""
":issue:`30301`: Fix AttributeError when using SimpleQueue.empty() under "
"*spawn* and *forkserver* start methods."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30301`: 修复在 *spawn* 和 *forkserver* "
"启动方法下使用SimpleQueue.empty()时的AttributeError。"

#: ../NEWS:43171 ../NEWS:46151 ../NEWS:50088
msgid ""
":issue:`30375`: Warnings emitted when compile a regular expression now "
"always point to the line in the user code.  Previously they could point into"
" inners of the re module if emitted from inside of groups or conditionals."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30375`: 编译正则表达式时发出的警告现在总是指向用户代码中的行。之前如果从组或条件内部发出，它们可能指向re模块的内部。"

#: ../NEWS:43175 ../NEWS:46147 ../NEWS:50084
msgid ""
":issue:`30329`: imaplib and poplib now catch the Windows socket WSAEINVAL "
"error (code 10022) on shutdown(SHUT_RDWR): An invalid operation was "
"attempted. This error occurs sometimes on SSL connections."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30329`: imaplib和poplib现在在shutdown(SHUT_RDWR)时捕获Windows socket "
"WSAEINVAL错误（代码10022）：尝试了无效操作。此错误有时发生在SSL连接上。"

#: ../NEWS:43179
msgid ""
":issue:`29196`: Removed previously deprecated in Python 2.4 classes Plist, "
"Dict and _InternalDict in the plistlib module.  Dict values in the result of"
" functions readPlist() and readPlistFromBytes() are now normal dicts.  You "
"no longer can use attribute access to access items of these dictionaries."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29196`: 移除了plistlib模块中以前在Python "
"2.4中弃用的类Plist、Dict和_InternalDict。readPlist()和readPlistFromBytes()函数的结果中的Dict值现在是普通的dict。你不能再使用属性访问来访问这些字典的项目。"

#: ../NEWS:43184
msgid ""
":issue:`9850`: The :mod:`macpath` is now deprecated and will be removed in "
"Python 3.8."
msgstr ":issue:`9850`: :mod:`macpath` 现在已被弃用，并将在Python 3.8中移除。"

#: ../NEWS:43187
msgid ""
":issue:`30299`: Compiling regular expression in debug mode on CPython now "
"displays the compiled bytecode in human readable form."
msgstr ":issue:`30299`: 在CPython上以调试模式编译正则表达式现在以人类可读的形式显示编译后的字节码。"

#: ../NEWS:43190 ../NEWS:46155 ../NEWS:50092
msgid ""
":issue:`30048`: Fixed ``Task.cancel()`` can be ignored when the task is "
"running coroutine and the coroutine returned without any more ``await``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30048`: 修复了当任务运行协程且协程返回而没有任何更多 ``await`` "
"时，``Task.cancel()``可能被忽略的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:43193 ../NEWS:46158
msgid ""
":issue:`30266`: contextlib.AbstractContextManager now supports anti-"
"registration by setting __enter__ = None or __exit__ = None, following the "
"pattern introduced in :issue:`25958`. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30266`: contextlib.AbstractContextManager现在支持通过设置__enter__ = "
"None或__exit__ = None进行反注册，遵循 :issue:`25958` 中引入的模式。由Jelle Zijlstra提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43197
msgid ""
":issue:`30340`: Enhanced regular expressions optimization. This increased "
"the performance of matching some patterns up to 25 times."
msgstr ":issue:`30340`: 增强正则表达式优化。这使某些模式的匹配性能提高了25倍。"

#: ../NEWS:43200 ../NEWS:46162
msgid ""
":issue:`30298`: Weaken the condition of deprecation warnings for inline "
"modifiers. Now allowed several subsequential inline modifiers at the start "
"of the pattern (e.g. ``'(?i)(?s)...'``).  In verbose mode whitespaces and "
"comments now are allowed before and between inline modifiers (e.g. ``'(?x) "
"(?i) (?s)...'``)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30298`: 放宽内联修饰符的弃用警告条件。现在允许在模式开始处连续使用多个内联修饰符（例如 "
"``'(?i)(?s)...'``）。在详细模式下，现在允许在内联修饰符之前和之间使用空格和注释（例如 ``'(?x) (?i) "
"(?s)...'``）。"

#: ../NEWS:43206
msgid ""
":issue:`30285`: Optimized case-insensitive matching and searching of regular"
" expressions."
msgstr ":issue:`30285`: 优化了正则表达式的不区分大小写的匹配和搜索。"

#: ../NEWS:43209 ../NEWS:46168 ../NEWS:50095
msgid ""
":issue:`29990`: Fix range checking in GB18030 decoder.  Original patch by Ma"
" Lin."
msgstr ":issue:`29990`: 修复GB18030解码器中的范围检查。原由Ma Lin提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43212
msgid ""
":issue:`29979`: rewrite cgi.parse_multipart, reusing the FieldStorage class "
"and making its results consistent with those of FieldStorage for "
"multipart/form-data requests. Patch by Pierre Quentel."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29979`: "
"重写cgi.parse_multipart，重用FieldStorage类，并使其结果与FieldStorage对于multipart/form-"
"data请求的结果一致。由Pierre Quentel提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43216 ../NEWS:46174 ../NEWS:50101
msgid ""
":issue:`30243`: Removed the __init__ methods of _json's scanner and encoder."
" Misusing them could cause memory leaks or crashes.  Now scanner and encoder"
" objects are completely initialized in the __new__ methods."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30243`: "
"移除了_json的扫描器和编码器的__init__方法。误用它们可能导致内存泄漏或崩溃。现在扫描器和编码器对象在__new__方法中完全初始化。"

#: ../NEWS:43220
msgid ""
":issue:`30215`: Compiled regular expression objects with the re.LOCALE flag "
"no longer depend on the locale at compile time.  Only the locale at matching"
" time affects the result of matching."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30215`: 使用re.LOCALE标志编译的正则表达式对象不再依赖于编译时的区域设置。只有匹配时的区域设置会影响匹配结果。"

#: ../NEWS:43224 ../NEWS:46178 ../NEWS:50105
msgid ""
":issue:`30185`: Avoid KeyboardInterrupt tracebacks in forkserver helper "
"process when Ctrl-C is received."
msgstr ":issue:`30185`: 在收到Ctrl-C时，避免forkserver辅助进程中的KeyboardInterrupt回溯。"

#: ../NEWS:43227
msgid ""
":issue:`30103`: binascii.b2a_uu() and uu.encode() now support using ``'`'`` "
"as zero instead of space."
msgstr ":issue:`30103`: binascii.b2a_uu()和uu.encode()现在支持使用 ``'`'`` 代替空格作为零。"

#: ../NEWS:43230 ../NEWS:46181 ../NEWS:50108
msgid ""
":issue:`28556`: Various updates to typing module: add typing.NoReturn type, "
"use WrapperDescriptorType, minor bug-fixes.  Original PRs by Jim Fasarakis-"
"Hilliard and Ivan Levkivskyi."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28556`: "
"对typing模块的各种更新：添加typing.NoReturn类型，使用WrapperDescriptorType，小错误修复。原PR由Jim "
"Fasarakis-Hilliard和Ivan Levkivskyi提供。"

#: ../NEWS:43234 ../NEWS:46185 ../NEWS:50112
msgid ""
":issue:`30205`: Fix getsockname() for unbound AF_UNIX sockets on Linux."
msgstr ":issue:`30205`: 修复Linux上未绑定的AF_UNIX套接字的getsockname()。"

#: ../NEWS:43236
msgid ""
":issue:`30228`: The seek() and tell() methods of io.FileIO now set the "
"internal seekable attribute to avoid one syscall on open() (in buffered or "
"text mode)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30228`: "
"io.FileIO的seek()和tell()方法现在设置内部seekable属性，以避免在open()时（在缓冲或文本模式下）进行一次系统调用。"

#: ../NEWS:43240
msgid ""
":issue:`30190`: unittest's assertAlmostEqual and assertNotAlmostEqual "
"provide a better message in case of failure which includes the difference "
"between left and right arguments.  (patch by Giampaolo Rodola')"
msgstr ""
":issue:`30190`: "
"unittest的assertAlmostEqual和assertNotAlmostEqual在失败时提供了更好的消息，包括左右参数的差异。（由Giampaolo"
" Rodola提供补丁）"

#: ../NEWS:43244
msgid ":issue:`30101`: Add support for curses.A_ITALIC."
msgstr ":issue:`30101`: 添加对curses.A_ITALIC的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:43246 ../NEWS:46122
msgid ""
":issue:`29822`: inspect.isabstract() now works during __init_subclass__.  "
"Patch by Nate Soares."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29822`: inspect.isabstract()现在在__init_subclass__期间工作。补丁由Nate "
"Soares提供。"

#: ../NEWS:43249 ../NEWS:46135 ../NEWS:50072
msgid ""
":issue:`29960`: Preserve generator state when _random.Random.setstate() "
"raises an exception. Patch by Bryan Olson."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29960`: 当_random.Random.setstate()引发异常时，保留生成器状态。补丁由Bryan Olson提供。"

#: ../NEWS:43252 ../NEWS:46187 ../NEWS:50114
msgid ""
":issue:`30070`: Fixed leaks and crashes in errors handling in the parser "
"module."
msgstr ":issue:`30070`: 修复了解析模块中错误处理的内存泄漏和崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:43255
msgid ""
":issue:`22352`: Column widths in the output of dis.dis() are now adjusted "
"for large line numbers and instruction offsets."
msgstr ":issue:`22352`: dis.dis()的输出中的列宽现在针对大行号和指令偏移进行了调整。"

#: ../NEWS:43258 ../NEWS:46190 ../NEWS:50117
msgid ""
":issue:`30061`: Fixed crashes in IOBase methods __next__() and readlines() "
"when readline() or __next__() respectively return non-sizeable object. Fixed"
" possible other errors caused by not checking results of PyObject_Size(), "
"PySequence_Size(), or PyMapping_Size()."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30061`: "
"修复了当readline()或__next__()分别返回不可大小化的对象时，IOBase方法__next__()和readlines()中的崩溃。修复了由不检查PyObject_Size()、PySequence_Size()或PyMapping_Size()的结果可能引起的其他错误。"

#: ../NEWS:43263
msgid ""
":issue:`30218`: Fix PathLike support for shutil.unpack_archive. Patch by "
"Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30218`: 修复了shutil.unpack_archive的PathLike支持。由Jelle Zijlstra提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43266
msgid ""
":issue:`10076`: Compiled regular expression and match objects in the re "
"module now support copy.copy() and copy.deepcopy() (they are considered "
"atomic)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`10076`: "
"re模块中的编译正则表达式和匹配对象现在支持copy.copy()和copy.deepcopy()（它们被认为是原子的）。"

#: ../NEWS:43269 ../NEWS:46199 ../NEWS:50122
msgid ""
":issue:`30068`: _io._IOBase.readlines will check if it's closed first when "
"hint is present."
msgstr ":issue:`30068`: 当存在hint时，_io._IOBase.readlines将首先检查是否关闭。"

#: ../NEWS:43272 ../NEWS:46202 ../NEWS:50125
msgid ""
":issue:`29694`: Fixed race condition in pathlib mkdir with flags "
"parents=True. Patch by Armin Rigo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29694`: 修复了pathlib mkdir与flags parents=True时的竞争条件。补丁由Armin Rigo提供。"

#: ../NEWS:43275 ../NEWS:46205 ../NEWS:50128
msgid ""
":issue:`29692`: Fixed arbitrary unchaining of RuntimeError exceptions in "
"contextlib.contextmanager.  Patch by Siddharth Velankar."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29692`: 修复了contextlib.contextmanager中RuntimeError异常的任意解链。由Siddharth "
"Velankar提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43278
msgid ""
":issue:`26187`: Test that sqlite3 trace callback is not called multiple "
"times when schema is changing.  Indirectly fixed by switching to use "
"sqlite3_prepare_v2() in :issue:`9303`.  Patch by Aviv Palivoda."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26187`: 测试sqlite3跟踪回调在模式更改时不被多次调用。通过切换到在 :issue:`9303` "
"中使用sqlite3_prepare_v2()间接修复。由Aviv Palivoda提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43282 ../NEWS:46195
msgid ""
":issue:`30017`: Allowed calling the close() method of the zip entry writer "
"object multiple times.  Writing to a closed writer now always produces a "
"ValueError."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30017`: 允许多次调用zip条目写入器对象的close()方法。向已关闭的写入器写入现在总是产生ValueError。"

#: ../NEWS:43286 ../NEWS:46208 ../NEWS:50131
msgid ""
":issue:`29998`: Pickling and copying ImportError now preserves name and path"
" attributes."
msgstr ":issue:`29998`: Pickling和复制ImportError现在保留name和path属性。"

#: ../NEWS:43289
msgid ":issue:`29995`: re.escape() now escapes only regex special characters."
msgstr ":issue:`29995`: re.escape() 现在仅转义正则表达式特殊字符。"

#: ../NEWS:43291
msgid ""
":issue:`29962`: Add math.remainder operation, implementing remainder as "
"specified in IEEE 754."
msgstr ":issue:`29962`: 添加 math.remainder 操作，实现 IEEE 754 中规定的余数。"

#: ../NEWS:43294
msgid ""
":issue:`29649`: Improve struct.pack_into() exception messages for problems "
"with the buffer size and offset.  Patch by Andrew Nester."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29649`: 改进 struct.pack_into() 对于缓冲区大小和偏移量问题的异常消息。由 Andrew Nester "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43297
msgid ""
":issue:`29654`: Support If-Modified-Since HTTP header (browser cache).  "
"Patch by Pierre Quentel."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29654`: 支持 If-Modified-Since HTTP 头部（浏览器缓存）。补丁由 Pierre Quentel 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:43300 ../NEWS:46091 ../NEWS:50041
msgid ""
":issue:`29931`: Fixed comparison check for ipaddress.ip_interface objects. "
"Patch by Sanjay Sundaresan."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29931`: 修复了 ipaddress.ip_interface 对象的比较检查。补丁由 Sanjay Sundaresan 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:43303 ../NEWS:46211
msgid ""
":issue:`29953`: Fixed memory leaks in the replace() method of datetime and "
"time objects when pass out of bound fold argument."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29953`: 修复了当传递超出范围的 fold 参数时，datetime 和 time 对象的 replace() "
"方法中的内存泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:43306 ../NEWS:46214 ../NEWS:50134
msgid ""
":issue:`29942`: Fix a crash in itertools.chain.from_iterable when "
"encountering long runs of empty iterables."
msgstr ":issue:`29942`: 修复了在遇到长串空可迭代对象时，itertools.chain.from_iterable 的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:43309
msgid ":issue:`10030`: Sped up reading encrypted ZIP files by 2 times."
msgstr ":issue:`10030`: 通过加密 ZIP 文件的读取速度提高了2倍。"

#: ../NEWS:43311
msgid ""
":issue:`29204`: Element.getiterator() and the html parameter of XMLParser() "
"were deprecated only in the documentation (since Python 3.2 and 3.4 "
"correspondingly). Now using them emits a deprecation warning."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29204`: Element.getiterator() 和 XMLParser() 的 html 参数仅在文档中被弃用（分别自 "
"Python 3.2 和 3.4 起）。现在使用它们会发出弃用警告。"

#: ../NEWS:43315 ../NEWS:46217 ../NEWS:50137
msgid ""
":issue:`27863`: Fixed multiple crashes in ElementTree caused by race "
"conditions and wrong types."
msgstr ":issue:`27863`: 修复了由竞争条件和错误类型引起的 ElementTree 中的多个崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:43318
msgid ""
":issue:`25996`: Added support of file descriptors in os.scandir() on Unix. "
"os.fwalk() is sped up by 2 times by using os.scandir()."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25996`: 在 Unix 上添加了对 os.scandir() 中文件描述符的支持。通过使用 "
"os.scandir()，os.fwalk() 的速度提高了2倍。"

#: ../NEWS:43321 ../NEWS:46220 ../NEWS:50140
msgid ""
":issue:`28699`: Fixed a bug in pools in multiprocessing.pool that raising an"
" exception at the very first of an iterable may swallow the exception or "
"make the program hang. Patch by Davin Potts and Xiang Zhang."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28699`: 修复了 multiprocessing.pool 中池的一个 "
"bug，即在可迭代对象的最开始引发异常可能会吞掉异常或使程序挂起。由 Davin Potts 和 Xiang Zhang 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43325 ../NEWS:46080 ../NEWS:50034
msgid ""
":issue:`23890`: unittest.TestCase.assertRaises() now manually breaks a "
"reference cycle to not keep objects alive longer than expected."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23890`: unittest.TestCase.assertRaises() 现在手动打破引用循环，以避免对象存活时间超过预期。"

#: ../NEWS:43328
msgid ""
":issue:`29901`: The zipapp module now supports general path-like objects, "
"not just pathlib.Path."
msgstr ":issue:`29901`: zipapp 模块现在支持一般的路径类对象，而不仅仅是 pathlib.Path。"

#: ../NEWS:43331 ../NEWS:46224 ../NEWS:50144
msgid ""
":issue:`25803`: Avoid incorrect errors raised by Path.mkdir(exist_ok=True) "
"when the OS gives priority to errors such as EACCES over EEXIST."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25803`: 当操作系统优先考虑如 EACCES 而不是 EEXIST 的错误时，避免 "
"Path.mkdir(exist_ok=True) 引发不正确的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:43334 ../NEWS:46227 ../NEWS:50147
msgid ""
":issue:`29861`: Release references to tasks, their arguments and their "
"results as soon as they are finished in multiprocessing.Pool."
msgstr ":issue:`29861`: 在 multiprocessing.Pool 中，任务、它们的参数和结果一旦完成就释放引用。"

#: ../NEWS:43337
msgid ""
":issue:`19930`: The mode argument of os.makedirs() no longer affects the "
"file permission bits of newly created intermediate-level directories."
msgstr ":issue:`19930`: os.makedirs()的mode参数不再影响新创建的中间级别目录的文件权限位。"

#: ../NEWS:43340 ../NEWS:46230 ../NEWS:50150
msgid ""
":issue:`29884`: faulthandler: Restore the old sigaltstack during teardown. "
"Patch by Christophe Zeitouny."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29884`: faulthandler: 在拆卸期间恢复旧的sigaltstack。由Christophe Zeitouny提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43343 ../NEWS:46233 ../NEWS:50153
msgid ""
":issue:`25455`: Fixed crashes in repr of recursive buffered file-like "
"objects."
msgstr ":issue:`25455`: 修复了递归缓冲文件类对象repr中的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:43345 ../NEWS:46235 ../NEWS:50155
msgid ""
":issue:`29800`: Fix crashes in partial.__repr__ if the keys of "
"partial.keywords are not strings.  Patch by Michael Seifert."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29800`: 修复了如果partial.keywords的键不是字符串时partial.__repr__的崩溃。由Michael "
"Seifert提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43348 ../NEWS:46241 ../NEWS:50161
msgid ""
":issue:`8256`: Fixed possible failing or crashing input() if attributes "
"\"encoding\" or \"errors\" of sys.stdin or sys.stdout are not set or are not"
" strings."
msgstr ""
":issue:`8256`: "
"修复了如果sys.stdin或sys.stdout的属性\"encoding\"或\"errors\"未设置或不是字符串时可能导致的input()失败或崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:43352
msgid ""
":issue:`28692`: Using non-integer value for selecting a plural form in "
"gettext is now deprecated."
msgstr ":issue:`28692`: 现在弃用使用非整数值在gettext中选择复数形式。"

#: ../NEWS:43355
msgid ""
":issue:`26121`: Use C library implementation for math functions erf() and "
"erfc()."
msgstr ":issue:`26121`: 使用C库实现math函数erf()和erfc()。"

#: ../NEWS:43358
msgid ""
":issue:`29619`: os.stat() and os.DirEntry.inode() now convert inode (st_ino)"
" using unsigned integers."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29619`: os.stat()和os.DirEntry.inode()现在使用无符号整数转换inode（st_ino）。"

#: ../NEWS:43361
msgid ""
":issue:`28298`: Fix a bug that prevented array 'Q', 'L' and 'I' from "
"accepting big intables (objects that have __int__) as elements."
msgstr ":issue:`28298`: 修复了一个阻止数组'Q'、'L'和'I'接受大整数（具有__int__的对象）作为元素的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:43364
msgid ""
":issue:`29645`: Speed up importing the webbrowser module. "
"webbrowser.register() is now thread-safe."
msgstr ":issue:`29645`: 加快了导入webbrowser模块的速度。webbrowser.register()现在是线程安全的。"

#: ../NEWS:43367 ../NEWS:46249
msgid ""
":issue:`28231`: The zipfile module now accepts path-like objects for "
"external paths."
msgstr ":issue:`28231`: zipfile模块现在接受路径类对象作为外部路径。"

#: ../NEWS:43370 ../NEWS:46252
msgid ""
":issue:`26915`: index() and count() methods of collections.abc.Sequence now "
"check identity before checking equality when do comparisons."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26915`: "
"collections.abc.Sequence的index()和count()方法在进行比较时现在在检查相等性之前检查身份。"

#: ../NEWS:43373
msgid ":issue:`28682`: Added support for bytes paths in os.fwalk()."
msgstr ":issue:`28682`: 在 os.fwalk() 中添加了对字节路径的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:43375
msgid ""
":issue:`29728`: Add new :const:`socket.TCP_NOTSENT_LOWAT` (Linux 3.12) "
"constant. Patch by Nathaniel J. Smith."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29728`: 添加新的 :const:`socket.TCP_NOTSENT_LOWAT` (Linux 3.12) 常量。由 "
"Nathaniel J. Smith 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43378 ../NEWS:46461
msgid ""
":issue:`29623`: Allow use of path-like object as a single argument in "
"ConfigParser.read(). Patch by David Ellis."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29623`: 允许在 ConfigParser.read() 中使用路径类对象作为单一参数。由 David Ellis 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43381
msgid ""
":issue:`9303`: Migrate sqlite3 module to _v2 API.  Patch by Aviv Palivoda."
msgstr ":issue:`9303`: 将sqlite3模块迁移到 _v2 API。由 Aviv Palivoda 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43383 ../NEWS:46464
msgid ""
":issue:`28963`: Fix out of bound iteration in "
"asyncio.Future.remove_done_callback implemented in C."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28963`: 修复了在 C 中实现的 asyncio.Future.remove_done_callback 中的越界迭代。"

#: ../NEWS:43386 ../NEWS:46467 ../NEWS:50173
msgid ""
":issue:`29704`: asyncio.subprocess.SubprocessStreamProtocol no longer closes"
" before all pipes are closed."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29704`: asyncio.subprocess.SubprocessStreamProtocol 在所有管道关闭之前不再关闭。"

#: ../NEWS:43389 ../NEWS:46470
msgid ""
":issue:`29271`: Fix Task.current_task and Task.all_tasks implemented in C to"
" accept None argument as their pure Python implementation."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29271`: 修复 Task.current_task 和 Task.all_tasks 在 C 中的实现，使其能够接受 None "
"参数，如同它们的纯 Python 实现一样。"

#: ../NEWS:43392 ../NEWS:46473 ../NEWS:50176
msgid ""
":issue:`29703`: Fix asyncio to support instantiation of new event loops in "
"child processes."
msgstr ":issue:`29703`: 修复 asyncio，支持在子进程中实例化新的事件循环。"

#: ../NEWS:43395 ../NEWS:46255 ../NEWS:50169
msgid ""
":issue:`29615`: SimpleXMLRPCDispatcher no longer chains KeyError (or any "
"other exception) to exception(s) raised in the dispatched methods. Patch by "
"Petr Motejlek."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29615`: SimpleXMLRPCDispatcher 不再将 KeyError（或任何其他异常）链接到调度方法中引发的异常。由 "
"Petr Motejlek 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43399
msgid ""
":issue:`7769`: Method register_function() of "
"xmlrpc.server.SimpleXMLRPCDispatcher and its subclasses can now be used as a"
" decorator."
msgstr ""
":issue:`7769`: xmlrpc.server.SimpleXMLRPCDispatcher 及其子类的 "
"register_function() 方法现在可以用作装饰器。"

#: ../NEWS:43403 ../NEWS:46476 ../NEWS:50179
msgid ""
":issue:`29376`: Fix assertion error in threading._DummyThread.is_alive()."
msgstr ":issue:`29376`: 修复 threading._DummyThread.is_alive() 中的断言错误。"

#: ../NEWS:43405 ../NEWS:46478
msgid ""
":issue:`28624`: Add a test that checks that cwd parameter of Popen() accepts"
" PathLike objects.  Patch by Sayan Chowdhury."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28624`: 添加一个测试，检查 Popen() 的 cwd 参数是否接受 PathLike 对象。由 Sayan Chowdhury"
" 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43408 ../NEWS:46481
msgid ""
":issue:`28518`: Start a transaction implicitly before a DML statement. Patch"
" by Aviv Palivoda."
msgstr ":issue:`28518`: 在 DML 语句之前隐式开始一个事务。由 Aviv Palivoda 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43411 ../NEWS:46238 ../NEWS:50158
msgid ""
":issue:`29742`: get_extra_info() raises exception if get called on closed "
"ssl transport. Patch by Nikolay Kim."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29742`: 如果 get_extra_info() 在关闭的 ssl 传输上调用，将引发异常。由 Nikolay Kim 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43414
msgid ""
":issue:`16285`: urllib.parse.quote is now based on RFC 3986 and hence "
"includes '~' in the set of characters that is not quoted by default. Patch "
"by Christian Theune and Ratnadeep Debnath."
msgstr ""
":issue:`16285`: urllib.parse.quote 现在基于 RFC 3986，因此默认情况下不引用 '~' 字符。补丁由 "
"Christian Theune 和 Ratnadeep Debnath 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:43418 ../NEWS:46484 ../NEWS:50187
msgid ""
":issue:`29532`: Altering a kwarg dictionary passed to functools.partial() no"
" longer affects a partial object after creation."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29532`: 修改传递给 functools.partial() 的 kwarg 字典不再影响创建后的 partial 对象。"

#: ../NEWS:43421 ../NEWS:46487 ../NEWS:50181
msgid ""
":issue:`29110`: Fix file object leak in aifc.open() when file is given as a "
"filesystem path and is not in valid AIFF format. Patch by Anthony Zhang."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29110`: 修复 aifc.open() 中当文件作为文件系统路径给出且不是有效的 AIFF 格式时的文件对象泄漏问题。由 "
"Anthony Zhang 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43424
msgid ""
":issue:`22807`: Add uuid.SafeUUID and uuid.UUID.is_safe to relay information"
" from the platform about whether generated UUIDs are generated with a "
"multiprocessing safe method."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22807`: 添加 uuid.SafeUUID 和 uuid.UUID.is_safe，以传递平台关于生成的 UUID "
"是否使用多进程安全方法生成的信息。"

#: ../NEWS:43428
msgid ""
":issue:`29576`: Improve some deprecations in importlib. Some deprecated "
"methods now emit DeprecationWarnings and have better descriptive messages."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29576`: 改进了 importlib 中的一些弃用。一些弃用的方法现在会发出 "
"DeprecationWarnings，并有更好的描述性消息。"

#: ../NEWS:43431
msgid ""
":issue:`29534`: Fixed different behaviour of Decimal.from_float() for "
"_decimal and _pydecimal. Thanks Andrew Nester."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29534`: 修复了 Decimal.from_float() 在 _decimal 和 _pydecimal 中的不同行为。感谢 "
"Andrew Nester。"

#: ../NEWS:43434
msgid ""
":issue:`10379`: locale.format_string now supports the 'monetary' keyword "
"argument, and locale.format is deprecated."
msgstr ""
":issue:`10379`: locale.format_string 现在支持 'monetary' 关键字参数，而 locale.format "
"已被弃用。"

#: ../NEWS:43437
msgid ""
":issue:`29851`: importlib.reload() now raises ModuleNotFoundError if the "
"module lacks a spec."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29851`: importlib.reload() 现在会在模块缺少 spec 时抛出 ModuleNotFoundError。"

#: ../NEWS:43440 ../NEWS:46490 ../NEWS:50190
msgid ""
":issue:`28556`: Various updates to typing module: typing.Counter, "
"typing.ChainMap, improved ABC caching, etc. Original PRs by Jelle Zijlstra, "
"Ivan Levkivskyi, Manuel Krebber, and Łukasz Langa."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28556`: 对 typing 模块进行了多项更新：typing.Counter、typing.ChainMap、改进的 ABC "
"缓存等。原始 PR 由 Jelle Zijlstra、Ivan Levkivskyi、Manuel Krebber 和 Łukasz Langa 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:43444 ../NEWS:46494 ../NEWS:50194
msgid ""
":issue:`29100`: Fix datetime.fromtimestamp() regression introduced in Python"
" 3.6.0: check minimum and maximum years."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29100`: 修复了 Python 3.6.0 中引入的 datetime.fromtimestamp() "
"的回归问题：检查最小和最大年份。"

#: ../NEWS:43447 ../NEWS:46500 ../NEWS:50200
msgid ":issue:`29416`: Prevent infinite loop in pathlib.Path.mkdir"
msgstr ":issue:`29416`: 防止 pathlib.Path.mkdir 中的无限循环。"

#: ../NEWS:43449 ../NEWS:46502 ../NEWS:50202
msgid ""
":issue:`29444`: Fixed out-of-bounds buffer access in the group() method of "
"the match object. Based on patch by WGH."
msgstr ":issue:`29444`: 修复了 match 对象的 group() 方法中的越界缓冲区访问。基于 WGH 的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43452
msgid ""
":issue:`29377`: Add WrapperDescriptorType, MethodWrapperType, and "
"MethodDescriptorType built-in types to types module. Original patch by "
"Manuel Krebber."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29377`: 将 WrapperDescriptorType、MethodWrapperType 和 "
"MethodDescriptorType 内置类型添加到 types 模块。原始由 Manuel Krebber 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43456
msgid ""
":issue:`29218`: Unused install_misc command is now removed.  It has been "
"documented as unused since 2000.  Patch by Eric N. Vander Weele."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29218`: 现在移除了未使用的 install_misc 命令。自 2000 年以来，它已被记录为未使用。由 Eric N. "
"Vander Weele 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43459
msgid ""
":issue:`29368`: The extend() method is now called instead of the append() "
"method when unpickle collections.deque and other list-like objects. This can"
" speed up unpickling to 2 times."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29368`: 现在在反序列化 collections.deque 和其他类似列表的对象时，调用 extend() 方法而不是 "
"append() 方法。这可以将反序列化速度提高至 2 倍。"

#: ../NEWS:43463
msgid ""
":issue:`29338`: The help of a builtin or extension class now includes the "
"constructor signature if __text_signature__ is provided for the class."
msgstr ":issue:`29338`: 现在，如果为类提供了 __text_signature__，内置或扩展类的帮助信息会包括构造函数签名。"

#: ../NEWS:43466 ../NEWS:46505 ../NEWS:50205
msgid ""
":issue:`29335`: Fix subprocess.Popen.wait() when the child process has "
"exited to a stopped instead of terminated state (ex: when under ptrace)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29335`: 修复了当子进程已退出到停止状态而不是终止状态（例如：在 ptrace 下）时的 "
"subprocess.Popen.wait()。"

#: ../NEWS:43469 ../NEWS:46508 ../NEWS:50208
msgid ""
":issue:`29290`: Fix a regression in argparse that help messages would wrap "
"at non-breaking spaces."
msgstr ":issue:`29290`: 修复了 argparse 中帮助消息会在非断行空格处换行的回归问题。"

#: ../NEWS:43472 ../NEWS:46511 ../NEWS:50211
msgid ":issue:`28735`: Fixed the comparison of mock.MagickMock with mock.ANY."
msgstr ":issue:`28735`: 修复了 mock.MagickMock 与 mock.ANY 的比较。"

#: ../NEWS:43474
msgid ":issue:`29197`: Removed deprecated function ntpath.splitunc()."
msgstr ":issue:`29197`: 移除了已弃用的函数 ntpath.splitunc()。"

#: ../NEWS:43476
msgid ""
":issue:`29210`: Removed support of deprecated argument \"exclude\" in "
"tarfile.TarFile.add()."
msgstr ":issue:`29210`: 移除了对 tarfile.TarFile.add() 中已弃用参数 \"exclude\" 的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:43479 ../NEWS:46516 ../NEWS:50215
msgid ""
":issue:`29219`: Fixed infinite recursion in the repr of uninitialized "
"ctypes.CDLL instances."
msgstr ":issue:`29219`: 修复了未初始化的 ctypes.CDLL 实例的 repr 中的无限递归。"

#: ../NEWS:43482
msgid ""
":issue:`29192`: Removed deprecated features in the http.cookies module."
msgstr ":issue:`29192`: 移除了 http.cookies 模块中已弃用的功能。"

#: ../NEWS:43484
msgid ""
":issue:`29193`: A format string argument for string.Formatter.format() is "
"now positional-only."
msgstr ":issue:`29193`: string.Formatter.format() 的格式字符串参数现在仅为位置参数。"

#: ../NEWS:43487
msgid ""
":issue:`29195`: Removed support of deprecated undocumented keyword arguments"
" in methods of regular expression objects."
msgstr ":issue:`29195`: 移除了对正则表达式对象方法中已弃用的未记录关键字参数的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:43490 ../NEWS:46521 ../NEWS:50218
msgid ""
":issue:`28969`: Fixed race condition in C implementation of "
"functools.lru_cache. KeyError could be raised when cached function with full"
" cache was simultaneously called from different threads with the same "
"uncached arguments."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28969`: "
"修复了functools.lru_cache的C实现中的竞态条件。当缓存函数满时，如果同时从不同线程以相同的未缓存参数调用，可能会引发KeyError。"

#: ../NEWS:43495
msgid ""
":issue:`20804`: The unittest.mock.sentinel attributes now preserve their "
"identity when they are copied or pickled."
msgstr ":issue:`20804`: unittest.mock.sentinel属性现在在复制或pickle时保持其身份。"

#: ../NEWS:43498 ../NEWS:46526 ../NEWS:50223
msgid ""
":issue:`29142`: In urllib.request, suffixes in no_proxy environment variable"
" with leading dots could match related hostnames again (e.g. .b.c matches "
"a.b.c). Patch by Milan Oberkirch."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29142`: "
"在urllib.request中，no_proxy环境变量中带有前导点的后缀可以再次匹配相关的主机名（例如.b.c匹配a.b.c）。由Milan "
"Oberkirch提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43502 ../NEWS:46530 ../NEWS:50184
msgid ""
":issue:`28961`: Fix unittest.mock._Call helper: don't ignore the name "
"parameter anymore. Patch written by Jiajun Huang."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28961`: 修复unittest.mock._Call辅助函数：不再忽略name参数。由Jiajun Huang提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43505 ../NEWS:46537 ../NEWS:50476
msgid ""
":issue:`15812`: inspect.getframeinfo() now correctly shows the first line of"
" a context. Patch by Sam Breese."
msgstr ":issue:`15812`: inspect.getframeinfo()现在正确显示上下文的第行。由Sam Breese提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43508
msgid ""
":issue:`28985`: Update authorizer constants in sqlite3 module. Patch by "
"Dingyuan Wang."
msgstr ":issue:`28985`: 更新sqlite3模块中的授权者常量。由Dingyuan Wang提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43511 ../NEWS:46549
msgid ":issue:`29079`: Prevent infinite loop in pathlib.resolve() on Windows"
msgstr ":issue:`29079`: 防止pathlib.resolve()在Windows上陷入无限循环。"

#: ../NEWS:43513 ../NEWS:46551 ../NEWS:50482
msgid ""
":issue:`13051`: Fixed recursion errors in large or resized "
"curses.textpad.Textbox.  Based on patch by Tycho Andersen."
msgstr ""
":issue:`13051`: 修复了大型或调整大小的curses.textpad.Textbox中的递归错误。基于Tycho Andersen的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43516 ../NEWS:46558 ../NEWS:50489
msgid ""
":issue:`9770`: curses.ascii predicates now work correctly with negative "
"integers."
msgstr ":issue:`9770`: curses.ascii谓词现在正确处理负整数。"

#: ../NEWS:43519 ../NEWS:46561 ../NEWS:50492
msgid ""
":issue:`28427`: old keys should not remove new values from "
"WeakValueDictionary when collecting from another thread."
msgstr ":issue:`28427`: 当从另一个线程收集时，旧键不应从WeakValueDictionary中移除新值。"

#: ../NEWS:43522 ../NEWS:46564 ../NEWS:50495
msgid ":issue:`28923`: Remove editor artifacts from Tix.py."
msgstr ":issue:`28923`: 从Tix.py中移除编辑器工件。"

#: ../NEWS:43524 ../NEWS:46569 ../NEWS:50497
msgid ":issue:`28871`: Fixed a crash when deallocate deep ElementTree."
msgstr ":issue:`28871`: 修复了在深度ElementTree释放时的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:43526 ../NEWS:46571 ../NEWS:50499
msgid ""
":issue:`19542`: Fix bugs in WeakValueDictionary.setdefault() and "
"WeakValueDictionary.pop() when a GC collection happens in another thread."
msgstr ""
":issue:`19542`: "
"修复WeakValueDictionary.setdefault()和WeakValueDictionary.pop()中的bug，这些bug在另一个线程发生GC收集时出现。"

#: ../NEWS:43529 ../NEWS:46574
msgid ""
":issue:`20191`: Fixed a crash in resource.prlimit() when passing a sequence "
"that doesn't own its elements as limits."
msgstr ":issue:`20191`: 修复了resource.prlimit()中的崩溃，当传递一个不拥有其元素的序列作为限制时。"

#: ../NEWS:43532
msgid ""
":issue:`16255`: subprocess.Popen uses /system/bin/sh on Android as the "
"shell, instead of /bin/sh."
msgstr ""
":issue:`16255`: subprocess.Popen在Android上使用/system/bin/sh作为shell，而不是/bin/sh。"

#: ../NEWS:43535 ../NEWS:46577 ../NEWS:50505
msgid ""
":issue:`28779`: multiprocessing.set_forkserver_preload() would crash the "
"forkserver process if a preloaded module instantiated some multiprocessing "
"objects such as locks."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28779`: "
"如果预加载的模块实例化了某些多处理对象（如锁），multiprocessing.set_forkserver_preload()会使forkserver进程崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:43539 ../NEWS:46584
msgid ""
":issue:`26937`: The chown() method of the tarfile.TarFile class does not "
"fail now when the grp module cannot be imported, as for example on Android "
"platforms."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26937`: tarfile.TarFile 类的 chown() 方法现在在无法导入 grp 模块时不会失败，例如在 Android"
" 平台上。"

#: ../NEWS:43543
msgid ""
":issue:`28847`: dbm.dumb now supports reading read-only files and no longer "
"writes the index file when it is not changed.  A deprecation warning is now "
"emitted if the index file is missed and recreated in the 'r' and 'w' modes "
"(will be an error in future Python releases)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28847`: dbm.dumb 现在支持读取只读文件，并且在索引文件未更改时不再写入。如果在 'r' 和 'w' "
"模式下索引文件丢失并重新创建，现在会发出弃用警告（在未来的 Python 版本中将会是错误）。"

#: ../NEWS:43548
msgid ""
":issue:`27030`: Unknown escapes consisting of ``'\\'`` and an ASCII letter "
"in re.sub() replacement templates regular expressions now are errors."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27030`: 在 re.sub() 替换模板正则表达式中，由 ``'\\'`` 和一个 ASCII 字母组成的未知转义现在会引发错误。"

#: ../NEWS:43551 ../NEWS:46765
msgid ""
":issue:`28835`: Fix a regression introduced in warnings.catch_warnings(): "
"call warnings.showwarning() if it was overridden inside the context manager."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28835`: 修复了 warnings.catch_warnings() 中引入的一个回归问题：如果在上下文管理器内部覆盖了 "
"warnings.showwarning()，则调用它。"

#: ../NEWS:43554 ../NEWS:46768
msgid ""
":issue:`27172`: To assist with upgrades from 2.7, the previously documented "
"deprecation of ``inspect.getfullargspec()`` has been reversed. This decision"
" may be revisited again after the Python 2.7 branch is no longer officially "
"supported."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27172`: 为了协助从 2.7 版本升级，之前文档中关于 ``inspect.getfullargspec()`` "
"的弃用已被撤销。在 Python 2.7 分支不再官方支持后，可能会重新考虑这一决定。"

#: ../NEWS:43559
msgid ""
":issue:`28740`: Add sys.getandroidapilevel(): return the build time API "
"version of Android as an integer. Function only available on Android."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28740`: 添加 sys.getandroidapilevel()：返回 Android 的构建时 API 版本作为整数。此函数仅在"
" Android 上可用。"

#: ../NEWS:43562 ../NEWS:46773
msgid ""
":issue:`26273`: Add new :const:`socket.TCP_CONGESTION` (Linux 2.6.13) and "
":const:`socket.TCP_USER_TIMEOUT` (Linux 2.6.37) constants. Patch written by "
"Omar Sandoval."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26273`: 新增 :const:`socket.TCP_CONGESTION` (Linux 2.6.13) 和 "
":const:`socket.TCP_USER_TIMEOUT` (Linux 2.6.37) 常量。补丁由 Omar Sandoval 编写。"

#: ../NEWS:43566 ../NEWS:46844
msgid ":issue:`28752`: Restored the __reduce__() methods of datetime objects."
msgstr ":issue:`28752`: 恢复了 datetime 对象的 __reduce__() 方法。"

#: ../NEWS:43568 ../NEWS:46846
msgid ""
":issue:`28727`: Regular expression patterns, _sre.SRE_Pattern objects "
"created by re.compile(), become comparable (only x==y and x!=y operators). "
"This change should fix the :issue:`18383`: don't duplicate warning filters "
"when the warnings module is reloaded (thing usually only done in unit "
"tests)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28727`: 正则表达式模式，由 re.compile() 创建的 _sre.SRE_Pattern 对象，现在可以比较（仅限 "
"x==y 和 x!=y 操作符）。这一更改应该修复了 :issue:`18383`：当 warnings "
"模块重新加载时不要重复警告过滤器（通常只在单元测试中这样做）。"

#: ../NEWS:43573
msgid ""
":issue:`20572`: Remove the subprocess.Popen.wait endtime parameter.  It was "
"deprecated in 3.4 and undocumented prior to that."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20572`: 移除了 subprocess.Popen.wait 的 endtime 参数。它在 3.4 "
"版本中被弃用，在此之前也未在文档中记录。"

#: ../NEWS:43576 ../NEWS:46854 ../NEWS:50512
msgid ""
":issue:`25659`: In ctypes, prevent a crash calling the from_buffer() and "
"from_buffer_copy() methods on abstract classes like Array."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25659`: 在 ctypes 中，防止在抽象类（如 Array）上调用 from_buffer() 和 "
"from_buffer_copy() 方法时崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:43579
msgid ""
":issue:`28548`: In the \"http.server\" module, parse the protocol version if"
" possible, to avoid using HTTP 0.9 in some error responses."
msgstr ":issue:`28548`: 在\"http.server\"模块中，尽可能解析协议版本，以避免在某些错误响应中使用HTTP 0.9。"

#: ../NEWS:43582 ../NEWS:46857
msgid ""
":issue:`19717`: Makes Path.resolve() succeed on paths that do not exist. "
"Patch by Vajrasky Kok"
msgstr ":issue:`19717`: 使Path.resolve()在不存在的路径上也能成功。由Vajrasky Kok提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43585 ../NEWS:46860
msgid ""
":issue:`28563`: Fixed possible DoS and arbitrary code execution when handle "
"plural form selections in the gettext module.  The expression parser now "
"supports exact syntax supported by GNU gettext."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28563`: 修复了在gettext模块中处理复数形式选择时可能导致的DoS和任意代码执行问题。表达式解析器现在支持GNU "
"gettext所支持的精确语法。"

#: ../NEWS:43589 ../NEWS:46864 ../NEWS:50521
msgid ""
":issue:`28387`: Fixed possible crash in _io.TextIOWrapper deallocator when "
"the garbage collector is invoked in other thread.  Based on patch by "
"Sebastian Cufre."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28387`: 修复了当垃圾收集器在其他线程中调用时，_io.TextIOWrapper解构器可能崩溃的问题。基于Sebastian "
"Cufre的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43593 ../NEWS:46947 ../NEWS:50525
msgid ""
":issue:`27517`: LZMA compressor and decompressor no longer raise exceptions "
"if given empty data twice.  Patch by Benjamin Fogle."
msgstr ":issue:`27517`: LZMA压缩器和解压器在两次接收到空数据时不再抛出异常。补丁由Benjamin Fogle提供。"

#: ../NEWS:43596 ../NEWS:46950 ../NEWS:50528
msgid ":issue:`28549`: Fixed segfault in curses's addch() with ncurses6."
msgstr ":issue:`28549`: 修复了curses的addch()在使用ncurses6时的段错误。"

#: ../NEWS:43598 ../NEWS:46952 ../NEWS:50530
msgid ""
":issue:`28449`: tarfile.open() with mode \"r\" or \"r:\" now tries to open a"
" tar file with compression before trying to open it without compression. "
"Otherwise it had 50% chance failed with ignore_zeros=True."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28449`: "
"tarfile.open()以模式\"r\"或\"r:\"现在会先尝试以压缩方式打开tar文件，再尝试无压缩方式打开。否则在使用ignore_zeros=True时有50%的几率失败。"

#: ../NEWS:43602 ../NEWS:46956 ../NEWS:50534
msgid ""
":issue:`23262`: The webbrowser module now supports Firefox 36+ and derived "
"browsers.  Based on patch by Oleg Broytman."
msgstr ":issue:`23262`: webbrowser模块现在支持Firefox 36+及衍生浏览器。基于Oleg Broytman的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43605
msgid ""
":issue:`24241`: The webbrowser in an X environment now prefers using the "
"default browser directly. Also, the webbrowser register() function now has a"
" documented 'preferred' argument, to specify browsers to be returned by "
"get() with no arguments. Patch by David Steele"
msgstr ""
":issue:`24241`: "
"在X环境下，webbrowser现在更倾向于直接使用默认浏览器。此外，webbrowser的register()函数现在有一个文档化的'preferred'参数，用于指定无参数调用get()时返回的浏览器。补丁由David"
" Steele提供。"

#: ../NEWS:43610 ../NEWS:46959 ../NEWS:50537
msgid ""
":issue:`27939`: Fixed bugs in tkinter.ttk.LabeledScale and tkinter.Scale "
"caused by representing the scale as float value internally in Tk.  "
"tkinter.IntVar now works if float value is set to underlying Tk variable."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27939`: "
"修复了tkinter.ttk.LabeledScale和tkinter.Scale中由于在Tk内部将比例表示为浮点值而导致的错误。如果底层Tk变量设置为浮点值，tkinter.IntVar现在可以正常工作。"

#: ../NEWS:43614
msgid ""
":issue:`28255`: calendar.TextCalendar.prweek() no longer prints a space "
"after a weeks's calendar.  calendar.TextCalendar.pryear() no longer prints "
"redundant newline after a year's calendar.  Based on patch by Xiang Zhang."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28255`: "
"calendar.TextCalendar.prweek()不再在周历后打印空格。calendar.TextCalendar.pryear()不再在年历后打印多余的换行符。基于Xiang"
" Zhang的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43618
msgid ""
":issue:`28255`: calendar.TextCalendar.prmonth() no longer prints a space at "
"the start of new line after printing a month's calendar.  Patch by Xiang "
"Zhang."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28255`: calendar.TextCalendar.prmonth()在打印月历后的新行开头不再打印空格。由Xiang "
"Zhang提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43622 ../NEWS:46970 ../NEWS:50545
msgid ""
":issue:`20491`: The textwrap.TextWrapper class now honors non-breaking "
"spaces. Based on patch by Kaarle Ritvanen."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20491`: textwrap.TextWrapper 类现在支持不换行空格。基于 Kaarle Ritvanen 的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43625 ../NEWS:46973 ../NEWS:50548
msgid ":issue:`28353`: os.fwalk() no longer fails on broken links."
msgstr ":issue:`28353`: os.fwalk() 不再因损坏的链接而失败。"

#: ../NEWS:43627 ../NEWS:46975
msgid ""
":issue:`28430`: Fix iterator of C implemented asyncio.Future doesn't accept "
"non-None value is passed to it.send(val)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28430`: 修复了 C 实现的 asyncio.Future 迭代器不接受非 None 值传递给 it.send(val) 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:43630 ../NEWS:46978
msgid ""
":issue:`27025`: Generated names for Tkinter widgets now start by the \"!\" "
"prefix for readability."
msgstr ":issue:`27025`: 为提升可读性，Tkinter 部件的生成名称现在以 \"!\" 前缀开头。"

#: ../NEWS:43633 ../NEWS:46981 ../NEWS:50550
msgid ""
":issue:`25464`: Fixed HList.header_exists() in tkinter.tix module by addin a"
" workaround to Tix library bug."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25464`: 通过为 Tix 库的 bug 添加变通方法，修复了 tkinter.tix 模块中的 "
"HList.header_exists()。"

#: ../NEWS:43636 ../NEWS:46984
msgid ""
":issue:`28488`: shutil.make_archive() no longer adds entry \"./\" to ZIP "
"archive."
msgstr ":issue:`28488`: shutil.make_archive() 不再向 ZIP 归档添加 \"./\" 条目。"

#: ../NEWS:43638 ../NEWS:46986
msgid ""
":issue:`25953`: re.sub() now raises an error for invalid numerical group "
"reference in replacement template even if the pattern is not found in the "
"string.  Error message for invalid group reference now includes the group "
"index and the position of the reference. Based on patch by SilentGhost."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25953`: re.sub() "
"现在即使在字符串中未找到模式，也会为替换模板中的无效数字组引用引发错误。无效组引用的错误消息现在包括组索引和引用的位置。基于 SilentGhost "
"的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43643
msgid ""
":issue:`28469`: timeit now uses the sequence 1, 2, 5, 10, 20, 50,... instead"
" of 1, 10, 100,... for autoranging."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28469`: timeit 现在使用 1, 2, 5, 10, 20, 50,... 序列代替 1, 10, 100,... "
"进行自动范围调整。"

#: ../NEWS:43646
msgid ""
":issue:`28115`: Command-line interface of the zipfile module now uses "
"argparse. Added support of long options."
msgstr ":issue:`28115`: zipfile 模块的命令行界面现在使用 argparse。添加了对长选项的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:43649 ../NEWS:46991
msgid ""
":issue:`18219`: Optimize csv.DictWriter for large number of columns. Patch "
"by Mariatta Wijaya."
msgstr ":issue:`18219`: 为大量列优化 csv.DictWriter。Mariatta Wijaya 的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43652 ../NEWS:46994
msgid ""
":issue:`28448`: Fix C implemented asyncio.Future didn't work on Windows."
msgstr ":issue:`28448`: 修复了 C 实现的 asyncio.Future 在 Windows 上不工作的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:43654
msgid ""
":issue:`23214`: In the \"io\" module, the argument to BufferedReader and "
"BytesIO's read1() methods is now optional and can be -1, matching the "
"BufferedIOBase specification."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23214`: 在 \"io\" 模块中，BufferedReader 和 BytesIO 的 read1() "
"方法的参数现在是可选的，并且可以是 -1，以匹配 BufferedIOBase 的规范。"

#: ../NEWS:43658 ../NEWS:46996
msgid ""
":issue:`28480`: Fix error building socket module when multithreading is "
"disabled."
msgstr ":issue:`28480`: 修复在禁用多线程时构建 socket 模块时的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:43661
msgid ""
":issue:`28240`: timeit: remove ``-c/--clock`` and ``-t/--time`` command line"
" options which were deprecated since Python 3.3."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28240`: timeit: 移除自 Python 3.3 以来已弃用的 ``-c/--clock`` 和 ``-t/--time``"
" 命令行选项。"

#: ../NEWS:43664
msgid ""
":issue:`28240`: timeit now repeats the benchmarks 5 times instead of only 3 "
"to make benchmarks more reliable."
msgstr ":issue:`28240`: timeit 现在将基准测试重复 5 次而非仅 3 次，以使基准测试更加可靠。"

#: ../NEWS:43667
msgid ""
":issue:`28240`: timeit autorange now uses a single loop iteration if the "
"benchmark takes less than 10 seconds, instead of 10 iterations. \"python3 -m"
" timeit -s 'import time' 'time.sleep(1)'\" now takes 4 seconds instead of 40"
" seconds."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28240`: 如果基准测试耗时少于 10 秒，timeit 自动范围调整现在使用单次循环迭代而非 10 次迭代。\"python3 "
"-m timeit -s 'import time' 'time.sleep(1)'\" 现在耗时 4 秒而非 40 秒。"

#: ../NEWS:43672
msgid ""
"Distutils.sdist now looks for README and setup.py files with case "
"sensitivity. This behavior matches that found in Setuptools 6.0 and later. "
"See `setuptools 100 <https://github.com/pypa/setuptools/issues/100>`_ for "
"rationale."
msgstr ""
"Distutils.sdist 现在对 README 和 setup.py 文件的查找区分大小写。这一行为与 Setuptools 6.0 "
"及以后版本中的行为一致。理由参见 `setuptools 100 "
"<https://github.com/pypa/setuptools/issues/100>`_。"

#: ../NEWS:43677
msgid ""
":issue:`24452`: Make webbrowser support Chrome on Mac OS X. Patch by Ned "
"Batchelder."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24452`: 使 webbrowser 支持 Mac OS X 上的 Chrome。由 Ned Batchelder 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43680 ../NEWS:47001 ../NEWS:50557
msgid ""
":issue:`20766`: Fix references leaked by pdb in the handling of SIGINT "
"handlers."
msgstr ":issue:`20766`: 修复了 pdb 在处理 SIGINT 处理器时的引用泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:43683 ../NEWS:47117
msgid ""
":issue:`27998`: Fixed bytes path support in os.scandir() on Windows. Patch "
"by Eryk Sun."
msgstr ":issue:`27998`: 修复了 Windows 上 os.scandir() 对字节路径的支持。由 Eryk Sun 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43686 ../NEWS:47120
msgid ":issue:`28317`: The disassembler now decodes FORMAT_VALUE argument."
msgstr ":issue:`28317`: 反汇编器现在解码 FORMAT_VALUE 参数。"

#: ../NEWS:43688 ../NEWS:47126
msgid ""
":issue:`28380`: unittest.mock Mock autospec functions now properly support "
"assert_called, assert_not_called, and assert_called_once."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28380`: unittest.mock 的 Mock autospec 函数现在正确支持 "
"assert_called、assert_not_called 和 assert_called_once。"

#: ../NEWS:43691 ../NEWS:47131
msgid ":issue:`28229`: lzma module now supports pathlib."
msgstr ":issue:`28229`: lzma 模块现在支持 pathlib。"

#: ../NEWS:43693 ../NEWS:47133 ../NEWS:50564
msgid ""
":issue:`28321`: Fixed writing non-BMP characters with binary format in "
"plistlib."
msgstr ":issue:`28321`: 修复了在 plistlib 中使用二进制格式写入非 BMP 字符的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:43696 ../NEWS:47136
msgid ""
":issue:`28225`: bz2 module now supports pathlib.  Initial patch by Ethan "
"Furman."
msgstr ":issue:`28225`: bz2 模块现在支持 pathlib。初始由 Ethan Furman 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43699 ../NEWS:47139
msgid ":issue:`28227`: gzip now supports pathlib.  Patch by Ethan Furman."
msgstr ":issue:`28227`: gzip 现在支持 pathlib。由 Ethan Furman 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43701
msgid ""
":issue:`28332`: Deprecated silent truncations in socket.htons and "
"socket.ntohs. Original patch by Oren Milman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28332`: 弃用了 socket.htons 和 socket.ntohs 中的静默截断。原始由 Oren Milman 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43704 ../NEWS:47141
msgid ""
":issue:`27358`: Optimized merging var-keyword arguments and improved error "
"message when passing a non-mapping as a var-keyword argument."
msgstr ":issue:`27358`: 优化了合并可变关键字参数的过程，并改进了当传递非映射作为可变关键字参数时的错误信息。"

#: ../NEWS:43707 ../NEWS:47144
msgid ""
":issue:`28257`: Improved error message when passing a non-iterable as a var-"
"positional argument.  Added opcode BUILD_TUPLE_UNPACK_WITH_CALL."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28257`: 改进了当传递非可迭代对象作为可变位置参数时的错误信息。添加了操作码 "
"BUILD_TUPLE_UNPACK_WITH_CALL。"

#: ../NEWS:43710 ../NEWS:47147 ../NEWS:50567
msgid ""
":issue:`28322`: Fixed possible crashes when unpickle itertools objects from "
"incorrect pickle data.  Based on patch by John Leitch."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28322`: 修复了当从错误的 pickle 数据反序列化 itertools 对象时可能发生的崩溃。基于 John Leitch "
"的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43713 ../NEWS:47150
msgid ":issue:`28228`: imghdr now supports pathlib."
msgstr ":issue:`28228`: imghdr 现在支持 pathlib。"

#: ../NEWS:43715 ../NEWS:47152
msgid ":issue:`28226`: compileall now supports pathlib."
msgstr ":issue:`28226`: compileall 现在支持 pathlib。"

#: ../NEWS:43717 ../NEWS:47154
msgid ""
":issue:`28314`: Fix function declaration (C flags) for the getiterator() "
"method of xml.etree.ElementTree.Element."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28314`: 修复了 xml.etree.ElementTree.Element 的 getiterator() 方法的函数声明（C "
"标志）。"

#: ../NEWS:43720 ../NEWS:47157
msgid ""
":issue:`28148`: Stop using localtime() and gmtime() in the time module. "
"Introduced platform independent _PyTime_localtime API that is similar to "
"POSIX localtime_r, but available on all platforms.  Patch by Ed Schouten."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28148`: 停止在 time 模块中使用 localtime() 和 gmtime()。引入了平台无关的 "
"_PyTime_localtime API，该 API 类似于 POSIX 的 localtime_r，但在所有平台上都可用。由 Ed Schouten"
" 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43724 ../NEWS:47161 ../NEWS:50576
msgid ""
":issue:`28253`: Fixed calendar functions for extreme months: 0001-01 and "
"9999-12. Methods itermonthdays() and itermonthdays2() are reimplemented so "
"that they don't call itermonthdates() which can cause datetime.date "
"under/overflow."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28253`: "
"修复了极端月份（0001-01和9999-12）的日历功能。重新实现了itermonthdays()和itermonthdays2()方法，使其不再调用可能导致datetime.date下溢/溢出的itermonthdates()。"

#: ../NEWS:43729 ../NEWS:47166 ../NEWS:50581
msgid ""
":issue:`28275`: Fixed possible use after free in the decompress() methods of"
" the LZMADecompressor and BZ2Decompressor classes. Original patch by John "
"Leitch."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28275`: "
"修复了LZMADecompressor和BZ2Decompressor类中decompress()方法可能存在的释放后使用问题。原始由John "
"Leitch提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43733 ../NEWS:47170 ../NEWS:50585
msgid ""
":issue:`27897`: Fixed possible crash in "
"sqlite3.Connection.create_collation() if pass invalid string-like object as "
"a name.  Patch by Xiang Zhang."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27897`: "
"修复了如果传递无效的字符串类似对象作为名称时，sqlite3.Connection.create_collation()可能崩溃的问题。由Xiang "
"Zhang提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43736 ../NEWS:47173
msgid ""
":issue:`18844`: random.choices() now has k as a keyword-only argument to "
"improve the readability of common cases and come into line with the "
"signature used in other languages."
msgstr ""
":issue:`18844`: random.choices()现在将k作为仅关键字参数，以提高常见情况的可读性，并与其他语言中使用的签名保持一致。"

#: ../NEWS:43740 ../NEWS:47177 ../NEWS:50588
msgid ""
":issue:`18893`: Fix invalid exception handling in "
"Lib/ctypes/macholib/dyld.py. Patch by Madison May."
msgstr ""
":issue:`18893`: 修复了Lib/ctypes/macholib/dyld.py中无效的异常处理。由Madison May提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43743 ../NEWS:47180
msgid ""
":issue:`27611`: Fixed support of default root window in the tkinter.tix "
"module. Added the master parameter in the DisplayStyle constructor."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27611`: 修复了tkinter.tix模块中对默认根窗口的支持。在DisplayStyle构造函数中添加了master参数。"

#: ../NEWS:43746 ../NEWS:47183 ../NEWS:50593
msgid ""
":issue:`27348`: In the traceback module, restore the formatting of exception"
" messages like \"Exception: None\".  This fixes a regression introduced in "
"3.5a2."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27348`: 在traceback模块中，恢复了类似于\"Exception: "
"None\"的异常消息的格式化。这修复了3.5a2中引入的回归问题。"

#: ../NEWS:43750 ../NEWS:47187 ../NEWS:50597
msgid ""
":issue:`25651`: Allow false values to be used for msg parameter of "
"subTest()."
msgstr ":issue:`25651`: 允许在subTest()的msg参数中使用假值。"

#: ../NEWS:43752 ../NEWS:47189
msgid ""
":issue:`27778`: Fix a memory leak in os.getrandom() when the getrandom() is "
"interrupted by a signal and a signal handler raises a Python exception."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27778`: "
"修复了当getrandom()被信号中断且信号处理程序引发Python异常时，os.getrandom()中的内存泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:43755 ../NEWS:47192
msgid ""
":issue:`28200`: Fix memory leak on Windows in the os module (fix "
"path_converter() function)."
msgstr ":issue:`28200`: 修复了Windows上os模块中的内存泄漏问题（修复了path_converter()函数）。"

#: ../NEWS:43758 ../NEWS:47195
msgid ""
":issue:`25400`: RobotFileParser now correctly returns default values for "
"crawl_delay and request_rate.  Initial patch by Peter Wirtz."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25400`: RobotFileParser现在正确返回crawl_delay和request_rate的默认值。初始由Peter "
"Wirtz提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43761 ../NEWS:47198 ../NEWS:50599
msgid ":issue:`27932`: Prevent memory leak in win32_ver()."
msgstr ":issue:`27932`: 防止win32_ver()中的内存泄漏。"

#: ../NEWS:43763 ../NEWS:47200 ../NEWS:50601
msgid "Fix UnboundLocalError in socket._sendfile_use_sendfile."
msgstr "修复socket._sendfile_use_sendfile中的UnboundLocalError。"

#: ../NEWS:43765 ../NEWS:47202 ../NEWS:50603
msgid ""
":issue:`28075`: Check for ERROR_ACCESS_DENIED in Windows implementation of "
"os.stat().  Patch by Eryk Sun."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28075`: 在Windows的os.stat()实现中检查ERROR_ACCESS_DENIED。由Eryk Sun提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43768 ../NEWS:47205
msgid ""
":issue:`22493`: Warning message emitted by using inline flags in the middle "
"of regular expression now contains a (truncated) regex pattern. Patch by Tim"
" Graham."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22493`: 现在，通过在正则表达式中间使用内联标志发出的警告消息包含（截断的）正则表达式模式。由Tim Graham提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43772 ../NEWS:47209 ../NEWS:50606
msgid ""
":issue:`25270`: Prevent codecs.escape_encode() from raising SystemError when"
" an empty bytestring is passed."
msgstr ":issue:`25270`: 防止在传递空字节串时codecs.escape_encode()引发SystemError。"

#: ../NEWS:43775 ../NEWS:47212 ../NEWS:50609
msgid ":issue:`28181`: Get antigravity over HTTPS. Patch by Kaartic Sivaraam."
msgstr ":issue:`28181`: 通过HTTPS获取antigravity。由Kaartic Sivaraam提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43777 ../NEWS:47214 ../NEWS:50611
msgid ""
":issue:`25895`: Enable WebSocket URL schemes in urllib.parse.urljoin. Patch "
"by Gergely Imreh and Markus Holtermann."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25895`: 在urllib.parse.urljoin中启用WebSocket URL方案。由Gergely "
"Imreh和Markus Holtermann提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43780 ../NEWS:47217
msgid ""
":issue:`28114`: Fix a crash in parse_envlist() when env contains byte "
"strings. Patch by Eryk Sun."
msgstr ":issue:`28114`: 修复当env包含字节字符串时parse_envlist()崩溃的问题。由Eryk Sun提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43783 ../NEWS:47220 ../NEWS:50614
msgid ""
":issue:`27599`: Fixed buffer overrun in binascii.b2a_qp() and "
"binascii.a2b_qp()."
msgstr ":issue:`27599`: 修复binascii.b2a_qp()和binascii.a2b_qp()中的缓冲区溢出问题。"

#: ../NEWS:43786 ../NEWS:47223 ../NEWS:50797
msgid ""
":issue:`27906`: Fix socket accept exhaustion during high TCP traffic. Patch "
"by Kevin Conway."
msgstr ":issue:`27906`: 在高TCP流量期间修复socket接受耗尽问题。由Kevin Conway提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43789 ../NEWS:47226 ../NEWS:50800
msgid ""
":issue:`28174`: Handle when SO_REUSEPORT isn't properly supported. Patch by "
"Seth Michael Larson."
msgstr ":issue:`28174`: 处理当SO_REUSEPORT未被正确支持时的情况。由Seth Michael Larson提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43792 ../NEWS:47229 ../NEWS:50803
msgid ""
":issue:`26654`: Inspect functools.partial in asyncio.Handle.__repr__. Patch "
"by iceboy."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26654`: 在asyncio.Handle.__repr__中检查functools.partial。由iceboy提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43795 ../NEWS:47232 ../NEWS:50806
msgid ":issue:`26909`: Fix slow pipes IO in asyncio. Patch by INADA Naoki."
msgstr ":issue:`26909`: 修复asyncio中慢速管道IO的问题。由INADA Naoki提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43797 ../NEWS:47234 ../NEWS:50808
msgid ""
":issue:`28176`: Fix callbacks race in asyncio.SelectorLoop.sock_connect."
msgstr ":issue:`28176`: 修复asyncio.SelectorLoop.sock_connect中的回调竞争问题。"

#: ../NEWS:43799 ../NEWS:47236 ../NEWS:50810
msgid ""
":issue:`27759`: Fix selectors incorrectly retain invalid file descriptors. "
"Patch by Mark Williams."
msgstr ":issue:`27759`: 修复选择器错误保留无效文件描述符的问题。由Mark Williams提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43802
msgid ""
":issue:`28325`: Remove vestigial MacOS 9 macurl2path module and its tests."
msgstr ":issue:`28325`: 移除遗留的MacOS 9 macurl2path模块及其测试。"

#: ../NEWS:43804 ../NEWS:47239 ../NEWS:50813
msgid ""
":issue:`28368`: Refuse monitoring processes if the child watcher has no loop"
" attached. Patch by Vincent Michel."
msgstr ":issue:`28368`: 如果子监视器没有附加循环，则拒绝监视进程。由Vincent Michel提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43807 ../NEWS:47242 ../NEWS:50816
msgid ""
":issue:`28369`: Raise RuntimeError when transport's FD is used with "
"add_reader, add_writer, etc."
msgstr ":issue:`28369`: 当传输的FD与add_reader、add_writer等一起使用时引发RuntimeError。"

#: ../NEWS:43810 ../NEWS:47245 ../NEWS:50819
msgid ""
":issue:`28370`: Speedup asyncio.StreamReader.readexactly. Patch by Коренберг"
" Марк."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28370`: 加速asyncio.StreamReader.readexactly。由Коренберг Марк提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43813 ../NEWS:47248 ../NEWS:50822
msgid ":issue:`28371`: Deprecate passing asyncio.Handles to run_in_executor."
msgstr ":issue:`28371`: 弃用将asyncio.Handles传递给run_in_executor的做法。"

#: ../NEWS:43815 ../NEWS:47250 ../NEWS:50824
msgid ""
":issue:`28372`: Fix asyncio to support formatting of non-python coroutines."
msgstr ":issue:`28372`: 修复asyncio以支持非python协程的格式化。"

#: ../NEWS:43817 ../NEWS:47252 ../NEWS:50826
msgid ""
":issue:`28399`: Remove UNIX socket from FS before binding. Patch by "
"Коренберг Марк."
msgstr ":issue:`28399`: 在绑定前从文件系统中移除UNIX套接字。由Коренберг Марк提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43820 ../NEWS:47255 ../NEWS:50829
msgid ":issue:`27972`: Prohibit Tasks to await on themselves."
msgstr ":issue:`27972`: 禁止Tasks等待自身。"

#: ../NEWS:43822 ../NEWS:46777
msgid ""
":issue:`24142`: Reading a corrupt config file left configparser in an "
"invalid state. Original patch by Florian Höch."
msgstr ":issue:`24142`: 读取损坏的配置文件会使configparser处于无效状态。原始补丁由Florian Höch提供。"

#: ../NEWS:43825 ../NEWS:46125
msgid ""
":issue:`29581`: ABCMeta.__new__ now accepts ``**kwargs``, allowing abstract "
"base classes to use keyword parameters in __init_subclass__. Patch by Nate "
"Soares."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29581`: ABCMeta.__new__现在接受 "
"``**kwargs``，允许抽象基类在__init_subclass__中使用关键字参数。由Nate Soares提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43829 ../NEWS:45318
msgid ""
":issue:`25532`: inspect.unwrap() will now only try to unwrap an object "
"sys.getrecursionlimit() times, to protect against objects which create a new"
" object on every attribute access."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25532`: "
"inspect.unwrap()现在只会尝试解包对象sys.getrecursionlimit()次，以防止在每次属性访问时创建新对象的对象。"

#: ../NEWS:43833 ../NEWS:46259
msgid ""
":issue:`30177`: path.resolve(strict=False) no longer cuts the path after the"
" first element not present in the filesystem.  Patch by Antoine Pietri."
msgstr ""
