"Pietri提供。"

#: ../NEWS:43839 ../NEWS:45745
msgid ""
":issue:`31294`: Fix incomplete code snippet in the ZeroMQSocketListener and "
"ZeroMQSocketHandler examples and adapt them to Python 3."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31294`: "
"修复ZeroMQSocketListener和ZeroMQSocketHandler示例中的不完整代码片段，并将它们适配到Python 3。"

#: ../NEWS:43842 ../NEWS:45748
msgid ""
":issue:`21649`: Add RFC 7525 and Mozilla server side TLS links to SSL "
"documentation."
msgstr ":issue:`21649`: 在SSL文档中添加RFC 7525和Mozilla服务器端TLS链接。"

#: ../NEWS:43845
msgid ":issue:`31128`: Allow the pydoc server to bind to arbitrary hostnames."
msgstr ":issue:`31128`: 允许pydoc服务器绑定到任意主机名。"

#: ../NEWS:43847 ../NEWS:45751
msgid ""
":issue:`30803`: Clarify doc on truth value testing. Original patch by Peter "
"Thomassen."
msgstr ":issue:`30803`: 澄清关于真值测试的文档。原始由Peter Thomassen提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43850 ../NEWS:46314 ../NEWS:50230
msgid ""
":issue:`30176`: Add missing attribute related constants in curses "
"documentation."
msgstr ":issue:`30176`: 在curses文档中添加缺失的属性相关常量。"

#: ../NEWS:43853 ../NEWS:46317
msgid ""
":issue:`30052`: the link targets for :func:`bytes` and :func:`bytearray` are"
" now their respective type definitions, rather than the corresponding "
"builtin function entries. Use :ref:`bytes <func-bytes>` and :ref:`bytearray "
"<func-bytearray>` to reference the latter. In order to ensure this and "
"future cross-reference updates are applied automatically, the daily "
"documentation builds now disable the default output caching features in "
"Sphinx."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30052`: :func:`bytes` 和 :func:`bytearray` "
"的链接目标现在是它们各自的类型定义，而不是相应的内置函数条目。使用 :ref:`bytes <func-bytes>` 和 "
":ref:`bytearray <func-bytearray>` "
"来引用后者。为了确保这一及未来的交叉引用更新能自动应用，每日文档构建现在禁用了Sphinx中的默认输出缓存功能。"

#: ../NEWS:43861 ../NEWS:46325 ../NEWS:50233
msgid ""
":issue:`26985`: Add missing info of code object in inspect documentation."
msgstr ":issue:`26985`: 在inspect文档中添加缺失的代码对象信息。"

#: ../NEWS:43863
msgid ""
":issue:`19824`: Improve the documentation for, and links to, template "
"strings by emphasizing their utility for internationalization, and by "
"clarifying some usage constraints. (See also: :issue:`20314`, "
":issue:`12518`)"
msgstr ""
":issue:`19824`: 通过强调模板字符串在国际化中的实用性，并澄清一些使用限制，改进模板字符串的文档和链接。(另见 : "
":issue:`20314`, :issue:`12518`)"

#: ../NEWS:43867 ../NEWS:46634 ../NEWS:50235
msgid ":issue:`28929`: Link the documentation to its source file on GitHub."
msgstr ":issue:`28929`: 将文档链接到其在GitHub上的源文件。"

