"``super()`` 所需的额外 ``__classcell__`` 处理。"

#: ../NEWS:43882 ../NEWS:46893 ../NEWS:50897
msgid ":issue:`28513`: Documented command-line interface of zipfile."
msgstr ":issue:`28513`: 记录了 zipfile 的命令行接口。"

