msgstr ""
":issue:`26939`: 添加support.setswitchinterval()函数以修复在Android armv7 "
"qemu模拟器上挂起的test_functools。"

#: ../NEWS:43950
msgid ""
":issue:`31354`: Allow ``--with-lto`` to be used on all builds, not just "
"``make profile-opt``."
msgstr ":issue:`31354`: 允许 ``--with-lto`` 用于所有构建，而不仅仅是 ``make profile-opt``。"

#: ../NEWS:43953
msgid ""
":issue:`31370`: Remove support for building --without-threads. This option "
"is not really useful anymore in the 21st century. Removing lots of "
"conditional paths allows us to simplify the code base, including in "
"difficult to maintain low-level internal code."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31370`: 移除对构建--without-"
"threads的支持。在21世纪，这个选项已经不再真正有用。移除大量条件路径允许我们简化代码库，包括难以维护的低级内部代码。"

#: ../NEWS:43958
msgid ""
":issue:`31341`: Per :pep:`11`, support for the IRIX operating system was "
"removed."
msgstr ":issue:`31341`: 根据 :pep:`11`，移除了对IRIX操作系统的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:43961 ../NEWS:45773
msgid ""
":issue:`30854`: Fix compile error when compiling --without-threads. Patch by"
" Masayuki Yamamoto."
msgstr ":issue:`30854`: 修复编译--without-threads时的编译错误。由Masayuki Yamamoto提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:43964 ../NEWS:46350 ../NEWS:50299
msgid ""
":issue:`30687`: Locate msbuild.exe on Windows when building rather than "
"vcvarsall.bat"
msgstr ":issue:`30687`: 在Windows上构建时定位msbuild.exe而不是vcvarsall.bat。"

#: ../NEWS:43967
msgid ""
":issue:`20210`: Support the *disabled* marker in Setup files. Extension "
"modules listed after this marker are not built at all, neither by the "
"Makefile nor by setup.py."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20210`: 支持Setup文件中的 *disabled* "
"标记。在此标记之后列出的扩展模块完全不被构建，无论是通过Makefile还是setup.py。"

#: ../NEWS:43971 ../NEWS:46294
msgid ""
":issue:`29941`: Add ``--with-assertions`` configure flag to explicitly "
"enable C ``assert()`` checks. Defaults to off. ``--with-pydebug`` implies "
"``--with-assertions``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29941`: 添加 ``--with-assertions`` 配置标志以明确启用C ``assert()`` "
"检查。默认为关闭。``--with-pydebug``意味着 ``--with-assertions``。"

#: ../NEWS:43975 ../NEWS:46298
msgid ""
":issue:`28787`: Fix out-of-tree builds of Python when configured with "
"``--with--dtrace``."
msgstr ":issue:`28787`: 修复使用 ``--with--dtrace`` 配置时Python的树外构建。"

#: ../NEWS:43978 ../NEWS:46301 ../NEWS:50286
msgid ""
":issue:`29243`: Prevent unnecessary rebuilding of Python during ``make "
"test``, ``make install`` and some other make targets when configured with "
"``--enable-optimizations``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29243`: 在配置为 ``--enable-optimizations`` 时，防止在 ``make test``、``make "
"install``和一些其他make目标期间不必要的Python重新构建。"

#: ../NEWS:43982 ../NEWS:46305 ../NEWS:50290
msgid ""
":issue:`23404`: Don't regenerate generated files based on file modification "
"time anymore: the action is now explicit. Replace ``make touch`` with ``make"
" regen-all``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23404`: 不再基于文件修改时间重新生成已生成的文件：该操作现在是显式的。用``make regen-all``替换 ``make "
"touch``。"

#: ../NEWS:43986 ../NEWS:46309 ../NEWS:50294
msgid ":issue:`29643`: Fix ``--enable-optimization`` didn't work."
msgstr ":issue:`29643`: 修复 ``--enable-optimization`` 不起作用的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:43988 ../NEWS:46669
msgid ""
":issue:`27593`: sys.version and the platform module python_build(), "
"python_branch(), and python_revision() functions now use git information "
"rather than hg when building from a repo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27593`: "
"当从仓库构建时，sys.version和platform模块的python_build()、python_branch()和python_revision()函数现在使用git信息而不是hg。"

