msgstr "Python 3.6.1 rc1"

#: ../NEWS:46386
msgid "*Release date: 2017-03-04*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2017-03-04*"

#: ../NEWS:46497 ../NEWS:50197
msgid ""
":issue:`29519`: Fix weakref spewing exceptions during interpreter shutdown "
"when used with a rare combination of multiprocessing and custom codecs."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29519`: 修复了在与multiprocessing和自定义编解码器的罕见组合使用时，weakref在解释器关闭期间抛出异常的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:46513
msgid ""
":issue:`29316`: Restore the provisional status of typing module, add "
"corresponding note to documentation. Patch by Ivan L."
msgstr ":issue:`29316`: 恢复typing模块的临时状态，向文档添加相应说明。由Ivan L.提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:46519 ../NEWS:50213
msgid ""
":issue:`29011`: Fix an important omission by adding Deque to the typing "
"module."
msgstr ":issue:`29011`: 通过向typing模块添加Deque来修复一个重要的遗漏。"

#: ../NEWS:46533
msgid ""
":issue:`29203`: functools.lru_cache() now respects :pep:`468` and preserves "
"the order of keyword arguments.  f(a=1, b=2) is now cached separately from "
"f(b=2, a=1) since both calls could potentially give different results."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29203`: functools.lru_cache()现在尊重 :pep:`468` 并保留关键字参数的顺序。f(a=1, "
"b=2)现在与f(b=2, a=1)分开缓存，因为这两个调用可能产生不同的结果。"

#: ../NEWS:46540 ../NEWS:50479
msgid ""
":issue:`29094`: Offsets in a ZIP file created with extern file object and "
"modes \"w\" and \"x\" now are relative to the start of the file."
msgstr ":issue:`29094`: 使用外部文件对象和模式\"w\"和\"x\"创建的ZIP文件中的偏移量现在相对于文件的开始位置。"

#: ../NEWS:46543
msgid ""
":issue:`29085`: Allow random.Random.seed() to use high quality OS randomness"
" rather than the pid and time."
msgstr ":issue:`29085`: 允许random.Random.seed()使用高质量的OS随机性，而不是pid和时间。"

#: ../NEWS:46546
msgid ""
":issue:`29061`: Fixed bug in secrets.randbelow() which would hang when given"
" a negative input.  Patch by Brendan Donegan."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29061`: 修复了secrets.randbelow()中的一个bug，该bug在给定负输入时会挂起。由Brendan "
"Donegan提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:46554 ../NEWS:50485
msgid ""
":issue:`29119`: Fix weakrefs in the pure python version of "
"collections.OrderedDict move_to_end() method. Contributed by Andra Bogildea."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29119`: 修复collections.OrderedDict "
"move_to_end()方法的纯Python版本中的weakrefs。由Andra Bogildea贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:46566
msgid ""
":issue:`29055`: Neaten-up empty population error on random.choice() by "
"suppressing the upstream exception."
msgstr ":issue:`29055`: 通过抑制上游异常，清理了random.choice()上的空种群错误。"

#: ../NEWS:46581 ../NEWS:50509
msgid ""
":issue:`28847`: dbm.dumb now supports reading read-only files and no longer "
