msgstr ":issue:`28847`: dbm.dumb现在支持读取只读文件，并且在索引文件未更改时不再写入索引文件。"

#: ../NEWS:46599
msgid ":issue:`29579`: Removes readme.txt from the installer"
msgstr ":issue:`29579`: 从安装程序中移除readme.txt"

#: ../NEWS:46601
msgid ""
":issue:`29326`: Ignores blank lines in ._pth files (Patch by Alexey "
"Izbyshev)"
msgstr ":issue:`29326`: 忽略._pth文件中的空行（由Alexey Izbyshev提供补丁）"

#: ../NEWS:46603
msgid ""
":issue:`28164`: Correctly handle special console filenames (patch by Eryk "
