msgstr ":issue:`28164`: 正确处理特殊的控制台文件名（由Eryk Sun提供补丁）"

#: ../NEWS:46605
msgid ":issue:`29409`: Implement :pep:`529` for io.FileIO (Patch by Eryk Sun)"
msgstr ":issue:`29409`: 为 io.FileIO 实现 :pep:`529` (由 Eryk Sun 提供的补丁) "

#: ../NEWS:46607 ../NEWS:50302
msgid ""
":issue:`29392`: Prevent crash when passing invalid arguments into msvcrt "
"module."
msgstr ":issue:`29392`: 防止将无效参数传递到 msvcrt 模块时崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:46612
msgid ""
":issue:`28896`: Deprecate WindowsRegistryFinder and disable it by default."
msgstr ":issue:`28896`: 弃用 WindowsRegistryFinder 并默认禁用它。"

#: ../NEWS:46617
msgid ""
":issue:`27867`: Function PySlice_GetIndicesEx() is replaced with a macro if "
"Py_LIMITED_API is not set or set to the value between 0x03050400 and "
"0x03060000 (not including) or 0x03060100 or higher."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27867`: 如果未设置 Py_LIMITED_API 或其值设置在 0x03050400 和 0x03060000（不包括）之间或 "
"0x03060100 或更高，则函数 PySlice_GetIndicesEx() 将被宏替换。"

#: ../NEWS:46647 ../NEWS:50267
msgid ""
":issue:`28087`: Skip test_asyncore and test_eintr poll failures on macOS. "
"Skip some tests of select.poll when running on macOS due to unresolved "
"issues with the underlying system poll function on some macOS versions."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28087`: 在 macOS 上跳过 test_asyncore 和 test_eintr 的 poll 失败。由于某些 macOS "
"版本上底层系统 poll 函数的未解决问题，在 macOS 上运行时跳过 select.poll 的一些测试。"

#: ../NEWS:46651 ../NEWS:50277
msgid ""
":issue:`29571`: to match the behaviour of the ``re.LOCALE`` flag, "
"test_re.test_locale_flag now uses ``locale.getpreferredencoding(False)`` to "
"determine the candidate encoding for the test regex (allowing it to "
"correctly skip the test when the default locale encoding is a multi-byte "
"encoding)"
msgstr ""
":issue:`29571`: 为了匹配 ``re.LOCALE`` 标志的行为，test_re.test_locale_flag 现在使用 "
"``locale.getpreferredencoding(False)`` "
"来确定测试正则表达式的候选编码（允许它在默认区域编码是多字节编码时正确跳过测试）"

