"in conforming to the specification."
msgstr ":issue:`26293`: 修复了不从文件开头开始写入 ZIP 文件的问题。ZIP 文件中的偏移量现在相对于存档的开始，以符合规范。"

#: ../NEWS:47129
msgid ":issue:`27181`: remove statistics.geometric_mean and defer until 3.7."
msgstr ":issue:`27181`: 移除 statistics.geometric_mean 并推迟至 3.7 版本。"

#: ../NEWS:47308
msgid "Python 3.6.0 beta 1"
msgstr "Python 3.6.0 beta 1"

#: ../NEWS:47310
msgid "*Release date: 2016-09-12*"
msgstr "*发布日期： 2016-09-12*"

#: ../NEWS:47315
msgid ""
":issue:`23722`: The __class__ cell used by zero-argument super() is now "
"initialized from type.__new__ rather than __build_class__, so class methods "
"relying on that will now work correctly when called from metaclass methods "
"during class creation. Patch by Martin Teichmann."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23722`: 由零参数 super() 使用的 __class__ 单元现在从 type.__new__ 而不是 "
"__build_class__ 初始化，因此在类创建期间从元类方法调用时，依赖于此的类方法现在将正常工作。由 Martin Teichmann "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:47320 ../NEWS:50413
msgid ""
":issue:`25221`: Fix corrupted result from PyLong_FromLong(0) when Python is "
"compiled with NSMALLPOSINTS = 0."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25221`: 当 Python 编译时设置 NSMALLPOSINTS = 0 时，修复 PyLong_FromLong(0) "
"的损坏结果。"

#: ../NEWS:47323
msgid ""
":issue:`27080`: Implement formatting support for :pep:`515`.  Initial patch "
"by Chris Angelico."
msgstr ":issue:`27080`: 实现 :pep:`515` 的格式化支持。初始由 Chris Angelico 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:47326
msgid ""
":issue:`27199`: In tarfile, expose copyfileobj bufsize to improve "
"throughput. Patch by Jason Fried."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27199`: 在 tarfile 中，公开 copyfileobj 的 bufsize 以提高吞吐量。由 Jason Fried "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:47329
msgid ""
":issue:`27948`: In f-strings, only allow backslashes inside the braces "
"(where the expressions are).  This is a breaking change from the 3.6 alpha "
"releases, where backslashes are allowed anywhere in an f-string.  Also, "
"require that expressions inside f-strings be enclosed within literal braces,"
" and not escapes like ``f'\\x7b\"hi\"\\x7d'``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27948`: 在 f-字符串中，仅允许在花括号内（表达式所在处）使用反斜杠。这是与 3.6 alpha "
"版本的破坏性变更，其中反斜杠允许在 f-字符串的任何地方使用。同时，要求 f-字符串内的表达式必须包围在字面花括号内，而不是像 "
"``f'\\x7b\"hi\"\\x7d'`` 这样的转义。"

#: ../NEWS:47335
msgid ":issue:`28046`: Remove platform-specific directories from sys.path."
msgstr ":issue:`28046`: 从 sys.path 中移除平台特定的目录。"

#: ../NEWS:47337
msgid ":issue:`28071`: Add early-out for differencing from an empty set."
msgstr ":issue:`28071`: 为与空集的差异添加早期退出。"

#: ../NEWS:47339 ../NEWS:50416
msgid ""
":issue:`25758`: Prevents zipimport from unnecessarily encoding a filename "
"(patch by Eryk Sun)"
msgstr ":issue:`25758`: 防止 zipimport 不必要地编码文件名（由 Eryk Sun 提供补丁）"

#: ../NEWS:47342
msgid ""
":issue:`25856`: The __module__ attribute of extension classes and functions "
"now is interned. This leads to more compact pickle data with protocol 4."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25856`: 扩展类和函数的 __module__ 属性现在被 interned。这导致协议 4 的 pickle 数据更加紧凑。"

#: ../NEWS:47345
msgid ""
":issue:`27213`: Rework CALL_FUNCTION* opcodes to produce shorter and more "
"efficient bytecode. Patch by Demur Rumed, design by Serhiy Storchaka, "
"reviewed by Serhiy Storchaka and Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27213`: 重做 CALL_FUNCTION* 操作码以产生更短更高效的字节码。补丁由 Demur Rumed 提供，设计由 "
"Serhiy Storchaka 完成，由 Serhiy Storchaka 和 Victor Stinner 审核。"

#: ../NEWS:47349
msgid ""
":issue:`26331`: Implement tokenizing support for :pep:`515`. Patch by Georg "
"Brandl."
msgstr ":issue:`26331`: 实现 :pep:`515` 的词法分析支持。由 Georg Brandl 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:47352
msgid ""
":issue:`27999`: Make \"global after use\" a SyntaxError, and ditto for "
"nonlocal. Patch by Ivan Levkivskyi."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27999`: 将“使用后全局”设为 SyntaxError，同样适用于 nonlocal。由 Ivan Levkivskyi "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:47355
msgid ":issue:`28003`: Implement :pep:`525` -- Asynchronous Generators."
msgstr ":issue:`28003`: 实现 :pep:`525` -- 异步生成器。"

#: ../NEWS:47357
msgid ""
":issue:`27985`: Implement :pep:`526` -- Syntax for Variable Annotations. "
"Patch by Ivan Levkivskyi."
msgstr ":issue:`27985`: 实现 :pep:`526` -- 变量注解语法。由 Ivan Levkivskyi 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:47360
msgid ""
":issue:`26058`: Add a new private version to the builtin dict type, "
"incremented at each dictionary creation and at each dictionary change. "
"Implementation of the PEP 509."
msgstr ":issue:`26058`: 为内置字典类型添加一个新的私有版本，每次字典创建和每次字典更改时递增。PEP 509的实现。"

#: ../NEWS:47364
msgid ""
":issue:`27364`: A backslash-character pair that is not a valid escape "
"sequence now generates a DeprecationWarning.  Patch by Emanuel Barry."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27364`: 现在，不是一个有效转义序列的反斜杠字符对会生成一个DeprecationWarning。补丁由Emanuel "
"Barry提供。"

#: ../NEWS:47367
msgid ""
":issue:`27350`: ``dict`` implementation is changed like PyPy. It is more "
"compact and preserves insertion order. (Concept developed by Raymond "
"Hettinger and patch by Inada Naoki.)"
msgstr ""
":issue:`27350`: ``dict`` 的实现改为类似PyPy的方式。它更紧凑并保持插入顺序。（概念由Raymond "
"Hettinger开发，由Inada Naoki提供补丁。）"

#: ../NEWS:47371
msgid ""
":issue:`27911`: Remove unnecessary error checks in "
"``exec_builtin_or_dynamic()``."
msgstr ":issue:`27911`: 移除 ``exec_builtin_or_dynamic()`` 中不必要的错误检查。"

#: ../NEWS:47374
msgid ""
":issue:`27078`: Added BUILD_STRING opcode.  Optimized f-strings evaluation."
msgstr ":issue:`27078`: 添加了BUILD_STRING操作码。优化了f-字符串的评估。"

#: ../NEWS:47376
msgid ""
":issue:`17884`: Python now requires systems with inttypes.h and stdint.h"
msgstr ":issue:`17884`: Python现在要求系统支持inttypes.h和stdint.h。"

#: ../NEWS:47378
msgid ""
":issue:`27961`: Require platforms to support ``long long``. Python hasn't "
"compiled without ``long long`` for years, so this is basically a formality."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27961`: 要求平台支持 ``long long``。Python多年来已不再编译不支持 ``long long`` "
"的版本，因此这基本上是一个形式上的要求。"

#: ../NEWS:47382
msgid ""
":issue:`27355`: Removed support for Windows CE.  It was never finished, and "
"Windows CE is no longer a relevant platform for Python."
msgstr ":issue:`27355`: 移除了对Windows CE的支持。它从未完成，而且Windows CE不再是Python的相关平台。"

#: ../NEWS:47385
msgid "Implement :pep:`523`."
msgstr "实现 :pep:`523`。"

#: ../NEWS:47387
msgid ""
":issue:`27870`: A left shift of zero by a large integer no longer attempts "
"to allocate large amounts of memory."
msgstr ":issue:`27870`: 零的大整数左移不再尝试分配大量内存。"

#: ../NEWS:47390
msgid ""
":issue:`25402`: In int-to-decimal-string conversion, improve the estimate of"
" the intermediate memory required, and remove an unnecessarily strict "
"overflow check. Patch by Serhiy Storchaka."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25402`: 在整数到十进制字符串的转换中，改进了对所需中间内存的估计，并移除了一个不必要的严格溢出检查。由Serhiy "
"Storchaka提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:47394
msgid ""
":issue:`27214`: In long_invert, be more careful about modifying object "
"returned by long_add, and remove an unnecessary check for small longs. "
"Thanks Oren Milman for analysis and patch."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27214`: 在long_invert中，更加小心地修改由long_add返回的对象，并移除了对小long的不必要检查。感谢Oren "
"Milman的分析和补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:47398
msgid ""
":issue:`27506`: Support passing the bytes/bytearray.translate() \"delete\" "
"argument by keyword."
msgstr ":issue:`27506`: 支持通过关键字传递bytes/bytearray.translate()的\"delete\"参数。"

#: ../NEWS:47401 ../NEWS:50422
msgid ""
":issue:`27812`: Properly clear out a generator's frame's backreference to "
"the generator to prevent crashes in frame.clear()."
msgstr ":issue:`27812`: 正确清除生成器帧对生成器的反向引用，以防止frame.clear()中的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:47404 ../NEWS:50425
msgid ""
":issue:`27811`: Fix a crash when a coroutine that has not been awaited is "
"finalized with warnings-as-errors enabled."
msgstr ":issue:`27811`: 修复了一个在启用警告即错误时，未等待的协程被最终化时崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:47407 ../NEWS:50428
msgid ""
":issue:`27587`: Fix another issue found by PVS-Studio: Null pointer check "
"after use of 'def' in _PyState_AddModule(). Initial patch by Christian "
"Heimes."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27587`: 修复了PVS-"
"Studio发现的另一个问题：在_PyState_AddModule()中使用'def'后的空指针检查。初始由Christian Heimes提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:47410
msgid ""
":issue:`27792`: The modulo operation applied to ``bool`` and other ``int`` "
"subclasses now always returns an ``int``. Previously the return type "
"depended on the input values. Patch by Xiang Zhang."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27792`: 现在对 ``bool`` 和其他 ``int`` 子类应用的模运算总是返回一个 "
"``int``。以前返回类型依赖于输入值。由 Xiang Zhang 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:47414
msgid ":issue:`26984`: int() now always returns an instance of exact int."
msgstr ":issue:`26984`: int() 现在总是返回一个精确的 int 实例。"

#: ../NEWS:47416
msgid ""
":issue:`25604`: Fix a minor bug in integer true division; this bug could "
"potentially have caused off-by-one-ulp results on platforms with unreliable "
"ldexp implementations."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25604`: 修复了整数真除法中的一个次要错误；这个错误可能导致在具有不可靠 ldexp 实现的平台上出现 off-by-one-"
"ulp 结果。"

#: ../NEWS:47420
msgid ":issue:`24254`: Make class definition namespace ordered by default."
msgstr ":issue:`24254`: 默认情况下，使类定义命名空间有序。"

#: ../NEWS:47422
msgid ""
":issue:`27662`: Fix an overflow check in ``List_New``: the original code was"
" checking against ``Py_SIZE_MAX`` instead of the correct upper bound of "
"``Py_SSIZE_T_MAX``. Patch by Xiang Zhang."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27662`: 修复了 ``List_New`` 中的一个溢出检查：原始代码检查的是 ``Py_SIZE_MAX`` 而不是正确的上限 "
"``Py_SSIZE_T_MAX``。由 Xiang Zhang 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:47426 ../NEWS:50434
msgid ""
":issue:`27782`: Multi-phase extension module import now correctly allows the"
" ``m_methods`` field to be used to add module level functions to instances "
"of non-module types returned from ``Py_create_mod``. Patch by Xiang Zhang."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27782`: 多阶段扩展模块导入现在正确地允许使用 ``m_methods`` 字段来向 ``Py_create_mod`` "
"返回的非模块类型实例添加模块级函数。由 Xiang Zhang 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:47430 ../NEWS:50438
msgid ""
":issue:`27936`: The round() function accepted a second None argument for "
"some types but not for others.  Fixed the inconsistency by accepting None "
"for all numeric types."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27936`: round() 函数对某些类型接受第二个 None 参数，但对其他类型不接受。通过接受所有数值类型的 None "
"来修复这种不一致性。"

#: ../NEWS:47434 ../NEWS:50442
msgid ""
":issue:`27487`: Warn if a submodule argument to \"python -m\" or "
"runpy.run_module() is found in sys.modules after parent packages are "
"imported, but before the submodule is executed."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27487`: 如果在导入父包之后但在执行子模块之前，在 sys.modules 中找到了 \"python -m\" 或 "
"runpy.run_module() 的子模块参数，则发出警告。"

#: ../NEWS:47438
msgid ""
":issue:`27157`: Make only type() itself accept the one-argument form. Patch "
"by Eryk Sun and Emanuel Barry."
msgstr ":issue:`27157`: 使只有 type() 本身接受单参数形式。由 Eryk Sun 和 Emanuel Barry 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:47441 ../NEWS:50446
msgid ""
":issue:`27558`: Fix a SystemError in the implementation of \"raise\" "
"statement. In a brand new thread, raise a RuntimeError since there is no "
"active exception to reraise. Patch written by Xiang Zhang."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27558`: 修复 \"raise\" 语句实现中的一个 SystemError。在一个全新的线程中，引发一个 "
"RuntimeError，因为没有活动的异常可以重新引发。补丁由 Xiang Zhang 编写。"

#: ../NEWS:47445
msgid ":issue:`28008`: Implement :pep:`530` -- asynchronous comprehensions."
msgstr ":issue:`28008`: 实现 :pep:`530` -- 异步推导式。"

#: ../NEWS:47447 ../NEWS:50471
msgid ":issue:`27942`: Fix memory leak in codeobject.c"
msgstr ":issue:`27942`: 修复 codeobject.c 中的内存泄漏"

#: ../NEWS:47452 ../NEWS:50515
msgid ":issue:`28732`: Fix crash in os.spawnv() with no elements in args"
msgstr ":issue:`28732`: 修复 os.spawnv() 在 args 中没有元素时的崩溃"

#: ../NEWS:47454 ../NEWS:50517
msgid ""
":issue:`28485`: Always raise ValueError for negative "
"compileall.compile_dir(workers=...) parameter, even when multithreading is "
"unavailable."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28485`: 对于 compileall.compile_dir(workers=...) 参数的负值，即使多线程不可用，也总是引发 "
"ValueError。"

#: ../NEWS:47458
msgid ""
":issue:`28037`: Use sqlite3_get_autocommit() instead of setting "
"Connection->inTransaction manually."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28037`: 使用 sqlite3_get_autocommit() 而不是手动设置 "
"Connection->inTransaction。"

#: ../NEWS:47461
msgid ""
":issue:`25283`: Attributes tm_gmtoff and tm_zone are now available on all "
"platforms in the return values of time.localtime() and time.gmtime()."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25283`: 现在，在所有平台上，time.localtime() 和 time.gmtime() 的返回值中都提供了属性 "
"tm_gmtoff 和 tm_zone。"

#: ../NEWS:47464
msgid ""
":issue:`24454`: Regular expression match object groups are now accessible "
"using __getitem__. \"mo[x]\" is equivalent to \"mo.group(x)\"."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24454`: 现在可以使用 __getitem__ 访问正则表达式匹配对象组。\"mo[x]\" 等同于 "
"\"mo.group(x)\"。"

#: ../NEWS:47467
msgid ""
":issue:`10740`: sqlite3 no longer implicitly commit an open transaction "
"before DDL statements."
msgstr ":issue:`10740`: sqlite3 不再在 DDL 语句之前隐式提交一个打开的事务。"

#: ../NEWS:47470
msgid ":issue:`17941`: Add a *module* parameter to collections.namedtuple()."
msgstr ":issue:`17941`: 向 collections.namedtuple() 添加了一个 *module* 参数。"

#: ../NEWS:47472
msgid ""
":issue:`22493`: Inline flags now should be used only at the start of the "
"regular expression. Deprecation warning is emitted if uses them in the "
"middle of the regular expression."
msgstr ":issue:`22493`: 内联标志现在应该只在正则表达式的开头使用。如果在正则表达式的中间使用它们，则会发出弃用警告。"

#: ../NEWS:47476
msgid ""
":issue:`26885`: xmlrpc now supports unmarshalling additional data types used"
" by Apache XML-RPC implementation for numerics and None."
msgstr ":issue:`26885`: xmlrpc 现在支持解组 Apache XML-RPC 实现用于数字和 None 的附加数据类型。"

#: ../NEWS:47479
msgid ""
":issue:`28070`: Fixed parsing inline verbose flag in regular expressions."
msgstr ":issue:`28070`: 修复了正则表达式中解析内联详细标志的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:47481
msgid ""
":issue:`19500`: Add client-side SSL session resumption to the ssl module."
msgstr ":issue:`19500`: 向 ssl 模块添加了客户端 SSL 会话恢复功能。"

#: ../NEWS:47483
msgid ""
":issue:`28022`: Deprecate ssl-related arguments in favor of SSLContext. The "
"deprecation include manual creation of SSLSocket and certfile/keyfile (or "
"similar) in ftplib, httplib, imaplib, smtplib, poplib and urllib."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28022`: 弃用有利于 SSLContext 的 ssl 相关参数。弃用包括在 "
"ftplib、httplib、imaplib、smtplib、poplib 和 urllib 中手动创建 SSLSocket 和 "
"certfile/keyfile（或类似）。"

#: ../NEWS:47487
msgid ""
":issue:`28043`: SSLContext has improved default settings: OP_NO_SSLv2, "
"OP_NO_SSLv3, OP_NO_COMPRESSION, OP_CIPHER_SERVER_PREFERENCE, "
"OP_SINGLE_DH_USE, OP_SINGLE_ECDH_USE and HIGH ciphers without MD5."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28043`: SSLContext "
"改进了默认设置：OP_NO_SSLv2、OP_NO_SSLv3、OP_NO_COMPRESSION、OP_CIPHER_SERVER_PREFERENCE、OP_SINGLE_DH_USE、OP_SINGLE_ECDH_USE"
" 和没有 MD5 的 HIGH 密码。"

#: ../NEWS:47491
msgid ""
":issue:`24693`: Changed some RuntimeError's in the zipfile module to more "
"appropriate types. Improved some error messages and debugging output."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24693`: 将 zipfile 模块中的一些 RuntimeError 更改为更合适的类型。改进了一些错误消息和调试输出。"

#: ../NEWS:47494
msgid ""
":issue:`17909`: ``json.load`` and ``json.loads`` now support binary input "
"encoded as UTF-8, UTF-16 or UTF-32. Patch by Serhiy Storchaka."
msgstr ""
":issue:`17909`: ``json.load`` 和 ``json.loads`` 现在支持以 UTF-8、UTF-16 或 UTF-32 "
"编码的二进制输入。由 Serhiy Storchaka 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:47497
msgid ""
":issue:`27137`: the pure Python fallback implementation of "
"``functools.partial`` now matches the behaviour of its accelerated C "
"counterpart for subclassing, pickling and text representation purposes. "
"Patch by Emanuel Barry and Serhiy Storchaka."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27137`: ``functools.partial`` 的纯 Python 回退实现现在在子类化、pickling "
"和文本表示目的方面与其加速的 C 对应物行为匹配。由 Emanuel Barry 和 Serhiy Storchaka 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:47502 ../NEWS:50570
msgid ""
"Fix possible integer overflows and crashes in the mmap module with unusual "
"usage patterns."
msgstr "修复了 mmap 模块中在异常使用模式下可能出现的整数溢出和崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:47505 ../NEWS:50573
msgid ""
":issue:`1703178`: Fix the ability to pass the --link-objects option to the "
"distutils build_ext command."
msgstr ":issue:`1703178`: 修复了向distutils的build_ext命令传递--link-objects选项的功能。"

#: ../NEWS:47508 ../NEWS:50620
msgid ""
":issue:`28019`: itertools.count() no longer rounds non-integer step in range"
" between 1.0 and 2.0 to 1."
msgstr ":issue:`28019`: itertools.count()不再将1.0到2.0之间的非整数步长四舍五入为1。"

#: ../NEWS:47511
msgid ""
":issue:`18401`: Pdb now supports the 'readrc' keyword argument to control "
"whether .pdbrc files should be read.  Patch by Martin Matusiak and Sam "
"Kimbrel."
msgstr ""
":issue:`18401`: Pdb现在支持'readrc'关键字参数，以控制是否应读取.pdbrc文件。由Martin Matusiak和Sam "
"Kimbrel提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:47515 ../NEWS:50623
msgid ""
":issue:`25969`: Update the lib2to3 grammar to handle the unpacking "
"generalizations added in 3.5."
msgstr ":issue:`25969`: 更新lib2to3语法以处理3.5中添加的解包泛化。"

#: ../NEWS:47518 ../NEWS:50626
msgid ""
":issue:`14977`: mailcap now respects the order of the lines in the mailcap "
"files (\"first match\"), as required by RFC 1542.  Patch by Michael Lazar."
msgstr ""
":issue:`14977`: mailcap现在遵循mailcap文件中的行顺序（“首次匹配”），符合RFC 1542的要求。由Michael "
"Lazar提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:47521
msgid ":issue:`28082`: Convert re flag constants to IntFlag."
msgstr ":issue:`28082`: 将re标志常量转换为IntFlag。"

#: ../NEWS:47523
msgid ""
":issue:`28025`: Convert all ssl module constants to IntEnum and IntFlags. "
"SSLContext properties now return flags and enums."
msgstr ":issue:`28025`: 将所有ssl模块常量转换为IntEnum和IntFlags。SSLContext属性现在返回标志和枚举。"

#: ../NEWS:47526
msgid ":issue:`23591`: Add Flag, IntFlag, and auto() to enum module."
msgstr ":issue:`23591`: 向enum模块添加Flag、IntFlag和auto()。"

#: ../NEWS:47528
msgid ""
":issue:`433028`: Added support of modifier spans in regular expressions."
msgstr ":issue:`433028`: 增加了对正则表达式中修饰符跨度的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:47530 ../NEWS:50629
msgid ":issue:`24594`: Validates persist parameter when opening MSI database"
msgstr ":issue:`24594`: 在打开MSI数据库时验证persist参数。"

#: ../NEWS:47532 ../NEWS:50631
msgid ""
":issue:`17582`: xml.etree.ElementTree nows preserves whitespaces in "
"attributes (Patch by Duane Griffin.  Reviewed and approved by Stefan "
"Behnel.)"
msgstr ""
":issue:`17582`: xml.etree.ElementTree现在保留属性中的空白（由Duane Griffin提供补丁。由Stefan "
"Behnel审查和批准。）。"

#: ../NEWS:47535 ../NEWS:50634
msgid ""
":issue:`28047`: Fixed calculation of line length used for the base64 CTE in "
"the new email policies."
msgstr ":issue:`28047`: 修复了用于新电子邮件策略中base64 CTE的行长度计算。"

#: ../NEWS:47538
msgid ":issue:`27576`: Fix call order in OrderedDict.__init__()."
msgstr ":issue:`27576`: 修复OrderedDict.__init__()中的调用顺序。"

#: ../NEWS:47540
msgid "email.generator.DecodedGenerator now supports the policy keyword."
msgstr "email.generator.DecodedGenerator现在支持policy关键字。"

#: ../NEWS:47542
msgid ""
":issue:`28027`: Remove undocumented modules from ``Lib/plat-*``: IN, CDROM, "
"DLFCN, TYPES, CDIO, and STROPTS."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28027`: 从 ``Lib/plat-*`` "
"中移除未记录的模块：IN、CDROM、DLFCN、TYPES、CDIO和STROPTS。"

#: ../NEWS:47545 ../NEWS:50637
msgid ""
":issue:`27445`: Don't pass str(_charset) to MIMEText.set_payload(). Patch by"
" Claude Paroz."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27445`: 不将str(_charset)传递给MIMEText.set_payload()。由Claude Paroz提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:47548
msgid ""
":issue:`24277`: The new email API is no longer provisional, and the docs "
"have been reorganized and rewritten to emphasize the new API."
msgstr ":issue:`24277`: 新的电子邮件API不再是临时的，文档已经重新组织和重写以强调新API。"

#: ../NEWS:47551 ../NEWS:50640
msgid ""
":issue:`22450`: urllib now includes an ``Accept: */*`` header among the "
"default headers. This makes the results of REST API requests more consistent"
" and predictable especially when proxy servers are involved."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22450`: urllib现在在默认头中包括一个 ``Accept: */*`` 头。这使得REST "
"API请求的结果更加一致和可预测，尤其是在涉及代理服务器时。"

#: ../NEWS:47555 ../NEWS:50644
msgid ""
"lib2to3.pgen3.driver.load_grammar() now creates a stable cache file between "
"runs given the same Grammar.txt input regardless of the hash randomization "
"setting."
msgstr ""
"lib2to3.pgen3.driver.load_grammar() "
"现在在相同的Grammar.txt输入下，无论哈希随机化设置如何，都会创建一个稳定的缓存文件。"

#: ../NEWS:47559
msgid ""
":issue:`28005`: Allow ImportErrors in encoding implementation to propagate."
msgstr ":issue:`28005`: 允许编码实现中的ImportErrors传播。"

#: ../NEWS:47561
msgid ":issue:`26667`: Support path-like objects in importlib.util."
msgstr ":issue:`26667`: 在importlib.util中支持路径类对象。"

#: ../NEWS:47563 ../NEWS:50648
msgid ""
":issue:`27570`: Avoid zero-length memcpy() etc calls with null source "
"pointers in the \"ctypes\" and \"array\" modules."
msgstr ":issue:`27570`: 在“ctypes”和“array”模块中避免使用空源指针进行零长度memcpy()等调用。"

#: ../NEWS:47566 ../NEWS:50651
msgid ""
":issue:`22233`: Break email header lines *only* on the RFC specified CR and "
"LF characters, not on arbitrary unicode line breaks.  This also fixes a bug "
"in HTTP header parsing."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22233`: "
"仅在RFC指定的CR和LF字符上断开电子邮件标题行，而不是在任意Unicode换行符上。这也修复了HTTP标题解析中的一个错误。"

#: ../NEWS:47570
msgid ""
":issue:`27331`: The email.mime classes now all accept an optional policy "
"keyword."
msgstr ":issue:`27331`: email.mime类现在都接受一个可选的policy关键字。"

#: ../NEWS:47573 ../NEWS:50655
msgid ""
":issue:`27988`: Fix email iter_attachments incorrect mutation of payload "
"list."
msgstr ":issue:`27988`: 修复email iter_attachments对payload列表的错误修改。"

#: ../NEWS:47575
msgid ":issue:`16113`: Add SHA-3 and SHAKE support to hashlib module."
msgstr ":issue:`16113`: 向hashlib模块添加SHA-3和SHAKE支持。"

#: ../NEWS:47577
msgid "Eliminate a tautological-pointer-compare warning in _scproxy.c."
msgstr "消除_scproxy.c中的一个同义指针比较警告。"

#: ../NEWS:47579
msgid ""
":issue:`27776`: The :func:`os.urandom` function does now block on Linux 3.17"
" and newer until the system urandom entropy pool is initialized to increase "
"the security. This change is part of the :pep:`524`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27776`: :func:`os.urandom` 函数现在在Linux "
"3.17及更新版本上会阻塞，直到系统urandom熵池初始化以提高安全性。这一变更是 :pep:`524` 的一部分。"

#: ../NEWS:47583
msgid ""
":issue:`27778`: Expose the Linux ``getrandom()`` syscall as a new "
":func:`os.getrandom` function. This change is part of the :pep:`524`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27778`: 将Linux的 ``getrandom()`` 系统调用作为一个新的 :func:`os.getrandom` "
"函数公开。这一变更是 :pep:`524` 的一部分。"

#: ../NEWS:47586 ../NEWS:50657
msgid ""
":issue:`27691`: Fix ssl module's parsing of GEN_RID subject alternative name"
" fields in X.509 certs."
msgstr ":issue:`27691`: 修复ssl模块对X.509证书中GEN_RID主题替代名字段的解析。"

#: ../NEWS:47589
msgid ":issue:`18844`: Add random.choices()."
msgstr ":issue:`18844`: 添加random.choices()。"

#: ../NEWS:47591
msgid ""
":issue:`25761`: Improved error reporting about truncated pickle data in C "
"implementation of unpickler.  UnpicklingError is now raised instead of "
"AttributeError and ValueError in some cases."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25761`: "
"改进了关于C实现解pickler中截断pickle数据的错误报告。在某些情况下，现在会抛出UnpicklingError而不是AttributeError和ValueError。"

#: ../NEWS:47595
msgid ":issue:`26798`: Add BLAKE2 (blake2b and blake2s) to hashlib."
msgstr ":issue:`26798`: 向hashlib添加BLAKE2（blake2b和blake2s）。"

#: ../NEWS:47597
msgid ""
":issue:`26032`: Optimized globbing in pathlib by using os.scandir(); it is "
"now about 1.5--4 times faster."
msgstr ":issue:`26032`: 通过使用os.scandir()优化了pathlib中的globing；现在大约快了1.5到4倍。"

#: ../NEWS:47600
msgid ""
":issue:`25596`: Optimized glob() and iglob() functions in the glob module; "
"they are now about 3--6 times faster."
msgstr ":issue:`25596`: 优化了glob模块中的glob()和iglob()函数；现在大约快了3到6倍。"

#: ../NEWS:47603
msgid ""
":issue:`27928`: Add scrypt (password-based key derivation function) to "
"hashlib module (requires OpenSSL 1.1.0)."
msgstr ":issue:`27928`: 向hashlib模块添加scrypt（基于密码的密钥派生函数）（需要OpenSSL 1.1.0）。"

#: ../NEWS:47606 ../NEWS:50660
msgid ""
":issue:`27850`: Remove 3DES from ssl module's default cipher list to counter"
" measure sweet32 attack (:cve:`2016-2183`)."
msgstr ":issue:`27850`: 从ssl模块的默认加密列表中移除3DES以应对sweet32攻击（:cve:`2016-2183`）。"

#: ../NEWS:47609 ../NEWS:50663
msgid ""
":issue:`27766`: Add ChaCha20 Poly1305 to ssl module's default cipher list. "
"(Required OpenSSL 1.1.0 or LibreSSL)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27766`: 向ssl模块的默认加密列表中添加ChaCha20 Poly1305。（需要OpenSSL "
"1.1.0或LibreSSL）。"

#: ../NEWS:47612
msgid ":issue:`25387`: Check return value of winsound.MessageBeep."
msgstr ":issue:`25387`: 检查winsound.MessageBeep的返回值。"

#: ../NEWS:47614
msgid ""
":issue:`27866`: Add SSLContext.get_ciphers() method to get a list of all "
"enabled ciphers."
msgstr ":issue:`27866`: 添加SSLContext.get_ciphers()方法以获取所有启用的加密列表。"

#: ../NEWS:47617
msgid ":issue:`27744`: Add AF_ALG (Linux Kernel crypto) to socket module."
msgstr ":issue:`27744`: 向socket模块添加AF_ALG（Linux内核加密）。"

#: ../NEWS:47619 ../NEWS:50666
msgid ":issue:`26470`: Port ssl and hashlib module to OpenSSL 1.1.0."
msgstr ":issue:`26470`: 将ssl和hashlib模块移植到OpenSSL 1.1.0。"

#: ../NEWS:47621
msgid ""
":issue:`11620`: Fix support for SND_MEMORY in winsound.PlaySound.  Based on "
"a patch by Tim Lesher."
msgstr ":issue:`11620`: 修复winsound.PlaySound中对SND_MEMORY的支持。基于Tim Lesher的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:47624
msgid ""
":issue:`11734`: Add support for IEEE 754 half-precision floats to the struct"
" module. Based on a patch by Eli Stevens."
msgstr ":issue:`11734`: 向struct模块添加对IEEE 754半精度浮点数的支持。基于Eli Stevens的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:47627
msgid ""
":issue:`27919`: Deprecated ``extra_path`` distribution option in distutils "
"packaging."
msgstr ":issue:`27919`: 弃用distutils打包中的 ``extra_path`` 分发选项。"

#: ../NEWS:47630
msgid ""
":issue:`23229`: Add new ``cmath`` constants: ``cmath.inf`` and ``cmath.nan``"
" to match ``math.inf`` and ``math.nan``, and also ``cmath.infj`` and "
"``cmath.nanj`` to match the format used by complex repr."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23229`: 添加新的 ``cmath``常量：``cmath.inf``和 ``cmath.nan`` 以匹配 "
"``math.inf`` 和``math.nan``，以及 ``cmath.infj`` 和 ``cmath.nanj`` "
"以匹配复数repr使用的格式。"

#: ../NEWS:47634
msgid ""
":issue:`27842`: The csv.DictReader now returns rows of type OrderedDict. "
"(Contributed by Steve Holden.)"
msgstr ":issue:`27842`: csv.DictReader现在返回OrderedDict类型的行。（由Steve Holden贡献。）"

#: ../NEWS:47637 ../NEWS:50668
msgid ""
"Remove support for passing a file descriptor to os.access. It never worked "
"but previously didn't raise."
msgstr "移除对传递文件描述符给os.access的支持。它从未工作过，但以前不会引发错误。"

#: ../NEWS:47640 ../NEWS:50671
msgid ":issue:`12885`: Fix error when distutils encounters symlink."
msgstr ":issue:`12885`: 修复distutils遇到符号链接时的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:47642 ../NEWS:50673
msgid ""
":issue:`27881`: Fixed possible bugs when setting "
"sqlite3.Connection.isolation_level. Based on patch by Xiang Zhang."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27881`: 修复了设置sqlite3.Connection.isolation_level时可能的错误。基于Xiang "
"Zhang的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:47645 ../NEWS:50676
msgid ""
":issue:`27861`: Fixed a crash in sqlite3.Connection.cursor() when a factory "
"creates not a cursor.  Patch by Xiang Zhang."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27861`: 修复了当工厂创建的不是游标时sqlite3.Connection.cursor()中的崩溃。由Xiang "
"Zhang提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:47648 ../NEWS:50679
msgid ":issue:`19884`: Avoid spurious output on OS X with Gnu Readline."
msgstr ":issue:`19884`: 避免在OS X上使用Gnu Readline时产生虚假输出。"

#: ../NEWS:47650 ../NEWS:50681
msgid ""
":issue:`27706`: Restore deterministic behavior of random.Random().seed() for"
" string seeds using seeding version 1.  Allows sequences of calls to "
"random() to exactly match those obtained in Python 2. Patch by Nofar "
"Schnider."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27706`: "
"恢复random.Random().seed()对于使用种子版本1的字符串种子的确定性行为。允许random()的调用序列与Python "
"2中完全匹配。由Nofar Schnider提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:47655 ../NEWS:50686
msgid ""
":issue:`10513`: Fix a regression in Connection.commit().  Statements should "
"not be reset after a commit."
msgstr ":issue:`10513`: 修复Connection.commit()中的回归问题。提交后不应重置语句。"

#: ../NEWS:47658
msgid ""
":issue:`12319`: Chunked transfer encoding support added to "
"http.client.HTTPConnection requests.  The urllib.request.AbstractHTTPHandler"
" class does not enforce a Content-Length header any more.  If a HTTP request"
" has a file or iterable body, but no Content-Length header, the library now "
"falls back to use chunked transfer-encoding."
msgstr ""
":issue:`12319`: "
"在http.client.HTTPConnection请求中添加了分块传输编码支持。urllib.request.AbstractHTTPHandler类不再强制要求Content-"
"Length头部。如果一个HTTP请求有一个文件或可迭代体，但没有Content-Length头部，库现在会转而使用分块传输编码。"

#: ../NEWS:47665
msgid ""
"A new version of typing.py from https://github.com/python/typing: - "
"Collection (only for 3.6) (:issue:`27598`) - Add FrozenSet to __all__ "
"(upstream #261) - fix crash in _get_type_vars() (upstream #259) - Remove the"
" dict constraint in ForwardRef._eval_type (upstream #252)"
msgstr ""
"来自https://github.com/python/typing的typing.py新版本：- "
"Collection（仅适用于3.6）(:issue:`27598`) - 将FrozenSet添加到__all__（上游#261） - "
"修复_get_type_vars()中的崩溃（上游#259） - 移除ForwardRef._eval_type中的字典约束（上游#252）"

#: ../NEWS:47670
msgid ""
":issue:`27832`: Make ``_normalize`` parameter to ``Fraction`` constructor "
"keyword-only, so that ``Fraction(2, 3, 4)`` now raises ``TypeError``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27832`: 使 ``_normalize`` 参数成为 ``Fraction`` "
"构造器的仅关键字参数，这样``Fraction(2, 3, 4)``现在会引发 ``TypeError``。"

#: ../NEWS:47673 ../NEWS:50694
msgid ""
":issue:`27539`: Fix unnormalised ``Fraction.__pow__`` result in the case of "
"negative exponent and negative base."
msgstr ":issue:`27539`: 修复了在负指数和负基数情况下未归一化的 ``Fraction.__pow__`` 结果。"

#: ../NEWS:47676 ../NEWS:50697
msgid ""
":issue:`21718`: cursor.description is now available for queries using CTEs."
msgstr ":issue:`21718`: 现在，使用CTEs的查询可以使用cursor.description了。"

#: ../NEWS:47678
msgid ""
":issue:`27819`: In distutils sdists, simply produce the \"gztar\" (gzipped "
"tar format) distributions on all platforms unless \"formats\" is supplied."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27819`: "
"在distutils的sdists中，除非提供了\"formats\"，否则简单地在所有平台上生成\"gztar\"（gzip压缩的tar格式）分发。"

#: ../NEWS:47681 ../NEWS:50699
msgid ""
":issue:`2466`: posixpath.ismount now correctly recognizes mount points which"
" the user does not have permission to access."
msgstr ":issue:`2466`: posixpath.ismount现在能正确识别用户没有权限访问的挂载点。"

#: ../NEWS:47684
msgid ""
":issue:`9998`: On Linux, ctypes.util.find_library now looks in "
"LD_LIBRARY_PATH for shared libraries."
msgstr ""
":issue:`9998`: 在Linux上，ctypes.util.find_library现在会在LD_LIBRARY_PATH中查找共享库。"

#: ../NEWS:47687
msgid ":issue:`27573`: exit message for code.interact is now configurable."
msgstr ":issue:`27573`: code.interact的退出消息现在可以配置。"

#: ../NEWS:47689 ../NEWS:50789
msgid ""
":issue:`27930`: Improved behaviour of logging.handlers.QueueListener. Thanks"
" to Paulo Andrade and Petr Viktorin for the analysis and patch."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27930`: 改进了logging.handlers.QueueListener的行为。感谢Paulo Andrade和Petr "
"Viktorin的分析和补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:47692
msgid ""
":issue:`6766`: Distributed reference counting added to multiprocessing to "
"support nesting of shared values / proxy objects."
msgstr ":issue:`6766`: 向multiprocessing添加了分布式引用计数以支持共享值/代理对象的嵌套。"

#: ../NEWS:47695 ../NEWS:50792
msgid ""
":issue:`21201`: Improves readability of multiprocessing error message.  "
"Thanks to Wojciech Walczak for patch."
msgstr ":issue:`21201`: 提高了multiprocessing错误消息的可读性。感谢Wojciech Walczak的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:47698
msgid "asyncio: Add set_protocol / get_protocol to Transports."
msgstr "asyncio: 在各Transport类中添加了 set_protocol / get_protocol 方法。"

#: ../NEWS:47700 ../NEWS:50795
msgid ":issue:`27456`: asyncio: Set TCP_NODELAY by default."
msgstr ":issue:`27456`: asyncio：默认设置TCP_NODELAY。"

#: ../NEWS:47705 ../NEWS:50860
msgid ""
":issue:`15308`: Add 'interrupt execution' (^C) to Shell menu. Patch by Roger"
" Serwy, updated by Bayard Randel."
msgstr ""
":issue:`15308`: 向Shell菜单添加了'中断执行'(^C)。由Roger Serwy提供补丁，由Bayard Randel更新。"

#: ../NEWS:47708 ../NEWS:50863
msgid ""
":issue:`27922`: Stop IDLE tests from 'flashing' gui widgets on the screen."
msgstr ":issue:`27922`: 停止IDLE测试在屏幕上'闪烁'gui小部件。"

#: ../NEWS:47710
msgid ""
":issue:`27891`: Consistently group and sort imports within idlelib modules."
msgstr ":issue:`27891`: 在idlelib模块中一致地分组和排序导入。"

#: ../NEWS:47712
msgid ":issue:`17642`: add larger font sizes for classroom projection."
msgstr ":issue:`17642`: 为教室投影添加更大的字体大小。"

#: ../NEWS:47714 ../NEWS:50865
msgid "Add version to title of IDLE help window."
msgstr "在 IDLE 帮助窗口的标题中加入版本号"

#: ../NEWS:47716 ../NEWS:50867
msgid ""
":issue:`25564`: In section on IDLE -- console differences, mention that "
"using exec means that __builtins__ is defined for each statement."
msgstr ":issue:`25564`: 在IDLE与控制台差异的部分，提到使用exec意味着每个语句都定义了__builtins__。"

#: ../NEWS:47719
msgid ""
":issue:`27821`: Fix 3.6.0a3 regression that prevented custom key sets from "
"being selected when no custom theme was defined."
msgstr ":issue:`27821`: 修复3.6.0a3回归，该回归阻止在没有定义自定义主题时选择自定义键集。"

#: ../NEWS:47725
msgid ""
":issue:`26900`: Excluded underscored names and other private API from "
"limited API."
msgstr ":issue:`26900`: 从有限API中排除下划线名称和其他私有API。"

#: ../NEWS:47728
msgid ""
":issue:`26027`: Add support for path-like objects in PyUnicode_FSConverter()"
" & PyUnicode_FSDecoder()."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26027`: 在PyUnicode_FSConverter()和PyUnicode_FSDecoder()中添加对路径类对象的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:47734
msgid ""
":issue:`27427`: Additional tests for the math module. Patch by Francisco "
"Couzo."
msgstr ":issue:`27427`: 为数学模块添加额外测试。由Francisco Couzo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:47736
msgid ""
":issue:`27953`: Skip math and cmath tests that fail on OS X 10.4 due to a "
