msgstr ":issue:`27953`: 跳过在OS X 10.4上由于tan函数的libm实现不佳而失败的数学和cmath测试。"

#: ../NEWS:47739
msgid ""
":issue:`26040`: Improve test_math and test_cmath coverage and rigour. Patch "
"by Jeff Allen."
msgstr ":issue:`26040`: 提高test_math和test_cmath的覆盖范围和严谨性。由Jeff Allen提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:47742 ../NEWS:50912
msgid ""
":issue:`27787`: Call gc.collect() before checking each test for \"dangling "
"threads\", since the dangling threads are weak references."
msgstr ":issue:`27787`: 在检查每个测试的“悬挂线程”之前调用gc.collect()，因为悬挂线程是弱引用。"

#: ../NEWS:47748 ../NEWS:50972
msgid ""
":issue:`27566`: Fix clean target in freeze makefile (patch by Lisa Roach)"
msgstr ":issue:`27566`: 修复冻结makefile中的clean目标（Lisa Roach提供补丁）"

#: ../NEWS:47750 ../NEWS:50974
msgid ":issue:`27705`: Update message in validate_ucrtbase.py"
msgstr ":issue:`27705`: 更新validate_ucrtbase.py中的消息"

#: ../NEWS:47752
msgid ""
":issue:`27976`: Deprecate building _ctypes with the bundled copy of libffi "
"on non-OSX UNIX platforms."
msgstr ":issue:`27976`: 弃用在非OSX UNIX平台上使用捆绑的libffi副本构建_ctypes。"

#: ../NEWS:47755
msgid ""
":issue:`27983`: Cause lack of llvm-profdata tool when using clang as "
"required for PGO linking to be a configure time error rather than make time "
"when ``--with-optimizations`` is enabled.  Also improve our ability to find "
"the llvm-profdata tool on MacOS and some Linuxes."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27983`: 当启用 ``--with-optimizations`` 时，将使用clang作为PGO链接所需的llvm-"
"profdata工具的缺失变为配置时错误，而不是制作时。同时提高我们在MacOS和一些Linux上找到llvm-profdata工具的能力。"

#: ../NEWS:47760
msgid ":issue:`21590`: Support for DTrace and SystemTap probes."
msgstr ":issue:`21590`: 支持DTrace和SystemTap探针。"

#: ../NEWS:47762 ../NEWS:50981
msgid ""
":issue:`26307`: The profile-opt build now applies PGO to the built-in "
"modules."
msgstr ":issue:`26307`: profile-opt构建现在将PGO应用于内置模块。"

#: ../NEWS:47764
msgid ""
":issue:`26359`: Add the --with-optimizations flag to turn on LTO and PGO "
"build support when available."
msgstr ":issue:`26359`: 添加--with-optimizations标志以在可用时开启LTO和PGO构建支持。"

#: ../NEWS:47767
msgid ":issue:`27917`: Set platform triplets for Android builds."
msgstr ":issue:`27917`: 为Android构建设置平台三元组。"

#: ../NEWS:47769
msgid ""
":issue:`25825`: Update references to the $(LIBPL) installation path on AIX. "
"This path was changed in 3.2a4."
msgstr ":issue:`25825`: 更新AIX上对$(LIBPL)安装路径的引用。此路径在3.2a4中更改。"

#: ../NEWS:47772
msgid "Update OS X installer to use SQLite 3.14.1 and XZ 5.2.2."
msgstr "更新 OS X 安装包，使用SQLite 3.14.1 和 XZ 5.2.2版本。"

#: ../NEWS:47774
msgid ":issue:`21122`: Fix LTO builds on OS X."
msgstr ":issue:`21122`: 修复OS X上的LTO构建。"

#: ../NEWS:47776
msgid ""
":issue:`17128`: Build OS X installer with a private copy of OpenSSL. Also "
"provide a sample Install Certificates command script to install a set of "
"root certificates from the third-party certifi module."
msgstr ""
":issue:`17128`: 构建带有OpenSSL私有副本的OS "
"X安装程序。同时提供一个安装证书命令脚本示例，用于从第三方certifi模块安装一组根证书。"

#: ../NEWS:47783 ../NEWS:50921
msgid ""
":issue:`27952`: Get Tools/scripts/fixcid.py working with Python 3 and the "
"current \"re\" module, avoid invalid Python backslash escapes, and fix a bug"
" parsing escaped C quote signs."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27952`: 使Tools/scripts/fixcid.py能够在Python "
"3和当前的\"re\"模块下工作，避免无效的Python反斜杠转义，并修复解析转义C引号符号时的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:47790
msgid ""
":issue:`28065`: Update xz dependency to 5.2.2 and build it from source."
msgstr ":issue:`28065`: 将xz依赖更新至5.2.2版本并从源代码构建。"

#: ../NEWS:47792 ../NEWS:50938
msgid ""
":issue:`25144`: Ensures TargetDir is set before continuing with custom "
"install."
msgstr ":issue:`25144`: 确保在继续自定义安装之前设置TargetDir。"

#: ../NEWS:47794
msgid ""
":issue:`1602`: Windows console doesn't input or print Unicode (PEP 528)"
msgstr ":issue:`1602`: Windows控制台不支持输入或打印Unicode（PEP 528）。"

#: ../NEWS:47796
msgid ""
":issue:`27781`: Change file system encoding on Windows to UTF-8 (PEP 529)"
msgstr ":issue:`27781`: 在Windows上将文件系统编码更改为UTF-8（PEP 529）。"

#: ../NEWS:47798
msgid ":issue:`27731`: Opt-out of MAX_PATH on Windows 10"
msgstr ":issue:`27731`: 在Windows 10上选择退出MAX_PATH限制。"

#: ../NEWS:47800
msgid ":issue:`6135`: Adds encoding and errors parameters to subprocess."
msgstr ":issue:`6135`: 向subprocess添加encoding和errors参数。"

#: ../NEWS:47802
msgid ""
":issue:`27959`: Adds oem encoding, alias ansi to mbcs, move aliasmbcs to "
"codec lookup."
msgstr ":issue:`27959`: 添加oem编码，将ansi别名设为mbcs，将aliasmbcs移动到编解码器查找。"

#: ../NEWS:47805
msgid ""
":issue:`27982`: The functions of the winsound module now accept keyword "
"arguments."
msgstr ":issue:`27982`: winsound模块的函数现在接受关键字参数。"

#: ../NEWS:47808
msgid ":issue:`20366`: Build full text search support into SQLite on Windows."
msgstr ":issue:`20366`: 在Windows上构建SQLite的全文搜索支持。"

#: ../NEWS:47810
msgid ""
":issue:`27756`: Adds new icons for Python files and processes on Windows. "
"Designs by Cherry Wang."
msgstr ":issue:`27756`: 为Windows上的Python文件和进程添加新图标。设计由Cherry Wang提供。"

#: ../NEWS:47813
msgid ":issue:`27883`: Update sqlite to 3.14.1.0 on Windows."
msgstr ":issue:`27883`: 在Windows上将sqlite更新至3.14.1.0版本。"

#: ../NEWS:47817
msgid "Python 3.6.0 alpha 4"
msgstr "Python 3.6.0 alpha 4"

#: ../NEWS:47819
msgid "*Release date: 2016-08-15*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2016-08-15*"

#: ../NEWS:47824
msgid ""
":issue:`27704`: Optimized creating bytes and bytearray from byte-like "
"objects and iterables. Speed up to 3 times for short objects.  Original "
"patch by Naoki Inada."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27704`: 优化从字节类对象和可迭代对象创建bytes和bytearray。对于短对象速度提升可达3倍。原始由Naoki "
"Inada提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:47828
msgid ""
":issue:`26823`: Large sections of repeated lines in tracebacks are now "
"abbreviated as \"[Previous line repeated {count} more times]\" by the "
"builtin traceback rendering. Patch by Emanuel Barry."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26823`: 回溯中大量重复的行现在被内置回溯渲染缩写为\"[Previous line repeated {count} more "
"times]\"。由Emanuel Barry提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:47832
msgid ""
":issue:`27574`: Decreased an overhead of parsing keyword arguments in "
"functions implemented with using Argument Clinic."
msgstr ":issue:`27574`: 减少了在使用Argument Clinic实现的函数中解析关键字参数的开销。"

#: ../NEWS:47835
msgid ""
":issue:`22557`: Now importing already imported modules is up to 2.5 times "
"faster."
msgstr ":issue:`22557`: 现在导入已经导入的模块速度提升可达2.5倍。"

#: ../NEWS:47838
msgid ":issue:`17596`: Include <wincrypt.h> to help with Min GW building."
msgstr ":issue:`17596`: 包含<wincrypt.h>以帮助Min GW构建。"

#: ../NEWS:47840
msgid ""
":issue:`17599`: On Windows, rename the privately defined REPARSE_DATA_BUFFER"
" structure to avoid conflicting with the definition from Min GW."
msgstr ""
":issue:`17599`: 在Windows上，重命名私有定义的REPARSE_DATA_BUFFER结构以避免与Min GW的定义冲突。"

#: ../NEWS:47843 ../NEWS:50462
msgid ""
":issue:`27507`: Add integer overflow check in bytearray.extend().  Patch by "
"Xiang Zhang."
msgstr ":issue:`27507`: 在bytearray.extend()中添加整数溢出检查。由张翔提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:47846 ../NEWS:50465
msgid ""
":issue:`27581`: Don't rely on wrapping for overflow check in "
"PySequence_Tuple().  Patch by Xiang Zhang."
msgstr ":issue:`27581`: 在PySequence_Tuple()中不依赖包装进行溢出检查。由张翔提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:47849
msgid ""
":issue:`1621`: Avoid signed integer overflow in list and tuple operations. "
"Patch by Xiang Zhang."
msgstr ":issue:`1621`: 避免在列表和元组操作中出现有符号整数溢出。由张翔提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:47852
msgid ""
":issue:`27419`: Standard __import__() no longer look up \"__import__\" in "
"globals or builtins for importing submodules or \"from import\".  Fixed a "
"crash if raise a warning about unabling to resolve package from __spec__ or "
"__package__."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27419`: 标准的__import__()不再在全局或内置变量中查找\"__import__\"以导入子模块或\"from "
"import\"。修复了如果从__spec__或__package__无法解析包时发出警告导致崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:47857 ../NEWS:50454
msgid ""
":issue:`27083`: Respect the PYTHONCASEOK environment variable under Windows."
msgstr ":issue:`27083`: 在Windows下尊重PYTHONCASEOK环境变量。"

#: ../NEWS:47859 ../NEWS:50456
msgid ""
":issue:`27514`: Make having too many statically nested blocks a SyntaxError "
"instead of SystemError."
msgstr ":issue:`27514`: 将静态嵌套块过多的情况改为SyntaxError而非SystemError。"

#: ../NEWS:47862
msgid ""
":issue:`27366`: Implemented :pep:`487` (Simpler customization of class "
"creation). Upon subclassing, the __init_subclass__ classmethod is called on "
"the base class. Descriptors are initialized with __set_name__ after class "
"creation."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27366`: 实现了 :pep:`487` (类创建的简化定制) "
"。在子类化时，__init_subclass__类方法会在基类上调用。描述符在类创建后通过__set_name__初始化。"

#: ../NEWS:47870
msgid ""
":issue:`26027`: Add :pep:`519`/__fspath__() support to the os and os.path "
"modules. Includes code from Jelle Zijlstra. (See also: :issue:`27524`)"
msgstr ""
":issue:`26027`: 向os和os.path模块添加 :pep:`519`/__fspath__()支持。包含来自Jelle "
"Zijlstra的代码。（另见 :issue:`27524`）"

#: ../NEWS:47873
msgid ""
":issue:`27598`: Add Collections to collections.abc. Patch by Ivan "
"Levkivskyi, docs by Neil Girdhar."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27598`: 将Collections添加到collections.abc。由Ivan Levkivskyi提供补丁，文档由Neil "
"Girdhar提供。"

#: ../NEWS:47876
msgid ""
":issue:`25958`: Support \"anti-registration\" of special methods from "
"various ABCs, like __hash__, __iter__ or __len__.  All these (and several "
"more) can be set to None in an implementation class and the behavior will be"
" as if the method is not defined at all. (Previously, this mechanism existed"
" only for __hash__, to make mutable classes unhashable.)  Code contributed "
"by Andrew Barnert and Ivan Levkivskyi."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25958`: "
"支持从各种ABC中\"反注册\"特殊方法，如__hash__、__iter__或__len__。所有这些（以及更多）可以在实现类中设置为None，行为将如同方法根本未定义。（以前，这种机制仅存在于__hash__，以使可变类不可哈希。）代码由Andrew"
" Barnert和Ivan Levkivskyi贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:47883
msgid ""
":issue:`16764`: Support keyword arguments to zlib.decompress().  Patch by "
"Xiang Zhang."
msgstr ":issue:`16764`: 支持zlib.decompress()的关键字参数。由张翔提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:47886
msgid ""
":issue:`27736`: Prevent segfault after interpreter re-initialization due to "
"ref count problem introduced in code for :issue:`27038` in 3.6.0a3. Patch by"
" Xiang Zhang."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27736`: 防止由于在3.6.0a3中为 :issue:`27038` "
"引入的代码导致的引用计数问题在解释器重新初始化后出现段错误。由张翔提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:47890
msgid ""
":issue:`25628`: The *verbose* and *rename* parameters for "
"collections.namedtuple are now keyword-only."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25628`: collections.namedtuple的 *verbose* 和 *rename* 参数现在仅为关键字参数。"

#: ../NEWS:47893
msgid ""
":issue:`12345`: Add mathematical constant tau to math and cmath. See also "
":pep:`628`."
msgstr ":issue:`12345`: 向 math 和 cmath 添加数学常数 tau。另见 :pep:`628`。"

#: ../NEWS:47896
msgid ""
":issue:`26823`: traceback.StackSummary.format now abbreviates large sections"
" of repeated lines as \"[Previous line repeated {count} more times]\" (this "
"change then further affects other traceback display operations in the "
"module). Patch by Emanuel Barry."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26823`: traceback.StackSummary.format 现在将重复行的大段缩写为 \"[前一行重复了 {count}"
" 次]\"（这一变化进一步影响了模块中的其他 traceback 显示操作）。由 Emanuel Barry 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:47901
msgid ""
":issue:`27664`: Add to concurrent.futures.thread.ThreadPoolExecutor() the "
"ability to specify a thread name prefix."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27664`: 向 concurrent.futures.thread.ThreadPoolExecutor() "
"添加了指定线程名前缀的能力。"

#: ../NEWS:47904
msgid ""
":issue:`27181`: Add geometric_mean and harmonic_mean to statistics module."
msgstr ":issue:`27181`: 向 statistics 模块添加 geometric_mean 和 harmonic_mean。"

#: ../NEWS:47906
msgid ":issue:`27573`: code.interact now prints an message when exiting."
msgstr ":issue:`27573`: code.interact 现在在退出时打印一条消息。"

#: ../NEWS:47908
msgid ":issue:`6422`: Add autorange method to timeit.Timer objects."
msgstr ":issue:`6422`: 向 timeit.Timer 对象添加 autorange 方法。"

#: ../NEWS:47910 ../NEWS:50702
msgid ""
":issue:`27773`: Correct some memory management errors server_hostname in "
"_ssl.wrap_socket()."
msgstr ":issue:`27773`: 更正 _ssl.wrap_socket() 中 server_hostname 的一些内存管理错误。"

#: ../NEWS:47913
msgid ""
":issue:`26750`: unittest.mock.create_autospec() now works properly for "
"subclasses of property() and other data descriptors.  Removes the never "
"publicly used, never documented unittest.mock.DescriptorTypes tuple."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26750`: unittest.mock.create_autospec() 现在可以正确用于 property() "
"和其他数据描述符的子类。移除从未公开使用、从未文档化的 unittest.mock.DescriptorTypes 元组。"

#: ../NEWS:47917
msgid ""
":issue:`26754`: Undocumented support of general bytes-like objects as path "
"in compile() and similar functions is now deprecated."
msgstr ":issue:`26754`: 现在弃用 compile() 及类似函数中未文档化的对一般 bytes-like 对象作为路径的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:47920
msgid ""
":issue:`26800`: Undocumented support of general bytes-like objects as paths "
"in os functions is now deprecated."
msgstr ":issue:`26800`: 现在弃用 os 函数中未文档化的对一般 bytes-like 对象作为路径的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:47923
msgid ""
":issue:`26981`: Add _order_ compatibility shim to enum.Enum for Python 2/3 "
"code bases."
msgstr ":issue:`26981`: 向 enum.Enum 添加 _order_ 兼容性垫片，用于 Python 2/3 代码库。"

#: ../NEWS:47926
msgid ":issue:`27661`: Added tzinfo keyword argument to datetime.combine."
msgstr ":issue:`27661`: 向 datetime.combine 添加 tzinfo 关键字参数。"

#: ../NEWS:47928 ../NEWS:50708
msgid ""
"In the curses module, raise an error if window.getstr() or window.instr() is"
" passed a negative value."
msgstr "在 curses 模块中，如果向 window.getstr() 或 window.instr() 传递负值，则引发错误。"

#: ../NEWS:47931 ../NEWS:50711
msgid ""
":issue:`27783`: Fix possible usage of uninitialized memory in "
"operator.methodcaller."
msgstr ":issue:`27783`: 修复 operator.methodcaller 中可能使用未初始化内存的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:47934 ../NEWS:50714
msgid ":issue:`27774`: Fix possible Py_DECREF on unowned object in _sre."
msgstr ":issue:`27774`: 修复 _sre 中可能对未拥有对象进行 Py_DECREF 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:47936 ../NEWS:50716
msgid ":issue:`27760`: Fix possible integer overflow in binascii.b2a_qp."
msgstr ":issue:`27760`: 修复 binascii.b2a_qp 中可能的整数溢出。"

#: ../NEWS:47938 ../NEWS:50718
msgid ""
":issue:`27758`: Fix possible integer overflow in the _csv module for large "
"record lengths."
msgstr ":issue:`27758`: 修复 _csv 模块中对于大记录长度可能的整数溢出。"

#: ../NEWS:47941 ../NEWS:50721
msgid ""
":issue:`27568`: Prevent HTTPoxy attack (:cve:`2016-1000110`). Ignore the "
"HTTP_PROXY variable when REQUEST_METHOD environment is set, which indicates "
"that the script is in CGI mode."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27568`: 防止 HTTPoxy 攻击 (:cve:`2016-1000110`)。当设置了 REQUEST_METHOD "
"环境变量时忽略 HTTP_PROXY 变量，这表明脚本处于 CGI 模式。"

#: ../NEWS:47945
msgid ""
":issue:`7063`: Remove dead code from the \"array\" module's slice handling. "
"Patch by Chuck."
msgstr ":issue:`7063`: 从“array”模块的切片处理中移除无用代码。由Chuck提交补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:47948 ../NEWS:50725
msgid ":issue:`27656`: Do not assume sched.h defines any SCHED_* constants."
msgstr ":issue:`27656`: 不再假设sched.h定义了任何SCHED_*常量。"

#: ../NEWS:47950 ../NEWS:50727
msgid ""
":issue:`27130`: In the \"zlib\" module, fix handling of large buffers "
"(typically 4 GiB) when compressing and decompressing.  Previously, inputs "
"were limited to 4 GiB, and compression and decompression operations did not "
"properly handle results of 4 GiB."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27130`: 在“zlib”模块中，修复了压缩和解压缩大缓冲区（通常为4 GiB）时的处理问题。之前，输入被限制在4 "
"GiB，压缩和解压缩操作未能正确处理4 GiB的结果。"

#: ../NEWS:47955
msgid ":issue:`24773`: Implemented :pep:`495` (Local Time Disambiguation)."
msgstr ":issue:`24773`: 实现了 :pep:`495` (本地时间歧义消除) 。"

#: ../NEWS:47957
msgid ""
"Expose the EPOLLEXCLUSIVE constant (when it is defined) in the select "
"module."
msgstr "在select模块中公开EPOLLEXCLUSIVE常量（当它被定义时）。"

#: ../NEWS:47960
msgid ""
":issue:`27567`: Expose the EPOLLRDHUP and POLLRDHUP constants in the select "
"module."
msgstr ":issue:`27567`: 在select模块中公开EPOLLRDHUP和POLLRDHUP常量。"

#: ../NEWS:47963
msgid ""
":issue:`1621`: Avoid signed int negation overflow in the \"audioop\" module."
msgstr ":issue:`1621`: 在“audioop”模块中避免有符号整数否定溢出。"

#: ../NEWS:47965 ../NEWS:50732
msgid ":issue:`27533`: Release GIL in nt._isdir"
msgstr ":issue:`27533`: 在nt._isdir中释放GIL。"

#: ../NEWS:47967 ../NEWS:50734
msgid ""
":issue:`17711`: Fixed unpickling by the persistent ID with protocol 0. "
"Original patch by Alexandre Vassalotti."
msgstr ":issue:`17711`: 修复了使用协议0的持久ID进行反序列化的问题。原始补丁由Alexandre Vassalotti提交。"

#: ../NEWS:47970 ../NEWS:50737
msgid ""
":issue:`27522`: Avoid an unintentional reference cycle in email.feedparser."
msgstr ":issue:`27522`: 避免在email.feedparser中无意中创建的引用循环。"

#: ../NEWS:47972
msgid ""
":issue:`27512`: Fix a segfault when os.fspath() called an __fspath__() "
"method that raised an exception. Patch by Xiang Zhang."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27512`: 修复了当os.fspath()调用一个引发异常的__fspath__()方法时的段错误。补丁由Xiang "
"Zhang提交。"

#: ../NEWS:47978 ../NEWS:50870
msgid ""
":issue:`27714`: text_textview and test_autocomplete now pass when re-run in "
"the same process.  This occurs when test_idle fails when run with the -w "
"option but without -jn.  Fix warning from test_config."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27714`: "
"text_textview和test_autocomplete现在在同一个进程中重新运行时通过。这发生在test_idle使用-w选项运行但未使用-"
"jn选项时失败时。修复test_config的警告。"

#: ../NEWS:47982
msgid ""
":issue:`27621`: Put query response validation error messages in the query "
"box itself instead of in a separate messagebox.  Redo tests to match. Add "
"Mac OSX refinements. Original patch by Mark Roseman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27621`: 将查询响应验证错误消息放在查询框本身中，而不是放在单独的消息框中。重做测试以匹配。添加Mac "
"OSX改进。原始补丁由Mark Roseman提交。"

#: ../NEWS:47986
msgid ":issue:`27620`: Escape key now closes Query box as cancelled."
msgstr ":issue:`27620`: 现在按Esc键会取消关闭查询框。"

#: ../NEWS:47988
msgid ""
":issue:`27609`: IDLE: tab after initial whitespace should tab, not "
"autocomplete. This fixes problem with writing docstrings at least twice "
"indented."
msgstr ":issue:`27609`: IDLE：在初始空白后按Tab键应制表，而不是自动完成。这解决了至少两次缩进编写文档字符串的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:47992
msgid ""
":issue:`27609`: Explicitly return None when there are also non-None returns."
" In a few cases, reverse a condition and eliminate a return."
msgstr ":issue:`27609`: 当也有非None返回时，显式返回None。在少数情况下，反转条件并消除返回。"

#: ../NEWS:47995 ../NEWS:50874
msgid ""
":issue:`25507`: IDLE no longer runs buggy code because of its tkinter "
"imports. Users must include the same imports required to run directly in "
"Python."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25507`: IDLE不再因为其tkinter导入而运行有bug的代码。用户必须包含直接在Python中运行所需的相同导入。"

#: ../NEWS:47998 ../NEWS:48182
msgid ""
":issue:`27173`: Add 'IDLE Modern Unix' to the built-in key sets. Make the "
"default key set depend on the platform. Add tests for the changes to the "
"config module."
msgstr ":issue:`27173`: 将'IDLE Modern Unix'添加到内置键集中。使默认键集依赖于平台。为配置模块的更改添加测试。"

#: ../NEWS:48002 ../NEWS:48189 ../NEWS:50877
msgid ""
":issue:`27452`: add line counter and crc to IDLE configHandler test dump."
msgstr ":issue:`27452`: 在IDLE configHandler测试转储中添加行计数器和crc。"

#: ../NEWS:48007
msgid ""
":issue:`25805`: Skip a test in test_pkgutil as needed that doesn't work when"
" ``__name__ == __main__``. Patch by SilentGhost."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25805`: 在test_pkgutil中根据需要跳过不适用于当 ``__name__ == __main__`` "
"时的测试。补丁由SilentGhost提供。"

#: ../NEWS:48010
msgid ""
":issue:`27472`: Add test.support.unix_shell as the path to the default "
"shell."
msgstr ":issue:`27472`: 添加test.support.unix_shell作为默认shell的路径。"

#: ../NEWS:48012 ../NEWS:50915
msgid ""
":issue:`27369`: In test_pyexpat, avoid testing an error message detail that "
"changed in Expat 2.2.0."
msgstr ":issue:`27369`: 在test_pyexpat中，避免测试在Expat 2.2.0中已更改的错误消息详情。"

#: ../NEWS:48015
msgid ""
":issue:`27594`: Prevent assertion error when running test_ast with coverage "
"enabled: ensure code object has a valid first line number. Patch suggested "
"by Ivan Levkivskyi."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27594`: 防止在启用覆盖时运行test_ast时出现断言错误：确保代码对象具有有效的首行号。补丁由Ivan "
"Levkivskyi建议。"

#: ../NEWS:48022
msgid ":issue:`27647`: Update bundled Tcl/Tk to 8.6.6."
msgstr ":issue:`27647`: 更新捆绑的Tcl/Tk至8.6.6。"

#: ../NEWS:48024
msgid ":issue:`27610`: Adds :pep:`514` metadata to Windows installer"
msgstr ":issue:`27610`: 向Windows安装程序添加 :pep:`514` 元数据。"

#: ../NEWS:48026 ../NEWS:50940
msgid ""
":issue:`27469`: Adds a shell extension to the launcher so that drag and drop"
" works correctly."
msgstr ":issue:`27469`: 向启动器添加shell扩展，以便拖放操作能正确工作。"

#: ../NEWS:48029
msgid ""
":issue:`27309`: Enables proper Windows styles in python[w].exe manifest."
msgstr ":issue:`27309`: 在python[w].exe清单中启用正确的Windows样式。"

#: ../NEWS:48034 ../NEWS:50985
msgid ""
":issue:`27713`: Suppress spurious build warnings when updating importlib's "
"bootstrap files. Patch by Xiang Zhang"
msgstr ":issue:`27713`: 在更新importlib的引导文件时抑制虚假的构建警告。由Xiang Zhang提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48037
msgid ""
":issue:`25825`: Correct the references to Modules/python.exp, which is "
"required on AIX.  The references were accidentally changed in 3.5.0a1."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25825`: 更正对Modules/python.exp的引用，这在AIX上是必需的。这些引用在3.5.0a1中意外被更改。"

#: ../NEWS:48040 ../NEWS:50993
msgid ""
":issue:`27453`: CPP invocation in configure must use CPPFLAGS. Patch by Chi "
"Hsuan Yen."
msgstr ":issue:`27453`: 配置中的CPP调用必须使用CPPFLAGS。由Chi Hsuan Yen提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48043 ../NEWS:50996
msgid ""
":issue:`27641`: The configure script now inserts comments into the makefile "
"to prevent the pgen and _freeze_importlib executables from being cross-"
"compiled."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27641`: 配置脚本现在在makefile中插入注释，以防止pgen和_freeze_importlib可执行文件被交叉编译。"

#: ../NEWS:48047 ../NEWS:51000
msgid ""
":issue:`26662`: Set PYTHON_FOR_GEN in configure as the Python program to be "
"used for file generation during the build."
msgstr ":issue:`26662`: 在配置中设置PYTHON_FOR_GEN作为构建期间用于文件生成的Python程序。"

#: ../NEWS:48050 ../NEWS:51003
msgid ""
":issue:`10910`: Avoid C++ compilation errors on FreeBSD and OS X. Also "
"update FreedBSD version checks for the original ctype UTF-8 workaround."
msgstr ""
":issue:`10910`: 避免在FreeBSD和OS X上出现C++编译错误。同时更新FreedBSD版本检查以应对原始的ctype "
"UTF-8变通方案。"

#: ../NEWS:48055
msgid "Python 3.6.0 alpha 3"
msgstr "Python 3.6.0 alpha 3"

#: ../NEWS:48057
msgid "*Release date: 2016-07-11*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2016-07-11*"

#: ../NEWS:48062 ../NEWS:50336
msgid ""
":issue:`27278`: Fix os.urandom() implementation using getrandom() on Linux. "
"Truncate size to INT_MAX and loop until we collected enough random bytes, "
"instead of casting a directly Py_ssize_t to int."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27278`: "
"修复在Linux上使用getrandom()实现的os.urandom()。将大小截断为INT_MAX，并循环直到收集足够的随机字节，而不是直接将Py_ssize_t转换为int。"

#: ../NEWS:48066 ../NEWS:50340
msgid ""
":issue:`22636`: Avoid shell injection problems with "
"ctypes.util.find_library()."
msgstr ":issue:`22636`: 避免 ctypes.util.find_library() 的 shell 注入问题。"

#: ../NEWS:48071 ../NEWS:50459
msgid ""
":issue:`27473`: Fixed possible integer overflow in bytes and bytearray "
"concatenations. Patch by Xiang Zhang."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27473`: 修复了 bytes 和 bytearray 连接中可能的整数溢出问题。补丁由 Xiang Zhang 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:48074
msgid ""
":issue:`23034`: The output of a special Python build with defined "
"COUNT_ALLOCS, SHOW_ALLOC_COUNT or SHOW_TRACK_COUNT macros is now off by  "
"default.  It can be re-enabled using the \"-X showalloccount\" option.  It "
"now outputs to stderr instead of stdout."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23034`: 现在默认关闭了定义了 COUNT_ALLOCS、SHOW_ALLOC_COUNT 或 SHOW_TRACK_COUNT "
"宏的特殊 Python 构建的输出。可以通过 \"-X showalloccount\" 选项重新启用。现在输出到 stderr 而不是 stdout。"

#: ../NEWS:48079 ../NEWS:50468
msgid ""
":issue:`27443`: __length_hint__() of bytearray iterators no longer return a "
"negative integer for a resized bytearray."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27443`: bytearray 迭代器的 __length_hint__() 不再为调整大小的 bytearray 返回负整数。"

#: ../NEWS:48082
msgid ""
":issue:`27007`: The fromhex() class methods of bytes and bytearray "
"subclasses now return an instance of corresponding subclass."
msgstr ":issue:`27007`: bytes 和 bytearray 子类的 fromhex() 类方法现在返回相应子类的实例。"

#: ../NEWS:48088 ../NEWS:50739
msgid ""
":issue:`26844`: Fix error message for imp.find_module() to refer to 'path' "
"instead of 'name'. Patch by Lev Maximov."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26844`: 修复 imp.find_module() 的错误消息，使其引用 'path' 而不是 'name'。由 Lev "
"Maximov 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48091 ../NEWS:50742
msgid ""
":issue:`23804`: Fix SSL zero-length recv() calls to not block and not raise "
"an error about unclean EOF."
msgstr ":issue:`23804`: 修复 SSL 零长度 recv() 调用，使其不阻塞且不引发关于不干净 EOF 的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:48094 ../NEWS:50745
msgid ""
":issue:`27466`: Change time format returned by http.cookie.time2netscape, "
"confirming the netscape cookie format and making it consistent with "
"documentation."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27466`: 更改 http.cookie.time2netscape 返回的时间格式，确认 netscape cookie "
"格式并使其与文档一致。"

#: ../NEWS:48098
msgid ""
":issue:`21708`: Deprecated dbm.dumb behavior that differs from common dbm "
"behavior: creating a database in 'r' and 'w' modes and modifying a database "
"in 'r' mode."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21708`: 弃用了 dbm.dumb 与常见 dbm 行为不同的行为：在 'r' 和 'w' 模式下创建数据库以及在 'r' "
"模式下修改数据库。"

#: ../NEWS:48102
msgid ""
":issue:`26721`: Change the socketserver.StreamRequestHandler.wfile attribute"
" to implement BufferedIOBase. In particular, the write() method no longer "
"does partial writes."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26721`: 将 socketserver.StreamRequestHandler.wfile 属性更改为实现 "
"BufferedIOBase。特别是，write() 方法不再进行部分写入。"

#: ../NEWS:48106
msgid ""
":issue:`22115`: Added methods trace_add, trace_remove and trace_info in the "
"tkinter.Variable class.  They replace old methods trace_variable, trace, "
"trace_vdelete and trace_vinfo that use obsolete Tcl commands and might not "
"work in future versions of Tcl.  Fixed old tracing methods: trace_vdelete() "
"with wrong mode no longer break tracing, trace_vinfo() now always returns a "
"list of pairs of strings, tracing in the \"u\" mode now works."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22115`: 在 tkinter.Variable 类中添加了 trace_add、trace_remove 和 trace_info"
" 方法。它们取代了使用过时 Tcl 命令的旧方法 trace_variable、trace、trace_vdelete 和 "
"trace_vinfo，这些旧方法在未来的 Tcl 版本中可能不起作用。修复了旧跟踪方法：trace_vdelete() "
"在模式错误时不再中断跟踪，trace_vinfo() 现在总是返回字符串对的列表，\"u\" 模式的跟踪现在正常工作。"

#: ../NEWS:48114
msgid ""
":issue:`26243`: Only the level argument to zlib.compress() is keyword "
"argument now.  The first argument is positional-only."
msgstr ":issue:`26243`: 现在 zlib.compress() 只有 level 参数是关键字参数。第一个参数是仅位置参数。"

#: ../NEWS:48117
msgid ""
":issue:`27038`: Expose the DirEntry type as os.DirEntry. Code patch by Jelle"
" Zijlstra."
msgstr ":issue:`27038`: 将DirEntry类型公开为os.DirEntry。代码由Jelle Zijlstra提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48120
msgid ""
":issue:`27186`: Update os.fspath()/PyOS_FSPath() to check the return value "
"of __fspath__() to be either str or bytes."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27186`: 更新os.fspath()/PyOS_FSPath()以检查__fspath__()的返回值为str或bytes。"

#: ../NEWS:48123
msgid ""
":issue:`18726`: All optional parameters of the dump(), dumps(), load() and "
"loads() functions and JSONEncoder and JSONDecoder class constructors in the "
"json module are now keyword-only."
msgstr ""
":issue:`18726`: "
"json模块中的dump()、dumps()、load()和loads()函数以及JSONEncoder和JSONDecoder类构造函数的所有可选参数现在仅为关键字参数。"

#: ../NEWS:48127
msgid ""
":issue:`27319`: Methods selection_set(), selection_add(), selection_remove()"
" and selection_toggle() of ttk.TreeView now allow passing multiple items as "
"multiple arguments instead of passing them as a tuple.  Deprecated "
"undocumented ability of calling the selection() method with arguments."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27319`: "
"ttk.TreeView的selection_set()、selection_add()、selection_remove()和selection_toggle()方法现在允许将多个项作为多个参数传递，而不是将它们作为元组传递。弃用了selection()方法带参数调用的未记录功能。"

#: ../NEWS:48132 ../NEWS:50759
msgid ""
":issue:`27079`: Fixed curses.ascii functions isblank(), iscntrl() and "
"ispunct()."
msgstr ":issue:`27079`: 修复了curses.ascii函数isblank()、iscntrl()和ispunct()。"

#: ../NEWS:48135
msgid ""
":issue:`27294`: Numerical state in the repr for Tkinter event objects is now"
" represented as a combination of known flags."
msgstr ":issue:`27294`: Tkinter事件对象的repr中的数值状态现在表示为已知标志的组合。"

#: ../NEWS:48138
msgid ""
":issue:`27177`: Match objects in the re module now support index-like "
"objects as group indices.  Based on patches by Jeroen Demeyer and Xiang "
"Zhang."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27177`: re模块中的Match对象现在支持类似索引的对象作为组索引。基于Jeroen Demeyer和Xiang "
"Zhang的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48141 ../NEWS:50762
msgid ""
":issue:`26754`: Some functions (compile() etc) accepted a filename argument "
"encoded as an iterable of integers. Now only strings and byte-like objects "
"are accepted."
msgstr ":issue:`26754`: 一些函数（如compile()等）接受以整数可迭代对象编码的文件名参数。现在只接受字符串和字节类对象。"

#: ../NEWS:48145
msgid ""
":issue:`26536`: socket.ioctl now supports SIO_LOOPBACK_FAST_PATH. Patch by "
"Daniel Stokes."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26536`: socket.ioctl现在支持SIO_LOOPBACK_FAST_PATH。由Daniel Stokes提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48148 ../NEWS:50766
msgid ""
":issue:`27048`: Prevents distutils failing on Windows when environment "
"variables contain non-ASCII characters"
msgstr ":issue:`27048`: 防止distutils在Windows上因环境变量包含非ASCII字符而失败。"

#: ../NEWS:48151 ../NEWS:50769
msgid ":issue:`27330`: Fixed possible leaks in the ctypes module."
msgstr ":issue:`27330`: 修复了ctypes模块中可能的泄漏。"

#: ../NEWS:48153 ../NEWS:50771
msgid ""
":issue:`27238`: Got rid of bare excepts in the turtle module.  Original "
"patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ":issue:`27238`: 移除了turtle模块中的裸except。原始由Jelle Zijlstra提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48156 ../NEWS:50774
msgid ""
":issue:`27122`: When an exception is raised within the context being managed"
" by a contextlib.ExitStack() and one of the exit stack generators catches "
"and raises it in a chain, do not re-raise the original exception when "
"exiting, let the new chained one through.  This avoids the :pep:`479` bug "
"described in issue25782."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27122`: "
"当在由contextlib.ExitStack()管理的上下文中引发异常，并且退出堆栈生成器之一捕获并在链中引发它时，退出时不再重新引发原始异常，而是让新的链式异常通过。这避免了issue25782中描述的"
" :pep:`479` 错误。"

#: ../NEWS:48162
msgid ""
":issue:`16864`: sqlite3.Cursor.lastrowid now supports REPLACE statement. "
"Initial patch by Alex LordThorsen."
msgstr ""
":issue:`16864`: sqlite3.Cursor.lastrowid现在支持REPLACE语句。初始补丁由Alex "
"LordThorsen提供。"

#: ../NEWS:48165 ../NEWS:50780
msgid ""
":issue:`26386`: Fixed ttk.TreeView selection operations with item id's "
"containing spaces."
msgstr ":issue:`26386`: 修复了 ttk.TreeView 选中操作中项目 ID 包含空格的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:48168
msgid ""
":issue:`8637`: Honor a pager set by the env var MANPAGER (in preference to "
"one set by the env var PAGER)."
msgstr ":issue:`8637`: 优先使用环境变量 MANPAGER 设置的页面浏览程序（而非环境变量 PAGER 设置的）。"

#: ../NEWS:48171 ../NEWS:50783
msgid ""
":issue:`16182`: Fix various functions in the \"readline\" module to use the "
"locale encoding, and fix get_begidx() and get_endidx() to return code point "
"indexes."
msgstr ""
":issue:`16182`: 修复 \"readline\" 模块中的多个函数以使用区域设置编码，并修复 get_begidx() 和 "
"get_endidx() 返回代码点索引。"

#: ../NEWS:48175 ../NEWS:50787
msgid ""
":issue:`27392`: Add loop.connect_accepted_socket(). Patch by Jim Fulton."
msgstr ":issue:`27392`: 添加 loop.connect_accepted_socket()。由 Jim Fulton 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48180
msgid ":issue:`27477`: IDLE search dialogs now use ttk widgets."
msgstr ":issue:`27477`: IDLE 搜索对话框现在使用 ttk 部件。"

#: ../NEWS:48186
msgid ""
":issue:`27452`: make command line \"idle-test> python test_help.py\" work. "
"__file__ is relative when python is started in the file's directory."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27452`: 使命令行 \"idle-test> python test_help.py\" 正常工作。当 python "
"在文件目录中启动时，__file__ 是相对的。"

#: ../NEWS:48191
msgid ""
":issue:`27380`: IDLE: add query.py with base Query dialog and ttk widgets. "
"Module had subclasses SectionName, ModuleName, and HelpSource, which are "
"used to get information from users by configdialog and file =>Load Module. "
"Each subclass has itw own validity checks.  Using ModuleName allows users to"
" edit bad module names instead of starting over. Add tests and delete the "
"two files combined into the new one."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27380`: IDLE：添加 query.py 包含基本查询对话框和 ttk 部件。模块有子类 "
"SectionName、ModuleName 和 HelpSource，用于通过 configdialog 和 file =>Load Module "
"从用户获取信息。每个子类有其自己的有效性检查。使用 ModuleName "
"允许用户编辑错误的模块名而不是重新开始。添加测试并删除合并到新文件中的两个文件。"

#: ../NEWS:48198
msgid ":issue:`27372`: Test_idle no longer changes the locale."
msgstr ":issue:`27372`: Test_idle 不再更改区域设置。"

#: ../NEWS:48200 ../NEWS:50879
msgid ""
":issue:`27365`: Allow non-ascii chars in IDLE NEWS.txt, for contributor "
"names."
msgstr ":issue:`27365`: 允许在 IDLE NEWS.txt 中使用非 ASCII 字符，用于贡献者姓名。"

#: ../NEWS:48202 ../NEWS:50881
msgid ""
":issue:`27245`: IDLE: Cleanly delete custom themes and key bindings. "
"Previously, when IDLE was started from a console or by import, a cascade of "
"warnings was emitted. Patch by Serhiy Storchaka."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27245`: IDLE：干净地删除自定义主题和键绑定。以前，当 IDLE 从控制台或通过导入启动时，会发出一系列警告。由 Serhiy"
" Storchaka 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48206
msgid ""
":issue:`24137`: Run IDLE, test_idle, and htest with tkinter default root "
"disabled.  Fix code and tests that fail with this restriction.  Fix htests "
"to not create a second and redundant root and mainloop."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24137`: 运行 IDLE、test_idle 和 htest 时禁用 tkinter 默认根。修复因此限制而失败的代码和测试。修复"
" htests 不创建第二个冗余的根和主循环。"

#: ../NEWS:48210
msgid ""
":issue:`27310`: Fix IDLE.app failure to launch on OS X due to vestigial "
"import."
msgstr ":issue:`27310`: 修复 IDLE.app 在 OS X 上因遗留导入而无法启动的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:48215
msgid ""
":issue:`26754`: PyUnicode_FSDecoder() accepted a filename argument encoded "
"as an iterable of integers. Now only strings and byte-like objects are "
"accepted."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26754`: PyUnicode_FSDecoder() 接受以整数迭代形式编码的文件名参数。现在只接受字符串和类字节对象。"

#: ../NEWS:48222 ../NEWS:50966
msgid ""
":issue:`28066`: Fix the logic that searches build directories for generated "
"include files when building outside the source tree."
msgstr ":issue:`28066`: 修复在源代码树外构建时搜索构建目录中生成的包含文件的逻辑。"

#: ../NEWS:48225
msgid ""
":issue:`27442`: Expose the Android API level that python was built against, "
"in sysconfig.get_config_vars() as 'ANDROID_API_LEVEL'."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27442`: 在sysconfig.get_config_vars()中暴露Python构建所针对的Android "
"API级别，作为'ANDROID_API_LEVEL'。"

#: ../NEWS:48228
msgid ""
":issue:`27434`: The interpreter that runs the cross-build, found in PATH, "
"must now be of the same feature version (e.g. 3.6) as the source being "
"built."
msgstr ":issue:`27434`: 运行交叉构建的解释器，位于PATH中，现在必须与正在构建的源代码具有相同的特性版本（例如3.6）。"

#: ../NEWS:48231 ../NEWS:51018
msgid ":issue:`26930`: Update Windows builds to use OpenSSL 1.0.2h."
msgstr ":issue:`26930`: 更新Windows构建以使用OpenSSL 1.0.2h。"

#: ../NEWS:48233
msgid ""
":issue:`23968`: Rename the platform directory from plat-$(MACHDEP) to "
"plat-$(PLATFORM_TRIPLET). Rename the config directory (LIBPL) from "
"config-$(LDVERSION) to config-$(LDVERSION)-$(PLATFORM_TRIPLET). Install the "
"platform specific _sysconfigdata module into the platform directory and "
"rename it to include the ABIFLAGS."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23968`: "
"将平台目录从plat-$(MACHDEP)重命名为plat-$(PLATFORM_TRIPLET)。将配置目录(LIBPL)从config-$(LDVERSION)重命名为config-$(LDVERSION)-$(PLATFORM_TRIPLET)。将特定于平台的_sysconfigdata模块安装到平台目录，并重命名以包含ABIFLAGS。"

#: ../NEWS:48239
msgid "Don't use largefile support for GNU/Hurd."
msgstr "在 GNU/Hurd 系统中不使用大文件支持。"

#: ../NEWS:48244 ../NEWS:50925
msgid ""
":issue:`27332`: Fixed the type of the first argument of module-level "
"functions generated by Argument Clinic.  Patch by Petr Viktorin."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27332`: 修复了由Argument Clinic生成的模块级函数的第一个参数的类型。由Petr Viktorin提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48247 ../NEWS:50928
msgid ":issue:`27418`: Fixed Tools/importbench/importbench.py."
msgstr ":issue:`27418`: 修复了Tools/importbench/importbench.py。"

#: ../NEWS:48252 ../NEWS:51623
msgid ""
":issue:`19489`: Moved the search box from the sidebar to the header and "
"footer of each page. Patch by Ammar Askar."
msgstr ":issue:`19489`: 将搜索框从侧边栏移动到每个页面的页眉和页脚。由Ammar Askar提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48255
msgid ""
":issue:`27285`: Update documentation to reflect the deprecation of "
"``pyvenv`` and normalize on the term \"virtual environment\". Patch by Steve"
" Piercy."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27285`: 更新文档以反映 ``pyvenv`` 的弃用，并统一使用术语“虚拟环境”。由Steve Piercy提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48261
msgid ""
":issue:`27027`: Added test.support.is_android that is True when this is an "
"Android build."
msgstr ":issue:`27027`: 添加了test.support.is_android，当这是一个Android构建时为True。"

#: ../NEWS:48266
msgid "Python 3.6.0 alpha 2"
msgstr "Python 3.6.0 alpha 2"

#: ../NEWS:48268
msgid "*Release date: 2016-06-13*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2016-06-13*"

#: ../NEWS:48273 ../NEWS:51039
msgid ":issue:`26556`: Update expat to 2.1.1, fixes :cve:`2015-1283`."
msgstr ":issue:`26556`: 将expat更新到2.1.1，修复了 :cve:`2015-1283`。"

#: ../NEWS:48275 ../NEWS:51041
msgid ""
"Fix TLS stripping vulnerability in smtplib, :cve:`2016-0772`. Reported by "
"Team Oststrom."
msgstr "修复smtplib中的TLS剥离漏洞，:cve:`2016-0772`。由Team Oststrom报告。"

#: ../NEWS:48278 ../NEWS:51044
msgid ""
":issue:`26839`: On Linux, :func:`os.urandom` now calls ``getrandom()`` with "
"``GRND_NONBLOCK`` to fall back on reading ``/dev/urandom`` if the urandom "
"entropy pool is not initialized yet. Patch written by Colm Buckley."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26839`: 在Linux上，:func:`os.urandom` 现在调用 ``getrandom()`` 与 "
"``GRND_NONBLOCK``，如果urandom熵池尚未初始化，则回退到读取 ``/dev/urandom``。补丁由Colm "
"Buckley编写。"

#: ../NEWS:48285
msgid ""
":issue:`27095`: Simplified MAKE_FUNCTION and removed MAKE_CLOSURE opcodes. "
"Patch by Demur Rumed."
msgstr ":issue:`27095`: 简化了MAKE_FUNCTION并移除了MAKE_CLOSURE操作码。由Demur Rumed提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48288
msgid ""
":issue:`27190`: Raise NotSupportedError if sqlite3 is older than 3.3.1. "
"Patch by Dave Sawyer."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27190`: 如果sqlite3版本低于3.3.1，则引发NotSupportedError。由Dave Sawyer提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48291
msgid ""
":issue:`27286`: Fixed compiling BUILD_MAP_UNPACK_WITH_CALL opcode.  Calling "
"function with generalized unpacking (PEP 448) and conflicting keyword names "
"could cause undefined behavior."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27286`: 修复了编译BUILD_MAP_UNPACK_WITH_CALL操作码的问题。使用广义解包（PEP "
"448）和冲突的关键字名称调用函数可能导致未定义行为。"

#: ../NEWS:48295
msgid ":issue:`27140`: Added BUILD_CONST_KEY_MAP opcode."
msgstr ":issue:`27140`: 添加了BUILD_CONST_KEY_MAP操作码。"

#: ../NEWS:48297
msgid ""
":issue:`27186`: Add support for os.PathLike objects to open() (part of "
":pep:`519`)."
msgstr ":issue:`27186`: 为 open() 添加对 os.PathLike 对象的支持（:pep:`519` 的一部分）。"

#: ../NEWS:48300 ../NEWS:51061
msgid ""
":issue:`27066`: Fixed SystemError if a custom opener (for open()) returns a "
"negative number without setting an exception."
msgstr ":issue:`27066`: 修复了如果自定义 opener（为 open()）返回一个负数而没有设置异常时的 SystemError。"

#: ../NEWS:48303
msgid ""
":issue:`26983`: float() now always return an instance of exact float. The "
"deprecation warning is emitted if __float__ returns an instance of a strict "
"subclass of float.  In a future versions of Python this can be an error."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26983`: float() 现在总是返回一个精确的 float 实例。如果 __float__ 返回一个 float "
"的严格子类的实例，将发出弃用警告。在 Python 的未来版本中，这可能是一个错误。"

#: ../NEWS:48308
msgid ""
":issue:`27097`: Python interpreter is now about 7% faster due to optimized "
"instruction decoding.  Based on patch by Demur Rumed."
msgstr ":issue:`27097`: Python 解释器现在由于优化的指令解码而大约快了 7%。基于 Demur Rumed 的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48311
msgid ""
":issue:`26647`: Python interpreter now uses 16-bit wordcode instead of "
"bytecode. Patch by Demur Rumed."
msgstr ":issue:`26647`: Python 解释器现在使用 16 位字码代替字节码。由 Demur Rumed 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48314
msgid ""
":issue:`23275`: Allow assigning to an empty target list in round brackets: "
"() = iterable."
msgstr ":issue:`23275`: 允许在圆括号中赋值给空的目标列表：() = iterable。"

#: ../NEWS:48317 ../NEWS:51183
msgid ""
":issue:`27243`: Update the __aiter__ protocol: instead of returning an "
"awaitable that resolves to an asynchronous iterator, the asynchronous "
"iterator should be returned directly.  Doing the former will trigger a "
"PendingDeprecationWarning."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27243`: 更新 __aiter__ 协议：异步迭代器应该直接返回，而不是返回一个解析为异步迭代器的 "
"awaitable。执行前者将触发 PendingDeprecationWarning。"

#: ../NEWS:48325
msgid ""
"Comment out socket (SO_REUSEPORT) and posix (O_SHLOCK, O_EXLOCK) constants "
"exposed on the API which are not implemented on GNU/Hurd. They would not "
"work at runtime anyway."
msgstr ""
"注释掉在 API 上暴露的未在 GNU/Hurd 上实现的 socket (SO_REUSEPORT) 和 posix (O_SHLOCK, "
"O_EXLOCK) 常量。无论如何，它们在运行时都不会工作。"

#: ../NEWS:48329
msgid ""
":issue:`27025`: Generated names for Tkinter widgets are now more meaningful "
"and recognizable."
msgstr ":issue:`27025`: 现在 Tkinter 小部件生成的名称更有意义且更易于识别。"

#: ../NEWS:48332
msgid ""
":issue:`25455`: Fixed crashes in repr of recursive ElementTree.Element and "
"functools.partial objects."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25455`: 修复了递归 ElementTree.Element 和 functools.partial 对象的 repr 中的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:48335
msgid ":issue:`27294`: Improved repr for Tkinter event objects."
msgstr ":issue:`27294`: 改进了 Tkinter 事件对象的 repr。"

#: ../NEWS:48337
msgid ""
":issue:`20508`: Improve exception message of IPv{4,6}Network.__getitem__. "
"Patch by Gareth Rees."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20508`: 改进了 IPv{4,6}Network.__getitem__ 的异常消息。由 Gareth Rees 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48340 ../NEWS:51191
msgid ""
":issue:`21386`: Implement missing IPv4Address.is_global property.  It was "
"documented since 07a5610bae9d.  Initial patch by Roger Luethi."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21386`: 实现了缺失的 IPv4Address.is_global 属性。自 07a5610bae9d 以来已有文档记录。初始由 "
"Roger Luethi 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48343
msgid ""
":issue:`27029`: Removed deprecated support of universal newlines mode from "
"ZipFile.open()."
msgstr ":issue:`27029`: 从 ZipFile.open() 中移除了对通用换行模式的已弃用支持。"

#: ../NEWS:48346
msgid ""
":issue:`27030`: Unknown escapes consisting of ``'\\'`` and an ASCII letter "
"in regular expressions now are errors.  The re.LOCALE flag now can be used "
"only with bytes patterns."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27030`: 现在，由 ``'\\'`` 和一个 ASCII 字母组成的未知转义在正则表达式中是错误。re.LOCALE "
"标志现在只能用于字节模式。"

#: ../NEWS:48350
msgid ""
":issue:`27186`: Add os.PathLike support to DirEntry (part of :pep:`519`). "
"Initial patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27186`: 向 DirEntry 添加 os.PathLike 支持（作为 :pep:`519` 的一部分）。初始由 Jelle "
"Zijlstra 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48353 ../NEWS:51194
msgid ""
":issue:`20900`: distutils register command now decodes HTTP responses "
"correctly.  Initial patch by ingrid."
msgstr ":issue:`20900`: distutils register 命令现在能正确解码 HTTP 响应。初始由 ingrid 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48356
msgid ""
":issue:`27186`: Add os.PathLike support to pathlib, removing its provisional"
" status (part of PEP 519). Initial patch by Dusty Phillips."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27186`: 向 pathlib 添加 os.PathLike 支持，移除其临时状态（作为 PEP 519 的一部分）。初始由 "
"Dusty Phillips 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48359
msgid ""
":issue:`27186`: Add support for os.PathLike objects to os.fsencode() and "
"os.fsdecode() (part of :pep:`519`)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27186`: 向 os.fsencode() 和 os.fsdecode() 添加对 os.PathLike 对象的支持（作为 "
":pep:`519` 的一部分）。"

#: ../NEWS:48362
msgid ""
":issue:`27186`: Introduce os.PathLike and os.fspath() (part of :pep:`519`)."
msgstr ":issue:`27186`: 引入 os.PathLike 和 os.fspath()（作为 :pep:`519` 的一部分）。"

#: ../NEWS:48364 ../NEWS:51197
msgid ""
"A new version of typing.py provides several new classes and features: "
"@overload outside stubs, Reversible, DefaultDict, Text, ContextManager, "
"Type[], NewType(), TYPE_CHECKING, and numerous bug fixes (note that some of "
"the new features are not yet implemented in mypy or other static analyzers)."
" Also classes for :pep:`492` (Awaitable, AsyncIterable, AsyncIterator) have "
"been added (in fact they made it into 3.5.1 but were never mentioned)."
msgstr ""
"新版本的 typing.py 提供了几个新类和特性：stubs 外的 "
"@overload、Reversible、DefaultDict、Text、ContextManager、Type[]、NewType()、TYPE_CHECKING，以及众多错误修复（注意，一些新特性尚未在"
" mypy 或其他静态分析器中实现）。同时，为 :pep:`492` (Awaitable、AsyncIterable、AsyncIterator) "
"添加的类也已加入（实际上它们已在 3.5.1 中实现，但从未被提及）。"

#: ../NEWS:48372 ../NEWS:51205
msgid ""
":issue:`25738`: Stop http.server.BaseHTTPRequestHandler.send_error() from "
"sending a message body for 205 Reset Content.  Also, don't send Content "
"header fields in responses that don't have a body.  Patch by Susumu Koshiba."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25738`: 停止 http.server.BaseHTTPRequestHandler.send_error() 为 205 "
"Reset Content 发送消息体。同时，不在没有正文的响应中发送 Content 头字段。由 Susumu Koshiba 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48377 ../NEWS:51210
msgid ""
":issue:`21313`: Fix the \"platform\" module to tolerate when sys.version "
"contains truncated build information."
msgstr ":issue:`21313`: 修复 \"platform\" 模块以容忍 sys.version 包含截断的构建信息。"

#: ../NEWS:48380
msgid ""
":issue:`23883`: Added missing APIs to __all__ to match the documented APIs "
"for the following modules: cgi, mailbox, mimetypes, plistlib and smtpd. "
"Patches by Jacek Kołodziej."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23883`: 向 __all__ 添加缺失的 API 以匹配以下模块的文档化 "
"API：cgi、mailbox、mimetypes、plistlib 和 smtpd。由 Jacek Kołodziej 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48384 ../NEWS:51213
msgid ""
":issue:`27164`: In the zlib module, allow decompressing raw Deflate streams "
"with a predefined zdict.  Based on patch by Xiang Zhang."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27164`: 在 zlib 模块中，允许使用预定义的 zdict 解压原始 Deflate 流。基于 Xiang Zhang 的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48387 ../NEWS:51216
msgid ""
":issue:`24291`: Fix wsgiref.simple_server.WSGIRequestHandler to completely "
"write data to the client.  Previously it could do partial writes and "
"truncate data.  Also, wsgiref.handler.ServerHandler can now handle stdout "
"doing partial writes, but this is deprecated."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24291`: 修复 wsgiref.simple_server.WSGIRequestHandler "
"以完全向客户端写入数据。之前它可能进行部分写入并截断数据。同时，wsgiref.handler.ServerHandler 现在可以处理 stdout "
"进行部分写入，但此功能已被弃用。"

#: ../NEWS:48392
msgid ""
":issue:`21272`: Use _sysconfigdata.py to initialize distutils.sysconfig."
msgstr ":issue:`21272`: 使用 _sysconfigdata.py 初始化 distutils.sysconfig。"

#: ../NEWS:48394
msgid ""
":issue:`19611`: :mod:`inspect` now reports the implicit ``.0`` parameters "
"generated by the compiler for comprehension and generator expression scopes "
"as if they were positional-only parameters called ``implicit0``. Patch by "
"Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":issue:`19611`: :mod:`inspect` 现在将编译器为推导式和生成器表达式作用域生成的隐式 ``.0`` 参数报告为名为 "
"``implicit0`` 的位置参数。由 Jelle Zijlstra 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48399 ../NEWS:51221
msgid ""
":issue:`26809`: Add ``__all__`` to :mod:`string`.  Patch by Emanuel Barry."
msgstr ":issue:`26809`: 向 :mod:`string` 添加了 ``__all__``。由 Emanuel Barry 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48401 ../NEWS:51223
msgid ""
":issue:`26373`: subprocess.Popen.communicate now correctly ignores "
"BrokenPipeError when the child process dies before .communicate() is called "
"in more/all circumstances."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26373`: subprocess.Popen.communicate 现在在更多/所有情况下，当子进程在调用 "
".communicate() 之前死亡时，正确地忽略 BrokenPipeError。"

#: ../NEWS:48405
msgid ""
"signal, socket, and ssl module IntEnum constant name lookups now return a "
"consistent name for values having multiple names.  Ex: signal.Signals(6) now"
" refers to itself as signal.SIGALRM rather than flipping between that and "
"signal.SIGIOT based on the interpreter's hash randomization seed."
msgstr ""
"signal、socket 和 ssl 模块的 IntEnum "
"常量名称查找现在为具有多个名称的值返回一致的名称。例如：signal.Signals(6) 现在自称为 "
"signal.SIGALRM，而不是根据解释器的哈希随机化种子在 signal.SIGALRM 和 signal.SIGIOT 之间切换。"

#: ../NEWS:48410
msgid ""
":issue:`27167`: Clarify the subprocess.CalledProcessError error message text"
" when the child process died due to a signal."
msgstr ":issue:`27167`: 当子进程因信号死亡时，澄清 subprocess.CalledProcessError 错误消息文本。"

#: ../NEWS:48413
msgid ""
":issue:`25931`: Don't define socketserver.Forking* names on platforms such "
"as Windows that do not support os.fork()."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25931`: 在像 Windows 这样不支持 os.fork() 的平台上不定义 socketserver.Forking* 名称。"

#: ../NEWS:48416 ../NEWS:51227
msgid ""
":issue:`21776`: distutils.upload now correctly handles HTTPError. Initial "
"patch by Claudiu Popa."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21776`: distutils.upload 现在正确处理 HTTPError。初始由 Claudiu Popa 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48419
msgid ""
":issue:`26526`: Replace custom parse tree validation in the parser module "
"with a simple DFA validator."
msgstr ":issue:`26526`: 用简单的 DFA 验证器替换解析器模块中的自定义解析树验证。"

#: ../NEWS:48422 ../NEWS:51230
msgid ""
":issue:`27114`: Fix SSLContext._load_windows_store_certs fails with "
"PermissionError"
msgstr ""
":issue:`27114`: 修复 SSLContext._load_windows_store_certs 因 PermissionError "
"失败的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:48425 ../NEWS:51233
msgid ""
":issue:`18383`: Avoid creating duplicate filters when using filterwarnings "
"and simplefilter. Based on patch by Alex Shkop."
msgstr ""
":issue:`18383`: 避免在使用 filterwarnings 和 simplefilter 时创建重复的过滤器。基于 Alex Shkop "
"的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48428
msgid ""
":issue:`23026`: winreg.QueryValueEx() now return an integer for REG_QWORD "
"type."
msgstr ":issue:`23026`: winreg.QueryValueEx() 现在为 REG_QWORD 类型返回一个整数。"

#: ../NEWS:48430
msgid ""
":issue:`26741`: subprocess.Popen destructor now emits a ResourceWarning "
"warning if the child process is still running."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26741`: 如果子进程仍在运行，subprocess.Popen 析构函数现在会发出 ResourceWarning 警告。"

#: ../NEWS:48433
msgid ""
":issue:`27056`: Optimize pickle.load() and pickle.loads(), up to 10% faster "
"to deserialize a lot of small objects."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27056`: 优化 pickle.load() 和 pickle.loads()，反序列化大量小对象时速度提高高达 10%。"

#: ../NEWS:48436
msgid ":issue:`21271`: New keyword only parameters in reset_mock call."
msgstr ":issue:`21271`: reset_mock 调用中的新关键字参数。"

#: ../NEWS:48441 ../NEWS:51570
msgid ""
":issue:`5124`: Paste with text selected now replaces the selection on X11. "
