" 语法着色器的测试。"

#: ../NEWS:48452
msgid ":issue:`27239`: idlelib.macosx.isXyzTk functions initialize as needed."
msgstr ":issue:`27239`: idlelib.macosx.isXyzTk 函数按需初始化。"

#: ../NEWS:48454
msgid ""
":issue:`27262`: move Aqua unbinding code, which enable context menus, to "
