msgstr ":issue:`27262`: 将 Aqua 解绑代码（启用上下文菜单）移至 macosx。"

#: ../NEWS:48457 ../NEWS:51574
msgid ""
":issue:`24759`: Make clear in idlelib.idle_test.__init__ that the directory "
