" Serhiy Storchaka 的 update_idletasks 解决方案应用于四个测试文件。在 idle_test/README.txt "
"中记录这一额外建议。"

#: ../NEWS:48465 ../NEWS:51582
msgid ""
":issue:`20567`: Revise idle_test/README.txt with advice about avoiding tk "
"warning messages from tests.  Apply advice to several IDLE tests."
msgstr ""
