#: ../NEWS:48468
msgid ""
":issue:`24225`: Update idlelib/README.txt with new file names and event "
"handlers."
msgstr ":issue:`24225`: 使用新文件名和事件处理程序更新 idlelib/README.txt。"

#: ../NEWS:48471
msgid ":issue:`27156`: Remove obsolete code not used by IDLE."
msgstr ":issue:`27156`: 移除 IDLE 未使用的过时代码。"

#: ../NEWS:48473 ../NEWS:51585
msgid ""
":issue:`27117`: Make colorizer htest and turtledemo work with dark themes. "
