msgstr ":issue:`26673`: 当 tk 报告字体大小为 0 时，更改为大小 10。Linux 上的此类字体阻止了配置对话框的打开。"

#: ../NEWS:48484 ../NEWS:51591
msgid ""
":issue:`21939`: Add test for IDLE's percolator. Original patch by Saimadhav "
