msgstr ":issue:`21939`: 添加 IDLE 的渗滤器测试。原始由 Saimadhav Heblikar 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48487 ../NEWS:51594
msgid ""
":issue:`21676`: Add test for IDLE's replace dialog. Original patch by "
"Saimadhav Heblikar."
msgstr ":issue:`21676`: 添加 IDLE 的替换对话框测试。原始由 Saimadhav Heblikar 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48490 ../NEWS:51597
msgid ""
":issue:`18410`: Add test for IDLE's search dialog. Original patch by Westley"
" Martínez."
msgstr ":issue:`18410`: 添加 IDLE 的搜索对话框测试。原始由 Westley Martínez 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48493
msgid ""
":issue:`21703`: Add test for undo delegator.  Patch mostly by Saimadhav "
