msgstr ":issue:`21703`: 添加撤销委托器的测试。补丁主要由 Saimadhav Heblikar 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:48496 ../NEWS:51603
msgid ""
":issue:`27044`: Add ConfigDialog.remove_var_callbacks to stop memory leaks."
msgstr ":issue:`27044`: 添加ConfigDialog.remove_var_callbacks以防止内存泄漏。"

#: ../NEWS:48498 ../NEWS:51605
msgid ":issue:`23977`: Add more asserts to test_delegator."
msgstr ":issue:`23977`: 在test_delegator中添加更多断言。"

#: ../NEWS:48503
msgid ""
":issue:`16484`: Change the default PYTHONDOCS URL to \"https:\", and fix the"
