"-j1 option was ignored."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25285`: 当使用-j1命令行选项时，regrtest现在使用子进程：每个测试文件在一个新的子进程中运行。之前，-j1选项被忽略。"

#: ../NEWS:48519
msgid ""
":issue:`25285`: Tools/buildbot/test.bat script now uses -j1 by default to "
"run each test file in fresh child process."
msgstr ":issue:`25285`: Tools/buildbot/test.bat脚本现在默认使用-j1来在每个新的子进程中运行测试文件。"

#: ../NEWS:48525
msgid ""
":issue:`27064`: The py.exe launcher now defaults to Python 3. The Windows "
"launcher ``py.exe`` no longer prefers an installed Python 2 version over "
"Python 3 by default when used interactively."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27064`: py.exe启动器现在默认使用Python 3。Windows启动器 ``py.exe`` "
"在交互使用时不再默认优先选择已安装的Python 2版本而不是Python 3。"

#: ../NEWS:48529 ../NEWS:51741
msgid ""
":issue:`17500`: Remove unused and outdated icons. (See also: "
"https://github.com/python/pythondotorg/issues/945)"
msgstr ""
":issue:`17500`: "
"移除未使用和过时的图标。（另见：https://github.com/python/pythondotorg/issues/945）"

#: ../NEWS:48535 ../NEWS:51677
msgid ""
":issue:`27229`: Fix the cross-compiling pgen rule for in-tree builds.  Patch"
" by Xavier de Gaye."
msgstr ":issue:`27229`: 修复树内构建的交叉编译pgen规则。由Xavier de Gaye提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48538 ../NEWS:51714
msgid ""
":issue:`26930`: Update OS X 10.5+ 32-bit-only installer to build and link "
"with OpenSSL 1.0.2h."
msgstr ":issue:`26930`: 更新OS X 10.5+ 32位仅安装程序以构建并与OpenSSL 1.0.2h链接。"

#: ../NEWS:48544
msgid ":issue:`27186`: Add the PyOS_FSPath() function (part of :pep:`519`)."
msgstr ":issue:`27186`: 添加PyOS_FSPath()函数（:pep:`519` 的一部分）。"

#: ../NEWS:48546
msgid ""
":issue:`26282`: PyArg_ParseTupleAndKeywords() now supports positional-only "
"parameters."
msgstr ":issue:`26282`: PyArg_ParseTupleAndKeywords()现在支持仅位置参数。"

#: ../NEWS:48552
msgid ""
":issue:`26282`: Argument Clinic now supports positional-only and keyword "
"parameters in the same function."
msgstr ":issue:`26282`: Argument Clinic现在支持在同一函数中的仅位置和关键字参数。"

#: ../NEWS:48557
msgid "Python 3.6.0 alpha 1"
msgstr "Python 3.6.0 alpha 1"

#: ../NEWS:48559
msgid "*Release date: 2016-05-16*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2016-05-16*"

#: ../NEWS:48564 ../NEWS:51048
msgid ""
":issue:`26657`: Fix directory traversal vulnerability with http.server on "
"Windows.  This fixes a regression that was introduced in 3.3.4rc1 and "
"3.4.0rc1.  Based on patch by Philipp Hagemeister."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26657`: "
"修复Windows上http.server的目录遍历漏洞。这修复了在3.3.4rc1和3.4.0rc1中引入的回归问题。基于Philipp "
"Hagemeister的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48568 ../NEWS:51052
msgid ""
":issue:`26313`: ssl.py _load_windows_store_certs fails if windows cert store"
" is empty. Patch by Baji."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26313`: 如果windows证书存储为空，ssl.py "
"_load_windows_store_certs失败。由Baji提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48571 ../NEWS:51055
msgid ""
":issue:`25939`: On Windows open the cert store readonly in "
"ssl.enum_certificates."
msgstr ":issue:`25939`: 在Windows上以只读方式打开证书存储于ssl.enum_certificates中。"

#: ../NEWS:48577 ../NEWS:51064
msgid ""
":issue:`20041`: Fixed TypeError when frame.f_trace is set to None. Patch by "
"Xavier de Gaye."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20041`: 修复当frame.f_trace被设置为None时的TypeError。由Xavier de Gaye提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48580 ../NEWS:51067
msgid ""
":issue:`26168`: Fixed possible refleaks in failing Py_BuildValue() with the "
"\"N\" format unit."
msgstr ":issue:`26168`: 修复了在使用 \"N\" 格式化单元时 Py_BuildValue() 失败可能导致的内存泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:48583 ../NEWS:51070
msgid ""
":issue:`26991`: Fix possible refleak when creating a function with "
"annotations."
msgstr ":issue:`26991`: 修复了创建带有注解的函数时可能出现的内存泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:48585
msgid ""
":issue:`27039`: Fixed bytearray.remove() for values greater than 127.  Based"
" on patch by Joe Jevnik."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27039`: 修复了 bytearray.remove() 对于大于127的值的处理。基于 Joe Jevnik 的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48588 ../NEWS:51075
msgid ""
":issue:`23640`: int.from_bytes() no longer bypasses constructors for "
"subclasses."
msgstr ":issue:`23640`: int.from_bytes() 不再绕过子类的构造函数。"

#: ../NEWS:48591
msgid ""
":issue:`27005`: Optimized the float.fromhex() class method for exact float. "
"It is now 2 times faster."
msgstr ":issue:`27005`: 优化了 float.fromhex() 类方法对于精确浮点数的处理。现在速度提高了2倍。"

#: ../NEWS:48594
msgid ""
":issue:`18531`: Single var-keyword argument of dict subtype was passed "
"unscathed to the C-defined function.  Now it is converted to exact dict."
msgstr ":issue:`18531`: 单一的可变关键字参数如果是字典子类，将不再原封不动地传递给C定义的函数。现在会被转换为确切的字典。"

#: ../NEWS:48597 ../NEWS:51078
msgid ""
":issue:`26811`: gc.get_objects() no longer contains a broken tuple with NULL"
" pointer."
msgstr ":issue:`26811`: gc.get_objects() 不再包含带有 NULL 指针的损坏元组。"

#: ../NEWS:48600 ../NEWS:51081
msgid ""
":issue:`20120`: Use RawConfigParser for .pypirc parsing, removing support "
"for interpolation unintentionally added with move to Python 3. Behavior no "
"longer does any interpolation in .pypirc files, matching behavior in Python "
"2.7 and Setuptools 19.0."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20120`: 使用 RawConfigParser 来解析 .pypirc 文件，移除了无意中随着迁移到 Python 3 "
"而添加的插值支持。现在的行为不会再在 .pypirc 文件中进行任何插值，与 Python 2.7 和 Setuptools 19.0 的行为一致。"

#: ../NEWS:48605
msgid ""
":issue:`26249`: Memory functions of the :c:func:`PyMem_Malloc` domain "
"(:c:macro:`PYMEM_DOMAIN_MEM`) now use the :ref:`pymalloc allocator "
"<pymalloc>` rather than system :c:func:`malloc`. Applications calling "
":c:func:`PyMem_Malloc` without holding the GIL can now crash: use "
"``PYTHONMALLOC=debug`` environment variable to validate the usage of memory "
"allocators in your application."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26249`: :c:func:`PyMem_Malloc` "
"域（:c:macro:`PYMEM_DOMAIN_MEM`）的内存函数现在使用 :ref:`pymalloc allocator <pymalloc>`"
" 而非系统的 :c:func:`malloc`。应用程序在不持有 GIL 的情况下调用 :c:func:`PyMem_Malloc` "
"现在可能会崩溃：使用 ``PYTHONMALLOC=debug`` 环境变量来验证你的应用程序中内存分配器的使用情况。"

#: ../NEWS:48612
msgid ""
":issue:`26802`: Optimize function calls only using unpacking like "
"``func(*tuple)`` (no other positional argument, no keyword): avoid copying "
"the tuple. Patch written by Joe Jevnik."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26802`: 优化了仅使用解包的函数调用，如 ``func(*tuple)`` (没有其他位置参数，没有关键字参数) "
"：避免复制元组。补丁由 Joe Jevnik 编写。"

#: ../NEWS:48616 ../NEWS:51086
msgid ":issue:`26659`: Make the builtin slice type support cycle collection."
msgstr ":issue:`26659`: 使内置的 slice 类型支持循环回收。"

#: ../NEWS:48618 ../NEWS:51088
msgid ""
":issue:`26718`: super.__init__ no longer leaks memory if called multiple "
"times. NOTE: A direct call of super.__init__ is not endorsed!"
msgstr ""
":issue:`26718`: super.__init__ 如果被多次调用，将不再泄露内存。注意：不推荐直接调用 super.__init__！"

#: ../NEWS:48621 ../NEWS:51118
msgid ":issue:`27138`: Fix the doc comment for FileFinder.find_spec()."
msgstr ":issue:`27138`: 修正了 FileFinder.find_spec() 的文档注释。"

#: ../NEWS:48623 ../NEWS:51162
msgid ":issue:`27147`: Mention :pep:`420` in the importlib docs."
msgstr ":issue:`27147`: 在 importlib 文档中提到了 :pep:`420`。"

#: ../NEWS:48625 ../NEWS:51091
msgid ""
":issue:`25339`: PYTHONIOENCODING now has priority over locale in setting the"
" error handler for stdin and stdout."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25339`: 现在在设置 stdin 和 stdout 的错误处理器时，PYTHONIOENCODING 优先于 locale。"

#: ../NEWS:48628 ../NEWS:51094
msgid ""
":issue:`26494`: Fixed crash on iterating exhausting iterators. Affected "
"classes are generic sequence iterators, iterators of str, bytes, bytearray, "
"list, tuple, set, frozenset, dict, OrderedDict, corresponding views and "
"os.scandir() iterator."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26494`: "
"修复了在迭代耗尽迭代器时的崩溃问题。受影响的类包括通用序列迭代器、str、bytes、bytearray、list、tuple、set、frozenset、dict、OrderedDict的迭代器，相应的视图以及os.scandir()迭代器。"

#: ../NEWS:48633
msgid ""
":issue:`26574`: Optimize ``bytes.replace(b'', b'.')`` and "
"``bytearray.replace(b'', b'.')``. Patch written by Josh Snider."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26574`: 优化了 ``bytes.replace(b'', b'.')`` 和 ``bytearray.replace(b'', "
"b'.')``。补丁由Josh Snider编写。"

#: ../NEWS:48636 ../NEWS:51099
msgid ""
":issue:`26581`: If coding cookie is specified multiple times on a line in "
"Python source code file, only the first one is taken to account."
msgstr ":issue:`26581`: 如果在Python源代码文件中一行内多次指定编码声明，只有第一个会被考虑。"

#: ../NEWS:48639
msgid ":issue:`19711`: Add tests for reloading namespace packages."
msgstr ":issue:`19711`: 为重新加载命名空间包添加了测试。"

#: ../NEWS:48641
msgid ""
":issue:`21099`: Switch applicable importlib tests to use :pep:`451` API."
msgstr ":issue:`21099`: 将适用的importlib测试切换到使用 :pep:`451` API。"

#: ../NEWS:48643
msgid ""
":issue:`26563`: Debug hooks on Python memory allocators now raise a fatal "
"error if functions of the :c:func:`PyMem_Malloc` family are called without "
"holding the GIL."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26563`: 如果调用 :c:func:`PyMem_Malloc` "
"系列函数时没有持有GIL，Python内存分配器的调试钩子现在会引发致命错误。"

#: ../NEWS:48647
msgid ""
":issue:`26564`: On error, the debug hooks on Python memory allocators now "
"use the :mod:`tracemalloc` module to get the traceback where a memory block "
"was allocated."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26564`: 在错误时，Python内存分配器的调试钩子现在使用 :mod:`tracemalloc` 模块来获取内存块分配时的回溯。"

#: ../NEWS:48651
msgid ""
":issue:`26558`: The debug hooks on Python memory allocator "
":c:func:`PyObject_Malloc` now detect when functions are called without "
"holding the GIL."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26558`: Python内存分配器 :c:func:`PyObject_Malloc` "
"的调试钩子现在可以检测到在没有持有GIL时调用函数的情况。"

#: ../NEWS:48655
msgid ""
":issue:`26516`: Add :envvar:`PYTHONMALLOC` environment variable to set the "
"Python memory allocators and/or install debug hooks."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26516`: 添加了 :envvar:`PYTHONMALLOC` 环境变量来设置Python内存分配器和/或安装调试钩子。"

#: ../NEWS:48658
msgid ""
":issue:`26516`: The :c:func:`PyMem_SetupDebugHooks` function can now also be"
" used on Python compiled in release mode."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26516`: :c:func:`PyMem_SetupDebugHooks` 函数现在也可以在发布模式下编译的Python中使用。"

#: ../NEWS:48661
msgid ""
":issue:`26516`: The :envvar:`PYTHONMALLOCSTATS` environment variable can now"
" also be used on Python compiled in release mode. It now has no effect if "
"set to an empty string."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26516`: :envvar:`PYTHONMALLOCSTATS` "
"环境变量现在也可以在发布模式下编译的Python中使用。如果设置为空字符串，则现在无效。"

#: ../NEWS:48665
msgid ""
":issue:`26516`: In debug mode, debug hooks are now also installed on Python "
"memory allocators when Python is configured without pymalloc."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26516`: 在调试模式下，当Python配置为不使用pymalloc时，调试钩子现在也会安装在Python内存分配器上。"

#: ../NEWS:48668 ../NEWS:51102
msgid ""
":issue:`26464`: Fix str.translate() when string is ASCII and first "
"replacements removes character, but next replacement uses a non-ASCII "
"character or a string longer than 1 character. Regression introduced in "
"Python 3.5.0."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26464`: "
"修复了当字符串为ASCII且第一个替换移除了字符，但下一个替换使用非ASCII字符或长度超过1个字符的字符串时str.translate()的问题。这是在Python"
" 3.5.0中引入的回归问题。"

#: ../NEWS:48672 ../NEWS:51106
msgid ""
":issue:`22836`: Ensure exception reports from PyErr_Display() and "
"PyErr_WriteUnraisable() are sensible even when formatting them produces "
"secondary errors.  This affects the reports produced by sys.__excepthook__()"
" and when __del__() raises an exception."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22836`: "
"确保即使格式化产生次要错误时，PyErr_Display()和PyErr_WriteUnraisable()产生的异常报告也是合理的。这影响sys.__excepthook__()产生的报告以及__del__()引发异常时的情况。"

#: ../NEWS:48677 ../NEWS:51111
msgid ""
":issue:`26302`: Correct behavior to reject comma as a legal character for "
"cookie names."
msgstr ":issue:`26302`: 修正行为，拒绝将逗号作为cookie名称的合法字符。"

#: ../NEWS:48680
msgid ""
":issue:`26136`: Upgrade the warning when a generator raises StopIteration "
"from PendingDeprecationWarning to DeprecationWarning.  Patch by Anish Shah."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26136`: "
"当生成器引发StopIteration时，将警告从PendingDeprecationWarning升级为DeprecationWarning。由Anish"
" Shah提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48683
msgid ""
":issue:`26204`: The compiler now ignores all constant statements: bytes, "
"str, int, float, complex, name constants (None, False, True), Ellipsis and "
"ast.Constant; not only str and int. For example, ``1.0`` is now ignored in "
"``def f(): 1.0``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26204`: "
"编译器现在忽略所有常量语句：bytes、str、int、float、complex、名称常量（None、False、True）、Ellipsis和ast.Constant；不仅仅是str和int。例如，``1.0``现在在``def"
" f(): 1.0``中被忽略。"

#: ../NEWS:48688 ../NEWS:51114
msgid ""
":issue:`4806`: Avoid masking the original TypeError exception when using "
"star (``*``) unpacking in function calls.  Based on patch by Hagen Fürstenau"
" and Daniel Urban."
msgstr ""
":issue:`4806`: 在函数调用中使用星号（``*``）解包时，避免掩盖原始的TypeError异常。基于Hagen "
"Fürstenau和Daniel Urban的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48692
msgid ""
":issue:`26146`: Add a new kind of AST node: ``ast.Constant``. It can be used"
" by external AST optimizers, but the compiler does not emit directly such "
"node."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26146`: 添加一种新的AST节点：``ast.Constant``。它可以被外部AST优化器使用，但编译器不直接发出这样的节点。"

#: ../NEWS:48696
msgid ""
":issue:`23601`: Sped-up allocation of dict key objects by using Python's "
"small object allocator.  (Contributed by Julian Taylor.)"
msgstr ":issue:`23601`: 通过使用Python的小对象分配器，加速了字典键对象的分配。（由Julian Taylor贡献。）"

#: ../NEWS:48699
msgid ""
":issue:`18018`: Import raises ImportError instead of SystemError if a "
"relative import is attempted without a known parent package."
msgstr ":issue:`18018`: 如果尝试在没有已知父包的情况下进行相对导入，导入将引发ImportError而不是SystemError。"

#: ../NEWS:48702
msgid ""
":issue:`25843`: When compiling code, don't merge constants if they are equal"
" but have a different types. For example, ``f1, f2 = lambda: 1, lambda: "
"1.0`` is now correctly compiled to two different functions: ``f1()`` returns"
" ``1`` (``int``) and ``f2()`` returns ``1.0`` (``float``), even if ``1`` and"
" ``1.0`` are equal."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25843`: 编译代码时，如果常量相等但类型不同，则不合并它们。例如，``f1, f2 = lambda: 1, lambda: "
"1.0``现在被正确编译为两个不同的函数：``f1()``返回 ``1`` (``int``) 和``f2()``返回 ``1.0`` "
"(``float``) ，即使 ``1`` 和 ``1.0`` 相等。"

#: ../NEWS:48708
msgid ""
":issue:`26107`: The format of the ``co_lnotab`` attribute of code objects "
"changes to support negative line number delta."
msgstr ":issue:`26107`: 代码对象的 ``co_lnotab`` 属性的格式更改以支持负行号增量。"

#: ../NEWS:48711 ../NEWS:51120
msgid ""
":issue:`26154`: Add a new private _PyThreadState_UncheckedGet() function to "
"get the current Python thread state, but don't issue a fatal error if it is "
"NULL. This new function must be used instead of accessing directly the "
"_PyThreadState_Current variable.  The variable is no more exposed since "
"Python 3.5.1 to hide the exact implementation of atomic C types, to avoid "
"compiler issues."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26154`: "
"新增一个私有函数_PyThreadState_UncheckedGet()用于获取当前Python线程状态，但如果其为NULL时不发出致命错误。必须使用此新函数而非直接访问_PyThreadState_Current变量。自Python"
" 3.5.1起，该变量不再暴露以隐藏原子C类型的精确实现，避免编译器问题。"

#: ../NEWS:48718
msgid ""
":issue:`25791`: If __package__ != __spec__.parent or if neither __package__ "
"or __spec__ are defined then ImportWarning is raised."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25791`: 如果__package__ != "
"__spec__.parent或既未定义__package__也未定义__spec__，则引发ImportWarning。"

#: ../NEWS:48721 ../NEWS:51137
msgid ""
":issue:`22995`: [UPDATE] Comment out the one of the pickleability tests in "
"_PyObject_GetState() due to regressions observed in Cython-based projects."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22995`: [更新] "
"由于在基于Cython的项目中观察到的回归问题，注释掉_PyObject_GetState()中的一个可pickle性测试。"

#: ../NEWS:48724 ../NEWS:51140
msgid ":issue:`25961`: Disallowed null characters in the type name."
msgstr ":issue:`25961`: 类型名称中不允许空字符。"

#: ../NEWS:48726 ../NEWS:51142
msgid ""
":issue:`25973`: Fix segfault when an invalid nonlocal statement binds a name"
" starting with two underscores."
msgstr ":issue:`25973`: 修复当无效的非局部语句绑定一个以两个下划线开头的名称时导致的段错误。"

#: ../NEWS:48729 ../NEWS:51145
msgid ""
":issue:`22995`: Instances of extension types with a state that aren't "
"subclasses of list or dict and haven't implemented any pickle-related "
"methods (__reduce__, __reduce_ex__, __getnewargs__, __getnewargs_ex__, or "
"__getstate__), can no longer be pickled.  Including memoryview."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22995`: "
"不是列表或字典的子类且未实现任何与pickle相关的方法（__reduce__、__reduce_ex__、__getnewargs__、__getnewargs_ex__或__getstate__）的扩展类型实例，包括memoryview，将不能再被pickle。"

#: ../NEWS:48734 ../NEWS:51150
msgid ""
":issue:`20440`: Massive replacing unsafe attribute setting code with special"
" macro Py_SETREF."
msgstr ":issue:`20440`: 大量替换不安全的属性设置代码为特殊宏Py_SETREF。"

#: ../NEWS:48737 ../NEWS:51153
msgid ""
":issue:`25766`: Special method __bytes__() now works in str subclasses."
msgstr ":issue:`25766`: 特殊方法__bytes__()现在在str子类中工作。"

#: ../NEWS:48739 ../NEWS:51155
msgid ""
":issue:`25421`: __sizeof__ methods of builtin types now use dynamic basic "
"size. This allows sys.getsize() to work correctly with their subclasses with"
" __slots__ defined."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25421`: "
"内置类型的__sizeof__方法现在使用动态基本大小。这使得sys.getsize()能够正确工作于定义了__slots__的子类。"

#: ../NEWS:48743 ../NEWS:51159 ../NEWS:51769
msgid ""
":issue:`25709`: Fixed problem with in-place string concatenation and utf-8 "
"cache."
msgstr ":issue:`25709`: 修复了原地字符串连接和utf-8缓存的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:48746
msgid ""
":issue:`5319`: New Py_FinalizeEx() API allowing Python to set an exit status"
" of 120 on failure to flush buffered streams."
msgstr ":issue:`5319`: 新增Py_FinalizeEx() API，允许Python在刷新缓冲流失败时设置退出状态为120。"

#: ../NEWS:48749
msgid ":issue:`25485`: telnetlib.Telnet is now a context manager."
msgstr ":issue:`25485`: telnetlib.Telnet现在是一个上下文管理器。"

#: ../NEWS:48751 ../NEWS:51164
msgid ""
":issue:`24097`: Fixed crash in object.__reduce__() if slot name is freed "
"inside __getattr__."
msgstr ":issue:`24097`: 修复了如果槽名称在__getattr__内部被释放时object.__reduce__()中的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:48754 ../NEWS:51167
msgid ""
":issue:`24731`: Fixed crash on converting objects with special methods "
"__bytes__, __trunc__, and __float__ returning instances of subclasses of "
"bytes, int, and float to subclasses of bytes, int, and float "
"correspondingly."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24731`: 修复了在将具有特殊方法 __bytes__、__trunc__ 和 __float__ 的对象转换为 bytes、int"
" 和 float 的子类时，返回这些子类实例导致的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:48759 ../NEWS:51787
msgid ""
":issue:`25630`: Fix a possible segfault during argument parsing in functions"
" that accept filesystem paths."
msgstr ":issue:`25630`: 修复了在接受文件系统路径的函数中，参数解析时可能发生的段错误。"

#: ../NEWS:48762 ../NEWS:51790
msgid ""
":issue:`23564`: Fixed a partially broken sanity check in the "
"_posixsubprocess internals regarding how fds_to_pass were passed to the "
"child.  The bug had no actual impact as subprocess.py already avoided it."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23564`: 修复了 _posixsubprocess 内部关于如何将 fds_to_pass "
"传递给子进程的部分损坏的健全性检查。由于 subprocess.py 已经避免了这个问题，这个错误没有实际影响。"

#: ../NEWS:48766 ../NEWS:51794
msgid ""
":issue:`25388`: Fixed tokenizer crash when processing undecodable source "
"code with a null byte."
msgstr ":issue:`25388`: 修复了在处理包含空字节的不可解码源代码时，分词器崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:48769 ../NEWS:51797
msgid ""
":issue:`25462`: The hash of the key now is calculated only once in most "
"operations in C implementation of OrderedDict."
msgstr ":issue:`25462`: 在 OrderedDict 的 C 实现中，大多数操作现在只计算一次键的哈希值。"

#: ../NEWS:48772 ../NEWS:51800
msgid ""
":issue:`22995`: Default implementation of __reduce__ and __reduce_ex__ now "
"rejects builtin types with not defined __new__."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22995`: __reduce__ 和 __reduce_ex__ 的默认实现现在拒绝那些未定义 __new__ 的内置类型。"

#: ../NEWS:48775 ../NEWS:51806
msgid ""
":issue:`24802`: Avoid buffer overreads when int(), float(), compile(), "
"exec() and eval() are passed bytes-like objects.  These objects are not "
"necessarily terminated by a null byte, but the functions assumed they were."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24802`: 当 int()、float()、compile()、exec() 和 eval() "
"传递类似字节的对象时，避免缓冲区过度读取。这些对象不一定以空字节终止，但函数假设它们是。"

#: ../NEWS:48780 ../NEWS:51803
msgid ""
":issue:`25555`: Fix parser and AST: fill lineno and col_offset of \"arg\" "
"node when compiling AST from Python objects."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25555`: 修复解析器和 AST：当从 Python 对象编译 AST 时，填充 \"arg\" 节点的 lineno 和 "
"col_offset。"

#: ../NEWS:48783 ../NEWS:51811
msgid ""
":issue:`24726`: Fixed a crash and leaking NULL in repr() of OrderedDict that"
" was mutated by direct calls of dict methods."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24726`: 修复了 OrderedDict 在直接调用 dict 方法后被 repr() 时崩溃和泄漏 NULL 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:48786 ../NEWS:51814
msgid ""
":issue:`25449`: Iterating OrderedDict with keys with unstable hash now "
"raises KeyError in C implementations as well as in Python implementation."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25449`: 现在在 C 实现和 Python 实现中，迭代具有不稳定哈希键的 OrderedDict 都会引发 KeyError。"

#: ../NEWS:48789 ../NEWS:51817
msgid ""
":issue:`25395`: Fixed crash when highly nested OrderedDict structures were "
"garbage collected."
msgstr ":issue:`25395`: 修复了在垃圾回收高度嵌套的 OrderedDict 结构时崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:48792
msgid ""
":issue:`25401`: Optimize bytes.fromhex() and bytearray.fromhex(): they are "
"now between 2x and 3.5x faster."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25401`: 优化了 bytes.fromhex() 和 bytearray.fromhex()：它们现在快了 2 到 3.5 倍。"

#: ../NEWS:48795
msgid ""
":issue:`25399`: Optimize bytearray % args using the new private "
"_PyBytesWriter API. Formatting is now between 2.5 and 5 times faster."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25399`: 使用新的私有 _PyBytesWriter API 优化了 bytearray % args 操作。格式化现在快了 "
"2.5 到 5 倍。"

#: ../NEWS:48798 ../NEWS:51820
msgid ""
":issue:`25274`: sys.setrecursionlimit() now raises a RecursionError if the "
"new recursion limit is too low depending at the current recursion depth. "
"Modify also the \"lower-water mark\" formula to make it monotonic. This mark"
" is used to decide when the overflowed flag of the thread state is reset."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25274`: sys.setrecursionlimit() 现在如果新的递归限制根据当前递归深度太低会引发 "
"RecursionError。同时修改“低水位标记”公式使其单调。这个标记用于决定何时重置线程状态的溢出标志。"

#: ../NEWS:48803 ../NEWS:51825
msgid ""
":issue:`24402`: Fix input() to prompt to the redirected stdout when "
"sys.stdout.fileno() fails."
msgstr ":issue:`24402`: 修复 input() 在 sys.stdout.fileno() 失败时提示重定向的 stdout。"

#: ../NEWS:48806
msgid ""
":issue:`25349`: Optimize bytes % args using the new private _PyBytesWriter "
"API. Formatting is now up to 2 times faster."
msgstr ":issue:`25349`: 使用新的私有 _PyBytesWriter API 优化 bytes % args。格式化现在快达2倍。"

#: ../NEWS:48809 ../NEWS:51828
msgid ""
":issue:`24806`: Prevent builtin types that are not allowed to be subclassed "
"from being subclassed through multiple inheritance."
msgstr ":issue:`24806`: 防止不允许被继承的内置类型通过多重继承被继承。"

#: ../NEWS:48812
msgid ""
":issue:`25301`: The UTF-8 decoder is now up to 15 times as fast for error "
"handlers: ``ignore``, ``replace`` and ``surrogateescape``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25301`: UTF-8 解码器现在对于错误处理程序 ``ignore``、``replace`` 和 "
"``surrogateescape`` 快达15倍。"

#: ../NEWS:48815 ../NEWS:51831
msgid ""
":issue:`24848`: Fixed a number of bugs in UTF-7 decoding of misformed data."
msgstr ":issue:`24848`: 修复了UTF-7解码畸形数据时的一些错误。"

#: ../NEWS:48817
msgid ""
":issue:`25267`: The UTF-8 encoder is now up to 75 times as fast for error "
"handlers: ``ignore``, ``replace``, ``surrogateescape``, ``surrogatepass``. "
"Patch co-written with Serhiy Storchaka."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25267`: UTF-8 编码器现在对于错误处理程序 "
"``ignore``、``replace``、``surrogateescape``、``surrogatepass`` 快达75倍。补丁与Serhiy"
" Storchaka共同编写。"

#: ../NEWS:48821 ../NEWS:51833
msgid ""
":issue:`25280`: Import trace messages emitted in verbose (-v) mode are no "
"longer formatted twice."
msgstr ":issue:`25280`: 在详细模式(-v)下发出的导入跟踪消息不再格式化两次。"

#: ../NEWS:48824
msgid ""
":issue:`25227`: Optimize ASCII and latin1 encoders with the "
"``surrogateescape`` error handler: the encoders are now up to 3 times as "
"fast. Initial patch written by Serhiy Storchaka."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25227`: 使用 ``surrogateescape`` "
"错误处理程序优化ASCII和latin1编码器：编码器现在快达3倍。初始补丁由Serhiy Storchaka编写。"

#: ../NEWS:48828 ../NEWS:51836
msgid ""
":issue:`25003`: On Solaris 11.3 or newer, os.urandom() now uses the "
"getrandom() function instead of the getentropy() function. The getentropy() "
"function is blocking to generate very good quality entropy, os.urandom() "
"doesn't need such high-quality entropy."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25003`: 在Solaris 11.3或更新版本上，os.urandom() 现在使用 getrandom() 函数而不是 "
"getentropy() 函数。getentropy() 函数为了生成非常高质量的熵是阻塞的，os.urandom() 不需要如此高质量的熵。"

#: ../NEWS:48833
msgid ""
":issue:`9232`: Modify Python's grammar to allow trailing commas in the "
"argument list of a function declaration.  For example, \"def f(\\*, a = 3,):"
" pass\" is now legal. Patch from Mark Dickinson."
msgstr ""
":issue:`9232`: 修改Python的语法以允许函数声明的参数列表中的尾随逗号。例如，“def f(\\*, a = 3,): "
"pass”现在是合法的。补丁来自Mark Dickinson。"

#: ../NEWS:48837
msgid ""
":issue:`24965`: Implement :pep:`498` \"Literal String Interpolation\". This "
"allows you to embed expressions inside f-strings, which are converted to "
"normal strings at run time. Given x=3, then f'value={x}' == 'value=3'. Patch"
" by Eric V. Smith."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24965`: 实现 :pep:`498` \"字面字符串插值\"。这允许你在f-"
"字符串中嵌入表达式，这些表达式在运行时被转换为普通字符串。给定x=3，那么 f'value={x}' == 'value=3'。由Eric V. "
"Smith提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48842 ../NEWS:51172
msgid ""
":issue:`26478`: Fix semantic bugs when using binary operators with "
"dictionary views and tuples."
msgstr ":issue:`26478`: 修复在使用二进制运算符与字典视图和元组时的语义错误。"

#: ../NEWS:48845 ../NEWS:51175
msgid ""
":issue:`26171`: Fix possible integer overflow and heap corruption in "
"zipimporter.get_data()."
msgstr ":issue:`26171`: 修复zipimporter.get_data()中可能的整数溢出和堆损坏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:48848 ../NEWS:51178
msgid ":issue:`25660`: Fix TAB key behaviour in REPL with readline."
msgstr ":issue:`25660`: 修复REPL中使用readline时的TAB键行为。"

#: ../NEWS:48850
msgid ":issue:`26288`: Optimize PyLong_AsDouble."
msgstr ":issue:`26288`: 优化PyLong_AsDouble。"

#: ../NEWS:48852
msgid ""
":issue:`26289`: Optimize floor and modulo division for single-digit longs. "
"Microbenchmarks show 2-2.5x improvement.  Built-in 'divmod' function is now "
"also ~10% faster. (See also: :issue:`26315`)"
msgstr ""
":issue:`26289`: "
"优化单数字长整数的地板除和模除运算。微基准测试显示有2-2.5倍的提升。内置的'divmod'函数现在也快了约10%。（另见：:issue:`26315`）"

#: ../NEWS:48856 ../NEWS:51180
msgid ""
":issue:`25887`: Raise a RuntimeError when a coroutine object is awaited more"
" than once."
msgstr ":issue:`25887`: 当协程对象被多次等待时，抛出RuntimeError。"

#: ../NEWS:48862 ../NEWS:51236
msgid ""
":issue:`27057`: Fix os.set_inheritable() on Android, ioctl() is blocked by "
"SELinux and fails with EACCESS. The function now falls back to fcntl(). "
"Patch written by Michał Bednarski."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27057`: "
"修复Android上的os.set_inheritable()，ioctl()被SELinux阻止并因EACCESS失败。该函数现在回退到使用fcntl()。补丁由Michał"
" Bednarski编写。"

#: ../NEWS:48866 ../NEWS:51240
msgid ""
":issue:`27014`: Fix infinite recursion using typing.py.  Thanks to Kalle "
"Tuure!"
msgstr ":issue:`27014`: 修复使用typing.py时的无限递归问题。感谢Kalle Tuure！"

#: ../NEWS:48868
msgid ""
":issue:`27031`: Removed dummy methods in Tkinter widget classes: "
"tk_menuBar() and tk_bindForTraversal()."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27031`: 移除了Tkinter小部件类中的虚拟方法：tk_menuBar()和tk_bindForTraversal()。"

#: ../NEWS:48871 ../NEWS:51242
msgid ""
":issue:`14132`: Fix urllib.request redirect handling when the target only "
"has a query string.  Original fix by Ján Janech."
msgstr ":issue:`14132`: 修复urllib.request在目标仅有查询字符串时的重定向处理。原始修复由Ján Janech提供。"

#: ../NEWS:48874 ../NEWS:51245
msgid ""
":issue:`17214`: The \"urllib.request\" module now percent-encodes non-ASCII "
"bytes found in redirect target URLs.  Some servers send Location header "
"fields with non-ASCII bytes, but \"http.client\" requires the request target"
" to be ASCII-encodable, otherwise a UnicodeEncodeError is raised.  Based on "
"patch by Christian Heimes."
msgstr ""
":issue:`17214`: "
"\"urllib.request\"模块现在对重定向目标URL中的非ASCII字节进行百分比编码。一些服务器发送含有非ASCII字节的Location头字段，但\"http.client\"要求请求目标必须可ASCII编码，否则会抛出UnicodeEncodeError。基于Christian"
" Heimes的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48880
msgid ""
":issue:`27033`: The default value of the decode_data parameter for "
"smtpd.SMTPChannel and smtpd.SMTPServer constructors is changed to False."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27033`: "
"smtpd.SMTPChannel和smtpd.SMTPServer构造函数的decode_data参数的默认值更改为False。"

#: ../NEWS:48883
msgid ":issue:`27034`: Removed deprecated class asynchat.fifo."
msgstr ":issue:`27034`: 移除了已弃用的类asynchat.fifo。"

#: ../NEWS:48885
msgid ""
":issue:`26870`: Added readline.set_auto_history(), which can stop entries "
"being automatically added to the history list.  Based on patch by Tyler "
"Crompton."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26870`: 添加了readline.set_auto_history()，可以阻止条目自动添加到历史列表中。基于Tyler "
"Crompton的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48889
msgid ""
":issue:`26039`: zipfile.ZipFile.open() can now be used to write data into a "
"ZIP file, as well as for extracting data.  Patch by Thomas Kluyver."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26039`: zipfile.ZipFile.open()现在可用于向ZIP文件中写入数据，以及提取数据。由Thomas "
"Kluyver提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48892 ../NEWS:51251
msgid ""
":issue:`26892`: Honor debuglevel flag in urllib.request.HTTPHandler. Patch "
"contributed by Chi Hsuan Yen."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26892`: 在urllib.request.HTTPHandler中尊重debuglevel标志。补丁由Chi Hsuan "
"Yen贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:48895 ../NEWS:51254
msgid ""
":issue:`22274`: In the subprocess module, allow stderr to be redirected to "
"stdout even when stdout is not redirected.  Patch by Akira Li."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22274`: 在subprocess模块中，即使stdout未被重定向，也允许将stderr重定向到stdout。补丁由Akira "
"Li提供。"

#: ../NEWS:48898 ../NEWS:51257
msgid ""
":issue:`26807`: mock_open 'files' no longer error on readline at end of "
"file. Patch from Yolanda Robla."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26807`: mock_open 'files' 在文件末尾的readline操作不再报错。补丁由Yolanda Robla提供。"

#: ../NEWS:48901 ../NEWS:51260
msgid ":issue:`25745`: Fixed leaking a userptr in curses panel destructor."
msgstr ":issue:`25745`: 修复了curses panel析构函数中userptr的泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:48903 ../NEWS:51262
msgid ""
":issue:`26977`: Removed unnecessary, and ignored, call to sum of squares "
"helper in statistics.pvariance."
msgstr ":issue:`26977`: 在statistics.pvariance中移除了不必要且被忽略的平方和辅助函数调用。"

#: ../NEWS:48906
msgid ""
":issue:`26002`: Use bisect in statistics.median instead of a linear search. "
"Patch by Upendra Kuma."
msgstr ":issue:`26002`: 在statistics.median中使用二分查找替代线性搜索。由Upendra Kuma提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48909
msgid ""
":issue:`25974`: Make use of new Decimal.as_integer_ratio() method in "
"statistics module. Patch by Stefan Krah."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25974`: 在统计模块中利用了新的Decimal.as_integer_ratio()方法。补丁由Stefan Krah提供。"

#: ../NEWS:48912
msgid ":issue:`26996`: Add secrets module as described in :pep:`506`."
msgstr ":issue:`26996`: 添加了如 :pep:`506` 所述的secrets模块。"

#: ../NEWS:48914 ../NEWS:51265
msgid ""
":issue:`26881`: The modulefinder module now supports extended opcode "
"arguments."
msgstr ":issue:`26881`: modulefinder模块现在支持扩展的操作码参数。"

#: ../NEWS:48916 ../NEWS:51267
msgid ""
":issue:`23815`: Fixed crashes related to directly created instances of types"
" in _tkinter and curses.panel modules."
msgstr ":issue:`23815`: 修复了直接创建_tkinter和curses.panel模块中类型实例相关的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:48919 ../NEWS:51270
msgid ""
":issue:`17765`: weakref.ref() no longer silently ignores keyword arguments. "
"Patch by Georg Brandl."
msgstr ":issue:`17765`: weakref.ref()不再默默忽略关键字参数。由Georg Brandl提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48922 ../NEWS:51273
msgid ""
":issue:`26873`: xmlrpc now raises ResponseError on unsupported type tags "
"instead of silently return incorrect result."
msgstr ":issue:`26873`: xmlrpc现在会在遇到不支持的类型标签时抛出ResponseError，而不是默默返回错误结果。"

#: ../NEWS:48925
msgid ""
":issue:`26915`: The __contains__ methods in the collections ABCs now check "
"for identity before checking equality.  This better matches the behavior of "
"the concrete classes, allows sensible handling of NaNs, and makes it easier "
"to reason about container invariants."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26915`: collections "
"ABCs中的__contains__方法现在在检查相等性之前先检查标识。这更好地匹配了具体类的行为，允许合理处理NaNs，并使容器不变量的推理更加容易。"

#: ../NEWS:48930 ../NEWS:51276
msgid ""
":issue:`26711`: Fixed the comparison of plistlib.Data with other types."
msgstr ":issue:`26711`: 修复了plistlib.Data与其他类型的比较问题。"

#: ../NEWS:48932 ../NEWS:51278
msgid ""
":issue:`24114`: Fix an uninitialized variable in ``ctypes.util``. The bug "
"only occurs on SunOS when the ctypes implementation searches for the "
"``crle`` program. Patch by Xiang Zhang.  Tested on SunOS by Kees Bos."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24114`: 修复了 ``ctypes.util`` 中一个未初始化的变量问题。此bug仅在SunOS上，当ctypes实现搜索 "
"``crle`` 程序时出现。由Xiang Zhang提供补丁。在SunOS上由Kees Bos测试。"

#: ../NEWS:48936 ../NEWS:51282
msgid ""
":issue:`26864`: In urllib.request, change the proxy bypass host checking "
"against no_proxy to be case-insensitive, and to not match unrelated host "
"names that happen to have a bypassed hostname as a suffix.  Patch by Xiang "
"Zhang."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26864`: "
"在urllib.request中，将代理绕过主机检查对no_proxy的匹配改为不区分大小写，并且不匹配那些恰好以后缀形式包含被绕过主机名的无关主机名。由Xiang"
" Zhang提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48941
msgid ""
":issue:`24902`: Print server URL on http.server startup.  Initial patch by "
"Felix Kaiser."
msgstr ":issue:`24902`: 在http.server启动时打印服务器URL。初始由Felix Kaiser提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48944
msgid ""
":issue:`25788`: fileinput.hook_encoded() now supports an \"errors\" argument"
" for passing to open.  Original patch by Joseph Hackman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25788`: fileinput.hook_encoded() 现在支持传递一个 \"errors\" 参数给 open。原始补丁由 "
"Joseph Hackman 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:48947 ../NEWS:51287
msgid ""
":issue:`26634`: recursive_repr() now sets __qualname__ of wrapper.  Patch by"
" Xiang Zhang."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26634`: recursive_repr() 现在设置包装器的 __qualname__。由 Xiang Zhang 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48950 ../NEWS:51290
msgid ""
":issue:`26804`: urllib.request will prefer lower_case proxy environment "
"variables over UPPER_CASE or Mixed_Case ones. Patch contributed by Hans-"
"Peter Jansen."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26804`: urllib.request 现在会优先选择小写的代理环境变量，而不是大写或混合大小写的。补丁由 Hans-Peter "
"Jansen 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:48954 ../NEWS:51294
msgid ""
":issue:`26837`: assertSequenceEqual() now correctly outputs non-stringified "
"differing items (like bytes in the -b mode).  This affects assertListEqual()"
" and assertTupleEqual()."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26837`: assertSequenceEqual() 现在能正确输出非字符串化的不同项（如 -b 模式下的字节）。这影响了 "
"assertListEqual() 和 assertTupleEqual()。"

#: ../NEWS:48958 ../NEWS:51298
msgid ""
":issue:`26041`: Remove \"will be removed in Python 3.7\" from deprecation "
"messages of platform.dist() and platform.linux_distribution(). Patch by "
"Kumaripaba Miyurusara Athukorala."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26041`: 从 platform.dist() 和 platform.linux_distribution() 的弃用消息中移除了 "
"\"将在 Python 3.7 中移除\"。由 Kumaripaba Miyurusara Athukorala 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48962 ../NEWS:51302
msgid ""
":issue:`26822`: itemgetter, attrgetter and methodcaller objects no longer "
"silently ignore keyword arguments."
msgstr ":issue:`26822`: itemgetter、attrgetter 和 methodcaller 对象不再静默忽略关键字参数。"

#: ../NEWS:48965 ../NEWS:51305
msgid ""
":issue:`26733`: Disassembling a class now disassembles class and static "
"methods. Patch by Xiang Zhang."
msgstr ":issue:`26733`: 反汇编一个类现在会反汇编类和静态方法。由 Xiang Zhang 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48968 ../NEWS:51308
msgid ""
":issue:`26801`: Fix error handling in :func:`shutil.get_terminal_size`, "
"catch :exc:`AttributeError` instead of :exc:`NameError`. Patch written by "
"Emanuel Barry."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26801`: 修复 :func:`shutil.get_terminal_size` 中的错误处理，捕获 "
":exc:`AttributeError` 而不是 :exc:`NameError`。补丁由 Emanuel Barry 编写。"

#: ../NEWS:48972 ../NEWS:51312
msgid ""
":issue:`24838`: tarfile's ustar and gnu formats now correctly calculate name"
" and link field limits for multibyte character encodings like utf-8."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24838`: tarfile 的 ustar 和 gnu 格式现在能正确计算多字节字符编码（如 utf-8）的名称和链接字段限制。"

#: ../NEWS:48975 ../NEWS:51315
msgid ""
":issue:`26717`: Stop encoding Latin-1-ized WSGI paths with UTF-8.  Patch by "
"Anthony Sottile."
msgstr ":issue:`26717`: 停止用 UTF-8 编码拉丁-1 化的 WSGI 路径。由 Anthony Sottile 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48978
msgid ":issue:`26782`: Add STARTUPINFO to subprocess.__all__ on Windows."
msgstr ":issue:`26782`: 在 Windows 上向 subprocess.__all__ 添加 STARTUPINFO。"

#: ../NEWS:48980
msgid ""
":issue:`26404`: Add context manager to socketserver.  Patch by Aviv "
"Palivoda."
msgstr ":issue:`26404`: 向 socketserver 添加上下文管理器。由 Aviv Palivoda 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48982 ../NEWS:51318
msgid ""
":issue:`26735`: Fix :func:`os.urandom` on Solaris 11.3 and newer when "
"reading more than 1,024 bytes: call ``getrandom()`` multiple times with a "
"limit of 1024 bytes per call."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26735`: 修复 Solaris 11.3 及更新版本上 :func:`os.urandom` 当读取超过 1,024 "
"字节时的问题：多次调用 ``getrandom()``，每次调用限制为 1024 字节。"

#: ../NEWS:48986
msgid ""
":issue:`26585`: Eliminate http.server._quote_html() and use "
"html.escape(quote=False).  Patch by Xiang Zhang."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26585`: 移除 http.server._quote_html() 并使用 html.escape(quote=False)。由 "
"Xiang Zhang 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48989
msgid ":issue:`26685`: Raise OSError if closing a socket fails."
msgstr ":issue:`26685`: 如果关闭套接字失败，则引发 OSError。"

#: ../NEWS:48991 ../NEWS:51322
msgid ""
":issue:`16329`: Add .webm to mimetypes.types_map.  Patch by Giampaolo "
"Rodola'."
msgstr ""
":issue:`16329`: 向 mimetypes.types_map 添加 .webm。由 Giampaolo Rodola' 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48993 ../NEWS:51324
msgid ""
":issue:`13952`: Add .csv to mimetypes.types_map.  Patch by Geoff Wilson."
msgstr ":issue:`13952`: 向 mimetypes.types_map 添加 .csv。由 Geoff Wilson 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:48995
msgid ""
":issue:`26587`: the site module now allows .pth files to specify files to be"
" added to sys.path (e.g. zip files)."
msgstr ":issue:`26587`: 站点模块现在允许 .pth 文件指定要添加到 sys.path 的文件（例如 zip 文件）。"

#: ../NEWS:48998
msgid ""
":issue:`25609`: Introduce contextlib.AbstractContextManager and "
"typing.ContextManager."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25609`: 引入了 contextlib.AbstractContextManager 和 "
"typing.ContextManager。"

#: ../NEWS:49001 ../NEWS:51326
msgid ":issue:`26709`: Fixed Y2038 problem in loading binary PLists."
msgstr ":issue:`26709`: 修复了加载二进制 PLists 时的 Y2038 问题。"

#: ../NEWS:49003 ../NEWS:51328
msgid ""
":issue:`23735`: Handle terminal resizing with Readline 6.3+ by installing "
"our own SIGWINCH handler.  Patch by Eric Price."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23735`: 通过安装我们自己的 SIGWINCH 处理程序，处理 Readline 6.3+ 的终端调整大小。由 Eric "
"Price 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49006
msgid ""
":issue:`25951`: Change SSLSocket.sendall() to return None, as explicitly "
"documented for plain socket objects.  Patch by Aviv Palivoda."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25951`: 将 SSLSocket.sendall() 更改为返回 None，如明文套接字对象文档中明确所述。补丁由 Aviv "
"Palivoda 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:49009 ../NEWS:51331
msgid ""
":issue:`26586`: In http.server, respond with \"413 Request header fields too"
" large\" if there are too many header fields to parse, rather than killing "
"the connection and raising an unhandled exception.  Patch by Xiang Zhang."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26586`: 在 http.server 中，如果头字段太多无法解析，则响应 \"413 "
"请求头字段太大\"，而不是终止连接并引发未处理的异常。由 Xiang Zhang 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49013
msgid ":issue:`26676`: Added missing XMLPullParser to ElementTree.__all__."
msgstr ":issue:`26676`: 将缺失的 XMLPullParser 添加到 ElementTree.__all__。"

#: ../NEWS:49015 ../NEWS:51335
msgid ""
":issue:`22854`: Change BufferedReader.writable() and "
"BufferedWriter.readable() to always return False."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22854`: 将 BufferedReader.writable() 和 BufferedWriter.readable() "
"更改为总是返回 False。"

#: ../NEWS:49018
msgid ""
":issue:`26492`: Exhausted iterator of array.array now conforms with the "
"behavior of iterators of other mutable sequences: it lefts exhausted even if"
" iterated array is extended."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26492`: array.array 的耗尽迭代器现在与其他可变序列的迭代器行为一致：即使迭代的数组被扩展，它也会保持耗尽状态。"

#: ../NEWS:49022
msgid ""
":issue:`26641`: doctest.DocFileTest and doctest.testfile() now support "
"packages (module split into multiple directories) for the package parameter."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26641`: doctest.DocFileTest 和 doctest.testfile() 现在支持 package "
"参数用于包（模块分割到多个目录）。"

#: ../NEWS:49025 ../NEWS:51338
msgid ""
":issue:`25195`: Fix a regression in mock.MagicMock. _Call is a subclass of "
"tuple (changeset 3603bae63c13 only works for classes) so we need to "
"implement __ne__ ourselves.  Patch by Andrew Plummer."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25195`: 修复了 mock.MagicMock 中的一个回归问题。_Call 是 tuple 的子类（changeset "
"3603bae63c13 仅适用于类），所以我们需要自己实现 __ne__。由 Andrew Plummer 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49029 ../NEWS:51342
msgid ""
":issue:`26644`: Raise ValueError rather than SystemError when a negative "
"length is passed to SSLSocket.recv() or read()."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26644`: 当向 SSLSocket.recv() 或 read() 传递负长度时，引发 ValueError 而不是 "
"SystemError。"

#: ../NEWS:49032 ../NEWS:51345
msgid ""
":issue:`23804`: Fix SSL recv(0) and read(0) methods to return zero bytes "
"instead of up to 1024."
msgstr ":issue:`23804`: 修复 SSL recv(0) 和 read(0) 方法返回零字节而不是最多 1024 字节的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:49035 ../NEWS:51348
msgid ":issue:`26616`: Fixed a bug in datetime.astimezone() method."
msgstr ":issue:`26616`: 修复了 datetime.astimezone() 方法中的一个错误。"

#: ../NEWS:49037
msgid ""
":issue:`26637`: The :mod:`importlib` module now emits an :exc:`ImportError` "
"rather than a :exc:`TypeError` if :func:`__import__` is tried during the "
"Python shutdown process but :data:`sys.path` is already cleared (set to "
"``None``)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26637`: 现在，如果在 Python 关闭过程中尝试 :func:`__import__` 但 :data:`sys.path` "
"已经被清除（设置为 ``None``），:mod:`importlib` 模块会发出 :exc:`ImportError` 而不是 "
":exc:`TypeError`。"

#: ../NEWS:49042
msgid ""
":issue:`21925`: :func:`warnings.formatwarning` now catches exceptions when "
"calling :func:`linecache.getline` and "
":func:`tracemalloc.get_object_traceback` to be able to log "
":exc:`ResourceWarning` emitted late during the Python shutdown process."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21925`: :func:`warnings.formatwarning` 现在在调用 "
":func:`linecache.getline` 和 :func:`tracemalloc.get_object_traceback` "
"时会捕获异常，以便能够记录在Python关闭过程中晚期发出的 :exc:`ResourceWarning`。"

#: ../NEWS:49047
msgid ""
":issue:`23848`: On Windows, faulthandler.enable() now also installs an "
"exception handler to dump the traceback of all Python threads on any Windows"
" exception, not only on UNIX signals (SIGSEGV, SIGFPE, SIGABRT)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23848`: 在Windows上，faulthandler.enable() "
"现在也会安装一个异常处理器，以在任何Windows异常（不仅仅是UNIX信号（SIGSEGV、SIGFPE、SIGABRT））上转储所有Python线程的跟踪信息。"

#: ../NEWS:49051
msgid ""
":issue:`26530`: Add C functions :c:func:`!_PyTraceMalloc_Track` and "
":c:func:`!_PyTraceMalloc_Untrack` to track memory blocks using the "
":mod:`tracemalloc` module. Add :c:func:`!_PyTraceMalloc_GetTraceback` to get"
" the traceback of an object."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26530`: 添加C函数 :c:func:`!_PyTraceMalloc_Track` 和 "
":c:func:`!_PyTraceMalloc_Untrack` 来使用 :mod:`tracemalloc` 模块跟踪内存块。添加 "
":c:func:`!_PyTraceMalloc_GetTraceback` 来获取对象的跟踪信息。"

#: ../NEWS:49056
msgid ""
":issue:`26588`: The _tracemalloc now supports tracing memory allocations of "
"multiple address spaces (domains)."
msgstr ":issue:`26588`: _tracemalloc 现在支持跟踪多个地址空间（域）的内存分配。"

#: ../NEWS:49059 ../NEWS:51354
msgid ""
":issue:`24266`: Ctrl+C during Readline history search now cancels the search"
" mode when compiled with Readline 7."
msgstr ":issue:`24266`: 在编译时使用Readline 7的情况下，Readline历史搜索期间的Ctrl+C现在会取消搜索模式。"

#: ../NEWS:49062
msgid ""
":issue:`26590`: Implement a safe finalizer for the _socket.socket type. It "
"now releases the GIL to close the socket."
msgstr ":issue:`26590`: 为_socket.socket类型实现了一个安全的终结器。它现在会释放GIL来关闭套接字。"

#: ../NEWS:49065
msgid ""
":issue:`18787`: spwd.getspnam() now raises a PermissionError if the user "
"doesn't have privileges."
msgstr ":issue:`18787`: 如果用户没有权限，spwd.getspnam() 现在会引发一个PermissionError。"

#: ../NEWS:49068 ../NEWS:51357
msgid ""
":issue:`26560`: Avoid potential ValueError in BaseHandler.start_response. "
"Initial patch by Peter Inglesby."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26560`: 避免BaseHandler.start_response中潜在的ValueError。初始由Peter "
"Inglesby提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49071
msgid ""
":issue:`26567`: Add a new function :c:func:`PyErr_ResourceWarning` function "
"to pass the destroyed object. Add a *source* attribute to "
":class:`warnings.WarningMessage`. Add warnings._showwarnmsg() which uses "
"tracemalloc to get the traceback where source object was allocated."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26567`: 添加一个新函数 :c:func:`PyErr_ResourceWarning` 来传递被销毁的对象。向 "
":class:`warnings.WarningMessage` 添加一个 *source* "
"属性。添加warnings._showwarnmsg()，它使用tracemalloc来获取源对象分配时的跟踪信息。"

#: ../NEWS:49076 ../NEWS:51360
msgid ""
":issue:`26569`: Fix :func:`pyclbr.readmodule` and "
":func:`pyclbr.readmodule_ex` to support importing packages."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26569`: 修复 :func:`pyclbr.readmodule` 和 :func:`pyclbr.readmodule_ex` "
"以支持导入包。"

#: ../NEWS:49079 ../NEWS:51363
msgid ""
":issue:`26499`: Account for remaining Content-Length in "
"HTTPResponse.readline() and read1(). Based on patch by Silent Ghost. Also "
"document that HTTPResponse now supports these methods."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26499`: 在HTTPResponse.readline()和read1()中考虑剩余的Content-"
"Length。基于Silent Ghost的补丁。同时记录HTTPResponse现在支持这些方法。"

#: ../NEWS:49083 ../NEWS:51367
msgid ""
":issue:`25320`: Handle sockets in directories unittest discovery is "
"scanning. Patch from Victor van den Elzen."
msgstr ":issue:`25320`: 处理unittest发现扫描的目录中的套接字。补丁来自Victor van den Elzen。"

#: ../NEWS:49086 ../NEWS:51370
msgid ""
":issue:`16181`: cookiejar.http2time() now returns None if year is higher "
"than datetime.MAXYEAR."
msgstr ""
":issue:`16181`: 现在如果年份高于datetime.MAXYEAR，cookiejar.http2time()会返回None。"

#: ../NEWS:49089 ../NEWS:51373
msgid ":issue:`26513`: Fixes platform module detection of Windows Server"
msgstr ":issue:`26513`: 修复了平台模块对Windows Server的检测。"

#: ../NEWS:49091 ../NEWS:51375
msgid ""
":issue:`23718`: Fixed parsing time in week 0 before Jan 1.  Original patch "
"by Tamás Bence Gedai."
msgstr ":issue:`23718`: 修复了在1月1日前的第0周解析时间的问题。原始由Tamás Bence Gedai提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49094
msgid ""
":issue:`26323`: Add Mock.assert_called() and Mock.assert_called_once() "
"methods to unittest.mock. Patch written by Amit Saha."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26323`: "
"向unittest.mock添加了Mock.assert_called()和Mock.assert_called_once()方法。补丁由Amit "
"Saha编写。"

#: ../NEWS:49097 ../NEWS:51378
msgid ""
":issue:`20589`: Invoking Path.owner() and Path.group() on Windows now raise "
"NotImplementedError instead of ImportError."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20589`: "
"在Windows上调用Path.owner()和Path.group()现在会引发NotImplementedError而不是ImportError。"

#: ../NEWS:49100 ../NEWS:51381
msgid ""
":issue:`26177`: Fixed the keys() method for Canvas and Scrollbar widgets."
msgstr ":issue:`26177`: 修复了Canvas和Scrollbar小部件的keys()方法。"

#: ../NEWS:49102
msgid ""
":issue:`15068`: Got rid of excessive buffering in fileinput. The bufsize "
"parameter is now deprecated and ignored."
msgstr ":issue:`15068`: 消除了fileinput中过度的缓冲。bufsize参数现在已被弃用并被忽略。"

#: ../NEWS:49105
msgid ""
":issue:`19475`: Added an optional argument timespec to the datetime "
"isoformat() method to choose the precision of the time component."
msgstr ":issue:`19475`: 向datetime的isoformat()方法添加了一个可选参数timespec，用于选择时间组件的精度。"

#: ../NEWS:49108 ../NEWS:51386
msgid ""
":issue:`2202`: Fix UnboundLocalError in "
"AbstractDigestAuthHandler.get_algorithm_impls. Initial patch by Mathieu "
"Dupuy."
msgstr ""
":issue:`2202`: "
"修复了AbstractDigestAuthHandler.get_algorithm_impls中的UnboundLocalError。初始由Mathieu"
" Dupuy提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49112
msgid ""
":issue:`26167`: Minimized overhead in copy.copy() and copy.deepcopy(). "
"Optimized copying and deepcopying bytearrays, NotImplemented, slices, short "
"lists, tuples, dicts, sets."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26167`: "
"最小化了copy.copy()和copy.deepcopy()的开销。优化了bytearrays、NotImplemented、slices、短列表、元组、字典和集合的复制和深复制。"

#: ../NEWS:49116 ../NEWS:51390
msgid ""
":issue:`25718`: Fixed pickling and copying the accumulate() iterator with "
"total is None."
msgstr ":issue:`25718`: 修复了当total为None时，对accumulate()迭代器的pickling和复制。"

#: ../NEWS:49119 ../NEWS:51393
msgid ""
":issue:`26475`: Fixed debugging output for regular expressions with the (?x)"
" flag."
msgstr ":issue:`26475`: 修复了带有(?x)标志的正则表达式的调试输出。"

#: ../NEWS:49122
msgid ":issue:`26482`: Allowed pickling recursive dequeues."
msgstr ":issue:`26482`: 允许pickling递归的dequeues。"

#: ../NEWS:49124
msgid ""
":issue:`26335`: Make mmap.write() return the number of bytes written like "
"other write methods.  Patch by Jakub Stasiak."
msgstr ":issue:`26335`: 使mmap.write()像其他write方法一样返回写入的字节数。补丁由Jakub Stasiak提供。"

#: ../NEWS:49127 ../NEWS:51396
msgid ""
":issue:`26457`: Fixed the subnets() methods in IP network classes for the "
"case when resulting prefix length is equal to maximal prefix length. Based "
"on patch by Xiang Zhang."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26457`: 修复了当结果前缀长度等于最大前缀长度时，IP网络类中的subnets()方法。基于Xiang Zhang的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49131 ../NEWS:51400
msgid ""
":issue:`26385`: Remove the file if the internal open() call in "
"NamedTemporaryFile() fails. Patch by Silent Ghost."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26385`: 如果NamedTemporaryFile()中的内部open()调用失败，则删除文件。由Silent "
"Ghost提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49134 ../NEWS:51403
msgid ""
":issue:`26402`: Fix XML-RPC client to retry when the server shuts down a "
"persistent connection.  This was a regression related to the new "
"http.client.RemoteDisconnected exception in 3.5.0a4."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26402`: 修复了XML-"
"RPC客户端在服务器关闭持久连接时重试的问题。这是与3.5.0a4中的新http.client.RemoteDisconnected异常相关的回归问题。"

#: ../NEWS:49138 ../NEWS:51407
msgid ""
":issue:`25913`: Leading ``<~`` is optional now in base64.a85decode() with "
"adobe=True.  Patch by Swati Jaiswal."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25913`: 在adobe=True时，base64.a85decode()中前导的 ``<~`` 现在是可选的。由Swati "
"Jaiswal提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49141 ../NEWS:51410
msgid ""
":issue:`26186`: Remove an invalid type check in importlib.util.LazyLoader."
msgstr ":issue:`26186`: 移除importlib.util.LazyLoader中的一个无效类型检查。"

#: ../NEWS:49143
msgid ""
":issue:`26367`: importlib.__import__() raises ImportError like "
"builtins.__import__() when ``level`` is specified but without an "
"accompanying package specified."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26367`: 当指定了 ``level`` "
"但没有指定相应的包时，importlib.__import__()会像builtins.__import__()一样引发ImportError。"

#: ../NEWS:49147 ../NEWS:51416
msgid ""
":issue:`26309`: In the \"socketserver\" module, shut down the request "
"(closing the connected socket) when verify_request() returns false.  Patch "
"by Aviv Palivoda."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26309`: "
"在\"socketserver\"模块中，当verify_request()返回false时，关闭请求（关闭连接的套接字）。由Aviv "
"Palivoda提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49151
msgid ""
":issue:`23430`: Change the socketserver module to only catch exceptions "
"raised from a request handler that are derived from Exception (instead of "
"BaseException). Therefore SystemExit and KeyboardInterrupt no longer trigger"
" the handle_error() method, and will now to stop a single-threaded server."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23430`: "
"更改socketserver模块，只捕获源自Exception（而不是BaseException）的请求处理程序引发的异常。因此，SystemExit和KeyboardInterrupt不再触发handle_error()方法，现在将停止单线程服务器。"

#: ../NEWS:49157 ../NEWS:51420
msgid ""
":issue:`25995`: os.walk() no longer uses FDs proportional to the tree depth."
msgstr ":issue:`25995`: os.walk()不再使用与树深度成比例的FDs。"

#: ../NEWS:49159
msgid ""
":issue:`25994`: Added the close() method and the support of the context "
"manager protocol for the os.scandir() iterator."
msgstr ":issue:`25994`: 为os.scandir()迭代器添加了close()方法和上下文管理器协议的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:49162
msgid ""
":issue:`23992`: multiprocessing: make MapResult not fail-fast upon "
"exception."
msgstr ":issue:`23992`: multiprocessing：使MapResult在异常时不快速失败。"

#: ../NEWS:49164
msgid ""
":issue:`26243`: Support keyword arguments to zlib.compress().  Patch by Aviv"
" Palivoda."
msgstr ":issue:`26243`: 支持zlib.compress()的关键字参数。由Aviv Palivoda提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49167 ../NEWS:51422
msgid ""
":issue:`26117`: The os.scandir() iterator now closes file descriptor not "
"only when the iteration is finished, but when it was failed with error."
msgstr ":issue:`26117`: os.scandir()迭代器现在不仅在迭代完成时关闭文件描述符，而且在因错误失败时也关闭。"

#: ../NEWS:49170
msgid ""
":issue:`25949`: __dict__ for an OrderedDict instance is now created only "
"when needed."
msgstr ":issue:`25949`: OrderedDict实例的__dict__现在只在需要时创建。"

#: ../NEWS:49173 ../NEWS:51425
msgid ""
":issue:`25911`: Restored support of bytes paths in os.walk() on Windows."
msgstr ":issue:`25911`: 恢复了在Windows上os.walk()中对字节路径的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:49175 ../NEWS:51427
msgid ""
":issue:`26045`: Add UTF-8 suggestion to error message when posting a non-"
"Latin-1 string with http.client."
msgstr ":issue:`26045`: 在使用http.client发布非Latin-1字符串时，向错误消息添加UTF-8建议。"

#: ../NEWS:49178
msgid ""
":issue:`26039`: Added zipfile.ZipInfo.from_file() and "
"zipinfo.ZipInfo.is_dir(). Patch by Thomas Kluyver."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26039`: "
"添加了zipfile.ZipInfo.from_file()和zipinfo.ZipInfo.is_dir()。由Thomas Kluyver提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49181 ../NEWS:51430
msgid ""
":issue:`12923`: Reset FancyURLopener's redirect counter even if there is an "
"exception. Based on patches by Brian Brazil and Daniel Rocco."
msgstr ""
":issue:`12923`: 即使有异常也重置FancyURLopener的重定向计数器。基于Brian Brazil和Daniel "
"Rocco的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49184 ../NEWS:51433
msgid ""
":issue:`25945`: Fixed a crash when unpickle the functools.partial object "
"with wrong state. Fixed a leak in failed functools.partial constructor. "
"\"args\" and \"keywords\" attributes of functools.partial have now always "
"types tuple and dict correspondingly."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25945`: 修复了解除 pickle functools.partial 对象时状态错误导致的崩溃问题。修复了 "
"functools.partial 构造函数失败时的内存泄漏。functools.partial 的 \"args\" 和 \"keywords\" "
"属性现在总是分别具有 tuple 和 dict 类型。"

#: ../NEWS:49189 ../NEWS:51438
msgid ""
":issue:`26202`: copy.deepcopy() now correctly copies range() objects with "
"non-atomic attributes."
msgstr ":issue:`26202`: copy.deepcopy() 现在能正确复制具有非原子属性的 range() 对象。"

#: ../NEWS:49192 ../NEWS:51441
msgid ""
":issue:`23076`: Path.glob() now raises a ValueError if it's called with an "
"invalid pattern. Patch by Thomas Nyberg."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23076`: Path.glob() 现在在调用无效模式时会引发 ValueError。补丁由 Thomas Nyberg 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:49195 ../NEWS:51444
msgid ":issue:`19883`: Fixed possible integer overflows in zipimport."
msgstr ":issue:`19883`: 修复了 zipimport 中可能的整数溢出问题。"

#: ../NEWS:49197 ../NEWS:51446
msgid ""
":issue:`26227`: On Windows, getnameinfo(), gethostbyaddr() and "
"gethostbyname_ex() functions of the socket module now decode the hostname "
"from the ANSI code page rather than UTF-8."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26227`: 在 Windows 上，socket 模块的 getnameinfo()、gethostbyaddr() 和 "
"gethostbyname_ex() 函数现在从 ANSI 代码页而非 UTF-8 解码主机名。"

#: ../NEWS:49201
msgid ""
":issue:`26099`: The site module now writes an error into stderr if "
"sitecustomize module can be imported but executing the module raise an "
"ImportError. Same change for usercustomize."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26099`: site 模块现在会在 sitecustomize 模块可以导入但执行该模块时引发 ImportError 时，向 "
"stderr 写入错误信息。对 usercustomize 做了相同的更改。"

#: ../NEWS:49205 ../NEWS:51450
msgid ""
":issue:`26147`: xmlrpc now works with strings not encodable with used non-"
"UTF-8 encoding."
msgstr ":issue:`26147`: xmlrpc 现在可以处理无法用所使用的非 UTF-8 编码编码的字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:49208 ../NEWS:51453
msgid ""
":issue:`25935`: Garbage collector now breaks reference loops with "
"OrderedDict."
msgstr ":issue:`25935`: 垃圾回收器现在可以打破 OrderedDict 的引用循环。"

#: ../NEWS:49210 ../NEWS:51455
msgid ":issue:`16620`: Fixed AttributeError in msilib.Directory.glob()."
msgstr ":issue:`16620`: 修复了 msilib.Directory.glob() 中的 AttributeError。"

#: ../NEWS:49212 ../NEWS:51457
msgid ""
":issue:`26013`: Added compatibility with broken protocol 2 pickles created "
"in old Python 3 versions (3.4.3 and lower)."
msgstr ":issue:`26013`: 增加了对旧 Python 3 版本（3.4.3 及以下）创建的损坏协议 2 pickle 的兼容性。"

#: ../NEWS:49215
msgid ":issue:`26129`: Deprecated accepting non-integers in grp.getgrgid()."
msgstr ":issue:`26129`: 废弃了在 grp.getgrgid() 中接受非整数。"

#: ../NEWS:49217 ../NEWS:51460
msgid ":issue:`25850`: Use cross-compilation by default for 64-bit Windows."
msgstr ":issue:`25850`: 默认使用交叉编译为 64 位 Windows。"

#: ../NEWS:49219
msgid ""
":issue:`25822`: Add docstrings to the fields of urllib.parse results. Patch "
"contributed by Swati Jaiswal."
msgstr ":issue:`25822`: 向 urllib.parse 结果的字段添加了文档字符串。由 Swati Jaiswal 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49222
msgid ""
":issue:`22642`: Convert trace module option parsing mechanism to argparse. "
"Patch contributed by SilentGhost."
msgstr ":issue:`22642`: 将 trace 模块的选项解析机制转换为 argparse。由 SilentGhost 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49225 ../NEWS:51464
msgid ""
":issue:`24705`: Fix sysconfig._parse_makefile not expanding ${} vars "
"appearing before $() vars."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24705`: 修复了 sysconfig._parse_makefile 不扩展出现在 $() 变量之前的 ${} 变量的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:49228
msgid ":issue:`26069`: Remove the deprecated apis in the trace module."
msgstr ":issue:`26069`: 移除了 trace 模块中已弃用的 API。"

#: ../NEWS:49230 ../NEWS:51467
msgid ""
":issue:`22138`: Fix mock.patch behavior when patching descriptors. Restore "
"original values after patching. Patch contributed by Sean McCully."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22138`: 修复了 mock.patch 在修补描述符时的行为。修补后恢复原始值。由 Sean McCully 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49233 ../NEWS:51470
msgid ""
":issue:`25672`: In the ssl module, enable the SSL_MODE_RELEASE_BUFFERS mode "
"option if it is safe to do so."
msgstr ":issue:`25672`: 在 ssl 模块中，如果安全的话，启用 SSL_MODE_RELEASE_BUFFERS 模式选项。"

#: ../NEWS:49236 ../NEWS:51473
msgid ""
":issue:`26012`: Don't traverse into symlinks for ``**`` pattern in "
"pathlib.Path.[r]glob()."
msgstr ":issue:`26012`: 在 pathlib.Path.[r]glob() 中不对符号链接进行 ``**`` 模式的遍历。"

#: ../NEWS:49239 ../NEWS:51476
msgid ""
":issue:`24120`: Ignore PermissionError when traversing a tree with "
"pathlib.Path.[r]glob(). Patch by Ulrich Petri."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24120`: 在使用 pathlib.Path.[r]glob() 遍历树时忽略 PermissionError。由 Ulrich "
"Petri 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49242
msgid ""
":issue:`21815`: Accept ] characters in the data portion of imap responses, "
"in order to handle the flags with square brackets accepted and produced by "
"servers such as gmail."
msgstr ":issue:`21815`: 在 imap 响应的数据部分接受 ] 字符，以处理由 gmail 等服务器接受和产生的带有方括号的标志。"

#: ../NEWS:49246 ../NEWS:51479
msgid ""
":issue:`25447`: fileinput now uses sys.stdin as-is if it does not have a "
"buffer attribute (restores backward compatibility)."
msgstr ":issue:`25447`: 如果 sys.stdin 没有缓冲区属性，fileinput 现在会直接使用它（恢复了向后兼容性）。"

#: ../NEWS:49249
msgid ""
":issue:`25971`: Optimized creating Fractions from floats by 2 times and from"
" Decimals by 3 times."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25971`: 通过 2 倍的速度优化了从浮点数创建 Fractions，通过 3 倍的速度优化了从 Decimals 创建 "
"Fractions。"

#: ../NEWS:49252
msgid ""
":issue:`25802`: Document as deprecated the remaining implementations of "
"importlib.abc.Loader.load_module()."
msgstr ":issue:`25802`: 将 importlib.abc.Loader.load_module() 的剩余实现文档化为已弃用。"

#: ../NEWS:49255
msgid ":issue:`25928`: Add Decimal.as_integer_ratio()."
msgstr ":issue:`25928`: 添加了 Decimal.as_integer_ratio()。"

#: ../NEWS:49257 ../NEWS:51482
msgid ""
":issue:`25447`: Copying the lru_cache() wrapper object now always works, "
"independently from the type of the wrapped object (by returning the original"
" object unchanged)."
msgstr ":issue:`25447`: 复制 lru_cache() 包装器对象现在总是有效，与被包装对象的类型无关（通过返回未更改的原始对象）。"

#: ../NEWS:49261
msgid ""
":issue:`25768`: Have the functions in compileall return booleans instead of "
"ints and add proper documentation and tests for the return values."
msgstr ":issue:`25768`: 使 compileall 中的函数返回布尔值而不是整数，并为返回值添加了适当的文档和测试。"

#: ../NEWS:49264 ../NEWS:51486
msgid ""
":issue:`24103`: Fixed possible use after free in ElementTree.XMLPullParser."
msgstr ":issue:`24103`: 修复了 ElementTree.XMLPullParser 中可能的使用后释放问题。"

#: ../NEWS:49266 ../NEWS:51488
msgid ""
":issue:`25860`: os.fwalk() no longer skips remaining directories when error "
"occurs. Original patch by Samson Lee."
msgstr ":issue:`25860`: os.fwalk() 在发生错误时不再跳过剩余的目录。原始由 Samson Lee 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49269 ../NEWS:51491
msgid ":issue:`25914`: Fixed and simplified OrderedDict.__sizeof__."
msgstr ":issue:`25914`: 修复并简化了 OrderedDict.__sizeof__。"

#: ../NEWS:49271
msgid ""
":issue:`25869`: Optimized deepcopying ElementTree; it is now 20 times "
"faster."
msgstr ":issue:`25869`: 优化了 ElementTree 的深拷贝；现在速度快了 20 倍。"

#: ../NEWS:49273
msgid ""
":issue:`25873`: Optimized iterating ElementTree.  Iterating elements "
"Element.iter() is now 40% faster, iterating text Element.itertext() is now "
"up to 2.5 times faster."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25873`: 优化了 ElementTree 的迭代。迭代元素 Element.iter() 现在快了 40%，迭代文本 "
"Element.itertext() 现在快了最多 2.5 倍。"

#: ../NEWS:49277 ../NEWS:51493
msgid ""
":issue:`25902`: Fixed various refcount issues in ElementTree iteration."
msgstr ":issue:`25902`: 修复了 ElementTree 迭代中的各种引用计数问题。"

#: ../NEWS:49279
msgid ""
":issue:`22227`: The TarFile iterator is reimplemented using generator. This "
"implementation is simpler that using class."
msgstr ":issue:`22227`: TarFile 迭代器使用生成器重新实现。这个实现比使用类更简单。"

#: ../NEWS:49282
msgid ""
":issue:`25638`: Optimized ElementTree.iterparse(); it is now 2x faster. "
"Optimized ElementTree parsing; it is now 10% faster."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25638`: 优化了 ElementTree.iterparse()；现在快了 2 倍。优化了 ElementTree 解析；现在快了"
" 10%。"

#: ../NEWS:49285
msgid ":issue:`25761`: Improved detecting errors in broken pickle data."
msgstr ":issue:`25761`: 改进了对损坏的 pickle 数据中错误的检测。"

#: ../NEWS:49287 ../NEWS:51495
msgid ""
":issue:`25717`: Restore the previous behaviour of tolerating most fstat() "
"errors when opening files.  This was a regression in 3.5a1, and stopped "
"anonymous temporary files from working in special cases."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25717`: "
"恢复在打开文件时容忍大多数fstat()错误的先前行为。这是3.5a1版本中的一个回归问题，阻止了匿名临时文件在特殊情况下的工作。"

#: ../NEWS:49291 ../NEWS:51499
msgid ""
":issue:`24903`: Fix regression in number of arguments compileall accepts "
"when '-d' is specified.  The check on the number of arguments has been "
"dropped completely as it never worked correctly anyway."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24903`: 修复了当指定'-d'时compileall接受的参数数量的回归问题。对参数数量的检查已被完全删除，因为它从未正确工作过。"

#: ../NEWS:49295 ../NEWS:51503
msgid ""
":issue:`25764`: In the subprocess module, preserve any exception caused by "
"fork() failure when preexec_fn is used."
msgstr ":issue:`25764`: 在subprocess模块中，当使用preexec_fn时，保留由fork()失败引起的任何异常。"

#: ../NEWS:49298
msgid ""
":issue:`25771`: Tweak the exception message for "
"importlib.util.resolve_name() when 'package' isn't specified but necessary."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25771`: 当'package'未指定但必要时，调整importlib.util.resolve_name()的异常消息。"

#: ../NEWS:49301 ../NEWS:51506
msgid ""
":issue:`6478`: _strptime's regexp cache now is reset after changing timezone"
" with time.tzset()."
msgstr ":issue:`6478`: 在更改时区后，_strptime的正则表达式缓存现在会被time.tzset()重置。"

#: ../NEWS:49304 ../NEWS:51509
msgid ""
":issue:`14285`: When executing a package with the \"python -m package\" "
"option, and package initialization fails, a proper traceback is now "
"reported.  The \"runpy\" module now lets exceptions from package "
"initialization pass back to the caller, rather than raising ImportError."
msgstr ""
":issue:`14285`: 当使用\"python -m "
"package\"选项执行包且包初始化失败时，现在会报告正确的回溯。\"runpy\"模块现在让包初始化的异常传递回调用者，而不是引发ImportError。"

#: ../NEWS:49309 ../NEWS:51514
msgid ""
":issue:`19771`: Also in runpy and the \"-m\" option, omit the irrelevant "
"message \". . . is a package and cannot be directly executed\" if the "
"package could not even be initialized (e.g. due to a bad ``*.pyc`` file)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`19771`: 同样在runpy和\"-m\"选项中，如果包甚至无法初始化（例如由于坏的 ``*.pyc`` "
"文件），则省略不相关的消息\"...是一个包，不能直接执行\"。"

#: ../NEWS:49313 ../NEWS:51518
msgid ""
":issue:`25177`: Fixed problem with the mean of very small and very large "
"numbers. As a side effect, statistics.mean and statistics.variance should be"
" significantly faster."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25177`: "
"修复了非常小和非常大的数字的平均值问题。作为副作用，statistics.mean和statistics.variance应该会显著更快。"

#: ../NEWS:49317 ../NEWS:51522
msgid ""
":issue:`25718`: Fixed copying object with state with boolean value is false."
msgstr ":issue:`25718`: 修复了复制状态为布尔值false的对象的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:49319 ../NEWS:51524
msgid ""
":issue:`10131`: Fixed deep copying of minidom documents.  Based on patch by "
"Marian Ganisin."
msgstr ":issue:`10131`: 修复了minidom文档的深拷贝问题。基于Marian Ganisin的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49322
msgid ""
":issue:`7990`: dir() on ElementTree.Element now lists properties: \"tag\", "
"\"text\", \"tail\" and \"attrib\".  Original patch by Santoso Wijaya."
msgstr ""
":issue:`7990`: ElementTree.Element上的dir()现在列出属性：\"tag\", \"text\", "
"\"tail\"和\"attrib\"。原始由Santoso Wijaya提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49325 ../NEWS:51527
msgid ""
":issue:`25725`: Fixed a reference leak in pickle.loads() when unpickling "
"invalid data including tuple instructions."
msgstr ":issue:`25725`: 修复了在解包含元组指令的无效数据时pickle.loads()中的引用泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:49328 ../NEWS:51530
msgid ""
":issue:`25663`: In the Readline completer, avoid listing duplicate global "
"names, and search the global namespace before searching builtins."
msgstr ":issue:`25663`: 在Readline completer中，避免列出重复的全局名称，并在搜索内置名称之前搜索全局命名空间。"

#: ../NEWS:49331 ../NEWS:51533
msgid ""
":issue:`25688`: Fixed file leak in ElementTree.iterparse() raising an error."
msgstr ":issue:`25688`: 修复了ElementTree.iterparse()在引发错误时的文件泄露问题。"

#: ../NEWS:49333 ../NEWS:51535
msgid ""
":issue:`23914`: Fixed SystemError raised by unpickler on broken pickle data."
msgstr ":issue:`23914`: 修复了解pickle数据损坏时unpickler引发的SystemError。"

#: ../NEWS:49335 ../NEWS:51537
msgid ""
":issue:`25691`: Fixed crash on deleting ElementTree.Element attributes."
msgstr ":issue:`25691`: 修复了删除ElementTree.Element属性时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:49337 ../NEWS:51539
msgid ""
":issue:`25624`: ZipFile now always writes a ZIP_STORED header for directory "
"entries.  Patch by Dingyuan Wang."
msgstr ":issue:`25624`: ZipFile现在总是为目录条目写入ZIP_STORED头。由王定远提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49340 ../NEWS:51855
msgid ""
":issue:`25626`: Change three zlib functions to accept sizes that fit in "
"Py_ssize_t, but internally cap those sizes to UINT_MAX.  This resolves a "
"regression in 3.5 where GzipFile.read() failed to read chunks larger than 2 "
"or 4 GiB.  The change affects the zlib.Decompress.decompress() max_length "
"parameter, the zlib.decompress() bufsize parameter, and the "
"zlib.Decompress.flush() length parameter."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25626`: "
"修改了三个zlib函数以接受适合Py_ssize_t的大小，但在内部将这些大小限制为UINT_MAX。这解决了3.5版本中GzipFile.read()无法读取大于2或4"
" "
"GiB块的回归问题。此更改影响zlib.Decompress.decompress()的max_length参数、zlib.decompress()的bufsize参数和zlib.Decompress.flush()的length参数。"

#: ../NEWS:49347 ../NEWS:51862
msgid ""
":issue:`25583`: Avoid incorrect errors raised by os.makedirs(exist_ok=True) "
"when the OS gives priority to errors such as EACCES over EEXIST."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25583`: "
"当操作系统优先考虑如EACCES这样的错误而不是EEXIST时，避免os.makedirs(exist_ok=True)引发错误。"

#: ../NEWS:49350 ../NEWS:51865
msgid ":issue:`25593`: Change semantics of EventLoop.stop() in asyncio."
msgstr ":issue:`25593`: 修改了asyncio中EventLoop.stop()的语义。"

#: ../NEWS:49352 ../NEWS:51867
msgid ""
":issue:`6973`: When we know a subprocess.Popen process has died, do not "
"allow the send_signal(), terminate(), or kill() methods to do anything as "
"they could potentially signal a different process."
msgstr ""
":issue:`6973`: "
"当我们知道一个subprocess.Popen进程已经死亡时，不允许send_signal()、terminate()或kill()方法执行任何操作，因为它们可能会信号到不同的进程。"

#: ../NEWS:49356
msgid ""
":issue:`23883`: Added missing APIs to __all__ to match the documented APIs "
"for the following modules: calendar, csv, enum, fileinput, ftplib, logging, "
"optparse, tarfile, threading and wave.  Also added a "
"test.support.check__all__() helper. Patches by Jacek Kołodziej, Mauro S. M. "
"Rodrigues and Joel Taddei."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23883`: "
"添加了缺失的API到__all__以匹配以下模块的文档API：calendar、csv、enum、fileinput、ftplib、logging、optparse、tarfile、threading和wave。还添加了一个test.support.check__all__()辅助函数。由Jacek"
" Kołodziej、Mauro S. M. Rodrigues和Joel Taddei提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49362
msgid ""
":issue:`25590`: In the Readline completer, only call getattr() once per "
"attribute.  Also complete names of attributes such as properties and slots "
"which are listed by dir() but not yet created on an instance."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25590`: 在Readline "
"completer中，每个属性只调用一次getattr()。同时完成如属性和槽这样的属性名称，这些属性由dir()列出但尚未在实例上创建。"

#: ../NEWS:49366 ../NEWS:51874
msgid ""
":issue:`25498`: Fix a crash when garbage-collecting ctypes objects created "
"by wrapping a memoryview.  This was a regression made in 3.5a1.  Based on "
"patch by Eryksun."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25498`: "
"修复了在垃圾回收由包装memoryview创建的ctypes对象时的崩溃问题。这是3.5a1中的一个回归。基于Eryksun的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49370 ../NEWS:51878
msgid ":issue:`25584`: Added \"escape\" to the __all__ list in the glob module."
msgstr ":issue:`25584`: 将\"escape\"添加到glob模块的__all__列表中。"

#: ../NEWS:49372 ../NEWS:51880
msgid ""
":issue:`25584`: Fixed recursive glob() with patterns starting with ``**``."
msgstr ":issue:`25584`: 修复了以 ``**`` 开头的递归glob()模式。"

#: ../NEWS:49374 ../NEWS:51882
msgid ":issue:`25446`: Fix regression in smtplib's AUTH LOGIN support."
msgstr ":issue:`25446`: 修复 smtplib 的 AUTH LOGIN 支持中的回归问题。"

#: ../NEWS:49376 ../NEWS:51884
msgid ""
":issue:`18010`: Fix the pydoc web server's module search function to handle "
"exceptions from importing packages."
msgstr ":issue:`18010`: 修复 pydoc web 服务器的模块搜索功能，以处理导入包时的异常。"

#: ../NEWS:49379 ../NEWS:51887
msgid ""
":issue:`25554`: Got rid of circular references in regular expression "
"parsing."
msgstr ":issue:`25554`: 消除了正则表达式解析中的循环引用。"

#: ../NEWS:49381
msgid ""
":issue:`18973`: Command-line interface of the calendar module now uses "
"argparse instead of optparse."
msgstr ":issue:`18973`: 日历模块的命令行界面现在使用 argparse 而不是 optparse。"

#: ../NEWS:49384 ../NEWS:51889
msgid ""
":issue:`25510`: fileinput.FileInput.readline() now returns b'' instead of ''"
" at the end if the FileInput was opened with binary mode. Patch by Ryosuke "
"Ito."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25510`: 如果 FileInput 以二进制模式打开，fileinput.FileInput.readline() 现在在末尾返回"
" b'' 而不是 ''。由 Ryosuke Ito 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49388 ../NEWS:51893
msgid ""
":issue:`25503`: Fixed inspect.getdoc() for inherited docstrings of "
"properties. Original patch by John Mark Vandenberg."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25503`: 修复了 inspect.getdoc() 对于属性的继承文档字符串的处理。原始由 John Mark "
"Vandenberg 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49391 ../NEWS:51896
msgid ""
":issue:`25515`: Always use os.urandom as a source of randomness in "
"uuid.uuid4."
msgstr ":issue:`25515`: 在 uuid.uuid4 中始终使用 os.urandom 作为随机性来源。"

#: ../NEWS:49393 ../NEWS:51898
msgid ""
":issue:`21827`: Fixed textwrap.dedent() for the case when largest common "
"whitespace is a substring of smallest leading whitespace. Based on patch by "
"Robert Li."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21827`: 修复了 textwrap.dedent() 当最大公共空白是最小前导空白的子字符串时的情况。基于 Robert Li "
"的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49397 ../NEWS:51902
msgid ""
":issue:`25447`: The lru_cache() wrapper objects now can be copied and "
"pickled (by returning the original object unchanged)."
msgstr ":issue:`25447`: lru_cache() 包装器对象现在可以被复制和 pickle（通过返回未更改的原始对象）。"

#: ../NEWS:49400 ../NEWS:51905
msgid ":issue:`25390`: typing: Don't crash on Union[str, Pattern]."
msgstr ":issue:`25390`: typing: 不因 Union[str, Pattern] 而崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:49402 ../NEWS:51907
msgid ""
":issue:`25441`: asyncio: Raise error from drain() when socket is closed."
msgstr ":issue:`25441`: asyncio: 当套接字关闭时从 drain() 引发错误。"

#: ../NEWS:49404 ../NEWS:51909
msgid ""
":issue:`25410`: Cleaned up and fixed minor bugs in C implementation of "
"OrderedDict."
msgstr ":issue:`25410`: 清理并修复了 OrderedDict 的 C 实现中的小错误。"

#: ../NEWS:49407 ../NEWS:51912
msgid ""
":issue:`25411`: Improved Unicode support in SMTPHandler through better use "
"of the email package. Thanks to user simon04 for the patch."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25411`: 通过更好地使用 email 包，改进了 SMTPHandler 中的 Unicode 支持。感谢用户 simon04 "
"的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49410
msgid ""
"Move the imp module from a PendingDeprecationWarning to DeprecationWarning."
msgstr "将 imp 模块从 PendingDeprecationWarning 移动到 DeprecationWarning。"

#: ../NEWS:49413 ../NEWS:51915
msgid ""
":issue:`25407`: Remove mentions of the formatter module being removed in "
"Python 3.6."
msgstr ":issue:`25407`: 移除了关于 formatter 模块在 Python 3.6 中被移除的提及。"

#: ../NEWS:49416 ../NEWS:51918
msgid ""
":issue:`25406`: Fixed a bug in C implementation of OrderedDict.move_to_end()"
" that caused segmentation fault or hang in iterating after moving several "
"items to the start of ordered dict."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25406`: 修复了 OrderedDict.move_to_end() 的 C "
"实现中的一个错误，该错误导致在将几个项目移动到有序字典的开头后在迭代中出现分段错误或挂起。"

#: ../NEWS:49420
msgid ""
":issue:`25382`: pickletools.dis() now outputs implicit memo index for the "
"MEMOIZE opcode."
msgstr ":issue:`25382`: pickletools.dis() 现在为 MEMOIZE 操作码输出隐式备忘录索引。"

#: ../NEWS:49423
msgid ""
":issue:`25357`: Add an optional newline parameter to binascii.b2a_base64(). "
"base64.b64encode() uses it to avoid a memory copy."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25357`: 向 binascii.b2a_base64() 添加了一个可选的新行参数。base64.b64encode() "
"使用它来避免内存拷贝。"

#: ../NEWS:49426
msgid ""
":issue:`24164`: Objects that need calling ``__new__`` with keyword "
"arguments, can now be pickled using pickle protocols older than protocol "
"version 4."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24164`: 需要使用关键字参数调用 ``__new__`` 的对象，现在可以使用低于协议版本4的pickle协议进行序列化。"

#: ../NEWS:49429 ../NEWS:51922
msgid ":issue:`25364`: zipfile now works in threads disabled builds."
msgstr ":issue:`25364`: zipfile 现在可以在禁用线程的构建中工作。"

#: ../NEWS:49431 ../NEWS:51924
msgid ""
":issue:`25328`: smtpd's SMTPChannel now correctly raises a ValueError if "
"both decode_data and enable_SMTPUTF8 are set to true."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25328`: 如果 decode_data 和 enable_SMTPUTF8 都被设置为 true，smtpd 的 "
"SMTPChannel 现在会正确地引发 ValueError。"

#: ../NEWS:49434
msgid ""
":issue:`16099`: RobotFileParser now supports Crawl-delay and Request-rate "
"extensions.  Patch by Nikolay Bogoychev."
msgstr ""
":issue:`16099`: RobotFileParser 现在支持 Crawl-delay 和 Request-rate 扩展。由 Nikolay"
" Bogoychev 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49437 ../NEWS:51927
msgid ""
":issue:`25316`: distutils raises OSError instead of DistutilsPlatformError "
"when MSVC is not installed."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25316`: 当未安装 MSVC 时，distutils 会引发 OSError 而不是 "
"DistutilsPlatformError。"

#: ../NEWS:49440 ../NEWS:51930
msgid ""
":issue:`25380`: Fixed protocol for the STACK_GLOBAL opcode in "
"pickletools.opcodes."
msgstr ":issue:`25380`: 修复了 pickletools.opcodes 中 STACK_GLOBAL 操作码的协议。"

#: ../NEWS:49443 ../NEWS:51933
msgid ""
":issue:`23972`: Updates asyncio datagram create method allowing reuseport "
"and reuseaddr socket options to be set prior to binding the socket. "
"Mirroring the existing asyncio create_server method the reuseaddr option for"
" datagram sockets defaults to True if the O/S is 'posix' (except if the "
"platform is Cygwin). Patch by Chris Laws."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23972`: 更新了 asyncio 的数据报创建方法，允许在绑定套接字之前设置 reuseport 和 reuseaddr "
"套接字选项。与现有的 asyncio create_server 方法类似，如果操作系统是 'posix'（除非平台是 Cygwin），数据报套接字的 "
"reuseaddr 选项默认为 True。由 Chris Laws 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49449 ../NEWS:51939
msgid ""
":issue:`25304`: Add asyncio.run_coroutine_threadsafe().  This lets you "
"submit a coroutine to a loop from another thread, returning a "
"concurrent.futures.Future.  By Vincent Michel."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25304`: 添加了 "
"asyncio.run_coroutine_threadsafe()。这让你可以从另一个线程向循环提交一个协程，返回一个 "
"concurrent.futures.Future。由 Vincent Michel 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:49453 ../NEWS:51943
msgid ""
":issue:`25232`: Fix CGIRequestHandler to split the query from the URL at the"
" first question mark (?) rather than the last. Patch from Xiang Zhang."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25232`: 修复 CGIRequestHandler，使其在第一个问号 (?) 处而不是最后一个问号处将查询与 URL "
"分开。补丁来自 Xiang Zhang。"

#: ../NEWS:49456 ../NEWS:51946
msgid ""
":issue:`24657`: Prevent CGIRequestHandler from collapsing slashes in the "
"query part of the URL as if it were a path. Patch from Xiang Zhang."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24657`: 防止 CGIRequestHandler 像处理路径一样在 URL 的查询部分折叠斜杠。补丁来自 Xiang "
"Zhang。"

#: ../NEWS:49459
msgid ""
":issue:`25287`: Don't add crypt.METHOD_CRYPT to crypt.methods if it's not "
"supported. Check if it is supported, it may not be supported on OpenBSD for "
"example."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25287`: 如果不支持 crypt.METHOD_CRYPT，则不要将其添加到 crypt.methods 中。检查是否支持，例如在"
" OpenBSD 上可能不支持。"

#: ../NEWS:49463 ../NEWS:51974
msgid ""
":issue:`23600`: Default implementation of tzinfo.fromutc() was returning "
"wrong results in some cases."
msgstr ":issue:`23600`: tzinfo.fromutc() 的默认实现在某些情况下返回了错误的结果。"

#: ../NEWS:49466 ../NEWS:51971
msgid ""
":issue:`25203`: Failed readline.set_completer_delims() no longer left the "
"module in inconsistent state."
msgstr ":issue:`25203`: 失败的 readline.set_completer_delims() 不再使模块处于不一致状态。"

#: ../NEWS:49469
msgid ""
":issue:`25011`: rlcompleter now omits private and special attribute names "
"unless the prefix starts with underscores."
msgstr ":issue:`25011`: rlcompleter 现在会省略私有和特殊属性名称，除非前缀以下划线开头。"

#: ../NEWS:49472
msgid ""
":issue:`25209`: rlcompleter now can add a space or a colon after completed "
"keyword."
msgstr ":issue:`25209`: rlcompleter 现在可以在完成的关键字后添加空格或冒号。"

#: ../NEWS:49475
msgid ":issue:`22241`: timezone.utc name is now plain 'UTC', not 'UTC-00:00'."
msgstr ":issue:`22241`: timezone.utc 名称现在是简单的 'UTC'，而不是 'UTC-00:00'。"

#: ../NEWS:49477
msgid ""
":issue:`23517`: fromtimestamp() and utcfromtimestamp() methods of "
"datetime.datetime now round microseconds to nearest with ties going to "
"nearest even integer (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), as round(float), instead of rounding"
" towards -Infinity (ROUND_FLOOR)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23517`: datetime.datetime 的 fromtimestamp() 和 utcfromtimestamp() "
"方法现在将微秒四舍五入到最近的偶数整数（ROUND_HALF_EVEN），如同 "
"round(float)，而不是向负无穷方向舍入（ROUND_FLOOR）。"

#: ../NEWS:49482
msgid ""
":issue:`23552`: Timeit now warns when there is substantial (4x) variance "
"between best and worst times. Patch from Serhiy Storchaka."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23552`: Timeit 现在在最佳和最差时间之间存在显著（4倍）差异时发出警告。补丁来自 Serhiy Storchaka。"

#: ../NEWS:49485
msgid ":issue:`24633`: site-packages/README -> README.txt."
msgstr ":issue:`24633`: site-packages/README -> README.txt。"

#: ../NEWS:49487
msgid ""
":issue:`24879`: help() and pydoc can now list named tuple fields in the "
"order they were defined rather than alphabetically.  The ordering is "
"determined by the _fields attribute if present."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24879`: help() 和 pydoc 现在可以按照命名元组字段定义的顺序而非字母顺序列出它们。排序由 _fields "
"属性（如果存在）决定。"

#: ../NEWS:49491
msgid ""
":issue:`24874`: Improve speed of itertools.cycle() and make its pickle more "
"compact."
msgstr ":issue:`24874`: 提高 itertools.cycle() 的速度并使其 pickle 更加紧凑。"

#: ../NEWS:49494
msgid ""
"Fix crash in itertools.cycle.__setstate__() when the first argument wasn't a"
" list."
msgstr "修复了当第一个参数不是列表时 itertools.cycle.__setstate__() 的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:49497
msgid ""
":issue:`20059`: urllib.parse raises ValueError on all invalid ports. Patch "
"by Martin Panter."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20059`: urllib.parse 在所有无效端口上引发 ValueError。补丁来自 Martin Panter。"

#: ../NEWS:49500
msgid ""
":issue:`24360`: Improve __repr__ of argparse.Namespace() for invalid "
"identifiers.  Patch by Matthias Bussonnier."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24360`: 为无效标识符改进 argparse.Namespace() 的 __repr__。补丁来自 Matthias "
"Bussonnier。"

#: ../NEWS:49503
msgid ""
":issue:`23426`: run_setup was broken in distutils. Patch from Alexander "
"Belopolsky."
msgstr ":issue:`23426`: distutils 中的 run_setup 被破坏。补丁来自 Alexander Belopolsky。"

#: ../NEWS:49506
msgid ""
":issue:`13938`: 2to3 converts StringTypes to a tuple. Patch from Mark "
"Hammond."
msgstr ":issue:`13938`: 2to3 将 StringTypes 转换为元组。补丁来自 Mark Hammond。"

#: ../NEWS:49508
msgid ""
":issue:`2091`: open() accepted a 'U' mode string containing '+', but 'U' can"
" only be used with 'r'. Patch from Jeff Balogh and John O'Connor."
msgstr ""
":issue:`2091`: open() 接受包含 '+' 的 'U' 模式字符串，但 'U' 只能与 'r' 一起使用。补丁来自 Jeff "
"Balogh 和 John O'Connor。"

#: ../NEWS:49511
msgid ""
":issue:`8585`: improved tests for zipimporter2. Patch from Mark Lawrence."
msgstr ":issue:`8585`: 改进了 zipimporter2 的测试。补丁来自 Mark Lawrence。"

#: ../NEWS:49513 ../NEWS:52516
msgid ""
":issue:`18622`: unittest.mock.mock_open().reset_mock would recurse "
"infinitely. Patch from Nicola Palumbo and Laurent De Buyst."
msgstr ""
":issue:`18622`: unittest.mock.mock_open().reset_mock 会无限递归。补丁来自 Nicola "
"Palumbo 和 Laurent De Buyst。"

#: ../NEWS:49516
msgid ""
":issue:`24426`: Fast searching optimization in regular expressions now works"
" for patterns that starts with capturing groups.  Fast searching "
"optimization now can't be disabled at compile time."
msgstr ":issue:`24426`: 正则表达式中的快速搜索优化现在适用于以捕获组开始的模式。快速搜索优化现在不能在编译时禁用。"

#: ../NEWS:49520 ../NEWS:52519
msgid ""
":issue:`23661`: unittest.mock side_effects can now be exceptions again. This"
" was a regression vs Python 3.4. Patch from Ignacio Rossi"
msgstr ""
":issue:`23661`: unittest.mock 的 side_effects 现在可以再次是异常。这是对 Python 3.4 "
"的一个回归。补丁来自 Ignacio Rossi"

#: ../NEWS:49523
msgid ":issue:`13248`: Remove deprecated inspect.getmoduleinfo function."
msgstr ":issue:`13248`: 移除已弃用的 inspect.getmoduleinfo 函数。"

#: ../NEWS:49525 ../NEWS:52048
msgid ":issue:`25578`: Fix (another) memory leak in SSLSocket.getpeercer()."
msgstr ":issue:`25578`: 修复 SSLSocket.getpeercer() 中的另一个内存泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:49527 ../NEWS:52050
msgid ""
":issue:`25530`: Disable the vulnerable SSLv3 protocol by default when "
"creating ssl.SSLContext."
msgstr ":issue:`25530`: 默认情况下，在创建 ssl.SSLContext 时禁用易受攻击的 SSLv3 协议。"

#: ../NEWS:49530 ../NEWS:52053
msgid ":issue:`25569`: Fix memory leak in SSLSocket.getpeercert()."
msgstr ":issue:`25569`: 修复 SSLSocket.getpeercert() 中的内存泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:49532 ../NEWS:52055
msgid ""
":issue:`25471`: Sockets returned from accept() shouldn't appear to be "
"nonblocking."
msgstr ":issue:`25471`: 从 accept() 返回的套接字不应显示为非阻塞。"

#: ../NEWS:49535 ../NEWS:52058
msgid ""
":issue:`25319`: When threading.Event is reinitialized, the underlying "
"condition should use a regular lock rather than a recursive lock."
msgstr ":issue:`25319`: 当 threading.Event 被重新初始化时，底层条件应使用常规锁而不是递归锁。"

#: ../NEWS:49538 ../NEWS:51542
msgid ""
"Skip getaddrinfo if host is already resolved. Patch by A. Jesse Jiryu Davis."
msgstr "如果主机已解析，则跳过 getaddrinfo。由 A. Jesse Jiryu Davis 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49541 ../NEWS:51545
msgid ""
":issue:`26050`: Add asyncio.StreamReader.readuntil() method. Patch by Марк "
"Коренберг."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26050`: 添加 asyncio.StreamReader.readuntil() 方法。由 Марк Коренберг "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49544 ../NEWS:51548
msgid ""
":issue:`25924`: Avoid unnecessary serialization of getaddrinfo(3) calls on "
"OS X versions 10.5 or higher.  Original patch by A. Jesse Jiryu Davis."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25924`: 在 OS X 10.5 或更高版本上避免不必要的 getaddrinfo(3) 调用序列化。原始补丁由 A. Jesse"
" Jiryu Davis 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:49547 ../NEWS:51551
msgid ""
":issue:`26406`: Avoid unnecessary serialization of getaddrinfo(3) calls on "
"current versions of OpenBSD and NetBSD.  Patch by A. Jesse Jiryu Davis."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26406`: 在当前版本的 OpenBSD 和 NetBSD 上避免不必要的 getaddrinfo(3) 调用序列化。由 A. "
"Jesse Jiryu Davis 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49550 ../NEWS:51554
msgid ""
":issue:`26848`: Fix asyncio/subprocess.communicate() to handle empty input. "
"Patch by Jack O'Connor."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26848`: 修复 asyncio/subprocess.communicate() 以处理空输入。由 Jack O'Connor "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49553 ../NEWS:51557
msgid ":issue:`27040`: Add loop.get_exception_handler method"
msgstr ":issue:`27040`: 添加 loop.get_exception_handler 方法"

#: ../NEWS:49555 ../NEWS:51559
msgid ":issue:`27041`: asyncio: Add loop.create_future method"
msgstr ":issue:`27041`: asyncio: 添加 loop.create_future 方法"

#: ../NEWS:49560 ../NEWS:51607
msgid ""
":issue:`20640`: Add tests for idlelib.configHelpSourceEdit. Patch by "
"Saimadhav Heblikar."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20640`: 为 idlelib.configHelpSourceEdit 添加测试。由 Saimadhav Heblikar "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49563 ../NEWS:51610
msgid ""
"In the 'IDLE-console differences' section of the IDLE doc, clarify how "
"running with IDLE affects sys.modules and the standard streams."
msgstr "在 IDLE 文档的 'IDLE-控制台差异' 部分，澄清使用 IDLE 运行如何影响 sys.modules 和标准流。"

#: ../NEWS:49566 ../NEWS:51613
msgid ""
":issue:`25507`: fix incorrect change in IOBinding that prevented printing. "
"Augment IOBinding htest to include all major IOBinding functions."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25507`: 修复 IOBinding 中阻止打印的错误更改。增强 IOBinding htest 以包括所有主要 IOBinding"
" 功能。"

#: ../NEWS:49569 ../NEWS:51616
msgid ""
":issue:`25905`: Revert unwanted conversion of ' to ’ RIGHT SINGLE QUOTATION "
"MARK in README.txt and open this and NEWS.txt with 'ascii'. Re-encode "
"CREDITS.txt to utf-8 and open it with 'utf-8'."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25905`: 恢复 README.txt 中 ' 到 ’ 右单引号的不必要转换，并用 'ascii' 打开此文件和 "
"NEWS.txt。将 CREDITS.txt 重新编码为 utf-8 并用 'utf-8' 打开。"

#: ../NEWS:49573 ../NEWS:52087
msgid ""
":issue:`15348`: Stop the debugger engine (normally in a user process) before"
" closing the debugger window (running in the IDLE process). This prevents "
"the RuntimeErrors that were being caught and ignored."
msgstr ""
":issue:`15348`: 在关闭调试器窗口（在 IDLE 进程中运行）之前停止调试器引擎（通常在用户进程中）。这防止了被捕获并忽略的 "
"RuntimeErrors。"

#: ../NEWS:49577 ../NEWS:52091
msgid ""
":issue:`24455`: Prevent IDLE from hanging when a) closing the shell while "
"the debugger is active (15347); b) closing the debugger with the [X] button "
"(15348); and c) activating the debugger when already active (24455). The "
"patch by Mark Roseman does this by making two changes. 1. Suspend and resume"
" the gui.interaction method with the tcl vwait mechanism intended for this "
"purpose (instead of root.mainloop & .quit). 2. In gui.run, allow any "
"existing interaction to terminate first."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24455`: 防止IDLE在以下情况下挂起：a) 当调试器处于活动状态时关闭shell（15347）；b) "
"使用[X]按钮关闭调试器（15348）；以及c) 当调试器已经处于活动状态时再次激活（24455）。Mark "
"Roseman的补丁通过两个更改来实现这一点。1. 使用为此目的设计的tcl vwait机制（而不是root.mainloop & "
".quit）暂停和恢复gui.interaction方法。2. 在gui.run中，允许任何现有的交互首先终止。"

#: ../NEWS:49585 ../NEWS:52099
msgid ""
"Change 'The program' to 'Your program' in an IDLE 'kill program?' message to"
" make it clearer that the program referred to is the currently running user "
"program, not IDLE itself."
msgstr "在IDLE的'终止程序？'消息中，将'程序'改为'您的程序'，以更清楚地表明所指的是当前运行的用户程序，而不是IDLE本身。"

#: ../NEWS:49589 ../NEWS:52103
msgid ""
":issue:`24750`: Improve the appearance of the IDLE editor window status bar."
" Patch by Mark Roseman."
msgstr ":issue:`24750`: 改善IDLE编辑器窗口状态栏的外观。Patch by Mark Roseman。"

#: ../NEWS:49592 ../NEWS:52106
msgid ""
":issue:`25313`: Change the handling of new built-in text color themes to "
"better address the compatibility problem introduced by the addition of IDLE "
"Dark. Consistently use the revised idleConf.CurrentTheme everywhere in "
"idlelib."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25313`: 更改新内置文本颜色主题的处理，以更好地解决由IDLE "
"Dark的添加引入的兼容性问题。在idlelib中一致地使用修订后的idleConf.CurrentTheme。"

#: ../NEWS:49596 ../NEWS:52110
msgid ""
":issue:`24782`: Extension configuration is now a tab in the IDLE Preferences"
" dialog rather than a separate dialog.  The former tabs are now a sorted "
"list.  Patch by Mark Roseman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24782`: 扩展配置现在是IDLE首选项对话框中的一个标签，而不是一个单独的对话框。原来的标签现在是一个排序列表。Patch by "
"Mark Roseman。"

#: ../NEWS:49600 ../NEWS:52114
msgid ""
":issue:`22726`: Re-activate the config dialog help button with some content "
"about the other buttons and the new IDLE Dark theme."
msgstr ":issue:`22726`: 重新激活配置对话框帮助按钮，包含一些关于其他按钮和新IDLE Dark主题的内容。"

#: ../NEWS:49603 ../NEWS:52117
msgid ""
":issue:`24820`: IDLE now has an 'IDLE Dark' built-in text color theme. It is"
" more or less IDLE Classic inverted, with a cobalt blue background. Strings,"
" comments, keywords, ... are still green, red, orange, ... . To use it with "
"IDLEs released before November 2015, hit the 'Save as New Custom Theme' "
"button and enter a new name, such as 'Custom Dark'.  The custom theme will "
"work with any IDLE release, and can be modified."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24820`: IDLE现在有一个'IDLE Dark'内置文本颜色主题。它或多或少是IDLE "
"Classic的反转，背景为钴蓝色。字符串、注释、关键字等仍然是绿色、红色、橙色等。要在2015年11月之前发布的IDLEs中使用它，点击'保存为新的自定义主题'按钮并输入一个新名称，如'Custom"
" Dark'。自定义主题适用于任何IDLE版本，并且可以修改。"

#: ../NEWS:49610 ../NEWS:52124
msgid ""
":issue:`25224`: README.txt is now an idlelib index for IDLE developers and "
"curious users. The previous user content is now in the IDLE doc chapter. "
"'IDLE' now means 'Integrated Development and Learning Environment'."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25224`: "
"README.txt现在是IDLE开发者和好奇用户的idlelib索引。以前的用户内容现在在IDLE文档章节中。'IDLE'现在意味着'集成开发和学习环境'。"

#: ../NEWS:49614 ../NEWS:52128
msgid ""
":issue:`24820`: Users can now set breakpoint colors in Settings -> Custom "
"Highlighting. Original patch by Mark Roseman."
msgstr ":issue:`24820`: 用户现在可以在设置->自定义高亮中设置断点颜色。原始由Mark Roseman提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49617 ../NEWS:52131
msgid ""
":issue:`24972`: Inactive selection background now matches active selection "
"background, as configured by users, on all systems.  Found items are now "
"always highlighted on Windows.  Initial patch by Mark Roseman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24972`: "
"非活动选择背景现在在所有系统上都与用户配置的活动选择背景相匹配。在Windows上，找到的项目现在总是高亮显示。初始由Mark Roseman提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49621 ../NEWS:52135
msgid ""
":issue:`24570`: Idle: make calltip and completion boxes appear on Macs "
"affected by a tk regression.  Initial patch by Mark Roseman."
msgstr ":issue:`24570`: Idle：在受tk回归影响的Mac上显示调用提示和完成框。初始补丁由Mark Roseman提供。"

#: ../NEWS:49624 ../NEWS:52138
msgid ""
":issue:`24988`: Idle ScrolledList context menus (used in debugger) now work "
"on Mac Aqua. Patch by Mark Roseman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24988`: Idle ScrolledList上下文菜单（在调试器中使用）现在在Mac Aqua上工作。由Mark "
"Roseman提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49627 ../NEWS:52141
msgid ""
":issue:`24801`: Make right-click for context menu work on Mac Aqua. Patch by"
" Mark Roseman."
msgstr ":issue:`24801`: 使右键点击上下文菜单在Mac Aqua上工作。由Mark Roseman提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49630 ../NEWS:52144
msgid ""
":issue:`25173`: Associate tkinter messageboxes with a specific widget. For "
"Mac OSX, make them a 'sheet'.  Patch by Mark Roseman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25173`: 将tkinter消息框与特定小部件关联。对于Mac OSX，使它们成为'表单'。由Mark Roseman提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49633 ../NEWS:52147
msgid ""
":issue:`25198`: Enhance the initial html viewer now used for Idle Help. "
"Properly indent fixed-pitch text (patch by Mark Roseman). Give code snippet "
"a very Sphinx-like light blueish-gray background. Re-use initial width and "
"height set by users for shell and editor. When the Table of Contents (TOC) "
"menu is used, put the section header at the top of the screen."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25198`: 增强现在用于Idle Help的初始html查看器。正确缩进固定间距文本（由Mark "
"Roseman提供补丁）。给代码片段一个非常类似Sphinx的浅蓝灰色背景。重用用户为shell和编辑器设置的初始宽度和高度。当使用目录（TOC）菜单时，将部分标题放在屏幕顶部。"

#: ../NEWS:49640 ../NEWS:52154
msgid ":issue:`25225`: Condense and rewrite Idle doc section on text colors."
msgstr ":issue:`25225`: 压缩并重写Idle文档中关于文本颜色的部分。"

#: ../NEWS:49642 ../NEWS:52156
msgid ""
":issue:`21995`: Explain some differences between IDLE and console Python."
msgstr ":issue:`21995`: 解释IDLE和控制台Python之间的一些差异。"

#: ../NEWS:49644 ../NEWS:52158
msgid ""
":issue:`22820`: Explain need for *print* when running file from Idle editor."
msgstr ":issue:`22820`: 解释在从Idle编辑器运行文件时需要 *print* 的原因。"

#: ../NEWS:49646 ../NEWS:52160
msgid ""
":issue:`25224`: Doc: augment Idle feature list and no-subprocess section."
msgstr ":issue:`25224`: 文档：增加Idle功能列表和无子进程部分。"

#: ../NEWS:49648 ../NEWS:52162
msgid ""
":issue:`25219`: Update doc for Idle command line options. Some were missing "
"and notes were not correct."
msgstr ":issue:`25219`: 更新Idle命令行选项的文档。有些选项缺失，注释也不正确。"

#: ../NEWS:49651 ../NEWS:52165
msgid ""
":issue:`24861`: Most of idlelib is private and subject to change. Use "
"idleib.idle.* to start Idle. See idlelib.__init__.__doc__."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24861`: "
"大多数idlelib是私有的，可能会更改。使用idleib.idle.*来启动Idle。参见idlelib.__init__.__doc__。"

#: ../NEWS:49654 ../NEWS:52168
msgid ""
":issue:`25199`: Idle: add synchronization comments for future maintainers."
msgstr ":issue:`25199`: Idle：为未来的维护者添加同步注释。"

#: ../NEWS:49656
msgid ""
":issue:`16893`: Replace help.txt with help.html for Idle doc display. The "
"new idlelib/help.html is rstripped Doc/build/html/library/idle.html. It "
