msgstr ""
":issue:`16893`: 将 Idle 文档显示的 help.txt 替换为 help.html。新的 idlelib/help.html "
"是去除右侧空格的 Doc/build/html/library/idle.html。它看起来比 help.txt 更好，并将更好地记录发布的 "
"Idle。适用于此文件的 tkinter html 查看器是由 Rose Roseman 编写的。现在未使用的 "
"EditorWindow.HelpDialog 类和 helt.txt 文件已被弃用。"

#: ../NEWS:49663 ../NEWS:52177
msgid ""
":issue:`24199`: Deprecate unused idlelib.idlever with possible removal in "
"3.6."
msgstr ":issue:`24199`: 弃用未使用的 idlelib.idlever，可能在 3.6 中移除。"

#: ../NEWS:49665 ../NEWS:52179
msgid ""
":issue:`24790`: Remove extraneous code (which also create 2 & 3 conflicts)."
msgstr ":issue:`24790`: 移除多余的代码（这也造成了 2 和 3 的冲突）。"

#: ../NEWS:49670 ../NEWS:51628
msgid ""
":issue:`26736`: Used HTTPS for external links in the documentation if "
"possible."
msgstr ":issue:`26736`: 尽可能在文档中使用 HTTPS 作为外部链接。"

#: ../NEWS:49672 ../NEWS:51630
msgid ""
":issue:`6953`: Rework the Readline module documentation to group related "
"functions together, and add more details such as what underlying Readline "
