":issue:`6953`: 重新组织 Readline 模块文档，将相关函数分组，并添加更多细节，如访问哪些底层的 Readline 函数和变量。"

#: ../NEWS:49676 ../NEWS:51634
msgid ""
":issue:`23606`: Adds note to ctypes documentation regarding cdll.msvcrt."
msgstr ":issue:`23606`: 向 ctypes 文档添加关于 cdll.msvcrt 的注释。"

#: ../NEWS:49678 ../NEWS:52194
msgid ""
":issue:`24952`: Clarify the default size argument of stack_size() in the "
"\"threading\" and \"_thread\" modules. Patch from Mattip."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24952`: 阐明 \"threading\" 和 \"_thread\" 模块中 stack_size() 的默认 size "
