msgstr ""
":issue:`26014`: 更新 3.x 打包文档：* 现在在旧版页面中提供了指向新文档的 \"参见\" 链接 * 更新了指向 setuptools"
" 文档的链接"

#: ../NEWS:49688 ../NEWS:51646
msgid ""
":issue:`21916`: Added tests for the turtle module.  Patch by ingrid, Gregory"
" Loyse and Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21916`: 为 turtle 模块添加了测试。由 ingrid、Gregory Loyse 和 Jelle Zijlstra "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49691
msgid ""
":issue:`26295`: When using \"python3 -m test --testdir=TESTDIR\", regrtest "
"doesn't add \"test.\" prefix to test module names."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26295`: 当使用 \"python3 -m test --testdir=TESTDIR\" 时，regrtest "
"不会给测试模块名添加 \"test.\" 前缀。"

#: ../NEWS:49694 ../NEWS:51649
msgid ""
":issue:`26523`: The multiprocessing thread pool (multiprocessing.dummy.Pool)"
" was untested."
msgstr ":issue:`26523`: 多进程线程池（multiprocessing.dummy.Pool）未经测试。"

#: ../NEWS:49697 ../NEWS:51652
msgid ""
":issue:`26015`: Added new tests for pickling iterators of mutable sequences."
msgstr ":issue:`26015`: 为可变序列的迭代器的 pickle 操作添加了新测试。"

#: ../NEWS:49699 ../NEWS:51654
msgid ""
":issue:`26325`: Added test.support.check_no_resource_warning() to check that"
" no ResourceWarning is emitted."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26325`: 添加了 test.support.check_no_resource_warning() 来检查是否未发出 "
"ResourceWarning。"

#: ../NEWS:49702
msgid ""
":issue:`25940`: Changed test_ssl to use its internal local server more.  "
"This avoids relying on svn.python.org, which recently changed root "
"certificate."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25940`: 更改 test_ssl 以更多地使用其内部本地服务器。这避免依赖 svn.python.org，后者最近更改了根证书。"

#: ../NEWS:49705 ../NEWS:51660
msgid ""
":issue:`25616`: Tests for OrderedDict are extracted from test_collections "
"into separate file test_ordered_dict."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25616`: OrderedDict 的测试从 test_collections 中提取出来，放入单独的文件 "
"test_ordered_dict 中。"

#: ../NEWS:49708 ../NEWS:52208
msgid ":issue:`25449`: Added tests for OrderedDict subclasses."
msgstr ":issue:`25449`: 为 OrderedDict 的子类添加了测试。"

#: ../NEWS:49710
msgid ""
":issue:`25188`: Add -P/--pgo to test.regrtest to suppress error output when "
"running the test suite for the purposes of a PGO build. Initial patch by "
"Alecsandru Patrascu."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25188`: 添加 -P/--pgo 到 "
"test.regrtest，以在运行测试套件用于PGO构建时抑制错误输出。初始由Alecsandru Patrascu提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49714
msgid ""
":issue:`22806`: Add ``python -m test --list-tests`` command to list tests."
msgstr ":issue:`22806`: 添加 ``python -m test --list-tests`` 命令以列出测试。"

#: ../NEWS:49716
msgid ""
":issue:`18174`: ``python -m test --huntrleaks ...`` now also checks for leak"
" of file descriptors. Patch written by Richard Oudkerk."
msgstr ""
":issue:`18174`: ``python -m test --huntrleaks ...`` "
"现在也会检查文件描述符的泄漏。补丁由Richard Oudkerk编写。"

#: ../NEWS:49719
msgid ""
":issue:`25260`: Fix ``python -m test --coverage`` on Windows. Remove the "
"list of ignored directories."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25260`: 修复 ``python -m test --coverage`` 在Windows上的问题。移除忽略目录的列表。"

#: ../NEWS:49722 ../NEWS:52215
msgid ""
"``PCbuild\\rt.bat`` now accepts an unlimited number of arguments to pass "
"along to regrtest.py.  Previously there was a limit of 9."
msgstr "``PCbuild\\rt.bat`` 现在可以接受无限数量的参数传递给regrtest.py。之前有9个的限制。"

#: ../NEWS:49725 ../NEWS:51663
msgid ""
":issue:`26583`: Skip test_timestamp_overflow in test_import if bytecode "
"files cannot be written."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26583`: 如果无法写入字节码文件，则在test_import中跳过test_timestamp_overflow测试。"

#: ../NEWS:49731
msgid ""
":issue:`21277`: Don't try to link _ctypes with a ffi_convenience library."
msgstr ":issue:`21277`: 不要试图将_ctypes与ffi_convenience库链接。"

#: ../NEWS:49733 ../NEWS:51669
msgid ""
":issue:`26884`: Fix linking extension modules for cross builds. Patch by "
"Xavier de Gaye."
msgstr ":issue:`26884`: 修复交叉构建中扩展模块的链接问题。由Xavier de Gaye提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49736
msgid ""
":issue:`26932`: Fixed support of RTLD_* constants defined as enum values, "
"not via macros (in particular on Android).  Patch by Chi Hsuan Yen."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26932`: 修复了对定义为枚举值而非宏的RTLD_*常量的支持（特别是在Android上）。由Chi Hsuan Yen提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49739 ../NEWS:51672
msgid ""
":issue:`22359`: Disable the rules for running _freeze_importlib and pgen "
"when cross-compiling.  The output of these programs is normally saved with "
"the source code anyway, and is still regenerated when doing a native build. "
"Patch by Xavier de Gaye."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22359`: "
"在交叉编译时禁用运行_freeze_importlib和pgen的规则。这些程序的输出通常与源代码一起保存，并且在本地构建时仍会重新生成。由Xavier"
" de Gaye提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49744
msgid ""
":issue:`21668`: Link audioop, _datetime, _ctypes_test modules to libm, "
"except on Mac OS X. Patch written by Chi Hsuan Yen."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21668`: 将audioop、_datetime、_ctypes_test模块链接到libm，除了Mac OS X。补丁由Chi "
"Hsuan Yen编写。"

#: ../NEWS:49747 ../NEWS:51683
msgid ""
":issue:`25702`: A --with-lto configure option has been added that will "
"enable link time optimizations at build time during a make profile-opt. Some"
" compilers and toolchains are known to not produce stable code when using "
"LTO, be sure to test things thoroughly before relying on it. It can provide "
"a few % speed up over profile-opt alone."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25702`: 添加了一个--with-lto配置选项，该选项将在make profile-"
"opt期间启用构建时的链接时间优化。已知一些编译器和工具链在使用LTO时不会产生稳定的代码，因此在依赖它之前确保彻底测试。它可以比仅使用profile-"
"opt提供几个%的速度提升。"

#: ../NEWS:49753 ../NEWS:51689
msgid ""
":issue:`26624`: Adds validation of ucrtbase[d].dll version with warning for "
"old versions."
msgstr ":issue:`26624`: 添加了对ucrtbase[d].dll版本的验证，并对旧版本发出警告。"

#: ../NEWS:49756 ../NEWS:51692
msgid ""
":issue:`17603`: Avoid error about nonexistent fileblocks.o file by using a "
"lower-level check for st_blocks in struct stat."
msgstr ""
":issue:`17603`: 通过使用struct stat中st_blocks的低级检查，避免关于不存在的fileblocks.o文件的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:49759 ../NEWS:51695
msgid ""
":issue:`26079`: Fixing the build output folder for tix-8.4.3.6. Patch by "
"Bjoern Thiel."
msgstr ":issue:`26079`: 修复 tix-8.4.3.6 的构建输出文件夹。由 Bjoern Thiel 提交补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:49762 ../NEWS:51698
msgid ":issue:`26465`: Update Windows builds to use OpenSSL 1.0.2g."
msgstr ":issue:`26465`: 更新 Windows 构建以使用 OpenSSL 1.0.2g。"

#: ../NEWS:49764
msgid ""
":issue:`25348`: Added ``--pgo`` and ``--pgo-job`` arguments to "
"``PCbuild\\build.bat`` for building with Profile-Guided Optimization.  The "
"old ``PCbuild\\build_pgo.bat`` script is removed."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25348`: 添加了 ``--pgo`` 和 ``--pgo-job`` 参数到 ``PCbuild\\build.bat`` "
"以便使用 Profile-Guided Optimization 构建。旧的 ``PCbuild\\build_pgo.bat`` 脚本已被移除。"

#: ../NEWS:49768 ../NEWS:51709
msgid ""
":issue:`25827`: Add support for building with ICC to ``configure``, "
"including a new ``--with-icc`` flag."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25827`: 向 ``configure`` 添加了对使用 ICC 构建的支持，包括一个新的 ``--with-icc`` 标志。"

#: ../NEWS:49771 ../NEWS:51712
msgid ":issue:`25696`: Fix installation of Python on UNIX with make -j9."
msgstr ":issue:`25696`: 修复了在 UNIX 上使用 make -j9 安装 Python 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:49773 ../NEWS:52226
msgid ""
":issue:`24986`: It is now possible to build Python on Windows without errors"
" when external libraries are not available."
msgstr ":issue:`24986`: 现在可以在 Windows 上构建 Python 而不会在没有外部库的情况下出现错误。"

#: ../NEWS:49776 ../NEWS:51700
msgid ""
":issue:`24421`: Compile Modules/_math.c once, before building extensions. "
"Previously it could fail to compile properly if the math and cmath builds "
"were concurrent."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24421`: 在构建扩展之前，先编译 Modules/_math.c 一次。之前如果数学和 cmath "
"构建同时进行，可能会导致编译失败。"

#: ../NEWS:49780
msgid ""
":issue:`26465`: Update OS X 10.5+ 32-bit-only installer to build and link "
