"Miro Hrončok."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30657`: 修复了PyBytes_DecodeEscape中可能的整数溢出，:cve:`2017-1000158`。原始补丁由Jay"
" Bosamiya提供；由Miro Hrončok重新基于Python 3。"

