":issue:`22970`: asyncio: Fix inconsistency cancelling Condition.wait. Patch "
"by David Coles."
msgstr ":issue:`22970`: asyncio：修复取消Condition.wait时的不一致性。由David Coles提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:51600
msgid ""
":issue:`21703`: Add test for IDLE's undo delegator. Original patch by "
"Saimadhav Heblikar ."
msgstr ":issue:`21703`: 为IDLE的撤销委托器添加测试。原始由Saimadhav Heblikar提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:51636
msgid ""
":issue:`25500`: Fix documentation to not claim that __import__ is searched "
"for in the global scope."
msgstr ":issue:`25500`: 修正文档，不再声称__import__在全局范围内搜索。"

