"signed.pythontest.net。这避免了对svn.python.org的依赖，该网站最近更改了根证书。"

#: ../NEWS:51680
msgid ""
":issue:`21668`: Link audioop, _datetime, _ctypes_test modules to libm, "
"except on Mac OS X. Patch written by Xavier de Gaye."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21668`: 将audioop、_datetime、_ctypes_test模块链接到libm，Mac OS "
"X除外。补丁由Xavier de Gaye编写。"

#: ../NEWS:51704
