"脚本现已弃用，仅调用``PCbuild\\build.bat --pgo %*``。"

#: ../NEWS:51762
msgid "Python 3.5.1 final"
msgstr "Python 3.5.1 正式版"

#: ../NEWS:51764
msgid "*Release date: 2015-12-06*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2015-12-06*"

#: ../NEWS:51775
msgid ""
":issue:`25715`: Python 3.5.1 installer shows wrong upgrade path and "
"incorrect logic for launcher detection."
msgstr ":issue:`25715`: Python 3.5.1安装程序显示错误的升级路径和启动器检测逻辑。"

#: ../NEWS:51780
msgid "Python 3.5.1 release candidate 1"
msgstr "Python 3.5.1 rc1"

#: ../NEWS:51782
msgid "*Release date: 2015-11-22*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2015-11-22*"

#: ../NEWS:51841
msgid ""
":issue:`25182`: The stdprinter (used as sys.stderr before the io module is "
"imported at startup) now uses the backslashreplace error handler."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25182`: "
"stdprinter（在启动时导入io模块之前用作sys.stderr）现在使用backslashreplace错误处理程序。"

#: ../NEWS:51844
msgid ""
":issue:`25131`: Make the line number and column offset of set/dict literals "
"and comprehensions correspond to the opening brace."
msgstr ":issue:`25131`: 使集合/字典字面量和推导式的行号和列偏移与开括号对应。"

#: ../NEWS:51847
msgid ""
":issue:`25150`: Hide the private :samp:`_Py_atomic_{xxx}` symbols from the "
"public Python.h header to fix a compilation error with OpenMP. "
"PyThreadState_GET() becomes an alias to PyThreadState_Get() to avoid ABI "
"incompatibilities."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25150`: 从公共Python.h头文件中隐藏私有的 :samp:`_Py_atomic_{xxx}` "
"符号，以修复与OpenMP的编译错误。PyThreadState_GET()成为PyThreadState_Get()的别名，以避免ABI不兼容。"

#: ../NEWS:51871
msgid ""
":issue:`25590`: In the Readline completer, only call getattr() once per "
"attribute."
msgstr ":issue:`25590`: 在Readline completer中，每个属性只调用一次getattr()。"

#: ../NEWS:51949
msgid ""
":issue:`24483`: C implementation of functools.lru_cache() now calculates "
"key's hash only once."
msgstr ":issue:`24483`: functools.lru_cache()的C实现现在只计算一次key的哈希。"

#: ../NEWS:51952
msgid ""
":issue:`22958`: Constructor and update method of weakref.WeakValueDictionary"
" now accept the self and the dict keyword arguments."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22958`: weakref.WeakValueDictionary的构造函数和更新方法现在接受self和dict关键字参数。"

#: ../NEWS:51955
msgid ""
":issue:`22609`: Constructor of collections.UserDict now accepts the self "
"keyword argument."
msgstr ":issue:`22609`: collections.UserDict的构造函数现在接受self关键字参数。"

#: ../NEWS:51958
msgid ":issue:`25111`: Fixed comparison of traceback.FrameSummary."
msgstr ":issue:`25111`: 修复了traceback.FrameSummary的比较。"

#: ../NEWS:51960
msgid ""
":issue:`25262`: Added support for BINBYTES8 opcode in Python implementation "
"of unpickler. Highest 32 bits of 64-bit size for BINUNICODE8 and BINBYTES8 "
"opcodes no longer silently ignored on 32-bit platforms in C implementation."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25262`: "
"在Python的解pickler实现中增加了对BINBYTES8操作码的支持。在C实现中，对于BINUNICODE8和BINBYTES8操作码的64位大小的高32位不再在32位平台上被静默忽略。"

#: ../NEWS:51965
msgid ""
":issue:`25034`: Fix string.Formatter problem with auto-numbering and nested "
"format_specs. Patch by Anthon van der Neut."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25034`: 修复了string.Formatter在自动编号和嵌套format_specs时的问题。由Anthon van der "
"Neut提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:51968
msgid ""
":issue:`25233`: Rewrite the guts of asyncio.Queue and asyncio.Semaphore to "
"be more understandable and correct."
msgstr ":issue:`25233`: 重写了asyncio.Queue和asyncio.Semaphore的内部实现，使其更加易懂和正确。"

#: ../NEWS:51977
msgid ""
":issue:`23329`: Allow the ssl module to be built with older versions of "
"LibreSSL."
msgstr ":issue:`23329`: 允许ssl模块与旧版本的LibreSSL一起构建。"

#: ../NEWS:51980
msgid "Prevent overflow in _Unpickler_Read."
msgstr "防止_Unpickler_Read中的溢出。"

#: ../NEWS:51982
msgid ""
":issue:`25047`: The XML encoding declaration written by Element Tree now "
"respects the letter case given by the user. This restores the ability to "
"write encoding names in uppercase like \"UTF-8\", which worked in Python 2."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25047`: Element "
"Tree写入的XML编码声明现在尊重用户给出的大小写。这恢复了以大写形式写入编码名称（如“UTF-8”）的能力，这在Python 2中是可行的。"

#: ../NEWS:51986
msgid ""
":issue:`25135`: Make deque_clear() safer by emptying the deque before "
"clearing. This helps avoid possible reentrancy issues."
msgstr ":issue:`25135`: 通过在清除前清空deque来使deque_clear()更安全。这有助于避免可能的可重入性问题。"

#: ../NEWS:51989
msgid ""
":issue:`19143`: platform module now reads Windows version from kernel32.dll "
"to avoid compatibility shims."
msgstr ":issue:`19143`: platform模块现在从kernel32.dll读取Windows版本以避免兼容性垫片。"

#: ../NEWS:51992
msgid ""
":issue:`25092`: Fix datetime.strftime() failure when errno was already set "
"to EINVAL."
msgstr ":issue:`25092`: 修复了当errno已经设置为EINVAL时datetime.strftime()失败的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:51995
msgid ""
":issue:`23517`: Fix rounding in fromtimestamp() and utcfromtimestamp() "
"methods of datetime.datetime: microseconds are now rounded to nearest with "
"ties going to nearest even integer (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), instead of being "
"rounding towards minus infinity (ROUND_FLOOR). It's important that these "
"methods use the same rounding mode than datetime.timedelta to keep the "
"property: (datetime(1970,1,1) + timedelta(seconds=t)) == "
"datetime.utcfromtimestamp(t). It also the rounding mode used by round(float)"
" for example."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23517`: "
"修复了datetime.datetime的fromtimestamp()和utcfromtimestamp()方法中的舍入问题：微秒现在被舍入到最接近的偶数（ROUND_HALF_EVEN），而不是向负无穷舍入（ROUND_FLOOR）。重要的是，这些方法使用与datetime.timedelta相同的舍入模式，以保持属性：(datetime(1970,1,1)"
" + timedelta(seconds=t)) == "
"datetime.utcfromtimestamp(t)。这也是round(float)使用的舍入模式。"

#: ../NEWS:52004
msgid ""
":issue:`25155`: Fix datetime.datetime.now() and datetime.datetime.utcnow() "
"on Windows to support date after year 2038. It was a regression introduced "
"in Python 3.5.0."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25155`: "
"修复了Windows上的datetime.datetime.now()和datetime.datetime.utcnow()以支持2038年之后的日期。这是在Python"
" 3.5.0中引入的回归问题。"

#: ../NEWS:52008
msgid ""
":issue:`25108`: Omitted internal frames in traceback functions "
"print_stack(), format_stack(), and extract_stack() called without arguments."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25108`: "
"在没有参数的情况下调用traceback函数print_stack()、format_stack()和extract_stack()时省略内部帧。"

#: ../NEWS:52011
msgid ""
":issue:`25118`: Fix a regression of Python 3.5.0 in os.waitpid() on Windows."
msgstr ":issue:`25118`: 修复了Python 3.5.0在Windows上os.waitpid()中的一个回归问题。"

#: ../NEWS:52013
msgid ""
":issue:`24684`: socket.socket.getaddrinfo() now calls "
"PyUnicode_AsEncodedString() instead of calling the encode() method of the "
"host, to handle correctly custom string with an encode() method which "
"doesn't return a byte string. The encoder of the IDNA codec is now called "
"directly instead of calling the encode() method of the string."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24684`: socket.socket.getaddrinfo() 现在调用 PyUnicode_AsEncodedString()"
" 而不是调用主机的 encode() 方法，以正确处理具有不返回字节字符串的 encode() 方法的自定义字符串。现在直接调用 IDNA "
"编解码器的编码器，而不是调用字符串的 encode() 方法。"

#: ../NEWS:52019
msgid ":issue:`25060`: Correctly compute stack usage of the BUILD_MAP opcode."
msgstr ":issue:`25060`: 正确计算 BUILD_MAP 操作码的堆栈使用情况。"

#: ../NEWS:52021
msgid ""
":issue:`24857`: Comparing call_args to a long sequence now correctly returns"
" a boolean result instead of raising an exception.  Patch by A Kaptur."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24857`: 现在将 call_args 与长序列比较时正确返回布尔结果，而不是引发异常。由 A Kaptur 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:52024
msgid ""
":issue:`23144`: Make sure that HTMLParser.feed() returns all the data, even "
"when convert_charrefs is True."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23144`: 确保即使 convert_charrefs 为 True，HTMLParser.feed() 也能返回所有数据。"

#: ../NEWS:52027
msgid ""
":issue:`24982`: shutil.make_archive() with the \"zip\" format now adds "
"entries for directories (including empty directories) in ZIP file."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24982`: 使用 \"zip\" 格式的 shutil.make_archive() 现在在 ZIP "
"文件中为目录（包括空目录）添加条目。"

#: ../NEWS:52030
msgid ""
":issue:`25019`: Fixed a crash caused by setting non-string key of expat "
"parser. Based on patch by John Leitch."
msgstr ":issue:`25019`: 修复了由设置 expat 解析器的非字符串键引起的崩溃。基于 John Leitch 的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:52033
msgid ""
":issue:`16180`: Exit pdb if file has syntax error, instead of trapping user "
"in an infinite loop.  Patch by Xavier de Gaye."
msgstr ":issue:`16180`: 如果文件有语法错误，退出 pdb，而不是将用户困在无限循环中。由 Xavier de Gaye 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:52036
msgid ""
":issue:`24891`: Fix a race condition at Python startup if the file "
"descriptor of stdin (0), stdout (1) or stderr (2) is closed while Python is "
"creating sys.stdin, sys.stdout and sys.stderr objects. These attributes are "
"now set to None if the creation of the object failed, instead of raising an "
"OSError exception. Initial patch written by Marco Paolini."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24891`: 修复 Python 启动时如果标准输入（0）、标准输出（1）或标准错误（2）的文件描述符在 Python 创建 "
"sys.stdin、sys.stdout 和 sys.stderr 对象时被关闭导致的竞态条件。如果对象创建失败，这些属性现在设置为 "
"None，而不是引发 OSError 异常。初始补丁由 Marco Paolini 编写。"

#: ../NEWS:52042
msgid ""
":issue:`24992`: Fix error handling and a race condition (related to garbage "
"collection) in collections.OrderedDict constructor."
msgstr ":issue:`24992`: 修复 collections.OrderedDict 构造函数中的错误处理和与垃圾收集相关的竞态条件。"

#: ../NEWS:52045
msgid ""
":issue:`24881`: Fixed setting binary mode in Python implementation of FileIO"
" on Windows and Cygwin.  Patch from Akira Li."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24881`: 在 Windows 和 Cygwin 上修复了 Python 实现的 FileIO 中设置二进制模式的问题。补丁来自 "
"Akira Li。"

#: ../NEWS:52061
msgid ""
":issue:`21112`: Fix regression in unittest.expectedFailure on subclasses. "
"Patch from Berker Peksag."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21112`: 修复 unittest.expectedFailure 在子类上的回归问题。补丁来自 Berker Peksag。"

#: ../NEWS:52064
msgid ""
":issue:`24764`: cgi.FieldStorage.read_multi() now ignores the Content-Length"
" header in part headers. Patch written by Peter Landry and reviewed by "
"Pierre Quentel."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24764`: cgi.FieldStorage.read_multi() 现在忽略部分头中的 Content-Length 头。补丁由"
" Peter Landry 编写，Pierre Quentel 审阅。"

#: ../NEWS:52068 ../NEWS:52333
msgid ""
":issue:`24913`: Fix overrun error in deque.index(). Found by John Leitch and"
" Bryce Darling."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24913`: 修复 deque.index() 中的溢出错误。由 John Leitch 和 Bryce Darling 发现。"

#: ../NEWS:52071
msgid ""
":issue:`24774`: Fix docstring in http.server.test. Patch from Chiu-Hsiang "
"Hsu."
msgstr ":issue:`24774`: 修复 http.server.test 中的文档字符串。补丁来自 Chiu-Hsiang Hsu。"

#: ../NEWS:52073
msgid ""
":issue:`21159`: Improve message in "
"configparser.InterpolationMissingOptionError. Patch from Łukasz Langa."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21159`: 改进 configparser.InterpolationMissingOptionError 中的消息。补丁来自 "
"Łukasz Langa。"

#: ../NEWS:52076
msgid ""
":issue:`20362`: Honour TestCase.longMessage correctly in assertRegex. Patch "
"from Ilia Kurenkov."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20362`: 在 assertRegex 中正确遵循 TestCase.longMessage。补丁来自 Ilia Kurenkov。"

#: ../NEWS:52079
msgid ""
":issue:`23572`: Fixed functools.singledispatch on classes with false "
"metaclasses.  Patch by Ethan Furman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23572`: 修复了 functools.singledispatch 在具有假元类的类上的问题。补丁来自 Ethan Furman。"

#: ../NEWS:52082
msgid "asyncio: ensure_future() now accepts awaitable objects."
msgstr "asyncio: ensure_future() 现在接受可等待对象。"

#: ../NEWS:52170
msgid ""
":issue:`16893`: Replace help.txt with help.html for Idle doc display. The "
"new idlelib/help.html is rstripped Doc/build/html/library/idle.html. It "
"looks better than help.txt and will better document Idle as released. The "
"tkinter html viewer that works for this file was written by Mark Roseman. "
"The now unused EditorWindow.HelpDialog class and helt.txt file are "
"deprecated."
msgstr ""
":issue:`16893`: 用 help.html 替换 help.txt 用于 Idle 文档显示。新的 idlelib/help.html 是从"
" Doc/build/html/library/idle.html 去除右侧空白的版本。它看起来比 help.txt 更好，并且能更好地记录发布的 "
"Idle。为此文件工作的 tkinter html 查看器由 Mark Roseman 编写。现在未使用的 "
"EditorWindow.HelpDialog 类和 helt.txt 文件已被弃用。"

#: ../NEWS:52187
msgid ""
":issue:`12067`: Rewrite Comparisons section in the Expressions chapter of "
"the language reference. Some of the details of comparing mixed types were "
"incorrect or ambiguous. NotImplemented is only relevant at a lower level "
"than the Expressions chapter. Added details of comparing range() objects, "
"and default behaviour and consistency suggestions for user-defined classes. "
"Patch from Andy Maier."
msgstr ""
":issue:`12067`: 重写语言参考中表达式章节的比较部分。一些关于比较混合类型的细节不正确或含糊。NotImplemented "
"仅在比表达式章节更低的层次相关。增加了比较 range() 对象的细节，以及用户定义类的默认行为和一致性建议。补丁来自 Andy Maier。"

#: ../NEWS:52197
msgid ""
":issue:`23725`: Overhaul tempfile docs. Note deprecated status of mktemp. "
"Patch from Zbigniew Jędrzejewski-Szmek."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23725`: 彻底修改 tempfile 文档。注意 mktemp 的弃用状态。补丁来自 Zbigniew Jędrzejewski-"
"Szmek。"

#: ../NEWS:52200
msgid ""
":issue:`24808`: Update the types of some PyTypeObject fields.  Patch by "
"Joseph Weston."
msgstr ":issue:`24808`: 更新一些 PyTypeObject 字段的类型。补丁来自 Joseph Weston。"

#: ../NEWS:52203
msgid ""
":issue:`22812`: Fix unittest discovery examples. Patch from Pam McA'Nulty."
msgstr ":issue:`22812`: 修复 unittest 发现示例。补丁来自 Pam McA'Nulty。"

#: ../NEWS:52210
msgid ""
":issue:`25099`: Make test_compileall not fail when an entry on sys.path "
"cannot be written to (commonly seen in administrative installs on Windows)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25099`: 使 test_compileall 在无法写入 sys.path 上的条目时不失败（在 Windows "
"的管理安装中常见）。"

#: ../NEWS:52213
msgid ":issue:`23919`: Prevents assert dialogs appearing in the test suite."
msgstr ":issue:`23919`: 防止测试套件中出现断言对话框。"

#: ../NEWS:52221
msgid ""
":issue:`24915`: Add LLVM support for PGO builds and use the test suite to "
"generate the profile data. Initial patch by Alecsandru Patrascu of Intel."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24915`: 为 PGO 构建添加 LLVM 支持，并使用测试套件生成配置文件数据。初始补丁来自 Intel 的 Alecsandru"
" Patrascu。"

#: ../NEWS:52224
msgid ":issue:`24910`: Windows MSIs now have unique display names."
msgstr ":issue:`24910`: Windows MSI 现在具有唯一的显示名称。"

#: ../NEWS:52232
msgid ""
":issue:`25450`: Updates shortcuts to start Python in installation directory."
msgstr ":issue:`25450`: 更新快捷方式以在安装目录中启动 Python。"

#: ../NEWS:52234
msgid ""
":issue:`25164`: Changes default all-users install directory to match per-"
"user directory."
msgstr ":issue:`25164`: 将默认所有用户安装目录更改为与每用户目录匹配。"

#: ../NEWS:52237
msgid ""
":issue:`25143`: Improves installer error messages for unsupported platforms."
msgstr ":issue:`25143`: 改进了对不支持平台的安装程序错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:52239
msgid ""
":issue:`25163`: Display correct directory in installer when using non-"
"default settings."
msgstr ":issue:`25163`: 在使用非默认设置时，在安装程序中显示正确的目录。"

#: ../NEWS:52242
msgid ""
":issue:`25361`: Disables use of SSE2 instructions in Windows 32-bit build"
msgstr ":issue:`25361`: 在Windows 32位构建中禁用SSE2指令的使用。"

#: ../NEWS:52244
msgid ""
":issue:`25089`: Adds logging to installer for case where launcher is not "
"selected on upgrade."
msgstr ":issue:`25089`: 在升级时未选择启动器的情况下，为安装程序添加日志记录。"

#: ../NEWS:52247
msgid ""
":issue:`25165`: Windows uninstallation should not remove launcher if other "
"versions remain"
msgstr ":issue:`25165`: 如果其他版本仍存在，Windows卸载不应移除启动器。"

#: ../NEWS:52250
msgid ":issue:`25112`: py.exe launcher is missing icons"
msgstr ":issue:`25112`: py.exe启动器缺少图标。"

#: ../NEWS:52252
msgid ":issue:`25102`: Windows installer does not precompile for -O or -OO."
msgstr ":issue:`25102`: Windows安装程序未预编译-O或-OO。"

#: ../NEWS:52254
msgid ""
":issue:`25081`: Makes Back button in installer go back to upgrade page when "
"upgrading."
msgstr ":issue:`25081`: 在升级时，使安装程序中的返回按钮返回到升级页面。"

#: ../NEWS:52257
msgid ":issue:`25091`: Increases font size of the installer."
msgstr ":issue:`25091`: 增加安装程序的字体大小。"

#: ../NEWS:52259
msgid ""
":issue:`25126`: Clarifies that the non-web installer will download some "
"components."
msgstr ":issue:`25126`: 澄清非Web安装程序将下载一些组件。"

#: ../NEWS:52262
msgid ""
":issue:`25213`: Restores requestedExecutionLevel to manifest to disable UAC "
"virtualization."
msgstr ":issue:`25213`: 恢复manifest中的requestedExecutionLevel以禁用UAC虚拟化。"

#: ../NEWS:52274
msgid "Python 3.5.0 final"
msgstr "Python 3.5.0 正式版"

#: ../NEWS:52276
msgid "*Release date: 2015-09-13*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2015-09-13*"

#: ../NEWS:52281
msgid ""
":issue:`25071`: Windows installer should not require TargetDir parameter "
"when installing quietly."
msgstr ":issue:`25071`: Windows安装程序在静默安装时不应需要TargetDir参数。"

#: ../NEWS:52286
msgid "Python 3.5.0 release candidate 4"
msgstr "Python 3.5.0 rc4"

#: ../NEWS:52288
msgid "*Release date: 2015-09-09*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2015-09-09*"

#: ../NEWS:52293
msgid ":issue:`25029`: Fixes MemoryError in test_strptime."
msgstr ":issue:`25029`: 修复test_strptime中的MemoryError。"

#: ../NEWS:52298
msgid ""
":issue:`25027`: Reverts partial-static build options and adds "
"vcruntime140.dll to Windows installation."
msgstr ":issue:`25027`: 恢复部分静态构建选项并将vcruntime140.dll添加到Windows安装中。"

#: ../NEWS:52303
msgid "Python 3.5.0 release candidate 3"
msgstr "Python 3.5.0 rc3"

#: ../NEWS:52305
msgid "*Release date: 2015-09-07*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2015-09-07*"

#: ../NEWS:52310
msgid ""
":issue:`24305`: Prevent import subsystem stack frames from being counted by "
"the warnings.warn(stacklevel=) parameter."
