msgstr ""
":issue:`24989`: 如果设置的位置超出大小，修复BytesIO.readline()中的缓冲区过度读取。基于John Leitch的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:52338
msgid "Python 3.5.0 release candidate 2"
msgstr "Python 3.5.0 rc2"

#: ../NEWS:52340
msgid "*Release date: 2015-08-25*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2015-08-25*"

