" name resolution scheme Python used prior to the introduction of lexical "
"scoping for function namespaces. Patch by Ivan Levkivskyi."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24129`: "
"明确名称解析的参考文档。这包括移除读者会熟悉Python在引入函数命名空间的词法作用域之前使用的名称解析方案的假设。由Ivan "
"Levkivskyi提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:52442
msgid ":issue:`20769`: Improve reload() docs. Patch by Dorian Pula."
msgstr ":issue:`20769`: 改进reload()文档。由Dorian Pula提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:52444
msgid ""
":issue:`23589`: Remove duplicate sentence from the FAQ.  Patch by Yongzhi "
"Pan."
