#: ../NEWS:52458
msgid "Python 3.5.0 beta 4"
msgstr "Python 3.5.0 beta 4"

#: ../NEWS:52460
msgid "*Release date: 2015-07-26*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2015-07-26*"

#: ../NEWS:52465
msgid ""
":issue:`23573`: Restored optimization of bytes.rfind() and bytearray.rfind()"
" for single-byte argument on Linux."
msgstr ":issue:`23573`: 在Linux上恢复了bytes.rfind()和bytearray.rfind()对单字节参数的优化。"

#: ../NEWS:52468
msgid ":issue:`24569`: Make :pep:`448` dictionary evaluation more consistent."
msgstr ":issue:`24569`: 使 :pep:`448` 字典评估更加一致。"

#: ../NEWS:52470
msgid ":issue:`24583`: Fix crash when set is mutated while being updated."
msgstr ":issue:`24583`: 修复集合在被更新时发生突变导致的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:52472
msgid ":issue:`24407`: Fix crash when dict is mutated while being updated."
msgstr ":issue:`24407`: 修复字典在被更新时发生突变导致的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:52474
msgid ""
":issue:`24619`: New approach for tokenizing async/await. As a consequence, "
"it is now possible to have one-line 'async def foo(): await ..' functions."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24619`: 新的异步/等待标记化方法。因此，现在可以有一行的'async def foo(): await ..'函数。"

#: ../NEWS:52477
msgid ""
":issue:`24687`: Plug refleak on SyntaxError in function parameters "
"annotations."
msgstr ":issue:`24687`: 修复函数参数注释中SyntaxError的反射泄漏。"

#: ../NEWS:52479
msgid ""
":issue:`15944`: memoryview: Allow arbitrary formats when casting to bytes. "
"Patch by Martin Panter."
msgstr ":issue:`15944`: memoryview：在转换为字节时允许任意格式。由Martin Panter提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:52485
msgid ""
":issue:`23441`: rcompleter now prints a tab character instead of displaying "
