msgstr ":issue:`24620`: Random.setstate()现在验证state最后一个元素的值。"

#: ../NEWS:52504
msgid ""
":issue:`22485`: Fixed an issue that caused ``inspect.getsource`` to return "
"incorrect results on nested functions."
msgstr ":issue:`22485`: 修复了导致 ``inspect.getsource`` 在嵌套函数上返回不正确结果的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:52507
msgid ""
":issue:`22153`: Improve unittest docs. Patch from Martin Panter and "
"evilzero."
msgstr ":issue:`22153`: 改进unittest文档。补丁来自Martin Panter和evilzero。"

#: ../NEWS:52509
msgid ""
":issue:`24580`: Symbolic group references to open group in re patterns now "
"are explicitly forbidden as well as numeric group references."
msgstr ":issue:`24580`: 在re模式中，现在明确禁止对开放组的符号组引用以及数字组引用。"

#: ../NEWS:52512
msgid ":issue:`24206`: Fixed __eq__ and __ne__ methods of inspect classes."
msgstr ":issue:`24206`: 修复了inspect类的__eq__和__ne__方法。"

#: ../NEWS:52514
msgid ""
":issue:`24631`: Fixed regression in the timeit module with multiline setup."
msgstr ":issue:`24631`: 修复了timeit模块中多行设置的回归问题。"

#: ../NEWS:52522
msgid ":issue:`24608`: chunk.Chunk.read() now always returns bytes, not str."
msgstr ":issue:`24608`: chunk.Chunk.read()现在总是返回字节，而不是str。"

#: ../NEWS:52524
msgid ":issue:`18684`: Fixed reading out of the buffer in the re module."
msgstr ":issue:`18684`: 修复了re模块中读取缓冲区的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:52526
msgid ""
":issue:`24259`: tarfile now raises a ReadError if an archive is truncated "
"inside a data segment."
msgstr ":issue:`24259`: 如果存档在数据段内被截断，tarfile现在会引发ReadError。"

#: ../NEWS:52529
msgid ""
":issue:`15014`: SMTP.auth() and SMTP.login() now support RFC 4954's optional"
