msgstr ""
":issue:`15014`: SMTP.auth()和SMTP.login()现在支持RFC 4954中SMTP AUTH命令的可选初始响应参数。"

#: ../NEWS:52532
msgid ""
":issue:`24669`: Fix inspect.getsource() for 'async def' functions. Patch by "
"Kai Groner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24669`: 修复inspect.getsource()对于'async def'函数的问题。由Kai Groner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:52535
msgid ":issue:`24688`: ast.get_docstring() for 'async def' functions."
msgstr ":issue:`24688`: ast.get_docstring()对于'async def'函数。"

#: ../NEWS:52540
msgid ""
":issue:`24603`: Update Windows builds and OS X 10.5 installer to use OpenSSL"
" 1.0.2d."
msgstr ":issue:`24603`: 更新Windows构建和OS X 10.5安装程序以使用OpenSSL 1.0.2d。"

#: ../NEWS:52545
msgid "Python 3.5.0 beta 3"
msgstr "Python 3.5.0 beta 3"

#: ../NEWS:52547
msgid "*Release date: 2015-07-05*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2015-07-05*"

#: ../NEWS:52552
msgid ""
":issue:`24467`: Fixed possible buffer over-read in bytearray. The bytearray "
"object now always allocates place for trailing null byte and it's buffer now"
" is always null-terminated."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24467`: 修复了 bytearray 中可能的缓冲区越界读取问题。bytearray "
"对象现在总是为尾随的空字节分配空间，其缓冲区现在总是以空字符结尾。"

#: ../NEWS:52556
msgid "Upgrade to Unicode 8.0.0."
msgstr "升级到 Unicode 8.0.0。"

#: ../NEWS:52558
msgid ":issue:`24345`: Add Py_tp_finalize slot for the stable ABI."
msgstr ":issue:`24345`: 为稳定 ABI 添加 Py_tp_finalize 插槽。"

#: ../NEWS:52560
msgid ""
":issue:`24400`: Introduce a distinct type for :pep:`492` coroutines; add "
"types.CoroutineType, inspect.getcoroutinestate, inspect.getcoroutinelocals; "
"coroutines no longer use CO_GENERATOR flag; sys.set_coroutine_wrapper works "
"only for 'async def' coroutines; inspect.iscoroutine no longer uses "
"collections.abc.Coroutine, it's intended to test for pure 'async def' "
"coroutines only; add new opcode: GET_YIELD_FROM_ITER; fix generators wrapper"
" used in types.coroutine to be instance of collections.abc.Generator; "
"collections.abc.Awaitable and collections.abc.Coroutine can no longer be "
"used to detect generator-based coroutines--use inspect.isawaitable instead."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24400`: 为 :pep:`492` 协程引入一个独特的类型；添加 types.CoroutineType, "
"inspect.getcoroutinestate, inspect.getcoroutinelocals；协程不再使用 CO_GENERATOR "
"标志；sys.set_coroutine_wrapper 仅适用于 'async def' 协程；inspect.iscoroutine 不再使用 "
"collections.abc.Coroutine，它旨在仅测试纯 'async def' "
"协程；添加新的操作码：GET_YIELD_FROM_ITER；修复 types.coroutine 中使用的生成器包装器为 "
"collections.abc.Generator 的实例；collections.abc.Awaitable 和 "
"collections.abc.Coroutine 不能再用于检测基于生成器的协程——请使用 inspect.isawaitable 代替。"

#: ../NEWS:52571
msgid ""
":issue:`24450`: Add gi_yieldfrom to generators and cr_await to coroutines. "
"Contributed by Benno Leslie and Yury Selivanov."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24450`: 向生成器添加 gi_yieldfrom 和向协程添加 cr_await。由 Benno Leslie 和 Yury "
"Selivanov 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:52574
msgid ""
":issue:`19235`: Add new RecursionError exception. Patch by Georg Brandl."
msgstr ":issue:`19235`: 添加新的 RecursionError 异常。由 Georg Brandl 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:52579
msgid ""
":issue:`21750`: mock_open.read_data can now be read from each instance, as "
"it could in Python 3.3."
msgstr ":issue:`21750`: mock_open.read_data 现在可以从每个实例中读取，就像在 Python 3.3 中一样。"

#: ../NEWS:52582
msgid ""
":issue:`24552`: Fix use after free in an error case of the _pickle module."
msgstr ":issue:`24552`: 修复 _pickle 模块在错误情况下的释放后使用问题。"

#: ../NEWS:52584
msgid ""
":issue:`24514`: tarfile now tolerates number fields consisting of only "
"whitespace."
msgstr ":issue:`24514`: tarfile 现在容忍仅由空白组成的数字字段。"

#: ../NEWS:52587
msgid ""
":issue:`19176`: Fixed doctype() related bugs in C implementation of "
"ElementTree. A deprecation warning no longer issued by XMLParser subclass "
"with default doctype() method.  Direct call of doctype() now issues a "
"warning.  Parser's doctype() now is not called if target's doctype() is "
"called.  Based on patch by Martin Panter."
msgstr ""
":issue:`19176`: 修复了 ElementTree 的 C 实现中与 doctype() 相关的错误。XMLParser "
"子类不再发出带有默认 doctype() 方法的弃用警告。直接调用 doctype() 现在会发出警告。如果目标的 doctype() 被调用，解析器的"
" doctype() 现在不会被调用。基于 Martin Panter 的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:52593
msgid ""
":issue:`20387`: Restore semantic round-trip correctness in "
"tokenize/untokenize for tab-indented blocks."
msgstr ":issue:`20387`: 在 tab 缩进的块中恢复 tokenize/untokenize 的语义往返正确性。"

#: ../NEWS:52596
msgid ""
":issue:`24456`: Fixed possible buffer over-read in adpcm2lin() and "
"lin2adpcm() functions of the audioop module."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24456`: 修复了 audioop 模块的 adpcm2lin() 和 lin2adpcm() 函数中可能的缓冲区越界读取问题。"

#: ../NEWS:52599
msgid ""
":issue:`24336`: The contextmanager decorator now works with functions with "
"keyword arguments called \"func\" and \"self\".  Patch by Martin Panter."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24336`: "
"contextmanager装饰器现在可以与名为\"func\"和\"self\"的关键字参数的函数一起工作。由Martin Panter提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:52602
msgid ""
":issue:`24522`: Fix possible integer overflow in json accelerator module."
msgstr ":issue:`24522`: 修复json加速模块中可能的整数溢出问题。"

#: ../NEWS:52604
msgid ""
":issue:`24489`: ensure a previously set C errno doesn't disturb "
"cmath.polar()."
msgstr ":issue:`24489`: 确保先前设置的C errno不会干扰cmath.polar()。"

#: ../NEWS:52606
msgid ""
":issue:`24408`: Fixed AttributeError in measure() and metrics() methods of "
"tkinter.Font."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24408`: 修复了tkinter.Font的measure()和metrics()方法中的AttributeError。"

#: ../NEWS:52609
msgid ""
":issue:`14373`: C implementation of functools.lru_cache() now can be used "
"with methods."
msgstr ":issue:`14373`: functools.lru_cache()的C实现现在可以与方法一起使用。"

#: ../NEWS:52612
msgid ":issue:`24347`: Set KeyError if PyDict_GetItemWithError returns NULL."
msgstr ":issue:`24347`: 如果PyDict_GetItemWithError返回NULL，则设置KeyError。"

#: ../NEWS:52614
msgid ":issue:`24348`: Drop superfluous incref/decref."
msgstr ":issue:`24348`: 删除多余的incref/decref。"

#: ../NEWS:52616
msgid ":issue:`24359`: Check for changed OrderedDict size during iteration."
msgstr ":issue:`24359`: 在迭代期间检查OrderedDict大小的变化。"

#: ../NEWS:52618
msgid ":issue:`24368`: Support keyword arguments in OrderedDict methods."
msgstr ":issue:`24368`: 支持OrderedDict方法中的关键字参数。"

#: ../NEWS:52620
msgid ":issue:`24362`: Simplify the C OrderedDict fast nodes resize logic."
msgstr ":issue:`24362`: 简化C OrderedDict快速节点调整大小的逻辑。"

#: ../NEWS:52622
msgid ":issue:`24377`: Fix a ref leak in OrderedDict.__repr__."
msgstr ":issue:`24377`: 修复OrderedDict.__repr__中的引用泄漏。"

#: ../NEWS:52624
msgid ":issue:`24369`: Defend against key-changes during iteration."
msgstr ":issue:`24369`: 防御迭代期间的键变更。"

#: ../NEWS:52629
msgid ""
":issue:`24373`: _testmultiphase and xxlimited now use tp_traverse and "
"tp_finalize to avoid reference leaks encountered when combining tp_dealloc "
"with PyType_FromSpec (see :issue:`16690` for details)"
msgstr ""
":issue:`24373`: "
"_testmultiphase和xxlimited现在使用tp_traverse和tp_finalize来避免当tp_dealloc与PyType_FromSpec结合时遇到的引用泄漏（详情见"
" :issue:`16690`）。"

#: ../NEWS:52636
msgid ""
":issue:`24458`: Update documentation to cover multi-phase initialization for"
" extension modules (PEP 489). Patch by Petr Viktorin."
msgstr ":issue:`24458`: 更新文档以涵盖扩展模块的多阶段初始化（PEP 489）。由Petr Viktorin提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:52639
msgid ""
":issue:`24351`: Clarify what is meant by \"identifier\" in the context of "
"string.Template instances."
msgstr ":issue:`24351`: 澄清在string.Template实例上下文中“标识符”的含义。"

#: ../NEWS:52645
msgid ""
":issue:`24432`: Update Windows builds and OS X 10.5 installer to use OpenSSL"
" 1.0.2c."
msgstr ":issue:`24432`: 更新Windows构建和OS X 10.5安装程序以使用OpenSSL 1.0.2c。"

#: ../NEWS:52650
msgid "Python 3.5.0 beta 2"
msgstr "Python 3.5.0 beta 2"

#: ../NEWS:52652
msgid "*Release date: 2015-05-31*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2015-05-31*"

#: ../NEWS:52657
msgid ""
":issue:`24284`: The startswith and endswith methods of the str class no "
"longer return True when finding the empty string and the indexes are "
"completely out of range."
msgstr ":issue:`24284`: str类的startswith和endswith方法在找到空字符串且索引完全超出范围时不再返回True。"

#: ../NEWS:52661
msgid ""
":issue:`24115`: Update uses of PyObject_IsTrue(), PyObject_Not(), "
"PyObject_IsInstance(), PyObject_RichCompareBool() and _PyDict_Contains() to "
"check for and handle errors correctly."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24115`: "
"更新PyObject_IsTrue()、PyObject_Not()、PyObject_IsInstance()、PyObject_RichCompareBool()和_PyDict_Contains()的使用，以正确检查和处错误。"

#: ../NEWS:52665
msgid ":issue:`24328`: Fix importing one character extension modules."
msgstr ":issue:`24328`: 修复导入单字符扩展模块的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:52667
msgid ""
":issue:`11205`: In dictionary displays, evaluate the key before the value."
msgstr ":issue:`11205`: 在字典显示中，先评估键再评估值。"

#: ../NEWS:52669
msgid ""
":issue:`24285`: Fixed regression that prevented importing extension modules "
"from inside packages. Patch by Petr Viktorin."
msgstr ":issue:`24285`: 修复了阻止从包内导入扩展模块的回归问题。由Petr Viktorin提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:52675
msgid ":issue:`23247`: Fix a crash in the StreamWriter.reset() of CJK codecs."
msgstr ":issue:`23247`: 修复了CJK编解码器中StreamWriter.reset()的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:52677
msgid ""
":issue:`24270`: Add math.isclose() and cmath.isclose() functions as per "
":pep:`485`. Contributed by Chris Barker and Tal Einat."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24270`: 根据 :pep:`485` 添加了math.isclose()和cmath.isclose()函数。由Chris "
"Barker和Tal Einat贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:52680
msgid ""
":issue:`5633`: Fixed timeit when the statement is a string and the setup is "
"not."
msgstr ":issue:`5633`: 修复了当语句是字符串而设置不是时的timeit问题。"

#: ../NEWS:52683
msgid ""
":issue:`24326`: Fixed audioop.ratecv() with non-default weightB argument. "
"Original patch by David Moore."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24326`: 修复了audioop.ratecv()使用非默认weightB参数的问题。原始补丁由David Moore提供。"

#: ../NEWS:52686
msgid ":issue:`16991`: Add a C implementation of OrderedDict."
msgstr ":issue:`16991`: 添加了OrderedDict的C实现。"

#: ../NEWS:52688
msgid ""
":issue:`23934`: Fix inspect.signature to fail correctly for builtin types "
"lacking signature information.  Initial patch by James Powell."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23934`: 修复inspect.signature以正确失败于缺乏签名信息的内置类型。初始由James Powell提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:52693
msgid "Python 3.5.0 beta 1"
msgstr "Python 3.5.0 beta 1"

#: ../NEWS:52695
msgid "*Release date: 2015-05-24*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2015-05-24*"

#: ../NEWS:52700
msgid ":issue:`24276`: Fixed optimization of property descriptor getter."
msgstr ":issue:`24276`: 修复了属性描述符getter的优化。"

#: ../NEWS:52702
msgid ""
":issue:`24268`: PEP 489: Multi-phase extension module initialization. Patch "
"by Petr Viktorin."
msgstr ":issue:`24268`: PEP 489: 多阶段扩展模块初始化。由Petr Viktorin提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:52705
msgid ""
":issue:`23955`: Add pyvenv.cfg option to suppress registry/environment "
"lookup for generating sys.path on Windows."
msgstr ":issue:`23955`: 添加pyvenv.cfg选项以抑制在Windows上生成sys.path时的注册表/环境查找。"

#: ../NEWS:52708
msgid ""
":issue:`24257`: Fixed system error in the comparison of faked "
"types.SimpleNamespace."
msgstr ":issue:`24257`: 修复了伪造的types.SimpleNamespace比较中的系统错误。"

#: ../NEWS:52711
msgid ""
":issue:`22939`: Fixed integer overflow in iterator object.  Patch by Clement"
" Rouault."
msgstr ":issue:`22939`: 修复了迭代器对象中的整数溢出问题。由Clement Rouault提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:52714
msgid ""
":issue:`23985`: Fix a possible buffer overrun when deleting a slice from the"
" front of a bytearray and then appending some other bytes data."
msgstr ":issue:`23985`: 修复了从bytearray前端删除一个切片后追加其他字节数据时可能发生的缓冲区溢出问题。"

#: ../NEWS:52717
msgid ""
":issue:`24102`: Fixed exception type checking in standard error handlers."
msgstr ":issue:`24102`: 修复了标准错误处理程序中的异常类型检查。"

#: ../NEWS:52719
msgid ":issue:`15027`: The UTF-32 encoder is now 3x to 7x faster."
msgstr ":issue:`15027`: UTF-32编码器现在快3到7倍。"

#: ../NEWS:52721
msgid ""
":issue:`23290`: Optimize set_merge() for cases where the target is empty. "
"(Contributed by Serhiy Storchaka.)"
msgstr ":issue:`23290`: 为目标为空的情况优化了set_merge()。（由Serhiy Storchaka贡献。）"

#: ../NEWS:52724
msgid ":issue:`2292`: PEP 448: Additional Unpacking Generalizations."
msgstr ":issue:`2292`: PEP 448: 额外的解包泛化。"

#: ../NEWS:52726
msgid ""
":issue:`24096`: Make warnings.warn_explicit more robust against mutation of "
"the warnings.filters list."
msgstr ":issue:`24096`: 使warnings.warn_explicit对warnings.filters列表的突变更加健壮。"

#: ../NEWS:52729
msgid ""
":issue:`23996`: Avoid a crash when a delegated generator raises an "
"unnormalized StopIteration exception.  Patch by Stefan Behnel."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23996`: 避免当委托的生成器引发未标准化的StopIteration异常时崩溃。由Stefan Behnel提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:52732
msgid ""
":issue:`23910`: Optimize property() getter calls.  Patch by Joe Jevnik."
msgstr ":issue:`23910`: 优化property() getter调用。由Joe Jevnik提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:52734
msgid ""
":issue:`23911`: Move path-based importlib bootstrap code to a separate "
"frozen module."
msgstr ":issue:`23911`: 将基于路径的importlib引导代码移动到一个单独的冻结模块。"

#: ../NEWS:52737
msgid ":issue:`24192`: Fix namespace package imports."
msgstr ":issue:`24192`: 修复命名空间包的导入问题。"

#: ../NEWS:52739
msgid ""
":issue:`24022`: Fix tokenizer crash when processing undecodable source code."
msgstr ":issue:`24022`: 修复处理不可解码源代码时标记器的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:52741
msgid ""
":issue:`9951`: Added a hex() method to bytes, bytearray, and memoryview."
msgstr ":issue:`9951`: 为bytes、bytearray和memoryview添加了hex()方法。"

#: ../NEWS:52743
msgid ""
":issue:`22906`: PEP 479: Change StopIteration handling inside generators."
msgstr ":issue:`22906`: PEP 479: 改变生成器内部StopIteration的处理方式。"

#: ../NEWS:52745
msgid ":issue:`24017`: PEP 492: Coroutines with async and await syntax."
msgstr ":issue:`24017`: PEP 492: 使用async和await语法实现协程。"

#: ../NEWS:52750
msgid ""
":issue:`14373`: Added C implementation of functools.lru_cache().  Based on "
"patches by Matt Joiner and Alexey Kachayev."
msgstr ""
":issue:`14373`: 添加了functools.lru_cache()的C实现。基于Matt Joiner和Alexey "
"Kachayev的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:52753
msgid ""
":issue:`24230`: The tempfile module now accepts bytes for prefix, suffix and"
" dir parameters and returns bytes in such situations (matching the os module"
" APIs)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24230`: "
"tempfile模块现在接受prefix、suffix和dir参数的bytes类型，并在这种情况下返回bytes（与os模块的API相匹配）。"

#: ../NEWS:52757
msgid ""
":issue:`22189`: collections.UserString now supports __getnewargs__(), "
"__rmod__(), casefold(), format_map(), isprintable(), and maketrans(). Patch "
"by Joe Jevnik."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22189`: "
"collections.UserString现在支持__getnewargs__()、__rmod__()、casefold()、format_map()、isprintable()和maketrans()。由Joe"
" Jevnik提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:52761
msgid ""
":issue:`24244`: Prevents termination when an invalid format string is "
"encountered on Windows in strftime."
msgstr ":issue:`24244`: 防止在Windows上遇到无效格式字符串时strftime终止。"

#: ../NEWS:52764
msgid ":issue:`23973`: PEP 484: Add the typing module."
msgstr ":issue:`23973`: PEP 484: 添加typing模块。"

#: ../NEWS:52766
msgid ""
":issue:`23086`: The collections.abc.Sequence() abstract base class added "
"*start* and *stop* parameters to the index() mixin. Patch by Devin "
"Jeanpierre."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23086`: collections.abc.Sequence()抽象基类为index()混入添加了 *start* 和 *stop*"
" 参数。由Devin Jeanpierre提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:52770
msgid ""
":issue:`20035`: Replaced the ``tkinter._fix`` module used for setting up the"
" Tcl/Tk environment on Windows with a private function in the ``_tkinter`` "
"module that makes no permanent changes to the environment."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20035`: 将用于在Windows上设置Tcl/Tk环境的 ``tkinter._fix`` 模块替换为 ``_tkinter`` "
"模块中的私有函数，该函数不会对环境进行永久性更改。"

#: ../NEWS:52774
msgid ""
":issue:`24257`: Fixed segmentation fault in sqlite3.Row constructor with "
"faked cursor type."
msgstr ":issue:`24257`: 修复了使用伪造游标类型时sqlite3.Row构造函数中的段错误。"

#: ../NEWS:52777
msgid ""
":issue:`15836`: assertRaises(), assertRaisesRegex(), assertWarns() and "
"assertWarnsRegex() assertments now check the type of the first argument to "
"prevent possible user error.  Based on patch by Daniel Wagner-Hall."
msgstr ""
":issue:`15836`: "
"assertRaises()、assertRaisesRegex()、assertWarns()和assertWarnsRegex()断言现在检查第一个参数的类型以防止可能的用户错误。基于Daniel"
" Wagner-Hall的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:52781
msgid ""
":issue:`9858`: Add missing method stubs to _io.RawIOBase.  Patch by Laura "
"Rupprecht."
msgstr ":issue:`9858`: 为_io.RawIOBase添加缺失的方法存根。由Laura Rupprecht提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:52784
msgid ""
":issue:`22955`: attrgetter, itemgetter and methodcaller objects in the "
"operator module now support pickling.  Added readable and evaluable repr for"
" these objects. Based on patch by Josh Rosenberg."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22955`: "
"operator模块中的attrgetter、itemgetter和methodcaller对象现在支持pickle。为这些对象添加了可读和可评估的repr。基于Josh"
" Rosenberg的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:52788
msgid ""
":issue:`22107`: tempfile.gettempdir() and tempfile.mkdtemp() now try again "
"when a directory with the chosen name already exists on Windows as well as "
"on Unix. tempfile.mkstemp() now fails early if parent directory is not valid"
" (not exists or is a file) on Windows."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22107`: tempfile.gettempdir() 和 tempfile.mkdtemp() 现在在 Windows 和 "
"Unix 上都会在所选名称的目录已存在时重试。tempfile.mkstemp() 现在在 Windows "
"上如果父目录无效（不存在或是文件）时会提前失败。"

#: ../NEWS:52793
msgid ""
":issue:`23780`: Improved error message in os.path.join() with single "
"argument."
msgstr ":issue:`23780`: 改进了 os.path.join() 在单个参数时的错误信息。"

#: ../NEWS:52795
msgid ""
":issue:`6598`: Increased time precision and random number range in "
"email.utils.make_msgid() to strengthen the uniqueness of the message ID."
msgstr ""
":issue:`6598`: 提高了 email.utils.make_msgid() 中的时间精度和随机数范围，以增强消息 ID 的唯一性。"

#: ../NEWS:52798
msgid ""
":issue:`24091`: Fixed various crashes in corner cases in C implementation of"
" ElementTree."
msgstr ":issue:`24091`: 修复了 ElementTree 的 C 实现中各种角落情况的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:52801
msgid ""
":issue:`21931`: msilib.FCICreate() now raises TypeError in the case of a bad"
" argument instead of a ValueError with a bogus FCI error number. Patch by "
"Jeffrey Armstrong."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21931`: msilib.FCICreate() 现在在参数错误的情况下会引发 TypeError 而不是带有虚假 FCI 错误号的"
" ValueError。由 Jeffrey Armstrong 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:52805
msgid ":issue:`13866`: *quote_via* argument added to urllib.parse.urlencode."
msgstr ":issue:`13866`: 为 urllib.parse.urlencode 添加了 *quote_via* 参数。"

#: ../NEWS:52807
msgid ""
":issue:`20098`: New mangle_from policy option for email, default True for "
"compat32, but False for all other policies."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20098`: 为 email 添加了新的 mangle_from 策略选项，对于 compat32 默认为 "
"True，但对于所有其他策略默认为 False。"

#: ../NEWS:52810
msgid ""
":issue:`24211`: The email library now supports RFC 6532: it can generate "
"headers using utf-8 instead of encoded words."
msgstr ":issue:`24211`: email 库现在支持 RFC 6532：它可以生成使用 utf-8 而不是编码单词的头部。"

#: ../NEWS:52813
msgid ":issue:`16314`: Added support for the LZMA compression in distutils."
msgstr ":issue:`16314`: 在 distutils 中添加了对 LZMA 压缩的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:52815
msgid ":issue:`21804`: poplib now supports RFC 6856 (UTF8)."
msgstr ":issue:`21804`: poplib 现在支持 RFC 6856 (UTF8)。"

#: ../NEWS:52817
msgid ":issue:`18682`: Optimized pprint functions for builtin scalar types."
msgstr ":issue:`18682`: 优化了内置标量类型的 pprint 函数。"

#: ../NEWS:52819
msgid ":issue:`22027`: smtplib now supports RFC 6531 (SMTPUTF8)."
msgstr ":issue:`22027`: smtplib 现在支持 RFC 6531 (SMTPUTF8)。"

#: ../NEWS:52821
msgid ""
":issue:`23488`: Random generator objects now consume 2x less memory on "
"64-bit."
msgstr ":issue:`23488`: 随机生成器对象现在在 64 位系统上消耗的内存减少了一半。"

#: ../NEWS:52823
msgid ""
":issue:`1322`: platform.dist() and platform.linux_distribution() functions "
"are now deprecated.  Initial patch by Vajrasky Kok."
msgstr ""
":issue:`1322`: platform.dist() 和 platform.linux_distribution() "
"函数现在已被弃用。初始补丁由 Vajrasky Kok 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:52826
msgid ""
":issue:`22486`: Added the math.gcd() function.  The fractions.gcd() function"
" now is deprecated.  Based on patch by Mark Dickinson."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22486`: 添加了 math.gcd() 函数。fractions.gcd() 函数现在已被弃用。基于 Mark Dickinson"
" 的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:52829
msgid ""
":issue:`24064`: Property() docstrings are now writeable. (Patch by Berker "
"Peksag.)"
msgstr ":issue:`24064`: Property() 的文档字符串现在可写。（由 Berker Peksag 提供补丁。）"

#: ../NEWS:52832
msgid ":issue:`22681`: Added support for the koi8_t encoding."
msgstr ":issue:`22681`: 添加了对 koi8_t 编码的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:52834
msgid ":issue:`22682`: Added support for the kz1048 encoding."
msgstr ":issue:`22682`: 添加了对 kz1048 编码的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:52836
msgid ""
":issue:`23796`: peek and read1 methods of BufferedReader now raise "
"ValueError if they called on a closed object. Patch by John Hergenroeder."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23796`: BufferedReader 的 peek 和 read1 方法现在在对象已关闭时调用会引发 ValueError。由 "
"John Hergenroeder 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:52839
msgid ""
":issue:`21795`: smtpd now supports the 8BITMIME extension whenever the new "
"*decode_data* constructor argument is set to False."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21795`: 当新的 *decode_data* 构造函数参数设置为 False 时，smtpd 现在支持 8BITMIME 扩展。"

#: ../NEWS:52842
msgid ""
":issue:`24155`: optimize heapq.heapify() for better cache performance when "
"heapifying large lists."
msgstr ":issue:`24155`: 优化 heapq.heapify() 以提高在堆化大型列表时的缓存性能。"

#: ../NEWS:52845
msgid ""
":issue:`21800`: imaplib now supports RFC 5161 (enable), RFC 6855 "
"(utf8/internationalized email) and automatically encodes non-ASCII usernames"
" and passwords to UTF8."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21800`: imaplib 现在支持 RFC 5161（启用）、RFC 6855（utf8/国际化邮件）并自动将非 ASCII "
"用户名和密码编码为 UTF8。"

#: ../NEWS:52849
msgid ""
":issue:`20274`: When calling a _sqlite.Connection, it now complains if "
"passed any keyword arguments.  Previously it silently ignored them."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20274`: 当调用 _sqlite.Connection 时，如果传递了任何关键字参数，现在会报错。之前是默默地忽略它们。"

#: ../NEWS:52852
msgid ""
":issue:`20274`: Remove ignored and erroneous \"kwargs\" parameters from "
"three METH_VARARGS methods on _sqlite.Connection."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20274`: 从 _sqlite.Connection 上的三个 METH_VARARGS 方法中移除被忽略和错误的 "
"\"kwargs\" 参数。"

#: ../NEWS:52855
msgid ""
":issue:`24134`: assertRaises(), assertRaisesRegex(), assertWarns() and "
"assertWarnsRegex() checks now emits a deprecation warning when callable is "
"None or keyword arguments except msg is passed in the context manager mode."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24134`: assertRaises()、assertRaisesRegex()、assertWarns() 和 "
"assertWarnsRegex() 检查现在当 callable 为 None 或在上下文管理器模式下传递了除 msg "
"外的关键字参数时，会发出弃用警告。"

#: ../NEWS:52860
msgid ""
":issue:`24018`: Add a collections.abc.Generator abstract base class. "
"Contributed by Stefan Behnel."
msgstr ":issue:`24018`: 添加 collections.abc.Generator 抽象基类。由 Stefan Behnel 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:52863
msgid ""
":issue:`23880`: Tkinter's getint() and getdouble() now support Tcl_Obj. "
"Tkinter's getdouble() now supports any numbers (in particular int)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23880`: Tkinter 的 getint() 和 getdouble() 现在支持 Tcl_Obj。Tkinter 的 "
"getdouble() 现在支持任何数字（特别是整数）。"

#: ../NEWS:52866
msgid ""
":issue:`22619`: Added negative limit support in the traceback module. Based "
"on patch by Dmitry Kazakov."
msgstr ":issue:`22619`: 在 traceback 模块中添加了对负限制的支持。基于 Dmitry Kazakov 的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:52869
msgid ""
":issue:`24094`: Fix possible crash in json.encode with poorly behaved dict "
"subclasses."
msgstr ":issue:`24094`: 修复了在 json.encode 中可能因为行为不良的字典子类而导致的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:52872
msgid ""
":issue:`9246`: On POSIX, os.getcwd() now supports paths longer than 1025 "
"bytes. Patch written by William Orr."
msgstr ""
":issue:`9246`: 在 POSIX 上，os.getcwd() 现在支持超过 1025 字节的路径。补丁由 William Orr 编写。"

#: ../NEWS:52875
msgid ""
":issue:`17445`: add difflib.diff_bytes() to support comparison of byte "
"strings (fixes a regression from Python 2)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`17445`: 添加 difflib.diff_bytes() 以支持字节字符串的比较（修复了从 Python 2 开始的回归）。"

#: ../NEWS:52878
msgid ""
":issue:`23917`: Fall back to sequential compilation when ProcessPoolExecutor"
" doesn't exist. Patch by Claudiu Popa."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23917`: 当 ProcessPoolExecutor 不存在时，回退到顺序编译。补丁由 Claudiu Popa 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:52881
msgid ""
":issue:`23008`: Fixed resolving attributes with boolean value is False in "
"pydoc."
msgstr ":issue:`23008`: 修复了在 pydoc 中解析布尔值为 False 的属性时的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:52884
msgid ""
"Fix asyncio issue 235: LifoQueue and PriorityQueue's put didn't increment "
"unfinished tasks (this bug was introduced when JoinableQueue was merged with"
" Queue)."
msgstr ""
"修复 asyncio 问题 235：LifoQueue 和 PriorityQueue 的 put 没有增加未完成任务（这个错误是在 "
"JoinableQueue 与 Queue 合并时引入的）。"

#: ../NEWS:52888
msgid ""
":issue:`23908`: os functions now reject paths with embedded null character "
"on Windows instead of silently truncating them."
msgstr ":issue:`23908`: os 函数现在在 Windows 上拒绝含有嵌入空字符的路径，而不是默默地截断它们。"

#: ../NEWS:52891
msgid ""
":issue:`23728`: binascii.crc_hqx() could return an integer outside of the "
"range 0-0xffff for empty data."
msgstr ":issue:`23728`: 对于空数据，binascii.crc_hqx() 可能返回一个超出 0-0xffff 范围的整数。"

#: ../NEWS:52894
msgid ""
":issue:`23887`: urllib.error.HTTPError now has a proper repr() "
"representation. Patch by Berker Peksag."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23887`: urllib.error.HTTPError 现在有了一个正确的 repr() 表示。由 Berker Peksag "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:52897
msgid ""
"asyncio: New event loop APIs: set_task_factory() and get_task_factory()."
msgstr "asyncio: 新增事件循环 API: set_task_factory() 和 get_task_factory()。"

#: ../NEWS:52899
msgid "asyncio: async() function is deprecated in favour of ensure_future()."
msgstr "asyncio: async() 函数已弃用，推荐使用 ensure_future()。"

#: ../NEWS:52901
msgid ""
":issue:`24178`: asyncio.Lock, Condition, Semaphore, and BoundedSemaphore "
"support new 'async with' syntax.  Contributed by Yury Selivanov."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24178`: asyncio.Lock、Condition、Semaphore 和 BoundedSemaphore 支持新的 "
"'async with' 语法。由 Yury Selivanov 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:52904
msgid ""
":issue:`24179`: Support 'async for' for asyncio.StreamReader. Contributed by"
" Yury Selivanov."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24179`: 为 asyncio.StreamReader 支持 'async for'。由 Yury Selivanov 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:52907
msgid ""
":issue:`24184`: Add AsyncIterator and AsyncIterable ABCs to collections.abc."
" Contributed by Yury Selivanov."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24184`: 将 AsyncIterator 和 AsyncIterable ABCs 添加到 collections.abc。由 "
"Yury Selivanov 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:52910
msgid ""
":issue:`22547`: Implement informative __repr__ for inspect.BoundArguments. "
"Contributed by Yury Selivanov."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22547`: 为 inspect.BoundArguments 实现信息丰富的 __repr__。由 Yury Selivanov "
"贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:52913
msgid ""
":issue:`24190`: Implement inspect.BoundArgument.apply_defaults() method. "
"Contributed by Yury Selivanov."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24190`: 实现 inspect.BoundArgument.apply_defaults() 方法。由 Yury "
"Selivanov 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:52916
msgid ""
":issue:`20691`: Add 'follow_wrapped' argument to "
"inspect.Signature.from_callable() and inspect.signature(). Contributed by "
"Yury Selivanov."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20691`: 向 inspect.Signature.from_callable() 和 inspect.signature() 添加"
" 'follow_wrapped' 参数。由 Yury Selivanov 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:52920
msgid ""
":issue:`24248`: Deprecate inspect.Signature.from_function() and "
"inspect.Signature.from_builtin()."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24248`: 弃用 inspect.Signature.from_function() 和 "
"inspect.Signature.from_builtin()。"

#: ../NEWS:52923
msgid ""
":issue:`23898`: Fix inspect.classify_class_attrs() to support attributes "
"with overloaded __eq__ and __bool__.  Patch by Mike Bayer."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23898`: 修复 inspect.classify_class_attrs() 以支持具有重载 __eq__ 和 __bool__ "
"的属性。由 Mike Bayer 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:52926
msgid ""
":issue:`24298`: Fix inspect.signature() to correctly unwrap wrappers around "
"bound methods."
msgstr ":issue:`24298`: 修复 inspect.signature() 以正确解包绑定方法的包装器。"

#: ../NEWS:52932
msgid ""
":issue:`23184`: remove unused names and imports in idlelib. Initial patch by"
" Al Sweigart."
msgstr ":issue:`23184`: 移除 idlelib 中未使用的名称和导入。初始由 Al Sweigart 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:52938
msgid ""
":issue:`21520`: test_zipfile no longer fails if the word 'bad' appears "
"anywhere in the name of the current directory."
msgstr ":issue:`21520`: 如果当前目录名称中出现 'bad' 单词，test_zipfile 不再失败。"

#: ../NEWS:52941
msgid ""
":issue:`9517`: Move script_helper into the support package. Patch by "
"Christie Wilson."
msgstr ":issue:`9517`: 将 script_helper 移动到 support 包中。由 Christie Wilson 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:52947
msgid ""
":issue:`22155`: Add File Handlers subsection with createfilehandler to "
"tkinter doc.  Remove obsolete example from FAQ.  Patch by Martin Panter."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22155`: 在 tkinter 文档中添加文件处理程序子章节，包含 createfilehandler。从 FAQ "
"中移除过时的示例。由 Martin Panter 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:52950
msgid ""
":issue:`24029`: Document the name binding behavior for submodule imports."
msgstr ":issue:`24029`: 记录子模块导入的名称绑定行为。"

#: ../NEWS:52952
msgid ":issue:`24077`: Fix typo in man page for -I command option: -s, not -S"
msgstr ":issue:`24077`: 修复 -I 命令选项的手册页中的拼写错误：-s，不是 -S。"

#: ../NEWS:52957
msgid ""
":issue:`24000`: Improved Argument Clinic's mapping of converters to legacy "
"\"format units\". Updated the documentation to match."
msgstr ":issue:`24000`: 改进了 Argument Clinic 对转换器到旧版“格式单元”的映射。更新了文档以匹配。"

#: ../NEWS:52960
msgid ""
":issue:`24001`: Argument Clinic converters now use accept={type} instead of "
"types={'type'} to specify the types the converter accepts."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24001`: Argument Clinic 转换器现在使用 accept={type} 而不是 types={'type'} "
"来指定转换器接受的类型。"

#: ../NEWS:52963
msgid ":issue:`23330`: h2py now supports arbitrary filenames in #include."
msgstr ":issue:`23330`: h2py 现在支持在 #include 中使用任意文件名。"

#: ../NEWS:52965
msgid ":issue:`24031`: make patchcheck now supports git checkouts, too."
msgstr ":issue:`24031`: make patchcheck 现在也支持 git 检出。"

#: ../NEWS:52969
msgid "Python 3.5.0 alpha 4"
msgstr "Python 3.5.0 alpha 4"

#: ../NEWS:52971
msgid "*Release date: 2015-04-19*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2015-04-19*"

#: ../NEWS:52976
msgid ""
":issue:`22980`: Under Linux, GNU/KFreeBSD and the Hurd, C extensions now "
"include the architecture triplet in the extension name, to make it easy to "
"test builds for different ABIs in the same working tree.  Under OS X, the "
"extension name now includes :pep:`3149`-style information."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22980`: 在 Linux、GNU/KFreeBSD 和 Hurd 下，C "
"扩展现在在扩展名中包括架构三元组，以便在同一工作树中轻松测试不同 ABI 的构建。在 OS X 下，扩展名现在包括 :pep:`3149` 风格的信息。"

#: ../NEWS:52981
msgid ""
":issue:`22631`: Added Linux-specific socket constant CAN_RAW_FD_FRAMES. "
"Patch courtesy of Joe Jevnik."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22631`: 添加了 Linux 特定的套接字常量 CAN_RAW_FD_FRAMES。由 Joe Jevnik 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:52984
msgid ":issue:`23731`: Implement :pep:`488`: removal of .pyo files."
msgstr ":issue:`23731`: 实现了 :pep:`488`: 移除了 .pyo 文件。"

#: ../NEWS:52986
msgid ""
":issue:`23726`: Don't enable GC for user subclasses of non-GC types that "
"don't add any new fields.  Patch by Eugene Toder."
msgstr ":issue:`23726`: 对于没有添加任何新字段的非 GC 类型的用户子类，不启用 GC。由 Eugene Toder 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:52989
msgid ""
":issue:`23309`: Avoid a deadlock at shutdown if a daemon thread is aborted "
"while it is holding a lock to a buffered I/O object, and the main thread "
"tries to use the same I/O object (typically stdout or stderr).  A fatal "
"error is emitted instead."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23309`: 如果在关闭时守护线程在被持有缓冲 I/O 对象的锁时被中止，并且主线程尝试使用相同的 I/O 对象（通常是 stdout"
" 或 stderr），则避免死锁。相反，会发出致命错误。"

#: ../NEWS:52994
msgid ""
":issue:`22977`: Fixed formatting Windows error messages on Wine. Patch by "
"Martin Panter."
msgstr ":issue:`22977`: 修复了在 Wine 上格式化 Windows 错误消息的问题。由 Martin Panter 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:52997
msgid ""
":issue:`23466`: %c, %o, %x, and %X in bytes formatting now raise TypeError "
"on non-integer input."
msgstr ":issue:`23466`: 在字节格式化中，%c、%o、%x 和 %X 现在对非整数输入引发 TypeError。"

#: ../NEWS:53000
msgid ""
":issue:`24044`: Fix possible null pointer dereference in list.sort in out of"
" memory conditions."
msgstr ":issue:`24044`: 修复了在内存不足情况下 list.sort 中可能的空指针解引用。"

#: ../NEWS:53003
msgid ""
":issue:`21354`: PyCFunction_New function is exposed by python DLL again."
msgstr ":issue:`21354`: PyCFunction_New 函数再次由 python DLL 暴露。"

#: ../NEWS:53008
msgid ""
":issue:`23840`: tokenize.open() now closes the temporary binary file on "
"error to fix a resource warning."
msgstr ":issue:`23840`: tokenize.open() 现在在错误时关闭临时二进制文件以修复资源警告。"

#: ../NEWS:53011
msgid ""
":issue:`16914`: new debuglevel 2 in smtplib adds timestamps to debug output."
msgstr ":issue:`16914`: smtplib 中的新调试级别 2 在调试输出中添加了时间戳。"

#: ../NEWS:53013
msgid ""
":issue:`7159`: urllib.request now supports sending auth credentials "
"automatically after the first 401.  This enhancement is a superset of the "
"enhancement from :issue:`19494` and supersedes that change."
msgstr ""
":issue:`7159`: urllib.request 现在支持在第一次 401 后自动发送认证凭据。此增强是 :issue:`19494` "
"增强的超集，并取代了该更改。"

#: ../NEWS:53017
msgid ""
":issue:`23703`: Fix a regression in urljoin() introduced in 901e4e52b20a. "
"Patch by Demian Brecht."
msgstr ":issue:`23703`: 修复在901e4e52b20a中引入的urljoin()回归问题。由Demian Brecht提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53020
msgid ":issue:`4254`: Adds _curses.update_lines_cols().  Patch by Arnon Yaari"
msgstr ":issue:`4254`: 添加_curses.update_lines_cols()。由Arnon Yaari提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53022
msgid ""
":issue:`19933`: Provide default argument for ndigits in round. Patch by "
"Vajrasky Kok."
msgstr ":issue:`19933`: 为round提供ndigits的默认参数。由Vajrasky Kok提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53025
msgid ""
":issue:`23193`: Add a numeric_owner parameter to tarfile.TarFile.extract and"
" tarfile.TarFile.extractall. Patch by Michael Vogt and Eric Smith."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23193`: "
"向tarfile.TarFile.extract和tarfile.TarFile.extractall添加numeric_owner参数。由Michael"
" Vogt和Eric Smith提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53028
msgid ""
":issue:`23342`: Add a subprocess.run() function than returns a CalledProcess"
" instance for a more consistent API than the existing call* functions."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23342`: "
"添加subprocess.run()函数，该函数返回CalledProcess实例，提供了比现有call*函数更一致的API。"

#: ../NEWS:53031
msgid ""
":issue:`21217`: inspect.getsourcelines() now tries to compute the start and "
"end lines from the code object, fixing an issue when a lambda function is "
"used as decorator argument. Patch by Thomas Ballinger and Allison Kaptur."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21217`: "
"inspect.getsourcelines()现在尝试从代码对象计算开始和结束行，修复了当lambda函数用作装饰器参数时的问题。由Thomas "
"Ballinger和Allison Kaptur提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53035
msgid ":issue:`24521`: Fix possible integer overflows in the pickle module."
msgstr ":issue:`24521`: 修复pickle模块中可能的整数溢出。"

#: ../NEWS:53037
msgid ":issue:`22931`: Allow '[' and ']' in cookie values."
msgstr ":issue:`22931`: 允许cookie值中包含'['和']'。"

#: ../NEWS:53039
msgid ""
"The keywords attribute of functools.partial is now always a dictionary."
msgstr "functools.partial的keywords属性现在总是一个字典。"

#: ../NEWS:53041
msgid ""
":issue:`23811`: Add missing newline to the PyCompileError error message. "
"Patch by Alex Shkop."
msgstr ":issue:`23811`: 向PyCompileError错误消息添加缺失的换行符。由Alex Shkop提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53044
msgid ""
":issue:`21116`: Avoid blowing memory when allocating a multiprocessing "
"shared array that's larger than 50% of the available RAM.  Patch by Médéric "
"Boquien."
msgstr ":issue:`21116`: 避免在分配大于可用RAM 50%的多进程共享数组时耗尽内存。由Médéric Boquien提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53048
msgid ""
":issue:`22982`: Improve BOM handling when seeking to multiple positions of a"
" writable text file."
msgstr ":issue:`22982`: 改进在可写文本文件的多位置查找时的BOM处理。"

#: ../NEWS:53051
msgid ":issue:`23464`: Removed deprecated asyncio JoinableQueue."
msgstr ":issue:`23464`: 移除已弃用的asyncio JoinableQueue。"

#: ../NEWS:53053
msgid ""
":issue:`23529`: Limit the size of decompressed data when reading from "
"GzipFile, BZ2File or LZMAFile.  This defeats denial of service attacks using"
" compressed bombs (i.e. compressed payloads which decompress to a huge "
"size).  Patch by Martin Panter and Nikolaus Rath."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23529`: "
"限制从GzipFile、BZ2File或LZMAFile读取时的解压数据大小。这防止了使用压缩炸弹（即解压后尺寸巨大的压缩负载）的拒绝服务攻击。由Martin"
" Panter和Nikolaus Rath提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53058
msgid ":issue:`21859`: Added Python implementation of io.FileIO."
msgstr ":issue:`21859`: 添加了io.FileIO的Python实现。"

#: ../NEWS:53060
msgid ""
":issue:`23865`: close() methods in multiple modules now are idempotent and "
"more robust at shutdown. If they need to release multiple resources, all are"
" released even if errors occur."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23865`: 多个模块中的close()方法现在在关闭时是幂等的且更健壮。如果需要释放多个资源，即使发生错误，所有资源也会被释放。"

#: ../NEWS:53064
msgid ""
":issue:`23400`: Raise same exception on both Python 2 and 3 if sem_open is "
"not available. Patch by Davin Potts."
msgstr ":issue:`23400`: 如果sem_open不可用，在Python 2和3上抛出相同的异常。由Davin Potts提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53067
msgid ""
":issue:`10838`: The subprocess now module includes SubprocessError and "
"TimeoutError in its list of exported names for the users wild enough to use "
"``from subprocess import *``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`10838`: "
"subprocess模块现在在其导出的名称列表中包括SubprocessError和TimeoutError，以供那些大胆使用 ``from "
"subprocess import *`` 的用户使用。"

#: ../NEWS:53071
msgid ""
":issue:`23411`: Added DefragResult, ParseResult, SplitResult, "
"DefragResultBytes, ParseResultBytes, and SplitResultBytes to "
"urllib.parse.__all__. Patch by Martin Panter."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23411`: "
"将DefragResult、ParseResult、SplitResult、DefragResultBytes、ParseResultBytes和SplitResultBytes添加到urllib.parse.__all__中。由Martin"
" Panter提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53075
msgid ""
":issue:`23881`: urllib.request.ftpwrapper constructor now closes the socket "
"if the FTP connection failed to fix a ResourceWarning."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23881`: "
"urllib.request.ftpwrapper构造函数现在会在FTP连接失败时关闭套接字，以修复ResourceWarning。"

#: ../NEWS:53078
msgid ""
":issue:`23853`: :meth:`socket.socket.sendall` does no more reset the socket "
"timeout each time data is sent successfully. The socket timeout is now the "
"maximum total duration to send all data."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23853`: :meth:`socket.socket.sendall` "
"不再在每次数据成功发送时重置套接字超时。套接字超时现在是发送所有数据的最大总持续时间。"

#: ../NEWS:53082
msgid ""
":issue:`22721`: An order of multiline pprint output of set or dict "
"containing orderable and non-orderable elements no longer depends on "
"iteration order of set or dict."
msgstr ":issue:`22721`: 包含可排序和不可排序元素的集合或多行pprint输出的字典的顺序不再依赖于集合或字典的迭代顺序。"

#: ../NEWS:53086
msgid ""
":issue:`15133`: _tkinter.tkapp.getboolean() now supports Tcl_Obj and always "
"returns bool. tkinter.BooleanVar now validates input values (accepted bool, "
"int, str, and Tcl_Obj).  tkinter.BooleanVar.get() now always returns bool."
msgstr ""
":issue:`15133`: "
"_tkinter.tkapp.getboolean()现在支持Tcl_Obj并始终返回bool。tkinter.BooleanVar现在验证输入值（接受bool、int、str和Tcl_Obj）。tkinter.BooleanVar.get()现在始终返回bool。"

#: ../NEWS:53091
msgid ":issue:`10590`: xml.sax.parseString() now supports string argument."
msgstr ":issue:`10590`: xml.sax.parseString()现在支持字符串参数。"

#: ../NEWS:53093
msgid ""
":issue:`23338`: Fixed formatting ctypes error messages on Cygwin. Patch by "
"Makoto Kato."
msgstr ":issue:`23338`: 修复了在Cygwin上格式化ctypes错误消息的问题。由Makoto Kato提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53096
msgid ":issue:`15582`: inspect.getdoc() now follows inheritance chains."
msgstr ":issue:`15582`: inspect.getdoc()现在遵循继承链。"

#: ../NEWS:53098
msgid ""
":issue:`2175`: SAX parsers now support a character stream of InputSource "
"object."
msgstr ":issue:`2175`: SAX解析器现在支持InputSource对象的字符流。"

#: ../NEWS:53101
msgid ""
":issue:`16840`: Tkinter now supports 64-bit integers added in Tcl 8.4 and "
"arbitrary precision integers added in Tcl 8.5."
msgstr ":issue:`16840`: Tkinter现在支持Tcl 8.4中添加的64位整数和Tcl 8.5中添加的任意精度整数。"

#: ../NEWS:53104
msgid ""
":issue:`23834`: Fix socket.sendto(), use the C Py_ssize_t type to store the "
"result of sendto() instead of the C int type."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23834`: 修复socket.sendto()，使用C Py_ssize_t类型来存储sendto()的结果，而不是C int类型。"

#: ../NEWS:53107
msgid ""
":issue:`23618`: :meth:`socket.socket.connect` now waits until the connection"
" completes instead of raising :exc:`InterruptedError` if the connection is "
"interrupted by signals, signal handlers don't raise an exception and the "
"socket is blocking or has a timeout. :meth:`socket.socket.connect` still "
"raise :exc:`InterruptedError` for non-blocking sockets."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23618`: :meth:`socket.socket.connect` 现在等待连接完成，而不是在连接被信号中断时抛出 "
":exc:`InterruptedError`，前提是信号处理程序没有抛出异常且套接字是阻塞的或具有超时。对于非阻塞套接字，:meth:`socket.socket.connect`"
" 仍然会抛出 :exc:`InterruptedError`。"

#: ../NEWS:53113
msgid ":issue:`21526`: Tkinter now supports new boolean type in Tcl 8.5."
msgstr ":issue:`21526`: Tkinter 现在支持 Tcl 8.5 中的新布尔类型。"

#: ../NEWS:53115
msgid ""
":issue:`23836`: Fix the faulthandler module to handle reentrant calls to its"
" signal handlers."
msgstr ":issue:`23836`: 修复 faulthandler 模块以处理对其信号处理程序的可重入调用。"

#: ../NEWS:53118
msgid ""
":issue:`23838`: linecache now clears the cache and returns an empty result "
"on MemoryError."
msgstr ":issue:`23838`: linecache 现在可以在 MemoryError 时清除缓存并返回空结果。"

#: ../NEWS:53121
msgid ""
":issue:`10395`: Added os.path.commonpath(). Implemented in posixpath and "
"ntpath. Based on patch by Rafik Draoui."
msgstr ""
":issue:`10395`: 添加了 os.path.commonpath()。在 posixpath 和 ntpath 中实现。基于 Rafik "
"Draoui 的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53124
msgid ""
":issue:`23611`: Serializing more \"lookupable\" objects (such as unbound "
"methods or nested classes) now are supported with pickle protocols < 4."
msgstr ":issue:`23611`: 现在支持使用 pickle 协议 < 4 序列化更多“可查找”对象（如未绑定方法或嵌套类）。"

#: ../NEWS:53127
msgid ":issue:`13583`: sqlite3.Row now supports slice indexing."
msgstr ":issue:`13583`: sqlite3.Row 现在支持切片索引。"

#: ../NEWS:53129
msgid ""
":issue:`18473`: Fixed 2to3 and 3to2 compatible pickle mappings.  Fixed "
"ambiguous reverse mappings.  Added many new mappings.  Import mapping is no "
"longer applied to modules already mapped with full name mapping."
msgstr ""
":issue:`18473`: 修复了 2to3 和 3to2 兼容的 pickle "
"映射。修复了模糊的反向映射。添加了许多新映射。导入映射不再应用于已使用全名映射的模块。"

#: ../NEWS:53133
msgid ""
":issue:`23485`: select.select() is now retried automatically with the "
"recomputed timeout when interrupted by a signal, except if the signal "
"handler raises an exception. This change is part of the :pep:`475`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23485`: select.select() 现在在被信号中断时会自动重试，并重新计算超时，除非信号处理程序引发异常。此变更是 "
":pep:`475` 的一部分。"

#: ../NEWS:53137
msgid ""
":issue:`23752`: When built from an existing file descriptor, io.FileIO() now"
" only calls fstat() once. Before fstat() was called twice, which was not "
"necessary."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23752`: 当从现有文件描述符构建时，io.FileIO() 现在只调用 fstat() 一次。之前 fstat() "
"被调用了两次，这是不必要的。"

#: ../NEWS:53141
msgid ""
":issue:`23704`: collections.deque() objects now support __add__, __mul__, "
"and __imul__()."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23704`: collections.deque() 对象现在支持 __add__, __mul__, 和 __imul__()。"

#: ../NEWS:53144
msgid ""
":issue:`23171`: csv.Writer.writerow() now supports arbitrary iterables."
msgstr ":issue:`23171`: csv.Writer.writerow() 现在支持任意可迭代对象。"

#: ../NEWS:53146
msgid ""
":issue:`23745`: The new email header parser now handles duplicate MIME "
"parameter names without error, similar to how get_param behaves."
msgstr ":issue:`23745`: 新的电子邮件头解析器现在可以无错误地处理重复的 MIME 参数名称，类似于 get_param 的行为。"

#: ../NEWS:53149
msgid ""
":issue:`22117`: Fix os.utime(), it now rounds the timestamp towards minus "
"infinity (-inf) instead of rounding towards zero."
msgstr ":issue:`22117`: 修复 os.utime()，现在它将时间戳向负无穷（-inf）舍入，而不是向零舍入。"

#: ../NEWS:53152
msgid ""
":issue:`23310`: Fix MagicMock's initializer to work with __methods__, just "
"like configure_mock().  Patch by Kasia Jachim."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23310`: 修复 MagicMock 的初始化器以与 __methods__ 一起工作，就像 configure_mock() "
"一样。由 Kasia Jachim 提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53158
msgid ""
":issue:`23817`: FreeBSD now uses \"1.0\" in the SOVERSION as other operating"
" systems, instead of just \"1\"."
msgstr ":issue:`23817`: FreeBSD 现在像其他操作系统一样在 SOVERSION 中使用 \"1.0\"，而不仅仅是 \"1\"。"

#: ../NEWS:53161
msgid ""
":issue:`23501`: Argument Clinic now generates code into separate files by "
"default."
msgstr ":issue:`23501`: Argument Clinic 现在默认将代码生成到单独的文件中。"

#: ../NEWS:53167
msgid ""
":issue:`23799`: Added test.support.start_threads() for running and cleaning "
"up multiple threads."
msgstr ":issue:`23799`: 添加了 test.support.start_threads() 用于运行和清理多个线程。"

#: ../NEWS:53170
msgid ""
":issue:`22390`: test.regrtest now emits a warning if temporary files or "
"directories are left after running a test."
msgstr ":issue:`22390`: test.regrtest 现在会在测试运行后如果临时文件或目录未被清理时发出警告。"

#: ../NEWS:53176
msgid ""
":issue:`18128`: pygettext now uses standard +NNNN format in the POT-"
"Creation-Date header."
msgstr ":issue:`18128`: pygettext 现在在 POT-Creation-Date 头中使用标准的 +NNNN 格式。"

#: ../NEWS:53179
msgid ""
":issue:`23935`: Argument Clinic's understanding of format units accepting "
"bytes, bytearrays, and buffers is now consistent with both the documentation"
" and the implementation."
msgstr ":issue:`23935`: Argument Clinic 现在对接受字节、字节数组和缓冲区的格式单元的理解与文档和实现一致。"

#: ../NEWS:53183
msgid ""
":issue:`23944`: Argument Clinic now wraps long impl prototypes at column 78."
msgstr ":issue:`23944`: Argument Clinic 现在在第78列换行长 impl 原型。"

#: ../NEWS:53185
msgid ""
":issue:`20586`: Argument Clinic now ensures that functions without "
"docstrings have signatures."
msgstr ":issue:`20586`: Argument Clinic 现在确保没有文档字符串的函数也有签名。"

#: ../NEWS:53188
msgid ""
":issue:`23492`: Argument Clinic now generates argument parsing code with "
"PyArg_Parse instead of PyArg_ParseTuple if possible."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23492`: Argument Clinic 现在尽可能使用 PyArg_Parse 而不是 PyArg_ParseTuple "
"生成参数解析代码。"

#: ../NEWS:53191
msgid ""
":issue:`23500`: Argument Clinic is now smarter about generating the "
"\"#ifndef\" (empty) definition of the methoddef macro: it's only generated "
"once, even if Argument Clinic processes the same symbol multiple times, and "
"it's emitted at the end of all processing rather than immediately after the "
"first use."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23500`: Argument Clinic 现在更智能地生成 methoddef 宏的“#ifndef”（空）定义：即使 "
"Argument Clinic 多次处理相同的符号，它也只会生成一次，并且是在所有处理完成后而不是在第一次使用后立即发出。"

#: ../NEWS:53200
msgid ""
":issue:`23998`: PyImport_ReInitLock() now checks for lock allocation error"
msgstr ":issue:`23998`: PyImport_ReInitLock() 现在检查锁分配错误"

#: ../NEWS:53204
msgid "Python 3.5.0 alpha 3"
msgstr "Python 3.5.0 alpha 3"

#: ../NEWS:53206
msgid "*Release date: 2015-03-28*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2015-03-28*"

#: ../NEWS:53211
msgid ""
":issue:`23573`: Increased performance of string search operations (str.find,"
" str.index, str.count, the in operator, str.split, str.partition) with "
"arguments of different kinds (UCS1, UCS2, UCS4)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23573`: 提高了字符串搜索操作（str.find、str.index、str.count、in "
"操作符、str.split、str.partition）与不同类型参数（UCS1、UCS2、UCS4）的性能。"

#: ../NEWS:53215
msgid ""
":issue:`23753`: Python doesn't support anymore platforms without stat() or "
"fstat(), these functions are always required."
msgstr ":issue:`23753`: Python 不再支持没有 stat() 或 fstat() 的平台，这些函数现在总是必需的。"

#: ../NEWS:53218
msgid ""
":issue:`23681`: The -b option now affects comparisons of bytes with int."
msgstr ":issue:`23681`: -b 选项现在影响 bytes 与 int 的比较。"

#: ../NEWS:53220
msgid ""
":issue:`23632`: Memoryviews now allow tuple indexing (including for multi-"
"dimensional memoryviews)."
msgstr ":issue:`23632`: Memoryviews 现在允许元组索引（包括多维 memoryviews）。"

#: ../NEWS:53223
msgid ":issue:`23192`: Fixed generator lambdas.  Patch by Bruno Cauet."
msgstr ":issue:`23192`: 修复了生成器 lambda。由 Bruno Cauet 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53225
msgid ""
":issue:`23629`: Fix the default __sizeof__ implementation for variable-sized"
" objects."
msgstr ":issue:`23629`: 修复了可变大小对象的默认 __sizeof__ 实现。"

#: ../NEWS:53231
msgid ""
":issue:`14260`: The groupindex attribute of regular expression pattern "
"object now is non-modifiable mapping."
msgstr ":issue:`14260`: 正则表达式模式对象的 groupindex 属性现在是非可修改的映射。"

#: ../NEWS:53234
msgid ""
":issue:`23792`: Ignore KeyboardInterrupt when the pydoc pager is active. "
"This mimics the behavior of the standard unix pagers, and prevents pipepager"
" from shutting down while the pager itself is still running."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23792`: 当 pydoc 分页器处于活动状态时忽略 KeyboardInterrupt。这模拟了标准 unix "
"分页器的行为，并防止 pipepager 在分页器本身仍在运行时关闭。"

#: ../NEWS:53238
msgid ""
":issue:`23775`: pprint() of OrderedDict now outputs the same representation "
"as repr()."
msgstr ":issue:`23775`: pprint() 现在输出的 OrderedDict 表示与 repr() 相同。"

#: ../NEWS:53241
msgid ":issue:`23765`: Removed IsBadStringPtr calls in ctypes"
msgstr ":issue:`23765`: 移除了 ctypes 中的 IsBadStringPtr 调用。"

#: ../NEWS:53243
msgid ":issue:`22364`: Improved some re error messages using regex for hints."
msgstr ":issue:`22364`: 使用正则表达式提示改进了部分 re 错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:53245
msgid ""
":issue:`23742`: ntpath.expandvars() no longer loses unbalanced single "
"quotes."
msgstr ":issue:`23742`: ntpath.expandvars() 不再丢失不平衡的单引号。"

#: ../NEWS:53247
msgid ""
":issue:`21717`: The zipfile.ZipFile.open function now supports 'x' "
"(exclusive creation) mode."
msgstr ":issue:`21717`: zipfile.ZipFile.open 函数现在支持 'x'（独占创建）模式。"

#: ../NEWS:53250
msgid ""
":issue:`21802`: The reader in BufferedRWPair now is closed even when closing"
" writer failed in BufferedRWPair.close()."
msgstr ":issue:`21802`: 现在，即使写入器关闭失败，BufferedRWPair.close() 中的读取器也会被关闭。"

#: ../NEWS:53253
msgid ""
":issue:`23622`: Unknown escapes in regular expressions that consist of "
"``'\\'`` and ASCII letter now raise a deprecation warning and will be "
"forbidden in Python 3.6."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23622`: 现在，由 ``'\\'`` 和 ASCII 字母组成的正则表达式中的未知转义将引发弃用警告，并将在 Python 3.6"
" 中禁止使用。"

#: ../NEWS:53257
msgid ""
":issue:`23671`: string.Template now allows specifying the \"self\" parameter"
" as a keyword argument.  string.Formatter now allows specifying the \"self\""
" and the \"format_string\" parameters as keyword arguments."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23671`: string.Template 现在允许将 \"self\" 参数指定为关键字参数。string.Formatter "
"现在允许将 \"self\" 和 \"format_string\" 参数指定为关键字参数。"

#: ../NEWS:53261
msgid ":issue:`23502`: The pprint module now supports mapping proxies."
msgstr ":issue:`23502`: pprint 模块现在支持映射代理。"

#: ../NEWS:53263
msgid ":issue:`17530`: pprint now wraps long bytes objects and bytearrays."
msgstr ":issue:`17530`: pprint 现在会换行显示长的 bytes 对象和 bytearrays。"

#: ../NEWS:53265
msgid ""
":issue:`22687`: Fixed some corner cases in breaking words in tetxtwrap. Got "
"rid of quadratic complexity in breaking long words."
msgstr ":issue:`22687`: 修复了 textwrap 中分割单词的一些极端情况。消除了分割长单词时的二次复杂度。"

#: ../NEWS:53268
msgid ""
":issue:`4727`: The copy module now uses pickle protocol 4 (PEP 3154) and "
"supports copying of instances of classes whose __new__ method takes keyword-"
"only arguments."
msgstr ""
":issue:`4727`: copy 模块现在使用 pickle 协议 4（PEP 3154），并支持复制其 __new__ "
"方法接受仅关键字参数的类实例。"

#: ../NEWS:53272
msgid ""
":issue:`23491`: Added a zipapp module to support creating executable zip "
"file archives of Python code. Registered \".pyz\" and \".pyzw\" extensions "
"on Windows for these archives (PEP 441)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23491`: 添加了一个 zipapp 模块以支持创建 Python 代码的可执行 zip 文件归档。为这些归档在 Windows "
"上注册了 \".pyz\" 和 \".pyzw\" 扩展名（PEP 441）。"

#: ../NEWS:53276
msgid ""
":issue:`23657`: Avoid explicit checks for str in zipapp, adding support for "
"pathlib.Path objects as arguments."
msgstr ":issue:`23657`: 避免在 zipapp 中显式检查 str，增加了对 pathlib.Path 对象作为参数的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:53279
msgid ""
":issue:`23688`: Added support of arbitrary bytes-like objects and avoided "
"unnecessary copying of memoryview in gzip.GzipFile.write(). Original patch "
"by Wolfgang Maier."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23688`: 添加了对任意字节类对象的支持，并避免了在 gzip.GzipFile.write() 中不必要地复制 "
"memoryview。原始由 Wolfgang Maier 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53283
msgid ""
":issue:`23252`: Added support for writing ZIP files to unseekable streams."
msgstr ":issue:`23252`: 添加了对将 ZIP 文件写入不可寻址流的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:53285
msgid ""
":issue:`23647`: Increase imaplib's MAXLINE to accommodate modern mailbox "
"sizes."
msgstr ":issue:`23647`: 增加了 imaplib 的 MAXLINE 以适应现代邮箱大小。"

#: ../NEWS:53287
msgid ""
":issue:`23539`: If body is None, http.client.HTTPConnection.request now sets"
" Content-Length to 0 for PUT, POST, and PATCH headers to avoid 411 errors "
"from some web servers."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23539`: 如果 body 为 None，http.client.HTTPConnection.request 现在会为 "
"PUT、POST 和 PATCH 头设置 Content-Length 为 0，以避免某些 web 服务器返回 411 错误。"

#: ../NEWS:53291
msgid ""
":issue:`22351`: The nntplib.NNTP constructor no longer leaves the connection"
" and socket open until the garbage collector cleans them up.  Patch by "
"Martin Panter."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22351`: nntplib.NNTP 构造函数不再保持连接和 socket 打开直到垃圾回收器清理它们。补丁由 Martin "
"Panter 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:53295
msgid ""
":issue:`23704`: collections.deque() objects now support methods for index(),"
" insert(), and copy().  This allows deques to be registered as a "
"MutableSequence and it improves their substitutability for lists."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23704`: collections.deque() 对象现在支持 index()、insert() 和 copy() 方法。这使得 "
"deque 可以注册为 MutableSequence 并且提高了它们替代列表的能力。"

#: ../NEWS:53299
msgid ""
":issue:`23715`: :func:`signal.sigwaitinfo` and :func:`signal.sigtimedwait` "
"are now retried when interrupted by a signal not in the *sigset* parameter, "
"if the signal handler does not raise an exception. signal.sigtimedwait() "
"recomputes the timeout with a monotonic clock when it is retried."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23715`: :func:`signal.sigwaitinfo` 和 :func:`signal.sigtimedwait` "
"现在当被不在 *sigset* 参数中的信号中断时，如果信号处理器没有引发异常，会重试。signal.sigtimedwait() "
"在重试时使用单调时钟重新计算超时。"

#: ../NEWS:53304
msgid ""
":issue:`23001`: Few functions in modules mmap, ossaudiodev, socket, ssl, and"
" codecs, that accepted only read-only bytes-like object now accept writable "
"bytes-like object too."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23001`: 在 mmap、ossaudiodev、socket、ssl 和 codecs 模块中，一些之前只接受只读 bytes-"
"like 对象的函数现在也接受可写的 bytes-like 对象。"

#: ../NEWS:53308
msgid ""
":issue:`23646`: If time.sleep() is interrupted by a signal, the sleep is now"
" retried with the recomputed delay, except if the signal handler raises an "
"exception (PEP 475)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23646`: 如果 time.sleep() 被信号中断，现在会使用重新计算的延迟重试睡眠，除非信号处理器引发异常（PEP 475）。"

#: ../NEWS:53312
msgid ""
":issue:`23136`: _strptime now uniformly handles all days in week 0, "
"including Dec 30 of previous year.  Based on patch by Jim Carroll."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23136`: _strptime 现在统一处理第 0 周的所有天，包括上一年的 12 月 30 日。基于 Jim Carroll "
"的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53315
msgid ""
":issue:`23700`: Iterator of NamedTemporaryFile now keeps a reference to "
"NamedTemporaryFile instance.  Patch by Bohuslav Kabrda."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23700`: NamedTemporaryFile 的迭代器现在保持对 NamedTemporaryFile 实例的引用。补丁由 "
"Bohuslav Kabrda 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:53318
msgid ""
":issue:`22903`: The fake test case created by unittest.loader when it fails "
"importing a test module is now picklable."
msgstr ":issue:`22903`: unittest.loader 在导入测试模块失败时创建的假测试用例现在可以 pickle。"

#: ../NEWS:53321
msgid ""
":issue:`22181`: On Linux, os.urandom() now uses the new getrandom() syscall "
"if available, syscall introduced in the Linux kernel 3.17. It is more "
"reliable and more secure, because it avoids the need of a file descriptor "
"and waits until the kernel has enough entropy."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22181`: 在 Linux 上，os.urandom() 现在如果可用会使用新的 getrandom() 系统调用，该系统调用在 "
"Linux 内核 3.17 中引入。它更可靠也更安全，因为它避免了文件描述符的需要，并等待内核有足够的熵。"

#: ../NEWS:53326
msgid ""
":issue:`2211`: Updated the implementation of the http.cookies.Morsel class. "
"Setting attributes key, value and coded_value directly now is deprecated. "
"update() and setdefault() now transform and check keys.  Comparing for "
"equality now takes into account attributes key, value and coded_value. "
"copy() now returns a Morsel, not a dict.  repr() now contains all "
"attributes. Optimized checking keys and quoting values.  Added new tests. "
"Original patch by Demian Brecht."
msgstr ""
":issue:`2211`: "
"更新了http.cookies.Morsel类的实现。现在直接设置属性key、value和coded_value已被弃用。update()和setdefault()现在会转换并检查键。比较相等性现在会考虑属性key、value和coded_value。copy()现在返回一个Morsel，而不是dict。repr()现在包含所有属性。优化了键的检查和值的引用。添加了新的测试。原始由Demian"
" Brecht提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53334
msgid ""
":issue:`18983`: Allow selection of output units in timeit. Patch by Julian "
"Gindi."
msgstr ":issue:`18983`: 允许在timeit中选择输出单位。由Julian Gindi提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53337
msgid ""
":issue:`23631`: Fix traceback.format_list when a traceback has been mutated."
msgstr ":issue:`23631`: 修复traceback.format_list当traceback被修改时的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:53339
msgid ""
":issue:`23568`: Add rdivmod support to MagicMock() objects. Patch by Håkan "
"Lövdahl."
msgstr ":issue:`23568`: 向MagicMock()对象添加rdivmod支持。由Håkan Lövdahl提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53342
msgid ":issue:`2052`: Add charset parameter to HtmlDiff.make_file()."
msgstr ":issue:`2052`: 向HtmlDiff.make_file()添加charset参数。"

#: ../NEWS:53344
msgid ":issue:`23668`: Support os.truncate and os.ftruncate on Windows."
msgstr ":issue:`23668`: 在Windows上支持os.truncate和os.ftruncate。"

#: ../NEWS:53346
msgid ""
":issue:`23138`: Fixed parsing cookies with absent keys or values in "
"cookiejar. Patch by Demian Brecht."
msgstr ":issue:`23138`: 修复了在cookiejar中解析缺少键或值的cookie的问题。由Demian Brecht提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53349
msgid ""
":issue:`23051`: multiprocessing.Pool methods imap() and imap_unordered() now"
" handle exceptions raised by an iterator.  Patch by Alon Diamant and Davin "
"Potts."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23051`: "
"multiprocessing.Pool方法imap()和imap_unordered()现在可以处理迭代器引发的异常。由Alon "
"Diamant和Davin Potts提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53353
msgid ""
":issue:`23581`: Add matmul support to MagicMock. Patch by Håkan Lövdahl."
msgstr ":issue:`23581`: 向MagicMock添加matmul支持。由Håkan Lövdahl提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53355
msgid ""
":issue:`23566`: enable(), register(), dump_traceback() and "
"dump_traceback_later() functions of faulthandler now accept file "
"descriptors. Patch by Wei Wu."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23566`: "
"faulthandler的enable()、register()、dump_traceback()和dump_traceback_later()函数现在接受文件描述符。由Wei"
" Wu提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53359
msgid ""
":issue:`22928`: Disabled HTTP header injections in http.client. Original "
"patch by Demian Brecht."
msgstr ":issue:`22928`: 在http.client中禁用了HTTP头注入。原始由Demian Brecht提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53362
msgid ""
":issue:`23615`: Modules bz2, tarfile and tokenize now can be reloaded with "
"imp.reload(). Patch by Thomas Kluyver."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23615`: 模块bz2、tarfile和tokenize现在可以通过imp.reload()重新加载。由Thomas "
"Kluyver提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53365
msgid ""
":issue:`23605`: os.walk() now calls os.scandir() instead of os.listdir(). "
"The usage of os.scandir() reduces the number of calls to os.stat(). Initial "
"patch written by Ben Hoyt."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23605`: "
"os.walk()现在调用os.scandir()而不是os.listdir()。使用os.scandir()减少了对os.stat()的调用次数。初始补丁由Ben"
" Hoyt编写。"

#: ../NEWS:53372
msgid ":issue:`23585`: make patchcheck will ensure the interpreter is built."
msgstr ":issue:`23585`: make patchcheck将确保解释器被构建。"

#: ../NEWS:53377
msgid ":issue:`23583`: Added tests for standard IO streams in IDLE."
msgstr ":issue:`23583`: 在IDLE中添加了标准IO流的测试。"

#: ../NEWS:53379
msgid ""
":issue:`22289`: Prevent test_urllib2net failures due to ftp connection "
"timeout."
msgstr ":issue:`22289`: 防止由于ftp连接超时导致的test_urllib2net失败。"

#: ../NEWS:53384
msgid ""
":issue:`22826`: The result of open() in Tools/freeze/bkfile.py is now better"
" compatible with regular files (in particular it now supports the context "
"management protocol)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22826`: Tools/freeze/bkfile.py 中的 open() "
"函数结果现在与常规文件更兼容（特别是现在支持上下文管理协议）。"

#: ../NEWS:53390
msgid "Python 3.5.0 alpha 2"
msgstr "Python 3.5.0 alpha 2"

#: ../NEWS:53392
msgid "*Release date: 2015-03-09*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2015-03-09*"

#: ../NEWS:53397
msgid ""
":issue:`23571`: PyObject_Call() and PyCFunction_Call() now raise a "
"SystemError if a function returns a result and raises an exception. The "
"SystemError is chained to the previous exception."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23571`: PyObject_Call() 和 PyCFunction_Call() 现在会在函数返回结果并引发异常时抛出 "
"SystemError。SystemError 会被链接到前一个异常。"

#: ../NEWS:53404
msgid ""
":issue:`22524`: New os.scandir() function, part of the :pep:`471`: "
"\"os.scandir() function -- a better and faster directory iterator\". Patch "
"written by Ben Hoyt."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22524`: 新增 os.scandir() 函数，属于 :pep:`471`: \"os.scandir() 函数 -- "
"一个更好更快的目录迭代器\"。补丁由 Ben Hoyt 编写。"

#: ../NEWS:53408
msgid ""
":issue:`23103`: Reduced the memory consumption of IPv4Address and "
"IPv6Address."
msgstr ":issue:`23103`: 减少了 IPv4Address 和 IPv6Address 的内存消耗。"

#: ../NEWS:53410
msgid ""
":issue:`21793`: BaseHTTPRequestHandler again logs response code as numeric, "
"not as stringified enum.  Patch by Demian Brecht."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21793`: BaseHTTPRequestHandler 再次将响应代码记录为数字，而不是字符串化的枚举。补丁由 Demian "
"Brecht 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:53413
msgid ""
":issue:`23476`: In the ssl module, enable OpenSSL's "
"X509_V_FLAG_TRUSTED_FIRST flag on certificate stores when it is available."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23476`: 在 ssl 模块中，当可用时，在证书存储上启用 OpenSSL 的 X509_V_FLAG_TRUSTED_FIRST "
"标志。"

#: ../NEWS:53416
msgid ""
":issue:`23576`: Avoid stalling in SSL reads when EOF has been reached in the"
" SSL layer but the underlying connection hasn't been closed."
msgstr ":issue:`23576`: 当 SSL 层已到达 EOF 但底层连接尚未关闭时，避免在 SSL 读取中停滞。"

#: ../NEWS:53419
msgid ":issue:`23504`: Added an __all__ to the types module."
msgstr ":issue:`23504`: 在 types 模块中添加了 __all__。"

#: ../NEWS:53421
msgid ":issue:`23563`: Optimized utility functions in urllib.parse."
msgstr ":issue:`23563`: 优化了 urllib.parse 中的实用函数。"

#: ../NEWS:53423
msgid ":issue:`7830`: Flatten nested functools.partial."
msgstr ":issue:`7830`: 扁平化嵌套的 functools.partial。"

#: ../NEWS:53425
msgid ":issue:`20204`: Added the __module__ attribute to _tkinter classes."
msgstr ":issue:`20204`: 为 _tkinter 类添加了 __module__ 属性。"

#: ../NEWS:53427
msgid ""
":issue:`19980`: Improved help() for non-recognized strings.  help('') now "
"shows the help on str.  help('help') now shows the help on help(). Original "
"patch by Mark Lawrence."
msgstr ""
":issue:`19980`: 改进了对非识别字符串的 help()。help('') 现在显示关于 str 的帮助。help('help') "
"现在显示关于 help() 的帮助。原始由 Mark Lawrence 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53431
msgid ""
":issue:`23521`: Corrected pure python implementation of timedelta division. "
"Eliminated OverflowError from ``timedelta * float`` for some floats; "
"Corrected rounding in timedelta true division."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23521`: 更正了 timedelta 除法的纯 Python 实现。对于某些浮点数，消除了 ``timedelta * "
"float`` 中的 OverflowError；更正了 timedelta 真除法中的舍入。"

#: ../NEWS:53435
msgid ""
":issue:`21619`: Popen objects no longer leave a zombie after exit in the "
"with statement if the pipe was broken.  Patch by Martin Panter."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21619`: 如果管道已断开，Popen 对象在 with 语句退出后不再留下僵尸进程。由 Martin Panter 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53438
msgid ""
":issue:`22936`: Make it possible to show local variables in tracebacks for "
"both the traceback module and unittest."
msgstr ":issue:`22936`: 使得可以在 traceback 模块和 unittest 中显示跟踪回溯中的局部变量。"

#: ../NEWS:53441
msgid ""
":issue:`15955`: Add an option to limit the output size in bz2.decompress(). "
"Patch by Nikolaus Rath."
msgstr ""
":issue:`15955`: 在 bz2.decompress() 中添加了一个选项以限制输出大小。由 Nikolaus Rath 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53444
msgid ""
":issue:`6639`: Module-level turtle functions no longer raise TclError after "
"closing the window."
msgstr ":issue:`6639`: 关闭窗口后，模块级的turtle函数不再引发TclError。"

#: ../NEWS:53447
msgid ""
":issue:`814253`: Group references and conditional group references now work "
"in lookbehind assertions in regular expressions. (See also: :issue:`9179`)"
msgstr ":issue:`814253`: 现在，在正则表达式的后向断言中，组引用和条件组引用可以正常工作。（另见：:issue:`9179`）"

#: ../NEWS:53450
msgid ""
":issue:`23215`: Multibyte codecs with custom error handlers that ignores "
"errors consumed too much memory and raised SystemError or MemoryError. "
"Original patch by Aleksi Torhamo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23215`: "
"使用自定义错误处理程序的多字节编解码器在忽略错误时消耗了过多内存并引发了SystemError或MemoryError。原始由Aleksi "
"Torhamo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53454
msgid ""
":issue:`5700`: io.FileIO() called flush() after closing the file. flush() "
"was not called in close() if closefd=False."
msgstr ""
":issue:`5700`: "
"io.FileIO()在关闭文件后调用了flush()。如果closefd=False，则在close()中不会调用flush()。"

#: ../NEWS:53457
msgid ""
":issue:`23374`: Fixed pydoc failure with non-ASCII files when stdout "
"encoding differs from file system encoding (e.g. on Mac OS)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23374`: 修复了当标准输出编码与文件系统编码不同（例如在Mac OS上）时，pydoc处理非ASCII文件失败的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:53460
msgid ":issue:`23481`: Remove RC4 from the SSL module's default cipher list."
msgstr ":issue:`23481`: 从SSL模块的默认密码列表中移除RC4。"

#: ../NEWS:53462
msgid ""
":issue:`21548`: Fix pydoc.synopsis() and pydoc.apropos() on modules with "
"empty docstrings."
msgstr ":issue:`21548`: 修复了pydoc.synopsis()和pydoc.apropos()在模块文档字符串为空时的行为。"

#: ../NEWS:53465
msgid ""
":issue:`22885`: Fixed arbitrary code execution vulnerability in the dbm.dumb"
" module. Original patch by Claudiu Popa."
msgstr ":issue:`22885`: 修复了dbm.dumb模块中的任意代码执行漏洞。原始由Claudiu Popa提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53468
msgid ""
":issue:`23239`: ssl.match_hostname() now supports matching of IP addresses."
msgstr ":issue:`23239`: ssl.match_hostname()现在支持IP地址的匹配。"

#: ../NEWS:53470
msgid ""
":issue:`23146`: Fix mishandling of absolute Windows paths with forward "
"slashes in pathlib."
msgstr ":issue:`23146`: 修复了pathlib中处理带有正斜杠的绝对Windows路径时的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:53473
msgid ""
":issue:`23096`: Pickle representation of floats with protocol 0 now is the "
"same for both Python and C implementations."
msgstr ":issue:`23096`: 现在，协议0下的浮点数的pickle表示在Python和C实现中是相同的。"

#: ../NEWS:53476
msgid ""
":issue:`19105`: pprint now more efficiently uses free space at the right."
msgstr ":issue:`19105`: pprint现在更有效地利用右侧的自由空间。"

#: ../NEWS:53478
msgid ""
":issue:`14910`: Add allow_abbrev parameter to argparse.ArgumentParser. Patch"
" by Jonathan Paugh, Steven Bethard, paul j3 and Daniel Eriksson."
msgstr ""
":issue:`14910`: 向argparse.ArgumentParser添加了allow_abbrev参数。由Jonathan "
"Paugh、Steven Bethard、paul j3和Daniel Eriksson提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53481
msgid ""
":issue:`21717`: tarfile.open() now supports 'x' (exclusive creation) mode."
msgstr ":issue:`21717`: tarfile.open()现在支持'x'（独占创建）模式。"

#: ../NEWS:53483
msgid ":issue:`23344`: marshal.dumps() is now 20-25% faster on average."
msgstr ":issue:`23344`: marshal.dumps()现在平均快了20-25%。"

#: ../NEWS:53485
msgid ""
":issue:`20416`: marshal.dumps() with protocols 3 and 4 is now 40-50% faster "
"on average."
msgstr ":issue:`20416`: 使用协议3和4的marshal.dumps()现在平均快了40-50%。"

#: ../NEWS:53488
msgid ":issue:`23421`: Fixed compression in tarfile CLI.  Patch by wdv4758h."
msgstr ":issue:`23421`: 修复了tarfile CLI中的压缩问题。由wdv4758h提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53490
msgid ":issue:`23367`: Fix possible overflows in the unicodedata module."
msgstr ":issue:`23367`: 修复了unicodedata模块中可能的溢出问题。"

#: ../NEWS:53492
msgid ""
":issue:`23361`: Fix possible overflow in Windows subprocess creation code."
msgstr ":issue:`23361`: 修复了Windows子进程创建代码中可能的溢出问题。"

#: ../NEWS:53494
msgid ""
"logging.handlers.QueueListener now takes a respect_handler_level keyword "
"argument which, if set to True, will pass messages to handlers taking "
"handler levels into account."
msgstr ""
"logging.handlers.QueueListener 现在接受一个 respect_handler_level 关键字参数，如果设置为 "
"True，将会在考虑处理器级别的情况下将消息传递给处理器。"

#: ../NEWS:53498
msgid ""
":issue:`19705`: turtledemo now has a visual sorting algorithm demo.  "
"Original patch from Jason Yeo."
msgstr ":issue:`19705`: turtledemo 现在有一个视觉排序算法演示。原始补丁来自 Jason Yeo。"

#: ../NEWS:53501
msgid ""
":issue:`23801`: Fix issue where cgi.FieldStorage did not always ignore the "
"entire preamble to a multipart body."
msgstr ":issue:`23801`: 修复了 cgi.FieldStorage 不总是忽略多部分主体的整个前导部分的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:53507
msgid ""
":issue:`23445`: pydebug builds now use \"gcc -Og\" where possible, to make "
"the resulting executable faster."
msgstr ":issue:`23445`: pydebug 构建现在尽可能使用 \"gcc -Og\"，以使生成的可执行文件更快。"

#: ../NEWS:53510
msgid ""
":issue:`23686`: Update OS X 10.5 installer build to use OpenSSL 1.0.2a."
msgstr ":issue:`23686`: 更新 OS X 10.5 安装程序构建以使用 OpenSSL 1.0.2a。"

#: ../NEWS:53515
msgid ""
":issue:`20204`: Deprecation warning is now raised for builtin types without "
"the __module__ attribute."
msgstr ":issue:`20204`: 现在对于没有 __module__ 属性的内置类型会发出弃用警告。"

#: ../NEWS:53521
msgid ""
":issue:`23465`: Implement :pep:`486` - Make the Python Launcher aware of "
"virtual environments. Patch by Paul Moore."
msgstr ":issue:`23465`: 实现 :pep:`486` - 使 Python 启动器感知虚拟环境。由 Paul Moore 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53524
msgid ""
":issue:`23437`: Make user scripts directory versioned on Windows. Patch by "
"Paul Moore."
msgstr ":issue:`23437`: 在 Windows 上使用户脚本目录版本化。由 Paul Moore 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53529
msgid "Python 3.5.0 alpha 1"
msgstr "Python 3.5.0 alpha 1"

#: ../NEWS:53531
msgid "*Release date: 2015-02-08*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2015-02-08*"

#: ../NEWS:53536
msgid ":issue:`23285`: PEP 475 - EINTR handling."
msgstr ":issue:`23285`: PEP 475 - EINTR 处理。"

#: ../NEWS:53538
msgid ""
":issue:`22735`: Fix many edge cases (including crashes) involving custom "
"mro() implementations."
msgstr ":issue:`22735`: 修复了许多涉及自定义 mro() 实现的边缘情况（包括崩溃）。"

#: ../NEWS:53541
msgid ""
":issue:`22896`: Avoid using PyObject_AsCharBuffer(), PyObject_AsReadBuffer()"
" and PyObject_AsWriteBuffer()."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22896`: 避免使用 PyObject_AsCharBuffer(), PyObject_AsReadBuffer() 和 "
"PyObject_AsWriteBuffer()。"

#: ../NEWS:53544
msgid ""
":issue:`21295`: Revert some changes (:issue:`16795`) to AST line numbers and"
" column offsets that constituted a regression."
msgstr ":issue:`21295`: 撤销了一些对 AST 行号和列偏移量的更改（:issue:`16795`），这些更改构成了回归。"

#: ../NEWS:53547
msgid ""
":issue:`22986`: Allow changing an object's __class__ between a dynamic type "
"and static type in some cases."
msgstr ":issue:`22986`: 在某些情况下允许更改对象的 __class__ 在动态类型和静态类型之间。"

#: ../NEWS:53550
msgid ""
":issue:`15859`: PyUnicode_EncodeFSDefault(), PyUnicode_EncodeMBCS() and "
"PyUnicode_EncodeCodePage() now raise an exception if the object is not a "
"Unicode object. For PyUnicode_EncodeFSDefault(), it was already the case on "
"platforms other than Windows. Patch written by Campbell Barton."
msgstr ""
":issue:`15859`: PyUnicode_EncodeFSDefault(), PyUnicode_EncodeMBCS() 和 "
"PyUnicode_EncodeCodePage() 现在如果对象不是 Unicode 对象则会引发异常。对于 "
"PyUnicode_EncodeFSDefault()，在非 Windows 平台上已经是这种情况。补丁由 Campbell Barton 编写。"

#: ../NEWS:53555
msgid ""
":issue:`21408`: The default __ne__() now returns NotImplemented if __eq__() "
"returned NotImplemented.  Original patch by Martin Panter."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21408`: 默认的 __ne__() 现在如果 __eq__() 返回 NotImplemented 则返回 "
"NotImplemented。原始由 Martin Panter 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53558
msgid ""
":issue:`23321`: Fixed a crash in str.decode() when error handler returned "
"replacement string longer than malformed input data."
msgstr ":issue:`23321`: 修复了当错误处理程序返回的替换字符串比畸形输入数据长时 str.decode() 中的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:53561
msgid ""
":issue:`22286`: The \"backslashreplace\" error handlers now works with "
"decoding and translating."
msgstr ":issue:`22286`: \"backslashreplace\" 错误处理程序现在可以用于解码和转换。"

#: ../NEWS:53564
msgid ""
":issue:`23253`: Delay-load ShellExecute[AW] in os.startfile for reduced "
"startup overhead on Windows."
msgstr ":issue:`23253`: 在Windows上延迟加载ShellExecute[AW]以减少os.startfile的启动开销。"

#: ../NEWS:53567
msgid ""
":issue:`22038`: pyatomic.h now uses stdatomic.h or GCC built-in functions "
"for atomic memory access if available. Patch written by Vitor de Lima and "
"Gustavo Temple."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22038`: pyatomic.h现在使用stdatomic.h或GCC内置函数进行原子内存访问（如果可用）。补丁由Vitor de "
"Lima和Gustavo Temple编写。"

#: ../NEWS:53571
msgid ""
":issue:`20284`: %-interpolation (aka printf) formatting added for bytes and "
"bytearray."
msgstr ":issue:`20284`: 为bytes和bytearray添加了%-插值（即printf）格式化。"

#: ../NEWS:53574
msgid ":issue:`23048`: Fix jumping out of an infinite while loop in the pdb."
msgstr ":issue:`23048`: 修复了在pdb中跳出无限while循环的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:53576
msgid ""
":issue:`20335`: bytes constructor now raises TypeError when encoding or "
"errors is specified with non-string argument.  Based on patch by Renaud "
"Blanch."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20335`: bytes构造函数现在在编码或错误与非字符串参数一起指定时引发TypeError。基于Renaud Blanch的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53579
msgid ""
":issue:`22834`: If the current working directory ends up being set to a non-"
"existent directory then import will no longer raise FileNotFoundError."
msgstr ":issue:`22834`: 如果当前工作目录最终被设置为不存在的目录，则导入将不再引发FileNotFoundError。"

#: ../NEWS:53582
msgid ""
":issue:`22869`: Move the interpreter startup & shutdown code to a new "
"dedicated pylifecycle.c module"
msgstr ":issue:`22869`: 将解释器启动和关闭代码移动到一个新的专用pylifecycle.c模块中。"

#: ../NEWS:53585
msgid ":issue:`22847`: Improve method cache efficiency."
msgstr ":issue:`22847`: 提高方法缓存的效率。"

#: ../NEWS:53587
msgid ""
":issue:`22335`: Fix crash when trying to enlarge a bytearray to 0x7fffffff "
"bytes on a 32-bit platform."
msgstr ":issue:`22335`: 修复在32位平台上尝试将bytearray扩大到0x7fffffff字节时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:53590
msgid ""
":issue:`22653`: Fix an assertion failure in debug mode when doing a "
"reentrant dict insertion in debug mode."
msgstr ":issue:`22653`: 修复在调试模式下进行可重入字典插入时的断言失败。"

#: ../NEWS:53593
msgid ""
":issue:`22643`: Fix integer overflow in Unicode case operations (upper, "
"lower, title, swapcase, casefold)."
msgstr ":issue:`22643`: 修复Unicode大小写操作（大写、小写、标题、交换大小写、casefold）中的整数溢出问题。"

#: ../NEWS:53596
msgid ""
":issue:`17636`: Circular imports involving relative imports are now "
"supported."
msgstr ":issue:`17636`: 现在支持涉及相对导入的循环导入。"

#: ../NEWS:53598
msgid ""
":issue:`22604`: Fix assertion error in debug mode when dividing a complex "
"number by (nan+0j)."
msgstr ":issue:`22604`: 修复在调试模式下将复数除以(nan+0j)时的断言错误。"

#: ../NEWS:53601
msgid ""
":issue:`21052`: Do not raise ImportWarning when sys.path_hooks or "
"sys.meta_path are set to None."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21052`: 当sys.path_hooks或sys.meta_path设置为None时，不引发ImportWarning。"

#: ../NEWS:53604
msgid ""
":issue:`16518`: Use 'bytes-like object required' in error messages that "
"previously used the far more cryptic \"'x' does not support the buffer "
"protocol."
msgstr ":issue:`16518`: 在错误消息中使用'需要类似字节的对象'，而不是之前使用的更为晦涩的\"'x'不支持缓冲区协议\"。"

#: ../NEWS:53608
msgid ""
":issue:`22470`: Fixed integer overflow issues in \"backslashreplace\", "
"\"xmlcharrefreplace\", and \"surrogatepass\" error handlers."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22470`: "
"修复了\"backslashreplace\"、\"xmlcharrefreplace\"和\"surrogatepass\"错误处理程序中的整数溢出问题。"

#: ../NEWS:53611
msgid ""
":issue:`22540`: speed up ``PyObject_IsInstance`` and ``PyObject_IsSubclass``"
" in the common case that the second argument has metaclass ``type``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22540`: 在第二个参数具有元类 ``type`` 的常见情况下，加速 ``PyObject_IsInstance`` "
"和``PyObject_IsSubclass``。"

#: ../NEWS:53614
msgid ""
":issue:`18711`: Add a new ``PyErr_FormatV`` function, similar to "
"``PyErr_Format`` but accepting a ``va_list`` argument."
msgstr ""
":issue:`18711`: 添加了一个新的 ``PyErr_FormatV`` 函数，类似于 "
"``PyErr_Format``，但接受一个``va_list``参数。"

#: ../NEWS:53617
msgid ""
":issue:`22520`: Fix overflow checking when generating the repr of a unicode "
"object."
msgstr ":issue:`22520`: 修复生成 unicode 对象 repr 时的溢出检查。"

#: ../NEWS:53620
msgid ":issue:`22519`: Fix overflow checking in PyBytes_Repr."
msgstr ":issue:`22519`: 修复 PyBytes_Repr 中的溢出检查。"

#: ../NEWS:53622
msgid ":issue:`22518`: Fix integer overflow issues in latin-1 encoding."
msgstr ":issue:`22518`: 修复 latin-1 编码中的整数溢出问题。"

#: ../NEWS:53624
msgid ""
":issue:`16324`: _charset parameter of MIMEText now also accepts "
"email.charset.Charset instances. Initial patch by Claude Paroz."
msgstr ""
":issue:`16324`: MIMEText 的 _charset 参数现在也接受 email.charset.Charset 实例。初始补丁由 "
"Claude Paroz 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:53627
msgid ""
":issue:`1764286`: Fix inspect.getsource() to support decorated functions. "
"Patch by Claudiu Popa."
msgstr ":issue:`1764286`: 修复 inspect.getsource() 以支持装饰函数。由 Claudiu Popa 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53630
msgid ":issue:`18554`: os.__all__ includes posix functions."
msgstr ":issue:`18554`: os.__all__ 包括 posix 函数。"

#: ../NEWS:53632
msgid ":issue:`21391`: Use os.path.abspath in the shutil module."
msgstr ":issue:`21391`: 在 shutil 模块中使用 os.path.abspath。"

#: ../NEWS:53634
msgid ""
":issue:`11471`: avoid generating a JUMP_FORWARD instruction at the end of an"
" if-block if there is no else-clause.  Original patch by Eugene Toder."
msgstr ""
":issue:`11471`: 避免在 if 块的末尾生成 JUMP_FORWARD 指令，如果没有 else 子句。原始由 Eugene Toder "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53637
msgid ""
":issue:`22215`: Now ValueError is raised instead of TypeError when str or "
"bytes argument contains not permitted null character or byte."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22215`: 现在当 str 或 bytes 参数包含不允许的空字符或字节时，会引发 ValueError 而不是 "
"TypeError。"

#: ../NEWS:53640
msgid ""
":issue:`22258`: Fix the internal function set_inheritable() on Illumos. This"
" platform exposes the function ``ioctl(FIOCLEX)``, but calling it fails with"
" errno is ENOTTY: \"Inappropriate ioctl for device\". set_inheritable() now "
"falls back to the slower ``fcntl()`` (``F_GETFD`` and then ``F_SETFD``)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22258`: 修复 Illumos 上的内部函数 set_inheritable()。该平台暴露了函数 "
"``ioctl(FIOCLEX)``，但调用它会失败，errno 是 ENOTTY: \"Inappropriate ioctl for "
"device\"。set_inheritable() 现在回退到较慢的 ``fcntl()`` (``F_GETFD`` 然后 "
"``F_SETFD``)。"

#: ../NEWS:53646
msgid ""
":issue:`21389`: Displaying the __qualname__ of the underlying function in "
"the repr of a bound method."
msgstr ":issue:`21389`: 在绑定方法的 repr 中显示底层函数的 __qualname__。"

#: ../NEWS:53649
msgid ""
":issue:`22206`: Using pthread, PyThread_create_key() now sets errno to "
"ENOMEM and returns -1 (error) on integer overflow."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22206`: 使用 pthread 时，PyThread_create_key() 现在在整数溢出时将 errno 设置为 "
"ENOMEM 并返回 -1（错误）。"

#: ../NEWS:53652
msgid ""
":issue:`20184`: Argument Clinic based signature introspection added for 30 "
"of the builtin functions."
msgstr ":issue:`20184`: 为 30 个内置函数添加了基于 Argument Clinic 的签名内省。"

#: ../NEWS:53655
msgid ""
":issue:`22116`: C functions and methods (of the 'builtin_function_or_method'"
" type) can now be weakref'ed.  Patch by Wei Wu."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22116`: C 函数和方法（'builtin_function_or_method' 类型）现在可以被弱引用。由 Wei Wu "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53658
msgid ""
":issue:`22077`: Improve index error messages for bytearrays, bytes, lists, "
"and tuples by adding 'or slices'. Added ', not <typename>' for bytearrays. "
"Original patch by Claudiu Popa."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22077`: 通过添加 'or slices' 改善 bytearrays、bytes、lists 和 tuples "
"的索引错误消息。为 bytearrays 添加了 ', not <typename>'。原始由 Claudiu Popa 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53662
msgid ""
":issue:`20179`: Apply Argument Clinic to bytes and bytearray. Patch by Tal "
"Einat."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20179`: 将 Argument Clinic 应用于 bytes 和 bytearray。由 Tal Einat 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53665
msgid ":issue:`22082`: Clear interned strings in slotdefs."
msgstr ":issue:`22082`: 清除 slotdefs 中的内部字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:53667
msgid "Upgrade Unicode database to Unicode 7.0.0."
msgstr "升级 Unicode 数据库到 7.0.0 版本。"

#: ../NEWS:53669
msgid ""
":issue:`21897`: Fix a crash with the f_locals attribute with closure "
"variables when frame.clear() has been called."
msgstr ":issue:`21897`: 修复当 frame.clear() 被调用时带有闭包变量的 f_locals 属性的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:53672
msgid ""
":issue:`21205`: Add a new ``__qualname__`` attribute to generator, the "
"qualified name, and use it in the representation of a generator "
"(``repr(gen)``). The default name of the generator (``__name__`` attribute) "
"is now get from the function instead of the code. Use "
"``gen.gi_code.co_name`` to get the name of the code."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21205`: 为生成器添加一个新的 ``__qualname__`` "
"属性，即限定名称，并在生成器的表示中使用它（``repr(gen)``）。生成器的默认名称（``__name__`` "
"属性）现在从函数中获取，而不是从代码中获取。使用 ``gen.gi_code.co_name`` 获取代码的名称。"

#: ../NEWS:53678
msgid ""
":issue:`21669`: With the aid of heuristics in SyntaxError.__init__, the "
"parser now attempts to generate more meaningful (or at least more search "
"engine friendly) error messages when \"exec\" and \"print\" are used as "
"statements."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21669`: 借助 SyntaxError.__init__ "
"中的启发式方法，解析器现在尝试在“exec”和“print”被用作语句时生成更有意义（或至少更搜索引擎友好）的错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:53682
msgid ""
":issue:`21642`: In the conditional if-else expression, allow an integer "
"written with no space between itself and the ``else`` keyword (e.g. ``True "
"if 42else False``) to be valid syntax."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21642`: 在条件 if-else 表达式中，允许整数与 ``else`` 关键字之间没有空格（例如 ``True if "
"42else False``）的写法作为有效语法。"

#: ../NEWS:53686
msgid ""
":issue:`21523`: Fix over-pessimistic computation of the stack effect of some"
" opcodes in the compiler.  This also fixes a quadratic compilation time "
"issue noticeable when compiling code with a large number of \"and\" and "
"\"or\" operators."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21523`: "
"修复了编译器中一些操作码堆栈效应的过度悲观计算。这也修复了当编译包含大量“and”和“or”运算符的代码时明显的二次编译时间问题。"

#: ../NEWS:53691
msgid ""
":issue:`21418`: Fix a crash in the builtin function super() when called "
"without argument and without current frame (ex: embedded Python)."
msgstr ":issue:`21418`: 修复了在没有参数且没有当前帧（例如嵌入式 Python）时调用内置函数 super() 时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:53694
msgid ""
":issue:`21425`: Fix flushing of standard streams in the interactive "
"interpreter."
msgstr ":issue:`21425`: 修复了交互式解释器中标准流的刷新问题。"

#: ../NEWS:53697
msgid ""
":issue:`21435`: In rare cases, when running finalizers on objects in cyclic "
"trash a bad pointer dereference could occur due to a subtle flaw in internal"
" iteration logic."
msgstr ":issue:`21435`: 在极少数情况下，对循环垃圾中的对象运行终结器时，由于内部迭代逻辑的微妙缺陷，可能会发生错误的指针解引用。"

#: ../NEWS:53701
msgid ""
":issue:`21377`: PyBytes_Concat() now tries to concatenate in-place when the "
"first argument has a reference count of 1.  Patch by Nikolaus Rath."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21377`: PyBytes_Concat() 现在尝试在第一个参数的引用计数为1时原地连接。由 Nikolaus Rath "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53704
msgid ""
":issue:`20355`: -W command line options now have higher priority than the "
"PYTHONWARNINGS environment variable.  Patch by Arfrever."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20355`: -W 命令行选项现在比 PYTHONWARNINGS 环境变量具有更高的优先级。由 Arfrever 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53707
msgid ":issue:`21274`: Define PATH_MAX for GNU/Hurd in Python/pythonrun.c."
msgstr ":issue:`21274`: 在 Python/pythonrun.c 中为 GNU/Hurd 定义 PATH_MAX。"

#: ../NEWS:53709
msgid ":issue:`20904`: Support setting FPU precision on m68k."
msgstr ":issue:`20904`: 支持在 m68k 上设置 FPU 精度。"

#: ../NEWS:53711
msgid ""
":issue:`21209`: Fix sending tuples to custom generator objects with the "
"yield from syntax."
msgstr ":issue:`21209`: 修复使用 yield from 语法向自定义生成器对象发送元组的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:53714
msgid ""
":issue:`21193`: pow(a, b, c) now raises ValueError rather than TypeError "
"when b is negative. Patch by Josh Rosenberg."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21193`: 当 b 为负数时，pow(a, b, c) 现在会引发 ValueError 而不是 TypeError。补丁由 "
"Josh Rosenberg 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:53717
msgid ""
":issue:`21176`: PEP 465: Add the '@' operator for matrix multiplication."
msgstr ":issue:`21176`: PEP 465: 为矩阵乘法添加'@'运算符。"

#: ../NEWS:53719
msgid ""
":issue:`21134`: Fix segfault when str is called on an uninitialized "
"UnicodeEncodeError, UnicodeDecodeError, or UnicodeTranslateError object."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21134`: "
"修复在未初始化的UnicodeEncodeError、UnicodeDecodeError或UnicodeTranslateError对象上调用str时出现的段错误。"

#: ../NEWS:53722
msgid ""
":issue:`19537`: Fix PyUnicode_DATA() alignment under m68k.  Patch by Andreas"
" Schwab."
msgstr ":issue:`19537`: 修复m68k下PyUnicode_DATA()的对齐问题。由Andreas Schwab提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53725
msgid ":issue:`20929`: Add a type cast to avoid shifting a negative number."
msgstr ":issue:`20929`: 添加类型转换以避免负数移位。"

#: ../NEWS:53727
msgid ""
":issue:`20731`: Properly position in source code files even if they are "
"opened in text mode. Patch by Serhiy Storchaka."
msgstr ":issue:`20731`: 即使以文本模式打开，也能正确定位源代码文件中的位置。由Serhiy Storchaka提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53730
msgid ""
":issue:`20637`: Key-sharing now also works for instance dictionaries of "
"subclasses.  Patch by Peter Ingebretson."
msgstr ":issue:`20637`: 键共享现在也适用于子类的实例字典。由Peter Ingebretson提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53733
msgid ""
":issue:`8297`: Attributes missing from modules now include the module name "
"in the error text.  Original patch by ysj.ray."
msgstr ":issue:`8297`: 模块中缺失的属性现在在错误文本中包含模块名称。原始由ysj.ray提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53736
msgid ""
":issue:`19995`: %c, %o, %x, and %X now raise TypeError on non-integer input."
msgstr ":issue:`19995`: %c、%o、%x和%X现在对非整数输入引发TypeError。"

#: ../NEWS:53738
msgid ""
":issue:`19655`: The ASDL parser - used by the build process to generate code"
" for managing the Python AST in C - was rewritten. The new parser is self "
"contained and does not require to carry long the spark.py parser-generator "
"library; spark.py was removed from the source base."
msgstr ""
":issue:`19655`: ASDL解析器 - 用于构建过程中生成用于在C中管理Python AST的代码 - "
"被重写。新解析器是自包含的，不需要携带spark.py解析器生成器库；spark.py已从源代码库中移除。"

#: ../NEWS:53743
msgid ""
":issue:`12546`: Allow ``\\x00`` to be used as a fill character when using "
"str, int, float, and complex __format__ methods."
msgstr ""
":issue:`12546`: 允许在使用str、int、float和complex的__format__方法时使用 ``\\x00`` 作为填充字符。"

#: ../NEWS:53746
msgid ":issue:`20480`: Add ipaddress.reverse_pointer. Patch by Leon Weber."
msgstr ":issue:`20480`: 添加ipaddress.reverse_pointer。由Leon Weber提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53748
msgid ""
":issue:`13598`: Modify string.Formatter to support auto-numbering of "
"replacement fields. It now matches the behavior of str.format() in this "
"regard. Patches by Phil Elson and Ramchandra Apte."
msgstr ""
":issue:`13598`: "
"修改string.Formatter以支持替换字段的自动编号。现在在这方面它与str.format()的行为相匹配。由Phil "
"Elson和Ramchandra Apte提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53752
msgid ""
":issue:`8931`: Make alternate formatting ('#') for type 'c' raise an "
"exception. In versions prior to 3.5, '#' with 'c' had no effect. Now "
"specifying it is an error. Patch by Torsten Landschoff."
msgstr ""
":issue:`8931`: "
"使类型'c'的替代格式('#')引发异常。在3.5之前的版本中，'#'与'c'一起使用没有效果。现在指定它是一个错误。由Torsten "
"Landschoff提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53756
msgid ""
":issue:`23165`: Perform overflow checks before allocating memory in the "
"_Py_char2wchar function."
msgstr ":issue:`23165`: 在_Py_char2wchar函数中分配内存之前执行溢出检查。"

#: ../NEWS:53762
msgid ":issue:`23399`: pyvenv creates relative symlinks where possible."
msgstr ":issue:`23399`: pyvenv尽可能创建相对符号链接。"

#: ../NEWS:53764
msgid ""
":issue:`20289`: cgi.FieldStorage() now supports the context management "
"protocol."
msgstr ":issue:`20289`: cgi.FieldStorage()现在支持上下文管理协议。"

#: ../NEWS:53767
msgid ""
":issue:`13128`: Print response headers for CONNECT requests when debuglevel "
"> 0. Patch by Demian Brecht."
msgstr ":issue:`13128`: 当debuglevel > 0时，打印CONNECT请求的响应头。由Demian Brecht提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53770
msgid ""
":issue:`15381`: Optimized io.BytesIO to make less allocations and copyings."
msgstr ":issue:`15381`: 优化了 io.BytesIO 以减少分配和复制操作。"

#: ../NEWS:53772
msgid ""
":issue:`22818`: Splitting on a pattern that could match an empty string now "
"raises a warning.  Patterns that can only match empty strings are now "
"rejected."
msgstr ":issue:`22818`: 现在，对可能匹配空字符串的模式进行拆分时会发出警告。只能匹配空字符串的模式现已被拒绝。"

#: ../NEWS:53776
msgid ""
":issue:`23099`: Closing io.BytesIO with exported buffer is rejected now to "
"prevent corrupting exported buffer."
msgstr ":issue:`23099`: 现在拒绝关闭带有导出缓冲区的 io.BytesIO，以防止损坏导出的缓冲区。"

#: ../NEWS:53779
msgid ""
":issue:`23326`: Removed __ne__ implementations.  Since fixing default __ne__"
" implementation in :issue:`21408` they are redundant."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23326`: 移除了 __ne__ 实现。由于在 :issue:`21408` 中修复了默认的 __ne__ 实现，它们现在是多余的。"

#: ../NEWS:53782
msgid ":issue:`23363`: Fix possible overflow in itertools.permutations."
msgstr ":issue:`23363`: 修复了 itertools.permutations 中可能的溢出问题。"

#: ../NEWS:53784
msgid ":issue:`23364`: Fix possible overflow in itertools.product."
msgstr ":issue:`23364`: 修复了 itertools.product 中可能的溢出问题。"

#: ../NEWS:53786
msgid ""
":issue:`23366`: Fixed possible integer overflow in itertools.combinations."
msgstr ":issue:`23366`: 修复了 itertools.combinations 中可能的整数溢出问题。"

#: ../NEWS:53788
msgid ""
":issue:`23369`: Fixed possible integer overflow in "
"_json.encode_basestring_ascii."
msgstr ":issue:`23369`: 修复了 _json.encode_basestring_ascii 中可能的整数溢出问题。"

#: ../NEWS:53791
msgid ""
":issue:`23353`: Fix the exception handling of generators in "
"PyEval_EvalFrameEx(). At entry, save or swap the exception state even if "
"PyEval_EvalFrameEx() is called with throwflag=0. At exit, the exception "
"state is now always restored or swapped, not only if why is WHY_YIELD or "
"WHY_RETURN. Patch co-written with Antoine Pitrou."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23353`: 修复了 PyEval_EvalFrameEx() 中生成器的异常处理。在入口处，即使 "
"PyEval_EvalFrameEx() 以 throwflag=0 调用，也会保存或交换异常状态。在退出时，异常状态现在总是被恢复或交换，不仅当 "
"why 是 WHY_YIELD 或 WHY_RETURN 时。补丁由 Antoine Pitrou 共同编写。"

#: ../NEWS:53797
msgid ""
":issue:`14099`: Restored support of writing ZIP files to tellable but non-"
"seekable streams."
msgstr ":issue:`14099`: 恢复了对可定位但不可寻址流的 ZIP 文件写入支持。"

#: ../NEWS:53800
msgid ""
":issue:`14099`: Writing to ZipFile and reading multiple ZipExtFiles is "
"threadsafe now."
msgstr ":issue:`14099`: 现在，写入 ZipFile 和读取多个 ZipExtFiles 是线程安全的。"

#: ../NEWS:53803
msgid ""
":issue:`19361`: JSON decoder now raises JSONDecodeError instead of "
"ValueError."
msgstr ":issue:`19361`: JSON 解码器现在引发 JSONDecodeError 而不是 ValueError。"

#: ../NEWS:53805
msgid ""
":issue:`18518`: timeit now rejects statements which can't be compiled "
"outside a function or a loop (e.g. \"return\" or \"break\")."
msgstr ":issue:`18518`: timeit 现在拒绝不能在函数或循环外编译的语句（例如 \"return\" 或 \"break\"）。"

#: ../NEWS:53808
msgid ""
":issue:`23094`: Fixed readline with frames in Python implementation of "
"pickle."
msgstr ":issue:`23094`: 修复了 pickle 的 Python 实现中带有帧的 readline 问题。"

#: ../NEWS:53810
msgid ":issue:`23268`: Fixed bugs in the comparison of ipaddress classes."
msgstr ":issue:`23268`: 修复了 ipaddress 类比较中的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:53812
msgid ""
":issue:`21408`: Removed incorrect implementations of __ne__() which didn't "
"returned NotImplemented if __eq__() returned NotImplemented.  The default "
"__ne__() now works correctly."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21408`: 移除了不正确的 __ne__() 实现，这些实现在 __eq__() 返回 NotImplemented 时没有返回 "
"NotImplemented。现在默认的 __ne__() 工作正常。"

#: ../NEWS:53816
msgid ""
":issue:`19996`: :class:`email.feedparser.FeedParser` now handles (malformed)"
" headers with no key rather than assuming the body has started."
msgstr ""
":issue:`19996`: :class:`email.feedparser.FeedParser` "
"现在处理（格式错误的）没有键的头部，而不是假设主体已经开始。"

#: ../NEWS:53819
msgid ""
":issue:`20188`: Support Application-Layer Protocol Negotiation (ALPN) in the"
" ssl module."
msgstr ":issue:`20188`: 在ssl模块中支持应用层协议协商(ALPN)。"

#: ../NEWS:53822
msgid ""
":issue:`23133`: Pickling of ipaddress objects now produces more compact and "
"portable representation."
msgstr ":issue:`23133`: ipaddress对象的pickle现在生成更紧凑且可移植的表示。"

#: ../NEWS:53825
msgid ":issue:`23248`: Update ssl error codes from latest OpenSSL git master."
msgstr ":issue:`23248`: 从最新的OpenSSL git master更新ssl错误代码。"

#: ../NEWS:53827
msgid ""
":issue:`23266`: Much faster implementation of ipaddress.collapse_addresses()"
" when there are many non-consecutive addresses."
msgstr ":issue:`23266`: 当存在许多非连续地址时，ipaddress.collapse_addresses()的实现速度大幅提升。"

#: ../NEWS:53830
msgid ":issue:`23098`: 64-bit dev_t is now supported in the os module."
msgstr ":issue:`23098`: os模块现在支持64位的dev_t。"

#: ../NEWS:53832
msgid ""
":issue:`21817`: When an exception is raised in a task submitted to a "
"ProcessPoolExecutor, the remote traceback is now displayed in the parent "
"process.  Patch by Claudiu Popa."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21817`: 当提交给ProcessPoolExecutor的任务中抛出异常时，现在会在父进程中显示远程回溯。由Claudiu "
"Popa提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53836
msgid ""
":issue:`15955`: Add an option to limit output size when decompressing LZMA "
"data.  Patch by Nikolaus Rath and Martin Panter."
msgstr ""
":issue:`15955`: 添加一个选项以限制解压LZMA数据时的输出大小。由Nikolaus Rath和Martin Panter提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53839
msgid ""
":issue:`23250`: In the http.cookies module, capitalize \"HttpOnly\" and "
"\"Secure\" as they are written in the standard."
msgstr ":issue:`23250`: 在http.cookies模块中，将\"HttpOnly\"和\"Secure\"按照标准中的写法大写。"

#: ../NEWS:53842
msgid ""
":issue:`23063`: In the distutils' check command, fix parsing of reST with "
"code or code-block directives."
msgstr ":issue:`23063`: 在distutils的check命令中，修复带有code或code-block指令的reST的解析。"

#: ../NEWS:53845
msgid ""
":issue:`23209`: selectors.BaseSelector.get_key() now raises a RuntimeError "
"if the selector is closed. And selectors.BaseSelector.close() now clears its"
" internal reference to the selector mapping to break a reference cycle. "
"Initial patch written by Martin Richard. (See also: :issue:`23225`)"
msgstr ""
":issue:`23209`: "
"如果选择器已关闭，selectors.BaseSelector.get_key()现在会抛出RuntimeError。并且selectors.BaseSelector.close()现在会清除其对选择器映射的内部引用以打破引用循环。初始补丁由Martin"
" Richard编写。（另见：:issue:`23225`）"

#: ../NEWS:53850
msgid ""
":issue:`17911`: Provide a way to seed the linecache for a PEP-302 module "
"without actually loading the code."
msgstr ":issue:`17911`: 提供一种方式来为PEP-302模块的linecache播种，而无需实际加载代码。"

#: ../NEWS:53853
msgid ""
":issue:`17911`: Provide a new object API for traceback, including the "
"ability to not lookup lines at all until the traceback is actually rendered,"
" without any trace of the original objects being kept alive."
msgstr ""
":issue:`17911`: 为traceback提供一个新的对象API，包括能够不在回溯实际渲染之前查找行，且不保留原始对象的任何痕迹。"

#: ../NEWS:53857
msgid ""
":issue:`19777`: Provide a home() classmethod on Path objects.  Contributed "
"by Victor Salgado and Mayank Tripathi."
msgstr ""
":issue:`19777`: 在Path对象上提供一个home()类方法。由Victor Salgado和Mayank Tripathi贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:53860
msgid ""
":issue:`23206`: Make ``json.dumps(..., ensure_ascii=False)`` as fast as the "
"default case of ``ensure_ascii=True``.  Patch by Naoki Inada."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23206`: 使 ``json.dumps(..., ensure_ascii=False)`` 与默认情况 "
"``ensure_ascii=True`` 一样快。由Naoki Inada提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53863
msgid ":issue:`23185`: Add math.inf and math.nan constants."
msgstr ":issue:`23185`: 添加math.inf和math.nan常量。"

#: ../NEWS:53865
msgid ""
":issue:`23186`: Add ssl.SSLObject.shared_ciphers() and "
"ssl.SSLSocket.shared_ciphers() to fetch the client's list ciphers sent at "
"handshake."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23186`: 添加 ssl.SSLObject.shared_ciphers() 和 "
"ssl.SSLSocket.shared_ciphers() 以获取客户端在握手时发送的加密套件列表。"

#: ../NEWS:53869
msgid ":issue:`23143`: Remove compatibility with OpenSSLs older than 0.9.8."
msgstr ":issue:`23143`: 移除对早于0.9.8版本的OpenSSL的兼容性支持。"

#: ../NEWS:53871
msgid ""
":issue:`23132`: Improve performance and introspection support of comparison "
"methods created by functool.total_ordering."
msgstr ":issue:`23132`: 改进由functool.total_ordering创建的比较方法的性能和内省支持。"

#: ../NEWS:53874
msgid ":issue:`19776`: Add an expanduser() method on Path objects."
msgstr ":issue:`19776`: 在Path对象上添加expanduser()方法。"

#: ../NEWS:53876
msgid ""
":issue:`23112`: Fix SimpleHTTPServer to correctly carry the query string and"
" fragment when it redirects to add a trailing slash."
msgstr ":issue:`23112`: 修复SimpleHTTPServer在重定向添加尾部斜杠时正确携带查询字符串和片段的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:53879
msgid ""
":issue:`21793`: Added http.HTTPStatus enums (i.e. HTTPStatus.OK, "
"HTTPStatus.NOT_FOUND). Patch by Demian Brecht."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21793`: 添加了http.HTTPStatus枚举（例如HTTPStatus.OK, "
"HTTPStatus.NOT_FOUND）。补丁由Demian Brecht提供。"

#: ../NEWS:53882
msgid ""
":issue:`23093`: In the io, module allow more operations to work on detached "
"streams."
msgstr ":issue:`23093`: 在io模块中，允许更多操作在已分离的流上工作。"

#: ../NEWS:53885
msgid ""
":issue:`23111`: In the ftplib, make ssl.PROTOCOL_SSLv23 the default protocol"
" version."
msgstr ":issue:`23111`: 在ftplib中，使ssl.PROTOCOL_SSLv23成为默认协议版本。"

#: ../NEWS:53888
msgid ""
":issue:`22585`: On OpenBSD 5.6 and newer, os.urandom() now calls "
"getentropy(), instead of reading /dev/urandom, to get pseudo-random bytes."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22585`: 在OpenBSD "
"5.6及更新版本上，os.urandom()现在调用getentropy()，而不是读取/dev/urandom，来获取伪随机字节。"

#: ../NEWS:53891
msgid ""
":issue:`19104`: pprint now produces evaluable output for wrapped strings."
msgstr ":issue:`19104`: pprint现在为包装的字符串生成可评估的输出。"

#: ../NEWS:53893
msgid ""
":issue:`23071`: Added missing names to codecs.__all__.  Patch by Martin "
"Panter."
msgstr ":issue:`23071`: 向codecs.__all__添加了缺失的名称。由Martin Panter提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53895
msgid ""
":issue:`22783`: Pickling now uses the NEWOBJ opcode instead of the NEWOBJ_EX"
" opcode if possible."
msgstr ":issue:`22783`: 如果可能，Pickling现在使用NEWOBJ操作码而不是NEWOBJ_EX操作码。"

#: ../NEWS:53898
msgid ":issue:`15513`: Added a __sizeof__ implementation for pickle classes."
msgstr ":issue:`15513`: 为pickle类添加了__sizeof__实现。"

#: ../NEWS:53900
msgid ""
":issue:`19858`: pickletools.optimize() now aware of the MEMOIZE opcode, can "
"produce more compact result and no longer produces invalid output if input "
"data contains MEMOIZE opcodes together with PUT or BINPUT opcodes."
msgstr ""
":issue:`19858`: "
"pickletools.optimize()现在能够识别MEMOIZE操作码，可以生成更紧凑的结果，并且在输入数据包含与PUT或BINPUT操作码一起的MEMOIZE操作码时不再生成无效输出。"

#: ../NEWS:53904
msgid ""
":issue:`22095`: Fixed HTTPConnection.set_tunnel with default port.  The port"
" value in the host header was set to \"None\".  Patch by Demian Brecht."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22095`: "
"修复了HTTPConnection.set_tunnel的默认端口问题。主机头中的端口值被设置为\"None\"。由Demian Brecht提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53907
msgid ""
":issue:`23016`: A warning no longer produces an AttributeError when the "
"program is run with pythonw.exe."
msgstr ":issue:`23016`: 当程序使用pythonw.exe运行时，警告不再产生AttributeError。"

#: ../NEWS:53910
msgid ""
":issue:`21775`: shutil.copytree(): fix crash when copying to VFAT. An "
"exception handler assumed that OSError objects always have a 'winerror' "
"attribute. That is not the case, so the exception handler itself raised "
"AttributeError when run on Linux (and, presumably, any other non-Windows "
"OS). Patch by Greg Ward."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21775`: shutil.copytree(): "
"修复在复制到VFAT时崩溃的问题。异常处理程序假设OSError对象总是有'winerror'属性。但事实并非如此，因此在Linux（以及任何其他非Windows操作系统）上运行时，异常处理程序本身会引发AttributeError。由Greg"
" Ward提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53916
msgid ""
":issue:`1218234`: Fix inspect.getsource() to load updated source of reloaded"
" module. Initial patch by Berker Peksag."
msgstr ""
":issue:`1218234`: 修复inspect.getsource()以加载重新加载模块的更新源代码。初始由Berker Peksag提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53919
msgid ""
":issue:`21740`: Support wrapped callables in doctest. Patch by Claudiu Popa."
msgstr ":issue:`21740`: 在doctest中支持包装的可调用对象。由Claudiu Popa提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53921
msgid ""
":issue:`23009`: Make sure selectors.EpollSelector.select() works when no FD "
"is registered."
msgstr ":issue:`23009`: 确保selectors.EpollSelector.select()在没有FD注册时也能工作。"

#: ../NEWS:53924
msgid ""
":issue:`22959`: In the constructor of http.client.HTTPSConnection, prefer "
"the context's check_hostname attribute over the *check_hostname* parameter."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22959`: "
"在http.client.HTTPSConnection的构造函数中，优先使用上下文的check_hostname属性而不是 "
"*check_hostname* 参数。"

#: ../NEWS:53927
msgid ""
":issue:`22696`: Add function :func:`sys.is_finalizing` to know about "
"interpreter shutdown."
msgstr ":issue:`22696`: 添加函数 :func:`sys.is_finalizing` 以了解解释器关闭状态。"

#: ../NEWS:53930
msgid ""
":issue:`16043`: Add a default limit for the amount of data "
"xmlrpclib.gzip_decode will return. This resolves :cve:`2013-1753`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`16043`: 为xmlrpclib.gzip_decode返回的数据量添加默认限制。这解决了 :cve:`2013-1753`。"

#: ../NEWS:53933
msgid ""
":issue:`14099`: ZipFile.open() no longer reopen the underlying file.  "
"Objects returned by ZipFile.open() can now operate independently of the "
"ZipFile even if the ZipFile was created by passing in a file-like object as "
"the first argument to the constructor."
msgstr ""
":issue:`14099`: "
"ZipFile.open()不再重新打开底层文件。ZipFile.open()返回的对象现在可以独立于ZipFile操作，即使ZipFile是通过将类似文件的对象作为构造函数的第一个参数传递而创建的。"

#: ../NEWS:53938
msgid ""
":issue:`22966`: Fix __pycache__ pyc file name clobber when pyc_compile is "
"asked to compile a source file containing multiple dots in the source file "
"name."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22966`: 修复当pyc_compile被要求编译包含源文件名中多个点的源文件时，__pycache__ pyc文件名冲突的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:53941
msgid ":issue:`21971`: Update turtledemo doc and add module to the index."
msgstr ":issue:`21971`: 更新turtledemo文档并将模块添加到索引中。"

#: ../NEWS:53943
msgid ""
":issue:`21032`: Fixed socket leak if HTTPConnection.getresponse() fails. "
"Original patch by Martin Panter."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21032`: 修复如果HTTPConnection.getresponse()失败时的套接字泄漏问题。原始由Martin "
"Panter提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53946
msgid ""
":issue:`22407`: Deprecated the use of re.LOCALE flag with str patterns or "
"re.ASCII. It was newer worked."
msgstr ":issue:`22407`: 弃用re.LOCALE标志与str模式或re.ASCII一起使用。它从未工作过。"

#: ../NEWS:53949
msgid ""
":issue:`22902`: The \"ip\" command is now used on Linux to determine MAC "
"address in uuid.getnode().  Patch by Bruno Cauet."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22902`: 在Linux上现在使用“ip”命令在uuid.getnode()中确定MAC地址。由Bruno Cauet提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53952
msgid ""
":issue:`22960`: Add a context argument to xmlrpclib.ServerProxy constructor."
msgstr ":issue:`22960`: 向xmlrpclib.ServerProxy构造函数添加上下文参数。"

#: ../NEWS:53954
msgid ":issue:`22389`: Add contextlib.redirect_stderr()."
msgstr ":issue:`22389`: 添加contextlib.redirect_stderr()。"

#: ../NEWS:53956
msgid ""
":issue:`21356`: Make ssl.RAND_egd() optional to support LibreSSL. The "
"availability of the function is checked during the compilation. Patch "
"written by Bernard Spil."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21356`: 使 ssl.RAND_egd() 成为可选项以支持 LibreSSL。该函数的可用性在编译期间进行检查。补丁由 "
"Bernard Spil 编写。"

#: ../NEWS:53960
msgid ""
":issue:`22915`: SAX parser now supports files opened with file descriptor or"
" bytes path."
msgstr ":issue:`22915`: SAX 解析器现在支持通过文件描述符或字节路径打开的文件。"

#: ../NEWS:53963
msgid ""
":issue:`22609`: Constructors and update methods of mapping classes in the "
"collections module now accept the self keyword argument."
msgstr ":issue:`22609`: collections 模块中的映射类的构造函数和更新方法现在接受 self 关键字参数。"

#: ../NEWS:53966
msgid ":issue:`22940`: Add readline.append_history_file."
msgstr ":issue:`22940`: 添加 readline.append_history_file。"

#: ../NEWS:53968
msgid ":issue:`19676`: Added the \"namereplace\" error handler."
msgstr ":issue:`19676`: 添加了 \"namereplace\" 错误处理程序。"

#: ../NEWS:53970
msgid ""
":issue:`22788`: Add *context* parameter to logging.handlers.HTTPHandler."
msgstr ":issue:`22788`: 向 logging.handlers.HTTPHandler 添加 *context* 参数。"

#: ../NEWS:53972
msgid ""
":issue:`22921`: Allow SSLContext to take the *hostname* parameter even if "
"OpenSSL doesn't support SNI."
msgstr ":issue:`22921`: 允许 SSLContext 接受 *hostname* 参数，即使 OpenSSL 不支持 SNI。"

#: ../NEWS:53975
msgid ""
":issue:`22894`: TestCase.subTest() would cause the test suite to be stopped "
"when in failfast mode, even in the absence of failures."
msgstr ":issue:`22894`: TestCase.subTest() 在 failfast 模式下会导致测试套件停止，即使没有失败。"

#: ../NEWS:53978
msgid ""
":issue:`22796`: HTTP cookie parsing is now stricter, in order to protect "
"against potential injection attacks."
msgstr ":issue:`22796`: HTTP cookie 解析现在更加严格，以防范潜在的注入攻击。"

#: ../NEWS:53981
msgid ":issue:`22370`: Windows detection in pathlib is now more robust."
msgstr ":issue:`22370`: pathlib 中的 Windows 检测现在更加健壮。"

#: ../NEWS:53983
msgid ""
":issue:`22841`: Reject coroutines in asyncio add_signal_handler(). Patch by "
"Ludovic.Gasc."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22841`: 在 asyncio add_signal_handler() 中拒绝协程。由 Ludovic.Gasc 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53986
msgid ""
":issue:`19494`: Added urllib.request.HTTPBasicPriorAuthHandler. Patch by "
"Matej Cepl."
msgstr ""
":issue:`19494`: 添加了 urllib.request.HTTPBasicPriorAuthHandler。由 Matej Cepl "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:53989
msgid ":issue:`22578`: Added attributes to the re.error class."
msgstr ":issue:`22578`: 向 re.error 类添加了属性。"

#: ../NEWS:53991
msgid ""
":issue:`22849`: Fix possible double free in the io.TextIOWrapper "
"constructor."
msgstr ":issue:`22849`: 修复了 io.TextIOWrapper 构造函数中可能的双重释放问题。"

#: ../NEWS:53993
msgid ""
":issue:`12728`: Different Unicode characters having the same uppercase but "
"different lowercase are now matched in case-insensitive regular expressions."
msgstr ":issue:`12728`: 现在在不区分大小写的正则表达式中匹配具有相同大写但不同小写的不同 Unicode 字符。"

#: ../NEWS:53997
msgid ""
":issue:`22821`: Fixed fcntl() with integer argument on 64-bit big-endian "
"platforms."
msgstr ":issue:`22821`: 修复了在 64 位大端平台上使用整数参数的 fcntl()。"

#: ../NEWS:54000
msgid ":issue:`21650`: Add an ``--sort-keys`` option to ``json.tool`` CLI."
msgstr ":issue:`21650`: 向 ``json.tool`` CLI 添加了一个 ``--sort-keys`` 选项。"

#: ../NEWS:54002
msgid ""
":issue:`22824`: Updated reprlib output format for sets to use set literals. "
"Patch contributed by Berker Peksag."
msgstr ":issue:`22824`: 更新了 reprlib 中集合的输出格式以使用集合字面量。补丁由 Berker Peksag 贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:54005
msgid ""
":issue:`22824`: Updated reprlib output format for arrays to display empty "
"arrays without an unnecessary empty list.  Suggested by Serhiy Storchaka."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22824`: 更新了 reprlib 中数组的输出格式，以显示没有不必要空列表的空数组。建议由 Serhiy Storchaka "
"提出。"

#: ../NEWS:54008
msgid ""
":issue:`22406`: Fixed the uu_codec codec incorrectly ported to 3.x. Based on"
" patch by Martin Panter."
msgstr ":issue:`22406`: 修复了错误移植到 3.x 的 uu_codec 编解码器。基于 Martin Panter 的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54011
msgid ""
":issue:`17293`: uuid.getnode() now determines MAC address on AIX using "
"netstat. Based on patch by Aivars Kalvāns."
msgstr ""
":issue:`17293`: uuid.getnode() 现在在 AIX 上使用 netstat 确定 MAC 地址。基于 Aivars "
"Kalvāns 的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54014
msgid ""
":issue:`22769`: Fixed ttk.Treeview.tag_has() when called without arguments."
msgstr ":issue:`22769`: 修复了 ttk.Treeview.tag_has() 在没有参数调用时的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:54016
msgid ":issue:`22417`: Verify certificates by default in httplib (PEP 476)."
msgstr ":issue:`22417`: 在 httplib 中默认验证证书 (PEP 476)。"

#: ../NEWS:54018
msgid ""
":issue:`22775`: Fixed unpickling of http.cookies.SimpleCookie with protocol "
"2 and above. Patch by Tim Graham."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22775`: 修复了使用协议 2 及以上版本对 http.cookies.SimpleCookie 的反序列化。补丁由 Tim "
"Graham 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:54021
msgid ""
":issue:`22776`: Brought excluded code into the scope of a try block in "
"SysLogHandler.emit()."
msgstr ":issue:`22776`: 在 SysLogHandler.emit() 中将排除的代码移至 try 块的作用域内。"

#: ../NEWS:54024
msgid ""
":issue:`22665`: Add missing get_terminal_size and SameFileError to "
"shutil.__all__."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22665`: 将缺失的 get_terminal_size 和 SameFileError 添加到 shutil.__all__。"

#: ../NEWS:54027
msgid ""
":issue:`6623`: Remove deprecated Netrc class in the ftplib module. Patch by "
"Matt Chaput."
msgstr ":issue:`6623`: 移除了 ftplib 模块中已弃用的 Netrc 类。由 Matt Chaput 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54030
msgid ""
":issue:`17381`: Fixed handling of case-insensitive ranges in regular "
"expressions."
msgstr ":issue:`17381`: 修复了正则表达式中不区分大小写范围的处理。"

#: ../NEWS:54033
msgid ""
":issue:`22410`: Module level functions in the re module now cache compiled "
"locale-dependent regular expressions taking into account the locale."
msgstr ":issue:`22410`: re 模块中的模块级函数现在会缓存考虑到区域的依赖于区域设置的编译后的正则表达式。"

#: ../NEWS:54036
msgid ""
":issue:`22759`: Query methods on pathlib.Path() (exists(), is_dir(), etc.) "
"now return False when the underlying stat call raises NotADirectoryError."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22759`: pathlib.Path() 上的查询方法 (exists(), is_dir() 等) 现在在底层 stat 调用引发"
" NotADirectoryError 时返回 False。"

#: ../NEWS:54039
msgid ""
":issue:`8876`: distutils now falls back to copying files when hard linking "
"doesn't work. This allows use with special filesystems such as VirtualBox "
"shared folders."
msgstr ""
":issue:`8876`: distutils 现在在硬链接不起作用时回退到复制文件。这允许使用如 VirtualBox "
"共享文件夹这样的特殊文件系统。"

#: ../NEWS:54043
msgid ":issue:`22217`: Implemented reprs of classes in the zipfile module."
msgstr ":issue:`22217`: 实现了 zipfile 模块中类的 reprs。"

#: ../NEWS:54045
msgid ":issue:`22457`: Honour load_tests in the start_dir of discovery."
msgstr ":issue:`22457`: 在发现的 start_dir 中尊重 load_tests。"

#: ../NEWS:54047
msgid ""
":issue:`18216`: gettext now raises an error when a .mo file has an "
"unsupported major version number.  Patch by Aaron Hill."
msgstr ":issue:`18216`: gettext 现在在 .mo 文件有不受支持的主版本号时引发错误。由 Aaron Hill 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54050
msgid ""
":issue:`13918`: Provide a locale.delocalize() function which can remove "
"locale-specific number formatting from a string representing a number, "
"without then converting it to a specific type.  Patch by Cédric Krier."
msgstr ""
":issue:`13918`: 提供了一个 locale.delocalize() "
"函数，可以从表示数字的字符串中移除区域特定的数字格式，而不将其转换为特定类型。由 Cédric Krier 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54054
msgid ""
":issue:`22676`: Make the pickling of global objects which don't have a "
"__module__ attribute less slow."
msgstr ":issue:`22676`: 使没有 __module__ 属性的全局对象的序列化不那么慢。"

#: ../NEWS:54057
msgid ":issue:`18853`: Fixed ResourceWarning in shlex.__nain__."
msgstr ":issue:`18853`: 修复了 shlex.__nain__ 中的 ResourceWarning。"

#: ../NEWS:54059
msgid ""
":issue:`9351`: Defaults set with set_defaults on an argparse subparser are "
"no longer ignored when also set on the parent parser."
msgstr ":issue:`9351`: 使用 set_defaults 在 argparse 子解析器上设置的默认值不再在父解析器上也设置时被忽略。"

#: ../NEWS:54062
msgid ""
":issue:`7559`: unittest test loading ImportErrors are reported as import "
"errors with their import exception rather than as attribute errors after the"
" import has already failed."
msgstr ""
":issue:`7559`: unittest 测试加载时的 ImportErrors 现在会在导入失败后作为导入异常报告，而不是属性错误。"

#: ../NEWS:54066
msgid ""
":issue:`19746`: Make it possible to examine the errors from unittest "
"discovery without executing the test suite. The new ``errors`` attribute on "
"``TestLoader`` exposes these non-fatal errors encountered during discovery."
msgstr ""
":issue:`19746`: 使得无需执行测试套件即可检查 unittest 发现过程中的错误。``TestLoader`` 的新 "
"``errors`` 属性暴露了在发现过程中遇到的这些非致命错误。"

#: ../NEWS:54071
msgid ""
":issue:`21991`: Make email.headerregistry's header 'params' attributes be "
"read-only (MappingProxyType).  Previously the dictionary was modifiable but "
"a new one was created on each access of the attribute."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21991`: 使 email.headerregistry 的头 'params' "
"属性变为只读（MappingProxyType）。之前字典是可修改的，但每次访问属性时都会创建一个新的字典。"

#: ../NEWS:54075
msgid ""
":issue:`22638`: SSLv3 is now disabled throughout the standard library. It "
"can still be enabled by instantiating a SSLContext manually."
msgstr ":issue:`22638`: 现在整个标准库中 SSLv3 已被禁用。仍然可以通过手动实例化 SSLContext 来启用它。"

#: ../NEWS:54078
msgid ""
":issue:`22641`: In asyncio, the default SSL context for client connections "
"is now created using ssl.create_default_context(), for stronger security."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22641`: 在 asyncio 中，客户端连接的默认 SSL 上下文现在使用 "
"ssl.create_default_context() 创建，以提高安全性。"

#: ../NEWS:54081
msgid ":issue:`17401`: Include closefd in io.FileIO repr."
msgstr ":issue:`17401`: 在 io.FileIO 的 repr 中包含 closefd。"

#: ../NEWS:54083
msgid ""
":issue:`21338`: Add silent mode for compileall. quiet parameters of "
"compile_{dir, file, path} functions now have a multilevel value. Also, -q "
"option of the CLI now have a multilevel value. Patch by Thomas Kluyver."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21338`: 为 compileall 添加静默模式。compile_{dir, file, path} 函数的 quiet "
"参数现在具有多级值。此外，CLI 的 -q 选项现在也具有多级值。由 Thomas Kluyver 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54087
msgid ""
":issue:`20152`: Convert the array and cmath modules to Argument Clinic."
msgstr ":issue:`20152`: 将 array 和 cmath 模块转换为 Argument Clinic。"

#: ../NEWS:54089
msgid ":issue:`18643`: Add socket.socketpair() on Windows."
msgstr ":issue:`18643`: 在 Windows 上添加 socket.socketpair()。"

#: ../NEWS:54091
msgid ""
":issue:`22435`: Fix a file descriptor leak when socketserver bind fails."
msgstr ":issue:`22435`: 修复 socketserver 绑定失败时的文件描述符泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:54093
msgid ""
":issue:`13096`: Fixed segfault in CTypes POINTER handling of large values."
msgstr ":issue:`13096`: 修复了 CTypes POINTER 处理大值时出现的段错误。"

#: ../NEWS:54095
msgid ""
":issue:`11694`: Raise ConversionError in xdrlib as documented.  Patch by "
"Filip Gruszczyński and Claudiu Popa."
msgstr ""
":issue:`11694`: 如文档所述，在 xdrlib 中引发 ConversionError。由 Filip Gruszczyński 和 "
"Claudiu Popa 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54098
msgid ":issue:`19380`: Optimized parsing of regular expressions."
msgstr ":issue:`19380`: 优化了正则表达式的解析。"

#: ../NEWS:54100
msgid ""
":issue:`1519638`: Now unmatched groups are replaced with empty strings in "
"re.sub() and re.subn()."
msgstr ":issue:`1519638`: 现在在 re.sub() 和 re.subn() 中，未匹配的组将被空字符串替换。"

#: ../NEWS:54103
msgid ":issue:`18615`: sndhdr.what/whathdr now return a namedtuple."
msgstr ":issue:`18615`: sndhdr.what/whathdr 现在返回一个 namedtuple。"

#: ../NEWS:54105
msgid ""
":issue:`22462`: Fix pyexpat's creation of a dummy frame to make it appear in"
" exception tracebacks."
msgstr ":issue:`22462`: 修复 pyexpat 创建虚拟帧以使其出现在异常回溯中的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:54108
msgid ""
":issue:`21965`: Add support for in-memory SSL to the ssl module.  Patch by "
"Geert Jansen."
msgstr ":issue:`21965`: 为 ssl 模块添加对内存中 SSL 的支持。由 Geert Jansen 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54111
msgid ""
":issue:`21173`: Fix len() on a WeakKeyDictionary when .clear() was called "
"with an iterator alive."
msgstr ":issue:`21173`: 修复了在调用.clear()时有迭代器存活时，对WeakKeyDictionary的len()操作的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:54114
msgid ""
":issue:`11866`: Eliminated race condition in the computation of names for "
"new threads."
msgstr ":issue:`11866`: 消除了新线程名称计算中的竞态条件。"

#: ../NEWS:54117
msgid ""
":issue:`21905`: Avoid RuntimeError in pickle.whichmodule() when sys.modules "
"is mutated while iterating.  Patch by Olivier Grisel."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21905`: "
"在迭代过程中当sys.modules被修改时，避免pickle.whichmodule()中的RuntimeError。由Olivier "
"Grisel提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54120
msgid ""
":issue:`11271`: concurrent.futures.Executor.map() now takes a *chunksize* "
"argument to allow batching of tasks in child processes and improve "
"performance of ProcessPoolExecutor.  Patch by Dan O'Reilly."
msgstr ""
":issue:`11271`: concurrent.futures.Executor.map()现在接受一个 *chunksize* "
"参数，允许在子进程中批量处理任务并提高ProcessPoolExecutor的性能。由Dan O'Reilly提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54124
msgid ""
":issue:`21883`: os.path.join() and os.path.relpath() now raise a TypeError "
"with more helpful error message for unsupported or mismatched types of "
"arguments."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21883`: "
"os.path.join()和os.path.relpath()现在对于不支持或参数类型不匹配的情况，会抛出带有更有帮助的错误信息的TypeError。"

#: ../NEWS:54128
msgid ""
":issue:`22219`: The zipfile module CLI now adds entries for directories "
"(including empty directories) in ZIP file."
msgstr ":issue:`22219`: zipfile模块的命令行接口现在为ZIP文件中的目录（包括空目录）添加条目。"

#: ../NEWS:54131
msgid ""
":issue:`22449`: In the ssl.SSLContext.load_default_certs, consult the "
"environmental variables SSL_CERT_DIR and SSL_CERT_FILE on Windows."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22449`: "
"在ssl.SSLContext.load_default_certs中，在Windows上查询环境变量SSL_CERT_DIR和SSL_CERT_FILE。"

#: ../NEWS:54134
msgid ""
":issue:`22508`: The email.__version__ variable has been removed; the email "
"code is no longer shipped separately from the stdlib, and __version__ hasn't"
" been updated in several releases."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22508`: "
"移除了email.__version__变量；email代码不再与标准库分开提供，并且__version__在多个版本中未更新。"

#: ../NEWS:54138
msgid ""
":issue:`20076`: Added non derived UTF-8 aliases to locale aliases table."
msgstr ":issue:`20076`: 向语言环境别名表添加了非派生的UTF-8别名。"

#: ../NEWS:54140
msgid ""
":issue:`20079`: Added locales supported in glibc 2.18 to locale alias table."
msgstr ":issue:`20079`: 向语言环境别名表添加了glibc 2.18支持的语言环境。"

#: ../NEWS:54142
msgid ""
":issue:`20218`: Added convenience methods read_text/write_text and "
"read_bytes/ write_bytes to pathlib.Path objects."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20218`: "
"向pathlib.Path对象添加了便利方法read_text/write_text和read_bytes/write_bytes。"

#: ../NEWS:54145
msgid ""
":issue:`22396`: On 32-bit AIX platform, don't expose os.posix_fadvise() nor "
"os.posix_fallocate() because their prototypes in system headers are wrong."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22396`: "
"在32位AIX平台上，不暴露os.posix_fadvise()和os.posix_fallocate()，因为它们在系统头文件中的原型是错误的。"

#: ../NEWS:54148
msgid ""
":issue:`22517`: When an io.BufferedRWPair object is deallocated, clear its "
"weakrefs."
msgstr ":issue:`22517`: 当io.BufferedRWPair对象被析构时，清除其弱引用。"

#: ../NEWS:54151
msgid ""
":issue:`22437`: Number of capturing groups in regular expression is no "
"longer limited by 100."
msgstr ":issue:`22437`: 正则表达式中的捕获组数量不再限制为100。"

#: ../NEWS:54154
msgid ""
":issue:`17442`: InteractiveInterpreter now displays the full chained "
"traceback in its showtraceback method, to match the built in interactive "
"interpreter."
msgstr ""
":issue:`17442`: "
"InteractiveInterpreter现在在其showtraceback方法中显示完整的链式回溯，以匹配内置的交互式解释器。"

#: ../NEWS:54158
msgid ":issue:`23392`: Added tests for marshal C API that works with FILE*."
msgstr ":issue:`23392`: 添加了与FILE*一起工作的marshal C API的测试。"

#: ../NEWS:54160
msgid ""
":issue:`10510`: distutils register and upload methods now use HTML standards"
" compliant CRLF line endings."
msgstr ":issue:`10510`: distutils的register和upload方法现在使用符合HTML标准的CRLF行尾。"

#: ../NEWS:54163
msgid ""
":issue:`9850`: Fixed macpath.join() for empty first component.  Patch by "
"Oleg Oshmyan."
msgstr ":issue:`9850`: 修复了macpath.join()对于空的第一组件的问题。由Oleg Oshmyan提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54166
msgid ""
":issue:`5309`: distutils' build and build_ext commands now accept a ``-j`` "
"option to enable parallel building of extension modules."
msgstr ""
":issue:`5309`: distutils的build和build_ext命令现在接受一个 ``-j`` 选项以启用扩展模块的并行构建。"

#: ../NEWS:54169
msgid ""
":issue:`22448`: Improve canceled timer handles cleanup to prevent unbound "
"memory usage. Patch by Joshua Moore-Oliva."
msgstr ":issue:`22448`: 改进取消的定时器句柄清理以防止无限制的内存使用。补丁由Joshua Moore-Oliva提供。"

#: ../NEWS:54172
msgid ""
":issue:`22427`: TemporaryDirectory no longer attempts to clean up twice when"
" used in the with statement in generator."
msgstr ":issue:`22427`: 当在生成器中使用with语句时，TemporaryDirectory不再尝试两次清理。"

#: ../NEWS:54175
msgid ""
":issue:`22362`: Forbidden ambiguous octal escapes out of range 0-0o377 in "
"regular expressions."
msgstr ":issue:`22362`: 禁止在正则表达式中使用超出0-0o377范围的模糊八进制转义。"

#: ../NEWS:54178
msgid ""
":issue:`20912`: Now directories added to ZIP file have correct Unix and MS-"
"DOS directory attributes."
msgstr ":issue:`20912`: 现在添加到ZIP文件的目录具有正确的Unix和MS-DOS目录属性。"

#: ../NEWS:54181
msgid ""
":issue:`21866`: ZipFile.close() no longer writes ZIP64 central directory "
"records if allowZip64 is false."
msgstr ":issue:`21866`: 如果allowZip64为false，ZipFile.close()不再写入ZIP64中央目录记录。"

#: ../NEWS:54184
msgid ""
":issue:`22278`: Fix urljoin problem with relative urls, a regression "
"observed after changes to issue22118 were submitted."
msgstr ":issue:`22278`: 修复了urljoin在处理相对URL时的问题，这是在提交issue22118的更改后观察到的回归。"

#: ../NEWS:54187
msgid ""
":issue:`22415`: Fixed debugging output of the GROUPREF_EXISTS opcode in the "
"re module. Removed trailing spaces in debugging output."
msgstr ":issue:`22415`: 修复了re模块中GROUPREF_EXISTS操作码的调试输出。移除了调试输出中的尾随空格。"

#: ../NEWS:54190
msgid ""
":issue:`22423`: Unhandled exception in thread no longer causes unhandled "
"AttributeError when sys.stderr is None."
msgstr ":issue:`22423`: 线程中的未处理异常不再导致当sys.stderr为None时未处理的AttributeError。"

#: ../NEWS:54193
msgid ""
":issue:`21332`: Ensure that ``bufsize=1`` in subprocess.Popen() selects line"
" buffering, rather than block buffering.  Patch by Akira Li."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21332`: 确保subprocess.Popen()中的 ``bufsize=1`` 选择行缓冲，而不是块缓冲。由Akira "
"Li提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54196
msgid ""
":issue:`21091`: Fix API bug: email.message.EmailMessage.is_attachment is now"
" a method."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21091`: 修复API错误：email.message.EmailMessage.is_attachment现在是一个方法。"

#: ../NEWS:54199
msgid ""
":issue:`21079`: Fix email.message.EmailMessage.is_attachment to return the "
"correct result when the header has parameters as well as a value."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21079`: "
"修复email.message.EmailMessage.is_attachment以在头部既有参数又有值时返回正确的结果。"

#: ../NEWS:54202
msgid ":issue:`22247`: Add NNTPError to nntplib.__all__."
msgstr ":issue:`22247`: 将NNTPError添加到nntplib.__all__。"

#: ../NEWS:54204
msgid ""
":issue:`22366`: urllib.request.urlopen will accept a context object "
"(SSLContext) as an argument which will then be used for HTTPS connection. "
"Patch by Alex Gaynor."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22366`: "
"urllib.request.urlopen将接受一个上下文对象（SSLContext）作为参数，该对象将用于HTTPS连接。由Alex "
"Gaynor提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54208
msgid ""
":issue:`4180`: The warnings registries are now reset when the filters are "
"modified."
msgstr ":issue:`4180`: 当过滤器被修改时，警告注册表现在被重置。"

#: ../NEWS:54211
msgid ""
":issue:`22419`: Limit the length of incoming HTTP request in wsgiref server "
"to 65536 bytes and send a 414 error code for higher lengths. Patch "
"contributed by Devin Cook."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22419`: 限制 wsgiref 服务器中传入 HTTP 请求的长度为 65536 字节，对于超出此长度的请求发送 414 "
"错误代码。由 Devin Cook 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54215
msgid ""
"Lax cookie parsing in http.cookies could be a security issue when combined "
"with non-standard cookie handling in some web browsers.  Reported by Sergey "
"Bobrov."
msgstr ""
"http.cookies 中的宽松 cookie 解析在与某些网页浏览器的非标准 cookie 处理结合使用时可能成为安全问题。由 Sergey "
"Bobrov 报告。"

#: ../NEWS:54219
msgid ""
":issue:`20537`: logging methods now accept an exception instance as well as "
"a Boolean value or exception tuple. Thanks to Yury Selivanov for the patch."
msgstr ":issue:`20537`: 日志记录方法现在接受异常实例以及布尔值或异常元组。感谢 Yury Selivanov 提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54222
msgid ""
":issue:`22384`: An exception in Tkinter callback no longer crashes the "
"program when it is run with pythonw.exe."
msgstr ":issue:`22384`: 当使用 pythonw.exe 运行时，Tkinter 回调中的异常不再导致程序崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:54225
msgid ""
":issue:`22168`: Prevent turtle AttributeError with non-default Canvas on OS "
"X."
msgstr ":issue:`22168`: 在 OS X 上使用非默认 Canvas 时防止 turtle 的 AttributeError。"

#: ../NEWS:54227
msgid ""
":issue:`21147`: sqlite3 now raises an exception if the request contains a "
"null character instead of truncating it.  Based on patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21147`: 如果请求包含空字符，sqlite3 现在会引发异常而不是截断它。基于 Victor Stinner 的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54230
msgid ""
":issue:`13968`: The glob module now supports recursive search in "
"subdirectories using the ``**`` pattern."
msgstr ":issue:`13968`: glob 模块现在支持使用 ``**`` 模式在子目录中进行递归搜索。"

#: ../NEWS:54233
msgid ""
":issue:`21951`: Fixed a crash in Tkinter on AIX when called Tcl command with"
" empty string or tuple argument."
msgstr ":issue:`21951`: 修复了在 AIX 上当使用空字符串或元组参数调用 Tcl 命令时 Tkinter 的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:54236
msgid ""
":issue:`21951`: Tkinter now most likely raises MemoryError instead of crash "
"if the memory allocation fails."
msgstr ":issue:`21951`: 如果内存分配失败，Tkinter 现在更可能引发 MemoryError 而不是崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:54239
msgid ""
":issue:`22338`: Fix a crash in the json module on memory allocation failure."
msgstr ":issue:`22338`: 修复了 json 模块在内存分配失败时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:54241
msgid ""
":issue:`12410`: imaplib.IMAP4 now supports the context management protocol. "
"Original patch by Tarek Ziadé."
msgstr ":issue:`12410`: imaplib.IMAP4 现在支持上下文管理协议。原始由 Tarek Ziadé 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54244
msgid ""
":issue:`21270`: We now override tuple methods in mock.call objects so that "
"they can be used as normal call attributes."
msgstr ":issue:`21270`: 我们现在在 mock.call 对象中覆盖元组方法，以便它们可以用作普通的调用属性。"

#: ../NEWS:54247
msgid ""
":issue:`16662`: ``load_tests()`` is now unconditionally run when it is "
"present in a package's ``__init__.py``.  "
"``TestLoader.loadTestsFromModule()`` still accepts use_load_tests, but it is"
" deprecated and ignored.  A new keyword-only attribute ``pattern`` is added "
"and documented.  Patch given by Robert Collins, tweaked by Barry Warsaw."
msgstr ""
":issue:`16662`: 当 ``load_tests()`` 存在于包的 ``__init__.py`` "
"中时，现在无条件运行。``TestLoader.loadTestsFromModule()`` 仍然接受 "
"use_load_tests，但它已被弃用并被忽略。新增并文档化了一个仅关键字的属性 ``pattern``。由 Robert Collins "
"提供补丁，Barry Warsaw 进行了调整。"

#: ../NEWS:54253
msgid ""
":issue:`22226`: First letter no longer is stripped from the \"status\" key "
"in the result of Treeview.heading()."
msgstr ":issue:`22226`: Treeview.heading() 的结果中 \"status\" 键的第一个字母不再被剥离。"

#: ../NEWS:54256
msgid ""
":issue:`19524`: Fixed resource leak in the HTTP connection when an invalid "
"response is received.  Patch by Martin Panter."
msgstr ":issue:`19524`: 修复了在接收到无效响应时HTTP连接的资源泄漏问题。由Martin Panter提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54259
msgid ""
":issue:`20421`: Add a .version() method to SSL sockets exposing the actual "
"protocol version in use."
msgstr ":issue:`20421`: 向SSL套接字添加了.version()方法，暴露实际使用的协议版本。"

#: ../NEWS:54262
msgid ""
":issue:`19546`: configparser exceptions no longer expose implementation "
"details. Chained KeyErrors are removed, which leads to cleaner tracebacks. "
"Patch by Claudiu Popa."
msgstr ""
":issue:`19546`: configparser异常不再暴露实现细节。移除了链式KeyErrors，使得跟踪回溯更加清晰。由Claudiu "
"Popa提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54266
msgid ""
":issue:`22051`: turtledemo no longer reloads examples to re-run them. "
"Initialization of variables and gui setup should be done in main(), which is"
" called each time a demo is run, but not on import."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22051`: "
"turtledemo不再重新加载示例来重新运行它们。变量初始化和GUI设置应该在main()中完成，每次运行演示时都会调用main()，但不会在导入时调用。"

#: ../NEWS:54270
msgid ""
":issue:`21933`: Turtledemo users can change the code font size with a menu "
"selection or control(command) '-' or '+' or control-mousewheel. Original "
"patch by Lita Cho."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21933`: Turtledemo用户可以通过菜单选择或控制(command) "
"'-'或'+'或控制鼠标滚轮来更改代码字体大小。原始由Lita Cho提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54274
msgid ""
":issue:`21597`: The separator between the turtledemo text pane and the "
"drawing canvas can now be grabbed and dragged with a mouse.  The code text "
"pane can be widened to easily view or copy the full width of the text.  The "
"canvas can be widened on small screens.  Original patches by Jan Kanis and "
"Lita Cho."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21597`: "
"现在可以通过鼠标抓取和拖动turtledemo文本窗格和绘图画布之间的分隔符。可以加宽代码文本窗格以便轻松查看或复制文本的完整宽度。在小屏幕上可以加宽画布。原始由Jan"
" Kanis和Lita Cho提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54280
msgid ""
":issue:`18132`: Turtledemo buttons no longer disappear when the window is "
"shrunk.  Original patches by Jan Kanis and Lita Cho."
msgstr ":issue:`18132`: 当窗口缩小时，Turtledemo按钮不再消失。原始由Jan Kanis和Lita Cho提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54283
msgid ""
":issue:`22043`: time.monotonic() is now always available. "
"``threading.Lock.acquire()``, ``threading.RLock.acquire()`` and socket "
"operations now use a monotonic clock, instead of the system clock, when a "
"timeout is used."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22043`: "
"time.monotonic()现在总是可用。``threading.Lock.acquire()``、``threading.RLock.acquire()``和套接字操作现在在使用超时时使用单调时钟，而不是系统时钟。"

#: ../NEWS:54288
msgid ""
":issue:`21527`: Add a default number of workers to ThreadPoolExecutor equal "
"to 5 times the number of CPUs.  Patch by Claudiu Popa."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21527`: 向ThreadPoolExecutor添加了默认的工作线程数，等于CPU数量的5倍。由Claudiu Popa提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54291
msgid ""
":issue:`22216`: smtplib now resets its state more completely after a quit.  "
"The most obvious consequence of the previous behavior was a STARTTLS failure"
" during a connect/starttls/quit/connect/starttls sequence."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22216`: "
"smtplib现在在退出后更完全地重置其状态。之前行为的最明显后果是在connect/starttls/quit/connect/starttls序列中的STARTTLS失败。"

#: ../NEWS:54295
msgid ""
":issue:`22098`: ctypes' BigEndianStructure and LittleEndianStructure now "
"define an empty __slots__ so that subclasses don't always get an instance "
"dict. Patch by Claudiu Popa."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22098`: "
"ctypes的BigEndianStructure和LittleEndianStructure现在定义了一个空的__slots__，这样子类不会总是得到一个实例字典。由Claudiu"
" Popa提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54299
msgid ""
":issue:`22185`: Fix an occasional RuntimeError in threading.Condition.wait()"
" caused by mutation of the waiters queue without holding the lock.  Patch by"
" Doug Zongker."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22185`: "
"修复了threading.Condition.wait()中因不持有锁而修改等待队列导致的偶尔出现的RuntimeError。由Doug "
"Zongker提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54303
msgid ""
":issue:`22287`: On UNIX, _PyTime_gettimeofday() now uses "
"clock_gettime(CLOCK_REALTIME) if available. As a side effect, Python now "
"depends on the librt library on Solaris and on Linux (only with glibc older "
"than 2.17)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22287`: "
"在UNIX上，_PyTime_gettimeofday()现在使用clock_gettime(CLOCK_REALTIME)（如果可用）。作为副作用，Python现在在Solaris和Linux上（仅glibc版本低于2.17时）依赖于librt库。"

#: ../NEWS:54308
msgid ""
":issue:`22182`: Use e.args to unpack exceptions correctly in "
"distutils.file_util.move_file. Patch by Claudiu Popa."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22182`: 在distutils.file_util.move_file中正确使用e.args来解包异常。由Claudiu "
"Popa提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54311
msgid ""
"The webbrowser module now uses subprocess's start_new_session=True rather "
"than a potentially risky preexec_fn=os.setsid call."
msgstr ""
"webbrowser模块现在使用subprocess的start_new_session=True，而不是潜在风险的preexec_fn=os.setsid调用。"

#: ../NEWS:54314
msgid ""
":issue:`22042`: signal.set_wakeup_fd(fd) now raises an exception if the file"
" descriptor is in blocking mode."
msgstr ":issue:`22042`: 如果文件描述符处于阻塞模式，signal.set_wakeup_fd(fd)现在会引发异常。"

#: ../NEWS:54317
msgid ""
":issue:`16808`: inspect.stack() now returns a named tuple instead of a "
"tuple. Patch by Daniel Shahaf."
msgstr ":issue:`16808`: inspect.stack()现在返回一个命名元组而不是元组。由Daniel Shahaf提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54320
msgid ""
":issue:`22236`: Fixed Tkinter images copying operations in NoDefaultRoot "
"mode."
msgstr ":issue:`22236`: 修复了在NoDefaultRoot模式下的Tkinter图像复制操作。"

#: ../NEWS:54322
msgid ""
":issue:`2527`: Add a *globals* argument to timeit functions, in order to "
"override the globals namespace in which the timed code is executed. Patch by"
" Ben Roberts."
msgstr ""
":issue:`2527`: 向timeit函数添加了一个 *globals* 参数，以便覆盖执行定时代码的全局命名空间。补丁由Ben "
"Roberts提供。"

#: ../NEWS:54326
msgid ""
":issue:`22118`: Switch urllib.parse to use RFC 3986 semantics for the "
"resolution of relative URLs, rather than RFCs 1808 and 2396. Patch by Demian"
" Brecht."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22118`: 将urllib.parse切换到使用RFC 3986语义解析相对URL，而不是RFCs "
"1808和2396。补丁由Demian Brecht提供。"

#: ../NEWS:54330
msgid ":issue:`21549`: Added the \"members\" parameter to TarFile.list()."
msgstr ":issue:`21549`: 向TarFile.list()添加了“members”参数。"

#: ../NEWS:54332
msgid ""
":issue:`19628`: Allow compileall recursion depth to be specified with a -r "
"option."
msgstr ":issue:`19628`: 允许通过-r选项指定compileall的递归深度。"

#: ../NEWS:54335
msgid ""
":issue:`15696`: Add a __sizeof__ implementation for mmap objects on Windows."
msgstr ":issue:`15696`: 为Windows上的mmap对象添加了__sizeof__实现。"

#: ../NEWS:54337
msgid ""
":issue:`22068`: Avoided reference loops with Variables and Fonts in Tkinter."
msgstr ":issue:`22068`: 避免了Tkinter中Variables和Fonts的引用循环。"

#: ../NEWS:54339
msgid ""
":issue:`22165`: SimpleHTTPRequestHandler now supports undecodable file "
"names."
msgstr ":issue:`22165`: SimpleHTTPRequestHandler现在支持不可解码的文件名。"

#: ../NEWS:54341
msgid ":issue:`15381`: Optimized line reading in io.BytesIO."
msgstr ":issue:`15381`: 优化了io.BytesIO中的行读取。"

#: ../NEWS:54343
msgid ""
":issue:`8797`: Raise HTTPError on failed Basic Authentication immediately. "
"Initial patch by Sam Bull."
msgstr ":issue:`8797`: 在基本认证失败时立即引发HTTPError。初始由Sam Bull提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54346
msgid ""
":issue:`20729`: Restored the use of lazy iterkeys()/itervalues()/iteritems()"
" in the mailbox module."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20729`: 恢复了mailbox模块中lazy iterkeys()/itervalues()/iteritems()的使用。"

#: ../NEWS:54349
msgid ""
":issue:`21448`: Changed FeedParser feed() to avoid *O*\\ (*n*\\ :sup:`2`) "
"behavior when parsing long line. Original patch by Raymond Hettinger."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21448`: 更改了FeedParser的feed()方法，以避免在解析长行时的*O*\\ (*n*\\ "
":sup:`2`)行为。原始由Raymond Hettinger提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54352
msgid ""
":issue:`22184`: The functools LRU Cache decorator factory now gives an "
"earlier and clearer error message when the user forgets the required "
"parameters."
msgstr ":issue:`22184`: 当用户忘记必需的参数时，functools LRU Cache装饰器工厂现在会提供更早更清晰的错误信息。"

#: ../NEWS:54355
msgid ""
":issue:`17923`: glob() patterns ending with a slash no longer match non-dirs"
" on AIX.  Based on patch by Delhallt."
msgstr ":issue:`17923`: 在AIX上，以斜杠结尾的glob()模式不再匹配非目录。基于Delhallt的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54358
msgid ":issue:`21725`: Added support for RFC 6531 (SMTPUTF8) in smtpd."
msgstr ":issue:`21725`: 在smtpd中添加了对RFC 6531（SMTPUTF8）的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:54360
msgid ""
":issue:`22176`: Update the ctypes module's libffi to v3.1.  This release "
"adds support for the Linux AArch64 and POWERPC ELF ABIv2 little endian "
"architectures."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22176`: 将ctypes模块的libffi更新到v3.1。此版本增加了对Linux AArch64和POWERPC ELF "
"ABIv2小端架构的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:54364
msgid ""
":issue:`5411`: Added support for the \"xztar\" format in the shutil module."
msgstr ":issue:`5411`: 在shutil模块中添加了对\"xztar\"格式的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:54366
msgid ""
":issue:`21121`: Don't force 3rd party C extensions to be built with "
"-Werror=declaration-after-statement."
msgstr ":issue:`21121`: 不再强制第三方C扩展使用-Werror=declaration-after-statement构建。"

#: ../NEWS:54369
msgid ""
":issue:`21975`: Fixed crash when using uninitialized sqlite3.Row (in "
"particular when unpickling pickled sqlite3.Row).  sqlite3.Row is now "
"initialized in the __new__() method."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21975`: 修复了使用未初始化的sqlite3.Row（特别是在解pickle pickled "
"sqlite3.Row时）时的崩溃问题。sqlite3.Row现在在__new__()方法中初始化。"

#: ../NEWS:54373
msgid ":issue:`20170`: Convert posixmodule to use Argument Clinic."
msgstr ":issue:`20170`: 将posixmodule转换为使用Argument Clinic。"

#: ../NEWS:54375
msgid ""
":issue:`21539`: Add an *exists_ok* argument to ``Pathlib.mkdir()`` to mimic "
"``mkdir -p`` and ``os.makedirs()`` functionality.  When true, ignore "
"``FileExistsErrors``. Patch by Berker Peksag."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21539`: 向 ``Pathlib.mkdir()`` 添加了一个 *exists_ok* 参数，以模拟 ``mkdir -p`` "
"和``os.makedirs()``的功能。当为真时，忽略 ``FileExistsErrors``。由Berker Peksag提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54379
msgid ""
":issue:`22127`: Bypass IDNA for pure-ASCII host names in the socket module "
"(in particular for numeric IPs)."
msgstr ":issue:`22127`: 在socket模块中绕过IDNA处理纯ASCII主机名（特别是数字IP）。"

#: ../NEWS:54382
msgid ""
":issue:`21047`: set the default value for the *convert_charrefs* argument of"
" HTMLParser to True.  Patch by Berker Peksag."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21047`: 将HTMLParser的 *convert_charrefs* 参数的默认值设置为True。由Berker "
"Peksag提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54385
msgid "Add an __all__ to html.entities."
msgstr "在 html.entities 包中增加 __all__ 变量。"

#: ../NEWS:54387
msgid ""
":issue:`15114`: the strict mode and argument of HTMLParser, "
"HTMLParser.error, and the HTMLParserError exception have been removed."
msgstr ""
":issue:`15114`: HTMLParser的严格模式和参数，HTMLParser.error，以及HTMLParserError异常已被移除。"

#: ../NEWS:54390
msgid ":issue:`22085`: Dropped support of Tk 8.3 in Tkinter."
msgstr ":issue:`22085`: 在Tkinter中放弃了对Tk 8.3的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:54392
msgid ""
":issue:`21580`: Now Tkinter correctly handles bytes arguments passed to Tk. "
"In particular this allows initializing images from binary data."
msgstr ":issue:`21580`: 现在Tkinter正确处理传递给Tk的字节参数。特别是这允许从二进制数据初始化图像。"

#: ../NEWS:54395
msgid ""
":issue:`22003`: When initialized from a bytes object, io.BytesIO() now "
"defers making a copy until it is mutated, improving performance and memory "
"use on some use cases. Patch by David Wilson."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22003`: "
"当从字节对象初始化时，io.BytesIO()现在延迟复制直到它被修改，从而在某些用例中提高了性能和内存使用。由David Wilson提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54399
msgid ""
":issue:`22018`: On Windows, signal.set_wakeup_fd() now also supports "
"sockets. A side effect is that Python depends to the WinSock library."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22018`: "
"在Windows上，signal.set_wakeup_fd()现在也支持套接字。一个副作用是Python依赖于WinSock库。"

#: ../NEWS:54402
msgid ""
":issue:`22054`: Add os.get_blocking() and os.set_blocking() functions to get"
" and set the blocking mode of a file descriptor (False if the O_NONBLOCK "
"flag is set, True otherwise). These functions are not available on Windows."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22054`: 添加 os.get_blocking() 和 os.set_blocking() "
"函数以获取和设置文件描述符的阻塞模式（如果设置了 O_NONBLOCK 标志则为 False，否则为 True）。这些函数在 Windows 上不可用。"

#: ../NEWS:54407
msgid ""
":issue:`17172`: Make turtledemo start as active on OS X even when run with "
"subprocess. Patch by Lita Cho."
msgstr ""
":issue:`17172`: 即使在通过子进程运行时，也使 turtledemo 在 OS X 上作为活动状态启动。补丁由 Lita Cho 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:54410
msgid ""
":issue:`21704`: Fix build error for _multiprocessing when semaphores are not"
" available. Patch by Arfrever Frehtes Taifersar Arahesis."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21704`: 当信号量不可用时，修复 _multiprocessing 的构建错误。由 Arfrever Frehtes "
"Taifersar Arahesis 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54413
msgid ""
":issue:`20173`: Convert sha1, sha256, sha512 and md5 to ArgumentClinic. "
"Patch by Vajrasky Kok."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20173`: 将 sha1、sha256、sha512 和 md5 转换为 ArgumentClinic。由 Vajrasky Kok"
" 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54416
msgid ""
"Fix repr(_socket.socket) on Windows 64-bit: don't fail with OverflowError on"
" closed socket. repr(socket.socket) already works fine."
msgstr ""
"修复 Windows 64 位上的 repr(_socket.socket)：不要在关闭的套接字上因 OverflowError "
"而失败。repr(socket.socket) 已经工作良好。"

#: ../NEWS:54419
msgid ""
":issue:`22033`: Reprs of most Python implemented classes now contain actual "
"class name instead of hardcoded one."
msgstr ":issue:`22033`: 大多数 Python 实现的类的 repr 现在包含实际的类名而不是硬编码的名称。"

#: ../NEWS:54422
msgid ""
":issue:`21947`: The dis module can now disassemble generator-iterator "
"objects based on their gi_code attribute. Patch by Clement Rouault."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21947`: dis 模块现在可以根据 generator-iterator 对象的 gi_code 属性对其进行反汇编。由 "
"Clement Rouault 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54425
msgid ""
":issue:`16133`: The asynchat.async_chat.handle_read() method now ignores "
"BlockingIOError exceptions."
msgstr ""
":issue:`16133`: asynchat.async_chat.handle_read() 方法现在忽略 BlockingIOError 异常。"

#: ../NEWS:54428
msgid ""
":issue:`22044`: Fixed premature DECREF in call_tzinfo_method. Patch by Tom "
"Flanagan."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22044`: 修复了 call_tzinfo_method 中的过早 DECREF。由 Tom Flanagan 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54431
msgid ""
":issue:`19884`: readline: Disable the meta modifier key if stdout is not a "
"terminal to not write the ANSI sequence ``\"\\033[1034h\"`` into stdout. "
"This sequence is used on some terminal (ex: TERM=xterm-256color\") to enable"
" support of 8 bit characters."
msgstr ""
":issue:`19884`: readline：如果标准输出不是终端，则禁用元修饰键，以避免将 ANSI 序列 ``\"\\033[1034h\"``"
" 写入标准输出。此序列用于某些终端（例如：TERM=xterm-256color）以启用 8 位字符支持。"

#: ../NEWS:54436
msgid ""
":issue:`4350`: Removed a number of out-of-dated and non-working for a long "
"time Tkinter methods."
msgstr ":issue:`4350`: 移除了许多长期过时且不工作的 Tkinter 方法。"

#: ../NEWS:54439
msgid ""
":issue:`6167`: Scrollbar.activate() now returns the name of active element "
"if the argument is not specified.  Scrollbar.set() now always accepts only 2"
" arguments."
msgstr ""
":issue:`6167`: Scrollbar.activate() 现在在未指定参数时返回活动元素的名称。Scrollbar.set() "
"现在总是只接受 2 个参数。"

#: ../NEWS:54443
msgid ":issue:`15275`: Clean up and speed up the ntpath module."
msgstr ":issue:`15275`: 清理并加速 ntpath 模块。"

#: ../NEWS:54445
msgid ""
":issue:`21888`: plistlib's load() and loads() now work if the fmt parameter "
"is specified."
msgstr ":issue:`21888`: plistlib 的 load() 和 loads() 现在在指定 fmt 参数时可以工作。"

#: ../NEWS:54448
msgid ""
":issue:`22032`: __qualname__ instead of __name__ is now always used to "
"format fully qualified class names of Python implemented classes."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22032`: 现在总是使用 __qualname__ 而不是 __name__ 来格式化 Python 实现的类的完全限定类名。"

#: ../NEWS:54451
msgid ""
":issue:`22031`: Reprs now always use hexadecimal format with the \"0x\" "
"prefix when contain an id in form \" at 0x...\"."
msgstr ":issue:`22031`: 当包含形如\" at 0x...\"的id时，Reprs现在总是使用带有\"0x\"前缀的十六进制格式。"

#: ../NEWS:54454
msgid ""
":issue:`22018`: signal.set_wakeup_fd() now raises an OSError instead of a "
"ValueError on ``fstat()`` failure."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22018`: signal.set_wakeup_fd()现在在 ``fstat()`` "
"失败时引发OSError而不是ValueError。"

#: ../NEWS:54457
msgid ""
":issue:`21044`: tarfile.open() now handles fileobj with an integer 'name' "
"attribute.  Based on patch by Antoine Pietri."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21044`: tarfile.open()现在可以处理具有整数'name'属性的fileobj。基于Antoine "
"Pietri的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54460
msgid ""
":issue:`21966`: Respect -q command-line option when code module is ran."
msgstr ":issue:`21966`: 当运行代码模块时，尊重-q命令行选项。"

#: ../NEWS:54462
msgid ""
":issue:`19076`: Don't pass the redundant 'file' argument to self.error()."
msgstr ":issue:`19076`: 不再向self.error()传递冗余的'file'参数。"

#: ../NEWS:54464
msgid ""
":issue:`16382`: Improve exception message of warnings.warn() for bad "
"category. Initial patch by Phil Elson."
msgstr ":issue:`16382`: 改进了warnings.warn()对于错误类别的异常消息。初始由Phil Elson提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54467
msgid ""
":issue:`21932`: os.read() now uses a :c:func:`Py_ssize_t` type instead of "
":c:expr:`int` for the size to support reading more than 2 GB at once. On "
"Windows, the size is truncated to INT_MAX. As any call to os.read(), the OS "
"may read less bytes than the number of requested bytes."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21932`: os.read()现在使用 :c:func:`Py_ssize_t` 类型而不是 :c:expr:`int` "
"来支持一次性读取超过2GB的数据。在Windows上，大小被截断为INT_MAX。如同任何对os.read()的调用，操作系统可能读取的字节数少于请求的字节数。"

#: ../NEWS:54472
msgid ""
":issue:`21942`: Fixed source file viewing in pydoc's server mode on Windows."
msgstr ":issue:`21942`: 修复了Windows上pydoc服务器模式下查看源文件的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:54474
msgid ""
":issue:`11259`: asynchat.async_chat().set_terminator() now raises a "
"ValueError if the number of received bytes is negative."
msgstr ""
":issue:`11259`: "
"asynchat.async_chat().set_terminator()现在如果接收到的字节数为负值时会引发ValueError。"

#: ../NEWS:54477
msgid ""
":issue:`12523`: asynchat.async_chat.push() now raises a TypeError if it "
"doesn't get a bytes string"
msgstr ""
":issue:`12523`: asynchat.async_chat.push()现在如果没有接收到字节字符串时会引发TypeError。"

#: ../NEWS:54480
msgid ""
":issue:`21707`: Add missing kwonlyargcount argument to "
"ModuleFinder.replace_paths_in_code()."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21707`: 向ModuleFinder.replace_paths_in_code()添加了缺失的kwonlyargcount参数。"

#: ../NEWS:54483
msgid ""
":issue:`20639`: calling Path.with_suffix('') allows removing the suffix "
"again. Patch by July Tikhonov."
msgstr ":issue:`20639`: 调用Path.with_suffix('')允许再次移除后缀。由July Tikhonov提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54486
msgid ""
":issue:`21714`: Disallow the construction of invalid paths using "
"Path.with_name().  Original patch by Antony Lee."
msgstr ":issue:`21714`: 禁止使用Path.with_name()构造无效路径。原始由Antony Lee提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54489
msgid ""
":issue:`15014`: Added 'auth' method to smtplib to make implementing auth "
"mechanisms simpler, and used it internally in the login method."
msgstr ":issue:`15014`: 向smtplib添加了'auth'方法以使实现认证机制更简单，并在login方法内部使用它。"

#: ../NEWS:54492
msgid ""
":issue:`21151`: Fixed a segfault in the winreg module when ``None`` is "
"passed as a ``REG_BINARY`` value to SetValueEx.  Patch by John Ehresman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21151`: 修复了当向SetValueEx传递 ``None`` 作为 ``REG_BINARY`` "
"值时winreg模块中的段错误。由John Ehresman提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54495
msgid ""
":issue:`21090`: io.FileIO.readall() does not ignore I/O errors anymore. "
"Before, it ignored I/O errors if at least the first C call read() succeed."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21090`: "
"io.FileIO.readall()不再忽略I/O错误。在此之前，如果至少第一次C调用read()成功，它会忽略I/O错误。"

#: ../NEWS:54498
msgid ""
":issue:`5800`: headers parameter of wsgiref.headers.Headers is now optional."
" Initial patch by Pablo Torres Navarrete and SilentGhost."
msgstr ""
":issue:`5800`: wsgiref.headers.Headers 的 headers 参数现在是可选的。初始由 Pablo Torres "
"Navarrete 和 SilentGhost 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54501
msgid ":issue:`21781`: ssl.RAND_add() now supports strings longer than 2 GB."
msgstr ":issue:`21781`: ssl.RAND_add() 现在支持超过 2 GB 的字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:54503
msgid ""
":issue:`21679`: Prevent extraneous fstat() calls during open().  Patch by "
"Bohuslav Kabrda."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21679`: 防止在 open() 过程中进行多余的 fstat() 调用。由 Bohuslav Kabrda 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54506
msgid ""
":issue:`21863`: cProfile now displays the module name of C extension "
"functions, in addition to their own name."
msgstr ":issue:`21863`: cProfile 现在除了显示 C 扩展函数的名称外，还会显示其模块名。"

#: ../NEWS:54509
msgid ""
":issue:`11453`: asyncore: emit a ResourceWarning when an unclosed "
"file_wrapper object is destroyed. The destructor now closes the file if "
"needed. The close() method can now be called twice: the second call does "
"nothing."
msgstr ""
":issue:`11453`: asyncore: 当未关闭的 file_wrapper 对象被销毁时发出 "
"ResourceWarning。现在析构函数会在需要时关闭文件。close() 方法现在可以被调用两次：第二次调用不做任何操作。"

#: ../NEWS:54513
msgid ""
":issue:`21858`: Better handling of Python exceptions in the sqlite3 module."
msgstr ":issue:`21858`: 在 sqlite3 模块中更好地处理 Python 异常。"

#: ../NEWS:54515
msgid ""
":issue:`21476`: Make sure the email.parser.BytesParser TextIOWrapper is "
"discarded after parsing, so the input file isn't unexpectedly closed."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21476`: 确保 email.parser.BytesParser TextIOWrapper "
"在解析后被丢弃，这样输入文件不会意外关闭。"

#: ../NEWS:54518
msgid ":issue:`20295`: imghdr now recognizes OpenEXR format images."
msgstr ":issue:`20295`: imghdr 现在可以识别 OpenEXR 格式的图像。"

#: ../NEWS:54520
msgid ""
":issue:`21729`: Used the \"with\" statement in the dbm.dumb module to ensure"
" files closing. Patch by Claudiu Popa."
msgstr ":issue:`21729`: 在 dbm.dumb 模块中使用 \"with\" 语句确保文件关闭。补丁由 Claudiu Popa 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:54523
msgid ""
":issue:`21491`: socketserver: Fix a race condition in child processes "
"reaping."
msgstr ":issue:`21491`: socketserver: 修复子进程回收中的一个竞争条件。"

#: ../NEWS:54525
msgid ""
":issue:`21719`: Added the ``st_file_attributes`` field to os.stat_result on "
"Windows."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21719`: 在 Windows 上为 os.stat_result 添加了 ``st_file_attributes`` 字段。"

#: ../NEWS:54528
msgid ":issue:`21832`: Require named tuple inputs to be exact strings."
msgstr ":issue:`21832`: 要求命名元组的输入必须是确切的字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:54530
msgid ""
":issue:`21722`: The distutils \"upload\" command now exits with a non-zero "
"return code when uploading fails.  Patch by Martin Dengler."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21722`: distutils 的 \"upload\" 命令现在在上传失败时以非零返回码退出。由 Martin Dengler "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54533
msgid ""
":issue:`21723`: asyncio.Queue: support any type of number (ex: float) for "
"the maximum size. Patch written by Vajrasky Kok."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21723`: asyncio.Queue: 支持任何类型的数字（例如浮点数）作为最大大小。补丁由 Vajrasky Kok 编写。"

#: ../NEWS:54536
msgid ""
":issue:`21711`: support for \"site-python\" directories has now been removed"
" from the site module (it was deprecated in 3.4)."
msgstr ":issue:`21711`: 现在已从 site 模块中移除了对 \"site-python\" 目录的支持（已在 3.4 中弃用）。"

#: ../NEWS:54539
msgid ""
":issue:`17552`: new socket.sendfile() method allowing a file to be sent over"
" a socket by using high-performance os.sendfile() on UNIX. Patch by "
"Giampaolo Rodola'."
msgstr ""
":issue:`17552`: 新的 socket.sendfile() 方法允许通过 UNIX 上的高性能 os.sendfile() 发送文件。由 "
"Giampaolo Rodola' 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54543
msgid ""
":issue:`18039`: dbm.dump.open() now always creates a new database when the "
"flag has the value 'n'.  Patch by Claudiu Popa."
msgstr ""
":issue:`18039`: dbm.dump.open() 现在当标志值为 'n' 时总是创建一个新的数据库。由 Claudiu Popa "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54546
msgid ""
":issue:`21326`: Add a new is_closed() method to asyncio.BaseEventLoop. "
"run_forever() and run_until_complete() methods of asyncio.BaseEventLoop now "
"raise an exception if the event loop was closed."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21326`: "
"向asyncio.BaseEventLoop添加了一个新的is_closed()方法。如果事件循环已关闭，asyncio.BaseEventLoop的run_forever()和run_until_complete()方法现在会抛出异常。"

#: ../NEWS:54550
msgid ""
":issue:`21766`: Prevent a security hole in CGIHTTPServer by URL unquoting "
"paths before checking for a CGI script at that path."
msgstr ":issue:`21766`: 通过在检查路径是否为CGI脚本之前对路径进行URL解码，防止了CGIHTTPServer中的安全漏洞。"

#: ../NEWS:54553
msgid ":issue:`21310`: Fixed possible resource leak in failed open()."
msgstr ":issue:`21310`: 修复了在open()失败时可能发生的资源泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:54555
msgid ""
":issue:`21256`: Printout of keyword args should be in deterministic order in"
" a mock function call. This will help to write better doctests."
msgstr ":issue:`21256`: 在模拟函数调用中，关键字参数的打印输出现在按确定性顺序进行。这将有助于编写更好的文档测试。"

#: ../NEWS:54558
msgid ""
":issue:`21677`: Fixed chaining nonnormalized exceptions in io close() "
"methods."
msgstr ":issue:`21677`: 修复了在io close()方法中链接非规范化异常的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:54560
msgid ""
":issue:`11709`: Fix the pydoc.help function to not fail when sys.stdin is "
"not a valid file."
msgstr ":issue:`11709`: 修复了pydoc.help函数在sys.stdin不是有效文件时不失败的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:54563
msgid ""
":issue:`21515`: tempfile.TemporaryFile now uses os.O_TMPFILE flag is "
"available."
msgstr ":issue:`21515`: tempfile.TemporaryFile现在在可用时使用os.O_TMPFILE标志。"

#: ../NEWS:54565
msgid ""
":issue:`13223`: Fix pydoc.writedoc so that the HTML documentation for "
"methods that use 'self' in the example code is generated correctly."
msgstr ":issue:`13223`: 修复了pydoc.writedoc，使得在示例代码中使用'self'的方法的HTML文档能够正确生成。"

#: ../NEWS:54568
msgid ":issue:`21463`: In urllib.request, fix pruning of the FTP cache."
msgstr ":issue:`21463`: 在urllib.request中，修复了FTP缓存的修剪问题。"

#: ../NEWS:54570
msgid ""
":issue:`21618`: The subprocess module could fail to close open fds that were"
" inherited by the calling process and already higher than POSIX resource "
"limits would otherwise allow.  On systems with a functioning /proc/self/fd "
"or /dev/fd interface the max is now ignored and all fds are closed."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21618`: "
"subprocess模块现在能够关闭调用进程继承的打开文件描述符，即使这些描述符已经高于POSIX资源限制所允许的值。在具有正常工作的/proc/self/fd或/dev/fd接口的系统上，现在忽略最大值并关闭所有文件描述符。"

#: ../NEWS:54575
msgid ""
":issue:`20383`: Introduce importlib.util.module_from_spec() as the preferred"
" way to create a new module."
msgstr ":issue:`20383`: 引入了importlib.util.module_from_spec()作为创建新模块的首选方式。"

#: ../NEWS:54578
msgid ""
":issue:`21552`: Fixed possible integer overflow of too long string lengths "
"in the tkinter module on 64-bit platforms."
msgstr ":issue:`21552`: 修复了在64位平台上，tkinter模块中过长的字符串长度可能导致整数溢出的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:54581
msgid ""
":issue:`14315`: The zipfile module now ignores extra fields in the central "
"directory that are too short to be parsed instead of letting a struct.unpack"
" error bubble up as this \"bad data\" appears in many real world zip files "
"in the wild and is ignored by other zip tools."
msgstr ""
":issue:`14315`: "
"zipfile模块现在会忽略中央目录中太短而无法解析的额外字段，而不是让struct.unpack错误冒泡，因为这种“坏数据”在现实世界的许多zip文件中出现，并被其他zip工具忽略。"

#: ../NEWS:54586
msgid ""
":issue:`13742`: Added \"key\" and \"reverse\" parameters to heapq.merge(). "
"(First draft of patch contributed by Simon Sapin.)"
msgstr ""
":issue:`13742`: 向heapq.merge()添加了“key”和“reverse”参数。（补丁的第一版由Simon Sapin贡献。）"

#: ../NEWS:54589
msgid ""
":issue:`21402`: tkinter.ttk now works when default root window is not set."
msgstr ":issue:`21402`: 当未设置默认根窗口时，tkinter.ttk现在可以正常工作。"

#: ../NEWS:54591
msgid ""
":issue:`3015`: ``_tkinter.create()`` now creates ``tkapp`` object with "
"``wantobjects=1`` by default."
msgstr ""
":issue:`3015`: ``_tkinter.create()`` 现在默认以 ``wantobjects=1`` 创建 ``tkapp`` "
"对象。"

#: ../NEWS:54594
msgid ""
":issue:`10203`: sqlite3.Row now truly supports sequence protocol.  In "
"particular it supports reverse() and negative indices.  Original patch by "
"Claudiu Popa."
msgstr ""
":issue:`10203`: sqlite3.Row 现在真正支持序列协议，特别是它支持 reverse() 和负索引。原始补丁由 Claudiu "
"Popa 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:54598
msgid ""
":issue:`18807`: If copying (no symlinks) specified for a venv, then the "
"python interpreter aliases (python, python3) are now created by copying "
"rather than symlinking."
msgstr ""
":issue:`18807`: 如果为 venv 指定了复制（无符号链接），则现在通过复制而非符号链接创建 python 解释器别名（python, "
"python3）。"

#: ../NEWS:54602
msgid ""
":issue:`20197`: Added support for the WebP image type in the imghdr module. "
"Patch by Fabrice Aneche and Claudiu Popa."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20197`: 在 imghdr 模块中添加了对 WebP 图像类型的支持。由 Fabrice Aneche 和 Claudiu "
"Popa 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54605
msgid ""
":issue:`21513`: Speedup some properties of IP addresses (IPv4Address, "
"IPv6Address) such as .is_private or .is_multicast."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21513`: 加速了 IP 地址（IPv4Address, IPv6Address）的一些属性，如 .is_private 或 "
".is_multicast。"

#: ../NEWS:54608
msgid ""
":issue:`21137`: Improve the repr for threading.Lock() and its variants by "
"showing the \"locked\" or \"unlocked\" status.  Patch by Berker Peksag."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21137`: 通过显示“锁定”或“未锁定”状态改进了 threading.Lock() 及其变体的 repr。补丁由 Berker "
"Peksag 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:54611
msgid ""
":issue:`21538`: The plistlib module now supports loading of binary plist "
"files when reference or offset size is not a power of two."
msgstr ":issue:`21538`: plistlib 模块现在支持在引用或偏移大小不是二的幂时加载二进制 plist 文件。"

#: ../NEWS:54614
msgid ":issue:`21455`: Add a default backlog to socket.listen()."
msgstr ":issue:`21455`: 为 socket.listen() 添加了一个默认的 backlog。"

#: ../NEWS:54616
msgid ""
":issue:`21525`: Most Tkinter methods which accepted tuples now accept lists "
"too."
msgstr ":issue:`21525`: 大多数接受元组的 Tkinter 方法现在也接受列表。"

#: ../NEWS:54619
msgid ""
":issue:`22166`: With the assistance of a new internal _codecs._forget_codec "
"helping function, test_codecs now clears the encoding caches to avoid the "
"appearance of a reference leak"
msgstr ""
":issue:`22166`: 在新内部 _codecs._forget_codec 辅助函数的帮助下，test_codecs "
"现在清除编码缓存以避免出现引用泄露。"

#: ../NEWS:54623
msgid ""
":issue:`22236`: Tkinter tests now don't reuse default root window.  New root"
" window is created for every test class."
msgstr ":issue:`22236`: Tkinter 测试现在不再重用默认的根窗口。为每个测试类创建新的根窗口。"

#: ../NEWS:54626
msgid ""
":issue:`10744`: Fix :pep:`3118` format strings on ctypes objects with a "
"nontrivial shape."
msgstr ":issue:`10744`: 修复具有非平凡形状的 ctypes 对象上的 :pep:`3118` 格式字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:54629
msgid ":issue:`20826`: Optimize ipaddress.collapse_addresses()."
msgstr ":issue:`20826`: 优化 ipaddress.collapse_addresses()。"

#: ../NEWS:54631
msgid ""
":issue:`21487`: Optimize ipaddress.summarize_address_range() and "
"ipaddress.{IPv4Network,IPv6Network}.subnets()."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21487`: 优化 ipaddress.summarize_address_range() 和 "
"ipaddress.{IPv4Network,IPv6Network}.subnets()。"

#: ../NEWS:54634
msgid ""
":issue:`21486`: Optimize parsing of netmasks in ipaddress.IPv4Network and "
"ipaddress.IPv6Network."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21486`: 优化 ipaddress.IPv4Network 和 ipaddress.IPv6Network 中网络掩码的解析。"

#: ../NEWS:54637
msgid ""
":issue:`13916`: Disallowed the surrogatepass error handler for non UTF-\\* "
"encodings."
msgstr ":issue:`13916`: 禁止了非 UTF-* 编码的 surrogatepass 错误处理器。"

#: ../NEWS:54640
msgid ""
":issue:`20998`: Fixed re.fullmatch() of repeated single character pattern "
"with ignore case. Original patch by Matthew Barnett."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20998`: 修复了忽略大小写的重复单字符模式的 re.fullmatch()。原始由 Matthew Barnett 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54643
msgid ""
":issue:`21075`: fileinput.FileInput now reads bytes from standard stream if "
"binary mode is specified.  Patch by Sam Kimbrel."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21075`: 如果指定了二进制模式，fileinput.FileInput 现在可以从标准流中读取字节。由 Sam Kimbrel "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54646
msgid ""
":issue:`19775`: Add a samefile() method to pathlib Path objects.  Initial "
"patch by Vajrasky Kok."
msgstr ""
":issue:`19775`: 向 pathlib Path 对象添加 samefile() 方法。初始由 Vajrasky Kok 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54649
msgid ""
":issue:`21226`: Set up modules properly in PyImport_ExecCodeModuleObject "
"(and friends)."
msgstr ":issue:`21226`: 在 PyImport_ExecCodeModuleObject（及其相关函数）中正确设置模块。"

#: ../NEWS:54652
msgid ""
":issue:`21398`: Fix a unicode error in the pydoc pager when the "
"documentation contains characters not encodable to the stdout encoding."
msgstr ":issue:`21398`: 修复 pydoc 分页器中的一个 unicode 错误，当文档包含无法编码为标准输出编码的字符时。"

#: ../NEWS:54655
msgid ""
":issue:`16531`: ipaddress.IPv4Network and ipaddress.IPv6Network now accept "
"an (address, netmask) tuple argument, so as to easily construct network "
"objects from existing addresses."
msgstr ""
":issue:`16531`: ipaddress.IPv4Network 和 ipaddress.IPv6Network "
"现在接受一个（地址，网络掩码）元组参数，以便从现有地址轻松构建网络对象。"

#: ../NEWS:54659
msgid ""
":issue:`21156`: importlib.abc.InspectLoader.source_to_code() is now a "
"staticmethod."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21156`: importlib.abc.InspectLoader.source_to_code() 现在是一个静态方法。"

#: ../NEWS:54662
msgid ""
":issue:`21424`: Simplified and optimized heaqp.nlargest() and nmsmallest() "
"to make fewer tuple comparisons."
msgstr ":issue:`21424`: 简化和优化了 heapq.nlargest() 和 nsmallest()，以减少元组比较的次数。"

#: ../NEWS:54665
msgid ""
":issue:`21396`: Fix TextIOWrapper(..., write_through=True) to not force a "
"flush() on the underlying binary stream.  Patch by akira."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21396`: 修复 TextIOWrapper(..., write_through=True) 不强制底层二进制流 flush() "
"的问题。由 akira 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54668
msgid ""
":issue:`18314`: Unlink now removes junctions on Windows. Patch by Kim "
"Gräsman"
msgstr ""
":issue:`18314`: 在 Windows 上，Unlink 现在可以移除 junctions。由 Kim Gräsman 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54670
msgid ""
":issue:`21088`: Bugfix for curses.window.addch() regression in 3.4.0. In "
"porting to Argument Clinic, the first two arguments were reversed."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21088`: 修复 curses.window.addch() 在 3.4.0 版本中的回归问题。在迁移到 Argument "
"Clinic 时，前两个参数被反转了。"

#: ../NEWS:54673
msgid ":issue:`21407`: _decimal: The module now supports function signatures."
msgstr ":issue:`21407`: _decimal: 模块现在支持函数签名。"

#: ../NEWS:54675
msgid ""
":issue:`10650`: Remove the non-standard 'watchexp' parameter from the "
"Decimal.quantize() method in the Python version.  It had never been present "
"in the C version."
msgstr ""
":issue:`10650`: 从 Python 版本的 Decimal.quantize() 方法中移除了非标准的 'watchexp' "
"参数。它从未在 C 版本中出现过。"

#: ../NEWS:54679
msgid ""
":issue:`21469`: Reduced the risk of false positives in robotparser by "
"checking to make sure that robots.txt has been read or does not exist prior "
"to returning True in can_fetch()."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21469`: 通过检查确保 robots.txt 已被读取或不存在，在 can_fetch() 返回 True 之前，减少了 "
"robotparser 中误报的风险。"

#: ../NEWS:54683
msgid ""
":issue:`19414`: Have the OrderedDict mark deleted links as unusable. This "
"gives an early failure if the link is deleted during iteration."
msgstr ":issue:`19414`: 让 OrderedDict 将被删除的链接标记为不可用。如果在迭代过程中链接被删除，这会提前失败。"

#: ../NEWS:54686
msgid ""
":issue:`21421`: Add __slots__ to the MappingViews ABC. Patch by Josh "
"Rosenberg."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21421`: 向 MappingViews ABC 添加 __slots__。由 Josh Rosenberg 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54688
msgid ""
":issue:`21101`: Eliminate double hashing in the C speed-up code for "
"collections.Counter()."
msgstr ":issue:`21101`: 在 collections.Counter() 的 C 加速代码中消除双重哈希。"

#: ../NEWS:54691
msgid ""
":issue:`21321`: itertools.islice() now releases the reference to the source "
"iterator when the slice is exhausted.  Patch by Anton Afanasyev."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21321`: itertools.islice() 现在在切片耗尽时会释放对源迭代器的引用。由 Anton Afanasyev "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54694
msgid ""
":issue:`21057`: TextIOWrapper now allows the underlying binary stream's "
"read() or read1() method to return an arbitrary bytes-like object (such as a"
" memoryview). Patch by Nikolaus Rath."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21057`: TextIOWrapper 现在允许底层的二进制流的 read() 或 read1() 方法返回任意的 bytes-"
"like 对象（如 memoryview）。由 Nikolaus Rath 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54698
msgid ""
":issue:`20951`: SSLSocket.send() now raises either SSLWantReadError or "
"SSLWantWriteError on a non-blocking socket if the operation would block. "
"Previously, it would return 0.  Patch by Nikolaus Rath."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20951`: 在非阻塞套接字上，如果操作会阻塞，SSLSocket.send() 现在会引发 SSLWantReadError 或 "
"SSLWantWriteError。之前，它会返回 0。由 Nikolaus Rath 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54702
msgid ""
":issue:`13248`: removed previously deprecated asyncore.dispatcher "
"__getattr__ cheap inheritance hack."
msgstr ":issue:`13248`: 移除了之前弃用的 asyncore.dispatcher __getattr__ 廉价继承 hack。"

#: ../NEWS:54705
msgid ""
":issue:`9815`: assertRaises now tries to clear references to local variables"
" in the exception's traceback."
msgstr ":issue:`9815`: assertRaises 现在尝试清除异常回溯中对局部变量的引用。"

#: ../NEWS:54708
msgid ""
":issue:`19940`: ssl.cert_time_to_seconds() now interprets the given time "
"string in the UTC timezone (as specified in RFC 5280), not the local "
"timezone."
msgstr ""
":issue:`19940`: ssl.cert_time_to_seconds() 现在将给定的时间字符串解释为 UTC 时区（如 RFC 5280 "
"所指定），而不是本地时区。"

#: ../NEWS:54711
msgid ""
":issue:`13204`: Calling sys.flags.__new__ would crash the interpreter, now "
"it raises a TypeError."
msgstr ":issue:`13204`: 调用 sys.flags.__new__ 会崩溃解释器，现在它会引发 TypeError。"

#: ../NEWS:54714
msgid ""
":issue:`19385`: Make operations on a closed dbm.dumb database always raise "
"the same exception."
msgstr ":issue:`19385`: 对已关闭的 dbm.dumb 数据库的操作现在总是引发相同的异常。"

#: ../NEWS:54717
msgid ""
":issue:`21207`: Detect when the os.urandom cached fd has been closed or "
"replaced, and open it anew."
msgstr ":issue:`21207`: 检测 os.urandom 缓存的 fd 是否被关闭或替换，并重新打开它。"

#: ../NEWS:54720
msgid ""
":issue:`21291`: subprocess's Popen.wait() is now thread safe so that "
"multiple threads may be calling wait() or poll() on a Popen instance at the "
"same time without losing the Popen.returncode value."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21291`: subprocess 的 Popen.wait() 现在是线程安全的，因此多个线程可以同时调用 Popen 实例的 "
"wait() 或 poll() 而不会丢失 Popen.returncode 值。"

#: ../NEWS:54724
msgid ""
":issue:`21127`: Path objects can now be instantiated from str subclass "
"instances (such as ``numpy.str_``)."
msgstr ":issue:`21127`: Path 对象现在可以从 str 子类实例（如 ``numpy.str_``）实例化。"

#: ../NEWS:54727
msgid ""
":issue:`15002`: urllib.response object to use _TemporaryFileWrapper (and "
"_TemporaryFileCloser) facility. Provides a better way to handle file "
"descriptor close. Patch contributed by Christian Theune."
msgstr ""
":issue:`15002`: urllib.response 对象使用 _TemporaryFileWrapper（和 "
"_TemporaryFileCloser）设施。提供了一种更好的处理文件描述符关闭的方法。由 Christian Theune 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54731
msgid ""
":issue:`12220`: mindom now raises a custom ValueError indicating it doesn't "
"support spaces in URIs instead of letting a 'split' ValueError bubble up."
msgstr ""
":issue:`12220`: mindom 现在会引发一个自定义的 ValueError，指示它不支持 URI 中的空格，而不是让 'split' "
"ValueError 冒泡。"

#: ../NEWS:54734
msgid ":issue:`21068`: The ssl.PROTOCOL* constants are now enum members."
msgstr ":issue:`21068`: ssl.PROTOCOL* 常量现在是枚举成员。"

#: ../NEWS:54736
msgid ""
":issue:`21276`: posixmodule: Don't define USE_XATTRS on KFreeBSD and the "
"Hurd."
msgstr ":issue:`21276`: posixmodule: 不要在 KFreeBSD 和 Hurd 上定义 USE_XATTRS。"

#: ../NEWS:54738
msgid ""
":issue:`21262`: New method assert_not_called for Mock. It raises "
"AssertionError if the mock has been called."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21262`: Mock 的新方法 assert_not_called。如果 mock 被调用过，它会引发 "
"AssertionError。"

#: ../NEWS:54741
msgid ""
":issue:`21238`: New keyword argument ``unsafe`` to Mock. It raises "
"``AttributeError`` in case of an attribute startswith assert or assret."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21238`: Mock 的新关键字参数 ``unsafe``。如果属性以 assert 或 assret 开头，它会引发 "
"``AttributeError``。"

#: ../NEWS:54744
msgid ""
":issue:`20896`: ssl.get_server_certificate() now uses PROTOCOL_SSLv23, not "
"PROTOCOL_SSLv3, for maximum compatibility."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20896`: ssl.get_server_certificate() 现在使用 PROTOCOL_SSLv23，而不是 "
"PROTOCOL_SSLv3，以获得最大的兼容性。"

#: ../NEWS:54747
msgid ""
":issue:`21239`: patch.stopall() didn't work deterministically when the same "
"name was patched more than once."
msgstr ":issue:`21239`: 当同一个名字被多次 patch 时，patch.stopall() 没有确定性地工作。"

#: ../NEWS:54750
msgid ""
":issue:`21203`: Updated fileConfig and dictConfig to remove inconsistencies."
" Thanks to Jure Koren for the patch."
msgstr ":issue:`21203`: 更新了 fileConfig 和 dictConfig 以消除不一致。感谢 Jure Koren 的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54753
msgid ""
":issue:`21222`: Passing name keyword argument to mock.create_autospec now "
"works."
msgstr ":issue:`21222`: 现在，将 name 关键字参数传递给 mock.create_autospec 可以工作了。"

#: ../NEWS:54756
msgid ""
":issue:`21197`: Add lib64 -> lib symlink in venvs on 64-bit non-OS X POSIX."
msgstr ":issue:`21197`: 在 64 位非 OS X POSIX 上，venvs 中添加了 lib64 -> lib 的符号链接。"

#: ../NEWS:54758
msgid ""
":issue:`17498`: Some SMTP servers disconnect after certain errors, violating"
" strict RFC conformance.  Instead of losing the error code when we issue the"
" subsequent RSET, smtplib now returns the error code and defers raising the "
"SMTPServerDisconnected error until the next command is issued."
msgstr ""
":issue:`17498`: 一些 SMTP 服务器在特定错误后断开连接，违反了严格的 RFC 一致性。smtplib "
"现在返回错误代码，并在发出下一个命令时延迟引发 SMTPServerDisconnected 错误，而不是在我们发出后续 RSET 时丢失错误代码。"

#: ../NEWS:54763
msgid ""
":issue:`17826`: setting an iterable side_effect on a mock function created "
"by create_autospec now works. Patch by Kushal Das."
msgstr ""
":issue:`17826`: 现在，在由 create_autospec 创建的 mock 函数上设置可迭代的 side_effect 可以工作了。由"
" Kushal Das 提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54766
msgid ""
":issue:`7776`: Fix ``Host:`` header and reconnection when using "
"http.client.HTTPConnection.set_tunnel(). Patch by Nikolaus Rath."
msgstr ""
":issue:`7776`: 修复了在使用 http.client.HTTPConnection.set_tunnel() 时的 ``Host:`` "
"标头和重新连接。由 Nikolaus Rath 提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54769
msgid ""
":issue:`20968`: unittest.mock.MagicMock now supports division. Patch by "
"Johannes Baiter."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20968`: unittest.mock.MagicMock 现在支持除法。由 Johannes Baiter 提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54772
msgid ""
":issue:`21529`: Fix arbitrary memory access in JSONDecoder.raw_decode with a"
" negative second parameter. Bug reported by Guido Vranken. (See also: "
":cve:`2014-4616`)"
msgstr ""
":issue:`21529`: 修复了 JSONDecoder.raw_decode 中第二个参数为负数时的任意内存访问。由 Guido Vranken"
" 报告的错误。（另见：:cve:`2014-4616`）"

#: ../NEWS:54776
msgid ""
":issue:`21169`: getpass now handles non-ascii characters that the input "
"stream encoding cannot encode by re-encoding using the replace error "
"handler."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21169`: getpass 现在通过使用 replace 错误处理程序重新编码，处理输入流编码无法编码的非 ASCII 字符。"

#: ../NEWS:54779
msgid ""
":issue:`21171`: Fixed undocumented filter API of the rot13 codec. Patch by "
"Berker Peksag."
msgstr ":issue:`21171`: 修复了 rot13 编解码器未记录的过滤器 API。由 Berker Peksag 提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54782
msgid ""
":issue:`20539`: Improved math.factorial error message for large positive "
"inputs and changed exception type (OverflowError -> ValueError) for large "
"negative inputs."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20539`: 改进了 math.factorial 对于大正数输入的错误消息，并更改了大负数输入的异常类型（OverflowError"
" -> ValueError）。"

#: ../NEWS:54786
msgid ""
":issue:`21172`: isinstance check relaxed from dict to collections.Mapping."
msgstr ":issue:`21172`: isinstance 检查从 dict 放宽到 collections.Mapping。"

#: ../NEWS:54788
msgid ""
":issue:`21155`: asyncio.EventLoop.create_unix_server() now raises a "
"ValueError if path and sock are specified at the same time."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21155`: asyncio.EventLoop.create_unix_server() 现在如果同时指定了 path 和 sock"
" 会抛出 ValueError。"

#: ../NEWS:54791
msgid ""
":issue:`21136`: Avoid unnecessary normalization of Fractions resulting from "
"power and other operations.  Patch by Raymond Hettinger."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21136`: 避免了由于幂和其他操作导致的 Fractions 不必要的规范化。由 Raymond Hettinger 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54794
msgid ":issue:`17621`: Introduce importlib.util.LazyLoader."
msgstr ":issue:`17621`: 引入了 importlib.util.LazyLoader。"

#: ../NEWS:54796
msgid ""
":issue:`21076`: signal module constants were turned into enums. Patch by "
"Giampaolo Rodola'."
msgstr ":issue:`21076`: signal 模块的常量被转换为枚举。由 Giampaolo Rodola' 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54799
msgid ":issue:`20636`: Improved the repr of Tkinter widgets."
msgstr ":issue:`20636`: 改进了 Tkinter 小部件的 repr。"

#: ../NEWS:54801
msgid ""
":issue:`19505`: The items, keys, and values views of OrderedDict now support"
" reverse iteration using reversed()."
msgstr ""
":issue:`19505`: OrderedDict 的 items、keys 和 values 视图现在支持使用 reversed() "
"进行反向迭代。"

#: ../NEWS:54804
msgid ""
":issue:`21149`: Improved thread-safety in logging cleanup during interpreter"
" shutdown. Thanks to Devin Jeanpierre for the patch."
msgstr ":issue:`21149`: 改进了解释器关闭期间日志清理的线程安全性。感谢 Devin Jeanpierre 提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54807
msgid ""
":issue:`21058`: Fix a leak of file descriptor in "
":func:`tempfile.NamedTemporaryFile`, close the file descriptor if "
":func:`io.open` fails"
msgstr ""
":issue:`21058`: 修复了 :func:`tempfile.NamedTemporaryFile` 中的文件描述符泄漏问题，如果 "
":func:`io.open` 失败则关闭文件描述符。"

#: ../NEWS:54811
msgid ""
":issue:`21200`: Return None from pkgutil.get_loader() when __spec__ is "
"missing."
msgstr ":issue:`21200`: 当 __spec__ 缺失时，从 pkgutil.get_loader() 返回 None。"

#: ../NEWS:54813
msgid ""
":issue:`21013`: Enhance ssl.create_default_context() when used for server "
"side sockets to provide better security by default."
msgstr ":issue:`21013`: 增强 ssl.create_default_context() 用于服务器端套接字时的默认安全性。"

#: ../NEWS:54816
msgid ""
":issue:`20145`: ``assertRaisesRegex`` and ``assertWarnsRegex`` now raise a "
"``TypeError`` if the second argument is not a string or compiled regex."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20145`: ``assertRaisesRegex`` 和 ``assertWarnsRegex`` "
"现在如果第二个参数不是字符串或编译的正则表达式会抛出 ``TypeError``。"

#: ../NEWS:54819
msgid ":issue:`20633`: Replace relative import by absolute import."
msgstr ":issue:`20633`: 用绝对导入替换相对导入。"

#: ../NEWS:54821
msgid ":issue:`20980`: Stop wrapping exception when using ThreadPool."
msgstr ":issue:`20980`: 使用 ThreadPool 时停止包装异常。"

#: ../NEWS:54823
msgid ""
":issue:`21082`: In os.makedirs, do not set the process-wide umask. Note this"
" changes behavior of makedirs when exist_ok=True."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21082`: 在 os.makedirs 中，不设置进程级的 umask。注意这改变了 makedirs 当 "
"exist_ok=True 时的行为。"

#: ../NEWS:54826
msgid ":issue:`20990`: Fix issues found by pyflakes for multiprocessing."
msgstr ":issue:`20990`: 修复了 pyflakes 为 multiprocessing 发现的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:54828
msgid ""
":issue:`21015`: SSL contexts will now automatically select an elliptic curve"
" for ECDH key exchange on OpenSSL 1.0.2 and later, and otherwise default to "
"\"prime256v1\"."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21015`: SSL 上下文现在会在 OpenSSL 1.0.2 及更高版本上自动为 ECDH 密钥交换选择椭圆曲线，否则默认为 "
"\"prime256v1\"。"

#: ../NEWS:54832
msgid ":issue:`21000`: Improve the command-line interface of json.tool."
msgstr ":issue:`21000`: 改进了 json.tool 的命令行界面。"

#: ../NEWS:54834
msgid ""
":issue:`20995`: Enhance default ciphers used by the ssl module to enable "
"better security and prioritize perfect forward secrecy."
msgstr ":issue:`20995`: 增强了 ssl 模块使用的默认密码，以实现更好的安全性并优先考虑完美前向保密。"

#: ../NEWS:54837
msgid ""
":issue:`20884`: Don't assume that __file__ is defined on importlib.__init__."
msgstr ":issue:`20884`: 不假设 __file__ 在 importlib.__init__ 上有定义。"

#: ../NEWS:54839
msgid ""
":issue:`21499`: Ignore __builtins__ in several test_importlib.test_api "
"tests."
msgstr ":issue:`21499`: 在几个 test_importlib.test_api 测试中忽略 __builtins__。"

#: ../NEWS:54841
msgid ":issue:`20627`: xmlrpc.client.ServerProxy is now a context manager."
msgstr ":issue:`20627`: xmlrpc.client.ServerProxy 现在是一个上下文管理器。"

#: ../NEWS:54843
msgid ""
":issue:`19165`: The formatter module now raises DeprecationWarning instead "
"of PendingDeprecationWarning."
msgstr ""
":issue:`19165`: formatter 模块现在引发 DeprecationWarning 而不是 "
"PendingDeprecationWarning。"

#: ../NEWS:54846
msgid ""
":issue:`13936`: Remove the ability of datetime.time instances to be "
"considered false in boolean contexts."
msgstr ":issue:`13936`: 移除了 datetime.time 实例在布尔上下文中被视为假的能力。"

#: ../NEWS:54849
msgid ""
":issue:`18931`: selectors module now supports /dev/poll on Solaris. Patch by"
" Giampaolo Rodola'."
msgstr ""
":issue:`18931`: selectors 模块现在支持 Solaris 上的 /dev/poll。补丁由 Giampaolo Rodola' "
"提供。"

#: ../NEWS:54852
msgid ""
":issue:`19977`: When the ``LC_TYPE`` locale is the POSIX locale (``C`` "
"locale), :py:data:`sys.stdin` and :py:data:`sys.stdout` are now using the "
"``surrogateescape`` error handler, instead of the ``strict`` error handler."
msgstr ""
":issue:`19977`: 当 ``LC_TYPE`` 语言环境是 POSIX 语言环境（``C`` "
"语言环境）时，:py:data:`sys.stdin` 和 :py:data:`sys.stdout` 现在使用 ``surrogateescape``"
" 错误处理程序，而不是 ``strict`` 错误处理程序。"

#: ../NEWS:54857
msgid ""
":issue:`20574`: Implement incremental decoder for cp65001 code (Windows code"
" page 65001, Microsoft UTF-8)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20574`: 为 cp65001 代码（Windows 代码页 65001，Microsoft UTF-8）实现增量解码器。"

#: ../NEWS:54860
msgid ""
":issue:`20879`: Delay the initialization of encoding and decoding tables for"
" base32, ascii85 and base85 codecs in the base64 module, and delay the "
"initialization of the unquote_to_bytes() table of the urllib.parse module, "
"to not waste memory if these modules are not used."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20879`: 延迟初始化 base64 模块中 base32、ascii85 和 base85 编解码器的编码和解码表，并延迟初始化 "
"urllib.parse 模块的 unquote_to_bytes() 表，以避免在这些模块未使用时浪费内存。"

#: ../NEWS:54865
msgid ""
":issue:`19157`: Include the broadcast address in the usable hosts for IPv6 "
"in ipaddress."
msgstr ":issue:`19157`: 在 ipaddress 中为 IPv6 包含广播地址到可用主机中。"

#: ../NEWS:54868
msgid ""
":issue:`11599`: When an external command (e.g. compiler) fails, distutils "
"now prints out the whole command line (instead of just the command name) if "
"the environment variable DISTUTILS_DEBUG is set."
msgstr ""
":issue:`11599`: 当外部命令（例如编译器）失败时，如果设置了环境变量 DISTUTILS_DEBUG，distutils "
"现在会打印出整个命令行（而不仅仅是命令名称）。"

#: ../NEWS:54872
msgid ""
":issue:`4931`: distutils should not produce unhelpful \"error: None\" "
"messages anymore. distutils.util.grok_environment_error is kept but doc-"
"deprecated."
msgstr ""
":issue:`4931`: distutils 不应再产生无帮助的“error: "
"None”消息。distutils.util.grok_environment_error 被保留但文档标记为弃用。"

#: ../NEWS:54875
msgid ""
":issue:`20875`: Prevent possible gzip \"'read' is not defined\" NameError. "
"Patch by Claudiu Popa."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20875`: 防止可能的 gzip \"'read' is not defined\" NameError。由 Claudiu "
"Popa 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54878
msgid ""
":issue:`11558`: ``email.message.Message.attach`` now returns a more useful "
"error message if ``attach`` is called on a message for which "
"``is_multipart`` is False."
msgstr ""
":issue:`11558`: ``email.message.Message.attach`` 现在在 ``is_multipart`` 为 "
"False 的消息上调用 ``attach`` 时返回更有用的错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:54882
msgid ""
":issue:`20283`: RE pattern methods now accept the string keyword parameters "
"as documented. The pattern and source keyword parameters are left as "
"deprecated aliases."
msgstr ":issue:`20283`: RE 模式方法现在接受字符串关键字参数如文档所述。模式和源关键字参数作为弃用的别名保留。"

#: ../NEWS:54886
msgid ":issue:`20778`: Fix modulefinder to work with bytecode-only modules."
msgstr ":issue:`20778`: 修复 modulefinder 以与仅字节码的模块一起工作。"

#: ../NEWS:54888
msgid ""
":issue:`20791`: copy.copy() now doesn't make a copy when the input is a "
"bytes object. Initial patch by Peter Otten."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20791`: copy.copy() 现在当输入是 bytes 对象时不再制作副本。初始由 Peter Otten 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54891
msgid ""
":issue:`19748`: On AIX, time.mktime() now raises an OverflowError for year "
"outsize range [1902; 2037]."
msgstr ""
":issue:`19748`: 在 AIX 上，time.mktime() 现在对于超出范围 [1902; 2037] 的年份会引发 "
"OverflowError。"

#: ../NEWS:54894
msgid ""
":issue:`19573`: inspect.signature: Use enum for parameter kind constants."
msgstr ":issue:`19573`: inspect.signature: 使用枚举作为参数种类常量。"

#: ../NEWS:54896
msgid ""
":issue:`20726`: inspect.signature: Make Signature and Parameter picklable."
msgstr ":issue:`20726`: inspect.signature: 使 Signature 和 Parameter 可 pickle。"

#: ../NEWS:54898
msgid ":issue:`17373`: Add inspect.Signature.from_callable method."
msgstr ":issue:`17373`: 添加 inspect.Signature.from_callable 方法。"

#: ../NEWS:54900
msgid ""
":issue:`20378`: Improve repr of inspect.Signature and inspect.Parameter."
msgstr ":issue:`20378`: 改进 inspect.Signature 和 inspect.Parameter 的 repr。"

#: ../NEWS:54902
msgid ""
":issue:`20816`: Fix inspect.getcallargs() to raise correct TypeError for "
"missing keyword-only arguments. Patch by Jeremiah Lowin."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20816`: 修复 inspect.getcallargs() 以对缺少的关键字参数引发正确的 TypeError。补丁由 "
"Jeremiah Lowin 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:54905
msgid ""
":issue:`20817`: Fix inspect.getcallargs() to fail correctly if more than 3 "
"arguments are missing. Patch by Jeremiah Lowin."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20817`: 修复 inspect.getcallargs() 以在缺少超过 3 个参数时正确失败。由 Jeremiah Lowin "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54908
msgid ""
":issue:`6676`: Ensure a meaningful exception is raised when attempting to "
"parse more than one XML document per pyexpat xmlparser instance. (Original "
"patches by Hirokazu Yamamoto and Amaury Forgeot d'Arc, with suggested "
"wording by David Gutteridge)"
msgstr ""
":issue:`6676`: 确保在尝试为每个 pyexpat xmlparser 实例解析多个 XML 文档时引发有意义的异常。（原始由 "
"Hirokazu Yamamoto 和 Amaury Forgeot d'Arc 提供补丁，建议措辞由 David Gutteridge 提出）"

#: ../NEWS:54913
msgid ""
":issue:`21117`: Fix inspect.signature to better support functools.partial. "
"Due to the specifics of functools.partial implementation, positional-or-"
"keyword arguments passed as keyword arguments become keyword-only."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21117`: 修复 inspect.signature 以更好地支持 functools.partial。由于 "
"functools.partial 实现的特殊性，作为关键字参数传递的位置或关键字参数变为仅关键字。"

#: ../NEWS:54918
msgid ""
":issue:`20334`: inspect.Signature and inspect.Parameter are now hashable. "
"Thanks to Antony Lee for bug reports and suggestions."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20334`: inspect.Signature 和 inspect.Parameter 现在可哈希。感谢 Antony Lee "
"的错误报告和建议。"

#: ../NEWS:54921
msgid ""
":issue:`15916`: doctest.DocTestSuite returns an empty unittest.TestSuite "
"instead of raising ValueError if it finds no tests"
msgstr ""
":issue:`15916`: 如果 doctest.DocTestSuite 没有找到测试，则返回一个空的 unittest.TestSuite "
"而不是引发 ValueError。"

#: ../NEWS:54924
msgid ""
":issue:`21209`: Fix asyncio.tasks.CoroWrapper to workaround a bug in yield-"
"from implementation in CPythons prior to 3.4.1."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21209`: 修复 asyncio.tasks.CoroWrapper 以解决在 CPython 3.4.1 之前的 yield-"
"from 实现中的一个错误。"

#: ../NEWS:54927
msgid ""
"asyncio: Add gi_{frame,running,code} properties to CoroWrapper (upstream "
":issue:`163`)."
msgstr ""
"asyncio: 向 CoroWrapper 添加 gi_{frame,running,code} 属性（上游 :issue:`163`）。"

#: ../NEWS:54930
msgid ""
":issue:`21311`: Avoid exception in _osx_support with non-standard compiler "
"configurations. Patch by John Szakmeister."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21311`: 避免在 _osx_support 中因非标准编译器配置而引发异常。由 John Szakmeister 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54933
msgid ""
":issue:`11571`: Ensure that the turtle window becomes the topmost window "
"when launched on OS X."
msgstr ":issue:`11571`: 确保在 OS X 上启动时 turtle 窗口成为最顶层窗口。"

#: ../NEWS:54936
msgid ""
":issue:`21801`: Validate that __signature__ is None or an instance of "
"Signature."
msgstr ":issue:`21801`: 验证 __signature__ 是否为 None 或 Signature 的实例。"

#: ../NEWS:54939
msgid ""
":issue:`21923`: Prevent AttributeError in "
"distutils.sysconfig.customize_compiler due to possible uninitialized "
"_config_vars."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21923`: "
"防止由于_config_vars可能未初始化而在distutils.sysconfig.customize_compiler中引发AttributeError。"

#: ../NEWS:54943
msgid ""
":issue:`21323`: Fix http.server to again handle scripts in CGI "
"subdirectories, broken by the fix for security :issue:`19435`.  Patch by "
"Zach Byrne."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21323`: 修复http.server再次处理CGI子目录中的脚本的问题，此功能因修复安全问题 :issue:`19435` "
"而损坏。由Zach Byrne提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54946
msgid ""
":issue:`22733`: Fix ffi_prep_args not zero-extending argument values "
"correctly on 64-bit Windows."
msgstr ":issue:`22733`: 修复ffi_prep_args在64位Windows上未能正确零扩展参数值的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:54949
msgid ""
":issue:`23302`: Default to TCP_NODELAY=1 upon establishing an "
"HTTPConnection. Removed use of hard-coded MSS as it's an optimization that's"
" no longer needed with Nagle disabled."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23302`: "
"在建立HTTPConnection时默认设置TCP_NODELAY=1。移除了对硬编码MSS的使用，因为这是一个在Nagle禁用后不再需要的优化。"

#: ../NEWS:54956
msgid ""
":issue:`20577`: Configuration of the max line length for the FormatParagraph"
" extension has been moved from the General tab of the Idle preferences "
"dialog to the FormatParagraph tab of the Config Extensions dialog. Patch by "
"Tal Einat."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20577`: FormatParagraph扩展的最大行长配置已从Idle偏好对话框的General标签页移动到Config "
"Extensions对话框的FormatParagraph标签页。由Tal Einat提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54961
msgid ""
":issue:`16893`: Update Idle doc chapter to match current Idle and add new "
"information."
msgstr ":issue:`16893`: 更新Idle文档章节以匹配当前Idle并添加新信息。"

#: ../NEWS:54964
msgid ""
":issue:`3068`: Add Idle extension configuration dialog to Options menu. "
"Changes are written to HOME/.idlerc/config-extensions.cfg. Original patch by"
" Tal Einat."
msgstr ""
":issue:`3068`: 在Options菜单中添加Idle扩展配置对话框。更改将写入HOME/.idlerc/config-"
"extensions.cfg。原始由Tal Einat提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:54968
msgid ""
":issue:`16233`: A module browser (File : Class Browser, Alt+C) requires an "
"editor window with a filename.  When Class Browser is requested otherwise, "
"from a shell, output window, or 'Untitled' editor, Idle no longer displays "
"an error box. It now pops up an Open Module box (Alt+M). If a valid name is "
"entered and a module is opened, a corresponding browser is also opened."
msgstr ""
":issue:`16233`: 模块浏览器（文件 : "
"类浏览器，Alt+C）需要一个有文件名的编辑器窗口。当从shell、输出窗口或'Untitled'编辑器请求类浏览器时，Idle不再显示错误框。现在会弹出一个打开模块框（Alt+M）。如果输入了一个有效的名称并打开了一个模块，相应的浏览器也会被打开。"

#: ../NEWS:54974
msgid ""
":issue:`4832`: Save As to type Python files automatically adds .py to the "
"name you enter (even if your system does not display it).  Some systems "
"automatically add .txt when type is Text files."
msgstr ""
":issue:`4832`: "
"保存为Python文件时自动为你输入的名称添加.py扩展名（即使你的系统不显示它）。某些系统在类型为文本文件时会自动添加.txt。"

#: ../NEWS:54978
msgid ""
":issue:`21986`: Code objects are not normally pickled by the pickle module. "
"To match this, they are no longer pickled when running under Idle."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21986`: 代码对象通常不被pickle模块pickle。为了匹配这一点，当在Idle下运行时，它们不再被pickle。"

#: ../NEWS:54981
msgid ""
":issue:`17390`: Adjust Editor window title; remove 'Python', move version to"
" end."
msgstr ":issue:`17390`: 调整编辑器窗口标题；移除'Python'，将版本号移至末尾。"

#: ../NEWS:54984
msgid ""
":issue:`14105`: Idle debugger breakpoints no longer disappear when inserting"
" or deleting lines."
msgstr ":issue:`14105`: 在插入或删除行时，Idle调试器的断点不再消失。"

#: ../NEWS:54987
msgid ""
":issue:`17172`: Turtledemo can now be run from Idle. Currently, the entry is"
