msgstr ":issue:`21686`: 为 HyperParser 添加单元测试。原始由 Saimadhav Heblikar 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:55003
msgid ""
":issue:`12387`: Add missing upper(lower)case versions of default Windows key"
