msgstr ":issue:`21695`: 在搜索仍在进行时关闭“在文件中查找”输出窗口不再关闭 Idle。"

#: ../NEWS:55010
msgid ":issue:`18910`: Add unittest for textView. Patch by Phil Webster."
msgstr ":issue:`18910`: 为 textView 添加单元测试。由 Phil Webster 提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:55012
msgid ""
":issue:`18292`: Add unittest for AutoExpand. Patch by Saihadhav Heblikar."
msgstr ":issue:`18292`: 为 AutoExpand 添加单元测试。由 Saihadhav Heblikar 提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:55014
msgid ":issue:`18409`: Add unittest for AutoComplete. Patch by Phil Webster."
msgstr ":issue:`18409`: 为 AutoComplete 添加单元测试。由 Phil Webster 提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:55016
msgid ""
":issue:`21477`: htest.py - Improve framework, complete set of tests. Patches"
" by Saimadhav Heblikar"
msgstr ":issue:`21477`: htest.py - 改进框架，完成测试集。由 Saimadhav Heblikar 提供的补丁"

#: ../NEWS:55019
msgid ""
":issue:`18104`: Add idlelib/idle_test/htest.py with a few sample tests to "
