":issue:`18104`: 添加 idlelib/idle_test/htest.py，包含几个示例测试，开始整合和改进 Idle "
"的人工验证测试。根据需要更改其他文件以与 htest 协同工作。将模块作为 __main__ 运行会运行所有测试。"

#: ../NEWS:55024
msgid ""
":issue:`21139`: Change default paragraph width to 72, the :pep:`8` "
"recommendation."
msgstr ":issue:`21139`: 将默认段落宽度更改为 72，这是 :pep:`8` 的推荐。"

#: ../NEWS:55027
msgid ""
":issue:`21284`: Paragraph reformat test passes after user changes reformat "
"width."
msgstr ":issue:`21284`: 用户更改重新格式化宽度后，段落重新格式化测试通过。"

#: ../NEWS:55030
msgid ""
":issue:`17654`: Ensure IDLE menus are customized properly on OS X for non-"
"framework builds and for all variants of Tk."
msgstr ":issue:`17654`: 确保在 OS X 上为非框架构建和所有 Tk 变体正确自定义 IDLE 菜单。"

#: ../NEWS:55033
msgid ""
":issue:`23180`: Rename IDLE \"Windows\" menu item to \"Window\". Patch by Al"
" Sweigart."
msgstr ":issue:`23180`: 将 IDLE 的“Windows”菜单项重命名为“Window”。由 Al Sweigart 提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:55039
msgid ""
":issue:`15506`: Use standard PKG_PROG_PKG_CONFIG autoconf macro in the "
"configure script."
msgstr ":issue:`15506`: 在配置脚本中使用标准的 PKG_PROG_PKG_CONFIG autoconf 宏。"

#: ../NEWS:55042
msgid ""
":issue:`22935`: Allow the ssl module to be compiled if openssl doesn't "
"support SSL 3."
msgstr ":issue:`22935`: 如果 openssl 不支持 SSL 3，也允许编译 ssl 模块。"

#: ../NEWS:55045
msgid ""
":issue:`22592`: Drop support of the Borland C compiler to build Python. The "
"distutils module still supports it to build extensions."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22592`: 放弃对使用 Borland C 编译器构建 Python 的支持。distutils 模块仍支持使用该编译器构建扩展。"

#: ../NEWS:55048
msgid ""
":issue:`22591`: Drop support of MS-DOS, especially of the DJGPP compiler "
"(MS-DOS port of GCC)."
msgstr ":issue:`22591`: 放弃对 MS-DOS 的支持，特别是 DJGPP 编译器（MS-DOS 版的 GCC）。"

#: ../NEWS:55051
msgid ""
":issue:`16537`: Check whether self.extensions is empty in setup.py. Patch by"
" Jonathan Hosmer."
msgstr ""
":issue:`16537`: 在 setup.py 中检查 self.extensions 是否为空。由 Jonathan Hosmer 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:55054
msgid ""
":issue:`22359`: Remove incorrect uses of recursive make.  Patch by Jonas "
"Wagner."
msgstr ":issue:`22359`: 移除递归 make 的错误使用。由 Jonas Wagner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:55057
msgid ""
":issue:`21958`: Define HAVE_ROUND when building with Visual Studio 2013 and "
"above.  Patch by Zachary Turner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21958`: 当使用 Visual Studio 2013 及以上版本构建时，定义 HAVE_ROUND。由 Zachary "
"Turner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:55060
msgid ""
":issue:`18093`: the programs that embed the CPython runtime are now in a "
"separate \"Programs\" directory, rather than being kept in the Modules "
"directory."
msgstr ""
":issue:`18093`: 嵌入 CPython 运行时的程序现在放在单独的 \"Programs\" 目录中，而不是保留在 Modules "
"目录中。"

#: ../NEWS:55064
msgid ""
":issue:`15759`: \"make suspicious\", \"make linkcheck\" and \"make doctest\""
" in Doc/ now display special message when and only when there are failures."
msgstr ""
":issue:`15759`: 在 Doc/ 中的 \"make suspicious\"、\"make linkcheck\" 和 \"make "
"doctest\" 现在仅在失败时显示特殊消息。"

#: ../NEWS:55067
msgid ""
":issue:`21141`: The Windows build process no longer attempts to find Perl, "
"instead relying on OpenSSL source being configured and ready to build. The "
"``PCbuild\\build_ssl.py`` script has been re-written and re-named to "
"``PCbuild\\prepare_ssl.py``, and takes care of configuring OpenSSL source "
"for both 32 and 64 bit platforms.  OpenSSL sources obtained from "
"svn.python.org will always be pre-configured and ready to build."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21141`: Windows 构建过程不再尝试查找 Perl，而是依赖已配置并准备好构建的 OpenSSL "
"源代码。``PCbuild\\build_ssl.py`` 脚本已被重写并重命名为 ``PCbuild\\prepare_ssl.py``，并负责为 "
"32 位和 64 位平台配置 OpenSSL 源代码。从 svn.python.org 获取的 OpenSSL 源代码将始终预先配置并准备好构建。"

#: ../NEWS:55074
msgid ":issue:`21037`: Add a build option to enable AddressSanitizer support."
msgstr ":issue:`21037`: 添加构建选项以启用 AddressSanitizer 支持。"

#: ../NEWS:55076
msgid ""
":issue:`19962`: The Windows build process now creates \"python.bat\" in the "
"root of the source tree, which passes all arguments through to the most "
"recently built interpreter."
msgstr ""
":issue:`19962`: Windows 构建过程现在在源代码树的根目录中创建 \"python.bat\"，它将所有参数传递给最近构建的解释器。"

#: ../NEWS:55080
msgid ""
":issue:`21285`: Refactor and fix curses configure check to always search in "
"a ncursesw directory."
msgstr ":issue:`21285`: 重构并修复 curses 配置检查，始终在 ncursesw 目录中搜索。"

#: ../NEWS:55083
msgid ""
":issue:`15234`: For BerkeleyDB and Sqlite, only add the found library and "
"include directories if they aren't already being searched. This avoids an "
"explicit runtime library dependency."
msgstr ""
":issue:`15234`: 对于 BerkeleyDB 和 Sqlite，仅当未搜索到库和包含目录时才添加它们。这避免了显式的运行时库依赖。"

#: ../NEWS:55087
msgid ""
":issue:`17861`: Tools/scripts/generate_opcode_h.py automatically regenerates"
" Include/opcode.h from Lib/opcode.py if the latter gets any change."
msgstr ""
":issue:`17861`: Tools/scripts/generate_opcode_h.py 如果 Lib/opcode.py "
"有任何更改，会自动从 Lib/opcode.py 重新生成 Include/opcode.h。"

#: ../NEWS:55090
msgid ""
":issue:`20644`: OS X installer build support for documentation build changes"
" in 3.4.1: assume externally supplied sphinx-build is available in /usr/bin."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20644`: OS X 安装程序构建支持3.4.1中文档构建的更改：假设外部提供的sphinx-build在/usr/bin中可用。"

#: ../NEWS:55093
msgid ""
":issue:`20022`: Eliminate use of deprecated bundlebuilder in OS X builds."
msgstr ":issue:`20022`: 在OS X构建中消除对已弃用的bundlebuilder的使用。"

#: ../NEWS:55095
msgid ""
":issue:`15968`: Incorporated Tcl, Tk, and Tix builds into the Windows build "
"solution."
msgstr ":issue:`15968`: 将Tcl、Tk和Tix构建集成到Windows构建解决方案中。"

#: ../NEWS:55098
msgid ":issue:`17095`: Fix Modules/Setup *shared* support."
msgstr ":issue:`17095`: 修复Modules/Setup *shared* 支持。"

#: ../NEWS:55100
msgid ":issue:`21811`: Anticipated fixes to support OS X versions > 10.9."
msgstr ":issue:`21811`: 预期修复以支持OS X版本 > 10.9。"

#: ../NEWS:55102
msgid ""
":issue:`21166`: Prevent possible segfaults and other random failures of "
"python --generate-posix-vars in pybuilddir.txt build target."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21166`: 防止python --generate-posix-"
"vars在pybuilddir.txt构建目标中可能出现的段错误和其他随机故障。"

#: ../NEWS:55105
msgid ":issue:`18096`: Fix library order returned by python-config."
msgstr ":issue:`18096`: 修复python-config返回的库顺序。"

#: ../NEWS:55107
msgid ""
":issue:`17219`: Add library build dir for Python extension cross-builds."
msgstr ":issue:`17219`: 为Python扩展跨构建添加库构建目录。"

#: ../NEWS:55109
msgid ""
":issue:`22919`: Windows build updated to support VC 14.0 (Visual Studio "
"2015), which will be used for the official release."
msgstr ":issue:`22919`: Windows构建更新以支持VC 14.0（Visual Studio 2015），这将用于官方发布。"

#: ../NEWS:55112
msgid ":issue:`21236`: Build _msi.pyd with cabinet.lib instead of fci.lib"
msgstr ":issue:`21236`: 使用cabinet.lib而非fci.lib构建_msi.pyd。"

#: ../NEWS:55114
msgid ""
":issue:`17128`: Use private version of OpenSSL for OS X 10.5+ installer."
msgstr ":issue:`17128`: 为OS X 10.5+安装程序使用OpenSSL的私有版本。"

#: ../NEWS:55119
msgid ""
":issue:`14203`: Remove obsolete support for view==NULL in "
"PyBuffer_FillInfo(), bytearray_getbuffer(), bytesiobuf_getbuffer() and "
"array_buffer_getbuf(). All functions now raise BufferError in that case."
msgstr ""
":issue:`14203`: "
"移除了对PyBuffer_FillInfo()、bytearray_getbuffer()、bytesiobuf_getbuffer()和array_buffer_getbuf()中view==NULL的过时支持。所有函数在那种情况下现在都会引发BufferError。"

#: ../NEWS:55123
msgid ""
":issue:`22445`: PyBuffer_IsContiguous() now implements precise contiguity "
"tests, compatible with NumPy's NPY_RELAXED_STRIDES_CHECKING compilation "
"flag.  Previously the function reported false negatives for corner cases."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22445`: "
"PyBuffer_IsContiguous()现在实现了精确的连续性测试，与NumPy的NPY_RELAXED_STRIDES_CHECKING编译标志兼容。之前该函数在角落案例中报告了假阴性。"

#: ../NEWS:55127
msgid ""
":issue:`22079`: PyType_Ready() now checks that statically allocated type has"
" no dynamically allocated bases."
msgstr ":issue:`22079`: PyType_Ready()现在检查静态分配的类型没有动态分配的基类。"

#: ../NEWS:55130
msgid ":issue:`22453`: Removed non-documented macro PyObject_REPR()."
msgstr ":issue:`22453`: 移除了未记录的宏PyObject_REPR()。"

#: ../NEWS:55132
msgid ""
":issue:`18395`: Rename ``_Py_char2wchar()`` to :c:func:`Py_DecodeLocale`, "
"rename ``_Py_wchar2char()`` to :c:func:`Py_EncodeLocale`, and document these"
" functions."
msgstr ""
":issue:`18395`: 将 ``_Py_char2wchar()`` 重命名为 "
":c:func:`Py_DecodeLocale`，将``_Py_wchar2char()`` 重命名为 "
":c:func:`Py_EncodeLocale`，并记录这些函数。"

#: ../NEWS:55136
msgid ""
":issue:`21233`: Add new C functions: PyMem_RawCalloc(), PyMem_Calloc(), "
"PyObject_Calloc(), _PyObject_GC_Calloc(). bytes(int) is now using "
"``calloc()`` instead of ``malloc()`` for large objects which is faster and "
"use less memory."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21233`: "
"添加新的C函数：PyMem_RawCalloc()、PyMem_Calloc()、PyObject_Calloc()、_PyObject_GC_Calloc()。bytes(int)现在对于大对象使用"
" ``calloc()`` 而非 ``malloc()``，这样更快且使用更少的内存。"

#: ../NEWS:55141
msgid ""
":issue:`20942`: PyImport_ImportFrozenModuleObject() no longer sets __file__ "
"to match what importlib does; this affects _frozen_importlib as well as any "
"module loaded using imp.init_frozen()."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20942`: PyImport_ImportFrozenModuleObject() 不再设置 __file__ 以匹配 "
"importlib 的行为；这影响了 _frozen_importlib 以及任何使用 imp.init_frozen() 加载的模块。"

#: ../NEWS:55148
msgid ""
":issue:`19548`: Update the codecs module documentation to better cover the "
"distinction between text encodings and other codecs, together with other "
"clarifications. Patch by Martin Panter."
msgstr ""
":issue:`19548`: 更新 codecs 模块文档，以更好地涵盖文本编码和其他编解码器之间的区别，以及其他一些澄清。由 Martin "
"Panter 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:55152
msgid ""
":issue:`22394`: Doc/Makefile now supports ``make venv PYTHON=../python`` to "
"create a venv for generating the documentation, e.g., ``make html "
"PYTHON=venv/bin/python3``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22394`: Doc/Makefile 现在支持 ``make venv PYTHON=../python`` "
"来创建一个用于生成文档的 venv，例如，``make html PYTHON=venv/bin/python3``。"

#: ../NEWS:55156
msgid ""
":issue:`21514`: The documentation of the json module now refers to new JSON "
"RFC 7159 instead of obsoleted RFC 4627."
msgstr ":issue:`21514`: json 模块的文档现在引用新的 JSON RFC 7159 而不是过时的 RFC 4627。"

#: ../NEWS:55159
msgid ""
":issue:`21777`: The binary sequence methods on bytes and bytearray are now "
"documented explicitly, rather than assuming users will be able to derive the"
" expected behaviour from the behaviour of the corresponding str methods."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21777`: bytes 和 bytearray 的二进制序列方法现在被明确文档化，而不是假设用户能够从相应的 str "
"方法的行为中推导出预期行为。"

#: ../NEWS:55164
msgid ":issue:`6916`: undocument deprecated asynchat.fifo class."
msgstr ":issue:`6916`: 取消文档中已弃用的 asynchat.fifo 类的记录。"

#: ../NEWS:55166
msgid ""
":issue:`17386`: Expanded functionality of the ``Doc/make.bat`` script to "
"make it much more comparable to ``Doc/Makefile``."
msgstr ":issue:`17386`: 扩展了 ``Doc/make.bat`` 脚本的功能，使其更加接近 ``Doc/Makefile``。"

#: ../NEWS:55169
msgid ""
":issue:`21312`: Update the thread_foobar.h template file to include newer "
"threading APIs. Patch by Jack McCracken."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21312`: 更新 thread_foobar.h 模板文件，包括更新的线程 API。由 Jack McCracken 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:55172
msgid ""
":issue:`21043`: Remove the recommendation for specific CA organizations and "
